<p><b>hauba, kabanica, kaciga, kapuljača</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (slang) a neighborhood</p><p><b>mjesto kraljevske rezidencije i de facto glavnog grada u zapadnom dijelu Nizozemske (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the site of the royal residence and the de facto capital in the western part of the Netherlands [Den Haag, The Hague]</p><p><b>između. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in between [between]</p><p><b>u prostoru između paluba, na brodu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in the space between decks, on a ship [between decks]</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je to samo jedan od glavnih elemenata, to znači da je to samo jedan od glavnih elemenata. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a .22 caliber firearm (pistol or rifle) [twenty-two]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the bore of a gun (or its ammunition) that measures twenty-two hundredths of an inch in diameter [.22-caliber, .22-calibre, .22 calibre]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the bore of a gun (or its ammunition) that measures twenty-two hundredths of an inch in diameter [.22-caliber, .22-calibre, .22 caliber]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the bore of a gun (or its ammunition) that measures twenty-two hundredths of an inch in diameter [.22-calibre, .22 caliber, .22 calibre]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the bore of a gun (or its ammunition) that measures twenty-two hundredths of an inch in diameter [.22-caliber, .22 caliber, .22 calibre]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the bore of a gun (or its ammunition) that measures thirty-eight hundredths of an inch in diameter [.38-caliber, .38-calibre, .38 calibre]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the bore of a gun (or its ammunition) that measures thirty-eight hundredths of an inch in diameter [.38-caliber, .38-calibre, .38 caliber]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the bore of a gun (or its ammunition) that measures thirty-eight hundredths of an inch in diameter [.38-calibre, .38 caliber, .38 calibre]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the bore of a gun (or its ammunition) that measures thirty-eight hundredths of an inch in diameter [.38-caliber, .38 caliber, .38 calibre]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the bore of a gun (or its ammunition) that measures forty-five hundredths of an inch in diameter [.45-caliber, .45-calibre, .45 calibre]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the bore of a gun (or its ammunition) that measures forty-five hundredths of an inch in diameter [.45-caliber, .45-calibre, .45 caliber]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the bore of a gun (or its ammunition) that measures forty-five hundredths of an inch in diameter [.45-calibre, .45 caliber, .45 calibre]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the bore of a gun (or its ammunition) that measures forty-five hundredths of an inch in diameter [.45-caliber, .45 caliber, .45 calibre]</p><p><b>nula</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mathematical element that when added to another number yields the same number [cipher, cypher, nought, zero]</p><p><i>adj.</i> indicating the absence of any or all units under consideration [zero]</p><p><b>Najmanji cijeli broj ili broj koji predstavlja taj broj, za proizvodnju proizvoda od metala ili od drugih materijala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the smallest whole number or a numeral representing this number [I, ace, one, single, unity]</p><p><i>adj.</i> used of a single unit or thing [ane, i, one]</p><p><b>Prva od dvije knjige Starog zavjeta koja govori o povijesti Jude i Izraela do povratka iz babilonskog ropstva 536. godine prije Krista. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first of two Old Testament books telling the history of Judah and Israel until the return from the Babylonian Captivity in 536 BC [I Chronicles]</p><p><b>Apokrifa koja se sastoji od zbirke Prvog i Drugog Pisa Kronika te Ezdre i Nehemije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an Apocryphal book consisting of a compilation from I Chronicles and II Chronicles and Ezra and Nehemiah [I Esdra]</p><p><b>Prva od dvije knjige Starog zavjeta koja govori o povijesti kraljeva Jude i Izraela. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first of two Old Testament books telling the histories of the kings of Judah and Israel [I Kings]</p><p><b>Prva knjiga o Makabejcima</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an Apocryphal book describing the life of Judas Maccabaeus [I Maccabees]</p><p><b>Prva od dvije knjige u Starom zavjetu koja govori o Sauli i Davidu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first of two books in the Old Testament that tell of Saul and David [I Samuel]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless insoluble solid alcohol used to make detergents and pharmaceuticals [lauryl alcohol]</p><p><b>igra u kojoj bacač dopušta protivničkom timu samo jedan udarac (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a game in which a pitcher allows the opposing team only one hit [one-hitter]</p><p><b>Kardinalni broj koji je zbir devet i jedan., što je jedan više od devet. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of nine and one [X, decade, ten, tenner]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than nine [ten, x]</p><p><b>od kemijske spojine koja ima prsten sa deset članova (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of a chemical compound having a ring with ten members [ten-membered]</p><p><b>stotina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ten 10s [C, century, hundred, one C]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being ten more than ninety [c, hundred, one hundred]</p><p><b>tisuća, tisuću</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the product of 10 and 100 [G, K, M, chiliad, grand, one thousand, thou, thousand, yard]</p><p><i>adj.</i> denoting a quantity consisting of 1,000 items or units [k, m, one thousand, thousand]</p><p><b>Kardinalni broj koji je proizvod deset i tisuću. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the product of ten and one thousand [myriad, ten thousand]</p><p><b>Kardinalni broj koji je peti u deset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the fifth power of ten [hundred thousand, lakh]</p><p><b>milijun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the number that is represented as a one followed by 6 zeros [meg, million, one thousand thousand]</p><p><b>milijarda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the number that is represented as a one followed by 9 zeros [billion, one thousand million]</p><p><b>broj koji je predstavljen kao jedan praćen 12 nula (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the number that is represented as a one followed by 12 zeros [one million million, trillion]</p><p><i>n.</i> the number that is represented as a one followed by 12 zeros [billion, one million million]</p><p><b>redovni broj od tisuću u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one thousand in counting order [thousandth]</p><p><b>redovni broj od stotinu u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred in counting order [centesimal, hundredth]</p><p><b>biti jedan više od stotinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than one hundred [ci, hundred and one, one hundred one]</p><p><b>redovni broj od stotinu jedan u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred one in counting order [hundred-and-first]</p><p><b>Pet više od stotinu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being five more than one hundred [cv, one hundred five]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto pet u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred five in counting order [hundred-and-fifth]</p><p><b>deseti</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the ninth and just before the eleventh in position [tenth]</p><p><b>jedanaest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of ten and one [XI, eleven]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than ten [eleven, xi]</p><p><b>Sveti Martin. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the feast of Saint Martin [Martinmas, St Martin's Day]</p><p><b>(bivši u Britaniji) ispit koji su 11 i 12 godina stari učenici uzimali za odabir odgovarajućih kandidata za osnovnu školu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (formerly in Britain) an examination taken by 11 and 12 year old students to select suitable candidates for grammar school [eleven-plus]</p><p><b>biti deset više od stotinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being ten more than one hundred [cx, one hundred ten]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto deset u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred ten in counting order [hundred-and-tenth]</p><p><b>Pet više od sto deset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being five more than one hundred ten [cxv, one hundred fifteen]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto petnaest u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred fifteen in counting order [hundred-and-fifteenth]</p><p><b>Dolazi sljedeći nakon desetog i neposredno prije dvanaest na položaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the tenth and just before the twelfth in position [eleventh]</p><p><b>12, XII, dvanaest, tucet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of eleven and one [XII, dozen, twelve]</p><p><i>adj.</i> denoting a quantity consisting of 12 items or units [dozen, twelve, xii]</p><p><b>vrsta serijske glazbe koju je uveo Arnold Schoenberg (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a type of serial music introduced by Arnold Schoenberg [12-tone system, twelve-tone music, twelve-tone system]</p><p><b>vrsta serijske glazbe koju je uveo Arnold Schoenberg (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a type of serial music introduced by Arnold Schoenberg [12-tone music, twelve-tone music, twelve-tone system]</p><p><b>Kardinalni broj koji je proizvod deset i dvanaest., 10 više od 100 10 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the product of ten and twelve [great hundred, long hundred]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being ten more than one hundred ten [cxx, one hundred twenty]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto dvadeset u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred twenty in counting order [hundred-and-twentieth]</p><p><b>Pet više od sto dvadeset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being five more than one hundred twenty [cxxv, one hundred twenty-five]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto dvadeset pet u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred twenty-five in counting order [hundred-and-twenty-fifth]</p><p><b>dvanaesti</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the eleventh and just before the thirteenth in position [twelfth]</p><p><b>trinaest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of twelve and one [XIII, baker's dozen, long dozen, thirteen]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than twelve [thirteen, xiii]</p><p><b>10 više od 120 (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being ten more than one hundred twenty [cxxx, one hundred thirty]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto trideset u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred thirty in counting order [hundred-and-thirtieth]</p><p><b>To je pet više od sto i trideset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being five more than one hundred thirty [cxxxv, one hundred thirty-five]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto trideset pet u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred thirty-five in counting order [hundred-and-thirty-fifth]</p><p><b>Dolazi sljedeći nakon dvanaest na položaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the twelfth in position [thirteenth]</p><p><b>Kardinalni broj koji je zbir trinaest i jedan., biti jedan više od trinaest (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of thirteen and one [XIV, fourteen]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than thirteen [fourteen, xiv]</p><p><b>zakoniti praznik u Francuskoj koji slavi napad na Pariz Bastille 1789. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a legal holiday in France celebrating the storming of the Paris bastille in 1789 [Bastille Day]</p><p><b>10 više od 130 (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being ten more than one hundred thirty [cxl, one hundred forty]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto četrdeset u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred forty in counting order [hundred-and-fortieth]</p><p><b>dvanaest desetaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> twelve dozen [gross]</p><p><b>Pet više od sto četrdeset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being five more than one hundred forty [cxlv, one hundred forty-five]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto četrdeset pet u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred forty-five in counting order [hundred-and-forty-fifth]</p><p><b>Dolazi sljedeći nakon trinaesti na položaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the thirteenth in position [fourteenth]</p><p><b>petnest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of fourteen and one [XV, fifteen]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than fourteen [fifteen, xv]</p><p><b>datum pobjede Saveznika nad Japanom, Drugi svjetski rat (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the date of Allied victory over Japan, World War II [V-J Day]</p><p><b>teroristička organizacija osnovana 1979. od strane frakcije Narodnog fronta za oslobođenje Palestine, ali raspuštena 1980-ih kada su ključni članovi otišli da se pridruže frakciji al-Fatah-a. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a terrorist organization formed in 1979 by a faction of the Popular Front for the Liberation of Palestine but disbanded in the 1980s when key members left to join a faction of al-Fatah</p><p><b>Četvrt sata. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a quarter of an hour [quarter-hour]</p><p><b>10 više od 140 (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being ten more than one hundred forty [cl, one hundred fifty]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto pedeset u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred fifty in counting order [hundred-and-fiftieth]</p><p><b>desetljeće od 1530 do 1539 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the decade from 1530 to 1539</p><p><b>Pet više od sto pedeset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being five more than one hundred fifty [clv, one hundred fifty-five]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto pedeset pet u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred fifty-five in counting order [hundred-and-fifty-fifth]</p><p><b>Dolazi sljedeći nakon četrnaestog i neposredno prije šesnaest na položaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the fourteenth and just before the sixteenth in position [fifteenth]</p><p><b>Kardinalni broj koji je zbir petnaest i jedan., biti jedan više od petnaest (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of fifteen and one [XVI, sixteen]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than fifteen [sixteen, xvi]</p><p><b>Samoproglašavanje osobnosti inventarizam razvijen od strane Raymond B. Cattell mjeriti 16 osobnosti dimenzije koje su se pojavile iz njegove faktor analize širokog spektra osobina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a self-report personality inventory developed by Raymond B. Cattell to measure the 16 personality dimensions that emerged from his factor analysis of a wide range of traits [Sixteen Personality Factor Questionnaire]</p><p><b>što je deset više od sto pedeset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being ten more than one hundred fifty [clx, one hundred sixty]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto šezdeset u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred sixty in counting order [hundred-and-sixtieth]</p><p><b>To je pet više od sto i šezdeset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being five more than one hundred sixty [clxv, one hundred sixty-five]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto šezdeset pet u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred sixty-five in counting order [hundred-and-sixty-fifth]</p><p><b>Sljedeći nakon petnaest na položaju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the fifteenth in position [sixteenth]</p><p><b>Kardinalni broj koji je zbir šestnaest i jedan., biti jedan više od šesnaest (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of sixteen and one [XVII, seventeen]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than sixteen [seventeen, xvii]</p><p><b>Marksističko-lenjinistička teroristička organizacija u Grčkoj koja se nasilno protivi imperijalizmu i kapitalizmu i NATO-u i Sjedinjenim Državama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Marxist-Leninist terrorist organization in Greece that is violently opposed to imperialism and capitalism and NATO and the United States [Revolutionary Organization 17 November]</p><p><b>10 više od 160 (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being ten more than one hundred sixty [clxx, one hundred seventy]</p><p><b>redovni broj od sto sedamdeset u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of one hundred seventy in counting order [hundred-and-seventieth]</p><p><b>Kardinalni broj jednako je desetak bruto (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cardinal number equal to one dozen gross [great gross]</p><p><b>Pet više od sto sedamdeset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being five more than one hundred seventy [clxxv, one hundred seventy-five]</p><p><b>desetljeće od 1750. do 1759. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the decade from 1750 to 1759</p><p><b>redovni