r of central to western United States having a narrow erect crown and soft wood [Abies lowiana, California white fir, Colorado fir, white fir]</p><p><b>mala brzo rastuća ali kratkotrajna jelka južnih Alleghenies slična jelki balzam ali s vrlo kratkim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small fast-growing but short-lived fir of southern Alleghenies similar to balsam fir but with very short leaves [Fraser fir]</p><p><b>visoka jelka na pacifičkoj obali sjeverozapadne Amerike s dugim zakrivljenim granama i dubokim zelenim listovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lofty fir of the Pacific coast of northwestern America having long curving branches and deep green leaves [giant fir, grand fir, lowland fir, lowland white fir]</p><p><b>srednjo visok drveni drvo iz Skalnih planina s uskom koničnom do stupničkom krunom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medium-tall timber tree of the Rocky Mountains having a narrowly conic to columnar crown [Alpine fir, subalpine fir]</p><p><b>Srednje do visoke jelke iz središnje i zapadne Sjedinjene Države s uskom uspravnom krunom i mekim drvetom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medium to tall fir of central to western United States having a narrow erect crown and soft wood [Abies concolor, California white fir, Colorado fir, white fir]</p><p><b>Piramidalna jelka sa jugozapadne Kalifornije s trnastima oštricama lišća i konusnim ljuskama s dugim šiljcima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pyramidal fir of southwestern California having spiny pointed leaves and cone scales with long spines [Abies bracteata, Santa Lucia fir, bristlecone fir]</p><p><b>Na kopnu u sjevernom Maroku nasuprot Gibraltarske stijene. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a promontory in northern Morocco opposite the Rock of Gibraltar [Abyla, Jebel Musa]</p><p><b>Grad u središnjem Teksasu., Grad u središnjem Kansasu zapadno od Topeke. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in central Texas</p><p><i>n.</i> a town in central Kansas to the west of Topeka</p><p><b>darovitost, kapacitet, moć, mogućnost, platežna sposobnost, podobnos