 infected and filled with pus</p><p><b>apsces u tkivu oko zuba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abscess of a common kind in the tissue around a tooth</p><p><b>Odbacuju cvijeće i lišće i plodove nakon stvaranja ožiljaka., odvojiti ili odvojiti odlomkom (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> shed flowers and leaves and fruit following formation of a scar tissue</p><p><i>v.</i> remove or separate by abscission</p><p><b>apscisa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the value of a coordinate on the horizontal axis</p><p><b>Ispuštanje cvijeća i lišća i voća nakon formiranja ožiljkovog tkiva u biljci, čin odrezanja nečega. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shedding of flowers and leaves and fruit following formation of scar tissue in a plant</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of cutting something off [cutting off]</p><p><b>prikrivati se, sakriti se, otići potajice, šmugnuti, sakriti, prikriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> run away [absquatulate, bolt, decamp, go off, make off, run off]</p><p><b>prikrivati se, sakriti se, otići potajice, šmugnuti, sakriti, prikriti (od &quot;abscond&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fugitive who runs away and hides to avoid arrest or prosecution</p><p><b>skriveno bježanje (da bi se izbjeglo uhićenje) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of running away secretly (as to avoid arrest) [decampment]</p><p><b>spuštanje, spuštati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (mountaineering) a descent of a vertical cliff or wall made by using a doubled rope that is fixed to a higher point and wrapped around the body [rappel]</p><p><i>v.</i> descend by means of a rappel [rappel, rope down]</p><p><b>spuštanje, spuštati (od &quot;abseil&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who descends down a nearly vertical face by using a doubled rope that is wrapped around the body and attached to some high point [rappeller]</p><p><b>izostajanje, izostanak, nedolazak, nedostatak, nejavljanje, nema, nepostojanje, odsustvo, odsutnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being absent</p><p><i>n.</i> failure to be present</p><p><i>n.</i> the time interval during which something or somebody is away</p><p><i>n.</i> the occurrence of an abrupt, transient loss or impairment of consciousness (which is not subsequently remembered), sometimes with light twitching, fluttering eyelids, etc. [absence seizure]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se ne primjenjuje lijek, lijek se može koristiti za liječenje bolesti u kojoj je osoba bolesna. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the occurrence of an abrupt, transient loss or impairment of consciousness (which is not subsequently remembered), sometimes with light twitching, fluttering eyelids, etc. [absence]</p><p><b>Neovlašteno odsustvo vojnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> unauthorized military absence [unauthorized absence]</p><p><b>izostati, odsutan, rasijan, rastresen, udaljiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> go away or leave [remove]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not being in a specified place</p><p><i>adj.</i> nonexistent [lacking, missing, wanting]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lost in thought [absentminded, abstracted, scatty]</p><p><b>odsutni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one that is absent or not in residence</p><p><b>(izbor) glasanje koje se daje u odsutnosti (obično pošteno prije dana izbora) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (election) a ballot that is cast while absent (usually mailed in prior to election day)</p><p><b>postotak radnika koji se ne javljaju na posao (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the percentage of workers who do not report to work</p><p><b>izostajanje, izostajanje s posla, zabušavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> habitual absence from work</p><p><b>rasijano, odsutno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an absentminded or preoccupied manner [absentmindedly, abstractedly, inattentively]</p><p><b>Izgubljen u mislima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lost in thought [absent, abstracted, scatty]</p><p><b>odsutno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an absentminded or preoccupied manner [absently, abstractedly, inattentively]</p><p><b>Zaokupljenost toliko velika da se ignoriraju uobičajeni zahtjevi za pažnjom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> preoccupation so great that the ordinary demands on attention are ignored</p><p><b>pelin, absinthe, apsint</b></p><p><i>n.</i> strong green liqueur flavored with wormwood and anise [absinthe]</p><p><b>apsint, pelin, absinthe</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic herb of temperate Eurasia and North Africa having a bitter taste used in making the liqueur absinthe [Artemisia absinthium, common wormwood, lad's love, old man]</p><p><i>n.</i> strong green liqueur flavored with wormwood and anise [absinth]</p><p><b>u obliku maslaca ili maslaca za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili maslace za maslace ili mas (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dark bitter oil obtained from wormwood leaves [wormwood oil]</p><p><b>apsolutan, bez primjesa, bezuvjetan, čist, neograničen, nesumnjiv, potpun, savršen, apsolutni, apsolutni kod, apsolutno</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something that is conceived or that exists independently and not in relation to other things</p><p><i>adj.</i> perfect or complete or pure</p><p><i>adj.</i> complete and without restriction or qualification [downright, out-and-out, rank, right-down, sheer]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not limited by law</p><p><i>adj.</i> expressing finality with no implication of possible change</p><p><i>adj.</i> not capable of being violated or infringed [infrangible, inviolable]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pure ethyl alcohol (containing no more than 1% water)</p><p><b>maksimalna visina na kojoj zrakoplov može održavati horizontalni let (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the maximum altitude at which an airplane can maintain horizontal flight</p><p><b>apsolutna učestalost, apsolutna frekvencija, frekvencija, čestotnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the number of observations in a given statistical category [frequency]</p><p><b>(astronomija) veličina zvijezde koja bi bila vidljiva na udaljenosti od 10 parsekova (32,62 svjetlosne godine) od Zemlje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (astronomy) the magnitude that a star would have if it were viewed from a distance of 10 parsecs (32.62 light years) from the earth</p><p><b>apsolutna većina, većina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (elections) more than half of the votes [majority]</p><p><b>sposobnost prepoznavanja visine tona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ability to identify the pitch of a tone [perfect pitch]</p><p><b>Temperatura je 0 stupnjeva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a temperature scale that defines absolute zero as 0 degrees [Kelvin scale]</p><p><b>fizički prostor neovisno o tome što ga zauzima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> physical space independent of what occupies it</p><p><b>temperatura izmerena na apsolutnoj skali (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> temperature measured on the absolute scale</p><p><b>Najniži stupanj stimulacije koji osoba može otkriti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the lowest level of stimulation that a person can detect</p><p><b>apsolutna vrijednost, apsolutna vrijednost broja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a real number regardless of its sign [numerical value]</p><p><b>mjerenje otpora protoka tekućine pod primjenom sile (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measure of the resistance to flow of a fluid under an applied force [coefficient of viscosity, dynamic viscosity]</p><p><b>apsolutna nula</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (cryogenics) the lowest temperature theoretically attainable (at which the kinetic energy of atoms and molecules is minimal)</p><p><b>apsolutno, bezuvjetno, nezavisno, potpuno, samostalno, sasvim</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> completely and without qualification [dead, perfectly, utterly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> totally and definitely</p><p><b>bezuvjetnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being complete or utter or extreme [starkness, utterness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being absolute</p><p><b>odrješenje, oproštaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being formally forgiven by a priest in the sacrament of penance</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of absolving or remitting [remission, remission of sin, remittal]</p><p><b>apsolutizam, autoritarizam, despotizam, diktatura, staljinizam, totalitarizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dominance through threat of punishment and violence [despotism, tyranny]</p><p><i>n.</i> a form of government in which the ruler is an absolute dictator (not restricted by a constitution or laws or opposition etc.) [Caesarism, Stalinism, authoritarianism, despotism, dictatorship, monocracy, one-man rule, shogunate, totalitarianism, tyranny]</p><p><i>n.</i> the principle of complete and unrestricted power in government [totalism, totalitarianism]</p><p><i>n.</i> the doctrine of an absolute being</p><p><b>Onaj koji zagovara absolutizam., o načelu totalitarizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who advocates absolutism</p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to the principle of totalitarianism [absolutistic]</p><p><b>o načelu totalitarizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to the principle of totalitarianism [absolutist]</p><p><b>odriješiti, osloboditi, ispovijedati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> grant remission of a sin to [shrive]</p><p><i>v.</i> let off the hook [free]</p><p><b>Oslobođen je svih pitanja o krivici. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> freed from any question of guilt [clear, cleared, exculpated, exonerated, vindicated]</p><p><b>odriješiti, osloboditi (od &quot;absolve&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who grants absolution</p><p><b>pružajući oproštenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> providing absolution [exonerative, forgiving]</p><p><b>absorbirati, apsorbirati, crpsti, obuzeti, progutati, upiti, usisati, uvući, asimilirati, bacati se, baciti se, posvetiti se, posvećivati se, udubiti se, udubljivati se, unijeti se, unositi se, zadubiti se, zadubljivati se, obuzimati, okupirati, zaokupiti, zaokupljati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become imbued</p><p><i>v.</i> take up mentally [assimilate, ingest, take in]</p><p><i>v.</i> take up, as of debts or payments [take over]</p><p><i>v.</i> take in, also metaphorically [draw, imbibe, soak up, sop up, suck, suck up, take in, take up]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to become one with</p><p><i>v.</i> suck or take up or in [take in]</p><p><i>v.</i> devote (oneself) fully to [engross, engulf, immerse, plunge, soak up, steep]</p><p><i>v.</i> assimilate or take in</p><p><i>v.</i> consume all of one's attention or time [engage, engross, occupy]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being absorbed or taken in through the pores of a surface</p><p><b>absorbancija, apsorpcija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) a measure of the extent to which a substance transmits light or other electromagnetic radiation [optical density, photographic density, transmission density]</p><p><b>materijal koji je bio ili je sposoban za apsorpciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a material that has been or is capable of being absorbed</p><p><b>apsorbiran, uračunat, apsorbirano</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> giving or marked by complete attention to [captive, engrossed, enwrapped, intent, wrapped]</p><p><i>adj.</i> retained without reflection</p><p><b>koji potiču ili potiču apsorpciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> inducing or promoting absorption [sorbefacient]</p><p><b>apsorbljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being absorbent</p><p><b>absorbent, apsorbent, koji upija, upijajući mat, upijajući materijal</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a material having capacity or tendency to absorb another substance [absorbent material]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having power or capacity or tendency to absorb or soak up something (liquids or energy etc.) [absorptive]</p><p><b>od pamuka napravljenog apsorbentnim uklanjanjem prirodnog voska (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cotton made absorbent by removal of the natural wax</p><p><b>materijal koji ima sposobnost ili tendenciju apsorpcije druge tvari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a material having capacity or tendency to absorb another substance [absorbent]</p><p><b>absorbent, apsorber</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) material in a nuclear reactor that absorbs radiation</p><p><b>apsorbirajući, apsorbiranje, koji upija, privlačan, upijajući, upijanje, usisavanje, zanosan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of arousing and holding the attention [engrossing, fascinating, gripping, riveting]</p><p><b>koeficijent apsorpcije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measure of the rate of decrease in the intensity of electromagnetic radiation (as light) as it passes through a given substance [absorption coefficient, coefficient of absorption]</p><p><b>absorpcija, apsorbirati, apsorpcija, resorpcija, upijanje, zadubljenost, apsorbiran, apsorpcije, apsorpcijom, asimilacija, integracija, preokupacija, zanimanje, zaokupljenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) a process in which one substance permeates another [soaking up]</p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the process in which incident radiated energy is retained without reflection or transmission on passing through a medium</p><p><i>n.</i> the social process of absorbing one cultural group into harmony with another [assimilation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of absorbing nutrients into the body after digestion [assimilation]</p><p><i>n.</i> complete attention [concentration, engrossment, immersion]</p><p><i>n.</i> the mental state of being preoccupied by something [engrossment, preoccupancy, preoccupation]</p><p><b>apsorpcijski pojas, apsorpcijski pojas (frekvencija)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dark band in the spectrum of white light that has been transmitted through a substance that exhibits absorption at selective wavelengths</p><p><b>koeficijent apsorpcije, koeficijent upijanja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measure of the rate of decrease in the intensity of electromagnetic radiation (as light) as it passes through a given substance [absorptance, coefficient of absorption]</p><p><b>(fizička) svojstvo tijela koje određuje dio zračenja ili tokova zvuka koji je tijelo apsorbovalo ili može apsorbirati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the property of a body that determines the fraction of the incident radiation or sound flux absorbed or absorbable by the body [absorptivity]</p><p><b>Indikator koji se koristi u reakcijama koje uključuju obaranje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an indicator used in reactions that involve precipitation</p><p><b>spektar elektromagnetnog zračenja koje je prošlo kroz medij koji je apsorbirao zračenje određenih valnih duljina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the spectrum of electromagnetic radiation that has passed through a medium that absorbed radiation of certain wavelengths</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit for measuring absorption</p><p><b>ima moć ili sposobnost ili sklonost apsorbirati ili upijati nešto (tečnosti ili energiju itd.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having power or capacity or tendency to absorb or soak up something (liquids or energy etc.) [absorbent]</p><p><b>(fizička) svojstvo tijela koje određuje dio zračenja ili tokova zvuka koji je tijelo apsorbovalo ili može apsorbirati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the property of a body that determines the fraction of the incident radiation or sound flux absorbed or absorbable by the body [absorption factor]</p><p><b>bježi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> run away [abscond, bolt, decamp, go off, make off, run off]</p><p><b>apstinirati, suzdržati se, suzdržavati se, uzdržati se, uzdržavati se, suzdržavati, sustezati, uzdržati, kloniti se, odreći se, odricati se, suzdržati se od</b></p><p><i>v.</i> refrain from voting</p><p><i>v.</i> choose not to consume [desist, refrain]</p><p><b>trezvenjak, uzdržljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who practices self denial as a spiritual discipline [ascetic]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who refrains from drinking intoxicating beverages [abstinent, nondrinker]</p><p><b>suzdržljiv, umjeren, uzdržljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> sparing in consumption of especially food and drink</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by temperance in indulgence [light]</p><p><b>suzdržljiv, umjeren, uzdržljiv (od &quot;abstemious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a sparing manner [temperately]</p><p><b>suzdržljiv, umjeren, uzdržljiv (od &quot;abstemious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> restricted to bare necessities</p><p><i>n.</i> moderation in eating and drinking</p><p><b>suzdržavanje, uzdržavanje, uzdržljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of abstaining (especially from alcohol) [abstinence]</p><p><b>samokontrola (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> self-restraining [abstinent]</p><p><b>apstinencija, suzdržavanje, suzdržljivost, umjerenost, uzdržljivost, samoodricanje, uzdržavanje, umerenost, trezvenost, trezvenjaštvo, apstiniranje, odricanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of abstaining (especially from alcohol) [abstention]</p><p><i>n.</i> act or practice of refraining from indulging an appetite</p><p><b>koji apstinira, suzdržan, trezven, trezveni, umjeren</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who refrains from drinking intoxicating beverages [abstainer, nondrinker]</p><p><i>adj.</i> self-restraining [abstentious]</p><p><b>abstrakt, apstrahirati, apstrakcija, apstrakt, apstraktni, izdvojiti, izvod, izvući, kratak izvadak, kratak pregled, neimenovan, odvojiti, odvratiti, razumijevanje, sadržaj, sadržaj, izvod, sažetak, sumirati, ukloniti, zaključiti, zamišljen, apstraktan, apstraktna, odvući, apstraktna ideja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a concept or idea not associated with any specific instance [abstraction]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sketchy summary of the main points of an argument or theory [outline, precis, synopsis]</p><p><i>v.</i> consider a concept without thinking of a specific example</p><p><i>v.</i> make off with belongings of others [cabbage, filch, hook, lift, nobble, pilfer, pinch, purloin, snarf, sneak, swipe]</p><p><i>v.</i> consider apart from a particular case or instance</p><p><i>v.</i> give an abstract (of)</p><p><i>adj.</i> existing only in the mind</p><p><i>adj.</i> not representing or imitating external reality or the objects of nature [abstractionist, nonfigurative, nonobjective]</p><p><i>adj.</i> dealing with a subject in the abstract without practical purpose or intention</p><p><b>apstraktni umjetnički žanr. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abstract genre of art [abstractionism]</p><p><b>slikar apstraktnih slika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a painter of abstract pictures [abstractionist]</p><p><b>apstrakcija, uopćenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a general concept formed by extracting common features from specific examples [abstraction]</p><p><b>New York škola slikarstva karakterizirana slobodno stvorene apstrakcije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a New York school of painting characterized by freely created abstractions [action painting]</p><p><b>apstraktno mišljenje, rasuđivanje, razmišljanje, rezoniranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thinking that is coherent and logical [logical thinking, reasoning]</p><p><b>nepažljiv, rasijan, rastresen, zamišljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lost in thought [absent, absentminded, scatty]</p><p><b>odsutno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an absentminded or preoccupied manner [absently, absentmindedly, inattentively]</p><p><b>obuzetost, opsjednutost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> preoccupation with something to the exclusion of all else [abstraction]</p><p><b>abstrakt, apstrahirati, apstrakcija, apstrakt, apstraktni, izdvojiti, izvod, izvući, kratak izvadak, kratak pregled, neimenovan, odvojiti, odvratiti, razumijevanje, sadržaj, sadržaj, izvod, sažetak, sumirati, ukloniti, zaključiti, zamišljen, apstraktan, apstraktna, odvući (od &quot;abstract&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who makes abstracts or summarizes information [abstractor]</p><p><b>apstrakcija, izlučivanje, otudjivanje, apstraktna ideja, generalizacija, obuzetost, opsjednutost, uopćenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a concept or idea not associated with any specific instance [abstract]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of withdrawing or removing something</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of formulating general concepts by abstracting common properties of instances [generalisation, generalization]</p><p><i>n.</i> an abstract painting</p><p><i>n.</i> preoccupation with something to the exclusion of all else [abstractedness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a general concept formed by extracting common features from specific examples [abstract entity]</p><p><b>apstraktni umjetnički žanr., prikaz koji nema reference na konkretne predmete ili specifične primjere (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abstract genre of art [abstract art]</p><p><i>n.</i> a representation having no reference to concrete objects or specific examples [unrealism]</p><p><b>slikar apstraktnih slika., Ne predstavljaju ili imitiraju vanjsku stvarnost ili predmete prirode (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a painter of abstract pictures [abstract artist]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not representing or imitating external reality or the objects of nature [abstract, nonfigurative, nonobjective]</p><p><b>Odluka Komisije (EU) br. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of an abstracting nature or having the power of abstracting</p><p><b>abstrakt, apstrahirati, apstrakcija, apstrakt, apstraktni, izdvojiti, izvod, izvući, kratak izvadak, kratak pregled, neimenovan, odvojiti, odvratiti, razumijevanje, sadržaj, sadržaj, izvod, sažetak, sumirati, ukloniti, zaključiti, zamišljen, apstraktan, apstraktna, odvući (od &quot;abstract&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in abstract terms</p><p><b>abstrakt, apstrahirati, apstrakcija, apstrakt, apstraktni, izdvojiti, izvod, izvući, kratak izvadak, kratak pregled, neimenovan, odvojiti, odvratiti, razumijevanje, sadržaj, sadržaj, izvod, sažetak, sumirati, ukloniti, zaključiti, zamišljen, apstraktan, apstraktna, odvući (od &quot;abstract&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being considered apart from a specific instance or object</p><p><b>osoba koja pravi sažetke ili sažima informacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who makes abstracts or summarizes information [abstracter]</p><p><b>dubok, nejasan, teško shvatljiv, zakučast</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> difficult to penetrate [deep, recondite]</p><p><b>dubok, nejasan, teško