ate approval [applaud, clap, spat]</p><p><b>aklamacija, klicanje, odobravanje, pljeskanje, proglas</b></p><p><i>n.</i> enthusiastic approval [acclaim, eclat, plaudit, plaudits]</p><p><b>aklimatizirati se, priviknuti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> get used to a certain climate [acclimatise, acclimatize]</p><p><b>aklimatizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> adaptation to a new climate (a new temperature or altitude or environment) [acclimatisation, acclimatization]</p><p><b>aklimatizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> adaptation to a new climate (a new temperature or altitude or environment) [acclimation, acclimatization]</p><p><b>navići se, prilagoditi se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> get used to a certain climate [acclimate, acclimatize]</p><p><b>aklimatizacija, aklimatizacije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> adaptation to a new climate (a new temperature or altitude or environment) [acclimation, acclimatisation]</p><p><b>aklimatizirati se, prilagoditi se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> get used to a certain climate [acclimate, acclimatise]</p><p><b>sklon prema gore (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> sloping upward [rising, uphill]</p><p><b>nagib, strmina, uspon, nagib, uspon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an upward slope or grade (as in a road) [ascent, climb, raise, rise, upgrade]</p><p><b>akolada, lovorike, nagrada, počast, priznanje, čast</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tangible symbol signifying approval or distinction [award, honor, honour, laurels]</p><p><b>akomodirati, izgladiti spor, izravnati, nastaniti, prihvatiti, prilagoditi, prilagoditi se, smjestiti, smještaj, snabdjeti, učiniti uslugu, urediti, uskladiti, zbrinjavati, odgovarati, pasati, pristajati, zadovoljavati, zadovoljiti, adaptirati, podesiti, podešavati, preraditi, prerađivati, preudesiti, preudešavati, preurediti, preuređivati, preustrojavati, preustrojiti, prilagođavati, pomiriti, usuglasiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be agreeable or acceptable to [fit, suit]</p><p><i>v.</i> make fit for, or change to suit a new purpose [adapt]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide with something desired or needed</p><p><i>v.</i> have room for [admit, hold]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide housing for [lodge]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide a service or favor for someone [oblige]</p><p><i>v.</i> make (one thing) compatible with (another) [conciliate, reconcile]</p><p><b>koji obuhvata, koji sadrži, ljubazan, pomirljiv, popustljiv, prilagodljiv, uslužan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> helpful in bringing about a harmonious adaptation [accommodative]</p><p><i>adj.</i> obliging</p><p><b>implantat leće koji sadrži šarcu koja omogućuje vid i blizu i daleko (tako oponaša prirodno leće mlade osobe) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lens implant containing a hinge that allows for both near and far vision (thus mimicking the natural lens of a young person) [accommodating lens implant]</p><p><b>implantat leće koji sadrži šarcu koja omogućuje vid i blizu i daleko (tako oponaša prirodno leće mlade osobe) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lens implant containing a hinge that allows for both near and far vision (thus mimicking the natural lens of a young person) [accommodating IOL]</p><p><b>koji obuhvata, koji sadrži, ljubazan, pomirljiv, popustljiv, prilagodljiv, uslužan (od &quot;accommodating&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in accommodation [obligingly]</p><p><b>akomodacija, izravnanje, pogodnosti, prilagodba, prilagođavanje, smještaj, stan, usluga, ustupak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> making or becoming suitable [adjustment, fitting]</p><p><i>n.</i> a settlement of differences</p><p><i>n.</i> in the theories of Jean Piaget: the modification of internal representations in order to accommodate a changing knowledge of reality</p><p><i>n.</i> living quarters provided for public convenience</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of providing something (lodging or seat or food) to meet a need</p><p><i>n.</i> (physiology) the automatic adjustment in focal length of the natural lens of the eye</p><p><b>osoba koja potvrđuje obveznicu bez naknade ili koristi, već jednostavno kao uslugu za posudnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who endorses a promissory note without compensation or benefit but simply as a favor to the borrower</p><p><b>(nautički) prenosni stubić obješen preko strane plovila kako bi se omogućio pristup malim brodovima uz njega. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (nautical) a portable ladder hung over the side of a vessel to give access to small boats alongside</p><p><b>promjene refleksnih reakcija u očima koje omogućuju fokusiranje predmeta na mrežnjaču (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> reflex changes in the eyes that enable an object to be focused on the retina</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s smještajem sočiva oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the accommodation of the lens of the eye</p><p><b>Pomoćno za harmoničnu adaptaciju., voljni prilagoditi se različitim okolnostima kako bi se postigli sporazumi, koji imaju tendenciju da se pomire ili prilagode (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> helpful in bringing about a harmonious adaptation [accommodating]</p><p><i>adj.</i> willing to adjust to differences in order to obtain agreement [cooperative]</p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to reconcile or accommodate [reconciling]</p><p><b>netko tko obavlja uslugu ili čini uslugu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who performs a service or does a favor [obliger]</p><p><b>praćen, priložen, priložena, u pratnji, prati, priložiti</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having companions or an escort</p><p><i>adj.</i> playing or singing with instrumental or vocal accompaniment [attended]</p><p><b>pratnja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an event or situation that happens at the same time as or in connection with another [attendant, co-occurrence, concomitant]</p><p><i>n.</i> a musical part (vocal or instrumental) that supports or provides background for other musical parts [backup, musical accompaniment, support]</p><p><i>n.</i> something added to complete or embellish or make perfect [complement]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of accompanying someone or something in order to protect them [escort]</p><p><b>pratilac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who provides musical accompaniment (usually on a piano) [accompanyist]</p><p><b>biti priložen, biti priložen uz, dopratiti, istodobno, otpratiti, popratiti, pratiti, priložen, uslijediti, pridružiti se, pridruživati se, praviti društvo</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be present or associated with an event or entity [attach to, come with, go with]</p><p><i>v.</i> go or travel along with</p><p><i>v.</i> perform an accompaniment to [follow, play along]</p><p><i>v.</i> be a companion to somebody [companion, company, keep company]</p><p><b>popratni, praćenje, pridružujući</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring with or following as a consequence [attendant, collateral, concomitant, consequent, ensuant, incidental, resultant, sequent]</p><p><b>vena koja prati drugu strukturu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein accompanying another structure [vena comitans]</p><p><b>osoba koja pruža glazbenu pratnju (obično na klaviru) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who provides musical accompaniment (usually on a piano) [accompanist]</p><p><b>suučesnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who joins with another in carrying out some plan (especially an unethical or illegal plan) [confederate]</p><p><b>ispuniti, izvršiti, napraviti, obaviti, ostvariti, postići, pružiti, realizirati, svršiti, usavršiti, ispunjavati, izvršavati, obavljati, ostvarivati, provesti, provoditi, učiniti, dosegnuti, dosezati, dostignuti, dostizati, dostići, postignuti, postizati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put in effect [action, carry out, carry through, execute, fulfil, fulfill]</p><p><i>v.</i> to gain with effort [achieve, attain, reach]</p><p><b>koji mogu postojati ili se odvijati ili dokazati istinitim (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of existing or taking place or proving true [achievable, doable, manageable, realizable]</p><p><b>dotjeran, izvršen, ostvaren, postići, postignut, potpuno izveden, usavršen, vješt, završen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> highly skilled [complete]</p><p><i>adj.</i> successfully completed or brought to an end [completed, realised, realized]</p><p><i>adj.</i> settled securely and unconditionally [effected, established]</p><p><b>Nepovratno postignuće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an irreversible accomplishment [fait accompli]</p><p><b>dostignuće, isporučen, ispunjenje, obrazovanje, odgojenost, ostvarenje, podvig, postignuće, svršavanje, teret, udobnost, uglađenost, uspjeh, sposobnost, vještina, znanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the action of accomplishing something [achievement]</p><p><i>n.</i> an ability that has been acquired by training [acquirement, acquisition, attainment, skill]</p><p><b>akord, dati, na način, podlaganje, postupati u skladu s, sklad, skladnost, slaganje, složiti se, sporazum, suglasnost, sloga, složnost, pakt, ugovor, pristajati, slagati se, uklapati se, uklopiti se, uskladiti se, usklađivati se, davati, dodijeliti, dodjeljivati, odobravati, odobriti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> harmony of people's opinions or actions or characters [agreement]</p><p><i>n.</i> concurrence of opinion [accordance, conformity]</p><p><i>n.</i> a written agreement between two states or sovereigns [pact, treaty]</p><p><i>n.</i> sympathetic compatibility</p><p><i>v.</i> go together [agree, concord, consort, fit in, harmonise, harmonize]</p><p><i>v.</i> allow to have [allot, grant]</p><p><b>Službenici koji su u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka mogu imati pravo na odobravanje obveza u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the settlement of a debt by paying less than the amount demanded in exchange for extinguishing the debt</p><p><b>dogovor, podudarnost, sklad, slaganje, suglasje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> concurrence of opinion [accord, conformity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of granting rights [accordance of rights]</p><p><b>Čin dodjele prava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of granting rights [accordance]</p><p><b>koji se slaže</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being in agreement or harmony</p><p><i>adj.</i> in keeping [agreeable, concordant, conformable, consonant]</p><p><b>po, po riječima, prema, prema tome, prema tvrdnjama, suglasno, u ovisnosti, u skladu</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (followed by `to') in agreement with or accordant with</p><p><i>adj.</i> (followed by `to') as reported or stated by</p><p><b>na taj način, o tome, po tome, prema tome, prema tomu, shodno tome, zato</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> (sentence connectors) because of the reason given [consequently]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in accordance with</p><p><b>harmonika, klasična harmonika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a portable box-shaped free-reed instrument [squeeze box]</p><p><b>unutarnja vrata koja se otvaraju sklopljenjem u dijelove (umjesto zamahanja na šarenama) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an interior door that opens by folding back in sections (rather than by swinging on hinges) [folding door]</p><p><b>harmonikaš</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a musician who plays the accordion</p><p><b>obratiti se, osloviti, oslovljavanje, pozdrav, prići nekomu, prilaženje, pristupanje, adresirati, obraćati se, oslovljavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> speak to someone [address, come up to]</p><p><i>v.</i> approach with an offer of sexual favors [hook, solicit]</p><p><b>porod</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the parturition process in human beings [childbearing, childbirth, vaginal birth]</p><p><b>liječnik specijaliziran za porodicu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a physician specializing in obstetrics [obstetrician]</p><p><b>babica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman skilled in aiding the delivery of babies [midwife]</p><p><b>bilanca, ceh, dobitak, iskaz, izvještaj, konačni obračun, konto, korisnički račun, korist, obračun, obračunavanje, obuhvat, obzir, ocjenjivanje, podnesak, portfelj, poslovno izvješće, priča, prikaz, procjena, račun, razlog, uzrok, važnost, zapis, zaračunavanje, značaj, nalog, kronika, povijesna kronika, povijest, izvješće, *account, business relationship, raeun, objašnjenje, obrazloženje, opis, razjašnjenje, tumačenje, raport, izračunati, izračunavati, kalkulirati, obračunati, obračunavati, računati, sračunati, izvijestiti, izvještavati, opisati, opisivati, prikazati, prikazivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a record or narrative description of past events [chronicle, history, story]</p><p><i>n.</i> a short account of the news [news report, report, story, write up]</p><p><i>n.</i> a formal contractual relationship established to provide for regular banking or brokerage or business services [business relationship]</p><p><i>n.</i> a statement that makes something comprehensible by describing the relevant structure or operation or circumstances etc. [explanation]</p><p><i>n.</i> grounds [score]</p><p><i>n.</i> importance or value</p><p><i>n.</i> a statement of recent transactions and the resulting balance [account statement, accounting]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of informing by verbal report [report]</p><p><i>n.</i> an itemized statement of money owed for goods shipped or services rendered [bill, invoice]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of taking advantage</p><p><i>v.</i> be the sole or primary factor in the existence, acquisition, supply, or disposal of something</p><p><i>v.</i> keep an account of [calculate]</p><p><i>v.</i> to give an account or representation of in words [describe, report]</p><p><i>v.</i> furnish a justifying analysis or explanation [answer for]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a record in which commercial accounts are recorded [book, book of account, ledger, leger]</p><p><b>osoba koja je odgovorna za račun klijenta za oglašivačku agenciju ili posredništvo ili drugo poslovanje u području usluga. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone in charge of a client's account for an advertising agency or brokerage or other service business [account representative, customer's broker, customer's man, registered representative]</p><p><b>objasniti, obračunati, protumačiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be the reason or explanation for</p><p><i>v.</i> give reasons for</p><p><b>Iznos koji se može uzeti u obzir za izračun porezne naknade za proizvode i usluge kupljene na kredit (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a liability account showing how much is owed for goods and services purchased on credit [payable]</p><p><b>osoba koja je odgovorna za račun klijenta za oglašivačku agenciju ili posredništvo ili drugo poslovanje u području usluga. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone in charge of a client's account for an advertising agency or brokerage or other service business [account executive, customer's broker, customer's man, registered representative]</p><p><b>račun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a statement of recent transactions and the resulting balance [account, accounting]</p><p><b>odgovornosti, odgovornost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> responsibility to someone or for some activity [answerability, answerableness]</p><p><b>na koji se može računati, odgovoran, odgovorni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> liable to account for one's actions</p><p><b>knjigovodstvo, računovodstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the occupation of maintaining and auditing records and preparing financial reports for a business [accounting]</p><p><b>knjigovođa, računovođa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who maintains and audits business accounts [comptroller, controller]</p><p><b>pozicija računovođa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the position of accountant</p><p><b>financijski obračun, knjigovodstvo, obračun, obračunavanje, proračun, računovodstvo, zaračunavanje, obračunavanje (korisničke usluge), računovodstvena, računovodstvu, račun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a convincing explanation that reveals basic causes</p><p><i>n.</i> a system that provides quantitative information about finances</p><p><i>n.</i> the occupation of maintaining and auditing records and preparing financial reports for a business [accountancy]</p><p><i>n.</i> a bookkeeper's chronological list of related debits and credits of a business [accounting system, method of accounting]</p><p><i>n.</i> a statement of recent transactions and the resulting balance [account, account statement]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ili (b) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ili (b) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ili (b) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ili (b) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013 ili u skladu s član (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> all the data (ledgers and journals and spreadsheets) that support a financial statement</p><p><b>knjiženje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a written record of a commercial transaction [entry, ledger entry]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, poduzeća koja pružaju usluge računovodstva i revizije za naknadu moraju biti: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a firm of accountants who provide accounting and auditing services for a fee</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka ne primjenjuje jedna od sljedećih odredbi: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a principle that governs current accounting practice and that is used as a reference to determine the appropriate treatment of complex transactions [accounting standard]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka ne primjenjuje jedna od sljedećih odredbi: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a principle that governs current accounting practice and that is used as a reference to determine the appropriate treatment of complex transactions [accounting principle]</p><p><b>računovodstveni sustav, sustav računa narodnoga gospodarstva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bookkeeper's chronological list of related debits and credits of a business [accounting, method of accounting]</p><p><b>računi dužnika novca koji duguje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a debtor's accounts of money he owes</p><p><b>potraživanja od kupaca</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a creditor's accounts of money owed to him</p><p><b>Obezbediti vojnu opremu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> provide with military equipment [accoutre]</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, "službenici" znači osoblje koje je obuhvaćeno: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> provided with necessary articles of equipment for a specialized purpose (especially military) [accoutred]</p><p><b>modni dodatak, odjevni dodatak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clothing that is worn or carried, but not part of your main clothing [accessory, accoutrement]</p><p><b>opremiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> provide with military equipment [accouter]</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, "službenici" znači osoblje koje je obuhvaćeno: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> provided with necessary articles of equipment for a specialized purpose (especially military) [accoutered]</p><p><b>modni dodatak, odjevni dodatak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clothing that is worn or carried, but not part of your main clothing [accessory, accouterment]</p><p><b>Accra</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital and largest city of Ghana with a deep-water port [capital of Ghana]</p><p><b>akreditirati, opunomoćiti, povjeriti, pripisivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> grant credentials to [recognise, recognize]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide or send (envoys or embassadors) with official credentials</p><p><i>v.</i> ascribe an achievement to [credit]</p><p><b>akreditacija, ovlašćivanje, potvrđivanje, punomoć</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of granting credit or recognition (especially with respect to educational institution that maintains suitable standards)</p><p><b>opunomoćen vjerodajnicom, ovlašten</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> given official approval to act [commissioned, licenced, licensed]</p><p><b>srasti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> grow together (of plants and organs)</p><p><i>v.</i> grow or become attached by accretion</p><p><b>naraštaj, porast, povećanje, prirast, priraštaj, srašćivanje, uvećanje, akumulacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an increase by natural growth or addition [accumulation]</p><p><i>n.</i> something contributing to growth or increase</p><p><i>n.</i> (astronomy) the formation of a celestial object by the effect of gravity pulling together surrounding objects and gases</p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) growth by addition as by the adhesion of parts or particles</p><p><i>n.</i> (geology) an increase in land resulting from alluvial deposits or waterborne sediment</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) an increase in a beneficiary's share in an estate (as when a co-beneficiary dies or fails to meet some condition or rejects the inheritance)</p><p><b>označen ili proizvedeno akrecijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked or produced by accretion</p><p><b>rast akrecije (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> growing by accretion</p><p><b>prirast, akumulacija, akumuliranje, nakupljanje, prikupljanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of accumulating [accruement, accumulation]</p><p><b>metod obračuna u kojem se svaka stavka upisuje kako je zaradjena ili nastala bez obzira na to kada su stvarna plaćanja primljena ili izvršena. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of accounting in which each item is entered as it is earned or incurred regardless of when actual payments are received or made</p><p><b>biti na korist, imati korist, nadjačati, narasti, pasti u dio, pridoći, pripadati, prirastati, prirasti, priticati, proizaći, potpadati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> grow by addition</p><p><i>v.</i> come into the possession of [fall]</p><p><b>dospio</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> periodically accumulated over time [accumulated]</p><p><b>akumulacija, akumuliranje, nakupljanje, prikupljanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of accumulating [accrual, accumulation]</p><p><b>kulturno se asimilirati. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> assimilate culturally</p><p><b>akulturacija, enkulturacija, socijalizacija, kultura</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the adoption of the behavior patterns of the surrounding culture [enculturation, socialisation, socialization]</p><p><i>n.</i> all the knowledge and values shared by a society [culture]</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of assimilating new ideas into an existing cognitive structure [assimilation]</p><p><b>o akulturaciji ili s njom povezanim (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to acculturation [acculturative]</p><p><b>o akulturaciji ili s njom povezanim (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to acculturation [acculturational]</p><p><b>nalegnut, naslonjen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lying down [decumbent, recumbent]</p><p><b>akomulirati, akumulirati, gomilati, nagomilati, nakupiti, kupiti, nakupljati, naslagati, pribirati se, sabirati, sabrati, sakupiti, sakupljati, skupiti, skupljati, slagati, zgrnuti, zgrnuti se, zgrtati, nagomilavati, okupiti, okupljati, pribirati, prikupiti, prikupljati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> get or gather together [amass, collect, compile, hoard, pile up, roll up]</p><p><i>v.</i> collect or gather [amass, conglomerate, cumulate, gather, pile up]</p><p><b>nakupljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> periodically accumulated over time [accrued]</p><p><b>akumulacija, gomila, hrpa, nagomilavanje, nakupljanje, uvećanje, zgrtanje, agregat, grupa, skup, skupina, zbir, zbirka, akumuliranje, prikupljanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an increase by natural growth or addition [accretion]</p><p><i>n.</i> several things grouped together or considered as a whole [aggregation, assemblage, collection]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of accumulating [accrual, accruement]</p><p><i>n.</i> (finance) profits that are not paid out as dividends but are added to the capital base of the corporation</p><p><b>nakupljajući</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> increasing by successive addition [cumulative]</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by acquiring or amassing</p><p><b>akumulator, gramzljivac, gramžljivac, kolektor, skupljač, baterija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is employed to collect payments (as for rent or taxes) [collector, gatherer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a voltaic battery that stores electric charge [storage battery]</p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a register that has a built-in adder that adds an input number to the contents of the register [accumulator register]</p><p><b>(računovodstvo) register koji ima ugrađen dodavatelj k