 koja se koristi kao analgetik, ali i kao antipiretik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white crystalline compound used as an analgesic and also as an antipyretic [acetanilide, phenylacetamide]</p><p><b>acetanilid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white crystalline compound used as an analgesic and also as an antipyretic [acetanilid, phenylacetamide]</p><p><b>acetat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a salt or ester of acetic acid [ethanoate]</p><p><i>n.</i> a fabric made from fibers of cellulose acetate [acetate rayon]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm i (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disk coated with cellulose acetate [phonograph recording disk]</p><p><b>od vlakana od celulozne acetatne vlakne (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fabric made from fibers of cellulose acetate [acetate]</p><p><b>acetatni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or containing acetic acid</p><p><b>fluorindol-octena kiselina, octena kiselina, octenakiselina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless pungent liquid widely used in manufacturing plastics and pharmaceuticals [ethanoic acid]</p><p><b>acetanhidrid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compound that is needed in order to refine opium into heroin</p><p><b>oksidirati, ukiseliti, zakiseliti, kiseliti, ukiseliti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make sour or more sour [acidify, acidulate, sour]</p><p><i>v.</i> turn acidic [acidify]</p><p><b>Svaka od tri tekuća acetatna jedinjenja koja nastaju prilikom zagrijavanja sirćetne kiseline i glicerina zajedno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of three liquid acetates that are formed when acetic acid and glycerin are heated together</p><p><b>nestabilna kiselina koja se nalazi u abnormalnim količinama u krvi i urinu u nekim slučajevima poremećajnih metabolizma (kao što su dijabetes ili gladovanje) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> unstable acid found in abnormal amounts in the blood and urine in some cases of impaired metabolism (as diabetes mellitus or starvation)</p><p><b>aceton</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the simplest ketone [dimethyl ketone, propanone]</p><p><b>keton koji je međuprodukt