(MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the organic group of acetic acid (CH3CO-) [acetyl, acetyl group, ethanoyl group, ethanoyl radical]</p><p><b>zauzimaju zamjenu acetilne skupine, Uređaj za proizvodnju i proizvodnju proizvoda od gume ili gume (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> receive substitution of an acetyl group [acetylise, acetylize]</p><p><i>v.</i> introduce an acetyl group into (a chemical compound) [acetylise, acetylize]</p><p><b>proces uvođenja acetilne skupine u spojeno tijelo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of introducing an acetyl group into a compound</p><p><b>neurotransmiter koji je derivat holina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a neurotransmitter that is a derivative of choline</p><p><b>acetilen, alkini, etin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless flammable gas used chiefly in welding and in organic synthesis [alkyne, ethyne]</p><p><b>od ili srodno s acetilenem (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or related to acetylene</p><p><b>acetil (od &quot;acetyl&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or related to acetic acid</p><p><b>zauzimaju zamjenu acetilne skupine, Uređaj za proizvodnju i proizvodnju proizvoda od gume ili gume (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> receive substitution of an acetyl group [acetylate, acetylize]</p><p><i>v.</i> introduce an acetyl group into (a chemical compound) [acetylate, acetylize]</p><p><b>zauzimaju zamjenu acetilne skupine, Uređaj za proizvodnju i proizvodnju proizvoda od gume ili gume (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> receive substitution of an acetyl group [acetylate, acetylise]</p><p><i>v.</i> introduce an acetyl group into (a chemical compound) [acetylate, acetylise]</p><p><b>acetilsalicilna kiselina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the acetylated derivative of salicylic acid [Bayer, Empirin, St. Joseph, aspirin]</p><p><b>regija drevne Grčke na sjevernoj obali Peloponeza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a region of ancient Greece on the north coast of the Peloponnese</p><p><b>član jedne od četiri jezične divizije prapovijesnih Grka, Stari grčki stanovnici Ahaje., o ili u vezi s Akajom ili njenim drevnim grčkim narodom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of one of four linguistic divisions of the prehistoric Greeks [Achaian]</p><p><i>n.</i> the ancient Greek inhabitants of Achaea [Arcado-Cyprians]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Achaea or its ancient Greek people</p><p><b>član jedne od četiri jezične divizije prapovijesnih Grka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of one of four linguistic divisions of the prehistoric Greeks [Achaean]</p><p><b>bol, boljeti, čeznut za nečim, bolovati, patiti, trpjeti, ginuti, kopnjeti, skapavati, venuti, čeznuti, žudjeti, izazivati bol, izazvati bol, nanijeti bol, nanositi bol, zaboljeti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dull persistent (usually moderately intense) pain [aching]</p><p><i>v.</i> feel physical pain [hurt, suffer]</p><p><i>v.</i> have a desire for something or someone who is not present [languish, pine, yearn, yen]</p><p><i>v.</i> be the source of pain [hurt, smart]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small dry indehiscent fruit with the seed distinct from the fruit wall</p><p><b>za suho jednosemno voće bez sjemenki (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to dry one-seeded indehiscent fruit</p><p><b>(grčka mitologija) rijeka u Hadesu preko koje su duše mrtvih nosio Charon (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) a river in Hades across which the souls of the dead were carried by Charon [River Acheron]</p><p><b>Tamno i tužno kao rijeka Akeron i Styx u Hadesu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> dark and dismal as of the rivers Acheron and Styx in Hades [Acherontic, Stygian]</p><p><b>smrtni ćun (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> death's-head moth [genus Acherontia]</p><p><b>Europski jastreb s oznakama na leđima koje liče na ljudsku lubanju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European hawkmoth with markings on the back resembling a human skull [death's-head moth]</p><p><b>Tamno i tužno kao rijeka Akeron i Styx u Hadesu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> dark and dismal as of the rivers Acheron and Styx in Hades [Acheronian, Stygian]</p><p><b>Američki državnik koji je promovirao Marshallov plan i pomogao u osnivanju NATO-a (1893-1971) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States statesman who promoted the Marshall Plan and helped establish NATO (1893-1971) [Dean Acheson, Dean Gooderham Acheson]</p><p><b>industrijski proces za proizvodnju grafita zagrijavanjem mješavine koksa i gline (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an industrial process for making graphite by heating a mixture of coke and clay</p><p><b>uobičajeni kućni i poljski cvrčci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common house and field crickets [genus Acheta]</p><p><b>čisti američki cvrčak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common American black cricket [field cricket]</p><p><b>živi u ljudskim stanovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lives in human dwellings [European house cricket]</p><p><b>stanje da se može postići (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being achievable [attainability, attainableness]</p><p><b>dostupan, ostvariv, ostvarive</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of existing or taking place or proving true [accomplishable, doable, manageable, realizable]</p><p><b>dostići, ispuniti, izvršiti, ostvariti, postići, postizati, provesti, steći, uspjeti, ostvare, ostvarit, postignu, dosegnuti, dosezati, dostignuti, dostizati, ispunjavati, ostvarivati, postignuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> to gain with effort [accomplish, attain, reach]</p><p><b>dostignuće, ispunjenje, izvršenje, ostvarenje, ostvarivanje, ostvarivanje ciljeva, postignuće, potpuno oblikovani grb, ostvarenja, ostvarivati, postignuća, postizanja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the action of accomplishing something [accomplishment]</p><p><b>dostići, ispuniti, izvršiti, ostvariti, postići, postizati, provesti, steći, uspjeti, ostvare, ostvarit, postignu (od &quot;achieve&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person with a record of successes [succeeder, success, winner]</p><p><b>papa koji je potpisao sporazum s Mussolinijem priznajući Vatikan kao neovisnu državu (1857-1939) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pope who signed a treaty with Mussolini recognizing the Vatican City as an independent state (1857-1939) [Ambrogio Damiano Achille Ratti, Pius XI]</p><p><b>stolisnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several plants of the genus Achillea native to Europe and having small white flowers in flat-topped flower heads</p><p><b>sveprisutna snažno mirisna evroazijska biljka koja stvara mat iz pustinje, živine ili pašnjaka s uskim listovima i malim obično bijelim cvetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ubiquitous strong-scented mat-forming Eurasian herb of wasteland, hedgerow or pasture having narrow serrate leaves and small usually white florets [milfoil, yarrow]</p><p><b>Eurazijska biljka s puste glave bijelih cvijeća u obliku gumbova i dugim sivo-zelenim lištima koji uzrokuju kihanje kada se uprašuju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Eurasian herb having loose heads of button-shaped white flowers and long grey-green leaves that cause sneezing when powdered [sneezeweed yarrow, sneezewort]</p><p><b>Ahilej</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mythical Greek hero of the Iliad</p><p><b>Ahilova tetiva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large tendon that runs from the heel to the calf [tendon of Achilles]</p><p><b>Ahilova peta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a seemingly small but actual mortal weakness</p><p><b>biljka iz roda Achimenes s naglasnim cvjetovima u obliku zvona koji liče na gloxinije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any plant of the genus Achimenes having showy bell-shaped flowers that resemble gloxinias [hot water plant]</p><p><b>bolan, bol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dull persistent (usually moderately intense) pain [ache]</p><p><i>adj.</i> causing a dull and steady pain [achy]</p><p><b>Cigna uzgajana posebno za svoj jestivi korijenski stalak od kojeg se dobiva škrob od korijena-strelja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> canna grown especially for its edible rootstock from which arrowroot starch is obtained [Canna edulis, Canna indica, arrowroot, indian shot]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 85% ili više, ali ne više od 50% masenog udjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not having a floral envelope or perianth</p><p><b>Ne