onicljiv, silovit, visok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mark placed above a vowel to indicate pronunciation [acute accent, ague]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having or experiencing a rapid onset and short but severe course</p><p><i>adj.</i> extremely sharp or severe [intense]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having or demonstrating ability to recognize or draw fine distinctions [discriminating, incisive, keen, knifelike, penetrating, penetrative, piercing, sharp]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of an angle</p><p><i>adj.</i> ending in a sharp point [acuate, needlelike, sharp]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of critical importance and consequence</p><p><b>znak postavljen iznad samoglasnika kako bi se pokazalo izgovor (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mark placed above a vowel to indicate pronunciation [acute, ague]</p><p><b>oštar ugao, oštri kut, šiljasti kut</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an angle less than 90 degrees but more than 0 degrees</p><p><b>akutna virusna bolest obilježena upalom živčanih stanica moždanog stabla i kičmene moždine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acute viral disease marked by inflammation of nerve cells of the brain stem and spinal cord [infantile paralysis, polio, poliomyelitis]</p><p><b>bilo koji poremećaj (kao iznenadna konfuzija ili dezorijentacija) kod inače normalne osobe koji je uzrokovan reverzibilnim (privremenim) oštećenjem moždanog tkiva (kao što su ozljede glave ili lijekovi ili infekcija) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any disorder (as sudden confusion or disorientation) in an otherwise normal person that is due to reversible (temporary) impairment of brain tissues (as by head injuries or drugs or infection) [acute organic brain syndrome]</p><p><b>gastritis uzrokovan unesenjem iritantnog tvari (kao što je previše aspirina) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> gastritis caused by ingesting an irritant (as too much aspirin)</p><p><b>glaukom u kojem iris blokira odliv vodene vode (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> glaucoma in which the iris blocks the outflow of aqueous humor [angle-closure glaucoma, closed-angle glaucoma]</p><p><b>glositis uzrokovan ozljedom ili infekcijom i karakteriziran oticanjem i bolom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> glossitis resulting from injury or infection and characterized by swelling and pain</p><p><b>encefalitis koji se sliči apopleksiji zbog ekstravasacije krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> encephalitis that resembles apoplexy due to blood extravasation</p><p><b>uobičajena oblika akutnog encefalitisa uzrokovanog herpesom simplexom 1 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common form of acute encephalitis caused by herpes simplex 1 [herpes encephalitis, herpes simplex encephalitis]</p><p><b>bubrežna insuficijencija povezana s opeklinama ili drugom traumom ili akutnom infekcijom ili opstrukcijom mokraćnih puteva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> renal failure associated with burns or other trauma or with acute infection or obstruction of the urinary tract [acute renal failure]</p><p><b>akutna leukemija, akutne leukemije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rapidly progressing leukemia</p><p><b>akutna leukemija koju karakterizira proliferacija nezrelih limfoblastnih stanica u koštanoj srži, limfnim čvorovima, slezni i krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> acute leukemia characterized by proliferation of immature lymphoblast-like cells in bone marrow, lymph nodes, spleen, and blood [acute lymphocytic leukemia]</p><p><b>akutna leukemija koju karakterizira proliferacija nezrelih limfoblastnih stanica u koštanoj srži, limfnim čvorovima, slezni i krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> acute leukemia characterized by proliferation of immature lymphoblast-like cells in bone marrow, lymph nodes, spleen, and blood [acute lymphoblastic leukemia]</p><p><b>akutna leukemija karakterizirana proliferacijom granularnih leukocita (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> acute leukemia characterized by proliferation of granular leukocytes [acute myeloid leukemia]</p><p><b>akutna leukemija karakterizirana proliferacijom granularnih leukocita (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> acute leukemia characterized by proliferation of granular leukocytes [acute myelocytic leukemia]</p><p><b>bilo koji poremećaj (kao iznenadna konfuzija ili dezorijentacija) kod inače normalne osobe koji je uzrokovan reverzibilnim (privremenim) oštećenjem moždanog tkiva (kao što su ozljede glave ili lijekovi ili infekcija) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any disorder (as sudden confusion or disorientation) in an otherwise normal person that is due to reversible (temporary) impairment of brain tissues (as by head injuries or drugs or infection) [acute brain disorder]</p><p><b>Pjelonefritis uzrokovan širenjem infekcije mjehura (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pyelonephritis resulting from the spread of a bladder infection</p><p><b>akutno zatajenje bubrega</b></p><p><i>n.</i> renal failure associated with burns or other trauma or with acute infection or obstruction of the urinary tract [acute kidney failure]</p><p><b>skizofrenija iznenadne pojave i relativno kratkog trajanja (nekoliko tjedana ili mjeseci) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> schizophrenia of abrupt onset and relatively short duration (a few weeks or months) [reactive schizophrenia]</p><p><b>trougao čiji su unutarnji uglovi svi oštri. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a triangle whose interior angles are all acute [acute-angled triangle]</p><p><b>trougao čiji su unutarnji uglovi svi oštri. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a triangle whose interior angles are all acute [acute triangle]</p><p><b>akutno, izrazito, oštro</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a keen or penetrating way [keenly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> having a rapid onset</p><p><i>adv.</i> changing suddenly in direction and degree [sharp, sharply]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a shrewd manner [astutely, sagaciously, sapiently, shrewdly]</p><p><b>oštrina, prodornost, pronicljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sensitivity that is keen and highly developed</p><p><i>n.</i> a quick and penetrating intelligence [acuity, keenness, sharpness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of having a sharp edge or point</p><p><b>aciklički, aperiodičan, neperiodičan, aperiodični, neperiodični</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not cyclic</p><p><i>adj.</i> having an open chain structure [open-chain]</p><p><b>aciklovir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an oral antiviral drug (trade name Zovirax) used to treat genital herpes [Zovirax]</p><p><b>kiselinski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any group or radical of the form RCO- where R is an organic group [acyl group]</p><p><b>organska spojeva koja reagiraju s vodom kako bi formirala kiselinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> organic compounds that react with water to form an acid [acid anhydrides]</p><p><b>bilo koja grupa ili radikal oblika RCO- gdje je R organska grupa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any group or radical of the form RCO- where R is an organic group [acyl]</p><p><b>organska spojeva koja sadrže grupu -COX gdje je X halogen atom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> organic compounds containing the group -COX where X is a halogen atom [acid halide]</p><p><b>proces uvođenja acilne skupine u spojeno tijelo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of introducing an acyl group into a compound</p><p><b>ester glicerola i masnih kiselina koji se prirodno nalazi u obliku masti i masnih ulja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ester of glycerol and fatty acids that occurs naturally as fats and fatty oils [glyceride]</p><p><b>do, n.e., abbr. nove ere, oglas, reklama, nove ere, oglašavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a public promotion of some product or service [advert, advertisement, advertising, advertizement, advertizing]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in the Christian era [A.D., anno Domini]</p><p><b>Agencija koja dizajnira oglase kako bi privukla pažnju javnosti na svoje klijente. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency that designs advertisement to call public attention to its clients [advertising agency]</p><p><b>organiziran program oglašavanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an organized program of advertisements [ad campaign, advertising campaign]</p><p><b>organiziran program oglašavanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an organized program of advertisements [ad blitz, advertising campaign]</p><p><b>lat. u ovom slučaju, ad hoc</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> often improvised or impromptu</p><