p><p><b>sušene cigle na suncu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sun-dried brick [adobe]</p><p><b>kuća izgrađena od trave ili kvrga postavljena u vodoravnim stazama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a house built of sod or adobe laid in horizontal courses [sod house, soddy]</p><p><b>Kalifornijskog bilja s ružičastim ljubičastim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> California herb with pinkish purple flowers [Fritillaria pluriflora, pink fritillary]</p><p><b>Slanina od povrća i mesa ili ribe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dish of marinated vegetables and meat or fish</p><p><b>postati tinejdžer (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become adolescent</p><p><b>adolescencija, mladost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time period between the beginning of puberty and adulthood</p><p><i>n.</i> in the state that someone is in between puberty and adulthood</p><p><b>adolescent, mlad, mladenački, djevojka, mladić</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a juvenile between the onset of puberty and maturity [stripling, teen, teenager]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or peculiar to or suggestive of an adolescent</p><p><i>adj.</i> being of the age 13 through 19 [teen, teenage, teenaged]</p><p><i>adj.</i> displaying or suggesting a lack of maturity [jejune, juvenile, puerile]</p><p><i>adj.</i> in the state of development between puberty and maturity</p><p><b>Austrijac koji je postao nacistički dužnosnik koji je upravljao koncentracijskim logorima gdje su u Drugom svjetskom ratu ubijeni milijuni Židova (1906-1962) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian who became the Nazi official who administered the concentration camps where millions of Jews were murdered during World War II (1906-1962) [Eichmann, Karl Adolf Eichmann]</p><p><b>Führer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German Nazi dictator during World War II (1889-1945) [Der Fuhrer, Hitler]</p><p><b>Austrijski arhitekt (1870-1933) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian architect (1870-1933) [Loos]</p><p><b>Njemački kemičar koji je proučavao steroide i holesterol i otkrio histamin (1876-1959) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German chemist who studied steroids and cholesterol and discovered histamine (1876-1959) [Windaus]</p><p><b>Izdavač američkih novina (1858-1935) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States newspaper publisher (1858-1935) [Ochs]</p><p><b>Belgijski proizvođač glazbenih instrumenata koji je izumio saksofon (1814-1894) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Belgian maker of musical instruments who invented the saxophone (1814-1894) [Sax]</p><p><b>stih s daktilom nakon kojeg slijedi spondee ili trochee, ili u vezi ili poput Adonisa., s ritmom koji se sastoji od daktila, nakon kojeg slijedi spondee ili trochee (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a verse line with a dactyl followed by a spondee or trochee [Adonic line]</p><p><i>adj.</i> or relating to or like Adonis</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a rhythm consisting of a dactyl followed by a spondee or a trochee</p><p><b>stih s daktilom nakon kojeg slijedi spondee ili trochee (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a verse line with a dactyl followed by a spondee or trochee [Adonic]</p><p><b>Adonis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any handsome young man</p><p><i>n.</i> annual or perennial herbs [genus Adonis]</p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) a handsome youth loved by both Aphrodite and Persephone</p><p><b>Evroazijska biljka uzgajana zbog svojih tamnocrvenih cvijeća s tamnim središtima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Eurasian herb cultivated for its deep red flowers with dark centers [pheasant's-eye]</p><p><b>adoptirati, birati, donijeti, posiniti, posvojiti, pozajmiti, prihvatiti, primijeniti, prisvojiti, usvajanjem, usvojiti, posuditi, preuzeti, sticati, dramatizirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> choose and follow [espouse, follow]</p><p><i>v.</i> take up and practice as one's own [borrow, take over, take up]</p><p><i>v.</i> take on titles, offices, duties, responsibilities [assume, take on, take over]</p><p><i>v.</i> take on a certain form, attribute, or aspect [acquire, assume, take, take on]</p><p><i>v.</i> take into one's family [take in]</p><p><i>v.</i> put into dramatic form [dramatise, dramatize]</p>