frike čiji su preci bili Nizozemci ili s njihovim jezikom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an official language of the Republic of South Africa [Taal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging or relating to white people of South Africa whose ancestors were Dutch or to their language [Afrikaner]</p><p><b>Bijeli rođenik provincije Cape koji je potomak nizozemskih doseljenika i koji govori afrikaneski. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white native of Cape Province who is a descendant of Dutch settlers and who speaks Afrikaans [Afrikaner, Boer]</p><p><b>Bijeli rođenik provincije Cape koji je potomak nizozemskih doseljenika i koji govori afrikaneski., pripadnici ili povezani s bijelcima Južne Afrike čiji su preci bili Nizozemci ili s njihovim jezikom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white native of Cape Province who is a descendant of Dutch settlers and who speaks Afrikaans [Afrikander, Boer]</p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging or relating to white people of South Africa whose ancestors were Dutch or to their language [Afrikaans]</p><p><b>Laboratorija za obranu američkog ratnog zrakoplovstva odgovorna za otkrivanje, razvoj i integraciju borbenih tehnologija za zrakoplovne snage. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a United States Air Force defense laboratory responsible for discovering and developing and integrating fighting technologies for aerospace forces [Air Force Research Laboratory]</p><p><b>afro-frizura</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rounded thickly curled hairdo [Afro hairdo]</p><p><b>okrugla, debelo zakrkana frizura. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rounded thickly curled hairdo [Afro]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na ili karakterističan za Amerikance afričkog podrijetla (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to or characteristic of Americans of African ancestry [African-American]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s narodima Afrike i Azije ili njihovim narodima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the nations of Africa and Asia or their peoples</p><p><b>velika obitelj srodnih jezika koji se govore u Aziji i Africi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large family of related languages spoken both in Asia and Africa [Afrasian, Afrasian language, Afroasiatic, Afroasiatic language, Hamito-Semitic]</p><p><b>Peruka koja daje izgled afro frizure. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wig that gives the appearance of an Afro hairdo</p><p><b>velika obitelj srodnih jezika koji se govore u Aziji i Africi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large family of related languages spoken both in Asia and Africa [Afrasian, Afrasian language, Afro-Asiatic, Afroasiatic language, Hamito-Semitic]</p><p><b>velika obitelj srodnih jezika koji se govore u Aziji i Africi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large family of related languages spoken both in Asia and Africa [Afrasian, Afrasian language, Afro-Asiatic, Afroasiatic, Hamito-Semitic]</p><p><b>Sastavljenici i slijepi drveći (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dioecious evergreen trees or shrubs [genus Afrocarpus]</p><p><b>Srednje veličine drvo iz Južne Afrike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medium-sized tree of South Africa [bastard yellowwood, common yellowwood]</p><p><b>Oba spola su svijetle boje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> both sexes are brightly colored [Afropavo congensis, Congo peafowl]</p><p><b>Oba spola su svijetle boje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> both sexes are brightly colored [Congo peafowl, afropavo]</p><p><b>zapovjedništvo američkog ratnog zrakoplovstva koje je odgovorno za obranu Sjedinjenih Država kroz svoje svemirske i interkontinentalne balističke raketne operacije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a command of the United States Air Force that is responsible for defending the United States through its space and intercontinental ballistic missile operations [Air Force Space Command]</p><p><b>krmeni dio broda, kruna, na krmi, na kruni, prema krmi, straga, zadnji, zadnji dio</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (nautical, aeronautical) situated at or toward the stern or tail</p><p><i>adv.</i> at or near or toward the stern of a ship or tail of an airplane [abaft, astern]</p><p><b>iza, kasnije, kasniji, naknadni, naknadno, nakon, o, po, p