y a negative image) that persists after stimulation has ceased [afterimage]</p><p><b>Dodatno pero (obično malo) na donjoj strani baze osovine neke pete kod neke ptice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a supplementary feather (usually small) on the underside of the base of the shaft of some feathers in some birds</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenjem od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having an aftershaft (a small feather at the base of some feathers)</p><p><b>potres (ili jedan od niza potresa) koji se javlja nakon glavnog udara potresa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tremor (or one of a series of tremors) occurring after the main shock of an earthquake</p><p><b>Poslijelik od ukusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an afterimage of a taste</p><p><b>primisao, zakašnjela misao</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thinking again about a choice previously made [reconsideration, rethink, second thought]</p><p><i>n.</i> an addition that was not included in the original plan</p><p><b>docnije, kasnije, naknadno, nakon, poslije, potom</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> happening at a time subsequent to a reference time [after, afterwards, later, later on, subsequently]</p><p><b>kasnije, naknadno, nakon, nakon toga, nato, onda, posle, poslije, poslije toga, potom, tada, u buduće, zatim</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> happening at a time subsequent to a reference time [after, afterward, later, later on, subsequently]</p><p><b>mjesto gdje si nakon smrti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the place where you are after you die</p><p><b>od metala s masenim udjelom polipropilena (CAS RN 1344-26-8) ili (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a soft white precious univalent metallic element having the highest electrical and thermal conductivity of any metal [atomic number 47, silver]</p><p><b>Aga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> title for a civil or military leader (especially in Turkey) [Agha]</p><p><b>još jedanput, još jednom, nadalje, opet, osim toga, ponovno, ponovo, s druge strane, uz to</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> anew [once again, once more, over again]</p><p><b>ponavljajuće (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> repeatedly [over and over, over and over again, time and again, time and time again]</p><p><b>što je brže moguće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> as fast as possible [against time]</p><p><b>u suprotnom smjeru od smjera vjetra puše (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in the direction opposite to the direction the wind is blowing [into the wind, upwind]</p><p><b>što je brže moguće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> as fast as possible [against the clock]</p><p><b>Uređaj koji se koristi za uzimanje kafije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cord (usually of goat's hair) that Arabs (especially Bedouins) wind around their heads to hold down the kaffiyeh</p><p><b>stanje u kojem se mlijeko ne izlučuje u majčinoj dojci nakon što je dijete rođeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a condition in which milk is not secreted in the mother's breasts after her child has been delivered [agalactosis]</p><p><b>stanje u kojem se mlijeko ne izlučuje u majčinoj dojci nakon što je dijete rođeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a condition in which milk is not secreted in the mother's breasts after her child has been delivered [agalactia]</p><p><b>Semiparazitna biljka s ljubičastim ili bijelim ili ružičastim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> semiparasitic herb with purple or white or pink flowers [genus Agalinis]</p><p><b>mali kopneni gušter toplih područja Starog svijeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small terrestrial lizard of warm regions of the Old World</p><p><b>Agamemnon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) the king who lead the Greeks against Troy in the Trojan War</p><p><b>asexualna reproduktivna stanica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an asexual reproductive cell</p><p><b>(reprodukcije) koje ne uključuju spajanje muških i ženskih gameta u reprodukciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of reproduction) not involving the fusion of male and female gametes in reproduction [agamogenetic, agamous, apomictic, parthenogenetic]</p><p><b>Uročić iz obitelji Agamidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i>