j</b></p><p><i>n.</i> traffic created by the movement of aircraft</p><p><b>zračni prijevoz, zračni promet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> transportation by air [air transportation]</p><p><b>prijevoz zrakoplovom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> transportation by air [air transport]</p><p><b>Službe za upravljanje zrakoplovima i zrakoplovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transportation system for moving passengers or goods by air</p><p><b>letenje, putovanje zrakom, putovanje zrakoplovom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> travel via aircraft [air, aviation]</p><p><b>netko tko putuje avionom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who travels by airplane [air traveller]</p><p><b>netko tko putuje avionom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who travels by airplane [air traveler]</p><p><b>zračna jedinica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a military unit that is part of the airforce</p><p><b>zvučni val koji se prenosi zrakom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sound wave that is transmitted via air</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a shaft for ventilation [air shaft]</p><p><b>dobivanje kisika iz zraka (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> deriving oxygen from the air</p><p><b>klimatizacija</b></p><p><i>v.</i> control the humidity and temperature of</p><p><i>v.</i> equip with an apparatus for controlling the humidity and temperature [air-cool]</p><p><b>rashlađen, ventiliran, ventilirana, klimatiziran, klimatizovan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> cooled by air conditioning</p><p><b>klima uređaj, aparat za pročišćavanje zraka u prostoriji</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an appliance designed to extract humidity from the air and thereby cool it [A/C, air conditioner]</p><p><b>S odjeljkom za upravljanje vodom i vodom (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> equip with an apparatus for controlling the humidity and temperature [air-condition]</p><p><b>zračno hlađenje, zrakom hlađeno, zrakom hlađen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> cooled by a flow of air</p><p><b>sušen kontaktom s neugrevanim zrakom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> made dry by contact with unheated air</p><p><b>pad (predmeta) iz zraka (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> drop (an object) from the air</p><p><b>sušiti zrakom, sušiti vazduhom</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not giving off moisture on exposure to the air</p><p><b>pun zrak. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> full of air</p><p><b>prijevoz (tovar) zrakoplovom (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> transport (cargo) by air [air-ship, airfreight]</p><p><b>ulaz zraka, usisivač zraka, usisnik zraka, uvodnik zraka, ulaz vazduha, usisnik vazduha</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a duct that admits air to be mixed with fuel</p><p><b>komora (često podzemna) ojačana protiv bombardiranja i opremljena hranom i životnim sadržajima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chamber (often underground) reinforced against bombing and provided with food and living facilities [bomb shelter, bombproof]</p><p><b>prijevoz (tovar) zrakoplovom (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> transport (cargo) by air [air-freight, airfreight]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se ne primjenjuje, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, se upotrebljavaju sljedeće: (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> alter by exposure to air with conversion at least in part to a carbonate</p><p><b>odrezani stopić konj postavljen na mastu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a truncated cloth cone mounted on a mast [air sock, drogue, sock, wind cone, wind sleeve, wind sock, windsock]</p><p><b>hermetičan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having no weak points [airtight]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not allowing air or gas to pass in or out [airtight, gas-tight]</p><p><b>koji se koriste između ili lansiraju iz ili uključuju rakete ili zrakoplove u letu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> operating between or launched from or involving rockets or aircraft in flight</p><p><b>raketa zrak-zrak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a missile designed to be launched from one airplane at another</p><p><b>"Stručni sustav" ili "sustav" za upravljanje zrakoplovima koji je konstruiran za upravljanje zrakoplovima ili za njihovo ispaljivanje na mete na tlu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> operating from or designed to be fired from aircraft at targets on the ground [air-to-surface]</p><p><b>raketa dizajnirana za lansiranje iz zrakoplova na metu na zemlji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a missile designed to be launched from an airplane at a target on the ground [air-to-surface missile]</p><p><b>"Stručni sustav" ili "sustav" za upravljanje zrakoplovima koji je konstruiran za upravljanje zrakoplovima ili za njihovo ispaljivanje na mete na tlu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> operating from or designed to be fired from aircraft at targets on the ground [air-to-ground]</p><p><b>raketa dizajnirana za lansiranje iz zrakoplova na metu na zemlji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a missile designed to be launched from an airplane at a target on the ground [air-to-ground missile]</p><p><b>avionski, biti u skoku, biti u zraku nakon skoka, na krilima vjetra, u avionu, u zraku, zračni, u vazduhu</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> moved or conveyed by or through air</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a patrol provided by aircraft</p><p><b>mehanizam prijenosa u kojem se zarazni uzročnik širi kao aerosol i obično ulazi u osobu kroz dišne puteve (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transmission mechanism in the which the infectious agent is spread as an aerosol and usually enters a person through the respiratory tract</p><p><b>mali padobran ili zglobni kljup za smanjenje brzine zrakoplova, s masenim udjelom goriva veći od 50 W, ali ne veći od 50 W, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small parachute or articulated flap to reduce the speed of an aircraft [dive brake]</p><p><i>n.</i> a vehicular brake that operates by compressed air</p><p><b>raspršivač, štrcaljka, zračni kist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an atomizer to spray paint by means of compressed air</p><p><i>v.</i> paint with an airbrush</p><p><b>Eksplozija u atmosferi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an explosion in the atmosphere</p><p><b>podzvučni mlazni putnički zrakoplov koji se upravlja na kratkim udaljenostima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a subsonic jet airliner operated over short distances</p><