y</p><p><b>alopatija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the usual method of treating disease with remedies that produce effects differing from those produced by the disease itself</p><p><b>(biološke vrste ili specijacije) koje se javljaju u područjima geografski izoliranim jedni od drugih (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of biological species or speciation) occurring in areas isolated geographically from one another</p><p><b>U slučaju da se ne primjenjuje ovaj članak, primjenjuje se sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the occurrence of related organisms in separate geographical areas with no overlap</p><p><b>alofon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (linguistics) any of various acoustically different forms of the same phoneme</p><p><b>koji se odnose na alofone (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to allophones</p><p><b>alopurinol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug (trade name Zyloprim) used to treat gout and other conditions in which there is an excessive buildup of uric acid [Zyloprim]</p><p><b>kasno-jurski dinosaurus mesojed (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> late Jurassic carnivorous dinosaur [allosaurus]</p><p><b>kasno-jurski dinosaurus mesojed (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> late Jurassic carnivorous dinosaur [allosaur]</p><p><b>dodijeliti, doznačiti, odrediti, označiti, raspodijeliti, razdati, razdijeliti, dodjeljivati, doznačivati, namijeniti, namjenjivati, određivati, raspodjeljivati, razdavati, razdjeljivati, dati, davati, odobravati, odobriti, dijeliti, podijeliti, porazdijeliti, porazdjeljivati, udijeliti, udjeljivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> give out [assign, portion]</p><p><i>v.</i> allow to have [accord, grant]</p><p><i>v.</i> administer or bestow, as in small portions [administer, deal, deal out, dish out, dispense, distribute, dole out, lot, mete out, parcel out, shell out]</p><p><b>alotman, dio, dodjeljivanje, raspodjela, raspodjela (radijske frekvencije ili kanala), rata, sudbina, udes, udio, alokacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a share set aside for a specific purpose [allocation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of dis