t or in exchange</p><p><i>v.</i> allow the presence of or allow (an activity) without opposing or prohibiting [permit, tolerate]</p><p><b>omogućiti ili pružiti priliku za (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a possibility or provide opportunity for [allow, leave, provide]</p><p><b>dopustite da uđem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> allow to enter [admit, intromit, let in]</p><p><b>dopustljiv, dopušten, dopuštena, dopuštenoj, dozvoljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> deductible according to the tax laws</p><p><i>adj.</i> that may be permitted especially as according to rule [permissible]</p><p><i>adj.</i> deserving to be allowed or considered</p><p><b>na dozvoljeni način (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a permissible manner [permissibly]</p><p><b>davanje, doplatak, dopuštanje, dopušteno odstupanje, dopuštenje, dozvola, džeparac, isplata, izdržavanje, novčana pripomoć, obrok, odobrenje, plata, popust, pristanak, sljedovanje, tolerancija, uzdržavanje, sledovanje, dozvoljavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amount allowed or granted (as during a given period)</p><p><i>n.</i> a sum granted as reimbursement for expenses</p><p><i>n.</i> an amount added or deducted on the basis of qualifying circumstances [adjustment]</p><p><i>n.</i> a permissible difference [leeway, margin, tolerance]</p><p><i>n.</i> a reserve fund created by a charge against profits in order to provide for changes in the value of a company's assets [allowance account, valuation account, valuation reserve]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of allowing</p><p><i>v.</i> put on a fixed allowance, as of food</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "skupna imovina" znači imovina koja se koristi za upravljanje poslovnim gospodarstvom u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a reserve fund created by a charge against profits in order to provide for changes in the value of a company's assets [allowance, valuation account, valuation reserve]</p><p><b>legirani, legirati, legura, miješati, primjesa, slitina, slitine, smjesa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mixture containing two or more metallic elements or metallic and nonmetallic elements usually fused together or dissolving into each other when molten [metal]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of impairing the quality or reducing the value of something [admixture]</p><p><i>v.</i> lower in value by increasing the base-metal content [debase]</p><p><i>v.</i> make an alloy of</p><p><b>odlitak od željeza koji sadrži legirane elemente (obično nikl ili hrom ili bakar ili molibden) za povećanje čvrstoće ili olakšanje toplinske obrade (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cast iron containing alloying elements (usually nickel or chromium or copper or molybdenum) to increase the strength or facilitate heat treatment [alloy iron]</p><p><b>odlitak od željeza koji sadrži legirane elemente (obično nikl ili hrom ili bakar ili molibden) za povećanje čvrstoće ili olakšanje toplinske obrade (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cast iron containing alloying elements (usually nickel or chromium or copper or molybdenum) to increase the strength or facilitate heat treatment [alloy cast iron]</p><p><b>legirani čelik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> steel who characteristics are determined by the addition of other elements in addition to carbon</p><p><b>legiran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of metals) debased by mixture with an inferior element</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of metals) blended to obtain a desired property</p><p><b>piment</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic West Indian tree that produces allspice berries [Pimenta dioica, allspice tree, pimento tree]</p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous shrubs having aromatic bark</p><p><i>n.</i> ground dried berrylike fruit of a West Indian allspice tree</p><p><b>tropsko američko stablo s malim bijelim cvijećima i aromatičnim bojama, aromatično West Indian stablo koje proizvodi allspice bobice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American tree having small white flowers and aromatic berries [Pimenta officinalis]</p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic West Indian tree that produces allspice