><i>n.</i> European mountain clover with fragrant usually pink flowers [Trifolium alpinum]</p><p><b>raznolikost klupskog mahova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a variety of club moss [Lycopodium alpinum]</p><p><b>Rizomatozna biljka s ljubičastog crvenog cvijeća pogodna za pokrivanje tla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rhizomatous herb with purple-red flowers suitable for groundcover [Homogyne alpina, Tussilago alpina]</p><p><b>Alpska sorta čarobnjaka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an Alpine variety of enchanter's nightshade [Circaea alpina]</p><p><b>srednjo visok drveni drvo iz Skalnih planina s uskom koničnom do stupničkom krunom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medium-tall timber tree of the Rocky Mountains having a narrowly conic to columnar crown [Abies lasiocarpa, subalpine fir]</p><p><b>glečer koji se spušta niz visoku dolinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a glacier that moves down from a high valley [Alpine type of glacier]</p><p><b>nizak tufted biljka s dlakavim stabljikama s kratkim uskim žutim zrake na vrhu svakog od cvjetne glave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low tufted plant having hairy stems each topped by a flower head with short narrow yellow rays [Hulsea algida, alpine hulsea]</p><p><b>S druge strane, za proizvodnju proizvoda iz poglavlja 94. točka (a) ovog članka ne vrijedi: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ornamental shrub or tree of the genus Laburnum [Laburnum alpinum, Scotch laburnum]</p><p><b>Zlatna traka slična uskoj zlatnoj trpci, ali s brdnim dlakama na rubovima stabljika lišća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> goldenrod similar to narrow goldenrod but having bristly hairs on edges of leaf stalks [Solidago multiradiata]</p><p><b>nizak tufted biljka s dlakavim stabljikama s kratkim uskim žutim zrake na vrhu svakog od cvjetne glave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low tufted plant having hairy stems each topped by a flower head with short narrow yellow rays [Hulsea algida, alpine gold]</p><p><b>dama paprika sa duboko odrezanim dijelovima lišća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lady fern with deeply cut leaf 