f white flowers with pink shading and crinkled yellow lips with variegated magenta stripes [Alpinia speciosa, Languas speciosa, shall-flower, shell ginger, shellflower]</p><p><b>alpinizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mountain climbing (not restricted to the Alps)</p><p><b>alpinist, planinar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain climber who specializes in difficult climbs</p><p><b>lijek protiv anksioznosti (trgovinski naziv Xanax) iz klase benzodiazepina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antianxiety agent (trade name Xanax) of the benzodiazepine class [Xanax]</p><p><b>Alpa, Alpe, gorja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large mountain system in south-central Europe [the Alps]</p><p><b>već</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> prior to a specified or implied time</p><p><b>dobro, sve je u redu, u redu</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> nonstandard usage</p><p><i>adv.</i> without doubt (used to reinforce an assertion) [all right]</p><p><i>adv.</i> an expression of agreement normally occurring at the beginning of a sentence [OK, all right, fine, very well]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a satisfactory or adequate manner [O.K., all right, okay]</p><p><b>zaširivanje tkiva u motornim traktovima bočnih stupnjeva i prednjih rogova kičmene moždine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thickening of tissue in the motor tracts of the lateral columns and anterior horns of the spinal cord [Lou Gehrig's disease, amyotrophic lateral sclerosis]</p><p><b>Elzas</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a region of northeastern France famous for its wines [Alsatia, Elsass]</p><p><b>Elzas</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a region of northeastern France famous for its wines [Alsace, Elsass]</p><p><b>u Alzaciji ili u Alzaciji, pasmina velikih pastrskih pasa koji se koriste u policijskom radu i kao vodič za slijepe, od ili u vezi s ili karakteristično za Alzaciju ili njezine stanovnike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or inhabitant of Alsace</p><p><i>n.</i> breed of large shepherd dogs used in police work and as a guide for the blind [German police dog, German shepherd, German shepherd dog]</p><p><i>adj.</i> 