e by Nicolo Amati or a member of his family</p><p><b>sklonost prema ili pokazivanje ljubavi (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> inclined toward or displaying love [amorous]</p><p><b>erotika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the arousal of feelings of sexual desire [amorousness, eroticism, erotism, sexiness]</p><p><b>ljubavni, ljubavnički, romantičan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> expressive of or exciting sexual love or romance [amorous, romantic]</p><p><b>vrlo veliki blisko razgranati južnoafrički grm s vidličastima svijetlozelenim bodljicama i sjajnim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> very large closely branched South African shrub having forked bright green spines and shiny leaves [Carissa grandiflora, Carissa macrocarpa, natal plum]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za proizvode koji sadrže: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> epiphytic or terrestrial ferns of America and Africa and Polynesia [genus Amauropelta]</p><p><b>crna mrena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> partial or total loss of sight without pathology of the eye</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na sljepoću uzrokovanu amaurozom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to blindness caused by amaurosis</p><p><b>frapirati, iznenaditi, zadiviti, zadivljuju, zapanjiti, zaprepastiti, začuditi, preneraziti, preneražavati, smesti, smetati, zabezeknuti, zapanjivati, zaprepašćivati, zbuniti, zbunjivati, zgranjivati, zgranuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> affect with wonder [astonish, astound]</p><p><i>v.</i> be a mystery or bewildering to [baffle, beat, bewilder, dumbfound, flummox, get, gravel, mystify, nonplus, perplex, pose, puzzle, stick, stupefy, vex]</p><p><b>u čudu</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> filled with the emotional impact of overwhelming surprise or shock [astonied, astonished, astounded, stunned]</p><p><b>čuđenje, zapanjenost, zaprepaštenje, začuđenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the feeling that accompanies something extremely surprising [astonishment]</p><p><b>čudnovat, frapantan, iznenađujući, nevjerojatan, nevjerovatan, zadivljujući, zapanjujući</b></p><p><