ent (a bill or constitution etc.)</p><p><b>naknada, odšteta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sum of money paid in compensation for loss or injury [damages, indemnification, indemnity, redress, restitution]</p><p><i>n.</i> something done or paid in expiation of a wrong [reparation]</p><p><b>raniji vladar Egipta koji je odbacio stare bogove i zamijenio ih klanjanjem sunca (umro 1358. pr. n. e.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> early ruler of Egypt who rejected the old gods and replaced them with sun worship (died in 1358 BC) [Akhenaten, Akhenaton, Ikhanaton]</p><p><b>amenoreja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> absence or suppression of normal menstrual flow [amenorrhea, amenorrhoea]</p><p><b>ljubaznost, prijatnost, ugodnost (od &quot;amenity&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> things that make you comfortable and at ease [comforts, conveniences, creature comforts]</p><p><b>ljubaznost, prijatnost, ugodnost, udobnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pleasantness resulting from agreeable conditions [agreeableness]</p><p><b>amenoreja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> absence or suppression of normal menstrual flow [amenia, amenorrhoea]</p><p><b>u vezi s potisnućem normalnog menstruacijskog toka iz bilo kojeg drugog razloga osim trudnoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> related to the suppression of normal menstrual flow for any reason other than pregnancy [amenorrheic, amenorrhoeal, amenorrhoeic]</p><p><b>u vezi s potisnućem normalnog menstruacijskog toka iz bilo kojeg drugog razloga osim trudnoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> related to the suppression of normal menstrual flow for any reason other than pregnancy [amenorrheal, amenorrhoeal, amenorrhoeic]</p><p><b>amenoreja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> absence or suppression of normal menstrual flow [amenia, amenorrhea]</p><p><b>u vezi s potisnućem normalnog menstruacijskog toka iz bilo kojeg drugog razloga osim trudnoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> related to the suppression of normal menstrual flow for any reason other than pregnancy [amenorrheal, amenorrheic, amenorrhoeic]</p><p><b>u vezi s potisnućem norma