ammonia by replacing hydrogen atoms by univalent hydrocarbon radicals [aminoalkane]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom nitrogena od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog nitrogena, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to or containing any of a group of organic compounds of nitrogen derived from ammonia [amino]</p><p><b>radijal -NH2, s masenim udjelom nitrogena od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog nitrogena, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the radical -NH2 [amino group]</p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to or containing any of a group of organic compounds of nitrogen derived from ammonia [aminic]</p><p><b>aminokiselina, aminokiselinska, aminokiseline</b></p><p><i>n.</i> organic compounds containing an amino group and a carboxylic acid group [aminoalkanoic acid]</p><p><b>radijal -NH2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the radical -NH2 [amino]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena (POP) od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plastic (synthetic resin) made from amino compounds [amino resin, aminoplast]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena (POP) od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plastic (synthetic resin) made from amino compounds [amino plastic, aminoplast]</p><p><b>neuobičajeno prisustvo aminokiselina u urinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormal presence of amino acids in the urine</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom ugljikovodika od 1,5% ili više, ali ne više od 2,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compound derived from ammonia by replacing hydrogen atoms by univalent hydrocarbon radicals [amine]</p><p><b>aminokiselina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> organic compounds containing an amino group and a carboxylic acid group [amino acid]</p><p><b>anilin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> oily poisonous liquid amine obtained from nitrobenzene and used to make dyes and plastics and medicines [aniline, aniline oil, phenylamine]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a derivative of benzoic acid</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom proteina od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a methyl with the hydrogen atom replaced by an amino radical</p><p><b>aminotransferaza, transaminaza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a class of transferases that catalyze transamination (that transfer an amino group from an amino acid to another compound) [aminotransferase, transaminase]</p><p><b>teofilin derivat koji se koristi kao bronhodilatator u liječenju bronhijalne astme, emfizema i bronhitisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a theophylline derivative that is used as a bronchodilator in the treatment of bronchial asthma, emphysema, and bronchitis</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena (POP) od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plastic (synthetic resin) made from amino compounds [amino plastic, amino resin]</p><p><b>bijela kristalna tvar koja se koristi kao analgetik i antipiretik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white crystalline substance used as an analgesic and antipyretic [amidopyrine]</p><p><b>aminotransferaza, transaminaza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a class of transferases that catalyze transamination (that transfer an amino group from an amino acid to another compound) [aminopherase, transaminase]</p><p><b>amiodaron</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antiarrhythmic drug (trade name Cordarone) that has potentially fatal side effects and is used to control serious heart rhythm problems only when safer agents have been ineffective [Cordarone]</p><p><b>emir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an independent ruler or chieftain (especially in Africa or Arabia) [ameer, emeer, emir]</p><p><b>amiš</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an American follower of the Mennonite religion</p><p><b>ortodoksna anabaptistička sekta koja se odvojila od menoniata krajem 17. stoljeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an orthodox Anabaptist sect separated from the Mennonites in late 17th century</p><p><b>krivo, loše, neumjesno, neuspio, nezgodno, pogrešno, promašeno, što nije u red, u nevrijeme</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not functioning properly [awry, haywire, wrong]</p><p><i>adv.</i> away from the correct or expected course [awry]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an improper or mistaken or unfortunate manner</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an imperfect or faulty way [imperfectly]</p><p><b>direktna metoda ćelijske podjele koja se karakterizira jednostavnom podjelom jezgre bez stvaranja hromozoma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the direct method of cell division characterized by simple division of the nucleus without formation of chromosomes</p><p><b>za jednostavnu metodu ćelijske podjele (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to a simple method of cell division</p><p><b>triciklični antidepresiv (trgovinski naziv Elavil) s ozbiljnim nuspojavama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tricyclic antidepressant drug (trade name Elavil) with serious side effects [Elavil, amitriptyline hydrochloride]</p><p><b>triciklični antidepresiv (trgovinski naziv Elavil) s ozbiljnim nuspojavama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tricyclic antidepressant drug (trade name Elavil) with serious side effects [Elavil, amitriptyline]</p><p><b>prijateljstvo, srdačnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cordial disposition [cordiality]</p><p><i>n.</i> a state of friendship and cordiality</p><p><b>vasodilatator (trgovinski naziv Norvasc) u obliku tableta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vasodilator (trade name Norvasc) taken in tablet form [Norvasc]</p><p><b>Aman, Amman</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital and largest city of Jordan [capital of Jordan]</p><p><b>ampermetar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a meter that measures the flow of electrical current in amperes</p><p><b>složen neorganski spoj koji sadrži molekule amonijaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a complex inorganic compound that contains ammonia molecules</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na ili je karakterističan za ammin (neorgansko koordinacijsko jedinjenje amonijaka i metalne soli) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to or characteristic of an ammine (an inorganic coordination compound of ammonia and a metallic salt)</p><p><b>metak, municija, streljivo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> projectiles to