 the intestines caused by Endamoeba histolytica [amebic dysentery]</p><p><b>amoebe, red Amoebida, red amoeba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the animal order including amoebas [Amoebina, order Amoebida, order Amoebina]</p><p><b>amoebe, red Amoebida, red amoeba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the animal order including amoebas [Amoebida, order Amoebida, order Amoebina]</p><p><b>infekcija amebom koja uzrokuje bolest (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> infection by a disease-causing ameba [amebiasis, amebiosis, amoebiasis]</p><p><b>ameboidski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> like an amoeba (especially in having a variable irregular shape) [ameboid]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na amebne ili im sliče (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to or resembling amoebae [ameban, amebic, amebous, amoeban, amoebic]</p><p><b>bjesomučno</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> wildly frenzied and out of control [amuck, berserk]</p><p><i>adv.</i> wildly [amuck]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a murderous frenzy [amuck, murderously]</p><p><b>drevna egipatska personifikacija zraka i daha. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a primeval Egyptian personification of air and breath [Amen, Amun]</p><p><b>Egipatski bog sunca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Egyptian sun god [Amen-Ra, Amun Ra]</p><p><b>Šerry iz Španjolske (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pale medium-dry sherry from Spain</p><p><b>(Rimska mitologija) bog ljubavi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman mythology) god of love [Cupid]</p><p><b>jedan od grupe rabina (aktivni 250-500 AD) koji su raspravljali o Mishnaic zakonu u pravnim školama Palestine i Mesopotamije gdje su objašnjavali i primjenjivali ranije učenja i čije su rasprave zabilježene u Talmudu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of a group of rabbis (active AD 250-500) who discussed the Mishnaic law in the law schools of Palestine and Mesopotamia where they explained and applied earlier teachings and whose discussions are recorded in the Talmud</p><p><b>Nauka da su moralne razlike nevažeće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the doctrine that moral distinctions are invalid</p><p><b>Osoba koja se drži doktrine da su obične moralne razlike nevažeće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who adheres to the doctrine that ordinary moral distinctions are invalid</p><p><b>amoralnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being amoral</p><p><b>bez obzira na moral. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without regard for morality [immorally]</p><p><b>Jedan posvećen ljubavi i ljubavlju posebno onaj koji piše o ljubavi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one dedicated to love and lovemaking especially one who writes about love</p><p><b>o ili u vezi romantične ljubavi (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to romantic love</p><p><b>ljubavan, ljubavni, zaljubljen, zaljubljiv, romantičan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> inclined toward or displaying love [amative]</p><p><i>adj.</i> expressive of or exciting sexual love or romance [amatory, romantic]</p><p><b>ljubavan, ljubavni, zaljubljen, zaljubljiv (od &quot;amorous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an amorous manner</p><p><b>erotika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of love or fondness [enamoredness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the arousal of feelings of sexual desire [amativeness, eroticism, erotism, sexiness]</p><p><b>biljke iz roda Amorpha s čistačastom listom i ljubičastim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any plant of the genus Amorpha having odd-pinnate leaves and purplish spicate flowers</p><p><b>u obliku krsta, od crvene do indigo boje, s krastavcima od crvene do indigo boje, od 1. do 2. kol. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an erect to spreading hairy shrub of the Pacific coast of the United States having racemes of red to indigo flowers [bastard indigo, false indigo]</p><p><b>grm pijesnih šuma i obale potoka zapadnih Sjedinjenih Država s sivim pinatnim cvijećima i tamnim rascemose cvijećima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrub of sandy woodlands and stream banks of western United States having hoary pinnate flowers and dull-colored racemose flowers [lead plant, leadplant]</p><p><b>guste grmlje na vlažnim obronama rijeka i poplavnim ravnicama istočnih Sjedinjenih Država koje imaju privlačan mirisan list i gusto rasume tamno ljubičastih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dense shrub of moist riverbanks and flood plains of the eastern United States having attractive fragrant foliage and dense racemes of dark purple flowers [bastard indigo, false indigo]</p><p><b>Svaka biljka iz roda Amorphophallus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any plant of the genus Amorphophallus</p><p><b>u jugoistočnoj Aziji (posebno na Filipinima) uzgajan zbog svoje jestive gomoljice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> putrid-smelling aroid of southeastern Asia (especially the Philippines) grown for its edible tuber [Amorphophallus paeonifolius, elephant yam, pungapung, telingo potato]</p><p><b>u jugoistočnoj Aziji (posebno na Filipinima) uzgajan zbog svoje jestive gomoljice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> putrid-smelling aroid of southeastern Asia (especially the Philippines) grown for its edible tuber [Amorphophallus campanulatus, elephant yam, pungapung, telingo potato]</p><p><b>smrdljiva pomalo mesna tropska biljka iz jugoistočne Azije uzgajana zbog svojih jestivih kormova ili u stakleniku zbog svojih velikih listova i najozbiljnijih tamno crvenih špatova koji okružuju veliki špat (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> foul-smelling somewhat fleshy tropical plant of southeastern Asia cultivated for its edible corms or in the greenhouse for its large leaves and showy dark red spathe surrounding a large spadix [devil's tongue, snake palm, umbrella arum]</p><p><b>loša smrada tropske biljke s špatom koja se podudara s korolom jutarnjeg sjaja i doseže promjer od nekoliko metara (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> malodorous tropical plant having a spathe that resembles the corolla of a morning glory and attains a diameter of several feet [krubi, titan arum]</p><p><b>amorfan, bezobličan, neiskristaliziran, nekristaliziran, amorfni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having no definite form or distinct shape [formless, shapeless]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking the system or structure characteristic of living bodies [unstructured]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a group of people or an organization) unorganized or unfocused</p><p><i>adj.</i> unclear because vague or badly organized</p><p><i>adj.</i> without real or apparent crystalline form [uncrystallised, uncrystallized]</p><p><b>amorfni oblik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ill-defined or arbitrary shape</p><p><b>potpuno je potopljena. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> utterly cast down</p><p><b>amortizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the reduction of the value of an asset by prorating its cost over a period of years [amortization]</p><p><i>n.</i> payment of an obligation in a series of installments or transfers [amortization]</p><p><b>amortizirati, otplatiti, otplaćivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> liquidate gradually [amortize]</p><p><b>amortizacija, otplata duga, smanjenje vrijednosti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the reduction of the value of an asset by prorating its cost over a period of years [amortisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> payment of an obligation in a series of installments or transfers [amortisation]</p><p><b>amortizirati, otplatiti dug, otplatiti, otplaćivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> liquidate gradually [amortise]</p><p><b>Amos</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Hebrew shepherd and minor prophet</p><p><i>n.</i> an Old Testament book telling Amos's prophecies [Book of Amos]</p><p><b>dostići, iznos, iznositi, količina, kvantitet, suma, svota, vrijednost, značenje, vrijednosti, kvantiteta, mjera, zbir, zbroj, vrijediti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a quantity of money [amount of money, sum, sum of money]</p><p><i>n.</i> the relative magnitude of something with reference to a criterion</p><p><i>n.</i> how much there is or how many there are of something that you can quantify [measure, quantity]</p><p><i>n.</i> a quantity obtained by the addition of a group of numbers [sum, total]</p><p><i>v.</i> be tantamount or equivalent to</p><p><i>v.</i> add up in number or quantity [add up, come, number, total]</p><p><i>v.</i> develop into [add up, come]</p><p><b>iznos, suma, svota</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a quantity of money [amount, sum, sum of money]</p><p><b>ljubavna afera, ljubavna avantura, ljubovanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a usually secretive or illicit sexual relationship [affair, affaire, intimacy, involvement, liaison]</p><p><b>osjećaj pretjeranog ponosa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> feelings of excessive pride [conceit, self-love, vanity]</p><p><b>antibiotici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antibiotic [Amoxil, Augmentin, Larotid, Polymox, Trimox]</p><p><b>antibiotici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antibiotic [Augmentin, Larotid, Polymox, Trimox, amoxicillin]</p><p><b>bilo koji od oblika kineskog jezika koji se govori u pokrajini Fukien (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the forms of Chinese spoken in Fukien province [Fukien, Fukkianese, Hokkianese, Min, Min dialect, Taiwanese]</p><p><b>amper</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of electric current adopted under the Systeme International d'Unites [A, ampere]</p><p><i>n.</i> a nucleotide found in muscle cells and important in metabolism [adenosine monophosphate, adenylic acid]</p><p><b>amperaža, struja u amper, struja u amperima, amperača</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the strength of an electrical current measured in amperes</p><p><b>amper</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a former unit of electric current (slightly smaller than the SI ampere) [international ampere]</p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of electric current adopted under the Systeme International d'Unites [A, amp]</p><p><b>Jedinica naboja jednaka 3600 kulona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of charge equal to 3600 coulombs</p><p><b>jedinica naboja jednaka 60 kulona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of charge equal to 60 coulombs</p><p><b>kulon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of electrical charge equal to the amount of charge transferred by a current of 1 ampere in 1 second [C, coulomb]</p><p><b>amper-zavojak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of magnetomotive force equal to the magnetomotive force produced by the passage of 1 ampere through 1 complete turn of a coil</p><p><b>znak za str (i), znak za struju, znak za struju (I)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a punctuation mark (&amp;) used to represent conjunction (and)</p><p><b>amfetamin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a central nervous system stimulant that increases energy and decreases appetite [pep pill, speed, upper]</p><p><b>sulfatni derivat amfetamina koji se koristi kao stimulansa za središnji živčani sustav (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sulfate derivative of amphetamine that is used as a stimulant for the central nervous system [amphetamine sulphate]</p><p><b>sulfatni derivat amfetamina koji se koristi kao stimulansa za središnji živčani sustav (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sulfate derivative of amphetamine that is used as a stimulant for the central nervous system [amphetamine sulfate]</p><p><b>razred kralježnjaka koji žive na kopnu, ali se razmnožavaju u vodi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the class of vertebrates that live on land but breed in water [class Amphibia]</p><p><b>amfibija, avion amfibija, vodozemac, vodozemni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a flat-bottomed motor vehicle that can travel on land or water [amphibious vehicle]</p><p><i>n.</i> an airplane designed to take off and land on water [amphibious aircraft]</p><p><i>n.</i> cold-blooded vertebrate typically living on land but breeding in water</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or characteristic of animals of the class Amphibia [amphibious]</p><p><b>bilo koja obitelj vodozemljana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any family of amphibians</p><p><b>Svaka vrsta amfibija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any genus of amphibians</p><p><b>koji imaju rano ili larvno vodeno i kopneno odraslo oblikovanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having an aquatic early or larval form and a terrestrial adult form [semiaquatic]</p><p><b>amfibijski, vodozemni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or characteristic of animals of the class Amphibia [amphibian]</p><p><i>adj.</i> operating or living on land and in water</p><p><b>amfibija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an airplane designed to take off and land on water [amphibian]</p><p><b>amfibijska operacija koja napada kopnenu bazu koju provode trupe koje iskrcavaju pomorski brodovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amphibious operation attacking a land base that is carried out by troops that are landed by naval ships</p><p><b>operacija na kopnu i kopnu koja se provodi s ciljem prevarenja neprijatelja i vođenja ga u postupak koji mu nije povoljna. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amphibious operation conducted for the purpose of deceiving the enemy and leading him into a course of action unfavorable to him</p><p><b>Vojna akcija koordiniranih kopnenih, pomorskih i zračnih snaga organiziranih za invaziju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a military action of coordinated land, sea, and air forces organized for an invasion</p><p><b>vojna operacija kopnenih i pomorskih snaga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a military operation by both land and sea forces</p><p><b>Amfibijsko vozilo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a flat-bottomed motor vehicle that can travel on land or water [amphibian]</p><p><b>amfibol, amfiboli</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mineral or mineral variety belonging to the amphibole group</p><p><b>grupa minerala s sličnom kristalnom strukturom koja sadrži silikatni lanac i kombinacije uglavnom natrija i kalcija i magnezija te željeza i aluminija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of minerals with similar crystal structures containing a silicate chain and combinations of chiefly sodium and calcium and magnesium and iron and aluminum</p><p><b>Cinipidna žlijezda ospi, posebno uzrokovala žlijezda hrastovog jabuka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cynipid gall wasps, especially causing oak-apple galls [genus Amphibolips]</p><p><b>Amfibolit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metamorphic rock composed chiefly of amphibole and plagioclase</p><p><b>dvosmislena gramatika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ambiguous grammatical construction [amphiboly]</p><p><b>dvosmislena gramatika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ambiguous grammatical construction [amphibology]</p><p><b>metrička jedinica s ne-naglasenim-naglasenim-ne-naglasenim slogovima (npr. `sjetite se') (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metrical unit with unstressed-stressed-unstressed syllables (e.g., `remember')</p><p><b>vrlo mali rod vinove loze iz Sjeverne Amerike i Azije: svinjski kikiriki (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> very small genus of twining vines of North America and Asia: hog peanut [Amphicarpaea, genus Amphicarpa, genus Amphicarpaea]</p><p><b>Vina široko rasprostranjena u istočnoj Sjevernoj Americi koja proizvodi vijoličaste do smeđe boje cvijeća i obilne (obično podzemne) jestive jednosemene struke slične kikirikiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vine widely distributed in eastern North America producing racemes of purple to maroon flowers and abundant (usually subterranean) edible one-seeded pods resembling peanuts [Amphicarpaea bracteata, hog peanut, wild peanut]</p><p><b>vrlo mali rod vinove loze iz Sjeverne Amerike i Azije: svinjski kikiriki (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> very small genus of twining vines of North America and Asia: hog peanut [Amphicarpa, genus Amphicarpa, genus Amphicarpaea]</p><p><b>Vina široko rasprostranjena u istočnoj Sjevernoj Americi koja proizvodi vijoličaste do smeđe boje cvijeća i obilne (obično podzemne) jestive jednosemene struke slične kikirikiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vine widely distributed in eastern North America producing racemes of purple to maroon flowers and abundant (usually subterranean) edible one-seeded pods resembling peanuts [Amphicarpa bracteata, hog peanut, wild peanut]</p><p><b>udruženje susjednih država ili plemena u drevnoj Grčkoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an association of neighboring states or tribes in ancient Greece</p><p><b>(genetika) organizam ili stanica koja ima diploidni skup hromozoma od svakog roditelja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (genetics) an organism or cell having a diploid set of chromosomes from each parent</p><p><b>stanje amfidiploidnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being amphidiploid</p><p><b>besmisleno pisanje (obično stih) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nonsensical writing (usually verse) [nonsense verse]</p><p><b>R