sical mythology) a serpent with a head at each end of its body</p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Amphisbaenidae [Amphisbaenia, genus Amphisbaena, genus Amphisbaenia]</p><p><b>vrsta rod Amphisbaenidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Amphisbaenidae [Amphisbaena, genus Amphisbaena, genus Amphisbaenia]</p><p><b>crv laščarice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> worm lizards [family Amphisbaenidae]</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenjem od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having columns either at both ends or at both sides</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by columniation having free columns in porticoes either at both ends or at both sides of a structure [amphiprostylar, amphiprostyle, porticoed]</p><p><b>amfiteatar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sloping gallery with seats for spectators (as in an operating room or theater) [amphitheatre]</p><p><i>n.</i> an oval large stadium with tiers of seats [amphitheatre, coliseum]</p><p><b>amfiteatar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sloping gallery with seats for spectators (as in an operating room or theater) [amphitheater]</p><p><i>n.</i> an oval large stadium with tiers of seats [amphitheater, coliseum]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s amfiteatrom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or related to an amphitheater [amphitheatrical]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s amfiteatrom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or related to an amphitheater [amphitheatric]</p><p><b>Kolosej</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large amphitheater in Rome whose construction was begun by Vespasian about AD 75 or 80 [Colosseum]</p><p><b>(od biljne jajne ćelije) djelomično obrnuta (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a plant ovule) partly inverted</p><p><b>djelomično preokrenuta jajnik okrenut natrag 90 stupnjeva na stabljku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a partly inverted ovule turned back 90 degrees on its stalk</p><p><b>vodeni salamander u obliku jegulje s dva para vrlo malih stopala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aquatic eel-shaped salamander having two pairs of very small feet [blind eel, congo eel, congo snake]</p><p><b>Kongoske zmije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> congo snakes [family Amphiumidae]</p><p><b>drevna vrč sa dva ručka i uskim vratom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient jar with two handles and a narrow neck</p><p><b>zvuk koji se čuje u auskultaciji sličan šupljom zvuku koji se stvara puhanjem preko usta boce (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the sound heard in auscultation resembling the hollow sound made by blowing across the mouth of a bottle</p><p><b>amfoterni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having characteristics of both an acid and a base and capable of reacting as either [amphiprotic]</p><p><b>antibiotika i antifungalna sredstva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antibiotic and antifungal agent</p><p><b>ampicilin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> semisynthetic penicillin (trade names Principen and Polycillin and SK-Ampicillin) [Polycillin, Principen, SK-Ampicillin]</p><p><b>bogat, bujan, dovoljan, mnogo, obilan, opširan, prostran, širok</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> more than enough in size or scope or capacity</p><p><i>adj.</i> affording an abundant supply [copious, plenteous, plentiful, rich]</p><p><i>adj.</i> fairly large in size [sizable, sizeable]</p><p><b>bogat, bujan, dovoljan, mnogo, obilan, opširan, prostran, širok (od &quot;ample&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being more than sufficient</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of impressive largeness in size</p><p><b>list s bazom koja se čuva od stabla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a leaf with its base clasping the stem</p><p><b>amplifikacija, faktor pojačanja, pojačanje, pojačavanje, povećanje, pretjerivanje, proširavanje, proširenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> addition of extra material or illustration or clarifying detail [elaboration]</p><p><i>n.</i> the amount of increase in signal power or voltage or current expressed as the ratio of output to input [gain]</p><p><i>n.</i> (electronics) the act of increasing voltage or power or current</p><p><b>pojačalo, pojačavač, pojačivač, radio pojačalo, amplifikator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electronic equipment that increases strength of signals passing through it</p><p><b>pojačati, pojačavati, povećati, povećati se, povećavati, pretjerivati, proširiti, širiti se, hiperbolizirati, napuhati, napuhavati, napuhivati, napuhnuti, pretjerati, pretjeravati, preuveličati, preuveličavati, uveličati, uveličavati, ekspandirati, razgranati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> increase in size, volume or significance [magnify]</p><p><i>v.</i> to enlarge beyond bounds or the truth [exaggerate, hyperbolise, hyperbolize, magnify, overdraw, overstate]</p><p><i>v.</i> exaggerate or make bigger [blow up, expand, inflate]</p><p><i>v.</i> increase the volume of</p><p><b>amplituda, bogatstvo, opseg, opsežnost, punoća, širina, amplitude</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the maximum displacement of a periodic wave</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of copious abundance [bountifulness, bounty]</p><p><i>n.</i> greatness of magnitude</p><p><b>Izravno označavanje: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> distortion that occurs when the output signal does not have a linear relation to the input signal [nonlinear distortion]</p><p><b>razina na amplitudi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the level on a scale of amplitude</p><p><b>amplitudna modulacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> modulation of the amplitude of the (radio) carrier wave [AM]</p><p><b>opširno, bogato</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to an ample degree or in an ample manner [richly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> sufficiently [fully]</p><p><b>ampula, fijala</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small bottle that contains a drug (especially a sealed sterile container for injection by needle) [ampul, ampule, phial, vial]</p><p><b>ampula, fijala</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small bottle that contains a drug (especially a sealed sterile container for injection by needle) [ampoule, ampule, phial, vial]</p><p><b>ampula, fijala</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small bottle that contains a drug (especially a sealed sterile container for injection by needle) [ampoule, ampul, phial, vial]</p><p><b>ampula</b