ation used as a stimulant to the central nervous system</p><p><i>adj.</i> stimulating the central nervous system</p><p><b>odsutnost osjećaja bola bez gubitka svijesti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> absence of the sense of pain without loss of consciousness</p><p><b>analgetik, analgetski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a medicine used to relieve pain [anodyne, pain pill, painkiller]</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of relieving pain [analgetic, anodyne]</p><p><b>analgetski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of relieving pain [analgesic, anodyne]</p><p><b>analogan, istovrstan, kontinuiran, signal kojem opseg stalno varira, analogni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something having the property of being analogous to something else [analogue, parallel]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of a circuit or device having an output that is proportional to the input [analogue, linear]</p><p><b>sat koji prikazuje vrijeme po položaju kažica na brojčaku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clock that displays the time of day by the position of hands on a dial</p><p><b>analogni računar, analogno računalo, kontinuirano računalo, analogni račun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a computer that represents information by variable quantities (e.g., positions or voltages) [analogue computer]</p><p><b>sat koji prikazuje vrijeme pozicijom kažica na brojčaku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a watch that represents time by the position of hands on a dial</p><p><b>uređaj za pretvaranje analognih signala u digitalne signale (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> device for converting analogue signals into digital signals [analog-to-digital converter, digitiser, digitizer]</p><p><b>analogno-digitalni pretvarač, analogno-digitalni pretvarač (A/D pretvarač)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> device for converting analogue signals into digital signals [analog-digital converter, digitiser, digitizer]</p><p><b>analogan, sličan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> expressing, composed of, or based on an analogy</p><p><b>Napravi analogiju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make an analogy [analogize]</p><p><b>netko tko traži analogije ili koji razmatra na temelju analogije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who looks for analogies or who reasons by analogy</p><p><b>Napravi analogiju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make an analogy [analogise]</p><p><b>analogan, jednak, odgovarajući, podudaran, sličan, slično, analogno</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> similar or equivalent in some respects though otherwise dissimilar [correspondent]</p><p><i>adj.</i> corresponding in function but not in evolutionary origin</p><p><b>analogno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an analogous manner</p><p><b>analogan, analogno</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something having the property of being analogous to something else [analog, parallel]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of a circuit or device having an output that is proportional to the input [analog, linear]</p><p><b>analogan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a computer that represents information by variable quantities (e.g., positions or voltages) [analog computer]</p><p><b>analogija, analognost, podudarnost, slaganje, sličnost, usporedba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inference that if things agree in some respects they probably agree in others</p><p><i>n.</i> drawing a comparison in order to show a similarity in some respect</p><p><i>n.</i> the religious belief that between creature and creator no similarity can be found so great but that the dissimilarity is always greater [doctrine of analogy]</p><p><b>analfabet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an illiterate person who does not know the alphabet [analphabetic]</p><p><b>analfabet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an illiterate person who does not know the alphabet [analphabet]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or expressed by a writing system that is not alphabetic</p><p><i>adj.</i> not alphabetic</p><p><i>adj.</i> having little acquaintance with writing [unlettered]</p><p><b>nemogućnost čitanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inability to read [illiteracy]</p><p><b>osoba koja se podvrgava psihoanalizi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person undergoing psychoanalysis</p><p><b>analizirati, ispitivati, rastavljati, raščlaniti, analiziramo, ispitati, preispitati, preispitivati, pretresati, pretresti, proučavati, proučiti, razlagati, razložiti, raščlanjivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> consider in detail and subject to an analysis in order to discover essential features or meaning [analyze, canvass, examine, study]</p><p><i>v.</i> break down into components or essential features [analyze]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a mathematical, chemical, or grammatical analysis of [analyze, break down, dissect, take apart]</p><p><i>v.</i> subject to psychoanalytic treatment [analyze, psychoanalyse, psychoanalyze]</p><p><b>analizator, raščlanjivač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instrument that performs analyses [analyzer]</p><p><b>analitička obrada, analiza, izračun, obrada, proračun, rastavljanje, raščlamba, raščlanjivanje, analiza slike, analize, analizi, obradu, raščlanjenj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an investigation of the component parts of a whole and their relations in making up the whole</p><p><i>n.</i> the abstract separation of a whole into its constituent parts in order to study the parts and their relations [analytic thinking]</p><p><i>n.</i> a form of literary criticism in which the structure of a piece of writing is analyzed</p><p><i>n.</i> the use of closed-class words instead of inflections: e.g., `the father of the bride' instead of `the bride's father'</p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of mathematics involving calculus and the theory of limits</p><p><i>n.</i> a set of techniques for exploring underlying motives and a method of treating various mental disorders [depth psychology, psychoanalysis]</p><p><b>analiza varijance</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a statistical method for making simultaneous comparisons between two or more means [ANOVA]</p><p><b>topologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of pure mathematics that deals only with the properties of a figure X that hold for every figure into which X can be transformed with a one-to-one correspondence that is continuous in both directions [topology]</p><p><b>analitičar, analizator, psihoanalitičar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is skilled at analyzing data</p><p><i>n.</i> an expert who studies financial data (on credit or securities or sales or financial patterns etc.) and recommends appropriate business actions</p><p><i>n.</i> a licensed practitioner of psychoanalysis [psychoanalyst]</p><p><b>analitičan, analitički, rastavljački</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> using or subjected to a methodology using algebra and calculus</p><p><i>adj.</i> using or skilled in using analysis (i.e., separating a whole--intellectual or substantial--into its elemental parts or basic principles) [analytical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> expressing a grammatical category by using two or more words rather than inflection [uninflected]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of a proposition that is necessarily true independent of fact or experience [analytical]</p><p><b>analitička geometrija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the use of algebra to study geometric properties [analytical geometry, coordinate geometry]</p><p><b>analiza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the abstract separation of a whole into its constituent parts in order to study the parts and their relations [analysis]</p><p><b>analitički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> using or skilled in using analysis (i.e., separating a whole--intellectual or substantial--into its elemental parts or basic principles) [analytic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of a proposition that is necessarily true independent of fact or experience [analytic]</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je to samo jedan od glavnih elemenata u proizvodnji, to znači da je to samo jedan od glavnih elemenata u proizvodnji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a beam balance of great precision used in quantitative chemical analysis [chemical balance]</p><p><b>ranu fazu kubizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the early phase of cubism</p><p><b>korištenje algebre za proučavanje geometrijskih svojstava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the use of algebra to study geometric properties [analytic geometry, coordinate geometry]</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je to primjenjivo u skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013, Komisija smatra da je to primjenjivo u skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 2. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an auditing procedure based on ratios among accounts and tries to identify significant changes</p><p><b>analitički (od &quot;analytical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by virtue of analysis</p><p><b>svojstvo analitičkog djelovanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being analytic</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being partitioned [decomposable]</p><p><b>analiza, analizirati, proučavati, raščlaniti, ispitati, ispitivati, preispitati, preispitivati, pretresati, pretresti, proučiti, razlagati, razložiti, raščlanjivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> consider in detail and subject to an analysis in order to discover essential features or meaning [analyse, canvass, examine, study]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a mathematical, chemical, or grammatical analysis of [analyse, break down, dissect, take apart]</p><p><i>v.</i> break down into components or essential features [analyse]</p><p><i>v.</i> subject to psychoanalytic treatment [analyse, psychoanalyse, psychoanalyze]</p><p><b>analiziran, obrađeni, analizira, analiziraju, analizirani, analiziranih, analizirati</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> examined carefully and methodically</p><p><b>analizator, raščlanjivač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instrument that performs analyses [analyser]</p><p><b>anamneza, sjećanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the case history of a medical patient as recalled by the patient [medical history, medical record]</p><p><i>n.</i> the ability to recall past occurrences [recollection, remembrance]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s anamnezom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to anamnesis</p><p><b>u drugom (ili sljedećem) susretu s istim antigenom obnovljena brza proizvodnja antitijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> renewed rapid production of an antibody on the second (or subsequent) encounter with the same antigen [anamnestic response]</p><p><b>u drugom (ili sljedećem) susretu s istim antigenom obnovljena brza proizvodnja antitijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> renewed rapid production of an antibody on the second (or subsequent) encounter with the same antigen [anamnestic reaction]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na postupnu evoluciju od jedne vrste organizma do druge vrste organizma, s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to gradual evolution from one type of organism to another</p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to a kind of distorting optical system</p><p><b>evolucija jedne vrste organizma iz druge kroz dug niz postupnih promjena, metamorfizam koji se događa duboko ispod površine zemlje, izkrivljena projekcija ili perspektiva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the evolution of one type of organism from another by a long series of gradual changes [anamorphosis]</p><p><i>n.</i> metamorphism that occurs deep under the earth's surface</p><p><i>n.</i> a distorted projection or perspective [anamorphosis]</p><p><b>evolucija jedne vrste organizma iz druge kroz dug niz postupnih promjena, izkrivljena projekcija ili perspektiva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the evolution of one type of organism from another by a long series of gradual changes [anamorphism]</p><p><i>n.</i> a distorted projection or perspective [anamorphism]</p><p><b>ananas</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of tropical American plants have sword-shaped leaves and a fleshy compound fruits composed of the fruits of several flowers (such as pineapples) [genus Ananas]</p><p><i>n.</i> large sweet fleshy tropical fruit with a terminal tuft of stiff leaves [pineapple]</p><p><b>tropska američka biljka koja nosi veliko mesno jestivo voće s krajnjim tuftom čvrstih listova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tropical American plant bearing a large fleshy edible fruit with a terminal tuft of stiff leaves [pineapple, pineapple plant]</p><p><b>običan lažov (po likovima iz Novog zavjeta koji su ubijeni zbog laganja) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a habitual liar (after a New Testament character who was struck dead for lying)</p><p><b>anapest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metrical unit with unstressed-unstressed-stressed syllables [anapest]</p><p><b>anapest (od &quot;anapaest&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a metric foot) characterized by two short syllables followed by a long one [anapestic]</p><p><b>anapest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metrical unit with unstressed-unstressed-stressed syllables [anapaest]</p><p><b>anapest (od &quot;anapest&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a metric foot) characterized by two short syllables followed by a long one [anapaestic]</p><p><b>rod biljaka sjeverno-umjerenog područja s sivim listovima: bisernoglasni vječni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of herbs of north temperate regions having hoary leaves: pearly everlasting [genus Anaphalis]</p><p><b>Američki vječni s lišćama s mekanim vune i korimbosne glave s bisernom bijelom bract (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an American everlasting having foliage with soft wooly hairs and corymbose heads with pearly white bracts [cottonweed, pearly everlasting]</p><p><b>stadij mejoze ili mitoze kada se hromozomi kreću prema suprotnim krajevima nuklearnog vrtača (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the stage of meiosis or mitosis when chromosomes move toward opposite ends of the nuclear spindle</p><p><b>od ili povezane s stadijem mitoze poznatom kao anafaza (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or related to the stage of mitosis known as anaphase</p><p><b>riječ (kao što je zamjena) koja se koristi kako bi se izbjeglo ponavljanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word (such as a pronoun) used to avoid repetition</p><p><b>anafora</b></p><p><i>n.</i> using a pronoun or similar word instead of repeating a word used earlier</p><p><i>n.</i> repetition of a word or phrase at the beginning of successive clauses [epanaphora]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na anaporu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to anaphora</p><p><b>zamjenik koji se odnosi na prethodnik. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pronoun that refers to an antecedent</p><p><b>odnos između anafore i njene prethodnice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relation between an anaphor and its antecedent</p><p><b>smanjenje ili odsutnost seksualne želje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> decline or absence of sexual desire</p><p><b>smanjuje seksualnu želju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to diminish sexual desire</p><p><b>povezano s preosjetljivošću poznatom kao anafilaksija (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> related to the hypersensitivity known as anaphylaxis</p><p><b>anafilaktički šok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a severe and rapid and sometimes fatal hypersensitivity reaction to a substance (especially a vaccine or penicillin or shellfish or insect venom) to which the organism has become sensitized by previous exposure</p><p><b>anafilaksa, anafilaksija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hypersensitivity reaction to the ingestion or injection of a substance (a protein or drug) resulting from prior contact with a substance</p><p><b>anaplazija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> loss of structural differentiation within a cell or group of cells often with increased capacity for multiplication, as in a malignant tumor</p><p><b>bolest goveda koja se prenosi krpeljima goveda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disease of cattle that is transmitted by cattle ticks</p><p><b>Anaplazija ili povezana s njom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to anaplasia</p><p><b>operacije koje se odnose na terapijsku ili kozmetičku reformu tkiva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> surgery concerned with therapeutic or cosmetic reformation of tissue [plastic surgery, reconstructive surgery]</p><p><b>ne-steroidni protuupalni lijek (trademarks Aleve i Anaprox i Aflaxen) koji se bori protiv boli i upale (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (trademarks Aleve and Anaprox and Aflaxen) that fights pain and inflammation [Aflaxen, Aleve, naproxen sodium]</p><p><b>primitivni gmizavac bez otvora u temporalnom dijelu lubanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> primitive reptile having no opening in the temporal region of the skull [anapsid reptile]</p><p><b>primitivni gmizavac bez otvora u temporalnom dijelu lubanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> primitive reptile having no opening in the temporal region of the skull [anapsid]</p><p><b>najstariji poznati gmizavci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> oldest known reptiles [subclass Anapsida]</p><p><b>Annapurna</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wife of Siva and a benevolent aspect of Devi: Hindu goddess of plenty [Annapurna, Parvati]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain in the Himalayas in Nepal (26,500 feet high) [Annapurna]</p><p><b>anarhičan, bez reda</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> without law or control [anarchical, lawless]</p><p><b>bez zakona ili kontrole. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> without law or control [anarchic, lawless]</p><p><b>na bezakonit buntovnik način (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a lawless rebellious manner</p><p><b>anarhizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a political theory favoring the abolition of governments</p><p><b>anarhist, anarhistički</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an advocate of anarchism [nihilist, syndicalist]</p><p><b>anarhistički, anarhički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or related to anarchism or tending toward anarchism</p><p><b>anarhija, bespravlje, bezakonje, bezvlađe, bezvlašće, nered</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of lawlessness and disorder (usually resulting from a failure of government) [lawlessness]</p><p><b>ribe vukove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wolffishes [family Anarhichadidae]</p><p><b>vrsta rod Anarhichadidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Anarhichadidae [genus Anarhichas]</p><p><b>anartrija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> partial or total loss of articulate speech resulting from lesions of the central nervous system</p><p><b>crtice, uspomene, zbirka anegdota o nekom čovjeku, zbirka izreka (od &quot;ana&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Anatidae: freshwater ducks [genus Anas]</p><p><b>dugoglaka rijeka patka Starog i Novog svijeta s izduženim središnjim repnim perjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> long-necked river duck of the Old and New Worlds having elongated central tail feathers [pin-tailed duck, pintail]</p><p><b>Vježžanj čiji mužjak ima bijelu krunu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a widgeon the male of which has a white crown [American widgeon, baldpate]</p><p><b>slatkovodna patka sjeverne hemisfere s širokim ravnim kljunom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> freshwater duck of the northern hemisphere having a broad flat bill [broadbill, shoveler, shoveller]</p><p><b>Uobičajena žuta žuta u Euroaziji i Sjevernoj Americi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common teal of Eurasia and North America [green-winged teal, greenwing]</p><p><b>Američki plavuš (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> American teal [blue-winged teal, bluewing]</p><p><b>Udio od 1. do 2. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> freshwater duck of Eurasia and northern Africa related to mallards and teals [widgeon, wigeon]</p><p><b>divlje patke od kojih potječu domaće patke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wild dabbling duck from which domestic ducks are descended [mallard]</p><p><b>mala evroazijska crvena boja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small Eurasian teal [garganey]</p><p><b>crna patka sjeveroistočne Sjedinjenih Država i Kanade (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dusky duck of northeastern United States and Canada [black duck]</p><p><b>Blagovići (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> squash bugs [genus Anasa]</p><p><b>veliki crni američki buba koji sisati sok od vinove loze od bundeve obitelji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large black American bug that sucks sap of vines of the gourd family [squash bug]</p><p><b>generalizirani edem s akumulacijom seruma u podkožnom vezivom tkivu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> generalized edema with accumulation of serum in subcutaneous connective tissue</p><p><b>koji se karakterizira ili je pogođen kapljicom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by or affected by dropsy</p><p><b>Indijanci koji su živjeli u današnjem južnom Coloradu, Utah-u, sjevernoj Arizoni i New Mexic-u i koji su gradili stene. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Native American who lived in what is now southern Colorado and Utah and northern Arizona and New Mexico and who built cliff dwellings</p><p><b>izumrle male slatkovodne ribe bez čeljusti koje obično imaju heterocercal rep i oklopnu glavu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extinct small freshwater jawless fish usually having a heterocercal tail and an armored head</p><p><b>izumrli red kralježnjaka bez vilice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extinct order of jawless vertebrates [order Anaspida]</p><p><b>mišićno djelovanje probavnog trakta u suprotnom smjeru od peristaltike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> muscular action of the alimentary tract in a direction opposite to peristalsis</p><p><b>jedna vrsta: Jerichova ruža (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one species: rose of Jericho [genus Anastatica]</p><p><b>mala siva azijska pustinjska biljka s malenim bijelim cvijećem koja se skuplja kad suha i širi kada je vlažna (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small grey Asiatic desert plant bearing minute white flowers that rolls up when dry and expands when moist [resurrection plant, rose of Jericho]</p><p><b>anastigmatska leća, anastigma sočiva, anastigmatsko sočivo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> compound lens or lens system designed to be free of astigmatism and able to form approximately point images</p><p><b>anastigmatska leća, anastigma sočiva, anastigmatsko sočivo (od &quot;anastigmat&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to a lens or lens system free of astigmatism (able to form point images) [stigmatic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not astigmatic [stigmatic]</p><p><b>sočivo namijenjeno ispravljanju astigmatizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lens designed to correct astigmatism</p><p><b>Priđite zajedno ili otvorite jedni druge., uzrok da se spoje ili otvore jedni u druge anastomozom (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> come together or open into each other [inosculate]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to join or open into each other by anastomosis [inosculate]</p><p><b>anastomoza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a natural or surgical joining of parts or branches of tubular structures so as to make or become continuous [inosculation]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s anastomozom ili koje imaju anastomozu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or exhibiting anastomosis</p><p><b>jedna od dvije veze koje služe mozgu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two communicating veins serving the brain [vena anastomotica]</p><p><b>otvaranje računa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> openbills [genus Anastomus]</p><p><b>preokret u redoslijedu riječi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the reversal of the normal order of words [inversion]</p><p><b>Arheološka rekonstrukcija ruševina spomenika iz pala ili razvaljenih fragmenata (u slučaju potrebe uključivanje novih materijala) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the archeological reassembly of ruined monuments from fallen or decayed fragments (incorporating new materials when necessary)</p><p><b>anatema, izopćenje iz crkvene zajednice, prokletstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a detested person [bete noire]</p><p><i>n.</i> a formal ecclesiastical curse accompanied by excommunication</p><p><b>formalni čin izgovora (nekoga ili nešto) proklet (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the formal act of pronouncing (someone or something) accursed [anathematization]</p><p><b>Prokletstvo ili proglašavanje zlim ili prokletstvom ili prijetnja božanskom kaznom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> curse or declare to be evil or anathema or threaten with divine punishment [accurse, anathematize, anathemise, anathemize, comminate, execrate]</p><p><b>formalni čin izgovora (nekoga ili nešto) proklet (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the formal act of pronouncing (someone or something) accursed [anathematisation]</p><p><b>anatemizirati, izopćiti iz crkve, kleti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> curse or declare to be evil or anathema or threaten with divine punishment [accurse, anathematise, anathemise, anathemize, comminate, execrate]</p><p><b>Želeći zlo na, Prokletstvo ili proglašavanje zlim ili prokletstvom ili prijetnja božanskom kaznom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> wish harm upon [anathemize, bedamn, beshrew, curse, damn, imprecate, maledict]</p><p><i>v.</i> curse or declare to be evil or anathema or threaten with divine punishment [accurse, anathematise, anathematize, anathemize, comminate, execrate]</p><p><b>Želeći zlo na, Prokletstvo ili proglašavanje zlim ili prokletstvom ili prijetnja božanskom kaznom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> wish harm upon [anathemise, bedamn, beshrew, curse, damn, imprecate, maledict]</p><p><i>v.</i> curse or declare to be evil or anathema or threaten with divine punishment [accurse, anathematise, anathematize, anathemise, comminate, execrate]</p><p><b>ptice plivače s teškim kratko nogama i čipom s rogovitim vrhom: labudovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> swimming birds having heavy short-legged bodies and bills with a horny tip: swans [family Anatidae]</p><p><b>Anatole France</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French writer of sophisticated novels and short stories (1844-1924) [France, Jacques Anatole Francois Thibault]</p><p><b>Ruski šahovski majstor koji je bio svjetski prvak od 1975. do 1985. godine kada ga je porazio Gary Kasparov (rođen 1951.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian chess master who was world champion from 1975 until 1985 when he was defeated by Gary Kasparov (born in 1951) [Anatoli Yevgenevich Karpov, Karpov]</p><p><b>Ruski šahovski majstor koji je bio svjetski prvak od 1975. do 1985. godine kada ga je porazio Gary Kasparov (rođen 1951.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian chess master who was world champion from 1975 until 1985 when he was defeated by Gary Kasparov (born in 1951) [Anatoli Karpov, Karpov]</p><p><b>poluostrvo u jugozapadnoj Aziji koje čini azijski dio Turske (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a peninsula in southwestern Asia that forms the Asian part of Turkey [Asia Minor]</p><p><b>izumrla grana indoeuropske obitelji jezika poznata iz natpisa i važna u rekonstrukciji proto-indoeuropskog jezika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an extinct branch of the Indo-European family of languages known from inscriptions and important in the reconstruction of Proto-Indo European [Anatolian language]</p><p><b>izumrla grana indoeuropske obitelji jezika poznata iz natpisa i važna u rekonstrukciji proto-indoeuropskog jezika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an extinct branch of the Indo-European family of languages known from inscriptions and important in the reconstruction of Proto-Indo European [Anatolian]</p><p><b>anatomski, anatomsko</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the structure of the body [anatomical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the branch of morphology that studies the structure of organisms [anatomical]</p><p><b>anatomski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expression that relates to anatomy [anatomical reference]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the structure of the body [anatomic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the branch of morphology that studies the structure of organisms [anatomic]</p><p><b>izraz koji se odnosi na anatomiju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expression that relates to anatomy [anatomical]</p><p><b>sfinkter</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ring of muscle that contracts to close an opening [sphincter, sphincter muscle]</p><p><b>anatomska građa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a particular complex anatomical part of a living thing and its construction and arrangement [bodily structure, body structure, complex body part, structure]</p><p><b>anatomski (od &quot;anatomical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with respect to anatomy</p><p><b>Dizect kako bi analizirali (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> dissect in order to analyze [anatomize]</p><p><b>anatom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expert in anatomy</p><p><b>Dizect kako bi analizirali, Analizirati do najmanjeg detalja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> dissect in order to analyze [anatomise]</p><p><i>v.</i> analyze down to the smallest detail</p><p><b>anatomija, kostur, seciranje, figura, građa, ljudsko tijelo, stas, tijelo, tjelesna građa, trup</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of morphology that deals with the structure of animals [general anatomy]</p><p><i>n.</i> alternative names for the body of a human being [bod, build, chassis, figure, flesh, form, frame, human body, material body, physical body, physique, shape, soma]</p><p><i>n.</i> a detailed analysis</p><p><b>jedan od najvećih i najpoznatijih dinosaura s patkinim čipom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the largest and most famous duck-billed dinosaurs</p><p><b>bakterijski toksin koji je oslabljen dok više nije toksičan, ali je dovoljno jak da izazove stvaranje antitijela i imunitet na specifičnu bolest koju uzrokuje toksin (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bacterial toxin that has been weakened until it is no longer toxic but is strong enough to induce the formation of antibodies and immunity to the specific disease caused by the toxin [toxoid]</p><p><b>(od biljne jajne ćelije) potpuno obrnuta (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a plant ovule) completely inverted [inverted]</p><p><b>potpuno preokrenuta jajnik okrenut natrag 180 stupnjeva na stabljku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a completely inverted ovule turned back 180 degrees on its stalk</p><p><b>Atinski filozof koji je tvrdio da je sve sastavljeno od vrlo malih čestica koje je uredila neka vječna inteligencija (500-428 pr. n. e.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a presocratic Athenian philosopher who maintained that everything is composed of very small particles that were arranged by some eternal intelligence (500-428 BC)</p><p><b>Anaksimandar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a presocratic Greek philosopher and student of Thales who believed the universal substance to be infinity rather than something resembling ordinary objects (611-547 BC)</p><p><b>grčki filozof i suradnik Anaksimandra koji je vjerovao da su sve stvari napravljene od zraka u različitim stupnjevima gustoće (6. stoljeće prije Krista) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a presocratic Greek philosopher and associate of Anaximander who believed that all things are made of air in different degrees of density (6th century BC)</p><p><b>predak, prednik, praotac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone from whom you are descended (but usually more remote than a grandparent) [antecedent, ascendant, ascendent, root]</p><p><b>obožavanje predaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> worship of ancestors</p><p><b>antikan, drevan, naslijeđen, rodovski, star</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> inherited or inheritable by established rules (usually legal rules) of descent [hereditary, patrimonial, transmissible]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or belonging to or inherited from an ancestor</p><p><b>Žena predak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman ancestor</p><p><b>porijeklo, preci, rod, poreklo, postanak, loza, obitelj, porod, potomstvo, soj, podrijetlo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the descendants of one individual [blood, blood line, bloodline, descent, line, line of descent, lineage, origin, parentage, pedigree, stemma, stock]</p><p><i>n.</i> inherited properties shared with others of your bloodline [derivation, filiation, lineage]</p><p><b>anker, injekcijska smjesa, kotva, lenger, pričvrstiti, sidra, sidrište, sidriti, sidro, simbol nade, spas, učvrstiti, usidiriti, usidriti, utočište, zatezač, zatezati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanical device that prevents a vessel from moving [ground tackle]</p><p><i>n.</i> a central cohesive source of support and stability [backbone, keystone, linchpin, lynchpin, mainstay]</p><p><i>n.</i> a television reporter who coordinates a broadcast to which several correspondents contribute [anchorman, anchorperson]</p><p><i>v.</i> fix firmly and stably [ground]</p><p><i>v.</i> secure a vessel with an anchor [cast anchor, drop anchor]</p><p><b>lance ili užeta koja veže sidro za brod (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the chain or rope that attaches an anchor to a vessel [anchor rope]</p><p><b>svjetlo u rigingu broda koji je na sidri. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a light in the rigging of a ship that is riding at anchor [riding lamp, riding light]</p><p><b>prsten</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a toroidal shape [annulus, doughnut, halo, ring]</p><p><b>lance ili užeta koja veže sidro za brod (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the chain or rope that attaches an anchor to a vessel [anchor chain]</p><p><b>kotvljenje, sidrište