<p><i>n.</i> silky-foliaged herb of the Rocky Mountains with bluish-white flowers [Alpine anemone, mountain anemone]</p><p><b>Udio: C. spp. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thimbleweed of central and eastern North America [Virginia thimbleweed]</p><p><b>jedna vrsta: anemone ruga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one species: rue anemone [genus Anemonella]</p><p><b>cvjetovi su u obliku čaše, podsjećaju na anemone, ali su delikatniji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> woodland flower native to eastern North America having cup-shaped flowers reminiscent of anemone but more delicate [rue anemone]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u ovom slučaju ne primjenjuje primjena ovog članka, za sve biljke koje su u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći uvjet: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of flowering plants (especially grasses etc) that are pollinated by the wind</p><p><b>jedna vrsta: yerba mansa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one species: yerba mansa [genus Anemopsis]</p><p><b>stoloniferno bilje iz jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika s oštrim korijenom i malim pikantnim cvijećem s bijelim bractama koje ukazuju na anemone (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stoloniferous herb of southwestern United States and Mexico having a pungent rootstock and small spicate flowers with white bracts suggesting an anemone [yerba mansa]</p><p><b>nedostatak u razvoju mozga koji rezultira malim ili nedostajućim moždanim polutkama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a defect in brain development resulting in small or missing brain hemispheres [anencephaly]</p><p><b>karakterizira se djelomičnim ili potpunim odsustvom mozga (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by partial or total absence of a brain [anencephalous]</p><p><b>karakterizira se djelomičnim ili potpunim odsustvom mozga (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by partial or total absence of a brain [anencephalic]</p><p><b>nedostatak u razvoju mozga koji rezultira malim ili nedostajućim moždanim polutkama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a defect in brain development resulting in small or missing brain hemispheres [anencephalia]</p><p><b>smanjenje ili nedostatak imunološkog odgovora na određeni antigen, Neaktivnost i nedostatak energije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> reduction or lack of an immune response to a specific antigen</p><p><i>n.</i> inactivity and lack of energy</p><p><b>barometar, suh, vrsta barometra, aneroidni barometar, suhi barometar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a barometer that measures pressure without using fluids [aneroid barometer]</p><p><i>adj.</i> containing no liquid or actuated without the use of liquid</p><p><b>aneroidni barometar, suhi barometar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a barometer that measures pressure without using fluids [aneroid]</p><p><b>anestezija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> loss of bodily sensation with or without loss of consciousness [anaesthesia]</p><p><b>anesteziolog</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a specialist who administers an anesthetic to a patient before he is treated [anaesthetist, anesthetist]</p><p><b>anesteziologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of medical science that studies and applies anesthetics</p><p><b>anestetik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that causes temporary loss of bodily sensations [anaesthetic, anaesthetic agent, anesthetic agent]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or producing insensibility [anaesthetic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by insensibility [anaesthetic]</p><p><b>anestetik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that causes temporary loss of bodily sensations [anaesthetic, anaesthetic agent, anesthetic]</p><p><b>anestezirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> administer an anesthetic drug to [anaesthetise, anaesthetize, anesthetize, put out, put under]</p><p><b>anestetičar, anesteziolog</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a specialist who administers an anesthetic to a patient before he is treated [anaesthetist, anesthesiologist]</p><p><b>anestezirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> administer an anesthetic drug to [anaesthetise, anaesthetize, anesthetise, put out, put under]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena (CAS RN 1344-26-8) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mixture of methyl and ethyl chloride</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s anestrusom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to anestrus [anestrous, anoestrous]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s anestrusom, (nižih sisavaca) koji nisu u stanju estra (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to anestrus [anestric, anoestrous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of lower mammals) not in a state of estrus</p><p><b>primjenjuje se na sisare koji nisu ljudi: stanje ili interval spolne neaktivnosti između dva razdoblja estra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> applies to nonhuman mammals: a state or interval of sexual inactivity between two periods of estrus [anestrus, anoestrum, anoestrus]</p><p><b>primjenjuje se na sisare koji nisu ljudi: stanje ili interval spolne neaktivnosti između dva razdoblja estra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> applies to nonhuman mammals: a state or interval of sexual inactivity between two periods of estrus [anestrum, anoestrum, anoestrus]</p><p><b>čorba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dill [genus Anethum]</p><p><b>kopar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic Old World herb having aromatic threadlike foliage and seeds used as seasoning [dill]</p><p><b>koji imaju kromosomski broj koji nije točan višestruki haploidnog broja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a chromosome number that is not an exact multiple of the haploid number</p><p><b>aneuplodije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormality involving a chromosome number that is not an exact multiple of the haploid number (one chromosome set is incomplete)</p><p><b>vitamin B koji sprečava beriberi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a B vitamin that prevents beriberi [antiberiberi factor, thiamin, thiamine, vitamin B1]</p><p><b>aneurizma, proširenje arterije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cardiovascular disease characterized by a saclike widening of an artery resulting from weakening of the artery wall [aneurysm]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na ili je pogođen aneurizmom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or affected by an aneurysm [aneurismatic, aneurysmal, aneurysmatic]</p><p><b>koji 