džba (od &quot;anger&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by extreme anger [enraged, furious, infuriated, maddened]</p><p><b>Anžuvinac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a resident of Anjou [Angevine]</p><p><b>Anžuvinac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a resident of Anjou [Angevin]</p><p><b>upale krvnih žila ili limfnih kanala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of a blood vessel or lymph duct</p><p><b>angina, angle, gušobolja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any disease of the throat or fauces marked by spasmodic attacks of intense suffocative pain</p><p><i>n.</i> a heart condition marked by paroxysms of chest pain due to reduced oxygen to the heart [angina pectoris]</p><p><b>angina pectoris, angina pektoris, angina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a heart condition marked by paroxysms of chest pain due to reduced oxygen to the heart [angina]</p><p><b>bol u grudnoj grlu ili bol koji je povezan s tim bolom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or related to the pain of angina pectoris [anginose, anginous]</p><p><b>bol u grudnoj grlu ili bol koji je povezan s tim bolom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or related to the pain of angina pectoris [anginal, anginous]</p><p><b>bol u grudnoj grlu ili bol koji je povezan s tim bolom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or related to the pain of angina pectoris [anginal, anginose]</p><p><b>serija rendgenskih zraka koja prikazuje djelovanje srca i njegovih krvnih žila nakon ubrizgavanja radiopakne tvari. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a series of X rays representing the action of the heart and its blood vessels after the injection of a radiopaque substance</p><p><b>Drvo s plodovima u ljusci ili u ljusci ili u ljusci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tree bearing fruit enclosed in a shell or involucre or husk</p><p><b>s voćem ili plodovima u ljusci ili ljusci (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or being fruit enclosed in a shell or husk [angiocarpous]</p><p><b>s voćem ili plodovima u ljusci ili ljusci (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or being fruit enclosed in a shell or husk [angiocarpic]</p><p><b>povraćaj velikih ograničenih područja subkutanskog edemom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> recurrent large circumscribed areas of subcutaneous edema [Quincke's edema, atrophedema, giant hives, periodic edema]</p><p><b>angiogeneza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the formation of new blood vessels</p><p><b>lijek koji je dizajniran kako bi spriječio rast krvnih žila koji hrani tumore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that is designed to prevent the growth of blood vessels that nourish tumors</p><p><b>radiografija krvnih žila nakon ubrizgavanja radiopakne tvari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an X-ray representation of blood vessels made after the injection of a radiopaque substance</p><p><b>angiografija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> roentgenographic examination of blood vessels after injection of a radiopaque contrast medium</p><p><b>oblik hemofilije otkriven od strane Erika von Willebranda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of hemophilia discovered by Erik von Willebrand [vascular hemophilia, von Willebrand's disease]</p><p><b>liječnik koji se specijalizirao za angiologiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a physician who specializes in angiology</p><p><b>grana medicinske znanosti koja proučava krvne i limfne žile i njihove poremećaje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of medical science that studies the blood and lymph vessels and their disorders</p><p><b>tumor koji se sastoji od mase krvi ili limfnih žila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tumor consisting of a mass of blood or lymphatic vessels</p><p><b>koji je ili je povezan s tumorom ili ima tumor vrste poznate kao angiom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or related to or having a tumor of the kind known as an angioma</p><p><b>bilo kakva bolest krvnih žila ili limfnih kanala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any disease of the blood vessels or lymph ducts</p><p><b>operacija za popravak oštećenog krvnog žila ili za otključavanje koronarne arterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an operation to repair a damaged blood vessel or unblock a coronary artery</p><p><b>Vrlo promjenjive vrste vrlo velikih primiti