ati, preokrenuti, prevrnuti, ukidanje</b></p><p><i>v.</i> declare invalid [avoid, invalidate, nullify, quash, void]</p><p><i>v.</i> cancel officially [countermand, lift, overturn, repeal, rescind, reverse, revoke, vacate]</p><p><b>kružni, okrugli, prstenast</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> shaped like a ring [annulate, annulated, circinate, doughnut-shaped, ring-shaped, ringed]</p><p><b>Samo tanak vanjski disk Sunca se može vidjeti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> only a thin outer disk of the sun can be seen</p><p><b>krugli skotom koji okružuje središte vidnog polja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a circular scotoma surrounding the center of the field of vision</p><p><b>u obliku prstena. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> shaped like a ring [annular, annulated, circinate, doughnut-shaped, ring-shaped, ringed]</p><p><b>u obliku prstena. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> shaped like a ring [annular, annulate, circinate, doughnut-shaped, ring-shaped, ringed]</p><p><b>(heraldici) naboj u obliku malog prstena, s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (heraldry) a charge in the shape of a small ring</p><p><i>n.</i> molding in the form of a ring [bandelet, bandelette, bandlet, square and rabbet]</p><p><b>poništaj, poništenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being cancelled or annulled [revocation]</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) a formal termination (of a relationship or a judicial proceeding etc) [invalidation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of abrogating [abrogation, repeal]</p><p><b>kružni, prsten</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a toroidal shape [anchor ring, doughnut, halo, ring]</p><p><i>n.</i> (Fungi) a remnant of the partial veil that in mature mushrooms surrounds the stem like a collar [skirt]</p><p><b>godišnje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Latin) year</p><p><b>objaviti, obznaniti, nagovijestiti, nagovješćivati, najaviti, najavljivati, navijestiti, naviještati, navješćivati, naznačiti, naznačivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> foreshadow or presage [announce, foretell, harbinger, herald]</p><p><b>najava, objavljivanje, blagovijes