aign against entering or continuing a war</p><p><b>antacid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agent that counteracts or neutralizes acidity (especially in the stomach) [alkaliser, alkalizer, antacid, gastric antacid]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na blokiranje ili smanjenje adrenergičkih učinaka u tijelu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to blocking or reducing adrenergic effects in the body</p><p><b>protivavionski, protuavionski, protuzrakoplovni, protuzračna obrana</b></p><p><i>n.</i> artillery designed to shoot upward at airplanes [ack-ack, ack-ack gun, antiaircraft gun, flack, flak, pom-pom]</p><p><i>adj.</i> designed for defense from a surface position against air attack</p><p><b>pucanje na neprijateljske zrakoplove. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> firing at enemy aircraft</p><p><b>protuzračna obrana</b></p><p><i>n.</i> artillery designed to shoot upward at airplanes [ack-ack, ack-ack gun, antiaircraft, flack, flak, pom-pom]</p><p><b>uglađeni rubovi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer graphics) a technique that is used to smooth jagged distortions in curves and diagonal lines so they appear smoother</p><p><b>lijek koji se koristi za smanjenje stresa ili napetosti bez smanjenja mentalnog jasnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug used to reduce stress or tension without reducing mental clarity [ataractic, ataractic agent, ataractic drug, tranquilizer, tranquilliser, tranquillizer]</p><p><b>uspavač koji se koristi za ublažavanje anksioznosti i smanjenje napetosti i razdražljivosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tranquilizer used to relieve anxiety and reduce tension and irritability [anxiolytic, anxiolytic drug, minor tranquilizer, minor tranquilliser, minor tranquillizer]</p><p><b>protiv politike apartheida u Južnoj Africi (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> opposing the policy of apartheid in South Africa</p><p><b>antiaritmik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug used to treat an abnormal heart rhythm [antiarrhythmic drug, antiarrhythmic medication]</p><p><b>antiaritmik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug used to treat an