inder consisting of casings designed to break into many small high-velocity fragments [anti-personnel bomb, daisy cutter, fragmentation bomb]</p><p><b>Astražantna tvar nanesena na kožu kako bi se smanjila znojenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an astringent substance applied to the skin to reduce perspiration</p><p><b>protivupalni lijekovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> counteracting inflammation</p><p><b>stih ili pjesma koja se uzdiše ili pjeva kao odgovor (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a verse or song to be chanted or sung in response [antiphony]</p><p><b>Zbirka antifona, sadrže ili koriste odgovore, s masom od 50 g/m2 ili većom od 50 g/m2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bound collection of antiphons [antiphonary]</p><p><i>adj.</i> containing or using responses [responsive]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or resembling an antiphon or antiphony [antiphonary]</p><p><b>Zbirka antifona, s masom od 50 g/m2 ili većom od 50 g/m2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bound collection of antiphons [antiphonal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or resembling an antiphon or antiphony [antiphonal]</p><p><b>alternativno (odgovarajuće) pjevanje od strane zbora u dva dijela, stih ili pjesma koja se uzdiše ili pjeva kao odgovor (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> alternate (responsive) singing by a choir in two parts</p><p><i>n.</i> a verse or song to be chanted or sung in response [antiphon]</p><p><b>upotreba riječi u smislu suprotnom njenom normalnom smislu (posebno u ironiji) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the use of a word in a sense opposite to its normal sense (especially in irony)</p><p><b>antipodan, antipodni, protupolan, suprotnopolan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relation of opposition along a diameter [antipodal opposition, diametrical opposition]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to the antipodes or situated at opposite sides of the earth [antipodean]</p><p><b>odnos opozicije duž prečnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relation of opposition along a diameter [antipodal, diametrical opposition]</p><p><b>antipod, točka na zemlji suprotna od 