sired [antipsychotic, antipsychotic drug, major tranquilizer, major tranquilliser, major tranquillizer, neuroleptic, neuroleptic agent, neuroleptic drug]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je primjena lijekova u primjeni na pacijenata u kliničkoj ispitivanju u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, primjenjuje se druga vrsta lijekova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tranquilizer used to treat psychotic conditions when a calming effect is desired [antipsychotic, antipsychotic agent, major tranquilizer, major tranquilliser, major tranquillizer, neuroleptic, neuroleptic agent, neuroleptic drug]</p><p><b>lijekovi s antipiretima za liječenje groznice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medication with antipyretics to treat a fever</p><p><b>bilo koji lijek koji smanjuje tjelesnu temperaturu radi sprečavanja ili ublažavanja groznice, za sprečavanje ili ublažavanje groznice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any medicine that lowers body temperature to prevent or alleviate fever [febrifuge]</p><p><i>adj.</i> preventing or alleviating fever</p><p><b>antikvaran, starinski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expert or collector of antiquities [antiquary, archaist]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to persons who study or deal in antiques or antiquities</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to antiques or antiquities</p><p><b>antičestica kvarka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the antiparticle of a quark</p><p><b>antikvar, starinar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expert or collector of antiquities [antiquarian, archaist]</p><p><b>pustiti da što zastari, ukinuti, zastario</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make obsolete or old-fashioned</p><p><i>v.</i> give an antique appearance to [antique]</p><p><b>antikan, staromodan, zastario, antikni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> so extremely old as seeming to belong to an earlier period [antediluvian, archaic]</p><p><b>antikni, antikvitet, iz davnina, starinski, starodrevan, Antika, antička, antičke, antički</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an elderly man [gaffer, old-timer, old geezer, oldtimer]</p><p><i>n.</i> any piece of furniture or decorative object or the like produced in a former period and valuable because of its beauty or rarity</p><p><i>v.</i> shop for antiques</p><p><i>v.</i> give an antique appearance to [antiquate]</p><p><i>adj.</i> made in or typical of earlier times and valued for its age</p><p><i>adj.</i> out of fashion [demode, ex, old-fashioned, old-hat, outmoded, passe, passee]</p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging to or lasting from times long ago [age-old]</p><p><b>antički, antičkog, antika, antiknost, davnina, drevnost, stari vijek, starina, starost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the historic period preceding the Middle Ages in Europe</p><p><i>n.</i> extreme oldness [ancientness]</p><p><i>n.</i> an artifact surviving from the past</p><p><b>Proces sprečavanja preusmjeravanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of preventing redeposition</p><p><b>rod biljaka iz obitelji Scrophulariaceae s svijetlo obojenim nepravilnim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of herbs of the family Scrophulariaceae with brightly colored irregular flowers [genus Antirrhinum]</p><p><b>Kalifornijska biljka s vitkim bijelim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> California plant with slender racemes of white flowers [white snapdragon]</p><p><b>Jugozapadna Sjedinjene Države biljka sa žutim cvijećem na stabljikama koje se okreću i previjaju kroz drugu vegetaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> southwestern United States plant with yellow flowers on stems that twist and twine through other vegetation [yellow twining snapdragon]</p><p><b>višegodišnja biljka porijeklom iz Sredozemlja, ali široko uzgajana zbog ljubičastih ili ružičastih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial native to the Mediterranean but widely cultivated for its purple or pink flowers [Mediterranean snapdragon]</p><p><b>Sistemi za uništavanje satelita u orbiti ili oni koji su povezani s njima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a system to destroy satellites in orbit [ASAT]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na antisemitizam ili su karakterizirani antisemitizmom (MT