iva i okreće prema dolje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of the aorta that arches and turns downward</p><p><b>otvor od donje lijeve komore srca do aorte (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the orifice from the lower left chamber of the heart to the aorta</p><p><b>pleksus limfnih čvorova u donjem dijelu abdominalne aorte (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plexus of lymph nodes in the lower portion of the abdominal aorta</p><p><b>abnormalno suženje aortnog zaliska (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormal narrowing of the aortic valve</p><p><b>polulunarni ventil između lijeve klijetke i aorte (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a semilunar valve between the left ventricle and the aorta</p><p><b>upale aorte (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of the aorta</p><p><b>ušice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> douroucoulis [genus Aotus]</p><p><b>Noćni majmun iz Srednje i Južne Amerike s velikim očima i debelim krznom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nocturnal monkey of Central America and South America with large eyes and thick fur [douroucouli]</p><p><b>divlje ovce sjeverne Afrike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wild sheep of northern Africa [Ammotragus lervia, Barbary sheep, arui, audad, maned sheep]</p><p><b>brzo, žurno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> (poetic, literary) quickly</p><p><i>adv.</i> with speed [chop-chop, in short order, quickly, rapidly, speedily]</p><p><b>Indijanac plemena Apaša, pariški razbojnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any member of Athapaskan tribes that migrated to the southwestern desert (from Arizona to Texas and south into Mexico)</p><p><i>n.</i> a Parisian gangster</p><p><i>n.</i> the language of the Apache</p><p><b>nasilni brzi ples u francuskom vodevilu (Apač je član francuskog podzemlja) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a violent fast dance in French vaudeville (an apache is a member of the French underworld)</p><p><b>ritualizirani ples Apača. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ritual dance of the Apache</p><p><b>Velika dvorana u drevnim perzijskim palačama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the great hall in ancient Persian palaces</p><p><b>