<b>apologet, branitelj, apologeta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who argues to defend or justify some policy or institution [justifier, vindicator]</p><p><b>ispričati se, ispričavati, ispričavati se, isprika, izvinjavati, opravdati se, pravdati se, žaliti, izvinjavati se, opravdati, opravdavati, racionalizirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> acknowledge faults or shortcomings or failing [apologise]</p><p><i>v.</i> defend, explain, clear away, or make excuses for by reasoning [apologise, excuse, rationalise, rationalize]</p><p><b>kratka moralna priča (često sa životinjskim likovima) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a short moral story (often with animal characters) [allegory, fable, parable]</p><p><b>apologija, isprika, obrana, pravdanje, odbrana</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expression of regret at having caused trouble for someone</p><p><i>n.</i> a formal written defense of something you believe in strongly [apologia]</p><p><i>n.</i> a poor example [excuse]</p><p><b>apoapsi u orbiti oko Mjeseca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> apoapsis in orbit around the moon [aposelene]</p><p><b>biljka koja se razmnožava ili se razmnožava apomiksom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plant that reproduces or is reproduced by apomixis</p><p><b>od ili povezane s biljkama koje se razmnožavaju apomiksom, (reprodukcije) koje ne uključuju spajanje muških i ženskih gameta u reprodukciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a plant that reproduces by apomixis [apomictical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of reproduction) not involving the fusion of male and female gametes in reproduction [agamic, agamogenetic, agamous, parthenogenetic]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s biljkama koje se razmnožavaju apomiksom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a plant that reproduces by apomixis [apomictic]</p><p><b>Svaka od nekoliko vrsta razmnožavanja bez oplodnje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several kinds of reproduction without fertilization</p><p><b>derivati morfija koji nisu tako jaki kao morfij (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a morphine derivative that is not as strong as morphine</p><p><b>bilo koji od dubljih i debljih fascija koje vezuju mišiće za kosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the deeper and thicker fascia that attach muscles to bones</p><p><b>od ili povezane s aponeurozom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to an aponeurosis</p><p><b>upućen nekome tko odlazi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> addressed to one who is departing</p><p><b>spominjanje nečega tako što će reći da neće biti spomenuto. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mentioning something by saying it will not be mentioned</p><p><b>od ili povezan s vjerovanjem da Bog može biti poznat ljudima samo u smislu onoga što On nije (kao što je `Bog je nepoznat') (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the belief that God can be known to humans only in terms of what He is not (such as `God is unknowable')</p><p><b>vjersko uvjerenje da Bog ne može biti poznat, ali je potpuno "drugi" i da ga treba opisati u negativnim terminima (u smislu onoga što Bog nije) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the religious belief that God cannot be known but is completely `other' and must be described in negative terms (in terms of what God is not)</p><p><b>aforizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a short pithy instructive saying [aphorism, apothegm]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s apofizom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to an apophysis</p><p><b>(botanica) prirodno natečenost ili povećanje: na dnu stabla ili seta kod određenih mahova ili na škrilju čunjeva određenih iglavca, (anatomija) prirodni rast ili projekcija na organ ili dio tijela kao što je proces kralježnice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (botany) a natural swelling or enlargement: at the base of the stalk or seta in certain mosses or on the cone scale of certain conifers</p><p><i>n.</i> (anatomy) a natural outgrowth or projection on an organ or body part such as the process of a vertebra</p><p><b>paraliziran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to or characteristic of apoplexy</p><p><b>koji podsjeća na apopleksiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling apoplexy [apoplectoid]</p><p><b>koji podsjeća na apopleksiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling apoplexy [apoplectiform]</p><p><b>apopleksija, kap, moždana kap, oduzetost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sudden loss of consciousness resulting when the rupture or occlusion of a blood vessel leads to oxygen lack in the brain [CVA, cerebrovascular accident, stroke]</p><p><b>apoptoza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a type of cell death in which the cell uses specialized cellular machinery to kill itself [caspase-mediated cell death, programmed cell death]</p><p><b>malo rod epifitnih kaktusa iz Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of epiphytic cacti of Mexico [genus Aporocactus]</p><p><b>Obično uzgajan tropski američki kaktus s vitkim puzećim stabljikama i vrlo velikim krumpirskim cvijećem koje cvjetaju nekoliko dana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> commonly cultivated tropical American cactus having slender creeping stems and very large showy crimson flowers that bloom for several days [rat's-tail cactus, rattail cactus]</p><p><b>apoapsi u orbiti oko Mjeseca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> apoapsis in orbit around the moon [apolune]</p><p><b>Označavanje ili označavanje životinje koje služi za upozoravanje predatora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> conspicuous coloration or markings of an animal serving to warn off predators [warning coloration]</p><p><b>prekidanje u sredini rečenice (kao što su to radili pisci realističnih razgovora) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> breaking off in the middle of a sentence (as by writers of realistic conversations)</p><p><b>koji se odnose na ili karakteristični za aposiopeziju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or characteristic of aposiopesis</p><p><b>izdaja, otpadništvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of having rejected your religious beliefs or your political party or a cause (often in favor of opposing beliefs or causes) [defection, renunciation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of abandoning a party for cause [tergiversation]</p><p><b>apostata, otpadnički, otpadnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disloyal person who betrays or deserts his cause or religion or political party or friend etc. [deserter, ratter, recreant, renegade, turncoat]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not faithful to religion or party or cause</p><p><b>Odustati od svojih vjerovanja ili odanosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> abandon one's beliefs or allegiances [apostatize, tergiversate]</p><p><b>Odustati od svojih vjerovanja ili odanosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> abandon one's beliefs or allegiances [apostatise, tergiversate]</p><p><b>bilo koji važan rani učitelj kršćanstva ili kršćanski misionar ljudima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any important early teacher of Christianity or a Christian missionary to a people [Apostle]</p><p><b>apostol, pobornik, propovjednik, vijesnik, vjesnik, Apostola</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ardent early supporter of a cause or reform</p><p><i>n.</i> any important early teacher of Christianity or a Christian missionary to a people [Apostelic Father]</p><p><i>n.</i> (New Testament) one of the original 12 disciples chosen by Christ to preach his gospel</p><p><b>(Rimska katolička crkva) Anglosaksonski misionar koji je poslan u Friziju i Njemačku da širi kršćansku vjeru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman Catholic Church) Anglo-Saxon missionary who was sent to Frisia and Germany to spread the Christian faith [Boniface, Saint Boniface, St. Boniface, Winfred, Wynfrith]</p><p><b>(Novi zavjet) kršćanski misionar među poganima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (New Testament) a Christian missionary to the Gentiles [Apostle Paul, Paul, Paul the Apostle, Saint Paul, Saul, Saul of Tarsus, St. Paul]</p><p><b>(Novi zavjet) kršćanski misionar među poganima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (New Testament) a Christian missionary to the Gentiles [Apostle of the Gentiles, Paul, Paul the Apostle, Saint Paul, Saul, Saul of Tarsus, St. Paul]</p><p><b>apostolstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the position of apostle</p><p><b>apostolski, papinski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or deriving from the Apostles or their teachings [apostolical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> proceeding from or ordered by or subject to a pope or the papacy regarded as the successor of the Apostles [apostolical, papal, pontifical]</p><p><b>(Rimska katolička crkva) predstavnik Svete stolice u zemlji koja nema formalne diplomatske odnose s njom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman Catholic Church) a representative of the Holy See in a country that has no formal diplomatic relations with it</p><p><b>papinski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> proceeding from or ordered by or subject to a pope or the papacy regarded as the successor of the Apostles [apostolic, papal, pontifical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or deriving from the Apostles or their teachings [apostolic]</p><p><b>apostrof, apostrofa, obraćanje, razgodak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> address to an absent or imaginary person</p><p><i>n.</i> the mark (') used to indicate the omission of one or more letters from a printed word</p><p><b>od ili karakteristično za apostrof (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or characteristic of apostrophe</p><p><b>upotrebi apostrof. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> use an apostrophe [apostrophize]</p><p><b>upotrebi apostrof. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> use an apostrophe [apostrophise]</p><p><b>za proizvodnju proizvoda od građevinskog građevinskog proizvoda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of apothecary weight equal to 480 grains or one twelfth of a troy pound [ounce, troy ounce]</p><p><b>s masenom od 0,15 g/m2 ili većom od 0,15 g/m2 ili većom od 0,15 g/m2 ili većom od 0,15 g/m2 ili većom od 0,15 g/m2 ili većom od 0,15 g/m2 ili većom od 0,15 g/m2 ili većom od 0,15 g/m2 ili većom od 0,15 g/m2 ili većom od 0,15 g/m2 ili većom od 0,15 g/m2 ili većom od 0,15 g/m2 ili većom od 0,15 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an apothecary weight equal to 12 ounces or 373.242 grams [troy pound]</p><p><b>bilo koja jedinica težine koja se koristi u ljekarni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any weight unit used in pharmacy [apothecaries' weight]</p><p><b>bilo koja jedinica težine koja se koristi u ljekarni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any weight unit used in pharmacy [apothecaries' unit]</p><p><b>apoteka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a health professional trained in the art of preparing and dispensing drugs [chemist, druggist, pharmacist, pill pusher, pill roller]</p><p><b>apoteka, ljekarna</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a retail shop where medicine and other articles are sold [chemist's, chemist's shop, drugstore, pharmacy]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s apotekijem nekih lišajeva i gljiva (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the apothecium of some lichens and fungi</p><p><b>Čašav askocarp u mnogim lišenima i askomicetnim gljivicama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cuplike ascocarp in many lichens and ascomycetous fungi</p><p><b>uzrečica, aforizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a short pithy instructive saying [aphorism, apophthegm]</p><p><b>u obliku ili karakteriziranom krupnim apothegmima, Kratko i duhovno i kao poezija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> given to or characterized by terse apothegms [apothegmatical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> terse and witty and like a maxim [aphoristic, epigrammatic]</p><p><b>u obliku ili karakteriziranom krupnim apothegmima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> given to or characterized by terse apothegms [apothegmatic]</p><p><b>Bogati ili slaviti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> deify or glorify [apotheosise, apotheosize]</p><p><b>obožavanje, apoteoza, deifikacija, obogotvorenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> model of excellence or perfection of a kind [ideal, nonesuch, nonpareil, nonsuch, paragon, saint]</p><p><i>n.</i> the elevation of a person (as to the status of a god) [deification, exaltation]</p><p><b>Bogati ili slaviti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> deify or glorify [apotheose, apotheosize]</p><p><b>Bogati ili slaviti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> deify or glorify [apotheose, apotheosise]</p><p><b>Ima moć da spreči zlo ili lošu sreću. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the power to prevent evil or bad luck</p><p><b>preplašiti, uplašiti, zapanjiti, zaprepastiti, zgrožen, zgranuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> strike with disgust or revulsion [appall, offend, outrage, scandalise, scandalize, shock]</p><p><i>v.</i> fill with apprehension or alarm [alarm, appall, dismay, horrify]</p><p><b>siromašno rudarsko područje u planinama Appalachian (od Pennsylvanije do Sjeverne Karoline) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an impoverished coal mining area in the Appalachian Mountains (from Pennsylvania to North Carolina)</p><p><b>rodom ili stanovnikom Appalachija, u ili u vezi s Appalachima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or inhabitant of Appalachia</p><p><i>adj.</i> in or relating to Appalachia</p><p><b>planinski lanac u istočnoj Americi koji se proteže od Quebeca do Meksičkog zaljeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain range in the eastern United States extending from Quebec to the Gulf of Mexico [Appalachians]</p><p><b>planinski lanac u istočnoj Americi koji se proteže od Quebeca do Meksičkog zaljeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain range in the eastern United States extending from Quebec to the Gulf of Mexico [Appalachian Mountains]</p><p><b>plašiti se, prepasti se, strahovati, strepiti, užasnuti, zapanjiti, zaprepastiti, zgranuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> strike with disgust or revulsion [appal, offend, outrage, scandalise, scandalize, shock]</p><p><i>v.</i> fill with apprehension or alarm [alarm, appal, dismay, horrify]</p><p><b>plašiti se, prepasti se, strahovati, strepiti, užasnuti, zapanjiti, zaprepastiti (od &quot;appall&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> struck with fear, dread, or consternation [aghast, dismayed, shocked]</p><p><b>strašan, užasan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an experience that appalls</p><p><i>adj.</i> causing consternation [dismaying]</p><p><b>strašan, užasan (od &quot;appalling&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to an appalling extent</p><p><b>čvrsta rasa konja za sedlo razvijena u zapadnoj Sjevernoj Americi i karakteristično sa ptičastom guzicom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hardy breed of saddle horse developed in western North America and characteristically having a spotted rump</p><p><b>bilo koji običajni i zakoniti uvjet koji odgovara vašem položaju u životu, Zakon o državnoj pomoći (Ustavni zakon) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any customary and rightful perquisite appropriate to your station in life [apanage]</p><p><i>n.</i> a grant (by a sovereign or a legislative body) of resources to maintain a dependent member of a ruling family [apanage]</p><p><b>aparatčik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a humorous but derogatory term for an official of a large organization (especially a political organization)</p><p><i>n.</i> a communist who was a member of the administrative system of a communist party</p><p><b>aparat, equipment, gimnastička sprava, instrument, naprava, organ, oruđe, pomagalo, sprava, uređaj, gimnastička spr</b></p><p><i>n.</i> equipment designed to serve a specific function [setup]</p><p><i>n.</i> (anatomy) a group of body parts that work together to perform a given function</p><p><b>genitourinanrni sustav, genitourinarni sistem, mokraćni sistem, mokraćni sustav, mokraćno-spolni sistem, mokraćno-spolni sustav, urogenitalni sistem, urogenitalni sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the system that includes all organs involved in reproduction and in the formation and voidance of urine [genitourinary apparatus, genitourinary system, systema urogenitale, urinary apparatus, urinary system, urogenital apparatus, urogenital system]</p><p><b>nošnja, oblačiti, odjeća, odjeće, odjenuti, ukrašavati, obući</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clothing in general [clothes, dress, wearing apparel]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide with clothes or put clothes on [clothe, dress, enclothe, fit out, garb, garment, habilitate, raiment, tog]</p><p><b>lanac trgovina odjećom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chain of clothing stores</p><p><b>proizvođači i prodavači modne odjeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> makers and sellers of fashionable clothing [fashion business, fashion industry, garment industry, rag trade]</p><p><b>nošnja, oblačiti, odjeća, odjeće, odjenuti, ukrašavati (od &quot;apparel&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> dressed or clothed especially in fine attire [attired, dressed, garbed, garmented, habilimented, robed]</p><p><b>svojstvo da je očito (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being apparent [apparentness]</p><p><b>jasan, očevidan, očigledan, očit, prividan, prividni, razvidan, vidljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> clearly revealed to the mind or the senses or judgment [evident, manifest, palpable, patent, plain, unmistakable]</p><p><i>adj.</i> appearing as such but not necessarily so [ostensible, seeming]</p><p><b>obzor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the line at which the sky and Earth appear to meet [horizon, sensible horizon, skyline, visible horizon]</p><p><b>optička iluzija kretanja proizvedena promatranjem brzog niza mirnih slika pokretnog objekta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an optical illusion of motion produced by viewing a rapid succession of still pictures of a moving object [apparent movement, motion, movement]</p><p><b>optička iluzija kretanja proizvedena promatranjem brzog niza mirnih slika pokretnog objekta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an optical illusion of motion produced by viewing a rapid succession of still pictures of a moving object [apparent motion, motion, movement]</p><p><b>izgleda, naoko, očevidno, prividno, razvidno, vidljivo, očito</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> from appearances alone [on the face of it, ostensibly, seemingly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> unmistakably (`plain' is often used informally for `plainly') [evidently, manifestly, obviously, patently, plain, plainly]</p><p><b>jasan, očevidan, očigledan, očit, prividan, prividni, razvidan, vidljiv (od &quot;apparent&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being apparent [apparency]</p><p><b>avet, duh, pojava, prikaza, sablast, utvara</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ghostly appearing figure [fantasm, phantasm, phantasma, phantom, specter, spectre]</p><p><i>n.</i> the appearance of a ghostlike figure</p><p><i>n.</i> something existing in perception only [fantasm, phantasm, phantasma, phantom, shadow]</p><p><i>n.</i> an act of appearing or becoming visible unexpectedly</p><p><b>koji liči na ili ima karakteristike fantaze (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling or characteristic of a phantom [ghostlike, ghostly, phantasmal, spectral, spiritual]</p><p><b>apel, apelirati, molba, molba da se nešto učini, obraćanje, optužiti, poziv, pozivamo, privlačnost, priziv, proglas, protestirati, sklonost, uložiti žalbu, umoljavati, žalba, žaliti se, apelacija, preklinjanje, zamolba, šarm, šarmantnost, prikupljanje, zahtjev, mamiti, primamiti, privlačiti, privući, svidjeti se, sviđati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> earnest or urgent request [entreaty, prayer]</p><p><i>n.</i> attractiveness that interests or pleases or stimulates [appealingness, charm]</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) a legal proceeding in which the appellant resorts to a higher court for the purpose of obtaining a review of a lower court decision and a reversal of the lower court's judgment or the granting of a new trial</p><p><i>n.</i> request for a sum of money [collection, ingathering, solicitation]</p><p><i>v.</i> take a court case to a higher court for review</p><p><i>v.</i> request earnestly (something from somebody) [invoke]</p><p><i>v.</i> be attractive to [attract]</p><p><i>v.</i> challenge (a decision)</p><p><i>v.</i> cite as an authority [invoke]</p><p><b>Odbor službenika koji nisu sudski ali su imenovani za razmatranje žalbi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a board of officials that are not judicial but are appointed to hear appeals [appeals board, board of appeals]</p><p><b>koji se može žaliti posebno na viši sud (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being appealed especially to a higher tribunal</p><p><b>dopadljiv, molećiv, mio, privlačan, simpatičan, suosjećajan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> able to attract interest or draw favorable attention</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of characters in literature or drama) evoking empathic or sympathetic feelings [likable, likeable, sympathetic]</p><p><b>dopadljiv, molećiv (od &quot;appealing&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an appealing manner</p><p><b