rovide the user with tools to accomplish a task [application program, applications programme]</p><p><i>n.</i> liquid preparation having a soothing or antiseptic or medicinal action when applied to the skin [lotion]</p><p><i>n.</i> a diligent effort [diligence]</p><p><i>n.</i> the action of putting something into operation</p><p><b>formular za molbu, obrazac zahtjeva, pristupnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form to use when making an application</p><p><b>aplikacijski program, namjenski program, program za posebne primjene, program</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a program that gives a computer instructions that provide the user with tools to accomplish a task [application, applications programme]</p><p><b>jezik čije izjave podudaraju terminologiju korisnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a language whose statements resemble terminology of the user [problem-oriented language]</p><p><b>program</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a program that gives a computer instructions that provide the user with tools to accomplish a task [application, application program]</p><p><b>lako primjenljiv ili praktičan (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> readily applicable or practical [applicatory]</p><p><b>aplikator, mazalica, sredstvo za nanošenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device for applying a substance [applier]</p><p><b>lako primjenljiv ili praktičan (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> readily applicable or practical [applicative]</p><p><b>aplicirano, koristiti, primijenjen, primijenjeni, primijenjeno, primjene, primjenljiv, primjenjen, primjenjuje, stavljen, uporabni, upotrebljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> concerned with concrete problems or data rather than with fundamental principles</p><p><b>Praktično primjena anatomskih znanja na dijagnozu i liječenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the practical application of anatomical knowledge to diagnosis and treatment [clinical anatomy]</p><p><b>primijenjena matematika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branches of mathematics that are involved in the study of the physical or biological or sociological world [applied mat