on, naming]</p><p><i>n.</i> a meeting arranged in advance [date, engagement]</p><p><i>n.</i> (usually in the plural) furnishings and equipment (especially for a ship or hotel) [fitting]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is appointed to a job or position [appointee]</p><p><i>n.</i> the job to which you are (or hope to be) appointed</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) the act of disposing of property by virtue of the power of appointment</p><p><b>Knjiga koja sadrži kalendar i prostor za bilježenje sastanaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a book containing a calendar and space to keep a record of appointments [appointment calendar]</p><p><b>Knjiga koja sadrži kalendar i prostor za bilježenje sastanaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a book containing a calendar and space to keep a record of appointments [appointment book]</p><p><b>dodijeliti, odmjeriti, odrediti (dio), razdijeliti, distribuirati, dodjeljivati, doznačavati, doznačiti, raspodijeliti, raspodjeljivati, rasporediti, raspoređivati, razdati, razdavati, razdjeljivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> distribute according to a plan or set apart for a special purpose [allocate]</p><p><i>v.</i> give out as one's portion or share [deal, divvy up, portion out, share]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 g/cm2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being distributed [allocable, allocatable]</p><p><b>dodijeliti, odmjeriti, odrediti (dio), razdijeliti (od &quot;apportion&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> given out in portions [dealt out, doled out, meted out, parceled out]</p><p><b>dodijeliti, odmjeriti, odrediti (dio), razdijeliti (od &quot;apportion&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of distributing by allotting or apportioning [allocation, allotment, apportionment, assignation, parceling, parcelling]</p><p><b>dodjeljivanje, raspodjela, raspored</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of distributing by allotting or apportioning [allocation, allotment, apportioning, assignation, parceling, parcelling]</p><p><b>Sposoban da se stavi nasuprot nečemu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i