genus Argyreia]</p><p><b>rijetki mineral od čelika i sivog boje koji se sastoji od srebra, germanija i sumpora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rare steel-grey mineral consisting of silver and germanium and sulfur</p><p><b>antiseptički lijek koji se sastoji od spoja proteina i srebra (trgovinski naziv Argyrol) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antiseptic consisting of a compound of protein and silver (trade name Argyrol) [mild silver protein]</p><p><b>narandžasta tortriks (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> orange tortrix [genus Argyrotaenia]</p><p><b>Kalifornijskog molja čije ličinke žive u posebno narančama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> California moth whose larvae live in especially oranges [orange tortrix, tortrix]</p><p><b>Maleni rod havajskih špilja koji se šire i formiraju ruže (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of Hawaiian spreading and rosette-forming shrubs [genus Argyroxiphium]</p><p><b>nisko rastuća biljka koja se nalazi samo u vulkanskim kraterima na Havajima s rozetama uskih šiljastih srebrnozelenih listova i grmovima obilnih crveno-fioletskih cvijeća na visokom stabljaku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low-growing plant found only in volcanic craters on Hawaii having rosettes of narrow pointed silver-green leaves and clusters of profuse red-purple flowers on a tall stem [silversword]</p><p><b>Budista koji je postigao nirvanu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Buddhist who has attained nirvana [Arhat, lohan]</p><p><b>Budista koji je postigao nirvanu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Buddhist who has attained nirvana [Arhant, lohan]</p><p><b>Arhus, Aarhus</b></p><p><i>n.</i> port city of Denmark in eastern Jutland [Aarhus]</p><p><b>arija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an elaborate song for solo voice</p><p><b>Arijadna</b></p><p><i>n.</i> beautiful daughter of Minos and Pasiphae</p><p><b>Sastavljanje zračnih fotografija koje čine sastavnu sliku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arrangement of aerial photographs forming a composite picture [mosaic, photomosaic]</p><p><b>grad u Tunisu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> city in Tunisia</p><p><b>jeretička nauka koju je učio Arije koja je tvrdila da je Otac radikalno nadmoćniji od Sina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heretical doctrine taught by Arius that asserted the radical primacy of the Father over the Son</p><p><b>bio je pristalica arijanskog vjerovanja (vjerovanja da Isus Krist nije bio Bog) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an adherent of Arianism (the belief that Jesus Christ was not truly God)</p><p><b>Keltska boginja poznata po svojoj ljepoti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Celtic goddess famous for her beauty [Arianrod]</p><p><b>Keltska boginja poznata po svojoj ljepoti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Celtic goddess famous for her beauty [Arianrhod]</p><p><b>član naroda Caddo koji su nekada živjeli u Dakotama zapadno od rijeke Missouri, Kadonski jezik kojim govore Arikara. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Caddo people who formerly lived in the Dakotas west of the Missouri river [Arikara]</p><p><i>n.</i> the Caddoan language spoken by the Arikara [Arikara]</p><p><b>bezvodan, dosadan, neplodan, sasušen, suh, suhoparan, sušni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking sufficient water or rainfall [waterless]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking vitality or spirit [desiccate, desiccated]</p><p><b>bezvodnost, suhoća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of yielding nothing of value [barrenness, fruitlessness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a deficiency of moisture (especially when resulting from a permanent absence of rainfall) [aridness, thirstiness]</p><p><b>bezvodan, dosadan, neplodan, sasušen, suh, suhoparan, sušni (od &quot;arid&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a deficiency of moisture (especially when resulting from a permanent absence of rainfall) [aridity, thirstiness]</p><p><b>Ovan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (astrology) a person who is born while the sun is in Aries [Ram]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small zodiacal constellation in the northern hemisphere</p><p><i>n.</i> the first sign of the zodiac which the sun enters at the vernal equinox [Aries the Ram, Ram]</p><p><b>Prvi znak zodijaka u koji Sunce ulazi na prolećnoj jednodnevnici. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first sign of the zodiac which the sun enters at the vernal equinox [Aries, Ram]</p><p><b>kratka arija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a short aria [short aria]</p><p><b>pravo</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an accurate manner [correctly, right]</p><p><b>morski sumci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sea catfishes [family Ariidae]</p><p><b>član naroda Caddo koji su nekada živjeli u Dakotama zapadno od rijeke Missouri, Kadonski jezik kojim govore Arikara. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Caddo people who formerly lived in the Dakotas west of the Missouri river [Aricara]</p><p><i>n.</i> the Caddoan language spoken by the Arikara [Aricara]</p><p><b>masno i obično svijetlo obojeno pokrivač nekih sjemena koji se razvija iz stabla jajne ćelije i djelomično ili u potpunosti obložava sjemeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fleshy and usually brightly colored cover of some seeds that develops from the ovule stalk and partially or entirely envelops the seed</p><p><b>(od nekih sjemena) s mesnatom i obično svijetle boje poklopac (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of some seeds) having a fleshy and usually brightly colored cover [arillate]</p><p><b>(od nekih sjemena) s mesnatom i obično svijetle boje poklopac (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of some seeds) having a fleshy and usually brightly colored cover [ariled]</p><p><b>rod Reduviidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Reduviidae [genus Arilus]</p><p><b>veliki grabežljiv sjevernoamerički kuk koji sisati krv drugih insekata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large predatory North American bug that sucks the blood of other insects [wheel bug]</p><p><b>Kaktusi koji se nalaze u području s relativno niskom razinom rasta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> slow-growing geophytic cacti [genus Ariocarpus]</p><p><b>obično neogranat obično bez kralježnice kaktus prekriven bradavičnim gomoljem i s crvenokrasnim cvijećem i bijelim ili zelenim plodovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> usually unbranched usually spineless cactus covered with warty tubercles and having magenta flowers and white or green fruit [living rock]</p><p><b>rod Stromateidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Stromateidae [genus Ariomma]</p><p><b>koji imaju melodiju (za razliku od recitativne) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a melody (as distinguished from recitative) [songlike]</p><p><b>(glazba) kratak recitativ koji je melodičan ali nije arija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (music) a short recitative that is melodic but is not an aria</p><p><b>Bjelovječe, s masnim udjelom od 0,05 g/m2 do 0,05 g/m2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tuberous or rhizomatous herbaceous perennials [genus Arisaema]</p><p><b>obična američka biljka s proljetnim cvjetovima koja ima listove za pokrivanje i uspravnu štapovsku spadix s sveobuhvatnim zelenim i ljubičastim spatheom koji proizvodi crvene bobice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common American spring-flowering woodland herb having sheathing leaves and an upright club-shaped spadix with overarching green and purple spathe producing scarlet berries [Arisaema triphyllum, Indian turnip, jack-in-the-pulpit, wake-robin]</p><p><b>biljka s ranim proljetnim cvjetom iz istočne Sjeverne Amerike koja sliči na srodnog ptica-na-pulpit ali ima digitate lišće, tanke zelenožute špatne i izduženu spadix (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> early spring-flowering plant of eastern North America resembling the related jack-in-the-pulpit but having digitate leaves, slender greenish yellow spathe and elongated spadix [green dragon]</p><p><b>obična američka biljka s proljetnim cvjetovima koja ima listove za pokrivanje i uspravnu štapovsku spadix s sveobuhvatnim zelenim i ljubičastim spatheom koji proizvodi crvene bobice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common American spring-flowering woodland herb having sheathing leaves and an upright club-shaped spadix with overarching green and purple spathe producing scarlet berries [Arisaema atrorubens, Indian turnip, jack-in-the-pulpit, wake-robin]</p><p><b>Uređene ili popravljene biljke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tuberous or rhizomatous perennial herbs [genus Arisarum]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 1. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka primjenjuje samo na biljke iz kategorije 0202 ili 0203 u skladu s člankom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, točka (b) ovog članka se primjenjuje samo na biljke iz kategorije 0203 ili 0204 u skladu s člankom 1. točkom (c) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tuberous perennial having a cowl-shaped maroon or violet-black spathe [friar's-cowl]</p><p><b>dići se, dizati se, naići, nametnuti se, nastajati, nastati, pojaviti se, poticati, proizlaziti, uskrsnuti, ustajati, ustati, postajati, postati, dignuti se, podignuti se, podizati se, podići se, iskrsavati, iskrsnuti, uzdignuti se, uzdizati se, uzdići se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> come into existence [develop, grow, originate, rise, spring up, uprise]</p><p><i>v.</i> originate or come into being [bob up, come up]</p><p><i>v.</i> rise to one's feet [get up, rise, stand up, uprise]</p><p><i>v.</i> result or issue [come up]</p><p><i>v.</i> move upward [come up, go up, lift, move up, rise, uprise]</p><p><i>v.</i> take part in a rebellion [rebel, rise, rise up]</p><p><i>v.</i> get up and out of bed [get up, rise, turn out, uprise]</p><p><b>veliko poluvjeklo zeleno stablo iz Istočne Indije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large semi-evergreen tree of the East Indies [Azadirachta indica, Melia Azadirachta, margosa, neem, neem tree, nim tree]</p><p><b>bristlelike proces blizu vrha antene određenih muha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bristlelike process near the tip of the antenna of certain flies</p><p><b>grčki gramatik poznat po svojim komentarima Iliade i Odiseje (oko 217-145 p. n. e.), svijetli krater na Mjesecu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient Greek grammarian remembered for his commentary on the Iliad and Odyssey (circa 217-145 BC)</p><p><i>n.</i> a bright crater on the Moon</p><p><b>Stari grčki astronom koji je bio jedan od prvih koji je predložio heliocentričnu teoriju svemira (oko 270 pne.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient Greek astronomer who was one of the first to propose a heliocentric theory of the universe (circa 270 BC)</p><p><b>Francuski skulptor monumentalnih ženskih gola (1861-1944) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French sculptor of monumental female nudes (1861-1944) [Maillol]</p><p><b>sintetički kortikosteroid (trgovinski nazivi Aristocort ili Aristopak ili Kenalog) koji se koristi kao protivupalni sredstvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a synthetic corticosteroid (trade names Aristocort or Aristopak or Kenalog) used as an anti-inflammatory agent [Aristopak, Kenalog, triamcinolone]</p><p><b>aristokracija, plemići, plemićima, plemstvo, aristokracije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a privileged class holding hereditary titles [nobility]</p><p><i>n.</i> the most powerful members of a society [gentry]</p><p><b>aristokrat, plemenitaš, plemić, aristokrata, aristrokratskog, patricij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the aristocracy [blue blood, patrician]</p><p><b>aristokratski, otmjen, aristrokratskog</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging to or characteristic of the nobility or aristocracy [aristocratical, blue, blue-blooded, gentle, patrician]</p><p><b>koji pripadaju plemstvu ili aristokratiji ili su karakteristični za njih (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging to or characteristic of the nobility or aristocracy [aristocratic, blue, blue-blooded, gentle, patrician]</p><p><b>na aristokratski način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an aristocratic manner</p><p><b>roditeljske žile (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> birthworts [genus Aristolochia]</p><p><b>puzava biljka s zakrivljenim cvijećem za koje se smatra da liči na fetuse (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> creeping plant having curving flowers thought to resemble fetuses [birthwort]</p><p><b>čvrsta listnatog vinogreba s velikim lišcima i cvijećem s kalijskom cijevom zakrivljenom poput zdjele cijevi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hardy deciduous vine having large leaves and flowers with the calyx tube curved like the bowl of a pipe [Aristolochia macrophylla, Dutchman's-pipe, pipe vine]</p><p><b>čvrsta listnatog vinogreba s velikim lišcima i cvijećem s kalijskom cijevom zakrivljenom poput zdjele cijevi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hardy deciduous vine having large leaves and flowers with the calyx tube curved like the bowl of a pipe [Aristolochia durior, Dutchman's-pipe, pipe vine]</p><p><b>rođenog šuma istočnih Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> birthwort of the eastern United States woodlands [Virginia serpentaria, Virginia serpentary, Virginia snakeroot]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u pitanju vrsta, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog poglavlja, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog poglavlja, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog poglavlja, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog poglavlja, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (b) ovog poglavlja, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (c) ovog poglavlja, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (e) ovog poglavlja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> family of birthworts (including wild ginger) [birthwort family, family Aristolochiaceae]</p><p><b>red biljaka odvojeni tubarskim petaloidnim periantom i donjim jajnikom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> order of plants distinguished by tubular petaloid perianth and inferior ovary [order Aristolochiales]</p><p><b>sintetički kortikosteroid (trgovinski nazivi Aristocort ili Aristopak ili Kenalog) koji se koristi kao protivupalni sredstvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a synthetic corticosteroid (trade names Aristocort or Aristopak or Kenalog) used as an anti-inflammatory agent [Aristocort, Kenalog, triamcinolone]</p><p><b>Aristofan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient Greek dramatist remembered for his comedies (448-380 BC)</p><p><b>sljedbenik Aristotela ili pristalica Aristotelijanizma, Aristotel ili njegova filozofija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a follower of Aristotle or an adherent of Aristotelianism [Aristotelian, Peripatetic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Aristotle or his philosophy [Aristotelian, Aristotelic, peripatetic]</p><p><b>maleni rod grmova ili malih stabala iz Australije i Novog Zelanda te zapadne Južne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of shrubs or small trees of Australia and New Zealand and western South America [genus Aristotelia]</p><p><b>graciozna listovita grmlja ili malo stablo s privlačnim lišće i malim crvenim bojama koje postaju crne kada sazreju i koriste se za pravljenje vina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> graceful deciduous shrub or small tree having attractive foliage and small red berries that turn black at maturity and are used for making wine [Aristotelia serrata, New Zealand wine berry, makomako, wineberry]</p><p><b>graciozna listovita grmlja ili malo stablo s privlačnim lišće i malim crvenim bojama koje postaju crne kada sazreju i koriste se za pravljenje vina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> graceful deciduous shrub or small tree having attractive foliage and small red berries that turn black at maturity and are used for making wine [Aristotelia racemosa, New Zealand wine berry, makomako, wineberry]</p><p><b>aristotelski, aristotelovac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a follower of Aristotle or an adherent of Aristotelianism [Aristotelean, Peripatetic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Aristotle or his philosophy [Aristotelean, Aristotelic, peripatetic]</p><p><b>Aristotelova silogistička logika koju je razvio Boetije u srednjem vijeku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the syllogistic logic of Aristotle as developed by Boethius in the Middle Ages</p><p><b>aristotelizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (philosophy) the philosophy of Aristotle that deals with logic and metaphysics and ethics and poetics and politics and natural science [peripateticism]</p><p><b>Aristotel ili njegova filozofija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Aristotle or his philosophy [Aristotelean, Aristotelian, peripatetic]</p><p><b>Aristotel</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the greatest of the ancient Athenian philosophers</p><p><b>Vještičje učenje pomoću brojeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> divination by means of numbers</p><p><b>aritmetički, aritmetika, račun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of pure mathematics dealing with the theory of numerical calculations</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or involving arithmetic [arithmetical]</p><p><b>aritmetička sredina, srednja vrijednost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sum of the values of a random variable divided by the number of values [expectation, expected value, first moment]</p><p><b>aritmetička operacija, računska radnja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mathematical operation involving numbers</p><p><b>aritmetički niz</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) a progression in which a constant is added to each term in order to obtain the next term</p><p><b>aritmetički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or involving arithmetic [arithmetic]</p><p><b>aritmetički (od &quot;arithmetical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with respect to arithmetic</p><p><b>netko tko se specijalizirao za aritmetiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who specializes in arithmetic</p><p><b>broj argumenata funkcije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the number of arguments that a function can take</p><p><b>Arije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Greek who was a Christian theologian active in Alexandria and who was declared a heretic for his doctrines about God (which came to be known as Arianism) (256?-336)</p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Ariidae: sea catfishes [genus Arius]</p><p><b>država u jugozapadnom dijelu Sjedinjenih Država., glatka zmija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state in southwestern United States [AZ, Grand Canyon State]</p><p><i>n.</i> glossy snake [genus Arizona]</p><p><b>mali grmovi u jugozapadnim Sjedinjenim Državama i sjeverozapadnom Meksiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small shrubby ash of southwestern United States and northwestern Mexico [Fraxinus velutina]</p><p><b>Drvo iz Arizone s plavo-srebrnim lišćama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Arizona timber tree with bluish silvery foliage [Cupressus arizonica]</p><p><b>Noćna zmija sa sjajnim tanim ljuskama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nocturnal burrowing snake of western United States with shiny tan scales [glossy snake]</p><p><b