e but fairly close to correct [about, approximately, close to, just about, more or less, or so, roughly, some]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in or to a reversed position or direction [about]</p><p><i>adv.</i> to a particular destination either specified or understood</p><p><i>adv.</i> all around or on all sides [about]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in circumference</p><p><i>adv.</i> from beginning to end [round]</p><p><b>Neformalni ili slangovi izrazi za mentalno neredovite (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> informal or slang terms for mentally irregular [balmy, barmy, bats, batty, bonkers, buggy, cracked, crackers, daft, dotty, fruity, haywire, kookie, kooky, loco, loony, loopy, nuts, nutty, round the bend, wacky, whacky]</p><p><b>bez zaustavljanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without stopping [for 24 hours, round the clock]</p><p><b>U svakom trenutku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> at all times [day-and-night, nonstop, round-the-clock]</p><p><b>buđenje, podraživanje, poticanje, uzbuđenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of arousing [rousing]</p><p><i>n.</i> a state of heightened physiological activity</p><p><i>n.</i> awakening from sleep</p><p><i>n.</i> mutual sexual fondling prior to sexual intercourse [foreplay, stimulation]</p><p><b>buditi, izazvati, potaknuti, probuditi, uzbuditi, uzbuniti, izazivati, pobuditi, pobuđivati, podjariti, potaći, poticati, raspaliti, raspaljivati, raspiriti, rasplamsati, rasplamsavati, razbuktati, razbuktavati, probuditi se, razbuditi, stimulirati, nadražiti, nadraživati, napaliti, napaljivati, uspaliti, uspaljivati, uzbuđivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> call forth (emotions, feelings, and responses) [elicit, enkindle, evoke, fire, kindle, provoke, raise]</p><p><i>v.</i> stop sleeping [awake, awaken, come alive, wake, wake up, waken]</p><p><i>v.</i> summon into action or bring into existence, often as if by magic [bring up, call down, call forth, conjure, conjure up, evoke, invoke, put forward, raise, stir]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be alert and energetic [brace, energise, energi