, cacodyl radical]</p><p><b>bijeli otrovni trioksid arsenika u prahu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white powdered poisonous trioxide of arsenic [arsenic, arsenous anhydride, arsenous oxide, ratsbane, white arsenic]</p><p><b>Pesticid ili lijek koji sadrži arsen, koji se odnose na arsen ili ga sadrže (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pesticide or drug containing arsenic</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or containing arsenic</p><p><b>arsenid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compound of arsenic with a more positive element</p><p><b>arsenov</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to compounds in which arsenic is trivalent</p><p><b>arsenopirit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a silver-white or grey ore of arsenic [mispickel]</p><p><b>bijeli otrovni trioksid arsenika u prahu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white powdered poisonous trioxide of arsenic [arsenic, arsenic trioxide, arsenous oxide, ratsbane, white arsenic]</p><p><b>bijeli otrovni trioksid arsenika u prahu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white powdered poisonous trioxide of arsenic [arsenic, arsenic trioxide, arsenous anhydride, ratsbane, white arsenic]</p><p><b>arsin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a poisonous colorless flammable gas used in organic synthesis and to dope transistors and as a poison gas in warfare</p><p><b>palež, palikućstvo, piromanija, zlonamjerna paljevina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> malicious burning to destroy property [fire-raising, incendiarism]</p><p><b>palikuća, potpaljivač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a criminal who illegally sets fire to property [firebug, incendiary]</p><p><b>likovni odgoj, lukavstvo, način, okretnost, podmuklost, umijeće, umjetnički, umjetničko djelo, umjetnost, vičnost, vješt, vještina, vrsta, zanat, znanje, umjetničke, umjetničkih, umjetničkim, umjetničko stvaralaštvo, grafika, grafičko oblikovanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the products of human creativity [fine art]</p><p><i>n.</i> the creation of beautiful or significant things [artistic creation, artistic production]</p><p><i>n.</i> a superior skill that you can learn by study and practice and observation [artistry, prowess]</p><p><i>n.</i> photographs or other visual representations in a printed publication [artwork, graphics, nontextual matter]</p><p><b>Uči se crtanje ili slikanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a class in which you learn to draw or paint</p><p><b>zbirka umjetničkih djela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of art works</p><p><b>kritičar slika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a critic of paintings</p><p><b>trgovac umjetničkim djelima koji zahtijevaju estetsku procjenu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dealer in works of art requiring esthetic evaluation</p><p><b>stil dizajna koji je bio popularan u 1920-ima i 1930-ima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a style of design that was popular in the 1920s and 1930s [deco]</p><p><b>akademski odjel odgovoran za podučavanje umjetnosti i cijenjenje umjetnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the academic department responsible for teaching art and art appreciation</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "izvršni direktor" znači direktor koji je zadužen za umjetničke aspekte pozorišne produkcije (kostume i kulise i osvjetljenje) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the director in charge of the artistic features of a theatrical production (costumes and scenery and lighting)</p><p><b>urednik koji je odgovoran za ilustracije i raspored u tiskanim materijalima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an editor who is responsible for illustrations and layouts in printed matter</p><p><b>Izložba umjetničkih predmeta (slike ili kipovi) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exhibition of art objects (paintings or statues)</p><p><b>(arhitektura) oblik umjetničkog izražavanja (kao što su pisanje ili slikarstvo ili arhitektura) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (architecture) a form of artistic expression (such as writing or painting or architecture)</p><p><b>umjetnička galerija, galerija, izložbena galerija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a room or series of rooms where works of art are exhibited [gallery, picture gallery]</p><p><b>povjesničar umjetnosti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a historian of art</p><p><b>povijest umjetnosti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the academic discipline that studies the development of painting and sculpture</p><p><b>artistički pokret, umjetnički pokret</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of artists who agree on general principles [artistic movement]</p><p><b>art nouveau</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a French school of art and architecture popular in the 1890s</p><p><b>umjetničko djelo neke umjetničke vrijednosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a work of art of some artistic value [objet d'art, piece]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom materijala od: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a high-quality paper (usually having a filler of china clay)</p><p><b>stil rock muzike koji se pojavio 1970-ih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a style of rock music that emerged in the 1970s [progressive rock]</p><p><b>umjetnička škola</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a school specializing in art</p><p><b>Nekoga koji studira da bude umjetnik. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone studying to be an artist</p><p><b>Američki jazz pijanist koji je bio gotovo potpuno slijep. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States jazz pianist who was almost completely blind [Arthur Tatum, Tatum]</p><p><b>netko tko predaje umjetnost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who teaches art</p><p><b>drvene lasica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wood swallows [family Artamidae]</p><p><b>tip rod Artamidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Artamidae [genus Artamus]</p><p><b>Artakserkso II.</b></p><p><i>n.</i> king of Persia who subdued numerous revolutions and made peace with Sparta (?-359 BC) [Artaxerxes II]</p><p><i>n.</i> king of Persia who sanctioned the practice of Judaism in Jerusalem (?-424 BC) [Artaxerxes I]</p><p><b>kralj Perzije koji je odobrio praksu judaizma u Jeruzalemu (?-424 p. n. e.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> king of Persia who sanctioned the practice of Judaism in Jerusalem (?-424 BC) [Artaxerxes]</p><p><b>Artakserkso II.</b></p><p><i>n.</i> king of Persia who subdued numerous revolutions and made peace with Sparta (?-359 BC) [Artaxerxes]</p><p><b>artefakt, rukotvorina, tvorevina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a man-made object taken as a whole [artifact]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s artefaktima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to artifacts [artifactual]</p><p><b>Škampi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fairy shrimp [Chirocephalus, genus Artemia, genus Chirocephalus]</p><p><b>uobičajena za slana jezera (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common to saline lakes [brine shrimp]</p><p><b>Artemida</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) the virgin goddess of the hunt and the Moon [Cynthia]</p><p><b>Europski šum (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European wormwood [Roman wormwood]</p><p><b>višegodišnja biljka koja je vrijedna kao ovčja hrana u Sjedinjenim Državama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a perennial that is valuable as sheep forage in the United States [bud brush, bud sagebrush]</p><p><b>Svakakav od različitih složenih grmova ili biljaka iz roda Artemisia s aromatičnim zelenim ili sivobijedim lišće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various composite shrubs or herbs of the genus Artemisia having aromatic green or greyish foliage</p><p><b>šumovita europska šumovaca naturalizirana u Sjevernoj Americi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrubby European wormwood naturalized in North America [southernwood]</p><p><b>pelin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic herb of temperate Eurasia and North Africa having a bitter taste used in making the liqueur absinthe [absinthe, common wormwood, lad's love, old man]</p><p><b>u području Irana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wormwood of southeastern Europe to Iran [sweet wormwood]</p><p><b>nizak sivo-pepeloviti kalifornijski grm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low ashy-grey California shrub [California sage, California sagebrush]</p><p><b>Europski šumski prah sličan je u svojim svojstvima običnom šunskom prahu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European wormwood similar to common wormwood in its properties [field wormwood]</p><p><b>nizak višegodišnji biljci s mnogo grana u zapadnim Sjedinjenim Državama s srebrnim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low much-branched perennial of western United States having silvery leaves [Seriphidium canum, gray sage, grey sage, silver sage, silver sagebrush]</p><p><b>aromatična višegodišnja biljka iz jugoistočne Rusije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic perennial of southeastern Russia [estragon, tarragon]</p><p><b>srebro-dlakavi grm iz središnje i južne Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> silver-haired shrub of central and southern United States and Mexico [sand sage, silvery wormwood]</p><p><b>aromatska višegodišnja biljka s svilovitim listovima iz suhih sjevernih dijelova sjeverne hemisfere (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> silky-leaved aromatic perennial of dry northern parts of the northern hemisphere [prairie sagewort, wormwood sage]</p><p><b>višegodišnja bačvarna bijela biljka iz jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial cottony-white herb of southwestern United States [Artemisia ludoviciana, cudweed, prairie sage, western mugwort, white sage]</p><p><b>višegodišnja bačvarna bijela biljka iz jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial cottony-white herb of southwestern United States [Artemisia gnaphalodes, cudweed, prairie sage, western mugwort, white sage]</p><p><b>biljke zapadnih i sjevernoeuropskih obala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plants of western and northern European coasts [Seriphidium maritimum, sea wormwood]</p><p><b>biljka sa sivim lišćama koja se nalazi duž istočne obale Sjeverne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> herb with greyish leaves found along the east coast of North America [beach wormwood, dusty miller, old woman]</p><p><b>aromatični grm iz sušnih područja zapadne Sjeverne Amerike s sivim lišćama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic shrub of arid regions of western North America having hoary leaves [Seriphidium tridentatum, big sagebrush, blue sage]</p><p><b>Europska tufted aromatična višegodišnja biljka s dlakavim crvenim ili ljubičastim stabljikama i tamno zelenim lištima, ispod belom i crveno-smeđim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European tufted aromatic perennial herb having hairy red or purple stems and dark green leaves downy white below and red-brown florets [common mugwort]</p><p><b>Veliki hram grčke boginje Artemis koji je počeo u Efezu 541. godine prije Krista i završen 220 godina kasnije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the large temple of the Greek goddess Artemis which was begun at Ephesus in 541 BC and completed 220 years later</p><p><b>Američki pisac humorističkih priča o putujućem showmanu (1834-1867) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer of humorous tales of an itinerant showman (1834-1867) [Browne, Charles Farrar Browne]</p><p><b>arterija, žila kucavica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blood vessel that carries blood from the heart to the body [arterial blood vessel, artery]</p><p><b>grana višnjaka koja opskrbljuje alveolarni proces (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the maxillary artery that supplies the alveolar process [alveolar artery]</p><p><b>alveolska arterija koja prolazi kroz mandibularni kanal i opskrbljuje donje zube (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the alveolar artery that goes through the mandibular canal to supply the lower teeth [inferior alveolar artery]</p><p><b>alveolska arterija koja opskrbljuje gornje zube (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the alveolar artery that supplies the upper teeth [superior alveolar artery]</p><p><b>terminalna grana facialne arterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the terminal branch of the facial artery [angular artery]</p><p><b>Veza iz ileokolične arterije koja opskrbljuje crvobojni dodatak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of the ileocolic artery that supplies the vermiform appendix [appendicular artery]</p><p><b>zakrivljena arterija u stopalima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> curved artery in the foot [arcuate artery]</p><p><b>grana ileokolične arterije koja opskrbljuje uzlazni debeljak. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of the ileocolic artery that supplies the ascending colon [ascending artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja isporučuje krv u uho (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> artery that supplies blood to the ear [auricular artery]</p><p><b>dio glavne arterije ruke koja leži u pazuhi i je kontinuirana s podklavijalnom arterijom iznad i brahijalnom arterijom ispod (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of the main artery of the arm that lies in the armpit and is continuous with the subclavian artery above and the brachial artery below [axillary artery]</p><p><b>Neparovana arterija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unpaired artery [basilar artery]</p><p><b>glavna arterija gore ruke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the main artery of the upper arm [brachial artery]</p><p><b>grana višnjaka koja isporučuje krv buccinator mišiću i obrazu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the maxillary artery that supplies blood to the buccinator muscle and the cheek [buccal artery]</p><p><b>ogranak unutrašnje pudendalne arterije kod muškaraca koji opskrbljuje pupoljku penisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the internal pudendal artery of males that supplies the bulb of the penis [artery of the penis bulb]</p><p><b>ogranak unutarnje pudendalne arterije kod žena koji opskrbljuje žarulju prednjega predjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the internal pudendal artery in females that supplies the bulb of the vestibule [artery of the vestibule bulb]</p><p><b>ili dvije glavne arterije vrata i glave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two major arteries of the neck and head [carotid artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja potječe iz abdominalne aorte odmah ispod dijafragme i odvija se u lijevu želučanu arteriju i zajedničku jetru i srčanu arteriju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that originates from the abdominal aorta just below the diaphragm and branches into the left gastric artery and the common hepatic artery and the splenic artery [celiac artery, celiac trunk, truncus celiacus]</p><p><b>ogranak očne arterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the ophthalmic artery [central artery of the retina]</p><p><b>arterija koja opskrbljuje mozak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that supplies the cerebellum [cerebellar artery]</p><p><b>bilo koja od arterija koja isporučuje krv u moždani korteks (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the arteries supplying blood to the cerebral cortex [cerebral artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja opskrbljuje hronoidni pleksus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that supplies the choroid plexus [choroidal artery]</p><p><b>jedna od nekoliko arterija koje opskrbljuju hronoidni sloj oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of several arteries supplying the choroid coat of the eye [ciliary artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja opskrbljuje zglob kuka i mišiće bedra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that supplies the hip joint and thigh muscles [circumflex artery of the thigh]</p><p><b>arterija koja opskrbljuje zglob ramena i mišiće ramena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that supplies the shoulder joint and shoulder muscles [circumflex humeral artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja opskrbljuje donje zidove trbuha i kožu i mišić sartorius (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that supplies the lower abdominal walls and skin and the sartorius muscle [circumflex iliac artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja služi mišićima ramena i skapulera (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that serves the muscles of the shoulder and scapular area [circumflex scapular artery]</p><p><b>arterije koje isporučuju krv u debelo crevo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arteries that supply blood to the colon [colic artery]</p><p><b>bilo koja od tri arterije u mozgu koje čine krug Willisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of three arteries in the brain that make up the circle of Willis [communicating artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja se odvija iz aorte kako bi se krv isporučila srcu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the artery that branches from the aorta to supply blood to the heart [coronary artery]</p><p><b>Veza jetrene arterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the hepatic artery [cystic artery]</p><p><b>arterije u ruci i nogama koje opskrbljuju prste i prste na nogama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arteries in the hand and foot that supply the fingers and toes [digital arteries]</p><p><b>jedna od tri arterije koje opskrbljuju prednje zidove trbuha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of three arteries supplying the anterior walls of the abdomen [epigastric artery]</p><p><b>ogranak oftalmološke arterije koji opskrbljuje strukture u i oko nosne kapsule (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the ophthalmic artery supplying structures in and around the nasal capsule [ethmoidal artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja potječe iz vanjske krvne arterije i daje granu koja opskrbljuje vrat i lice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that originates in the external carotid and gives off branches that supply the neck and face [external maxillary artery, facial artery]</p><p><b>glavna arterija bedra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the chief artery of the thigh [femoral artery]</p><p><b>arterije koje opskrbljuju zidove želuca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the arteries that supply the walls of the stomach [gastric artery]</p><p><b>nekoliko malih arterija koje se odvajaju od arterije sleze i idu u veću zakrivljenost želuca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> several small arteries branching off of the splenic artery and going to the greater curvature of the stomach [short gastric artery, vasa brevis]</p><p><b>grana celijaka koja opskrbljuje manje zakrivljenost želuca i trbušnog dijela jednjaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the celiac artery that supplies the lesser curvature of the stomach and the abdominal part of the esophagus [left gastric artery]</p><p><b>grane unutarnje ilijačke arterije koje opskrbljuju zglob kuka i glutoalni region (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> branches of the internal iliac artery that supply the hip joint and gluteal region [gluteal artery]</p><p><b>arterije koje opskrbljuju jetru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arteries that supply the liver [hepatic artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja potiče iz gornje mezenterične arterije i opskrbljuje krajnji dio ileuma i cecum i crvobrojni dodatak i uzlazni debeljak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that originates from the superior mesenteric artery and supplies the terminal part of the ileum and the cecum and the vermiform appendix and the ascending colon [ileocolic artery]</p><p><b>ogranak gornje mezenterične arterije koja opskrbljuje ileum (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> branch of the superior mesenteric artery that supplies the ileum [ileal artery, intestinal artery]</p><p><b>jedna od velikih arterija koja isporučuje krv u zdjelicu i noge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the large arteries supplying blood to the pelvis and legs [iliac artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja potječe iz unutrašnje ilijačke arterije i opskrbljuje zdjelične mišiće i kosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that originates in the internal iliac artery and supplies the pelvic muscles and bones [iliolumbar artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja potječe iz maksilarne arterije i opskrbljuje strukture ispod orbite (od donjeg kapka do gornje usne) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that originates from the maxillary artery and supplies structures below the orbit (from lower eyelid to upper lip) [infraorbital artery]</p><p><b>nekoliko arterija i opskrbljuju međukostalne prostore prsnog kaveza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> several arteries and supplying the intercostal spaces of the rib cage [intercostal artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja je grana arterije lica koja opskrbljuje usne usta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that is a branch of the facial artery that supplies the lips of the mouth [labial artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja je grana arterije lica koja opskrbljuje donju usnu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that is a branch of the facial artery that supplies the lower lip [inferior labial artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja je grana arterije lica koja opskrbljuje gornju usnu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that is a branch of the facial artery that supplies the upper lip [superior labial artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja potječe iz oftalmološke arterije i opskrbljuje suzne žlijezde i rektalne mišiće oka i gornje kapke i čelo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that originates from the ophthalmic artery and supplies the lacrimal gland and rectal eye muscles and the upper eyelid and the forehead [lacrimal artery]</p><p><b>ili dvije arterije koje isporučuju krv u grkljan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two arteries that supply blood to the larynx [laryngeal artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja potiče iz celijaka i isporučuje krv slezni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that originates from the celiac trunk and supplies blood to the spleen [lienal artery, splenic artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja potječe iz vanjske karotide i opskrbljuje donju stranu jezika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery originating from the external carotid artery and supplying the under side of the tongue [lingual artery]</p><p><b>jedan od četiri ili pet parova arterija koje potječu iz trbušne aorte i opskrbljuju ljesne kralježnice i mišiće leđa i trbušni zid (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of four or five pairs of arteries that originate in the abdominal aorta and supply the lumbar vertebrae and the back muscles and abdominal wall [lumbar artery]</p><p><b>jedna od dvije arterije koje se odvajaju od vanjske karotide i opskrbljuju strukturu lica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two arteries branching from the external carotid artery and supplying structure of the face [maxillary artery]</p><p><b>bilo koja od tri arterije koje opskrbljuju moždane moždane moždane žlijezde i susjedne strukture (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of three arteries supplying the meninges of the brain and neighboring structures [meningeal artery]</p><p><b>jedna od dvije grane aorte koja prolazi između dva sloja mezenterija do crijeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of two branches of the aorta that pass between the two layers of the mesentery to the intestines [mesenteric artery]</p><p><b>dorsalne i dlanovne arterije ruke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dorsal and palmar arteries of the hand [metacarpal artery]</p><p><b>dorsalne i plantarne arterije do metatarzalne regije stopala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dorsal and plantar arteries to the metatarsal region of the foot [metatarsal artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja opskrbljuje trbušnu i međukostalne mišiće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that supplies the abdomen and intercostal muscles [musculophrenic artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja opskrbljuje meduljarnu šupljinu duge kosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that supplies the medullary cavity of the long bone [nutrient artery]</p><p><b>očna arterija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the internal carotid artery that supplies the eye and neighboring structures [ophthalmic artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja se odvija iz aorte i snabdijeva krvlju jajnike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the artery that branches from the aorta and supplies blood to the ovaries [ovarian artery]</p><p><b>jedna od nekoliko arterija koje opskrbljuju lice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of several arteries supplying the face [palatine artery]</p><p><b>grana srčane arterije koja opskrbljuje gušteraču (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the splenic artery that supplies the pancreas [pancreatic artery]</p><p><b>ogranak unutarnje pudendalne arterije koja opskrbljuje površinske strukture perineuma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the internal pudendal artery that supplies superficial structures of the perineum [perineal artery]</p><p><b>zakoljena arterija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a continuation of the femoral artery that branches to supply the legs and feet [popliteal artery]</p><p><b>arterije koje opskrbljuju vanjske genitalne organe ljudi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arteries supplying the external genital organs of humans [pudendal artery]</p><p><b>jedna od dvije arterije (odjeljak plućnog debla) koja nosi vensku krv iz srca u pluća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of two arteries (branches of the pulmonary trunk) that carry venous blood from the heart to the lungs [pulmonary artery]</p><p><b>ogranak brahijalne arterije koji počinje ispod laktova i proteže se niz podlakticu oko zgloba i u dlan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> branch of the brachial artery beginning below the elbow and extending down the forearm around the wrist and into the palm [radial artery]</p><p><b>jedna od arterija koje opskrbljuju rektalno područje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the arteries supplying the rectal area [rectal artery]</p><p><b>arterija koja potiče iz abdominalne aorte i opskrbljuje bubrege i nadbubrežne žlijezde i uretere (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery originating from the abdominal aorta and supplying the kidneys and adrenal glands and ureters [renal artery]</p><p><b>potključna arterija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two arteries that supply blood to the neck and arms [subclavian artery]</p><p><b>Temporalna arterija koja ide do prednjeg dijela moždane kore temporalnog režnja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> temporal artery that goes to the anterior part of the cerebral cortex of the temporal lobe [anterior temporal artery]</p><p><b>Temporalna arterija koja ide do srednjeg dijela moždane kore temporalnog režnja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> temporal artery that goes to the middle part of the cerebral cortex of the temporal lobe [intermediate temporal artery]</p><p><b>Temporalna arterija koja opskrbljuje stražnji dio kore temporalnog režnja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> temporal artery that supplies the posterior part of the cortex of the temporal lobe [posterior temporal artery]</p><p><b>grana aorte koja opskrbljuje testise (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the aorta supplying the testicles [internal spermatic artery, testicular artery]</p><p><b>Velika arterija koja se odvaja od brahijalne arterije kako bi opskrbila mišiće podlaktice i zgloba i ruke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large artery that branches from the brachial artery to supply the muscles of the forearm and wrist and hand [ulnar artery]</p><p><b>ogranak unutrašnje ilijske arterije koja opskrbljuje maternicu i gornji dio vagine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the internal iliac artery that supplies the uterus and the upper part of the vagina [uterine artery]</p><p><b>grana unutarnjeg ilijaka koja pruža krv za vaginu i bazu mjehura i rektum (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the internal iliac that provides blood for the vagina and the base of the bladder and the rectum [vaginal artery]</p><p><b>prva grana podklavijalne arterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first branch of the subclavian artery [vertebral artery]</p><p><b>arterijski, glavni, koji graniči, koji se grana, arterijska</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or involving or contained in the arteries</p><p><b>krv pronađena u arterijama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> blood found in arteries</p><p><b>mjerenje razine pH-a i koncentracije kisika i ugljičnog dioksida u arterijskoj krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> measurement of the pH level and the oxygen and carbon dioxide concentrations in arterial blood</p><p><b>arterija, žila kucavica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blood vessel that carries blood from the heart to the body [arteria, artery]</p><p><b>masnoće unutar arterijskog zida (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fatty deposit inside an arterial wall</p><p><b>pritisak cirkulirajuće krvi na arterijama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the pressure of the circulating blood on the arteries</p><p><b>Glavni ili glavni put (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a major or main route</p><p><b>arterioskleroza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sclerosis of the arterial walls [arteriosclerosis, coronary-artery disease, hardening of the arteries, induration of the arteries]</p><p><b>promjena venske krvi u arterijsku krv (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> change venous blood into arterial blood [arterialize]</p><p><b>promjena venske krvi u arterijsku krv (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> change venous blood into arterial blood [arterialise]</p><p><b>abnormalna usisnuća arterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal distension of an artery [arteriectasis]</p><p><b>abnormalna usisnuća arterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal distension of an artery [arteriectasia]</p><p><b>rendgenski snimak arterije ispunjene kontrastnim sredstvom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an X ray of an artery filled with a contrast medium</p><p><b>arteriografija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> roentgenographic examination of arteries</p><p><b>jedna od malih tankovidnih arterija koje završavaju u kapilarima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the small thin-walled arteries that end in capillaries [arteriole, capillary artery]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s ili uključuju arteriole (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or involving arterioles</p><p><b>jedna od malih tankovidnih arterija koje završavaju u kapilarima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the small thin-walled arteries that end in capillaries [arteriola, capillary artery]</p><p><b>skleroza arteriola (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sclerosis of the arterioles</p><p><b>arterioskleroza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sclerosis of the arterial walls [arterial sclerosis, coronary-artery disease, hardening of the arteries, induration of the arteries]</p><p><b>stadij arterioskleroze u kojem su zatvoreni krvni sudovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stage of arteriosclerosis involving closure of blood vessels</p><p><b>bolesnici arterioskleroze (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> affected by arteriosclerosis</p><p><b>povezivanje arterije s venom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> connecting an artery to a vein</p><p><b>upale arterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of an artery</p><p><b>arterija, glavni prometni put, žila kucavica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blood vessel that carries blood from the heart to the body [arteria, arterial blood vessel]</p><p><i>n.</i> a major thoroughfare that bears important traffic</p><p><b>arterija koja je grana bazilarne arterije koja opskrbljuje labirint (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that is a branch of the basilar artery that supplies the labyrinth [internal auditory artery, labyrinthine artery]</p><p><b>ogranak unutrašnje pudendalne arterije kod muškaraca koji opskrbljuje pupoljku penisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the internal pudendal artery of males that supplies the bulb of the penis [arteria bulbi penis]</p><p><b>ogranak unutarnje pudendalne arterije kod žena koji opskrbljuje žarulju prednjega predjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the internal pudendal artery in females that supplies the bulb of the vestibule [arteria bulbi vestibuli]</p><p><b>arteški, arteški bunar</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of water) rising to the surface under internal hydrostatic pressure</p><p><b>arteški bunar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a well drilled through impermeable strata into strata that receive water from a higher altitude so there is pressure to force the water to flow upward</p><p><b>lukav, prepreden, umješan, vješt</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not straightforward or candid [disingenuous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by skill in achieving a desired end especially with cunning or craft</p><p><b>lukav, prepreden, umješan, vješt (od &quot;artful&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an artful manner</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a disingenuous manner [disingenuously]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an artful manner [craftily, cunningly, foxily, knavishly, slyly, trickily]</p><p><b>lukav, prepreden, umješan, vješt (od &quot;artful&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being adroit in taking unfair advantage</p><p><b>bol u zglobovima ili zglobovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pain in a joint or joints</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s artralgijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to arthralgia</p><p><b>osoba koja boluje od artritisa, od ili povezane s artritisom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person afflicted with arthritis</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to arthritis [creaky, rheumatic, rheumatoid, rheumy]</p><p><b>artritis, artroza, upala zglobova</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of a joint or joints</p><p><b>Odlazak tekućine iz zgloba sintezom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> removal of fluid from a joint by centesis</p><p><b>artrodeza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the surgical fixation of a joint which is intended to result in 