nergy [Arthur Holly Compton, Compton]</p><p><b>Britanski pisac koji je stvorio Sherlocka Holmesa (1859-1930) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> British author who created Sherlock Holmes (1859-1930) [A. Conan Doyle, Conan Doyle, Sir Arthur Conan Doyle]</p><p><b>Američki elektroinženjer poznat po radu na teoriji izmjenjene struje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States electrical engineer noted for his work on the theory of alternating currents [A. E. Kennelly, Kennelly]</p><p><b>Britanski arheolog koji je iskopao palaču Knossos na Kreti kako bi pronašao ono što je nazvao minojskom civilizacijom (1851-1941) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> British archaeologist who excavated the palace of Knossos in Crete to find what he called Minoan civilization (1851-1941) [Evans, Sir Arthur John Evans]</p><p><b>popularni američki dirigent (1894-1979) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> popular United States conductor (1894-1979) [Fiedler]</p><p><b>Američki odvjetnik uključen u nekoliko poznatih sudskih suđenja (1881-1954) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States lawyer involved in several famous court trials (1881-1954) [Hays]</p><p><b>Američki fizičar poznat po istraživanju rentgenskih i gama zraka i nuklearne energije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States physicist noted for research on x-rays and gamma rays and nuclear energy [Arthur Compton, Compton]</p><p><b>Engleski geolog i pristalica teorije kontinentalnog pomicanja (1890-1965) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English geologist and supporter of the theory of continental drift (1890-1965) [Holmes]</p><p><b>Švicarski skladatelj (rođen u Francuskoj) koji je bio osnivač grupe u Parizu koja je uključivala Erika Satieja i Dariusa Milhauda i Francis Poulenc i Jean Cocteaua (1892-1955) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Swiss composer (born in France) who was the founding member of a group in Paris that included Erik Satie and Darius Milhaud and Francis Poulenc and Jean Cocteau (1892-1955) [Honegger]</p><p><b>Američki klarinetist i vođa swing benda (1910-2004) (MT)</b></p><p><i