an, raščlanjivanje, razgovijetan, razumljiv, rječit, spajati, vezivati, formulirati, govoriti, izgovarati, izraziti, izražavati, izreći, izricati, reći, sročiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> provide with a joint [joint]</p><p><i>v.</i> put into words or an expression [formulate, give voice, phrase, word]</p><p><i>v.</i> speak, pronounce, or utter in a certain way [enounce, enunciate, pronounce, say, sound out]</p><p><i>v.</i> unite by forming a joint or joints</p><p><i>v.</i> express or state clearly [enunciate, vocalise, vocalize]</p><p><i>adj.</i> expressing yourself easily or characterized by clear expressive language</p><p><i>adj.</i> consisting of segments held together by joints [articulated]</p><p><b>člankovit, zglobni, zglobno</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> consisting of segments held together by joints [articulate]</p><p><b>ljestvica koja se sastoji od dijelova (obično četiri) koji se drže zajedno zglobovima koji se mogu zaključati na mjestu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ladder consisting of segments (usually four) that are held together by joints that can lock in place</p><p><b>kamion koji se sastoji od traktora i prikolice zajedno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a truck consisting of a tractor and trailer together [rig, semi, tractor trailer, trailer truck, trucking rig]</p><p><b>rječito</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with eloquence [eloquently]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an articulate manner [eloquently]</p><p><b>jasnoća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being facile in speech and writing [fluency, volubility]</p><p><b>zglob</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (anatomy) the point of connection between two bones or elements of a skeleton (especially if it allows motion) [articulation, joint]</p><p><b>kuk</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ball-and-socket joint between the head of the femur and the acetabulum [coxa, hip, hip joint]</p><p><b>lakat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hinge joint between the forearm and upper arm and the corresponding joint in the forelimb of a quadruped [cubital joint, cubitus, elbow, elbow joint, human elbow