a, Eastern Samoa]</p><p><i>adv.</i> to the same degree (often followed by `as') [equally, every bit]</p><p><b>Svi zajedno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> all together [en bloc, en masse]</p><p><b>u stvarnosti ili aktuelnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in reality or actuality [in fact, in point of fact]</p><p><b>što je više moguće</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to a feasible extent [as much as possible]</p><p><b>dopunjuje kako slijedi, kako slijedi</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> what is listed next</p><p><b>na čarobni način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a magical manner [magically]</p><p><b>U stvarnom stanju stvari i često suprotno očekivanjima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in the actual state of affairs and often contrary to expectations</p><p><b>Kao da je stvarno tako. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> as if it were really so [so to speak]</p><p><b>Zbog sreće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by good fortune [fortuitously, fortunately, luckily]</p><p><b>u mogućoj mjeri (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to a feasible extent [as far as possible]</p><p><b>prema potrebi</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> according to need (physicians use PRN in writing prescriptions) [PRN, as required, pro re nata]</p><p><b>prema potrebi</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> according to need (physicians use PRN in writing prescriptions) [PRN, as needed, pro re nata]</p><p><b>Na najkraći i najdirektniji put. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by the shortest and most direct route</p><p><b>na uobičajen način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in the usual manner</p><p><b>U načinu govora. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a manner of speaking [so to speak]</p><p><b>isto tako kao, također</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in addition [also, besides, likewise, too]</p><p><b>još</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> used in negative statement to describe a situation that has existed up to this point or up to the present time [heretofore, hitherto, so far, thus far, til now, until now, up to now, yet]</p><p><b>gume od smole koje se posebno koriste za liječenje iritacije kože (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> gum resin