t domaće piletine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intestinal parasite of domestic fowl [chicken roundworm]</p><p><b>tip rodovi obitelji Ascaridae: okrugli crvi s tri usne (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the family Ascaridae: roundworms with a three-lipped mouth [genus Ascaris]</p><p><b>česni parazit ljudi i svinja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intestinal parasite of humans and pigs [common roundworm]</p><p><b>ići uzlazno, penjati se, popeti se, rasti, uzdizati se, uzlijetati, uspeti se, uspinjati se, dizati se, dići se, izaći, izlaziti, podignuti se, podizati se, podići se, uzdignuti se, uzdići se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> travel up [go up]</p><p><i>v.</i> go back in order of genealogical succession</p><p><i>v.</i> become king or queen</p><p><i>v.</i> appear to be moving upward, as by means of tendrils [climb up]</p><p><i>v.</i> go along towards (a river's) source</p><p><i>v.</i> slope upwards</p><p><i>v.</i> come up, of celestial bodies [come up, rise, uprise]</p><p><i>v.</i> move to a better position in life or to a better job [move up, rise]</p><p><b>koji je sposoban za uzdizanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being ascended [ascendible, climbable]</p><p><b>dominacija, kontrola, moa, nadmoa, utjecaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state that exists when one person or group has power over another [ascendancy, ascendence, ascendency, control, dominance]</p><p><b>dominacija, utjecaj, vlast, kontrola, moa, nadmoa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state that exists when one person or group has power over another [ascendance, ascendence, ascendency, control, dominance]</p><p><b>prevlast, uspinjući, uzlazni, praotac, predak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> position or state of being dominant or in control [ascendent]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone from whom you are descended (but usually more remote than a grandparent) [ancestor, antecedent, ascendent, root]</p><p><i>adj.</i> tending or directed upward [ascendent, ascensive]</p><p><i>adj.</i> most powerful or important or influential [ascendent, dominating]</p><p><b>dominacija, kontrola, moa, nadmoa, utjecaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state that exists when one person or group has power over another [ascendance, ascendancy, ascendency, control, dominance]</p><p><b>nadmoćnost, nadomoćnost, dominacija, kontrola, moa, nadmoa, utjecaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state that exists when one person or group has power over another [ascendance, ascendancy, ascendence, control, dominance]</p><p><b>horoskop, koji se diže, prevladavajući, prevlast, utjecaj, vlast, praotac, predak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> position or state of being dominant or in control [ascendant]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone from whom you are descended (but usually more remote than a grandparent) [ancestor, antecedent, ascendant, root]</p><p><i>adj.</i> tending or directed upward [ascendant, ascensive]</p><p><i>adj.</i> most powerful or important or influential [ascendant, dominating]</p><p><b>bloker</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who ascends</p><p><i>n.</i> a lowercase letter that has a part extending above other lowercase letters</p><p><i>n.</i> (printing) the part of tall lowercase letters that extends above the other lowercase letters</p><p><b>koji je sposoban za uzdizanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being ascended [ascendable, climbable]</p><p><b>rastući, ulaznog, uzlazni, uzlazno, uzlazno sortiranje, uspinjanje, uspon, uzlazak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of changing location in an upward direction [ascension, ascent, rise]</p><p><i>adj.</i> moving or going or growing upward</p><p><b>uzlazni dio aorte kako izlazi iz lijeve klijetke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ascending part of the aorta as it emerges from the left ventricle</p><p><b>grana ileokolične arterije koja opskrbljuje uzlazni debeljak. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of the ileocolic artery that supplies the ascending colon [arteria ascendens]</p><p><b>dio debelog crijeva koji se uzdiže od cecuma do poprečnog debelog crijeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of the large intestine that ascends from the cecum to the transverse colon</p><p><b>točka na kojoj orbita prelazi ekliptičku ravninu idući sjeverno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the point at which an orbit crosses the ecliptic plane going north</p><p><b>dizanje, dolazak, penjanje, uspinjanje, uznešenje, Uzašašće, uzdizanje, uspon, uzlazak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Christianity) celebration of the Ascension of Christ into heaven [Ascension Day, Ascension of the Lord]</p><p><i>n.</i> a movement upward [ascent, rise, rising]</p><p><i>n.</i> (New Testament) the rising of the body of Jesus into heaven on the 40th day after his Resurrection [Ascension of Christ]</p><p><i>n.</i> (astronomy) the rising of a star above the horizon</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of changing location in an upward direction [ascending, ascent, rise]</p><p><b>(kršćansko) slavlje Kristova uzdizanja na nebo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Christianity) celebration of the Ascension of Christ into heaven [Ascension, Ascension of the Lord]</p><p><b>Uzašašće</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (New Testament) the rising of the body of Jesus into heaven on the 40th day after his Resurrection [Ascension]</p><p><b>(kršćansko) slavlje Kristova uzdizanja na nebo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Christianity) celebration of the Ascension of Christ into heaven [Ascension, Ascension Day]</p><p><b>tendencija za povećanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to rise</p><p><b>u obliku od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od polja ili od (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending or directed upward [ascendant, ascendent]</p><p><b>dizanje, nagib, nizbrdica, penjanje, strmina, uspon, uzbrdica, uzlet, uspinjanje, uzlazak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an upward slope or grade (as i