em je gljivična komponenta askomicet (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lichen in which the fungus component is an ascomycete</p><p><b>askocarp s slojem ćelija koji nosi spore (himenium) na širokom disku nalik spremniku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ascocarp having the spore-bearing layer of cells (the hymenium) on a broad disklike receptacle</p><p><b>mješinarka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any fungus of the class Ascomycetes (or subdivision Ascomycota) in which the spores are formed inside an ascus [ascomycetous fungus]</p><p><b>mješinarka (od &quot;ascomycete&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large class of higher fungi coextensive with division Ascomycota: sac fungi [class Ascomycetes]</p><p><b>u vezi s gljivicama klase Ascomycetes ili karakteristične za njih (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> related to or characteristic of fungi of the class Ascomycetes</p><p><b>mješinarka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any fungus of the class Ascomycetes (or subdivision Ascomycota) in which the spores are formed inside an ascus [ascomycete]</p><p><b>veliki poddijel Eumycota uključujući Hemiascomycetes i Plectomycetes i Pyrenomycetes i Discomycetes (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large subdivision of Eumycota including Hemiascomycetes and Plectomycetes and Pyrenomycetes and Discomycetes [Ascomycotina, subdivision Ascomycota, subdivision Ascomycotina]</p><p><b>veliki poddijel Eumycota uključujući Hemiascomycetes i Plectomycetes i Pyrenomycetes i Discomycetes (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large subdivision of Eumycota including Hemiascomycetes and Plectomycetes and Pyrenomycetes and Discomycetes [Ascomycota, subdivision Ascomycota, subdivision Ascomycotina]</p><p><b>brune alge koje se razlikuju po komprimiranim ili napunjenim granama duž osove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> brown algae distinguished by compressed or inflated branchlets along the axis [genus Ascophyllum]</p><p><b>sličan i pronađen s crnim kamenim rastvorom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> similar to and found with black rockweed [bladderwrack]</p><p><b>askorbinska kiselina</b></p