ćenje u udruženju kanala koji povezuju različite jezike u mozgu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aphasia in which the lesion is assumed to be in the association tracts connecting the various language centers in the brain [conduction aphasia]</p><p><b>karakterizira ili uzrokuje ili proizlazi iz procesa spajanja ideja ili događaja u sjećanju ili mašti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by or causing or resulting from the process of bringing ideas or events together in memory or imagination [associative]</p><p><b>opraštati, oprostiti, oslobađati, osloboditi</b></p><p><i>v.</i> pronounce not guilty of criminal charges [acquit, clear, discharge, exculpate, exonerate]</p><p><b>asonanca</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the repetition of similar vowels in the stressed syllables of successive words [vowel rhyme]</p><p><b>koji imaju isti zvuk (posebno isti vokalni zvuk) koji se pojavljuje u uzastopnim naglaskanim slogovima, koji imaju isti glasni glas koji se pojavljuje s različitim konsonantima u uzastopnim riječima ili naglasenim slogovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the same sound (especially the same vowel sound) occurring in successive stressed syllables</p><p><i>adj.</i> having the same vowel sound occurring with different consonants in successive words or stressed syllables</p><p><b>Odgovaraju u samoglasnim zvukovima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> correspond in vowel sounds</p><p><b>izabirati, odabirati, opremiti, podudarati se, pristati, rasporediti, razvrstati se, slagati se, složiti, sortirati, svrstati, grupirati, kategorizirati, klasificirati, razvrstati, razvrstavati, svrstavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> keep company with [affiliate, associate, consort]</p><p><i>v.</i> arrange or order by classes or categories [class, classify, separate, sort, sort out]</p><p><b>parenje pojedinaca koji imaju više zajedničkih osobina nego što je vjerojatno u slučajnom parenju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mating of individuals having more traits in common than likely in random mating</p><p><b>izmješan, miješan, odabran, različit</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> consisting of a haphazard assortment of different kinds [miscellaneous, mixed, motley, sundry]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of many different kinds purposefully arranged but lacking any uniformity [various]</p><p><b>asortiman, izbor, izbor (stvari), odabiranje, sortiranje, sređivanje, svrstavanje, vrsta, mnoštvo, plejada, dijeljenje, kategorizacija, klasifikacija, razvrstavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a collection containing a variety of sorts of things [miscellanea, miscellany, mixed bag, mixture, motley, potpourri, salmagundi, smorgasbord, variety]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of distributing things into classes or categories of the same type [categorisation, categorization, classification, compartmentalisation, compartmentalization]</p><p><b>drevni grad na Nilu u Egiptu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient city on the Nile in Egypt [Assuan, Aswan]</p><p><b>ublažiti, umiriti, utoliti, gasiti, utažiti, utaživati, izbaviti, olakšati, olakšavati, smiriti, smirivati, ublažavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be more favorably inclined [appease, conciliate, gentle, gruntle, lenify, mollify, pacify, placate]</p><p><i>v.</i> satisfy (thirst) [allay, quench, slake]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide physical relief, as from pain [alleviate, palliate, relieve]</p><p><b>smirivanje, olakšanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the feeling that comes when something burdensome is removed or reduced [alleviation, relief]</p><p><b>drevni grad na Nilu u Egiptu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient city on the Nile in Egypt [Assouan, Aswan]</p><p><b>oslobađanje od straha i brige. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> freeing from fear and anxiety [soothing]</p><p><b>nagađati, poprimiti, predviđati, pretpostaviti, pretpostavljati, preuzeti, preuzeti na sebe, prihvati točno, prisvojiti, simulirati, smatrati, arogantnost, predviđamo, sticati, hiniti, praviti se, pretvarati se, oblačiti, obući, odijevati, odjenuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> take to be the case or to be true [presume, take for granted]</p><