vore malezijski ljudi na Formosi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a language spoken by a Malaysian people on Formosa [Tayalic]</p><p><b>Ate</b></p><p><i>n.</i> goddess of criminal rashness and its punishment</p><p><b>kolapsa proširenih pluća (posebno kod dojenčadi) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> collapse of an expanded lung (especially in infants)</p><p><b>oblik infantilnosti karakteriziran fizičkim nerazvijanjem, ali normalnom inteligencijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of infantilism characterized by physical underdevelopment but normal intelligence [ateliosis]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s ateleozom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to ateleiosis</p><p><b>štapovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spider monkeys [genus Ateles]</p><p><b>drveni majmun tropske Amerike s dugim vitkim nogama i dugim repom za hvatanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arboreal monkey of tropical America with long slender legs and long prehensile tail [spider monkey]</p><p><b>atelier, atelje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a studio especially for an artist or designer [artist's workroom]</p><p><b>oblik infantilnosti karakteriziran fizičkim nerazvijanjem, ali normalnom inteligencijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of infantilism characterized by physical underdevelopment but normal intelligence [ateleiosis]</p><p><b>Sunce (ili solarni disk) koje je bilo božanstvo monoteističkog kulta pod faraonom Akhenatonom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sun (or solar disc) which was the deity of a monotheistic cult under the Pharaoh Akhenaten [Aton]</p><p><b>oralni beta- blokator (trgovinski naziv Tenormin) koji se koristi za liječenje hipertenzije i angine. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an oral beta blocker (trade name Tenormin) used in treating hypertension and angina [Tenormin]</p><p><b>grana jetrene arterije koja opskrbljuje pilorski dio želuca na manjoj zakrivljenosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the hepatic artery that supplies the pyloric portion of the stomach on the lesser curvature [right gastric artery]</p><p><b>Agencija za pr