i s atonalismom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to atonalism</p><p><b>odsutnost ključa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the absence of a key [atonalism]</p><p><b>atonalnost (od &quot;atonal&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without tonality</p><p><b>izmiriti, okajati, popraviti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make amends for [aby, abye, expiate]</p><p><i>v.</i> turn away from sin or do penitence [repent]</p><p><b>ispaštanje, izmirenje, naknada, okajavanje, okajanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> compensation for a wrong [expiation, satisfaction]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of atoning for sin or wrongdoing (especially appeasing a deity) [expiation, propitiation]</p><p><b>nedostatak normalnog mišićnog napona ili tonusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lack of normal muscular tension or tonus [amyotonia, atonicity, atony]</p><p><b>atona, atoničan, bez naglaska, nenaglašen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by a lack of tonus</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of syllables) carrying no stress [unaccented]</p><p><b>nedostatak normalnog mišićnog napona ili tonusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lack of normal muscular tension or tonus [amyotonia, atonia, atony]</p><p><b>nedostatak normalnog mišićnog napona ili tonusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lack of normal muscular tension or tonus [amyotonia, atonia, atonicity]</p><p><b>gore</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> on, to, or at the top</p><p><b>alergijska reakcija koja se kod osjetljive osobe pojavi samo nekoliko minuta nakon kontakta s (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an allergic reaction that becomes apparent in a sensitized person only minutes after contact [atopy, immediate allergy, type I allergic reaction]</p><p><b>atopijski dermatitis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a severe form of dermatitis characterized by atopy [atopic eczema]</p><p><b>ozbiljan oblik dermatitisa karakteriziran atopijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a severe form of dermatitis characterized by atopy [atopic dermatitis]</p><p><b>odsutnost ili gubitak topognozije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> absence or loss of topognosia [atopognosis]</p><p><b>o