ena koji sadrži velike količine aluminija, željeza i magnezija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dark-green to black glassy mineral of the pyroxene group containing large amounts of aluminum and iron and magnesium</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 85% ili više, ali ne više od 50% (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or containing the mineral augite</p><p><b>povećanje, povećati, povećati se, proširiti, uvećati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> enlarge or increase</p><p><i>v.</i> grow or intensify</p><p><b>dodavanje, porast, povećanje, povećavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount by which something increases</p><p><i>n.</i> the statement of a theme in notes of greater duration (usually twice the length of the original)</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of augmenting</p><p><b>povećanje ili sposobnost povećanja posebno u veličini ili količini ili stupnju, Intenzivna povećanjem i poboljšanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> increasing or having the power to increase especially in size or amount or degree</p><p><i>adj.</i> intensifying by augmentation and enhancement [enhancive]</p><p><b>proširen, proširena</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> added to or made greater in amount or number or strength</p><p><b>antibiotici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antibiotic [Amoxil, Larotid, Polymox, Trimox, amoxicillin]</p><p><b>dokument sastavljen 1555. godine kako bi se obranila katoličanost luteranske nauke i opravdalo inovacije u luteranskoj praksi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the document drawn up in 1555 to defend the catholicity of Lutheran doctrine and to justify innovations in Lutheran practice</p><p><b>proricati, prorok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (ancient Rome) a religious official who interpreted omens to guide public policy [auspex]</p><p><i>v.</i> indicate, as with a sign or an omen [auspicate, betoken, bode, forecast, foreshadow, foretell, omen, portend, predict, prefigure, presage, prognosticate]</p><p><i>v.</i> predict from an omen</p><p><b>gatanje, predosjećanje, predznak, proricanje, slutnja, znamenje, nagovještaj</b></p><p><i>n.