y rod-shaped usually Gram-positive bacteria that produce endospores [family Bacillaceae]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na ili proizvode od strane ili sadrže bacilje, formiran kao bakillus (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or produced by or containing bacilli [bacillary]</p><p><i>adj.</i> formed like a bacillus [bacillary, bacilliform, baculiform, rod-shaped]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste životinja koje su u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći popis: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> marine and freshwater eukaryotic algae: diatoms [Diatomophyceae, class Bacillariophyceae, class Diatomophyceae]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na ili proizvode od strane ili sadrže bacilje, formiran kao bakillus (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or produced by or containing bacilli [bacillar]</p><p><i>adj.</i> formed like a bacillus [bacillar, bacilliform, baculiform, rod-shaped]</p><p><b>akutna infekcija crijeva od strane bakterije shigella (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acute infection of the intestine by shigella bacteria [shigellosis]</p><p><b>ozbiljna bakterijska bolest mladih piletina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a serious bacterial disease of young chickens [bacillary white diarrhoea, pullorum disease]</p><p><b>ozbiljna bakterijska bolest mladih piletina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a serious bacterial disease of young chickens [bacillary white diarrhea, pullorum disease]</p><p><b>formiran kao bakillus (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> formed like a bacillus [bacillar, bacillary, baculiform, rod-shaped]</p><p><b>bacil</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aerobic rod-shaped spore-producing bacterium [B]</p><p><b>vrsta bacilusa koja uzrokuje antraks kod ljudi i životinja (goveđe i svinje i ovce i zečevi i miševi i morske svinje) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a species of bacillus that causes anthrax in humans and in animals (cattle and swine and sheep and rabbits and mice and guinea pigs) [anthrax bacillus]</p><p><b>vrsta bakrila koja se nalazi u tlu i razgrađivanoj organskoj materiji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a species of bacillus found in soil and decomposing organic matter [Bacillus subtilis, grass bacillus, hay bacillus]</p><p><b>vrsta bakrila koja se nalazi u tlu i razgrađivanoj organskoj materiji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a species of bacillus found in soil and decomposing organic matter [Bacillus globigii, grass bacillus, hay bacillus]</p><p><b>polipeptidni antibiotik poznate kemijske strukture učinkovit protiv nekoliko vrsta gram-pozitivnih organizama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a polypeptide antibiotic of known chemical structure effective against several types of Gram-positive organisms</p><p><b>natrag, nazad, dno, hrbat, iza, leđa, leđni, naličje, naslon, branič kod nogometa, kladiti se, odozada, opet, podržati, podupirati, potpomoći, povlačiti se, povrat, povratak, povratan, pozadina, pust, star, stražnji, stražnji dio, udaljen, unatrag, unazadan, ustegnuti, uzmicati, zadnji, zaleđe, zastario, prethodna, povratne, povratni, pozadi, zadnje, dorsum, poleđina, kralježnica, ići unatrag, poduprijeti, sekundirati, voziti u rikverc, voziti unatrag, biti straga, biti u pozadini</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the posterior part of a human (or animal) body from the neck to the end of the spine [dorsum]</p><p><i>n.</i> the side that goes last or is not normally seen [rear]</p><p><i>n.</i> the part of something that is furthest from the normal viewer [rear]</p><p><i>n.</i> (football) a person who plays in the backfield</p><p><i>n.</i> the series of vertebrae forming the axis of the skeleton and protecting the spinal cord [backbone, rachis, spinal column, spine, vertebral column]</p><p><i>n.</i> the protective covering on the front, back, and spine of a book [binding, book binding, cover]</p><p><i>n.</i> the part of a garment that covers the back of your body</p><p><i>n.</i> a support that you can lean against while sitting [backrest]</p><p><i>n.</i> (American football) the position of a player on a football team who is stationed b