evelopment of dental caries [dental plaque]</p><p><b>bilo koji endotoksin ili egzotoksin koji se formira u bakterijskim stanicama ili ih stvaraju bakterijske stanice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any endotoxin or exotoxin formed in or elaborated by bacterial cells</p><p><b>bakterija, bakterijski (od &quot;bacterial&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by bacteria</p><p><b>za sprečavanje infekcije inhibiranjem rasta ili djelovanja mikroorganizama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> preventing infection by inhibiting the growth or action of microorganisms [disinfectant, germicidal]</p><p><b>antibakterijski lijek, baktericid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any chemical agent that destroys bacteria [bacteriacide]</p><p><i>n.</i> any drug that destroys bacteria or inhibits their growth [antibacterial, antibacterial drug]</p><p><b>prelazna prisutnost bakterija (ili drugih mikroorganizama) u krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> transient presence of bacteria (or other microorganisms) in the blood [bacteremia, bacteriaemia]</p><p><b>supstanca u fotosenzitivnim bakterijama koja je povezana s klorofilom viših biljaka, ali se razlikuje od njega (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a substance in photosensitive bacteria that is related to but different from chlorophyll of higher plants</p><p><b>koji liče na bakterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling bacteria [bacterioidal, bacteroid, bacteroidal]</p><p><b>koji liče na bakterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling bacteria [bacterioid, bacteroid, bacteroidal]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s bakteriologijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to bacteriology [bacteriological]</p><p><b>bakteriološka, bakteriološki</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to bacteriology [bacteriologic]</p><p><b>Upotreba štetnih bakterija kao oružja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the use of harmful bacteria as a weapon [germ warfare]</p><p><b>bakteriolog</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a biologist who studies bacteria</p><p><b>bakteriologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of medical science that studies bacteria i