/p><p><i>adj.</i> exhibiting symptoms resulting from repeated physical and emotional injury</p><p><b>istrošenje, razmrskati, sploštenje, šteta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of subjecting to strong attack [banging]</p><p><b>ovan za probijanje bedema</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ram used to break down doors of fortified buildings</p><p><b>akumulator, baterija, baterije, galvanski elemenat, galvanski element, zlostavljanje, bitnica, niz, skup, skupina, bombardiranje, fizički nasrtaj, tvorni napadaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> group of guns or missile launchers operated together at one place</p><p><i>n.</i> a device that produces electricity [electric battery]</p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of related things intended for use together</p><p><i>n.</i> a unit composed of the pitcher and catcher</p><p><i>n.</i> a series of stamps operated in one mortar for crushing ores [stamp battery]</p><p><i>n.</i> the heavy fire of artillery to saturate an area rather than hit a specific target [barrage, barrage fire, bombardment, shelling]</p><p><i>n.</i> an assault in which the assailant makes physical contact [assault and battery]</p><p><b>razrijeđena sumporna kiselina koja se koristi u akumulatorima za pohranu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dilute sulfuric acid used in storage batteries [electrolyte acid]</p><p><b>punjač akumulatora, punjač baterija, punjač baterije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device that can hold a rechargeable battery by means of an electrical cable [charger]</p><p><b>Naziv ulice za lisergnu kiselinu dietilamid (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> street name for lysergic acid diethylamide [Elvis, Lucy in the sky with diamonds, Zen, acid, back breaker, dose, dot, loony toons, pane, superman, window pane]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva od 0,15 mas.% ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mas.% (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> powered by one or more electric batteries</p><p><b>udaranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) the batter's attempt to get on base</p><p><i>n.</i> stuffing made of rolls or sheets of cotton wool or synthetic fiber [batten]</p><p><b>(bezbol) mjera udarača performanse, (dugotrajnost bejsbolskog termina) postotak puta kada neki napor uspije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) a measure of a batter's performance [hitting average]</p><p><i>n.</i> (an extension of the baseball term) the proportion of times some effort succeeds</p><p><b>pokretni ekran postavljen iza domaće baze za hvatanje loptica tijekom vježbanja udarača (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a movable screen placed behind home base to catch balls during batting practice [cage]</p><p><b>(baseball) netko tko uči batters kako bolje udariti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) someone who teaches batters how to bat better</p><p><b>rukavica koju nose lopovi u bejzbolu kako bi se čvrstije držali palicom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a glove worn by batters in baseball to give a firmer grip on the bat</p><p><b>kaciga koju nosi lopov u bejzbolu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a helmet worn by the batter in baseball</p><p><b>(bezbol) popis udaraca u redoslijedu u kojem će udarač (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) a list of batters in the order in which they will bat [card, lineup]</p><p><b>biti se, bitka, boj, bojna, borba, borbeni, boriti se, sukob, muka, napor, naprezanje, trud</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hostile meeting of opposing military forces in the course of a war [conflict, engagement, fight]</p><p><i>n.</i> an energetic attempt to achieve something [struggle]</p><p><i>n.</i> an open clash between two opposing groups (or individuals) [conflict, struggle]</p><p><i>v.</i> battle or contend against in or as if in a battle [combat]</p><p><b>država u zapadnim Sjedinjenim Državama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state in the western United States [NV, Nev., Nevada, Sagebrush State, Silver State]</p><p><b>krstarica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cruiser of maximum speed and firepower</p><p><b>bojni poklič</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a yell intended to rally a group of soldiers in battle [rallying cry, war cry, war whoop]</p><p><i>n.</i> a slogan used to rally support for a cause [cry, rallying cry, war cry, watchword]</p><p><b>gubitak vojne opreme u borbi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> loss of military equipment in battle [combat casualty]</p><p><b>maskirna uniforma, ratna odora, ratna uniforma</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a military uniform designed for field service</p><p><b>mentalni poremećaj uzrokovan stresom aktivnog ratovanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mental disorder caused by stress of active warfare [combat fatigue, combat neurosis, shell shock]</p><p><b>zastava koja vodi trupe u bitku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a flag that leads troops into battle</p><p><b>flota ratnih brodova spremna za bitku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fleet of warships prepared for battle</p><p><b>battle group</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an army unit usually consisting of five companies</p><p><b>linija duž koje se sukobe vojnici susreću (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the line along which warring troops meet</p><p><b>opsada u kojoj su savezne trupe pod Shermanom odsečile željeznice koje opskrbljuju grad i onda ga zapalile. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a siege in which Federal troops under Sherman cut off the railroads supplying the city and then burned it [Atlanta]</p><p><b>odlučujuća bitka tijekom Napoleonskih kampanja (1805) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a decisive battle during the Napoleonic campaigns (1805) [Austerlitz]</p><p><b>bitka u ratu Velike Alijanse u Irskoj 1690. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in the War of the Grand Alliance in Ireland in 1690 [Boyne]</p><p><b>dugotrajno bombardiranje britanskih gradova od strane njemačke Luftwaffe tijekom Drugog svjetskog rata i zračne borbe koje su ga pratile (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the prolonged bombardment of British cities by the German Luftwaffe during World War II and the aerial combat that accompanied it</p><p><b>bitka 937. godine kada je Athelstan porazio Škoti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in 937 when Athelstan defeated the Scots [Brunanburh]</p><p><b>bilo koja od dvije bitke tijekom američkog građanskog rata (1861 i 1862) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two battles during the American Civil War (1861 and 1862) [Bull Run]</p><p><b>Prva bitka američkog rata za neovisnost (1775) koja se vodila u Breed's Hillu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first important battle of the American War of Independence (1775) which was fought at Breed's Hill [Bunker Hill]</p><p><b>bitka u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1917) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> battle of World War I (1917) [Caporetto]</p><p><b>U Američkom građanskom ratu 1863. vojske Unije pod komandom Ulysse S. Granta su pobijedile vojsku Konfederacije pod Braxtonom Braggom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in the American Civil War (1863) the Union armies of Hooker, Thomas, and Sherman under the command of Ulysses S. Grant won a decisive victory over the Confederate Army under Braxton Bragg [Chattanooga]</p><p><b>Pobjeda Konfederacije u Američkom građanskom ratu (1863.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Confederate victory in the American Civil War (1863) [Chickamauga]</p><p><b>bitka u Američkoj revoluciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> battle in the American Revolution [Cowpens]</p><p><b>Prva odlučujuća bitka Stogodišnjeg rata. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first decisive battle of the Hundred Years' War [Crecy]</p><p><b>bitka 401 pne kada je Artakserks II porazio svog mlađeg brata koji je pokušao uzurpirati prijestolje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> battle in 401 BC when the Artaxerxes II defeated his younger brother who tried to usurp the throne [Cunaxa]</p><p><b>Bitka koja je okončala drugi makedonski rat (197 pne.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the battle that ended the second Macedonian War (197 BC) [Cynoscephalae]</p><p><b>bitka u Drugom svjetskom ratu (1942.) koja je rezultirala odlučnom pobjedom Britanskih trupa pod Montgomeryjem nad njemačkim trupama pod Rommelom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pitched battle in World War II (1942) resulting in a decisive Allied victory by British troops under Montgomery over German troops under Rommel [Al Alamayn, El Alamein]</p><p><b>bitka 1513 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in 1513 [Flodden]</p><p><b>Bitka 1745. u kojoj je francuska vojska pod vođstvom maršala Saxe porazila englesku vojsku i njihove saveznike pod vođstvom vojvode Cumberland. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in 1745 in which the French army under Marshal Saxe defeated the English army and their allies under the duke of Cumberland [Fontenoy]</p><p><b>važna bitka u Američkom građanskom ratu (1862) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an important battle in the American Civil War (1862) [Fredericksburg]</p><p><b>bitka u Američkom građanskom ratu (1863.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle of the American Civil War (1863) [Gettysburg]</p><p><b>bitka u kojoj je Aleksandar osvojio svoju prvu veliku pobjedu protiv Perzijanaca (334 pne.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the battle in which Alexander won his first major victory against the Persians (334 BC) [Granicus]</p><p><b>bitka u Drugom svjetskom ratu u Pacifiku (1942-1943) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in World War II in the Pacific (1942-1943) [Guadalcanal]</p><p><b>Bitka kod Hastingsa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the decisive battle in which William the Conqueror (duke of Normandy) defeated the Saxons under Harold II (1066) and thus left England open for the Norman Conquest [Hastings]</p><p><b>bitka tijekom Napoleonovih ratova (1800) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle during the Napoleonic Wars (1800) [Hohenlinden]</p><p><b>bitka između nasljednika Aleksandra Velikog (301. pne.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle between the successors of Alexander the Great (301 BC) [Ipsus]</p><p><b>Bitka kod Isa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle (333 BC) in which Alexander the Great defeated the Persians under Darius III [Issus]</p><p><b>bitka (1590.) u kojoj su Hugenoti pod Henrike IV. porazili katolike pod vojvodom od Mayennea (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle (1590) in which the Huguenots under Henry IV defeated the Catholics under the duke of Mayenne [Ivry, Ivry la Bataille]</p><p><b>Jena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the battle in 1806 in which Napoleon decisively defeated the Prussians [Jena]</p><p><b>Neodlučna pomorska bitka u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1916) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an indecisive naval battle in World War I (1916) [Jutland]</p><p><b>bitka 680. godine u kojoj su poginuli unuk Muhameda i njegovi sljedbenici. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in 680 in which the grandson of Mohammed and his followers were killed</p><p><b>Bitka 217. pne. u kojoj je Hannibal zasjedao rimsku vojsku pod vođstvom Flaminija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in 217 BC in which Hannibal ambushed a Roman army led by Flaminius [Lake Trasimenus]</p><p><b>(1568.) Katoličke snage koje su podupirale Mariju, kraljicu Škotske, porazile su protestanti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (1568) Catholic forces supporting Mary Queen of Scots were routed by Protestants [Langside]</p><p><b>Turska pomorska moć je 1571. uništena od strane saveza kršćanskih naroda koje je organizirao papa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Turkish sea power was destroyed in 1571 by a league of Christian nations organized by the Pope [Lepanto]</p><p><b>Tebe su porazile Spartanu 371. godine prije Krista. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Thebes defeated Sparta in 371 BC [Leuctra]</p><p><b>bitka u Montani u blizini rijeke Little Bighorn između konjice Sjedinjenih Država pod Custerom i nekoliko grupa Indijanaca (1876) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in Montana near the Little Bighorn River between United States cavalry under Custer and several groups of Native Americans (1876) [Battle of the Little Bighorn, Custer's Last Stand, Little Bighorn]</p><p><b>Glavna bitka balkanskih ratova (1912) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the principal battle of the Balkan Wars (1912) [Lule Burgas]</p><p><b>bitka u Tridesetogodišnjem ratu (1632) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in the Thirty Years' War (1632) [Lutzen]</p><p><b>bitka 1859. u kojoj su francuske i sardinske snage pod Napoleonom III. porazile Austrijance pod Franciskom Josipom I. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in 1859 in which the French and Sardinian forces under Napoleon III defeated the Austrians under Francis Joseph I [Magenta]</p><p><b>bitka u kojoj su Danski porazili Sakse 991. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in which the Danes defeated the Saxons in 991 [Maldon]</p><p><b>bitka u 490 pr.n.e. u kojoj su Atinjani i njihovi saveznici porazili Perzijance (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in 490 BC in which the Athenians and their allies defeated the Persians [Marathon]</p><p><b>Bitka 1644. godine u kojoj su parlamentarci pod grofom Manchesterom porazili royaliste pod princom Rupertom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in 1644 in which the Parliamentarians under the earl of Manchester defeated the Royalists under Prince Rupert [Marston Moor]</p><p><b>pomorska bitka Drugog svjetskog rata (juni 1942) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> naval battle of World War II (June 1942) [Midway]</p><p><b>Bitka u Sedmogodišnjem ratu (1759) u kojoj su engleske snage i njihovi saveznici porazili Francuze (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in the Seven Years' War (1759) in which the English forces and their allies defeated the French [Minden]</p><p><b>bitka u New Jerseyu tijekom Američke revolucije (1778) koja se završila povlačenjem britanskih snaga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pitched battle in New Jersey during the American Revolution (1778) that ended with the withdrawal of British forces [Battle of Monmouth Court House, Monmouth Court House]</p><p><b>bitka u New Jerseyu tijekom Američke revolucije (1778) koja se završila povlačenjem britanskih snaga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pitched battle in New Jersey during the American Revolution (1778) that ended with the withdrawal of British forces [Battle of Monmouth, Monmouth Court House]</p><p><b>Bitka 1645. koja je odlučila ishod prvog Engleskog građanskog rata kada su parlamentarci dobili veliku pobjedu nad royalistima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in 1645 that settled the outcome of the first English Civil War as the Parliamentarians won a major victory over the Royalists [Naseby]</p><p><b>odlučujuća pomorska bitka u Grčkom ratu za neovisnost (1827) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a decisive naval battle in the War of Greek Independence (1827) [Navarino]</p><p><b>bitka (1898.) u kojoj su Engleska i Egipatska vojska pod Kitchenerom porazila Sudanske (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle (1898) in which an English and Egyptian army under Kitchener defeated the Sudanese [Omdurman]</p><p><b>bitka u kojoj je vladar Afganistana porazio Mahratte 1761. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> battle in which the ruler of Afghanistan defeated the Mahrattas in 1761 [Panipat]</p><p><b>Cezar je porazio Pompeja 48. godine prije Krista. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Caesar defeated Pompey in 48 BC [Pharsalus]</p><p><b>Octavian i Mark Antony porazili su Brutusa i Cassiusa u 42 BC (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Octavian and Mark Antony defeated Brutus and Cassius in 42 BC [Philippi]</p><p><b>Druga velika bitka američkog građanskog rata (1862) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second great battle of the American Civil War (1862) [Shiloh, battle of Shiloh]</p><p><b>Pobjeda 1757. godine Britanaca pod Cliveom nad Siraj-ud-daula koji je uspostavio britansku nadmoć nad Bengalom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the victory in 1757 by the British under Clive over Siraj-ud-daula that established British supremacy over Bengal [Plassey]</p><p><b>poraz perzijske vojske od strane Grka u Platei 479. pne. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a defeat of the Persian army by the Greeks at Plataea in 479 BC [Plataea]</p><p><b>Bitka 1356. godine u kojoj su Englezi pod Black Prince porazili Francuze. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the battle in 1356 in which the English under the Black Prince defeated the French [Poitiers]</p><p><b>Bitka u kojoj su meksičke snage porazile francuske 1862. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in which Mexican forces defeated the French in 1862</p><p><b>Velika pobjeda Rimljana nad Makedoncima 168 pne. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a major victory by the Romans over the Macedonians in 168 BC [Pydna]</p><p><b>Ravenna</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle between the French and an alliance of Spaniards and Swiss and Venetians in 1512 [Ravenna]</p><p><b>bitka u Tridesetogodišnjem ratu (1643) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in the Thirty Years' War (1643) [Rocroi]</p><p><b>bitka u Sedmogodišnjem ratu (1757) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in the Seven Years' War (1757) [Rossbach]</p><p><b>bitka tijekom američke revolucije (1777) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle during the American Revolution (1777) [Saratoga]</p><p><b>Švicarska konfederacija je pobjegla Habsburškoj dominaciji pobjedom 1386. godine. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the Swiss Confederation escaped Hapsburg domination by their victory in 1386 [Sempach]</p><p><b>Druga velika bitka američkog građanskog rata (1862) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second great battle of the American Civil War (1862) [Shiloh, battle of Pittsburgh Landing]</p><p><b>bitka u Prvom svjetskom ratu (maj 1918) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in World War I (May 1918) [Soissons, battle of the Aisne, battle of the Chemin-des-Dames]</p><p><b>Neodlučna bitka 1859. između Francuza i Sardanaca pod Napoleonom III. i Austrijancima pod Franciskom Josifom I. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an indecisive battle in 1859 between the French and Sardinians under Napoleon III and the Austrians under Francis Joseph I [Solferino]</p><p><b>Bitka između Grantove i Leeove vojske tijekom Wilderness kampanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle between the armies of Grant and Lee during the Wilderness Campaign [Spotsylvania]</p><p><b>bitka u operaciji Meuse-Argonne u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1918) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in the Meuse-Argonne operation in World War I (1918) [Saint-Mihiel, St Mihiel]</p><p><b>bitka u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1914) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in World War I (1914) [Tannenberg]</p><p><b>bitka u Francuskoj 687. među potomcima Klovisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in France in 687 among the descendants of Clovis [Tertry]</p><p><b>Bitka u 9. godini nove ere u kojoj su Germani pod Arminijem uništili tri rimske legije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in 9 AD in which the Germans under Arminius annihilated three Roman Legions [Teutoburger Wald]</p><p><b>konačna bitka rata ruža 1471. u kojoj je Edvard IV. porazio Lancastrians. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the final battle of the War of the Roses in 1471 in which Edward IV defeated the Lancastrians [Tewkesbury]</p><p><b>bitka u Prvom svjetskom ratu (maj 1918) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in World War I (May 1918) [Soissons, battle of Soissons-Reims, battle of the Chemin-des-Dames]</p><p><b>bitka u Drugom svjetskom ratu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle during World War II [Ardennes counteroffensive, Battle of the Bulge]</p><p><b>pomorska bitka u Drugom svjetskom ratu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a naval battle in World War II [Bismarck Sea]</p><p><b>bitka u Drugom svjetskom ratu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle during World War II [Ardennes counteroffensive, Battle of the Ardennes Bulge]</p><p><b>bitka u Prvom svjetskom ratu (maj 1918) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in World War I (May 1918) [Soissons, battle of Soissons-Reims, battle of the Aisne]</p><p><b>Japanski poraz u Drugom svjetskom ratu (maj 1942) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Japanese defeat in World War II (May 1942) [Coral Sea]</p><p><b>bitka u Montani u blizini rijeke Little Bighorn između konjice Sjedinjenih Država pod Custerom i nekoliko grupa Indijanaca (1876) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in Montana near the Little Bighorn River between United States cavalry under Custer and several groups of Native Americans (1876) [Battle of Little Bighorn, Custer's Last Stand, Little Bighorn]</p><p><b>Bitka u Prvom svjetskom ratu u sjeverozapadnoj Francuskoj gdje su Saveznici porazili Nijemce 1918. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a World War I battle in northwestern France where the Allies defeated the Germans in 1918 [Belleau Wood, Chateau-Thierry, Marne River]</p><p><b>pomorska bitka u Drugom svjetskom ratu (1944.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a naval battle in World War II (1944) [Philippine Sea]</p><p><b>bitka u Drugom svjetskom ratu (1944), bitka u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1916) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> battle of World War II (1944) [Somme, Somme River]</p><p><i>n.</i> battle in World War I (1916) [Somme, Somme River]</p><p><b>U Kanalu mala flota britanskih brodova uspješno je porazila veliku armadu koju je Filip II poslao iz Španjolske da napadne Englesku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in the English Channel a small fleet of British ships successfully defeated the large armada sent from Spain by Philip II to invade England</p><p><b>Slavna bitka 480 pne. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a famous battle in 480 BC [Thermopylae]</p><p><b>pomorska bitka 1805. godine kod jugozapadne obale Španjolske. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a naval battle in 1805 off the southwest coast of Spain [Trafalgar]</p><p><b>Bitka u središnjoj Italiji gdje je Hannibal porazio Rimljane pod Flaminijem 217. pne. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in central Italy where Hannibal defeated the Romans under Flaminius in 217 BC [Trasimeno]</p><p><b>Francuski su porazili austrijske i pruske trupe 1792. (s slavnim topovskim udarom francuske artiljerije) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the French defeated the Austrian and Prussian troops in 1792 (with a famous cannonade from the French artillery) [Valmy]</p><p><b>bitka u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1916) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in World War I (1916) [Verdun]</p><p><b>bitka u Napoleonskim kampanjama (1809) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in the Napoleonic campaigns (1809) [Wagram]</p><p><b>U prosincu 1941. otok su zauzeli Japanci nakon što je nekoliko stotina američkih marinaca bilo u stanju da se bori protiv Japana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in December 1941 the island was captured by the Japanese after a gallant last-ditch stand by a few hundred United States marines [Battle of Wake Island]</p><p><b>U prosincu 1941. otok su zauzeli Japanci nakon što je nekoliko stotina američkih marinaca bilo u stanju da se bori protiv Japana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in December 1941 the island was captured by the Japanese after a gallant last-ditch stand by a few hundred United States marines [Battle of Wake]</p><p><b>Bitka 18. lipnja 1815. u kojoj su pruske i britanske snage pod vođstvom Bluchera i vojvode od Wellingtona porazile francuske snage pod Napoleonom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the battle on 18 June 1815 in which Prussian and British forces under Blucher and the Duke of Wellington routed the French forces under Napoleon [Waterloo]</p><p><b>natjecanje u kojem se koristi inteligencija umjesto nasilja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a contest in which intelligence rather than violence is used</p><p><b>bitka u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1917), bitka u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1915), bitka u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1914) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> battle in World War I (1917) [Ypres, third battle of Ypres]</p><p><i>n.</i> battle in World War I (1915) [Ypres, second battle of Ypres]</p><p><i>n.</i> battle in World War I (1914) [Ypres, first battle of Ypres]</p><p><b>Bitka 202. pne. u kojoj je Scipio odlučno porazio Hannibala na kraju Drugog punskog rata. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the battle in 202 BC in which Scipio decisively defeated Hannibal at the end of the second Punic War [Zama]</p><p><b>Plan za vođenje bitke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plan for conducting a battle</p><p><b>Bučna svađa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a noisy riotous fight [melee, scrimmage]</p><p><b>Sredstvo za upravljanje vatrenim oružjem (SMS) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an arrangement of sights that makes possible the rapid aiming of a firearm at short ranges [battlesight]</p><p><b>Broadax korišten kao oružje., Oštrozgovorna dominantanka žena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a broadax used as a weapon [battle-axe]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sharp-tongued domineering wife [battle-axe]</p><p><b>Oštrozgovorna dominantanka žena, Broadax korišten kao oružje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sharp-tongued domineering wife [battle-ax]</p><p><i>n.</i> a broadax used as a weapon [battle-ax]</p><p><b>Ožiljak bitke. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> scarred by battle</p><p><b>lak raketa s dugim rukom koju koriste badmintonski igrači, drevna igra raketa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a light long-handled racket used by badminton players [badminton racket, badminton racquet]</p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient racket game [battledore and shuttlecock]</p><p><b>badminton</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient racket game [battledore]</p><p><b>bojište, bojno polje, ratište, bojišnica, poprište bitke, poprište borbe</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a region where a battle is being (or has been) fought [battleground, field, field of battle, field of honor]</p><p><b>bojišnica, bojište, fronta, ratište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the line along which opposing armies face each other [front, front line]</p><p><b>imati ili pokazati spremnost za borbu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or showing a ready disposition to fight [bellicose, combative]</p><p><b>borilište, bojišnica, bojište, bojno polje, poprište bitke, poprište borbe, ratište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a region where a battle is being (or has been) fought [battlefield, field, field of battle, field of honor]</p><p><b>grudobran</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rampart built around the top of a castle with regular gaps for firing arrows or guns [crenelation, crenellation]</p><p><b>grudobran (od &quot;battlement&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> protected with battlements or parapets with indentations or embrasures for shooting through</p><p><i>adj.</i> having or resembling repeated square indentations like those in a battlement [castellated, castled, embattled]</p><p><b>borac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who fights (or is fighting) [belligerent, combatant, fighter, scrapper]</p><p><b>bojni brod, oklopnjača, ratni brod</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large and heavily armoured warship [battlewagon]</p><p><b>Sredstvo za upravljanje vatrenim oružjem (SMS) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an arrangement of sights that makes possible the rapid aiming of a firearm at short ranges [battle sight]</p><p><b>veliki i teško oklopljeni ratni brod (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large and heavily armoured warship [battleship]</p><p><b>hajka, lov, krvoproliće</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hunt in which beaters force the game to flee in the direction of the hunter</p><p><i>n.</i> indiscriminate slaughter [bloodbath, bloodletting, bloodshed]</p><p><b>ćaknut</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> informal or slang terms for mentally irregular [around the bend, balmy, barmy, bats, bonkers, buggy, cracked, crackers, daft, dotty, fruity, haywire, kookie, kooky, loco, loony, loopy, nuts, nutty, round the bend, wacky, whacky]</p><p><b>krilo slij miša, krilo slijepog miša</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of a pair of swinging doors (as at the entrance to a western saloon)</p><p><i>adj.</i> formed or shaped like a bat's wing</p><p><b>sitnica, trica, ukrasni predmet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mock scepter carried by a court jester</p><p><i>n.</i> cheap showy jewelry or ornament on clothing [bangle, fallal, gaud, gewgaw, novelty, trinket]</p><p><b>baud - jedinica za brzinu signalizacije, bod, broj bita u sek, broj bita u sekundi, Baud, jedinica za brzinu signalizacije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a data transmission rate (bits/second) for modems [baud rate]</p><p><b>broj bitova u sekundi, broj podataka u sekundi, brzina prijenosa, brzina prijenosa podataka, bod</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a data transmission rate (bits/second) for modems [baud]</p><p><b>francuski pjesnik poznat po makabrnim slikama i podsjetljivom jeziku (1821-1867) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a French poet noted for macabre imagery and evocative language (1821-1867) [Charles Baudelaire, Charles Pierre Baudelaire]</p><p><b>Bauhaus</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a German style of architecture begun by Walter Gropius in 1918</p><p><b>planinski ebani, drvo orhideje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mountain ebony, orchid tree [genus Bauhinia]</p><p><b>grm ili drvo iz Holandske Gvaje s gr