robability of a set of possible causes for a given observed event can be computed from knowledge of the probability of each cause and the conditional probability of the outcome of each cause</p><p><b>statističkih metoda na bazi Bayesovog teorema ili s njima povezanih metoda (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to statistical methods based on Bayes' theorem</p><p><b>Najveće slatkovodno jezero u Aziji ili Europi i najdublje jezero na svijetu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the largest freshwater lake in Asia or Europe and the deepest lake in the world [Baikal, Lake Baikal, Lake Baykal]</p><p><b>bajonet, bajunet, bajuneta, bajoneta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a knife that can be fixed to the end of a rifle and used as a weapon</p><p><i>v.</i> stab or kill someone with a bayonet</p><p><b>Bajona</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in northeastern New Jersey</p><p><b>most od čelika koji povezuje New Jersey i Staten Island u Bayonneu, New Jersey (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a steel arch bridge connecting New Jersey and Staten Island at Bayonne, New Jersey</p><p><b>pritok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a swampy arm or slow-moving outlet of a lake (term used mainly in Mississippi and Louisiana)</p><p><b>Glavni i najveći grad Libana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> capital and largest city of Lebanon [Beirut, capital of Lebanon]</p><p><b>Mali grad blizu Jeruzalema na zapadnoj obali rijeke Jordan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small town near Jerusalem on the West Bank of the Jordan River [Bethlehem, Bethlehem-Judah, Bethlehem Ephrathah]</p><p><b>pijaca, tržnica, bazar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a shop where a variety of goods are sold [bazar]</p><p><i>n.</i> a street of small shops (especially in Orient) [bazar]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sale of miscellany [fair]</p><p><b>bazar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a street of small shops (especially in Orient) [bazaar]</p><p><i>n.</i> a shop where a variety of goods are sold [bazaar]</p><p><b>vrlo veliki neodređeni broj (obično hiperbola) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a very large indefinite number (usually hyperbole) [billion, gazillion, jillion, million, trillion, zillion]</p><p><b>bazuka, reaktivni minobacač, ručni bacač, ručni raketni bacač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a portable rocket launcher used by infantrymen as an antitank weapon</p><p><b>mala zrna ispaljena iz zračne puške ili BB pištolja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small pellet fired from an air rifle or BB gun [BB shot]</p><p><b>zračni pištolj u kojem su BB pogon kompresiranim zrakom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an air gun in which BBs are propelled by compressed air</p><p><b>mala zrna ispaljena iz zračne puške ili BB pištolja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small pellet fired from an air rifle or BB gun [BB]</p><p><b>barel</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various units of capacity [barrel]</p><p><b>Računar koji pokreće softver koji korisnicima omogućuje ostavljanje poruka i pristup informacijama od općeg interesa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a computer that is running software that allows users to leave messages and access information of general interest [bulletin board, bulletin board system, electronic bulletin board]</p><p><b>prije nove ere</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> before the Christian era [B.C., before Christ]</p><p><b>razdoblja prije naše ere (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> of the period before the Common Era [B.C.E.]</p><p><b>diplomu iz religije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bachelor's degree in religion [Bachelor of Divinity]</p><p><b>aromatska smola žvakaće guma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic gum resin</p><p><b>biti, koštati, nalaziti se, osjećati se, postojati, vrijediti, budi, budu, Be, atomski broj 4, berilij, bivati, egzistirati, opstojati, biti jednak, predstavljati, sačinjavati, tvoriti, činiti, živjeti, iznositi, stajati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a light strong brittle grey toxic bivalent metallic element [atomic number 4, beryllium, glucinium]</p><p><i>v.</i> have the quality of being</p><p><i>v.</i> be identical to</p><p><i>v.</i> occupy a certain position or area</p><p><i>v.</i> have an existence, be extant [exist]</p><p><i>v