alne Gvineje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an island in the Gulf of Guinea that is part of Equatorial Guinea</p><p><b>biološki</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to biology or to life and living things [biological]</p><p><b>Upotreba bakterija ili virusa ili toksina za uništavanje ljudi i životinja ili hrane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the use of bacteria or viruses or toxins to destroy men and animals or food [BW, bioattack, biological attack, biological warfare]</p><p><b>bioloskog, biološke, biološki, bioloških</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to biology or to life and living things [biologic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a parent or child) related by blood [natural]</p><p><b>bilo koje bakterije ili viruse ili toksine koji bi se mogli koristiti u biološkom ratu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any bacterium or virus or toxin that could be used in biological warfare [biohazard]</p><p><b>Upotreba bakterija ili virusa ili toksina za uništavanje ljudi i životinja ili hrane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the use of bacteria or viruses or toxins to destroy men and animals or food [BW, bioattack, biologic attack, biological warfare]</p><p><b>urođeni mehanizam u živim organizmima koji kontrolira periodicnost mnogih fizioloških funkcija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an innate mechanism in living organisms that controls the periodicity of many physiological functions</p><p><b>postupci koji uključuju poduzimanje obrambenih mjera protiv napada s korištenjem bioloških agensa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> procedures involved in taking defensive measures against attacks using biological agents [biodefence, biodefense, biological defense]</p><p><b>postupci koji uključuju poduzimanje obrambenih mjera protiv napada s korištenjem bioloških agensa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> procedures involved in taking defensive measures against attacks using biological agents [biodefence, biodefense, biological defence]</p><p><b>biološka grupa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of plants or animals</p><p><b>biološki proces, organski proces</b></p><