er constrictor, black racer]</p><p><b>Murski jeleni zapadnih Skalnih planina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mule deer of western Rocky Mountains [Odocoileus hemionus columbianus, black-tailed deer, blacktail deer]</p><p><b>Murski jeleni zapadnih Skalnih planina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mule deer of western Rocky Mountains [Odocoileus hemionus columbianus, black-tailed deer, blacktail]</p><p><b>Česti zec travnjaka i otvorenih područja zapadnih Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the common jackrabbit of grasslands and open areas of western United States [Lepus californicus]</p><p><b>rep je crno vrh (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tail is black tipped [Cynomys ludovicianus]</p><p><b>crni trn, trnina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thorny Eurasian bush with plumlike fruits [Prunus spinosa, sloe]</p><p><i>n.</i> erect and almost thornless American hawthorn with somewhat pear-shaped berries [Crataegus calpodendron, Crataegus tomentosa, pear haw, pear hawthorn]</p><p><b>široko rasprostranjena plitka morska riba s perajima koja su navodno potapala u mastilo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> widely distributed shallow-water shark with fins seemingly dipped in ink [Carcharhinus limbatus, sandbar shark]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm, odjeća s crnom vrhom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a black bituminous material used for paving roads or other areas [blacktopping]</p><p><i>v.</i> coat with blacktop</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a black bituminous material used for paving roads or other areas [blacktop]</p><p><b>Jednostavna zaključka za privremeno pričvršćivanje lanaca na kuku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a simple hitch used for temporarily attaching a line to a hook</p><p><b>napad namijenjen uništenju nečijeg ugleda, mješavina kalomela i limewater koji se koristi na sifilitične rane, Pročišćavanje koje obojava površinu crnom, (informacije) iz skrivenosti, boja sa crnom lisom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an attack intended to ruin someone's reputation [assassination, character assassination]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mixture of calomel and limewater that is used on syphilitic sores [black lotion]</p><p><i>n.</i> a wash that colors a surface black</p><p><i>v.</i> bring (information) out of concealment</p><p><i>v.</i> color with blackwash</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko bolesti ljudi ili životinja karakteriziranih tamnim mokraćom koja je posljedica brzog razgradnje crvenih krvnih stanica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several human or animal diseases characterized by dark urine resulting from rapid breakdown of red blood cells</p><p><b>teška i često smrtonosna malarija koja se karakterizira oštećenjem bubrega što rezultira tamnim mokraćom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> severe and often fatal malaria characterized by kidney damage resulting in dark urine</p><p><b>Vrlo tamno drvo bilo kojeg od nekoliko drveća crnog drveta, bilo koje od nekoliko drveća od tvrdog drveta koje proizvode drvo vrlo tamne boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> very dark wood of any of several blackwood trees</p><p><i>n.</i> any of several hardwood trees yielding very dark-colored wood [blackwood tree]</p><p><b>bilo koje od nekoliko drveća od tvrdog drveta koje proizvode drvo vrlo tamne boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several hardwood trees yielding very dark-colored wood [blackwood]</p><p><b>brbljivac, mjehur</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a distensible membranous sac (usually containing liquid or gas) [vesica]</p><p><i>n.</i> a bag that fills with air</p><p><b>višegodišnja biljka iz arktičke Europe s velikim bijelim cvijećem s napunjenim čašama, plavozelena biljka s ljepljivim stabljikama i grmovima velikih bijeli cvjetova s uveče otvorenim cvjetovima s puno napunjenim čašama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial of Arctic Europe having large white flowers with inflated calyx [Silene uniflora, Silene vulgaris]</p><p><i>n.</i> bluish-green herb having sticky stems and clusters of large evening-opening white flowers with much-inflated calyx [Lychnis alba, Silene latifolia, evening lychnis, white campion, white cockle]</p><p><b>Starozemska višegodišnja biljka uzgajana zbog svoje ukrasne narandžaste crvene čaše s napunjenim papirom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Old World perennial cultivated for its ornamental inflated papery orange-red calyx [Chinese lantern plant, Physalis alkekengi, winter cherry]</p><p><b>poremećaj mokraćne mjehurice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disorder of the urinary bladder</p><p><b>papratka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any fern of the genus Cystopteris characterized by a hooded indusium or bladderlike membrane covering the sori</p><p><b>Uobičajena kamena trava koja se koristi za pripremu morskih morskih voda i kao gnojivo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a common rockweed used in preparing kelp and as manure [Fucus vesiculosus, black rockweed, bladderwrack, tang]</p><p><b>Jednogodišnje korovlje s prolaznim žutim ljubičastim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annual weedy herb with ephemeral yellow purple-eyed flowers [Hibiscus trionum, black-eyed Susan, flower-of-an-hour, flowers-of-an-hour]</p><p><b>pucalina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> yellow-flowered European shrub cultivated for its succession of yellow flowers and very inflated bladdery pods and as a source of wildlife food [Colutea arborescens]</p><p><b>mišić sphincter mokraćne mjehurice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sphincter muscle of the urinary bladder [musculus sphincter vesicae]</p><p><b>mokraćni kamenac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a calculus formed in the bladder [cystolith]</p><p><b>Larna žlijezda žlijezda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> encysted saclike larva of the tapeworm</p><p><b>slično mjehuru. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling a bladder [bladdery]</p><p><b>srednjerođeni crno-sivi tuljan s velikom napušnom vrećom na glavi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medium-sized blackish-grey seal with large inflatable sac on the head [Cystophora cristata, hooded seal]</p><p><b>porodica dvostrukožnih biljaka redom Sapindales uglavnom se nalazi u sjevernoj umjerenoj zoni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of dic