om pentametru) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> unrhymed verse (usually in iambic pentameter)</p><p><b>ćebe, deka, gunj, navlaka, omotač, pokrivač, prekrivač, vuneni pokrivač za krevet, dekica, poplun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bedding that keeps a person warm in bed [cover]</p><p><i>n.</i> anything that covers [mantle]</p><p><i>n.</i> a layer of lead surrounding the highly reactive core of a nuclear reactor</p><p><i>v.</i> cover as if with a blanket</p><p><i>v.</i> form a blanket-like cover (over)</p><p><i>adj.</i> broad in scope or content [across-the-board, all-embracing, all-encompassing, all-inclusive, broad, encompassing, extensive, panoptic, wide]</p><p><b>Gaillardia pulchella, gailardija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annual of central United States having showy long-stalked yellow flower heads marked with scarlet or purple in the center [Gaillardia pulchella, Indian blanket, fire-wheel, fire wheel]</p><p><b>blokirati širok spektar frekvencija kako bi se utjecala na sve komunikacije u području osim usmjerene komunikacije antena (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> jam a broad spectrum of frequencies to affect all communications in the area except for directional antenna communications</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenjem od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strong reinforcing stitch for edges of blanket and other thick material</p><p><b>ćebe, deka, gunj, navlaka, omotač, pokrivač, prekrivač, vuneni pokrivač za krevet (od &quot;blanket&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> covered with (or as if with) a blanket</p><p><b>krajnje</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a blank and uncomprehending manner</p><p><b>bezizražajnost, praznina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being blank</p><p><b>bitni morski ribe za hranu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> important marine food fishes [tilefish]</p><p><b>Grad u južnom Malaviju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> city in southern Malawi</p><p><b>rastrubiti, razglasiti, trubiti, zvek, zveka, zveket, praskati, treštati, brujati, gakati, potrubiti, zabrujati, 