e]</p><p><i>n.</i> a group of persons associated by some common tie or occupation and regarded as an entity</p><p><i>n.</i> a natural object consisting of a dead animal or person [dead body]</p><p><i>n.</i> an individual 3-dimensional object that has mass and that is distinguishable from other objects</p><p><i>n.</i> the body excluding the head and neck and limbs [torso, trunk]</p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of particulars considered as a system</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of holding together and retaining its shape [consistence, consistency, substance]</p><p><i>n.</i> the central message of a communication</p><p><i>n.</i> the main mass of a thing</p><p><i>n.</i> a resonating chamber in a musical instrument (as the body of a violin) [soundbox]</p><p><i>n.</i> the external structure of a vehicle</p><p><i>v.</i> invest with or as with a body [personify]</p><p><b>sa punom vjerom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with complete faith [heart and soul]</p><p><b>oklop koji štiti cijelo tijelo nosioca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> armor that protects the wearer's whole body [body armour, cataphract, coat of mail, suit of armor, suit of armour]</p><p><b>oklop koji štiti cijelo tijelo nosioca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> armor that protects the wearer's whole body [body armor, cataphract, coat of mail, suit of armor, suit of armour]</p><p><b>vreća u koju se stavlja tijelo mrtvog vojnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bag in which the body of a dead soldier is placed [human remains pouch, personnel pouch]</p><p><b>broj vojnika ubijenih u operaciji ili vremenskom razdoblju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a count of troops killed in an operation or time period</p><p><b>tjelesni pokrov</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any covering for the body or a body part</p><p><b>Pokret tijela igrača kao da bi predmet već pogoniti ići u željenom smjeru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a motion of the body by a player as if to make an object already propelled go in the desired direction</p><p><b>tjelesna tekućina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the liqu