ustrian border</p><p><b>veliki rod tropskih američkih vinograda s najozbiljnijim, često pločastima umbellate cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large genus of tropical American vines having showy often spotted umbellate flowers [genus Bomarea]</p><p><b>tropska loza s ružičastom i žutom cvjetom, plitkom ljubičastim i jestivim korijenima, ponekad kuvana kao zamjena za krumpir (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical vine having pink-and-yellow flowers spotted purple and edible roots sometimes boiled as a potato substitute [salsilla]</p><p><b>tropska loza s krunama od malih ljubičastih cvijeća i jestivim korijenima ponekad kuhana kao zamjena za krumpir (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical vine having umbels of small purple flowers and edible roots sometimes boiled as a potato substitute [salsilla]</p><p><b>bomba, bombardirati, bombe, uspjeh, bombardovati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an explosive device fused to explode under specific conditions</p><p><i>n.</i> strong sealed vessel for measuring heat of combustion [bomb calorimeter]</p><p><i>n.</i> an event that fails badly or is totally ineffectual [dud, turkey]</p><p><i>v.</i> throw bombs at or attack with bombs [bombard]</p><p><i>v.</i> fail to get a passing grade [fail, flunk, flush it]</p><p><b>eksplozija bombe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the explosion of a bomb</p><p><b>Svaka vrsta goriva može se upotrebljavati za mjerenje topline. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> strong sealed vessel for measuring heat of combustion [bomb]</p><p><b>učiniti nekoga beskućnikom uništavajući njihove kuće bombama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make somebody homeless by destroying their houses with bombs</p><p><b>uređaj na zrakoplovu za nošenje bombi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device on an aircraft for carrying bombs</p><p><b>komora (često podzemna) ojačana protiv bombardiranja i opremljena hranom i životnim sadržajima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chamber (often underground) reinforced against bombing and provided with food and living facilities [air-raid shelter, bombp