ving a smooth brindle or black coat with white markings [Boston terrier]</p><p><b>slojevito kolače ispunjeno kremom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> layer cake filled with custard</p><p><b>mačeva paprika sa lukovitim ili spuštenijim pinatnim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sword fern with arching or drooping pinnate fronds [Nephrolepis exaltata, Nephrolepis exaltata bostoniensis]</p><p><b>Brodnjaci u Bostonu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the seaport at Boston</p><p><b>Azijska loza s tri-lobed lišća i ljubičasti bobice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Asiatic vine with three-lobed leaves and purple berries [Japanese ivy, Parthenocissus tricuspidata]</p><p><b>salata s relativno mekim lišćama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lettuce with relatively soft leaves</p><p><b>ljuljačka stolica koja ima visoku vrpcu na leđima i dekorativni gornji panel (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rocking chair that has a high spindle back and a decorative top panel</p><p><b>Demonstracija (1773) građana Bostona koji su (prikriveni za Indijance) napali tri britanska broda u luci Boston i bacili stotine sanduka čaja u luku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> demonstration (1773) by citizens of Boston who (disguised as Indians) raided three British ships in Boston harbor and dumped hundreds of chests of tea into the harbor</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, podrijetlo mora biti: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small pug-faced American terrier breed having a smooth brindle or black coat with white markings [Boston bull]</p><p><b>rodom ili stanovnikom Bostona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or resident of Boston</p><p><b>noštromo, vođa palube</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a petty officer on a merchant ship who controls the work of other seamen [bo's'n, bo'sun, boatswain, bos'n]</p><p><b>Škotski pisac poznat po svojoj biografiji Samuela Johnsona (1740-1795), odani obožavatelj i zapisnik tuđih riječi i djela. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.<