ar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who makes mistakes because of incompetence [blunderer, bumbler, bungler, butcher, fuckup, fumbler, sad sack, stumbler]</p><p><b>loše napravljeno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> poorly done [butcherly, unskillful]</p><p><b>čvrsta, dlakava, dlakava, dlakava muha čije su ličinke paraziti na ljudima i drugim sisarima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stout-bodied hairy dipterous fly whose larvae are parasites on humans and other mammals</p><p><b>isto tako, oba, obje, oboje, obojica, također</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used with count nouns) two considered together</p><p><b>briga, dodijavati, dosađivanje, dosađivati, gnjaviti, kopkati, smetati, smetati (nekog), uznemiravanje, uznemiriti, zamaram, zamarati, problem, uznemirivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an angry disturbance [fuss, hassle, trouble]</p><p><i>n.</i> something or someone that causes trouble [annoyance, botheration, infliction, pain, pain in the ass, pain in the neck]</p><p><i>v.</i> take the trouble to do something [inconvenience oneself, trouble, trouble oneself]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause annoyance in [annoy, chafe, devil, get at, get to, gravel, irritate, nark, nettle, rag, rile, vex]</p><p><i>v.</i> to cause inconvenience or discomfort to [discommode, disoblige, incommode, inconvenience, put out, trouble]</p><p><i>v.</i> intrude or enter uninvited</p><p><i>v.</i> make nervous or agitated</p><p><i>v.</i> make confused or perplexed or puzzled</p><p><b>prokletstvo!</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the psychological state of being irritated or annoyed [annoyance, irritation, vexation]</p><p><i>n.</i> something or someone that causes trouble [annoyance, bother, infliction, pain, pain in the ass, pain in the neck]</p><p><b>briga, dodijavati, dosađivanje, dosađivati, gnjaviti, kopkati, smetati, smetati (nekog), uznemiravanje, uznemiriti, zamaram, zamarati (od &quot;bother&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> caused to show discomposure [daunted, fazed]</p><p><b>dosadan, mučan, neugodan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing irritation or 