.</i> the pressure of an ideal gas at constant temperature varies inversely with the volume [Mariotte's law]</p><p><b>Pripada ili karakteristična za malog dječaka, Kao dječak. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> befitting or characteristic of a young boy [boyish, schoolboyish]</p><p><i>adv.</i> like a boy [boyishly]</p><p><b>bitka u ratu Velike Alijanse u Irskoj 1690. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in the War of the Grand Alliance in Ireland in 1690 [battle of Boyne]</p><p><b>Eurafrička godišnja biljka naturalizirana u Americi kao korov. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Eurafrican annual naturalized in America as a weed [Mercurialis annua, herb mercury, herbs mercury]</p><p><b>uzgojena hibridna brana iz Kalifornije koja ima velika tamno crvena voća s okusom sličnim malinama, Sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cultivated hybrid bramble of California having large dark wine-red fruit with a flavor resembling raspberries [boysenberry bush]</p><p><i>n.</i> large raspberry-flavored fruit</p><p><b>uzgojena hibridna brana iz Kalifornije koja ima velika tamno crvena voća s okusom sličnim malinama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cultivated hybrid bramble of California having large dark wine-red fruit with a flavor resembling raspberries [boysenberry]</p><p><b>slične grožđu grožđa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling a cluster of grapes in form [botryoid, botryoidal]</p><p><b>Grad u jugozapadnoj Montani. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a town in southwestern Montana</p><p><b>Čovjek koji je glup, nesposoban budala., Neformalni izraz za mladića ili muškarca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a man who is a stupid incompetent fool [cuckoo, fathead, goof, goofball, goose, jackass, twat, zany]</p><p><i>n.</i> an informal term for a youth or man [cat, guy, hombre, sod]</p><p><b>povećana prostata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> enlarged prostate [benign prostatic hyperplasia]</p><p><b>mjerilo gustoće pakiranja informacija na mediju za pohranu podataka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measure of how densely information is pa