dijanaca koji su živjeli nomadskim životom slijedeći bizona u Velikih ravnica Sjeverne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of one of the tribes of American Indians who lived a nomadic life following the buffalo in the Great Plains of North America [Plains Indian]</p><p><b>masno drusno voće zečjeg drveta, grm jugoistočne Sjedinjenih Američkih Država parazit na korijenima krastavca s rijetkim šiljcima zelenkastih cvijeća i pulpnih drup (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> oily drupaceous fruit of rabbitwood [elk nut, oil nut]</p><p><i>n.</i> shrub of southeastern United States parasitic on roots of hemlocks having sparse spikes of greenish flowers and pulpy drupes [Pyrularia pubera, rabbitwood]</p><p><b>Hrupasta začinjena piletina krila. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> crisp spicy chicken wings</p><p><b>Ribe iz Sjeverne Amerike poput velikih karpa, bilo koji od nekoliko velikih pušača doline Mississippija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large carp-like North American fish</p><p><i>n.</i> any of several large suckers of the Mississippi valley [buffalo fish]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, za sve vrste uspravnih biljaka koje se koriste za proizvodnju hrane za životinje, za koje se primjenjuje odredba iz članka 4. stavka 1. ovog Pravilnika, za koje se primjenjuje odredba iz članka 4. stavka 1. točaka (a) i (b) ovog Pravilnika, za koje se primjenjuje odredba iz članka 4. stavka 2. ovog Pravilnika, za koje se primjenjuje odredba iz članka 4. stavka 1. točaka (a) i (b) ovog Pravilnika, za koje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect tussock-forming perennial bur grass used particularly in South Africa and Australia for pasture and forage [Cenchrus ciliaris, Pennisetum cenchroides]</p><p><b>bafer, brbljivac, buffer, međumemorija, međuspremnik, odbojnik, privremeni spremnik, sprežna memorija, šupljoglavac, tampon, zaštita, ublažiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) an ionic compound that resists changes in its pH</p><p><i>n.</i> a neutral zone between two rival powers that is created in order to diminish the danger of conflict [buffer zone]</p><p><i>n.</i> an inclined metal frame at the front of a locomotive to clear the track [cowcatcher, fender, pilot]</p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a part of RAM used for temporary storage of data that is waiting to be sent to a device [buffer storage, buffer store]</p><p><i>n.</i> a power tool used to buff surfaces [polisher]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cushion-like device that reduces shock due to an impact [fender]</p><p><i>n.</i> an implement consisting of soft material mounted on a block [buff]</p><p><i>v.</i> add a buffer (a solution)</p><p><i>v.</i> protect from impact [cushion, soften]</p><p><b>mala neutralna država između dvije rivalizujuće sile. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small neutral state between two rival powers [buffer state]</p><p><b>raztopina koja sadrži tampon (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a solution containing a buffer</p><p><b>mala neutralna država između dvije rivalizujuće sile. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small neutral state between two rival powers [buffer country]</p><p><b>međumemorija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a part of RAM used for temporary storage of data that is waiting to be sent to a device [buffer, buffer store]</p><p><b>međumemorija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a part of RAM used for temporary storage of data that is waiting to be sent to a device [buffer, buffer storage]</p><p><b>tampon područje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a neutral zone between two rival powers that is created in order to diminish the danger of conflict [buffer]</p><p><b>aspirin obložen supstancom sposobnom za neutralizaciju kiseline (trgovinski naziv Bufferin) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aspirin coated with a substance capable of neutralizing acid (trade name Bufferin) [Bufferin]</p><p><b>aspirin obložen supstancom sposobnom za neutralizaciju kiseline (trgovinski naziv Bufferin) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aspirin coated with a substance capable of neutralizing acid (trade name Bufferin) [buffered aspirin]