bous, bulging, protuberant]</p><p><b>poremećaj prehranjivanja u kojem osoba izmjenjuje snažnu želju za hranom i averziju prema hrani (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disorder of eating in which the person alternates between strong craving for food and aversion to food [binge-purge syndrome, binge-vomit syndrome, bulimarexia]</p><p><b>poremećaj prehranjivanja u kojem osoba izmjenjuje snažnu želju za hranom i averziju prema hrani (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disorder of eating in which the person alternates between strong craving for food and aversion to food [binge-purge syndrome, binge-vomit syndrome, bulima nervosa]</p><p><b>bulimija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disorder of eating seen among young women who go on eating binges and then feel guilt and depression and self-condemnation [binge-eating syndrome]</p><p><i>n.</i> pathologically insatiable hunger (especially when caused by brain lesions)</p><p><b>osoba koja pati od bulimije, koji pate od bulimije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person suffering from bulimia</p><p><i>adj.</i> suffering from bulimia</p><p><b>hrpa, masa, masovni, obim, obujam, opseg, opsežan, rasut, rasuti teret, teret, tovar, ukupnost, većina, veličina, velika zapremi, velika zapremina, velike količine, zapreminski, izbočiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property resulting from being or relating to the greater in number of two parts [majority]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of something that is great in magnitude [mass, volume]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property possessed by a large mass</p><p><i>v.</i> stick out or up</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to bulge or swell outwards [bulge]</p><p><b>visi, kao da je nešto prijetnje, mračno ili prijetnje (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> hang over, as of something threatening, dark, or menacing [brood, hover, loom]</p><p><b>Pošta koja se sastoji od velikog broja identičnih pošiljaka (okružnica ili oglasa) poslanih na pojedinačne adrese po cijenama manjim od 1 klase i plaćene u jednoj seriji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mail consisting of large numbers of i