ted States having large stiff glossy leaves and huge white sweet-smelling flowers [Magnolia grandiflora, evergreen magnolia, large-flowering magnolia, southern magnolia]</p><p><b>kontrabas</b></p><p><i>n.</i> largest and lowest member of the violin family [bass fiddle, bass viol, contrabass, double bass, string bass]</p><p><b>tržište koje se odlikuje rastućim cijenama vrijednosnih papira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a market characterized by rising prices for securities</p><p><b>Velika moćna rasa razvijena ukrcavanjem buldoga i mastifa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large powerful breed developed by crossing the bulldog and the mastiff</p><p><b>bivša politička stranka u Sjedinjenim Državama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a former political party in the United States [Progressive Party]</p><p><b>debeli kratak snažan vrat (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thick short powerful neck</p><p><b>u obliku žutih plodova, s žutim cvjetovima i žutim plodovima sličnim bojama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coarse prickly weed having pale yellow flowers and yellow berrylike fruit [Solanum carolinense, ball nettle, ball nightshade, horse nettle]</p><p><b>bolest svinja koja dovodi do oticanja čvorova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disease of pigs resulting in swelling of the snout</p><p><b>Česta i široko rasprostranjena visoka drvena borova zapadne Sjeverne Amerike s tamnozelenim iglama u gomilama od 2 do 5 i debelom kore s tamno smeđim pločama kada su zrele (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common and widely distributed tall timber pine of western North America having dark green needles in bunches of 2 to 5 and thick bark with dark brown plates when mature [Pinus ponderosa, ponderosa, ponderosa pine, western yellow pine]</p><p><b>potok u sjeveroistočnoj Virginiji gdje su se vodile dvije bitke u Američkom građanskom ratu, bilo koja od dvije bitke tijekom američkog građanskog rata (1861 i 1862) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a creek in northeastern Virginia where two battles were fought in the American Civil War</p><p><i>n.</i> e