ubilački</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> poorly done [botchy, unskillful]</p><p><i>adj.</i> accompanied by bloodshed [gory, sanguinary, sanguineous, slaughterous]</p><p><b>klaonica, mesarnica, mesarstvo, pokolj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a building where animals are butchered [abattoir, shambles, slaughterhouse]</p><p><i>n.</i> the business of a butcher [butchering]</p><p><i>n.</i> the savage and excessive killing of many people [carnage, mass murder, massacre, slaughter]</p><p><b>rod istočnoindijskih stabala ili grmova: dhak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of East Indian trees or shrubs: dhak [genus Butea]</p><p><b>Istočnoindijsko stablo koje ima obilje intenzivnih crvenokosanog baršunastog cvjeta i daje žutu boju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> East Indian tree bearing a profusion of intense vermilion velvet-textured blooms and yielding a yellow dye [Butea monosperma, dak, dhak, palas]</p><p><b>sušen sok drveta dhak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dried juice of the dhak tree [Bengal kino, butea kino, gum butea]</p><p><b>sušen sok drveta dhak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dried juice of the dhak tree [Bengal kino, butea gum, gum butea]</p><p><b>Istočnoindijsko stablo koje ima obilje intenzivnih crvenokosanog baršunastog cvjeta i daje žutu boju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> East Indian tree bearing a profusion of intense vermilion velvet-textured blooms and yielding a yellow dye [Butea frondosa, dak, dhak, palas]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom ugljikovodika od 1,5% ili više, ali ne više od 2,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of three isomeric hydrocarbons C4H8 [butylene]</p><p><b>Širokrasti jastrebovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> broad-winged soaring hawks [genus Buteo]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the common European short-winged hawk [buzzard]</p><p><b>tamno smeđe vrste američkog sokola s crvenkasto smeđim repom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dark brown American hawk species having a reddish-brown tail [red-tailed hawk, redtail]</p><p><b>veliki sokol sjeverne hemisfere koji se uglavnom hrani malim glodavcima i koji je koristan poljoprivrednicima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large hawk of the northern hemisphere that feeds chiefly on small rodents and is beneficial to farmers [rough-legged hawk, roughleg]</p><p><b>Sjevernoamerički sokola sa crvenkasto smeđim ramenima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American hawk with reddish brown shoulders [red-shouldered hawk]</p><p><b>Svaka čvorska čvorska čvorska vrsta, koji se odnosi na sokola rod Buteo ili na njega sliči (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any hawk of the genus Buteo</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or resembling a hawk of the genus Buteo</p><p><b>batler, peharnik, sluga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a manservant (usually the head servant of a household) who has charge of wines and the table [pantryman]</p><p><i>n.</i> English novelist who described a fictitious land he called Erewhon (1835-1902) [Samuel Butler]</p><p><i>n.</i> English poet (1612-1680) [Samuel Butler]</p><p><b>batak, bosti, bure, cigareta, čik, debeli kraj, deblji kraj, drška, granica, iverak, kraj, kundak, list, nastavak, pikavac, spoj, stik, stražnjica, sučeljni, udariti glavom, upadati u riječ, usadnik, veliko bure, završetak, završetak nečega, dupe, guza, zadnjica, debelo meso, guzica, rit, cilj, meta, naslanjati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thick end of the handle [butt end]</p><p><i>n.</i> the part of a plant from which the roots spring or the part of a stalk or trunk nearest the roots</p><p><i>n.</i> a victim of ridicule or pranks [goat, laughingstock, stooge]</p><p><i>n.</i> the fleshy part of the human body that you sit on [arse, ass, backside, behind, bottom, bum, buns, buttocks, can, derriere, fanny, fundament, hind end, hindquarters, keister, nates, posterior, prat, rear, rear end, rump, seat, stern, tail, tail end, tooshie, tush]</p><p><i>n.</i> sports equipment consisting of an object set up for a marksman or archer to aim at [target]</p><p><i>n.</i> finely ground tobacco wrapped in paper [cigaret, cigarette, coffin nail, fag]</p><p><i>n.</i>