f nitrogen compounds [cyanamide]</p><p><b>izračunljiv, proračunljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> able to be calculated or estimated</p><p><b>izračunati, izračunavamo, izračunavanje, izračunavati, kalkulirati, obračunati, obračunavati, procijeniti, prosuditi, računati, sračunati, proračunati, proračunavati, predvidjeti, predviđati, procjenjivati, smatrati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a mathematical calculation or computation [cipher, compute, cypher, figure, reckon, work out]</p><p><i>v.</i> judge to be probable [count on, estimate, figure, forecast, reckon]</p><p><i>v.</i> keep an account of [account]</p><p><i>v.</i> predict in advance [forecast]</p><p><i>v.</i> specifically design a product, event, or activity for a certain public [aim, direct]</p><p><i>v.</i> have faith or confidence in [bank, bet, count, depend, look, reckon, rely, swear]</p><p><b>izračunat, izračunati, sračunat</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> carefully thought out in advance [deliberate, measured]</p><p><b>izračunavanje, obračunavanja, obračunavanje, procjenjivanje, proračun, proračuna, računanje, računati, računski, za izračunavanje, za računanje, za sračunavanje</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> acting with a specific goal [calculative, conniving, scheming, shrewd]</p><p><b>digitron, kalkulator, računalnik, računar, računarski stroj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small machine that is used for mathematical calculations [calculator]</p><p><b>izračunavanje, obračunavanja, obračunavanje, procjenjivanje, proračun, proračuna, računanje, računati, računski, za izračunavanje, za računanje, za sračunavanje (od &quot;calculating&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a calculating manner</p><p><b>izračun, izračunavanje, kalkulacija, obračun, proračun, proračun polja, proračuna, proračunavanja, proračunavanje, računanje, promišljanje, razmatranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the procedure of calculating [computation, computing]</p><p><i>n.</i> problem solving that involves numbers or quantities [computation, figuring, reckoning]</p><p><i>n.</i> planning something carefully and intentionally [deliberation]</p><p><b>djelovanje s određenim ciljem (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> acting with a specific goal [calculating, conniving, scheming, shrewd]</p><p><b>kalkulator, računalo, računar, računarski stroj, računska mašina, digitron, računalnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expert at calculation (or at operating calculating machines) [computer, estimator, figurer, reckoner]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small machine that is used for mathematical calculations [calculating machine]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na ili uzrokovani ili imaju kalkulus ili kalkuli (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or caused by or having a calculus or calculi</p><p><b>infinitezimalni račun, kamen, račun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hard lump produced by the concretion of mineral salts [concretion]</p><p><i>n.</i> an incrustation that forms on the teeth and gums [tartar, tophus]</p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of mathematics that is concerned with limits and with the differentiation and integration of functions [infinitesimal calculus]</p><p><b>varijacioni račun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the calculus of maxima and minima of definite integrals</p><p><b>Najveći grad u Indiji i jedan od najvećih gradova na svijetu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the largest city in India and one of the largest cities in the world [Kolkata]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s ili karakteristično za Kalkutu ili njenih stanovnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of Calcutta or its inhabitants</p><p><b>Američki skulptor koji je prvi stvorio mobilne i konobare (1898-1976) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States sculptor who first created mobiles and stabiles (1898-1976) [Alexander Calder]</p><p><b>veliki krater uzrokovan nasilnom eksplozijom vulkana koji se urušava u depresiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large crater caused by the violent explosion of a volcano that collapses into a depression</p><p><b>Španjolski pjesnik i dramski pisac koji se smatra jednim od najvećih španjolskih pisaca (1600-1681) (MT)</