iv, ugasiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> subject to a demand for payment before due date</p><p><b>Grčka koloratura sopranka (rođena u Sjedinjenim Državama) poznata po svojoj dramatičnoj intenznosti u opernim ulogama (1923-1977) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Greek coloratura soprano (born in the United States) known for her dramatic intensity in operatic roles (1923-1977) [Maria Callas, Maria Meneghini Callas]</p><p><b>Bučna parada., bučna lažna serenada (izrada udarajući lonac i čajnik) novonaplavenom paru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a noisy boisterous parade [callithump, callithump parade]</p><p><i>n.</i> a noisy mock serenade (made by banging pans and kettles) to a newly married couple [belling, callithump, charivari, chivaree, shivaree]</p><p><b>poziv za povrat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a request by the manufacturer of a defective product to return the product (as for replacement or repair) [recall]</p><p><b>posjetitelj, pozivač, pozivatelj, sudioniku komunikaciji koji započinje komunikaciju, gost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a social or business visitor [company]</p><p><i>n.</i> an investor who buys a call option</p><p><i>n.</i> the bettor in a card game who matches the bet and calls for a show of hands</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who announces the changes of steps during a dance [caller-out]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who proclaims or summons in a loud voice</p><p><i>n.</i> the person who convenes a meeting</p><p><i>n.</i> the person initiating a telephone call [caller-up, phoner, telephoner]</p><p><i>adj.</i> providing coolness</p><p><i>adj.</i> fresh</p><p><b>id pozivatelja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small display that will show you the telephone number of the party calling you</p><p><b>osoba koja najavljuje promjene koraka tijekom plesa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who announces the changes of steps during a dance [caller]</p><p><b>osoba koja je pokrenula telefonski poziv (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person initiating a telephone call [caller, phoner, telephoner]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različit