ue to red-purple flowers [Anchusa riparia]</p><p><i>n.</i> anchusa of southern Africa having blue flowers with white throats [Anchusa capensis]</p><p><b>Kap na Magellanovom moreuzu u južnom Čileu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cape on the Strait of Magellan in southern Chile</p><p><b>grad u jugoistočnom Missouriju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a town in southeast Missouri</p><p><b>godišnji od tropske Južne Amerike s jestivim ljubičastim plodovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annual of tropical South America having edible purple fruits [Physalis peruviana, purple ground cherry]</p><p><b>Na kopnu Hatteras Island u blizini obale Atlantika u Sjevernoj Karolini. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a promontory on Hatteras Island off the Atlantic coast of North Carolina</p><p><b>kamenito vodovođe koje pripada Čileu na najjužnijem kraju Južne Amerike (južno od vatrene zemlje) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rocky headland belonging to Chile at the southernmost tip of South America (south of Tierra del Fuego)</p><p><b>snažan sisavac poput psa iz južne i istočne Afrike koji lovi u velikim čoparima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a powerful doglike mammal of southern and eastern Africa that hunts in large packs [African hunting dog, Lycaon pictus, hyena dog]</p><p><b>ljekovitog bilja s bijelim cvjetovima u obliku zvona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> southern African herb with white bell-shaped flowers [Galtonia candicans, Hyacinthus candicans, summer hyacinth]</p><p><b>Zastozelena grmlja koja se široko uzgaja zbog svojih velikih mirisnih bijeli cvjetovi poput voska i blistavih listova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> evergreen shrub widely cultivated for its large fragrant waxlike white flowers and glossy leaves [Gardenia augusta, Gardenia jasminoides, cape jessamine]</p><p><b>Zastozelena grmlja koja se široko uzgaja zbog svojih velikih mirisnih bijeli cvjetovi poput voska i blistavih listova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> evergreen shrub widely cultivated for its large fragrant waxlike white flowers and glossy leaves [Gardenia au