us Capella, genus Gallinago]</p><p><b>avantura, ispad, kapar, skakati, skakutati, skok, kapra, igra, igranje, fora, nepodopština, psina, smicalica, vic, šala, štos</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous plants of the genus Capparis</p><p><i>n.</i> pickled flower buds used as a pungent relish in various dishes and sauces</p><p><i>n.</i> a crime (especially a robbery) [job]</p><p><i>n.</i> a playful leap or hop [capriole]</p><p><i>n.</i> gay or light-hearted recreational activity for diversion or amusement [frolic, gambol, play, romp]</p><p><i>n.</i> a ludicrous or grotesque act done for fun and amusement [antic, joke, prank, put-on, trick]</p><p><i>v.</i> jump about playfully</p><p><b>rod dileniidnih dikota red Rhoeadales koji uključuje: rodove Capparis, Cleome, Crateva i Polanisia (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dilleniid dicot family of the order Rhoeadales that includes: genera Capparis, Cleome, Crateva, and Polanisia [Capparidaceae, family Capparidaceae]</p><p><b>Almanah sos s kapricama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> allemande sauce with capers</p><p><b>otrovni stari svijet spurg (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> poisonous Old World spurge [Euphorbia lathyris, mole plant, myrtle spurge]</p><p><b>grm ili drvo iz južnog Floride do Srednje i Južne Amerike, grm od južne Floride do Zapadne Indije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrub or small tree of southern Florida to Central and South America [Capparis flexuosa, bay-leaved caper]</p><p><i>n.</i> shrub of southern Florida to West Indies [Capparis cynophallophora, Jamaica caper tree]</p><p><b>gluhan, tetrijeb, Tetrao urogallus, tetrijeb gluhan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large black Old World grouse [Tetrao urogallus, capercailzie, horse of the wood]</p><p><b>Tetrao urogallus, tetrijeb gluhan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large black Old World grouse [Tetrao urogallus, capercaillie, horse of the wood]</p><p><b>Kralj Francuske izabran 987. i osnivač dinastije Kapeta (940-996) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> King of France elected in 987 and founding the Capetian dynasty (