apillaries</p><p><b>Prelom bez odvajanja fragmenata i linija lomljenja vrlo tanka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fracture without separation of the fragments and the line of the break being very thin [hairline fracture]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tube of small internal diameter [capillary, capillary tubing]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tube of small internal diameter [capillary, capillary tube]</p><p><b>Minutna vena neprekidna s kapilarnom žilom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a minute vein continuous with a capillary [venula, venule]</p><p><b>bilo koji od minijaturnih krvnih žila koji povezuju arteriole s venulama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the minute blood vessels connecting arterioles with venules [capillary]</p><p><b>glavni, glavni grad, glavnica, kapital, kapitalan, kapitel, metropola, novac ili imovina koji se koristi u poslovne svrhe, osnovni kapital, početno slovo, poslovni fond, smrtan, sredstvo, veliko slovo, glavnim, kapitala, kapitalu, verzal, glavica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> assets available for use in the production of further assets [working capital]</p><p><i>n.</i> wealth in the form of money or property owned by a person or business and human resources of economic value</p><p><i>n.</i> a seat of government</p><p><i>n.</i> one of the large alphabetic characters used as the first letter in writing or printing proper names and sometimes for emphasis [capital letter, majuscule, upper-case letter, uppercase]</p><p><i>n.</i> a center that is associated more than any other with some activity or product</p><p><i>n.</i> the federal government of the United States [Washington]</p><p><i>n.</i> a book written by Karl Marx (1867) describing his economic theories [Das Kapital]</p><p><i>n.</i> the upper part of a column that supports the entablature [cap, chapiter]</p><p><i>adj.</i> first-rate</p><p><i>adj.</i> of primary importance</p><p><i>adj.</i> uppercase [great, majuscule]</p><p><b>(ekonomika) dio platne bilance koji bilježi odlazak i priliv financijskih vrijednosnih papira u državi, (finance) račun o neto vrijednosti poslovanja na određeni datum (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (economics) that part of the balance of payments recording a nation's outflow and inflow of financial securities</p><p><i>n.</i> (finance) an account of the net value of a business at a specified date</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 2. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the opportunity cost of the funds employed as the result of an investment decision [cost of capital]</p><p><b>troškovi dugoročnih poboljšanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cost of long-term improvements</p><p><b>kapitalni dobitak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount by which the selling price of an asset exceeds the purchase price</p><p><b>porez na kapitalne dobitke, porez na kapitalni dobitak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tax on capital gains</p><p><b>veliko slovo, verzal</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the large alphabetic characters used as the first letter in writing or printing proper names and sometimes for emphasis [capital, majuscule, upper-case letter, uppercase]</p><p><b>porez na kapital ili imovinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tax on capital or property</p><p><b>Iznos koji se primjenjuje na vrijednost imovine u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili člankom 4. točkom (b) ili člankom 4. točkom (c) ili člankom 4. točkom (d) ili člankom 4. točkom (e) ili člankom 4. točkom (e) ili člankom 4. točkom (e) ili člankom 4. točkom (e) ili člankom 4. točkom (e) ili člankom 4. točkom (e) ili člankom 4. točkom (e) ili člankom 4. točkom (e) ili član (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount by which the purchase price of an asset exceeds the selling price</p><p><b>Glavni i najveći grad Afganistana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital and largest city of Afghanistan [Kabul]</p><p><b>Glavni grad države Alabama na rijeci Mobile. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state capital of A