ovima uspravnih listnih stabljika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> whorls of deep blue to dark purple flowers at tips of erect leafy stems [Penstemon serrulatus]</p><p><b>planinski lanac u sjeverozapadnim Sjedinjenim Državama koji se proteže kroz Washington i Oregon i sjevernu Kaliforniju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain range in the northwestern United States extending through Washington and Oregon and northern California [Cascade Mountains, Cascades]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva od 10 kW ili više, ali ne više od 100 kW (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a number of transformers in series</p><p><b>kaskadama, kaskade</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain range in the northwestern United States extending through Washington and Oregon and northern California [Cascade Mountains, Cascade Range]</p><p><b>planinska žaba pronađena u blizini vode (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mountain frog found near water [Rana cascadae]</p><p><b>sekundarni meni koji se pojavljuje dok držite kursor nad stavkom u primarnom meniju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a secondary menu that appears while you are holding the cursor over an item on the primary menu [hierarchical menu, submenu]</p><p><b>sušena kora grmljavaca korištena kao laksativ (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dried bark of the cascara buckthorn used as a laxative [cascara sagrada, chittam bark, chittem bark]</p><p><b>grm na pacifičkoj obali Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrubby tree of the Pacific coast of the United States [Rhamnus purshianus, bearberry, bearwood, chittamwood, chittimwood]</p><p><b>sušena kora grmljavaca korištena kao laksativ (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dried bark of the cascara buckthorn used as a laxative [cascara, chittam bark, chittem bark]</p><p><b>Šumovi od žuta ili od žuta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> West Indian shrub with aromatic bark [Croton eluteria]</p><p><b>aromatska kora od cascarille (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic bark of cascarilla [eleuthera bark, sweetwood bark]</p><p><b>događaj, futrola, ime, kašeta, kofer, kućište, kutija, omot, padež, pakovanje, postolje, sanduk, slučaj, stanje, stvar, šasija, uvjet, veličina slova, zaštitni pokrov paradne zastave, slučaja, slučaju, instanca, primjer, slueaj, torba, klijent, gramatički padež, ekscentrik, osobenjak, čudak, vitrina, oblagati, obložiti, zatvarati, zatvoriti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an occurrence of something [example, instance]</p><p><i>n.</i> a special set of circumstances [event]</p><p><i>n.</i> a comprehensive term for any proceeding in a court of law whereby an individual seeks a legal remedy [causa, cause, lawsuit, suit]</p><p><i>n.</i> the actual state of things</p><p><i>n.</i> a portable container for carrying several objects</p><p><i>n.</i> a person requiring professional services</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is subjected to experimental or other observational procedures [guinea pig, subject]</p><p><i>n.</i> a problem requiring investigation</p><p><i>n.</i> a statement of facts and reasons used to support an argument</p><p><i>n.</i> the quantity contained in a case [caseful]</p><p><i>n.</i> nouns or pronouns or adjectives (often marked by inflection) related in some way to other words in a sentence [grammatical case]</p><p><i>n.</i> a specific state of mind that is temporary</p><p><i>n.</i> a person of a specified kind (usually with many eccentricities) [character, eccentric, type]</p><p><i>n.</i> a specific size and style of type within a type family [face, font, fount, typeface]</p><p><i>n.</i> an enveloping structure or covering enclosing an animal or plant organ or part [sheath]</p><p><i>n.</i> the housing or outer covering of something [casing, shell]</p><p><i>n.</i> the enclosing frame around a door or window opening [casing]</p><p><i>n.</i> (printing) the receptacle in which a compositor has his type, which is divided into compartments for the different letters, spaces, or numbers [compositor's case, typesetter's case]</p><p><i>n.</i> bed linen consisting of a cover for a pillow [pillow slip, pillowcase, slip]</p><p><i>n.</i> a glass container used to store and display items in a shop or museum or home [display case, showcase, vitrine]</p><p><i>v.</i> look over, usually with the intention to rob</p><p><i>v.</i> enclose in, or as if in, a case [encase, incase]</p><p><b>slaganje u padežu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> agreement in grammatical case between words in the same construction</p><p><b>anamneza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> detailed record of the background of a person or group under study or treatment</p><p><b>presedan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an example that is used to justify similar occurrences at a later time [precedent]</p><p><b>metalno oštro s drškom, nož s fiksnim oštricom koji se nosi u omotnici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metal blade with a handle</p><p><i>n.</i> a knife with a fixed blade that is carried in a sheath [sheath knife]</p><p><b>sudska praksa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system of jurisprudence based on judicial precedents rather than statutory laws [common law, precedent]</p><p><i>n.</i> (civil law) a law established by following earlier judicial decisions [common law, precedent]</p><p><b>broj slučajeva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the number of cases handled in a given period of time (as by a court or agency)</p><p><b>operativni agent koji također služi kao službeni zaposlenik obavještajne službe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an operative who also serves as an official staffer of an intelligence service</p><p><b>sačma</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metallic cylinder packed with shot and used as ammunition in a firearm [canister, canister shot]</p><p><b>analiza slučaja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a careful study of some social unit (as a corporation or division within a corporation) that attempts to determine what factors led to its success or failure</p><p><i>n.</i> a detailed analysis of a person or group from a social or psychological or medical point of view</p><p><b>odvojeni i različiti od drugih iste vrste (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> separate and distinct from others of the same kind [individual, item-by-item]