etala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili, u kućištu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> covered or protected with or as if with a case [encased, incased]</p><p><i>adj.</i> enclosed in a case</p><p><b>količina sadržana u kutiji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quantity contained in a case [case]</p><p><b>kazein, sirivo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a milk protein used in making e.g. plastics and adhesives</p><p><i>n.</i> a water-base paint made with a protein precipitated from milk [casein paint]</p><p><b>proizvodi od kazeina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> made from casein</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom masnoće od 1 kg ili više, ali ne više od 1 kg (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a water-base paint made with a protein precipitated from milk [casein]</p><p><b>Larve žive u cevima od hrane koja je vezana za svilenu materiju koju on previja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the larvae live in tubes of its food material fastened with silk that it spins [Tinea pellionella]</p><p><b>krilo, prozor, prozorski okvir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a window sash that is hinged (usually on one side)</p><p><b>prozor s jednim ili više kašmana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a window with one or more casements</p><p><b>sirast</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of damaged or necrotic tissue</p><p><b>kasarna</b></p><p><i>n.</i> military barracks in a garrison town</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve osobe koje su u stanju podnositi dijagnozu i liječenje, primjenjuje se sljedeći postupak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> close sociological study of a maladjusted person or family for diagnosis and treatment</p><p><b>osoba koja je zaposlena za pružanje socijalnih usluga (posebno za ugrožene osobe) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone employed to provide social services (especially to the disadvantaged) [social worker, welfare worker]</p><p><b>larva insekta koja se okružuje zaštitnom kućištem oko svog tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> insect larva that constructs a protective case around its body</p><p><b>Američki željeznički inženjer koji je umro pokušavajući spriječiti njegov vlak da se sudari s drugim vlakom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States railroad engineer who died trying to stop his train from crashing into another train [John Luther Jones, Jones]</p><p><b>Američki bejzbolski menadžer (1890-1975) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States baseball manager (1890-1975) [Charles Dillon Stengel, Stengel]</p><p><b>gotov novac, gotovina, novac, platiti u gotovini, promijeniti, promijeniti novac, u gotovom, unovčiti, keš</b></p><p><i>n.</i> money in the form of bills or coins [hard cash, hard currency]</p><p><i>n.</i> prompt payment for goods or services in currency or by check [immediate payment]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States country music singer and songwriter (1932-2003) [John Cash, Johnny Cash]</p><p><i>v.</i> exchange for cash [cash in]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an account with a securities brokerage whose transactions are settled on a cash basis</p><p><b>gotovinski predujam, akontacija, avans, kapara, predujam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amount paid before it is earned [advance]</p><p><b>stol na velikoj zabavi gdje možete kupiti piće po čaši. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a counter at a large party where you can purchase drinks by the glass</p><p><b>metod računovodstva u kojem se svaka stavka upisuje prilikom primanja ili izvršenja plaćanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of accounting in which each item is entered as payments are received or made</p><p><b>kreditna kartica koja nositelju daje pravo na primanje gotovine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a credit card that entitles the holder to receive cash [cashcard]</p><p><b>krava muzara</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a project that generates a continuous flow of money [money-spinner, moneymaker]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, proizvod može biti upotrebljen za proizvodnju proizvoda koji se proizvode u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a readily salable crop that is grown and gathered for the market (as vegetables or cotton or tobacco)</p><p><b>bankomat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unattended machine (outside some banks) that dispenses money when a personal coded card is used [ATM, automated teller, automated teller machine, automatic teller, automatic teller machine, cash machine]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je kreditni instrument u pitanju, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ili (d) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (e) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 4. točkom (a) ovog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a highly liquid debt instrument with maturities of less than three months</p><p><b>izvještaj o novčanom toku, novčani tijek, opticaj sredstava, priljev gotovine, priljev kapitala, protok kapitala, tijek gotovine, tok gotovine, tok novca</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the excess of cash revenues over cash outlays in a give period of time (not including non-cash expenses)</p><p><b>unovčiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> exchange for cash [cash]</p><p><b>gotovina, financije, financijska sredstva, novčana sredstva, novčani resursi, sredstva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> assets in the form of money [finances, funds, monetary resource, pecuniary resource]</p><p><b>iskoristiti ili iskoristiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> take advantage of or capitalize on</p><p><b>crknuti, izdahnuti, krepati, preminuti, skončati, skončavati, umirati, umrijeti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> pass from physical life and lose all bodily attributes and functions necessary to sustain life [buy the farm, choke, conk, croak, decease, die, drop dead, exit, expire, give-up the ghost, go, kick the bucket, pass, pass away, perish, pop off, snuff it]</p><p><b>bankomat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unattended machine (outside some banks) that dispenses money when a personal coded card is used [ATM, automated teller, automated teller machine, automatic teller, automatic teller machine, cash dispenser]</p><p><b>pouzeće</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> collecting the charges upon delivery [C.O.D., COD]</p><p><b>izabrati jednostavniji životni stil nakon što se zapitao lične i karijere zadovoljstvo ciljeve (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> choose a simpler life style after questioning personal and career satisfaction goals</p><p><b>U slučaju da je predmetna vrijednost u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 3. točkom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the current delivery price of a commodity traded in the spot market [spot price]</p><p><b>kasa, registar-kasa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cashbox with an adding machine to register transactions [register]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je osiguranik preminuo, u slučaju da je životno osiguranje otkazano prije smrti, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 3. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 3. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount that the insurance company will pay on a given life insurance policy if the policy is cancelled prior to the death of the insured</p><p><b>plati i nosi</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> sold for cash and the customer carries it away (no delivery service)</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> able to be converted into ready money or the equivalent [redeemable]</p><p><b>trezor za držanje gotovine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strongbox for holding cash [money box, till]</p><p><b>kreditna kartica koja nositelju daje pravo na primanje gotovine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a credit card that entitles the holder to receive cash [cash card]</p><p><b>gotov novac, gotovina, novac, platiti u gotovini, promijeniti, promijeniti novac, u gotovom, unovčiti (od &quot;cash&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> for which money has been paid</p><p><b>indijski oraščić, indonezijski orašćić</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American evergreen tree bearing kidney-shaped nuts that are edible only when roasted [Anacardium occidentale, cashew tree]</p><p><i>n.</i> kidney-shaped nut edible only when roasted [cashew nut]</p><p><b>indijski oraščić, kasu orah</b></p><p><i>n.</i> kidney-shaped nut edible only when roasted [cashew]</p><p><b>tropsko američko zimzeleno stablo koje nosi orahe u obliku bubrega koje su jestive samo kad su pržene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American evergreen tree bearing kidney-shaped nuts that are edible only when roasted [Anacardium occidentale, cashew]</p><p><b>blagajnica, blagajnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an employee of a bank who receives and pays out money [bank clerk, teller]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person responsible for receiving payments for goods and services (as in a shop or restaurant)</p><p><i>v.</i> discard or do away with</p><p><i>v.</i> discharge with dishonor, as in the army</p><p><b>Ček koji je izdao službenik banke na račun banke (ne računa privatne osobe) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a check issued by the officer of a bank on the banks own account (not that of a private person) [cashier's cheque, treasurer's check, treasurer's cheque]</p><p><b>Ček koji je izdao službenik banke na račun banke (ne računa privatne osobe) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a check issued by the officer of a bank on the banks own account (not that of a private person) [cashier's check, treasurer's check, treasurer's cheque]</p><p><b>kašmir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a soft fabric made from the wool of the Cashmere goat</p><p><i>n.</i> the wool of the Kashmir goat</p><p><i>n.</i> an area in southwestern Asia whose sovereignty is disputed between Pakistan and India [Jammu and Kashmir, Kashmir]</p><p><b>Himalajska koza s svilovitom donjom kožom koja je vrlo cenjena kao kašmirska vuna (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Himalayan goat having a silky undercoat highly prized as cashmere wool [Kashmir goat]</p><p><b>Američki biohemičar (rođen u Poljskoj) koji je pokazao da su nekoliko bolesti uzrokovane nedostatkom ishrane i koji je skovao izraz `vitamin' za uključene kemikalije (1884-1967) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States biochemist (born in Poland) who showed that several diseases were caused by dietary deficiencies and who coined the term `vitamin' for the chemicals involved (1884-1967) [Funk]</p><p><b>futrola, grotlište, kaplama, korice, kućište, kutija, navlaka, omot, sanduk</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the housing or outer covering of something [case, shell]</p><p><i>n.</i> the outermost covering of a pneumatic tire</p><p><i>n.</i> the enclosing frame around a door or window opening [case]</p><p><b>casino, kasino, kockarnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a public building for gambling and entertainment [gambling casino]</p><p><i>n.</i> a card game in which cards face up on the table are taken with eligible cards in the hand [cassino]</p><p><b>poslovni objekat koji kombinira kazino i hotel, zgrada u kojoj se nalaze hotel i kazino (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a business establishment that combines a casino and a hotel [hotel-casino]</p><p><i>n.</i> a building that houses both a hotel and a casino [hotel-casino]</p><p><b>bačva, bure</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quantity a cask will hold [caskful]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cylindrical container that holds liquids [barrel]</p><p><b>kutija, urna s pepelom, lijes, mrtvački sanduk</b></p><p><i>n.</i> box in which a corpse is buried or cremated [coffin]</p><p><i>n.</i> small and often ornate box for holding jewels or other valuables [jewel casket]</p><p><i>v.</i> enclose in a casket</p><p><b>količinu koju će bačva moći zadržati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quantity a cask will hold [cask]</p><p><b>bijeli egri (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white egrets [genus Casmerodius]</p><p><b>široko rasprostranjen bijeli egret Starog svijeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> widely distributed Old World white egret [great white heron]</p><p><b>(Novi zavjet) jedan od tri mudraca sa istoka koji su donijeli darove za djeteta Isusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (New Testament) one of the three sages from the east who came bearing gifts for the infant Jesus [Gaspar]</p><p><b>Danski liječnik koji je otkrio Bartholinovu žlijezdu (1585-1629) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Danish physician who discovered Bartholin's gland (1585-1629) [Bartholin]</p><p><b>kaspaze</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of a group of proteases that mediate apoptosis</p><p><b>vrsta ćelijske smrti u kojoj stanica koristi specijalizirane stanične strojeve za samoubojstvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a type of cell death in which the cell uses specialized cellular machinery to kill itself [apoptosis, programmed cell death]</p><p><b>grad u istočnom središnjem Wyomingu na rijeci North Platte (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city of east central Wyoming on the North Platte river</p><p><b>veliko slano jezero između Irana i Rusije koje hrani rijeka Volga. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large saltwater lake between Iran and Russia fed by the Volga River [Caspian Sea]</p><p><b>Kaspijsko more</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large saltwater lake between Iran and Russia fed by the Volga River [Caspian]</p><p><b>kaciga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (15-16th century) any armor for the head</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a light open casque without a visor or beaver [casquetel]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a light open casque without a visor or beaver [casquet]</p><p><b>Američki arhitekt koji je utjecao na razvoj nebodera (1859-1934) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States architect who influenced the development of the skyscraper (1859-1934) [Gilbert]</p><p><b>Kasandra</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) a prophetess in Troy during the Trojan War whose predictions were true but were never believed</p><p><b>aromatizator koji se proizvodi kuhanjem soka gorke manijave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a flavoring made by boiling down the juice of the bitter cassava</p><p><b>manioka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a starch made by leaching and drying the root of the cassava plant [cassava starch, manioc, manioca]</p><p><i>n.</i> cassava root eaten as a staple food after drying and leaching [manioc]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of several plants of the genus Manihot having fleshy roots yielding a nutritious starch [casava]</p><p><b>škrob koji se proizvodi izlijevanjem i sušenjem korijena biljke manijave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a starch made by leaching and drying the root of the cassava plant [cassava, manioc, manioca]</p><p><b>S druge strane, radi se o teleskopima za slikanje zraka, koji imaju paraboloidno primarno ogledalo i hiperboloidno sekundarno ogledalo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a reflecting telescope that has a paraboloidal primary mirror and a hyperboloidal secondary mirror [Gregorian telescope]</p><p><b>lonac, šerpa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> food cooked and served in a casserole</p><p><i>n.</i> large deep dish in which food can be cooked and served</p><p><b>kaseta, magnetske kasete</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a container that holds a magnetic tape used for recording or playing sound or video</p><p><b>kazetofon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tape deck for playing and recording cassette tapes</p><p><b>Električna oprema za reprodukciju kaseta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electronic equipment for playing cassettes</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije ne veći od 50 kVA (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a recorder for recording or playing cassettes</p><p><b>kasetna vrpca, magnetna vrpca za pohranu signala</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cassette that contains magnetic tape</p><p><b>bilo koje od različitih stabala ili grmova roda Cassia s čipčanim složenim listovima i obično žutim cvijećem s dugim kvržicama sjemenki, neke vrste rodova Cassia često klasifikirane kao članovi rodova Senna ili Chamaecrista, Kinesko drvo s aromatičnom kore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various trees or shrubs of the genus Cassia having pinnately compound leaves and usually yellow flowers followed by long seedpods</p><p><i>n.</i> some genus Cassia species often classified as members of the genus Senna or genus Chamaecrista [genus Cassia]</p><p><i>n.</i> Chinese tree with aromatic bark [Cinnamomum cassia, cassia-bark tree]</p><p><b>Blizanj s cvetnim cvetovima od crvenokakvog žuta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect shrub having racemes of tawny yellow flowers [Alexandria senna, Alexandrian senna, Cassia augustifolia, Indian senna, Senna alexandrina, tinnevelly senna, true senna]</p><p><b>tropski grm (posebno iz Amerike) s žutim cvijećem i velikim lišćama čiji se sok koristi kao lijek za krpelje i otrovne ugrizove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical shrub (especially of Americas) having yellow flowers and large leaves whose juice is used as a cure for ringworm and poisonous bites [Senna alata, ringworm bush, ringworm cassia, ringworm shrub]</p><p><b>Blizanj s cvetnim cvetovima od crvenokakvog žuta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect shrub having racemes of tawny yellow flowers [Alexandria senna, Alexandrian senna, Cassia acutifolia, Indian senna, Senna alexandrina, tinnevelly senna, true senna]</p><p><b>Zeleni indijski grm s žutim cvijećem čija se kore koriste za sunčanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> evergreen Indian shrub with vivid yellow flowers whose bark is used in tanning [Senna auriculata, avaram, tanner's cassia]</p><p><b>aromatska kora drveta kasia-bark (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic bark of the cassia-bark tree [Chinese cinnamon]</p><p><b>tropska američka biljka s letcima osjetljivim na dodir (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American plant having leaflets somewhat sensitive to the touch [Chamaecrista fasciculata, partridge pea, sensitive pea, wild sensitive plant]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous or semi-evergreen tree having scented sepia to yellow flowers in drooping racemes and pods whose pulp is used medicinally [canafistola, canafistula, drumstick tree, golden shower tree, pudding pipe tree, purging cassia]</p><p><b>tropsko američko poluvjeklo stablo s uspravnim cvjetovima ružičaste ili ružičaste boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American semi-evergreen tree having erect racemes of pink or rose-colored flowers [horse cassia, pink shower, pink shower tree]</p><p><b>ljeplovita ukrasna hibrida iz jugoistočne Azije i Havaja s rasemicama cvijeća u boji od kreme do narandžaste i crvene boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous ornamental hybrid of southeastern Asia and Hawaii having racemes of flowers ranging in color from cream-colored to orange and red [rainbow shower]</p><p><b>Istočnoindijsko stablo koje ima duge čunje koje sadrže crnu katartičnu pulpu koja se koristi kao lijek za konje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> East Indian tree having long pods containing a black cathartic pulp used as a horse medicine [Cassia roxburghii, horse cassia]</p><p><b>Sjevera američka višegodišnja biljka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American perennial herb [Senna marilandica, wild senna]</p><p><b>vrlo listovit loš smrad tropski korovnjak čija se sjemena koriste kao dodatak kavi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> very leafy malodorous tropical weedy shrub whose seeds have been used as an adulterant for coffee [Senna occidentalis, coffee senna, mogdad coffee, stinking