ualnim funkcijama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychoanalysis) anxiety resulting from real or imagined threats to your sexual functions</p><p><b>Muški pjevač koji je kastriran prije puberteta i zadržava sopran ili alt glas (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a male singer who was castrated before puberty and retains a soprano or alto voice</p><p><b>luka na otoku Svete Lucije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a port on the island of Saint Lucia</p><p><b>Kubanski socijalistički vođa koji je 1959. svrgao diktatora i uspostavio marksističku socijalističku državu na Kubi (rođen 1927.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Cuban socialist leader who overthrew a dictator in 1959 and established a Marxist socialist state in Cuba (born in 1927) [Fidel Castro, Fidel Castro Ruz]</p><p><b>oblik komunizma razvijen na Kubi od strane Fidela Castra. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of communism developed in Cuba by Fidel Castro</p><p><b>ležeran, nemaran, povremen, slučajan, sportski, usputan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by blithe unconcern [insouciant, nonchalant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> without or seeming to be without plan or method</p><p><i>adj.</i> appropriate for ordinary or routine occasions [daily, everyday]</p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring or appearing or singled out by chance [chance]</p><p><i>adj.</i> hasty and without attention to detail [cursory, passing, perfunctory, superficial]</p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring on a temporary or irregular basis [occasional]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by a feeling of irresponsibility [fooling]</p><p><i>adj.</i> natural and unstudied [free-and-easy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not showing effort or strain [effortless]</p><p><b>ležerno, prigodno, slučajno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> not methodically or according to plan</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an unconcerned manner [nonchalantly]</p><p><b>ležernost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a casual manner [familiarity]</p><p><b>nesretan slučaj, nezgoda, oštećenje, žrtva, stradalnik, postradali</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone injured or killed or captured or missing in a military