xtending out into an auditorium</p><p><i>n.</i> narrow pathway high in the air (as above a stage or between parts of a building or along a bridge)</p><p><b>Veliki region između Crnog i Kaspijskog mora koji sadrži planine Kavkaz (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large region between the Black and Caspian seas that contains the Caucasus Mountains [Caucasus]</p><p><b>stanovnik Kavkaza, Kavkažanin, kavkaski, bijelac, pripadnik bijelačke rase, Kavkazac, arijevac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Caucasian [White, White person]</p><p><i>n.</i> a number of languages spoken in the Caucasus that are unrelated to languages spoken elsewhere [Caucasian language]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the geographical region of Caucasia [Caucasic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Caucasian people [Caucasoid]</p><p><b>brojni jezici koji se govore na Kavkazu koji nisu povezani s jezicima koji se govore na drugim mjestima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a number of languages spoken in the Caucasus that are unrelated to languages spoken elsewhere [Caucasian]</p><p><b>srednjo veličine, kaukasijsko veliko-zelenjeno stablo koje se razlikuje od drugih orašastih stabala svojim krilatim plodovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medium-sized Caucasian much-branched tree distinguished from other walnut trees by its winged fruit [Pterocarya fraxinifolia]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s zemljopisnim područjem Kavkaza (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the geographical region of Caucasia [Caucasian]</p><p><b>bijelac</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Caucasian people [Caucasian]</p><p><b>Kavkaz</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the mountain range in Caucasia between the Black Sea and the Caspian Sea that forms part of the traditional border between Europe and Asia [Caucasus Mountains]</p><p><i>n.</i> a large region between the Black and Caspian seas that contains the Caucasus Mountains [Caucasia]</p><p><b>Kavkaz</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the mountain range in Caucasia between the Black Sea and the Caspian Sea that forms part of the traditional border between Europe and Asia [Caucasus]</p><p><b>vijeće</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a closed political meeting</p><p><i>v.</i> meet to select a candidate or promote a policy</p><p><b>reproduktivne kemikalije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any taillike structure</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 85% ili više, ali ne više od 50%, nalik repu., S obzirom na to da je to samo jedan od glavnih oblika, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, to znači da se ne primjenjuje samo na proizvodnju proizvoda koji sadrže:, prema stražnjem kraju tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> constituting or relating to a tail</p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling a tail [taillike]</p><p><i>adj.</i> situated in or directed toward the part of the body from which the tail arises</p><p><i>adv.</i> toward the posterior end of the body [caudally]</p><p><b>Regionalna anestezija koja je rezultat ubrizgavanja anestetika u kaudalni kraj kralježničnog kanala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> regional anesthesia resulting from injection of an anesthetic into the caudal end of the spinal canal [caudal anesthesia, caudal block]</p><p><b>Regionalna anestezija koja je rezultat ubrizgavanja anestetika u kaudalni kraj kralježničnog kanala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> regional anesthesia resulting from injection of an anesthetic into the caudal end of the spinal canal [caudal anaesthesia, caudal block]</p><p><b>rep posebno sisavaca stražnji na i iznad anusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tail especially of a mammal posterior to and above the anus</p><p><b>Regionalna anestezija koja je rezultat ubrizgavanja anestetika u kaudalni kraj kralježničnog kanala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> regional anesthesia resulting from injection of an anesthetic into the caudal end of the spinal canal [caudal anaesthesia, caudal anesthesia]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je proizvod namijenjen za proizvodnju proizvoda koji sadrže: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the tail of fishes and some other aquatic vertebrates [tail fin]</p><p><b>jedan od 4 kralježnika u ljudskom koksixu (MT)</b><