oot, papooseroot, squaw root, squawroot]</p><p><b>slučaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a comprehensive term for any proceeding in a court of law whereby an individual seeks a legal remedy [case, cause, lawsuit, suit]</p><p><b>kauzalni, uzročni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> involving or constituting a cause</p><p><b>uzrok, uzročnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any entity that produces an effect or is responsible for events or results [causal agent, cause]</p><p><b>uzrok, uzročnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any entity that produces an effect or is responsible for events or results [causal agency, cause]</p><p><b>odrednica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a determining or causal element or factor [determinant, determinative, determiner, determining factor]</p><p><b>Žar u udovima duž perifernog živca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a burning pain in a limb along the course of a peripheral nerve</p><p><b>kauzalnost, uzročnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relation between causes and effects</p><p><b>kauzalni, uzročni (od &quot;causal&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a causal fashion</p><p><b>prouzrokovanost, kauzalitet, kauzalnost, uzrokovanje, uzročnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of causing something to happen [causing]</p><p><b>uzročan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> producing an effect</p><p><b>izazivati, izazvati, parnica, poteći, povod, prouzročiti, prouzrokovati, razlog, stvar, stvoriti, uzročnik, uzročnost štete, uzrok, uzrokovati, uzrokuju, kampanja, pohod, pokret, slučaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> events that provide the generative force that is the origin of something</p><p><i>n.</i> a justification for something existing or happening [grounds, reason]</p><p><i>n.</i> a series of actions advancing a principle or tending toward a particular end [campaign, crusade, drive, effort, movement]</p><p><i>n.</i> any entity that produces an effect or is responsible for events or results [causal agency, causal agent]</p><p><i>n.</i> a comprehensive term for any proceeding in a court of law whereby an individual seeks a legal remedy [case, causa, 