urn, cauterise]</p><p><i>v.</i> make insensitive or callous [callous, cauterise]</p><p><b>Instrument ili tvar koja se koristi za uništavanje tkiva iz medicinskih razloga (npr. uklanjanje bradavice) spaljivanjem ga vrućim željezom ili električnom strujom ili kaustičnom ili smrzavanjem., u slučaju da se u slučaju izloženosti na temelju ovog članka primjenjuje druga metoda, to je: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instrument or substance used to destroy tissue for medical reasons (eg removal of a wart) by burning it with a hot iron or an electric current or a caustic or by freezing it [cauterant]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of coagulating blood and destroying tissue with a hot iron or caustic agent or by freezing [cauterisation, cauterization]</p><p><b>obazrivost, opomena, opomenuti, oprez, opreznost, pažljivost, pažnja, upozorenje, upozoriti, oprez!, predostrožnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being cautious [carefulness, cautiousness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a warning against certain acts [caveat]</p><p><i>n.</i> judiciousness in avoiding harm or danger [care, forethought, precaution]</p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being circumspect and prudent [circumspection]</p><p><i>v.</i> warn strongly [admonish, monish]</p><p><b>odbijanje, da opominje, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> warding off [prophylactic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to warn [admonitory, exemplary, monitory, warning]</p><p><b>obazriv, oprezan, pažljiv</b></p><p><i>n.</i> people who are fearful and cautious [timid]</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing careful forethought</p><p><i>adj.</i> avoiding excess [conservative]</p><p><b>izjavu koju je podnio s pažljivim kvalifikacijama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a statement made with careful qualifications</p><p><b>oprezno, suzdržano</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> as if with kid gloves [carefully]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a conservative manner [conservatively, guardedly]</p><p><b>opreznost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being cautious [carefulness, caution]</p><p><b>kavalkada, konjička parada</b></p><p><i>n.</i> 