cavern]</p><p><b>dubok, golem, kavernozan, prostran, pun spilja, rupičav, špiljast, šupalj, šupljikav, upao</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being or suggesting a cavern</p><p><i>adj.</i> filled with vascular sinuses and capable of becoming distended and rigid as the result of being filled with blood [erectile]</p><p><b>ili jednog od par velikih venskih sinusa u lubanju lubanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of a pair of large venous sinuses in the cranial cavity [sinus cavernosus]</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenim dijelom od 8 mm ili više, ali ne više od 8 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a concave molding shaped like a quarter circle in cross section</p><p><b>rod Cavia, rod zamoraca, zamorci</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Caviidae: guinea pigs [genus Cavia]</p><p><b>čvrsta, gotovo bez repa, domaća ptica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stout-bodied nearly tailless domesticated cavy [guinea pig]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> South American cavy [aperea, wild cavy]</p><p><b>ikra (riblja), kavijar, riblja ikra, ikra</b></p><p><i>n.</i> salted roe of sturgeon or other large fish [caviare]</p><p><b>Slanjeni jajci jesterca ili drugih velikih riba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> salted roe of sturgeon or other large fish [caviar]</p><p><b>porodica Caviidae, porodica zamoraca, zamorci</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of Hystricomorpha [family Caviidae]</p><p><b>cjepidlačenje, cjepidlačiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an evasion of the point of an argument by raising irrelevant distinctions or objections [quibble, quiddity]</p><p><i>v.</i> raise trivial objections [carp, chicane]</p><p><b>cjepidlačenje, cjepidlačiti (od &quot;cavil&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disputant who quibbles [caviller, pettifogger, quibbler]</p><p><b>zanovijatalac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disputant who quibbles [caviler, pettifogger, quibbler]</p><p><b>duplja, proširenje, rezonantna šupljina, rezonator, špilja, šupljina, udubljenje (od &quot;cavity&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pitted with cell-like cavities (as a honey