od 10 kg (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> recording equipment for making compact disks [compact-disk burner]</p><p><b>uređaj na računalu u koji se stavlja CD</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drive that reads a compact disc and that is connected to an audio system</p><p><b>CD uređaj za reprodukciju, čitač CD, čitač diskova CD</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stand-alone piece of electronic equipment that either has its own display or attaches to a television set</p><p><b>kompaktni disk na koji možete pisati samo jednom i nakon toga je samo za čitanje memorije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compact disc on which you can write only once and thereafter is read-only memory [CD-WO, compact disc recordable, compact disc write-once]</p><p><b>CD-ROM, kompaktni disk- memorija za iščitavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compact disk that is used with a computer (rather than with an audio system) [compact disc read-only memory]</p><p><b>CD-ROM uređaj, CD-ROM uređaj (za reprodukciju)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drive that is connected to a computer and on which a CD-ROM can be `played'</p><p><b>kompaktni disk na koji možete pisati samo jednom i nakon toga je samo za čitanje memorije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compact disc on which you can write only once and thereafter is read-only memory [CD-R, compact disc recordable, compact disc write-once]</p><p><b>glikoprotein koji se uglavnom nalazi na površini pomoćnih T stanica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a glycoprotein that is found primarily on the surface of helper T cells [cluster of differentiation 4]</p><p><b>T-ćelija s CD4 receptorom koja prepoznaje antigene na površini zaražene stanice i luči limfokine koji stimuliraju B-ćelije i ubice T-ćelije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> T cell with CD4 receptor that recognizes antigens on the surface of a virus-infected cell and secretes lymphokines that stimulate B cells and killer T cells [CD4 T cell, helper T cell, helper cell]</p><p><b>T-ćelija s CD4 receptorom koja prepoznaje antigene na površini zaražene stanice i luči limfokine koji stimu