mmunal living [cenobitical, coenobitic, coenobitical]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s cenobitima ili njihovim običajima zajedničkog života ili im odgovaraju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or befitting cenobites or their practices of communal living [cenobitic, coenobitic, coenobitical]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u embrionalnom razvoju ne pojavljuju znakovi ili struktura koji nisu prisutni u ranijoj evolucijskoj povijesti soja ili vrste (kao što je dodavanje posteljice u evoluciji sisavaca), (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> introduction during embryonic development of characters or structure not present in the earlier evolutionary history of the strain or species (such as the addition of the placenta in mammalian evolution) [caenogenesis, cainogenesis, kainogenesis, kenogenesis]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s cenogenezom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to cenogenesis</p><p><b>spomenik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a monument built to honor people whose remains are interred elsewhere or whose remains cannot be recovered [empty tomb]</p><p><b>kenozoik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> approximately the last 63 million years [Age of Mammals, Cenozoic era]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or denoting the Cenozoic era</p><p><b>kenozoik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> approximately the last 63 million years [Age of Mammals, Cenozoic]</p><p><b>kaditi</b></p><p><i>v.</i> perfume especially with a censer [incense, thurify]</p><p><b>kadilo, kadionica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a container for burning incense (especially one that is swung on a chain in a religious ritual) [thurible]</p><p><b>cenzor, cenzurirati, sudac, izopćiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who censures or condemns</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is authorized to read publications or correspondence or to watch theatrical performances and suppress in whole or in part anything considered obscene or politically unacceptable</p><p><i>v.</i> forbid the public distribution of ( a movie or a newspaper) [ban]</p><p><i>v.</i> subject to political, religious, or m