ary]</p><p><b>država u zapadnom središnjem dijelu Sjedinjenih Država u Skalnim planinama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state in west central United States in the Rocky Mountains [CO, Colo., Colorado]</p><p><b>stogodišnji (od &quot;centennial&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> every hundred years</p><p><b>centar, centrirati, centru, sjedište, sredina, sredini, središte, šiljak, vrh, bit, esencija, jezgra, srž, suština, središte pozornosti, fokusirati se, koncentrirati se, usredotočiti se, usredotočivati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an area that is approximately central within some larger region [centre, eye, heart, middle]</p><p><i>n.</i> the piece of ground in the outfield directly ahead of the catcher [center field, centerfield]</p><p><i>n.</i> a building dedicated to a particular activity [centre]</p><p><i>n.</i> a point equidistant from the ends of a line or the extremities of a figure [centre, midpoint]</p><p><i>n.</i> the choicest or most essential or most vital part of some idea or experience [centre, core, essence, gist, heart, heart and soul, inwardness, kernel, marrow, meat, nitty-gritty, nub, pith, substance, sum]</p><p><i>n.</i> the object upon which interest and attention focuses [center of attention, centre, centre of attention]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cluster of nerve cells governing a specific bodily process [centre, nerve center, nerve centre]</p><p><i>n.</i> the middle of a military or naval formation</p><p><i>n.</i> (basketball) the person who plays center on a basketball team</p><p><i>n.</i> (football) the person who plays center on the line of scrimmage and snaps the ball to the quarterback [snapper]</p><p><i>n.</i> a place where some particular activity is concentrated [centre]</p><p><i>n.</i> politically moderate persons</p><p><i>n.</i> (ice hockey) the person who plays center on a hockey team</p><p><i>n.</i> the sweet central portion of a piece of candy that is enclosed in chocolate or some other covering [centre]</p><p><i>n.</i> mercantile establishment consisting of a carefully landscaped complex of shops representing leading merchandisers [mall, plaza, shopping center, shopping centre, shopping mall]</p><p><i>n.</i> the position on a hockey team of the player who participates in the face off at the beginning of the game</p><p><i>n.</i> (American football) the position of the player on the line of scrimmage who puts the ball in play</p><p><i>n.</i> a position on a basketball team of the player who participates in the jump that starts the game</p><p><i>v.</i> center upon [center on, concentrate on, focus on, revolve about, revolve around]</p><p><i>v.</i> direct one's attention on something [centre, concentrate, focus, pore, rivet]</p><p><i>v.</i> move into the center [centre]</p><p><i>adj.</i> equally distant from the extremes [halfway, middle, midway]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or belonging to neither the right nor the left politically or intellectually</p><p><b>malo sa oštrim središnjem točkom za vodstvo i dva bočna rezača (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bit with a sharp center point for guidance and two side cutters [centre bit]</p><p><b>centar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the piece of ground in the outfield directly ahead of the catcher [center, centerfield]</p><p><i>n.</i> the fielding position of the player on a baseball team who is expected to field balls in the central third of the outfield [centerfield]</p><p><b>Osoba koja igra na središtu terena. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who plays center field [centerfielder]</p><p><b>federalna agencija u Ministarstvu zdravstva i socijalnih usluga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a federal agency in the Department of Health and Human Services [CDC]</p><p><b>simetrala, središnja crta, središnja linija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a line that bisects a plane figure [centerline]</p><p><b>središte, središte pozornosti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the object upon which interest and attention focuses [center, centre, centre of attention]</p><p><b>središte uzgona</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the center of mass of the im