im cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of chiefly tropical American vines of the family Leguminosae having trifoliate leaves and large flowers [genus Centrosema]</p><p><b>u obliku od šarene ili šarene vinske loze s velikim cvjetovima, s slabim prelazima ili s slabim prelazima, od New Jerseyja do tropskog istočnog dijelu Sjeverne Amerike, ponekad uzgajana zbog svojih ljubičastih i bijelih cvjetova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large-flowered weakly twining or prostrate vine of New Jersey to tropical eastern North America, sometimes cultivated for its purple and white flowers [butterfly pea]</p><p><b>središnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small region of cytoplasm adjacent to the nucleus [central body]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s centrosomom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a centrosome</p><p><b>korišten u bivšim sustavima klasifikacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used in former classification systems [group Centrospermae]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a symmetrical arrangement of radiating parts about a central point [radially symmetrical]</p><p><b>Glavno tijelo kralježnice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the main body of a vertebra</p><p><b>dvostruki rod iz obitelji Primulaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dicotyledonous genus of the family Primulaceae [genus Centunculus]</p><p><b>centurion</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (ancient Rome) the leader of 100 soldiers</p><p><b>stoljeće, stoljeća, stoljeću, vijek, stotina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a period of 100 years</p><p><i>n.</i> ten 10s [100, C, hundred, one C]</p><p><b>tropske američke biljke s bazalnim rozetama vlaknastih lišća u obliku mača i cvijeća u visokim šiljcima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American plants with basal rosettes of fibrous sword-shaped leaves and flowers in tall spikes [American aloe, agave]</p><p><b>glavni izvršni ravnatelj, glavni izvršni direktor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the corporate executive responsible for the operations of the firm [chief executive officer, chie