osporin</p><p><b>jedan od nekoliko antibiotičkih tvari širokog spektra dobivenih iz gljiva i povezanih s penicilinom (trgovinski nazivi Mefoxin) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of several broad spectrum antibiotic substances obtained from fungi and related to penicillin (trade names Mefoxin) [Mefoxin]</p><p><b>rod biljaka red Rosales (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of plants of order Rosales [family Cephalotaceae]</p><p><b>porodica Cephalotaxaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of Cephalotaxaceae [family Cephalotaxaceae, plum-yew family]</p><p><b>rod Cephalotaxus (vidjeti prune-yews) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the genus of Cephalotaxus (see plum-yews) [genus Cephalotaxus]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili većim od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a semisynthetic analogue of cephalosporin</p><p><b>jedna vrsta: australska biljka za vrč (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one species: Australian pitcher plant [genus Cephalotus]</p><p><b>biljka koja ima zelenu vrč i čep s šarenama i s crvenim rubovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a carnivorous perennial herb having a green pitcher and hinged lid both with red edges [Australian pitcher plant]</p><p><b>(grčka mitologija) kralj Etiopije i muž Kasiopeje, slaba sazvežđe na sjevernoj hemisferi u blizini Kassiopeje i polne zvijezde. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) king of Ethiopia and husband of Cassiopeia</p><p><i>n.</i> a faint constellation in the northern hemisphere near Cassiopeia and the pole star</p><p><b>rod ptica uključujući: guillemots (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of birds including: guillemots [genus Cepphus]</p><p><b>Sjevernopacifički guillemot (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> northern Pacific guillemot [pigeon guillemot]</p><p><b>Emocionalni odgovor koji je stečen uvjetovanjem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an emotional response that has been acquired by conditioning [conditioned emotion, conditioned emotional response]</p><p><b>strizibube</b></p><p><i>n.</i> long-horned beetles [family Cerambycidae]</p><p><b>keramički, kera