em (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large edible mackerel of temperate United States coastal Atlantic waters [Scomberomorus regalis, kingfish, pintado]</p><p><i>n.</i> large mackerel with long pointed snout [Scomberomorus cavalla, cavalla, king mackerel]</p><p><b>bijela čvrsta masna kiselina koja se nalazi u vosku (kao što je pčelinji vosak) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white solid fatty acid found in waxes (such as beeswax) [hexacosanoic acid]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s ili sadrže cerium s valentnošću 3 (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or containing cerium with valence 3</p><p><b>Vokasna palma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wax palms [genus Ceroxylon]</p><p><b>palma iz Anda koja daje smolavi vosak koji je pomiješan s masnoća za pravljenje svijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> palm of the Andes yielding a resinous wax which is mixed with tallow to make candles [Ceroxylon andicola, wax palm]</p><p><b>palma iz Anda koja daje smolavi vosak koji je pomiješan s masnoća za pravljenje svijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> palm of the Andes yielding a resinous wax which is mixed with tallow to make candles [Ceroxylon alpinum, wax palm]</p><p><b>apsolutna sigurnoća. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an absolute certainty</p><p><b>eventualan, eventualna, izvjestan, jamačan, kakav, nedvojben, neke, neki, nekih, nesumnjiv, određen, određene, određenim, određenoj, pojedini, pojedinih, pojedinim, pouzdan, siguran, stanoviti, stanovitog, uvjeren</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> definite but not specified or identified</p><p><i>adj.</i> having or feeling no doubt or uncertainty [sure]</p><p><i>adj.</i> established beyond doubt or question</p><p><i>adj.</i> certain to occur [sure]</p><p><i>adj.</i> established irrevocably [sealed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> reliable in operation or effect [sure]</p><p><i>adj.</i> exercising or taking care great enough to bring assurance [sure]</p><p><b>dakako, doista, izvjesno, jamačno, kako da ne, naravno, nesumnjivo, sigurno, svakako, zacijelo, zasigurno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> definitely or positively (`sure' is sometimes used informally for `surely') [for certain, for sure, sure, sure as shooting, sure enough, surely]</p><p><b>izvjesnost, jamačno, sigurnost, točnost, nedvojbenost, pouzdanost, sigurna stvar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being certain</p><p><i>n.</i> something that is certain [foregone conclusion, sure thing]</p><p><b>tip rod Certhiidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Certhiidae [genus Certhia]</p><p><b>Obični puzač u Sjevernoj Americi sa zakrivljenim kljunom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a common creeper in North America with a down-curved bill [American creeper, brown creeper]</p><p><b>Europski šumarić s zakrivljenim kljunom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common European brown-and-buff tree creeper with down-curved bill [European creeper]</p><p><b>uši (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> creepers [family Certhiidae]</p><p><b>koji se može provjeriti</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> fit to be certified as insane (and treated accordingly) [certified]</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being guaranteed or certified</p><p><b>atest, certifikat, diploma, izvod, potvrda, svjedočanstvo, svjedodžba, uvjerenje, vjerodajnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a document attesting to the truth of certain stated facts [certification, credential, credentials]</p><p><i>n.</i> a formal declaration that documents a fact of relevance to finance and investment [security]</p><p><i>v.</i> present someone with a certificate</p><p><i>v.</i> authorize by certificate</p><p><b>potvrda o depozitu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a debt instrument issued by a bank [CD]</p><p><b>potvrda o registriranju, potvrda o upisu u trgovački registar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> state approval of the articles of incorporation of a corporation</p><p><b>pisano obećanje da će vratiti dug (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a written promise to repay a debt [debt instrument, obligation]</p><p><b>kvalificiran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> furnished with or authorized by a certificate: "certificated teachers"</p><p><b>atestiranje, certificiranja, certificiranje, certificiranjem, certifikacija, fitoplazmoze šumskog drveća, homologacija, ovjera, ovlašćivanje, posvjedočenje, certifikat, potvrda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of certifying or bestowing a franchise on [enfranchisement]</p><p><i>n.</i> confirmation that some fact or statement is true through the use of documentary evidence [corroboration, documentation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a document attesting to the truth of certain stated facts [certificate, credential, credentials]</p><p><i>n.</i> validating the authenticity of something or someone [authentication]</p><p><b>Služenje za ovjerenje ili potvrdu na autoritativnom nivou (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to certify or endorse authoritatively</p><p><b>certificiran, diplomiran, koji ima svjedodžbu, ovjeren, ovjereni, ovlašćen, ovlašten, potvrđen, preporučen, službeni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> endorsed authoritatively as having met certain requirements</p><p><i>adj.</i> fit to be certified as insane (and treated accordingly) [certifiable]</p><p><i>adj.</i> holding appropriate documentation and officially on record as qualified to perform a specified function or practice a specified skill [qualified]</p><p><b>Ček koji sadrži potvrdu da osoba koja je izdao ček ima dovoljno sredstava na depozitu za pokrivanje plaćanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a check containing certification that the person who issued the check has sufficient funds on deposit to cover payment [certified cheque]</p><p><b>Ček koji sadrži potvrdu da osoba koja je izdao ček ima dovoljno sredstava na depozitu za pokrivanje plaćanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a check containing certification that the person who issued the check has sufficient funds on deposit to cover payment [certified check]</p><p><b>Mlijeko iz mliječnih tvornica koje je regulisano od strane ovlaštene medicinske mliječne komisije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> milk from dairies regulated by an authorized medical milk commission</p><p><b>U slučaju da je osoba koja je primjenjuje ovaj standard u državnoj upra