wax]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na ili izlučuju cerumen (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or secreting cerumen</p><p><b>otrovni bijeli pigment koji sadrži olovo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a poisonous white pigment that contains lead [lead carbonate, white lead]</p><p><b>bijela olovna ruda, cerusit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mineral consisting of lead carbonate that is an important source of lead [white lead ore]</p><p><b>Španjolski pisac poznat po Don Quijoteu koji satirizira viteštvo i utjecao na razvoj romana (1547-1616) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Spanish writer best remembered for `Don Quixote' which satirizes chivalry and influenced the development of the novel form (1547-1616) [Cervantes Saavedra, Miguel de Cervantes, Miguel de Cervantes Saavedra]</p><p><b>Španjolski pisac poznat po Don Quijoteu koji satirizira viteštvo i utjecao na razvoj romana (1547-1616) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Spanish writer best remembered for `Don Quixote' which satirizes chivalry and influenced the development of the novel form (1547-1616) [Cervantes, Miguel de Cervantes, Miguel de Cervantes Saavedra]</p><p><b>zatiljni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the cervix of the uterus</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or associated with the neck</p><p><b>arterija koja opskrbljuje mišiće vrata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that supplies the muscles of the neck [areteria cervicalis]</p><p><b>kanal u obliku vretena koji se proteže od maternice do vagine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a spindle-shaped canal extending from the uterus to the vagina [canalis cervicis uteri]</p><p><b>kontracepcijski uređaj koji se sastoji od male čaše u obliku prsta koja se stavlja preko grlića maternice kako bi se spriječio ulazak sperme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a contraceptive device consisting of a small thimble-shaped cup that is placed over the uterine cervix to prevent the entrance of spermatozoa</p><p><b>abnormalno stanje koje je posljedica kompresije korijena kralježnice u području vrata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an 