ćom od 300 g/m2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rice and chicken cooked together with or without other ingredients and variously seasoned</p><p><b>abnormalna izbočina prsne kosti uzrokovana rahitisom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormal protrusion of the breastbone caused by rickets [pigeon breast]</p><p><b>Hrana od piletine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stock made with chicken [chicken stock]</p><p><b>piletina sa pomidorom, gljivicama i biljkama u talijanskom stilu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chicken casserole prepared with tomatoes and mushrooms and herbs in the Italian style [chicken cacciatore, hunter's chicken]</p><p><b>piletina sa pomidorom, gljivicama i biljkama u talijanskom stilu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chicken casserole prepared with tomatoes and mushrooms and herbs in the Italian style [chicken cacciatora, hunter's chicken]</p><p><b>piletina kuhana i poslužena u pecivu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chicken cooked and served in a casserole</p><p><b>kokošarnik, kokošinjac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a farm building for housing poultry [coop, hencoop, henhouse]</p><p><b>tanke kriške piletine punjene sirom i šunkom i zatim sauteirane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thin slices of chicken stuffed with cheese and ham and then sauteed</p><p><b>donji zglob noge piletine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the lower joint of the leg of a chicken [chicken leg]</p><p><b>peradarstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> farm where chickens are raised for sale</p><p><b>mačji kašalj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dry mash for poultry [scratch]</p><p><i>n.</i> an amphetamine derivative (trade name Methedrine) used in the form of a crystalline hydrochloride [Methedrine, chalk, crank, deoxyephedrine, glass, ice, meth, methamphetamine, methamphetamine hydrochloride, shabu, trash]</p><p><b>Netehnički naziv za sve sokola za koje se kaže da pljačkaju peradi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nontechnical term for any hawks said to prey on poultry [hen hawk]</p><p><b>Uređene pileće repice okružene maslacem (koji je začinjen biljkama) i zatim prekrivene mrvica