ece has been chopped or broken off of something [check]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small disk-shaped counter used to represent money when gambling [poker chip]</p><p><i>n.</i> electronic equipment consisting of a small crystal of a silicon semiconductor fabricated to carry out a number of electronic functions in an integrated circuit [micro chip, microchip, microprocessor chip, silicon chip]</p><p><i>n.</i> (golf) a low running approach shot [chip shot]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of chipping something [chipping, splintering]</p><p><i>v.</i> break off (a piece from a whole) [break away, break off, chip off, come off]</p><p><i>v.</i> cut a nick into [nick]</p><p><i>v.</i> play a chip shot</p><p><i>v.</i> form by chipping</p><p><i>v.</i> break a small piece off from [break off, cut off, knap]</p><p><b>djeljati, dupsti, gravirati, isklesati, klesati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> engrave or cut by chipping away at a surface [carve]</p><p><b>uklanjati ili se postupno povlačiti: "Ovi novi običaji smanjuju kvalitetu života" (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove or withdraw gradually: "These new customs are chipping away at the quality of life" [chip away at]</p><p><b>uklanjati ili se postupno povlačiti: "Ovi novi običaji smanjuju kvalitetu života" (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove or withdraw gradually: "These new customs are chipping away at the quality of life" [chip away]</p><p><b>doprinijeti, doprinositi, kontribuirati, pridonijeti, pridonositi, prilagati, priložiti, sudjelovati, ulagati, uložiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> contribute to some cause [contribute, give, kick in]</p><p><b>krnjiti, odlamati, odlomiti, okrhnuti, okrnjiti, otkrhnuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> break off (a piece from a whole) [break away, break off, chip, come off]</p><p><b>(golf) nisko trčanje pristup pucao (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (golf) a low running approach shot [chip]</p><p><b>iverica, ploča iverica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cheap hard material made from wood chips that are pressed together and bound with synthetic resin [hardboard]</p>