 to Christians at birth or christening [baptismal name]</p><p><b>kršćanstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a monotheistic system of beliefs and practices based on the Old Testament and the teachings of Jesus as embodied in the New Testament and emphasizing the role of Jesus as savior [Christianity]</p><p><b>Njemački kemičar koji je otkrio ozone i razvio vatreni pamuk kao gorivo u vatrenom oružju (1799-1868) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German chemist who discovered ozone and developed guncotton as a propellant in firearms (1799-1868) [Christian Friedrich Schonbein, Schonbein]</p><p><b>Protestantska denominacija koju je 1866. osnovala Mary Baker Eddy., religijski sustav zasnovan na učenjima Mary Baker Eddy naglašavajući duhovno iscjeljivanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Protestant denomination founded by Mary Baker Eddy in 1866 [Church of Christ Scientist]</p><p><i>n.</i> religious system based on teachings of Mary Baker Eddy emphasizing spiritual healing</p><p><b>član protestantske crkve koju je u Sjedinjenim Državama osnovala Mary Baker Eddy. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Protestant church founded in the United States by Mary Baker Eddy</p><p><b>učenja kršćanskih crkava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the teachings of Christian churches</p><p><b>godina u crkvenom kalendaru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the year in the ecclesiastical calendar [church year]</p><p><b>Glavni i najveći grad Norveške (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital and largest city of Norway [Oslo, capital of Norway]</p><p><b>preobraćaj u kršćanstvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> conversion to Christianity [Christianization]</p><p><b>preobrati se u kršćanstvo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> convert to Christianity [Christianize]</p><p><b>kršćanstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a monotheistic system of beliefs and practices based on the Old Testament and the teachings of Jesus as embodied in the New Testament and emphasizing the role of Jesus as savior [Christian religion]</p><p><i>n.</i> the collective body of Christians throughout the world and history (found predominantly in Europe and the Americas and Australia) [Christendom]</p><p><b>preobraćaj u kršćanstvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> conversion to Christianity [Christianisation]</p><p><b>Prilagoditi se u ime kršćanstva., preobrati se u kršćanstvo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> adapt in the name of Christianity</p><p><i>v.</i> convert to Christianity [Christianise]</p><p><b>kršćanin, kršćanski, kršćanska, kršćanske, hrišćanski (od &quot;christian&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> becoming to or like a Christian</p><p><b>Agatha Christie</b></p><p><i>n.</i> prolific English writer of detective stories (1890-1976) [Agatha Christie, Dame Agatha Mary Clarissa Christie]</p><p><b>Chris Evert</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States tennis player who won women's singles titles in the United States and at Wimbledon (born in 1954) [Chris Evert, Chrissie Evert, Evert]</p><p><b>Ne vjeruje u Krista. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not believing in Christ [nonchristian]</p><p><b>sličan ili pokaziva duh Kristov (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling or showing the spirit of Christ [christly]</p><p><b>Krist (od &quot;christ&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling or showing the spirit of Christ [christlike]</p><p><b>Badnjak, Božić, Božićna</b></p><p><i>n.</i> period extending from Dec. 24 to Jan. 6 [Christmastide, Christmastime, Noel, Yule, Yuletide]</p><p><i>n.</i> a Christian holiday celebrating the birth of Christ [Christmas Day, Dec 25, Xmas]</p><p><b>hibridna zimskocvjetna begonija koja se uzgaja zbog svojih mnogih velikih ružičastih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hybrid winter-blooming begonia grown for its many large pink flowers [Begonia cheimantha, blooming-fool begonia]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko biljaka rodova Blandfordia s velikim narandžastim ili crvenokrasnim cvijećima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several plants of the genus Blandfordia having large orange or crimson flowers</p><p><b>trnasti zimzeleni grm iz jugoistočne Sjedinjenih Država s širištima grana obično plavih ili ljubičastih cvijeća i crvenih bobica, U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za proizvodnju proizvoda iz kategorije "Korišćenje" u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, proizvođač proizvodi proizvode iz kategorije "Korišćenje" u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spiny evergreen shrub of southeastern United States having spreading branches usually blue or mauve flowers and red berries [Christmasberry, Lycium carolinianum]</p><p><i>n.</i> ornamental evergreen treelike shrub of the Pacific coast of the United States having large white flowers and red berrylike fruits [Christmasberry, Heteromeles arbutifolia, Photinia arbutifolia, tollon, toyon]</p><p><b>dar koji se daje za Božić za usluge tijekom godine. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a present given at Christmas for services during the year</p><p><b>Australsko drvo ili grm s crvenim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Australian tree or shrub with red flowers [Ceratopetalum gummiferum, Christmas tree]</p><p><b>epifitni kaktus brazilskog podrijetla, široko uzgajan kao kućna biljka s spojenim ravnim segmentima i obično ružičastim cvijećem koje cvjeta zimi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> epiphytic cactus of Brazilian ancestry widely cultivated as a houseplant having jointed flat segments and usually rose-purple flowers that bloom in winter [Schlumbergera baridgesii, Schlumbergera buckleyi]</p><p><b>bogata voćna torta (obično prekrivena ledom i marcipanom) koja se jede za Božić (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rich fruitcake (usually covered with icing and marzipan) and eaten at Christmas</p><p><b>Kartica s Božićnim pozdravom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a card expressing a Christmas greeting</p><p><b>radostna vjerska pjesma proslavljajući rođenje Krista (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> joyful religious song celebrating the birth of Christ [carol]</p><p><b>kršćanski praznik koji slavi rođenje Krista. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Christian holiday celebrating the birth of Christ [Christmas, Dec 25, Xmas]</p><p><b>poremećaj zgrušavanja krvi sličan hemofiliji A ali uzrokovan urođenim nedostatkom faktora IX. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clotting disorder similar to hemophilia A but caused by a congenital deficiency of factor IX [haemophilia B, hemophilia B]</p><p><b>Badnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the day before Christmas [Dec 24]</p><p><b>Koagulacijski faktor čije odsustvo povezano je s hemofilijom B. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coagulation factor whose absence is associated with hemophilia B [factor IX]</p><p><b>Sjevernoamerički zimzeleni paprikac s pramenjenim lišćama i gustim grmovima lančastih listova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American evergreen fern having pinnate leaves and dense clusters of lance-shaped fronds [Polystichum acrostichoides, canker brake, dagger fern, evergreen wood fern]</p><p><b>tropska američka biljka s otrovnim mlijekom i najozbiljnijim suvištnim lištima obično crvenokrasnim laticama koje okružuju male žute cvijeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American plant having poisonous milk and showy tapering usually scarlet petallike leaves surrounding small yellow flowers [Christmas star, Euphorbia pulcherrima, Mexican flameleaf, lobster plant, painted leaf, poinsettia]</p><p><b>dar koji se daje za Božić. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a present given at Christmas time [Christmas present]</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko štapova koji imaju dugačke puzeće stabljike i uspravne grane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several club mosses having long creeping stems and erect branches [ground pine]</p><p><b>Ilex aquifolium, božikovina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an evergreen tree [American holly]</p><p><b>dar koji se daje za Božić. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a present given at Christmas time [Christmas gift]</p><p><b>bogat pareni ili kuhani puding koji liči na kolač. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rich steamed or boiled pudding that resembles cake [plum pudding]</p><p><b>Helleborus niger, crni kukurijek, crnoglavac, kukurijek božićnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European evergreen plant with white or purplish rose-like winter-blooming flowers [Helleborus niger, black hellebore, winter rose]</p><p><b>tropska američka biljka s otrovnim mlijekom i najozbiljnijim suvištnim lištima obično crvenokrasnim laticama koje okružuju male žute cvijeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American plant having poisonous milk and showy tapering usually scarlet petallike leaves surrounding small yellow flowers [Christmas flower, Euphorbia pulcherrima, Mexican flameleaf, lobster plant, painted leaf, poinsettia]</p><p><b>čarapa koja je puna malih božićnih darova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stocking that is filled with small Christmas presents</p><p><b>božićna jelka, božićno drvce, božićno drvo, Jela</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Australian tree or shrub with red flowers [Ceratopetalum gummiferum, Christmas bush]</p><p><i>n.</i> a terrestrial evergreen shrub or small tree of western Australia having brilliant yellow-orange flowers [Nuytsia floribunda, fire tree, flame tree]</p><p><i>n.</i> tall timber tree of central and southern Europe having a regular crown and grey bark [Abies alba, European silver fir]</p><p><i>n.</i> medium to tall fir of western North America having a conic crown and branches in tiers [Abies amabilis, Pacific silver fir, amabilis fir, red silver fir, white fir]</p><p><i>n.</i> an ornamented evergreen used as a Christmas decoration</p><p><b>trnasti zimzeleni grm iz jugoistočne Sjedinjenih Država s širištima grana obično plavih ili ljubičastih cvijeća i crvenih bobica, U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za proizvodnju proizvoda iz kategorije "Korišćenje" u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, proizvođač proizvodi proizvode iz kategorije "Korišćenje" u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spiny evergreen shrub of southeastern United States having spreading branches usually blue or mauve flowers and red berries [Christmas berry, Lycium carolinianum]</p><p><i>n.</i> ornamental evergreen treelike shrub of the Pacific coast of the United States having large white flowers and red berrylike fruits [Christmas berry, Heteromeles arbutifolia, Photinia arbutifolia, tollon, toyon]</p><p><b>Božić</b></p><p><i>n.</i> period extending from Dec. 24 to Jan. 6 [Christmas, Christmastime, Noel, Yule, Yuletide]</p><p><b>Božić</b></p><p><i>n.</i> period extending from Dec. 24 to Jan. 6 [Christmas, Christmastide, Noel, Yule, Yuletide]</p><p><b>Kristologije ili s njom povezane (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Christology</p><p><b>kristologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a religious doctrine or theory based on Jesus or Jesus' teachings</p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of theology concerned with the person and attributes and deeds of Christ</p><p><b>Njemački kompozitor više od 100 opera (1714-1787) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German composer of more than 100 operas (1714-1787) [Gluck]</p><p><b>Kršćanski mučenik i zaštitnik putnika (3. stoljeće) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Christian martyr and patron saint of travellers (3rd century) [Saint Christopher, St. Christopher]</p><p><b>Američki graničar koji je vodio Fremontove ekspedicije 1840-ih i služio kao general Unije u Američkom građanskom ratu (1809-1868) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States frontiersman who guided Fremont's expeditions in the 1840s and served as a Union general in the American Civil War (1809-1868) [Carson, Kit Carson]</p><p><b>Talijanski pomornik koji je otkrio Novi svijet u službi Španjolske dok je tražio put do Kine (1451-1506) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Italian navigator who discovered the New World in the service of Spain while looking for a route to China (1451-1506) [Columbus, Cristobal Colon, Cristoforo Colombo]</p><p><b>Engleski dramski pisac poznat po svojim komedijama (rođen 1907) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English dramatist noted for his comic verse dramas (born 1907) [Fry]</p><p><b>Američki pisac (rođen u Engleskoj) čiji su najpoznatiji romani prikazali Berlin 1930-ih i koji je surađivao s W. H. Audenom u pisanju pjesama (1904-1986) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer (born in England) whose best known novels portray Berlin in the 1930's and who collaborated with W. H. Auden in writing plays in verse (1904-1986) [Christopher William Bradshaw Isherwood, Isherwood]</p><p><b>Engleski pjesnik i dramaturg koji je uveo prazan stih kao oblik dramatičnog izražavanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English poet and playwright who introduced blank verse as a form of dramatic expression [Marlowe]</p><p><b>Američki pisac (rođen u Engleskoj) čiji su najpoznatiji romani prikazali Berlin 1930-ih i koji je surađivao s W. H. Audenom u pisanju pjesama (1904-1986) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer (born in England) whose best known novels portray Berlin in the 1930's and who collaborated with W. H. Auden in writing plays in verse (1904-1986) [Christopher Isherwood, Isherwood]</p><p><b>Hromatska čistoća: ne razblažava se bijelom bojom i stoga ima živu boju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chromatic purity: freedom from dilution with white and hence vivid in hue [intensity, saturation, vividness]</p><p><b>oblik sinestezije u kojoj ne-vizuelna stimulacija rezultira iskustvom osjetila boja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of synesthesia in which nonvisual stimulation results in the experience of color sensations [chromesthesia]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any salt or ester of chromic acid</p><p><b>kromatski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> able to refract light without spectral color separation</p><p><i>adj.</i> based on a scale consisting of 12 semitones</p><p><i>adj.</i> being or having or characterized by hue</p><p><b>optička aberacija u kojoj slika ima obojene rubove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an optical aberration in which the image has colored fringes</p><p><b>kromatska boja, spektralna boja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a color that has hue [chromatic colour, spectral color, spectral colour]</p><p><b>kromatska boja, spektralna boja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a color that has hue [chromatic color, spectral color, spectral colour]</p><p><b>12-notna skala uključujući sve polutone oktave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a 12-note scale including all the semitones of the octave</p><p><b>normalna sposobnost viđenja boja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the normal ability to see colors [color vision, trichromacy]</p><p><b>u pogledu boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with respect to color</p><p><b>nijansa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of a color as determined by its dominant wavelength [hue]</p><p><b>jedan od dva identična lanca u koja se hromozom dijeli tijekom mitoze (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of two identical strands into which a chromosome splits during mitosis</p><p><b>Sklonični materijal koji se može lako bojati u ćelijskom jezgru i koji se sastoji od DNK i RNK i različitih proteina. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the readily stainable substance of a cell nucleus consisting of DNA and RNA and various proteins [chromatin granule]</p><p><b>Sklonični materijal koji se može lako bojati u ćelijskom jezgru i koji se sastoji od DNK i RNK i različitih proteina. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the readily stainable substance of a cell nucleus consisting of DNA and RNA and various proteins [chromatin]</p><p><b>(od tvari ćelijske jezgre) lako obojene mrljama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of substance of a cell nucleus) readily colored by stains</p><p><b>halucinacije u pogledu obojenih svjetla, neuobičajeno pigmentaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hallucinatory perception of colored lights</p><p><i>n.</i> abnormal pigmentation</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka primjenjuje na proizvod, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, točka (b) ovog članka ne smije biti primjenjiva na proizvod koji je proizveden u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the recording (column or paper strip) on which the constituents of a mixture are adsorbed in chromatography</p><p><b>od ili povezane s kromatografijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to chromatography [chromatographical]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s kromatografijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to chromatography [chromatographic]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mas.% ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mas.% (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by means of a chromatographic process</p><p><b>kromatografija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a process used for separating mixtures by virtue of differences in absorbency</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vertical glass tube used in column chromatography [column]</p><p><b>hrom, krom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> another word for chromium when it is used in dyes or pigments</p><p><i>v.</i> plate with chromium [chromium-plate]</p><p><i>v.</i> treat with a chromium compound</p><p><b>Slanina od kiseline, s masenim udjelom kiseline u prosjeku od 0,5% do 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a violet-colored salt used in hide tanning and as a mordant in dyeing</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mas.% ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mas.%, sjajno zelena boja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of a class of green pigments consisting of chrome yellow and iron blue</p><p><i>n.</i> a brilliant green color</p><p><b>crveni pigment koji se koristi u bojama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a red pigment used in paints</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena (CAS RN 1344-26-8) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several yellow pigments consisting of normal lead chromate and other lead compounds</p><p><b>Elinvar je zaštitni znak za vrstu čelika koji se koristi za opruge satova jer je njegova elastičnost konstantna u širokom rasponu temperatura. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Elinvar is a trademark for a kind of steel used for watch springs because its elasticity is constant over a wide range of temperatures [Elinvar]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena od 99,99% ili više, ali ne više od 99,99% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a steel alloy made with chromium and tungsten</p><p><b>oblik sinestezije u kojoj ne-vizuelna stimulacija rezultira iskustvom osjetila boja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of synesthesia in which nonvisual stimulation results in the experience of color sensations [chromaesthesia]</p><p><b>Neustabilna kiselina poznata samo u rastvoru i kao kromatne soli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unstable acid known only in solution and as chromate salts</p><p><b>mineral smeđak-crni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a brownish-black mineral</p><p><b>hrom, krom, kromiran</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hard brittle multivalent metallic element [Cr, atomic number 24]</p><p><b>čelik s hromom koji ga čini otpornim na koroziju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> steel containing chromium that makes it resistant to corrosion [stainless, stainless steel]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> plate with chromium [chrome]</p><p><b>gljivična infekcija koju karakteriziraju svrbežne bradavice na koži (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungal infection characterized by itchy warty nodules on the skin</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,05 do 0,05 g/cm3 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compound that can be converted to a pigment</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom materijala od 85% ili više, ali ne više od 50% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> single- or multi-color lithography</p><p><b>kemijska skupina koja daje boju molekuli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the chemical group that gives color to a molecule</p><p><b>kromoplast</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plastid containing pigments other than chlorophyll usually yellow or orange carotenoids</p><p><b>od ili povezane s kromosomom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a chromosome</p><p><b>bilo kakva promjena u normalnoj strukturi ili broju hromozoma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any change in the normal structure or number of chromosomes [chromosomal anomaly, chromosonal disorder, chrosomal abnormality]</p><p><b>bilo kakva promjena u normalnoj strukturi ili broju hromozoma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any change in the normal structure or number of chromosomes [chromosomal aberration, chromosonal disorder, chrosomal abnormality]</p><p><b>(genetika) bilo koji događaj koji mijenja genetsku strukturu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (genetics) any event that changes genetic structure [genetic mutation, mutation]</p><p><b>kromosom, kromosomi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a threadlike strand of DNA in the cell nucleus that carries the genes in a linear order</p><p><b>(genetika) proces lociranja gena na hromozomu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (genetics) the process of locating genes on a chromosome [mapping]</p><p><b>bilo kakva promjena u normalnoj strukturi ili broju hromozoma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any change in the normal structure or number of chromosomes [chromosomal aberration, chromosomal anomaly, chrosomal abnormality]</p><p><b>plinoviti sloj Sunčeve atmosfere (koji se proteže od fotosfere do korone) koji je vidljiv tijekom potpunog pomračenja Sunca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gaseous layer of the sun's atmosphere (extending from the photosphere to the corona) that is visible during a total eclipse of the sun</p><p><b>kroničan, kronični, kroničnih, kroničnom, zastario</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being long-lasting and recurrent or characterized by long suffering</p><p><i>adj.</i> of long duration [continuing]</p><p><i>adj.</i> habitual [inveterate]</p><p><b>kronični bronhitis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of bronchitis characterized by excess production of sputum leading to a chronic cough and obstruction of air flow</p><p><b>Ekcem karakteriziran gustenjem kože s naglasenim linijama kože (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eczema characterized by thickening of the skin with accentuated skin lines [eczema hypertrophicum, lichtenoid eczema]</p><p><b>gastrocitis može biti simptom čir u želucu ili anemije ili raka želuca ili drugih poremećaja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> persistent gastritis can be a symptom of a gastric ulcer or pernicious anemia or stomach cancer or other disorders</p><p><b>glaukom uzrokovan blokadom Schl