nom koja može ravnati konkavne ili konveksne površine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plane with a flexible face that can plane concave or convex surfaces [compass plane]</p><p><b>cirkular, tračna pila</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a power saw that has a steel disk with cutting teeth on the periphery [buzz saw]</p><p><b>od odjeće od pređe od 85 g/m2 do 85 g/m2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> knitted in tubular form</p><p><b>Službenici za izdavanje novčanih oglasa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> circulating printed notices as a means of advertising [circularization]</p><p><b>prenijeti, prenositi, priopćavati, priopćiti, pronijeti, pronositi, propagirati, proširiti, proširivati, razglasiti, razglašavati, raširiti, raširivati, širiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> canvass by distributing letters [circularize]</p><p><i>v.</i> distribute circulars to [circularize]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to become widely known [broadcast, circularize, circulate, diffuse, disperse, disseminate, distribute, pass around, propagate, spread]</p><p><b>kružnost, okruglost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the roundness of a 2-dimensional figure [disk shape]</p><p><b>Službenici za izdavanje novčanih oglasa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> circulating printed notices as a means of advertising [circularisation]</p><p><b>zaokružiti, prenijeti, prenositi, priopćavati, priopćiti, pronijeti, pronositi, propagirati, proširiti, proširivati, razglasiti, razglašavati, raširiti, raširivati, širiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> canvass by distributing letters [circularise]</p><p><i>v.</i> canvass by using a questionnaire</p><p><i>v.</i> distribute circulars to [circularise]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to become widely known [broadcast, circularise, circulate, diffuse, disperse, disseminate, distribute, pass around, propagate, spread]</p><p><i>v.</i> make circular</p><p><b>cirkular, cirkularan, cjenik, kružan, kružeći, kružni, kružno pozivanje, kružnog, okrugao, okruglim, okružnica, reklama, cirkularni, cirkularno, kružna (od &quot;circular&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a circular m