rus having thick rind and juicy pulp [citrous fruit, citrus]</p><p><b>Jugoistočno azijsko stablo koje proizvodi velika voća slična grejpfruitu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> southeastern Asian tree producing large fruits resembling grapefruits [Citrus decumana, Citrus maxima, pomelo, pomelo tree, pummelo, shaddock]</p><p><b>Limunovo drvo s plodovima s pomalo neukusnom slatko-slatkom pulpom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lemon tree having fruit with a somewhat insipid sweetish pulp [sweet lemon, sweet lime]</p><p><b>limun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small evergreen tree that originated in Asia but is widely cultivated for its fruit [lemon, lemon tree]</p><p><b>hibrid između mandarina i limuna s vrlo kislim plodovima s ljuskom naranče (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hybrid between mandarin orange and lemon having very acid fruit with orange peel [lemanderin, rangpur, rangpur lime]</p><p><b>Jugoistočno azijsko stablo koje proizvodi velika voća slična grejpfruitu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> southeastern Asian tree producing large fruits resembling grapefruits [Citrus decumana, Citrus grandis, pomelo, pomelo tree, pummelo, shaddock]</p><p><b>Hrani se raznovrsnim biljkama, ali posebno je uništavajući za citruse. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> feeds on a wide variety of cultivated plants but especially destructive to citrus [Planococcus citri]</p><p><b>trnasta, uvijek zelena drvo ili grm Indije koje se široko uzgaja zbog svojih velikih plodova nalik limunu s gustim bradavičnim ljuskom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thorny evergreen small tree or shrub of India widely cultivated for its large lemonlike fruits that have thick warty rind [citron, citron tree]</p><p><b>veliki drvo citrus s velikim slatkim duboko narandžastom voćem koje se lako lušti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large citrus tree having large sweet deep orange fruit that is easily peeled [king orange, tangor, temple orange, temple orange tree]</p><p><b>grejp</b></p><p><i>n.</i> citrus tree bearing large round edible fruit having a thick yellow rind and