nim ili više savijanja oštrice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large knife with one or more folding blades [jackknife]</p><p><b>grupa, kakvoća, klasa, klasificirati, nastava, razred, razvrstati, red, sat, sloj, stalež, školski sat, učenički kolektiv, vrsta, kategorija, soj, sorta, društvena klasa, društveni stalež, kolegij, predmet, tečaj, generacija, godina, grupirati, kategorizirati, razvrstavati, sortirati, svrstati, svrstavati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of things sharing a common attribute [category, family]</p><p><i>n.</i> a body of students who are taught together [course, form, grade]</p><p><i>n.</i> people having the same social, economic, or educational status [social class, socio-economic class, stratum]</p><p><i>n.</i> education imparted in a series of lessons or meetings [course, course of instruction, course of study]</p><p><i>n.</i> a league ranked by quality [division]</p><p><i>n.</i> a body of students who graduate together [year]</p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) a taxonomic group containing one or more orders</p><p><i>n.</i> elegance in dress or behavior</p><p><i>v.</i> arrange or order by classes or categories [assort, classify, separate, sort, sort out]</p><p><b>Slijemice za stanicu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cellular slime molds [Acrasiomycetes]</p><p><b>Neko tko pokazuje impresivnu i stilsku izvrsnost. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who shows impressive and stylish excellence</p><p><b>veliki razred sjedećih morskih koelenterata koji uključuje morske anemone i koralje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large class of sedentary marine coelenterates that includes sea anemones and corals [Actinozoa, Anthozoa, class Anthozoa]</p><p><b>tužbu koju je podnio predstavnik grupe ljudi u ime svih članova grupe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lawsuit brought by a representative member of a large group of people on behalf of all members of the group [class-action suit]</p><p><b>razred kralježnjaka koji žive na kopnu, ali se razmnožavaju u vodi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the class