i>n.</i> the act of removing solid particles from a liquid [clarification]</p><p><b>Srednje mjesto za prikupljanje novca gdje banke razmjenjuju čekove ili nacrte (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a central collection place where banks exchange checks or drafts</p><p><b>bistro, dakako, jasno, načisto, pregledno, razgovijetno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without doubt or question</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an intelligible manner [intelligibly, understandably]</p><p><i>adv.</i> clear to the mind [distinctly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an easily perceptible manner [clear]</p><p><b>jasnoća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> free from obscurity and easy to understand [clarity, limpidity, lucidity, lucidness, pellucidity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of clear water [clarity, uncloudedness]</p><p><b>dio unutarnjeg zida koji se uzdiže iznad susjednog krova s prozorima koji dopuštaju svjetlost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> part of an interior wall rising above the adjacent roof with windows admitting light [clerestory]</p><p><b>put na kojem vam nije dozvoljeno stati (osim ako imate kvar) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a road on which you are not allowed to stop (unless you have a breakdown)</p><p><b>biljke rodova Pilea s spušteni zelenim cvjetnim grmovima i glatkim prozirnim stabljikama i lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plants of the genus Pilea having drooping green flower clusters and smooth translucent stems and leaves [Pilea pumilla, dead nettle, richweed]</p><p><b>S druge strane, za proizvodnju proizvoda iz tarifne kategorije 8402 ili 8403 ne smiju se upotrebljavati:, Spojnica (obično s dva izlazna roga) oko koje se može pričvrstiti konopac, s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm,, Obezbjeđivanje čepova, na čvrstom čekiću. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metal or leather projection (as from the sole of a shoe)</p><p><i>n.</i> a fastener (usually with two projecting horns) around which a rope can be secured</p><p><i>n.</i> a strip of wood or metal used to strengthen the surface to which it is attached</p>