nim korijenima s bijelim do kremastim cvijećem u prilično ravnim glavama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> climbing shrub with adhesive aerial roots having opposite leaves and small white flowers in terminal cymes [Schizophragma hydrangeoides]</p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous climber with aerial roots having large flat flower heads [Hydrangea petiolaris]</p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous climber with aerial roots having white to creamy flowers in fairly flat heads [Hydrangea anomala]</p><p><b>željezni šiljak koji se veže za cipele kako bi se spriječilo klizanje na ledu prilikom hoda ili penjanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an iron spike attached to the shoe to prevent slipping on ice when walking or climbing [climber, crampon, crampoon]</p><p><b>bilo koja biljka rod Gloriosa iz tropske Afrike i Azije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any plant of the genus Gloriosa of tropical Africa and Asia [Gloriosa superba, creeping lily, gloriosa, glory lily]</p><p><b>tropski paprika široko rasprostranjen u Starom svijetu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical fern widespread in Old World [Lygodium microphyllum, climbing maidenhair fern, snake fern]</p><p><b>tropski paprika široko rasprostranjen u Starom svijetu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical fern widespread in Old World [Lygodium microphyllum, climbing maidenhair, snake fern]</p><p><b>otrovna višegodišnja vinograda Starog svijeta s ljubičastim cvijećem i ovalnim koralno crvenim bojama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> poisonous perennial Old World vine having violet flowers and oval coral-red berries [Solanum dulcamara, bittersweet, bittersweet nightshade, deadly nightshade, poisonous nightshade, woody nightshade]</p><p><b>Zelenoglasna biljka koja se uzgaja kao ukrasna biljka zbog svojih svijetlozelenih stabljika koje rastu iz velikih žarulja iznad zemlje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> much-branched leafless twining South African herb cultivated as an ornamental for its bright green stems growing from large aboveground bulbs [Bowiea volubilis]</p><p><b>mala čvorka iz Indije čije su žlijezde modifikovane kako bi joj omogućile disanje zraka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small perch of India whose gills are modified to allow it to breathe air [A. testudineus, Anabas testudineus]</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko sjevernoameričkih salamandra prilagođenih penjanju s dobro razvijenim udovima i dugim, pomalo kvadratnim prstima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several North American salamanders adapted for climbing with well-developed limbs and long somewhat squared-off toes</p><p><b>atmosfera, klima</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the weather in some location averaged over some long period of time [climate]</p><p><b>dohvatiti, stisnuti, zgrabiti, zagrljaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (boxing) the act of one boxer holding onto the other to avoid being hit and to rest momentarily</p><p><i>n.</i> a small slip noose made with seizing [clench]</p><p><i>n.</i> the flattened part of a nail or bolt or rivet</p><p><i>n.</i> a device (generally used by carpenters) that holds things firmly together [clamp]</p><p><i>n.</i> a tight or amorous embrace [hug, squeeze]</p><p><i>v.</i> secure or fasten by flattening the ends of nails or bolts</p><p><i>v.</i> hold a boxing opponent with one or both arms so as to prevent punches</p><p><i>v.</i> hold in a tight grasp [clench]</p><p><i>v.</i> embrace amorously</p><p><i>v.</i> flatten the ends (of nails and rivets)</p><p><i>v.</i> settle conclusively</p><p><b>rijeka koja izlazi u jugozapadnoj Virginiji i teče generalno jugozapadno preko istočnog Tennesseeja do rijeke Tennessee (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a river that rises in southwestern Virginia and flows generally southwestward across eastern Tennessee to the Tennessee River</p><p><b>dohvatiti, stisnuti, zgrabiti (od &quot;clinch&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> closed or squeezed together tightly [clenched]</p><p><b>dohvatiti, stisnuti, zgrabiti (od &quot;clinch&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an argument that is conclusive [determiner, determining factor]</p><p><i>n.</i> a point or fact or remark that settles something conclusively [decisive factor]</p><p><i>n.</i> a tool used to clinch nails or bolts or rivets</p><p><b>s pregrštom od 8 mm ili više, ali ne više od 8 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having overlapping hull planks [clinker-built, lap-strake, lap-straked, lap-streak, lap-streaked]</p><p><b>Američki genet koji je uspio prenijeti funkcionalan gen s jednog miša na drugi (rođen 1934.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> American geneticist who succeeded in transferring a functioning gene from one mouse to another (born in 1934) [Martin Cline]</p><p><b>držati se, prianjati, pribiti se, prilijepiti se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fruit (especially peach) whose flesh adheres strongly to the pit [clingstone]</p><p><i>v.</i> come or be in close contact with [adhere, cleave, cohere, stick]</p><p><i>v.</i> to remain emotionally or intellectually attached</p><p><i>v.</i> hold on tightly or tenaciously [hang]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15% ili više, ali ne više od 0,15% masenog udjela, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thin plastic film made of saran (trade name Saran Wrap) that sticks to itself [Saran Wrap, clingfilm]</p><p><b>čvrsto držati, obično rukama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> hold firmly, usually with one's hands [clutch, hold close, hold tight]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15% ili više, ali ne više od 0,15% masenog udjela, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thin plastic film made of saran (trade name Saran Wrap) that sticks to itself [Saran Wrap, cling film]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je riječ o ribama iz kategorije IIa, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, ribama iz kategorije IIa i IIa ovog članka može se koristiti samo za ribolov u ribolovnim područjima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> very small (to 3 inches) flattened marine fish with a sucking disc on the abdomen for clinging to rocks etc.</p><p><b>breskva durancija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fruit (especially peach) whose flesh adheres strongly to the pit [cling]</p><p><b>ambulanta, bolnica, dispanzer, klinici, klinika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a medical establishment run by a group of medical specialists</p><p><i>n.</i> meeting for diagnosis of problems and instruction or remedial work in a particular activity</p><p><i>n.</i> a healthcare facility for outpatient care</p><p><b>bolnički, klinički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to a clinic or conducted in or as if in a clinic and depending on direct observation of patients</p><p><i>adj.</i> scientifically detached</p><p><b>Praktično primjena anatomskih znanja na dijagnozu i liječenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the practical application of anatomical knowledge to diagnosis and treatment [applied anatomy]</p><p><b>depresija, klinička depresija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of depression and anhedonia so severe as to require clinical intervention [depression, depressive disorder]</p><p><b>neurologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (neurology) the branch of medicine that deals with the nervous system and its disorders [neurology]</p><p><b>terapeut koji se bavi mentalnim i emocionalnim poremećajima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a therapist who deals with mental and emotional disorders [psychotherapist]</p><p><b>grana psihologije koja se bavi liječenjem abnormalnog razmišljanja i ponašanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of psychology concerned with the treatment of abnormal mentation and behavior</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve proizvode koji se upotrebljavaju u proizvodnji lijekova ili novog invazivnog medicinskog proizvoda, primjenjuje se sljedeći standard: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rigorously controlled test of a new drug or a new invasive medical device on human subjects [clinical trial]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom ugljika od 10%, ali ne više od 50% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mercury thermometer designed to measure the temperature of the human body [mercury-in-glass clinical thermometer]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve proizvode koji se upotrebljavaju u proizvodnji lijekova ili novog invazivnog medicinskog proizvoda, primjenjuje se sljedeći standard: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rigorously controlled test of a new drug or a new invasive medical device on human subjects [clinical test]</p><p><b>bolnički, klinički (od &quot;clinical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a clinical manner</p><p><b>liječnik (medicinski ili psihološki) koji radi klinički rad umjesto laboratorijskih eksperimenata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a practitioner (of medicine or psychology) who does clinical work instead of laboratory experiments</p><p><b>uglavnom male blennioidne ribe koralnih grebena i morskih travnjaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mostly small blennioid fishes of coral reefs and seagrass beds [clinid fish]</p><p><b>uglavnom male blennioidne ribe koralnih grebena i morskih travnjaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mostly small blennioid fishes of coral reefs and seagrass beds [clinid]</p><p><b>životinjske žlijezde u umjerenoj i tropskoj vodi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> viviparous blennies of temperate and tropical seas [family Clinidae]</p><p><b>tamnica, zveket, zveketati, zatvor, cilikati, zveckati, zvečati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a short light metallic sound [chink, click]</p><p><i>n.</i> a correctional institution used to detain persons who are in the lawful custody of the government (either accused persons awaiting trial or convicted persons serving a sentence) [gaol, jail, jailhouse, pokey, poky, slammer]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a high sound typical of glass</p><p><i>v.</i> make or emit a high sound [chink, tink, tinkle]</p><p><b>tamnica, zveket, zveketati (od &quot;clink&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fragment of incombustible matter left after a wood or coal or charcoal fire [cinder]</p><p><i>n.</i> a hard brick used as a paving stone [clinker brick]</p><p><i>v.</i> clear out the cinders and clinker from</p><p><i>v.</i> turn to clinker or form clinker under excessive heat in burning</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je to uobičajeno, ne smije se upotrebljavati za proizvodnju električnih vozila. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a light concrete building block made with cinder aggregate [breeze block, cinder block]</p><p><b>tvrda cigla koja se koristi kao kamen za trotoar (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hard brick used as a paving stone [clinker]</p><p><b>s pregrštom od 8 mm ili više, ali ne više od 8 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having overlapping hull planks [clincher-built, lap-strake, lap-straked, lap-streak, lap-streaked]</p><p><b>tamnica, zveket, zveketati (od &quot;clink&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> like the light sharp ringing sound of glasses being tapped</p><p><b>urođeni defekt u kojem je vrh glave potisnut (konkavan umjesto konveksan) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a congenital defect in which the top of the head is depressed (concave instead of convex) [clinocephaly]</p><p><b>urođeni defekt u kojem je vrh glave potisnut (konkavan umjesto konveksan) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a congenital defect in which the top of the head is depressed (concave instead of convex) [clinocephalism]</p><p><b>Rođeni defekt u kojem je jedan ili više prstiju ili prstiju neuobičajeno postavljeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a congenital defect in which one or more toes or fingers are abnormally positioned</p><p><b>klinometar, pokazivač nagiba broda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instrument used by surveyors in order to measure an angle of inclination or elevation [inclinometer]</p><p><b>divlji bazal (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wild basil [genus Clinopodium]</p><p><b>aromatska biljka s velikim ružičastim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic herb with large pink flowers [Calamintha grandiflora, Satureja grandiflora, large-flowered calamint]</p><p><b>od čelika ili čelika od čelika ili čelika od čelika ili čelika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic herb having heads of small pink or whitish flowers [Satureja vulgaris, cushion calamint, wild basil]</p><p><b>ne-steroidni protuupalni lijek (trgovinski naziv Clinoril) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (trade name Clinoril) [sulindac]</p><p><b>blistaju zlatom ili srebrom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> glittering with gold or silver [tinseled, tinselly]</p><p><b>supruga predsjednika Clintona i kasnije žena član Senata Sjedinjenih Država (1947-), 42. predsjednik Sjedinjenih Država (1946-), Američki političar koji je kao guverner New Yorka podržao projekt izgradnje Kanala Erie (1769-1828), Grad u istočnoj središnjoj Iowi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wife of President Clinton and later a woman member of the United States Senate (1947-) [Hilary Clinton, Hilary Rodham Clinton]</p><p><i>n.</i> 42nd President of the United States (1946-) [Bill Clinton, President Clinton, William Jefferson Clinton]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States politician who as governor of New York supported the project to build the Erie Canal (1769-1828) [DeWitt Clinton]</p><p><i>n.</i> a town in east central Iowa</p><p><b>Izvršni pod predsjednikom Clintonom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the executive under President Clinton</p><p><b>biljka od vrste Clintonia koja ima široke bazalne lišće i bijele ili žuto- ili ljubičasto-crvene cvijeće s plavim ili crnim bojama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any temperate liliaceous plant of the genus Clintonia having broad basal leaves and white or yellowish or purplish flowers followed by blue or black berries [clintonia]</p><p><b>biljka od vrste Clintonia koja ima široke bazalne lišće i bijele ili žuto- ili ljubičasto-crvene cvijeće s plavim ili crnim bojama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any temperate liliaceous plant of the genus Clintonia having broad basal leaves and white or yellowish or purplish flowers followed by blue or black berries [Clinton's lily]</p><p><b>biljka s skoro bezlistnim stabljikom na vrhu koje obiluje grm crvenih ili crvenkasto-lavandastih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant with nearly leafless stalk topped by a cluster of red or reddish lavender flowers [Andrew's clintonia, red Clintonia]</p><p><b>Uobičajena šumska biljka iz umjerene Sjeverne Amerike s žutim cvjetovima i malim okruglim plavim plodovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common woodland herb of temperate North America having yellow nodding flowers and small round blue fruits [heal all, yellow clintonia]</p><p><b>biljka s jednim ili dva bijela cvjetna zvijezda na kratkim stabljikama bez lišća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant with 1 or 2 white starlike flowers on short leafless stalks [bride's bonnet, queen's cup]</p><p><b>Klio</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) the Muse of history</p><p><b>lijek koji se koristi za liječenje određene gljivične infekcije (kao što je nogu sportaša) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> drug used to treat certain fungal infection (as athlete's foot) [iodochlorhydroxyquin]</p><p><b>isječak, isjeći dio, karika, kvačica, odsječak, odsjeći, okvir, podšišati, potkresati, spojiti, spojnica, striženje, šišanje, veza, prigoda, put, ostrići, kresati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metal frame or container holding cartridges [cartridge clip, cartridge holder, magazine]</p><p><i>n.</i> an instance or single occasion for some event [time]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various small fasteners used to hold loose articles together</p><p><i>n.</i> an article of jewelry that can be clipped onto a hat or dress</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of clipping or snipping [clipping, snip]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sharp slanting blow</p><p><i>v.</i> sever or remove by pinching or snipping [nip, nip off, snip, snip off]</p><p><i>v.</i> run at a moderately swift pace [jog, trot]</p><p><i>v.</i> attach with a clip</p><p><i>v.</i> cultivate, tend, and cut back the growth of [crop, cut back, dress, lop, prune, snip, trim]</p><p><i>v.</i> terminate or abbreviate before its intended or proper end or its full extent [curtail, cut short]</p><p><b>crtež, crtežni isječak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ready-made pieces of computerized graphic art that can be used to decorate a document</p><p><b>prevarant koji oduzima žrtvu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a swindler who fleeces the victim</p><p><b>mjesto zabave gdje se za lošu zabavu naplaćuju visoke cijene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a place of entertainment where high prices are charged for poor entertainment</p><p><b>kratak komad žice s alligatorskim sponama na oba kraja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a short piece of wire with alligator clips on both ends</p><p><b>zvuk konjskih kopita koji udaraju na tvrdu površinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sound of a horse's hoofs hitting on a hard surface [clippety-clop, clop, clopping, clumping, clunking]</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da se u ovom poglavlju ne primjenjuju primjerične oznake za uređaje za proizvodnju električnih vozila, u skladu s člankom 83. stavkom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 83. stavkom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, točka (a) ovog članka ne vrijedi za uređaje za proizvodnju električnih vozila., s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device (as an earring, sunglasses, microphone etc.) that is attached by clips</p><p><i>adj.</i> attachable by a clip</p><p><b>međumemorija, međuspremnik, spremnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small writing board with a clip at the top for holding papers</p><p><b>podrezan, rezak</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> cut or trimmed by clipping</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of speech) having quick short sounds</p><p><b>clipper, izdvajač, izrezivač, kliper, tip jedrenjaka, vrsta programskog jezika, izrezivač (slike na zaslonu)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (electronics) a nonlinear electronic circuit whose output is limited in amplitude [limiter]</p><p><i>n.</i> a fast sailing ship used in former times [clipper ship]</p><p><i>n.</i> shears for cutting grass or shrubbery (often used in the plural)</p><p><i>n.</i> scissors for cutting hair or finger nails (often used in the plural)</p><p><b>brzi jedrilica korišten u prošlosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fast sailing ship used in former times [clipper]</p><p><b>zvuk konjskih kopita koji udaraju na tvrdu površinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sound of a horse's hoofs hitting on a hard surface [clip-clop, clop, clopping, clumping, clunking]</p><p><b>isijecanje dijela, isječak, novinski isječak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an excerpt cut from a newspaper or magazine [cutting, newspaper clipping, press clipping, press cutting]</p><p><i>n.</i> cutting down to the desired size or shape [trim, trimming]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of clipping or snipping [clip, snip]</p><p><b>grupa, klika, družina, koterija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exclusive circle of people with a common purpose [camp, coterie, ingroup, inner circle, pack]</p><p><b>Pripadaju ili karakteristični za one koji su skloni društvenoj isključenosti i koji odbacuju napredak ljudi koji se smatraju inferiornim. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> befitting or characteristic of those who incline to social exclusiveness and who rebuff the advances of people considered inferior [clannish, clubby, snobbish, snobby]</p><p><b>Na klanski način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a clannish manner [clannishly]</p><p><b>sklonost da se druže samo s određenom grupom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tendency to associate with only a select group [clannishness, exclusiveness]</p><p><b>klitoris, dražica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a female sexual organ homologous to the penis [button, clitoris]</p><p><b>rod agarica s bijelim do blijedožutom odlaganjem spora i mesnim stabljikama koje su središnje povezane s kapa i usko povezane žlijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of agarics with white to pale yellow spore deposits and fleshy stalks centrally attached to the cap and closely attached gills [genus Clitocybe]</p><p><b>kijačasta grlašica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agaric with a flat cap that is greyish or yellowish brown with pallid gills and a stalk that bulges toward the base</p><p><b>mala otrovna agarica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small poisonous agaric</p><p><b>neukrašena grlašica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungus with a cap that is creamy grey when young and turns brown with age and a whitish stalk that stains yellow when handled</p><p><b>perunikina vitezovka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an edible agaric with large silky white caps and thick stalks [Lepista irina, Tricholoma irinum]</p><p><b>jestiva agarica koja je bleda ljubičasta kad je mlada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> edible agaric that is pale lilac when young [blewits]</p><p><b>veliki bijeli agaric (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large white agaric [Clytocybe alba]</p><p><b>Hranljiva bijela agarica koja rađa plodove u gustim klasterima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an edible white agaric that fruits in dense clusters</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s klitorisom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the clitoris [clitoric]</p><p><b>vene koje služe klitoris (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that serve the clitoris [vena clitoridis]</p><p><b>rod tropskih grmova ili vinove loze s pinatnim lišćama i velikim osnim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of tropical shrubs or vines having pinnate leaves and large axillary flowers [genus Clitoria]</p><p><b>u obliku divljeg vinove loze s velikim cvjetovima iz jugoistočne i središnje Sjedinjene Države s blijedo plavim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large-flowered wild twining vine of southeastern and central United States having pale blue flowers [butterfly pea]</p><p><b>Vina tropske Azije s pinatnim listovima i svijetlo plavim cvijećem s žutim središtima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vine of tropical Asia having pinnate leaves and bright blue flowers with yellow centers [blue pea, butterfly pea]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s klitorisom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the clitoris [clitoral]</p><p><b>izrezivanje klitorisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> excision of the clitoris [female circumcision]</p><p><b>dražica, klitoris</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a female sexual organ homologous to the penis [button, clit]</p><p><b>stvaraju škrkavu škripuću buku trljanjem posebnih tjelesnih struktura. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a shrill creaking noise by rubbing together special bodily structures [stridulate]</p><p><b>Britanski general i državnik čija je po