h wooden soles [geta, patten, sabot]</p><p><i>n.</i> any object that acts as a hindrance or obstruction</p><p><i>n.</i> a dance performed while wearing shoes with wooden soles [clog dance, clog dancing]</p><p><i>v.</i> become or cause to become obstructed [back up, choke, choke off, clog up, congest, foul]</p><p><i>v.</i> dance a clog dance</p><p><i>v.</i> impede the motion of, as with a chain or a burden</p><p><i>v.</i> impede with a clog or as if with a clog [constipate]</p><p><i>v.</i> coalesce or unite in a mass [clot]</p><p><i>v.</i> fill to excess so that function is impaired [overload]</p><p><b>ples koji se izvodi dok nosi cipele s drvenim podnožjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dance performed while wearing shoes with wooden soles [clog, clog dancing]</p><p><b>Nekoga tko pleše začepljenje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who does clog dancing</p><p><b>ples koji se izvodi dok nosi cipele s drvenim podnožjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dance performed while wearing shoes with wooden soles [clog, clog dance]</p><p><b>biti ili uzrokovati da se postane ometanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become or cause to become obstructed [back up, choke, choke off, clog, congest, foul]</p><p><b>zagušen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> thickened or coalesced in soft thick lumps (such as clogs or clots) [clotted]</p><p><i>adj.</i> stopped up [choked]</p><p><i>adj.</i> loaded with something that hinders motion</p><p><b>sprečavanje kretanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> preventing movement [hindering, impeding, obstructive]</p><p><b>grudav, ljepljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of soil) compact and fine-grained [clayey, heavy]</p><p><b>od metala ili od drugih materijala, ali ne više od 85% masenog dijela,, (za metale) s područjima odvojenima od metala i ispunjenima obojenom emajlom i pečenim (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> enamelware in which colored areas are separated by thin metal strips</p><p><i>adj.</i> (for metals) having areas separated by metal and filled with colored enamel and fired [champleve]</p><p><b>manastir, zatvoriti, klaustar, klauzura, samostan, zatvoreni samostan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> residence that is a place of religious seclusion (such as a monastery) [religious residence]</p><p><i>n.</i> a courtyard with covered walks (as in religious institutions)</p><p><i>v.</i> surround with a cloister, as of a garden</p><p><i>v.</i> surround with a cloister</p><p><i>v.</i> seclude from the world in or as if in a cloister</p><p><b>manastir, zatvoriti, klaustar (od &quot;cloister&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of communal life sequestered from the world under religious vows [cloistral, conventual, monastic, monastical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> providing privacy or seclusion [reclusive, secluded, sequestered]</p><p><b>Odvojeni od svijeta pod vjerskim zavjetima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of communal life sequestered from the world under religious vows [cloistered, conventual, monastic, monastical]</p><p><b>lijek za plodnost (trgovinski naziv Clomid) koji se koristi za stimulaciju ovulacije i koji je povezan s višestrukim porođajima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fertility drug (trade name Clomid) that is used to stimulate ovulation and that has been associated with multiple births [clomiphene, clomiphene citrate]</p><p><b>lijek za plodnost (trgovinski naziv Clomid) koji se koristi za stimulaciju ovulacije i koji je povezan s višestrukim porođajima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fertility drug (trade name Clomid) that is used to stimulate ovulation and that has been associated with multiple births [Clomid, clomiphene citrate]</p><p><b>lijek za plodnost (trgovinski naziv Clomid) koji se koristi za stimulaciju ovulacije i koji je povezan s višestrukim porođajima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fertility drug (trade name Clomid) that is used to stimulate ovulation and that has been associated with multiple births [Clomid, clomiphene]</p><p><b>Triciklični antidepresivi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tricyclic antidepressant drug</p><p><b>Neugodno hodati. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> walk clumsily [clump]</p><p><b>grupa genetski identičnih stanica ili organizama dobivenih od jedne stanice ili pojedinca nekom vrstom aseksualne reprodukcije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of genetically identical cells or organisms derived from a single cell or individual by some kind of asexual reproduction [clone]</p><p><b>klonski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a clone</p><p><b>klon, kloniraj, kopija, klonirati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is almost identical to another [dead ringer, ringer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a group of genetically identical cells or organisms derived from a single cell or individual by some kind of asexual reproduction [clon]</p><p><i>n.</i> an unauthorized copy or imitation [knockoff]</p><p><i>v.</i> make multiple identical copies of</p><p><b>Neobična neuromuskularna aktivnost karakterizirana brzim izmjenama kontrakcije i opuštanja mišića ili s njom povezana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to abnormal neuromuscular activity characterized by rapidly alternating muscle contraction and relaxation</p><p><b>antihipertenziv (trgovinski naziv Catapres) koji se može davati oralno ili putem transdermalnih flastera. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antihypertensive (trade name Catapres) that can be administered orally or via transdermal patches [Catapres]</p><p><b>kloniranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a general term for the research activity that creates a copy of some biological entity (a gene or organism or cell)</p><p><b>konvulzije koje se odlikuju izmjenama kontrakcija i opuštanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> convulsion characterized by alternating contractions and relaxations</p><p><b>zvuk konjskih kopita koji udaraju na tvrdu površinu, napraviti ili se kretati uz zvuk kao što su konjski kopita udari u zemlju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sound of a horse's hoofs hitting on a hard surface [clip-clop, clippety-clop, clopping, clumping, clunking]</p><p><i>v.</i> make or move along with a sound as of a horse's hooves striking the ground [clump, clunk, plunk]</p><p><b>razrjeđivač krvi (trgovinski naziv Plavix) odobren za liječenje blagih srčanih udara (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blood thinner (trade name Plavix) approved for the treatment of mild heart attacks [Plavix]</p><p><b>zvuk konjskih kopita koji udaraju na tvrdu površinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sound of a horse's hoofs hitting on a hard surface [clip-clop, clippety-clop, clop, clumping, clunking]</p><p><b>S druge strane, proizvodi iz poglavlja 3. točka (a) i (b) ovog članka ne mogu se upotrebljavati u proizvodnji proizvoda od proizvoda iz poglavlja (b) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commercial bleaching agent</p><p><b>uz, zaključiti, blizak, kraj, pokraj, prestanak, prestati, svršetak, u blizina, blizu, blokirati, intiman, zatvaranje, zatvarati, zatvoriti, završiti, isključiti, ugasiti, blizina, blizini, zatvori, konac, zaključak, završetak, zatvarati se, zatvoriti se, isključiti se, dovršavati se, dovršiti se, okončati se, okončavati se, prestajati, svršavati se, svršiti se, završavati, završavati se, završiti se, nedaleki, obližnji</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the temporal end [conclusion, finale, finis, finish, last, stopping point]</p><p><i>n.</i> the last section of a communication [closing, conclusion, end, ending]</p><p><i>n.</i> the concluding part of any performance [closing curtain, finale, finis]</p><p><i>v.</i> move so that an opening or passage is obstructed [shut]</p><p><i>v.</i> become closed [shut]</p><p><i>v.</i> cease to operate or cause to cease operating [close down, close up, fold, shut down]</p><p><i>v.</i> finish or terminate (meetings, speeches, etc.)</p><p><i>v.</i> come to a close [conclude]</p><p><i>v.</i> complete a business deal, negotiation, or an agreement</p><p><i>v.</i> be priced or listed when trading stops</p><p><i>v.</i> engage at close quarters</p><p><i>v.</i> cause a window or an application to disappear on a computer desktop</p><p><i>v.</i> change one's body stance so that the forward shoulder and foot are closer to the intended point of impact</p><p><i>v.</i> come together, as if in an embrace [come together]</p><p><i>v.</i> draw near</p><p><i>v.</i> bring together all the elements or parts of</p><p><i>v.</i> bar access to</p><p><i>v.</i> fill or stop up [fill up]</p><p><i>v.</i> unite or bring into contact or bring together the edges of [close up]</p><p><i>v.</i> finish a game in baseball by protecting a lead</p><p><i>adj.</i> at or within a short distance in space or time or having elements near each other</p><p><i>adj.</i> close in relevance or relationship</p><p><i>adj.</i> not far distant in time or space or degree or circumstances [near, nigh]</p><p><i>adj.</i> rigorously attentive</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by fidelity to an original [faithful]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a contest or contestants) evenly matched [tight]</p><p><i>adj.</i> crowded [confining]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking fresh air [airless, stuffy, unaired]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of textiles [tight]</p><p><i>adj.</i> strictly confined or guarded</p><p><i>adj.</i> confined to specific persons</p><p><i>adj.</i> fitting closely but comfortably [close-fitting, snug]</p><p><i>adj.</i> used of hair or haircuts</p><p><i>adj.</i> giving or spending with reluctance [cheeseparing, near, penny-pinching, skinny]</p><p><i>adj.</i> inclined to secrecy or reticence about divulging information [closelipped, closemouthed, secretive, tightlipped]</p><p><i>adv.</i> near in time or place or relationship [near, nigh]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an attentive manner [closely, tight]</p><p><b>blizu u prostoru, Zatvoreno u vrijeme. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> close in space [at hand]</p><p><i>adj.</i> close in time [at hand, imminent, impendent, impending]</p><p><b>nešto postignuto (ili izbjegnuto) uz malu maržu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something achieved (or escaped) by a narrow margin [close shave, narrow escape, squeak, squeaker]</p><p><b>korporacija u vlasništvu nekoliko ljudi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a corporation owned by a few people [closed corpo