ijski sustav koji se ne koristi za emitiranje, ali je povezan kablovima na određene monitore (kao u tvornici ili kazalištu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a television system that is not used for broadcasting but is connected by cables to designated monitors (as in a factory or theater)</p><p><b>funkcionalna riječ, gramatička riječ, nepunoznačna riječ, nepunoznačnica, sinsemantička riječ</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word that is uninflected and serves a grammatical function but has little identifiable meaning [function word]</p><p><b>ne otvoren za javnost (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not open to the public</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "poduzeće za ulaganja" znači društvo za ulaganja koje se bavi ulaganjem u dionice koje se trguje na berzi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a regulated investment company that issues a fixed number of shares which are listed on a stock market [closed-end investment company]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "poduzeće za ulaganja" znači društvo za ulaganja koje se bavi ulaganjem u dionice koje se trguje na berzi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a regulated investment company that issues a fixed number of shares which are listed on a stock market [closed-end fund]</p><p><b>operacija srca u kojoj se izvodi mali rez (ne otvara se grudi) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heart surgery in which a small incision is made (the chest cavity is not opened)</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je to uobičajeno, to se ne može koristiti za proizvodnju električnih vozila. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a control system with a feedback loop that is active [closed loop]</p><p><b>Ne spremni prihvatiti nove ideje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not ready to receive to new ideas [close-minded]</p><p><b>s atomima vezanih vezama u kružnom ili trokutnom obliku (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having atoms linked by bonds represented in circular or triangular form [closed-chain]</p><p><b>završetak operacija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> termination of operations [closing, closure, shutdown]</p><p><b>Ne žele se odvojiti od novca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> unwilling to part with money [hardfisted, tightfisted]</p><p><b>sklon tajnosti ili suzdržanosti u vezi s otkrivanjem informacija (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> inclined to secrecy or reticence about divulging information [close, closemouthed, secretive, tightlipped]</p><p><b>gusto, izbliza, pažljivo, pobliže, temeljito, tijesno, usko</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a close relation or position in time or space</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an attentive manner [close, tight]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a close manner [intimately, nearly]</p><p><b>Dionice su javno trgovane ali većina ih drži nekoliko dioničara koji nemaju planove za prodaju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stock is publicly traded but most is held by a few shareholders who have no plans to sell</p><p><b>Drže se zajedno kao društvene ili kulturne veze. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> held together as by social or cultural ties [close-knit]</p><p><b>u vlasništvu relativno malog broja dioničara (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> owned by a relatively few shareholders</p><p><b>sklon tajnosti ili suzdržanosti u vezi s otkrivanjem informacija (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> inclined to secrecy or reticence about divulging information [close, closelipped, secretive, tightlipped]</p><p><b>bliskost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of being intimate and belonging together [intimacy]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being close and poorly ventilated [stuffiness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the spatial property resulting from a relatively small distance [nearness]</p><p><i>n.</i> extreme stinginess [meanness, minginess, niggardliness, niggardness, parsimoniousness, parsimony, tightfistedness, tightness]</p><p><i>n.</i> characterized by a lack of openness (especially about one's actions or purposes) [secretiveness]</p><p><i>n.</i> close or warm friendship [familiarity, intimacy]</p><p><b>zatvoriti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sale intended to dispose of all remaining stock</p><p><b>bliže, bl