all, chunk, clod, glob, lump]</p><p><i>n.</i> a heavy dull sound (as made by impact of heavy objects) [clunk, thud, thump, thumping]</p><p><i>v.</i> make or move along with a sound as of a horse's hooves striking the ground [clop, clunk, plunk]</p><p><i>v.</i> come together as in a cluster or flock [cluster, constellate, flock]</p><p><i>v.</i> walk clumsily [clomp]</p><p><i>v.</i> gather or cause to gather into a cluster [bunch, bundle, cluster]</p><p><b>gruda, grumen, grupa (drveća), lupa, topot, tresnuti (od &quot;clump&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sound of a horse's hoofs hitting on a hard surface [clip-clop, clippety-clop, clop, clopping, clunking]</p><p><b>nespretan, netaktičan, neumjestan, nezgrapan, nespretno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a clumsy manner</p><p><b>nesklad, nespretnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> unskillfulness resulting from a lack of training [awkwardness, ineptitude, ineptness, maladroitness, slowness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the carriage of someone whose movements and posture are ungainly or inelegant [awkwardness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the inelegance of someone stiff and unrelaxed (as by embarrassment) [awkwardness, gracelessness, stiffness]</p><p><b>glomazan, nespretan, nespretni, neumjestan, nevješt</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking grace in movement or posture [clunky, gawky, ungainly, unwieldy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not elegant or graceful in expression [awkward, cumbersome, ill-chosen, inapt, inept]</p><p><i>adj.</i> difficult to handle or manage especially because of shape [awkward, bunglesome, ungainly]</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing lack of skill or aptitude [bungling, fumbling, incompetent]</p><p><b>osoba s lošom motornom koordinacijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person with poor motor coordination</p><p><b>čvrsta glina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hardened clay</p><p><b>klopotati, mukao, prigušen zvuk</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a heavy dull sound (as made by impact of heavy objects) [clump, thud, thump, thumping]</p><p><i>v.</i> make or move along with a sound as of a horse's ho