.</i> epiphytic clusia of British Guiana [waxflower]</p><p><b>Clusia (Clusia) - obična tropska američka clusia s jednim bijelom ili ružastom cvjetom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a common tropical American clusia having solitary white or rose flowers [Clusia rosea, pitch apple, strangler fig]</p><p><b>Clusia (Clusia) - obična tropska američka clusia s jednim bijelom ili ružastom cvjetom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a common tropical American clusia having solitary white or rose flowers [Clusia major, pitch apple, strangler fig]</p><p><b>široko rasprostranjena obitelj uglavnom tropskih stabala i grmova i vinove loze koja proizvodi ulja i smole i neki korisni drvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> widely distributed family of chiefly tropical trees and shrubs and vines that produce oils and resins and some usable timber [Guttiferae, St John's wort family, family Clusiaceae, family Guttiferae]</p><p><b>grozd, grupa podataka na disku, jato, kita, klaster, načičkati se, nakupina, roj, skupina, grupa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a grouping of a number of similar things [bunch, clump, clustering]</p><p><i>v.</i> come together as in a cluster or flock [clump, constellate, flock]</p><p><i>v.</i> gather or cause to gather into a cluster [bunch, bundle, clump]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za proizvodnju hrane za životinje u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći tarifni broj: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> drought-tolerant herb grown for forage and for its seed which yield a gum used as a thickening agent or sizing material [Cyamopsis psoraloides, Cyamopsis tetragonolobus, guar]</p><p><b>bomba koja se sastoji od spremnika koji se baca iz zrakoplova i koji se otvara kako bi se oslobodio skup bombleta (obično fragmentacijske bombe) na širokom području (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bomb consisting of a canister that is dropped from a plane and that opens to release a cluster of bomblets (usually fragmentation bombs) over a wide area</p><p><b>jedna od manjih bombi koje su puštene iz kasetne bombe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the smaller bombs that are released from a cluster bomb [bomblet]</p><p><b>bolna opadajuća glavobolja povezana s oslobađanjem histamina iz stanica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a painful recurring headache associated with the release of histamine from cells [histamine headache]</p><p><b>glikoprotein koji se uglavnom nalazi na površini pomoćnih T stanica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a glycoprotein that is found primarily on the surface of helper T cells [CD4]</p><p><b>membranski glikoprotein koji se uglavnom nalazi na površini citotoksičnih T stanica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a membrane glycoprotein that is found primarily on the surface of cytotoxic T cells [CD8]</p><p><b>nagomilan, okupljen, u skupinama</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> growing close together but not in dense mats</p><p><i>adj.</i> clustered together but not coherent [agglomerate, agglomerated, agglomerative]</p><p><b>zvonoc iz Europe do umjerene Azije s gustim šiljcima od ljubičastog plavog do bijelog cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bellflower of Europe to temperate Asia having dense spikes of violet-blue to white flowers [Campanula glomerata]</p><p><b>Grupa od nekoliko kratkih stabljika s 2 široka lišća i 2-4 spuštena smeđasta do zelenkasto cvjetova s vrećicama obilježenim ljubičastim. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clusters of several short stems each having 2 broad leaves and 2-4 drooping brownish to greenish flowers with pouches mottled with purple [Cypripedium fasciculatum]</p><p><b>guste dlakave višegodišnje biljke s uglavnom trokutnim bazalnim listovima i ružičastom ljubičastocvrstom cvjetom u paničnim grmovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> densely hairy perennial having mostly triangular basal leaves and rose-purple flowers in panicled clusters [Callirhoe triangulata]</p><p><b>raspoređivanje u razrede, razredovanje, ugroždnjavanje, uskupljavanje, grupa, klaster, skupina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a grouping of a number of similar things [bunch, clump, cluster]</p><p><b>grabiti, hrvanje, kandže, kopča, kvačilo, leglo, spojka, stiskati, šape, ščepati, zahvat, zgrabiti, stisak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of grasping [clasp, clench, clutches, grasp, grip, hold]</p><p><i>n.</i> a tense critical situation</p><p><i>n.</i> a number of birds hatched at the same time</p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of things or persons to be handled together [batch]</p><p><i>n.</i> a woman's strapless purse that is carried in the hand [clutch bag]</p><p><i>n.</i> a pedal or lever that engages or disengages a rotating shaft and a driving mechanism [clutch pedal]</p><p><i>n.</i> a coupling that connects or disconnects driving and driven parts of a driving mechanism</p><p><i>v.</i> take hold of [prehend, seize]</p><p><i>v.</i> hold firmly, usually with one's hands [cling to, hold close, hold tight]</p><p><i>v.</i> affect [get hold of, seize]</p><p><b>ženski torbica bez trakova koji se nosi u ruci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman's strapless purse that is carried in the hand [clutch]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pedal or lever that engages or disengages a rotating shaft and a driving mechanism [clutch]</p><p><b>stisak, zahvat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of grasping [clasp, clench, clutch, grasp, grip, hold]</p><p><b>graja, gungula, jurnjava, larma, paničariti, gomilati, nagomilati, nagomilavati, natrpati, natrpavati, pretrpati, pretrpavati, trpati, zakrčiti, zakrčivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a confused multitude of things [fuddle, jumble, mare's nest, muddle, smother, welter]</p><p><i>n.</i> unwanted echoes that interfere with the observation of signals on a radar screen</p><p><i>v.</i> fill a space in a disorderly way [clutter up]</p><p><b>gomilati, nagomilati, nagomilavati, natrpati, natrpavati, pretrpati, pretrpavati, trpati, zakrčiti, zakrčivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> fill a space in a disorderly way [clutter]</p><p><b>graja, gungula, jurnjava, larma, paničariti (od &q