e epithelial cells and can cause birth defects [cytomegalovirus]</p><p><b>suzavac koji je slabiji od CS plina, ali traje duže (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tear gas that is weaker than CS gas but lasts longer [chloroacetophenone]</p><p><b>toranj u Torontu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tower in Toronto</p><p><b>ušice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> whiptails [genus Cnemidophorus]</p><p><b>s dužnim prugama prekrivenim svjetlim mrljama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> having longitudinal stripes overlaid with light spots [Chihuahuan spotted whiptail]</p><p><b>vrlo brz gušter iz istočnih i središnjih Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> very swift lizard of eastern and central United States [race runner, racerunner, six-lined racerunner]</p><p><b>Oznake su tamnije i oštrije nego kod zapadnog whiptail-a. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> markings are darker and more marked than in western whiptail [checkered whiptail]</p><p><b>aktivni gušter s mrežom tamnih crnih oznaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> active lizard having a network of dusky dark markings [western whiptail]</p><p><b>s različitim uzdužnim prugama: od Colorado Platea od Arizone do zapadnog Colorada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> having distinct longitudinal stripes: of Colorado Plateau from Arizona to western Colorado [plateau striped whiptail]</p><p><b>jedna vrsta: blagoslovljeni bodljik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one species: blessed thistle [genus Cnicus]</p><p><b>godišnji od mediteranskih do portugalskih stabljika s dlakavim stabljikama i lištima s malo trnjavim zubima i velikim glavama žutih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annual of Mediterranean to Portugal having hairy stems and minutely spiny-toothed leaves and large heads of yellow flowers [blessed thistle, sweet sultan]</p><p><b>vodene žlijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hydras [Coelenterata, phylum Cnidaria, phylum Coelenterata]</p><p><b>radijalno simetrične životinje koje imaju tijela nalik vrećicama s samo jednim otvorom i pipke s štikljastim strukturama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ra