 a hard ferromagnetic silver-white bivalent or trivalent metallic element [atomic number 27, cobalt]</p><p><i>n.</i> one who refuses to serve in the armed forces on grounds of conscience [conscientious objector]</p><p><i>n.</i> a state in west central United States in the Rocky Mountains [Centennial State, Colo., Colorado]</p><p><b>koautor, suradnik</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be a co-author on (a book, a paper)</p><p><b>U slučaju da je tuženik u postupku u kojem je podnesen zahtjev za pokretanje postupka u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, tuženik koji je u postupku u kojem je podnesen zahtjev za pokretanje postupka u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe može biti tuženik koji je u postupku u kojem je podnesen zahtjev za pokretanje postupka u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a defendant who has been joined together with one or more other defendants in a single action [codefendant]</p><p><b>netko tko je prvi od dva ili više ljudi koji otkrivaju nešto (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is the first of two or more people to discover something</p><p><b>studentica na koledžu ili sveučilištu s zajedničkim obrazovanjem, u kojima prisustvuju članovi oba spola (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a female student at a coeducational college or university [college girl]</p><p><i>adj.</i> attended by members of both sexes [coeducational]</p><p><b>edukacija osoba oba spola zajedno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> educate persons of both sexes together [coeducate]</p><p><b>Idite sa mnom, padnite zajedno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> go with, fall together [coincide, cooccur]</p><p><b>izjasniti se, izjašnjavati se, priklanjati se, prikloniti se, svrstati se, svrstavati se, zauzeti stranu, zauzimati stranu</b></p><p><i>v.</i> go or occur together [collocate with, construe with, cooccur with, go with]</p><p><b>događaj ili situacija koja se događa u isto vrijeme ili u vezi s drugim događajem ili situacijom koja se događa u isto vrijeme ili u vezi s drugim događajima ili situacijama koje se događaju u isto vrijeme ili u vezi s drugim događajima ili situacijama koje se događaju u isto vrijeme ili u vezi s drugim događajima ili situacijama koje se događaju u isto vrijeme ili u vezi s drugim događajima ili situacijama koje se događaju u isto vrijeme ili u odnosu na druge događaje ili situacije., vremenska svojstva dvije stvari događaju u isto vrijeme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an event or situation that happens at the same time as or in connection with another [accompaniment, attendant, concomitant]</p><p><i>n.</i> the temporal property of two things happening at the same time [coincidence, concurrence, conjunction]</p><p><b>koji se javljaju ili rade u isto vrijeme (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring or operating at the same time [coincident, coincidental, coinciding, concurrent, cooccurring, simultaneous]</p><p><b>zadruga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a jointly owned commercial enterprise (usually organized by farmers or consumers) that produces and distributes goods and services and is run for the benefit of its owners [cooperative]</p><p><b>Republika na sjeveroistoku Južne Amerike. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in northeastern South America [British Guiana, Guyana]</p><p><b>preuzeti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> choose or elect as a fellow member or colleague</p><p><i>v.</i> neutralize or win over through assimilation into an established group</p><p><i>v.</i> appoint summarily or commandeer</p><p><i>v.</i> take or assume for one's own use</p><p><b>kooptiranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the selection of a new member (usually by a vote of the existing membership) [co-option]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of appointing summarily (with or without the appointee's consent) [co-option]</p><p><b>kooptiranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the selection of a new member (usually by a vote of the existing membership) [co-optation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of appointing summarily (with or without the appointee's consent) [co-optation]</p><p><b