ide, slide]</p><p><i>v.</i> move effortlessly</p><p><b>grmlje s svilovitim lišće i šiljcima cilindričnih žutih nektarnih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrubby tree with silky foliage and spikes of cylindrical yellow nectarous flowers [Australian honeysuckle, Banksia integrifolia, honeysuckle]</p><p><b>biljka s lišcima uglavnom na dnu i otvoreno razgranatim grmovima malih bijelih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant with leaves mostly at the base and openly branched clusters of small white flowers [Boykinia elata, Boykinia occidentalis]</p><p><b>lilij na pacifičkoj obali Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> orange-flowered lily of Pacific coast of United States [Lilium maritinum]</p><p><b>vrlo promjenjivi često grmljivi zimzeleni hrast od obalne zone zapadne Sjeverne Amerike koji ima male debele obično trnovite tamnozelene lišće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> highly variable often shrubby evergreen oak of coastal zone of western North America having small thick usually spiny-toothed dark-green leaves [California live oak, Quercus agrifolia]</p><p><b>niz planinskih lanova duž pacifičke obale Sjeverne Amerike od jugoistočne Aljaske do Donje Kalifornije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a string of mountain ranges along the Pacific coast of North America from southeastern Alaska to Lower California [Coast Range]</p><p><b>čvrsta kožna listnatog paprika zapadne Sjeverne Amerike s ovativnim listovima odvojenim do srednjeg rebra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stiff leathery-leaved fern of western North America having ovate fronds parted to the midrib [Polypodium scouleri, leatherleaf, leathery polypody]</p><p><b>niz planinskih lanova duž pacifičke obale Sjeverne Amerike od jugoistočne Aljaske do Donje Kalifornije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a string of mountain ranges along the Pacific coast of North America from southeastern Alaska to Lower California [Coast Mountains]</p><p><b>Visoko zeleno stabljike na obalnim podbrdima Sjedinjenih Država od Oregona do Big Sura (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.<