ih tesnih hlača (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (15th-16th century) a flap for the crotch of men's tight-fitting breeches</p><p><b>besmisleno govoriti ili pisati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nonsensical talk or writing [applesauce, folderol, rubbish, trash, tripe, trumpery, wish-wash]</p><p><b>Američki showman poznat po svom Wild West Showu (1846-1917) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States showman famous for his Wild West Show (1846-1917) [Buffalo Bill, Buffalo Bill Cody, William F. Cody, William Frederick Cody]</p><p><b>edukacija osoba oba spola zajedno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> educate persons of both sexes together [co-educate]</p><p><b>obrazovanje muškaraca i žena u istim ustanovama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> education of men and women in the same institutions</p><p><b>obospolan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> attended by members of both sexes [co-ed]</p><p><b>koeficijenata, koeficijent</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a constant number that serves as a measure of some property or characteristic</p><p><b>mjerenje brzine smanjenja intenziteta elektromagnetnog zračenja (kao svjetlosti) dok prolazi kroz određenu tvar (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measure of the rate of decrease in the intensity of electromagnetic radiation (as light) as it passes through a given substance [absorptance, absorption coefficient]</p><p><b>koeficijent usklađenosti između različitih skupova redovnih rangiranja istog skupa stvari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a coefficient of agreement (concordance) between different sets of rank orderings of the same set of things</p><p><b>statistička vrijednost koja prikazuje koliko se dvije varijable razlikuju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a statistic representing how closely two variables co-vary [correlation, correlation coefficient]</p><p><b>odnos otpora na tijelu koje se kreće kroz zrak na proizvod brzine i površine tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of the drag on a body moving through air to the product of the velocity and the surface area of the body [drag coefficient]</p><p><b>(fizički) odnos primjenjenog napona na promjenu oblika elastičnog tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the ratio of the applied stress to the change in shape of an elastic body [elastic modulus, modulus of elasticity]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, za sve proizvode koji sadrže: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the fractional change in length or area or volume per unit change in temperature at a given constant pressure [expansivity]</p><p><b>faktor trenja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of the weight of an object being moved along a surface and the force that maintains contact between the object and the surface</p><p><b>mjerenje indukcije između dva kola (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measure of the induction between two circuits [mutual inductance]</p><p><b>dio zračne energije koja se odražava s površine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the fraction of radiant energy that is reflected from a surface [reflectance, reflection factor, reflectivity]</p><p><b>odnos elektromotoričke sile proizvedene u krugu samoindukcijom prema brzini promjene struje koja je proizvede, izražen u h. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of the electromotive force produced in a circuit by self-induction to the rate of change of current producing it, expressed in henries [self-inductance]</p><p><b>mjerenje otpora protoka tekućine pod primjenom sile (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measure of the resistance to flow of a fluid under an applied force [absolute viscosity, dynamic viscosity]</p><p><b>Ribe za koje se mislilo da su izumrle od doba krede, ali su pronađene 1938. kod obale Afrike. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fish thought to have been extinct since the Cretaceous period but found in 1938 off the coast of Africa [Latimeria chalumnae]</p><p><b>vodene žlijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hydras [Cnidaria, phylum Cnidaria, phylum Coelenterata]</p><p><b>radijalno simetrične životinje koje imaju tijela nalik vrećicama s samo jednim otvorom i pipke s štikljastim strukturama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> radially symmetrical animals having saclike bodies with only one opening and tentacles with stinging structures [cnidarian]</p><p><b>familija ceelenterata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of coelenterates</p><p><b>rod ceelenterata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of coelenterates</p><p><b>Kožna šupljina tijela koelenterata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the saclike body cavity of a coelenterate</p><p><b>od ili u ili pripadaju šupljini trbuha (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or in or belonging to the cavity of the abdomen [celiac]</p><p><b>veliki pleksus simpatičnih živaca u trbuhu iza želuca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large plexus of sympathetic nerves in the abdomen behind the stomach [abdominal nerve plexus, plexus celiacus, solar plexus]</p><p><b>Zemljane orhideje hladnijih dijelova Sjeverne Amerike i Europe: satirske orhideje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> terrestrial orchids of cooler parts of North America and Europe: satyr orchid [genus Coeloglossum]</p><p><b>Orhideja s širokim ovativnim listovima i dugim zelenim cvjetovima vrlo nepravilnim. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> orchid with broad ovate leaves and long-bracted green very irregular flowers [satyr orchid]</p><p><b>Orhideja s dugim kapuljažnim zelenim do žutozelenim cvijećem, prepunom ljubičaste boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> orchid having hooded long-bracted green to yellow-green flowers suffused with purple [frog orchid]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih orhideja roda Coelogyne s: grmovima mirisnih čipastih sniježno-bijeli cvjetovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various orchids of the genus Coelogyne with: clusters of fragrant lacy snow-white flowers</p><p><b>šupljina u mezodermu embriona koja kod ljudi dovodi do pleuralne šupljine i perikardne šupljine i peritonealne šupljine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cavity in the mesoderm of an embryo that gives rise in humans to the pleural cavity and pericardial cavity and peritoneal cavity [celom, celoma]</p><p><b>jedan od najstarijih poznatih dinosaura (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the oldest known dinosaurs</p><p><b>optički uređaj koji prati putanje nebeskog tijela i odražava njegovu svjetlost u teleskop (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> optical device used to follow the path of a celestial body and reflect its light into a telescope</p><p><b>član vjerskoga reda koji živi zajedno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of a religious order living in common [cenobite]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s cenobitima ili njihovim običajima zajedničkog života ili im odgovaraju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or befitting cenobites or their practices of communal living [cenobitic, cenobitical, coenobitical]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s cenobitima ili njihovim običajima zajedničkog života ili im odgovaraju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or befitting cenobites or their practices of communal living [cenobitic, cenobitical, coenobitic]</p><p><b>mali molekul (ne protein, ali ponekad vitamin) neophodan za aktivnost nekih enzima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small molecule (not a protein but sometimes a vitamin) essential for the activity of some enzymes</p><p><b>Koenzim prisutan u svim živim stanicama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a coenzyme present in all living cells</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko kinona koji se nalaze u živim stanicama i koji djeluju kao koenzimi koji prenose elektrone iz jednog molekula u drugi u staničnom disanju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several quinones found in living cells and that function as coenzymes that transfer electrons from one molecule to another in cell respiration [ubiquinone]</p><p><b>imaju jednako pravo pred zakonom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the same standing before the law</p><p><b>obuzdati, prinuditi, prisiliti, suzbiti, forsirati, iznuditi, iznuđivati, nametati, nametnuti, natjerati, natjeravati, primorati, primoravati, prisiljavati, pritiskati, pritisnuti, siliti, tjerati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> to cause to do through pressure or necessity, by physical, moral or intellectual means [force, hale, pressure, squeeze]</p><p><b>prinuda, prisila</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of compelling by force of authority</p><p><i>n.</i> using force to cause something to occur [compulsion]</p><p><b>prinudan, prisilan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> serving or intended to coerce</p><p><b>vrsta roda Coerebidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Coerebidae [genus Coereba]</p><p><b>pčele. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the honeycreepers [Dacninae, family Coerebidae, family Dacninae]</p><p><b>za isti period (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of the same period [coeval, contemporaneous]</p><p><b>član indijanskog naroda koji živi u sjevernom Idahu oko jezera Coeur d'Alene, Grad u sjevernom dijelu Idaha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of an Amerindian people living in northern Idaho around Coeur d'Alene Lake</p><p><i>n.</i> a town in the northern panhandle of Idaho</p><p><b>jezero u sjevernom Idahu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lake in northern Idaho</p><p><b>suvremenik, vršnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person of nearly the same age as another [contemporary]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of the same period [coetaneous, contemporaneous]</p><p><b>generacija, naraštaj, pokoljenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> all the people living at the same time or of approximately the same age [contemporaries, generation]</p><p><b>istodobno, koegzistirati, postojati istodobno</b></p><p><i>v.</i> coexist peacefully, as of nations</p><p><i>v.</i> exist together [cohabit]</p><p><b>sunazočnost, suživot</b></p><p><i>n.</i> existing peacefully together</p><p><b>postojeći u isto vrijeme (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> existing at the same time [coexisting]</p><p><b>istodobno, koegzistirati, postojati istodobno (od &quot;coexist&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> existing at the same time [coexistent]</p><p><b>jednaki rok trajanja ili trajanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> equality of extension or duration</p><p><b>koji su jednake razine ili obima ili trajanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being of equal extent or scope or duration [conterminous, coterminous]</p><p><b>supstanca (kao koenzim) koja se mora spojiti s drugom da bi se postigao određeni rezultat (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a substance (as a coenzyme) that must join with another to produce a given result</p><p><b>kavana stabla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coffee trees [genus Coffea]</p><p><b>Šumovi iz sjeveroistočne tropske Afrike, široko uzgajani u tropskim ili blizu tropskim područjima zbog sjemena koja čine većinu komercijalne kave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrubby tree of northeastern tropical Africa widely cultivated in tropical or near tropical regions for its seed which form most of the commercial coffee [Arabian coffee]</p><p><b>izvorno iz Zapadne Afrike, ali uzgajan na Javi i drugdje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> native to West Africa but grown in Java and elsewhere [Coffea robusta, Rio Nunez coffee, robusta coffee]</p><p><b>malo stablo iz zapadne Afrike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small tree of West Africa [Liberian coffee]</p><p><b>izvorno iz Zapadne Afrike, ali uzgajan na Javi i drugdje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> native to West Africa but grown in Java and elsewhere [Coffea canephora, Rio Nunez coffee, robusta coffee]</p><p><b>kava, kave, kavine, kavu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a beverage consisting of an infusion of ground coffee beans [java]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of several small trees and shrubs native to the tropical Old World yielding coffee beans [coffee tree]</p><p><i>n.</i> a seed of the coffee tree [coffee bean, coffee berry]</p><p><i>n.</i> a medium brown to dark-brown color [burnt umber, chocolate, deep brown, umber]</p><p><b>kafić, kavana, zalogajnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small restaurant where drinks and snacks are sold [cafe, coffee shop, coffeehouse]</p><p><b>Sjeme drveta kave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a seed of the coffee tree [coffee, coffee berry]</p><p><b>Sjeme drveta kave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a seed of the coffee tree [coffee, coffee bean]</p><p><b>uticaj na biljku kave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blight affecting the coffee plant</p><p><b>prehrana uzeta tijekom pauze 