lows the characteristic nearly perpetual springing pattern [springtail]</p><p><b>čahura za zatezanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metal cap or band placed on a wooden pole to prevent splitting [ferrule]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cone-shaped chuck used for holding cylindrical pieces in a lathe [collet chuck]</p><p><i>n.</i> a band or collar that holds an individual stone in a jewelry setting</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cone-shaped chuck used for holding cylindrical pieces in a lathe [collet]</p><p><b>sudariti se, kolidirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be incompatible [clash, jar]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to collide</p><p><i>v.</i> crash together with violent impact [clash]</p><p><b>Udario protiv (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> hit against [hit, impinge on, run into, strike]</p><p><b>sudariti se (od &quot;collide&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an accelerator in which two beams of particles are forced to collide head on</p><p><b>ovčar, ovčar (pas), pas, pas ovčar, koli, škotski ovčar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a silky-coated sheepdog with a long ruff and long narrow head developed in Scotland</p><p><b>brod za prijevoz ugljena, brod za ugljen, rudar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who works in a coal mine [coal miner, pitman]</p><p><b>rudnik ugljena, ugljenokop</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a workplace consisting of a coal mine plus all the buildings and equipment connected with it [pit]</p><p><b>asocirati, povezati, povezivati, referirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a logical or causal connection [associate, connect, link, link up, relate, tie in]</p><p><i>v.</i> consider (an instance of something) as part of a general rule or principle [subsume]</p><p><b>povezivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being joined together [conjugation, conjunction, junction]</p><p><i>n.</i> the connection of isolated facts by a general hypothesis</p><p><b>napraviti ili staviti paralelno nečemu, (optički instrument) (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make or place parallel to something [