alne arhitekture koja ima veliki broj instrukcija hard kodiranih u CPU čip (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a kind of computer architecture that has a large number of instructions hard coded into the CPU chip [CISC, complex instruction set computing]</p><p><b>(računovodstvo) vrsta računalne arhitekture koja ima veliki broj instrukcija hard kodiranih u CPU čip (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a kind of computer architecture that has a large number of instructions hard coded into the CPU chip [CISC, complex instruction set computer]</p><p><b>broj s realnim i imaginarnim dijelom, kompleksni broj, imaginarni broj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) a number of the form a+bi where a and b are real numbers and i is the square root of -1 [complex quantity, imaginary, imaginary number]</p><p><b>Geometrijsko predstavljanje kompleksnih brojeva utvrđenih realnom osom i ortogonalnom imaginarnom osom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a geometric representation of the complex numbers established by the real axis and the orthogonal imaginary axis</p><p><b>imaginarni broj, kompleksni broj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) a number of the form a+bi where a and b are real numbers and i is the square root of -1 [complex number, imaginary, imaginary number]</p><p><b>zavisno složena rečenica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sentence composed of at least one main clause and one subordinate clause</p><p><b>Netko čini stvari složene. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone makes things complex</p><p><b>imaju ili razviju komplicirane posljedice, napraviti kompleksno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> have or develop complicating consequences [ramify]</p><p><i>v.</i> make complex</p><p><b>izgled, put, ten</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the coloring of a person's face [skin color, skin colour]</p><p><i>n.</i> a combination that results from coupling or interlinking</p><p><i>n.</i> a point of view or general attitude or inclination</p><p><i>n.</i> texture and appearance of the skin of the face</p><p><i>n.</i> (obsolete) 