erized by florets arranged in dense heads that resemble single flowers [composite]</p><p><b>velika britanska ili kanadska srednja škola za djecu svih sposobnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large British or Canadian secondary school for children of all abilities [comprehensive school]</p><p><b>kompozitan, kompozitni, kompozitnog, mješavina, mješovit, složen, smjesa, spregnut, spregnuta, spregnutih, spregnutim, sprezanje, kompozitna (od &quot;composite&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being a composite number</p><p><b>kompozicija, oblikovanje, sastav, sastavljanje, skladba, skladbu, slaganje, spajanje, stečajna nagodba, razmještaj, uređenje, ustroj, ustrojstvo, kemijski sastav, glazbena kompozicija, muzička kompozicija, opus, komponiranje, skladanje, autorstvo, pisanje, pisano stvaralaštvo, tipografija, esej</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the spatial property resulting from the arrangement of parts in relation to each other and to the whole [composing]</p><p><i>n.</i> the way in which someone or something is composed [constitution, make-up, makeup, physical composition]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mixture of ingredients</p><p><i>n.</i> a musical work that has been created [musical composition, opus, piece, piece of music]</p><p><i>n.</i> musical creation [composing]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of creating written works [authorship, penning, writing]</p><p><i>n.</i> art and technique of printing with movable type [typography]</p><p><i>n.</i> an essay (especially one written as an assignment) [paper, report, theme]</p><p><i>n.</i> something that is created by arranging several things to form a unified whole</p><p><b>karton</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stiff moderately thick paper [cardboard]</p><p><b>organiziranje ili grupiranje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> arranging or grouping</p><p><b>slovoslagar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who sets written material into type [setter, typesetter, typographer]</p><p><b>(štampa) spremnik u kojem kompozitor ima svoj tip, koji je podijeljen u odjeljke za različita 