ercoming distrust and animosity [placation, propitiation]</p><p><b>za umirujuće (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> intended to placate [conciliatory]</p><p><b>izmiritelj, miritelj, posrednik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who tries to bring peace [make-peace, pacifier, peacemaker, reconciler]</p><p><b>davanje ili spremnost da se popusti, za umirujuće (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> making or willing to make concessions [compromising, flexible]</p><p><i>adj.</i> intended to placate [conciliative]</p><p><b>jedar, jezgrovit, kratak, sažet</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> expressing much in few words</p><p><b>jedar, jezgrovit, kratak, sažet (od &quot;concise&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a concise manner [briefly, in brief, in short, shortly]</p><p><b>jedar, jezgrovit, kratak, sažet (od &quot;concise&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> terseness and economy in writing and speaking achieved by expressing a great deal in just a few words [concision, pithiness, succinctness]</p><p><b>U ovom slučaju, u slučaju da je riječ o izricanju riječi, to znači da se u pisanom i govornom obliku postiže kratkotrajnost i ekonomičnost. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> terseness and economy in writing and speaking achieved by expressing a great deal in just a few words [conciseness, pithiness, succinctness]</p><p><b>konklava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a confidential or secret meeting</p><p><b>dovršiti, konstatirati, sklopiti, zaključiti, završiti, dovršavati, okončati, okončavati, svršavati, svršiti, zaključivati, završavati, dovršavati se, dovršiti se, okončati se, okončavati se, prestajati, prestati, svršavati se, svršiti se, završavati se, završiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> decide by reasoning [reason, reason out]</p><p><i>v.</i> bring to a close</p><p><i>v.</i> reach a conclusion after a discussion or deliberation [resolve]</p><p><i>v.</i> come to a close [close]</p><p><i>v.</i> reach agreement on</p><p><b>sklopile, sklopljen, zaključen, zaključena</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having come or been brought to a conclusion [all over, complete, ended, over, terminated]</p><p><b>posljednji</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring at or forming an end or termination [final, last, terminal]</p><p><b>konstatacija, kraj, okončanje, prestanak, sklapanje, zaključak, završetak, odluka, konac, svršetak, okončavanje, prekid, zaključivanje, završavanje, odlučivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a position or opinion or judgment reached after consideration [decision, determination]</p><p><i>n.</i> an intuitive assumption</p><p><i>n.</i> the temporal end [close, finale, finis, finish, last, stopping point]</p><p><i>n.</i> event whose occurrence ends something [ending, finish]</p><p><i>n.</i> the proposition arrived at by logical reasoning (such as the proposition that must follow from the major and minor premises of a syllogism) [ratiocination]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of ending something [ending, termination]</p><p><i>n.</i> a final settlement</p><p><i>n.</i> the last section of a communication [close, closing, end, ending]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of making up your mind about something [decision, determination]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je predmetno pravno pravilo u skladu s člankom 1. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) Direktive 2004/39/EZ, to pravno pravilo može se upotrebljavati u slučaju da je predmetno pravno pravilo u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) Direktive 2004/39/EZ. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a finding as to the applicability of a rule of law to particular facts [finding of law]</p><p><b>konačan, odlučujući, uvjerljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> forming an end or termination</p><p><b>definitivno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a conclusive way [once and for all]</p><p><b>konačan, odlučujući, uvjerljiv (od &quot;conclusive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being final or definitely settled [decisiveness, finality]</p><p><b>kuhati, svariti, zamijesiti, domisliti se, domišljati se, izmisliti, izmišljati, izumiti, kovati, misliti, skovati, smisliti, smišljati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a concoction (of) by mixing</p><p><i>v.</i> prepare or cook by mixing ingredients [cook up]</p><p><i>v.</i> invent [trump up]</p><p><i>v.</i> devise or invent [dream up, hatch, think of, think up]</p><p><b>izmišljotina, mješavina, napitak, preparat, varenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any foodstuff made by combining different ingredients [intermixture, mixture]</p><p><i>n.</i> an occurrence of an unusual mixture</p><p><i>n.</i> the invention of a scheme or story to suit some purpose</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of creating something (a medicine or drink or soup etc.) by compounding or mixing a variety of components [confection]</p><p><b>istodobna međusobna povezanost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> occurrence or existence together or in connection with one another</p><p><b>prateći</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an event or situation that happens at the same time as or in connection with another [accompaniment, attendant, co-occurrence]</p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring with or following as a consequence [accompanying, attendant, collateral, consequent, ensuant, incidental, resultant, sequent]</p><p><b>harmonija, jedinstvo, sklad, slagati se, sloga, suglasnost, slaganje, sročnost, pristajati, složiti se, uklapati se, uklopiti se, uskladiti se, usklađivati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> capital of the state of New Hampshire [capital of New Hampshire]</p><p><i>n.</i> a harmonious state of things in general and of their properties (as of colors and sounds) [concordance, harmony]</p><p><i>n.</i> the determination of grammatical inflection on the basis of word relations [agreement]</p><p><i>n.</i> town in eastern Massachusetts near Boston where the first battle of the American Revolution was fought</p><p><i>n.</i> agreement of opinions [concordance, harmony]</p><p><i>n.</i> the first battle of the American Revolution (April 19, 1775) [Lexington, Lexington and Concord]</p><p><i>v.</i> go together [accord, agree, consort, fit in, harmonise, harmonize]</p><p><i>v.</i> arrange by concord or agreement</p><p><i>v.</i> arrange the words of a text so as to create a concordance</p><p><i>v.</i> be in accord [agree, concur, hold]</p><p><b>uši od ušiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> slipskin grape</p><p><b>suglasnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a harmonious state of things in general and of their properties (as of colors and sounds) [concord, harmony]</p><p><i>n.</i> agreement of opinions [concord, harmony]</p><p><i>n.</i> an index of all main words in a book along with their immediate contexts</p><p><b>u skladu s, da smo istog mišljenja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> in keeping [accordant, agreeable, conformable, consonant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being of the same opinion [concurring]</p><p><b>konkordat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a signed written agreement between two or more parties (nations) to perform some action [compact, covenant]</p><p><b>gomilanje, nagomilavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large gathering of people [multitude, throng]</p><p><i>n.</i> a wide hallway in a building where people can walk</p><p><i>n.</i> a coming together of people [confluence]</p><p><b>beton, betona, betonirati, betonski, konkretan, konkretnih, konkretno, konkretnom, konkretnu, materijali, stvaran, stvarna imenica, konkretne</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strong hard building material composed of sand and gravel and cement and water</p><p><i>v.</i> cover with cement</p><p><i>v.</i> form into a solid mass</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being perceived by the senses</p><p><i>adj.</i> formed by the coalescence of particles</p><p><b>područje u gradu s velikim modernim zgradama koje se smatra opasnim i neprijatnim (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an area in a city with large modern buildings that is perceived as dangerous and unpleasant</p><p><b>stroj s velikim vrtolomićem u kojem se cement miješa s drugim materijalima za izradu betona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a machine with a large revolving drum in which cement is mixed with other materials to make concrete [cement mixer]</p><p><b>predstavljanje apstraktne ideje u konkretnim uvjetima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a representation of an abstract idea in concrete terms [concretism]</p><p><b>beton, betona, betonirati, betonski, konkretan, konkretnih, konkretno, konkretnom, konkretnu, materijali, stvaran, stvarna imenica, konkretne (od &quot;concrete&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in concrete terms</p><p><b>beton, betona, betonirati, betonski, konkretan, konkretnih, konkretno, konkretnom, konkretnu, materijali, stvaran, stvarna imenica, konkretne (od &quot;concrete&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being concrete (not abstract)</p><p><b>formiranje kamenih predmeta unutar organa tijela (npr. bubrezi), čvrsta grudica nastajuća kongrecijom mineralnih soli, povećanje gustoće nečega., Ujedinjenje različitih stvari u jedno tijelo ili oblik ili grupu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the formation of stonelike objects within a body organ (e.g., the kidneys)</p><p><i>n.</i> a hard lump produced by the concretion of mineral salts [calculus]</p><p><i>n.</i> an increase in the density of something [compaction, compression, densification]</p><p><i>n.</i> the union of diverse things into one body or form or group [coalescence, coalescency, coalition, conglutination]</p><p><b>Postaju specifični. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become specific [concretize]</p><p><b>predstavljanje apstraktne ideje u konkretnim uvjetima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a representation of an abstract idea in concrete terms [concrete representation]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s konkretnim predstavama apstrakcija (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to concrete representations of abstractions</p><p><b>Napravi nešto konkretno., Postaju specifični. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make something concrete</p><p><i>v.</i> become specific [concretise]</p><p><b>suložništvo, priležništvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cohabitation without being legally married</p><p><b>konkubina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman who cohabits with an important man [courtesan, doxy, paramour]</p><p><b>pohota, požuda, fizička privlačnost, seksualna privlačnost, tjelesna privlačnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a desire for sexual intimacy [eros, physical attraction, sexual desire]</p><p><b>pohotljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> vigorously passionate [lustful, lusty]</p><p><b>podudarati se, poklapati se, slagati se, suglasiti se, koincidirati, poklopiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be in accord [agree, concord, hold]</p><p><i>v.</i> happen simultaneously [coincide]</p><p><b>potpomaganje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> agreement of results or opinions [concurrency]</p><p><i>n.</i> acting together, as agents or circumstances or events [concurrency]</p><p><i>n.</i> a state of cooperation [meeting of minds]</p><p><i>n.</i> the temporal property of two things happening at the same time [co-occurrence, coincidence, conjunction]</p><p><b>istodobnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> agreement of results or opinions [concurrence]</p><p><i>n.</i> acting together, as agents or circumstances or events [concurrence]</p><p><b>istodoban, istovremen, konkurent, podudaran, popratni, suparnik, zajednički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring or operating at the same time [co-occurrent, coincident, coincidental, coinciding, cooccurring, simultaneous]</p><p><b>S druge strane, za proizvodnju električnih vozila za vozila iz kategorije 8703 i 8704 ne vrijede: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the execution of two or more computer programs by a single computer [multiprogramming]</p><p><b>(pravno) nemar dvije ili više osoba koje djeluju neovisno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) negligence of two of more persons acting independently</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da se u ovom poglavlju ne primjenjuju primjerične oznake, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, primjenjuje se sljedeći opis: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> two or more operations performed at the same time (or within a give interval)</p><p><b>istovremeno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> overlapping in duration [at the same time]</p><p><b>da smo istog mišljenja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being of the same opinion [concordant]</p><p><b>mišljenje koje se slaže s sudskim odlukom o slučaju, ali je napisano kako bi se izrazila razmatranja određenog suca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an opinion that agrees with the court's disposition of the case but is written to express a particular judge's reasoning</p><p><b>potresti, zatresti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> shake violently</p><p><i>v.</i> injure the brain</p><p><b>kontuzija, potres</b></p><p><i>n.</i> injury to the brain caused by a blow</p><p><i>n.</i> any violent blow</p><p><b>osuditi, proglasiti krivim, ukoriti, ozloglasiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> express strong disapproval of [decry, excoriate, objurgate, reprobate]</p><p><i>v.</i> declare or judge unfit for use or habitation</p><p><i>v.</i> compel or force into a particular state or activity</p><p><i>v.</i> demonstrate the guilt of (someone)</p><p><i>v.</i> pronounce a sentence on (somebody) in a court of law [doom, sentence]</p><p><i>v.</i> appropriate (property) for public use</p><p><b>za osudu</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> bringing or deserving severe rebuke or censure [criminal, deplorable, reprehensible, vicious]</p><p><b>osuda, presuda sudska, sudska presuda, eksproprijacija, izvlaštenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expression of strong disapproval [disapprobation]</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) the act of condemning (as land forfeited for public use) or judging to be unfit for use (as a food product or an unsafe building)</p><p><i>n.</i> an appeal to some supernatural power to inflict evil on someone or some group [curse, execration]</p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being strongly disapproved of</p><p><i>n.</i> (criminal law) a final judgment of guilty in a criminal case and the punishment that is imposed [conviction, judgment of conviction, sentence]</p><p><b>koji sadrži ili nametne osudu ili osudu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> containing or imposing condemnation or censure [condemning]</p><p><b>osuditi, proglasiti krivim, ukoriti (od &quot;condemn&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> containing or imposing condemnation or censure [condemnatory]</p><p><b>kondenzacija, kondenzat, zgušnjavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a product of condensation</p><p><i>n.</i> atmospheric moisture that has condensed because of cold [condensation]</p><p><b>kondenzacija, kondenzaciju, zgušnjavanje, kondenzat, kompresija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychoanalysis) an unconscious process whereby two ideas or images combine into a single symbol</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of changing from a gaseous to a liquid or solid state</p><p><i>n.</i> atmospheric moisture that has condensed because of cold [condensate]</p><p><i>n.</i> the process or result of becoming smaller or pressed together [compression, contraction]</p><p><i>n.</i> a shortened version of a written work [abridgement, abridgment, capsule]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of increasing the density of something [condensing]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vacuum pump used to obtain a high vacuum [diffusion pump]</p><p><b>umjetni oblak koji je stvoren zrakoplovom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artificial cloud created by an aircraft [contrail]</p><p><b>kondenzirati se, sabiti, sažeti, sažeto izraziti, skratiti, zgusnuti, zgušnjavati se, koncentrirati, kondenzirati, zgušnjavati, sabijati se, sabiti se, zgusnuti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> undergo condensation [distil, distill]</p><p><i>v.</i> make more concise [concentrate, digest]</p><p><i>v.</i> remove water from</p><p><i>v.</i> cause a gas or vapor to change into a liquid</p><p><i>v.</i> become more compact or concentrated</p><p><i>v.</i> develop due to condensation</p><p><i>v.</i> compress or concentrate [concentrate, contract]</p><p><b>Slatko isparavano mlijeko (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sweetened evaporated milk</p><p><b>hladionik, kondenzator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electrical device characterized by its capacity to store an electric charge [capacitance, capacitor, electrical condenser]</p><p><i>n.</i> an apparatus that converts vapor into liquid</p><p><i>n.</i> a hollow coil that condenses by abstracting heat</p><p><i>n.</i> lens used to concentrate light on an object [optical condenser]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom materijala od 85% ili više, ali ne više od 85%, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> microphone consisting of a capacitor with one plate fixed and the other forming the diaphragm moved by sound waves [capacitor microphone, capacitor mike, condenser mike]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom materijala od 85% ili više, ali ne više od 85%, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> microphone consisting of a capacitor with one plate fixed and the other forming the diaphragm moved by sound waves [capacitor microphone, capacitor mike, condenser microphone]</p><p><b>kondenzirati se, sabiti, sažeti, sažeto izraziti, skratiti, zgusnuti, zgušnjavati se (od &quot;condense&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of increasing the density of something [condensation]</p><p><b>spustiti se, udostojati, udostojiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> behave in a patronizing and condescending manner</p><p><i>v.</i> do something that one considers to be below one's dignity [deign, descend]</p><p><i>v.</i> debase oneself morally, act in an undignified, unworthy, or dishonorable way [lower oneself, stoop]</p><p><i>v.</i> treat condescendingly [patronise, patronize]</p><p><b>ljubazan, milostiv, prijazan, pristupačan, snishodljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of behavior or attitude) characteristic of those who treat others with condescension [arch, patronising, patronizing]</p><p><b>ljubazan, milostiv, prijazan, pristupačan, snishodljiv (od &quot;condescending&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with condescension [patronisingly, patronizingly]</p><p><b>ljubazan, milostiv, prijazan, pristupačan, snishodljiv (od &quot;condescending&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> affability to your inferiors and temporary disregard for differences of position or rank [condescension]</p><p><b>osobina pokazivanja arogancije tako što se pokorava onima koje smatraju inferiornima, komunikacija koja pokazuje nepovoljanost prema primatelju tako što se ponaša kao da je prepušteno, Prijateljstvo prema svojim nižim i privremeno zanemarivanje razlika u položaju ili rangu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of displaying arrogance by patronizing those considered inferior [disdainfulness, superciliousness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a communication that indicates lack of respect by patronizing the recipient [disdain, patronage]</p><p><i>n.</i> affability to your inferiors and temporary disregard for differences of position or rank [condescendingness]</p><p><b>prikladno ili prikladno i zasluženo (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> fitting or appropriate and deserved</p><p><b>začin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a preparation (a sauce or relish or spice) to enhance flavor or enjoyment</p><p><b>kondicija, odnos, okolnost, položaj, postaviti uvjet, situacija, stanje, uvjet, uvjetovati, zahtjev, stanja, stanju, uvjetom, status, podatak, stvar, činjenica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state at a particular time [status]</p><p><i>n.</i> an assumption on which rests the validity or effect of something else [precondition, stipulation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mode of being or form of existence of a person or thing</p><p><i>n.</i> information that should be kept in mind when making a decision [circumstance, consideration]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of (good) health (especially in the phrases `in condition' or `in shape' or `out of condition' or `out of shape') [shape]</p><p><i>n.</i> an illness, disease, or other medical problem</p><p><i>n.</i> (usually plural) a statement of what is required as part of an agreement [strings, term]</p><p><i>n.</i> the procedure that is varied in order to estimate a variable's effect by comparison with a control condition [experimental condition]</p><p><i>v.</i> establish a conditioned response</p><p><i>v.</i> develop (a child's or animal's) behavior by instruction and practice [check, discipline, train]</p><p><i>v.</i> specify as a condition or requirement in a contract or agreement [qualify, specify, stipulate]</p><p><i>v.</i> put into a better state</p><p><i>v.</i> apply conditioner to in order to make smooth and shiny</p><p><b>kondicional, kondicionirana, pogodben, pogodbeni, pogodbeni način, uslovan, uvjetan, uvjetni, uvjetno</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> qualified by reservations</p><p><i>adj.</i> imposing or depending on or containing a condition</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, ugovorni ugovor može biti ugovor koji se zaključuje u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a contract whose performance depends on a fact or event that affects legal relations</p><p><b>uvjetna vjerojatnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the probability that an event will occur given that one or more other events have occurred [contingent probability]</p><p><b>primljen odgovor koji je pod kontrolom (uvjetno na pojavu) podsticaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acquired response that is under the control of (conditional on the occurrence of) a stimulus [acquired reflex, conditional reflex, conditional response, conditioned reaction, conditioned reflex, conditioned response]</p><p><b>primljen odgovor koji je pod kontrolom (uvjetno na pojavu) podsticaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acquired response that is under the control of (conditional on the occurrence of) a stimulus [acquired reflex, conditional reaction, conditional response, conditioned reaction, conditioned reflex, conditioned response]</p><p><b>logistički odnos između prijedloga p i q oblika `ako p onda q' (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a logical relation between propositions p and q of the form `if p then q' [implication, logical implication]</p><p><b>primljen odgovor koji je pod kontrolom (uvjetno na pojavu) podsticaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acquired response that is under the control of (conditional on the occurrence of) a stimulus [acquired reflex, conditional reaction, conditional reflex, conditioned reaction, conditioned reflex, conditioned response]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u pitanju kreditna vrijednost, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 3. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u slučaju da je 