ija u kojoj se pretpostavlja da je oštećenje u udruženju kanala koji povezuju različite jezike u mozgu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aphasia in which the lesion is assumed to be in the association tracts connecting the various language centers in the brain [associative aphasia]</p><p><b>gubitak sluha zbog problema s kostima srednjeg uha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hearing loss due to problems with the bones of the middle ear [conductive hearing loss, middle-ear deafness]</p><p><b>provodljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the quality or power of conducting heat or electricity or sound</p><p><b>gubitak sluha zbog problema s kostima srednjeg uha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hearing loss due to problems with the bones of the middle ear [conduction deafness, middle-ear deafness]</p><p><b>provodljivost, vodljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the transmission of heat or electricity or sound [conduction]</p><p><b>dirigent, električni vodič, kondukter, provodnik, vodič, vođa, zborovođa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who leads a musical group [director, music director]</p><p><i>n.</i> a substance that readily conducts e.g. electricity and heat</p><p><i>n.</i> the person who collects fares on a public conveyance</p><p><i>n.</i> a device designed to transmit electricity, heat, etc.</p><p><b>Žena konduktorka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman conductor</p><p><b>cijev, cjevovod, izolacijska cijev, izolaciona cijev, kanal, kanalica, vod, vodovodna cijev, kabel</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a passage (a pipe or tunnel) through which water or electric wires can pass</p><p><b>od ili povezane s ili nalik kondylu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or resembling a condyle</p><p><b>okrugli udarac na kosti gdje formira zglob s drugom kosom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a round bump on a bone where it forms a joint with another bone</p><p><b>kraniometrijska točka na vrhu mandibularnog kondila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the craniometric point at the tip of the mandibular condyle</p><p><b>genitalni kondilom</b></p><p><i>