ial assistance [middleman]</p><p><i>n.</i> a channel for communication between groups [inter-group communication, liaison, link]</p><p><i>n.</i> (electronics) a junction where things (as two electrical conductors) touch or are in physical contact [tangency]</p><p><i>n.</i> a communicative interaction [touch]</p><p><i>n.</i> a thin curved glass or plastic lens designed to fit over the cornea in order to correct vision or to deliver medication [contact lens]</p><p><i>v.</i> be in or establish communication with [get hold of, get through, reach]</p><p><i>v.</i> be in direct physical contact with [adjoin, meet, touch]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u slučaju reakcije ne primjenjuje druga metoda, u slučaju da se ne primjenjuje druga metoda, primjenjuje se druga metoda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> acceleration of a chemical reaction induced the presence of material that is chemically unchanged at the end of the reaction [catalysis]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> contact consisting of a conducting arm that rotates over a series of fixed contacts and comes to rest on an outlet [wiper, wiper arm]</p><p><b>odgođena vrsta alergijske reakcije kože koja je posljedica kontakta kože s određenim alergenom (kao što je otrovni bršljan) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a delayed type of allergic reaction of the skin resulting from skin contact with a specific allergen (such as poison ivy)</p><p><b>kontaktna leća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thin curved glass or plastic lens designed to fit over the cornea in order to correct vision or to deliver medication [contact]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 1,15 kVA ili većim od 2,25 kVA, ali ne većim od 2,25 kVA, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a microphone designed to be used in contact with a source of sound (or with a resonating surface) [contact mike]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 1,15 kVA ili većim od 2,25 kVA, ali ne većim od 2,25 kVA, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a microphone designed to be used in contact with a source of sound (or with a resonating surface) [contact microphone]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se upotrebljava u proizvodnji proizvoda iz poglavlja 94. točka (a) ovog Pravilnika, točka (b) ovog Pravilnika ne smije biti primjenjiva na proizvodnju proizvoda koji sadržava: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a print made by exposing a photosensitive surface to direct contact with a photographic negative</p><p><b>kontaktni sport</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sport that necessarily involves body contact between opposing players</p><p><b>Italijanski poljoprivrednik. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an Italian farmer</p><p><b>zaraza, prijenos</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any disease easily transmitted by contact [contagious disease]</p><p><i>n.</i> an incident in which an infectious disease is transmitted [infection, transmission]</p><p><i>n.</i> the communication of an attitude or emotional state among a number of people [infection]</p><p><b>infektivan, infektivan., kužan, zarazan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> easily diffused or spread as from one person to another</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of disease) capable of being transmitted by infection [catching, communicable, contractable, transmissible, transmittable]</p><p><b>zarazna bolest kućnih životinja koja često rezultira spontanim pobačajem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an infectious disease of domestic animals often resulting in spontaneous abortion [Bang's disease, brucellosis]</p><p><b>zarazna bolest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any disease easily transmitted by contact [contagion]</p><p><b>infektivan, infektivan., kužan, zarazan (od &quot;contagious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a contagious manner [infectiously]</p><p><b>sadržati, sadržavati, uzdržati se, sadrži, držati, nositi, primiti, zaprimati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> include or contain [comprise, incorporate]</p><p><i>v.</i> contain or hold [bear, carry, hold]</p><p><i>v.</i> lessen the intensity of [check, control, curb, hold, hold in, moderate]</p><p><i>v.</i> be divisible by</p><p><i>v.</i> be capable of holding or containing [hold, take]</p><p><i>v.</i> hold back, as of a danger or an enemy [arrest, check, hold back, stop, turn back]</p><p><b>sadržan, sadržane</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> gotten under control</p><p><b>kontejner, kontejner (podatkovni paketu korisničkom opterećen, posuda, spremnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any object that can be used to hold things (especially a large metal boxlike object of standardized dimensions that can be loaded from one form of transport to another)</p><p><b>brod kontejner</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cargo ship designed to hold containerized cargoes [container vessel, containership]</p><p><b>teretni brod namijenjen za smještaj kontejnerskog tereta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cargo ship designed to hold containerized cargoes [container ship, containership]</p><p><b>pun spremnik, spremnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quantity that a container will hold</p><p><b>pakiranje u spremniku (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> package in a container [containerize]</p><p><b>pakiranje u spremniku (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> package in a container [containerise]</p><p><b>teretni brod namijenjen za smještaj kontejnerskog tereta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cargo ship designed to hold containerized cargoes [container ship, container vessel]</p><p><b>blokiranje, obuzdavanje, okruženje, sputavanje, zadržavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a policy of creating strategic alliances in order to check the expansion of a hostile power or ideology or to force it to negotiate peacefully</p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) a system designed to prevent the accidental release of radioactive material from a reactor</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of containing</p><p><b>supstanca koja kontaminira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a substance that contaminates [contamination]</p><p><b>zaprljati, zaraziti, isprljati, kontaminirati, onečistiti, onečišćavati, onečišćivati, oskrnaviti, prljati, zagaditi, zagađivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make impure [foul, pollute]</p><p><i>v.</i> make radioactive by adding radioactive material</p><p><b>kontaminiran, kontaminiranog</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> corrupted by contact or association</p><p><i>adj.</i> rendered unwholesome by contaminants and pollution [polluted]</p><p><b>zaprljati, zaraziti (od &quot;contaminate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> spreading pollution or contamination [dirty]</p><p><i>adj.</i> that infects or taints [corrupting]</p><p><b>infektivnost, kontaminacija, kontaminirano, onečišćenja, onečišćenje, oskvrnuće, zagađivanje, zaraza, zaraženost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being contaminated [taint]</p><p><i>n.</i> a substance that contaminates [contaminant]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of contaminating or polluting [pollution]</p><p><b>zagađenje kontaktom ili mešanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> making impure by contact or mixing</p><p><b>Talijanski fizičar po kojem je Volt dobio ime (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Italian physicist after whom the volt is named [Conte Alessandro Volta, Count Alessandro Volta, Volta]</p><p><b>Talijanski fizičar po kojem je Volt dobio ime (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Italian physicist after whom the volt is named [Conte Alessandro Giuseppe Antonio Anastasio Volta, Count Alessandro Volta, Volta]</p><p><b>prezirati, nipodaštavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> look down on with disdain [despise, disdain, scorn]</p><p><b>promatrati, razmatrati, razmišljati, smišljati, kontemplirati, meditirati, misliti, mozgati, promisliti, promišljati, promozgati, razmisliti, razmotriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> look at thoughtfully</p><p><i>v.</i> consider as a possibility</p><p><i>v.</i> think intently and at length, as for spiritual purposes [meditate, study]</p><p><i>v.</i> reflect deeply on a subject [chew over, excogitate, meditate, mull, mull over, muse, ponder, reflect, ruminate, speculate, think over]</p><p><b>kontemplacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long and thoughtful observation</p><p><i>n.</i> a calm, lengthy, intent consideration [musing, reflection, reflexion, rumination, thoughtfulness]</p><p><b>Osoba posvećena kontemplativnom životu., duboko ili ozbiljno razmišljanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person devoted to the contemplative life</p><p><i>adj.</i> deeply or seriously thoughtful [brooding, broody, meditative, musing, pensive, pondering, reflective, ruminative]</p><p><b>duboko ozbiljno razmišljanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deep serious thoughtfulness [meditativeness, pensiveness]</p><p><b>sadašnjost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being current or of the present [contemporaneousness, modernism, modernity, modernness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of belonging to the same period of time [contemporaneousness]</p><p><b>istodoban, istovremen, suvremen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring in the same period of time [contemporary]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of the same period [coetaneous, coeval]</p><p><b>istodobno, istovremeno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> during the same period of time</p><p><b>istodoban, istovremen, suvremen (od &quot;contemporaneous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being current or of the present [contemporaneity, modernism, modernity, modernness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of belonging to the same period of time [contemporaneity]</p><p><b>suvremenici, generacija, naraštaj, pokoljenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> all the people living at the same time or of approximately the same age [coevals, generation]</p><p><b>današnji, današnjica, današnjice, današnjih, istodoban, moderan, suvremen, suvremene, suvremeni, suvremenik, suvremenoga, tadašnji, suvremenih, suvremenoj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person of nearly the same age as another [coeval]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of the present [modern-day]</p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging to the present time [present-day]</p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring in the same period of time [contemporaneous]</p><p><b>okolnosti i ideje današnjeg doba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the circumstances and ideas of the present age [modern times, modern world, present times]</p><p><b>događaju se u isto vrijeme, organizira ili predstavlja događaje tako da se događaju istovremeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> happen at the same time [contemporize, synchronise, synchronize]</p><p><i>v.</i> arrange or represent events so that they co-occur [contemporize, synchronise, synchronize]</p><p><b>događaju se u isto vrijeme, organizira ili predstavlja događaje tako da se događaju istovremeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> happen at the same time [contemporise, synchronise, synchronize]</p><p><i>v.</i> arrange or represent events so that they co-occur [contemporise, synchronise, synchronize]</p><p><b>nepoštovanje vlasti, prezir, preziranje, prijezir, prkos</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lack of respect accompanied by a feeling of intense dislike [despite, disdain, scorn]</p><p><i>n.</i> a manner that is generally disrespectful and contemptuous [disrespect]</p><p><i>n.</i> open disrespect for a person or thing [scorn]</p><p><i>n.</i> a willful disobedience to or disrespect for the authority of a court or legislative body</p><p><b>namjerno ometanje rada savezne zakonodavne vlasti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deliberate obstruction of the operation of the federal legislative branch</p><p><b>neodazivanje sudbenom pozivu, nepoštivanje suda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> disrespect for the rules of a court of law</p><p><b>Nevrednost zbog nedostatka viših vrijednosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> unworthiness by virtue of lacking higher values [baseness, despicability, despicableness, sordidness]</p><p><b>odvratan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> deserving of contempt or scorn</p><p><b>Na način koji zaslužuje prezir. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a manner deserving contempt</p><p><b>prezriv, uvredljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> expressing extreme contempt [disdainful, insulting, scornful]</p><p><b>prezriv (od &quot;contemptuous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without respect [contumeliously, disdainfully, scornfully]</p><p><b>prezriv (od &quot;contemptuous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the manifestation of scorn and contempt</p><p><b>boriti se, jagmiti se, natjecati se, tvrditi, debatirati, diskutirati, raspraviti, raspravljati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> maintain or assert [postulate]</p><p><i>v.</i> have an argument about something [argue, debate, fence]</p><p><i>v.</i> to make the subject of dispute, contention, or litigation [contest, repugn]</p><p><i>v.</i> succeed in doing, achieving, or producing (something) with the limited or inadequate means available [cope, deal, get by, grapple, make do, make out, manage]</p><p><i>v.</i> compete for something [compete, vie]</p><p><i>v.</i> be engaged in a fight [fight, struggle]</p><p><b>kandidat, konkurencija, konkurent, protivnik, rival, suparnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the contestant you hope to defeat [challenger, competition, competitor, rival]</p><p><b>informacijski sadržaj, količina, popis sadržaja, sadržaj, sadržajem, sadržaju, udio, zadovoljan, zadovoljiti, zadovoljno, zadovoljstvo, poruka, predmet, tema, kapacitet, mentalni sadržaj, objekt</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (usually plural) everything that is included in a collection and that is held or included in something [contents]</p><p><i>n.</i> what a communication that is about something is about [message, subject matter, substance]</p><p><i>n.</i> the proportion of a substance that is contained in a mixture or alloy etc.</p><p><i>n.</i> the amount that can be contained [capacity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the sum or range of what has been perceived, discovered, or learned [cognitive content, mental object]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being contented with your situation in life [contentedness]</p><p><i>n.</i> something (a person or object or scene) selected by an artist or photographer for graphic representation [depicted object, subject]</p><p><i>v.</i> satisfy in a limited way</p><p><i>v.</i> make content</p><p><i>adj.</i> satisfied or showing satisfaction with things as they are [contented]</p><p><b>punoznačna riječ, punoznačnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word to which an independent meaning can be assigned [open-class word]</p><p><b>dovoljan, zadovoljan, sadržaj</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> satisfied or showing satisfaction with things as they are [content]</p><p><b>dovoljan, zadovoljan (od &quot;contented&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with equanimity</p><p><b>dovoljan, zadovoljan (od &quot;contented&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being contented with your situation in life [content]</p><p><b>argument, natjecanje, rasprava, sukob, sukob zahtjeva, tvrdnja, konkuriranje, nadmetanje, rivalstvo, suparništvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a point asserted as part of an argument</p><p><i>n.</i> a contentious speech act [arguing, argument, contestation, controversy, disceptation, disputation, tilt]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of competing as for profit or a prize [competition, rivalry]</p><p><b>prijeporan, sporan, svadljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> inclined or showing an inclination to dispute or disagree, even to engage in law suits [combative, disputatious, disputative, litigious]</p><p><i>adj.</i> involving or likely to cause controversy</p><p><b>prijeporan, sporan, svadljiv (od &quot;contentious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inclination to be quarrelsome and contentious [quarrelsomeness]</p><p><b>zadovoljenje, zadovoljstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> happiness with one's situation in life</p><p><b>sadržaj, sadržaji, stvari, sadržaja, sadržaje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (usually plural) everything that is included in a collection and that is held or included in something [content]</p><p><i>n.</i> a list of divisions (chapters or articles) and the pages on which they start [table of contents]</p><p><b>granični, podudaran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> connecting without a break [contiguous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a common boundary or edge [adjacent, contiguous, neighboring]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being of equal extent or scope or duration [coextensive, coterminous]</p><p><b>borba, boriti se, izazov (natjecanje), nagradna igra, natjecanja, natjecanje, natjecati se, osporiti, pobijati, prepirka, takmičenje, takmičiti se, nadmetanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an occasion on which a winner is selected from among two or more contestants [competition]</p><p><i>n.</i> a struggle between rivals</p><p><i>v.</i> to make the subject of dispute, contention, or litigation [contend, repugn]</p><p><b>koji se može osporiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being contested</p><p><b>borac, natjecatelj, takmac, disident</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who participates in competitions</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who dissents from some established policy [dissenter, dissident, objector, protester]</p><p><b>pobijanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a contentious speech act [arguing, argument, contention, controversy, disceptation, disputation, tilt]</p><p><b>prijeporan, sporan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> disputed or made the object of contention or competition</p><p><b>pobjednik (trke ili izbora itd.) čija je pobjeda osporavana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a winner (of a race or an election etc.) whose victory is contested</p><p><b>borba, boriti se, izazov (natjecanje), nagradna igra, natjecanja, natjecanje, natjecati se, osporiti, pobijati, prepirka, takmičenje, takmičiti se (od &quot;contest&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who contests an outcome (of a race or an election etc.)</p><p><b>kontekst, kontekstnost, objašnjenje, sklop, sklopu, suvislost, ukupno značenje, dodatak, dopuna tekstu, kontekstu, okolnost, prilika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> discourse that surrounds a language unit and helps to determine its interpretation [context of use, linguistic context]</p><p><i>n.</i> the set of facts or circumstances that surround a situation or event [circumstance, setting]</p><p><b>kontekst</b></p><p><i>n.</i> discourse that surrounds a language unit and helps to determine its interpretation [context, linguistic context]</p><p><b>koji odgovara kontekstu, koji se može razabrati iz teksta, kontekstualan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or determined by or in context</p><p><b>definicija u kojoj se izraz koristi uklanjanjem u veći izraz koji sadrži njegovo objašnjenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a definition in which the term is used by embedding it in a larger expression containing its explanation</p><p><b>bilo koja doktrina koja naglašava važnost konteksta u rješavanju problema ili utvrđivanju značenja pojmova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any doctrine emphasizing the importance of the context in solving problems or establishing the meaning of terms</p><p><b>kontekstualno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a manner dependent on context</p><p><b>blizina, neprekidnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the attribute of being so near as to be touching [adjacency, contiguousness]</p><p><b>dodirni, granični, međašni, pograničan, neposredan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> very close or connected in space or time [immediate]</p><p><i>adj.</i> connecting without a break [conterminous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a common boundary or edge [adjacent, conterminous, neighboring]</p><p><b>dodirni, granični, međašni, pograničan (od &quot;contiguous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the attribute of being so near as to be touching [adjacency, contiguity]</p><p><b>čednost, umjerenost, uzdržljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the exercise of self constraint in sexual matters [continency]</p><p><i>n.</i> voluntary control over urinary and fecal discharge</p><p><b>samokontrola u spolnim stvarima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the exercise of self constraint in sexual matters [continence]</p><p><b>kontinent, kontinentalan, kopno, suzdržljiv</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the large landmasses of the earth</p><p><i>n.</i> the European mainland</p><p><i>adj.</i> having control over urination and defecation</p><p><i>adj.</i> abstaining from sexual intercourse [celibate]</p><p><b>uključujući cijeli kontinent (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> involving the entire continent</p><p><b>kontinentalan, kontinentalni, kopneni, kontinentalna, kontinentalne, kontinentalnih, kontinentalnog, kontinentalnoj, kontinentalnom</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to or typical of Europe</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or concerning the American colonies during and immediately after the American Revolutionary War</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of a continent</p><p><i>adj.</i> being or concerning or limited to a continent especially the continents of North America or Europe</p><p><b>Američka vojska tijekom Američke revolucije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the American army during the American Revolution</p><p><b>doručak koji obično uključuje kolač i kavu ili čaj. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a breakfast that usually includes a roll and coffee or tea [petit dejeuner]</p><p><b>Zakonodavno vijeće sastavljeno od delegata pobunjeničkih kolonija koji su se sastajali tijekom i nakon Američke revolucije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the legislative assembly composed of delegates from the rebel colonies who met during and after the American Revolution</p><p><b>vodonosni pojas kontinenta (posebno vodonosni pojas Sjeverne Amerike koji se formira niz planinskih grebena koji se protežu od Aljaske do Meksika) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the watershed of a continent (especially the watershed of North America formed by a series of mountain ridges extending from Alaska to Mexico)</p><p><b>postupno kretanje i formiranje kontinenata (kao što je opisano tektonskim pločama) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the gradual movement and formation of continents (as described by plate tectonics)</p><p><b>glečer koji se širi iz središnje mase leda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a glacier that spreads out from a central mass of ice</p><p><b>plan hotela koji svakodnevno nudi kontinentalni doručak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hotel plan that provides a continental breakfast daily [European plan]</p><p><b>mekana prekrivačica obično ispunjena dnom eiderskog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a soft quilt usually filled with the down of the eider [duvet, eiderdown]</p><p><b>epikontinentalni pojas, kontinentska podina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relatively shallow (up to 200 meters) seabed surrounding a continent</p><p><b>strmo silaženje morskog dna od kontinentalnog pojasa do apsisaalne zone (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the steep descent of the seabed from the continental shelf to the abyssal zone [bathyal district, bathyal zone]</p><p><b>kontingencija, slučajnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a possible event or occurrence or result [contingency, eventuality]</p><p><b>kontingencija, mogućnost, možebitnost, nepredviđena situacija, slučaj, slučajnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a possible event or occurrence or result [contingence, eventuality]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being contingent on something</p><p><b>U slučaju da je osoba koja je primljena u postupku u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe u slučaju da je osoba koja je primljena u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe u slučaju da je osoba koja je primljena u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe u slučaju da je osoba koja je primljena u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) te Uredbe u slučaju da je osoba koja je primljena u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fee that is payable only if the outcome is successful (as for an attorney's services)</p><p><b>Alternativa u odnosu na uobičajen postupak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an alternative to the normal procedure</p><p><b>kontigent, kontingent, zavisan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gathering of persons representative of some larger group</p><p><i>n.</i> a temporary military unit [detail]</p><p><i>adj.</i> possible but not certain to occur</p><p><i>adj.</i> being determined by conditions or circumstances that follow [contingent on, contingent upon, dependant on, dependant upon, dependent on, dependent upon, depending on]</p><p><i>adj.</i> uncertain because of uncontrollable circumstances</p><p><b>određene uvjetima ili okolnostima koje slijede: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being determined by conditions or circumstances that follow [contingent, contingent upon, dependant on, dependant upon, dependent on, dependent upon, depending on]</p><p><b>Probabilnost da će se događaj dogoditi s obzirom na to da se dogodio jedan ili više drugih događaja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the probability that an event will occur given that one or more other events have occurred [conditional probability]</p><p><b>određene uvjetima ili okolnostima koje slijede: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being determined by conditions or circumstances that follow [contingent, contingent on, dependant on, dependant upon, dependent on, dependent upon, depending on]</p><p><b>kontinuiran, kontinuiranih, neprekidan, neprestan, stalan, stalno, trajan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> recurring regularly or frequently in a prolonged and closely spaced series</p><p><i>adj.</i> having no interruptions</p><p><b>često, neprekidno, neprestalno, stalno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> seemingly without interruption</p><p><b>kontinuiranost, kontinuitet, nastavak, nastavljanje, neprekidnost, neprekinutost, stalnost, trajanje, trajnost, duracija, protezanje, protezanje kroz vrijeme</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of continuing an activity without interruption [continuation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the period of time during which something continues [duration]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of enduring or continuing in time [duration]</p><p><b>konsonant izražen sužavanjem (ali ne zatvaranjem) glasnog trakta, Zvuci govora proizvedeni prisilom na zrak kroz uski prolaz (kao `f', `s', `z', ili `th' u riječima `thin' i `then') (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> consonant articulated by constricting (but not closing) the vocal tract [continuant consonant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of speech sounds produced by forcing air through a constricted passage (as `f', `s', `z', or `th' in both `thin' and `then') [fricative, sibilant, spirant, strident]</p><p><b>konsonant izražen sužavanjem (ali ne zatvaranjem) glasnog trakta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> consonant articulated by constricting (but not closing) the vocal tract [continuant]</p><p><b>nastavak, nastavku, nastavljanje, obnavljanje, produžetak, kontinuiranost, kontinuitet, neprekidnost, neprekinutost, stalnost, trajanje, trajnost, dugotrajnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of continuing an activity without interruption [continuance]</p><p><i>n.</i> a part added to a book or play that continues and extends it [sequel]</p><p><i>n.</i> a Gestalt principle of organization holding that there is an innate tendency to perceive a line as continuing its established direction [good continuation, law of continuation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the consequence of being lengthened in duration [lengthiness, prolongation, protraction]</p><p><b>veznik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an uninflected function word that serves to conjoin words or phrases or clauses or sentences [conjunction, conjunctive, connective]</p><p><b>dalje, daljnji, nastaviti, potrajati, prebivati, produžiti, ustrajati, daljnjem, nastavi, nastavila, nastavljati, nastaviti se, nastavljati se, ostajati, ostati, dosegnuti, dosezati, obuhvatiti, obuhvaćati, prekriti, prekrivati, prostirati se, prostrijeti se, protegnuti se, protezati se, segnuti, sezati, uključiti, uključivati, trajati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> continue a certain state, condition, or activity [go along, go on, keep, proceed]</p><p><i>v.</i> continue talking [carry on, go on, proceed]</p><p><i>v.</i> keep or maintain in unaltered condition [bear on, carry on, preserve, uphold]</p><p><i>v.</i> move ahead [go forward, proceed]</p><p><i>v.</i> allow to remain in a place or position or maintain a property or feature [keep, keep on, retain]</p><p><i>v.</i> do something repeatedly and showing no intention to stop [persist in]</p><p><i>v.</i> continue after an interruption</p><p><i>v.</i> continue in a place, position, or situation [remain, stay, stay on]</p><p><i>v.</i> span an interval of distance, space or time [cover, extend]</p><p><i>v.</i> exist over a prolonged period of time</p><p><b>daljnji, daljnju, nastavak, nastaviti, nastavljen, neprekidan, potrajala, potrajati</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> without stop or interruption</p><p><b>lomak čiji je brojač cijeli broj i čiji je imenik cijeli broj plus lomak čiji je brojač cijeli broj i čiji je imenik cijeli broj plus lomak itd. (MT)<