re which suit is to be trumps [declarer]</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) a party to a contract</p><p><i>n.</i> a bodily organ that contracts [contractile organ]</p><p><b>ugovorni, ugovornim, ugovoran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or part of a binding legal agreement</p><p><b>kontraktualno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by virtue of a contract</p><p><b>kontraktura</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal and usually permanent contraction of a muscle</p><p><b>vrsta narodnog plesa u kojem su parovi postavljeni u serije ili su jedni prema drugima u redu, Izvesti kontradanse. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a type of folk dance in which couples are arranged in sets or face one another in a line [contra danse, contredanse, country-dance, country dancing]</p><p><i>v.</i> perform a contradance [contra danse, contredanse, country-dance]</p><p><b>opovrći, opovrgnuti, osporavati, pobijati, proturječan, proturječiti, negirati, nijekati, opovrgavati, osporiti, pobiti, poreknuti, poreći, poricati, protusloviti, zanijekati, odupirati se, oduprijeti se, protiviti se, suprotstaviti se, suprotstavljati se, usprotiviti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be in contradiction with [belie, negate]</p><p><i>v.</i> deny the truth of [contravene, negate]</p><p><i>v.</i> be resistant to [controvert, oppose]</p><p><i>v.</i> prove negative [negate]</p><p><b>kontradikcija, proturječje, proturječnost, protivurječje, protuslovlje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> opposition between two conflicting forces or ideas</p><p><i>n.</i> (logic) a statement that is necessarily false [contradiction in terms]</p><p><i>n.</i> the speech act of contradicting someone</p><p><b>kontradikcija, protivurječje, proturječje, protuslovlje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (logic) a statement that is necessarily false [contradiction]</p><p><b>proturječan (od &quot;contradictory&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a contradictory manner</p><p><b>odnos koji postoji kada suprotnosti ne mogu koegzistirati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relation that exists when opposites cannot coexist</p><p><b>proturječan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> two propositions are contradictories if both cannot be true (or both cannot be false) at the same time</p><p><i>adj.</i> of words or propositions so related that both cannot be true and both cannot be false</p><p><i>adj.</i> that confounds or contradicts or confuses [confounding]</p><p><i>adj.</i> in disagreement [at odds, conflicting, self-contradictory]</p><p><i>adj.</i> unable for both to exist or be true at the same time [mutually exclusive]</p><p><b>Razlika na temelju kontrasta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a distinction drawn on the basis of contrast</p><p><b>Razlikuju se kontrastnim osobinama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> distinguish by contrasting qualities</p><p><b>kontrafagot</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the bassoon that is the largest instrument in the oboe family [contrabassoon, double bassoon]</p><p><b>umjetni oblak koji je stvoren zrakoplovom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artificial cloud created by an aircraft [condensation trail]</p><p><b>kontraindicirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a treatment inadvisable</p><p><b>(medicinski) razlog zbog kojeg se ne preporučuje propisivanje određenog lijeka ili primjena određenog postupka ili liječenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (medicine) a reason that makes it inadvisable to prescribe a particular drug or employ a particular procedure or treatment</p><p><b>na ili u odnosu na suprotnu stranu (telo) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> on or relating to the opposite side (of the body)</p><p><b>alt, altistica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman singer having a contralto voice</p><p><i>n.</i> the lowest female singing voice [alto]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or being the lowest female voice [alto]</p><p><b>izum, novatorstvo, aparat, naprava, sprava, spraveica, spravica, sredstvo, uređaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device or control that is very useful for a particular job [appliance, contrivance, convenience, gadget, gismo, gizmo, widget]</p><p><b>U skladu s pravilima kontrapunkcije ili u skladu s njima, s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or characteristic of or according to the rules of counterpoint</p><p><i>adj.</i> having two or more independent but harmonically related melodic parts sounding together [polyphonic]</p><p><b>kompozitor koji se specijalizirao za kontrapunkt. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a composer who specializes in counterpoint</p><p><b>Ulagač koji namjerno odluči ići protiv prevladajuće mudrosti drugih ulagača. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an investor who deliberately decides to go against the prevailing wisdom of other investors</p><p><b>suprotnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relation between contraries</p><p><b>obrnut, oprečan, oprečno, protimba, protivan, protivni, protivnima, suprotan, suprotno, suprotnost, u suprotnosti, protivno (od &quot;contrary&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a contrary disobedient manner [contrariwise, perversely]</p><p><i>adv.</i> contrary to expectations [contrariwise, on the contrary, to the contrary]</p><p><b>namjerno i tvrdoglav neposlušnost i otpor prema vodstvu ili disciplini, Neprijateljski i ekscentričan. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deliberate and stubborn unruliness and resistance to guidance or discipline [perverseness, perversity]</p><p><i>n.</i> a fussy and eccentric disposition [crankiness, crotchetiness, grumpiness]</p><p><b>Teško se nositi s njima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> difficult to deal with [cross-grained]</p><p><b>U suprotnom neposlušnim načinom., s obrnutim redoslijedom., suprotno očekivanjima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a contrary disobedient manner [contrarily, perversely]</p><p><i>adv.</i> with the order reversed [the other way around, vice versa]</p><p><i>adv.</i> contrary to expectations [contrarily, on the contrary, to the contrary]</p><p><b>obrnut, oprečan, oprečno, protimba, protivan, protivni, protivnima, suprotan, suprotno, suprotnost, u suprotnosti, protivno, kontrarnost, oprečnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a relation of direct opposition [opposite, reverse]</p><p><i>n.</i> exact opposition</p><p><i>n.</i> a logical relation such that two propositions are contraries if both cannot be true but both can be false</p><p><i>adj.</i> very opposed in nature or character or purpose</p><p><i>adj.</i> of words or propositions so related that both cannot be true but both may be false</p><p><i>adj.</i> resistant to guidance or discipline [obstinate, perverse, wayward]</p><p><i>adj.</i> in an opposing direction [adverse]</p><p><b>suprotno činjenicama (obično kao hipoteza) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> going counter to the facts (usually as a hypothesis) [counterfactual]</p><p><b>protiv (od &quot;contra&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Nicaraguan counterrevolutionary guerrilla force from 1979 to 1990</p><p><b>kontrast, kontrastu, odudarati, oprečnost, razlika, suprotnost, suprotstaviti, usporediti, kontrastiranje, razlikovanje, razdjelnica, razmeđe</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the opposition or dissimilarity of things that are compared [direct contrast]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of distinguishing by comparing differences</p><p><i>n.</i> a conceptual separation or distinction [demarcation, dividing line, line]</p><p><i>n.</i> the perceptual effect of the juxtaposition of very different colors</p><p><i>n.</i> the range of optical density and tone on a photographic negative or print (or the extent to which adjacent areas on a television screen differ in brightness)</p><p><i>v.</i> put in opposition to show or emphasize differences</p><p><i>v.</i> to show differences when compared [counterpoint]</p><p><b>supstanca koja je nepristarna na rendgenske zrake (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a substance that is opaque to x-rays [contrast medium]</p><p><b>kontrast, kontrasta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a substance that is opaque to x-rays [contrast material]</p><p><b>kontrasti</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> strikingly different [contrastive]</p><p><b>kontrasti (od &quot;contrasting&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a contrasting manner</p><p><b>kontrastivan, oprečan, suprotan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of words so related that one contrasts with the other [incompatible]</p><p><i>adj.</i> strikingly different [contrasting]</p><p><i>adj.</i> syntactically establishing a relation of contrast between sentences or elements of a sentence</p><p><b>koji imaju oštre razlike između crno-bijelog (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having sharp differences between black and white</p><p><b>oduprijeti, opirati se, prekoračiti, oduprijeti se, prekršiti, negirati, nijekati, opovrgavati, opovrgnuti, opovrći, osporavati, osporiti, pobijati, pobiti, poreknuti, poreći, poricati, proturječiti, protusloviti, zanijekati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> go against, as of rules and laws [conflict, infringe, run afoul]</p><p><i>v.</i> deny the truth of [contradict, negate]</p><p><b>kršenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coming into conflict with [dispute]</p><p><b>vrsta narodnog plesa u kojem su parovi postavljeni u serije ili su jedni prema drugima u redu, Izvesti kontradanse. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a type of folk dance in which couples are arranged in sets or face one another in a line [contra danse, contradance, country-dance, country dancing]</p><p><i>v.</i> perform a contradance [contra danse, contradance, country-dance]</p><p><b>Neugodan sukob. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an awkward clash</p><p><b>darovati, dati, donirati, doprinijeti, podnesu, podnijeti, pokloniti, pridonijeti, pridonose, pridonositi, pridonjeti, priložiti, uložiti, davati, dodati, dodavati, donijeti, donositi, doprinositi, pridodati, pridodavati, pružati, pružiti, kontribuirati, prilagati, sudjelovati, ulagati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bestow a quality on [add, bestow, bring, impart, lend]</p><p><i>v.</i> contribute to some cause [chip in, give, kick in]</p><p><i>v.</i> be conducive to [conduce, lead]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide [put up]</p><p><b>doprinos, doprinosi, doprinositi</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to bring about [conducive, contributive, contributory, tributary]</p><p><b>doprinos, kontribucija, pridonošenje, prilog, sudjelovanje, udio, ulog, donacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the effort contributed by a person in bringing about a result [part, share]</p><p><i>n.</i> a voluntary gift (as of money or service or ideas) made to some worthwhile cause [donation]</p><p><i>n.</i> act of giving in common with others for a common purpose especially to a charity [donation]</p><p><i>n.</i> an amount of money contributed</p><p><i>n.</i> a writing for publication especially one of a collection of writings as an article or story</p><p><b>koji imaju tendenciju da dovedu do (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to bring about [conducive, contributing, contributory, tributary]</p><p><b>osoba koja daje (ili obećava da će dati) novčani iznos, pisac čije je djelo objavljeno u novinama ili časopisima ili kao dio knjige (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who contributes (or promises to contribute) a sum of money [subscriber]</p><p><i>n.</i> a writer whose work is published in a newspaper or magazine or as part of a book</p><p><b>doprinosni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to bring about [conducive, contributing, contributive, tributary]</p><p><b>(zakon) ponašanje tužitelja koje doprinosi šteti koja je posljedica zanemarivanja tuženika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) behavior by the plaintiff that contributes to the harm resulting from the defendant's negligence</p><p><b>koji se kaje, pokajnički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> feeling or expressing pain or sorrow for sins or offenses [remorseful, rueful, ruthful]</p><p><b>koji se kaje, pokajnički (od &quot;contrite&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a rueful manner [remorsefully, ruefully]</p><p><b>koji se kaje, pokajnički (od &quot;contrite&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sorrow for sin arising from fear of damnation [attrition, contrition]</p><p><b>skrušenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sorrow for sin arising from fear of damnation [attrition, contriteness]</p><p><b>izum, pronalazak, pronalaženje, aparat, naprava, sprava, spraveica, spravica, sredstvo, uređaj, lukavstvo, lukavština, podvala, prijevara, varka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device or control that is very useful for a particular job [appliance, contraption, convenience, gadget, gismo, gizmo, widget]</p><p><i>n.</i> the faculty of contriving</p><p><i>n.</i> an elaborate or deceitful scheme contrived to deceive or evade [dodge, stratagem]</p><p><i>n.</i> an artificial or unnatural or obviously contrived arrangement of details or parts etc.</p><p><i>n.</i> any improvised arrangement for temporary use [lash-up]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of devising something [devisal]</p><p><b>dosjetiti se, izmisliti, pronaći, smisliti, baciti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make or work out a plan for [design, plan, project]</p><p><i>v.</i> come up with (an idea, plan, explanation, theory, or principle) after a mental effort [devise, excogitate, forge, formulate, invent]</p><p><i>v.</i> put or send forth [cast, project, throw]</p><p><b>koji pokazuju učinke planiranja ili manipulacije, umjetno formalno (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> showing effects of planning or manipulation</p><p><i>adj.</i> artificially formal [artificial, hokey, stilted]</p><p><b>izumitelj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who makes plans [deviser, planner]</p><p><b>imati utjecaj, kontrola, kontrolirati, nadgledati, nadzirati, nadzor, ovladati, provjera, regulacija, reguliranje, regulirati, upravljač, upravljački postupak, upravljanje, upravljati, vođenje, kontrole, kontrolirate, kontrolu, upravljanje letom, kontroliranje, dominacija, moa, nadmoa, utjecaj, svladavanje, poznavanje, vladanje, znanje, upravljački mehanizam, upravljački sklop, komandirati, koristiti, rukovati, prekontrolirati, provjeravati, provjeriti, usporediti, uspoređivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> power to direct or determine</p><p><i>n.</i> a relation of constraint of one entity (thing or person or group) by another</p><p><i>n.</i> (physiology) regulation or maintenance of a function or action or reflex etc</p><p><i>n.</i> a standard against which other conditions can be compared in a scientific experiment [control condition]</p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of managing or exerting control over something</p><p><i>n.</i> the state that exists when one person or group has power over another [ascendance, ascendancy, ascendence, ascendency, dominance]</p><p><i>n.</i> discipline in personal and social activities [restraint]</p><p><i>n.</i> great skillfulness and knowledge of some subject or activity [command, mastery]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanism that controls the operation of a machine [controller]</p><p><i>n.</i> a spiritual agency that is assumed to assist the medium during a seance</p><p><i>n.</i> the economic policy of controlling or limiting or curbing prices or wages etc.</p><p><i>v.</i> exercise authoritative control or power over [command]</p><p><i>v.</i> lessen the intensity of [check, contain, curb, hold, hold in, moderate]</p><p><i>v.</i> handle and cause to function [operate]</p><p><i>v.</i> maintain influence over (others or oneself) skillfully, usually to one's advantage [keep in line, manipulate]</p><p><i>v.</i> check or regulate (a scientific experiment) by conducting a parallel experiment or comparing with another standard [verify]</p><p><i>v.</i> place under restrictions [restrict]</p><p><i>v.</i> verify by using a duplicate register for comparison</p><p><i>v.</i> be careful or certain to do something [ascertain, assure, check, ensure, insure, see, see to it]</p><p><i>v.</i> have a firm understanding or knowledge of [master]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 4. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 4. točkom (c) ovog članka, u (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an account that shows totals of amounts entered in a subsidiary ledger</p><p><b>kontrolna ploča, konzola, upravljaeka ploča</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electrical device consisting of a flat insulated surface that contains switches and dials and meters for controlling other electrical devices [board, control panel, instrument panel, panel]</p><p><b>kontrolni centar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the operational center for a group of related activities</p><p><b>kontrolni znak, nadzorni znak, upravljački znak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ASCII characters to indicate carriage return or tab or backspace [ASCII control character]</p><p><b>upravljački sklop</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feedback circuit that subtracts from the input [negative feedback circuit]</p><p><b>standard protiv kojeg se u znanstvenom eksperimentu mogu usporediti drugi uvjeti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a standard against which other conditions can be compared in a scientific experiment [control]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to slučaj, u slučaju da je to slučaj, u slučaju da je to slučaj, u slučaju da je to slučaj, u slučaju da je to slučaj, u slučaju da je to slučaj, u slučaju da je to slučaj, u slučaju da je to slučaj, u slučaju da je to slučaj u slučaju da je to slučaj u slučaju da je to slučaj u slučaju da je to slučaj u slučaju da je to slučaj u slučaju da je to slučaj u slučaju da je to slučaj u slučaju da je to slučaj u slučaju da je to slučaj u slučaju da je to slučaj u slučaju da je to slučaj u slučaju da je to (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an experiment designed to control for variables affecting the results of another experiment</p><p><b>osoba s natjeranom željom da kontroliše situacije i ljude (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone with a compulsive desire to exert control over situations and people</p><p><b>"Službeni sustav" je sustav koji se koristi za upravljanje informacijama o sustavu ili sustavu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an operation that controls the recording or processing or transmission of interpretation of data [control operation]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electrode placed between the cathode and anode of a vacuum tube to control the flow of electrons through the tube [grid]</p><p><b>nadzorna tipka, upravljačka tipka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) the key on a computer keyboard that is used (in combination with some other key) to type control characters [command key]</p><p><b>"Službeni sustav" je sustav koji se koristi za upravljanje informacijama o sustavu ili sustavu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an operation that controls the recording or processing or transmission of interpretation of data [control function]</p><p><b>kontrolni okvir, upravljačka ploča, kontrolna ploča, konzola, upravljaeka ploča</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electrical device consisting of a flat insulated surface that contains switches and dials and meters for controlling other electrical devices [board, control board, instrument panel, panel]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a steel or aluminum rod that can be moved up or down to control the rate of the nuclear reaction</p><p><b>kontrolna kabina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a room housing control equipment (as in a recording studio)</p><p><b>pilotska palica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lever used by a pilot to control the ailerons and elevators of an airplane [joystick, stick]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 3. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shares owned by shareholders who have a controlling interest</p><p><b>uređaj koji pruža reaktivnu snagu kada je u pokretu u odnosu na okolni zrak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device that provides reactive force when in motion relative to the surrounding air [aerofoil, airfoil, surface]</p><p><b>kontrolni sustav, upravljanja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system for controlling the operation of another system</p><p><b>kontrolni toranj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tower with an elevated workspace enclosed in glass for the visual observation of aircraft around an airport</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being controlled [governable]</p><p><b>kontroliran, pod nadzorom, pod prevladavajućim utjecajem</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> restrained or managed or kept within certain bounds</p><p><b>kontrolirana supstanca, kontrolirana tvar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug or chemical substance whose possession and use are controlled by law</p><p><b>kontroler, nadglednik, regulator, upravljački sklop, upravljački uređaj, upravljačko računalo, računovođa, kontrola, upravljač, upravljački mehanizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who maintains and audits business accounts [accountant, comptroller]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who directs and restrains [restrainer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanism that controls the operation of a machine [control]</p><p><b>poziciju kontrolora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the position of controller</p><p><b>kontrola, kontroling, kontroliranje, kontrolu, nadziranje, upravljanje</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> able to control or determine policy</p><p><b>U slučaju da je društvo u vlasništvu više od 50% dionica s glasačkim pravom, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, društvo može imati samo jednu dionicu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ownership of more than 50% of a corporation's voting shares</p><p><b>kontraverzan, kontroverzan, sporan, za diskusiju</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by or capable of arousing controversy</p><p><b>Osoba koja se prepiru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who disputes [disputant, eristic]</p><p><b>kontraverzan, kontroverzan, sporan, za diskusiju (od &quot;controversial&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> involving controversy [polemically]</p><p><b>diskusija, nesug