ple used primarily in cooking for pies and applesauce etc</p><p><b>čokolada za kuhanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pure unsweetened chocolate used in baking and icings and sauces and candy [baking chocolate, bitter chocolate]</p><p><b>za proizvodnju proizvoda od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous vegetable oils used in cooking</p><p><b>prosulja, prsura, prženica, tava, tepsija, tiganj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cooking utensil consisting of a wide metal vessel [pan]</p><p><b>štednjak, kuhalo, pea</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a kitchen appliance used for cooking food [kitchen range, kitchen stove, range, stove]</p><p><b>kuhinjski pribor od materijala koji se ne topi lako (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a kitchen utensil made of material that does not melt easily [cookware]</p><p><b>Neformalni obrok koji se kuha i jede na otvorenom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an informal meal cooked and eaten outdoors</p><p><b>za proizvodnju hrane ili za proizvodnju hrane za životinje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stove for cooking (especially a wood- or coal-burning kitchen stove)</p><p><b>kuhinjsko posuđe</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a kitchen utensil made of material that does not melt easily [cooking utensil]</p><p><b>kolačić, keks</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cook on a ranch or at a camp [cookie]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various small flat sweet cakes (`biscuit' is the British term) [biscuit, cookie]</p><p><b>staklo u kojem se čuvaju kolačići (a ponekad i novac) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a jar in which cookies are kept (and sometimes money is hidden) [cookie jar]</p><p><b>hladan, hladi, hladiti, hladiti se, hladno, hladnokrvan, hladovina, lijepilo, odl