Florida and West Indies and Cuba [Florida arrowroot, Seminole bread, Zamia pumila]</p><p><b>kavez, vrša za ribu, zatvoriti, kokošarnik, kokošinjac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a farm building for housing poultry [chicken coop, hencoop, henhouse]</p><p><i>n.</i> an enclosure made or wire or metal bars in which birds or animals can be kept [cage]</p><p><b>Uvođenje u ili kao u kucu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> confine in or as if in a coop [coop up]</p><p><b>Uvođenje u ili kao u kucu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> confine in or as if in a coop [coop in]</p><p><b>bačvar, badnjar, bakar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States industrialist who built the first American locomotive [Peter Cooper]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States film actor noted for his portrayals of strong silent heroes (1901-1961) [Frank Cooper, Gary Cooper]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States novelist noted for his stories of American Indians and the frontier life (1789-1851) [James Fenimore Cooper]</p><p><i>n.</i> a craftsman who makes or repairs wooden barrels or tubs [barrel maker]</p><p><i>v.</i> make barrels and casks</p><p><b>Univerzitet je osnovao 1859. godine Peter Cooper za besplatne kurseve u umjetnosti i znanosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> university founded in 1859 by Peter Cooper to offer free courses in the arts and sciences [Cooper Union for the Advancement of Science and Art]</p><p><b>Univerzitet je osnovao 1859. godine Peter Cooper za besplatne kurseve u umjetnosti i znanosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> university founded in 1859 by Peter Cooper to offer free courses in the arts and sciences [Cooper Union]</p><p><b>plavo-sivi sjevernoamerički sokola koji lete s puškom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bluish-grey North American hawk having a darting flight [Accipiter cooperii, blue darter]</p><p><b>suradnja, suradnje, surađivati, kolaborirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> work together on a common enterprise of project [collaborate, get together, join forces]</p><p><b>kooperacija, suradnja, suradnju, suradnje, suradnji, kolaboracija, surađivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> joint operation or action</p><p><i>n.</i> the practice of cooperating</p><p><b>suradnja, suradnje, zadruga, kooperativan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a jointly owned commercial enterprise (usually organized by farmers or consumers) that produces and distributes goods and services and is run for the benefit of its owners [co-op]</p><p><i>n.</i> an association formed and operated for the benefit of those using it</p><p><i>adj.</i> involving the joint activity of two or more [concerted, conjunct, conjunctive]</p><p><i>adj.</i> done with or working with others for a common purpose or benefit</p><p><i>adj.</i> willing to adjust to differences in order to obtain agreement [accommodative]</p><p><b>kooperativno, suradnički</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in close cooperation [hand and glove, hand in glove]</p><p><b>suradnja, suradnje, zadruga (od &quot;cooperative&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being cooperative [amenability, amenableness]</p><p><b>partner</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an associate in an activity or endeavor or sphere of common interest [collaborator, pardner, partner]</p><p><b>Mali grad u istočnom centru New Yorka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small town in east central New York</p><p><b>koordinacija, koordinacije, koordinata, koordinatni, koordinatnih, koordinatno, koordinirati, povezati, uskladiti, usklađivati, organizirati, postrojiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a number that identifies a position relative to an axis [co-ordinate]</p><p><i>v.</i> bring order and organization to [organise, organize]</p><p><i>v.</i> bring into common action, movement, or condition</p><p><i>v.</i> be co-ordinated</p><p><i>v.</i> bring (components or parts) into proper or desirable coordination correlation [align, ordinate]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of equal importance, rank, or degree</p><p><b>jedna od fiksnih referentnih crta koordinatnog sustava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the fixed reference lines of a coordinate system</p><p><b>kovalentna veza u kojoj su oba elektrona osigurana od strane jednog od atoma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a covalent bond in which both electrons are provided by one of the atoms [dative bond]</p><p><b>Reč u složenoj rečenici koja je gramatički ekvivalentna glavnoj rečenici i koja obavlja istu gramatičku funkciju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clause in a complex sentence that is grammatically equivalent to the main clause and that performs the same grammatical function</p><p><b>korištenje algebre za proučavanje geometrijskih svojstava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the use of algebra to study geometric properties [analytic geometry, analytical geometry]</p><p><b>koordinatni sustav, koordinatni sistem</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system that uses coordinates to establish position [frame of reference, reference frame, reference system]</p><p><b>koordiniran, koordinirano</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> operating as a unit [co-ordinated, interconnected, unified]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being dexterous in the use of more than one set of muscle movements [co-ordinated]</p><p><i>adj.</i> intentionally matched [co-ordinated, matching]</p><p><b>Greenwich Mean Time ažuriran s prestupnim sekundama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Greenwich Mean Time updated with leap seconds [UTC]</p><p><b>koordinacija, koordinacije, koordinata, koordinatni, koordinatnih, koordinatno, koordinirati, povezati, uskladiti, usklađivati (od &quot;coordinate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a coordinated manner</p><p><b>koordinirajući</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to connect two grammatical constituents of identical construction [coordinative]</p><p><b>Koordinacija u kombinaciji jezičkih jedinica istog statusa, spojnica (kao što su `and' ili `or') koja povezuje dva identično konstruirana gramatika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the coordination by conjunction of linguistic units of the same status</p><p><i>n.</i> a conjunction (like `and' or `or') that connects two identically constructed grammatical constituents</p><p><b>koordinacija, koordinacije, koordinacijski, koordinacijskog, koordinaciju, usklađenje, usklađivanje, usuglašavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the skillful and effective interaction of movements</p><p><i>n.</i> the regulation of diverse elements into an integrated and harmonious operation</p><p><i>n.</i> the grammatical relation of two constituents having the same grammatical form</p><p><i>n.</i> being of coordinate importance, rank, or degree</p><p><b>kompleksni spoj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compound described in terms of the central atom to which other atoms are bound or coordinated [complex]</p><p><b>koji služe za povezivanje dva gramatika istog grafičkog sastava (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to connect two grammatical constituents of identical construction [coordinating]</p><p><b>koordinator, koordinatora, koordinatoru</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone whose task is to see that work goes harmoniously [co-ordinator]</p><p><b>Rijeka koja izlazi u sjeverozapadnoj Georgiji i teče jugozapadno kroz istočnu Alabamu da se pridruži rijeci Tallapoosa blizu Montgomeryja i formira rijeku Alabama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> river that rises in northwestern Georgia and flows southwest through eastern Alabama to join the Tallapoosa River near Montgomery and form the Alabama River [Coosa River]</p><p><b>Rijeka koja izlazi u sjeverozapadnoj Georgiji i teče jugozapadno kroz istočnu Alabamu da se pridruži rijeci Tallapoosa blizu Montgomeryja i formira rijeku Alabama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> river that rises in northwestern Georgia and flows southwest through eastern Alabama to join the Tallapoosa River near Montgomery and form the Alabama River [Coosa]</p><p><b>bena, liska</b></p><p><i>n.</i> slate-black slow-flying birds somewhat resembling ducks</p><p><b>bena, liska (od &quot;coot&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large river turtle of the southern United States and northern Mexico [Pseudemys concinna, river cooter]</p><p><b>parazitska ušija koja zaražava ljudsko tijelo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a parasitic louse that infests the body of human beings [Pediculus corporis, body louse]</p><p><b>murjak, policajac, cajkan, pandur, hapsiti, hvatati, pohapsiti, pohvatati, privesti, privoditi, uhapsiti, uhititi, uhićivati, uhvatiti, zatvarati, zatvoriti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> uncomplimentary terms for a policeman [bull, copper, fuzz, pig]</p><p><i>v.</i> take by theft [glom, hook, knock off, snitch, thieve]</p><p><i>v.</i> take into custody [apprehend, arrest, collar, nab, nail, pick up]</p><p><b>izbjeći, zanemariti, povući se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> choose not to do something, as out of fear of failing [opt out]</p><p><b>potpuno zadovoljavajuće (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> completely satisfactory [copasetic, copesetic, copesettic]</p><p><b>Olejorezin koji se koristi u lakovima i mastima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an oleoresin used in varnishes and ointments [balsam capivi, copaiba balsam]</p><p><b>Olejorezin koji se koristi u lakovima i mastima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an oleoresin used in varnishes and ointments [balsam capivi, copaiba]</p><p><b>kopal</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a brittle aromatic resin used in varnishes</p><p><b>S druge strane, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> partly mineralized copal dug from the ground [copalite, fossil copal]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> partly mineralized copal dug from the ground [copaline, fossil copal]</p><p><b>dionik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a joint partner (as in a business enterprise)</p><p><b>Društvo u kojem zaposlenici dobivaju udio u dobitima uz plaću. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a partnership in which employees get a share of the profits in addition to their wages</p><p><b>potpuno zadovoljavajuće (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> completely satisfactory [copacetic, copesetic, copesettic]</p><p><b>boriti se, izaći na kraj, nositi se, ogrtač, snalaziti se, uhvatiti se u kostac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> brick that is laid sidewa