me respects between ducks and swans</p><p><b>odnos hipotenuze prema suprotnoj strani pravougaonog trouglova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ratio of the hypotenuse to the opposite side of a right-angled triangle [cosecant]</p><p><b>odnos hipotenuze prema suprotnoj strani pravougaonog trouglova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ratio of the hypotenuse to the opposite side of a right-angled triangle [cosec]</p><p><b>biti gdje zemljotresni valovi stižu istovremeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being where earthquake waves arrive simultaneously [coseismic]</p><p><b>biti gdje zemljotresni valovi stižu istovremeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being where earthquake waves arrive simultaneously [coseismal]</p><p><b>od metala prekrivenom kožom s fleksibilnom ručicom, udario s cosh, obično na glavi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of metal covered by leather with a flexible handle [blackjack, sap]</p><p><i>v.</i> hit with a cosh, usually on the head</p><p><b>maziti</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> conforming to dietary laws [kosher]</p><p><b>potpisati zajedno, Potpis i potpis (potpis druge osobe), kao za kredit (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> sign jointly [co-sign]</p><p><i>v.</i> sign and endorse (another person's signature), as for a loan [co-sign]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je ugovor ili deklaracija potpisana u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, podnositelj zahtjeva može se prijaviti u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka., potpisivanje zajedno s drugima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of two or more signers of the same document (as a treaty or declaration) [cosigner]</p><p><i>adj.</i> signing jointly with others</p><p><b>U slučaju da je ugovor ili deklaracija potpisana u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, podnositelj zahtjeva može se prijaviti u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka., (i) potpisnik osim glavnog potpisnika (za provjeru autentičnosti glavnog potpisa ili za pružanje jamstva) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of two or more signers of the same document (as a treaty or declaration) [cosignatory]</p><p><i>n.</i> a signer in addition to the principal signer (to verify the authenticity of the principal signature or to provide surety)</p><p><b>prijatno, udobno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a cozy manner [cozily]</p><p><b>Talijanski financijer i državnik i prijatelj papinog suda (1389-1464) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Italian financier and statesman and friend of the papal court (1389-1464) [Cosimo the Elder]</p><p><b>Talijanski financijer i državnik i prijatelj papinog suda (1389-1464) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Italian financier and statesman and friend of the papal court (1389-1464) [Cosimo de Medici]</p><p><b>kosinus, kosinusov</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ratio of the adjacent side to the hypotenuse of a right-angled triangle [cos]</p><p><b>udobnost, ugodnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of warm snug comfort [coziness, snugness]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih uglavnom meksičkih biljaka roda Cosmos koji imaju izlazi glave različitih boja cvijeća i listova s pinatom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various mostly Mexican herbs of the genus Cosmos having radiate heads of variously colored flowers and pinnate leaves [cosmos]</p><p><b>kozmetički, kozmetika, dekorativan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a toiletry designed to beautify the body</p><p><i>adj.</i> serving an esthetic rather than a useful purpose [decorative, ornamental]</p><p><i>adj.</i> serving an aesthetic purpose in beautifying the body [enhancive]</p><p><b>Odjel zubarstva koji se bavi izgledom zuba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of dentistry dealing with the appearance of the teeth</p><p><b>kirurg koji ljepša tijelo (posebno lice) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a surgeon who beautifies the body (especially the face) [plastic surgeon]</p><p><b>plastična kirurgija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plastic surgery to remove wrinkles and other signs of aging from your face [face lift, face lifting, facelift, lift, nip and tuck, rhytidectomy, rhytidoplasty]</p><p><b>za kozmetičke svrhe za poboljšanje izgleda (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> for cosmetic purposes to improve appearance</p><p><b>osoba koja prodaje ili koristi kozmetiku, netko tko radi u ljepotnom salonu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who sells or applies cosmetics</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who works in a beauty parlor [beautician]</p><p><b>stručnjak za upotrebu kozmetike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expert in the use of cosmetics</p><p><b>Pravila za uljepšavanje lica, kose i kože. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the practice of beautifying the face and hair and skin</p><p><b>kozmički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or from or pertaining to or characteristic of the cosmos or universe</p><p><i>adj.</i> inconceivably extended in space or time</p><p><b>(kosmologija) hlađeni ostatak vrućeg velikog praska koji ispunjava cijeli svemir i može se promatrati danas sa prosječnom temperaturom od oko 2.725 kelvina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (cosmology) the cooled remnant of the hot big bang that fills the entire universe and can be observed today with an average temperature of about 2.725 kelvin [CBR, CMB, CMBR, cosmic microwave background, cosmic microwave background radiation]</p><p><b>Oblaci čestica ili plinova koji se javljaju u svemiru. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clouds of particles or gases occurring throughout interstellar space</p><p><b>(kosmologija) hlađeni ostatak vrućeg velikog praska koji ispunjava cijeli svemir i može se promatrati danas sa prosječnom temperaturom od oko 2.725 kelvina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (cosmology) the cooled remnant of the hot big bang that fills the entire universe and can be observed today with an average temperature of about 2.725 kelvin [CBR, CMB, CMBR, cosmic background radiation, cosmic microwave background radiation]</p><p><b>(kosmologija) hlađeni ostatak vrućeg velikog praska koji ispunjava cijeli svemir i može se promatrati danas sa prosječnom temperaturom od oko 2.725 kelvina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (cosmology) the cooled remnant of the hot big bang that fills the entire universe and can be observed today with an average temperature of about 2.725 kelvin [CBR, CMB, CMBR, cosmic background radiation, cosmic microwave background]</p><p><b>zračenje koje dolazi izvana Sunčevog sustava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> radiation coming from outside the solar system</p><p><b>visoko prodiruće ionizirajuće zračenje vanzemaljskog podrijetla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> highly penetrating ionizing radiation of extraterrestrial origin</p><p><b>(kosmologija) hipotetička jednodimenzionalna subatomska čestica koja ima koncentraciju energije i dinamička svojstva fleksibilne petlje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (cosmology) a hypothetical one-dimensional subatomic particle having a concentration of energy and the dynamic properties of a flexible loop [string]</p><p><b>kozmičko vrijeme</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time covered by the physical formation and development of the universe</p><p><b>kozmid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (genetics) a large vector that is made from a bacteriophage and used to clone genes or gene fragments</p><p><b>rod ribe iz obitelji Syngnathidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of fish in the family Syngnathidae [genus Cosmocampus]</p><p><b>Ribe koje su duže od 15 cm. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fish 8 inches long [deepwater pipefish]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na granu astronomije koja se bavi porijeklom i poviješću i strukturom i dinamikom svemira (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to the branch of astronomy dealing with the origin and history and structure and dynamics of the universe [cosmogonic, cosmogonical, cosmologic, cosmological]</p><p><b>kozmogonija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of astrophysics that studies the origin and evolution and structure of the universe [cosmogony, cosmology]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na granu astronomije koja se bavi porijeklom i poviješću i strukturom i dinamikom svemira (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to the branch of astronomy dealing with the origin and history and structure and dynamics of the universe [cosmogenic, cosmogonical, cosmologic, cosmological]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na granu astronomije koja se bavi porijeklom i poviješću i strukturom i dinamikom svemira (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to the branch of astronomy dealing with the origin and history and structure and dynamics of the universe [cosmogenic, cosmogonic, cosmologic, cosmological]</p><p><b>kozmogonija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of astrophysics that studies the origin and evolution and structure of the universe [cosmogeny, cosmology]</p><p><b>Znanstvenik sa znanjem o kosmografiji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a scientist knowledgeable about cosmography [cosmographist]</p><p><b>Znanstvenik sa znanjem o kosmografiji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a scientist knowledgeable about cosmography [cosmographer]</p><p><b>kozmografija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the science that maps the general features of the universe</p><p><i>n.</i> a representation of the earth or the heavens</p><p><b>obožavanje svemira. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the worship of the cosmos</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na granu astronomije koja se bavi porijeklom i poviješću i strukturom i dinamikom svemira, koji se odnosi na granu filozofije koja se bavi elementima i zakonima i posebno karakteristikama svemira kao što su prostor i vrijeme i uzročnost (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to the branch of astronomy dealing with the origin and history and structure and dynamics of the universe [cosmogenic, cosmogonic, cosmogonical, cosmological]</p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to the branch of philosophy dealing with the elements and laws and especially the characteristics of the universe such as space and time and causality [cosmological]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na granu astronomije koja se bavi porijeklom i poviješću i strukturom i dinamikom svemira, koji se odnosi na granu filozofije koja se bavi elementima i zakonima i posebno karakteristikama svemira kao što su prostor i vrijeme i uzročnost (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to the branch of astronomy dealing with the origin and history and structure and dynamics of the universe [cosmogenic, cosmogonic, cosmogonical, cosmologic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to the branch of philosophy dealing with the elements and laws and especially the characteristics of the universe such as space and time and causality [cosmologic]</p><p><b>kozmološka konstanta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an arbitrary constant in the equations of general relativity theory</p><p><b>astronom koji proučava evoluciju i prostor-vremenske odnose svemira. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an astronomer who studies the evolution and space-time relations of the universe</p><p><b>kozmologija, kozmogonija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the metaphysical study of the origin and nature of the universe</p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of astrophysics that studies the origin and evolution and structure of the universe [cosmogeny, cosmogony]</p><p><b>astronaut, kozmonaut</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person trained to travel in a spacecraft [astronaut, spaceman]</p><p><b>svjetski, kozmopolitski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sophisticated person who has travelled in many countries [cosmopolite]</p><p><i>adj.</i> growing or occurring in many parts of the world [widely distributed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> composed of people from or at home in many parts of the world</p><p><i>adj.</i> of worldwide scope or applicability [ecumenical, general, oecumenical, universal, world-wide, worldwide]</p><p><b>sofisticirana osoba koja je putovala u mnogim zemljama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sophisticated person who has travelled in many countries [cosmopolitan]</p><p><b>kozmos, svemir, kosmos, vasiona, bitak, bivstvo, makrokozmos, svijet, univerzum</b></p><p><i>n.</i> everything that exists anywhere [creation, existence, macrocosm, universe, world]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various mostly Mexican herbs of the genus Cosmos having radiate heads of variously colored flowers and pinnate leaves [cosmea]</p><p><b>veliki protonski sinhrotron (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large proton synchrotron</p><p><b>podnositelj zahtjeva