zga, usprotiviti (se), uzvratiti, žeton, stol, šank, tabulator, povratak, kožna peta, peta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> table consisting of a horizontal surface over which business is transacted</p><p><i>n.</i> game equipment (as a piece of wood, plastic, or ivory) used for keeping a count or reserving a space in various card or board games</p><p><i>n.</i> a calculator that keeps a record of the number of times something happens [tabulator]</p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of furniture that stands at the side of a dining room [buffet, sideboard]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who counts things</p><p><i>n.</i> a quick reply to a question or remark (especially a witty or critical one) [comeback, rejoinder, replication, retort, return, riposte]</p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a register whose contents go through a regular series of states (usually states indicating consecutive integers)</p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of leather forming the back of a shoe or boot [heel counter]</p><p><i>n.</i> a return punch (especially by a boxer) [counterpunch, parry]</p><p><i>v.</i> speak in response</p><p><i>v.</i> act in advance of [anticipate, foresee, forestall]</p><p><i>adj.</i> indicating opposition or resistance [antagonistic]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in the opposite direction</p><p><b>Ček u prahu koji pruža banka za korisnike koji izvlače novac (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blank check provided by a bank for the convenience of customers who are making withdrawals</p><p><b>uvjetovanje u kojem je drugi nekompatibilan odgovor uvjetovan već uvjetovanim podražajem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> conditioning in which a second incompatible response is conditioned to an already conditioned stimulus</p><p><b>reakcija rimokatoličke crkve na reformaciju koja je potvrdila poštovanje svetih i autoritet pape (što su protestanti usprotivili) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the reaction of the Roman Catholic Church to the Reformation reaffirming the veneration of saints and the authority of the Pope (to which Protestants objected)</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measuring instrument for counting individual ionizing events</p><p><b>Bušenje u suprotnom smjeru. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> drill in an opposite direction</p><p><b>revolucionar čiji je cilj preokrenuti promjene koje je uvedla ranija revolucija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a revolutionary whose aim is to reverse the changes introduced by an earlier revolution [counterrevolutionary, counterrevolutionist]</p><p><b>Kontraobavještajna služba namijenjena otkrivanju i suzbijanju sabotaže (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> counterintelligence designed to detect and counteract sabotage</p><p><b>parirati, protiviti se, protudjelovati, suprotstaviti, suzbijati, pokvariti, potkopati, sabotirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> act in opposition to [antagonise, antagonize]</p><p><i>v.</i> oppose or check by a counteraction [countercheck]</p><p><i>v.</i> oppose and mitigate the effects of by contrary actions [counterbalance, countervail, neutralize]</p><p><i>v.</i> destroy property or hinder normal operations [countermine, sabotage, subvert, undermine, weaken]</p><p><b>osujećenje, otpor, pariranje, protudjelovanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> action intended to nullify the effects of some previous action [neutralisation, neutralization]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> opposing or neutralizing or mitigating an effect by contrary action</p><p><b>na protivni način (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a counteractive manner</p><p><b>argument koji se nudi u suprotnosti s drugim argumentom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an argument offered in opposition to another argument</p><p><b>Napad odbrambene snage protiv napadajuće neprijateljske snage kako bi se povratila izgubljena teritorija ili odjepila neprijateljska napredna jedinica itd., (šah) napad koji je namijenjen suprotstavljanju protivničkoj prednosti u drugom dijelu ploče., Napravi protunapad. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an attack by a defending force against an attacking enemy force in order to regain lost ground or cut off enemy advance units etc. [countermove]</p><p><i>n.</i> (chess) an attack that is intended to counter the opponent's advantage in another part of the board [counterplay]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a counterattack [counterstrike]</p><p><b>Rivalirna atrakcija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rival attraction</p><p><b>izjednačiti, protuteža, uravnoteženje, uravnotežiti, ekvilibrij, izjednačenje, ravnomjernost, ravnoteža, nadoknaditi, suprotstaviti se, suprotstavljati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a weight that balances another weight [balance, counterpoise, counterweight, equaliser, equalizer]</p><p><i>n.</i> equality of distribution [balance, equilibrium, equipoise]</p><p><i>n.</i> a compensating equivalent [offset]</p><p><i>v.</i> adjust for [compensate, correct, even off, even out, even up, make up]</p><p><i>v.</i> contrast with equal weight or force [oppose]</p><p><i>v.</i> oppose and mitigate the effects of by contrary actions [counteract, countervail, neutralize]</p><p><b>Uravnoteženost se postiže pomoću težine ili sile koja pomera drugu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> brought into equipoise by means of a weight or force that offsets another [counterpoised]</p><p><b>"Stražnja za zaštitu od eksploziva" znači: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fire delivered to neutralize or destroy indirect fire weapon systems</p><p><b>snažan i neograničen odgovor (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vigorous and unrestrained response</p><p><b>Odgovorni udarac. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a return blow</p><p><b>bombardiranje namijenjeno uništavanju ili neutralizaciji neprijateljskog oružja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bombardment intended to destroy or neutralize enemy weapons</p><p><b>upustivi dio</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bit for enlarging the upper part of a hole [countersink, countersink bit]</p><p><b>izazov na red. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> challenge in turn</p><p><b>izmijeniti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to change places [interchange, transpose]</p><p><b>protutužba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a charge brought by an accused person against the accuser</p><p><i>n.</i> a retaliatory charge</p><p><b>provjera koja ograničava drugu provjeru, nešto što provjerava ispravnost prethodne provjere, Odluka Komisije (EU) 2016/1036 od 25. prosinca 2016. o uvođenju mjera za zaštitu podataka o osobama (SL L 347, 20.12.2016., str., provjerite drugi put. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a check that restrains another check</p><p><i>n.</i> something that checks the correctness of a previous check [double check]</p><p><i>v.</i> oppose or check by a counteraction [counteract]</p><p><i>v.</i> check a second time</p><p><b>protutužba, protuzahtjev</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a claim filed in opposition to another claim in a legal action</p><p><i>v.</i> set up a claim in opposition to a previous claim</p><p><b>suprotno kazaljci sata</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> in the direction opposite to the rotation of the hands of a clock [anticlockwise, contraclockwise]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a direction opposite to the direction in which the hands of a clock move [anticlockwise]</p><p><b>okretanje lijevo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rotation to the left [levorotation]</p><p><b>iznenadno i odlučno svrgavanje vlade koja je došla na vlast državnim udarom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sudden and decisive overthrow of a government that gained power by a coup d'etat</p><p><b>kultura s stilom života i vrijednostima suprotnim onima u uspostavljenoj kulturi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a culture with lifestyles and values opposed to those of the established culture</p><p><b>protustruja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stretch of turbulent water in a river or the sea caused by one current flowing into or across another current [crosscurrent, rip, riptide, tide rip]</p><p><i>n.</i> actions counter to the main group activity [crosscurrent]</p><p><b>demonstracija održana u suprotnosti s drugom demonstracijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a demonstration held in opposition to another demonstration</p><p><b>Osoba koja demonstrira protiv druge demonstracije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who demonstrates in opposition to another demonstration</p><p><b>kontrašpijunaža</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spying on the spies</p><p><b>kontraprimjer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> refutation by example</p><p><b>suprotno činjenicama (obično kao hipoteza) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> going counter to the facts (usually as a hypothesis) [contrary to fact]</p><p><b>kvaliteta suprotnosti činjenici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being contrary to fact</p><p><b>falsificirati, krivotvoren, krivotvorina, krivotvoriti, lažan, patvorina, patvoriti, lažirati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a copy that is represented as the original [forgery]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a copy of with the intent to deceive [fake, forge]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not genuine [imitative]</p><p><b>falsificirati, krivotvoren, krivotvorina, krivotvoriti, lažan, patvorina, patvoriti (od &quot;counterfeit&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who makes copies illegally [forger]</p><p><b>Vatrena paljba namijenjena neutralizaciji ili uništavanju neprijateljskog oružja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fire intended to neutralize or destroy enemy weapons</p><p><b>kupon, kupon od čeka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of a check that is retained as a record [check stub, stub]</p><p><b>slaba tačka svjetlosti na noćnom nebu koja se pojavljuje neposredno nasuprot položaja Sunca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a faint spot of light in the night sky that appears directly opposite the position of the sun [gegenschein]</p><p><b>mjere koje je vlada poduzela kako bi porazila pobunu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> actions taken by a government to defeat insurgency [pacification]</p><p><b>Od ili u vezi ili karakteristika akcija poduzete od strane vlade porazit pobunu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating or characteristic of actions taken by a government to defeat insurgency</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, države članice mogu u skladu s člankom 21. stavkom (b) ovog Sporazuma osigurati da se u skladu s člankom 21. stavkom (c) ovog Sporazuma: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intelligence activities concerned with identifying and counteracting the threat to security posed by hostile intelligence organizations or by individuals engaged in espionage or sabotage or subversion or terrorism</p><p><b>Nasuprot onome što bi zdrav razum sugerirao. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> contrary to what common sense would suggest</p><p><b>Na kontradiktoran način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a counterintuitive manner</p><p><b>lijek koji se primjenjuje lokalno kako bi se uzrokovalo površinsko upale kako bi se smanjila dublja upala. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a medicine applied locally to produce superficial inflammation in order to reduce deeper inflammation</p><p><b>osoba koja služi u konobaru (kao u restoranu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who attends a counter (as in a diner) [counterperson, counterwoman]</p><p><b>poništenje, poništiti, protiv nalog, protunalog, dokinuti, lift, napustiti, opozvati, preokrenuti, prevrnuti, ukidanje, ukinuti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a contrary command cancelling or reversing a previous command</p><p><i>v.</i> cancel officially [annul, lift, overturn, repeal, rescind, reverse, revoke, vacate]</p><p><b>(vojni) marš u suprotnom smjeru ili natrag po istoj ruti, Povratak na isti način., Promjena redoslijeda vojnika tijekom marširanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (military) a march in the reverse direction or back along the same route</p><p><i>v.</i> march back along the same way</p><p><i>v.</i> change the order of soldiers during a march</p><p><b>protumjera</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an action taken to offset another action</p><p><b>pokvariti, potkopati, sabotirati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (military) a tunnel dug to defeat similar activities by the enemy</p><p><i>v.</i> destroy property or hinder normal operations [counteract, sabotage, subvert, undermine, weaken]</p><p><i>v.</i> destroy enemy mines with one's own mines</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mortar fire intended to destroy or neutralize enemy weapons</p><p><b>Napad odbrambene snage protiv napadajuće neprijateljske snage kako bi se povratila izgubljena teritorija ili odjepila neprijateljska napredna jedinica itd. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an attack by a defending force against an attacking enemy force in order to regain lost ground or cut off enemy advance units etc. [counterattack]</p><p><b>opsežna ofanziva (više od protunapada) koju poduzima odbrambena snaga kako bi preuzela inicijativu od napadajuće snage (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large scale offensive (more than a counterattack) undertaken by a defending force to seize the initiative from an attacking force</p><p><b>ponuda koju je napravio netko tko je odbio prethodnu ponudu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an offer made by someone who has rejected a prior offer</p><p><b>pokrivač, prekrivač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> decorative cover for a bed [bed cover, bed covering, bedcover, bedspread, spread]</p><p><b>duplikat, dvojnik, kopija, prijepis, suradnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person or thing having the same function or characteristics as another [opposite number, vis-a-vis]</p><p><i>n.</i> a duplicate copy [similitude, twin]</p><p><b>osoba koja služi u konobaru (kao u restoranu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who attends a counter (as in a diner) [counterman, counterwoman]</p><p><b>Plan koji je namijenjen potkopanju drugog plana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plot intended to subvert another plot [counterplot]</p><p><b>(šah) napad koji je namijenjen suprotstavljanju protivničkoj prednosti u drugom dijelu ploče. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chess) an attack that is intended to counter the opponent's advantage in another part of the board [counterattack]</p><p><b>protuprigovor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plaintiff's reply to a defendant's plea</p><p><b>Plan koji je namijenjen potkopanju drugog plana., napraviti plan u odgovoru na drugi plan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plot intended to subvert another plot [counterplan]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a plot in response to another plot</p><p><b>kontrapunkt</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a musical form involving the simultaneous sound of two or more melodies</p><p><i>v.</i> to show differences when compared [contrast]</p><p><i>v.</i> write in counterpoint</p><p><b>protuteža</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a weight that balances another weight [balance, counterbalance, counterweight, equaliser, equalizer]</p><p><i>v.</i> constitute a counterweight or counterbalance to [counterpose, counterweight]</p><p><b>Uravnoteženost se postiže pomoću težine ili sile koja pomera drugu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> brought into equipoise by means of a weight or force that offsets another [counterbalanced]</p><p><b>lijek koji zaustavlja ili kontrolira učinke otrova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a remedy that stops or controls the effects of a poison [antidote]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 2. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> constitute a counterweight or counterbalance to [counterpoise, counterweight]</p><p><b>intenzivna unaprijed dogovorena vatra isporučena kada se otkrije immanentni neprijateljski napad (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intensive prearranged fire delivered when the immanence of enemy attack is discovered</p><p><b>koji imaju tendenciju da ometaju postizanje cilja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to hinder the achievement of a goal</p><p><b>prijedlog koji se nudi kao alternativa ranijem prijedlogu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a proposal offered as an alternative to an earlier proposal</p><p><b>povratni udarac (posebno od boksača) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a return punch (especially by a boxer) [counter, parry]</p><p><b>protureformacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a reformation intended to counter the results of a prior reformation</p><p><b>kontrarevolucija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a revolution whose aim is to reverse the changes introduced by a previous revolution</p><p><b>revolucionar čiji je cilj preokrenuti promjene koje je uvedla ranija revolucija., koji se odnosi na ili je kon