(MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a counterattack [counterattack]</p><p><b>dio kontraobaveštajne službe namijenjen otkrivanju i sprečavanju subverzivnih aktivnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the aspect of counterintelligence designed to detect and prevent subversive activities</p><p><b>tužba podignuta protiv nekoga tko vas je tužio (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a suit brought against someone who has sued you</p><p><b>kontratenor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a male singer with a voice above that of a tenor</p><p><i>n.</i> the highest adult male singing voice [alto]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or being the highest male voice [alto]</p><p><b>namjenjena sprečavanju terorizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> intended to prevent terrorism [counterterrorist]</p><p><b>strategija namijenjena sprečavanju ili suzbijanju terorizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strategy intended to prevent or counter terrorism</p><p><b>netko tko pokušava spriječiti terorizam, namjenjena sprečavanju terorizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who attempts to prevent terrorism</p><p><i>adj.</i> intended to prevent terrorism [counterterror]</p><p><b>Agencija koja pomaže direktoru CIA-e da koordinira napore protiv terorizma kako bi se spriječile i zaustavile terorističke aktivnosti u najranijoj mogućoj fazi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency that helps the Director of Central Intelligence coordinate counterterrorist efforts in order to preempt and disrupt and defeat terrorist activities at the earliest possible stage [CTC]</p><p><b>radna ploča</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the top side of a counter</p><p><b>Psihoanalitičko djelovanje je psihoanalitičko djelovanje na pacijenta ili općenito emocionalno sudjelovanje psihoanalitičara u terapijskoj interakciji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the psychoanalyst's displacement of emotion onto the patient or more generally the psychoanalyst's emotional involvement in the therapeutic interaction</p><p><b>kompenzirati, poravnati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> compensate for or counterbalance [offset]</p><p><i>v.</i> oppose and mitigate the effects of by contrary actions [counteract, counterbalance, neutralize]</p><p><b>Službenici u skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 1. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a duty imposed to offset subsidies by foreign governments</p><p><b>težina koja uravnotežuje drugu težinu, U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 2. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a weight that balances another weight [balance, counterbalance, counterpoise, equaliser, equalizer]</p><p><i>v.</i> constitute a counterweight or counterbalance to [counterpoise, counterpose]</p><p><b>osoba koja služi u konobaru (kao u restoranu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who attends a counter (as in a diner) [counterman, counterperson]</p><p><b>grofica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> female equivalent of a count or earl</p><p><b>brojanje, brojenje, prebrojavanje, računanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of counting [count, enumeration, numeration, reckoning, tally]</p><p><b>Ured koji koriste računovođe poduzeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> office used by the accountants of a business</p><p><b>bezbroj, bezbrojan, brojni, brojnim</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> too numerous to be counted [infinite, innumerable, innumerous, multitudinous, myriad, numberless, uncounted, unnumberable, unnumbered, unnumerable]</p><p><b>bezbrojnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a number beyond counting [innumerableness]</p><p><b>seljački, seoski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of rural life [countryfied, rustic]</p><p><b>domovina, država, na ladanju, narodni, okolina, pokrajina, provincija, selo, zemlja, zemlje, zemlji, zemlju, ozemlje, nacija, narod, puk, pučanstvo, stanovništvo, ruralni kraj, ruralno područje, seoski kraj, kraj, područje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a politically organized body of people under a single government [body politic, commonwealth, land, nation, res publica, state]</p><p><i>n.</i> the territory occupied by a nation [land, state]</p><p><i>n.</i> the people who live in a nation or country [land, nation]</p><p><i>n.</i> an area outside of cities and towns [rural area]</p