>Promen koji je rezultat ili uzrokuje deformaciju zemljine kore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> movement resulting from or causing deformation of the earth's crust [tectonic movement]</p><p><b>Čvrsti sloj Zemljine kore za koji se vjeruje da se polako kreće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rigid layer of the Earth's crust that is believed to drift slowly [plate]</p><p><b>kora, kora (hljeba), kora hljeba, kora kruha, korica, krasta, ljuska, maska, okorjeti, pokožica (od &quot;crust&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a hardened crust as a covering [crustlike, crusty, encrusted]</p><p><b>(od lišajeva) s tankim krupnim talusom koji se usko veže za površinu na kojoj raste (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of lichens) having a thin crusty thallus that adheres closely to the surface on which it is growing</p><p><b>Talansi lišaja (Thalus lichenus) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thin crusty lichen thallus</p><p><b>čangrizav, krastav, okorio</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a hardened crust as a covering [crusted, crustlike, encrusted]</p><p><i>adj.</i> brusque and surly and forbidding [curmudgeonly, gruff, ill-humored, ill-humoured]</p><p><b>štaka, štap</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wooden or metal staff that fits under the armpit and reaches to the ground</p><p><i>n.</i> anything that serves as an expedient</p><p><b>bit značenja, nedoumica, teškoća, zapreka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small conspicuous constellation in the southern hemisphere in the Milky Way near Centaurus [Crux Australis, Southern Cross]</p><p><i>n.</i> the most important point [crux of the matter]</p><p><b>Malo vidljivo sazvežđe na južnoj hemisferi u Mliječnom putu blizu Kentaura. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small conspicuous constellation in the southern hemisphere in the Milky Way near Centaurus [Crux, Southern Cross]</p><p><b>Najvažnija stvar. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the most important point [crux]</p><p><b>dozvati, glasati se, grcati, jadikovati, jauk, krik, kriknuti, molba, plač, plakanje, plakati, poklič, poklik, povik, uzvik, vapaj, vikat