iner]</p><p><b>mala južnoamerička trnasta stabla s tamnocrvenom i crvenom crvenom cvjetom samostalna ili u skupovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small South American spiny tree with dark crimson and scarlet flowers solitary or clustered [Erythrina crista-galli, ceibo, common coral tree, cry-baby tree]</p><p><b>Preosjetljivost na hladnoću (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hypersensitivity to cold [cryaesthesia]</p><p><b>do neba vapeći, hitan, koji plače, koji viče, plač, plačan, plakanje, prijek, vapijući, oplakivanje, prolijevanje suza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of shedding tears (usually accompanied by sobs or other inarticulate sounds) [tears, weeping]</p><p><i>adj.</i> demanding attention [clamant, exigent, insistent, instant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> conspicuously and outrageously bad or reprehensible [egregious, flagrant, glaring, gross, rank]</p><p><b>osjetljivost zbog hladnoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> insensibility resulting from cold [cryoanesthesia]</p><p><b>osjetljivost zbog hladnoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> insensibility resulting from cold [cryoanaesthesia]</p><p><b>grana biologije koja proučava učinke niske temperature na živa tkiva ili organe ili organizme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of biology that studies the effects of low temperatures on living tissues or organs or organisms</p><p><b>S odjeljkom za proizvodnju električnih goriva od:, primjena tvari koja uništava tkivo smrzavanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instrument for destroying tissue by freezing it</p><p><i>n.</i> application of a substance that destroys tissue by freezing it</p><p><b>tečnost koja ključe na temperaturi ispod -160 C i koja se koristi kao rashladno sredstvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a liquid that boils at below -160 C and is used as a refrigerant</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s vrlo niskim temperaturama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to very low temperatures</p><p><b>grana fizike koja proučava pojave koje se javljaju na vrlo niskim temperaturama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of physics that studies the phenomena that occur at very low temperatures [cryogeny]</p><p><b>grana fizike koja proučava pojave koje se javljaju na vrlo niskim temperaturama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of physics that studies the phenomena that occur at very low temperatures [cryogenics]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white mineral consisting of fluorides of aluminum and sodium [Greenland spar]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thermometer designed to measure low temperatures</p><p><b>od ili povezane s krioničkom tehnologijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to cryonics</p><p><b>zamrzavanje teško bolesne ili nedavno preminule osobe kako bi se zaustavila razgradnja tkiva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the freezing of a seriously ill or recently deceased person to stop tissues from decomposing</p><p><b>ozeblina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> destruction of tissue by freezing and characterized by tingling, blistering and possibly gangrene [frostbite]</p><p><b>morbidni strah od smrzavanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a morbid fear of freezing</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measuring instrument for measuring freezing and melting points</p><p><b>termostat koji radi na vrlo niskim temperaturama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thermostat that operates at very low temperatures</p><p><b>korištenje ekstremne hladnoće (obično tekućeg dušika) za uništavanje neželjenog tkiva (bradavice ili katarakta ili rak kože) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the use of extreme cold (usually liquid nitrogen) to destroy unwanted tissue (warts or cataracts or skin cancers)</p><p><b>grobnica, grobnica u crkvi, kosturnica, kripta, šifriranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cellar or vault or underground burial chamber (especially beneath a church)</p><p><b>rod Stichaeidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Stichaeidae [genus Cryptacanthodes]</p><p><b>Ulica u obliku jegulje, atlantska dno riba s velikim gotovo vertikalnim ustima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eellike Atlantic bottom fish with large almost vertical mouth [ghostfish, wrymouth]</p><p><b>kriptoanaliza, kriptografija, kriptologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the science of analyzing and deciphering codes and ciphers and cryptograms [cryptanalytics, cryptography, cryptology]</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da su u skladu s člankom 73. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog poglavlja, sve informacije koje se odnose na ovaj podtočak mogu se upotrebljavati za potrebe ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> decoder skilled in the analysis of codes and cryptograms [cryptographer, cryptologist]</p><p><b>za ili u vezi s kriptanalizom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to cryptanalysis [cryptographic, cryptographical, cryptologic, cryptological]</p><p><b>kriptoanaliza, kriptografija, kriptologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the science of analyzing and deciphering codes and ciphers and cryptograms [cryptanalysis, cryptography, cryptology]</p><p><b>tajnovit</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of an obscure nature [cryptical, deep, inscrutable, mysterious, mystifying]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a secret or hidden meaning [cabalistic, cryptical, kabbalistic, qabalistic, sibylline]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a puzzling terseness</p><p><b>za boje koje prikrivaju ili prerušavaju oblik životinje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coloring that conceals or disguises an animal's shape</p><p><b>Nejasne prirode., ima tajno ili skriveno značenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of an obscure nature [cryptic, deep, inscrutable, mysterious, mystifying]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a secret or hidden meaning [cabalistic, cryptic, kabbalistic, qabalistic, sibylline]</p><p><b>Na tajni način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a cryptic manner [enigmatically, mysteriously]</p><p><b>stanje u kojem životinjska metabolička aktivnost dolazi do reverzibilnog zaustavljanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state in which an animal's metabolic activities come to a reversible standstill</p><p><b>za ili povezane s stanjem kriptobioze (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or related to the state of cryptobiosis</p><p><b>cryptobranchidae</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large aquatic salamanders: hellbenders [family Cryptobranchidae]</p><p><b>vrsta rod Cryptobranchidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Cryptobranchidae [genus Cryptobranchus]</p><p><b>Veliki salamander sjevernoameričkih rijeka i potoka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large salamander of North American rivers and streams [hellbender, mud puppy]</p><p><b>obitelj Blattodea (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of Blattodea [family Cryptocercidae]</p><p><b>ščurci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cockroaches [genus Cryptocercus]</p><p><b>gljivična infekcija karakterizirana nodularnim oštećenjima - prvo u plućima i širenje na živčani sustav (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungal infection characterized by nodular lesions--first in the lungs and spreading to the nervous system</p><p><b>biljke iz roda Cryptocoryne (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any plant of the genus Cryptocoryne [water trumpet]</p><p><b>bescvjetnica, kritosjemenjača, skrivenosjemenjača, tajnosjemenjača</b></p><p><i>n.</i> formerly recognized taxonomic group including all flowerless and seedless plants that reproduce by means of spores: ferns, mosses, algae, fungi</p><p><b>u bivšim sustavima klasifikacije: jedna od dvije glavne biljne kategorije, uključujući sve biljke koje ne nose sjeme: paprike, mahovi, alge, gljivice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in former classification systems: one of two major plant divisions, including all plants that do not bear seeds: ferns, mosses, algae, fungi</p><p><b>bescvjetnica, kritosjemenjača, skrivenosjemenjača, tajnosjemenjača (od &quot;cryptogam&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a cryptogam [cryptogamous]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s kriptogamom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a cryptogam [cryptogamic]</p><p><b>kriptogram</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of writing in code or cipher 