of quartz</p><p><i>n.</i> a protective cover that protects the face of a watch [watch crystal, watch glass]</p><p><b>kristalna kugla</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a glass or crystal globe used in crystal gazing by fortunetellers</p><p><b>bistar, bistrim</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> transmitting light [crystalline, limpid, lucid, pellucid, transparent]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of language) transparently clear [limpid, lucid, luculent, pellucid, perspicuous]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a counter tube in which an ionizing event increases conductivity</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a detector consisting of a fine wire in contact with a galena crystal</p><p><b>Gledajući u kristalnu kuglu da bi probudili vizije budućih ili udaljenih događaja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> staring into a crystal ball to arouse visions of future or distant events</p><p><b>3D geometrijski raspored atoma ili molekula ili iona koji čine kristal (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a 3-dimensional geometric arrangement of the atoms or molecules or ions composing a crystal [Bravais lattice, space lattice]</p><p><b>Mikrofon u kojem zvučni valovi vibriraju piezoelektričnim kristalima koji stvaraju različito napono (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a microphone in which sound waves vibrate a piezoelectric crystal that generates a varying voltage [crystal mike]</p><p><b>Mikrofon u kojem zvučni valovi vibriraju piezoelektričnim kristalima koji stvaraju različito napono (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a microphone in which sound waves vibrate a piezoelectric crystal that generates a varying voltage [crystal microphone]</p><p><b>kvarcni oscilator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an oscillator that produces electrical oscillations at a frequency determined by the physical characteristics of a piezoelectric quartz crystal [quartz oscillator]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cartridge in which an output voltage is produced by the vibration of a piezoelectric crystal</p><p><b>dioda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a semiconductor that consists of a p-n junction [diode, junction rectifier, semiconductor diode]</p><p><b>rani radio prijemnik koji koristi kristalni detektor (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an early radio receiver using a crystal detector</p><p><b>uvijekzelena grmlja istočne Sjeverne Amerike s bijelim ili kremastim zvončano-oblikovanim cvijećima i tamnozeleno dlakavim lišćama koje se koristi za čaj tijekom Američke revolucije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> evergreen shrub of eastern North America having white or creamy bell-shaped flowers and dark green hairy leaves used for tea during American Revolution [Labrador tea, Ledum groenlandicum]</p><p><b>u obliku od crvene boje ili crvene boje ili crne boje ili crne boje ili crne boje, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a green crystal (violet in water) used as a dye or stain or bactericide or fungicide or anthelmintic or burn treatment [gentian violet]</p><p><b>kristalizirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make free from confusion or ambiguity [clear, clear up, crystalize, crystallise, crystallize, elucidate, enlighten, illuminate, shed light on, sort out, straighten out]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to form crystals or assume crystalline form [crystalize, crystallise, crystallize]</p><p><i>v.</i> assume crystalline form [crystalize, crystallize, effloresce]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to take on a definite and clear shape [crystalize, crystallise, crystallize]</p><p><b>(uglavnom za voće) konzervirano premazanjem šećerom ili omogućavanjem apsorpcije šećera, s unutarnjom strukturom i vanjskom oblikom kristala (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used especially of fruits) preserved by coating with or allowing to absorb sugar [candied, crystalized, glace]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having both internal structure and external form of a crystal [crystallized]</p><p><b>kristalizirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make free from confusion or ambiguity [clear, clear up, crystalise, crystallise, crys