inning in 1907 that featured surfaces of geometrical planes</p><p><b>umjetnik koji se pridržava načela kubizma, koji se odnosi na ili karakterističan za kubizam (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artist who adheres to the principles of cubism</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or characteristic of cubism [cubistic]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na ili karakterističan za kubizam (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or characteristic of cubism [cubist]</p><p><b>lakat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient unit of length based on the length of the forearm</p><p><b>od ili u vezi sa laktom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the elbow</p><p><b>lakat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hinge joint between the forearm and upper arm and the corresponding joint in the forelimb of a quadruped [articulatio cubiti, cubitus, elbow, elbow joint, human elbow]</p><p><b>živc koji teče duž unutrašnje strane ruke i prolazi blizu laktova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nerve running along the inner side of the arm and passing near the elbow [nervus ulnaris, ulnar nerve]</p><p><b>Oklop koji štiti lakt (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> body armor that protects the elbow</p><p><b>lakat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hinge joint between the forearm and upper arm and the corresponding joint in the forelimb of a quadruped [articulatio cubiti, cubital joint, elbow, elbow joint, human elbow]</p><p><i>n.</i> the arm from the elbow to the fingertips</p><p><b>kvadar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rectangular parallelepiped</p><p><i>adj.</i> shaped like a cube [cube-shaped, cubelike, cubical, cubiform, cuboidal]</p><p><b>Koštana kost na vanjskoj strani tarsa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cube shaped bone on the outer side of the tarsus</p><p><b>kubični</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> shaped like a cube [cube-shaped, cubelike, cubical, cubiform, cuboid]</p><p><b>epitelna stanica koja ima oblik kocke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an epithelial cell that shaped like a cube [cuboidal epithelial cell]</p><p><b>epitelna stanica koja ima oblik kocke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an epithe