iness, culpability]</p><p><b>Na način ili u stupnju koji zaslužuje krivnju ili osudu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a manner or to a degree deserving blame or censure [reprehensibly]</p><p><b>krivac, optuženik, zločinac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who perpetrates wrongdoing [perpetrator]</p><p><b>kult, kultan, obožavanje, vjerski obred</b></p><p><i>n.</i> followers of an exclusive system of beliefs and practices</p><p><i>n.</i> an interest followed with exaggerated zeal [craze, fad, furor, furore, rage]</p><p><i>n.</i> followers of an unorthodox, extremist, or false religion or sect who often live outside of conventional society under the direction of a charismatic leader</p><p><i>n.</i> a religion or sect that is generally considered to be unorthodox, extremist, or false</p><p><i>n.</i> a system of religious beliefs and rituals [cultus, religious cult]</p><p><b>snažna predanost određenoj osobi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intense devotion to a particular person</p><p><b>odanost nauku ili kultu ili praksama kulta, vjerska revnost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> devotion to the doctrine or a cult or to the practices of a cult</p><p><i>n.</i> religious zeal [devotion, veneration]</p><p><b>član religijskog kulta, član neortodoksnog kulta koji obično živi izvan konvencionalnog društva pod vodstvom karizmatičnog vođe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of a religious cult</p><p><i>n.</i> a member of an unorthodox cult who generally lives outside of conventional society under the direction of a charismatic leader</p><p><b>(s poljoprivrednim zemljištem) sposobnim za produktivno uzgoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of farmland) capable of being farmed productively [arable, cultivatable, tillable]</p><p><b>kultivar, sorta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a variety of a plant developed from a natural species and maintained under cultivation</p><p><b>(s poljoprivrednim zemljištem) sposobnim za produktivno uzgoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of farmland) capable of being farmed productively [arable, cultivab