ess [damp, moistness]</p><p><b>gospođica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a young unmarried woman [damoiselle, damosel, damozel, demoiselle]</p><p><b>male svijetle boje tropske morske ribe koralnih grebena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small brilliantly colored tropical marine fishes of coral reefs [demoiselle]</p><p><b>tanak insekt koji ne ubija sličan, ali manji od libulje, ali s preokrenutim krilima u mirovanju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> slender non-stinging insect similar to but smaller than the dragonfly but having wings folded when at rest</p><p><b>tamno ljubičasta šljiva drveta damson (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dark purple plum of the damson tree [damson plum]</p><p><b>tropsko američko drvo s tamnim tvrdim teškim drvetom i malim purpurnim plodovima nalik šljive, šljiva koja se dugo uzgaja zbog svojih jestivih plodova, tamno ljubičasta šljiva drveta damson (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American timber tree with dark hard heavy wood and small plumlike purple fruit [Chrysophyllum oliviforme, caimitillo, satin leaf, satinleaf]</p><p><i>n.</i> plum tree long cultivated for its edible fruit [Prunus domestica insititia, damson plum tree]</p><p><i>n.</i> dark purple plum of the damson tree [damson]</p><p><b>šljiva koja se dugo uzgaja zbog svojih jestivih plodova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plum tree long cultivated for its edible fruit [Prunus domestica insititia, damson plum]</p><p><b>Keltska boginja koja je bila majka Tuatha De Dananna. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Celtic goddess who was the mother of the Tuatha De Danann [Danu]</p><p><b>relativno male kopnene paprike tropske Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fairly small terrestrial ferns of tropical America [genus Danaea]</p><p><b>veliki tropski leptir s degeneriranim prednjim nogama i neugodnim okusom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large tropical butterfly with degenerate forelegs and an unpleasant taste [danaid butterfly]</p><p><b>veliki tropski leptir s degeneriranim prednjim nogama i neugodnim okusom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large tropical 