thery fern of tropical Asia and Malaysia [Davalia bullata, Davalia bullata mariesii, ball fern, squirrel's-foot fern]</p><p><b>u obliku krastavca, od vrste Davallia (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hare's-foot fern of the genus Davallia [Australian hare's foot]</p><p><b>jedna od nekoliko obitelji u koje su Polypodiaceae podijeljene u nekim sustavima klasifikacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of a number of families into which Polypodiaceae has been subdivided in some classification systems [family Davalliaceae]</p><p><b>grad u istočnoj Iowi na rijeci Mississippi preko Moline i Rock Islanda, mali dekorativni pisaći stol, veliki kauč koji se obično pretvara u krevet (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in eastern Iowa on the Mississippi River across from Moline and Rock Island</p><p><i>n.</i> a small decorative writing desk</p><p><i>n.</i> a large sofa usually convertible into a bed</p><p><b>zaštitnik Velsa (oko 520-600), Francuski neoklasični slikar koji je aktivno podržavao Francusku revoluciju (1748-1825), (Stari zavjet) drugi kralj Izraelaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> patron saint of Wales (circa 520-600) [Saint David, St. David]</p><p><i>n.</i> French neoclassical painter who actively supported the French Revolution (1748-1825) [Jacques Louis David]</p><p><i>n.</i> (Old Testament) the 2nd king of the Israelites</p><p><b>Meksički slikar zidnih slika koji prikazuju prosvjed i revoluciju (1896-1974) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Mexican painter of murals depicting protest and revolution (1896-1974) [David Siqueiros, Siqueiros]</p><p><b>Američki građevinski inženjer poznat po projektovanju visećih mostova (uključujući most Georgea Washingtona) (1886-1960) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States civil engineer noted for designing suspension bridges (including the George Washington Bridge) (1886-1960) [Steinman]</p><p><b>Izraelski državnik (rođen u Poljskoj) i aktivni cionist koji je nakon Drugog svjetskog rata organizirao otpor protiv Britanaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Israeli statesman (born in Poland) and active Zionist who organized resistance against the British after World War II [Ben Gurion, David Grun]</p><p><b>Australijski liječnik i bakteriolog koji je opisao bakteriju koja uzrokuje valovitu groznicu ili brucelozu (1855-1931) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Australian physician and bacteriologist who described the bacterium that causes undulant fever or brucellosis (1855-1931) [Bruce, Sir David Bruce]</p><p><b>Američki izumitelj koji je 1775. godine dizajnirao potopnicu koja je bila neučinkovita, ali mu je kasnije zaslužila priznanje kao pionir podmornice (1742-1824) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> American inventor who in 1775 designed a man-propelled submarine that was ineffectual but subsequently earned him recognition as a submarine pioneer (1742-1824) [Bushnell, Father of the Submarine]</p><p><b>Američki graničar i političar iz Tennesseeja koji je umro u opsadi Alamoa (1786-1836) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States frontiersman and Tennessee politician who died at the siege of the Alamo (1786-1836) [Crockett, Davy Crockett]</p><p><b>Engleski glumac i voditelj kazališta koji je bio najznačajniji Shakespeareov glumac svog vremena (1717-1779) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English actor and theater manager who was the foremost Shakespearean actor of his day (1717-1779) [Garrick]</p><p><b>Američki admiral koji je zapovijedao brodovima Unije tijekom Američkog građanskog rata (1801-1870) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States admiral who commanded Union ships during the American Civil War (1801-1870) [Farragut]</p><p><b>Izraelski državnik (rođen u Poljskoj) i aktivni cionist koji je nakon Drugog svjetskog rata organizirao otpor protiv Britanaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Israeli statesman (born in Poland) and active Zionist who organized resistance against the British after World War II [Ben Gurion, David Ben Gurion]</p><p><b>Engleski filozof koji je uveo teoriju asocijacije ideja (1705-1757) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English philosopher who introduced the theory of the association of ideas (1705-1757) [Hartley]</p><p><b>Engleski romanopisac, pjesnik i esejista čiji rad osuđuje industrijsko društvo i istražuje seksualne odnose (1885-1930) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English novelist and poet and essayist whose work condemned industrial society and explored sexual relationships (1885-1930) [D. H. Lawrence, Lawrence]</p><p><b>Njemački matematičar (1862-1943) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German mathematician (1862-1943) [Hilbert]</p><p><b>Američki neurolog poznat po studijama o neuronskoj osnovi vida (rođen 1926.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States neuroscientist noted for his studies of the neural basis of vision (born in 1926) [Hubel]</p><p><b>Škotski filozof Skeptična filozofija ograničila je ljudsko znanje na ono što se može osjetiti osjetilima (1711-1776) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Scottish philosopher skeptical philosophy restricted human knowledge to that which can be perceived by the senses (1711-1776) [Hume]</p><p><b>Engleski pisac špijunskih romana (rođen 1931.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English writer of novels of espionage (born in 1931) [John le Carre, le Carre]</p><p><b>Američki filmski redatelj koji je prvi koristio flashbackove i izblijednje (1875-1948) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States film maker who was the first to use flashbacks and fade-outs (1875-1948) [D. W. Griffith, Griffith]</p><p><b>Škotski misionar i istraživač koji je otkrio rijeku Zambezi i Victoria Falls (1813-1873) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Scottish missionary and explorer who discovered the Zambezi River and Victoria Falls (1813-1873) [Livingstone]</p><p><b>Britanski politički karikaturist (rođen na Novom Zelandu) koji je stvorio lik pukovnika Blimp (1891-1963) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> British political cartoonist (born in New Zealand) who created the character Colonel Blimp (1891-1963) [Low, Sir David Alexander Cecil Low, Sir David Low]</p><p><b>Američki dramaturg (rođen 1947) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States playwright (born in 1947) 