es laid the foundations for synchronic linguistics (1857-1913) [Ferdinand de Saussure, Saussure]</p><p><b>Talijanski filmski redatelj (1901-1974) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Italian film maker (1901-1974) [Vittorio De Sica]</p><p><b>Nizozemski filozof koji je prihvatio panteistički sustav (1632-1677) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Dutch philosopher who espoused a pantheistic system (1632-1677) [Baruch de Spinoza, Benedict de Spinoza, Spinoza]</p><p><b>Irski državnik (rođen u Sjedinjenim Državama) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Irish statesman (born in the United States) [Eamon de Valera]</p><p><b>Nizozemski botaničar koji je ponovno otkrio Mendelove zakone i razvio teoriju evolucije o mutacijama (1848-1935) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Dutch botanist who rediscovered Mendel's laws and developed the mutation theory of evolution (1848-1935) [Hugo De Vries, Hugo deVries, deVries]</p><p><b>odvojiti se prodajom (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> dispose of by selling</p><p><b>uklanjanje zraka ili plina iz (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove air or gas from [deaerate]</p><p><b>Smanji naglasak. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> reduce the emphasis [de-emphasize, destress]</p><p><b>Smanji naglasak. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> reduce the emphasis [de-emphasise, destress]</p><p><b>iscrpiti, iscrpljivati, iscrpsti, izmarati, izmoriti, umarati, umoriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> deprive of energy [de-energize]</p><p><b>isprazniti energiju, iscrpiti, iscrpljivati, iscrpsti, izmarati, izmoriti, umarati, umoriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> deprive of energy [de-energise]</p><p><b>smanji se u veličini, obimu ili intenzitetu, smanjivanje razine ili intenziteta ili veličine ili opsega (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> diminish in size, scope, or intensity</p><p><i>v.</i> reduce the level or intensity or size or scope of [step down, weaken]</p><p><b>(rat) smanjenje intenziteta (krize ili rata) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (war) a reduction in intensity (of a crisis or a war)</p><p><b>odlediti, odmrznuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make or become free of frost or ice [defrost, deice]</p><p><b>dejodinaza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an enzyme that removes the iodine radical</p><p><b>uklanjanje joda iz (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove iodine from</p><p><b>uklanjanje joda iz (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> removing iodine from</p><p><b>S druge strane, za proizvodnju i proizvodnju proizvoda iz poglavlja 98. točka (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeće: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the removal of iodine atoms from organic compounds</p><p><b>uklanjanje iona iz (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove ions from</p><p><b>denacifikacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> social process of removing Nazis from official positions and giving up any allegiance to Nazism [denazification]</p><p><b>socijalni proces neutralizacije utjecaja Josipa Stalina revizijom njegove politike i uklanjanjem spomenika posvećenih njemu i preimenovanjem mjesta nazvanih u njegovu čast (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> social process of neutralizing the influence of Joseph Stalin by revising his policies and removing monuments dedicated to him and renaming places named in his honor [de-Stalinization, destalinisation, destalinization]</p><p><b>socijalni proces neutralizacije utjecaja Josipa Stalina revizijom njegove politike i uklanjanjem spomenika posvećenih njemu i preimenovanjem mjesta nazvanih u njegovu čast (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> social process of neutralizing the influence of Joseph Stalin by revising his policies and removing monuments dedicated to him and renaming places named in his honor [de-Stalinisation, destalinisation, destalinization]</p><p><b>federalna agencija odgovorna za provođenje zakona i propisa koji uređuju droge i kontrolirane tvari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> federal agency responsible for enforcing laws and regulations governing narcotics and controlled substances [Drug Enforcement Administration, Drug Enforcement Agency]</p><p><b>prodaju (umjetnička djela) iz zbirke, posebno kako bi se prikupilo novac za kupnju drugih umjetničkih djela (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> sell (art works) from a collection, especially in order to raise money for the purchase of other art works</p><p><b>đakon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Protestant layman who assists the minister [Protestant deacon]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cleric ranking just below a priest in Christian churches</p><p><b>Žena đakona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman deacon</p><p><b>obustaviti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove from active military status or reassign</p><p><i>v.</i> make inactive [inactivate]</p><p><b>deaktivacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> breaking up a military unit (by transfers or discharges) [inactivation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of deactivating or making ineffective (as a bomb) [defusing]</p><p><b>beživotan, izvjestan, mrtav, mrtvac, nevrijedan, potpuno, ravan, mrtva, sasvim, točno, umrli, naglo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> people who are no longer living</p><p><i>n.</i> a time when coldness (or some other quality associated with death) is intense</p><p><i>adj.</i> no longer having or seeming to have or expecting to have life</p><p><i>adj.</i> not showing characteristics of life especially the capacity to sustain life</p><p><i>adj.</i> very tired [all in, beat, bushed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> unerringly accurate</p><p><i>adj.</i> physically inactive</p><p><i>adj.</i> (followed by `to') not showing human feeling or sensitivity [numb]</p><p><i>adj.</i> devoid of physical sensation [deadened]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking acoustic resonance</p><p><i>adj.</i> not yielding a return [idle]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not circulating or flowing [stagnant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not surviving in active use</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking resilience or bounce</p><p><i>adj.</i> out of use or operation because of a fault or breakdown</p><p><i>adj.</i> no longer having force or relevance</p><p><i>adj.</i> the complete stoppage of an action</p><p><i>adj.</i> drained of electric charge [drained]</p><p><i>adj.</i> devoid of activity</p><p><i>adv.</i> quickly and without warning [abruptly, short, suddenly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> completely and without qualification [absolutely, perfectly, utterly]</p><p><b>ravno naprijed</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> exactly ahead or in front</p><p><b>Nevoljno prekidanje emitiranja tijekom kojeg nema zvuka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inadvertent interruption in a broadcast during which there is no sound</p><p><b>os koja nosi kotač, ali bez snage za ga pokretanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an axle that carries a wheel but without power to drive it</p><p><b>leš, strvina, tijelo, truplo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a natural object consisting of a dead animal or person [body]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to potrebno za provjeru obrtanog momenta, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, prijenos momenta na motor mora biti u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the position of a crank when it is in line with the connecting rod and not exerting torque [dead centre]</p><p><b>nulta točka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the position of a crank when it is in line with the connecting rod and not exerting torque [dead center]</p><p><b>kap koja se koristi za tajnu razmjenu obavještajnih informacija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drop used for the clandestine exchange of intelligence information</p><p><b>Nešto osuđeno na neuspjeh. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something doomed to failure</p><p><b>bezizlazan, ćorsokak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a passage with access only at one end [cul, cul de sac]</p><p><i>n.</i> a situation in which no progress can be made or no advancement is possible [deadlock, impasse, stalemate, standstill]</p><p><b>nekretnine koje su nepromijenljivo u vlasništvu (kao što je crkvena korporacija), utjecaj prošlih događaja ili odluka na nas (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> real property held inalienably (as by an ecclesiastical corporation) [mortmain]</p><p><i>n.</i> the oppressive influence of past events or decisions [dead hand of the past, mortmain]</p><p><b>utjecaj prošlih događaja ili odluka na nas (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the oppressive influence of past events or decisions [dead hand, mortmain]</p><p><b>nejednakost u utrci. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tie in a race</p><p><b>jezik koji se više ne uči kao maternji jezik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a language that is no longer learned as a native language</p><p><b>stanje nečega što je pretrpjelo svoju važnost, Pošta koja se ne može dostaviti niti vratiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of something that has outlived its relevance [non-issue]</p><p><i>n.</i> mail that can neither be delivered nor returned [dead mail]</p><p><b>stalno opterećenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a constant load on a structure (e.g. a bridge) due to the weight of the supported structure itself</p><p><b>Pošta koja se ne može dostaviti niti vratiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mail that can neither be delivered nor returned [dead letter]</p><p><b>Polako marširanje za pogrebne procesije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a slow march to be played for funeral processions [funeral march]</p><p><b>metafora koja se toliko često pojavljuje da je postala novo značenje izraza (npr. `on je zmija' možda je nekada bila metafora, ali nakon godina upotrebe umrla je i postala novo značenje riječi `zmija') (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metaphor that has occurred so often that it has become a new meaning of the expression (e.g., `he is a snake' may once have been a metaphor but after years of use it has died and become a new sense of the word `snake') [frozen metaphor]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste biljaka koje se upotrebljavaju u proizvodnji biljaka iz kategorije "Stoga" u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, za koje se primjenjuje točka (a) ovog članka, se upotrebljavaju:, bilo koja biljka iz roda Lamium koja ima gomile malih obično ljubičastih cvijeća s dvije usne, grobost, žuljasto-žuljasto-evroazijsko bilje s bijelim ili crvenkastim cvijećem i lišće nalik kopriji, biljke rodova Pilea s spušteni zelenim cvjetnim grmovima i glatkim prozirnim stabljikama i lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> foul-smelling perennial Eurasiatic herb with a green creeping rhizome [Stachys sylvatica, hedge nettle]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various plants of the genus Lamium having clusters of small usually purplish flowers with two lips</p><p><i>n.</i> coarse bristly Eurasian plant with white or reddish flowers and foliage resembling that of a nettle [Galeopsis tetrahit, hemp nettle]</p><p><i>n.</i> a plants of the genus Pilea having drooping green flower clusters and smooth translucent stems and leaves [Pilea pumilla, clearweed, richweed]</p><p><b>precizno postavljen ili bačen (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> accurately placed or thrown [true]</p><p><b>mrtvac, pokojnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is no longer alive [dead soul, deceased, deceased person, decedent, departed]</p><p><b>Procjena na temelju malog ili nikakvih informacija, navigacija bez pomoći nebeskih promatrača (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an estimate based on little or no information [guess, guessing, guesswork, shot]</p><p><i>n.</i> navigation without the aid of celestial observations</p><p><b>Osoba koja je gotovo identična drugoj osobi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is almost identical to another [clone, ringer]</p><p><b>mrtvačnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a building (or room) where dead bodies are kept before burial or cremation [morgue, mortuary]</p><p><b>jezero slane vode na granici između Izraela i Jordana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a saltwater lake on the border between Israel and Jordan</p><p><b>(Stari zavjet) zbirka pisanih svitaka (koji sadrže gotovo sav Stari zavjet) pronađena u pećini blizu Mrtvog mora krajem 1940-ih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Old Testament) a collection of written scrolls (containing nearly all of the Old Testament) found in a cave near the Dead Sea in the late 1940s</p><p><b>-Sve je u redu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> fixed in your purpose [bent, bent on, out to]</p><p><b>pokojnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is no longer alive [dead person, deceased, deceased person, decedent, departed]</p><p><b>tara