se, or vigorous [blunt]</p><p><i>v.</i> convert (metallic mercury) into a grey powder consisting of minute globules, as by shaking with chalk or fatty oil</p><p><b>izgubiti snagu, omlitaviti (od &quot;deaden&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> devoid of physical sensation [dead]</p><p><i>adj.</i> made or become less intense</p><p><b>izgubiti snagu, omlitaviti (od &quot;deaden&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of making something futile and useless (as by routine) [constipation, impairment, stultification]</p><p><i>adj.</i> so lacking in interest as to cause mental weariness [boring, dull, ho-hum, irksome, slow, tedious, tiresome, wearisome]</p><p><b>-Smrtonosna metka., (nautički) okrugli disk od tvrdog drveta s rupama i ruputim perimetrom koji se koristi za stezanje pokrivača (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dead shot</p><p><i>n.</i> (nautical) a round hardwood disk with holes and a grooved perimeter used to tighten a shroud</p><p><b>osoba koja ne poduzima poslove i ne plaća svoj put., vlak ili autobus ili taksi koji putuje prazan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nonenterprising person who is not paying his way</p><p><i>n.</i> a train or bus or taxi traveling empty</p><p><b>snažan zatvarač iznad brodskog prozora koji je zatvoren u olujnim vremenima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strong shutter over a ship's porthole that is closed in stormy weather</p><p><b>dogovoreni rok, krajnji rok, posljednji rok, rok, zadnji rok, termin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the point in time at which something must be completed</p><p><b>kvaliteta smrtonosnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being deadly [lethality]</p><p><b>bez rješenja, ćorsokak, mrtva točka, potpuni zastoj, zastoj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a situation in which no progress can be made or no advancement is possible [dead end, impasse, stalemate, standstill]</p><p><b>bez rješenja, ćorsokak, mrtva točka, potpuni zastoj, zastoj (od &quot;deadlock&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> at a complete standstill because of opposition of two unrelenting forces or factions [stalemated]</p><p><b>samrtnički, smrtni, smrtno, smrtonosan, smrtonosni, smrtonosna, ubojit</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing or capable of causing death [deathly, mortal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of an instrument of certain death [lethal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> extremely poisonous or injurious [venomous, virulent]</p><p><i>adj.</i> involving loss of divine grace or spiritual death [mortal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> exceedingly harmful [baneful, pernicious, pestilent]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a disease) having a rapid course and violent effect</p><p><i>adv.</i> as if dead [lifelessly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> (used as intensives) extremely [deucedly, devilishly, insanely, madly]</p><p><b>višegodišnje evroazijsko bilje s crvenkastim cvjetovima u obliku zvona i sjajnim crnim bojama, otrovna višegodišnja vinograda Starog svijeta s ljubičastim cvijećem i ovalnim koralno crvenim bojama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial Eurasian herb with reddish bell-shaped flowers and shining black berries [Atropa belladonna, belladonna, belladonna plant]</p><p><i>n.</i> poisonous perennial Old World vine having violet flowers and oval coral-red berries [Solanum dulcamara, bittersweet, bittersweet nightshade, climbing nightshade, poisonous nightshade, woody nightshade]</p><p><b>smrtni grijeh</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unpardonable sin entailing a total loss of grace [mortal sin]</p><p><b>mrtvilo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being unresponsive [unresponsiveness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the physical property of something that has lost its elasticity</p><p><i>n.</i> the inanimate property of something that has died</p><p><b>bezizražajan, bezličan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> deliberately impassive in manner [expressionless, impassive, poker-faced, unexpressive]</p><p><i>adv.</i> without betraying any feeling</p><p><b>grana ili dio drveta koji je mrtav, netko ili nešto što je neželjeno i nepotrebno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch or a part of a tree that is dead</p><p><i>n.</i> someone or something that is unwanted and unneeded [fifth wheel]</p><p><b>za proizvodnju električnih goriva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used for chromatography [diethylaminoethyl cellulose]</p><p><b>uklanjanje zraka ili plina iz (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove air or gas from [de-aerate]</p><p><b>gluh, gluhi, oglušiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> people who have severe hearing impairments</p><p><i>v.</i> make or render deaf [deafen]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking or deprived of the sense of hearing wholly or in part</p><p><i>adj.</i> (usually followed by `to') unwilling or refusing to pay heed [indifferent]</p><p><b>potpuno gluhi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> totally deaf [profoundly deaf, stone-deaf, unhearing]</p><p><b>osoba s teškim oštećenjem sluha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person with a severe auditory impairment</p><p><b>elektronički uređaj koji pojačava zvuk i nosi se kako bi se nadoknadio slab sluh (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electronic device that amplifies sound and is worn to compensate for poor hearing [hearing aid]</p><p><b>gluhonjem, gluhonijem, gluhonijemih</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking the sense of hearing and the ability to speak [deaf-mute]</p><p><b>gluha osoba koja ne može govoriti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a deaf person who is unable to speak [deaf-mute, mute]</p><p><b>gluhonijem</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a deaf person who is unable to speak [deaf-and-dumb person, mute]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking the sense of hearing and the ability to speak [deaf-and-dumb]</p><p><b>urođena gluhoća koja dovodi do nemogućnosti govora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> congenital deafness that results in inability to speak [deaf-mutism]</p><p><b>urođena gluhoća koja dovodi do nemogućnosti govora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> congenital deafness that results in inability to speak [deaf-muteness]</p><p><b>prigušiti, zaglušiti, oglušiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be unbearably loud</p><p><i>v.</i> make or render deaf [deaf]</p><p><i>v.</i> make soundproof</p><p><b>zaglušen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> caused to hear poorly or not at all</p><p><b>prigušiti, zaglušiti