ument about something [argue, contend, fence]</p><p><b>debata, debatirati, diskutirati, raspra, rasprava, raspravljanje, raspravljati, razmišljati (od &quot;debate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who engages in debate [arguer]</p><p><b>bančenje, pijančenje, raskalašenost, razvrat, orgija, iskvariti, izopačavati, izopačiti, izopačivati, kvariti, podrivati, podrovati, pokvariti, razvratiti, razvraćati, srozati, srozavati, zavesti, zavoditi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wild gathering involving excessive drinking and promiscuity [bacchanal, bacchanalia, debauchery, drunken revelry, orgy, riot, saturnalia]</p><p><i>v.</i> corrupt morally or by intemperance or sensuality [corrupt, debase, demoralise, demoralize, deprave, misdirect, pervert, profane, subvert, vitiate]</p><p><b>pomiješan, razvratan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> unrestrained by convention or morality [degenerate, degraded, dissipated, dissolute, fast, libertine, profligate, riotous]</p><p><b>razvratna osoba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dissolute person [libertine, rounder]</p><p><b>bančenje, pijančenje, raskalašenost, razvrat (od &quot;debauch&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who assaults others sexually [ravisher, violator]</p><p><b>razuzdanost, razvrat, orgija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wild gathering involving excessive drinking and promiscuity [bacchanal, bacchanalia, debauch, drunken revelry, orgy, riot, saturnalia]</p><p><b>obveznica, zaduženje, zadužnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ability of a customer to obtain goods or services before payment, based on the trust that payment will be made in the future [debenture bond, unsecured bond]</p><p><i>n.</i> a certificate or voucher acknowledging a debt</p><p><b>zadužnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ability of a customer to obtain goods or services before payment, based on the trust that payment will be made in the future [debenture, unsecured bond]</p><p><b>nedostatak tjelesne ili mišićne snage ili vitalnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking bodily or muscular strength or vitali