>adj.</i> of coal, as contrasted with coal obtained from a strip mine</p><p><b>duboko ružičaste nijanse (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of a deep shade of pink</p><p><b>(posebno se koristi za ideje ili načela) duboko ukorenjena (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used especially of ideas or principles) deeply rooted [deep-seated, implanted, ingrained, planted]</p><p><b>velike dubine, dubinski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or taking place in the deeper parts of the sea</p><p><b>Ronilac u dubokim dijelovima mora. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diver in the deeper parts of the sea</p><p><b>(posebno se koristi za ideje ili načela) duboko ukorenjena (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used especially of ideas or principles) deeply rooted [deep-rooted, implanted, ingrained, planted]</p><p><b>s potopljenom površinom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a sunken area [recessed, sunken]</p><p><b>Izbacite., Bacite sa broda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> toss out [give it the deep six]</p><p><i>v.</i> throw from a boat [throw overboard]</p><p><b>duboka voda</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or carried on in waters of great depth</p><p><b>Nešto što ima boju bundeve. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of something having the color of a pumpkin</p><p><b>dubiti, produbiti, produbljivati, intenzivirati se, jačati, pojačati se, pojačavati se, produbiti se, produbljivati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make more intense, stronger, or more marked [compound, heighten, intensify]</p><p><i>v.</i> become more intense [intensify]</p><p><i>v.</i> make deeper</p><p><i>v.</i> become deeper in tone [change]</p><p><b>produbljivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a process of becoming deeper and more profound</p><p><i>adj.</i> accumulating and becoming more intense [thickening]</p><p><b>aparat za duboko smrzavanje, frizer, hladnjača, ledenica, ledenjača, zamrzivač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electric refrigerator (trade name Deepfreeze) in which food is frozen and stored for long periods of time [deep-freeze, deep freezer, freezer]</p><p><b>duboko, jako, snažno</b></p><p><i>ad