ulate]</p><p><b>oskvrnuće</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being polluted [befoulment, pollution]</p><p><b>oskvrnitelj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person or organization that causes pollution of the environment [polluter]</p><p><b>odrediv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being defined, limited, or explained</p><p><b>definiraju, definiran, definiranja, definiranje, definirati, odrediti, utvrditi, precizirati, opredijeliti se, specificirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> determine the essential quality of [delimit, delimitate, delineate, specify]</p><p><i>v.</i> give a definition for the meaning of a word</p><p><i>v.</i> determine the nature of</p><p><i>v.</i> show the form or outline of [delineate]</p><p><i>v.</i> decide upon or fix definitely [determine, fix, limit, set, specify]</p><p><b>definiraju, definiran, definiranim, odrediti, određen, određene, određeno, utvrđen, definiralo, definirane, definirano</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> clearly characterized or delimited</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing clearly the outline or profile or boundary [outlined]</p><p><b>definicija, definiranje, određivanja, određivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any process serving to define the shape of something [shaping]</p><p><b>definitivan, jasan, određen, točan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> precise</p><p><i>adj.</i> known for certain</p><p><b>određen član</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a determiner (as `the' in English) that indicates specificity of reference</p><p><b>integral funkcije na određenom intervalu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the integral of a function over a definite interval</p><p><b>određena količina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a specific measure of amount</p><p><b>definitivno, definitvno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without question and beyond doubt [by all odds, decidedly, emphatically, in spades, unquestionably]</p><p><b>definitivan, jasan, određen, točan (od &quot;definite&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being predictable with great confidence [determinateness]</p><p><b>definicija, kontura, odrednica, određenje, značenje, definicij