no. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a defense organized before contact is made with the enemy and while time for organization is available [deliberate defence]</p><p><b>namjerno, promišljeno, svojevoljno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with intention [advisedly, by choice, by design, designedly, intentionally, on purpose, purposely]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a deliberate unhurried manner [measuredly]</p><p><b>hotimičan, namjeran, odmjeren, pomišljati, promišljen, razmišljati, razmotriti, savjetovati se, spor, svjestan, vijećati (od &quot;deliberate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rate demonstrating an absence of haste or hurry [deliberation, slowness, unhurriedness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of thoughtfulness in action or decision [deliberation]</p><p><b>dogovor, promišljanje, prosuđivanje, razmišljanje, rasprava, razmatranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (usually plural) discussion of all sides of a question</p><p><i>n.</i> careful consideration [advisement, weighing]</p><p><i>n.</i> planning something carefully and intentionally [calculation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a rate demonstrating an absence of haste or hurry [deliberateness, slowness, unhurriedness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of thoughtfulness in action or decision [deliberateness]</p><p><b>dogovoran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> involved in or characterized by deliberation and discussion and examination</p><p><b>okupljanje ljudi u svrhu mirnog razmatranja i rasprave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an assembly of people for the purpose of unhurried consideration and discussion</p><p><b>Léo Delibes</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French composer of operas (1836-1891) [Clement Philibert Leo Delibes, Leo Delibes]</p><p><b>koji se može izbrisati (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being deleted</p><p><b>delikatesa, delikatnost, finoća, nježan, nježnost, prefinjenost, profinjenost, slast, poslastica, specijalitet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being beautiful and delicate in appearance [daintiness, fineness]</p><p><i>n.</i> something considered choice to eat [dainty, goody, k