>v.</i> break down into components</p><p><b>kolebanje, nećkati se, odbijati, prigovarati, isključiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) a formal objection to an opponent's pleadings [demurral, demurrer]</p><p><i>v.</i> take exception to [except]</p><p><i>v.</i> enter a demurrer</p><p><b>skroman</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> affectedly modest or shy especially in a playful or provocative way [coy, overmodest]</p><p><b>skroman (od &quot;demure&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a demure manner</p><p><b>skroman (od &quot;demure&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of behaving with reserve and decorum</p><p><i>n.</i> the affectation of being demure in a provocative way [coyness]</p><p><b>danguba, prekoračenje roka, prekostojnica, prekostojnice, vrijeme utrošeno na krcanje/iskrcavanje preko ugov, zakasnina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a charge required as compensation for the delay of a ship or freight car or other cargo beyond its scheduled time of departure</p><p><i>n.</i> detention of a ship or freight car or other cargo beyond its scheduled time of departure</p><p><b>(pravno) formalni prigovor na radnu izjavu protivnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) a formal objection to an opponent's pleadings [demur, demurrer]</p><p><b>(pravno) formalni prigovor na radnu izjavu protivnika, (pravno) bilo koje radno pismo koje osporava pravnu dovoljnoću radnih pisama protivnika, odgovor ili žalba optuženog koji negira istinu optužbi protiv njega (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) a formal objection to an opponent's pleadings [demur, demurral]</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) any pleading that attacks the legal sufficiency of the opponent's pleadings</p><p><i>n.</i> a defendant's answer or plea denying the truth of the charges against him [defence, defense, denial]</p><p><b>uništavaju mijelinski omotač (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> destroy the myelin sheath of</p><p><b>gubitak mijelinske obloge nekih živčanih vlakana što rezultira oštećenjem njihove funkcije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> loss of the myelin covering of some nerve fibers