ine, detalja, detalje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> true confidential information [inside information]</p><p><b>pritvoriti, spriječiti, uhapsiti, zadržati, zadržati (brod u luci), internirati, odgađati, odgoditi, usporavati, usporiti, zadržavati, zatezati, zaustaviti, zaustavljati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> deprive of freedom [confine]</p><p><i>v.</i> stop or halt [delay, stay]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be slowed down or delayed [delay, hold up]</p><p><b>logoraš, pritvorenik, uhićenik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> some held in custody [political detainee]</p><p><b>detencija, pritvor, zadržavanje, zatvor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of being confined (usually for a short time) [custody, detention, hold]</p><p><b>detektirati, naći, opaziti, otkriti, otkrivati, otrkiti, pronaći, konstatirati, nalaziti, opažati, primijetiti, primjećivati, pronalaziti, utvrditi, utvrđivati, zamijetiti, zamjećivati, zapaziti, zapažati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> discover or determine the existence, presence, or fact of [discover, find, notice, observe]</p><p><b>detektibilan, prepoznatljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being detected [noticeable]</p><p><i>adj.</i> easily seen or detected [perceptible]</p><p><b>detektiran, opažen, otkriven</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> perceived or discerned</p><p><i>adj.</i> perceived with the mind</p><p><b>detektiranje, otkrivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a police investigation to determine the perpetrator [detection, detective work, sleuthing]</p><p><b>detekcija, opažanje, otkrivanje, pronalaženje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the perception that something has occurred or some state exists [sensing]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of detecting something [catching, espial, spotting, spying]</p><p><i>n.</i> the detection that a signal is being received [signal detection]</p><p><i>n.</i> a police investigation to determine the perpetrator [detecting, detective work, sleuthing]</p><p><b>detektiv, detektiva, detektivski, detektivsko</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a police officer who investigates crimes [investigator, police detectiv