onalni, koji ide u koso</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (geometry) a straight line connecting any two vertices of a polygon that are not adjacent</p><p><i>n.</i> a line or cut across a fabric that is not at right angles to a side of the fabric [bias]</p><p><i>n.</i> an oblique line of squares of the same color on a checkerboard</p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) a set of entries in a square matrix running diagonally either from the upper left to lower right entry or running from the upper right to lower left entry</p><p><i>n.</i> a punctuation mark (/) used to separate related items of information [separatrix, slash, solidus, stroke, virgule]</p><p><i>adj.</i> connecting two nonadjacent corners of a plane figure or any two corners of a solid that are not in the same face</p><p><i>adj.</i> having an oblique or slanted direction [aslant, aslope, slanted, slanting, sloped, sloping]</p><p><b>kvadratna matrica s svim elementima koji nisu na glavnoj dijagonali jednaka nuli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a square matrix with all elements not on the main diagonal equal to zero</p><p><b>promjena kvadratne matrice u dijagonalnu formu (s svim nultom dijagonalnim elementima) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> changing a square matrix to diagonal form (with all non-zero elements on the principal diagonal) [diagonalization]</p><p><b>transformirati matricu u dijagonalnu matricu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> transform a matrix to a diagonal matrix [diagonalize]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being transformed into a diagonal matrix</p><p><b>dijagonalizacijski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> changing a square matrix to diagonal form (with all non-zero elements on the principal diagonal) [diagonalisation]</p><p><b>transformirati matricu u dijagonalnu matricu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> transform a matrix to a diagonal matrix [diagonalise]</p><p><b>dijagonalan, dijagonalno, poprečno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a diagonal manner</p><p><b>dijagram, dijagrama, graf, grafički p