lating to or containing diazonium</p><p><b>u kojem je R aromatični ugljovodik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the univalent cation R-N:N- (where R is an aromatic hydrocarbon)</p><p><b>preobraziti (amin) u diazo spojeve (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> convert (an amine) into a diazo compound</p><p><b>diazoksid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vasodilator (trade name Hyperstat) used to treat severe hypertension [Hyperstat]</p><p><b>kiselina koja sadrži dva zamjenjiva atoma vodika po molekuli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acid containing two replaceable hydrogen atoms per molecule</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a salt derived by replacing two hydrogen atoms per molecule</p><p><b>drveni ručni alat sa oštrim krajem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wooden hand tool with a pointed end [dibble]</p><p><b>drveni ručni alat sa oštrim krajem, biljka s drvenim ručnim alatom, napraviti rupu drvenim alatom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wooden hand tool with a pointed end [dibber]</p><p><i>v.</i> plant with a wooden hand tool</p><p><i>v.</i> make a hole with a wooden hand tool</p><p><b>(Židovski folklor) demon koji ulazi u tijelo žive osobe i kontrolira ponašanje tog tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Jewish folklore) a demon that enters the body of a living person and controls that body's behavior [dybbuk]</p><p><b>metrička jedinica s ne-naglasenim-ne-naglasenim slogovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metrical unit with unstressed-unstressed syllables [pyrrhic]</p><p><b>Glavonožci s dvije žlijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cephalopods having two gills [dibranchiate, dibranchiate mollusk]</p><p><b>dvoškržnjaci, podrazred Dibranchia, podrazred Dibranchiata</b></p><p><i>n.</i> comprising all living cephalopods except the family Nautilidae: the orders Octopoda (octopuses) and Decapoda (squids and cuttlefish) [Dibranchiata, subclass Dibranchia, subclass Dibranchiata]</p><p><b>dvoškržnjaci, podrazred Dibranchia, podrazred Dibranchiata</b></p><p><i>n.</i> co