, or recover by digging [dig, dig out]</p><p><b>promjena spolnih i aseksualnih generacija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> alternation of sexual and asexual generations [metagenesis]</p><p><b>klasificirati, kratak prikaz, pravni zbornik, pregled, probaviti, sistematizirati, svariti, variti, kompilacija, durati, izdržati, izdržavati, izdurati, otrpjeti, podnašati, podnijeti, podnositi, probavljati, tolerirati, trpjeti, koncentrirati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a periodical that summarizes the news</p><p><i>n.</i> something that is compiled (as into a single book or file) [compilation]</p><p><i>v.</i> convert food into absorbable substances</p><p><i>v.</i> arrange and integrate in the mind</p><p><i>v.</i> put up with something or somebody unpleasant [abide, bear, brook, endure, put up, stand, stick out, stomach, suffer, support, tolerate]</p><p><i>v.</i> become assimilated into the body</p><p><i>v.</i> systematize, as by classifying and summarizing</p><p><i>v.</i> soften or disintegrate, as by undergoing exposure to heat or moisture</p><p><i>v.</i> make more concise [concentrate, condense]</p><p><i>v.</i> soften or disintegrate by means of chemical action, heat, or moisture</p><p><b>klasificirati, kratak prikaz, pravni zbornik, pregled, probaviti, sistematizirati, svariti, variti (od &quot;digest&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> autoclave consisting of a vessel in which plant or animal materials are digested</p><p><b>probavljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being easy to digest [digestibleness]</p><p><b>lako probavljiv, lako svarljiv, probavljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being converted into assimilable condition in the alimentary canal</p><p><b>lako probavljiv, lako svarljiv, probavljiv (od &quot;digestible&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being easy to digest [digestibility]</p><p><b>digestija, probava, probavljanje, varenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of decomposing organic matter (as in sewage) by bacteria or by chemical action or heat</p><p><i>n.</i> the 