tisation]</p><p><b>digitalizirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put into digital form, as for use in a computer [digitalise, digitalize, digitise]</p><p><b>digitalizator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> device for converting analogue signals into digital signals [analog-digital converter, analog-to-digital converter, digitiser]</p><p><b>Digitalis se koristi za liječenje kongestivne srčane insuficijencije ili srčane aritmije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> digitalis preparation used to treat congestive heart failure or cardiac arrhythmia</p><p><b>čestit, dostojanstven, gord, ugledan, veličanstven</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or expressing dignity</p><p><i>adj.</i> having or showing self-esteem [self-respectful, self-respecting]</p><p><b>oplemeniti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> confer dignity or honor upon [ennoble]</p><p><i>v.</i> raise the status of</p><p><b>oplemeniti (od &quot;dignify&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> investing with dignity or honor [ennobling]</p><p><b>dostojanstvenik, vip</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an important or influential (and often overbearing) person [VIP, high-up, high muckamuck, panjandrum, very important person]</p><p><b>dignitet, dostojanstva, dostojanstvo, počastiti, visoki položaj, visoki status</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being worthy of esteem or respect [self-regard, self-respect, self-worth]</p><p><i>n.</i> formality in bearing and appearance [gravitas, lordliness]</p><p><i>n.</i> high office or rank or station</p><p><b>digitalis (trgovinski naziv Lanoxin) za liječenje kongestivne srčane insuficijencije ili srčane aritmije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> digitalis preparation (trade name Lanoxin) used to treat congestive heart failure or cardiac arrhythmia [Lanoxin]</p><p><b>dva uzastopna slova (posebno dva slova koja se koriste za predstavljanje jednog zvuka: `sh' u `shoe') (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> two successive letters (especially two letters used to represent a single sound: `sh' in `shoe') [digraph]</p><p><b>dva uzastopna slova (posebno dva slova koja se koriste za predstavljanje jednog zvuka: `sh' u `shoe') (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> two successive letters (especially two letters used to represent a single sound: `sh' in `shoe') [digram]</p><p><b>odstupiti, skrenuti, odlutati, udaljiti se, skretati, zastraniti, zastranjivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> lose clarity or turn aside especially from the main subject of attention or course of argument in writing, thinking, or speaking [divagate, stray, wander]</p><p><i>v.</i> wander from a direct or straight course [depart, sidetrack, straggle]</p><p><b>devijacija, digresija, odmak, odmicanje, odstupanje, odvraćanje, otklanjanje, otklon, skretanje, udaljivanje, zastranjenje, zastranjivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a message that departs from the main subject [aside, divagation, excursus, parenthesis]</p><p><i>n.</i> a turning aside (of your course or attention or concern) [deflection, deflexion, deviation, divagation, diversion]</p><p><i>n.</i> wandering from the main path of a journey [excursion]</p><p><b>od površinske važnosti ako postoji, (npr. govor i pisanje) koji imaju tendenciju da se odmaknu od glavne točke ili pokrivaju širok spektar tema (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of superficial relevance if any [tangential]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of e.g. speech and writing) tending to depart from the main point or cover a wide range of subjects [discursive, excursive, rambling]</p><p><b>arheološko iskapanje, kopajući, kopati, udarac, uživati (od &quot;dig&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an excavation for ore or precious stones or for archaeology [diggings]</p><p><i>n.</i> temporary living quarters [diggings, domiciliation, lodgings, pad]</p><p><b>hibrid koji proizlaze od roditelja koji se razlikuju samo po dva genetska loka koja imaju dva alela svaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hybrid produced by parents that differ only at two gene loci that have two alleles each</p><p><b>hibridizacija koristeći dvije osobine s dva alela svaki (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hybridization using two traits with two alleles each</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of a class of alcohols having 2 hydroxyl groups in each molecule [diol, glycol]</p><p><b>antibiotici koji se sastoje od hidrogeniranog oblika streptomicina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antibiotic consisting of a hydrogenated form of streptomycin</p><p><b>Amino kiselina koja se formira u jetri i pretvara u dopamin u mozgu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> amino acid that is formed in the liver and converted into dopamine in the brain [dopa]</p><p><b>Dijon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an industrial city in eastern France to the north of Lyons</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko malih antilopa istočne Afrike rod Madoqua (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several small antelopes of eastern Africa of the genus Madoqua</p><p><b>Afričko stablo s jestivim žutim plodovima sličnim mangoima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> African tree with edible yellow fruit resembling mangos [Irvingia gabonensis, wild mango, wild mango tree]</p><p><b>Sjeme divljeg managa bogato uljem za jelo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> edible oil-rich seed of wild mango</p><p><b>brana, brazda, jarak, nasip, prepreka, rov, smetnja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (slang) offensive term for a lesbian who is noticeably masculine [butch, dyke]</p><p><i>n.</i> a barrier constructed to contain the flow of water or to keep out the sea [dam, dyke]</p><p><i>v.</i> enclose with a dike [dyke]</p><p><b>fenitoin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an anticonvulsant drug (trade name Dilantin) used to treat epilepsy and that is not a sedative [diphenylhydantoin, phenytoin]</p><p><b>rušiti, istrunuti, oronuti, propadati, propasti, raspadati se, raspasti se, trunuti, urušavati se, urušiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bring into a condition of decay or partial ruin by neglect or misuse</p><p><i>v.</i> fall into decay or ruin [crumble, decay]</p><p><b>oronuo, razoren, sklon padu, trošan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> in deplorable condition [bedraggled, broken-down, derelict, ramshackle, tatterdemalion, tumble-down]</p><p><b>propadanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of deterioration due to old age or long use [decrepitude]</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of becoming dilapidated [ruin]</p><p><b>dilatacija, rastezanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being stretched beyond normal dimensions [distension, distention]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of expanding an aperture [dilation]</p><p><b>kirurški postupak koji se obično izvodi pod lokalnom anestezijom u kojem se vrat maternice proširuje i sluznica maternice se odriše kuretom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a surgical procedure usually performed under local anesthesia in which the cervix is dilated and the endometrial lining of the uterus is scraped with a curet [D and C, dilation and curettage]</p><p><b>proširiti, rastegnuti, raširiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become wider [distend]</p><p><i>v.</i> add details, as to an account or idea [elaborate, enlarge, expand, expatiate, exposit, expound, flesh out, lucubrate]</p><p><b>proširiti, rastegnuti, raširiti se (od &quot;dilate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a surgical instrument that is used to dilate or distend an opening or an organ [dilator]</p><p><b>rasprostiranje, širenje, dilatacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lengthy discussion (spoken or written) on a particular topic</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of expanding an aperture [dilatation]</p><p><b>kirurški postupak koji se obično izvodi pod lokalnom anestezijom u kojem se vrat maternice proširuje i sluznica maternice se odriše kuretom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a surgical procedure usually performed under local anesthesia in which the cervix is dilated and the endometrial lining of the uterus is scraped with a curet [D and C, dilatation and curettage]</p><p><b>mišić ili živc koji dilata ili proširuje dio tijela, lijek koji uzrokuje dilataciju, kirurški instrument koji se koristi za proširenje ili uvećanje otvora ili organa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a muscle or nerve that dilates or widens a body part</p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that causes dilation</p><p><i>n.</i> a surgical instrument that is used to dilate or distend an opening or an organ [dilater]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se ne uspije ući u rad, to je usporavanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> slowness as a consequence of not getting around to it [procrastination]</p><p><b>dilatoran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> wasting time [laggard, pokey, poky]</p><p><b>podnesak koji odgađa tužbu bez rješavanja razloga tužbe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plea that delays the action without settling the cause of action</p><p><b>narkotni analgetik (trgovinski naziv Dilaudid) koji se koristi za liječenje umjerene do teške boli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a narcotic analgesic (trade name Dilaudid) used to treat moderate to severe pain [hydromorphone, hydromorphone hydrochloride]</p><p><b>dildo, vibrator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vibrating device that substitutes for an erect penis to provide vaginal stimulation</p><p><b>dilema, nedoumica, škripac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> state of uncertainty or perplexity especially as requiring a choice between equally unfavorable options [quandary]</p><p><b>amater, ljubitelj, diletant</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amateur who engages in an activity without serious intentions and who pretends to have knowledge [dabbler, sciolist]</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing frivolous or superficial interest [dilettanteish, dilettantish, sciolistic]</p><p><b>pokazivanje lažne ili površne zainteresiranosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> showing frivolous or superficial interest [dilettante, dilettantish, sciolistic]</p><p><b>pokazivanje lažne ili površne zainteresiranosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> showing frivolous or superficial interest [dilettante, dilettanteish, sciolistic]</p><p><b>marljivost, poštanska kola, pozornost, ustrajnost, vrednoća, vrijednost, radinost, mar, predanost, revnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> conscientiousness in paying proper attention to a task</p><p><i>n.</i> persevering determination to perform a task [industriousness, industry]</p><p><i>n.</i> a diligent effort [application]</p><p><b>marljiv, radin, ustrajan, vrijedan, vrijedni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> quietly and steadily persevering especially in detail or exactness [persevering]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by care and perseverance in carrying out tasks</p><p><b>marljivo</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with diligence</p><p><b>kopar, mirodija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic Old World herb having aromatic threadlike foliage and seeds used as seasoning [Anethum graveolens]</p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic threadlike foliage of the dill plant used as seasoning [dill weed]</p><p><b>Svinja, slijepa, slijepa i slijepa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pickle preserved in brine or vinegar flavored with dill seed</p><p><b>Sjeme biljke dils koji se koristi kao začin (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> seed of the dill plant used as seasoning</p><p><b>kopar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic threadlike foliage of the dill plant used as seasoning [dill]</p><p><b>bilo koje od nekoliko zimzelenih stabala ili grmova roda Dillenia uzgajanih zbog svog lišća i cvjetova koji podsjećaju na magnolije, a nakon kojih slijedi voće koje se koristi u kariju i žele i konzervi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several evergreen trees or shrubs of the genus Dillenia grown for their foliage and nodding flowers resembling magnolias which are followed by fruit that is used in curries and jellies and preserves</p><p><b>uglavnom tropski grmovi i stabla i planinari s kožnim lištima ili ravnim lištanim stabljikama: rodovi Dillenia i Hibbertia (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chiefly tropical shrubs and trees and climbers having leathery leaves or flattened leaflike stems: genera Dillenia and Hibbertia [family Dilleniaceae]</p><p><b>porodica svojte dilleniida</b></p><p><i>n.</i> family of more or less advanced dicotyledonous trees and shrubs and herbs</p><p><b>rod svojte dilleniida</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of more or less advanced dicotyledonous trees and shrubs and herbs</p><p><b>skupina obitelji više ili manje naprednih stabala i grmova i biljaka s ili polipetalnim ili gamopetalnim korolama i često s jajnikave pričvršćenim na zidove jajnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of families of more or less advanced trees and shrubs and herbs having either polypetalous or gamopetalous corollas and often with ovules attached to the walls of the ovary [subclass Dilleniidae]</p><p><b>Nekoga tko gubi vrijeme. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who wastes time [dallier, dillydallier, lounger, mope]</p><p><b>Odgoditi ono što treba da se radi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> postpone doing what one should be doing [dillydally, drag one's feet, drag one's heels, procrastinate, shillyshally, stall]</p><p><b>Nekoga tko gubi vrijeme. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who wastes time [dallier, dilly-dallier, lounger, mope]</p><p><b>Odgoditi ono što treba da se radi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> postpone doing what one should be doing [dilly-dally, drag one's feet, drag one's heels, procrastinate, shillyshally, stall]</p><p><b>kalcijum blokator (trgovinski naziv Cardizem) koji se koristi za liječenje hipertenzije ili angine ili srčane insuficijencije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a calcium blocker (trade name Cardizem) used in treating hypertension or angina or heart failure [Cardizem]</p><p><b>razrjeđivač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diluting agent [dilutant, thinner]</p><p><b>sredstvo za razblažavanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diluting agent [diluent, thinner]</p><p><b>razblažiti, razrijediti, razrijediti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> lessen the strength or flavor of a solution or mixture [cut, reduce, thin, thin out]</p><p><i>v.</i> corrupt, debase, or make impure by adding a foreign or inferior substance [adulterate, debase, load, stretch]</p><p><i>adj.</i> reduced in strength or concentration or quality or purity [diluted]</p><p><b>razrijeđen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> reduced in strength or concentration or quality or purity [dilute]</p><p><b>razblaživanje, razrjeđivanje, razvodnjavanje, slabljenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diluted solution</p><p><i>n.</i> weakening (reducing the concentration) by the addition of water or a thinner</p><p><b>od ili povezan s poplavom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or connected with a deluge [diluvian]</p><p><b>od ili povezan s poplavom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or connected with a deluge [diluvial]</p><p><b>blijed, maglovit, mat, mračan, mračiti, mutan, potamniti, potamnjeti, slab, taman, zamračiti, zamutiti, zamagliti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> switch (a car's headlights) from a higher to a lower beam [dip]</p><p><i>v.</i> become dim or lusterless</p><p><i>v.</i> make dim or lusterless</p><p><i>v.</i> make dim by comparison or conceal [blind]</p><p><i>v.</i> become vague or indistinct [blur, slur]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking in light [subdued]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking clarity or distinctness [faint, shadowy, vague, wispy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> made dim or less bright [dimmed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> offering little or no hope [black, bleak]</p><p><i>adj.</i> slow to learn or understand [dense, dull, dumb, obtuse, slow]</p><p><b>tradicionalna kineska kuhinja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> traditional Chinese cuisine</p><p><b>ako imate znatno smanjeno vidno stanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having greatly reduced vision [near-blind, purblind, sand-blind, visually challenged, visually impaired]</p><p><b>Nemaju mentalnu sposobnost i suptilnost. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking mental capacity and subtlety [simple, simple-minded]</p><p><b>Američki profesionalni bejzbolista poznat po svojoj sposobnosti udarača (1914-1999) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States professional baseball player noted for his batting ability (1914-1999) [Joe DiMaggio, Joseph Paul DiMaggio]</p><p><b>drevni grad (što se smatra najstarijim na svijetu) i sadašnji glavni grad i najveći grad Sirije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient city (widely regarded as the world's oldest) and present capital and largest city of Syria [Damascus, capital of Syria]</p><p><b>deseti dio dolara, kovani novac od deset centi, novčić od 10 centi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a United States coin worth one tenth of a dollar</p><p><i>n.</i> street name for a packet of illegal drugs that is sold for ten dollars [dime bag]</p><p><b>Ulica ime za paket ilegalnih droga koji se prodaje za deset dolara (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> street name for a packet of illegal drugs that is sold for ten dollars [dime]</p><p><b>melodramatičan roman. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a melodramatic paperback novel [penny dreadful]</p><p><b>antihistaminik i antiemetik (trgovinski naziv Dramamin) koji se koriste za liječenje bolesti od kretanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antihistamine and antiemetic (trade name Dramamine) used to treat motion sickness [Dramamine]</p><p><b>dimenzija, dimenzije, dimenzijom, mjera, obimnost, protega, razmjer, veličina, značaj, atribut, karakteristika, obilježje, svojstvo, proporcije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the magnitude of something in a particular direction (especially length or width or height)</p><p><i>n.</i> a construct whereby objects or individuals can be distinguished [attribute, property]</p><p><i>n.</i> one of three Cartesian coordinates that determine a position in space</p><p><i>n.</i> magnitude or extent [proportion]</p><p><i>v.</i> indicate the dimensions on</p><p><i>v.</i> shape or form to required dimensions</p><p><b>dimenzionalan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to dimensions</p><p><i>adj.</i> having dimension--the quality or character or stature proper to a person</p><p><b>dimenzionalnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the spatial property of having dimensions</p><p><b>dimenzioniranje, projektiranje</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> indicating or determining size and position in space</p><p><b>molekula stvorena od dvije manje indentične moleku</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compound whose molecules are composed of two identical monomers</p><p><b>antihistamin (trgovinski naziv Dimetane) koji se koristi za liječenje reakcija preosjetljivosti (kao što je rinitis) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antihistamine (trade name Dimetane) used to treat hypersensitivity reactions (as rhinitis) [brompheniramine maleate]</p><p><b>Trgovinsko ime lijeka koji sadrži antihistaminik i dekongestant (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> trade name for a drug containing an antihistamine and a decongestant</p><p><b>najprostiji keton (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the simplest ketone [acetone, propanone]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena od 1,5% ili više, ali ne više od 2,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compound used in analysis as a precipitant for palladium or nickel</p><p><b>mesožder dinosaurus iz Perma u Sjevernoj Americi s grebenom ili dorsalnim jedrom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> carnivorous dinosaur of the Permian in North America having a crest or dorsal sail</p><p><b>smanjiti, umanjiti, opadati, opasti, smanjiti se, smanjivati se, sniziti se, snižavati se, umanjiti se, umanjivati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> decrease in size, extent, or range [decrease, fall, lessen]</p><p><i>v.</i> lessen the authority, dignity, or reputation of [belittle]</p><p><b>smanjen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> impaired by diminution [lessened, vitiated, weakened]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of an organ or body part) diminished in size or strength as a result of disease or injury or lack of use [atrophied, wasted]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of musical intervals) reduction by a semitone of any perfect or minor musical interval</p><p><i>adj.</i> made to seem smaller or less (especially in worth) [belittled, small]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u pitanju luk čija je visina manja od polovine njegove širine, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an arch whose height is less than half its width [scheme arch, skeen arch, skene arch]</p><p><b>smanjenje, smanjenjem</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> becoming smaller or less or appearing to do so</p><p><b>(Glazba) postupno smanjenje glasnosti, (Glazba) postupno smanjuje glasnost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (music) a gradual decrease in loudness [decrescendo]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (music) gradually decreasing in volume [decrescendo]</p><p><b>smanjenje, umanjenje, opadanje, pad, padanje, smanjivanje, reduciranje, redukcija, umanjivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> change toward something smaller or lower [decline]</p><p><i>n.</i> the statement of a theme in notes of lesser duration (usually half the length of the original)</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of decreasing or reducing something [decrease, reduction, step-down]</p><p><b>deminutiv, deminutivan, koji umanjuje, majušan, malen, sićušan, umanjenica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word that is formed with a suffix (such as -let or -kin) to indicate smallness</p><p><i>adj.</i> very small [bantam, flyspeck, lilliputian, midget, petite, tiny]</p><p><b>deminutiv, deminutivan, koji umanjuje, majušan, malen, sićušan, umanjenica (od &quot;diminutive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being very small in size [minuteness, petiteness, tininess, weeness]</p><p><b>od čvrste pamukaste tkanine s uzdignutim uzorkom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strong cotton fabric with a raised pattern</p><p><b>nejasno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a dim indistinct manner [indistinctly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a manner lacking interest or vitality [palely, pallidly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> with a dim light [murkily]</p><p><b>blijed, onemogućen, zamagljen, zasjenjen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> made dim or less bright [dim]</p><p><b>prekidač za kratka svjetla, svjetla za parkiranje, uređaj za regulaciju intenziteta rasvjete</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rheostat that varies the current through an electric light in order to control the level of illumination</p><p><b>maglovitost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being poorly illuminated [duskiness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of lights or sounds that lack brilliance or are reduced in intensity [subduedness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being dim or lacking contrast [faintness]</p><p><b>Drvo iz jugoistočne Azije do Australije koje se uglavnom uzgaja zbog slatkih jestivih plodova sličnih liči orašastima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tree of southeastern Asia to Australia grown primarily for its sweet edible fruit resembling litchi nuts [Euphorbia litchi, Nephelium longana, longan, longanberry, lungen]</p><p><b>koji se javljaju ili postoje u dva različita oblika (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring or existing in two different forms [dimorphous]</p><p><b>dimorfizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) the property of certain substances that enables them to exist in two distinct crystalline forms</p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) the existence of two forms of individual within the same animal species (independent of sex differences)</p><p><b>Zelenokosi i njihovi derivati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> South African herbs or subshrubs with usually yellow flowers [genus Dimorphotheca]</p><p><b>koji se javljaju ili postoje u dva različita oblika (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring or existing in two different forms [dimorphic]</p><p><b>tama koja nastaje zbog ugasivanja svjetla (kao u gradu nevidljivom za neprijateljske zrakoplove) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> darkness resulting from the extinction of lights (as in a city invisible to enemy aircraft) [blackout, brownout]</p><p><b>malo ulegnuće</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chad that has been punched or dimpled but all four corners are still attached [dimpled chad, pregnant chad]</p><p><i>n.</i> any slight depression in a surface</p><p><i>n.</i> a small natural hollow in the cheek or chin</p><p><i>v.</i> mark with, or as if with, dimples</p><p><i>v.</i> produce dimples while smiling</p><p><b>Čad koji je proboden ili uvučen u jame, ali su sva četiri ugla još uvijek povezana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chad that has been punched or dimpled but all four corners are still attached [dimple, pregnant chad]</p><p><b>Glup, nesposoban čovjek. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stupid incompetent person [doofus, half-wit, nitwit]</p><p><b>galama, larma, lupa, zveckanje, zveket, zvek, zveka, graja, gungula, gužva, komešanje, metež, strka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a loud harsh or strident noise [blare, blaring, cacophony, clamor]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of making a noisy disturbance [commotion, ruckus, ruction, rumpus, tumult]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a resonant sound, like artillery [boom]</p><p><i>v.</i> instill (into a person) by constant repetition</p><p><b>Američki izumitelj koji je upotrijebio Polaroid film u sočiva i izumio jedan korak fotografski proces (1909-1991) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States inventor who incorporated Polaroid film into lenses and invented the one step photographic process (1909-1991) [Edwin Herbert Land, Land]</p><p><b>dinar, libijski dinar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> 100 dinars equal 1 rial in Iran [Iranian dinar]</p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Yugoslavia [Yugoslavian dinar]</p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Tunisia [Tunisian dinar]</p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Libya [Libyan dinar]</p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Kuwait [Kuwaiti dinar]</p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Jordan [Jordanian dinar]</p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Iraq [Iraqi dinar]</p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Bahrain [Bahrain dinar]</p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Algeria [Algerian dinar]</p><p><b>velika boginja prirode drevne Frigije u Mala Aziji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> great nature goddess of ancient Phrygia in Asia Minor [Cybele, Great Mother, Magna Mater, Mater Turrita]</p><p><b>hraniti, objedovati, ručati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> have supper</p><p><i>v.</i> give dinner to</p><p><b>jesti kod kuće (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> eat at home [eat in]</p><p><b>jesti u restoranu ili kod nekoga drugog (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> eat at a restaurant or at somebody else's home [eat out]</p><p><b>čovjek koji objeduje, vagon-restoran</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person eating a meal (especially in a restaurant)</p><p><i>n.</i> a passenger car where food is served in transit [buffet car, dining car, dining compartment]</p><p><i>n.</i> a restaurant that resembles a dining car</p><p><b>dinar, keš, lova, para, penezi, zelembać, šoldi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> informal terms for money [boodle, bread, cabbage, clams, dough, gelt, kale, lettuce, lolly, loot, lucre, moolah, pelf, scratch, shekels, simoleons, sugar, wampum]</p><p><b>Danska pisateljica koja je živela u Keniji 19 godina i poznata je po svojim spisima o Africi (1885-1962) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Danish writer who lived in Kenya for 19 years and is remembered for her writings about Africa (1885-1962) [Baroness Karen Blixen, Blixen, Isak Dinesen, Karen Blixen]</p><p><b>malo područje izvan kuhinje koje se koristi za obrok (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small area off of a kitchen that is used for dining</p><p><b>Zvuk zvona., odraz na površini (kao što je napravljen udarom), "Džing-ding" kao zvono. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ringing sound</p><p><i>n.</i> an impression in a surface (as made by a blow) [dent, gouge, nick]</p><p><i>v.</i> go `ding dong', like a bell [dingdong, dong]</p><p><b>Zvono. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the noise made by a bell</p><p><b>glupi, prazničav čovjek. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a silly empty-headed person</p><p><b>zaglušan</b></p><p><i>v.</i> go `ding dong', like a bell [ding, dong]</p><p><i>adv.</i> heartily or earnestly</p><p><b>promjena boje zbog prljavštine, napraviti udubljenje ili otisak u, -Ne, ne, ne. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> discoloration due to dirtiness [dinginess]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a dent or impression in [batter]</p><p><i>v.</i> make dingy</p><p><b>čamac, gumeni čamac, veslački čamac, čamac na vesla</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small boat of shallow draft with cross thwarts for seats and rowlocks for oars with which it is propelled [dory, rowboat]</p><p><b>mutan, pohaban, prljav, taman (od &quot;dingy&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a dingy manner [grubbily, grungily]</p><p><b>promjena boje zbog prljavštine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> discoloration due to dirtiness [dinge]</p><p><b>kurac, mala dolina, mala šumovita dolina, pimpek</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small wooded hollow [dell]</p><p><b>divlji pas poput vuka, žuto-smeđi, australski. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wolflike yellowish-brown wild dog of Australia [Canis dingo, warragal, warrigal]</p><p><b>mutan, pohaban, prljav, ta