ge of the prophase of meiosis</p><p><b>riblje ribe s kostiju na južnoj hemisferi koje dišu modifikovanim zračnim mjehurom i žlijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bony fishes of the southern hemisphere that breathe by a modified air bladder as well as gills [subclass Dipnoi]</p><p><b>Jerboas iz Starog svijeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Old World jerboas [family Dipodidae]</p><p><b>štakori klokan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> kangaroo rats [genus Dipodomys]</p><p><b>najrasprostranjeniji štakor klokan: ravnice i planinska područja središnje i zapadne Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> most widely distributed kangaroo rat: plains and mountain areas of central and western United States [Ord kangaroo rat]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih skakajućih glodavca pustinjskog područja Sjeverne Amerike i Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various leaping rodents of desert regions of North America and Mexico [desert rat, kangaroo rat]</p><p><b>jedna vrsta: australski grašak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one species: Australian pea [genus Dipogon]</p><p><b>Južnoafrička zimzelena djelimično drvena loza uzgajana zbog svojih grama ružičastih ljubičastih cvijeća koje slijede jestivi čunjevi poput graha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> South African evergreen partly woody vine grown for its clusters of rosy purple flowers followed by edible pods like snap beans [Australian pea, Dolichos lignosus]</p><p><b>bipolaran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having equal and opposite electric charges or magnetic poles having opposite signs and separated by a small distance</p><p><b>dipol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pair of equal and opposite electric charges or magnetic poles separated by a small distance</p><p><i>n.</i> an aerial half a wavelength long consisting of two rods connected to a transmission line at the center [dipole antenna]</p><p><b>s dužinom od pola valne dužine i s dužinom od oko 30 mm, ali ne više od 30 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an aerial half a wavelength long consisting of two rods connected to a transmission line at the center [dipole]</p><p><b>molekula koja je stalni dipol (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a molecule that is a permanent dipole</p><p><b>dipolni moment</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the moment of a dipole</p><p><b>ako imate neuobičajeno opuštanje kralježnice (posebno kod konja) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having abnormal sagging of the spine (especially in horses) [lordotic, swayback, swaybacked]</p><p><b>ulje tamne boje i loše mirisa dobiveno ugljenom kostiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dark-colored ill-smelling oil obtained by carbonizing bone [bone oil]</p><p><b>crpka, krčag, ronilac, vodeni kos, zabavni objekt u luna-parku</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ladle that has a cup with a long handle</p><p><i>n.</i> a cluster of seven stars in Ursa Minor [Little Dipper]</p><p><i>n.</i> a group of seven bright stars in the constellation Ursa Major [Big Dipper, Charles's Wain, Plough, Wagon, Wain]</p><p><i>n.</i> small North American diving duck [Bucephela albeola, bufflehead, butterball]</p><p><i>n.</i> small stocky diving bird without webbed feet [water ouzel]</p><p><b>crpka, krčag, ronilac, vodeni kos, zabavni objekt u luna-parku (od &quot;dipper&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Baptist denomination founded in 1708 by Americans of German descent [Church of the Brethren, Dunkers]</p><p><b>uglavnom južnoeuropske biljke s cvijećem obično u guštim glavama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chiefly southern European herbs with flowers usually in dense cymose heads [family Dipsacaceae]</p><p><b>vrsta rod Dipsacaceae: teasel (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Dipsacaceae: teasel [genus Dipsacus]</p><p><b>Kroz obalu i u obliku od šljunčane boje, slijepljivi ili slijepljivi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> teasel with lilac flowers native to Old World but naturalized in North America [common teasel]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> similar to the common teasel and similarly used [fuller's teasel]</p><p><b>Europski cvetovi sa bijelim do ružičastim cvetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European teasel with white to pink flowers [wild teasel]</p><p><b>dipsomanija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an intense persistent desire to drink alcoholic beverages to excess [alcoholism, potomania]</p><p><b>alkoholičar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who drinks alcohol to excess habitually [alcoholic, alky, boozer, lush, soaker, souse]</p><p><b>pustinjske iguane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> desert iguanas [genus Dipsosaurus]</p><p><b>mali dugorepasti gušter iz sušnih područja jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i sjeverozapadnog Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small long-tailed lizard of arid areas of southwestern United States and northwestern Mexico [desert iguana]</p><p><b>mjerna šipka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a graduated rod dipped into a container to indicate the fluid level</p><p><b>veliki red insekata koji imaju samo jedan par krila i usne za sisanje ili proboj. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large order of insects having a single pair of wings and sucking or piercing mouths [order Diptera]</p><p><b>dvokrilac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> insects having usually a single pair of functional wings (anterior pair) with the posterior pair reduced to small knobbed structures and mouth parts adapted for sucking or lapping or piercing [dipteron, dipterous insect, two-winged insects]</p><p><b>Drvo iz obitelji Dipterocarpaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tree of the family Dipterocarpaceae</p><p><b>uglavnom tropska azijska stabla s dvoskraljenim plodovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chiefly tropical Asian trees with two-winged fruits [family Dipterocarpaceae]</p><p><b>dvokrilac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> insects having usually a single pair of functional wings (anterior pair) with the posterior pair reduced to small knobbed structures and mouth parts adapted for sucking or lapping or piercing [dipteran, dipterous insect, two-winged insects]</p><p><b>mali rod velikih listnatog grma s velikim skupovima krilatog sjemena koji postaju crveni dok sazrevaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of large deciduous shrubs having large clusters of winged seeds that turn red as they mature [genus Dipteronia]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s ili pripadaju Diptera (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or belonging to the Diptera</p><p><b>dvokrilac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> insects having usually a single pair of functional wings (anterior pair) with the posterior pair reduced to small knobbed structures and mouth parts adapted for sucking or lapping or piercing [dipteran, dipteron, two-winged insects]</p><p><b>tropska američka stabla: grah tonka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American trees: tonka beans [Coumarouna, genus Coumarouna, genus Dipteryx]</p><p><b>Visoko tropsko južnoameričko stablo koje ima pulpito jaje u obliku čestica mirisnih crnih mandljastih sjemena koji se koriste za aromatizaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall tropical South American tree having pulpy egg-shaped pods of fragrant black almond-shaped seeds used for flavoring [Coumarouna odorata, tonka bean, tonka bean tree]</p><p><b>diptih</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a painting or carving (especially an altarpiece) on two panels (usually hinged like a book)</p><p><b>tip rod Dipodidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Dipodidae [genus Dipus]</p><p><b>ulaz na zapad drevne Atene u blizini kojeg je pronađen karakterističan stil keramike, od ili u vezi s ulazom na zapadu drevne Atine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gateway to the west of ancient Athens near which a distinctive style of pottery has been found [Dipylon gate]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a gateway on the west of ancient Athens</p><p><b>ulaz na zapad drevne Atene u blizini kojeg je pronađen karakterističan stil keramike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gateway to the west of ancient Athens near which a distinctive style of pottery has been found [Dipylon]</p><p><b>Engleski fizičar koji je primijenio teoriju relativnosti na kvantnu mehaniku i predvidio postojanje antimaterije i pozitrona (1902-1984) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English theoretical physicist who applied relativity theory to quantum mechanics and predicted the existence of antimatter and the positron (1902-1984) [Paul Adrien Maurice Dirac]</p><p><b>ljeplovita grma iz Sjeverne Amerike: kožna drva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous shrub of North America: leatherwood [genus Dirca]</p><p><b>ljeplovita grmlja iz istočne Sjeverne Amerike s čvrstim fleksibilnim granama i fleksibilnom kore i malim žutim cvijećima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous shrub of eastern North America having tough flexible branches and pliable bark and small yellow flowers [leatherwood, moose-wood, moosewood, ropebark, wicopy]</p><p><b>grozan, strašan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> fraught with extreme danger [desperate]</p><p><i>adj.</i> causing fear or dread or terror [awful, direful, dread, dreaded, dreadful, fearful, fearsome, frightening, horrendous, horrific, terrible]</p><p><b>stanje ekstremne nevolje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of extreme distress [desperate straits]</p><p><b>direktan, direktno, istosmjeran, izravan, izravnog, izravnoj, narediti, naređivati, neposredan, neposrednog, otvoren, potpun, rukovoditi, upraviti, upravljati, upravni, usmjeriti, voditi, izravne, izravni, izravno, neposredni, uperiti, uputiti, upućivati, usmjeravati, režirati, nadzirati, ravnati, dovesti, dovoditi, odvesti, odvoditi, povesti, provesti, provoditi, sprovesti, sprovoditi, odaslati, odašiljati, otpremati, otpremiti, poslati, pošiljati, ciljati, naciljati, naperiti, nišaniti, periti, dirigirati, adresirati, nasloviti, organizirati, orkestrirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> command with authority</p><p><i>v.</i> intend (something) to move towards a certain goal [aim, place, point, target]</p><p><i>v.</i> guide the actors in (plays and films)</p><p><i>v.</i> be in charge of</p><p><i>v.</i> take somebody somewhere [conduct, guide, lead, take]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to go somewhere [send]</p><p><i>v.</i> point or cause to go (blows, weapons, or objects such as photographic equipment) towards [aim, take, take aim, train]</p><p><i>v.</i> lead, as in the performance of a composition [conduct, lead]</p><p><i>v.</i> give directions to</p><p><i>v.</i> specifically design a product, event, or activity for a certain public [aim, calculate]</p><p><i>v.</i> direct the course [channelise, channelize, guide, head, maneuver, manoeuver, manoeuvre, point, steer]</p><p><i>v.</i> put an address on (an envelope) [address]</p><p><i>v.</i> plan and direct (a complex undertaking) [engineer, mastermind, orchestrate, organise, organize]</p><p><i>adj.</i> direct in spatial dimensions</p><p><i>adj.</i> having no intervening persons, agents, conditions [unmediated]</p><p><i>adj.</i> straightforward in means or manner or behavior or language or action</p><p><i>adj.</i> in a straight unbroken line of descent from parent to child [lineal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> moving from west to east on the celestial sphere</p><p><i>adj.</i> similar in nature or effect or relation to another quantity</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a current) flowing in one direction only</p><p><i>adj.</i> being an immediate result or consequence</p><p><i>adj.</i> in precisely the same words used by a writer or speaker [verbatim]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking compromising or mitigating elements</p><p><i>adv.</i> without deviation [directly, straight]</p><p><b>direktna akcija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a protest action by labor or minority groups to obtain their demands</p><p><b>(npr. "mokro" i "suho") (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antonyms that are commonly associated (e.g., `wet' and `dry')</p><p><b>kontrast, suprotnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the opposition or dissimilarity of things that are compared [contrast]</p><p><b>korelacija u kojoj su velike vrijednosti jedne varijable povezane s velikim vrijednostima druge i male s malim (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a correlation in which large values of one variable are associated with large values of the other and small with small [positive correlation]</p><p><b>istosmjerna struja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electric current that flows in one direction steadily [DC, direct electric current]</p><p><b>izvještaj o točnim riječima korištenim u govoru (npr. "On je rekao `Ja sam budala'") (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a report of the exact words used in a discourse (e.g., "he said `I am a fool'") [direct quotation]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je proizvod iz članka 1. stavka 2. točke (a) primjenjuje se samo na proizvod iz članka 2. stavka 2. točke (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dye with a high affinity for cellulose fibers (cotton or rayon etc.) [substantive dye]</p><p><b>električna struja koja neprekidno teče u jednom smjeru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electric current that flows in one direction steadily [DC, direct current]</p><p><b>izravan dokaz, izravan dokaz o nečemu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> evidence (usually the testimony of a witness) directly related to the fact in dispute</p><p><b>(zakon) početno ispitivanje svjedoka od strane stranke koja je pozvala svjedoka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) the initial questioning of a witness by the party that called the witness</p><p><b>Umetnost u cilju koji je vidljiv osobi koja ga cilja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fire delivered on a target that is visible to the person aiming it</p><p><b>let s jednom ili više prekida, ali bez promjene zrakoplova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a flight with one or more intermediate stops but no change of aircraft</p><p><b>"Kreditni instrumenti" su kreditni instrumenti koji se upotrebljavaju za plaćanje kreditnih sredstava u skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 1. točkom (a) CRR-a. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a loan by a lender to a customer without the use of a third party</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, poduzeća koja su poduzeća u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka mogu biti poduzeća u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> advertising sent directly to prospective customers via the mail</p><p><b>distributer koji koristi direktnu poštu za prodaju robe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a distributor who uses direct mail to sell merchandise</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 1303/2013 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> marketing via a promotion delivered directly to the individual prospective customer</p><p><b>direktni objekt</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the object that receives the direct action of the verb [object of the verb]</p><p><b>primarno gdje glasači direktno biraju kandidate koji će se kandidovati za dužnost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a primary where voters directly select the candidates who will run for office</p><p><b>izvještaj o točnim riječima korištenim u govoru (npr. "On je rekao `Ja sam budala'") (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a report of the exact words used in a discourse (e.g., "he said `I am a fool'") [direct discourse]</p><p><b>ujedinjenje dva nespojna skupa u kojima je svaki element zbir jednog elementa iz svakog od nespojnih skupa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a union of two disjoint sets in which every element is the sum of an element from each of the disjoint sets</p><p><b>Misija koja zahtijeva od jedne snage da podrži drugu specifičnu silu i ovlaćuje je da se izravno odazove zahtjevu za pomoć podržane snage. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mission requiring one force to support another specific force and authorizing it to answer directly the supported force's request for assistance</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, "službenici" su osoblje koja je podređena upravljanju ili upravljanju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fire delivered in support of part of a force (as opposed to general supporting fire delivered in support of the force as a whole)</p><p><b>neposredni porez</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tax paid directly by the person or organization on whom it is levied</p><p><b>pojavljivanje plime na jednoj strani Zemlje koja se poklapa s plimom na suprotnoj strani. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the occurrence of high tide on one side of the earth coinciding with high tide on the opposite side</p><p><b>mehanizam prijenosa u kojem se zarazni uzrok prenosi izravno u tijelo dodirom, ugrizanjem, poljubom ili spolnim odnosom ili kapi u oči, nos ili usta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transmission mechanism in which the infectious agent is transferred directly into the body via touching or biting or kissing or sexual intercourse or by droplets entering the eye or nose or mouth</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "službenici" su osoblje ili subjekti koji su u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a trust created by the free and deliberate act of the parties involved (usually on the basis of written documentation) [express trust]</p><p><b>Nekada škola koja je naplaćovala školarine i također primala državne bespovratne sredstva u zamjenu za primanje određenih neplaćenih učenika koje su nominirale lokalne vlasti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> formerly a school that charged tuition fees and also received government grants in return for admitting certain non-paying students who were nominated by the local authorities</p><p><b>reguliran, upravljan, usmjeren, usmjereno</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (often used in combination) having a specified direction</p><p><i>adj.</i> manageable by a supervising agent</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve studije koje se provode u okviru programa za obrazovanje i obrazovanje u okviru programa za obrazovanje i obrazovanje u okviru programa za obrazovanje i obrazovanje u okviru programa za obrazovanje i obrazovanje u okviru programa za obrazovanje i obrazovanje u okviru programa za obrazovanje i obrazovanje u okviru programa za obrazovanje u okviru programa za obrazovanje i obrazovanje u okviru programa za obrazovanje u okviru programa za obrazovanje u okviru programa za obrazovanje u okviru programa za obrazovanje u okviru programa za obrazovanje u okviru programa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a course of study that is supervised and controlled by a specialist in the subject</p><p><b>sudska presuda u sudskom postupku bez razmatranja od strane porote (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a verdict entered by the court in a jury trial without consideration by the jury</p><p><b>direktan, direktno, istosmjeran, izravan, izravnog, izravnoj, narediti, naređivati, neposredan, neposrednog, otvoren, potpun, rukovoditi, upraviti, upravljati, upravni, usmjeriti, voditi, izravne, izravni, izravno, neposredni (od &quot;direct&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> showing the way by conducting or leading [directional, directive, guiding]</p><p><b>naredba, pravac, reguliranje, režija, rukovodstvo, smjer, smjernica, uprava, upravljanje, uputa, zapovijed, smjera, smjeru, put, putanja, putokaz, savjet, gospodarenje, menadžeriranje, menadžment, rukovođenje, naputak, kormilarenje, usmjeravanje, vodstvo, vođenje, fokus, fokusiranje, koncentriranje, usredeotočavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a line leading to a place or point [way]</p><p><i>n.</i> the spatial relation between something and the course along which it points or moves</p><p><i>n.</i> a general course along which something has a tendency to develop</p><p><i>n.</i> something that provides direction or advice as to a decision or course of action [counsel, counseling, counselling, guidance]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of managing something [management]</p><p><i>n.</i> a message describing how something is to be done [instruction]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of setting and holding a course [guidance, steering]</p><p><i>n.</i> a formal statement of a command or injunction to do something [charge, commission]</p><p><i>n.</i> the concentration of attention or energy on something [centering, focal point, focus, focusing, focussing]</p><p><b>usmjeren</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or indicating directions in space</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to direction toward a (nonspatial) goal</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing the way by conducting or leading [directing, directive, guiding]</p><p><b>Sredstva za upravljanje radionom za radionapravljanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antenna that transmits or receives signals only in a narrow angle</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 300 kVA ili većim od 300 kVA, ali ne više od 300 kVA, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a microphone that is designed to receive sound from a particular direction [directional mike]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 300 kVA ili većim od 300 kVA, ali ne više od 300 kVA, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a microphone that is designed to receive sound from a particular direction [directional microphone]</p><p><b>usmjerenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of a microphone or antenna of being more sensitive in one direction than in another [directivity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being directional or maintaining a direction</p><p><b>bez cilja plutajući. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> aimlessly drifting [adrift, afloat, aimless, planless, rudderless, undirected]</p><p><b>direktiva, propis, propisi, propisom, smjernica, uputa, uredba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pronouncement encouraging or banning some activity</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing the way by conducting or leading [directing, directional, guiding]</p><p><b>direktiva, propis, propisi, propisom, smjernica, uputa, uredba (od &quot;directive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being directive [directivity]</p><p><b>Prirodnost mikrofona ili antene da bude osjetljiviji u jednom smjeru nego u drugom, kvaliteta biti direktiva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of a microphone or antenna of being more sensitive in one direction than in another [directionality]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being directive [directiveness]</p><p><b>čim, direktno, izravno, neposredno, odmah, potpuno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without deviation [direct, straight]</p><p><i>adv.</i> without anyone or anything intervening</p><p><i>adv.</i> without delay or hesitation [at once, forthwith, immediately, instantly, like a shot, now, right away, straight off, straightaway]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a forthright manner [flat, straight]</p><p><b>di