gration of personality including erratic speech and childish mannerisms and bizarre behavior [disorganized schizophrenia, hebephrenia, hebephrenic schizophrenia]</p><p><b>uzrokovati da se izgubite ili dezorijentirate (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be lost or disoriented [disorientate]</p><p><b>dezorijentirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be lost or disoriented [disorient]</p><p><b>dezorijentacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wild delusion (especially one induced by a hallucinogenic drug) [freak out]</p><p><i>n.</i> confusion (usually transient) about where you are and how to proceed</p><p><b>Izgubio si smjer., socijalno dezorijentirani (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having lost your bearings [confused, lost]</p><p><i>adj.</i> socially disoriented [alienated, anomic]</p><p><b>uzrokovanje gubitka fizičkog ili intelektualnog utjecaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing loss of physical or intellectual bearings</p><p><b>dezavuirati, ne priznati, ne priznavati svojim, odreći se, razbaštiniti, razvlastiti, odricati se, zanijekati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> prevent deliberately (as by making a will) from inheriting [disinherit]</p><p><i>v.</i> cast off [renounce, repudiate]</p><p><b>dezavuirati, ne priznati, ne priznavati svojim, odreći se (od &quot;disown&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> refusal to acknowledge as one's own [disownment]</p><p><b>Odbijanje da se prizna kao svoje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> refusal to acknowledge as one's own [disowning]</p><p><b>omalovažavati, ponižavati, obezvređivati, obezvrijediti, omalovažiti, ozloglasiti, podcijeniti, podcjenjivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> express a negative opinion of [belittle, pick at]</p><p><b>ponižavanje, ocrnjivanje, omalovažavanje, potcjenjivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a communication that belittles somebody or something [depreciation, derogation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of speaking contemptuously of [dispraise]</p><p><b>omalovažavati, ponižavati (od &quot;disparage&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who disparages or belittles the worth of something [depreciator, detractor, knocker]</p><p><b>omalovažavati, ponižavati (od &quot;disparage&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> expressive of low opinion [derogative, derogatory]</p><p><b>na ponižavajući način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a disparaging manner [slightingly]</p><p><b>bitno različite stvari, nejednak, neskladan, nespojiv, nesuglasan, neusporedive stvari, posve različit</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> fundamentally different or distinct in quality or kind</p><p><i>adj.</i> including markedly dissimilar elements</p><p><b>bitno različite stvari, nejednak, neskladan, nespojiv, nesuglasan, neusporedive stvari, posve različit (od &quot;disparate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> utter dissimilarity [distinctiveness]</p><p><b>disparitet, nejednakost, nepodudaranje, zbroj elemenata digitalnog signala</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inequality or difference in some respect</p><p><b>objektivnost i odvajanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> objectivity and detachment [dispassionateness, dryness]</p><p><b>nepristran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> unaffected by strong emotion or prejudice [cold-eyed]</p><p><b>nepristran (od &quot;dispassionate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an impartially dispassionate manner</p><p><b>nepristran (od &quot;dispassionate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> objectivity and detachment [dispassion, dryness]</p><p><b>dispečerski, dnevna zapovijed, obavijest, obavještenje, odaslati, odašiljanje, otposlati, otprema, otpremiti, poslati, pošiljka, požuriti, slati, žurba, slanje, odašiljati, otpraviti, otpravljati, otpremati, pošiljati, likvidirati, pogubiti, pogubljivati, smaknuti, smicati, ubijati, ubiti, ucmekati, ukloniti, umoriti, usmrtiti, usmrćivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an official report (usually sent in haste) [communique, despatch]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of sending off something [despatch, shipment]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being prompt and efficient [despatch, expedition, expeditiousness]</p><p><i>n.</i> killing a person or animal [despatch]</p><p><i>v.</i> send away towards a designated goal [despatch, send off]</p><p><i>v.</i> complete or carry out [complete, discharge]</p><p><i>v.</i> kill intentionally and with premeditation [bump off, hit, murder, off, polish off, remove, slay]</p><p><i>v.</i> dispose of rapidly and without delay and efficiently</p><p><i>v.</i> kill without delay</p><p><b>S druge strane, za transport pošiljaka ili drugih vrijednih predmeta, ne smiju se upotrebljavati za transport pošiljaka ili drugih vrijednih predmeta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> case consisting of an oblong container (usually having a lock) for carrying dispatches or other valuables [dispatch case]</p><p><b>S druge strane, za transport pošiljaka ili drugih vrijednih predmeta, ne smiju se upotrebljavati za transport pošiljaka ili drugih vrijednih predmeta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> case consisting of an oblong container (usually having a lock) for carrying dispatches or other valuables [dispatch box]</p><p><b>glasnik koji nosi vojne poruke (obično na motociklu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a messenger who carries military dispatches (usually on a motorcycle)</p><p><b>dispečer, otpremnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the official who signals the beginning of a race or competition [starter]</p><p><i>n.</i> employee of a transportation company who controls the departures of vehicles according to weather conditions and in the interest of efficient service</p><p><b>rastjerati, rasturiti, rastjerivati, rasturati, razagnati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> force to go away [chase away, drive away, drive off, drive out, run off, turn back]</p><p><i>v.</i> to cause to separate and go in different directions [break up, disperse, dissipate, scatter]</p><p><b>kvaliteta koju posjeduje nešto bez čega se ne možeš nositi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality possessed by something that you can get along without [dispensableness]</p><p><b>neobavezan, oprostiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being dispensed with or done without</p><p><b>neobavezan, oprostiv (od &quot;dispensable&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality possessed by something that you can get along without [dispensability]</p><p><b>ambulanta, ordinacija, apoteka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clinic where medicine and medical supplies are dispensed</p><p><b>dijelenje, dijeljenje, izdavanje, određivanje, oproštaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exemption from some rule or obligation</p><p><i>n.</i> a share that has been dispensed or distributed</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of dispensing (giving out in portions)</p><p><b>dijeliti, moći bez nečega, dati, davati, podijeliti, porazdijeliti, porazdjeljivati, razdati, razdavati, razdijeliti, razdjeljivati, udijeliti, udjeljivati, prepisati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> administer or bestow, as in small portions [administer, allot, deal, deal out, dish out, distribute, dole out, lot, mete out, parcel out, shell out]</p><p><i>v.</i> grant a dispensation</p><p><i>v.</i> give or apply (medications) [administer]</p><p><b>odreći se, odricati se, odvajati, odvojiti, prepustiti, prepuštati, ustupati, ustupiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> give up what is not strictly needed [give up, part with, spare]</p><p><i>v.</i> do without or cease to hold or adhere to [forego, foreswear, forgo, relinquish, waive]</p><p><i>v.</i> forgo or do or go without</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 g/cm2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> distributed or weighted out in carefully determined portions</p><p><b>djelitelj, farmaceut, dozator, posuda za doziranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a container so designed that the contents can be used in prescribed amounts</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who dispenses</p><p><b>osipanje, rasturanje, diseminacija, disperzija, rasap, rasijavanje, rasipanje, raspršenje, raspršivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of dispersing or diffusing something [diffusion, dispersion, dissemination]</p><p><b>disperzirati, rasijati, raspršiti, rasturiti, rasuti, raširiti, razagnati, posipati, posuti, rasipati, rasipavati, raspršivati, razbacati, razbacivati, sipati, rastjerivati, rasturati, rasijati se, rasipati se, raspršit