continence, self-gratification]</p><p><b>otapanje, otopiti, otopljen, poništenje, raspuštanje, rastvaranje, razlaganje, razrješenje, razvod, razvoda, razvrgnuće, raspad</b></p><p><i>n.</i> separation into component parts [disintegration]</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of going into solution [dissolving]</p><p><i>n.</i> dissolute indulgence in sensual pleasure [dissipation, licentiousness, looseness, profligacy]</p><p><i>n.</i> the termination of a meeting [adjournment]</p><p><i>n.</i> the termination or disintegration of a relationship (between persons or nations) [breakup]</p><p><b>razmatranje braka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an annulment of a marriage</p><p><b>rastopiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of dissolving [dissoluble]</p><p><b>izgubiti se, raspustiti, rastopiti, razriješiti, razvrgnuti, otapati, otopiti, rastapati, topiti, rasturiti, otapati se, otopiti se, rastapati se, rastopiti se, topiti se, istapati, istapati se, istopiti, istopiti se, kopnjeti, okopnjeti, okopnjivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (film) a gradual transition from one scene to the next</p><p><i>v.</i> become weaker [fade away, fade out]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to go into a solution [break up, resolve]</p><p><i>v.</i> come to an end [break up]</p><p><i>v.</i> stop functioning or cohering as a unit [disband]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to lose control emotionally</p><p><i>v.</i> lose control emotionally</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to fade away</p><p><i>v.</i> pass into a solution</p><p><i>v.</i> become or cause to become soft or liquid [dethaw, melt, thaw, unfreeze, unthaw]</p><p><i>v.</i> bring the association of to an end or cause to break up [break up]</p><p><i>v.</i> declare void [dismiss]</p><p><b>otapala, otopljen, rastopljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of solid matter) reduced to a liquid form</p><p><b>otapalo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a liquid substance capable of dissolving other substances [dissolver, dissolving agent, resolvent, solvent]</p><p><b>otapalo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a liquid substance capable of dissolving other substances [dissolvent, dissolving agent, resolvent, solvent]</p><p><b>otapanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of going into solution [dissolution]</p><p><b>otapalo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a liquid substance capable of dissolving other substances [dissolvent, dissolver, resolvent, solvent]</p><p><b>disonanca, disonancija, nesklad, neslaganje, nesloga, nesložnost, nesuglasica, nesuglasje, razilaženje u mišljenju</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a conflict of people's opinions or actions or characters [disagreement, dissension]</p><p><i>n.</i> the auditory experience of sound that lacks musical quality [noise, racket]</p><p><i>n.</i> disagreeable sounds</p><p><b>disonantan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by musical dissonance [unresolved]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking in harmony [discordant, disharmonious, inharmonic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not in accord [at variance, discrepant]</p><p><b>biti disonantan ili grub, uzrok da zvuči surovo i neprijatno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be dissonant or harsh</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to sound harsh and unpleasant [disharmonize]</p><p><b>odgovoriti, odvratiti, destimulirati, odbijati, odbiti, odgovarati, odvraćati, plašiti, strašiti, uplašiti, ustrašiti, zastrašiti, zastrašivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> turn away from by persuasion [deter]</p><p><b>odgovaranje, odvračanje, odvraćanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a communication that dissuades you</p><p><i>n.</i> persuading not to do or believe something</p><p><b>koji odgovara, koji odvraća</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> deterring from action</p><p><b>dvosložna riječ</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word having two syllables [disyllable]</p><p><b>asimetrija, asimetričnost, nepodudarnost, neravnoteža</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) a lack of symmetry [asymmetry, imbalance]</p><p><b>kudjelja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sphere of work by women</p><p><i>n.</i> the staff on which wool or flax is wound before spinning</p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of or peculiar to a woman [female]</p><p><b>distalni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> situated farthest from point of attachment or origin, as of a limb or bone</p><p><i>adj.</i> directed away from the midline or mesial plane of the body</p><p><b>oblik mišićne distrofije koja se javlja u dobi između 40 i 60 godina i obilježava se slabost i opadanje mišića ruku, predlakti i donje noge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of muscular dystrophy that sets in between 40 and 60 years of age and is characterized by weakness and wasting of the muscles of the hands and forearms and lower legs</p><p><b>distalni (od &quot;distal&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> far from the center</p><p><b>daljina, dio puta, distanca, odmak, odmaknuti, odstojanje, razdaljina, razdvojenost, razmak, udaljenost, udaljenosti, udaljenje, distance, puta, razmaka, apatija, rezerviranost, distancirati se, odmaknuti se, odmicati se, ograditi se, ograđivati se, udaljavati se, udaljiti se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property created by the space between two objects or points</p><p><i>n.</i> a distant region</p><p><i>n.</i> size of the gap between two places [length]</p><p><i>n.</i> indifference by personal withdrawal [aloofness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the interval between two times [space]</p><p><i>n.</i> a remote point in time</p><p><i>v.</i> keep at a distance</p><p><i>v.</i> go far ahead of [outdistance, outstrip]</p><p><b>Vid za predmete koji su 20 metara ili više od promatrača (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vision for objects that a 20 feet or more from the viewer</p><p><b>dalek, daleki, dalekih, daleko, hladan, udaljen, distanciran, rezerviran, uzdržan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> separated in space or coming from or going to a distance</p><p><i>adj.</i> far apart in relevance or relationship or kinship [remote]</p><p><i>adj.</i> remote in manner [aloof, upstage]</p><p><i>adj.</i> separate or apart in time [remote, removed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> located far away spatially [remote]</p><p><b>daleko</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> from or at a distance</p><p><b>gađenje, mrskost, odvratnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of intense dislike [antipathy, aversion]</p><p><b>neukusan, odvratan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not pleasing in odor or taste [unsavory, unsavoury]</p><p><i>adj.</i> highly offensive [disgustful, disgusting, foul, loathly, loathsome, repellant, repellent, repelling, revolting, skanky, wicked, yucky]</p><p><b>neukusan, odvratan (od &quot;distasteful&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an offensively distasteful manner</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a disgusting manner or to a disgusting degree [disgustingly, revoltingly, sickeningly]</p><p><b>neukusan, odvratan (od &quot;distasteful&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extreme unpalatability to the mouth [disgustingness, nauseatingness, sickeningness, unsavoriness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being offensive [odiousness, offensiveness]</p><p><b>duševna poremećenost, poremećenje, pseća kuga, slabost, slikati temperama, tempera, zlovolja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various infectious viral diseases of animals</p><p><i>n.</i> an angry and disagreeable mood [ill humor, ill humour]</p><p><i>n.</i> paint made by mixing the pigments with water and a binder</p><p><i>n.</i> a painting created with paint that is made by mixing the pigments with water and a binder</p><p><i>n.</i> a method of painting in which the pigments are mixed with water and a binder</p><p><i>v.</i> paint with distemper</p><p><b>napuhavati, raspirivati, rastegnuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become wider [dilate]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to expand as it by internal pressure</p><p><i>v.</i> swell from or as if from internal pressure</p><p><b>elastičan, rastegljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being distended</p><p><b>rastezanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of expanding by pressure from within [distention]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being stretched beyond normal dimensions [dilatation, distention]</p><p><b>stanje rastegnute izvan normalnih dimenzija, Čin širenja pod pritiskom iznutra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being stretched beyond normal dimensions [dilatation, distension]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of expanding by pressure from within [distension]</p><p><b>par</b></p><p><i>n.</i> two items of the same kind [brace, couple, couplet, duad, duet, duo, dyad, pair, span, twain, twosome, yoke]</p><p><b>cijediti se, destilirati, izvući srž, kapati, otjecati, peći rakiju, polako kapati, procijediti, sažeti, destilirati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> undergo condensation [condense, distill]</p><p><i>v.</i> extract by the process of distillation [distill, extract]</p><p><i>v.</i> undergo the process of distillation [distill]</p><p><i>v.</i> give off (a liquid) [distill]</p><p><b>destilirati, pročistiti, pročišćavati, pročišćivati, čistiti, destilirati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove impurities from, increase the concentration of, and separate through the process of distillation [make pure, purify, sublimate]</p><p><i>v.</i> undergo the process of distillation [distil]</p><p><i>v.</i> extract by the process of distillation [distil, extract]</p><p><i>v.</i> undergo condensation [condense, distil]</p><p><i>v.</i> give off (a liquid) [distil]</p><p><b>čisti tečnost dobivena kondenzacijom iz pare tijekom destilacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a purified liquid produced by condensation from a vapor during distilling [distillation]</p><p><b>destilacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of purifying a liquid by boiling it and condensing its vapors [distillment]</p><p><i>n.</i> a purified liquid produced by condensation from a vapor during distilling [distillate]</p><p><b>destilirana voda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> water that has been purified by distillation</p><p><b>destilirati (od &quot;distill&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who distills alcoholic liquors</p><p><b>destilerija, pecara</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plant and works where alcoholic drinks are made by distillation [still]</p><p><b>destilacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of purifying a liquid by boiling it and condensing its vapors [distillation]</p><p><b>izrazit, jasan, određen, poseban, različit, upečatljiv, zaseban</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (often followed by `from') not alike [distinguishable]</p><p><i>adj.</i> easy to perceive</p><p><i>adj.</i> constituting a separate entity or part [discrete]</p><p><i>adj.</i> recognizable [decided]</p><p><i>adj.</i> clearly or sharply defined to the mind [clear-cut, trenchant]</p><p><b>odlika, otmjenost, razlika, razlike, razlikovanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a discrimination between things as different and distinct on the basis of their characteristics or attributes [differentiation]</p><p><i>n.</i> high status importance owing to marked superiority [eminence, note, preeminence]</p><p><i>n.</i> a distinguishing difference between similar things or people</p><p><i>n.</i> an honor awarded to someone in recognition of achievement or superiority</p><p><b>karakterističan, naročit, osobina, osobit</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of a feature that helps to distinguish a person or thing [typical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being classified [classifiable]</p><p><b>osobina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an odd or unusual characteristic [distinguishing characteristic, peculiarity]</p><p><b>distinktivno, izrazito, osobito, značajno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an identifiably distinctive manner</p><p><b>svojstvenost, izvanrednost, jedinstvenost, naročitost, osobitost, posebnost, razlikovnost, specifičnost, specijalnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a distinguishing trait [peculiarity, speciality, specialness, specialty]</p><p><i>n.</i> utter dissimilarity [disparateness]</p><p><b>izrazito, jasno, različito</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> clear to the mind [clearly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a distinct and distinguishable manner</p><p><i>adv.</i> to a distinct degree</p><p><b>izrazit, jasan, određen, poseban, različit, upečatljiv, zaseban (od &quot;distinct&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being sharp and clear [sharpness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being several and distinct [discreteness, separateness, severalty]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being not alike [otherness, separateness]</p><p><b>dijeliti, istaći, raspoznavati, razaznavati, razlikovati, razlučiti, diferencirati, lučiti, odvajati, odvojiti, podvojiti, razlučivati, determinirati, identificirati, imenovati, odrediti, određivati, opisati, otkriti, otkrivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> mark as different [differentiate, secern, secernate, separate, severalise, severalize, tell, tell apart]</p><p><i>v.</i> detect with the senses [discern, make out, pick out, recognise, recognize, spot, tell apart]</p><p><i>v.</i> be a distinctive feature, attribute, or trait [differentiate, mark]</p><p><i>v.</i> make conspicuous or noteworthy [signalise, signalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> identify as in botany or biology, for example [describe, discover, identify, key, key out, name]</p><p><b>koji se može podijeliti, koji se može razlikovati, lučiv, razberiv, značajan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being perceived as different or distinct</p><p><i>adj.</i> (often followed by `from') not alike [distinct]</p><p><b>istaknut, istaknutim, razgovjetan, cijenjen, eminentan, poznat, ugledan, uvažen, vrstan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of persons) standing above others in character or attainment or reputation</p><p><i>adj.</i> used of a person's appearance or behavior [grand, imposing, magisterial]</p><p><b>Britansko vojno odlikovanje za izvanredno ponašanje na terenu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a British military decoration for distinguished conduct in the field</p><p><b>Odlikovanje američkog ratnog zrakoplovstva za junaštvo tijekom sudjelovanja u zračnom letu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a United States Air Force decoration for heroism while participating in an aerial flight</p><p><b>Odlikovanje američke vojske za izvanredno junaštvo protiv oružanog neprijatelja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a United States Army decoration for extraordinary heroism against an armed enemy</p><p><b>Američka vojna odlikovanje za zasluge u ratnom vrijeme dužnost velike odgovornosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a United States military decoration for meritorious service in wartime duty of great responsibility</p><p><b>Britansko vojno odlikovanje za specijalnu službu u akciji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a British military decoration for special service in action</p><p><b>Čudan ili neobičan karakteristika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an odd or unusual characteristic [distinctive feature, peculiarity]</p><p><b>bolest jetre (posebno kod ovaca i goveda) uzrokovana bubrezima jetre i njihovim nusproizvodima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disease of the liver (especially in sheep and cattle) caused by liver flukes and their by-products [black disease, liver rot, sheep rot]</p><p><b>deformirati, iskriviti, iskrivljivanje, izobličiti, izopačiti, izvitoperiti, izvrnuti, nakriviti, narušavati, unakaziti, frkati, iskrivljavati, ispreplesti, isprepletati, izobličavati, izvijati, izvinuti, mrsiti, svijati, svinuti, uvijati, uvinuti, viti, zamrsiti, zaplesti, zapletati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make false by mutilation or addition [falsify, garble, warp]</p><p><i>v.</i> form into a spiral shape [twine, twist]</p><p><i>v.</i> twist and press out of shape [contort, deform, wring]</p><p><i>v.</i> affect as in thought or feeling [color, colour, tinge]</p><p><i>v.</i> alter the shape of (something) by stress [deform, strain]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se ne upotrebljava u proizvodnji proizvoda iz poglavlja 3. ovog članka, to znači da se ne primjenjuje na proizvodnju proizvoda iz poglavlja 3. ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of having the meaning altered or twisted</p><p><b>iskrivljen, iznakažen, izobličen, izopačen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> so badly formed or out of shape as to be ugly [deformed, ill-shapen, malformed, misshapen]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having an intended meaning altered or misrepresented [misrepresented, perverted, twisted]</p><p><b>iskrivljenje, izobličenje, izobličenost, nakrivljenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a shape resulting from distortion [distortion]</p><p><b>deformacija, distorzija, iskrivljavanje, iskrivljenost, iskrivljenje, izobličenost, izobličenje, krivljenje, kvar, nakrivljenje, aberacija, optička aberacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a change for the worse [deformation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a shape resulting from distortion [distorted shape]</p><p><i>n.</i> an optical phenomenon resulting from the failure of a lens or mirror to produce a good image [aberration, optical aberration]</p><p><i>n.</i> a change (usually undesired) in the waveform of an acoustic or analog electrical signal</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of distorting something so it seems to mean something it was not intended to mean [overrefinement, straining, torture, twisting]</p><p><i>n.</i> the mistake of misrepresenting the facts</p><p><b>slikar koji uvodi distorzije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a painter who introduces distortions</p><p><b>odvratiti, odvratiti pažnju, odvući pažnju, pomesti, poremetiti, zbuniti, uznemiravati, uznemiriti, uznemirivati, uzrujati, uzrujavati, zabrinjavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> draw someone's attention away from something [deflect]</p><p><i>v.</i> disturb in mind or make uneasy or cause to be worried or alarmed [cark, disorder, disquiet, perturb, trouble, unhinge]</p><p><b>omesti, rastrzan, zbunjen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the attention diverted especially because of anxiety [distrait]</p><p><b>bezumno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a distracted manner</p><p><b>bezumlje, nemir, odvlačenje pažnje, pometenost, rastresenost, razbibriga, razonoda, smušenost, zabava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mental turmoil</p><p><i>n.</i> an obstacle to attention</p><p><i>n.</i> an entertainment that provokes pleased interest and distracts you from worries and vexations [beguilement]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of distracting [misdirection]</p><p><b>zaplijeniti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> levy a distress on</p><p><i>v.</i> confiscate by distress</p><p><i>v.</i> legally take something in place of a debt payment</p><p><b>ovrha, ovršni, ovršnom, pljenidba, zabrana, zapljena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the seizure and holding of property as security for payment of a debt or satisfaction of a claim [distress]</p><p><b>rasijan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the attention diverted especially because of anxiety [distracted]</p><p><b>bezuman, izbezumljen, izvan sebe (biti), lud, nesređen, razmrdan, uzrujan, zbunjen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> deeply agitated especially from emotion [overwrought]</p><p><b>bol, čemer, havarija, izmoriti, jad, nanijeti bol, nanijeti nevolju, neprilika, nesreća, nevolja, opasnost, pogibelj, pogibeljna situacija, potresti, ražalostiti, uzbuditi, žalostiti, ovrha</b></p><p><i>n.</i> psychological suffering [hurt, suffering]</p><p><i>n.</i> a state of adversity (danger or affliction or need)</p><p><i>n.</i> extreme physical pain</p><p><i>n.</i> the seizure and holding of property as security for payment of a debt or satisfaction of a claim [distraint]</p><p><i>v.</i> bring into difficulties or distress, especially financial hardship [straiten]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause mental pain to</p><p><b>Međunarodno priznat signal koji brod ili zrakoplov šalje kako bi se pokazalo da je potrebna pomoć. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an internationally recognized signal sent out by a ship or plane indicating that help is needed [distress signal]</p><p><b>pomorski poziv za pomoć/asistenciju, signal opasnosti, signal pogibelji, signal poziva u pomoć</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an internationally recognized signal sent out by a ship or plane indicating that help is needed [distress call]</p><p><b>tužan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> facing or experiencing financial trouble or difficulty [hard-pressed, hard put, in a bad way]</p><p><i>adj.</i> generalized feeling of distress [dysphoric, unhappy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> suffering severe physical strain or distress [stressed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> afflicted with or marked by anxious uneasiness or trouble or grief [disquieted, disturbed, upset, worried]</p><p><b>tužan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing distress or worry or anxiety [distressing, disturbing, perturbing, troubling, worrisome, worrying]</p><p><b>tužan (od &quot;distressful&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with distress</p><p><b>tužan (od &quot;distressful&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of arousing fear or distress [seriousness]</p><p><b>tužan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing distress or worry or anxiety [distressful, disturbing, perturbing, troubling, worrisome, worrying]</p><p><i>adj.</i> bad [deplorable, lamentable, pitiful, sad, sorry]</p><p><b>tužan (od &quot;distressing&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> unpleasantly [painfully]</p><p><b>tužan (od &quot;distressing&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being painful [painfulness]</p><p><b>grana rijeke koja teče daleko od glavnog toka i ne pridružuje se njemu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of a river that flows away from the main stream and does not rejoin it</p><p><b>dijeliti, distribuirati, izdavati, podijeliti, porazdijeliti, prodavati, raspačavati, raspodijeliti, raspršiti, raširiti, razdijeliti, dati, davati, porazdjeljivati, razdati, razdavati, razdjeljivati, udijeliti, udjeljivati, disperzirati, proširiti, proširivati, raspačati, rasprostraniti, rasprostranjivati, raspršivati, raširivati, širiti, prenijeti, prenositi, priopćavati, priopćiti, pronijeti, pronositi, propagirati, razglasiti, razglašavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> administer or bestow, as in small portions [administer, allot, deal, deal out, dish out, dispense, dole out, lot, mete out, parcel out, shell out]</p><p><i>v.</i> distribute or disperse widely [spread]</p><p><i>v.</i> make available</p><p><i>v.</i> give to several people [give out, hand out, pass out]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be distributed [circulate, pass around, pass on]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to become widely known [broadcast, circularise, circularize, circulate, diffuse, disperse, disseminate, pass around, propagate, spread]</p><p><i>v.</i> spread throughout a given area</p><p><i>v.</i> be distributed or spread, as in statistical analyses</p><p><i>v.</i> be mathematically distributive</p><p><i>v.</i> to arrange in a systematic order [stagger]</p><p><b>dijeljen, distribuiran, raspodijeljen, raspodijeljeno, raspoređen, raspoređenih</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> spread out or scattered about or divided up</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "proizvodnja podataka" znači proizvodnja podataka u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> data processing in which some of the functions are performed in different places and connected by transmission facilities [remote-access data processing, teleprocessing]</p><p><b>Požar raspršen kako bi se učinkovito angažirao u području mete. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fire dispersed so as to engage effectively an area target</p><p><b>distributer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who markets merchandise [distributor]</p><p><i>n.</i> electrical device that distributes voltage to the spark plugs of a gasoline engine in the order of the firing sequence [distributor, electrical distributor]</p><p><b>dijeljenje, distribucija, distribucijski, distributivan, izdavanje, podjela, podjele, raspodijeliti, raspodijeljen, raspodjela, rasprostranjenost, rasprostranjenje, razdioba, distributivnih, raspodjelu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (statistics) an arrangement of values of a variable showing their observed or theoretical frequency of occurrence [statistical distribution]</p><p><i>n.</i> the spatial or geographic property of being scattered about over a range, area, or volume [dispersion]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of distributing or spreading or apportioning</p><p><i>n.</i> the commercial activity of transporting and selling goods from a producer to a consumer</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, "proizvod" znači proizvod koji se proizvodi u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a contract governing the marketing of an item of merchandise</p><p><b>način prodaje proizvoda tvrtke ili izravno ili putem distributera (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a way of selling a company's product either directly or via distributors [channel]</p><p><b>trošak distribucije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any cost incurred by a producer or wholesaler or retailer or distributor (as for advertising and shipping etc)</p><p><b>statistički podaci izračunati bez znanja o obliku ili parametrima raspodjele iz koje se izvode promatranja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a statistic computed without knowledge of the form or the parameters of the distribution from which observations are drawn [nonparametric statistic]</p><p><b>zakon raspodjele, zakon razdiobe</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) the total energy in an assembly of molecules is not distributed equally but is distributed around an average value according to a statistical distribution</p><p><b>lista raspodjele (poruka primateljima), popis raspodjele</b></p><p><i>n.</i> list of names to whom a communication should be sent</p><p><b>dijelni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to spatial distribution</p><p><b>distributivan, distributivna</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to distribute or allot or disperse</p><p><b>šok uzrokovan lošom distribucijom protoka krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shock caused by poor distribution of the blood flow</p><p><b>distributivan, distributivna (od &quot;distributive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> as individuals or as separate units (not collectively)</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a distributive manner</p><p><b>distributer, distributera, distributor, djelitelj, isporučilac, isporučitelj, opskrbljivač, raspodjeljivač, razvodnik, razvodnik paljenja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who markets merchandise [distributer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person with authority to allot or deal out or apportion [allocator]</p><p><i>n.</i> a company that markets merchandise</p><p><i>n.</i> electrical device that distributes voltage to the spark plugs of a gasoline engine in the order of the firing sequence [distributer, electrical distributor]</p><p><b>Kamen unutar distributera koji se okreće da kontakt svjetiončare u pravom redu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cam inside the distributor that rotates to contact spark plug terminals in the correct order</p><p><b>razvodna kapa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cap of the distributor that holds in place the wires from the distributor to the spark plugs</p><p><b>S druge strane, za proizvodnju električnih vozila: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the housing that supports the distributor cam</p><p><b>kontakt u distributeru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a contact in the distributor [breaker point, point]</p><p><b>administrativna jedinica, četvrt, distrikt, gradska četvrt, kotar, kraj, oblast, odjel, okrug, okružje, okružni, općina, područje, pokrajina, predio, predjel, regija, županija, teritorij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a region marked off for administrative or other purposes [dominion, territorial dominion, territory]</p><p><i>v.</i> regulate housing in [zone]</p><p><b>okružni tužilac, okružni tužitelj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an official prosecutor for a judicial district [DA]</p><p><b>granicu između dva okruga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the boundary between two districts</p><p><b>menadžer koji nadgleda prodajnu aktivnost za okrug (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a manager who supervises the sales activity for a district</p><p><b>Okrug u potpunosti zauziman od grada Washingtona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the district occupied entirely by the city of Washington [D.C., DC]</p><p><b>nepouzdanje, nepovjerenje, strašiti, sumnja, sumnjati, zabrinutost, manjak povjerenja, sumnjičavost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> doubt about someone's honesty [misgiving, mistrust, suspicion]</p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of not trusting others [distrustfulness, mistrust]</p><p><i>v.</i> regard as untrustworthy [mistrust, suspect]</p><p><b>nepovjerljiv, sumnjičav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or showing distrust</p><p><b>nepovjerljiv, sumnjičav (od &quot;distrustful&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with distrust [mistrustfully]</p><p><b>manjak povjerenja, nepovjerenje, sumnja, sumnjičavost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of not trusting others [distrust, mistrust]</p><p><b>gnjaviti, narušavati, narušiti, ometati, poremetiti, remetiti, smetati, smetati (nekog), uznemiriti, uznemirivati, brinuti, mučiti, potresati, potresti, uznemiravati, zabrinuti, omesti, prekidati, prekinuti, smesti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> move deeply [trouble, upset]</p><p><i>v.</i> change the arrangement or position of [agitate, commove, raise up, shake up, stir up, vex]</p><p><i>v.</i> tamper with [touch]</p><p><i>v.</i> destroy the peace or tranquility of [interrupt]</p><p><i>v.</i> damage as if by shaking or jarring</p><p><b>narušenje, nemir, nered, ometanje, poremećaj, smetnja, uznemirivanje, bura, graja, izgred, remećenje, urnebes, buka, disonanca, disonancija, kakofonija, nesuglasje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> activity that is a malfunction, intrusion, or interruption [perturbation]</p><p><i>n.</i> an unhappy and worried mental state [perturbation, upset]</p><p><i>n.</i> a disorderly outburst or tumult [commotion, disruption, flutter, hoo-ha, hoo-hah, hurly burly, kerfuffle, to-do]</p><p><i>n.</i> a noisy fight [affray, fray, ruffle]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of disturbing something or someone</p><p><i>n.</i> (psychiatry) a psychological disorder of thought or emotion [folie, mental disorder, mental disturbance, psychological disorder]</p><p><i>n.</i> electrical or acoustic activity that can disturb communication [interference, noise]</p><p><b>Ako je to potrebno, država članica može dopustiti da se u skladu s člankom 5. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, ako je to potrebno, odredi za određene vrste vozila. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any act of molesting, interrupting, hindering, agitating, or arousing from a state of repose or otherwise depriving inhabitants of the peace and quiet to which they are entitled [breach of the peace, disorderly behavior, disorderly conduct]</p><p><b>poremećen, uznemiren</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the place or position changed</p><p><i>adj.</i> afflicted with or marked by anxious uneasiness or trouble or grief [disquieted, distressed, upset, worried]</p><p><i>adj.</i> emotionally unstable and having difficulty coping with personal relationships [maladjusted]</p><p><i>adj.</i> affected with madness or insanity [brainsick, crazy, demented, mad, sick, unbalanced, unhinged]</p><p><b>gnjaviti, narušavati, narušiti, ometati, poremetiti, remetiti, smetati, smetati (nekog), uznemiriti, uznemirivati (od &quot;disturb&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a troubler who interrupts or interferes with peace and quiet</p><p><b>uznemiravanje</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing distress or worry or anxiety [distressful, distressing, perturbing, troubling, worrisome, worrying]</p><p><b>uznemiravanje (od &quot;disturbing&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a disturbing manner</p><p><b>lijek (trgovinski naziv Antabuse) koji se koristi za liječenje alkoholizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug (trade name Antabuse) used in the treatment of alcoholism [Antabuse]</p><p><b>razdvojiti ili razdvojiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> break up or separate [break apart]</p><p><b>nesloga, rastavljanje, razdor, razdvajanje, razlika, nejedinstvo, razjedinjenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the termination or destruction of union</p><p><b>rastaviti, dijeliti, odijeliti, odjeljivati, odvajati, odvojiti, podijeliti, podvojiti, rastavljati, razdijeliti, razdjeljivati, razdvajati, razdvojiti, separirati, udaljiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> part [disassociate, disjoint, dissociate, divorce]</p><p><i>v.</i> force, take, or pull apart [divide, part, separate]</p><p><b>koji su podijeljeni (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having been divided [disconnected, fragmented, split]</p><p><b>razdvajanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lack of unity (usually resulting from dissension)</p><p><b>neupotreba, neupotrebljavanje, odvika, prestati upotrebljavati, zastarjeti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of something that has been unused and neglected [neglect]</p><p><b>više nije u upotrebi (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> no longer in use [obsolete]</p><p><b>s ili karakteriziran ili sastoji se od dva slogova (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or characterized by or consisting of two syllables</p><p><b>dvosložna riječ</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word having two syllables [dissyllable]</p><p><b>kraći od dva telegrafska signala koja se koriste u Morseovom kodu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the shorter of the two telegraphic signals used in Morse code [dot]</p><p><b>zeleno stablo iz istočne Azije i Filipina s velikim kožnim lišćama i malim zelenobitnim cvijećima u kompaktnim cimetama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> evergreen tree of eastern Asia and Philippines having large leathery leaves and small green-white flowers in compact cymes [Alstonia scholaris, devil tree, dita bark]</p><p><b>zeleno stablo iz istočne Azije i Filipina s velikim kožnim lišćama i malim zelenobitnim cvijećima u kompaktnim cimetama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> evergreen tree of eastern Asia and Philippines having large leathery leaves and small green-white flowers in compact cymes [Alstonia scholaris, devil tree, dita]</p><p><b>jama, jarak, prokop, rov, šanac, otarasiti se, odbaciti, riješiti se, kurtalisati se, jaružati, kopati kanal, nogirati, prekinuti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long narrow excavation in the earth</p><p><i>n.</i> any small natural waterway</p><p><i>v.</i> forsake</p><p><i>v.</i> throw away [chuck]</p><p><i>v.</i> sever all ties with, usually unceremoniously or irresponsibly [dump]</p><p><i>v.</i> make an emergency landing on water</p><p><i>v.</i> crash or crash-land</p><p><i>v.</i> cut a trench in, as for drainage [trench]</p><p><b>radnik koji kopa jarke. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a laborer who digs ditches [mud digger]</p><p><b>Osmunda regalis, kraljevski pujanik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large deeply rooted fern of worldwide distribution with upright bipinnate compound tufted fronds [French bracken, Osmunda regalis, king fern, royal fern, royal osmund]</p><p><b>visoka sjevernoamerička trska s relativno širokim lišćama i velikim plutavim panicama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall North American reed having relative wide leaves and large plumelike panicles [Phragmites communis, carrizo