hould be repeated [ditto mark]</p><p><i>v.</i> repeat an action or statement</p><p><b>znak koji se koristi za označavanje riječi iznad njega treba ponoviti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mark used to indicate the word above it should be repeated [ditto]</p><p><b>pjesmica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a short simple song (or the words of a poem intended to be sung)</p><p><b>oprema koju koriste mornari i vojnici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> kit used by sailors and soldiers</p><p><b>diureza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> increased secretion of urine</p><p><b>diuretici</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any substance that tends to increase the flow of urine, which causes the body to get rid of excess water [diuretic drug, water pill]</p><p><b>diuretici</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any substance that tends to increase the flow of urine, which causes the body to get rid of excess water [diuretic, water pill]</p><p><b>diuretik (trgovinski naziv Diuril) koji se koristi za liječenje edem i hipertenzije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diuretic drug (trade name Diuril) used in the treatment of edema and hypertension [chlorothiazide]</p><p><b>danji, dnevni, jednodnevan, dnevan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or belonging to or active during the day</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a daily cycle or occurring every day</p><p><b>paralaks nebeskog tijela koji koristi dvije točke na površini Zemlje dok se Zemlja okreće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the parallax of a celestial body using two points on the surface of the earth as the earth rotates [geocentric parallax]</p><p><b>fluktuacije koje se javljaju tijekom svakog dana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fluctuations that occur during each day</p><p><b>diva, primadona</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a distinguished female operatic singer [prima donna]</p><p><b>lutati, odlutati, udaljiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> lose clarity or turn aside especially from the main subject of attention or course of argument in writing, thinking, or speaking [digress, stray, wander]</p><p><b>devijacija, digresija, odmak, odmicanje, odstupanje, odvraćanje, otklanjanje, otklon, skretanje, udaljivanje, zastranjenje, zastranjivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a message that departs from the main subject [aside, digression, excursus, parenthesis]</p><p><i>n.</i> a turning aside (of your course or attention or concern) [deflection, deflexion, deviation, digression, diversion]</p><p><b>dvovalentan, dvovalentni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a valence of two or having two valences [bivalent]</p><p><b>divan, otoman, sećija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long backless sofa (usually with pillows against a wall)</p><p><i>n.</i> a Muslim council of state [diwan]</p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of Persian or Arabic poems (usually by one author) [diwan]</p><p><i>n.</i> a Muslim council chamber or law court [diwan]</p><p><b>bezoručni kauč. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an armless couch [daybed]</p><p><b>razilaziti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> branch off</p><p><i>v.</i> spread apart</p><p><b>razdvajanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> branching at a wide angle</p><p><b>gnjuriti, roniti, ronjenje, skočiti u vodu, skok u vodu, spust, upijač, uron, uroniti, zagnjuriti se, zaroniti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cheap disreputable nightclub or dance hall [honkytonk]</p><p><i>n.</i> a headlong plunge into water [diving]</p><p><i>n.</i> a steep nose-down descent by an aircraft [nose dive, nosedive]</p><p><i>v.</i> drop steeply [plunge, plunk]</p><p><i>v.</i> plunge into water</p><p><i>v.</i> swim under water</p><p><b>bombarder, bombarder za obrušavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bomber that releases its bombs during a steep dive toward the target</p><p><b>mali padobran ili zglobni kljup za smanjenje brzine zrakoplova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small parachute or articulated flap to reduce the speed of an aircraft [airbrake]</p><p><b>bomba iz ronjenja aviona (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bomb from a diving airplane</p><p><b>bombardiranje u kojem bombarder pušta bombu dok leti ravno prema cilju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bombing run in which the bomber releases the bomb while flying straight toward the target</p><p><b>ronilac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who works underwater [frogman, underwater diver]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who dives (into water) [plunger]</p><p><i>n.</i> large somewhat primitive fish-eating diving bird of the northern hemisphere having webbed feet placed far back [loon]</p><p><b>divergirati, granati, razilaziti (se), razilaziti se, razdvajati se, razdvojiti se, razići se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> move or draw apart</p><p><i>v.</i> have no limits as a mathematical series</p><p><i>v.</i> extend in a different direction</p><p><i>v.</i> be at variance with [depart, deviate, vary]</p><p><b>divergencija, neslaganje, odstupanje, razilaženje, širenje, devijacija, otklon, razlika, aporija, diskrepancija, nesklad</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of moving away in different direction from a common point [divergency]</p><p><i>n.</i> a variation that deviates from the standard or norm [departure, deviation, difference]</p><p><i>n.</i> an infinite series that has no limit [divergency]</p><p><i>n.</i> a difference between conflicting facts or claims or opinions [disagreement, discrepancy, variance]</p><p><b>beskonačan niz koji nema granice., Čin udaljavanja u različitom smjeru od zajedničke točke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an infinite series that has no limit [divergence]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of moving away in different direction from a common point [divergence]</p><p><b>divergentan, odvojen, različit</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> diverging from another or from a standard</p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to move apart in different directions [diverging]</p><p><b>strabismus u kojem je jedno ili oba oka usmjerena prema van (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> strabismus in which one or both eyes are directed outward [exotropia, walleye]</p><p><b>Mislitelj koji se udaljava od problema kako je navedeno i često ima nove ideje i rješenja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thinker who moves away from the problem as stated and often has novel ideas and solutions</p><p><b>Razmišljanje koje se kreće u različitim smjerovima tako da uključuje različite aspekte i koje ponekad dovodi do novih ideja i rješenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thinking that moves away in diverging directions so as to involve a variety of aspects and which sometimes lead to novel ideas and solutions [out-of-the-box thinking]</p><p><b>divergentan, koji svijetli, radijantan, različit, sjajan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to move apart in different directions [divergent]</p><p><b>objektiva tako da se paralelni zrak svjetlosti koji prolazi kroz njega razdvaja ili širi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lens such that a parallel beam of light passing through it is caused to diverge or spread out [concave lens]</p><p><b>razni, raznolik, raznovrstan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> many and different [diverse]</p><p><b>drugačiji, najrazličitije, najrazličitiji, različit, različitih, razni, raznolik, raznovrsne</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> many and different [divers]</p><p><i>adj.</i> distinctly dissimilar or unlike [various]</p><p><b>različito</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in diverse ways [multifariously, variously]</p><p><b>raznolikost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> noticeable heterogeneity [diversity, multifariousness, variety]</p><p><b>diverzificiranost, diverzifikacija, diverzifikacija portfelja, raznolikost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of introducing variety (especially in investments or in the variety of goods and services offered) [variegation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being varied</p><p><b>nejednolik, raznoliki, raznolikih</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having variety of character or form or components</p><p><b>promijeniti, razlikovati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make (more) diverse</p><p><i>v.</i> spread into new habitats and produce variety or variegate [radiate]</p><p><i>v.</i> vary in order to spread risk or to expand [branch out, broaden]</p><p><b>diverzija, odvajanje, skretanje, zlouporaba, razbibriga, razonoda, rekreacija, zabava, devijacija, digresija, odmak, odmicanje, odstupanje, odvraćanje, otklanjanje, otklon, udaljivanje, zastranjenje, zastranjivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an activity that diverts or amuses or stimulates [recreation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a turning aside (of your course or attention or concern) [deflection, deflexion, deviation, digression, divagation]</p><p><i>n.</i> an attack calculated to draw enemy defense away from the point of the principal attack [diversionary attack]</p><p><b>(npr. taktika) koja je vjerojatno ili je namijenjena zbuniti ili zavesti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of tactics e.g.) likely or designed to confuse or deceive</p><p><b>Napad koji je izračunan kako bi odvukao neprijateljsku obranu od točke glavnog napada. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an attack calculated to draw enemy defense away from the point of the principal attack [diversion]</p><p><b>amfibijski diverzijski napad (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amphibious diversionary attack</p><p><b>osoba koja sabotira ili namjerno uzrokuje olupinu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who commits sabotage or deliberately causes wrecks [saboteur, wrecker]</p><p><b>diverzitet, raščlanjenost, različitost, razlike, raznolikost, raznolikosti, raznovrsnost, višestruki prijenos</b></p><p><i>n.</i> noticeable heterogeneity [diverseness, multifariousness, variety]</p><p><i>n.</i> the condition or result of being changeable</p><p><b>odvratiti, odvratiti pažnju, preusmjeriti, razonoditi, skrenuti, zabavljati, ugađati, ugoditi, zabaviti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> turn aside [deviate]</p><p><i>v.</i> send on a course or in a direction different from the planned or intended one</p><p><i>v.</i> occupy in an agreeable, entertaining or pleasant fashion [amuse, disport]</p><p><i>v.</i> withdraw (money) and move into a different location, often secretly and with dishonest intentions [hive off]</p><p><b>preusmjereno</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pleasantly occupied [amused, entertained]</p><p><b>upala divertikula</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of a diverticulum in the digestive tract (especially the colon)</p><p><b>prisutnost višestrukih divertikula u zidovima debelog crijeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> presence of multiple diverticula in the walls of the colon</p><p><b>hernija kroz mišićni zid cijevnog organa (posebno debelog crijeva) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a herniation through the muscular wall of a tubular organ (especially the colon)</p><p><b>glazbena kompozicija u nekoliko djelova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a musical composition in several movements [serenade]</p><p><b>preusmjeravanje, veseo, zabavan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> providing enjoyment [amusing, amusive]</p><p><b>veselo, zabavno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an entertaining and amusing manner [amusingly]</p><p><b>lišiti, osloboditi, skinuti, svući, svući odijelo, lišavati, oduzeti, oduzimati, opljačkati, pljačkati, uskratiti, uskraćivati, razodijevati, razodjenuti, skidati, svlačiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> take away possessions from someone [deprive, strip]</p><p><i>v.</i> deprive of status or authority [disinvest]</p><p><i>v.</i> reduce or dispose of [disinvest]</p><p><i>v.</i> remove (someone's or one's own) clothes [disinvest, strip, undress]</p><p><b>lišavanje, oduzimanje, svlačenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an order to an offending party to rid itself of property</p><p><i>n.</i> the sale by a company of a product line or a subsidiary or a division</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, za proizvodnju proizvoda iz kategorije II. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> twisted seed pods of the divi-divi tree</p><p><i>n.</i> small thornless tree or shrub of tropical America whose seed pods are a source of tannin [Caesalpinia coriaria]</p><p><b>može se podijeliti obično bez ostavljanja ostatka (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> can be divided usually without leaving a remainder</p><p><b>dijeliti, odijeliti pregrado, odvojiti, podijeliti, podjeliti (među), raspoloviti, rastaviti, razdijeliti, razvođe, rezati, razvodnica, cijepati, cjepkati, podjeljivati, podvojiti, rascijepati, rascijepiti, rascjepkati, rascjepkavati, rascjepljivati, raskoliti, rastavljati, razdjeljivati, razdvajati, razdvojiti, dijeliti se, odcijepiti se, odcjepljivati se, odijeliti se, odjeljivati se, odvajati se, odvojiti se, podijeliti se, rastaviti se, rastavljati se, separirati se, udaljiti se, odijeliti, odjeljivati, odvajati, separirati, udaljiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a serious disagreement between two groups of people (typically producing tension or hostility)</p><p><i>n.</i> a ridge of land that separates two adjacent river systems [water parting, watershed]</p><p><i>v.</i> separate into parts or portions [carve up, dissever, separate, split, split up]</p><p><i>v.</i> perform a division [fraction]</p><p><i>v.</i> act as a barrier between [separate]</p><p><i>v.</i> come apart [part, separate]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a division or separation [separate]</p><p><i>v.</i> force, take, or pull apart [disunite, part, separate]</p><p><b>dijeli, dijeljen, podijeljen, podijeljena, podjeljen, raspoređen, raspoređeni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> separated into parts or pieces</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a median strip or island between lanes of traffic moving in opposite directions [dual-lane]</p><p><i>adj.</i> distributed in portions (often equal) on the basis of a plan or purpose [divided up, shared, shared out]</p><p><b>autocesta podijeljena na pola barijerom koja odvaja promet koji ide u različitim smjerovima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a highway divided down the middle by a barrier that separates traffic going in different directions [dual carriageway]</p><p><b>raspoređivanje u dijelove (često jednake) na temelju plana ili namjene (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> distributed in portions (often equal) on the basis of a plan or purpose [divided, shared, shared out]</p><p><b>dijeljenik, dividend, dividenda, dividende, djeljenik, prihod od ulaganja, udio</b></p><p><i>n.</i> that part of the earnings of a corporation that is distributed to its shareholders</p><p><i>n.</i> a number to be divided by another number</p><p><i>n.</i> a bonus</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (d) ove Uredbe, u (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an order of payment (such as a check payable to a shareholder) in which a dividend is paid</p><p><b>pregrada, razdjelnik, razdjeljivač, paravan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a taxonomist who classifies organisms into many groups on the basis of relatively minor characteristics [splitter]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who separates something into parts or groups</p><p><i>n.</i> a vertical structure that divides or separates (as a wall divides one room from another) [partition]</p><p><i>n.</i> a drafting instrument resembling a compass that is used for dividing lines into equal segments or for transferring measurements</p><p><b>razdjelnica, razmeđe</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a conceptual separation or distinction [contrast, demarcation, line]</p><p><b>narativna epska pjesma napisana od Dantea (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a narrative epic poem written by Dante [Divine Comedy]</p><p><b>gatanje, proricanje, vračanje, proročanstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> successful conjecture by unusual insight or good luck</p><p><i>n.</i> a prediction uttered under divine inspiration [prophecy]</p><p><i>n.</i> the art or gift of prophecy (or the pretense of prophecy) by supernatural means [foretelling, fortune telling, soothsaying]</p><p><b>Sličnost ili karakteristika proroka ili proročanstva, temelje se na pretpostavkama, a ne na odgovarajućim dokazima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling or characteristic of a prophet or prophecy [mantic, sibyllic, sibylline, vatic, vatical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> based primarily on surmise rather than adequate evidence [conjectural, hypothetic, hypothetical, supposed, suppositional, suppositious, supposititious]</p><p><b>bogoslov, božanski, božji, duhovnik, duhovno lice, proricati, uzvišen</b></p><p><i>n.</i> terms referring to the Judeo-Christian God [Almighty, Creator, God Almighty, Godhead, Jehovah, Lord, Maker]</p><p><i>n.</i> a clergyman or other person in religious orders [churchman, cleric, ecclesiastic]</p><p><i>v.</i> perceive intuitively or through some inexplicable perceptive powers</p><p><i>v.</i> search by divining, as if with a rod</p><p><i>adj.</i> emanating from God [godly]</p><p><i>adj.</i> resulting from divine providence [providential]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being or having the nature of a god [godlike]</p><p><i>adj.</i> devoted to or in the service or worship of a deity</p><p><i>adj.</i> appropriate to or befitting a god [godlike]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being of such surpassing excellence as to suggest inspiration by the gods [elysian, inspired]</p><p><b>narativna epska pjesma napisana od Dantea (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a narrative epic poem written by Dante [Divina Commedia]</p><p><b>(teologija) poseban utjecaj božanskog bića na um ljudskih bića (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (theology) a special influence of a divinity on the minds of human beings [inspiration]</p><p><b>Zakon za koji se vjeruje da dolazi izravno od Boga. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a law that is believed to come directly from God</p><p><b>Poslanik od Allaha. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a messenger from God</p><p><b>božanski časoslov</b></p><p><i>n.</i> canonical prayers recited daily by priests (e.g. the breviary of the Roman Catholic Church)</p><p><b>objava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> communication of knowledge to man by a divine or supernatural agency [revelation]</p><p><b>nauku da kraljevi imaju pravo vladati izravno od Boga i da nisu odgovorni svojim podanicima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the doctrine that kings derive their right to rule directly from God and are not accountable to their subjects [divine right of kings]</p><p><b>nauku da kraljevi imaju pravo vladati izravno od Boga i da nisu odgovorni svojim podanicima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the doctrine that kings derive their right to rule directly from God and are not accountable to their subjects [divine right]</p><p><b>bogoslužje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of public worship following prescribed rules [religious service, service]</p><p><b>Islamska teroristička stanica koja je potekla iz Jordana, ali djeluje u Njemačkoj. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an Islamic terrorist cell that originated in Jordan but operates in Germany [Al Tawhid, al-Tawhid]</p><p><b>bogoslov, božanski, božji, duhovnik, duhovno lice, proricati, uzvišen (od &quot;divine&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by divine means</p><p><b>vidovnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who claims to discover hidden knowledge with the aid of supernatural powers</p><p><b>ronilački, ronilačkog, ronjenje, zaroniti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an athletic competition that involves diving into water [diving event]</p><p><i>n.</i> a headlong plunge into water [dive]</p><p><b>S druge opreme za podmorništvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> diving apparatus for underwater work</p><p><b>trambulin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a springboard from which swimmers can dive</p><p><b>odjeća s masenim i hermetički zatvorenim vodom i zračenjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a weighted and hermetically sealed garment supplied with air [diving suit]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih pataka, posebno u zaljevu i u estuariji, koji se rone u potrazi za hranom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various ducks of especially bays and estuaries that dive for their food</p><p><b>sportsko natjecanje koje uključuje ronjenje u vodu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an athletic competition that involves diving into water [diving]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko malih ptica za ronjenje u morima južne hemisfere (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several small diving birds of southern hemisphere seas</p><p><b>ronilačko odijelo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a weighted and hermetically sealed garment supplied with air [diving dress]</p><p><b>Čep s vilicama koji se navodi da se spušta dolje kako bi se pokazala podzemna voda ili nafta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> forked stick that is said to dip down to indicate underground water or oil [dowser, dowsing rod, water finder, waterfinder]</p><p><b>bogoslovlje, božanstvo, božanstvenost, bog, teologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any supernatural being worshipped as controlling some part of the world or some aspect of life or who is the personification of a force [deity, god, immortal]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being divine</p><p><i>n.</i> white creamy fudge made with egg whites [divinity fudge]</p><p><i>n.</i> the rational and systematic study of religion and its influences and of the nature of religious truth [theology]</p><p><b>Bijeli kremasto čokoladni kolačić napravljen od bijelca jaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> white creamy fudge made with egg whites [divinity]</p><p><b>bezbojna, nestabilna i vrlo zapaljiva tekućina koja se nekada koristila kao anestetik za inhalaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless volatile highly flammable liquid formerly used as an inhalation anesthetic [diethyl ether, ether, ethoxyethane, ethyl ether, vinyl ether]</p><p><b>djeljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being divisible</p><p><b>djeljiv, rastavljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being or liable to be divided or separated</p><p><b>dijeljenje, dioba, divizija, liga, nogometna liga, odjel, odjeljak, odjeljenje, podijeljenost, podjela, podjeljak, pregrada, radna jedinica, razdioba, razdor, sektor, diobeni, dio, odjsečak, sekcija, komadanje, zrakoplovna divizija, mornarička divizija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an army unit large enough to sustain combat</p><p><i>n.</i> one of the portions into which something is regarded as divided and which together constitute a whole [part, section]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act or process of dividing</p><p><i>n.</i> an administrative unit in government or business</p><p><i>n.</i> discord that splits a group [variance]</p><p><i>n.</i> a league ranked by quality [class]</p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) a group of organisms forming a subdivision of a larger category</p><p><i>n.</i> (botany) taxonomic unit of plants corresponding to a phylum</p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of the United States Air Force usually comprising two or more wings [air division]</p><p><i>n.</i> a group of ships of similar type [naval division]</p><p><i>n.</i> an arithmetic operation that is the inverse of multiplication</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of dividing or partitioning [partition, partitioning, sectionalisation, sectionalization, segmentation]</p><p><b>od biljaka s cvjetnim stablama koja proizvode sjemena zatvorena u jajniku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> comprising flowering plants that produce seeds enclosed in an ovary [Angiospermae, Anthophyta, Magnoliophyta, class Angiospermae, division Magnoliophyta]</p><p><b>U nekim klasifikacijama smatra se kraljevstvom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in some classifications considered a kingdom</p><p><b>podjela necvjetnica za koje su karakteristične rizodine umjesto pravih korijena i imaju malo ili nimalo organiziranog vaskularnog tkiva i pokazuju izmjenu generacija između oblika koji nose gamete i oblika koji nose spore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a division of nonflowering plants characterized by rhizoids rather than true roots and having little or no organized vascular tissue and showing alternation of generations between gamete-bearing forms and spore-bearing forms [Bryophyta]</p><p><b>Velika podjela uglavnom slatkovodnih eukariotskih algi koje posjeduju hlorofil a i b, skladište hrane kao skrob i stanične zidine celuloze (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large division of chiefly freshwater eukaryotic algae that possess chlorophyll a and b, store food as starch, and cellulose cell walls [Chlorophyta]</p><p><b>uglavnom slatkovodne eukariotske alge koje imaju hlorofil maskiran smeđim ili žutim pigmentom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mostly freshwater eukaryotic algae having the chlorophyll masked by brown or yellow pigment [Chrysophyta]</p><p><b>prokariotski organizmi ponekad se smatraju klasom ili filom ili podkraljevstvom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> prokaryotic organisms sometimes considered a class or phylum or subkingdom [Cyanophyta]</p><p><b>podjela reda Therapsida iz trijasnog razdoblja koja obuhvaća male mesojede reptile tetrapodske vrste često s zubima sličnim sisarima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a division of the order Therapsida from the Triassic period comprising small carnivorous tetrapod reptiles often with mammal-like teeth [Cynodontia]</p><p><b>Divizija Therapsida (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a division of Therapsida [Dicynodontia]</p><p><b>eubakterije, odjel Eubacteria, odjel eubakterija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one-celled monerans having simple cells with rigid walls and (in motile types) flagella</p><p><b>Bjelovječe i ptice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> free-swimming flagellate algae [Euglenophyta]</p><p><b>Pravi gljivice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> true fungi [Eumycota]</p><p><b>čirevi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> slime molds [Gymnomycota, Myxomycota, division Myxomycota]</p><p><b>biljke s golim sjemenom koja nije zatvorena u jajnik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plants having naked seeds not enclosed in an ovary [Gymnospermae, Gymnospermophyta, class Gymnospermae]</p><p><b>alge koje sadrže hlorofil a i obično c i žlijezde nejednakog dužine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> algae having chlorophyll a and usually c, and flagella of unequal lengths [Heterokontophyta]</p><p><b>koji sadrže liševine koje simbiotički rastu s algama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> comprising the lichens which grow symbiotically with algae [Lichenes]</p><p><b>od biljaka s cvjetnim stablama koja proizvode sjemena zatvorena u jajniku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> comprising flowering plants that produce seeds enclosed in an ovary [Angiospermae, Anthophyta, Magnoliophyta, class Angiospermae, division Anthophyta]</p><p><b>čirevi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> slime molds [Gymnomycota, Myxomycota, division Gymnomycota]</p><p><b>Koekstenzivna s klasom Phaeophyceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coextensive with class Phaeophyceae [Phaeophyta]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je proizvod proizvedeno u Uniji ili u trećem zemljom, u Uniji se može upotrebljavati proizvod iz trećeg zemljnog područja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eukaryotic one-celled living organisms distinct from multicellular plants and animals: protozoa, slime molds, and eukaryotic algae [Protista]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 g/m2 do 0,15 g/m2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> containing all the vascular plants that do not bear seeds: ferns, horsetails, club mosses, and whisk ferns [Pteridophyta]</p><p><b>donje biljke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lower plants [Rhodophyta]</p><p><b>bivši naziv za Cyanophyta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> former term for the Cyanophyta [Schizophyta]</p><p><b>biljke sjemenke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> seed plants [Spermatophyta]</p><p><b>u prethodnim klasifikacijama: koje obuhvaćaju biljke s vaskularnim sustavom uključujući paprike i njihove saveznike kao i biljke sjemenke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in former classifications: comprising plants with a vascular system including ferns and fern allies as well as seed plants [Tracheophyta]</p><p><b>diobeni, diobni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a military division</p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to divide or marking a division</p><p><i>adj.</i> constituting a division or an aliquot part of the basic monetary unit</p><p><b>koji dijeli</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> dissenting (especially dissenting with the majority opinion) [dissentious, factious]</p><p><b>djelilac, djelitelj, faktor, divizor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of two or more integers that can be exactly divided into another integer [factor]</p><p><i>n.</i> the number by which a dividend is divided</p><p><b>rastava, rastava (braka), rastava braka, rastaviti, rastaviti (se), razvesti, razvesti se, razvod, razvod braka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the legal dissolution of a marriage [divorcement]</p><p><i>v.</i> part [disassociate, disjoint, dissociate, disunite]</p><p><i>v.</i> get a divorce [split up]</p><p><b>sud koji je nadležan za raskid bračnih ugovora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a court having jurisdiction over the termination of marriage contracts</p><p><b>odvjetnik specijaliziran za postupke za razvod ili poništenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lawyer specializing in actions for divorce or annulment</p><p><b>rastavljen, razveden</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of someone whose marriage has been legally dissolved</p><p><b>Čovjek koji je razveo (ili odvojio) svoju ženu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a man who is divorced from (or separated from) his wife [grass widower]</p><p><b>rastavljen (osoba)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a divorced woman or a woman who is separated from her husband [grass widow]</p><p><b>rastava, razvesti, razvod</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the legal dissolution of a marriage [divorce]</p><p><b>busen, rupa ili udubina na igralištu golfa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (golf) the cavity left when a piece of turf is cut from the ground by the club head in making a stroke</p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of turf dug out of a lawn or fairway (by an animals hooves or a golf club)</p><p><b>objaviti, objelodaniti, odati, otkriti, požderati, rasprostraniti, razglasiti, reći tajnu, objavljivati, objelodanjivati, odavati, otkrivati, razotkriti, razotkrivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make known to the public information that was previously known only to a few people or that was meant to be kept a secret [break, bring out, disclose, discover, expose, give away, let on, let out, reveal, uncover, unwrap]</p><p><b>razglašivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of disclosing something that was secret or private [divulgence]</p><p><b>otkrivanje nečega što je bilo tajno ili privatno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of disclosing something that was secret or private [divulgement]</p><p><b>kratka za dividendu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> short for dividend</p><p><b>razdijeliti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> give out as one's portion or share [apportion, deal, portion out, share]</p><p><b>muslimanski državni savjet, zbirka perzijskih ili arapskih pjesama (obično jednog autora), muslimanski vijeće ili sud (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Muslim council of state [divan]</p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of Persian or Arabic poems (usually by one author) [divan]</p><p><i>n.</i> a Muslim council chamber or law court [divan]</p><p><b>Američki socijalni reformator koji je pionir u reformi zatvora i liječenju mentalno bolesnih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States social reformer who pioneered in the reform of prisons and in the treatment of the mentally ill [Dorothea Dix, Dorothea Lynde Dix]</p><p><b>konfederacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the southern states that seceded from the United States in 1861 [Confederacy, Confederate States, Confederate States of America, Dixieland, South]</p><p><i>n.</i> a large metal pot (12 gallon camp kettle) for cooking</p><p><b>čaša za jednokratnu upotrebu od papira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disposable cup made of paper [paper cup]</p><p><b>bivša politička stranka u Sjedinjenim Državama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a former political party in the United States [States' Rights Democratic Party]</p><p><b>diksilend, konfederacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the southern states that seceded from the United States in 1861 [Confederacy, Confederate States, Confederate States of America, Dixie, South]</p><p><b>nakinđuriti se, nalickati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> dress up garishly and tastelessly [bedizen]</p><p><b>za životinje koje su proizvedene iz dva odvojeno oplođena jajašca: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> derived from two separately fertilized eggs [dizygous]</p><p><b>ili dva blizanca koja su se razvila iz dva odvojena oplođena jajašca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two twins who developed from two separate fertilized eggs [fraternal twin]</p><p><b>za životinje koje su proizvedene iz dva odvojeno oplođena jajašca: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> derived from two separately fertilized eggs [dizygotic]</p><p><b>nepromišljen, nesmotren, omamiti, osjećaj vrtoglavice, vrtoglav, zamantan (od &quot;dizzy&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a giddy light-h