e decisions [authorisation, authority, authorization, potency, say-so]</p><p><b>dominanta, dominantan, koji gospodari, nadmoćan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (music) the fifth note of the diatonic scale</p><p><i>n.</i> an allele that produces the same phenotype whether its paired allele is identical or different [dominant allele]</p><p><i>adj.</i> exercising influence or control</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of genes) producing the same phenotype whether its allele is identical or dissimilar</p><p><i>adj.</i> most frequent or common [predominant, prevailing, prevalent, rife]</p><p><b>allel koji proizvodi isti fenotip bez obzira na to je li njegov par allela identičan ili različit (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an allele that produces the same phenotype whether its paired allele is identical or different [dominant]</p><p><b>gen koji proizvodi isti fenotip u organizmu bez obzira na to jesu li njegovi aleli identični ili ne (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> gene that produces the same phenotype in the organism whether or not its allele identical</p><p><b>dominantan, dominirati, gospodariti, prevladavati, vladati, prevladati, upravljati, voditi, zasjeniti, komandirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be larger in number, quantity, power, status or importance [predominate, prevail, reign, rule]</p><p><i>v.</i> be in control</p><p><i>v.</i> have dominance or the power to defeat over [master]</p><p><i>v.</i> be greater in significance than [eclipse, overshadow]</p><p><i>v.</i> look down on [command, overlook, overtop]</p><p><b>izmučen, pod dominacijom, potlačen, shrvan, skrhan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> controlled or ruled by superior authority or power</p><p><i>adj.</i> harassed by persistent nagging [henpecked]</p><p><b>dominantan, dominira</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> most powerful or important or influential [ascendant, ascendent]</p><p><i>adj.</i> used of a height or viewpoint [commanding, overlooking]</p><p><i>adj.</i> offensively self-assured or given to exercising usually unwarranted power [autocratic, bossy, high-and-mighty