drawers for keeping clothes [bureau, chest, chest of drawers]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who dresses in a particular way</p><p><i>n.</i> a wardrobe assistant for an actor [actor's assistant]</p><p><i>n.</i> low table with mirror or mirrors where one sits while dressing or applying makeup [dressing table, toilet table, vanity]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cabinet with shelves</p><p><b>gnojenje, oblačenje, obrada čelika, odijevanje, postrojavanje, pripravljanje, začin, začini, medicinski zavoj, oblog, zavoj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> savory dressings for salads [salad dressing]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mixture of seasoned ingredients used to stuff meats and vegetables [stuffing]</p><p><i>n.</i> making fertile as by applying fertilizer or manure [fecundation, fertilisation, fertilization]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cloth covering for a wound or sore [medical dressing]</p><p><i>n.</i> processes in the conversion of rough hides into leather</p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of getting dressed [grooming]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of applying a bandage [bandaging, binding]</p><p><b>mali komad prtljage za nošenje četkica i boca i toaletnih predmeta tijekom putovanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small piece of luggage for carrying brushes and bottles and toilet articles while traveling</p><p><b>Oštro prezivanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a severe scolding [bawling out, castigation, chewing out, earful, going-over, upbraiding]</p><p><b>kućna haljina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a robe worn before dressing or while lounging [lounging robe, robe-de-chambre]</p><p><b>svlačionica, garderoba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a room in which you can change clothes</p><p><b>Ženska luza jakna (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman's loose jacket [dressing sacque]</p><p><b>Ženska luza jakna (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman's loose jacket [dressing sack]</p><p><b>(vojni) postaja smještena u blizini borbene zone za pružanje prve pomoći ranjenima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (military) a station located near a combat area for giving first aid to the wounded [aid station]</p><p><b>nizak stol s ogledalom ili ogledalom gdje se sjedi dok se oblači ili koristi šminku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low table with mirror or mirrors where one sits while dressing or applying makeup [dresser, toilet table, vanity]</p><p><b>krojač, krojačica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who makes or mends dresses [modiste, needlewoman, seamstress, sempstress]</p><p><b>Neko tko modelira haljine. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who models dresses</p><p><b>zanat izrade haljina. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the craft of making dresses</p><p><b>elegantan, svečan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> in fancy clothing</p><p><b>crtati, nacrtan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States actor (born in Ireland) [John Drew]</p><p><b>gnijezdo vjeverice. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the nest of a squirrel</p><p><b>Francuski vojni časnik židovskog podrijetla čije je krivično zatvaranje zbog izdaje 1894. godine pokrenulo pitanja antisemitizma koji su dominirali francuskom politikom sve do njegovog puštanja 1906. godine (1859-1935) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French army officer of Jewish descent whose false imprisonment for treason in 1894 raised issues of anti-Semitism that dominated French politics until his release in 1906 (1859-1935) [Alfred Dreyfus]</p><p><b>Smanjena neograničena količina (posebno tekućine) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small indefinite quantity (especially of a liquid) [driblet, drop]</p><p><b>driblati, driblati u nogometu, kapanje, sliniti, tjerati loptu ispred sebe, vođenje, dribling, curiti, iscuriti, iskapati, kapati, rominjati, nakapati, pokapati, ukapati, balaviti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> flowing in drops [drip, trickle]</p><p><i>n.</i> saliva spilling from the mouth [drivel, drool, slobber]</p><p><i>n.</i> the propulsion of a ball by repeated taps or kicks [dribbling]</p><p><i>v.</i> run or flow slowly, as in drops or in an unsteady stream [filter, trickle]</p><p><i>v.</i> let or cause to fall in drops [drip, drop]</p><p><i>v.</i> propel [carry]</p><p><i>v.</i> let saliva drivel from th