izveli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European biennial formerly grown for the blue coloring matter yielded by its leaves [Isatis tinctoria]</p><p><b>Europska višegodišnja biljka s crvenim ili ružičastavio-bijelim cvijećem i crvenim korijenima koja se ponekad koristi kao zamjena za madder u bojenju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> creeping European perennial having red or pinkish-white flowers and red roots sometimes used as a substitute for madder in dyeing [Asperula tinctoria]</p><p><b>mala grmlja u Euroaziji koja ima grmlje žutih cvijeća koji daju boju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small Eurasian shrub having clusters of yellow flowers that yield a dye [Genista tinctoria, dyer's greenweed, dyeweed, greenweed, whin, woadwaxen, woodwaxen]</p><p><b>Dvostruko travlje s dlakavim podeljenim lištima i žutim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Eurasian perennial herb with hairy divided leaves and yellow flowers [Anthemis tinctoria, golden marguerite, yellow chamomile]</p><p><b>bojilo, boja, farba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a usually soluble substance for staining or coloring e.g. fabrics or hair [dye]</p><p><b>mala grmlja u Euroaziji koja ima grmlje žutih cvijeća koji daju boju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small Eurasian shrub having clusters of yellow flowers that yield a dye [Genista tinctoria, dyer's-broom, dyer's greenweed, greenweed, whin, woadwaxen, woodwaxen]</p><p><b>Drvo od kojeg se dobiva boja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any wood from which dye is obtained</p><p><b>samrtni, umiranje, umirući, smrt</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time when something ends [death, demise]</p><p><i>adj.</i> in or associated with the process of passing from life or ceasing to be</p><p><i>adj.</i> eagerly desirous [anxious]</p><p><b>jezik australijskih Aboridžina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a language of Australian aborigines [Jirrbal]</p><p><b>grudobran, nasip, rov, brana</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (slang) offensive term for a lesbian who is noticeably masculine [butch, dike]</p><p><i>n.</i> a barrier constructed to contain the flow of water or to keep out the sea [dam, dike]</p><p><i>v.</i> enclose with a dike [dike]</p><p><b>Američki tekstopisac poznat po svojim protestnim pjesmama (rođen 1941), Keltski bog valova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States songwriter noted for his protest songs (born in 1941) [Bob Dylan]</p><p><i>n.</i> Celtic god of the waves</p><p><b>Velški pjesnik (1914-1953) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Welsh poet (1914-1953) [Dylan Thomas, Thomas]</p><p><b>Velški pjesnik (1914-1953) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Welsh poet (1914-1953) [Dylan Marlais Thomas, Thomas]</p><p><b>dinamičan, dinamički, dinamičkih, dinamika, energičan, pokretljiv, promjenljiv, dinamička, dinamičko, dinamične</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an efficient incentive [moral force]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by action or forcefulness or force of personality [dynamical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to dynamics</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of verbs (e.g. `to run') and participial adjectives (e.g. `running' in `running water')) expressing action rather than a state of being [active]</p><p><b>(aeronautika) stanje ravnoteže u kojem centrifužne sile zbog rotirajuće mase (npr. propeler) ne stvaraju silu u osovini i tako se smanjuje vibracija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (aeronautics) the state of equilibrium in which centrifugal forces due to a rotating mass (e.g., a propeller) do not produce force in the shaft and so vibration is reduced</p><p><b>struja električnog naboja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a flow of electric charge [current electricity]</p><p><b>Sposobnost sustava za reprodukciju glasnih zvukova bez distorzije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capacity of a system to reproduce loud sounds without distortion [headroom]</p><p><b>mjerenje otpora protoka tekućine pod primjenom sile (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measure of the resistance to flow of a fluid under an applied force [absolute viscosity, coefficient of viscosity]</p><p><b>dinamički, dinamičan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by action or forcefulness or force of personali