normal development (of organs or cells) or an abnormal structure resulting from such growth</p><p><b>koji se odnose na ili dokazuju displaziju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or evidencing dysplasia</p><p><b>zaduha</b></p><p><i>n.</i> difficult or labored respiration [dyspnoea]</p><p><b>ne može disati osim s poteškoćama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not breathing or able to breathe except with difficulty [breathless, dyspneic, dyspnoeal, dyspnoeic]</p><p><b>ne može disati osim s poteškoćama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not breathing or able to breathe except with difficulty [breathless, dyspneal, dyspnoeal, dyspnoeic]</p><p><b>zaduha</b></p><p><i>n.</i> difficult or labored respiration [dyspnea]</p><p><b>ne može disati osim s poteškoćama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not breathing or able to breathe except with difficulty [breathless, dyspneal, dyspneic, dyspnoeic]</p><p><b>ne može disati osim s poteškoćama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not breathing or able to breathe except with difficulty [breathless, dyspneal, dyspneic, dyspnoeal]</p><p><b>disprozij, disprozijum</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a trivalent metallic element of the rare earth group [Dy, atomic number 66]</p><p><b>nesposobnost koordinacije dobrovoljnih mišićnih pokreta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inability to coordinate voluntary muscle movements [ataxia, ataxy, motor ataxia]</p><p><b>blage kronične depresije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mild chronic depression [dysthymic depression]</p><p><b>blage kronične depresije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mild chronic depression [dysthymia]</p><p><b>Država u kojoj su uvjeti života izuzetno loši zbog nedostatka ili ugnjetavanja ili terora, rad izmišljenog djela koji opisuje zamišljeno mjesto gdje je život iznimno loš zbog nedostatka, ugnjetavanja ili terora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> state in which the conditions of life are extremely bad as from deprivation or oppression or terror</p><p><i>n.</i> a work of fiction describing an imaginary place where life is extremely bad because of depri