n of the ionosphere (from 50 to 90 miles up) that reflects radio waves of medium length [E layer, Heaviside layer, Kennelly-Heaviside layer]</p><p><b>čak i (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> even</p><p><b>U svakom trenutku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> at all times [always, ever]</p><p><b>bomba koja eksplodira u zraku i oslobađa masivan izboj elektromagnetne energije dovoljan da onesposobiti računare i telekomunikacije bez ubijanja ljudi ili oštećenja zgrada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bomb that explodes in midair and releases a massive burst of electromagnetic energy sufficient to disable computers and telecommunications without killing people or damaging buildings [microwave bomb]</p><p><b>elektronska trgovina, elektronsko poslovanje, e-trgovina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> commerce conducted electronically (as on the internet)</p><p><b>Refrakcijski zahvat koji preoblikuje rožnjaču (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a refractive surgery procedure that reshapes the cornea [LASEK, laser-assisted subepithelial keratomileusis]</p><p><b>elektronska pošta, e-mail, e-pošta, e pošta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a system of world-wide electronic communication in which a computer user can compose a message at one terminal that can be regenerated at the recipient's terminal when the recipient logs in [electronic mail, email]</p><p><i>v.</i> communicate electronically on the computer [email, netmail]</p><p><b>u slučaju da je proizvod iz članka 1. stavka 1. točke (a) ili (b) ovog članka upotrebljen u proizvodima iz članka 1. stavka 2. točke (a) ili (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (b) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antibiotic (trade name Erythrocin or E-Mycin or Ethril or Ilosone or Pediamycin) obtained from the actinomycete Streptomyces erythreus [Erythrocin, Ethril, Ilosone, Pediamycin, erythromycin]</p><p><b>Finski liječnik koji je prvi opisao vaskularnu hemofiliju (1870-1949) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Finnish physician who first described vascular hemophilia (1870-1949) [Erik Adolf von Willebrand, Erik von Willebrand, Willebrand, von Willebrand]</p><p><b>Američki pisac poznat po svojim humorističkim esejima (1899-1985) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer noted for his humorous essays (1899-1985) [Elwyn Brooks White, White]</p><p><b>vrsta bakterije koja se obično nalazi u crijevnom traktu ljudi i drugih životinja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a species of bacterium normally present in intestinal tract of humans and other animals [Escherichia coli]</p><p><b>Američki pisac poznat po svojoj tipografski ekscentričnoj poeziji (1894-1962) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer noted for his typographically eccentric poetry (1894-1962) [Edward Estlin Cummings, cummings]</p><p><b>Američki glumac (1914-1998) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States actor (1914-1998) [Marshall]</p><p><b>Američki željeznički tajkun (1848-1909) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States railway tycoon (1848-1909) [Edward Henry Harriman, Harriman]</p><p><b>Njemački fiziolog koji je proučavao senzorijske reakcije na podražaje i smatra se ocem psihofizike (1795-1878) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German physiologist who studied sensory responses to stimuli and is considered the father of psychophysics (1795-1878) [Ernst Heinrich Weber, Weber]</p><p><b>Američki piscica (rođena 1931.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States novelist (born in 1931) [Doctorow, Edgard Lawrence Doctorow]</p><p><b>Američki fizičar koji je razvio ciklotron (1901-1958) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States physicist who developed the cyclotron (1901-1958) [Ernest Orlando Lawrence, Lawrence]</p><p><b>E. O. Wilson</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States entomologist who has generalized from social insects to other animals including humans (born in 1929) [Edward Osborne Wilson, Wilson]</p><p><b>Njemački pisac fantastičnih priča (1776-1822) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German writer of fantastic tales (1776-1822) [Ernst Theodor Amadeus Hoffmann, Ernst Theodor Wilhelm Hoffmann, Hoffmann]</p><p><b>Irski fizičar koji je (s Sir John Cockcroftom 1931) prvi razdvojio atom (1903-1995) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Irish physicist who (with Sir John Cockcroft in 1931) first split an atom (1903-1995) [Ernest Thomas Sinton Walton, Ernest Walton, Walton]</p><p><b>Američki kemičar i fizičar koji je surađivao s Michelsonom u Michelson-Morleyjevom eksperimentu (1838-1923) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States chemist and physicist who collaborated with Michelson in the Michelson-Morley experiment (1838-1923) [Edward Morley, Edward Williams Morley, Morley]</p><p><b>npr., na primjer, primjerice</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> as an example [for example, for instance]</p><p><b>Neovisna savezna agencija osnovana za koordinaciju programa usmjerenih na smanjenje onečišćenja i zaštitu okoliša. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an independent federal agency established to coordinate programs aimed at reducing pollution and protecting the environment [EPA, Environmental Protection Agency]</p><p><b>esp, vidovitost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> apparent power to perceive things that are not present to the senses [ESP, clairvoyance, extrasensory perception, second sight]</p><p><b>Europska suradnja na ovlašćivanju</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the Babylonian god of wisdom</p><p><b>pojedini, svaki, svaki pojedini, uzajamno, o, pojedinog, svaka, svake, svakog, svakom, svaku</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of count nouns) every one considered individually</p><p><i>adv.</i> to or from every one of two or more (considered individually) [apiece, for each one, from each one, to each one]</p><p><b>bez propusta tjedan dana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without missing a week [every week, hebdomadally, weekly]</p><p><b>godišnje</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without missing a year [annually, every year, yearly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> by the year [annually, p.a., per annum, per year]</p><p><b>carski moljci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> imperial moths [gen