ove bolesti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a physician who specializes in the ear and its diseases [ear specialist, otologist]</p><p><b>bazgova uška, judino uho</b></p><p><i>n.</i> widely distributed edible fungus shaped like a human ear and growing on decaying wood [Auricularia auricula, Jew's-ear, Jew's-ears]</p><p><b>otvor (kao u kacigi) kako bi zvuk dostigao uši. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hole (as in a helmet) for sound to reach the ears</p><p><b>masno višenkasto tijelo ljudskog uha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the fleshy pendulous part of the external human ear [earlobe]</p><p><b>liječnik koji se specijalizirao za uho i njegove bolesti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a physician who specializes in the ear and its diseases [ear doctor, otologist]</p><p><b>Konusni akustični uređaj koji se nekada koristio za usmjeravanje zvuka u uho osobe s oštećenim sluhom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a conical acoustic device formerly used to direct sound to the ear of a hearing-impaired person [hearing aid]</p><p><b>s oblikom uha (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a shape resembling an ear [auriform, ear-shaped]</p><p><b>specijalista za bolesti uha, nosa ili grla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a specialist in the disorders of the ear or nose or throat [ENT man, otolaryngologist, otorhinolaryngologist, rhinolaryngologist]</p><p><b>s oblikom uha (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a shape resembling an ear [auriform, ear-like]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih velikih jestivih morskih ždernica rod Haliotis s školjkom u obliku uha s bisernom unutrašnjom stranom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various large edible marine gastropods of the genus Haliotis having an ear-shaped shell with pearly interior [abalone]</p><p><b>bol u srednjem ili unutarnjem uhu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ache localized in the middle or inner ear [otalgia]</p><p><b>naušnica s privjeskom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an earring with a pendant ornament [drop earring, pendant earring]</p><p><b>bubnjić (u uhu), bubnjić</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the me