ingmaker, Richard Neville, Warwick]</p><p><b>Engleski filozof i matematičar koji je surađivao s Whiteheadom (1872-1970) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English philosopher and mathematician who collaborated with Whitehead (1872-1970) [Bertrand Arthur William Russell, Bertrand Russell, Russell]</p><p><b>Pravnik SAD-a koji je bio glavni sudac Vrhovnog suda SAD-a (1891-1974) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States jurist who served as chief justice of the United States Supreme Court (1891-1974) [Warren]</p><p><b>priušak, ušna resica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of two flaps attached to a cap to keep the ears warm [earflap]</p><p><b>dostojanstvo ili čin ili položaj grofa ili grofice, Domena koju kontroliše grof ili grofica ili grofica. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the dignity or rank or position of an earl or countess</p><p><i>n.</i> the domain controlled by an earl or count or countess</p><p><b>malo uspravno listno stablo s velikim lištima u višenim formacijama na vrhovima grana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small erect deciduous tree with large leaves in coiled formations at branch tips [Magnolia fraseri]</p><p><b>bez drške, bezuh</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking external ears</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko tankih guštera bez vanjskih otvora uha: ravnica zapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several slender lizards without external ear openings: of plains of western United States and Mexico</p><p><b>Svaka od nekoliko tjuna bez vanjskih ušnih krila i s čvrstom dlačinom nalik dlači s stražnjim udovima smanjenim na plivačke peraje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several seals lacking external ear flaps and having a stiff hairlike coat with hind limbs reduced to swimming flippers [hair seal, true seal]</p><p><b>ranije, raniji, skorije, rano</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (comparative and superlative of `early') more early than [earliest]</p><p><i>adv.</i> earlier in time [before]</p><p><i>adv.</i> comparatives of `soon' or `early' [sooner]</p><p><i>adv.</i> before now [in 