aving edible tubers with the flavor of roasted chestnuts [Conopodium denudatum]</p><p><i>n.</i> pod of the peanut vine containing usually 2 nuts or seeds [goober, goober pea, groundnut, monkey nut, peanut]</p><p><i>n.</i> edible subterranean fungus of the genus Tuber [truffle]</p><p><b>Europska biljka s malim gomoljicama koja se koristi za hranu i u Škotskoj za aromatizaciju viskija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European herb bearing small tubers used for food and in Scotland to flavor whiskey [Lathyrus tuberosus, earth-nut pea, heath pea, tuberous vetch]</p><p><b>potres, zemljotres</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shaking and vibration at the surface of the earth resulting from underground movement along a fault plane or from volcanic activity [quake, seism, temblor]</p><p><i>n.</i> a disturbance that is extremely disruptive</p><p><b>Dovoljno glasno da potrese zemlju., dovoljno značajna da utječe na cijeli svijet. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> loud enough to shake the very earth</p><p><i>adj.</i> sufficiently significant to affect the whole world [world-shaking, world-shattering]</p><p><b>bilo koje gljivice iz obitelji Geastraceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any fungus of the family Geastraceae</p><p><b>jezičnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any club-shaped fungus of the genus Geoglossum [earth-tongue]</p><p><b>Zemljani zid (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an earthen rampart</p><p><b>kišna glista, glista, gujavica, muktaš, podlac, prostak, puzavac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> terrestrial worm that burrows into and helps aerate soil [angleworm, crawler, dew worm, fishing worm, fishworm, nightcrawler, nightwalker, red worm, wiggler]</p><p><b>očito i bez ukusnog nepristojno, Ne udaljena od prirode ili sugeriraju prirodu, srdačan i požudac., od ili sastavljen od ili sličan zemljištu, razumno i praktično. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> conspicuously and tastelessly indecent [crude, gross, vulgar]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not far removed from or suggestive of nature</p><p><i>adj.</i> hearty and lusty</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or consisting of or resembling earth</p><p><i>adj.</i> sensible and practical [down-to-earth]</p><p><b>cerumen</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a soft yellow wax secreted by glands in the ear canal [cerumen]</p><p><b>uholaža, uholaža (buba)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous insects of the order Dermaptera having elongate bodies and slender many-jointed antennae and a pair of large pincers at the rear of the abdomen</p><p><b>Federalni sustav upozorenja koji je aktiviran od strane FEMA-e. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a federal warning system that is activated by FEMA [Emergency Alert System]</p><p><b>lakoća, lakše, mir, nelagodno, nesmetano, neusiljenost, olakšan, olakšanje, olakšati, olakšica, popustiti, smanjiti, spokojstvo, ublažiti, udobnost, jednostavnost, lagodnost, blagostanje, odmor, opuštanje, počinak, predah, relaksacija, olakšavati, omogućavati, omogućiti, pojednostaviti, pojednostavljivati, simplificirati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> freedom from difficulty or hardship or effort [easiness, simpleness, simplicity]</p><p><i>n.</i> a freedom from financial difficulty that promotes a comfortable state [comfort]</p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being comfortable or relieved (especially after being relieved of distress) [relief]</p><p><i>n.</i> freedom from constraint or embarrassment [informality]</p><p><i>n.</i> freedom from activity (work or strain or responsibility) [relaxation, repose, rest]</p><p><i>v.</i> move gently or carefully</p><p><i>v.</i> lessen pain or discomfort [comfort]</p><p><i>v.</i> make easier [alleviate, facilitate]</p><p><i>v.</i> lessen the intensity of or calm [allay, relieve, still]</p><p><b>postaje manje intenzivan, smanjenje pritiska ili intenziteta (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become less intense [ease up, flag, slacken off]</p><p><i>v.</i> reduce pressure or intensity [ease up, let up]</p><p><b>popustiti, maknuti se, micati se, pomaknuti se, pomicati se, prepustiti, prepuštati, propustiti, propuštati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> move in order to make room for someone for something [give, give way, move over, yield]</p><p><i>v.</i> become less intense [ease off, flag, slacken off]</p><p><i>v.</i> reduce pressure or intensity [ease off, let up]</p><p><b>(od boli ili tuge) je podnijela. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of pain or sorrow) made easier to bear [alleviated, relieved]</p><p><b>slikar nogare, štafelaj, štafelajni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an upright tripod for displaying something (usually an artist's canvas)</p><p><b>olakšica, služnost, olakšanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) the privilege of using something that is not your own (as using another's land as a right of way to your own land)</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of reducing something unpleasant (as pain or annoyance) [alleviation, easing, relief]</p><p><b>bez muke, bez sumnje, lagano, lako, olako, vjerojatno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with ease (`easy' is sometimes used informally for `easily') [easy]</p><p><i>adv.</i> without question</p><p><i>adv.</i> indicating high probability [well]</p><p><b>bezbrižnost, lakoća, lakoumnost, mirnoća, neusiljenost, udobnost, opuštanje, jednostavnost, lagodnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of refreshing tranquility and an absence of tension or worry [relaxation]</p><p><i>n.</i> freedom from difficulty or hardship or effort [ease, simpleness, simplicity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being easy in behavior or style</p><p><b>olakšanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a change for the better [moderation, relief]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of reducing something unpleasant (as pain or annoyance) [alleviation, easement, relief]</p><p><b>istočni, istočno, istok, istočnoj, istočnom, E, Orijent, istočan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal compass point that is at 90 degrees [E, due east, eastward]</p><p><i>n.</i> the countries of Asia [Orient]</p><p><i>n.</i> the region of the United States lying to the north of the Ohio River and to the east of the Mississippi River [eastern United States]</p><p><i>n.</i> the direction corresponding to the eastward cardinal compass point</p><p><i>n.</i> 