erranean vine having oblong fruit that when ripe expels its seeds and juice violently when touched [exploding cucumber, squirting cucumber, touch-me-not]</p><p><b>(telekomunikacije) sustav kodiranja koji uključuje dodatne bitove pariteta kako bi se otkrile pogreške (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (telecommunication) a coding system that incorporates extra parity bits in order to detect errors [error correction code]</p><p><b>ecce homo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a representation (a picture or sculpture) of Jesus wearing a crown of thorns</p><p><b>čudak, čudan, ekscentar, ekscentričan, ekscentrik, nastran, neobičan, osobenjak, bizaran, nekonvencionalan, otkačen, šašav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person with an unusual or odd personality [eccentric person, flake, geek, oddball]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person of a specified kind (usually with many eccentricities) [case, character, type]</p><p><i>adj.</i> conspicuously or grossly unconventional or unusual [bizarre, flakey, flaky, freakish, freaky, gonzo, off-the-wall, outlandish, outre]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not having a common center [nonconcentric]</p><p><b>ekscentrik, osobenjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person with an unusual or odd personality [eccentric, flake, geek, oddball]</p><p><b>na ekscentričan ili bizaran način., Ne simetrično u odnosu na centar. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an eccentric or bizarre manner</p><p><i>adv.</i> not symmetrically with respect to the center</p><p><b>ekcentričnost, ekscentričnost, nastranost, neobičnost, neuravnoteženost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> strange and unconventional behavior</p><p><i>n.</i> (geometry) a ratio describing the shape of a conic section</p><p><i>n.</i> a circularity that has a different center or deviates from a circular path</p><p><b>crno-plavo ili ljubičasto područje koje je rezultat modrice., izlivanje krvi iz puklih krvnih žila u okolno tkivo kako bi se na koži formirala ljubičasta ili crno-plava mrlja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the purple or black-and-blue area resulting from a bruise</p><p><i>n.</i>