ovu koji je jeftiniji od smještaja prve klase (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a class of accommodations on a ship or train or plane that are less expensive than first class accommodations [cabin class, second class]</p><p><b>ekonomija razmjera</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the saving in cost of production that is due to mass production</p><p><b>ECOSOC</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a permanent council of the United Nations [Economic and Social Council]</p><p><b>Komisija Gospodarskog i socijalnog vijeća Ujedinjenih naroda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commission of the Economic and Social Council of the United Nations [Economic and Social Council commission]</p><p><b>ekosustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system formed by the interaction of a community of organisms with their physical environment</p><p><b>nasilje koje se provodi radi ostvarivanja političkih ili društvenih ciljeva zaštitnika okoliša (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> violence carried out to further the political or social objectives of the environmentalists [eco-warfare, ecological terrorism, ecological warfare]</p><p><b>turistički turizam u egzotične ili ugrožene ekosustave radi promatranja divljih životinja ili pomoći u očuvanju prirode (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tourism to exotic or threatened ecosystems to observe wildlife or to help preserve nature</p><p><b>izgovorni retorik. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exclamatory rhetorical device [exclamation]</p><p><b>riječni rak, slatkovodni rak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tiny lobster-like crustaceans usually boiled briefly [crawdad, crawfish, crayfish]</p><p><i>n.</i> small crayfish of Europe and Asia and western North America [Old World crayfish]</p><p><b>boje nebijeljena platna, boje nebjeljena platna, svijetlosmeđ, svjetlosmeđ</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a very light brown [beige]</p><p><b>ekstaza, mahnitanje, ushit, zanos, zanesenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of being carried away by overwhelming emotion [exaltation, rapture, raptus, transport]</p><p><i>n.</i> a state of elated bliss [rapture]</p><p><i>n.</i> stree