skog pokreta koji potiče suradnju i bolje razumijevanje među različitim vjerskim denominacijama: usmjeren na univerzalno kršćansko jedinstvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Christianity) the doctrine of the ecumenical movement that promotes cooperation and better understanding among different religious denominations: aimed at universal Christian unity [ecumenicism, ecumenism]</p><p><b>(kršćanstvo) doktrina ekumenskog pokreta koji potiče suradnju i bolje razumijevanje među različitim vjerskim denominacijama: usmjeren na univerzalno kršćansko jedinstvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Christianity) the doctrine of the ecumenical movement that promotes cooperation and better understanding among different religious denominations: aimed at universal Christian unity [ecumenicalism, ecumenism]</p><p><b>ekumenizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a movement promoting union between religions (especially between Christian churches) [oecumenism]</p><p><i>n.</i> (Christianity) the doctrine of the ecumenical movement that promotes cooperation and better understanding among different religious denominations: aimed at universal Christian unity [ecumenicalism, ecumenicism]</p><p><b>ekcem, lišaj, perutac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> generic term for inflammatory conditions of the skin</p><p><b>Ekcem karakteriziran grozničnim stanjem i široko rasprostranjenim izbijanjem mjehurića (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eczema characterized by a feverish condition and widespread eruption of vesicles</p><p><b>Ekcem karakteriziran gustenjem kože s naglasenim linijama kože (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eczema characterized by thickening of the skin with accentuated skin lines [chronic eczema, lichtenoid eczema]</p><p><b>gljivična infekcija prepona (najčešće kod muškaraca) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fungal infection of the groin (most common in men) [jock itch, tinea cruris]</p><p><b>sada rijetka komplikacija vakcinacije koja se nadovezuje na atopijski dermatitis s visokom groznicom i generaliziranim mjehurićima i papulovesicama (MT)</b></p><p>