ta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of information equal to 1024 pebibits or 2^60 bits [exbibit]</p><p><b>vodeni hyacinth (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> water hyacinth [genus Eichhornia]</p><p><b>tropska plutajuća vodena biljka s šiljcima velikih plavih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tropical floating aquatic plant having spikes of large blue flowers [Eichhornia spesiosa, water hyacinth, water orchid]</p><p><b>tropska plutajuća vodena biljka s šiljcima velikih plavih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tropical floating aquatic plant having spikes of large blue flowers [Eichhornia crassipes, water hyacinth, water orchid]</p><p><b>Austrijac koji je postao nacistički dužnosnik koji je upravljao koncentracijskim logorima gdje su u Drugom svjetskom ratu ubijeni milijuni Židova (1906-1962) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian who became the Nazi official who administered the concentration camps where millions of Jews were murdered during World War II (1906-1962) [Adolf Eichmann, Karl Adolf Eichmann]</p><p><b>omega-3 masna kiselina s 20 ugljikovih atoma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an omega-3 fatty acid with 20 carbon atoms</p><p><b>ajderska plovka, gavka, polarna patka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> duck of the northern hemisphere much valued for the fine soft down of the females [eider duck]</p><p><b>Patka sjeverne hemisfere je vrlo cijenjena zbog fine mekane pečene ženice. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> duck of the northern hemisphere much valued for the fine soft down of the females [eider]</p><p><b>paperje, poplun s perjem</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a soft quilt usually filled with the down of the eider [continental quilt, duvet]</p><p><i>n.</i> down of the eider duck</p><p><b>s visokom vizualnom točkinjom gotovo fotografske točnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of visual imagery of almost photographic accuracy</p><p><b>(antropologija) prepoznatljiv izraz kognitivnog ili intelektualnog karaktera kulture ili društvene skupine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (anthropology) the distinctive expression of the cognitive or intellectual character of a culture or a social group</p><p><b>Francuski inženjer koji je izgradio Eiffelov toranj (1832-1923) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French engineer who constructed the Eiffel Tower (1832-1923) [Alexandre Gustave Eiffel]</p><p><b>300 metara visoka kula od kovače koja je izgrađena u Parizu 1889. godine. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wrought iron tower 300 meters high that was constructed in Paris in 1889</p><p><b>Njemački kemičar koji je radio istraživanje o brzim kemijskim reakcijama (rođen 1927.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German chemist who did research on high-speed chemical reactions (born in 1927) [Manfred Eigen]</p><p><b>svojstvena vrijednost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) any number such that a given square matrix minus that number times the identity matrix has a zero determinant [characteristic root of a square matrix, eigenvalue of a matrix, eigenvalue of a square matrix]</p><p><b>(matematika) bilo koji broj tako da datom kvadratnom matrici minus taj broj puta matrica identiteta ima nultu determinant (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) any number such that a given square matrix minus that number times the identity matrix has a zero determinant [characteristic root of a square matrix, eigenvalue, eigenvalue of a square matrix]</p><p><b>(matematika) bilo koji broj tako da datom kvadratnom matrici minus taj broj puta matrica identiteta ima nultu determinant (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) any number such that a given square matrix minus that number times the identity matrix has a zero determinant [characteristic root of a square matrix, eigenvalue, eigenvalue of a matrix]</p><p><b>osam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of seven and one [8, VIII, eighter, eighter from Decatur, octad, octet, octonary, ogdoad]</p><p><i>n.</i> a group of United States painters founded in 1907 and noted for their realistic depictions of sordid aspects of city life [Ashcan School]</p><p><i>n.</i> one of four playing cards in a deck with eight pips on the face [eight-spot]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than seven [8, viii]</p><p><b>crna kugla s brojem 8 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a black pool ball bearing the number 8</p><p><b>trajanje osam dana (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lasting for eight days</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having eight units or components [eightfold, octuple]</p><p><b>od kemijske spojine koja ima prsten sa osam članova (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of a chemical compound having a ring with eight members [8-membered]</p><p><b>s 8 strana (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having eight sides</p><p><b>jedna od četiri igračke karte u palubi s osam pipes na licu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of four playing cards in a deck with eight pips on the face [eight]</p><p><b>osamnaest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of seventeen and one [18, XVIII]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than seventeen [18, xviii]</p><p><b>osamnaesti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> position 18 in a countable series of things</p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the seventeenth in position [18th]</p><p><b>amandman na Ustav Sjedinjenih Država usvojen 1920. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amendment to the Constitution of the United States adopted in 1920</p><p><b>osam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of seven and one [8, VIII, eight, eighter from Decatur, octad, octet, octonary, ogdoad]</p><p><b>osam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of seven and one [8, VIII, eight, eighter, octad, octet, octonary, ogdoad]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having eight units or components [eight-fold, octuple]</p><p><b>oktava, osmi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> position eight in a countable series of things</p><p><i>n.</i> one part in eight equal parts [one-eighth]</p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the seventh and just before the ninth in position [8th]</p><p><b>sastavni osjetilni živc koji opskrbljuje ćelije dlake vestibularnog organa i ćelije dlake hrčke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a composite sensory nerve supplying the hair cells of the vestibular organ and the hair cells of the cochlea [acoustic nerve, auditory nerve, nervus vestibulocochlearis, vestibulocochlear nerve]</p><p><b>glazbena nota s vremenskom vrijednošću osme cijele note (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a musical note having the time value of an eighth of a whole note [quaver]</p><p><b>osamdeset (od &quot;eighty&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the decade from 1880 to 1889 [1880s]</p><p><i>n.</i> the decade from 1980 to 1989 [1980s]</p><p><i>n.</i> the time of life between 80 and 90 [mid-eighties]</p><p><b>osamdeseti, osamdesetina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> position 80 in a countable series of things</p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of eighty in counting order [80th]</p><p><b>vrijednost od osam penija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a coin worth eight pennies</p><p><b>upotrebljava se za veličinu noktiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> used of nail size</p><p><b>Nož od 2,5 inča. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nail 2.5 inches long</p><p><b>osam osoba koje se smatraju jedinicom, Škotski tulub za osam plesača. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eight people considered as a unit [octet, octette]</p><p><i>n.</i> a Scottish reel for eight dancers</p><p><b>Veličine knjige čije se stranice formiraju sklopivši list papira tri puta i formirajući osam listova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the size of a book whose pages are made by folding a sheet of paper three times to form eight leaves [8vo, octavo]</p><p><b>osamdeset</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the product of ten and eight [80, LXXX, fourscore]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being ten more than seventy [80, fourscore, lxxx]</p><p><b>biti osam više od osamdeset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being eight more than eighty [88, lxxxviii]</p><p><b>redovni broj osamdeset pet u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of eighty-five in counting order [85th]</p><p><b>biti pet više od osamdeset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being five more than eighty [85, lxxxv]</p><p><b>biti četiri više od osamdeset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being four more than eighty [84, lxxxiv]</p><p><b>Da je devet više od osamdeset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being nine more than eighty [89, ixc]</p><p><b>biti jedan više od osamdeset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than eighty [81, lxxxi]</p><p><b>Da je sedam više od osamdeset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being seven more than eighty [87, lxxxvii]</p><p><b>biti šest više od osamdeset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being six more than eighty [86, lxxxvi]</p><p><b>biti tri više od osamdeset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being three more than eighty [83, lxxxiii]</p><p><b>biti dva više od osamdeset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being two more than eighty [82, lxxxii]</p><p><b>Nizozemski liječnik koji je otkrio da je beriberi uzrokovan nedostatkom hranjivih sastojaka (1858-1930) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Dutch physician who discovered that beriberi is caused by a nutritional deficiency (1858-1930) [Christiaan Eijkman]</p><p><b>Američka operna sopranistkinja poznata po jasnoći i snazi glasa (1920-2002) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States operatic soprano noted for the clarity and power of her voice (1920-2002) [Farrell]</p><p><b>parazit na probavnom epitelju kralježnjaka i viših beskičmenjaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> parasitic on the digestive epithelium of vertebrates and higher invertebrates [coccidium]</p><p><b>obitelj protoctista u redu Coccidia (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of protoctist in the order Coccidia [family Eimeriidae]</p><p><b>Eindhoven</b></p><p><i>n.</i> city in southeastern Netherlands noted for electrical industry</p><p><b>genije, mozak, um</b></p><p><i>n.</i> physicist born in Germany who formulated the special theory of relativity and the general theory of relativity [Albert Einstein]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who has exceptional intellectual ability and originality [brain, brainiac, genius, mastermind]</p><p><b>generalizacija posebne relativnosti da uključi gravitaciju (na temelju principa ekvivalentnosti) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a generalization of special relativity to include gravity (based on the principle of equivalence) [general relativity, general relativity theory, general theory of relativity]</p><p><b>fizička teorija relativnosti zasnovana na pretpostavci da je brzina svjetlosti u vakuumu konstanta i pretpostavka da su zakoni fizike invariantni u svim inercijskim sustavima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a physical theory of relativity based on the assumption that the speed of light in a vacuum is a constant and the assumption that the laws of physics are invariant in all inertial systems [special relativity, special relativity theory, special theory of relativity]</p><p><b>(fizici) teorija da su prostor i vrijeme relativni koncepti, a ne apsolutni koncepti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the theory that space and time are relative concepts rather than absolute concepts [relativity, relativity theory, theory of relativity]</p><p><b>o ili u vezi s Albertom Einsteinom ili njegovim teorijama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Albert Einstein or his theories</p><p><b>einsteinij, ajnštajnijum, Es, atomski broj 99</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a radioactive transuranic element produced by bombarding plutonium with neutrons [E, Es, atomic number 99]</p><p><b>Nizozemski fiziolog koji je izmislio prvi elektrokardiograf (1860-1927) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Dutch physiologist who devised the first electrocardiograph (1860-1927) [Willem Einthoven]</p><p><b>rod Mustelidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Mustelidae [genus Eira]</p><p><b>duge repne drevne mustelidine iz Srednje i Južne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> long-tailed arboreal mustelid of Central America and South America [taira, tayra]</p><p><b>Republika koja se sastoji od 26 od 32 grofstva koje čine otok Irsku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic consisting of 26 of 32 counties comprising the island of Ireland [Ireland, Irish Republic, Republic of Ireland]</p><p><b>osobno tumačenje nekog teksta (posebno Biblije) koristeći svoje ideje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> personal interpretation of a text (especially of the Bible) using your own ideas</p><p><b>General Sjedinjenih Država koji je nadgledao invaziju na Normandiju i poraz nacističke Njemačke. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States general who supervised the invasion of Normandy and the defeat of Nazi Germany [Dwight D. Eisenhower, Dwight David Eisenhower, Dwight Eisenhower, Ike, President Eisenhower]</p><p><b>Američki fotograf (rođen u Njemačkoj) čije su fotografije bez poziranja stvorile fotoperiodizam (rođen 1898) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States photographer (born in Germany) whose unposed documentary photographs created photojournalism (born in 1898) [Alfred Eisenstaedt]</p><p><b>Ruski filmski redatelj koji je pionir u korištenju montaže i smatra se jednim od najuticajnijih filmskih redatelja u povijesti filmskih filmova (1898-1948) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian film maker who pioneered the use of montage and is considered among the most influential film makers in the history of motion pictures (1898-1948) [Sergei Eisenstein, Sergei Mikhailovich Eisenstein]</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko godišnjih velških festivala koji uključuju umjetnička natjecanja (posebno u pjevanju) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several annual Welsh festivals involving artistic competitions (especially in singing)</p><p><b>(arheologija) hrpa kućnog otpada koja sadrži školjke i životinjske kosti koje označavaju mjesto prapovijesnog naselja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (archeology) a mound of domestic refuse containing shells and animal bones marking the site of a prehistoric settlement [kitchen midden, midden]</p><p><b>bilo koji, ili, jedan ili drugi, jedan od, jedan od dvojice, ma koji, ni, niti, oba, obje, oboje, obojica, svaki</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> after a negative statement used as an intensive meaning something like `likewise' or `also'</p><p><b>ejakulirati, izbacivati, uskliknuti, ejakulat, sjeme, brbljati, bubnuti, izbrbljati, izlanuti, izvaliti, lanuti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the thick white fluid containing spermatozoa that is ejaculated by the male genital tract [come, cum, seed, semen, seminal fluid]</p><p><i>v.</i> utter impulsively [blunder, blunder out, blurt, blurt out]</p><p><i>v.</i> eject semen</p><p><b>ejakulacija, ejakulat, ištrcavanje, izbacivanje, lučenje, usklik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abrupt emphatic exclamation expressing emotion [interjection]</p><p><i>n.</i> the discharge of semen in males</p><p><b>i muškarac koji izbaci spermu., govornik koji izgovara nagli uzvik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a man who ejaculates semen</p><p><i>n.</i> a speaker who utters a sudden exclamation</p><p><b>dio semennog kanala koji se formira od kanala iz semenske mjehurice i deferentnog žila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a part of the seminal duct formed by the duct from the seminal vesicle and the vas deferens</p><p><b>istjerati, izbaciti, goniti, isključiti, isključivati, istjeravati, istjerivati, izagnati, izbacivati, izgnati, odstraniti, odstranjivati, potjerati, prognati, progoniti, protjerati, protjeravati, protjerivati, tjerati, ispustiti, ispuštati, izlučiti, izlučivati, lučiti, ištrcati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put out or expel from a place [boot out, chuck out, exclude, turf out, turn out]</p><p><i>v.</i> eliminate (a substance) [discharge, exhaust, expel, release]</p><p><i>v.</i> leave an aircraft rapidly, using an ejection seat or capsule</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to come out in a squirt [force out, squeeze out, squirt]</p><p><b>izbacivanje, izbačaj, istjerivanje, izgon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of expelling or projecting or ejecting [expulsion, forcing out, projection]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of forcing out someone or something [exclusion, expulsion, riddance]</p><p><b>Sjedalo pilota u zrakoplovu koje se može silom izbaciti u slučaju nužde. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pilot's seat in an airplane that can be forcibly ejected in the case of an emergency [capsule, ejector seat]</p><p><b>izbacivač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who ousts or supplants someone else [ouster]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanism in a firearm that ejects the empty shell case after firing [cartridge ejector]</p><p><b>Sjedalo pilota u zrakoplovu koje se može silom izbaciti u slučaju nužde. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pilot's seat in an airplane that can be forcibly ejected in the case of an emergency [capsule, ejection seat]</p><p><b>osjećaj nemira i nemira u nogama nakon što odete u krevet (ponekad uzrokuje nesanicu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> feeling of uneasiness and restlessness in the legs after going to bed (sometimes causing insomnia) [restless legs, restless legs syndrome]</p><p><b>dopuniti ono za što se smatra da je nedostatno, Živjeti iz dana u dan, kao da je s nekim teškoćama, Napraviti napornim i nesigurnim sredstvima, teško dobiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> supplement what is thought to be deficient [fill out]</p><p><i>v.</i> live from day to day, as with some hardship</p><p><i>v.</i> make by laborious and precarious means [squeeze out]</p><p><i>v.</i> obtain with difficulty [squeeze out]</p><p><b>grafički zapis srčanog ciklusa koji se proizvodi elektrokardiografom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a graphical recording of the cardiac cycle produced by an electrocardiograph [ECG, cardiogram, electrocardiogram]</p><p><b>Švedski oceanograf koji je prepoznao ulogu Coriolisovog učinka na oceanske struje (1874-1954) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Swedish oceanographer who recognized the role of the Coriolis effect on ocean currents (1874-1954) [Vagn Walfrid Ekman]</p><p><b>ALT, EL, altituda, elevacija, visina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> angular distance above the horizon (especially of a celestial object) [ALT, altitude, elevation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a railway that is powered by electricity and that runs on a track that is raised above the street level [elevated, elevated railroad, elevated railway, overhead railway]</p><p><b>Grad u Maroku blizu obale Atlantika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a town in Morocco near the Atlantic coast</p><p><b>selo zapadno od Aleksandrije na sjevernoj obali Egipta, bitka u Drugom svjetskom ratu (1942.) koja je rezultirala odlučnom pobjedom Britanskih trupa pod Montgomeryjem nad njemačkim trupama pod Rommelom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a village to the west of Alexandria on the northern coast of Egypt</p><p><i>n.</i> a pitched battle in World War II (1942) resulting in a decisive Allied victory by British troops under Montgomery over German troops under Rommel [Al Alamayn, Battle of El Alamein]</p><p><b>Doha</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital and chief port of Qatar [Bida, Doha, capital of Qatar]</p><p><b>Španjolski general čije su vojske preuzele kontrolu nad Španjolskom 1939. i koji je vladao kao diktator do svoje smrti (1892-1975) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Spanish general whose armies took control of Spain in 1939 and who ruled as a dictator until his death (1892-1975) [Francisco Franco, Franco, General Franco]</p><p><b>heroj španjolske epske pjesme iz 12. stoljeća. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the hero of a Spanish epic poem from the 12th century</p><p><b>zamišljeno mjesto velikog bogatstva i mogućnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an imaginary place of great wealth and opportunity [eldorado]</p><p><b>drevni egipatski grad na zapadnoj obali Nila nasuprot Kaira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient Egyptian city on the west bank of the Nile opposite Cairo [Giza, Gizeh]</p><p><b>Španjolski slikar (rođen u Grčkoj) poznat po svojim religijskim djelima u kojima je prikazan izduženi oblik čovjeka i dramatična upotreba boja (1541. - 1614.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Spanish painter (born in Greece) remembered for his religious works characterized by elongated human forms and dramatic use of color (1541-1614) [Domenikos Theotocopoulos, Greco]</p><p><b>Glavna luka Egipta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the chief port of Egypt [Alexandria]</p><p><b>Venezuelanski državnik koji je vodio pobunu južnoameričkih kolonija protiv španjolske vladavine, planina u Andima u Argentini (visina 22 047 stopa) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Venezuelan statesman who led the revolt of South American colonies against Spanish rule [Bolivar, Simon Bolivar]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain in the Andes in Argentina (22,047 feet high)</p><p><b>Drugi najveći aktivni vulkan na svijetu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the world's 2nd largest active volcano</p><p><b>planinski vrh u Andima na granici između Argentine i Čilea (visina 21.457 stopa) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain peak in the Andes on the border between Argentina and Chile (21,457 feet high)</p><p><b>(oceanografija) topla morska struja koja teče duž ekvatora od datumske linije i južno od obale Ekvadora u vrijeme Božića, Kristovo dijete. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (oceanography) a warm ocean current that flows along the equator from the date line and south off the coast of Ecuador at Christmas time</p><p><i>n.</i> the Christ child</p><p><b>Intenzivniji El Nino koji se događa svakih nekoliko godina kada se ne pojavi izlivanje hladne vode bogate hranjivim materijama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a more intense El Nino that occurs every few years when the welling up of cold nutrient-rich water does not occur</p><p><b>Grad u zapadnom Teksasu na granici s Meksikom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in western Texas on the Mexican border</p><p><b>Glavni grad Egipta i najveći grad u Africi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital of Egypt and the largest city in Africa [Al Qahira, Cairo, Egyptian capital, capital of Egypt]</p><p><b>El Salvador, Salvador</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic on the Pacific coast of Central America [Republic of El Salvador, Salvador]</p><p><b>osnovna jedinica novca u Salvadoru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in El Salvador [colon]</p><p><b>monetarna jedinica u El Salvadoru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> monetary unit in El Salvador</p><p><b>Luksor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in central Egypt on the east bank of the Nile that is a center for visitors to the ruins of and around Thebes [Luxor]</p><p><b>ekstremno lijevska teroristička grupa osnovana u Grčkoj 1971. godine kako bi se suprotstavila vojnoj hunti koja je vladala Grčkom od 1967. do 1974. godine. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an extreme leftist terrorist group formed in Greece in 1971 to oppose the military junta that ruled Greece from 1967 to 1974 [Revolutionary People's Struggle]</p><p><b>dotjeran, elaborat, izrađen, obraditi, razraditi, razrađen, složen, usavršen, dotjerati, dotjerivati, elaborirati, obogatiti, obogaćivati, razrađivati, usavršavati, usavršiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> add details, as to an account or idea [dilate, enlarge, expand, expatiate, exposit, expound, flesh out, lucubrate]</p><p><i>v.</i> produce from basic elements or sources</p><p><i>v.</i> make more complex, intricate, or richer [complicate, rarify, refine]</p><p><i>v.</i> work out in detail [work out]</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by complexity and richness of detail [luxuriant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> developed or executed with care and in minute detail [detailed, elaborated]</p><p><b>obrađen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> developed or executed with care and in minute detail [detailed, elaborate]</p><p><b>dotjerano, razrađeno, savršeno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with elaboration [in an elaborate way, intricately]</p><p><b>dotjeran, elaborat, izrađen, obraditi, razraditi, razrađen, složen, usavršen (od &quot;elaborate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> marked by elaborately complex detail [elaboration, intricacy, involution]</p><p><i>n.</i> an ornate appearance [ornateness]</p><p><b>argumentacija, elaboracija, obrada, razrada, razrađenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> addition of extra material or illustration or clarifying detail [amplification]</p><p><i>n.</i> the result of improving something [refinement]</p><p><i>n.</i> a discussion that provides additional information [enlargement, expansion]</p><p><i>n.</i> marked by elaborately complex detail [elaborateness, intricacy, involution]</p><p><i>n.</i> developing in intricate and painstaking detail [working out]</p><p><b>grmovi ili drveće često naoružano (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrubs or small trees often armed [family Elaeagnaceae, oleaster family]</p><p><b>Olejster (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> oleaster [genus Elaeagnus]</p><p><b>ljeplovita grmljava stabla iz Europe i zapadne Azije s sivim listovima i malim žutim plodovima prekrivenim srebrnim ljuskama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous shrubby tree of Europe and western Asia having grey leaves and small yellow fruits covered in silvery scales [Russian olive, silver berry]</p><p><b>ljepljivi neoružani sjevernoamerički grm s srebrnim lišćama i plodovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous unarmed North American shrub with silvery leaves and fruits [silver-bush, silver berry, silverberry, silverbush]</p><p><b>U Indiji i Kini postoji i stabla koja imaju crveno maslinovo voće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect shrub or climber of India and China with red olivelike fruit [wild olive]</p><p><b>ulje palmi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> oil palms [genus Elaeis]</p><p><b>afrički palmi za ulje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> oil palm of Africa [African oil palm]</p><p><b>palma iz Srednje i Južne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> palm of Central and South America [American oil palm]</p><p><b>rod drveća i grmova široko rasprostranjen u toplim područjima, od kojih neki daju korisno drvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of trees and shrubs widely distributed in warm regions some yielding useful timber [elaeocarpus family, family Elaeocarpaceae]</p><p><b>vrsta rod porodice Elaeocarpaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the family Elaeocarpaceae [genus Elaeocarpus]</p><p><b>rod drveća i grmova široko rasprostranjen u toplim područjima, od kojih neki daju korisno drvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of trees and shrubs widely distributed in warm regions some yielding useful timber [Elaeocarpaceae, family Elaeocarpaceae]</p><p><b>Australsko stablo s tvrdim bijelim drvetom i sjajnim zelenim lišćama s bijelim cvijećem,