 galvanic skin response, psychogalvanic response]</p><p><b>oluja koja nastaje zbog snažnog porasta struje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a storm resulting from strong rising air currents [electric storm, thunderstorm]</p><p><b>električna sklopka, elektronska sklopka, prekidač, sklopka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> control consisting of a mechanical or electrical or electronic device for making or breaking or changing the connections in a circuit [electric switch, switch]</p><p><b>Električna energija, oprema u motornom vozilu koja osigurava struju za pokretanje motora i paljenje goriva te za rad svjetala i brisala za vjetrobransko staklo i grijalaca i klimatizacije te radija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> utility that provides electricity [electrical plant]</p><p><i>n.</i> equipment in a motor vehicle that provides electricity to start the engine and ignite the fuel and operate the lights and windshield wiper and heater and air conditioner and radio</p><p><b>Električarovo zanatstvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the craft of an electrician</p><p><b>električan, električni, elektro, elektrotehnički, električka, električne (od &quot;electrical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by electricity</p><p><b>električar, elektrotehničar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who installs or repairs electrical or telephone lines [lineman, linesman]</p><p><b>elektricitet, električna energija, električna struja, elektrika, struja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a physical phenomenon associated with stationary or moving electrons and protons</p><p><i>n.</i> energy made available by the flow of electric charge through a conductor [electrical energy, power]</p><p><i>n.</i> keen and shared excitement</p><p><b>elektrifikacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of thrilling or markedly exciting some person or group</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of providing electricity</p><p><b>elektrificirati, elektrizirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> excite suddenly and intensely</p><p><i>v.</i> charge (a conductor) with electricity</p><p><i>v.</i> equip for use with electricity [wire]</p><p><b>elektrificirati, elektrizirati (od &quot;electrify&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing a surge of emotion or excitement [thrilling]</p><p><b>elektro-akustični konvertor, elektro-akustični pretvarač, elektro-akustični pretvornik, elektro-akustični transduktor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transducer that converts electrical to acoustic energy or vice versa</p><p><b>elektrokardiogram</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a graphical recording of the cardiac cycle produced by an electrocardiograph [ECG, EKG, cardiogram]</p><p><b>EKG, elektrokardiograf, kardiograf</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medical instrument that records electric currents associated with contractions of the heart [cardiograph]</p><p><b>EKG, elektrokardiograf, kardiograf (od &quot;electrocardiograph&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to an electrocardiograph</p><p><b>elektrokardiografija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> diagnostic procedure consisting of recording the activity of the heart electronically with a cardiograph (and producing a cardiogram) [cardiography]</p><p><b>elektrokauterizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> application of a needle heated by an electric current to destroy tissue (as to remove warts)</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or involving electrochemistry</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a serial arrangement of metallic elements or ions according to their electrode potentials determined under specified conditions [electromotive force series, electromotive series]</p><p><b>elektrokemija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> branch of chemistry that deals with the chemical action of electricity and the production of electricity by chemical reactions</p><p><b>Upravljanje snažnom električnom strujom koja prolazi kroz mozak kako bi izazvala grčeve i komu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the administration of a strong electric current that passes through the brain to induce convulsions and coma [ECT, electroshock, electroshock therapy]</p><p><b>ubiti strujom</b></p><p><i>v.</i> kill by electric shock</p><p><i>v.</i> kill by electrocution, as in the electric chair [fry]</p><p><b>smaknuće na električnoj stolici, ubijanje električnom strujom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> execution by electricity [burning]</p><p><i>n.</i> killing by electric shock</p><p><b>smaknuće na električnoj stolici, ubijanje električnom strujom (od &quot;electrocution&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an executioner who uses electricity to kill the condemned person</p><p><b>elektroda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a conductor used to make electrical contact with some part of a circuit</p><p><b>elektrodepozicija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the deposition of a substance on an electrode by the action of electricity (especially by electrolysis)</p><p><b>promjena električnih svojstava kože kao odgovor na stres ili anksioznost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a change in the electrical properties of the skin in response to stress or anxiety [Fere phenomenon, GSR, Tarchanoff phenomenon, electrical skin response, galvanic skin response, psychogalvanic response]</p><p><b>S više od 50 kVA, ali ne više od 150 kVA, ali ne više od 150 kVA, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> measuring instrument that uses the interaction of the magnetic fields of two coils to measure current or voltage or power</p><p><b>grafički zapis električne aktivnosti mozga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a graphical record of electrical activity of the brain [EEG, encephalogram]</p><p><b>elektroencefalograf</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medical instrument that records electric currents generated by the brain</p><p><b>elektroencefalograf (od &quot;electroencephalograph&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to an electroencephalograph</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva ne veći od 50 kVA, s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an apparatus for the electrical transmission of pictures</p><p><i>n.</i> electrical device used for etching by electrolytic means</p><p><b>osoba koja je vještena u korištenju struje za uklanjanje madeža ili bradavica ili korijena kose (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone skilled in the use of electricity to remove moles or warts or hair roots</p><p><b>elektroliza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) a chemical decomposition reaction produced by passing an electric current through a solution containing ions</p><p><i>n.</i> removing superfluous or unwanted hair by passing an electric current through the hair root</p><p><b>elektrolit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a solution that conducts electricity</p><p><b>razrijeđena sumporna kiselina koja se koristi u akumulatorima za pohranu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dilute sulfuric acid used in storage batteries [battery acid]</p><p><b>Ravnoteža između količine elektrolita (kao kalcij i natrij i kalij) koja je nužna za normalno zdravlje i funkcioniranje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an equilibrium between the amounts of electrolytes (as calcium and sodium and potassium) that is essential for normal health and functioning</p><p><b>elektrolitički</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fixed capacitor consisting of two electrodes separated by an electrolyte [electrolytic capacitor, electrolytic condenser]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or concerned with or produced by electrolysis</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or containing an electrolyte</p><p><b>elektrolit, elektrolitički kondenzator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fixed capacitor consisting of two electrodes separated by an electrolyte [electrolytic, electrolytic condenser]</p><p><b>elektrolitska ćelija, goriva ćelija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cell containing an electrolyte in which an applied voltage causes a reaction to occur that would not occur otherwise (such as the breakdown of water into hydrogen and oxygen)</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fixed capacitor consisting of two electrodes separated by an electrolyte [electrolytic, electrolytic capacitor]</p><p><b>elektromagnet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a temporary magnet made by coiling wire around an iron core</p><p><b>elektromagnetski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to or exhibiting magnetism produced by electric charge in motion</p><p><b>elektromagnetska linija za kašnjenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a delay line based on the time of propagation of electromagnetic waves</p><p><b>elektromagnetske interakcije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an interaction between charged elementary particles that is intermediate in strength between the strong and weak interactions</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "službenici" su osoblje koje je poduzeto za obavljanje obavještajnih djelatnosti u skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the deliberate insertion of electromagnetic energy into transmission paths with the objective of confusing or deceiving operators</p><p><b>elektromagnetsko zračenje, elektromagnetski val</b></p><p><i>n.</i> radiation consisting of waves of energy associated with electric and magnetic fields resulting from the acceleration of an electric charge [electromagnetic wave, nonparticulate radiation]</p><p><b>elektromagnetski spektar, spektar elektromagnetskog zračenja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the entire frequency range of electromagnetic waves</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various systems of units for measuring electricity and magnetism [emu]</p><p><b>elektromagnetski val, elektromagnetsko zračenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> radiation consisting of waves of energy associated with electric and magnetic fields resulting from the acceleration of an electric charge [electromagnetic radiation, nonparticulate radiation]</p><p><b>elektromagnetika, elektromagnetizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of physics concerned with electromagnetic phenomena [electromagnetism]</p><p><b>elektromagnetizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> magnetism produced by an electric current</p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of physics concerned with electromagnetic phenomena [electromagnetics]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne više od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or involving an electrically operated mechanical device</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanical device that is operated by electricity</p><p><b>elektrometar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> meter to measure electrostatic voltage differences</p><p><b>elektromotoran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> concerned with or producing electric current</p><p><b>Terapija koja koristi lokalnu električnu struju za unos iona lijeka u tkiva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> therapy that uses a local electric current to introduce the ions of a medicine into the tissues [EMDA, ionic medication, iontophoresis, iontotherapy]</p><p><b>elektromotorna sila</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the rate at which energy is drawn from a source that produces a flow of electricity in a circuit [emf, voltage]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a serial arrangement of metallic elements or ions according to their electrode potentials determined under specified conditions [electrochemical series, electromotive series]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a serial arrangement of metallic elements or ions according to their electrode potentials determined under specified conditions [electrochemical series, electromotive force series]</p><p><b>grafički zapis električnih struja povezanih s kontrakcijama mišića (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a graphical record of electric currents associated with muscle contractions [EMG]</p><p><b>medicinski instrument koji snima električne valove povezane s aktivnostima kostnih mišića (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a medical instrument that records the electrical waves associated with the activity of skeletal muscles</p><p><b>elektormiografski, elektromiografija, elektromiograifija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> diagnosis of neuromuscular disorders with the use of an electromyograph</p><p><b>elektron, elektronski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an elementary particle with negative charge [negatron]</p><p><b>Sastavnik koji se sastoji od ubrzivača koji sudara elektrone i pozitrone (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> collider that consists of an accelerator that collides electrons and positrons</p><p><b>elektronska zraka, elektronski snop</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of nearly parallel lines of electromagnetic radiation [beam, ray]</p><p><b>elektronski top</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the electrode that is the source of electrons in a cathode-ray tube or electron microscope</p><p><b>elektronska oprema koja koristi magnetno ili električno polje kako bi usredotočila zrak elektrona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electronic equipment that uses a magnetic or electric field in order to focus a beam of electrons [lens]</p><p><b>elektronsaka mikroskopija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a microscope that is similar in purpose to a light microscope but achieves much greater resolving power by using a parallel beam of electrons to illuminate the object instead of a beam of light</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or involving an electron microscope</p><p><b>elektronska mikroskopija, elektronsko mikroskopske analize</b></p><p><i>n.</i> microscopy with the use of electron microscopes</p><p><b>vakuumska cijev koja pojačava protok elektrona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vacuum tube that amplifies a flow of electrons</p><p><b>grana elektronike koja se bavi snopovima elektrona i njihovim usmjeravanjem i deflekcijom pomoću magnetnih polja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of electronics that deals with beams of electrons and their focusing and deflection by magnetic fields</p><p><b>putanje elektrona oko jezgre atoma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the path of an electron around the nucleus of an atom [orbit]</p><p><b>S druge strane, radi se o radiološkom spektroskopiji u kojoj se radila rezonančna apsorpcija zračenja paramagnetom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> microwave spectroscopy in which there is resonant absorption of radiation by a paramagnet [ESR, electron spin resonance]</p><p><b>radijacija beta čestica tijekom radioaktivnog raspada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> radiation of beta particles during radioactive decay [beta radiation, beta ray]</p><p><b>grupa elektronova oko jezgre atoma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a grouping of electrons surrounding the nucleus of an atom</p><p><b>elektronska spinska rezonancija, elektron-spin rezonancija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> microwave spectroscopy in which there is resonant absorption of radiation by a paramagnet [ESR, electron paramagnetic resonance]</p><p><b>cijev, elektron cijev, elektronska cijev, katodna cijev, vakumska cijev, vakuumska cijev</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electronic device consisting of a system of electrodes arranged in an evacuated glass or metal envelope [thermionic tube, thermionic vacuum tube, thermionic valve, tube, vacuum tube]</p><p><b>elektronvolt</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of energy equal to the work done by an electron accelerated through a potential difference of 1 volt [eV]</p><p><b>s negativnim nabojem (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a negative charge [negative, negatively charged]</p><p><b>elekronegativnost, elektronegativnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) the tendency of an atom or radical to attract electrons in the formation of an ionic bond [negativity]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having no net electric charge [neutral]</p><p><b>elektronički, elektroničkim, elektronski, elektronička, elektroničko</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to electronics</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or concerned with electrons</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a balance that generates a current proportional to the displacement of the pan</p><p><b>Računar koji pokreće softver koji korisnicima omogućuje ostavljanje poruka i pristup informacijama od općeg interesa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a computer that is running software that allows users to leave messages and access information of general interest [bbs, bulletin board, bulletin board system]</p><p><b>komunikacija putem računala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> communication by computer</p><p><b>kompjuter, kompjutor, računalo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a machine for performing calculations automatically [computer, computing device, computing machine, data processor, information processing system]</p><p><b>(telekomunikacijski) pretvarač za pretvaranje signala s jedne frekvencije na drugu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (telecommunication) converter for converting a signal from one frequency to another</p><p><b>elektronsko ratovanje koje se provodi kako bi se osigurala učinkovita prijateljska upotreba elektromagnetnog spektra unatoč tome što neprijatelj koristi elektronsko ratovanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electronic warfare undertaken to insure effective friendly use of the electromagnetic spectrum in spite of the enemy's use of electronic warfare [ECCM]</p><p><b>"elektronsko ratovanje" je elektronsko ratovanje koje se vodi radi sprečavanja ili smanjenja učinkovite upotrebe elektromagnetnog spektra od strane neprijatelja; (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electronic warfare undertaken to prevent or reduce an enemy's effective use of the electromagnetic spectrum [ECM]</p><p><b>S druge strane, za proizvodnju električnih vozila za vozila iz kategorije 8703 i 8704 ne vrijede: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> automatic data processing by electronic means without the use of tabulating cards or punched tapes [EDP]</p><p><b>(računovodstvo) baza podataka kojoj računari mogu pristupiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a database that can be accessed by computers [computer database, electronic information service, on-line database]</p><p><b>Svrha je da se zaštite zaštite od opasnosti od izbijanja iz sustava za zaštitu podataka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the deliberate use of electromagnetic energy in a manner intended to convey misleading information</p><p><b>elektronička naprava, elektronički uređaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device that accomplishes its purpose electronically</p><p><b>S druge strane, za potrebe ovog članka, "službenici" su: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a machine-readable version of a standard dictionary [MRD, machine readable dictionary]</p><p><b>elektronička oprema</b></p><p><i>n.</i> equipment that involves the controlled conduction of electrons (especially in a gas or vacuum or semiconductor)</p><p><b>elektronički monitor koji prati otkucaje srca fetusa i kontrakcije maternice tijekom porođaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electronic monitor that monitors fetal heartbeat and the mother's uterine contractions during childbirth [electronic foetal monitor, fetal monitor, foetal monitor]</p><p><b>elektronički monitor koji prati otkucaje srca fetusa i kontrakcije maternice tijekom porođaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electronic monitor that monitors fetal heartbeat and the mother's uterine contractions during childbirth [electronic fetal monitor, fetal monitor, foetal monitor]</p><p><b>sliku predstavljenu kao dvodimenzionalni niz vrijednosti osvetljenosti za piksele (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an image represented as a two dimensional array of brightness values for pixels [bitmap]</p><p><b>Uvođenje elektromagnetne energije u neprijateljske sustave koji imitiraju neprijateljske emisije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the introduction of electromagnetic energy into enemy systems that imitates enemy emissions [imitative electronic deception]</p><p><b>elektronička obavijesna služba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a database that can be accessed by computers [computer database, electronic database, on-line database]</p><p><b>glazbeni instrument koji elektronički stvara zvukove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a musical instrument that generates sounds electronically [electronic musical instrument]</p><p><b>zaglušivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deliberate radiation or reflection of electromagnetic energy for the purpose of disrupting enemy use of electronic devices or systems [jam, jamming]</p><p><b>elektronička pošta, e-mail</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a system of world-wide electronic communication in which a computer user can compose a message at one terminal that can be regenerated at the recipient's terminal when the recipient logs in [e-mail, email]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, države članice mogu dopustiti da se u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, odobravaju: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> actions to eliminate revealing telltale indicators that could be used by the enemy (or to convey misleading indicators) [manipulative electronic deception]</p><p><b>elektroničko izvještavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sending and processing of e-mail by computer [messaging]</p><p><b>glazbeni instrument koji elektronički stvara zvukove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a musical instrument that generates sounds electronically [electronic instrument]</p><p><b>mreža</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (electronics) a system of interconnected electronic components or circuits [network]</p><p><b>(glazba) elektronička simulacija cijevnog organa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (music) an electronic simulation of a pipe organ [Hammond organ, electric organ, organ]</p><p><b>za otkrivanje i identifikaciju i procjenu i lociranje stranog elektromagnetnog zračenja (osim radioaktivnog) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the detection and identification and evaluation and location of foreign electromagnetic radiations (other than radioactive)</p><p><b>radio prijemnik koji se automatski kreće kroz određeni odabrani opseg frekvencija u potrazi za nekim signalima ili uvjetima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a radio receiver that moves automatically across some selected range of frequencies looking for some signal or condition [scanner]</p><p><b>Snimak koji se može prikazati na slici: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a signal generated by electronic means</p><p><b>Akcije koje predstavljaju prijateljske teoretske ili stvarne sposobnosti za zavaravanje neprijateljskih snaga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> actions to represent friendly notional or actual capabilities to mislead hostile forces [simulative electronic deception]</p><p><b>(računovodstvo) pokazivač koji kad se pokaže na računalni ekran, osjeća je li tačka osvijetljena ili ne (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a pointer that when pointed at a computer display senses whether or not the spot is illuminated [light pen]</p><p><b>Službeni sustav za nadzor putem elektroničkih sredstava (npr. televizija) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> surveillance by electronic means (e.g. television)</p><p><b>tekst koji je u obliku koji računalo može pohraniti ili prikazati na računaru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> text that is in a form that computer can store or display on a computer screen</p><p><b>elektronski tranzistor, spojni tranzistor, tranzistor, tranzistorsko pojačalo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a semiconductor device capable of amplification [junction transistor, transistor]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 1,15 kVA ili većim od 2,25 kVA, ali ne većim od 2,15 kVA (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a voltmeter whose sensitivity is increased by amplification</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, države članice mogu dopustiti da se radi na korištenju radi radicijskih sustava za upravljanje energijom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> military action involving the use of electromagnetic energy to determine or exploit or reduce or prevent hostile use of the electromagnetic spectrum [EW]</p><p><b>"elektronsko ratovanje" pod izravnim nadzorom operativnog zapovjednika radi lociranja izvora zračene elektromagnetne energije u svrhu neposrednog prepoznavanja prijetnje; (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electronic warfare undertaken under direct control of an operational commander to locate sources of radiated electromagnetic energy for the purpose of immediate threat recognition [ESM]</p><p><b>elektronički</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by electronic means</p><p><b>elektronika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of physics that deals with the emission and effects of electrons and with the use of electronic devices</p><p><b>tvrtka koja proizvodi i prodaje elektroničke instrumente (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company that makes and sells electronic instruments</p><p><b>elektronička industrija, elektronska industrija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the manufacturers of electronic products considered collectively</p><p><b>Informacije dobivene iz elektromagnetnog zračenja iz stranih izvora (osim radioaktivnih izvora) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intelligence derived from electromagnetic radiations from foreign sources (other than radioactive sources) [ELINT]</p><p><b>elektroforetske tehnike, elektroforeza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the motion of charged particles in a colloid under the influence of an electric field [cataphoresis, dielectrolysis, ionophoresis]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s elektroforozijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to electrophoresis [cataphoretic]</p><p><b>mala obitelj koja se sastoji od električnih jegulja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small family comprising the electric eels [family Electrophoridae]</p><p><b>Jednostavni elektrostatički generator koji generiše ponavljajuće naboje statičke električne energije, tip rod iz obitelji Electrophoridae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a simple electrostatic generator that generates repeated charges of static electricity</p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the family Electrophoridae [genus Electrophorus]</p><p><b>Ulica u obliku slatkovodne ribe Južne Amerike s električnim organima u tijelu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eel-shaped freshwater fish of South America having electric organs in its body [electric eel]</p><p><b>Svaka vrsta materijala koja je na elektrolizu prekrivena tankim slojem metala, s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any artifact that has been plated with a thin coat of metal by electrolysis</p><p><i>v.</i> coat with metal by electrolysis</p><p><b>za proizvodnju električnih goriva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plater who uses electrolysis</p><p><b>s pozitivnim nabojem (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a positive charge [positive, positively charged]</p><p><b>grafički zapis električne aktivnosti mrežnjače koja nastaje kada se svjetlost bljeska u oko (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a graphical recording of the electrical activity of the retina that results when light is flashed into the eye</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je to samo jedan od glavnih elemenata u ovom modelu, to znači da je to samo jedan od glavnih elemenata u ovom modelu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> measuring instrument that detects electric charge</p><p><b>elektrošok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the administration of a strong electric current that passes through the brain to induce convulsions and coma [ECT, electroconvulsive therapy, electroshock therapy]</p><p><b>Upravljanje snažnom električnom strujom koja prolazi kroz mozak kako bi izazvala grčeve i komu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the administration of a strong electric current that passes through the brain to induce convulsions and coma [ECT, electroconvulsive therapy, electroshock]</p><p><b>nesvjesnost uzrokovana prolaskom niske napone električne struje kroz mozak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> unconsciousness brought about by the passage of a low voltage electric current through the brain</p><p><b>elektrostatičan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> concerned with or producing or caused by static electricity [static]</p><p><b>kemijska veza u kojoj jedan atom gubi elektron da bi formirao pozitivan ion a drugi atom dobiva elektron da bi formirao negativan ion (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chemical bond in which one atom loses an electron to form a positive ion and the other atom gains an electron to form a negative ion [electrovalent bond, ionic bond]</p><p><b>električni naboj u mirovanju na površini izolirane površine (koji uspostavlja i susjedno elektrostatsko polje) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the electric charge at rest on the surface of an insulated body (which establishes and adjacent electrostatic field)</p><p><b>električno polje povezano s statičkim električnim nabojima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electric field associated with static electric charges</p><p><b>električni uređaj koji proizvodi visoku napetost stvaranjem napona statičke električne energije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electrical device that produces a high voltage by building up a charge of static electricity [Van de Graaff generator, Wimshurst machine, electrostatic machine]</p><p><b>električni uređaj koji proizvodi visoku napetost stvaranjem napona statičke električne energije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electrical device that produces a high voltage by building up a charge of static electricity [Van de Graaff generator, Wimshurst machine, electrostatic generator]</p><p><b>Proces kojim se uklanjaju suspendirane čestice prašine iz plina primjenom visokonapetostnog elektrostatičkog naboja na čestice i prikupljanjem ih na napunjene ploče. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a process that removes suspended dust particles from a gas by applying a high voltage electrostatic charge to the particles and collecting them on charged plates</p><p><b>elektrostatski otprašivač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> removes dust particles from gases by electrostatic precipitation [Cottrell precipitator, precipitator]</p><p><b>štampač koji koristi električni naboj za deponiranje tonera na papir (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a printer that uses an electric charge to deposit toner on paper</p><p><b>Svaka od različitih jedinica električne energije temeljenih na silama interakcije između električnih naboja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various units of electricity based on forces of interaction between electric charges</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an electrostatic manner</p><p><b>elektrostatika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of physics that deals with static 