 colored glassy compound (opaque or partially opaque) that is fused to the surface of metal or glass or pottery for decoration or protection</p><p><i>n.</i> a paint that dries to a hard glossy finish</p><p><i>n.</i> any smooth glossy coating that resembles ceramic glaze</p><p><i>v.</i> coat, inlay, or surface with enamel</p><p><b>S druge konstrukcije od željeza ili čelika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cooking utensil of enameled iron</p><p><b>Amin koji sadrži dvostruku vezu -C=C-N- (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amine containing the double bond linkage -C=C-N-</p><p><b>zaljubiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> attract [becharm, beguile, bewitch, captivate, capture, catch, charm, enamour, enchant, entrance, fascinate, trance]</p><p><b>zaljubljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by foolish or unreasoning fondness [in love, infatuated, potty, smitten, soft on, taken with]</p><p><b>zaljubljen (od &quot;enamored&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of love or fondness [amorousness]</p><p><b>zaljubiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> attract [becharm, beguile, bewitch, captivate, capture, catch, charm, enamor, enchant, entrance, fascinate, trance]</p><p><b>izbijanje na sluznici (kao što je unutrašnjost usta) koje se javlja kao simptom bolesti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eruption on a mucous membrane (as the inside of the mouth) occurring as a symptom of a disease [enanthema]</p><p><b>izbijanje na sluznici (kao što je unutrašnjost usta) koje se javlja kao simptom bolesti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eruption on a mucous membrane (as the inside of the mouth) occurring as a symptom of a disease [enanthem]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena (CAS RN 1344-26-8) za proizvodnju polipropilena, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either one of a pair of compounds (crystals or molecules) that are mirror images on each other but are not identical [enantiomorph]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena (CAS RN 1344-26-8) za proizvodnju polipropilena, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either one of a pair of compounds (crystals or molecules) that are mirror images on each other but are not identical [enantiomer]</p><p><b>odnos opozicije između kristala ili molekula koji su odraz jedni drugih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relation of opposition between crystals or molecules that are reflections of one another [mirror-image relation]</p><p><b>slobodno pokretni zglob u kojem se kugla na glavi jedne kosti uklapa u zaobljenu šupljinu u drugoj kosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a freely moving joint in which a sphere on the head of one bone fits into a rounded cavity in the other bone [articulatio spheroidea, ball-and-socket joint, cotyloid joint, enarthrosis, spheroid joint]</p><p><b>slobodno pokretni zglob u kojem se kugla na glavi jedne kosti uklapa u zaobljenu šupljinu u drugoj kosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a freely moving joint in which a sphere on the head of one bone fits into a rounded cavity in the other bone [articulatio spheroidea, ball-and-socket joint, cotyloid joint, enarthrodial joint, spheroid joint]</p><p><b>jedan srodnik s majčine strane, srodni po majčinoj strani (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one related on the mother's side [matrikin, matrilineal kin, matrilineal sib, matrisib]</p><p><i>adj.</i> related on the mother's side [enatic, maternal]</p><p><b>srodni po majčinoj strani (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> related on the mother's side [enate, maternal]</p><p><b>linija porijekla koja se prati kroz majčinu stranu obitelji, Prirodna izbočina ili rast iz biljnog tijela ili organa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> line of descent traced through the maternal side of the family [cognation, matrilineage]</p><p><i>n.</i> a natural projection or outgrowth from a plant body or organ [plant process]</p><p><b>genetski modificirano anti-TNF jedinjenje (trgovinski naziv Enbrel) koje se sastoji od receptora koji se vežu za TNF. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genetically engineered anti-TNF compound (trade name Enbrel) consisting of receptors that bind TNF [etanercept]</p><p><b>antiaritmički lijek (trgovinski naziv Enkaid) koji se koristi za liječenje životno opasnih aritmija, ali povećava rizik od iznenadne smrti kod pacijenata s srčanim udarom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antiarrhythmic drug (trade name Enkaid) used to treat life-threatening arrhythmias but increases the risk of sudden death in heart attack patients [Enkaid]</p><p><b>ulogoriti se, utaboriti, utaboriti se, kampirati, logorovati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> live in or as if in a tent [bivouac, camp, camp out, tent]</p><p><b>tabor, barake, vojni kamp, vojni tabor, vojnički kamp</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a site where people on holiday can pitch a tent [bivouac, campground, camping area, camping ground, camping site, campsite]</p><p><i>n.</i> temporary living quarters specially built by the army for soldiers [bivouac, camp, cantonment]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of encamping and living in tents in a camp [bivouacking, camping, tenting]</p><p><b>zatvoriti u kućište</b></p><p><i>v.</i> enclose in a capsule or other small container</p><p><i>v.</i> put in a short or concise form [capsule, capsulise, capsulize]</p><p><b>dodavanje zaglavlja na paket podataka, enkapsulacija, omatanje, ovijanje podataka, učahurenje podataka, učahurivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being enclosed (as in a capsule)</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of enclosing (as in a capsule)</p><p><b>spakirati, oblagati, obložiti, zatvarati, zatvoriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> enclose in, or as if in, a case [case, incase]</p><p><b>za proizvodnju proizvoda od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili od metala ili (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> covered or protected with or as if with a case [cased, incased]</p><p><b>zatvaranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of enclosing something in a case [incasement]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,05 do 0,05 g/m2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a paint consisting of pigment mixed with melted beeswax</p><p><b>u kasnoj fazi trudnoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> in an advanced stage of pregnancy [big, expectant, gravid, great, heavy, large, with child]</p><p><b>rod grmova jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika: brittlebush (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of shrubs of southwestern United States and Mexico: brittlebush [genus Encelia]</p><p><b>Mirisno okruglo grmlje iz jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i susjednog Meksika s krhkim stabljikama i malim, guštim plavo-zelenim lišćama i žutim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fragrant rounded shrub of southwestern United States and adjacent Mexico having brittle stems and small crowded blue-green leaves and yellow flowers [brittle bush, brittlebush, incienso]</p><p><b>mali rod kserofitskih biljaka iz jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of xerophytic herbs of southwestern United States [genus Enceliopsis]</p><p><b>biljka koja ima bazalan skup sivozelenih lišća i stabljika bez lišća s jednom širokom žutom cvjetnom glavom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> herb having a basal cluster of grey-green leaves and leafless stalks each with a solitary broad yellow flower head [sunray]</p><p><b>bilo koji od brojnih cikada iz roda Encephalartos koji imaju čvrste cilindrične deblo i krajnju krunu dugih često trnastih pinatnih listova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous cycads of the genus Encephalartos having stout cylindrical trunks and a terminal crown of long often spiny pinnate leaves</p><p><b>Južnoafrički cikad (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> South African cycad [kaffir bread]</p><p><b>encefalitis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of the brain usually caused by a virus [cephalitis, phrenitis]</p><p><b>encefalitis koji je bio epidemija između 1915 i 1926 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an encephalitis that was epidemic between 1915 and 1926 [epidemic encephalitis, lethargic encephalitis, sleeping sickness, sleepy sickness]</p><p><b>izbočina moždanog tkiva kroz urođenu pukotinu u lubanji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> protrusion of brain tissue through a congenital fissure in the skull</p><p><b>elektroencefalograf</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a graphical record of electrical activity of the brain [EEG, electroencephalogram]</p><p><i>n.</i> an X ray of the brain made by replacing spinal fluid with a gas (usually oxygen) to improve contrast [pneumoencephalogram]</p><p><b>radiografija mozga nakon što je kičmena tekućina zamijenjena plinom (obično kisikom) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> roentgenography of the brain after spinal fluid has been replaced by a gas (usually oxygen)</p><p><b>upale mozga i kičmene moždine i njihovih moždanih moždanih žlijezda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of the brain and spinal cord and their meninges [cerebromeningitis, meningoencephalitis]</p><p><b>encefalomijelitis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of the brain and spinal cord</p><p><b>dio središnjeg živčanog sustava koji uključuje sve više živčane centre (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> that part of the central nervous system that includes all the higher nervous centers [brain]</p><p><b>bilo kakvo poremećaj ili bolest mozga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any disorder or disease of the brain [brain disease, brain disorder]</p><p><b>okovati, zakovati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> restrain or bind with chains</p><p><b>okovati, zakovati (od &quot;enchain&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> bound with chains [chained]</p><p><b>očarati, opčiniti, opčinjati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> hold spellbound [delight, enrapture, enthral, enthrall, ravish, transport]</p><p><i>v.</i> attract [becharm, beguile, bewitch, captivate, capture, catch, charm, enamor, enamour, entrance, fascinate, trance]</p><p><i>v.</i> cast a spell over someone or something [bewitch, glamour, hex, jinx, witch]</p><p><b>očaran, očarani, oduševili, oduševljen, začarani</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> influenced as by charms or incantations</p><p><b>čarobnjak, oduševljava, onaj koji očarava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sorcerer or magician</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko uspravnih višegodišnjih rizomatnih biljaka roda Circaea s bijelim cvijećem koje se otvaraju u zoru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several erect perennial rhizomatous herbs of the genus Circaea having white flowers that open at dawn</p><p><b>čudesan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capturing interest as if by a spell [bewitching, captivating, enthralling, entrancing, fascinating]</p><p><b>čudesan (od &quot;enchanting&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a bewitching manner [bewitchingly, captivatingly, enthrallingly]</p><p><b>čar, čarolija, draž, dražest, oduševljenje, opčaravanje, ushit, trans</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of great liking for something wonderful and unusual [captivation, enthrallment, fascination]</p><p><i>n.</i> a psychological state induced by (or as if induced by) a magical incantation [spell, trance]</p><p><i>n.</i> a magical spell [bewitchment]</p><p><b>zavodnica, vila, vještica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman who is considered to be dangerously seductive [Delilah, femme fatale, siren, temptress]</p><p><i>n.</i> a female sorcerer or magician [witch]</p><p><b>tortilla sa punjenjem mesa pečena u paradižnom umaku začinjenom čilijem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tortilla with meat filling baked in tomato sauce seasoned with chili</p><p><b>priručnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a concise reference book providing specific information about a subject or location [handbook, vade mecum]</p><p><b>benigni tumor sporo rastućih hrskavičnih stanica na krajevima cijevnih kostiju (posebno u rukama i nogama) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> benign slow-growing tumor of cartilaginous cells at the ends of tubular bones (especially in the hands and feet)</p><p><b>kodirati, šifrirati, prekodirati, prevesti, prevoditi</b></p><p><i>v.</i> convert ordinary language into code [cipher, code, cypher, encrypt, inscribe, write in code]</p><p><b>obuhvatiti, obujmiti, okružiti, opkoliti, opkoljavati, zaokružiti, opasati, opasivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> form or draw a circle around [circle]</p><p><i>v.</i> bind with something round or circular [gird]</p><p><b>okružen, okružuje, opasan, zaokružen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> confined on all sides [surrounded]</p><p><b>opasavanje, opkoljavanje, blokada, blokiranje, blokiranost, odsijecanje, odsječenost, okruživanje, opkoljenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a war measure that isolates some area of importance to the enemy [blockade]</p><p><b>obuhvatiti, obujmiti, okružiti, opkoliti, opkoljavati, zaokružiti (od &quot;encircle&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being all around the edges [skirting]</p><p><b>enklava, teritorij okružen tuđom državom, uključen u tuđu državu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an enclosed territory that is culturally distinct from the foreign territory that surrounds it</p><p><b>obuhvatiti, ograditi, okružiti, opasati, opkoliti, priložiti, staviti unutra, uložiti u pismo, zatvoriti, obavijati, obaviti, obuhvaćati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> enclose or enfold completely with or as if with a covering [enfold, envelop, enwrap, wrap]</p><p><i>v.</i> close in [confine, hold in]</p><p><i>v.</i> surround completely [close in, inclose, shut in]</p><p><i>v.</i> place, fit, or thrust (something) into another thing [inclose, insert, introduce, put in, stick in]</p><p><b>ograđen, ograđenom, okružen, opkoljen, priložen, zatvoren, zatvorena</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> closed in or surrounded or included within</p><p><b>zatvoreni prostor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> space that is surrounded by something [cavity]</p><p><b>ograđivanje, priložiti pismima</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of enclosing something inside something else [enclosure, envelopment, inclosure]</p><p><b>kuci ste .zaštiti ovitak, kućište, ograda, ograđeni prostor, prilog, omeđeni prostor, šupljina</b></p><p><i>n.</i