ava, ohrabrivanje, ohrabrujuće, ohrabrujući, poticajima, potiče</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> giving courage or confidence or hope</p><p><i>adj.</i> furnishing support and encouragement [supporting]</p><p><b>oduševljava, ohrabrivanje, ohrabrujuće, ohrabrujući, poticajima, potiče (od &quot;encouraging&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an encouraging manner</p><p><b>Napravi crvenokosa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make crimson</p><p><b>nasrnuti, posegnuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> advance beyond the usual limit [impinge, infringe]</p><p><i>v.</i> impinge or infringe upon [entrench, impinge, trench]</p><p><b>nadirati, napasti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> to intrude upon, infringe, encroach on, violate [intrude on, invade, obtrude upon]</p><p><b>osvajač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who enters by force in order to conquer [invader]</p><p><b>nasrnuti, posegnuti (od &quot;encroach&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> gradually intrusive without right or permission [invasive, trespassing]</p><p><b>nastupanje, presezanje, prisvajanje, prodiranje u kopno, zadiranje, invazija, prodor, upad</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any entry into an area not previously occupied [intrusion, invasion]</p><p><i>n.</i> entry to another's property without right or permission [intrusion, trespass, usurpation, violation]</p><p><i>n.</i> influencing strongly [impact, impingement]</p><p><b>okorjeti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cover or coat with a crust [incrust]</p><p><i>v.</i> decorate or cover lavishly (as with gems) [beset, incrust]</p><p><i>v.</i> form a crust or a hard layer [incrust]</p><p><b>kora</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the formation of a crust [incrustation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a hard outer layer that covers something [crust, incrustation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a decorative coating of contrasting material that is applied to a surface as an inlay or overlay [incrustation]</p><p><b>okorjeti (od &quot;encrust&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a hardened crust as a covering [crusted, crustlike, crusty]</p><p><b>kodirati, prekodirati, prevesti, prevoditi, šifrir