><b>(kimske reakcije ili spoja) koje se javljaju ili formiraju apsorpcijom toplote (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a chemical reaction or compound) occurring or formed with absorption of heat [endothermic, heat-absorbing]</p><p><b>(kimske reakcije ili spoja) koje se javljaju ili formiraju apsorpcijom toplote (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a chemical reaction or compound) occurring or formed with absorption of heat [endothermal, heat-absorbing]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se radi o proizvodnji od električne energije, to znači da se radi o proizvodnji od električne energije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chemical reaction accompanied by the absorption of heat</p><p><b>toksin koji se nalazi unutar mikroorganizama i oslobađa se samo kada se mikroorganizmi razgrađuju ili umiru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a toxin that is confined inside the microorganisms and is released only when the microorganisms are broken down or die</p><p><b>Kateter koji se unosi u dušnik kroz usta ili nos kako bi se održao otvoreni prolaz zraka ili za isporuku kisika ili za omogućavanje usisavanja sluzi ili za sprečavanje aspiracije sadržaja želuca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a catheter that is inserted into the trachea through the mouth or nose in order to maintain an open air passage or to deliver oxygen or to permit the suctioning of mucus or to prevent aspiration of the stomach contents</p><p><b>u žilu ili kroz žilu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> within or by means of a vein [intravenous]</p><p><b>obdariti, pokloniti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> give qualities or abilities to [empower, endue, gift, indue, invest]</p><p><i>v.</i> furnish with an endowment [dower]</p><p><b>obdaren, obdarena, obdarila</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> provided or supplied or equipped with (especially as by inheritance or nature)</p><p><b>darovanje, darovitost, miraz, talent, zadužbina, zaklada</b></p><p><i>n.</i> natural abilities or qualities [gift, natural endowment, talent]</p><p><i>n.</i> the capital that provides income for an institution [endowment fund]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of endowing with a permanent source of income</p><p><b>zadužbina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital that provides income for an institution [endowment]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je osoba koja je primila osiguranje u skladu s člankom 77. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe u razdoblju od tri mjeseca od datuma primjene tog zakona, u skladu s člankom 77. stavkom (b) ove Uredbe, primjenjuje se sljedeći uvjet: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> life insurance for a specified amount which is payable to the insured person at the expiration of a certain period of time or to a designated beneficiary immediately upon the death of the insured</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih parazita koji žive u unutarnjim organima životinja (posebno crijevi crijeva), od ili u vezi s entozoama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various parasites that live in the internal organs of animals (especially intestinal worms) [endoparasite, entoparasite, entozoan, entozoon]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to entozoa [entozoan]</p><p><b>Živi u živoj životinji obično kao parazit. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> living within a living animal usually as a parasite [entozoan, entozoic]</p><p><b>Ravan kraj motoričkog neurona koji prenosi nervne impulse na mišić (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the flattened end of a motor neuron that transmits neural impulses to a muscle [end-plate, motor end plate]</p><p><b>krajnja točka, krajnja točka (npr. terminal, poveznik)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a place where something ends or is complete [end point, termination, terminus]</p><p><b>dodijeliti, opskrbiti, zaodjenuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> give qualities or abilities to [empower, endow, gift, indue, invest]</p><p><b>podnošljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being borne though unpleasant [bearable, sufferable, supportable]</p><p><b>istrajnost, izdržljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the power to withstand hardship or stress</p><p><i>n.</i> a state of surviving [survival]</p><p><b>bilo koji dug i naporan poduhvat (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any long and arduous undertaking [marathon]</p><p><b>Vozi se dugo sati na dugim udaljenostima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> riding for long hours over long distances</p><p><b>izdržati, podnijeti, podnositi, pretrpjeti, trpjeti, ustrajati, durati, izdržavati, izdurati, otrpjeti, podnašati, probaviti, probavljati, tolerirati, odolijevati, odoljeti, prebroditi, održati se, održavati se, potrajati, trajati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put up with something or somebody unpleasant [abide, bear, brook, digest, put up, stand, stick out, stomach, suffer, support, tolerate]</p><p><i>v.</i> face and withstand with courage [brave, brave out, weather]</p><p><i>v.</i> continue to live and avoid dying [go, hold out, hold up, last, live, live on, survive]</p><p><i>v.</i> undergo or be subjected to [suffer]</p><p><i>v.</i> last and be usable [hold out, wear]</p><p><i>v.</i> persist for a specified period of time [last]</p><p><i>v.</i> continue to exist [die hard, persist, prevail, run]</p><p><b>izdržljiv, otporan, trajan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lasting a long time [abiding, imperishable]</p><p><i>adj.</i> patiently bearing continual wrongs or trouble [long-suffering]</p><p><b>izdržljiv, otporan, trajan (od &quot;enduring&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an enduring manner</p><p><b>snaga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> permanence by virtue of the power to resist stress or force [durability, lastingness, strength]</p><p><b>na kraju ili u uspravnom položaju, u smjeru ili prema smjeru krajeva, s krajem naprijed ili prema promatraču (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> on end or upright [endwise]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in or toward the direction of the ends [endwise]</p><p><i>adv.</i> with the end forward or toward the observer [end on, endwise]</p><p><b>na kraju ili u uspravnom položaju, u smjeru ili prema smjeru krajeva, s krajem naprijed ili prema promatraču (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> on end or upright [endways]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in or toward the direction of the ends [endways]</p><p><i>adv.</i> with the end forward or toward the observer [end on, endways]</p><p><b>kompasna točka na pola puta između sjeveroistoka i istoka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the compass point midway between northeast and east [east northeast]</p><p><b>Talijanski papa od 1458. do 1464. koji se sjeća zbog neuspjelog pokušaja vođenja križarskog rata protiv Turaka (1405-1464) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Italian pope from 1458 to 1464 who is remembered for his unsuccessful attempt to lead a crusade against the Turks (1405-1464) [Aeneas Silvius, Pius II]</p><p><b>ispiranje crijeva, klistir, klistiranje, klizma, uljevak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an injection of a liquid through the anus to stimulate evacuation [clyster]</p><p><b>dušmanin, neprijatelj, neprijateljima, neprijateljska, protivnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an opposing military force</p><p><i>n.</i> an armed adversary (especially a member of an opposing military force) [foe, foeman, opposition]</p><p><i>n.</i> any hostile group of people</p><p><i>n.</i> a personal enemy [foe]</p><p><b>energetski, energičan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> possessing or exerting or displaying energy</p><p><i>adj.</i> working hard to promote an enterprise [gumptious, industrious, up-and-coming]</p><p><b>na energičan način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an energetic manner</p><p><b>Biološka jedinica koja se sastoji od jezgre i tijela citoplazme s kojom se međusobno komunicira. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a biological unit consisting of a nucleus and the body of cytoplasm with which it interacts [protoplast]</p><p><b>buditi, potaknuti, poticati, razbuditi, stimulirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> raise to a higher energy level [energize, excite]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be alert and energetic [arouse, brace, energize, perk up, stimulate]</p><p><b>buditi, potaknuti, poticati, razbuditi, stimulirati (od &quot;energise&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who imparts energy and vitality and spirit to other people [animator, energizer, vitaliser, vitalizer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a device that supplies electrical energy [energizer]</p><p><b>buditi, potaknuti, poticati, razbuditi, stimulirati (od &quot;energise&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> supplying motive force [energizing, kinetic]</p><p><b>biti djelotvoran, biti energičan, energično djelovati, ispuniti energijom, potkrijepiti, učiniti snažnim, uključiti, uvesti energiju, buditi, potaknuti, poticati, razbuditi, stimulirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be alert and energetic [arouse, brace, energise, perk up, stimulate]</p><p><i>v.</i> raise to a higher energy level [energise, excite]</p><p><b>biti djelotvoran, biti energičan, energično djelovati, ispuniti energijom, potkrijepiti, učiniti snažnim, uključiti, uvesti energiju (od &quot;energize&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who imparts energy and vitality and spirit to other people [animator, energiser, vitaliser, vitalizer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a device that supplies electrical energy [energiser]</p><p><b>biti djelotvoran, biti energičan, energično djelovati, ispuniti energijom, potkrijepiti, učiniti snažnim, uključiti, uvesti energiju (od &quot;energize&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of causing to have energy and be active [activating, activation]</p><p><i>adj.</i> supplying motive force [energising, kinetic]</p><p><b>energetika, energetski, energetski potencijal, energija, moć, napor, snaga, energetska, energetske, energije, energijom, vitalnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) a thermodynamic quantity equivalent to the capacity of a physical system to do work [free energy]</p><p><i>n.</i> forceful exertion [vigor, vigour, zip]</p><p><i>n.</i> enterprising or ambitious drive [get-up-and-go, push]</p><p><i>n.</i> an imaginative lively style (especially style of writing) [muscularity, vigor, vigour, vim]</p><p><i>n.</i> a healthy capacity for vigorous activity [vim, vitality]</p><p><i>n.</i> any source of usable power</p><p><i>n.</i> the federal department responsible for maintaining a national energy policy of the United States [DOE, Department of Energy, Energy Department]</p><p><b>Federalno ministarstvo odgovorno za održavanje nacionalne energetske politike Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the federal department responsible for maintaining a national energy policy of the United States [DOE, Department of Energy, Energy]</p><p><b>energetski nivo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a definite stable energy that a physical system can have [energy state]</p><p><b>Energija koju atomski sustav mora steći prije nego što se proces (kao što je emisija ili reakcija) može dogoditi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the energy that an atomic system must acquire before a process (such as an emission or reaction) can occur [activation energy]</p><p><b>osoba koja je sekretar Ministarstva energetike, položaj šefa Odjela za energetiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Department of Energy [Secretary of Energy]</p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the Department of Energy [Secretary of Energy]</p><p><b>definirana stabilna energija koju fizički sustav može imati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a definite stable energy that a physical system can have [energy level]</p><p><b>jedinica za mjerenje rada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of measurement for work [heat unit, work unit]</p><p><b>(nuklearne reakcije) koja se događa s apsorpcijom energije (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a nuclear reaction) occurring with absorption of energy [endoergic]</p><p><b>(nuklearne reakcije) koja se događa s evolucijom ili oslobađanjem energije, od ili u vezi s katabolizmom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a nuclear reaction) occurring with evolution or releasing of energy [exoergic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to catabolism [destructive-metabolic]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s anabolizmom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to anabolism [constructive-metabolic]</p><p><b>iscrpiti, nemoćan, oslabiti, oslabljen, slab, iznervirati, nervirati, uznemiriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> weaken mentally or morally</p><p><i>v.</i> disturb the composure of [faze, unnerve, unsettle]</p><p><b>nedostatak energije ili vitalnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking energy or vitality [adynamic, asthenic, debilitated]</p><p><b>iscrpiti, nemoćan, oslabiti, oslabljen, slab (od &quot;enervate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing debilitation [debilitative, enfeebling, weakening]</p><p><b>nedostatak vitalnosti, ozbiljna slabost i gubitak energije, kirurško uklanjanje živca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lack of vitality</p><p><i>n.</i> serious weakening and loss of energy [debilitation, enfeeblement, exhaustion]</p><p><i>n.</i> surgical removal of a nerve</p><p><b>Rumunski violinist i skladatelj (1881-1955) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Romanian violinist and composer (1881-1955) [George Enescu, Georges Enesco]</p><p><b>Uralički jezik koji govore Yenisejci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the Uralic language spoken by the Yeniseian [Entsi, Entsy, Yenisei, Yenisei-Samoyed, Yeniseian]</p><p><b>osoba čije neobično ponašanje osramotljuje druge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person whose unconventional behavior embarrasses others</p><p><b>iznuriti, oslabiti, iscrpiti, iscrpljivati, iscrpsti, isisati, izmarati, izmoriti, izmožditi, izmožđivati, oslabjeti, oslabljivati, slabiti, slabjeti, umarati, umoriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make weak [debilitate, drain]</p><p><b>ozbiljna slabost i gubitak energije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> serious weakening and loss of energy [debilitation, enervation, exhaustion]</p><p><b>iznuriti, oslabiti (od &quot;enfeeble&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing debilitation [debilitative, enervating, weakening]</p><p><b>stavljen u posjed zemlje u zamjenu za jamstvo službe, u feudalnom društvu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put in possession of land in exchange for a pledge of service, in feudal society</p><p><b>Pod feudalnim sustavom, dokument kojim je osobi dodijeljena zemlja u zamjenu za jamstvo službe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> under the feudal system, the deed by which a person was given land in exchange for a pledge of service</p><p><b>Pucnjava usmjerena duž dužine umjesto širine formacije, S obzirom na to da je to primjenjivo za sve vrste vozila, to znači da se ne može upotrebljavati za vozila koja se koriste u ovom sektoru. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> gunfire directed along the length rather than the breadth of a formation [enfilade fire]</p><p><i>v.</i> rake or be in a position to rake with gunfire in a lengthwise direction</p><p><b>Pucnjava usmjerena duž dužine umjesto širine formacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> gunfire directed along the length rather than the breadth of a formation [enfilade]</p><p><b>Nezapaljiva tekućina (trgovinski naziv Ethrane) koja se koristi kao inhalacijski anestetik za opću anesteziju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nonflammable liquid (trade name Ethrane) used as an inhalation general anesthetic [Ethrane]</p><p><b>umotati, uvijati, zamotati, zavijati, ograditi</b></p><p><i>v.</i> enclose or enfold completely with or as if with a covering [enclose, envelop, enwrap, wrap]</p><p><b>umotati, uvijati, zamotati, zavijati (od &quot;enfold&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the action of enfolding something [involution]</p><p><b>nametnuti, podstaći, primijeniti, primoravati, prisiliti, sprovesti silom, implementirati, nametati, primjenjivati, provesti, provoditi, sprovesti, sprovoditi</b></p><p><i>v.</i> ensure observance of laws and rules [apply, implement]</p><p><i>v.</i> compel to behave in a certain way [constrain, impose]</p><p><b>koji može imati važnost, koji može imati vrijednost, koji se može nametnuti, koji se može provesti, nametnut zakonski, utjeriv, važnost, zakonski utjeriv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being enforced</p><p><b>podstaknut, primijenjen, sproveden, sprovela</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> forced or compelled or put in force [implemented]</p><p><b>ovrha, prisilna naplata, provedba, provođenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of enforcing</p><p><b>nametnuti, podstaći, primijeniti, primoravati, prisiliti, sprovesti silom (od &quot;enforce&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one whose job it 