><p><i>adj.</i> having ones attention or mind or energy engaged [occupied]</p><p><i>adj.</i> involved in military hostilities</p><p><i>adj.</i> reserved in advance [booked, set-aside]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of facilities such as telephones or lavatories) unavailable for use by anyone else or indicating unavailability [busy, in use]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of toothed parts or gears) interlocked and interacting [intermeshed, meshed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having services contracted for</p><p><i>adj.</i> built against or attached to a wall</p><p><b>angažiranja, angažiranje, angažman, angažmana, dužnost, obaveza, zaruke, bitka, boj, borba, sukob, sastanak, termin, ugovoreni sastanak, zapošljavanje, angažiranost, participacija, sudjelovanje, uključenje, uključenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hostile meeting of opposing military forces in the course of a war [battle, conflict, fight]</p><p><i>n.</i> a meeting arranged in advance [appointment, date]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mutual promise to marry [betrothal, troth]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of giving someone a job [employment]</p><p><i>n.</i> employment for performers or performing groups that lasts for a limited period of time [booking]</p><p><i>n.</i> contact by fitting together [interlocking, mesh, meshing]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of sharing in the activities of a group [involution, involvement, participation]</p><p><b>Prsten koji se daje i nosi kao znak zaručništva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ring given and worn as a sign of betrothal</p><p><b>ljubazan, prijazan, privlačan, zanimljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> attracting or delighting [piquant]</p><p><b>privlačivo</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an engaging manner [winsomely]</p><p><b>Njemački kompozitor šest opera i druge sporedne glazbe (1854-1921) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German composer of six operas and other incidental music (1854-1921) [Humperdinck]</p><p><b>visoka smreka Skamenih planina i Britanske Kolumbije s plavo-zelenim iglama i oštrom koničnom krunom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall spruce o