ting onto a surface by carving or etching</p><p><i>n.</i> a printmaker who prints from an engraved printing plate</p><p><b>bakrorez, drvorez, graviran kliše, graviranje, gravura, rezbarenje, rezbarija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a print made from an engraving</p><p><i>n.</i> a block or plate or other hard surface that has been engraved</p><p><i>n.</i> making engraved or etched plates and printing designs from them [etching]</p><p><b>napisati, obuzeti, ovladati, privući, zauzeti, bacati se, baciti se, posvetiti se, posvećivati se, udubiti se, udubljivati se, unijeti se, unositi se, zadubiti se, zadubljivati se, obuzimati, okupirati, zaokupiti, zaokupljati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> devote (oneself) fully to [absorb, engulf, immerse, plunge, soak up, steep]</p><p><i>v.</i> consume all of one's attention or time [absorb, engage, occupy]</p><p><b>napisati, obuzeti, ovladati, privući, zauzeti (od &quot;engross&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> giving or marked by complete attention to [absorbed, captive, enwrapped, intent, wrapped]</p><p><i>adj.</i> written formally in a large clear script, as a deed or other legal document</p><p><b>napisati, obuzeti, ovladati, privući, zauzeti (od &quot;engross&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of arousing and holding the attention [absorbing, fascinating, gripping, riveting]</p><p><b>preokupacija, zadubljenost, zanimanje, zaokupljenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> complete attention [absorption, concentration, immersion]</p><p><i>n.</i> the mental state of being preoccupied by something [absorption, preoccupancy, preoccupation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being intent and concentrated [intentness]</p><p><b>gutati, obuzimati, bacati se, baciti se, posvetiti se, posvećivati se, udubiti se, udubljivati se, unijeti se, unositi se, zadubiti se, zadubljivati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> devote (oneself) fully to [absorb, engross, immerse, plunge, soak up, steep]</p><p><i>v.</i> flow over or cover completely</p><p><b>obogatiti, poboljšati, pobuditi, potaknut, povećati, p