d States after 1939) who worked on artificial radioactivity caused by neutron bombardment and who headed the group that in 1942 produced the first controlled nuclear reaction (1901-1954) [Fermi]</p><p><b>zaodjenuti, zaodjeti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> provide with a coating</p><p><i>v.</i> adorn with a robe</p><p><b>unijeti u spisak, novačiti, pridobiti, pridobivati, priključiti, priključivati, regrutirati, unovačiti, upisati, upisivati, učlaniti, učlanjivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> register formally as a participant or member [enroll, enter, inscribe, recruit]</p><p><b>učlaniti, upisati se, uviti, novačiti, pridobiti, pridobivati, priključiti, priključivati, regrutirati, unovačiti, upisati, upisivati, učlanjivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> register formally as a participant or member [enrol, enter, inscribe, recruit]</p><p><b>polaznik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who enrolls in (or is enrolled in) a class or course of study</p><p><b>broj upisanih, učlanjenje, registracija, upis, upisivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of enrolling [enrolment, registration]</p><p><i>n.</i> the body of people (such as students) who register or enroll at the same time [registration]</p><p><b>broj upisanih, izjava o pristupanju, popis, stavljanje u popis, upis, vojačenje, zaprimanje, registracija, upisivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of enrolling [enrollment, registration]</p><p><b>skloniti (se), skloniti se, gnijezditi se, namjestiti se, namještati se, smjestiti se, smještati se, ugnijezditi se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> fix firmly [settle]</p><p><b>ansambl, ansamblom, glazbeni ansambl, muzički ansambl</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of musicians playing or singing together</p><p><i>n.</i> a cast other than the principals [supporting players]</p><p><i>n.</i> the chorus of a ballet company [corps de ballet]</p><p><i>n.</i> an assemblage of parts or details (as in a work of art) considered as forming a whole [tout ensemble]</p><p><i>n.</i> a coordinated outfit (set of clothing)</p><p><b>Tropične biljke Starog svijeta: Abisinijske banane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Old World tropical herbs: Abyssinian bananas [genus Ensete]</p><p><b>Velika zelena biljka s velikim lišcima u obliku vesla i plodovima koji se ne mogu jesti, ali imaju jestive mladoplodne izdanke. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large evergreen arborescent herb having huge paddle-shaped leaves and bearing inedible fruit that resemble bananas but edible young flower shoots [Abyssinian banana, Ethiopian banana, Musa ensete]</p><p><b>brižljivo čuvati, čuvati kao svetinju, služiti kao svetište, u srcu nositi, zatvoriti, zatvoriti kao u svetište, zatvoriti u svetište</b></p><p><i>v.</i> enclose in a shrine [shrine]</p><p><i>v.</i> hold sacred [saint]</p><p><b>pokrivanje kao da je sa pokrivačem (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cover as if with a shroud [cover, hide, shroud]</p><p><b>kao mač, mačast, poput mača</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> shaped like a sword blade [bladelike, sword-shaped, swordlike]</p><p><b>list u obliku mača. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sword-shaped leaf</p><p><b>barjak, pomorska zastava, vojnopomorska zastava, zastava, zastava na krmi broda, zastavnik, zastavnica, krmena zastava, državna zastava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who holds a commissioned rank in the United States Navy or the United States Coast Guard</p><p><i>n.</i> an emblem flown as a symbol of nationality [national flag]</p><p><i>n.</i> colors flown by a ship to show its nationality</p><p><b>silirana krma, silos</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fodder harvested while green and kept succulent by partial fermentation as in a silo [silage]</p><p><b>skladištenje u silosu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> store in a silo</p><p><b>čokolada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> razor clams [genus Ensis]</p><p><b>Uzdiži se na nebo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> exalt to the skies</p><p><b>podjarmiti, porobiti, zarobiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a slave of</p><p><b>ropstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being a slave [captivity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of making slaves of your captives</p><p><b>uhvatiti u zam