, s više strana, s više strana, s više strana, s više strana, s više strana, s više strana, s više strana, s više strana, s više strana, s više strana, s više strana, s više strana, s više strana, s više strana, s više od četiri strane, s više od četiri strane, s više od (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a three-sided regular polygon [equilateral triangle]</p><p><b>konj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hoofed mammals having slender legs and a flat coat with a narrow mane along the back of the neck [equine]</p><p><b>kopitari</b></p><p><i>n.</i> horses [family Equidae]</p><p><b>ravnostran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the same distance apart at every point</p><p><b>Ravno raspodjelu s jednakom učestalosti pojave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a flat distribution having equal frequencies of occurrence</p><p><b>istostran, istostraničan, jednakostran, jednakostraničan, ravnostrani</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a figure whose sides are all equal</p><p><i>adj.</i> having all sides or faces equal</p><p><b>jednakostraničan trokut</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a three-sided regular polygon [equiangular triangle]</p><p><b>uravnotežiti, balansirati, izbalansirati, ujednačavati, ujednačiti, uravnoteživati, uskladiti, usklađivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bring to a chemical stasis or equilibrium</p><p><i>v.</i> bring into balance or equilibrium [balance, equilibrise, equilibrize]</p><p><b>stabilizacija dovedenjem u ravnotežu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stabilization by bringing into equilibrium</p><p><b>balansirati, izbalansirati, ujednačavati, ujednačiti, uravnotežiti, uravnoteživati, uskladiti, usklađivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bring into balance or equilibrium [balance, equilibrate, equilibrize]</p><p><b>ekvilibrijum, ravnoteža, ravnotežan, ravnotežna, uravnoteženost, ekvilibrij, izjednačenje, protuteža, ravnomjernost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stable situation in which forces cancel one another</p><p><i>n.</i> a chemical reaction and its reverse proceed at equal rates [chemical equilibrium]</p><p><i>n.</i> equality of distribution [balance, counterbalance, equipoise]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sensory system located in structures of the inner ear that registers the orientation of the head [labyrinthine sense, sense of balance, sense of equilibrium, vestibular sense]</p><p><b>konstanta ravnoteže</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) the ratio of concentrations when equilibrium is reached in a reversible reaction (when the rate of the forward reaction equals the rate of the reverse reaction)</p><p><b>(hemija) princip da je (u kemijskoj ravnoteži) u reverzibilnoj reakciji odnos brzine napredne reakcije prema brzini reverzne reakcije konstantna za tu reakciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) the principle that (at chemical equilibrium) in a reversible reaction the ratio of the rate of the forward reaction to the rate of the reverse reaction is a constant for that reaction [law of chemical equilibrium]</p><p><b>balansirati, izbalansirati, ujednačavati, ujednačiti, uravnotežiti, uravnoteživati, uskladiti, usklađivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bring into balance or equilibrium [balance, equilibrate, equilibrise]</p><p><b>konjski, konj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hoofed mammals having slender legs and a flat coat with a narrow mane along the back of the neck [equid]</p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling a horse</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or belonging to the family Equidae</p><p><b>akutna bakterijska bolest konja koja se karakterizira upalom sluznice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acute bacterial disease of horses characterized by inflammation of the mucous membranes [strangles]</p><p><b>Encefalitis uzrokovan virusom koji se prenosi komarcem od zaraženog konja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> encephalitis caused by a virus that is transmitted by a mosquito from an infected horse [equine encephalomyelitis]</p><p><b>Encefalitis uzrokovan virusom koji se prenosi komarcem od zaraženog konja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> encephalitis caused by a virus that is transmitted by a mosquito from an infected horse [equine encephalitis]</p><p><b>ekvator nebeski, nebeski ekvator, ravn