a od poluproizvodnog materijala od poluproizvodnog materi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a reddish mineral consisting of hydrated cobalt arsenate in monoclinic crystalline form and used in coloring glass [cobalt bloom]</p><p><b>nukleirani stanica u koštanoj srži iz koje crvene krvne stanice razviju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nucleated cell in bone marrow from which red blood cells develop</p><p><b>krvna bolest obilježena abnormalnim prisustvom eritroblasta u krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blood disease characterized by the abnormal presence of erythroblasts in the blood</p><p><b>teška anemija kod novorođenčadi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> severe anemia in newborn babies</p><p><b>čokolada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> patas [genus Erythrocebus]</p><p><b>crvenkasto-dugovrsni majmun zapadne Afrike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> reddish long-tailed monkey of west Africa [hussar monkey, patas]</p><p><b>u slučaju da je proizvod iz članka 1. stavka 1. točke (a) ili (b) ovog članka upotrebljen u proizvodima iz članka 1. stavka 2. točke (a) ili (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (b) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antibiotic (trade name Erythrocin or E-Mycin or Ethril or Ilosone or Pediamycin) obtained from the actinomycete Streptomyces erythreus [E-Mycin, Ethril, Ilosone, Pediamycin, erythromycin]</p><p><b>eritrocit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mature blood cell that contains hemoglobin to carry oxygen to the bodily tissues [RBC, red blood cell]</p><p><b>brzina kojom se crveni krvni stanice uspoređuju u krvnoj cijevi pod standardiziranim uvjetima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the rate at which red blood cells settle out in a tube of blood under standardized conditions [ESR, sed rate, sedimentation rate]</p><p><b>bilo koja tvar koja može uzrokovati lizu (uništenje) eritrocita (crvenih krvnih stanica) i oslobađanje njihovog hemoglobina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any substance that can cause lysis (destruction) of erythrocytes (red blood cells) and the release of their hemoglobin [erythrolysin, haemolysin, hemolysin]</p><p><b>bilo kakvo kožno oboljenje koje uključuje abnormalnu crvenilo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any skin disorder involving abnormal redness</p><p><b>koji se odnose na eritrocite (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to erythrocytes</p><p><b>bilo koja tvar koja može uzrokovati lizu (uništenje) eritrocita (crvenih krvnih stanica) i oslobađanje njihovog hemoglobina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any substance that can cause lysis (destruction) of erythrocytes (red blood cells) and the release of their hemoglobin [erythrocytolysin, haemolysin, hemolysin]</p><p><b>eritromicin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antibiotic (trade name Erythrocin or E-Mycin or Ethril or Ilosone or Pediamycin) obtained from the actinomycete Streptomyces erythreus [E-Mycin, Erythrocin, Ethril, Ilosone, Pediamycin]</p><p><b>višegodišnje žaruljaste biljke većine sjevernih Sjedinjenih Država: violeta sa zubom psa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial bulbous herbs most of northern United States: dogtooth violet [genus Erythronium]</p><p><b>Sjevernoamerički pasji zub s usamljenim bijelim cvijećem s žutim središtima i plavim ili ružičastim vanjskim dijelom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American dogtooth having solitary white flowers with yellow centers and blue or pink exteriors [blonde lilian, white dog's-tooth violet, white dogtooth violet]</p><p><b>U istočnoj Sjevernoj Americi, s jednim žutim cvijećem označenim smeđom ili ljubičastim i mrljano unutrašnjosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eastern North American dogtooth having solitary yellow flowers marked with brown or purple and spotted interiors [amberbell, trout lily, yellow adder's tongue]</p><p><b>Kalifornijskog violeta sa kremastim bijelim cvijećem, ponekad žuto-tinkiranim. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> California dogtooth violet with creamy white flowers sometimes yellow-tinged [fawn lily]</p><p><b>čvrsti europski pasji zub s ružastom do ljubičastim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sturdy European dogtooth with rose to mauve flowers [European dogtooth]</p><p><b>crvena violeta s žutim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dogtooth violet of western North America having bright yellow flowers [glacier lily, snow lily]</p><p><b>višegodišnje biljke s velikim bijelim cvijećem označenim narančastom bojom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial herb having large white flowers marked with orange [avalanche lily]</p><p><b>proces proizvodnje crvenih krvnih stanica od matičnih stanica u koštanoj srži (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of producing red blood cells by the stem cells in the bone marrow</p><p><b>od ili povezane s stvaranjem crvenih krvnih stanica (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the formation of red blood cells</p><p><b>eritropoietin, eritropoetin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a glycoprotein secreted by the kidneys that stimulates the production of red blood cells</p><p><b>rod biljaka redom Geraniales (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of plants of order Geraniales [family Erythroxylaceae]</p><p><b>veliki rod južnoameričkih grmova i malih stabala iz obitelji Erythroxylaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large genus of South American shrubs and small trees of the family Erythroxylaceae [Erythroxylum, genus Erythroxylon, genus Erythroxylum]</p><p><b>Južnoamerički grm čije lišće žvače domoroci u Andima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a South American shrub whose leaves are chewed by natives of the Andes [coca, coca plant]</p><p><b>Južnoamerički grm čiji su lišće izvor kokaina. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a South American shrub whose leaves are a source of cocaine</p><p><b>veliki rod južnoameričkih grmova i malih stabala iz obitelji Erythroxylaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large genus of South American shrubs and small trees of the family Erythroxylaceae [Erythroxylon, genus Erythroxylon, genus Erythroxylum]</p><p><b>Es, atomski broj 99, einsteinij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a radioactive transuranic element produced by bombarding plutonium with neutrons [E, atomic number 99, einsteinium]</p><p><b>fizičar počast za napredak u elektronici čvrstog stanja (rođen u Japanu 1925) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> physicist honored for advances in solid state electronics (born in Japan in 1925) [Leo Esaki]</p><p><b>(Stari zavjet) najstariji sin Izaka koji bi naslijedio zavjet koji je Bog sklopio s Abrahamom i koji je Abraham dao Izaku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Old Testament) the eldest son of Isaac who would have inherited the covenant that God made with Abraham and that Abraham passed on to Isaac</p><p><b>mala eskadrila., letjelica koja obično sadrži šest zrakoplova (kao u Francuskoj tijekom Prvog svjetskog rata) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small squadron</p><p><i>n.</i> an air force squadron typically containing six airplanes (as in France during World War I)</p><p><b>juriš</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an act of scaling by the use of ladders (especially the walls of a fortification)</p><p><i>v.</i> climb up and over</p><p><b>juriš (od &quot;escalade&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who gains access by the use of ladders</p><p><b>eskalirati, intenzivirati, pojačati, intenzivirati se, pojačati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> increase in extent or intensity [intensify, step up]</p><p><b>eskalacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an increase to counteract a perceived discrepancy</p><p><b>eskalator, pomične mehaničke stepenice, pokretne stepenice, pokretne stube, pomične stepenice, pomične stube</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clause in a contract that provides for an increase or a decrease in wages or prices or benefits etc. depending on certain conditions (as a change in the cost of living index) [escalator clause]</p><p><i>n.</i> a stairway whose steps move continuously on a circulating belt [moving staircase, moving stairway]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, "odjeljak" znači dio ugovora koji se odnosi na određene odredbe koje se odnose na određene odredbe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clause in a