m 4. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 5. stavkom 3. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 5. stavkom 3. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mutual fund that is traded on a stock exchange [exchange traded fund]</p><p><b>diuretik (trgovinski naziv Edecrin) koji se koristi za liječenje edem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> diuretic (trade name Edecrin) used to treat edema [Edecrin]</p><p><b>vojnik američke revolucije čije su trupe pomogle da se osvoji Fort Ticonderoga od Britanaca (1738-1789) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a soldier of the American Revolution whose troops helped capture Fort Ticonderoga from the British (1738-1789) [Allen]</p><p><b>acetaldehid, etanal</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless volatile water-soluble liquid aldehyde used chiefly in the manufacture of acetic acid and perfumes and drugs [acetaldehyde]</p><p><b>paraldehid, trimetiltrioksan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless liquid (a cyclic trimer of acetaldehyde) that is used as a sedative and a solvent [paraldehyde]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless solid amide of acetic acid used as a solvent and in the synthesis of organic compounds [acetamide]</p><p><b>etan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless odorless alkane gas used as fuel [C2H6]</p><p><b>toksična bezbožna kristalična organska kiselina koja se nalazi u oksali i drugim biljkama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a toxic colorless crystalline organic acid found in oxalis and other plants [oxalic acid]</p><p><b>etilen-glikol, glikol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sweet but poisonous syrupy liquid used as an antifreeze and solvent [ethylene glycol, glycol]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a salt or ester of acetic acid [acetate]</p><p><b>bezbožna žestoka tekućina koja se široko koristi u proizvodnji plastike i lijekova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless pungent liquid widely used in manufacturing plastics and pharmaceuticals [acetic acid]</p><p><b>etanol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the intoxicating agent in fermented and distilled liquors [ethyl alcohol, fermentation alcohol, grain alcohol]</p><p><b>bezbojan tekući acil-hlorid (CH3COCl) koji ima oštar miris (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> colorless liquid acyl chloride (CH3COCl) that has a pungent odor [acetyl chloride]</p><p><b>organska skupina sirćetne kiseline (CH3CO-) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the organic group of acetic acid (CH3CO-) [acetyl, acetyl group, acetyl radical, ethanoyl radical]</p><p><b>organska skupina sirćetne kiseline (CH3CO-) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the organic group of acetic acid (CH3CO-) [acetyl, acetyl group, acetyl radical, ethanoyl group]</p><p><b>blag sedativ-hipnotički lijek (trgovinski naziv Placidyl) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mild sedative-hypnotic drug (trade name Placidyl) [Placidyl]</p><p><b>Američka glumica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States actress [Barrymore]</p><p><b>Pjevačica iz Sjedinjenih Država koja se pojavila u nekoliko glazbenih komedija (1909-1984) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States singer who appeared in several musical comedies (1909-1984) [Merman]</p><p><b>Američka glumica i pjevačica (1896-1977) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States actress and singer (1896-1977) [Waters]</p><p><b>Anglosaksonski kralj Kenta kojeg je sveti Augustin preobratio u kršćanstvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Anglo-Saxon king of Kent who was converted to Christianity by Saint Augustine</p><p><b>Kralj Engleske koji je naslijedio prijestolje nakon što je njegov polubrat Edward mučenik ubijen., kralj Wessexa i Kenta i stariji brat Alfreda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> king of the English who succeeded to the throne after his half-brother Edward the Martyr was murdered [Ethelred II, Ethelred the Unready]</p><p><i>n.</i> king of Wessex and Kent and elder brother of Alfred [Ethelred I]</p><p><b>kralj Wessexa i Kenta i stariji brat Alfreda. (M