tic]</p><p><b>Švicarski matematičar (1707-1783) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Swiss mathematician (1707-1783) [Leonhard Euler]</p><p><b>pohvali formalno i elokventno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> praise formally and eloquently [eulogize]</p><p><b>govornik koji govori pohvale ili panegirike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an orator who delivers eulogies or panegyrics [panegyrist]</p><p><b>formalno izražavanje pohvale (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> formally expressing praise [encomiastic, panegyric, panegyrical]</p><p><b>formalni izraz hvale za nekoga tko je nedavno umro (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a formal expression of praise for someone who has died recently [eulogy]</p><p><b>hvaliti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> praise formally and eloquently [eulogise]</p><p><b>hvalospjev, panegirik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a formal expression of praise for someone who has died recently [eulogium]</p><p><i>n.</i> a formal expression of praise [encomium, paean, panegyric, pean]</p><p><b>Novi svijet skini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> New World skinks [genus Eumeces]</p><p><b>Često živi u hrastovitim i borovim staništima u stjenovitim planinskim područjima jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> frequents oak and pine habitats in rocky mountainous areas of United States southwest and Mexico [mountain skink]</p><p><b>nalazi se u zapadnoj Sjevernoj Americi na travnjama i otvorenim šumama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> found in western North American grasslands and open woodlands [western skink]</p><p><b>Vespovi-mašoni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mason wasps [genus Eumenes]</p><p><b>(klasična mitologija) odvratna zmijska kosa čudovišta (obično tri u broju) koji progone nekažnjeni kriminalci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (classical mythology) the hideous snake-haired monsters (usually three in number) who pursued unpunished criminals [Erinyes, Fury]</p><p><b>morski lavovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sea lions [genus Eumetopias]</p><p><b>najveći morski lav (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> largest sea lion [Steller's sea lion, 