ces) capable of being volatilized [vaporific, vaporizable, vapourific, vapourisable, volatilisable, volatilizable]</p><p><b>isparavati, evaporirati, hlapiti, hlapjeti, ishlapiti, ishlapjeti, ispariti, vaporizirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> lose or cause to lose liquid by vaporization leaving a more concentrated residue [vaporise, vaporize]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to change into a vapor [vaporise]</p><p><i>v.</i> change into a vapor [vaporise]</p><p><i>v.</i> become less intense and fade away gradually [disappear, melt]</p><p><b>odvod u obliku pare (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> drawn off in the form of vapor</p><p><b>mlijeko koncentrirano isparavanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> milk concentrated by evaporation</p><p><b>ishlapljivanje, isparavanje, isparivanje, uparivanje, hlapljenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of becoming a vapor [vapor, vaporisation, vaporization, vapour]</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of extracting moisture [dehydration, desiccation, drying up]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na ili uzrokuju ili su uzrokovani isparavanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or causing or being caused by evaporation</p><p><b>S druge strane, za proizvodnju električnih vozila s motorom za vožnju: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cooling system that cools by evaporation</p><p><b>sediment koji ostaje nakon isparavanja morske vode (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sediment that is left after the evaporation of seawater</p><p><b>Instrument koji mjeri brzinu isparivanja vode (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instrument that measures rate of evaporation of water [atmometer]</p><p><b>Francuski matematičar koji je opisao uvjete za rješavanje polinomnih jednačina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French mathematician who described the conditions for solving polynomial equations [Galois]</p><p><b>izbjegavanje, izgovor, odstupanje, skretanje, utaja, neplaćanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a statement that is not literally false but that cleverly avoids an unpleasant truth [equivocation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the deliberate act of faili