as, images, representations, expressions) characterized by perfect conformity to fact or truth [accurate, precise]</p><p><b>Kladim se da možeš izabrati prvog i drugog u pravom redoslijedu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bet that you can pick the first and second finishers in the right order [perfecta]</p><p><b>koji iziskuje, pretjeran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having complicated nutritional requirements [fastidious]</p><p><i>adj.</i> severe and unremitting in making demands [stern, strict]</p><p><i>adj.</i> requiring precise accuracy [exigent]</p><p><b>strogost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> act of demanding or levying by force or authority</p><p><b>točnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being exact [exactness]</p><p><b>baš tako, sasvim tako, tako je, taman, točno, upravo, upravo tako, upravo toliko, precizno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> indicating exactness or preciseness [just, precisely, properly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> just as it should be [on the button, on the dot, on the nose, precisely]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a precise manner [incisively, precisely]</p><p><b>točnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being exact [exactitude]</p><p><b>rod tropskih azijskih i afričkih biljaka: osobito perzijske ljubičice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of tropical Asiatic and African plants: especially Persian violets [genus Exacum]</p><p><b>višegodišnja biljka koja se uzgaja posebno kao kućna biljka zbog mirisnih plavičasto-tamnolavandarskih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial cultivated especially as a houseplant for its fragrant bluish to dark lavender flowers [Persian violet]</p><p><b>rod gmizavaca iz podjele Cynodontia (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of reptiles of the division Cynodontia [genus Exaeretodon]</p><p><b>pretjerati, pretjerivati, preuveličati, preuveličavati, hiperbolizirati, napuhati, napuhavati, napuhivati, napuhnuti, pretjeravati, uveličati, uveličavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> to enlarge beyond bounds or the truth [amplify, hyperbolise, hyperbolize, magnify, overdraw, overstate]</p