performance]</p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) the process of carrying out an instruction by a computer [instruction execution]</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) the completion of a legal instrument (such as a contract or deed) by signing it (and perhaps sealing and delivering it) so that it becomes legally binding and enforceable [execution of instrument]</p><p><i>n.</i> a routine court order that attempts to enforce the judgment that has been granted to a plaintiff by authorizing a sheriff to carry it out [writ of execution]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of accomplishing some aim or executing some order [carrying out, implementation]</p><p><i>n.</i> unlawful premeditated killing of a human being by a human being [murder, slaying]</p><p><b>(zakon) dovršetak pravnog instrumenta (kao što je ugovor ili listina) potpisivanjem (i možda zapečaćivanjem i isporukom) kako bi postao pravno obvezujući i izvršiv (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) the completion of a legal instrument (such as a contract or deed) by signing it (and perhaps sealing and delivering it) so that it becomes legally binding and enforceable [execution]</p><p><b>prodaja imovine od strane šerifa na temelju sudskog naloga o izvršenju kako bi se zadovoljila neplaćena obveza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sale of property by the sheriff under authority of a court's writ of execution in order satisfy an unpaid obligation [forced sale, judicial sale, sheriff's sale]</p><p><b>(računalnička znanost) brzina kojom računarski uređaj može izvršiti upute (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) the speed with which a computational device can execute instructions</p><p><b>dželat, izvršitelj, krvnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an official who inflicts capital punishment in pursuit of a warrant [public executioner]</p><p><b>izvršan, izvršni, izvršni program, izvršno tijelo, rukovoditelj, izvršni direktor, izvršna vlast, administrator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person responsible for the administration of a business [executive director]</p><p><i>n.</i> persons who administer the law</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who manages a government agency or department [administrator]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having the function of carrying out plans or orders etc.</p><p><b>Agencija izvršne vlasti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency of the executive branch of government</p><p><b>Podružnica vlade Sjedinjenih Država koja je odgovorna za provođenje zakona. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of the United States government that is responsible for carrying out the laws [Executive Office of the President]</p><p><b>ovlast (obično predsjednika ili guvernera) da pomiluje ili pomakne kaznu nekoga osuđenog u toj nadležnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the power (usually of a president or governor) to pardon or commute the sentence of someone convicted in that jurisdiction</p><p><b>Vijeće koje dijeli vrhovnu izvršnu vlast. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a council that shares the supreme executive power</p><p><b>savezni odjel u izvršnoj vlasti vlade Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a federal department in the executive branch of the government of the United States</p><p><b>izvršni direktor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person responsible for the administration of a business [executive]</p><p><b>Podružnica vlade Sjedinjenih Država koja je odgovorna za provođenje zakona. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of the United States government that is responsible for carrying out the laws [executive branch]</p><p><b>direktor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the officer second in command</p><p><b>izvedbeni program, izvršni program</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a program that controls the execution of other programs [supervisor, supervisory program]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a routine that coordinates the operation of subroutines [supervisory routine]</p><p><b>Sekretar koji ima administrativne dužnosti i odgovornosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a secretary having administrative duties and responsibilities</p><p><b>sjednica (obično