onger in existence [nonextant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of e.g. volcanos) permanently inactive</p><p><i>adj.</i> being out or having grown cold [out]</p><p><b>ekstinkcija, gašenje, istrebljenje, izumiranje, slabljenje, ugasnulost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> no longer active</p><p><i>n.</i> no longer in existence [defunctness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the reduction of the intensity of radiation as a consequence of absorption and radiation</p><p><i>n.</i> complete annihilation [extermination]</p><p><i>n.</i> a conditioning process in which the reinforcer is removed and a conditioned response becomes independent of the conditioned stimulus [experimental extinction]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of extinguishing [extinguishing, quenching]</p><p><b>kut od svoje osi koji kristal mora okrenuti prije nego što se pojavi maksimalno tamno kada se gleda u polariziranom svjetlu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the angle from its axis that a crystal must be rotated before appearing maximally dark when viewed in polarized light [angle of extinction]</p><p><b>gasiti, pogasiti, samogasiv, ugasiti, ugasiti vatru, uništiti, utrnuti, eliminirati, odbaciti, odbacivati, riješiti se, rješavati se, ukidati, ukinuti, desetkovati, istrijebiti, pobiti, potući, poubijati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put an end to [snuff out]</p><p><i>v.</i> put out, as of fires, flames, or lights [blow out, quench, snuff out]</p><p><i>v.</i> extinguish by crushing [crush out, press out, stub out]</p><p><i>v.</i> terminate, end, or take out [do away with, eliminate, get rid of]</p><p><i>v.</i> kill in large numbers [annihilate, carry off, decimate, eliminate, eradicate, wipe out]</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je to primjena iz članka 4. stavka 1. točke (a) ovog poglavlja, točka (a) ovog članka ne vrijedi za proizvodnju proizvoda koji sadrže: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being extinguished or killed</p><p><b>gasiti, pogasiti, samogasiv, ugasiti, ugasiti vatru, uništiti, utrnuti (od &quot;extinguish&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of a conditioned response</p><p><b>aparat za gašenje, aparat za gašenje požara, gasilo za svijeću, sprava za gašenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a manually operated device for extinguishing small fires [asphyxiator, fire extinguisher]</p><p><b>gašenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of extinguishing [extinction, quenching]</p><p><b>koji je sposoban za potpuno uništenje ili uništenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being totally destroyed or wiped out [exterminable]</p><p><b>iskorijeniti, istrijebiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> destroy completely, as if down to the roots [eradicate, exterminate, root out, uproot]</p><p><i>v.</i> pull up by or as if by the roots [deracinate, root out, uproot]</p><p><i>v.</i> surgically remove (an organ)</p><p><b>istrebljenje, ablacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> surgical removal of a body part or tissue [ablation, cutting out, excision]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of pulling up or out [deracination, excision]</p><p><b>hvaliti, uznositi, veličati, glorificirati, slaviti, uznijeti, uzvisiti, uzvisivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> praise, glorify, or honor [exalt, glorify, laud, proclaim]</p><p><b>netko tko prenosi visoku pohvalu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who communicates high praise [laudator, lauder]</p><p><b>pohvala</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expression of approval and commendation [congratulations, kudos, praise]</p><p><b>iznuditi, iznuđivati, iscijediti, mučiti, podvaliti, zavrtanje</b></p><p><i>v.</i> obtain through intimidation</p><p><i>v.</i> obtain by coercion or intimidation [gouge, rack, squeeze, wring]</p><p><i>v.</i> get or cause to become in a difficult or laborious manner [wring from]</p><p><b>iznuda, iznuđivanje, otimanje, ucjena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exorbitant charge</p><p><i>n.</i> unjust exaction (as by the misuse of authority)</p><p><i>n.</i> the felonious act of extorting money (as by threats of violence)</p><p><b>iznuđivački, lihvarski, otimački, prekomjeran, pretjeran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> greatly exceeding bounds of reason or moderation [exorbitant, outrageous, steep, unconscionable, usurious]</p><p><b>iznuđivački, lihvarski, otimački, pretjerano</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to an exorbitant degree [exorbitantly, usuriously]</p><p><b>gulikoža, iznuđivač, otimač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a criminal who extorts money from someone by threatening to expose embarrassing information about them [blackmailer, extortionist]</p><p><b>kriminal koji od nekoga iznudi novac prijeteći da će otkriti sramotne informacije o njemu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a criminal who extorts money from someone by threatening to expose embarrassing information about them [blackmailer, extortioner]</p><p><b>dodatak, dodatan, dodatkom, dodatni, dodatno, ekstra, izvanredan, naročito, poseban, posebno, preko broja, više, zaseban</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a minor actor in crowd scenes [spear carrier, supernumerary]</p><p><i>n.</i> an additional edition of a newspaper (usually to report a crisis)</p><p><i>n.</i> something additional of the same kind [duplicate]</p><p><i>adj.</i> more than is needed, desired, or required [excess, redundant, spare, supererogatory, superfluous, supernumerary, surplus]</p><p><i>adj.</i> added to a regular schedule [special]</p><p><i>adj.</i> further or added [additional]</p><p><i>adv.</i> unusually or exceptionally</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ovog članka, poduzeća mogu imati: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dividend paid in addition to the regular dividend</p><p><b>produženje igre dok jedna ekipa nije ispred na kraju ininga. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> overtime play until one team is ahead at the end of an inning</p><p><b>veličina odjeće za vrlo veliku osobu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a garment size for a very large person</p><p><b>U američkom nogometu bod dodijeljen za uspješan udarac nakon dodira. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in American football a point awarded for a successful place kick following a touchdown [point after, point after touchdown]</p><p><b>produžetak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> playing time beyond regulation, to break a tie [overtime]</p><p><b>operacija katarakte u kojoj se uklanja samo prednja strana leće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cataract surgery in which only the front of the lens is removed</p><p><b>koji se nalaze ili javljaju izvan stanice ili stanica (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> located or occurring outside a cell or cells</p><p><b>tekućine koje sadrže proteine i elektrolite uključujući tekućinu u krvnoj plazmi i intersticijalnu tekućinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> liquid containing proteins and electrolytes including the liquid in blood plasma and interstitial fluid [ECF]</p><p><b>crpiti, ekstrakt, iscijediti, istisnuti, iščupati, izbor iz knjige, izdvajanje, izdvojiti, izlučiti, izvadak, izvaditi, izvod, izvući, načiniti izvadak, načiniti izvadak iz knjige, odlomak, polučiti, sažetak, sažeti, destilirati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a solution obtained by steeping or soaking a substance (usually in water) [infusion]</p><p><i>n.</i> a passage selected from a larger work [excerpt, excerption, selection]</p><p><i>v.</i> remove, usually with some force or effort [draw out, pull, pull out, pull up, rip out, take out, tear out]</p><p><i>v.</i> get despite difficulties or obstacles</p><p><i>v.</i> deduce (a principle) or construe (a meaning) [draw out, educe, elicit, evoke]</p><p><i>v.</i> extract by the process of distillation [distil, distill]</p><p><i>v.</i> separate (a metal) from an ore</p><p><i>v.</i> obtain from a substance, as by mechanical action [express, press out]</p><p><i>v.</i> take out of a literary work in order to cite or copy [excerpt, take out]</p><p><i>v.</i> calculate the root of a number</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mas.% ili većim od 0,15 mas.% (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being extracted [extractible]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mas.% ili većim od 0,15 mas.% (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being extracted [extractable]</p><p><b>ekstrakcija, izlučivanje, izolacija, izvadak, izvlačenje, izvod, porijeklo, vađenje, podrijetlo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of obtaining something from a mixture or compound by chemical or physical or mechanical means</p><p><i>n.</i> properties attributable to your ancestry [descent, origin]</p><p><i>n.</i> the action of taking out something (especially using effort or force)</p><p><b>ekstrator, ekstraktor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instrument for extracting tight-fitting components</p><p><i>n.</i> an apparatus that uses centrifugal force to separate particles from a suspension [centrifuge, separator]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanism in a firearm that pulls an empty shell case out of the chamber and passes it to the ejector [cartridge extractor, cartridge remover]</p><p><b>izvan redovnog akademskog programa, izvan redovnih dužnosti vašeg posla ili profesije, karakterizira se preljubom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> outside the regular academic curriculum</p><p><i>adj.</i> outside the regular duties of your job or profession</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by adultery [adulterous, extramarital]</p><p><b>Obrazovni programi koji nisu obuhvaćeni redovnim nastavnim planovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> educational activities not falling within the scope of the regular curriculum</p><p><b>izručiti, deportirati, ekstradirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> hand over to the authorities of another country [deliver, deport]</p><p><b>ekstradicija, izručenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the surrender of an accused or convicted person by one state or country to another (usually under the provisions of a statute or treaty)</p><p><b>vanjska krivulja luka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the exterior curve of an arch</p><p><b>na ili izvan dure mater (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> on or outside the dura mater [epidural]</p><p><b>izvan ili izvan galaksije (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> outside or beyond a galaxy</p><p><b>(astronomija) zbirka zvjezdanih sustava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (astronomy) a collection of star systems [galaxy]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se ne provede u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> beyond the usual course of legal proceedings</p><p><b>Ne regulisano ili sankcionirano zakonom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not regulated or sanctioned by law [nonlegal]</p><p><b>Ne uključen u područje jezika (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not included within the realm of language</p><p><b>vanbračni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by adultery [adulterous, extracurricular]</p><p><b>spolni odnos između osoba koje nisu u braku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sexual intercourse between individuals who are not married to one another [free love]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> carried on outside the bounds of an institution or community</p><p><b>dalek, stran, tuđ</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not pertinent to the matter under consideration [immaterial, impertinent, orthogonal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not essential</p><p><i>adj.</i> not belonging to that in which it is contained [foreign]</p><p><i>adj.</i> coming from the outside [external, outside]</p><p><b>dalek, stran, tuđ (od &quot;extraneous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> unrelatedness by virtue of falling outside the matter at hand</p><p><b>izvanredni u određenom svojstvu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> extraordinary in a particular capacity</p><p><b>izvanredno, neobično, posebno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> extremely [inordinately]</p><p><b>kvaliteta iznimnosti i neobičnog susreta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being extraordinary and not commonly encountered</p><p><b>izuzetan, izuzetne, izuzetnim, izvanredan, izvanredna, izvanredno, neobičan, neobično, neredovit, poseban</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> beyond what is ordinary or usual</p><p><i>adj.</i> far more than usual or expected [over-the-top, sinful]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of an official) serving an unusual or special function in addition to those of the regular officials</p><p><b>ekstra polirati, procijeniti vrijednost izvan područja poznatih vri, generalizirati, uopćiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> draw from specific cases for more general cases [generalise, generalize, infer]</p><p><i>v.</i> estimate the value of [interpolate]</p><p><i>v.</i> gain knowledge of (an area not known or experienced) by extrapolating</p><p><b>ekstrapolacija, procijeniti vrijednost izvan područja zadanih vrij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) calculation of the value of a function outside the range of known values</p><p><i>n.</i> an inference about the future (or about some hypothetical situation) based on known facts and observations</p><p><b>Čini se da je izvan normalnih osjetilnih kanala. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> seemingly outside normal sensory channels [paranormal]</p><p><b>esp, vidovitost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> apparent power to perceive things that are not present to the senses [E.S.P., ESP, clairvoyance, second sight]</p><p><b>preuranjena sistola koja rezultira trenutačnom srčanom aritmijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a premature systole resulting in a momentary cardiac arrhythmia</p><p><b>za vrijeme ekstrasystole ili u vezi s njom ili tijekom nje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or happening during an extrasystole</p><p><b>izvanzemaljski, izvanzemaljac, vanzemaljac, vanzemaljski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of life assumed to exist outside the Earth or its atmosphere [alien, extraterrestrial being]</p><p><i>adj.</i> originating or located or occurring outside Earth or its atmosphere</p><p><b>izvanzemaljac, vanzemaljac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of life assumed to exist outside the Earth or its atmosphere [alien, extraterrestrial]</p><p><b>nebeski objekt, nebesko tijelo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a natural object existing outside the earth and outside the earth's atmosphere [estraterrestrial body]</p><p><b>izvan teritorijalnih granica ili nadležnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> outside territorial limits or jurisdiction [exterritorial]</p><p><b>trudnoća koja je rezultat trudnoće na drugom mjestu od maternice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pregnancy resulting from gestation elsewhere than in the uterus [eccyesis, ectopic gestation, ectopic pregnancy, extrauterine pregnancy, metacyesis]</p><p><b>trudnoća koja je rezultat trudnoće na drugom mjestu od maternice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pregnancy resulting from gestation elsewhere than in the uterus [eccyesis, ectopic gestation, ectopic pregnancy, extrauterine gestation, metacyesis]</p><p><b>ekstravagancija, nastranost, neumjerenost, prekomjernost, pretjeranost, pretjerivanje, rasipnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of exceeding the appropriate limits of decorum or probability or truth [extravagancy]</p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of spending extravagantly [prodigality, profligacy]</p><p><i>n.</i> excessive spending [high life, highlife, lavishness, prodigality]</p><p><b>kvaliteta premašavanja odgovarajućih granica pristojnosti ili vjerojatnosti ili istine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of exceeding the appropriate limits of decorum or probability or truth [extravagance]</p><p><b>ekstravagantan, nastran, neobičan, rasipan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> unrestrained, especially with regard to feelings [excessive, exuberant, overweening]</p><p><i>adj.</i> recklessly wasteful [prodigal, profligate, spendthrift]</p><p><b>obilan</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an abundant manner [abundantly, copiously, profusely]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a wasteful manner [lavishly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a rich and lavish manner [lavishly, richly]</p><p><b>burleska</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any lavishly staged or spectacular entertainment</p><p><b>eksplodirati, eruptirati, rigati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> force out or cause to escape from a proper vessel or channel</p><p><i>v.</i> become active and spew forth lava and rocks [belch, erupt]</p><p><i>v.</i> geology: cause molten material, such as lava, to pour forth</p><p><b>ekstravasirana tekućina (krv, limfa ili urin), (vulkanova) izlijevanje dima ili lave (ili naslaga tako formirana), Proces izlučivanja ili prolaska iz žile u okolna tkiva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an extravasated liquid (blood or lymph or urine)</p><p><i>n.</i> (of volcanos) pouring out fumes or lava (or a deposit so formed) [eructation, eruption]</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of exuding or passing out of a vessel into surrounding tissues</p><p><b>(psikološka) ekstrovertna narav (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) an extroverted disposition [extroversion]</p><p><b>usmjerena prema vanjskom području (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> directed outward [extroversive]</p><p><b>(psihologija) osoba koja se više bavi praktičnim stvarnostima nego unutarnjim mislima i osjećajima, - da se brine o socijalnom i fizičkom okruženju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) a person concerned more with practical realities than with inner thoughts and feelings [extrovert]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being concerned with the social and physical environment [extraverted, extravertive, extrovert, extroverted, extrovertive]</p><p><b>- da se brine o socijalnom i fizičkom okruženju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being concerned with the social and physical environment [extravert, extravertive, extrovert, extroverted, extrovertive]</p><p><b>- da se brine o socijalnom i fizičkom okruženju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being concerned with the social and physical environment [extravert, extraverted, extrovert, extroverted, extrovertive]</p><p><b>ekstrem, ekstreman, ekstremnih, ekstremnim, granični, krajnost, krajnji, ekstremne</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the furthest or highest degree of something</p><p><i>n.</i> the point located farthest from the middle of something [extreme point, extremum]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of the greatest possible degree or extent or intensity [utmost, uttermost]</p><p><i>adj.</i> far beyond a norm in quantity or amount or degree</p><p><i>adj.</i> beyond a norm in views or actions</p><p><i>adj.</i> most distant in any direction</p><p><b>Točka koja se nalazi najudaljenije od sredine nečega. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the point located farthest from the middle of something [extreme, extremum]</p><p><b>ekstremno konzervativni. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an extreme conservative [reactionary, ultraconservative]</p><p><b>katolički sakrament. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Catholic sacrament [anointing of the sick, last rites]</p><p><b>ekstermno, ekstremno, iznimne, iznimno, izrazito, izvanredno, jako, krajnje, krajnje mjere, neobično, veoma, vrlo</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to a high degree or extent [highly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> to an extreme degree [deathly, exceedingly, super]</p><p><b>ekstremno visoke frekvencije (30 do 300 GHz), krajnje visoke frekvencije, ehf</b></p><p><i>n.</i> 30 to 300 gigahertz [EHF]</p><p><b>ekstremno niske frekvencije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> below 3 kilohertz [ELF]</p><p><b>ekstrem, ekstreman, ekstremnih, ekstremnim, granični, krajnost, krajnji, ekstremne (od &quot;extreme&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being extreme</p><p><b>ekstremizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any political theory favoring immoderate uncompromising policies</p><p><b>ekstremist, politički ultraradikal, pristaša ekstremnih nazora</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who holds extreme views</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of opinions and actions) far beyond the norm [radical, ultra]</p><p><b>kraj, krajnost, krajnje mjere, vrh, vrhunac, završetak, ekstremitet, okrajina, periferija, ud</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an external body part that projects from the body [appendage, member]</p><p><i>n.</i> an extreme condition or state (especially of adversity or disease)</p><p><i>n.</i> the greatest or utmost degree</p><p><i>n.</i> the outermost or farthest region or point</p><p><i>n.</i> that part of a limb that is farthest from the torso</p><p><b>Točka koja se nalazi najudaljenije od sredine nečega., Najveći mogući iznos ili vrijednost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the point located farthest from the middle of something [extreme, extreme point]</p><p><i>n.</i> the most extreme possible amount or value [peak]</p><p><b>izbježiv, koji se može rasplesti, razmrsiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being extricated</p><p><b>izvući, oslobađati, osloboditi, rasplesti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> release from entanglement of difficulty [disencumber, disentangle, untangle]</p><p><b>Čin oslobađanja iz zaglavljenog stanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of releasing from a snarled or tangled condition [disentanglement, unsnarling, untangling]</p><p><b>ekstrinzičan, nepredviđen, neuobičajen, primjesni, vanjski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not forming an essential part of a thing or arising or originating from the outside</p><p><b>U slučaju da je osoba koja je podvrgnuta postupku u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka u pravnom sustavu u kojoj se nalazi sudski sud, podliježe postupku u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka, ili ako je sudski sud u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka, podliježe postupku u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fraud that prevents a party from knowing their rights or from having a fair opportunity of presenting them at trial [collateral fraud]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s ekstropijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to extropy</p><p><b>Predviđanje da će ljudska inteligencija i tehnologija omogućiti da se život organizira u cijelom svemiru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the prediction that human intelligence and technology will enable life to expand in an orderly way throughout the entire universe</p><p><b>Ne introspektivno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not introspective [extroverted]</p><p><b>(psikološka) ekstrovertna narav (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) an extroverted disposition [extraversion]</p><p><b>usmjerena prema vanjskom području (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> directed outward [extraversive]</p><p><b>ekstrovert</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) a person concerned more with practical realities than with inner thoughts and feelings [extravert]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being concerned with the social and physical environment [extravert, extraverted, extravertive, extroverted, extrovertive]</p><p><b>ekstrover