/p><p><i>v.</i> to express great joy [exult, jubilate, rejoice, triumph]</p><p><b>supstanca koja izlijeva iz porama biljaka, Ispuštanje (tečnost) u kapljicama ili malim količinama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a substance that oozes out from plant pores [exudation]</p><p><i>v.</i> release (a liquid) in drops or small quantities [exude, ooze, ooze out, transude]</p><p><b>lučenje, znojenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a substance that oozes out from plant pores [exudate]</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of exuding [transudation]</p><p><b>izlaziti, izlučivati se, lučiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> release (a liquid) in drops or small quantities [exudate, ooze, ooze out, transude]</p><p><i>v.</i> make apparent by one's mood or behavior</p><p><b>kliktati, likovati, trijumfirati, radovati se, veseliti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> feel extreme happiness or elation [be on cloud nine, jump for joy, walk on air]</p><p><i>v.</i> to express great joy [exuberate, jubilate, rejoice, triumph]</p><p><b>radosni i ponosni posebno zbog trijumfa ili uspjeha (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> joyful and proud especially because of triumph or success [exulting, jubilant, prideful, rejoicing, triumphal, triumphant]</p><p><b>U radosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an exultant manner [exultingly]</p><p><b>likovanje, zanos</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of extreme joy [jubilance, jubilancy, jubilation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the utterance of sounds expressing great joy [jubilation, rejoicing]</p><p><b>kliktati, likovati, trijumfirati (od &quot;exult&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> joyful and proud especially because of triumph or success [exultant, jubilant, prideful, rejoicing, triumphal, triumphant]</p><p><b>U radosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an exultant manner [exultantly]</p><p><b>naseljeno područje izvan grada i izvan predgrađa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a residential area outside of a city and beyond suburbia</p><p><b>odbačene kože ili prekrića različitih organizama tijekom ekdise (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cast-off skins or coverings of various organisms during ecdysis</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s odbačenim kožama ili kožama raznih životinja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the cast-off skins or cuticles of various animals</p><p><b>linjati se, mitariti se, olinjati se, presvlačiti, presvući</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cast off hair, skin, horn, or feathers [molt, moult, shed, slough]</p><p><b>slijepo ili gnijezdano sokola (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unfledged or nestling hawk</p><p><b>Jan van Eyck</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Flemish painter who was a founder of the Flemish school of painting and who pioneered modern techniques of oil painting (1390-1441) [Jan van Eyck, van Eyck]</p><p><b>gledati, oko, pogled, uška, oka, centar, sredina, središte, ušica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the organ of sight [oculus, optic]</p><p><i>n.</i> good discernment (either visually or as if visually)</p><p><i>n.</i> attention to what is seen</p><p><i>n.</i> an area that is approximately central within some larger region [center, centre, heart, middle]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small hole or loop (as in a needle)</p><p><i>v.</i> look at [eyeball]</p><p><b>očna banka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a place for storing and preserving corneas that are obtained from human corpses immediately after death</p><p><b>Refleks koji brzo zatvara i otvara oči. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a reflex that closes and opens the eyes rapidly [blink, blinking, nictation, nictitation, wink, winking]</p><p><b>vizualne slike koje su ugodne za gledanje, ali koje nisu intelektualno zahtjevne (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> visual images that are pleasing to see but are intellectually undemanding</p><p><b>grafikon koji se čita s fiksne udaljenosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chart that is read from a fixed distance</p><p><b>bolnica u kojoj se specijalisti brinu o očima pacijenta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clinic where specialist care for a patient's eyes</p><p><b>stanje optičkih svojstava oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of the optical properties of the eye</p><p><b>kontakt očima</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a meeting of the eyes between two people that expresses meaningful nonverbal communication</p><p><i>n.</i> contact that occurs when two people look directly at each other</p><p><b>mali žilac s obronkom zakrivljenim kako bi se uklonio u orbitu oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small vessel with a rim curved to fit the orbit of the eye [eyebath, eyecup]</p><p><b>upotreba pogrešnih slovara za prepoznavanje govornika koji govori kolokvijalno ili neobrazovan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the use of misspellings to identify a colloquial or uneducated speaker</p><p><b>bilo kakva bolest oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any disease of the eye</p><p><b>liječnik specijaliziran za dijagnozu i liječenje bolesti oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a medical doctor specializing in the diagnosis and treatment of diseases of the eye [oculist, ophthalmologist]</p><p><b>kapaljka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pipet consisting of a small tube with a vacuum bulb at one end for drawing liquid in and releasing it a drop at a time [dropper]</p><p><b>ječmenac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an infection of the sebaceous gland of the eyelid [hordeolum, sty, stye]</p><p><b>masku koja pokriva gornji dio lica, ali s rupama za oči (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mask covering the upper part of the face but with holes for the eyes [domino, half mask]</p><p><b>kretanje pogleda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the movement of the eyes</p><p><b>jedan od malih mišića oka koji služe za okretanje očnog globusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the small muscles of the eye that serve to rotate the eyeball [ocular muscle]</p><p><b>Egipatska boginja s lavom glavom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lion-headed Egyptian goddess [Sekhet]</p><p><b>alkoholno piće namijenjeno buđenju rano ujutro., Nešto iznenađujuće i otkrivajuće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an alcoholic drink intended to wake one up early in the morning</p><p><i>n.</i> something surprising and revealing</p><p><b>bilo koji kirurški zahvat koji uključuje oči (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any surgical procedure involving the eyes [eye surgery]</p><p><b>nedokladna rima (npr. `love' i `move') (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an imperfect rhyme (e.g., `love' and `move')</p><p><b>kostiju u lubanji koja sadrži očnu kuglu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the bony cavity in the skull containing the eyeball [cranial orbit, orbit, orbital cavity]</p><p><b>bilo koji kirurški zahvat koji uključuje oči (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any surgical procedure involving the eyes [eye operation]</p><p><b>jedan od četiri šiljčana konična zuba (dva u svakoj vilici) smještena između reznica i premolara (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the four pointed conical teeth (two in each jaw) located between the incisors and the premolars [canine, canine tooth, cuspid, dogtooth, eyetooth]</p><p><b>blistav pogled oka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a radiant glance of the eye</p><p><b>osobna ili stvarna osobnost koja privlači pažnju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a striking person or thing that attracts attention</p><p><b>atraktivan, privlačan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> seizing the attention [attention-getting]</p><p><b>stvarajući iluziju da vidite stvarnost. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> creating the illusion of seeing reality [trompe-l'oeil]</p><p><b>kap iz kapljice za oči, metoda za navodnjavanje oka koju koriste oftalmolozi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drop from an eye dropper [eyedrop]</p><p><i>n.</i> a method of irrigating the eye used by ophthalmologists [eyedrop]</p><p><b>losije koje se sastoje od rastvora koji se koristi kao sredstvo za čišćenje očiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lotion consisting of a solution used as a cleanser for the eyes [collyrium, eyewash]</p><p><b>Nevjerojatno impresivno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> amazingly impressive [dazzling, fulgurant, fulgurous]</p><p><b>kapsula u obliku kugle koja sadrži oko kičmenjaka, Pogledaj. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ball-shaped capsule containing the vertebrate eye [orb]</p><p><i>v.</i> look at [eye]</p><p><b>mali žilac s obronkom zakrivljenim kako bi se uklonio u orbitu oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small vessel with a rim curved to fit the orbit of the eye [eye cup, eyecup]</p><p><b>obrva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the arch of hair above each eye [brow, supercilium]</p><p><b>šminka koju daje kozmetička olovka koja se koristi za tamnjenje obrva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> makeup provided by a cosmetic pencil that is used to darken the eyebrows</p><p><b>mali žilac s obronkom zakrivljenim kako bi se uklonio u orbitu oka, (embriologija) dvostrana čaščasta depresija koja se razvija u pigmentirane i osjetilne slojeve mrežnjače (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small vessel with a rim curved to fit the orbit of the eye [eye cup, eyebath]</p><p><i>n.</i> (embryology) a two-walled cuplike depression that develops into the pigmented and sensory layers of the retina [optic cup]</p><p><b>s očima ili očima ili s osobinama nalik očima posebno kako je navedeno: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having an eye or eyes or eyelike feature especially as specified</p><p><b>svojstvo favoriziranja jednog oka nad drugim (kao u ciljanju) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of favoring one eye over the other (as in taking aim)</p><p><b>kap iz kapljice za oči, metoda za navodnjavanje oka koju koriste oftalmolozi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drop from an eye dropper [eye-drop]</p><p><i>n.</i> a method of irrigating the eye used by ophthalmologists [eye-drop]</p><p><b>osoba, privlačan znak, zrnce prašine</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strikingly beautiful woman</p><p><i>n.</i> a full view</p><p><b>leća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lens for correcting defective vision in one eye [monocle]</p><p><b>osoba koja nosi naočale kako bi bolje vidjela. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who wears spectacles in order to see better</p><p><b>naočale</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (plural) optical instrument consisting of a frame that holds a pair of lenses for correcting defective vision [glasses, specs, spectacles]</p><p><b>zirak, špijunka, športelin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hole (in a door or an oven etc) through which you can peep [peephole, spyhole]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small hole (usually round and finished around the edges) in cloth or leather for the passage of a cord or hook or bar [eyelet]</p><p><b>Član naroda Caddo sa sjeveroistočnog Teksasa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Caddo people of northeastern Texas</p><p><b>trepavica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the short curved hairs that grow from the edges of the eyelids [cilium, lash]</p><p><b>bez očiju, slijep</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking eyes or eyelike features</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking sight [sightless, unseeing]</p><p><b>bez očiju, slijep (od &quot;eyeless&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> blindness due to loss of the eyes</p><p><b>malen okrugli otvor, oko, omča, petlja, prozorčić na krovu, rupica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small hole (usually round and finished around the edges) in cloth or leather for the passage of a cord or hook or bar [eyehole]</p><p><i>n.</i> fastener consisting of a metal ring for lining a small hole to permit the attachment of cords or lines [cringle, grommet, grummet, loop]</p><p><b>očni kapak, kapak, vjeđa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two folds of skin that can be moved to cover or open the eye [lid, palpebra]</p><p><b>koji sugeriše oko ili oči (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> suggesting an eye or eyes</p><p><b>Make-up koji naglašava oblik očiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> makeup applied to emphasize the shape of the eyes</p><p><b>očni povez, povez</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a protective cloth covering for an injured eye [patch]</p><p><b>naočak, okular</b></p><p><i>n.</i> combination of lenses at the viewing end of optical instruments [ocular]</p><p><b>oči, očiju, očima, oka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> opinion or judgment</p><p><b>službena klasifikacija dokumenata (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> official classification for documents</p><p><b>vizir, šilt, štit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a brim that projects to the front to shade the eyes [bill, peak, visor, vizor]</p><p><b>maske koje se sastoje od kozmetičke tvari koja se koristi za tamnjenje očiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> makeup consisting of a cosmetic substance used to darken the eyes</p><p><b>pogled</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the range of the eye [view]</p><p><b>čulo vida, vid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> normal use of the faculty of vision [seeing, sightedness]</p><p><b>nagrđen</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something very ugly and offensive</p><p><b>Očevlježak (kao na krilima nekih leptira) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an eyelike marking (as on the wings of some butterflies) [ocellus]</p><p><b>Umoranost očiju uzrokovana dugotrajnim radom od strane osobe s nekorektnim problemima s vidom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tiredness of the eyes caused by prolonged close work by a person with an uncorrected vision problem [asthenopia]</p><p><b>očnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the four pointed conical teeth (two in each jaw) located between the incisors and the premolars [canine, canine tooth, cuspid, dogtooth, eye tooth]</p><p><b>prijevara, sprava za pranje očiju nakon nezgode</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lotion consisting of a solution used as a cleanser for the eyes [collyrium, eye-lotion]</p><p><b>očevidac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a spectator who can describe what happened</p><p><i>v.</i> be present at an event and see it with one's own eyes</p><p><b>jaguarundi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> long-bodied long-tailed tropical American wildcat [Felis yagouaroundi, jaguarondi, jaguarundi, jaguarundi cat]</p><p><b>Plitko slano jezero u južnoj središnjoj Australiji oko 35 metara ispod razine mora. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a shallow salt lake in south central Australia about 35 feet below sea level [Lake Eyre]</p><p><b>poluostrvo južne Australije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a peninsula of southern Australia</p><p><b>Visoko gnijezdo grabljive ptice (kao što je sokola ili orla), bilo koje naselje na visini. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the lofty nest of a bird of prey (such as a hawk or eagle) [aerie, aery, eyry]</p><p><i>n.</i> any habitation at a high altitude [aerie, aery, eyry]</p><p><b>100 aurara jednako je 1 kruni na Islandu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> 100 aurar equal 1 krona in Iceland</p><p><b>Visoko gnijezdo grabljive ptice (kao što je sokola ili orla), bilo koje naselje na visini. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the lofty nest of a bird of prey (such as a hawk or eagle) [aerie, aery, eyrie]</p><p><i>n.</i> any habitation at a high altitude [aerie, aery, eyrie]</p><p><b>britanski psiholog (rođen u Njemačkoj) poznat po svojim teorijama o inteligenciji i osobnosti i zbog svoje oštre kritike Freudianske psihoanalize (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a British psychologist (born in Germany) noted for his theories of intelligence and personality and for his strong criticism of Freudian psychoanalysis [H. J. Eysenck, Hans Eysenck, Hans Jurgen Eysenck]</p><p><b>Inventar osobnosti o samoproglašenju temeljen na Hans Eysenckovoj faktorskoj analizi osobnosti koja pretpostavlja tri osnovna faktora (dva najvažnija su ekstroverzija u introverziju i neurotizam) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a self-report personality inventory based on Hans Eysenck's factor analysis of personality which assumes three basic factors (the two most important being extraversion to introversion and neuroticism) [EPI]</p><p><b>Ezekiel</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Hebrew prophet of the 6th century BC who was exiled to Babylon in 587 BC [Ezekiel]</p><p><i>n.</i> an Old Testament book containing Ezekiel's prophecies of the downfall of Jerusalem and Judah and their subsequent restoration [Book of Ezekiel, Ezekiel]</p><p><b>z</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the 26th letter of the Roman alphabet [Z, izzard, z, zed, zee]</p><p><b>Ezekija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Old Testament) king of Judah who abolished idolatry (715-687 BC) [Hezekiah]</p><p><b>Ezekiel</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Hebrew prophet of the 6th century BC who was exiled to Babylon in 587 BC [Ezechiel]</p><p><i>n.</i> an Old Testament book containing Ezekiel's prophecies of the downfall of Jerusalem and Judah and their subsequent restoration [Book of Ezekiel, Ezechiel]</p><p><b>Drugi najveći od četiri glavna japanska otoka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second largest of the four main islands of Japan [Hokkaido, Yezo]</p><p><b>Azijski grm s vidljivim racemoznim ružnatim cvijećem koji se široko koristi kao ukras i za kontrolu erozije te kao izvor hrane za divlje ptice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Asian shrub having conspicuous racemose rose-purple flowers widely used as an ornamental and in erosion control and as a source of feed for wild birds [Lespedeza bicolor, bicolor lespediza]</p><p><b>Ezra</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Jewish priest and scribe sent by the Persian king to restore Jewish law and worship in Jerusalem</p><p><i>n.</i> an Old Testament book telling of a rabbi's efforts in the 5th century BC to reconstitute Jewish law and worship in Jerusalem after the Babylonian Captivity [Book of Ezra]</p><p><b>Američki poslovni čovjek koji je ujedinio telegrafni sustav u Sjedinjenim Državama i koji je 1865. (s Andrewom D. Whiteom) osnovao Cornell University (1807-1874) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States businessman who unified the telegraph system in the United States and who in 1865 (with Andrew D. White) founded Cornell University (1807-1874) [Cornell]</p><p><b>Američki pisac koji je živio u Europi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer who lived in Europe [Ezra Pound, Pound]</p><p><b>Američki pisac koji je živio u Europi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer who lived in Europe [Ezra Loomis Pound, Pound]</p><p><b>farad, f</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a degree on the Fahrenheit scale of temperature [degree Fahrenheit]</p><p><i>n.</i> a nonmetallic univalent element belonging to the halogens [atomic number 9, fluorine]</p><p><i>n.</i> the capacitance of a capacitor that has an equal and opposite charge of 1 coulomb on each plate and a voltage difference of 1 volt between the plates [farad]</p><p><i>n.</i> the 6th letter of the Roman alphabet</p><p><b>ključ koji stavlja F ispod srednjeg C na četvrtoj liniji štapova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clef that puts the F below middle C on the fourth line of a staff [bass clef]</p><p><b>Najviši region ionosfere (od 90 do 600 milja gore) koji sadrži najveću koncentraciju slobodnih elektrona i najkorisniji je za radio prijenos na daljinu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the highest region of the ionosphere (from 90 to 600 miles up) which contains the highest concentration of free electrons and is most useful for long-range radio transmission [Appleton layer, F region]</p><p><b>f-broj, f-broj. žarišni broj, omjer žarišne udaljenosti i otvora lece, f broj, fokalni broj, fokalni omjer, žarišni broj, žarišni omjer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of the focal length to the diameter of a (camera) lens system [focal ratio, speed, stop number]</p><p><b>Najviši region ionosfere (od 90 do 600 milja gore) koji sadrži najveću koncentraciju slobodnih elektrona i najkorisniji je za radio prijenos na daljinu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the highest region of the ionosphere (from 90 to 600 miles up) which contains the highest concentration of free electrons and is most useful for long-range radio transmission [Appleton layer, F layer]</p><p><b>32. predsjednik Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> 32nd President of the United States [FDR, Franklin Delano Roosevelt, Franklin Roosevelt, President Franklin Roosevelt, President Roosevelt, Roosevelt]</p><p><b>Kanadski fiziolog koji je otkrio insulin s C. H. Bestom i koji ga je koristio za liječenje dijabetesa ((1891-1941) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Canadian physiologist who discovered insulin with C. H. Best and who used it to treat diabetes(1891-1941) [Banting, Sir Frederick Grant Banting]</p><p><b>Američki pisac čiji su romani karakterizirali jazz doba u Sjedinjenim Državama (1896-1940) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States author whose novels characterized the Jazz Age in the United States (1896-1940) [Fitzgerald, Francis Scott Key Fitzgerald]</p><p><b>Tajni savezni sud stvoren 1978. godine Zakonom o nadzoru stranih obavještajnih službi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a secret federal court created in 1978 by the Foreign Intelligence Surveillance Act [Foreign Intelligence Surveillance Court]</p><p><b>sloj koji imenuje četvrtu (subdominantnu) notu dijatonske skale u solmizaciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the syllable naming the fourth (subdominant) note of the diatonic scale in solmization</p><p><b>beznačajni slogovi u refrenu pjesme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> meaningless syllables in the refrain of a partsong [fal la]</p><p><b>Agencija u Ministarstvu prometa koja je odgovorna za sigurnost civilnog zrakoplovstva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency in the Department of Transportation that is responsible for the safety of civilian aviation [Federal Aviation Administration]</p><p><b>basnoslovan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> extremely pleasing [fabulous]</p><p><b>velika obitelj stabala, grmova, loze i biljaka koji nose luske graha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large family of trees, shrubs, vines, and herbs bearing bean pods [Leguminosae, family Fabaceae, family Leguminosae, legume family, pea family]</p><p><b>Ruski zlatar poznat po stvaranju serije ljubiteljskih i emaliranih uskrsnih jaja za europsko kraljevstvo (1846-1920) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian goldsmith noted for creating a series of jeweled and enameled Easter eggs for European royalty (1846-1920) [Peter Carl Faberge]</p><p><b>član Fabianskog društva u Britaniji, od ili u vezi s Fabijanstvom, koristeći oprezan polagan strategiju da se iscrpi protivljenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Fabian Society in Britain</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Fabianism</p><p><i>adj.</i> using cautious slow strategy to wear down opposition</p><p><b>udruženje britanskih socijalista koji zagovaraju postupne reforme unutar zakona koje vode ka demokratskom socijalizmu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an association of British socialists who advocate gradual reforms within the law leading to democratic socialism</p><p><b>rod južnoameričkih i središnjeameričkih vječnozelenih grmova sličnih vrtu (MT)</b></p><p>