ing yellow pea-like flowers [Thermopsis macrophylla, golden pea, yellow pea]</p><p><b>rod grubih biljaka i potgreblja iz sušne Sjeverne i Južne Amerike s ružičastim ili crvenokrasnim cvijećima i globusnim plodovima, američka biljka rod Malvastrum (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of coarse herbs and subshrubs of arid North and South America having pink or scarlet flowers and globose fruits [globe mallow]</p><p><i>n.</i> an American plant of the genus Malvastrum</p><p><b>peronospora, plamenjača</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various fungi of the family Peronosporaceae parasitic on e.g. grapes and potatoes and melons [downy mildew]</p><p><b>Američke biljke koje su vrlo slične jastogom Starog svijeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> American plants closely resembling Old World mistletoe [mistletoe]</p><p><b>biljka s malim bijelim cvijećem koji visi u labavim grmovima na listnatim stabljikama, biljka u šumi s proljetnim cvjetovima i bijelom cvjetom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant with tiny white flowers hanging in loose clusters on leafy stems [Tiarella unifoliata, false mitrewort]</p><p><i>n.</i> stoloniferous white-flowered spring-blooming woodland plant [Tiarella cordifolia, coolwart, false mitrewort, foamflower]</p><p><b>biljka s malim bijelim cvijećem koji visi u labavim grmovima na listnatim stabljikama, biljka u šumi s proljetnim cvjetovima i bijelom cvjetom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant with tiny white flowers hanging in loose clusters on leafy stems [Tiarella unifoliata, false miterwort]</p><p><i>n.</i> stoloniferous white-flowered spring-blooming woodland plant [Tiarella cordifolia, coolwart, false miterwort, foamflower]</p><p><b>gljiva iz obitelji Helvellaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungus of the family Helvellaceae</p><p><b>ime koje je privremeno preuzeto (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a name that has been assumed temporarily [alias, assumed name]</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko cvjetnih korova rodova Boehmeria bez žarke dlake (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several flowering