znak sjećanja na uništenje hramova u Jeruzalemu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Judaism) a major fast day on the Jewish calendar commemorating the destruction of the temples in Jerusalem [Fast of Ab, Ninth of Ab, Ninth of Av, Tisha b'Ab, Tisha b'Av, Tishah b'Ab, Tishah b'Av]</p><p><b>(Judaizam) manji post 13. adara u znak sjećanja na tri dana postovanja koje je Ester obavila prije nego što se obratila perzijskom kralju u ime židovskog naroda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Judaism) a minor fast day on Adar 13 commemorates three days that Esther fasted before approaching the Persian king on behalf of the Jewish people</p><p><b>(Judaizam) mali post 3. tisri, u znak sjećanja na ubojstvo židovskog guvernera Judeje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Judaism) a minor fast day on Tishri 3 that commemorates the killing of the Jewish governor of Judah</p><p><b>(Judaizam) mali post na Tammuz 17 kada su zidovi Jeruzalema bili narušeni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Judaism) a minor fast day on Tammuz 17 when the walls of Jerusalem were breached</p><p><b>(Judaizam) mali post na Tevet 10 obilježava početak opsade Jeruzalema i također je proglašen danom sjećanja na šest milijuna Židova koji su poginuli u holokaustu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Judaism) a minor fast day on Tevet 10 commemorates the beginning of the siege of Jerusalem and has also been proclaimed a memorial day for the six million Jews who died in the Holocaust</p><p><b>(Judaizam) mali post 14. nisana koji se održavaju samo prvorođeni muškarci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Judaism) a minor fast day on Nissan 14 that is observed only by firstborn males</p><p><b>brz, trik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cunning or deceitful action or device [trick]</p><p><b>nuklearni reaktor u kojem su nuklearne fisije uzrokovane brzim neutronima jer se koristi malo ili nijedan moderator (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nuclear reactor in which nuclear fissions are caused by fast neutrons because little or no moderator is used</p><p><b>(simulacija) vremenska skala koja se koristi u o