ion against the czarist government which led to the abdication of Nicholas II and the creation of a provisional government in March 1917 [Russian Revolution]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s izmetom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to feces [faecal]</p><p><b>Akumulacija tvrdog stola u rektumu ili donjem crijevcu koje osoba ne može pomaknuti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> accumulation of hardened feces in the rectum or lower colon which the person cannot move</p><p><b>izmet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> solid excretory product evacuated from the bowels [BM, dejection, faecal matter, faeces, feces, ordure, stool]</p><p><b>test koji se provodi kod kuće u kojem uzimate uzorke stolice i testiraju ih na tragove krvi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a test performed at home in which you collect specimens of your stool that are tested for traces of blood [faecal occult test, stool test]</p><p><b>tvrda masa izmetnog materijala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hard mass of fecal matter [coprolith, faecalith, stercolith]</p><p><b>izmet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> solid excretory product evacuated from the bowels [BM, dejection, faecal matter, faeces, fecal matter, ordure, stool]</p><p><b>Njemački fizičar koji je osnovao psihofizičku znanost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German physicist who founded psychophysics [Gustav Theodor Fechner]</p><p><b>(psihofizički) koncept da se veličina subjektivne senzacije povećava proporcionalno logaritmu intenziteta podražaja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychophysics) the concept that the magnitude of a subjective sensation increases proportional to the logarithm of the stimulus intensity [Weber-Fechner law]</p><p><b>bespomoćan, slab</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not fit to assume responsibility</p><p><i>adj.</i> generally incompetent and ineffectual [inept]</p><p><b>bespomoćan, slab (od &quot;feckless&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with ineptitude [ineptly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a feckless manner</p><p><b>bespomoćan, slab (od &quot;feckless&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> worthlessness due to being 