t domestic opponents [Saddam's Martyrs]</p><p><b>izuzetno fine tjestenine tanje od vermicellija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extremely fine pasta thinner than vermicelli</p><p><b>federalni, federativni, savezni, Saveznu, Federalno, federalan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Union Army during the American Civil War [Federal soldier, Union soldier]</p><p><i>n.</i> any federal law-enforcement officer [Fed, federal official]</p><p><i>adj.</i> national</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the central government of a federation</p><p><i>adj.</i> being of or having to do with the northern United States and those loyal to the Union during the American Civil War [Union]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by or constituting a form of government in which power is divided between one central and several regional authorities</p><p><b>agencija, odjel, uprava, ured, vladina agencija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an administrative unit of government [agency, authority, bureau, government agency, office]</p><p><b>agent, federalni agent</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any agent or representative of a federal agency or bureau [agent]</p><p><b>Agencija u Ministarstvu prometa koja je odgovorna za sigurnost civilnog zrakoplovstva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency in the Department of Transportation that is responsible for the safety of civilian aviation [FAA]</p><p><b>FBI</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a federal law enforcement agency that is the principal investigative arm of the Department of Justice [FBI]</p><p><b>Agencija za provođenje zakona Ministarstva pravosuđa koja upravlja nacionalnim sustavom zatvora i pritvornih ustanova za zatvaranje zatvorenika osuđenih na zatvorsku kaznu za savezne zločine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the law enforcement agency of the Justice Department that operates a nationwide system of prisons and detention facilities to incarcerate inmates sentenced to imprisonment for federal crimes [BoP]</p><p><b>federalna komisija za komunikacije (SAD), savezno povjerenstvo za komunikacije (SAD)</b></p><