st Party, Federalist Party]</p><p><b>Agencija u Upravnom uredu za opće usluge koja je sigurnosna organizacija koja pruža sigurno okruženje u kojem savezne agencije mogu obavljati svoje poslove. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency in the General Services Administration that is a security organization to provide a safe environment where Federal agencies can conduct their business [FPS]</p><p><b>Savezna Republika Njemačka, Madžarska, Mađarska</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in north central Europe on the North Sea [West Germany]</p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in central Europe [Deutschland, FRG, Germany]</p><p><b>Savezna Republika Nigerija, Gana</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in West Africa on the Gulf of Guinea [Nigeria]</p><p><b>planinska republika u jugoistočnoj Europi koja se graniči s Jadranskim morem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mountainous republic in southeastern Europe bordering on the Adriatic Sea [Jugoslavija, Serbia and Montenegro, Union of Serbia and Montenegro, Yugoslavia]</p><p><b>Centralna banka Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the central bank of the United States [FRS, Fed, Federal Reserve System]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 12. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of 12 regional banks that monitor and act as depositories for banks in their region [reserve bank]</p><p><b>Središnja banka SAD-a</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the seven-member board governing the Federal Reserve System</p><p><b>novčanica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of paper money (especially one issued by a central bank) [bank bill, bank note, banker's bill, banknote, bill, government note, greenback, note]</p><p><b>Centralna banka Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the central bank of the United States [FRS, Fed, Federal Reserve]</p><p><b>Sredstva za upravljanje financijskim sustavom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a federally chartered savings bank [FSB]</p><p><b>Agencija za unutarnju kontraobavještajnu službu Ruske Federacije i nasljednik sovjetske KGB-