ent to deceive [affect, dissemble, pretend, sham]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a pretence of [assume, sham, simulate]</p><p><b>lažan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not genuine</p><p><b>himba, hinjenje, lažnost, pretvaranje, prijetvornost, simuliranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pretending with intention to deceive [dissembling, pretence, pretense]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of giving a false appearance [pretence, pretending, pretense, simulation]</p><p><b>Šumovi iz Južne Amerike s jestivim zelenkastim voćem nalik šljive (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> South American shrub having edible greenish plumlike fruit [feijoa bush]</p><p><i>n.</i> dark-green kiwi-sized tropical fruit with white flesh [pineapple guava]</p><p><b>Šumovi iz Južne Amerike s jestivim zelenkastim voćem nalik šljive (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> South American shrub having edible greenish plumlike fruit [feijoa]</p><p><b>finta, lukavština, neiskrenost, pretvaranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any distracting or deceptive maneuver (as a mock attack)</p><p><i>v.</i> deceive by a mock action</p><p><b>pas mješanac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nervous belligerent little mongrel dog [fice]</p><p><b>agresivan, borben, živahan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> showing courage [plucky, spunky]</p><p><i>adj.</i> quick to take offense [huffy, thin-skinned, touchy]</p><p><b>falafel</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small croquette of mashed chick peas or fava beans seasoned with sesame seeds [falafel]</p><p><b>ne-steroidni protuupalni lijek (trgovinski naziv Feldene) koji se koristi za liječenje artritisa i drugih upalnih stanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (trade name Feldene) used to treat arthritis and other inflammatory conditions [piroxicam]</p><p><b>feldspat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of a group of hard crystalline minerals that consist of aluminum silicates of potassium or sodium or calcium or barium [felspar]</p><p><b>rod tropskih afričkih biljaka ili potgreblja s obično plavim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of tropical African herbs or subshr