lating to or containing iron [ferrous]</p><p><b>crveni oksid željeza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a red oxide of iron</p><p><b>bruna nestabilna kiselina formirana od fericyanida (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a brown unstable acid formed from ferricyanide</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> salt of ferricyanic acid obtained by oxidation of a ferrocyanide</p><p><b>fenomen u feritima u kojem može doći do nepotpunog otkazivanja antiferromagnetskih uređenih spina koji daju neto magnetni moment (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a phenomenon in ferrites where there can be incomplete cancellation of antiferromagnetic arranged spins giving a net magnetic moment</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vertical rotating mechanism consisting of a large wheel with suspended seats that remain upright as the wheel rotates</p><p><b>ferit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a solid solution in which alpha iron is the solvent</p><p><b>proteini koji sadrže 20% željeza koji se nalazi u crijevima i jetri i slezni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a protein containing 20% iron that is found in the intestines and liver and spleen</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena (CAS RN 1344-26-8) i (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pyrophoric alloy of iron with cerium</p><p><b>armirani beton</b></p><p><i>n.</i> concrete with metal and/or mesh added to provide extra support against stresses [reinforced concrete]</p><p><b>bijela nestabilna kiselina formirana od soli ferocjanida (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white unstable acid formed from ferrocyanide salts</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena (CAS RN 1344-26-8) i (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> salt of ferrocyanic acid usually obtained by a reaction of a cyanide with iron sulphate</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or demonstrating ferromagnetism</p><p><b>fenomen koji se pojavljuje kod materijala poput 