rons (1918-1988) [Richard Feynman, Richard Phillips Feynman]</p><p><b>fes</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in north central Morocco [Fes]</p><p><i>n.</i> a felt cap (usually red) for a man [tarboosh]</p><p><b>Federalna agencija u Ministarstvu za stanovanje i urbani razvoj koja osigurava stambene hipoteke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the federal agency in the Department of Housing and Urban Development that insures residential mortgages [Federal Housing Administration]</p><p><b>Korporacija ovlaštena Kongresom za pružanje sekundarnog tržišta za stambene hipoteke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a corporation authorized by Congress to provide a secondary market for residential mortgages [Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corporation, Freddie Mac]</p><p><b>mladoženja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a man who is engaged to be married [groom-to-be]</p><p><b>mlada, nevjesta, zaručnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman who is engaged to be married [bride-to-be]</p><p><b>fijasko, neuspjeh, propast</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sudden and violent collapse [debacle]</p><p><b>nalog, odredba, zapovijed, dekret, edikt, objava, proglas, propis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a legally binding command or decision entered on the court record (as if issued by a court or judge) [decree, edict, order, rescript]</p><p><b>novac koji vlada proglašava zakonitim sredstvom plaćanja iako se ne može pretvoriti u standardne novčane valute (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> money that the government declares to be legal tender although it cannot be converted into standard specie</p><p><b>izmišljotina, lagati, laž, udarac (boks), bajka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a trivial lie [story, tale, taradiddle, tarradiddle]</p><p><i>v.</i> tell a relatively insignificant lie</p><p><b>netko tko laže. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who tells lies [fabricator, storyteller]</p><p><b>Neznačajni čin laganja ili namjerno nejasnoća. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a trivial act of lying or being deliberately unclear [paltering]</p><p><b>optičko vlakno, svjetlo vod, svjetlo vod n o vlakno, vlakno</