abrication]</p><p><b>fikcionalno, fiktivan, zamišljen, izmišljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> related to or involving literary fiction</p><p><i>adj.</i> formed or conceived by the imagination [fabricated, fancied, fictitious]</p><p><b>životinje koje postoje samo u izmišljenoj knjizi (obično u dječijim pričama) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> animals that exist only in fiction (usually in children's stories)</p><p><b>lik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an imaginary person represented in a work of fiction (play or film or story) [character, fictitious character]</p><p><b>književno djelo koje je djelomično ili u potpunosti utemeljeno na činjenicama, ali je napisano kao da je fikcija, pisanje u izmišljenom obliku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a literary work based partly or wholly on fact but written as if it were fiction [fictionalization]</p><p><i>n.</i> writing in a fictional form [fabrication, fictionalization]</p><p><b>pretvoriti u fikciju, preobraziti u oblik ili stil romana (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make into fiction [fictionalize, retell]</p><p><i>v.</i> convert into the form or the style of a novel [fictionalize, novelise, novelize]</p><p><b>književno djelo koje je djelomično ili u potpunosti utemeljeno na činjenicama, ali je napisano kao da je fikcija, pisanje u izmišljenom obliku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a literary work based partly or wholly on fact but written as if it were fiction [fictionalisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> writing in a fictional form [fabrication, fictionalisation]</p><p><b>pretvoriti u fikciju, preobraziti u oblik ili stil romana (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make into fiction [fictionalise, retell]</p><p><i>v.</i> convert into the form or the style of a novel [fictionalise, novelise, novelize]</p><p><b>izmišljen, izmišljeni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> formed or conceived by the imagination [fabricated, fancied, fictional]</p><p><i>adj.</i> adopted in order to deceive [assumed, false, fictive, pretended, put on, sham]</p><p><b>lik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an imaginary person represented in a work of fiction (play or film or story) [character, fictional character]</p><p><b>(zakon) ime pod kojim korporacija obavlja poslovanje koje nije pravno ime korporacije kako je navedeno u njenim člancima o osnivanju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) a name under which a corporation conducts business that is not the legal name of the corporation as shown in its articles of incorporation [DBA, Doing Business As, assumed name]</p><p><b>Mjesto koje postoji samo u mašti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a place that exists only in imagination [imaginary place, mythical place]</p><p><b>izmišljen, izmišljeni (od &quot;fictitious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a false manner intended to mislead</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a fictional manner (created by the imagination)</p><p><b>fiktivan, izmišljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> adopted in order to deceive [assumed, false, fictitious, pretended, put on, sham]</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of imaginative creation</p><p><b>veliki rod tropskih stabala ili grmova ili penjaka uključujući smokve (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large genus of tropical trees or shrubs or climbers including fig trees [genus Ficus]</p><p><b>drvo koje se nalazi na jugu Floride i u Zapadnoj Indiji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strangler tree native to southern Florida and West Indies [Florida strangler fig, golden fig, strangler fig, wild fig]</p><p><b>Drvo u istočnoj Indiji koje izlazi iz zraka i koje raste u zemlju i stvara dodatna debla. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> East Indian tree that puts out aerial shoots that grow down into the soil forming additional trunks [East Indian fig tree, Indian banyan, banian, banian tree, banyan, banyan tree]</p><p><b>obična smokva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Mediterranean tree widely cultivated for its edible fruit [common fig, common fig tree, fig]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste stabla u kategoriji "Stopice" se primjenjuje sljedeće: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wild variety of the common fig used to facilitate pollination of certain figs [caprifig]</p><p><b>grm ili malo stablo koje se često uzgaja kao kućna biljka s lišćem poput jastog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrub or small tree often grown as a houseplant having foliage like mistletoe [Ficus diversifolia, mistletoe fig, mistletoe rubber plant]</p><p><b>grm ili malo stablo koje se često uzgaja kao kućna biljka s lišćem poput jastog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrub or small tree often grown as a houseplant having foliage like mistletoe [Ficus deltoidea, mistletoe fig, mistletoe rubber plant]</p><p><b>veliko tropsko azijsko stablo često patuljasto kao kućna biljka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large tropical Asian tree frequently dwarfed as a houseplant [Assam rubber, India-rubber fig, India-rubber plant, India-rubber tree, rubber plant]</p><p><b>Indsko smokvo poznato po svojoj velikosti i dugovječnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fig tree of India noted for great size and longevity [bo tree, peepul, pipal, pipal tree, pipul, sacred fig]</p><p><b>Australijsko stablo slično banjani često se saditi kao ukras (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Australian tree resembling the banyan often planted for ornament [Botany Bay fig, Port Jackson fig, little-leaf fig, rusty rig]</p><p><b>Debela grana široko rasprostranjena stabla iz Afrike i susjedne jugozapadne Azije često podržana granama koje se dižu blizu zemlje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thick-branched wide-spreading tree of Africa and adjacent southwestern Asia often buttressed with branches rising from near the ground [mulberry fig, sycamore, sycamore fig]</p><p><b>besposličariti, guslati, gusle, violina, zabušavati, krpiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bowed stringed instrument that is the highest member of the violin family [violin]</p><p><i>v.</i> avoid (one's assigned duties) [goldbrick, shirk, shrink from]</p><p><i>v.</i> commit fraud and steal from one's employer</p><p><i>v.</i> play the violin or fiddle</p><p><i>v.</i> play on a violin</p><p><i>v.</i> manipulate manually or in one's mind or imagination [diddle, play, toy]</p><p><i>v.</i> play around with or alter or falsify, usually secretively or dishonestly [monkey, tamper]</p><p><i>v.</i> try to fix or mend [tinker]</p><p><b>manipulirati, kao na živčan ili nesvjesan način (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> manipulate, as in a nervous or unconscious manner [twiddle]</p><p><b>glup razgovor, prazne riječi, brbljavac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> trivial nonsense [balderdash, piffle]</p><p><b>(oblike lišća) s zaobljenim krajevima i skraćeno središte (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a leaf shape) having rounded ends and a contracted center [pandurate, panduriform]</p><p><b>Matteuccia struthiopteris, Onoclea struthiopteris, Pteretis struthiopteris, bujadika, peruša, smeđa stela</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall fern of northern temperate regions having graceful arched fronds and sporophylls resembling ostrich plumes [Matteuccia struthiopteris, Onoclea struthiopteris, Pteretis struthiopteris, ostrich fern, shuttlecock fern]</p><p><i>n.</i> New World fern having woolly cinnamon-colored spore-bearing fronds in early spring later surrounded by green fronds [Osmunda cinnamonea, cinnamon fern, fiddlehead fern]</p><p><b>Pferka Novog svijeta s volnjastim listovima boje cimet koji su u početku proljeća nosili spore a kasnije ih okružuju zeleni listovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> New World fern having woolly cinnamon-colored spore-bearing fronds in early spring later surrounded by green fronds [Osmunda cinnamonea, cinnamon fern, fiddlehead]</p><p><b>dlakavi godišnji iz Kalifornije do Meksika s gušćenim cimetima malih plavih do lilaka ili mauve cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hairy annual of California to Mexico with crowded cymes of small blue to lilac or mauve flowers [Phacelia tanacetifolia]</p><p><b>violinista, violinist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a musician who plays the violin [violinist]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who manipulates in a nervous or unconscious manner [twiddler]</p><p><i>n.</i> an unskilled person who tries to fix or mend [tinkerer]</p><p><b>-Krabovi iz američkih obalnih regija. Imaju jednu kandžu. Veoma je uvećana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> burrowing crab of American coastal regions having one claw much enlarged in the male</p><p><b>gudalo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bow used in playing the violin [violin bow]</p><p><b>malen, neznatan, odvratan, otrcan, sitan, tričav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (informal) small and of little importance [footling, lilliputian, little, niggling, petty, picayune, piddling, piffling, trivial]</p><p><b>Kubanski socijalistički vođa koji je 1959. svrgao diktatora i uspostavio marksističku socijalističku državu na Kubi (rođen 1927.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Cuban socialist leader who overthrew a dictator in 1959 and established a Marxist socialist state in Cuba (born in 1927) [Castro, Fidel Castro Ruz]</p><p><b>Kubanski socijalistički vođa koji je 1959. svrgao diktatora i uspostavio marksističku socijalističku državu na Kubi (rođen 1927.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Cuban socialist leader who overthrew a dictator in 1959 and established a Marxist socialist state in Cuba (born in 1927) [Castro, Fidel Castro]</p><p><b>odanost, preciznost, stupanj vjernosti standarda, vjernost, vjernosti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> accuracy with which an electronic system reproduces the sound or image of its input signal</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being faithful [faithfulness]</p><p><b>nervozan čovjek, strepnja, vrpoljiti, vrpoljiti se, meškoljiti se, migoljiti se, mrdati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of agitation expressed in continual motion [fidgetiness, restlessness]</p><p><i>v.</i> move restlessly</p><p><b>osjećaj uznemirenosti izražen stalnim kretanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of agitation expressed in continual motion [fidget, restlessness]</p><p><b>nemiran, nervozan, uzvrpoljen, uznemiren</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> nervous and unable to relax [antsy, fretful, itchy]</p><p><b>otvoren, pouzdan, povjerljiv, uzet kao mjerilo, uzet kao norma</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or of the nature of a legal trust (i.e. the holding of something in trust for another) [fiduciary]</p><p><i>adj.</i> used as a fixed standard of reference for comparison or measurement</p><p><i>adj.</i> based on trust</p><p><b>fiducijaran, kurator, opunomoćenik, upravitelj, zasnovan na povjerenju</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who holds assets in trust for a beneficiary</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or of the nature of a legal trust (i.e. the holding of something in trust for another) [fiducial]</p><p><b>fiducijarna dužnost, fiducijarna obveza, povjerenička dužnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the legal duty of a fiduciary to act in the best interests of the beneficiary</p><p><b>fiducijarni odnos, odnos povjerenja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the legal relation that exists when one person justifiably places reliance on another whose aid or protection is sought in some matter</p><p><b>popularni američki dirigent (1894-1979) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> popular United States conductor (1894-1979) [Arthur Fiedler]</p><p><b>feud, leno</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of land held under the feudal system [feoff]</p><p><b>feud</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the domain controlled by a feudal lord</p><p><i>n.</i> an organization that is controlled by a dominant person or group</p><p><b>bojište, djelokrug, igralište, list, njiva, područje, polje, teren, terenski, područja, području, polja, polju, terenska, terenu, pašnjak, oranica, bojišnica, bojno polje, poprište bitke, poprište borbe, ratište, znanstveno područje, znanstveno polje, ravan, ravnica, pista, staza, uzletište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of land cleared of trees and usually enclosed</p><p><i>n.</i> a region where a battle is being (or has been) fought [battlefield, battleground, field of battle, field of honor]</p><p><i>n.</i> somewhere (away from a studio or office or library or laboratory) where practical work is done or data is collected</p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of knowledge [bailiwick, discipline, field of study, study, subject, subject area, subject field]</p><p><i>n.</i> the space around a radiating body within which its electromagnetic oscillations can exert force on another similar body not in contact with it [field of force, force field]</p><p><i>n.</i> a particular kind of commercial enterprise [field of operation, line of business]</p><p><i>n.</i> a particular environment or walk of life [area, arena, domain, orbit, sphere]</p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of land prepared for playing a game [athletic field, playing area, playing field]</p><p><i>n.</i> extensive tract of level open land [champaign, plain]</p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) a set of elements such that addition and multiplication are commutative and associative and multiplication is distributive over addition and there are two elements 0 and 1</p><p><i>n.</i> a region in which active military operations are in progress [field of operations, theater, theater of operations, theatre, theatre of operations]</p><p><i>n.</i> all of the horses in a particular horse race</p><p><i>n.</i> all the competitors in a particular contest or sporting event</p><p><i>n.</i> a geographic region (land or sea) under which something valuable is found</p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a set of one or more adjacent characters comprising a unit of information</p><p><i>n.</i> the area that is visible (as through an optical instrument) [field of view]</p><p><i>n.</i> a place where planes take off and land [airfield, flying field, landing field]</p><p><i>v.</i> catch or pick up (balls) in baseball or cricket</p><p><i>v.</i> play as a fielder</p><p><i>v.</i> answer adequately or successfully</p><p><i>v.</i> select (a team or individual player) for a game</p><p><b>S druge opreme od željeza ili električne energije, osim opreme za proizvodnju električne energije ili električne energije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> movable artillery (other than antiaircraft) used by armies in the field (especially for direct support of front-line troops) [field gun]</p><p><b>trailing europska aromatična biljka iz obitelji mentene s zaobljenim listovima i malim ljubičastim cvijećem koje se često uzgajaju u visićim košaricama, Srednja grana od grmljava od 1. do 2. kolovoza. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> trailing European aromatic plant of the mint family having rounded leaves and small purplish flowers often grown in hanging baskets [Glechoma hederaceae, Nepeta hederaceae, alehoof, gill-over-the-ground, ground ivy, runaway robin]</p><p><i>n.</i> low-growing strongly aromatic perennial herb of southern Europe to Great Britain [Calamintha nepeta, Calamintha nepeta glantulosa, Satureja calamintha glandulosa, Satureja nepeta, lesser calamint]</p><p><b>bob</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Old World upright plant grown especially for its large flat edible seeds but also as fodder [English bean, European bean, Vicia faba, broad-bean, broad-bean plant, broad bean]</p><p><b>Europska višegodišnja biljka s slabim penjanjem s bijelim ili ružičastim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> weakly climbing European perennial with white or pink flowers [Convolvulus arvensis, wild morning-glory]</p><p><b>godišnje trave iz Europe i umjerene Azije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annual grass of Europe and temperate Asia [Bromus arvensis]</p><p><b>maksimalna količina vode koju određeno tlo može zadržati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the maximum amount of water that a particular soil can hold</p><p><b>Europski bijelac prirodno se pojavio u Sjevernoj Americi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European white-flowered weed naturalized in North America [Anthemis arvensis, corn chamomile, corn mayweed]</p><p><b>guste tufted višegodišnje chickweed sjeverno umjerenoga područja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> densely tufted perennial chickweed of north temperate zone [Cerastium arvense, field mouse-ear]</p><p><b>električna spoja oko polja magneta koja proizvodi magnetnu pokretačku silu za postavljanje toka u električnom stroju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the electric coil around a field magnet that produces the magneto motive force to set up the flux in an electric machine [field winding]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, uz pomoć proizvoda iz članka 1. stavka 1. točke (a) ovog članka, proizvedeni su: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> corn grown primarily for animal feed or market grain</p><p><b>čisti američki cvrčak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common American black cricket [Acheta assimilis]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, uzgoj se može upotrebljavati za proizvodnju biljaka ili povrća. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a crop (other than fruits or vegetables) that is grown for agricultural purposes</p><p><b>(vojni) dan za vojne vježbe i prikaz, dan za natjecanje na otvorenom, vrijeme neobičnog zadovoljstva i uspjeha., Dan posvećen društvenom okupljanju na otvorenom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (military) a day for military exercises and display</p><p><i>n.</i> a day for outdoor athletic competition</p><p><i>n.</i> a time of unusual pleasure and success</p><p><i>n.</i> a day devoted to an outdoor social gathering [outing, picnic]</p><p><b>emisija elektrona koji su odvojeni od matičnih atoma velikim električnim poljem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the emission of electrons that are stripped from parent atoms by a high electric field</p><p><b>natjecanje koje se održava na terenu umjesto na trkačkoj stazi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a competition that takes place on a field rather than on a running track</p><p><b>igra na terenu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an outdoor game played on a field of specified dimensions</p><p><b>žestok divlji luk iz Starog svijeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pungent Old World wild onion [Allium vineale, crow garlic, false garlic, stag's garlic, wild garlic]</p><p><b>bek</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (football) the person who plays quarterback [quarterback, signal caller]</p><p><i>n.</i> (American football) the position of the football player in the backfield who directs the offensive play of his team [quarterback, signal caller]</p><p><b>mali refrakcijski teleskop (M