rički novčanicu vrijednu 50 dolara. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a United States bill worth 50 dollars [fifty]</p><p><b>polovina izražena u postotku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a half expressed as a percentage</p><p><b>američki novčić vrijedan pola dolara (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a United States coin worth half of a dollar [half dollar]</p><p><b>-Biti osam više od pedeset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being eight more than fifty [58, lviii]</p><p><b>redovni broj pedeset pet u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of fifty-five in counting order [55th]</p><p><b>jednaki u stupnju ili obimu ili iznosu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> equal in degree or extent or amount [even]</p><p><b>biti pet više od pedeset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being five more than fifty [55, lv]</p><p><b>Četiri više od pedeset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being four more than fifty [54, liv]</p><p><b>Da je devet više od pedeset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being nine more than fifty [59, ilx]</p><p><b>biti jedan više od pedeset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than fifty [51, li]</p><p><b>-Sedam više od pedeset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being seven more than fifty [57, lvii]</p><p><b>da je šest više od pedeset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being six more than fifty [56, lvi]</p><p><b>biti tri više od pedeset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being three more than fifty [53, liii]</p><p><b>biti dva više od pedeset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being two more than fifty [52, lii]</p><p><b>smokva, slika, obična smokva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diagram or picture illustrating textual material [figure]</p><p><i>n.</i> Mediterranean tree widely cultivated for its edible fruit [Ficus carica, common fig, common fig tree]</p><p><i>n.</i> a Libyan terrorist group organized in 1995 and aligned with al-Qaeda [Al-Jama'a al-Islamiyyah al-Muqatilah bi-Libya, Libyan Fighting Group, Libyan Islamic Fighting Group, Libyan Islamic Group]</p><p><i>n.</i> fleshy sweet pear-shaped yellowish or purple multiple