ck up]</p><p><b>tvrdi vosak kremasto boje dobiven od javanskog smokve (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hard cream-colored wax obtained from a Javanese fig tree [gondang wax]</p><p><b>zeleno-žuto australsko oriolo koje se uglavnom hrani smokvom i drugim voćem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> greenish-yellow Australian oriole feeding chiefly on figs and other fruits</p><p><b>s oblikom smokve (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> shaped in the form of a fig</p><p><b>veliki zelenkasto-junijski bubač južne Sjedinjene Države (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large greenish June beetle of southern United States [green June beetle]</p><p><b>bitka, borba, boriti se, dvoboj, probiti, suzbijati, svađa, tučnjava, tući se, borbe, boj, sukob, meč, odupirati se, oduprijeti se, oponirati, protiviti se, suprotstaviti se, suprotstavljati se, usprotiviti se, naprezati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hostile meeting of opposing military forces in the course of a war [battle, conflict, engagement]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of fighting [combat, fighting, scrap]</p><p><i>n.</i> an aggressive willingness to compete [competitiveness]</p><p><i>n.</i> an intense verbal dispute</p><p><i>n.</i> a boxing or wrestling match</p><p><i>v.</i> be engaged in a fight [contend, struggle]</p><p><i>v.</i> fight against or resist strongly [defend, fight back, fight down, oppose]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a strenuous or labored effort [struggle]</p><p><i>v.</i> exert oneself continuously, vigorously, or obtrusively to gain an end or engage in a crusade for a certain cause or person [agitate, campaign, crusade, press, push]</p><p><b>boriti se, odupirati se, oduprijeti se, oponirati, protiviti se, suprotstaviti se, suprotstavljati se, tući se, usprotiviti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> defend oneself</p><p><i>v.</i> fight against or resist strongly [defend, fight, fight down, oppose]</p><p><b>boriti se, odupirati se, oduprijeti se, oponirati, protiviti se, suprotstaviti se, suprotstavljati se, tući se, usprotiviti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> fight against or resist str