.</i> pass through [percolate, permeate, sink in]</p><p><i>v.</i> run or flow slowly, as in drops or in an unsteady stream [dribble, trickle]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> filter consisting of a layer of sand or gravel for filtering water</p><p><b>cijediti, filtrirati, ocijediti, procijediti, procjeđivati, prokapati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove by passing through a filter [filter, filtrate, separate out, strain]</p><p><b>filtar-papir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a porous unsized paper used for filtering</p><p><b>element filtra</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an air filter on the end of a cigarette</p><p><b>od cigarete ili cigarete (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of a cigar or cigarette</p><p><b>cigareta s vrhom filtera (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cigarette with a filter tip</p><p><b>blato, nečistoća, prljavština</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any substance considered disgustingly foul or unpleasant [crud, skank]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being covered with unclean things [dirt, grease, grime, grunge, soil, stain]</p><p><i>n.</i> a state characterized by foul or disgusting dirt and refuse [filthiness, foulness, nastiness]</p><p><i>n.</i> an offensive or indecent word or phrase [dirty word, obscenity, smut, vulgarism]</p><p><b>besramno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a filthy unclean manner [dirtily]</p><p><b>stanje koje se karakterizira prljavim ili odvratnim prljavštinom i otpadom, moralno uništenje ili onečišćenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state characterized by foul or disgusting dirt and refuse [filth, foulness, nastiness]</p><p><i>n.</i> moral corruption or pollution</p><p><b>besraman, blatan, nečist, nemoralan, prljav, prost</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> disgustingly dirty [foul, nasty]</p><p><i>adj.</i> vile [dirty, lousy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by obscenity [cruddy, foul, nasty, smutty]</p><p><b>sramna zarada. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shameful profit</p><p><b>filtrat, filtrirati, procijediti, pročistiti, cijediti, ocijediti, procjeđivati, prokapati</b></p><p>