perty of being unyielding to the touch</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being steady or securely and immovably fixed in place [steadiness]</p><p><b>nepokolebljivost, odlučnost, rezolutnost, čvrstina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being resolute [firmness, resoluteness, resolution, resolve]</p><p><b>program izveden u sklopovskoj opremi, ugrađeni program, ugrađeni softver, firmver</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) coded instructions that are stored permanently in read-only memory [microcode]</p><p><b>najprije, prvi, prvo, broj jedan, pokret, početak, start, vrijeme polaska, vrijeme početka, vrijeme počinjanja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first or highest in an ordering or series [number one]</p><p><i>n.</i> the first element in a countable series [number 1, number one]</p><p><i>n.</i> the time at which something is supposed to begin [beginning, commencement, get-go, kickoff, offset, outset, showtime, start, starting time]</p><p><i>n.</i> the fielding position of the player on a baseball team who is stationed at first of the bases in the infield (counting counterclockwise from home plate) [first base]</p><p><i>n.</i> an honours degree of the highest class [first-class honours degree]</p><p><i>n.</i> the lowest forward gear ratio in the gear box of a motor vehicle [first gear, low, low gear]</p><p><i>adj.</i> preceding all others in time or space or degree</p><p><i>adj.</i> indicating the beginning unit in a series [1st]</p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to set in motion [inaugural, initiative, initiatory, maiden]</p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to begin [beginning]</p><p><i>adj.</i> ranking above all others [foremost, world-class]</p><p><i>adj.</i> highest in pitch or chief among parts or voices or instruments or orchestra sections</p><p><i>adv.</i> before anything else [first of all, first off, firstly, foremost]</p><p><i>adv.</i> the initial time</p><p><i>adv.</i> before another in time, space, or importance</p><p><i>adv.</i> prominently forward [foremost]</p><p><b>prva pomoć</b><