ccupied for years [Pandion haliaetus, fish hawk, osprey, sea eagle]</p><p><b>porodica riba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various families of fish</p><p><b>ribogojstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a workplace (usually a pond) where fish are raised for food</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog poglavlja, za riblje meso se upotrebljavaju: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a longitudinal slice or boned side of a fish [filet, fillet, fish fillet]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog poglavlja, za riblje meso se upotrebljavaju: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a longitudinal slice or boned side of a fish [filet, fillet, fish filet]</p><p><b>dug file od ribe na kruhu i prženom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long fillet of fish breaded and fried [fish stick]</p><p><b>sličan, ali manji od dobsonflyja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> similar to but smaller than the dobsonfly [fish-fly]</p><p><b>Kuhanje gdje je pržena riba glavno jelo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cookout where fried fish is the main course</p><p><b>malo stablo iz Zapadne Indije i Floride s velikim lišcima i panicama crveno-pramčanog ljubičastog do bijelog cvijeća, nakon čega slijede dekorativni krilati krošnji s krilima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small tree of West Indies and Florida having large odd-pinnate leaves and panicles of red-striped purple to white flowers followed by decorative curly winged seedpods [Jamaica dogwood, Piscidia erythrina, Piscidia piscipula]</p><p><b>rod riba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various genus of fish</p><p><b>u obliku od crvene ili crvene boje, s površinom od oko 30 cm ili više, ali ne više od 30 cm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an upright geranium having scalloped leaves with a broad color zone inside the margin and white or pink or red flowers [Pelargonium hortorum, bedding geranium, zonal pelargonium]</p><p><b>Gelatin, dobiven kuhanjem riblje kože, peraja i kostiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> gelatinous substance obtained by boiling skins fins and bones of fish</p><p><b>bukoč</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large har