erving fish or other food that is cooked in a frying pan</p><p><b>vrsta ribe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a species of fish</p><p><b>prečni presjek dijela velike ribe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cross-section slice of a large fish</p><p><b>gulaš od ribe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stew made with fish</p><p><b>dug file od ribe na kruhu i prženom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long fillet of fish breaded and fried [fish finger]</p><p><b>akvarij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tank or pool or bowl filled with water for keeping live fish and underwater animals [aquarium, marine museum]</p><p><b>sličan, ali manji od dobsonflyja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> similar to but smaller than the dobsonfly [fish fly]</p><p><b>masno ulje dobiveno od jetre raznih riba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fatty oil obtained from the livers of various fish [fish oil]</p><p><b>obožavanje ribe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the worship of fish [ichthyolatry]</p><p><b>riblje kosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bone of a fish</p><p><b>stanje u kojem nemate privatnost, Prozirna zdjela u kojoj se drže male ribe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of affairs in which you have no privacy [fish bowl, goldfish bowl]</p><p><i>n.</i> a transparent bowl in which small fish are kept [fish bowl, goldfish bowl]</p><p><b>ribar, ribič</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone whose occupation is catching fish [fisherman]</p><p><i>n.</i> large dark brown North American arboreal carnivorous mammal [Martes pennanti, black cat, fisher cat, pekan]</p><p><b>veliki tamno smeđi sjevernoamerički drvožedni mesojedni sisari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large dark brown North American arboreal carnivorous mammal [Martes pennanti, black cat, fisher, pekan]</p><p><b>ribar, ribič</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone whose occupation is catching fish [fisher]</p><p><b>Uređaj za proizvodnju električnih vozila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a knot for tying a line to a spar or ring</p><p><b>čvor za vezanje krajeva dvije linije zajedno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a knot for tying the ends of two li