gives off an unpleasant odor when threatened [Mustela putorius, foulmart, foumart, polecat]</p><p><b>grčevit, mušičav, na mahove</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring in spells and often abruptly [spasmodic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> intermittently stopping and starting [interrupted, off-and-on]</p><p><b>na mahove</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a fitful manner</p><p><b>grčevit, mušičav, na mahove (od &quot;fitful&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being spasmodic and irregular [jerkiness]</p><p><b>namjestiti, biti prikladan, grčevi, montirati, napad, napadaji, nastup, odgovara, odgovarajuća veličina, odgovarati, pasati, podesiti, podoban, pogodan, prikladan, prilagodba, prilagoditi, prilagoditi se, pristajati, sklop, spreman, stajati, u dobroj formi, uglađen, uvježban, zdrav, zgodan (od &quot;fit&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in accordance with what is appropriate or suitable for the circumstances [appropriately, befittingly, duly, fittingly, properly, suitably]</p><p><b>oprema</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the items furnishing or equipping a room (especially built-in furniture)</p><p><b>dobra kondicija, forma, kondicija, način vježbanja, podobnost, pogodnost, prikladnost, rekreacija, uvježbanost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being suitable [fittingness]</p><p><i>n.</i> good physical condition [physical fitness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being qualified</p><p><b>ponavljajuće eksplozije aktivnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> repeated bursts of activity</p><p><b>montiran, postavljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being the right size and shape to fit as desired</p><p><b>pripremljen sa odgovarajućom opremom, S druge strane, za proizvode koji su navedeni u točki 1. točkama (a) i (b) ovog poglavlja, primjenjuje se sljedeći opis: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> prepared with proper equipment [equipped]</p><p><i>adj.</i> furnished with essential equipment for a particular occupation or undertaking occupation [outfitted]</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenjem od oko 10 mm ili više, ali ne više od 10 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sheet (usually with elastic edges) tailored to fit a particular mattress [contour sheet]</p><p><b>instalater, mehaničar, modelar, monter</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who fits a garment to a particular person</p><p><i>adj.</i> improved in health or physical condition [healthier]</p><p><b>koji dolikuje, montaža, namještaj, okov, podesan, podešavanje, pogodan, prikladan, priključak, prilagodba, prilagođavanje, pristao, uklapaju, uklapanje, uklapati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> making or becoming suitable [accommodation, adjustment]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small and often standardized accessory to a larger system</p><p><i>n.</i> (usually in the plural) furnishings and equipment (especially for a ship or hotel) [appointment]</p><p><i>n.</i> putting clothes on to see whether they fit [try-on, trying on]</p><p><i>adj.</i> in harmony with the spirit of particular persons or occasion [decent]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being precisely fitting and right [meet]</p><p><b>koji dolikuje, montaža, namještaj, okov, podesan, podešavanje, pogodan, prikladan, priključak, prilagodba, prilagođavanje, pristao, uklapaju, uklapanje, uklapati (od &quot;fitting&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in accordance with what is appropriate or suitable for the circumstances [appropriately, befittingly, duly, fitly, properly, suitably]</p><p><b>koji dolikuje, montaža, namještaj, okov, podesan, podešavanje, pogodan, prikladan, priključak, prilagodba, prilagođavanje, pristao, uklapaju, uklapanje, uklapati (od &quot;fitting&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being suitable [fitness]</p><p><b>Engleski pjesnik poznat uglavnom po svom slobodnom prijevodu poezije Omara Khayyama (1809-1883), Američki pisac čiji su romani karakterizirali jazz doba u Sjedinjenim Državama (1896-1940), Pjevačica američkih scat (1917-1996) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English poet remembered primarily for his free translation of the poetry of Omar Khayyam (1809-1883) [Edward Fitzgerald]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States author whose novels characterized the Jazz Age in the United States (1896-1940) [F. Scott Fitzgerald, Francis Scott Key Fitzgerald]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States scat singer (1917-1996) [Ella Fitzgerald]</p><p><b>pet, petica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of four and one [5, Little Phoebe, Phoebe, V, cinque, fin, fivesome, pentad, quint, quintet, quintuplet]</p><p><i>n.</i> a team that plays basketball [basketball team]</p><p><i>n.</i> a playing card or a domino or a die whose upward face shows five pips [five-spot]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than four [5, v]</p><p><b>Američki novčanicu vrijednu 5 dolara. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a United States bill worth 5 dollars [five-spot, fiver]</p><p><b>pet stotina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the product of one hundred and five [500, D]</p><p><i>n.</i> a card game similar to ecarte [euchre]</p><p><i>adj.</i> denoting a quantity consisting of 500 items or units [500, d]</p><p><b>željezo za srednju udaljenost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> middle-distance iron [mashie]</p><p><b>liga irokeza koja je prvobitno uključivala Mohawk, Oneida, Onondaga, Cayuga i Seneca (Pet naroda) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a league of Iroquois tribes including originally the Mohawk, Oneida, Onondaga, Cayuga and Seneca (the Five Nations) [Iroquois League, League of Iroquois, Six Nations]</p><p><b>mješavina pet začina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Chinese seasoning made by grinding star anise and fennel and pepper and cloves and cinnamon</p><p><b>bilo koja od brojnih biljaka uzgajanih zbog svojih petkastih cvijeća. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of a numerous plants grown for their five-petaled flowers [cinquefoil]</p><p><b>čvrsta palmatično razgranata sjevernoamerička paprika s divergentnim rekurviranim granama koje se nose na sjajnim tamnocrvenkastim stabljikama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hardy palmately branched North American fern with divergent recurved branches borne on lustrous dark reddish stipes [Adiantum pedatum, American maide