uid that flows in a given time [flow rate, rate of flow]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of flowing or streaming [stream]</p><p><i>n.</i> any uninterrupted stream or discharge</p><p><i>n.</i> something that resembles a flowing stream in moving continuously [stream]</p><p><i>n.</i> dominant course (suggestive of running water) of successive events or ideas [current, stream]</p><p><i>n.</i> the monthly discharge of blood from the uterus of nonpregnant women from puberty to menopause [catamenia, menses, menstruation, menstruum, period]</p><p><i>v.</i> move or progress freely as if in a stream [flux]</p><p><i>v.</i> move along, of liquids [course, feed, run]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to flow</p><p><i>v.</i> be abundantly present</p><p><i>v.</i> fall or flow in a certain way [fall, hang]</p><p><i>v.</i> cover or swamp with water</p><p><i>v.</i> undergo menstruation [menstruate]</p><p><b>curiti, iscuriti, otjecati, teći</b></p><p><i>v.</i> flow off or away gradually [flow off]</p><p><b>dijagram tijeka, dijagram toka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diagram of the sequence of operations in a computer program or an accounting system [flow diagram, flow sheet, flowchart]</p><p><b>dijagram toka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diagram of the sequence of operations in a computer program or an accounting system [flow chart, flow sheet, flowchart]</p><p><b>proistjecati, proizaći, proizlaziti, rezultirati, slijediti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be the result of [be due]</p><p><b>protok zraka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the flow of air [air flow, airflow]</p><p><b>curiti, iscuriti, otjecati, teći</b></p><p><i>v.</i> flow off or away gradually [flow away]</p><p><b>proliv ili proliv (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> flow or spill forth [effuse]</p><p><b>davanje, koja protječe u jedinici vremena, količina kapljevine, proizvodnost, protok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount of fluid that flows in a given time [flow, rate of flow]</p><p><b>Dijagram slijeda operacija u računalnom programu ili računovodstvenom sustavu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diagram of the sequence of operations in a computer program or an accounting system [flow chart, flow diagram, flowchart]</p><p><b>postupno unutarnje kretanje ili deformacija čvrstog tijela (kao što je toplina), vodeno tijelo koje je stvoreno namjernim poplavom područja, Plavljenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> gradual internal motion or deformation of a solid body (as by heat)</p><p><i>n.</i> a body of water that has been created by deliberately flooding an area</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of flooding [flood]</p><p><b>blok dijagram, dijagram toka, organigram</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diagram of the sequence of operations in a computer program or an accounting system [flow chart, flow diagram, flow sheet]</p><p><b>cvijet, cvjetati, cvjetni, ukras, cvat, cvasti, procvasti, procvjetati, rascvasti se, rascvjetati se, rascvjetavati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plant cultivated for its blooms or blossoms</p><p><i>n.</i> reproductive organ of angiosperm plants especially one having showy or colorful parts [bloom, blossom]</p><p><i>n.</i> the period of greatest prosperity or productivity [bloom, blossom, efflorescence, flush, heyday, peak, prime]</p><p><i>v.</i> produce or yield flowers [bloom, blossom]</p><p><b>buket, cvjetni aranžman</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a decorative arrangement of flowers [floral arrangement]</p><p><b>cvijetna gredica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bed in which flowers are growing [bed of flowers, flowerbed]</p><p><b>pupolj koji se razvija samo cvijet ili cvijeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bud from which only a flower or flowers develop</p><p><b>cvijeće povezano u lancu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> flowers strung together in a chain</p><p><b>netko tko odbacuje uspostavljenu kulturu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who rejects the established culture [hippie, hippy, hipster]</p><p><b>cvjetovica koja se sastoji od gomile cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inflorescence consisting of a cluster of flowers</p><p><b>cvjetnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a garden featuring flowering plants</p><p><