ati (od &quot;fondle&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lover who gently fondles and caresses the loved one [petter]</p><p><i>n.</i> a molester who touches the intimate parts of the victim</p><p><b>ljubimac, maza, mezimac, miljenik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> affectionate play (or foreplay without contact with the genital organs) [caressing, cuddling, hugging, kissing, necking, petting, smooching, snuggling]</p><p><b>nježno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with fondness [lovingly]</p><p><b>ljubav, naklonost, nježnost, sklonost, voljenje, zaluđenost, blagost, dragost, privrženost, toplina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a predisposition to like something [fancy, partiality]</p><p><i>n.</i> a positive feeling of liking [affection, affectionateness, heart, philia, tenderness, warmheartedness, warmness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a quality proceeding from feelings of affection or love [affectionateness, lovingness, warmth]</p><p><b>od mesa ili morskih plodova, kuhani u vrućem ulju i zatim namočeni u bilo koji od različitih umakova, slijedeći: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cubes of meat or seafood cooked in hot oil and then dipped in any of various sauces [fondue]</p><p><i>n.</i> hot cheese or chocolate melted to the consistency of a sauce into which bread or fruits are dipped [fondue]</p><p><b>fondi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cubes of meat or seafood cooked in hot oil and then dipped in any of various sauces [fondu]</p><p><i>n.</i> hot cheese or chocolate melted to the consistency of a sauce into which bread or fruits are dipped [fondu]</p><p><b>font, fonta, karakteri, krstionica, pismo, slova, vrsta slova, baptisterij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a specific size and style of type within a type family [case, face, fount, typeface]</p><p><i>n.</i> bowl for baptismal water [baptismal font, baptistery, baptistry]</p><p><b>rom pisača</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any font that is contained in a cartridge that can be plugged into a computer printer [cartridge font]</p><p><b>bilo koji membranski otvor između kostiju lubanje kod novorođenčeta ili fetusa 