gree [forth, onward]</p><p><i>adv.</i> toward the future [ahead]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a forward direction [ahead, forrader, forwards, onward, onwards]</p><p><i>adv.</i> near or toward the bow of a ship or cockpit of a plane [fore]</p><p><b>U slučaju trgovanja na tržištu robnih proizvoda, trgovanje na tržištu robnih proizvoda je trgovanje na tržištu robnih proizvoda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commodity exchange where futures contracts are traded [futures exchange, futures market]</p><p><b>napredak, napredovanje, pomak, progres</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of moving forward (as toward a goal) [advance, advancement, onward motion, procession, progress, progression]</p><p><b>-Proštaj do prijemnika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pass to a receiver downfield from the passer [aerial]</p><p><b>(futbol) nositelj lopte koji pokušava dobiti tlo bacajući napredni prolaz (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (football) a ball carrier who tries to gain ground by throwing a forward pass [passer]</p><p><b>Naprijed vremena. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> ahead of the times [advanced, innovative, modern]</p><p><b>Naprijed. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> moving forward [advancing, forward]</p><p><b>otprema, otpremi, prosljeđivanje, špedicija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of sending on to another destination</p><p><i>n.</i> the advancement of some enterprise [furtherance, promotion]</p><p><b>bezobraznost, spremnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> offensive boldness and assertiveness [bumptiousness, cockiness, pushiness]</p><p><i>n.</i> an advanced stage</p><p><i>n.</i> prompt willingness [eagerness, readiness, zeal]</p><p><b>naprijed</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> at or to or toward the front [forrad, forrard, forward, frontward, frontwards]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a forward direction [ahead, forrader, forward, onward, onwards]</p><p><b>(hemija) negativni univalentni acilni radikal CHO koji se pojavljuje u aldehidima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) the negative univalent acyl radical CHO that occurs in aldehydes</p><p><b>tablete 