rganism [nonparasitic, nonsymbiotic]</p><p><b>otvoren</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of livestock and domestic poultry</p><p><b>trska koja se ne uklapa blizu otvoru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a reed that does not fit closely over the aperture</p><p><b>instrument sa slobodnim jezičkom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wind instrument with a free reed</p><p><b>gdje je ropstvo bilo zabranjeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> where slavery was prohibited [non-slave, slaveless]</p><p><b>prostodušan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by directness in manner or speech [blunt, candid, forthright, frank, outspoken, plainspoken, point-blank, straight-from-the-shoulder]</p><p><b>koji mogu plivati. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of animals) able to swim about [unattached]</p><p><b>mali brzi insektivni šišmiša sa kožnim ušima i dugim repom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small swift insectivorous bat with leathery ears and a long tail [freetail, freetailed bat]</p><p><b>ne želi prihvatiti autoritet ili dogmu (posebno u religiji) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> unwilling to accept authority or dogma (especially in religion) [latitudinarian, undogmatic, undogmatical]</p><p><b>nešto što je besplatno (obično se pruža kao dio promotivne sheme) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something that is free (usually provided as part of a promotional scheme) [freebie]</p><p><b>nešto što je besplatno (obično se pruža kao dio promotivne sheme) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something that is free (usually provided as part of a promotional scheme) [freebee]</p><p><b>paluba nadvodja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the uppermost watertight deck</p><p><b>netko tko uzima plijen ili pljačku (kao u ratu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who takes spoils or plunder (as in war) [despoiler, looter, pillager, plunderer, raider, spoiler]</p><p><b>Rođen slobodan od slobodnih roditelja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> born free of free parents</p><p><b>osoba koja je oslobođena ropstva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who has been freed from slavery [freedwoman]</p><p><b>sloboda, s