ini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fruit (especially peach) whose flesh does not adhere to the pit</p><p><b>utrka (kao u plivanju) u kojoj svaki natjecatelj ima slobodan izbor stila koji će koristiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a race (as in swimming) in which each contestant has a free choice of the style to use</p><p><b>mali brzi insektivni šišmiša sa kožnim ušima i dugim repom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small swift insectivorous bat with leathery ears and a long tail [free-tailed bat, freetailed bat]</p><p><b>mali brzi insektivni šišmiša sa kožnim ušima i dugim repom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small swift insectivorous bat with leathery ears and a long tail [free-tailed bat, freetail]</p><p><b>slobodoumnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who rejects religion</p><p><b>Nauka da je razum prava osnova za regulisanje ponašanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the doctrine that reason is the right basis for regulating conduct [rationalism]</p><p><b>Freetown</b></p><p><i>n.</i> port city and the capital and largest city of Sierra Leone [capital of Sierra Leone]</p><p><b>besplatni softver, freeware, softver koji se može distribuirati, ali ne i modificirati, besplatna programska oprema</b></p><p><i>n.</i> software that is provided without charge</p><p><b>autoput, autocesta, brza cesta, državna cesta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a broad highway designed for high-speed traffic [expressway, motorway, pike, state highway, superhighway, throughway, thruway]</p><p><b>spojnica (kao na zadnjem kotaču bicikla) koja omogućuje da se kotači slobodno okreću (kao u sporu), živjeti bez žurbe, neodgovorno ili slobodno, obalu u vozilu koje koristi slobodno točkovanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clutch (as on the rear wheel of a bicycle) that allows wheels to turn freely (as in coasting)</p><p><i>v.</i> live unhurriedly, irresponsibly, or freely [drift]</p><p><i>v.</i> coast in a vehicle using the freewheel</p><p><b>netko koji djeluje slobodno ili čak neodgovorno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone acting freely or even irre