s]</p><p><i>n.</i> North American food and game fish</p><p><b>deverika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> flesh of various freshwater fishes of North America or of Europe [bream]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various usually edible freshwater percoid fishes having compressed bodies and shiny scales [bream]</p><p><b>dvoslojni mehurići u rasprostranjenom broju u rijekama središnje Sjedinjene Države (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bivalve mollusk abundant in rivers of central United States [freshwater mussel]</p><p><b>Sjevernoamerička konopljana s lištima sa suvim membranskim rubovima i s dužnim krovom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American cordgrass having leaves with dry membranous margins and glumes with long awns [Spartina pectinmata, prairie cordgrass, slough grass]</p><p><b>Uga koji žive u slatkoj vodi kao odrasli, ali se vraćaju u more da bi se razmnožili (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eels that live in fresh water as adults but return to sea to spawn [common eel]</p><p><b>slatkovodna riba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> flesh of fish from fresh water used as food</p><p><b>minijaturna konjska gastropoda koja na površini sliči na limpet, ali živi i hrani se slatkovodnim biljkama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> minute conical gastropod superficially resembling a limpet but living and feeding on freshwater plants [Ancylus fluviatilis, river limpet]</p><p><b>bezupka, bezupka velika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bivalve mollusk abundant in rivers of central United States [freshwater clam]</p><p><b>Francuski fizičar koji je izumio polarizirano svjetlo i Fresnelovu sočivo (1788-1827) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French physicist who invented polarized light and invented the Fresnel lens (1788-1827) [Augustin Jean Fresnel]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lens composed of a number of small lenses arranged to make a lightweight lens of large diameter and short focal length</p><p><b>grad u južnoj središnjoj Kaliforniji u dolini San Joaquin (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in south central California in the San Joaquin Valley</p><p><b>jesti puno i bez ograničenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> eat a lot and without restraint [gluttonise, gluttonize]</p><p><b>bijes, iskrzati, išarati, mreškati, ornament, rezbarski, šara, meandar, nažuljati, grebati, grepsti, trljati, trti, žuljati, potkopavati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> agitation resulting from active worry [lather, stew, sweat, swither]</p><p><i>n.</i> a spot that has been worn away by abrasion or erosion [worn spot]</p><p><i>n.</i> an ornamental pattern consisting of repeated vertical and horizontal lines (often in relief) [Greek fret, Greek key, key pattern]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small bar of metal across the fingerboard of a musical instrument</p><p><i>v.</i> worry unnecessarily or excessively [fuss, niggle]</p><p><i>v.</i> be agitated or irritated</p><p><i>v.</i> provide (a musical instrument) with frets</p><p><i>v.</i> become or make sore by or as if by rubbing [chafe, gall]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause annoyance in</p><p><i>v.</i> gnaw into [eat into, grate, rankle]</p><p><i>v.</i> carve a pattern into</p><p><i>v.</i> decorate with an interlaced design</p><p><i>v.</i> be too tight [choke, gag]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause friction [chafe, fray, rub, scratch]</p><p><i>v.</i> remove soil or rock [eat away, erode]</p><p><i>v.</i> wear away or erode [eat away]</p><p><b>osjetljiv, razdražljiv, nemiran, nervozan, uznemiren</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> nervous and unable to relax [antsy, fidgety, itchy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> habitually complaining [querulous, whiney, whiny]</p><p><b>osjetljiv, razdražljiv (od &quot;fretful&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a fretful manner</p><p><b>osjetljiv, razdražljiv (od &quot;fretful&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an irritable petulant feeling [choler, crossness, fussiness, irritability, peevishness, petulance]</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenim dijelom, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fine-toothed power saw with a narrow blade [jigsaw, scroll saw]</p><p><b>s pregradušnim dijelovima, s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm i (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having frets</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a pattern of fretwork or latticework [interlaced, latticed, latticelike]</p><p><b>razbarija, rezbarenje, rezbarija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> framework consisting of an ornamental design made of strips of wood or metal [lattice, latticework]</p><p><b>Austrijski neurolog koji je osnovao psihoanalizu (1856-1939) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian neurologist who originated psychoanalysis (1856-1939) [Sigmund Freud]</p><p><b>osoba koja slijedi osnovne teorije ili prakse Sigmunda Freuda, Sigmund Freud ili njegove psihoanalitičke ideje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who follows the basic theories or practices of Sigmund Freud</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Sigmund Freud or his psychoanalytic ideas</p><p><b>psihološke teorije Sigmunda Freuda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the psychological theories of Sigmund Freud</p><p><b>-Pogrešak koji je (po Sigmundu Freudu) rezultat djelovanja nesvjesnih želja ili sukoba i može otkriti nesvjesne procese kod normalnih zdravih pojedinaca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a slip-up that (according to Sigmund Freud) results from the operation of unconscious wishes or conflicts and can reveal unconscious processes in normal healthy individuals</p><p><b>(Nordska mitologija) bog plodnosti zemlje i mira i blagostanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Norse mythology) god of earth's fertility and peace and prosperity [Freyr]</p><p><b>(Nordska mitologija) boginja ljubavi i plodnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Norse mythology) goddess of love and fecundity [Freyja]</p><p><b>(Nordska mitologija) boginja ljubavi i plodnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Norse mythology) goddess of love and fecundity [Freya]</p><p><b>(Nordska mitologija) bog plodnosti zemlje i mira i blagostanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Norse mythology) god of earth's fertility and peace and prosperity [Frey]</p><p><b>Madžarska, Mađarska</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in central Europe [Deutschland, Federal Republic of Germany, Germany]</p><p><b>Šesti dan u tjednu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sixth day of the week [Friday]</p><p><b>Prekomjerna slomivost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> excessive breakableness [crumbliness]</p><p><b>drobiv, trošan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> easily broken into small fragments or reduced to powder [crumbly]</p><p><b>fratar, kaluđer, redovnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a male member of a religious order that originally relied solely on alms [mendicant]</p><p><b>rimokatolički redovnik koji nosi crni ogrtač dominikanskog reda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Roman Catholic friar wearing the black mantle of the Dominican order [Black Friar, Blackfriar, Dominican]</p><p><b>bledo svjetlo ponekad viđeno noću preko močvarnog tla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pale light sometimes seen at night over marshy ground [ignis fatuus, jack-o'-lantern, will-o'-the-wisp]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 1. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka primjenjuje samo na biljke iz kategorije 0202 ili 0203 u skladu s člankom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, točka (b) ovog članka se primjenjuje samo na biljke iz kategorije 0203 ili 0204 u skladu s člankom 1. točkom (c) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tuberous perennial having a cowl-shaped maroon or violet-black spathe [Arisarum vulgare]</p><p><b>samostan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a monastery of friars</p><p><b>masnoće od teleća, pečeno i glazirano u vlastitim sokovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> larded veal braised and glazed in its own juices</p><p><b>U slučaju da je proizvod proizveden u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, proizvedeni su proizvodi koji se upotrebljavaju u proizvodima iz kategorije II., napraviti frizuru od kuhanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pieces of chicken or other meat stewed in gravy with e.g. carrots and onions and served with noodles or dumplings</p><p><i>v.</i> make a fricassee of by cooking</p><p><b>kontinuirani konsonant koji nastaje disanjem i kretanjem protiv suženja glasnog trakta, Zvuci govora proizvedeni prisilom na zrak kroz uski prolaz (kao `f', `s', `z', ili `th' u riječima `thin' i `then') (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a continuant consonant produced by breath moving against a narrowing of the vocal tract [fricative consonant, spirant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of speech sounds produced by forcing air through a constricted passage (as `f', `s', `z', or `th' in both `thin' and `then') [continuant, sibilant, spirant, strident]</p><p><b>kontinuirani konsonant koji nastaje disanjem i kretanjem protiv suženja glasnog trakta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a continuant consonant produced by breath moving against a narrowing of the vocal tract [fricative, spirant]</p><p><b>Američki industrijalist koji je stekao bogatstvo u industriji čelika (1849-1919) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States industrialist who amassed a fortune in the steel industry (1849-1919) [Henry Clay Frick]</p><p><b>frikcija, nesloga, trenje, trvenje, konflikt, nesporazum, nesuglasica, nesuglasje, razilaženje, sukob, sva?a</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of conflict between persons [clash]</p><p><i>n.</i> the resistance encountered when one body is moved in contact with another [rubbing]</p><p><i>n.</i> effort expended in moving one object over another with pressure [detrition, rubbing]</p><p><b>spojnica u kojoj jedan dio okreće drugi od trenja između njih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clutch in which one part turns the other by the friction between them</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lighter consisting of a thin piece of wood or cardboard tipped with combustible chemical [lucifer, match]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a water-resistant adhesive tape used to insulate exposed electrical conductors [insulating tape]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 85% ili više, ali ne više od 50% (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to or worked or produced by friction</p><p><b>bez sva trenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking all friction</p><p><b>petak, petkom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sixth day of the week [Fri]</p><p><b>frižider, hladnjak, električni hladnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a refrigerator in which the coolant is pumped around by an electric motor [electric refrigerator]</p><p><b>Norveški istraživač Arktika i direktor programa pomoći Društva naroda za izbjeglice Prvog svjetskog rata (1861-1930) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Norwegian explorer of the Arctic and director of the League of Nations relief program for refugees of World War I (1861-1930) [Nansen]</p><p><b>peći, prepržen, pržen, pržena</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> cooked by frying in fat [deep-fried]</p><p><b>u obliku jaja ili maslaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eggs cooked by sauteing in oil or butter</p><p><b>U slučaju da je proizvod proizveden u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, proizvedena je od strane proizvođača. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> boiled rice mixed with scallions and minced pork or shrimp and quickly scrambled with eggs [Chinese fried rice]</p><p><b>Američka feministkinja koja je osnovala nacionalnu organizaciju za žene (rođena 1921.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States feminist who founded a national organization for women (born in 1921) [Betty Friedan, Betty Naomi Friedan, Betty Naomi Goldstein Friedan]</p><p><b>malo kolače u obliku prstena ili okreta ili kugle ili trake prženog u dubokoj masti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small cake in the form of a ring or twist or ball or strip fried in deep fat</p><p><b>Američki ekonomist poznat kao zagovornik monetarizma i zbog svog protivljenja vladinoj intervenciji u ekonomiji (rođen 1912.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States economist noted as a proponent of monetarism and for his opposition to government intervention in the economy (born in 1912) [Milton Friedman]</p><p><b>test trudnoće koji uključuje ubrizgavanje neke od ženske urina u neparenog ženskog zeca i kasnije ispitivanje jajnika zeca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pregnancy test that involves injecting some of the woman's urine into an unmated female rabbit and later examining the ovaries of the rabbit [rabbit test]</p><p><b>skleroza stražnje i bočne stupnjeve kičmene moždine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sclerosis of the posterior and lateral columns of the spinal cord [herediatry spinal ataxia]</p><p><b>Austrijski liječnik koji je pokušao liječiti bolesti hipnozom (1734-1815) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian physician who tried to treat diseases with a form of hypnotism (1734-1815) [Franz Anton Mesmer, Mesmer]</p><p><b>Njemački kemičar poznat po otkriću prstenaste strukture benzena (1829-1896) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German chemist remembered for his discovery of the ring structure of benzene (1829-1896) [Friedrich August Kekule von Stradonitz, Kekule]</p><p><b>Njemački kemičar poznat po otkriću prstenaste strukture benzena (1829-1896) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German chemist remembered for his discovery of the ring structure of benzene (1829-1896) [Friedrich August Kekule, Kekule]</p><p><b>Engleski ekonomist (rođen u Austriji) poznat po radu na optimalnoj raspodjeli resursa (1899-1992) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English economist (born in Austria) noted for work on the optimum allocation of resources (1899-1992) [Hayek]</p><p><b>Njemački klasičar koji je tvrdio da su Iliadu i Odiseju napisali nekoliko autora (1759-1824) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German classical scholar who claimed that the Iliad and Odyssey were composed by several authors (1759-1824) [Wolf]</p><p><b>socijalist koji je napisao Komunistički manifest s Karlom Marxom 1848. godine (1820-1895.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> socialist who wrote the Communist Manifesto with Karl Marx in 1848 (1820-1895) [Engels]</p><p><b>Njemački učitelj koji je osnovao sustav dječjih vrtova (1782-1852) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German educator who founded the kindergarten system (1782-1852) [Friedrich Wilhelm August Froebel, Froebel]</p><p><b>Njemački pjesnik