>n.</i> (Norse mythology) goddess of the heavens and married love [Frigg]</p><p><b>strah, užas, zaplašiti, bojazan, plašiti, prepadati, prepasti, preplašiti, prestraviti, prestravljivati, prestrašiti, strašiti, uplašiti, ustrašiti, užasavati, užasnuti, zastrašiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an emotion experienced in anticipation of some specific pain or danger (usually accompanied by a desire to flee or fight) [fear, fearfulness]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause fear in [affright, frighten, scare]</p><p><b>preplašiti, prestrašiti, strašiti, uplašiti, užasnuti, zaplašiti, zastrašiti, plašiti, prepadati, prepasti, prestraviti, prestravljivati, ustrašiti, užasavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause fear in [affright, fright, scare]</p><p><b>uzrok gubitka hrabrosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to lose courage [dash, daunt, frighten off, pall, scare, scare away, scare off]</p><p><b>uzrok gubitka hrabrosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to lose courage [dash, daunt, frighten away, pall, scare, scare away, scare off]</p><p><b>prestrašen, uplašen, zastrašen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> made afraid [scared]</p><p><i>adj.</i> thrown into a state of intense fear or desperation [panic-stricken, panic-struck, panicked, panicky, terrified]</p><p><b>koji plaši, zastrašujući, strašan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of inspiring with fear [terrorisation, terrorization]</p><p><i>adj.</i> causing fear or dread or terror [awful, dire, direful, dread, dreaded, dreadful, fearful, fearsome, horrendous, horrific, terrible]</p><p><b>koji plaši, zastrašujući (od &quot;frightening&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an alarming manner [scarily]</p><p><b>gadan, ružan, strašan, užasan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> provoking horror [atrocious, horrible, horrifying, ugly]</p><p><i>adj.</i> extreme in degree or extent or amount or impact [awful, terrible, tremendous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> extremely distressing [fearful]</p><p><b>gadan, ružan, strašan, užasan (od &quot;frightful&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> used as intensifiers [awful, awfully, terribly]</p><p><b>gadan, ružan, strašan, užasan (od &quot;frightful&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being frightful</p><p><b>frigidan, hladan, leden</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> sexually unresponsive [cold]</p><p><i>adj.</i> extremely cold [arctic, gelid, glacial, icy, polar]</p><p><i>adj.</i> devoid of warmth and cordiality [frosty, frozen, glacial, icy, wintry]</p><p><b>ledeni pojas</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of the Earth's surface forming a cap over a pole [polar region, polar zone]</p><p><b>frigidnost, hladnoća, studen, bezdušnost, bezosjećajnost, bešćutnost, neosjećajnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sexual unresponsiveness (especially of women) and inability to achieve orgasm during intercourse [frigidness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the absence of heat [cold, coldness, frigidness, low temperature]</p><p><i>n.</i> a lack of affection or enthusiasm [chilliness, coldness, coolness, frigidness, iciness]</p><p><b>frigidan, hladan, leden (od &quot;frigid&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without warmth or enthusiasm [frostily]</p><p><b>hladnoća, studen, bezdušnost, bezosjećajnost, bešćutnost, neosjećajnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sexual unresponsiveness (especially of women) and inability to achieve orgasm during intercourse [frigidity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the absence of heat [cold, coldness, frigidity, low temperature]</p><p><i>n.</i> a lack of affection or enthusiasm [chilliness, coldness, coolness, frigidity, iciness]</p><p><b>uzrokovanje prehlade (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing cold</p><p><b>biljka čestih zrna uzgajana za zrna umjesto za struke (posebno sorta s velikim crvenim bubrežnim zrnom) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the common bean plant grown for the beans rather than the pods (especially a variety with large red kidney-shaped beans) [frijole, kidney bean]</p><p><b>biljka čestih zrna uzgajana za zrna umjesto za struke (posebno sorta s velikim crvenim bubrežnim zrnom), Čokolada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the common bean plant grown for the beans rather than the pods (especially a variety with large red kidney-shaped beans) [frijol, kidney bean]</p><p><i>n.</i> Mexican bean</p><p><b>sušena graha, kuhana i pržena, a zatim pržena u masnoću s različitim začinima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dried beans cooked and mashed and then fried in lard with various seasonings [refried beans]</p><p><b>grm ili malo stablo s pimetnim lišćama otrovnim za stoku i guste raseme intenzivno mirisnih plavih cvijeća i crvenih graha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrub or small tree having pinnate leaves poisonous to livestock and dense racemes of intensely fragrant blue flowers and red beans [Sophora secundiflora, coral bean, frijolito, mescal bean]</p><p><b>grm ili malo stablo s pimetnim lišćama otrovnim za stoku i guste raseme intenzivno mirisnih plavih cvijeća i crvenih graha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrub or small tree having pinnate leaves poisonous to livestock and dense racemes of intensely fragrant blue flowers and red beans [Sophora secundiflora, coral bean, frijolillo, mescal bean]</p><p><b>nabor, volan, volan (haljina)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (paleontology) a bony plate that curves upward behind the skull of many ceratopsian dinosaurs</p><p><i>n.</i> an external body part consisting of feathers or hair about the neck of a bird or other animal [ruff]</p><p><i>n.</i> a strip of pleated material used as a decoration or a trim [flounce, furbelow, ruffle]</p><p><i>n.</i> ornamental objects of no great value [falderol, folderal, gimcrack, gimcrackery, nonsense, trumpery]</p><p><b>naboran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having decorative ruffles or frills [frilly, ruffled]</p><p><b>veliki drveni insektivni australski gušter s krpom kože oko vrata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large arboreal insectivorous Australian lizard with a ruff of skin around the neck [Chlamydosaurus kingi]</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenjem od 0,15 mm ili većim od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having decorative ruffles or frills [frilled, ruffled]</p><p><b>treći mjesec revolucionarnog kalendara (novembar i prosinac) (MT)</b