 prema ili prema prednjem dijelu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> at or to or toward the front [forrad, forrard, forward, forwards, frontwards]</p><p><b>na ili prema ili prema prednjem dijelu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> at or to or toward the front [forrad, forrard, forward, forwards, frontward]</p><p><b>jako hladno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> very cold</p><p><b>mraz, zamrznuti, zamrznuti se, inje, smrzavica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ice crystals forming a white deposit (especially on objects outside) [hoar, hoarfrost, rime]</p><p><i>n.</i> weather cold enough to cause freezing [freeze]</p><p><i>n.</i> the formation of frost or ice on a surface [icing]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States poet famous for his lyrical poems on country life in New England (1874-1963) [Robert Frost, Robert Lee Frost]</p><p><i>v.</i> decorate with frosting [ice]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide with a rough or speckled surface or appearance</p><p><i>v.</i> cover with frost</p><p><i>v.</i> damage by frost</p><p><b>duge morske ribe s dugim bičem bez šupljine i oštrim zubima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> long-bodied marine fishes having a long whiplike scaleless body and sharp teeth [cutlassfish, hairtail]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, za sve proizvode koji se upotrebljavaju u proizvodnji goriva ili goriva, primjenjuje se sljedeći uvjet: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> upthrust of ground or pavement caused by the freezing of moist soil [frost heaving]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, za sve proizvode koji se upotrebljavaju u proizvodnji goriva ili goriva, primjenjuje se sljedeći uvjet: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> upthrust of ground or pavement caused by the freezing of moist soil [frost heave]</p><p><b>inje, mraz, slana</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small crystals of ice [diamond dust, frost snow, ice crystal, ice needle, poudrin, snow mist]</p><p><b>Pokriveni slojem leda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become covered with a layer of ice [ice over, ice up]</p><p><b>inje, mraz, slana</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small crystals of ice [diamond dust, frost mist, ice crystal, ice needle, poudrin, snow mist]</p><p><b>gljiva s crvenim kapom i crvenim grubo mrežnim stabljkom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungus with a red cap and a red coarsely reticulate stalk [Boletus frostii]</p><p><b>i od leda se stvrdi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of the ground) made hard by frost</p><p><b>višegodišnja biljka iz istočne Sjedinjenih Država s ranim usamljenim žutim cvijećem, nakon čega slijede kasni bezcvetni cvijeće, visoka višegodišnja biljka s grmovima bijelih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial of the eastern United States having early solitary yellow flowers followed by late petalless flowers [Crocanthemum canadense, Helianthemum canadense, frostweed, frostwort]</p><p><i>n.</i> tall perennial herb having clusters of white flowers [Verbesina virginica, Virginia crownbeard, frostweed]</p><p><b>smrzotine, ozeblina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> destruction of tissue by freezing and characterized by tingling, blistering and possibly gangrene [cryopathy]</p><p><b>povrijeđen smrzavanjem ili djelomičnim smrzavanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> injured by freezing or partial freezing</p><p><b>smrznut</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of glass) having a roughened coating resembling frost</p><p><b>Obični evroazijski šišmiš s bijelom vrhom dlake u svom krznu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common Eurasian bat with white-tipped hairs in its coat [Vespertilio murinus]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s ili na način Robert Frost (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or in the manner of Robert Frost</p><p><b>hladan, leden, mrazovit, studen, zamrznut (od &quot;frosty&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without warmth or enthusiasm [frigidly]</p><p><b>hladnoća kao što je dokazano smrzavanjem, srebrno-bijele boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coldness as evidenced by frost</p><p><i>n.</i> a silvery-white color [hoariness]</p><p><b>šećerna glazura</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a flavored sugar topping used to coat and decorate cakes [ice, icing]</p><p><b>višegodišnja biljka iz istočne Sjedinjenih Država s ranim usamljenim žutim cvijećem, nakon čega slijede kasni bezcvetni cvijeće, visoka višegodišnja biljka s grmovima bijelih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial of the eastern United States having early solitary yellow flowers followed by late petalless flowers [Crocanthemum canadense, Helianthemum canadense, frost-weed, frostwort]</p><p><i>n.</i> tall perennial herb having clusters of white flowers [Verbesina virginica, Virginia crownbeard, frost-weed]</p><p><b>višegodišnja biljka iz istočne Sjedinjenih Država s ranim usamljenim žutim cvijećem, nakon čega slijede kasni bezcvetni cvijeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial of the eastern United States having early solitary yellow flowers followed by late petalless flowers [Crocanthemum canadense, Helianthemum canadense, frost-weed, frostweed]</p><p><b>hladan, leden, mrazovit, studen, zamrznut</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> devoid of warmth and cordiality [frigid, frozen, glacial, icy, wintry]</p><p><i>adj.</i> covered with frost [rimed, rimy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> pleasantly cold and invigorating [crisp, nipping, nippy, snappy]</p><p><b>pjena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mass of small bubbles formed in or on a liquid [foam]</p><p><i>v.</i> become bubbly or frothy or foaming [effervesce, fizz, foam, form bubbles, sparkle]</p><p><i>v.</i> make froth or foam and become bubbly [spume, suds]</p><p><i>v.</i> exude or expel foam</p><p><b>biti u stanju nekontrolirane ljutnje (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be in a state of uncontrolled anger [foam at the mouth]</p><p><b>na penast način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a frothy manner</p><p><b>svojstvo izbacivanja mjehurića (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of giving off bubbles [bubbliness, effervescence]</p><p><b>pjena (od &quot;froth&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> producing or covered with lathery sweat or saliva from exhaustion or disease [foaming, foamy]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 g/cm3, Oznaka visokog duha ili uzbuđenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> emitting or filled with bubbles as from carbonation or fermentation [bubbling, bubbly, effervescing, foaming, foamy, spumy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by high spirits or excitement [bubbling, effervescent, scintillating, sparkly]</p><p><b>masturbacija trljanjem protiv druge osobe (kao u gomili) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> masturbation by rubbing against another person (as in a crowd)</p><p><b>osoba koja masturbira trljajući se o drugu osobu (kao što je u gomili) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who masturbates by rubbing against another person (as in a crowd)</p><p><b>čudan, nepokoran, neugodan, prkosan, svojeglav, tvrdoglav, uporan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> habitually disposed to disobedience and opposition [headstrong, self-willed, wilful, willful]</p><p><b>mrgođenje, namrštiti se, odbijati, mrštiti se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a facial expression of dislike or displeasure [scowl]</p><p><i>v.</i> look angry or sullen, wrinkle one's forehead, as if to signal disapproval [glower, lour, lower]</p><p><b>hrup na licu povezan sa mrknućem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a facial wrinkle associated with frowning</p><p><b>Neprijatno gledam. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> look disapprovingly upon [frown upon]</p><p><b>Neprijatno gledam. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> look disapprovingly upon [frown on]</p><p><b>namršten</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> showing displeasure or anger</p><p><b>namršten (od &quot;frowning&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with a frown</p><p><b>Odvratno i nečivo mirisanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> stale and unclean smelling [fusty, musty]</p><p><b>Nepažljiv u urednosti, posebno u odjeći i osobnom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> negligent of neatness especially in dress and person [frowzy, slovenly]</p><p><b>u neredu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> in disarray [disheveled, dishevelled, rumpled, tousled]</p><p><b>koji zaudara</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> negligent of neatness especially in dress and person [frowsy, slovenly]</p><p><b>smrznut, smrznuta, smrznuti, smrznuti se, zamrznut, zamrznuti</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> turned into ice</p><p><i>adj.</i> absolutely still [rooted, stock-still]</p><p><i>adj.</i> devoid of warmth and cordiality [frigid, frosty, glacial, icy, wintry]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not thawed</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of foods) preserved by freezing sufficiently rapidly to retain flavor and nutritional value [flash-frozen, quick-frozen]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not convertible to cash</p><p><i>adj.</i> incapable of being changed or moved or undone [fixed]</p><p><b>Sladak sličan sladoledu, ali s kuhanom bazom kreme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dessert resembling ice cream but with a boiled custard base [soft ice cream]</p><p><b>Svaka vrsta deserta pripremljena smrzavanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various desserts prepared by freezing</p><p><b>Hrana konzervirana smrzavanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> food preserved by freezing [frozen foods]</p><p><b>Hrana konzervirana smrzavanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> food preserved by freezing [frozen food]</p><p><b>metafora koja se toliko često pojavljuje da je postala novo značenje izraza (npr. `on je zmija' možda je nekada bila metafora, ali nakon godina upotrebe umrla je i postala novo značenje riječi `zmija') (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metaphor that has occurred so often that it has become a new meaning of the expression (e.g., `he is a snake' may once have been a metaphor but after years of use it has died and become a new sense of the word `snake') [dead metaphor]</p><p><b>smrznuti sok naranče</b></p><p><i>n.</i> orange juice that has been concentrated and frozen [orange-juice concentrate]</p><p><b>Hladni desert koji se sastoji od mješavine kreme i orašastih plodova i (ponekad) alkoholnih pića. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chilled dessert consisting of a mixture of custard and nuts and (sometimes) liquor</p><p><b>Mekan frizuran desert od zaslađene jogurte s okusom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a soft frozen dessert of sweetened flavored yogurt</p><p><