 apparel [trappings]</p><p><i>n.</i> (usually plural) the instrumentalities (furniture and appliances and other movable accessories including curtains and rugs) that make a home (or other area) livable</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of providing a house or room with furniture and other removable items such as shelves, carpets, appliances, etc.</p><p><b>namještaj, namještaja, namještajem, pokućstvo, komad namještaja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> furnishings that make a room or other area ready for occupancy [article of furniture, piece of furniture]</p><p><b>tvrtka koja prodaje namještaj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company that sells furniture</p><p><b>drvodozor koji se specijalizira za izradu namještaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woodworker who specializes in making furniture [cabinetmaker]</p><p><b>Engleski filolog koji je prvi predložio Oxford English Dictionary (1825-1910) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English philologist who first proposed the Oxford English Dictionary (1825-1910) [Frederick James Furnivall]</p><p><b>Zanimanje koje prati pretjerana revnost., iznenadni izboj (kao znak protesta) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an interest followed with exaggerated zeal [craze, cult, fad, furore, rage]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sudden outburst (as of protest) [furore]</p><p><b>buran uspje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an interest followed with exaggerated zeal [craze, cult, fad, furor, rage]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sudden outburst (as of protest) [furor]</p><p><b>furosemid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> commonly used diuretic (trade name Lasix) used to treat hypertension and edema [Lasix]</p><p><b>prekrivena je guste dlake od fine sviđane dlake (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> covered with a dense coat of fine silky hairs [furry]</p><p><b>krznar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone whose occupation is making or repairing fur garments [cloakmaker]</p><p><b>oplaćivanje, oplata, podstavljanje krznom, prevlaka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a furlike coating of matter as on the tongue</p><p><i>n.</i> strip used to give a level surface for attaching wallboard [furring strip]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> strip used to give a level surface for attaching wallboard [furring]</p><p><b>brazda, izbrazdati, orati, razor, užlijebiti, borati, mreškati, nabirati, naborati, nabrati, namreškati, zgužvati, brazdati, urezati, urezivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long shallow trench in the ground (especially one made by a plow)</p><p><i>n.</i> a slight depression or fold in the smoothness of a surface [crease, crinkle, line, seam, wrinkle]</p><p><i>v.</i> hollow out in the form of a furrow or groove [groove, rut]</p><p><i>v.</i> make wrinkled or creased [crease, wrinkle]</p><p><i>v.</i> cut a furrow into a columns [chamfer, chase]</p><p><b>brazda, izbrazdati, orati (od &quot;furrow&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having long narrow shallow depressions (as grooves or wrinkles) in the surface [rugged]</p><p><b>krzneni, sličan krznu</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> covered with a dense coat of fine silky hairs [furred]</p><p><b>neželjeni nuspojava nekih antibiotika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a benign side effect of some antibiotics [black tongue, hairy tongue]</p><p><b>dalje, dalji, daljnji, dodatni, drugi, nadalje, podrobniji, pored toga, potpomoći, udaljenije, unaprijediti, daljnjeg, daljnjih, daljnjom, podrobnije, poticati, gurati, hrabriti, ohrabriti, ohrabrivati, podržati, podržavati, podupirati, poduprijeti, progurati, promaknuti, promicati, promovirati, stimulirati, zagovarati, zalagati se, založiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> promote the growth of [foster]</p><p><i>v.</i> contribute to the progress or growth of [advance, boost, encourage, promote]</p><p><i>adj.</i> more distant in especially degree [farther]</p><p><i>adv.</i> to or at a greater extent or degree or a more advanced stage (`further' is used more often than `farther' in this abstract sense) [farther]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in addition or furthermore</p><p><i>adv.</i> to or at a greater distance in time or space (`farther' is used more frequently than `further' in this physical sense) [farther]</p><p><b>jačanje, pomaganje, promicanje, širenje, unapređivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> encouragement of the progress or growth or acceptance of something [advancement, promotion]</p><p><i>n.</i> the advancement of some enterprise [forwarding, promotion]</p><p><b>nadalje, osim toga, štoviše</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in addition [moreover, what is more]</p><p><b>(komparativno ` daleko) najudaljenije u prostoru ili vremenu ili redu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (comparatives of `far') most remote in space or time or order [farthermost, farthest, furthest, utmost, uttermost]</p><p><b>najdalje, najdalji, najudaljeniji</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (comparatives of `far') most remote in space or time or order [farthermost, farthest, furthermost, utmost, uttermost]</p><p><i>adv.</i> to the greatest degree or extent or most advanced stage (`furthest' is used more often than `farthest' in this abstract sense) [farthest]</p><p><i>adv.</i> to the greatest distance in space or time (`farthest' is used more often than `furthest' in this physical sense) [farthest]</p><p><b>koji radi krišom, potajan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by quiet and caution and secrecy [sneak, sneaky, stealthy, surreptitious]</p><p><i>adj.</i> secret and sly or sordid [backstair, backstairs]</p><p><b>kradom, potajno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a furtive manner [on the sly]</p><p><b>skrovitost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disposition to be sly and stealthy and to do things surreptitiously [sneakiness, stealthiness]</p><p><b>bolno rane s tvrdim jezgrom punim gnoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a painful sore with a hard core filled with pus [boil]</p><p><b>akutna kožna bolest obilježena prisustvom mnogih čireva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> acute skin disease characterized by the presence of many furuncles</p><p><b>bijes, gnjev, srdžba, strast, mahnitost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of intense anger [madness, rage]</p><p><i>n.</i> state of violent mental agitation [craze, delirium, frenzy, hysteria]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being wild or turbulent [ferocity, fierceness, furiousness, vehemence, violence, wildness]</p><p><i>n.</i> (classical mythology) the hideous snake-haired monsters (usually three in number) who pursued unpunished criminals [Erinyes, Eumenides]</p><p><b>vrlo trnasti i gust zimzeleni grm s mirisnim zlatno-žutim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> very spiny and dense evergreen shrub with fragrant golden-yellow flowers [Irish gorse, Ulex europaeus, gorse, whin]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom ugljika od 10 kg ili više, ali ne više od 10 kg, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stick of black carbon material used for drawing [charcoal]</p><p><b>stabla kadong (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> quandong trees [Eucarya, genus Eucarya, genus Fusanus]</p><p><b>Australsko stablo s jestivim mesom i jestivim sjemenom nalik orašastima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Australian tree with edible flesh and edible nutlike seed [Eucarya acuminata, quandang, quandong, quandong tree]</p><p><b>Odroblje od ušiju (Fusarium) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wilt caused by fungi of the genus Fusarium</p><p><b>tamno ljubičasta crvena boja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dark purplish-red color</p><p><b>rod gljiva iz obitelji Boletaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of fungi belonging to the family Boletaceae [genus Fuscoboletinus]</p><p><b>jedljiva gljiva s ružičasto ljubičastim čepom i stabljkom i površinom pora koja je žuta s velikim ugaonim poreima koje postaju poput žlijezda u zrelosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an edible fungus with a pinkish purple cap and stalk and a pore surface that is yellow with large angular pores that become like gills in maturity</p><p><b>hrošća od štetnih biljaka, s velikom konveksnom smeđom kapačkom i bijelom površinom pore i stabljkom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an edible fungus with a broadly convex brown cap and a whitish pore surface and stalk</p><p><b>od nečeg tamno smeđe sive boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of something having a dusky brownish grey color [taupe]</p><p><b>detonator, fitilj, osigurač, rastopiti se, sjediniti, stopiti, štapin, upaljač, izmiješati, izmiksati, kombinirati, miješati, miksati, pomiješati, sjedinjavati, smiješati, smiksati, spajati, spojiti, stapati, umiješati, umiksati, združiti, združivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electrical device that can interrupt the flow of electrical current when it is overloaded [electrical fuse, safety fuse]</p><p><i>n.</i> any igniter that is used to initiate the burning of a propellant [fusee, fuze, fuzee, primer, priming]</p><p><i>v.</i> mix together different elements [blend, coalesce, combine, commingle, conflate, flux, immix, meld, merge, mix]</p><p><i>v.</i> become plastic or fluid or liquefied from heat</p><p><i>v.</i> equip with a fuse</p><p><i>v.</i> make liquid or plastic by heating</p><p><b>fuzioniran, legiran, stopljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> joined together into a whole [amalgamate, amalgamated, coalesced, consolidated]</p><p><b>spiralno ranu vrtač u satu koji suprotstavlja smanjujuću snagu glavne opruge koja se neovlači, Bojan flar koji se koristi kao upozorenje kamiona i vlaka., trljajuća šibica s velikom glavom koja će ostati upaljena u vjetru, Svaka zapaljiva naprava koja se koristi za pokretanje paljenja goriva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a spirally grooved spindle in a clock that counteracts the diminishing power of the uncoiling mainspring [fusee drive]</p><p><i>n.</i> a colored flare used as a warning signal by trucks and trains [fuzee]</p><p><i>n.</i> a friction match with a large head that will stay alight in the wind [fuzee]</p><p><i>n.</i> any igniter that is used to initiate the burning of a propellant [fuse, fuze, fuzee, primer, priming]</p><p><b>spiralno ranu vrtač u satu koji suprotstavlja smanjujuću snagu glavne opruge koja se neovlači (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a spirally grooved spindle in a clock that counteracts the diminishing power of the uncoiling mainspring [fusee]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mixture of amyl alcohols and propanol and butanol formed from distillation of fermented liquors</p><p><b>fizelaža, trup aviona</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the central body of an airplane that is designed to accommodate the crew and passengers (or cargo)</p><p><b>rastopljiv, taljiv, topljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being melted and fused</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena (POP) od 0,8 mas.% ili više, ali ne više od 0,8 mas.% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an alloy with a low melting point and used as solder and in safety plugs and sprinkler fuses</p><p><b>u svakom kraju suze (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tapering at each end [cigar-shaped, spindle-shaped]</p><p><b>lak mušket od kremenog kovača. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a light flintlock musket</p><p><b>(bivši) britanski pješak naoružan sa laganim kremenom musketom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (formerly) a British infantryman armed with a light flintlock musket</p><p><b>pucnjava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rapid simultaneous discharge of firearms [burst, salvo, volley]</p><p><i>v.</i> attack with fusillade</p><p><b>fuzija, mješavina, spajanje, stapanje, topljenje, koalicija, sjedinjenje, ujedinjenje, združenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an occurrence that involves the production of a union [merger, unification]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being combined into one body [coalition]</p><p><i>n.</i> the merging of adjacent sounds or syllables or words</p><p><i>n.</i> a nuclear reaction in which nuclei combine to form more massive nuclei with the simultaneous release of energy [nuclear fusion, nuclear fusion reaction]</p><p><i>n.</i> the combining of images from the two eyes to form a single visual percept [optical fusion]</p><p><i>n.</i> correction of an unstable part of the spine by joining two or more vertebrae [spinal fusion]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of fusing (or melting) together</p><p><b>nuklearnog oružja koje oslobađa atomsku energiju spajanjem lakih (vodoničnih) jezgara na visokim temperaturama kako bi se formirao helijum (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nuclear weapon that releases atomic energy by union of light (hydrogen) nuclei at high temperatures to form helium [H-bomb, hydrogen bomb, thermonuclear bomb]</p><p><b>Kuhanje koje kombinira sastojke i tehnike i začine iz različitih kuhinja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cooking that combines ingredients and techniques and seasonings from different cuisines</p><p><b>nuklearni reaktor koji koristi kontroliranu fuziju za proizvodnju energije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nuclear reactor that uses controlled nuclear fusion to generate energy [thermonuclear reactor]</p><p><b>buka, frka, galama, galamiti, komešanje, metež, vika, problem, razmirica, čarka, graja, gungula, gurnjava, gužva, naguravanje, roj, vreva, maziti, tetošiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an excited state of agitation [dither, flap, pother, tizzy]</p><p><i>n.</i> an angry disturbance [bother, hassle, trouble]</p><p><i>n.</i> a quarrel about petty points [bicker, bickering, pettifoggery, spat, squabble, tiff]</p><p><i>n.</i> a rapid active commotion [ado, bustle, flurry, hustle, stir]</p><p><i>v.</i> worry unnecessarily or excessively [fret, niggle]</p><p><i>v.</i> care for like a mother [mother, overprotect]</p><p><b>misli na nesrećne stvari koje bi se mogle dogoditi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thinks about unfortunate things that might happen [fusspot, worrier, worrywart]</p><p><b>nemiran (od &quot;fussy&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a fussy manner</p><p><b>razdražljiv osjećaj., nepotrebno detaljno ispitivanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an irritable petulant feeling [choler, crossness, fretfulness, irritability, peevishness, petulance]</p><p><i>n.</i> unnecessary elaborateness in details</p><p><b>misli na nesrećne stvari koje bi se mogle dogoditi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thinks about unfortunate things that might happen [fuss-budget, worrier, worrywart]</p><p><b>nemiran, pedantan, sitničav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> annoyed and irritable [bad-tempered, crabbed, crabby, cross, grouchy, grumpy, ill-tempered]</p><p><i>adj.</i> overcrowded or cluttered with detail [busy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> exacting especially about details [finical, finicky, particular, picky]</p><p><b>staromodan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pompous or pretentious talk or writing [blah, bombast, claptrap, rant]</p><p><i>n.</i> a strong cotton and linen fabric with a slight nap</p><p><b>lemati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> strike with a cudgel [cudgel]</p><p><b>staromodan, ustajao, zagušljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> stale and unclean smelling [frowsty, musty]</p><p><i>adj.</i> old-fashioned and out of date [nonprogressive, standpat, unprogressive]</p><p><b>beskoristan, bezuspješan, isprazan, nekoristan, neuspješan, uzaludan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> producing no result or effect [ineffectual, meaningless, otiose, unavailing]</p><p><i>adj.</i> unproductive of success [bootless, fruitless, sleeveless, vain]</p><p><b>beskoristan, bezuspješan, isprazan, nekoristan, neuspješan, uzaludan (od &quot;futile&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a futile and unproductive manner</p><p><b>beskorisnost, bezvrijednost, ispraznost, jalovost, ništavost, ništetnost, površnost, uzaludnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> uselessness as a consequence of having no practical result</p><p><b>za upotrebu u proizvodnji materijala od tekstilnih materijala od čelika ili čelika, od čelika ili čelika, osim čelika od čelika ili čelika od čelika ili čelika, od čelika ili čelika, od čelika ili čelika, od čelika ili čelika, od čelika ili čelika, od čelika ili čelika, od čelika ili čelika, od čelika ili čelika, od čelika ili čelika, od čelika ili čelika, od čelika ili čelika ili čelika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mattress consisting of a pad of cotton batting that is used for sleeping on the floor or on a raised frame</p><p><b>pokrivač koji je dio brodske opreme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shroud that is part of a ship's rigging</p><p><b>budući, budućnost, futur, glagolsko vrijeme futur, budućem, budući da, budućih, budućim, budućnos, budućnosti, buduća vremena, sutra, sutrašnjica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time yet to come [futurity, hereafter, time to come]</p><p><i>n.</i> a verb tense that expresses actions or states in the future [future tense]</p><p><i>n.</i> bulk commodities bought or sold at an agreed price for delivery at a specified future date</p><p><i>adj.</i> yet to be or coming</p><p><i>adj.</i> effective in or looking toward the future</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of elected officers) elected but not yet serving [next, succeeding]</p><p><i>adj.</i> a verb tense or other formation referring to events or states that have not yet happened</p><p><b>određeni dan u budućnosti koji je određeno kao vrijeme kad će se nešto dogoditi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a particular day in the future that is specified as the time something will happen</p><p><b>- Perfektno vrijeme koje se koristi za opis akcije koja će biti završena u budućnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a perfective tense used to describe action that will be completed in the future [future perfect tense]</p><p><b>- Perfektno vrijeme koje se koristi za opis akcije koja će biti završena u budućnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a perfective tense used to describe action that will be completed in the future [future perfect]</p><p><b>Progresivno vrijeme koje se koristi za izražavanje akcije koja će se odvijati u budućnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a progressive tense used to express action that will be on-going in the future [future progressive tense]</p><p><b>Progresivno vrijeme koje se koristi za izražavanje akcije koja će se odvijati u budućnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a progressive tense used to express action that will be on-going in the future [future progressive]</p><p><b>futur</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a verb tense that expresses actions or states in the future [future]</p><p><b>Još uvijek ne dolazi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> yet to come</p><p><b>bez izgleda ili nade za budućnost. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having no prospect or hope of a future</p><p><b>"Postojanje" znači da se u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka ne primjenjuju obveze koje se odnose na: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agreement to buy or sell a specific amount of a commodity or financial instrument at a particular price on a stipulated future date</p><p><b>U slučaju trgovanja na tržištu robnih proizvoda, trgovanje na tržištu robnih proizvoda je trgovanje na tržištu robnih proizvoda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commodity exchange where futures contracts are traded [forward market, futures market]</p><p><b>ročno tržište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commodity exchange where futures contracts are traded [forward market, futures exchange]</p><p><b>futurizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artistic movement in Italy around 1910 that tried to express the energy and values of the machine age</p><p><i>n.</i> the position that the meaning of life should be sought in the future</p><p><b>futurist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a theologian who believes that the Scripture prophecies of the Apocalypse (the Book of Revelation) will be fulfilled in the future</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who predicts the future [fantast]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to futurism [futuristic]</p><p><b>futurist (od &quot;futurist&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to futurism [futurist]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, poduzeća koja se bave proizvodnjom proizvoda mogu: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the study or prediction of future developments on the basis of existing conditions [futurology]</p><p><b>budućnost, buduća vremena, sutra, sutrašnjica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time yet to come [future, hereafter, time to come]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being in or of the future</p><p><b>futurologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the study or prediction of future developments on the basis of existing conditions [futuristics]</p><p><b>Svaka zapaljiva naprava koja se koristi za pokretanje paljenja goriva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any igniter that is used to initiate the burning of a propellant [fuse, fusee, fuzee, primer, priming]</p><p><b>Bojan flar koji se koristi kao upozorenje kamiona i vlaka., trljajuća šibica s velikom glavom koja će ostati upaljena u vjetru, Svaka zapaljiva naprava koja se koristi za pokretanje paljenja goriva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colored flare used as a warning signal by trucks and trains [fusee]</p><p><i>n.</i> a friction match with a large head that will stay alight in the wind [fusee]</p><p><i>n.</i> any igniter that is used to initiate the burning of a propellant [fuse, fusee, fuze, primer, priming]</p><p><b>bujna kosa, paperje, cajkan, murjak, pandur</b></p><p><i>n.</i> filamentous hairlike growth on a plant [hair, tomentum]</p><p><i>n.</i> uncomplimentary terms for a policeman [bull, cop, copper, pig]</p><p><i>n.</i> a hazy or indistinct representation [blur]</p><p><i>n.</i> the first beard of an adolescent boy</p><p><b>bujna kosa, paperje (od &quot;fuzz&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> covering with fine light hairs [fuzzy]</p><p><b>kvaliteta nejasnosti i bez oštih obrisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being indistinct and without sharp outlines [blurriness, fogginess, indistinctness, softness]</p><p><b>neizrazit, nejasan, pahuljast, pomućen, zacrvenjen, zbunjen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> covering with fine light hairs [fuzzed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> indistinct or hazy in outline [bleary, blurred, blurry, foggy, hazy, muzzy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> confused and not coherent</p><p><b>neizrazita logika, neizrazita (fuzzy) logika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of mathematical logic in which truth can assume a continuum of values between 0 and 1</p><p><b>Agencija u Ministarstvu unutarnjih poslova koja čuva i štiti ribe i divlje životinje i njihova staništa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency in the Department of the Interior that conserves and protects fish and wildlife and their habitats [US Fish and Wildlife Service, United States Fish and Wildlife Service]</p><p><b>Ruski romanopisac koji je pisao o ljudskoj patnji s humorom