.</i> the most commonly used illicit drug [cannabis, marihuana, marijuana]</p><p><b>bluna</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large heavily built seabird with a long stout bill noted for its plunging dives for fish</p><p><b>(Jidish) lopov ili nepošteno lice ili lopov (često se koristi kao opći izraz zlostavljanja) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Yiddish) a thief or dishonest person or scoundrel (often used as a general term of abuse) [ganef, gonif, goniff]</p><p><b>gladak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> primitive fishes having thick bony scales with a shiny covering [ganoid fish]</p><p><b>primitivne ribe s debelim kostnim ljuskama s sjajnim prekrivanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> primitive fishes having thick bony scales with a shiny covering [ganoid]</p><p><b>skupina uglavnom izumrlih primitivnih rib s kostom karakteriziranih oklopnim koštanim ljuskama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of mostly extinct primitive bony fishes characterized by armor-like bony scales [order Ganoidei]</p><p><b>Bliznica koja se nalazi u ribama (posebno u ribama ganoidnim) i čini vanjski sloj njihovih ljuski. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shiny substance that resemble enamel and is secreted by the corium of certain fishes (especially ganoid fishes) and composes the outer layer of their scales [ganoine]</p><p><b>Bliznica koja se nalazi u ribama (posebno u ribama ganoidnim) i čini vanjski sloj njihovih ljuski. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shiny substance that resemble enamel and is secreted by the corium of certain fishes (especially ganoid fishes) and composes the outer layer of their scales [ganoin]</p><p><b>provincija u sjeverno-srednjoj Kini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a province in north-central China [Gansu province, Kansu]</p><p><b>provincija u sjeverno-srednjoj Kini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a province in north-central China [Gansu, Kansu]</p><p><b>sulfonamid (trgovinski naziv Gantanol) koji se koristi za liječenje infekcija (posebno infekcija mokraćnih puteva) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sulfonamide (trade name Gantanol) used to t