idne zmije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Australian elapid snakes [Acanthophis]</p><p><b>rod Bruchidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Bruchidae [Acanthoscelides]</p><p><b>vrsta roda Acanthuridae: dr. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Acanthuridae: doctorfishes [Acanthurus]</p><p><b>Medvjedine hlače (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bear's breeches</p><p><b>Svaka od nekoliko gljiva red Acarina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several mites of the order Acarina [acarus]</p><p><b>Accipiter, rod Accipiter, rod jastreba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the family Accipitridae [Accipiter]</p><p><b>vrsta rod Aceraceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Aceraceae [Acer]</p><p><b>smrtni ćun (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> death's-head moth [Acherontia]</p><p><b>uobičajeni kućni i poljski cvrčci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common house and field crickets [Acheta]</p><p><b>višegodišnje, često aromatične i ponekad matne biljke sjeverno-umjerenog područja: jarov (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial often aromatic and sometimes mat-forming herbs of north temperate regions: yarrow</p><p><b>rodni tropski višegodišnji američki biljke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of tropical perennial American herbs</p><p><b>rod Labridae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Labridae [Achoerodus]</p><p><b>tropska stabla s listovima i velikim plodovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical trees having papery leaves and large fruit [Achras]</p><p><b>gepard, gepardi, rod Acinonyx, rod geparda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cheetahs [Acinonyx]</p><p><b>biljke blisko povezane s rodovima Satureja i Calamintha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plants closely allied to the genera Satureja and Calamintha [Acinos]</p><p><b>Acipenser</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Acipenseridae: sturgeons [Acipenser]</p><p><b>mali rod stabala i grmova koji sadrže vrlo toksične glikozide za srce (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of trees and shrubs containing strongly toxic cardiac glycosides [Acocanthera, Acokanthera, genus Acokanthera]</p><p><