e genus of the family Corynebacteriaceae which is widely distributed in nature</p><p><b>velike palme iz tropske Azije do Australije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large fan palms of tropical Asia to Australia [Corypha]</p><p><b>uglavnom globose kaktusi jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika prekriveni mnogim čvorovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mainly globose cacti of southwestern United States and Mexico covered with many nodules</p><p><b>rod dinosaura kasne krede (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of duck-billed dinosaurs of late Cretaceous</p><p><b>rod Anatidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Anatidae</p><p><b>rod ribe iz obitelji Syngnathidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of fish in the family Syngnathidae [Cosmocampus]</p><p><b>rod tropskih američkih biljaka uzgojenih zbog svojih obojenih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of tropical American plants cultivated for their colorful flowers</p><p><b>rod protuctista flagelatnog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of flagellate protoctist</p><p><b>tip rod Cotingidae: cotingas (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Cotingidae: cotingas</p><p><b>drveće za dim (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> smoke trees [Cotinus]</p><p><b>rod listnatog ili večnozelena stabla Starog svijeta koji se široko uzgajaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of deciduous or evergreen Old World shrubs widely cultivated</p><p><b>vrsta roda Cottidae: sklopovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Cottidae: sculpins [Cottus]</p><p><b>kozmopolitske biljke posebno južne hemisfere (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cosmopolitan herbs especially southern hemisphere [Cotula]</p><p><b>Coturnix</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Old World quail [Coturnix]</p><p><b>tropska američka stabla: grah tonka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American trees: tonka beans [Coumarouna, Dipteryx, genus Dipteryx]</p><p><b>vrsta rod Cracticidae: australski mesari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Cracticidae: Australian butcherbirds [Cracticus]</p><p><b>Jednogodišnje ili višegodišnje biljke 