alizing in geometry [geometrician]</p><p><b>geometrijski, geometrijski oblik stanice pčelinjega saća</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by simple geometric forms in design and decoration [geometrical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or determined by geometry [geometrical]</p><p><b>srednja vrijednost n brojeva izražena kao n-ti korijen njihovog proizvoda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the mean of n numbers expressed as the n-th root of their product</p><p><b>Moderna verzija rimskog koraca sada je 5 stopa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a modern version of the Roman pace now taken to be 5 feet</p><p><b>(matematika) progresija u kojoj se svaki izraz množi sa konstantanom kako bi se dobio sljedeći izraz (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) a progression in which each term is multiplied by a constant in order to obtain the next term</p><p><b>Geometrijski napredak napisan kao zbir (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a geometric progression written as a sum</p><p><b>geometričan, geometrijske, geometrijski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or determined by geometry [geometric]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by simple geometric forms in design and decoration [geometric]</p><p><b>neobična asimetrija u obliku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an irregular asymmetry in shape [irregularity]</p><p><b>svojstvo poligona: svojstvo jednakih strana i jednakih uglova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a property of polygons: the property of having equal sides and equal angles [regularity]</p><p><b>geometričan, geometrijske, geometrijski (od &quot;geometrical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with respect to geometry</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a geometric fashion</p><p><b>matematičar specijaliziran za geometriju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mathematician specializing in geometry [geometer]</p><p><b>Širi krilač koji se zove "mjerni crvi" (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> slender-bodied broad-winged moth whose larvae are called measuring worms [geometrid moth]</p><p><b>Širi krilač koji se zove "mjerni crvi" (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> slen