o tijekom Francuske revolucije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Italian pope from 1775 to 1799 who served during the French Revolution [Giovanni Angelo Braschi, Pius VI]</p><p><b>Talijanski modni dizajner (1946-1997) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Italian fashion designer (1946-1997) [Versace]</p><p><b>div, diva, divovski, džin, genij, gigant, golem, gorostas, gorstasan, ogroman, divovska zvijezda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any creature of exceptional size</p><p><i>n.</i> a person of exceptional importance and reputation [behemoth, colossus, heavyweight, titan]</p><p><i>n.</i> an unusually large enterprise</p><p><i>n.</i> a very large person [heavyweight, hulk, whale]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone or something that is abnormally large and powerful [behemoth, colossus, goliath, monster]</p><p><i>n.</i> an imaginary figure of superhuman size and strength</p><p><i>n.</i> a very bright star of large diameter and low density (relative to the Sun) [giant star]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of great mass [elephantine, gargantuan, jumbo]</p><p><b>veliki mrvičar bez zuba sa dugim jezikom i moćnim kandžama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large shaggy-haired toothless anteater with long tongue and powerful claws [Myrmecophaga jubata, ant bear, great anteater, tamanoir]</p><p><b>oko tri metra dugačak bez repa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> about three feet long exclusive of tail [Priodontes giganteus, tatou, tatu]</p><p><b>ogromni tropski bambus jugoistočne Azije s čvrstim šupljim vrhovima koji liče na deblo stabla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> immense tropical southeast Asian bamboo with tough hollow culms that resemble tree trunks [Dendrocalamus giganteus, kyo-chiku]</p><p><b>spektakularna višegodišnja biljka porijeklom iz mokrih planinskih travnjaka Perua (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spectacular perennial native of wet montane grasslands of Peru [Laccopetalum giganteum]</p><p><b>visoka trava južne Sjedinjenih Država koja raste u grmlju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall grass of southern United States growing in thickets [Arundinaria giga