ifficulty that is not readily evident [catch]</p><p><i>n.</i> something unspecified whose name is either forgotten or not known [doodad, doohickey, doojigger, gismo, gizmo, gubbins, thingamabob, thingamajig, thingmabob, thingmajig, thingumabob, thingumajig, thingummy, whatchamacallit, whatchamacallum, whatsis, widget]</p><p><i>n.</i> any clever maneuver [device, twist]</p><p><b>zbirka trikova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of gimmicks</p><p><b>hrom, hramati, šepati, šepesati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> disability of walking due to crippling of the legs or feet [claudication, gameness, gimpiness, lameness, limping]</p><p><i>v.</i> walk impeded by some physical limitation or injury [hitch, hobble, limp]</p><p><b>invalidnost u hodanju zbog osakaćenja nogu ili stopala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> disability of walking due to crippling of the legs or feet [claudication, gameness, gimp, lameness, limping]</p><p><b>invaliditet u stopalima ili nogama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> disabled in the feet or legs [crippled, game, halt, halting, lame]</p><p><b>ako, džin, džin (rakija), gin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> strong liquor flavored with juniper berries</p><p><i>n.</i> a trap for birds or small mammals [noose, snare]</p><p><i>n.</i> a machine that separates the seeds from raw cotton fibers [cotton gin]</p><p><i>n.</i> a form of rummy in which a player can go out if the cards remaining in their hand total less than 10 points [gin rummy, knock rummy]</p><p><i>v.</i> separate the seeds from (cotton) with a cotton gin</p><p><i>v.</i> trap with a snare</p><p><b>Koktel od gina i slatkog vermuta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cocktail made of gin and sweet vermouth</p><p><b>džin-tonik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> gin and quinine water</p><p><b>Taverna koja se sastoji od zgrade s barom i javnim sobama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tavern consisting of a building with a bar and public rooms [pothouse, pub, public house, saloon, taphouse]</p><p><b>Rickey napravljen s ginom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rickey made with gin</p><p><b>oblik rummyja u kojem igrač može izaći ako su kartice koje su mu ostale u ruci manje od 10 bodova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of rummy in which a player can go out if the cards remaining in their hand total less than 10 points [gin, knock rummy]</p><p><b>Sling napravljen od gina. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sling made with gin</p><p><b>tropsko američko stablo s malim jestivim plodom s zelenom kožnom kožom i slatkom sočnom prozirnom pulpom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American tree bearing a small edible fruit with green leathery skin and sweet juicy translucent pulp [Melicocca bijuga, Melicocca bijugatus, Spanish lime, Spanish lime tree, genip, honey berry, mamoncillo]</p><p><b>đumbir, poduzetnost, đinđer, đumbir u prahu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial plants having thick branching aromatic rhizomes and leafy reedlike stems</p><p><i>n.</i> dried ground gingerroot [powdered ginger]</p><p><i>n.</i> pungent rhizome of the common ginger plant [gingerroot]</p><p><i>n.</i> liveliness and energy [pep, peppiness]</p><p><i>v.</i> add ginger to in order to add flavor</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used especially of hair or fur) having a bright orange-brown color [gingery]</p><p><b>gumoziranog gaziranog pića (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ginger-flavored carbonated drink [ginger pop]</p><p><b>s masom od 0,15 g/l ili većom od 0,15 g/l (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> carbonated slightly alcoholic drink flavored with fermented ginger</p><p><b>rod tropskih monocotyledonous biljaka red Musales (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of tropical monocotyledonous plants of order Musales [Zingiberaceae, family Zingiberaceae]</p><p><b>djumbir oraščić, đumbir - oraščić</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a crisp round cookie flavored with ginger [ginger snap, gingersnap, snap]</p><p><b>gumoziranog gaziranog pića (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ginger-flavored carbonated drink [ginger ale]</p><p><b>Američka plesačica i filmska glumica koja je bila partner Fred Astaire (1911-1995) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United Stat