ustrijaš i pionir u zrakoplovstvu (1878-1930) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States industrialist and aviation pioneer (1878-1930) [Curtiss, Glenn Hammond Curtiss]</p><p><b>Američki industrijaš i pionir u zrakoplovstvu (1878-1930) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States industrialist and aviation pioneer (1878-1930) [Curtiss, Glenn Curtiss]</p><p><b>Američki dirigent popularnog big benda (1909-1944) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States bandleader of a popular big band (1909-1944) [Alton Glenn Miller, Miller]</p><p><b>Američki kemičar koji je bio jedan od otkrivača plutonija (1912-1999) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States chemist who was one of the discoverers of plutonium (1912-1999) [Glenn Theodore Seaborg, Seaborg]</p><p><b>Američki kemičar koji je bio jedan od otkrivača plutonija (1912-1999) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States chemist who was one of the discoverers of plutonium (1912-1999) [Glenn T. Seaborg, Seaborg]</p><p><b>konkavitet u glavi lopatice koji prima glavu humera kako bi formirao zglob ramena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the concavity in the head of the scapula that receives the head of the humerus to form the shoulder joint [glenoid fossa]</p><p><b>konkavitet u glavi lopatice koji prima glavu humera kako bi formirao zglob ramena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a deep concavity in the temporal bone at the root of the zygomatic arch that receives the condyle of the mandible [mandibular fossa]</p><p><i>n.</i> the concavity in the head of the scapula that receives the head of the humerus to form the shoulder joint [glenoid cavity]</p><p><b>sustentakularno tkivo koje okružuje i podržava neurone u središnjem živčanom sustavu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sustentacular tissue that surrounds and supports neurons in the central nervous system [neuroglia]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s neuroglijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to neuroglia</p><p><b>ćelija neuroglije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cell of the neuroglia [neurogliacyte, neuroglial cell]</p><p><b>glad