im mjestima širom Sjeverne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pasture grass of moist places throughout North America [reed meadow grass]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a syrupy acid obtained by oxidation of glycerol or glyceraldehyde</p><p><b>gliceraldehid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sweet crystalline aldehyde formed by the breakdown of sugars [glyceraldehyde]</p><p><b>ester glicerola i masnih kiselina koji se prirodno nalazi u obliku masti i masnih ulja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ester of glycerol and fatty acids that occurs naturally as fats and fatty oils [acylglycerol]</p><p><b>glicerin, glicerol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sweet syrupy trihydroxy alcohol obtained by saponification of fats and oils [glycerine, glycerol]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mixture of glycerin and gelatin that is used in histology for mounting specimens</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gelatinous preparation made from gelatin and glycerin and water</p><p><b>glicerin, glicerol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sweet syrupy trihydroxy alcohol obtained by saponification of fats and oils [glycerin, glycerol]</p><p><b>lijek koji se proizvodi mešanjem tvari u glicerin (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a medicine made by mixing a substance in glycerin [glycerole]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a medicated skin preparation made from glycerin and glycerinated gelatin [glycerogelatin]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a medicated skin preparation made from glycerin and glycerinated gelatin [glycerogel]</p><p><b>glicerol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sweet syrupy trihydroxy alcohol obtained by saponification of fats and oils [glycerin, glycerine]</p><p><b>gliceril ester m