je (1853-1890) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Dutch Post-impressionist painter noted for his use of color (1853-1890) [Vincent van Gogh, van Gogh]</p><p><b>Gogolj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian writer who introduced realism to Russian literature (1809-1852) [Nikolai Vasilievich Gogol]</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko srodnih jezika Kelta u Irskoj i Škotskoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several related languages of the Celts in Ireland and Scotland [Erse, Gaelic]</p><p><b>ići, koji ide, odlazak, polazak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of departing [departure, going away, leaving]</p><p><i>n.</i> euphemistic expressions for death [departure, exit, expiration, loss, passing, release]</p><p><i>n.</i> advancing toward a goal [sledding]</p><p><i>adj.</i> in full operation</p><p><b>Sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> debarkation from a boat or ship</p><p><b>odlazak, polazak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of departing [departure, going, leaving]</p><p><b>dječja igra u kojoj igrači marširaju uz muziku oko grupe stolica koje sadrže jednu stolicu manje od broja igrača (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a child's game in which players march to music around a group of chairs that contains one chair less than the number of players [musical chairs]</p><p><b>(od broda) potonuće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (of a ship) sinking [foundering]</p><p><b>Prodaja svih materijalnih sredstava poduzeća koje se sprema zatvoriti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sale of all the tangible assets of a business that is about to close</p><p><b>pažljivu i temeljnu inspekciju, Oštro prezivanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a careful and thorough inspection</p><p><i>n.</i> a severe scolding [bawling out, castigation, chewing out, dressing down, earful, upbraiding]</p><p><b>abnormalno povećanje štitne žlezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormally enlarged thyroid gland [goitre, struma, thyromegaly]</p><p><b>guša</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormally enlarged thyroid gland [goiter, struma, thyromegaly]</p><p><b>bilo koja tvar (kao što je tioracil)