ijezda u kojoj se proizvode gamete (polne stanice) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gland in which gametes (sex cells) are produced [sex gland]</p><p><b>gonada, gonadni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the gonads</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s gonadotropinom ili s gonadotropinom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or involving gonadotropin [gonadotropic]</p><p><b>hormon koji se luči iz prednje hipofize i posteljice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hormone secreted by the anterior pituitary gland and placenta [gonadotrophin, gonadotropic hormone, gonadotropin]</p><p><b>hormon koji se luči iz prednje hipofize i posteljice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hormone secreted by the anterior pituitary gland and placenta [gonadotrophic hormone, gonadotropic hormone, gonadotropin]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s gonadotropinom ili s gonadotropinom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or involving gonadotropin [gonadotrophic]</p><p><b>gonadotropni hormoni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hormone secreted by the anterior pituitary gland and placenta [gonadotrophic hormone, gonadotrophin, gonadotropin]</p><p><b>hormon koji se luči iz prednje hipofize i posteljice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hormone secreted by the anterior pituitary gland and placenta [gonadotrophic hormone, gonadotrophin, gonadotropic hormone]</p><p><b>visoka tropska američka drveta posebno obilna u istočnom Brazilu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall tropical American timber tree especially abundant in eastern Brazil [Astronium fraxinifolium]</p><p><b>Francuski pisac koji je surađivao sa bratom Edmondom de Goncourtom na mnogim knjigama (1830-1870), Francuski pisac koji je surađivao sa bratom Julesom de Goncourtom na mnogim knjigama i koji je u svojoj oporuki uspostavio Prix Goncourt (1822-1896) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French writer who collaborated with his brother Edmond de Goncourt on many books (1830-1870) [Jules Alfred Huot de Goncourt, Jules de Goncourt]</p><p><i>n.</i> French writer who collaborated with his brother Jules de Goncourt on many books and who in his will established the Prix Goncourt (1822-1896) [Edmond Louis Antoine Huot de Goncourt, Edmond de Goncourt]</p><p><b>član nekadašnjeg plemenskog naroda u južnoj središnjoj Indiji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of a formerly tribal people in south central India</p><p><b>tvrdi vosak kremasto boje dobiven od javanskog smokve (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hard cream-colored wax obtained from a Javanese fig tree [fig wax]</p><p><b>Dravidski jezik kojim govore Gondovi u južnoj središnjoj Indiji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Dravidian language spoken by the Gond in south central India</p><p><b>gondola</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a low flat-bottomed freight car with fixed sides but no roof [gondola car]</p><p><i>n.</i> long narrow flat-bottomed boat propelled by sculling</p><p><i>n.</i> the compartment that is suspended from an airship and that carries personnel and the cargo and the power plant [car]</p><p><b>Niski teretni vagon s ravnim dnom s fiksnim stranama, ali bez krova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a low flat-bottomed freight car with fixed sides but no roof [gondola]</p><p><b>(Venecijanski) čamac koji pokreće gondolu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a (Venetian) boatman who propels a gondola [gondoliere]</p><p><b>(Venecijanski) čamac koji pokreće gondolu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a (Venetian) boatman who propels a gondola [gondolier]</p><p><b>hipotetički kontinent koji se (prema teoriji tektonske ploče) kasnije raspao na Indiju i Australiju i Afriku i Južnu Ameriku i Antarktik. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hypothetical continent that (according to plate tectonic theory) broke up later into India and Australia and Africa and South America and Antarctica</p><p><b>izgubljen, nestao, otišao, pođe, propao, prošao, umrli</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> destroyed or killed [done for, kaput]</p><p><i>adj.</i> dead [asleep, at peace, at rest, deceased, departed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> well in the past [bygone, bypast, departed, foregone]</p><p><i>adj.</i> stupefied or excited by a chemical substance (especially alcohol) [drunk, inebriated, intoxicated, ripped]</p><p><i>adj.</i> drained of energy or effectiveness [dog-tired, exhausted, fagged, fatigued, played out, spent, washed-out, worn-out, worn out]</p><p><i>adj.</i> used up or no longer available</p><p><b>izgubljen, nestao, otišao, pođe, propao, prošao (od &quot;gone&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person in desperate straits [toast]</p><p><b>gong, tam-tam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a percussion instrument consisting of a metal plate that is struck with a softheaded drumstick [tam-tam]</p><p><i>n.</i> a percussion instrument consisting of a set of tuned bells that are struck with a hammer [bell, chime]</p><p><i>v.</i> sound a gong</p><p><b>Boja s zvonom na njoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a buoy with a bell on it [bell buoy]</p><p><b>Španjolski pjesnik čije je djelo karakteriziralo elegantno stilo (1561-1627) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Spanish poet whose work was characterized by an affected elegance of style (1561-1627) [Luis de Gongora y Argote]</p><p><b>utjecaj elegancije stila koji je u španjolsku književnost uveo pjesnik Gongora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an affected elegance of style that was introduced into Spanish literature by the poet Gongora</p><p><b>-Prakticiralo je elegantni stil španjolskog pjesnika Gongora. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a practitioner of the affected elegant style of the Spanish poet Gongora</p><p><b>(Jidish) lopov ili nepošteno lice ili lopov (često se koristi kao opći izraz zlostavljanja) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Yiddish) a thief or dishonest person or scoundrel (often used as a general term of abuse) [ganef, ganof, goniff]</p><p><b>(Jidish) lopov ili nepošteno lice ili lopov (često se koristi kao opći izraz zlostavljanja) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Yiddish) a thief or dishonest person or scoundrel (often used as a general term of abuse) [ganef, ganof, gonif]</p><p><b>goniometar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> direction finder that determines the angular direction of incoming radio signals</