right, ripe]</p><p><i>adj.</i> resulting favorably [well]</p><p><i>adj.</i> exerting force or influence [effective, in effect, in force]</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of pleasing</p><p><i>adj.</i> appealing to the mind [serious]</p><p><i>adj.</i> in excellent physical condition [sound]</p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to promote physical well-being [salutary]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not forged [honest]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not left to spoil [unspoiled, unspoilt]</p><p><i>adj.</i> generally admired</p><p><i>adv.</i> (often used as a combining form) in a good or proper or satisfactory manner or to a high standard (`good' is a nonstandard dialectal variant for `well') [well]</p><p><i>adv.</i> completely and absolutely (`good' is sometimes used informally for `thoroughly') [soundly, thoroughly]</p><p><b>Dobar dan, dobar dan!</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a conventional expression of greeting or farewell [afternoon]</p><p><b>Svjedočanstvo nekoga tko bi trebao znati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> testimony by someone who should know</p><p><b>Biblija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sacred writings of the Christian religions [Bible, Book, Christian Bible, Holy Scripture, Holy Writ, Scripture, Word, Word of God]</p><p><b>Gestaltov princip organizacije koji tvrdi da postoji urođena tendencija da se linija smatra nastavkom svog uspostavljenog smjera. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Gestalt principle of organization holding that there is an innate tendency to perceive a line as continuing its established direction [continuation, law of continuation]</p><p><b>dobar dan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a farewell remark [adieu, adios, arrivederci, au revoir, auf wiedersehen, bye, bye-bye, cheerio, good-by, good-bye, goodby, goodbye, sayonara, so long]</p><p><b>gomila, hrpa, hrpetina, masa, mnoštvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (often followed by `of') a large number or amount or extent [batch, deal, flock, great deal, hatful, heap, lot, mass, mess, mickle, mint, mountain, muckle, passel, peck, pile, plenty, pot, quite a little, raft, sight, slew, spa