ie]</p><p><b>mali tupi ili metalno obojeni tineoidni moljci čije ličinke koplje u biljnim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small dull or metallic-colored tineoid moths whose larvae mine in plant leaves [gracilariid moth]</p><p><b>mali tupi ili metalno obojeni tineoidni moljci čije ličinke koplje u biljnim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small dull or metallic-colored tineoid moths whose larvae mine in plant leaves [gracilariid]</p><p><b>rudari lišća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> leaf miners [Gracillariidae, family Gracilariidae]</p><p><b>Visoka i graciozna. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> slender and graceful [willowy]</p><p><b>ljupkost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> elegance and beauty of movement or expression [grace]</p><p><b>rudari lišća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> leaf miners [Gracilariidae, family Gracilariidae]</p><p><b>dražestan, elegantan, ljubazan, milostiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by charm, good taste, and generosity of spirit</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by kindness and warm courtesy especially of a king to his subjects [benignant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> exhibiting courtesy and politeness [courteous, nice]</p><p><i>adj.</i> disposed to bestow favors</p><p><b>dostojanstveno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a gracious or graceful manner [gracefully]</p><p><b>dražestan, elegantan, ljubazan, milostiv (od &quot;gracious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> excellence of manners or social conduct</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being kind and gentle [benignancy, benignity]</p><p><b>Blizanje crnog azijskog štarla često se uči oponašati govor., američki crnoprat s dugim repom s iridescentnim crnim perjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> glossy black Asiatic starling often taught to mimic speech [Gracula religiosa, Indian grackle, hill myna]</p><p><i>n.</i> long-tailed American blackbird having iridescent black plumage [crow blackbird]</p><p><b>Minska (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mynas [genus Gracula]</p><p><b>Blizanje crnog azijskog štarla često se uči oponašati govor. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> glossy black