, nivo, cijeniti, ocjenjivati, procijeniti, procjenjivati, rangirati, stupnjevati, bodovati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a body of students who are taught together [class, course, form]</p><p><i>n.</i> a relative position or degree of value in a graded group [level, tier]</p><p><i>n.</i> the gradient of a slope or road or other surface</p><p><i>n.</i> one-hundredth of a right angle [grad]</p><p><i>n.</i> a degree of ablaut [gradation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a number or letter indicating quality (especially of a student's performance) [mark, score]</p><p><i>n.</i> the height of the ground on which something stands [ground level]</p><p><i>n.</i> a position on a scale of intensity or amount or quality [degree, level]</p><p><i>n.</i> a variety of cattle produced by crossbreeding with a superior breed</p><p><i>v.</i> assign a rank or rating to [order, place, range, rank, rate]</p><p><i>v.</i> level to the right gradient</p><p><i>v.</i> assign a grade or rank to, according to one's evaluation [mark, score]</p><p><i>v.</i> determine the grade of or assign a grade to</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to potrebno za ispitivanje, ispitivanje se provodi na temelju sljedećih kriterija: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intersection of a railway and a road on the same level [level crossing]</p><p><b>V-oblikna značka s rukavom koja označava vojni čin i službu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> V-shaped sleeve badge indicating military rank and service [chevron, stripe, stripes]</p><p><b>brojni broj sati dodjeljenih za tečaj. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a numerical value assigned to a letter grade received in a course taken at a college or university multiplied by the number of credit hours awarded for the course</p><p><b>mjera akademskih postignuća studenta na koledžu ili sveučilištu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measure of a student's academic achievement at a college or university [GPA]</p><p><b>škola za malu djecu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a school for young children [elementary school, grammar school, primary school]</p><p><b