nflower cultivated for its deep purple fruit [Passiflora edulis, purple granadillo]</p><p><i>n.</i> the egg-shaped edible fruit of tropical American vines related to passionflowers</p><p><b>Drvo u zapadnoj Indiji koje daje vrhunski zeleno ebono. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> West Indian tree yielding a fine grade of green ebony [Brya ebenus, granadillo]</p><p><b>crveno-tamno tvrdo drvo koje se dobiva od kokobola i koristi se za izradu glazbenih instrumenata, npr. klarinet, Drvo od drveta granadilla za izradu glazbenih instrumenata, posebno klarinetova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dark red hardwood derived from the cocobolo and used in making musical instruments e.g. clarinets</p><p><i>n.</i> wood of the granadilla tree used for making musical instruments especially clarinets [cocoswood, cocuswood]</p><p><b>Drvo u zapadnoj Indiji koje daje vrhunski zeleno ebono. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> West Indian tree yielding a fine grade of green ebony [Brya ebenus, granadilla tree]</p><p><b>ambar, hambar, žitnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a storehouse for threshed grain or animal feed [garner]</p><p><b>divan, odličan, sjajan, veličanstven, velik, značajan, tisuća, tisuću</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the product of 10 and 100 [1000, G, K, M, chiliad, one thousand, thou, thousand, yard]</p><p><i>n.</i> a piano with the strings on a horizontal harp-shaped frame [grand piano]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of behavior that is impressive and ambitious in scale or scope [expansive, heroic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or befitting a lord [august, lordly]</p><p><i>adj.</i> ostentatiously rich and superior in quality [deluxe, gilded, lush, luxurious, opulent, princely, sumptuous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> extraordinarily good or great [fantastic, howling, marvellous, marvelous, rattling, terrific, tremendous, wonderful, wondrous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of high moral or intellectual value [elevated, exalted, high-flown, high-minded, idealistic, lofty, noble-minded, rarefied, rarified, sublime]</p><p><i>adj.</i> large