ee, striped squirrel]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various terrestrial burrowing rodents of Old and New Worlds [gopher, spermophile]</p><p><b>osnovno stanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the lowest energy state of an atom or other particle</p><p><b>tenis povrat napravljen udaranjem lopte nakon što je odbojka jednom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tennis return made by hitting the ball after it has bounced once</p><p><b>Tjelesna tvar u kojoj su ugrađene tkivne stanice, Čisti nežutičasti dio citoplazme stanice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the body substance in which tissue cells are embedded [intercellular substance, matrix]</p><p><i>n.</i> the clear nongranular portion of the cytoplasm of a cell [hyaloplasm]</p><p><b>bibavica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an obvious change of public opinion or political sentiment that occurs without leadership or overt expression</p><p><i>n.</i> a broad and deep undulation of the ocean [heavy swell]</p><p><b>kotva, sidro</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanical device that prevents a vessel from moving [anchor]</p><p><b>podzemna voda, podzemne vode</b></p><p><i>n.</i> underground water that is held in the soil and in pervious rocks [spring water, well water]</p><p><b>površinski zemaljski val</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a radio wave propagated on or near the earth's surface</p><p><b>cilj projektila (kao bomba ili raketa), mjesto Svjetskog trgovinskog centra prije nego što je uništeno, U slučaju nuklearnog oružja, točka eksplozije (ili iznad ili ispod) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the target of a projectile (as a bomb or missile)</p><p><i>n.</i> the site of the World Trade Center before it was destroyed</p><p><i>n.</i> the point of detonation (or above or below) of a nuclear weapon</p><p><b>malena prostrana ili uzlazna grmlja s crvenokrasnim cvijećem i sočnim plodovima sličnim brusnicama, puževi grm istočne Sjeverne Amerike s bijelim zvonovitim cvijećima, a zatim začinjenim crvenim voćem nalik bobici i sjajnim aromatičnim lištima koji daju zimsko zeleno ulje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small prostrate or ascending shrub having scarlet flowers and succulent fruit resembling cranberries [Astroloma humifusum, Styphelia humifusum, cranberry heath, groundberry, native cranberry]</p><p><i>n.</i> creeping shrub of eastern North America having white bell-shaped flowers followed by spicy red berrylike fruit and shiny aromatic leaves that yield wintergreen oil [Gaultheria procumbens, checkerberry, creeping wintergreen, groundberry, mountain tea, teaberry, wintergreen]</p><p><b>letjelica slijetanje u lošem vremenu u kojem je pilot je govorio dolje od strane kontrole na zemlji koristeći preciznost pristup radar (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aircraft landing in bad weather in which the pilot is talked down by ground control using precision approach radar [GCA]</p><p><b>hovercraft, lebdjelica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a craft capable of moving over water or land on a cushion of air created by jet engines [hovercraft]</p><p><b>eksplozivna mina skrivena ispod zemlje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an explosive mine hidden underground [booby trap, land mine]</p><p><b>prizemlje</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> on the floor closest to level with the ground</p><p><b>biljaka koje rastu relativno nisko do zemlje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of plants that grow relatively low to the ground [flat-growing, low-growing]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, zrakoplov može biti upotrebljen za upravljanje zrakoplovima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the crew of technicians and mechanics who service aircraft on the ground [ground crew]</p><p><b>Veliki biljkojedni dinosaur iz krede pronađen u zapadnoj Sjevernoj Americi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> huge herbivorous dinosaur of the Cretaceous found in western North America [seismosaur]</p><p><b>(baseball) udarac koji putuje duž zemlje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) a hit that travels along the ground [ground ball, grounder, hopper]</p><p><b>malena prostrana ili uzlazna grmlja s crvenokrasnim cvijećem i sočnim plodovima sličnim brusnicama, puževi grm istočne Sjeverne Amerike s bijelim zvonovitim cvijećima, a zatim začinjenim crvenim voćem nalik bobici i sjajnim aromatičnim lištima koji daju zimsko zeleno ulje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small prostrate or ascending shrub having scarlet flowers and succulent fruit resembling cranberries [Astroloma humifusum, Styphelia humifusum, cranberry heath, ground-berry, native cranberry]</p><p><i>n.</i> creeping shrub of eastern North America having white bell-shaped flowers followed by spicy red berrylike fruit and shiny aromatic leaves that yield wintergreen oil [Gaultheria procumbens, checkerberry, creeping wintergreen, ground-berry, mountain tea, teaberry, wintergreen]</p><p><b>pionir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who helps to open up a new line of research or technology or art [innovator, pioneer, trailblazer]</p><p><b>inovativan, nov, početak građevinskih radova</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ceremonial breaking of the ground to formally begin a construction project [groundbreaking ceremony]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being or producing something like nothing done or experienced or created before [innovational, innovative]</p><p><b>ceremonijalno rušenje zemlje za formalno početak izgradnje projekta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ceremonial breaking of the ground to formally begin a construction project [groundbreaking]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je proizvodnja biljaka u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za koje se primjenjuje točka (b) ovog članka, za biljke koje su u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći uvjet:, U slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka ne primjenjuje na biljke koje su u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, točka (b) ovog članka ne primjenjuje se na biljke koje su u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low-growing plants planted in deep shade or on a steep slope where turf is difficult to grow [ground cover]</p><p><i>n.</i> small plants other than saplings growing on a forest floor [ground cover]</p><p><b>baza, igralište, list, mljeven, osnova, pod, polje, prizeman, prizemlje, razlog, smrviti, temelj, temeljiti se, teren, tlo, uzemljiti, zdjela, zemlja, utemeljit (od &quot;ground&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) a hit that travels along the ground [ground ball, groundball, hopper]</p><p><b>ribama koje žive na morskom dnu (posebno ribama s komercijalnim značajem poput trske i egle, ili ravnim ribama poput žablja) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fish that live on the sea bottom (particularly the commercially important gadoid fish like cod and haddock, or flatfish like flounder) [bottom fish]</p><p><b>nutrija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> reddish brown North American marmot [Marmota monax, woodchuck]</p><p><b>Ako se svinja pojavi i vidi svoju sjenu na ovaj dan, bit će još 6 tjedana zime. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> if the ground hog emerges and sees his shadow on this day, there will be 6 more weeks of winter [February 2]</p><p><b>nasukanje, nasukavanje broda, uzemljenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> education or instruction in the fundamentals of a field of knowledge [foundation]</p><p><i>n.</i> fastening electrical equipment to earth [earthing]</p><p><b>osoba koja održava prostor (posjeda ili park ili sportsko igralište) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who maintains the grounds (of an estate or park or athletic field) [groundskeeper, groundsman]</p><p><b>bestemeljan, bezrazložan, neosnovan, neutemeljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> without a basis in reason or fact [baseless, idle, unfounded, unwarranted, wild]</p><p><b>bezrazložnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of lacking substance or value [idleness]</p><p><b>u Elizabetanskom kazalištu: gledaoci u jeftinom odjeljku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in Elizabethan theater: a playgoer in the cheap standing section</p><p><b>(geologija) matrica finozrnčanih kristalnih materijala u koje su ugrađeni veći kristali (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (geology) the matrix of fine-graine