 tree, groundsel bush]</p><p><b>vodotvoran komad tkanine raspoređen na podu (kao pod šatorom) kako bi se zaštitio od vlage (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a waterproofed piece of cloth spread on the ground (as under a tent) to protect from moisture [ground cloth]</p><p><b>osoba koja održava prostor (posjeda ili park ili sportsko igralište) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who maintains the grounds (of an estate or park or athletic field) [groundkeeper, groundsman]</p><p><b>osoba koja održava prostor (posjeda ili park ili sportsko igralište) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who maintains the grounds (of an estate or park or athletic field) [groundkeeper, groundskeeper]</p><p><b>brzina zrakoplova u odnosu na tlo; (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the speed of an aircraft relative to the ground</p><p><b>podzemna površina ispod koje je tlo u potpunosti zasićeno vodom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> underground surface below which the ground is wholly saturated with water [water level, water table]</p><p><b>osnova, podloga, temelj, temelje, temelji, baza, osnovica, dno, podnožje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the fundamental assumptions from which something is begun or developed or calculated or explained [base, basis, cornerstone, foundation, fundament]</p><p><i>n.</i> lowest support of a structure [base, foot, foundation, fundament, substructure, understructure]</p><p><i>n.</i> preliminary preparation as a basis or foundation</p><p><b>družina, grupa, grupiranje, grupirati, instrumentalni sastav, postrojba, sastav, skupina, skupiti, zajednica, grupe, skup, radikal, dijeliti, podijeliti, rasporediti, raspoređivati, razvrstati, razvrstavati, svrstati, svrstavati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any number of entities (members) considered as a unit [grouping]</p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) two or more atoms bound together as a single unit and forming part of a molecule [chemical group, radical]</p><p><i>n.</i> a set that is closed, associative, has an identity element and every element has an inverse [mathematical group]</p><p><i>v.</i> arrange into a group or groups</p><p><i>v.</i> form a group or group together [aggroup]</p><p><b>krvna grupa čije crvene stanice nose A antigen (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the blood group whose red cells carry the A antigen [A, type A]</p><p><b>krvna grupa čije crvene stanice nose i A i B antigene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the blood group whose red cells carry both the A and B antigens [AB, type AB]</p><p><b>grupna aktivnost, grupna radnja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> action taken by a group of people</p><p><b>upotrebljava se u nekim sustavima klasifikacije biljaka koje nose mačke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used in some classification systems for plants that bear catkins [Amentiferae]</p><p><b>krvna grupa čije crvene stanice nose B antigen (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the blood group whose red cells carry the B antigen [B, type B]</p><p><b>časnik (posebno u Kraljevskom zrakoplovstvu) ekvivalentni čin pukovniku u vojsci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commissioned officer (especially one in the Royal Air Force) equivalent in rank to a colonel in the army</p><p><b>korišten u bivšim sustavima klasifikacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used in former classification systems [Centrospermae]</p><p><b>konferencija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a discussion among participants who have an agreed (serious) topic [conference]</p><p><b>ogranak socijalne psihologije koji proučava psihodinamiku interakcije u društvenim skupinama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of social psychology that studies the psychodynamics of interaction in social groups</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u pitanju osiguranje koje je kupilo društvo, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ili člankom 3. točkom (b) ovog članka, društvo može osigurati da se u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ili člankom 3. točkom (b) ovog članka ne primjenjuje osiguranje koje je kupilo društvo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> insurance that is purchased by a group (such as the employees of a company) usually at a reduced rate to individual members of the group</p><p><b>sastanak, susret</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a formally arranged gathering [meeting]</p><p><b>krvna grupa čije crvene stanice ne nose ni A ni B antigene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the blood group whose red cells carry neither the A nor B antigens [O, type O]</p><p><b>sudjelovanje svih članova skupine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> participation by all members of a group</p><p><b>(medicina) praksa medicine od strane skupine liječnika koji dijele svoje prostorije i druge resurse (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (medicine) the practice of medicine by a group of physicians who share their premises and other resources</p><p><b>psihoterapija u kojoj se mala skupina osoba sastaje s terapeutom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> psychotherapy in which a small group of individuals meet with a therapist [group therapy]</p><p><b>primjenjuje se u nekim sustavima klasifikacije: skupina izumrlih fosilnih gimnosperma koestentnih s redom Cycadofilicales (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used in some classification systems: a group of extinct fossil gymnosperms coextensive with the order Cycadofilicales [Pteridospermae, Pteridospermaphyta, group Pteridospermaphyta]</p><p><b>primjenjuje se u nekim sustavima klasifikacije: skupina izumrlih fosilnih gimnosperma koestentnih s redom Cycadofilicales (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used in some classification systems: a group of extinct fossil gymnosperms coextensive with the order Cycadofilicales [Pteridospermae, Pteridospermaphyta, group Pteridospermae]</p><p><b>teorija grupa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of mathematics dealing with groups</p><p><b>psihoterapija u kojoj se mala skupina osoba sastaje s terapeutom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> psychotherapy in which a small group of individuals meet with a therapist [group psychotherapy]</p><p><b>grupiran, okupljen, okupljeni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> arranged into groups [sorted]</p><p><b>škarpina, škrpina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> flesh of a saltwater fish similar to sea bass</p><p><i>n.</i> usually solitary bottom sea basses of warm seas</