im u Kuranu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Islam) serious crimes committed by Muslims and punishable by punishments established in the Koran</p><p><b>za najdublje dijelove oceana (ispod 6000 m) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to the deepest parts of the ocean (below 6000 meters)</p><p><b>koljak, vrsta bakalara</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lean white flesh of fish similar to but smaller than cod</p><p><i>n.</i> important food fish on both sides of the Atlantic [Melanogrammus aeglefinus]</p><p><b>najraniji eon u povijesti Zemlje od prve akrecije planetarnog materijala (približno prije 4.600 milijuna godina) do datuma najstarijih poznatih stijena (približno prije 3.800 milijuna godina), od ili u vezi s ili karakteristika Hades ili Tartarus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the earliest eon in the history of the Earth from the first accretion of planetary material (around 4,600 million years ago) until the date of the oldest known rocks (about 3,800 million years ago) [Hadean aeon, Hadean eon, Hadean time, Priscoan, Priscoan aeon, Priscoan eon]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of Hades or Tartarus [Plutonian, Tartarean]</p><p><b>najraniji eon u povijesti Zemlje od prve akrecije planetarnog materijala (približno prije 4.600 milijuna godina) do datuma najstarijih poznatih stijena (približno prije 3.800 milijuna godina) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the earliest eon in the history of the Earth from the first accretion of planetary material (around 4,600 million years ago) until the date of the oldest known rocks (about 3,800 million years ago) [Hadean, Hadean eon, Hadean time, Priscoan, Priscoan aeon, Priscoan eon]</p><p><b>najraniji eon u povijesti Zemlje od prve akrecije planetarnog materijala (približno prije 4.600 milijuna godina) do datuma najstarijih poznatih stijena (približno prije 3.800 milijuna godina) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the earliest eon in the history of the Earth from the first accretion of planetary material (around 4,600 million years ago) until the date of the oldest known rocks (about 3,800 million years ago) [Hadean, Hadean aeon, Hadean time, Priscoan, Priscoan aeon, Priscoan eon]</p><p><b>najraniji eon u povijesti Zemlje od prve akrecije planetarnog materijala (približno prije 4.600 milijuna godina) do datuma najstarijih poznatih stijena (približno prije 3.800 milijuna godina) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the earliest eon in the history of the Earth from the first accretion of planetary material (around 4,600 million years ago) until the date of the oldest known rocks (about 3,800 million years ago) [Hadean, Hadean aeon, Hadean eon, Priscoan, Priscoan aeon, Priscoan eon]</p><p><b>Had</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) the god of the underworld in ancient mythology [Aides, Aidoneus]</p><p><i>n.</i> (religion) the world of the dead [Hell, Scheol, infernal region, netherworld, underworld]</p><p><b>(Islam) tradicija zasnovana na izvještajima o izjavama i aktivnostima Muhameda i njegovih sljedbenika, (Islam) način života propisan kao normativni za muslimane na temelju učenja i praksi Muhameda i tumačenja Kurana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Islam) a tradition based on reports of the sayings and activities of Muhammad and his companions</p><p><i>n.</i> (Islam) the way of life prescribed as normative for Muslims on the basis of the teachings and practices of Muhammad and interpretations of the Koran [Sunna, Sunnah]</p><p><b>Peti stub islama je hodočašće u Meku u mjesecu Dhu al-Hijja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the fifth pillar of Islam is a pilgrimage to Mecca during the month of Dhu al-Hijja [haj, hajj]</p><p><b>hodža</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an Arabic term of respect for someone who has made the pilgrimage to Mecca [haji, hajji]</p><p><b>Rimski car koji je bio usvojeni sin Trajana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Roman Emperor who was the adoptive son of Trajan [Adrian, Publius Aelius Hadrianus]</p><p><b>drevni rimski zid izgrađen od strane Hadrijana u 2. stoljeću. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient Roman wall built by Hadrian in the 2n