from a vertebral centrum and enclosing the caudal blood vessels [hemal arch]</p><p><b>hemangiom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> benign angioma consisting of a mass of blood vessels [hemangioma]</p><p><b>rod afričkih listnatog ili večnozelena žarulja: krvavi lilijani (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of African deciduous or evergreen bulbous herbs: blood lilies [genus Haemanthus]</p><p><b>spektakularna biljka s velikim prostranim lišćama sa crvenkasto-fijazma i cvijećem s gomilom dugih žutih štamena u koralno-crvenom čašu mesnih bracta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spectacular plant having large prostrate leaves barred in reddish-purple and flowers with a clump of long yellow stamens in a coral-red cup of fleshy bracts [Cape tulip]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na krvne žile ili krv (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to the blood vessels or blood [haemal, hemal, hematal]</p><p><b>hematemeza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vomiting blood [hematemesis]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na ili sadrže ili utječu na krv (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or containing or affecting blood [haemic, hematic, hemic]</p><p><b>lijek koji povećava sadržaj hemoglobina u krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a medicine that increases the hemoglobin content of the blood [hematinic]</p><p><b>S druge vrste: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the principal form of iron ore [hematite]</p><p><b>Europski rod muha krvopijaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European genus of bloodsucking flies [genus Haematobia]</p><p><b>mala crna evropska muha koja je uvedena u Sjevernu Ameriku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small black European fly introduced into North America [horn fly]</p><p><b>oteklina uzrokovana nakupljanjem krvi u tjelesnoj šupljini (posebno oteklina membrane koja pokriva testis) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> swelling caused by blood collecting in a body cavity (especially a swelling of the membrane covering the testis) [haematocoele, hematocele, hematocoele]</p><p><b>prolaz stolice koja sadrži krv (kao što je divertikuliza ili rak debelog crijeva ili peptički čir) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> passage of stools containing blood (as from diverticulosis or colon cancer or peptic ulcer) [hematochezia]</p><p><b>oteklina uzrokovana nakupljanjem krvi u tjelesnoj šupljini (posebno oteklina membrane koja pokriva testis) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> swelling caused by blood collecting in a body cavity (especially a swelling of the membrane covering the testis) [haematocele, hematocele, hematocoele]</p><p><b>Akumulacija krvi u vagini i maternici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> accumulation of blood in the vagina and uterus [hematocolpometra]</p><p><b>akumuliranje menstruacijske krvi u vagini (obično zbog imperforiranog himena) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> accumulation of menstrual blood in the vagina (usually due to an imperforate hymen) [hematocolpos]</p><p><b>hematokrit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of the volume occupied by packed red blood cells to the volume of the whole blood as measured by a hematocrit [hematocrit, packed cell volume]</p><p><i>n.</i> a measuring instrument to determine (usually by centrifugation) the relative amounts of corpuscles and plasma in the blood [hematocrit]</p><p><b>abnormalno nizak broj crvenih krvnih stanica u krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormally low number of red blood cells in the blood [hematocytopenia]</p><p><b>prisutnost crvenih krvnih stanica u urinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the presence of red blood cells in the urine [hematocyturia]</p><p><b>formiranje krvnih stanica u živom tijelu (posebno u koštanoj srži) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the formation of blood cells in the living body (especially in the bone marrow) [haematopoiesis, haemogenesis, haemopoiesis, hematogenesis, hematopoiesis, hemogenesis, hemopoiesis, sanguification]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na stvaranje krvi ili krvnih stanica (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to the formation of blood or blood cells [haematopoietic, haemopoietic, hematogenic, hematopoietic, hemopoietic]</p><p><b>bezbojan protein dobiven uklanjanjem heme iz hemoglobina (