stih grmljavih grmlja ili stabala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of tropical American spiny bushy shrubs or trees [Haematoxylon, genus Haematoxylon, genus Haematoxylum]</p><p><b>u obliku grmljava ili malog stabla iz Srednje Amerike i Zapadne Indije s dva lišća i trkačima malih svijetlo žutih cvijeća i koji daje tvrdo smeđe ili smeđakrasno-crveno sržno drvo koje se koristi za pripremu crne boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spiny shrub or small tree of Central America and West Indies having bipinnate leaves and racemes of small bright yellow flowers and yielding a hard brown or brownish-red heartwood used in preparing a black dye [bloodwood tree, campeachy, logwood, logwood tree]</p><p><b>prisutnost krvi u urinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the presence of blood in the urine [hematuria]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na ili sadrže ili utječu na krv (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or containing or affecting blood [haematic, hematic, hemic]</p><p><b>kompleksni crveni organski pigment koji sadrži željezo i druge atome na koje se kisika veže (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a complex red organic pigment containing iron and other atoms to which oxygen binds [haem, hematin, heme, protoheme]</p><p><b>hemodijaliza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dialysis of the blood to remove toxic substances or metabolic wastes from the bloodstream [hemodialysis]</p><p><b>neki rodovi smješteni u obitelj Liliaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> some genera placed in family Liliaceae [bloodwort family, family Haemodoraceae]</p><p><b>vrsta rod porodice Haemodoraceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of family Haemodoraceae [genus Haemodorum]</p><p><b>formiranje krvnih stanica u živom tijelu (posebno u koštanoj srži) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the formation of blood cells in the living body (especially in the bone marrow) [haematogenesis, haematopoiesis, haemopoiesis, hematogenesis, hematopoiesis, hemogenesis, hemopoiesis, sanguification]</p><p><b>hemoprotein sastavljen od globina i hema koji crvenim krvnim stanicama daje