ne halucinacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mental state in which the person has continual hallucinations</p><p><b>prvi najveći unutrašnji prst (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first largest innermost toe [big toe, great toe]</p><p><b>hodnik, predsoblje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an interior passage or corridor onto which rooms open [hall]</p><p><b>vlati i klasa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stems of beans and peas and potatoes and grasses collectively as used for thatching and bedding [haulm]</p><p><b>stolna igra u kojoj igrači pokušavaju pomaknuti svoje figure u baze protivnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a board game in which players try to move their pieces into their opponent's bases</p><p><b>aureola, krug svjetlosti, oreol, vijenac, prsten, kolobar, korona, koruna</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an indication of radiant light drawn around the head of a saint [aura, aureole, gloriole, glory, nimbus]</p><p><i>n.</i> a toroidal shape [anchor ring, annulus, doughnut, ring]</p><p><i>n.</i> a circle of light around the sun or moon</p><p><b>uobičajena bolest na lištima ovsa i drugih trava., Blagost biljaka graha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blight affecting the leaves of oats and other grasses</p><p><i>n.</i> a blight of bean plants [bean blight, halo spot]</p><p><b>Blagost biljaka graha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blight of bean plants [bean blight, halo blight]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog dianaxa (CAS RN 1344-26-8) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> organic compound in which halogen atoms have been substituted for hydrogen atoms in an alkane [alkyl halide]</p><p><b>Halofili u slanoj sredini kao što su Mrtvo more ili slane ravnice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> halophiles in saline environments such as the Dead Sea or salt flats [halobacteria, halobacterium]</p><p><b>Halofili u slanoj sredini kao što su Mrtvo more ili slane ravnice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> halophiles in saline environments such as the Dead Sea or salt flats [halobacter, halobacterium]</p><p><b>Halofili u slano