 and other halogen atoms</p><p><b>Haldol) koji se koristi za liječenje nekih psihotičnih poremećaja i Touretteovog sindroma. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tranquilizer (trade name Haldol) used to treat some psychotic disorders and Tourette's syndrome [Haldol]</p><p><b>Arheobacteria koja zahtijevaju okoliš bogat solom za rast i opstanak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> archaebacteria requiring a salt-rich environment for growth and survival [halophile]</p><p><b>Arheobacteria koja zahtijevaju okoliš bogat solom za rast i opstanak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> archaebacteria requiring a salt-rich environment for growth and survival [halophil]</p><p><b>biljka koja prirodno raste u vrlo slanoj zemlji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant growing naturally in very salty soil</p><p><b>obilje dvostrukoznih biljaka red Myrtales (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of dicotyledonous plants of the order Myrtales [Haloragidaceae, family Haloragaceae, family Haloragidaceae, water-milfoil family]</p><p><b>obilje dvostrukoznih biljaka red Myrtales (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of dicotyledonous plants of the order Myrtales [Haloragaceae, family Haloragaceae, family Haloragidaceae, water-milfoil family]</p><p><b>Nezapaljivi inhalacijski anestetik koji uzrokuje opću anesteziju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nonflammable inhalation anesthetic that produces general anesthesia</p><p><b>Nizozemski portretni i žanrovski slikar koji je svojim portretima obdario vitalnost i humor (1580?-1666) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Dutch portrait and genre painter who endowed his portraits with vitality and humor (1580?-1666) [Frans Hals]</p><p><b>hramati, hrom, hromost, priječiti, stanka, šepav, zastajati, zastoj, zaustaviti, zaustavljanje, kraj, obustava, prestanak, stati, zastati, zaustaviti se, zaustavljati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of inactivity following an interruption [arrest, check, hitch, stay, stop, stoppage]</p><p><i>n.</i> the event of something ending [stop]</p><p><i>n.</i> an interruption or temporary suspensi