illa, Liquidambar, Parrotia, and other small genera [family Hamamelidaceae, witch-hazel family]</p><p><b>skupina uglavnom drvenih biljaka koje se smatraju među najprimitivnijim angiospermima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of chiefly woody plants considered among the most primitive of angiosperms [subclass Hamamelidae]</p><p><b>rod fosilnih biljaka iz oligocena s cvjetovima sličnim cvjetovima čarobnjačke hazeline (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of fossil plants of the Oligocene having flowers resembling those of the witch hazel [genus Hamamelidanthum]</p><p><b>rod fosilnih biljaka s drvetom identičnim ili sličnim drvetu čarobnjačke hazeline (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of fossil plants having wood identical with or similar to that of the witch hazel [genus Hamamelidoxylon]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je proizvodnja u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom 1. ovog članka u potpunosti završena, proizvođač mora upotrijebiti: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous shrubs or small trees: witch hazel [genus Hamamelis]</p><p><b>Mirisan grm doline Mississippija s vrlo malim cvijećem od sredine zime do proljeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fragrant shrub of lower Mississippi valley having very small flowers from midwinter to spring [vernal witch hazel]</p><p><b>Običan grm iz istočne Sjeverne Amerike koji ima male žute cvijeće nakon što su lišće pale (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common shrub of eastern North America having small yellow flowers after the leaves have fallen [Virginian witch hazel]</p><p><b>rod fosilnih biljaka s lištima sličnim lištima čarobnjaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of fossil plants having leaves similar to those of the witch hazel [genus Hamamelites]</p><p><b>(Stari zavjet) ministar perzijskog cara koji je mrzio Židove i obješen zbog planiranja masakra nad njima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Old Testament) the minister of the Persian emperor who hated the Jews and was hanged for plotting to massacre them</p><p><b>nedostatak karaktera ili pogreška tragičnog junaka koji vodi do njegovog pada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the character flaw or error of a tragic hero that leads to his downfall [tragic flaw]</p><p><b>fokalni rast koji se sliči na neoplazmu, ali je rezultat nepravilnog razvoja organa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a focal growth that resembles a neoplasm but results from faulty development in an organ</p><p><b>militantno islamsko fundamentalističko političko pokret koje se protivi miru s Izraelom i koristi terorizam kao oružje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a militant Islamic fundamentalist political movement that opposes peace with Israel and uses terrorism as a weapon [Islamic Resistance Movement]</p><p><b>kosti zgloba u skladu s četvrtim i petim prstima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the wrist bone in line with the 4th and 5th fingers [hamate bone, os hamatum, unciform bone]</p><p><b>kosti zgloba u skladu s četvrtim i petim prstima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the wrist bone in line with the 4th and 5th fingers [hamate, os hamatum, unciform bone]</p><p><b>Hamburg</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a port city in northern Germany on the Elbe River that was founded by Charlemagne in the 9th century and is today the largest port in Germany</p><p><b>Peršić s glatkim lišćama i uvećanim jestivim korijenom koji se podseća na ukusnu peršićku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> parsley with smooth leaves and enlarged edible taproot resembling a savory parsnip [Petroselinum crispum tuberosum, turnip-rooted parsley]</p><p><b>hamburger, sendvič s kosanim mesom u okruglom pecivu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sandwich consisting of a fried cake of minced beef served on a bun, often with other ingredients [beefburger, burger]</p><p><i>n.</i> beef that has been ground [ground beef]</p><p><b>okrugli kruh u obliku da drži hamburger patty (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a round bun shaped to hold a hamburger patty [hamburger roll]</p><p><b>okrugli kruh u obliku da drži hamburger patty (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a round bun shaped to hold a hamburger patty [hamburger bun]</p><p><b>kosani odrezak, pljeska