nom uglu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chad that is incompletely removed and hanging by one corner</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih mekopternih insekata iz obitelji Bittacidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various mecopterous insects of the family Bittacidae</p><p><b>vrt u Babilonu koji je zalivan pumpama iz Eufrata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a terraced garden at Babylon watered by pumps from the Euphrates</p><p><b>obično uzgajana južnoamerička biljka s peltatnim lišćama i ružičastim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commonly cultivated trailing South American plant with peltate leaves and rosy flowers [Pelargonium peltatum, ivy-leaved geranium, ivy geranium]</p><p><b>gornji zid nagnutog raskrsca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the upper wall of an inclined fault</p><p><b>krvnik, krvnik vješanjem</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an executioner who hangs the condemned person</p><p><b>konop za vješanje, uže za vješanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rope that is used by a hangman to execute persons who have been condemned to death by hanging [halter, hangman's rope, hemp, hempen necktie]</p><p><b>konop za vješanje, uže za vješanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rope that is used by a hangman to execute persons who have been condemned to death by hanging [halter, hangman's halter, hemp, hempen necktie]</p><p><b>Ogromno suvo krilo kože u blizini podnožja noktiju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a loose narrow strip of skin near the base of a fingernail [agnail]</p><p><b>vući se, boravište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a frequently visited place [haunt, repair, resort, stamping ground]</p><p><b>mamurluk</b></p><p><i>n.</i> disagreeable aftereffects from the use of drugs (especially alcohol) [katzenjammer]</p><p><i>n.</i> an official who remains in office after his term [holdover]</p><p><i>n.</i> something that has survived from the past [holdover]</p><p><b>grad u istočnoj Kini na zaljevu Hangzhou (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city of eastern China on Hangzhou Bay [Hangchow]</p><p><b>zaljev koji je formiran ušću Istočno kineskog