olog iz Sjedinjenih Država poznat po proučavanju mozga i hipofize i koji je otkrio Cushingov sindrom (1869-1939) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States neurologist noted for his study of the brain and pituitary gland and who identified Cushing's syndrome (1869-1939) [Cushing, Harvey Cushing]</p><p><b>berba, brati, ljetina, rod, skupljati, ubirati, vršidba, žeti, žetva, prinos, urod, doba berbe, doba žetve, kupiti, požeti, požnjeti, sakupiti, sakupljati, skupiti, ubrati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the yield from plants in a single growing season [crop]</p><p><i>n.</i> the consequence of an effort or activity</p><p><i>n.</i> the gathering of a ripened crop [harvest home, harvesting]</p><p><i>n.</i> the season for gathering crops [harvest time]</p><p><i>v.</i> gather, as of natural products [glean, reap]</p><p><i>v.</i> remove from a culture or a living or dead body, as for the purposes of transplantation</p><p><b>Njegova karakteristična pjesma se čuje tijekom srpnja i kolovoza. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> its distinctive song is heard during July and August [dog-day cicada]</p><p><b>i skupljanje zrele žitnice. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the gathering of a ripened crop [harvest, harvesting]</p><p><b>larvičasti gljiva koji sisati krv kralježnjaka uključujući ljude uzrokuju intenzivno iritaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> larval mite that sucks the blood of vertebrates including human beings causing intense irritation [chigger, jigger, redbug]</p><p><b>pun mjesec najbliži septembarskom jednodnevnom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the full moon nearest the September equinox</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko malih sivih miševa Novog svijeta koji žive na primjer u žitnim poljima., mali crvenkasto smeđi evroazijski miš koji živi na primjer u kukuruznim poljima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several small greyish New World mice inhabiting e.g. grain fields [American harvest mouse]</p><p><i>n.</i> small reddish-brown Eurasian mouse inhabiting e.g. cornfields [Micromyx minutus]</p><p><b>doba žetve, be