pitanje, naslov, glavić, vršak, ravnati, rukovoditi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the upper part of the human body or the front part of the body in animals [caput]</p><p><i>n.</i> a single domestic animal</p><p><i>n.</i> that which is responsible for one's thoughts, feelings, and conscious brain functions [brain, mind, nous, psyche]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is in charge [chief, top dog]</p><p><i>n.</i> the front of a military formation or procession</p><p><i>n.</i> the pressure exerted by a fluid</p><p><i>n.</i> the top of something</p><p><i>n.</i> the source of water from which a stream arises [fountainhead, headspring]</p><p><i>n.</i> (grammar) the word in a grammatical constituent that plays the same grammatical role as the whole constituent [head word]</p><p><i>n.</i> the tip of an abscess (where the pus accumulates)</p><p><i>n.</i> the length or height based on the size of a human or animal head</p><p><i>n.</i> a dense cluster of flowers or foliage [capitulum]</p><p><i>n.</i> the educator who has executive authority for a school [head teacher, principal, school principal]</p><p><i>n.</i> an individual person</p><p><i>n.</i> a user of (usually soft) drugs</p><p><i>n.</i> a natural elevation (especially a rocky one that juts out into the sea) [foreland, headland, promontory]</p><p><i>n.</i> a rounded compact mass</p><p><i>n.</i> the foam or froth that accumulates at the top when you pour an effervescent liquid into a container</p><p><i>n.</i> the part in the front or nearest the viewer [forefront]</p><p><i>n.</i> a difficult juncture [pass, straits]</p><p><i>n.</i> forward movement [headway]</p><p><i>n.</i> a V-shaped mark at one end of an arrow pointer [point]</p><p><i>n.</i> the subject matter at issue [question]</p><p><i>n.</i> a line of text serving to indicate what the passage below it is about [header, heading]</p><p><i>n.</i> the rounded end of a bone that fits into a rounded cavity in another bone to form a joint</p><p><i>n.</i> that part of a skeletal muscle t