lje za zapošljavanje (posebno za korporacije), divljak koji odseče i čuva glave neprijatelja kao trofeje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a recruiter of personnel (especially for corporations)</p><p><i>n.</i> a savage who cuts off and preserves the heads of enemies as trophies [head-shrinker]</p><p><b>kurs, naslov, odrednice, područje zaglavlja, pravac, predvođenje, rubrika, tarifni broj, zaglavlje, područje zaglavlja (MHS paketa), put, putanja, smjer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a line of text serving to indicate what the passage below it is about [head, header]</p><p><i>n.</i> the direction or path along which something moves or along which it lies [aim, bearing]</p><p><i>n.</i> a horizontal (or nearly horizontal) passageway in a mine [drift, gallery]</p><p><b>snažno svjetlo s reflektorom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a powerful light with reflector [headlight]</p><p><b>rt</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a natural elevation (especially a rocky one that juts out into the sea) [foreland, head, promontory]</p><p><b>bez glave, bez vođe, bezglav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not having a head or formed without a head</p><p><i>adj.</i> not using intelligence [brainless]</p><p><b>far, prednje svjetlo, reflektor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a powerful light with reflector [headlamp]</p><p><b>ima izbočinu koja liči na glavu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a protuberance that resembles a head</p><p><b>glavni naslov, naslov, naslov novinskog stupca, naslov stupca</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the heading or caption of a newspaper article [newspaper headline]</p><p><i>v.</i> publicize widely or highly, as if with a headline</p><p><i>v.</i> provide (a newspaper page or a story) with a headline</p><p><b>zvijezda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a performer who receives prominent billing [star]</p><p><b>koristeći skraćeni stil naslovnih pisaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> using the abbreviated style of headline writers</p><p><b>hrvanje držanje u kojem je protivnik glava zaključana između krivoga vašeg lakt i strane vašeg tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i>