</p><p><i>n.</i> a preliminary race in which the winner advances to a more important race</p><p><i>n.</i> utility to warm a building [heating, heating plant, heating system]</p><p><i>v.</i> make hot or hotter [heat up]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide with heat</p><p><i>v.</i> arouse or excite feelings and passions [fire up, ignite, inflame, stir up, wake]</p><p><i>v.</i> gain heat or get hot [heat up, hot up]</p><p><b>ograničenje leta velikom brzinom koje je nametnuto aerodinamičkim zagrijavanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a limit to high speed flight imposed by aerodynamic heating [thermal barrier]</p><p><b>entalpija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (thermodynamics) a thermodynamic quantity equal to the internal energy of a system plus the product of its volume and pressure [H, enthalpy, total heat]</p><p><b>razmak topline (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dissipation of heat</p><p><b>toplina, toplinska energija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of energy that is transferred by a difference in temperature [heat]</p><p><b>toplinski stroj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any engine that makes use of heat to do work</p><p><b>izmjenjivač topline</b></p><p><i>n.</i> device that transfers heat from one liquid to another without allowing them to mix</p><p><b>stanje obilježeno vrtoglavicom i mučnino i slabost uzrokovana iscrpljenjem tjelesnih tekućina i elektrolita (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a condition marked by dizziness and nausea and weakness caused by depletion of body fluids and electrolytes [heat prostration]</p><p><b>bljesak intenzivne toplote (kao što je oslobođen atomskom eksplozijom) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a flash of intense heat (as released by an atomic explosion)</p><p><b>Kolapsa uzrokovana izloženosti prekomjernoj toploti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> collapse caused by exposure to excessive heat [heatstroke]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 1,15 kVA ili većim od 2,15 kVA, ali ne većim od 1,15 kVA, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electric heater consisting of a high-power incandescent lamp that emits infrared radiation [infrared lamp]</p><p><b>bljesak svjetlosti u blizini horizonta bez grmljavine (posebno na vrućim večerama) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bright flashes of light near the horizon without thunder (especially on hot evenings)</p><p><b>toplina oslobođena jedinicom mase plina na mjestu ključanja dok se kondenzira u tekućinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heat liberated by a unit mass of gas at its boiling point as it condenses into a liquid</p><p><b>toplina potrebna za razgradnju tekuće tvari na jednostavnije sastavne dijelove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the heat required for a fluid substance to break up into simpler constituents</p><p><b>toplina nastavila ili apsorbirana tijekom formiranja jednog mola tvari iz njenih sastavnih elemenata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the heat evolved or absorbed during the formation of one mole of a substance from its component elements</p><p><b>toplina apsorbirana jediničnom masom čvrste tvari u trenutku topljenja kako bi se čvrsta tvari pretvorila u tekućinu na istoj temperaturi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heat absorbed by a unit mass of a solid at its melting point in order to convert the solid into a liquid at the same temperature</p><p><b>toplina koja se oslobađa od jedinice mase tekućine na mjestu smrzavanja kada se zagrijava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heat liberated by a unit mass of liquid at its freezing point when it solidifies</p><p><b>toplina nastaje ili apsorbira kada se jedan mol tvari rastvori u velikom zapreminu rastvarača (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the heat evolved or absorbed when one mole of a substance is dissolved in a large volume of a solvent</p><p><b>toplina apsorbirana jedinicom mase materijala kada se promijeni iz čvrstog u plinovo stanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heat absorbed by a unit mass of material when it changes from a solid to a gaseous state</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se radije u skladu s člankom 93. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog poglavlja, radije se radi na proizvodnji električne energije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heat absorbed or radiated during a change of phase at a constant temperature and pressure [latent heat]</p><p><b>toplina apsorbirana jedinicom mase materijala na njegovoj točci ključanja kako bi se materijal pretvorio u plin na istoj temperaturi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heat absorbed by a unit mass of a material at its boiling point in order to convert the material into a gas at the same temperature [heat of vaporization]</p><p><b>toplina apsorbirana jedinicom mase materijala na njegovoj točci ključanja kako bi se materijal pretvorio u plin na istoj temperaturi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heat absorbed by a unit mass of a material at its boiling point in order to convert the material into a gas at the same temperature [heat of vaporisation]</p><p><b>stanje obilježeno vrtoglavicom i mučnino i slabost uzrokovana iscrpljenjem tjelesnih tekućina i elektrolita (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a condition marked by dizziness and nausea and weakness caused by depletion of body fluids and electrolytes [heat exhaustion]</p><p><b>dizalica topline, toplinska crpka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> apparatus that extracts heat from a liquid that is at a higher temperature than its surroundings</p><p><b>obstrukcija znojnih kanala tijekom visoke vrućine i vlažnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> obstruction of the sweat ducts during high heat and humidity [miliaria, prickly heat]</p><p><b>zračenje koje proizvodi toplinski učinak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ray that produces a thermal effect</p><p><b>zaštitni preklop koji štiti svemirsku letjelicu od pregrevanja pri ponovnom ulasku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a protective covering that protects a spacecraft from overheating on reentry</p><p><b>hladnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metal conductor specially designed to conduct (and radiate) heat</p><p><b>jedinica za mjerenje rada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of measurement for work [energy unit, work unit]</p><p><b>podgrijati, grijati se, podgrijati se, podgrijavati se, ugrijati se, ugrijavati se, usijati se, zagrijat