 of the animal viruses that cause painful blisters on the skin [herpes virus]</p><p><b>uobičajena oblika akutnog encefalitisa uzrokovanog herpesom simplexom 1 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common form of acute encephalitis caused by herpes simplex 1 [acute inclusion body encephalitis, herpes simplex encephalitis]</p><p><b>infekcija uzrokovana virusom herpes simplex tipa 2 (HSV-2) koja se obično prenosi seksualnim kontaktom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an infection caused by herpes simplex virus type 2 (HSV-2) that is usually transmitted by sexual contact [genital herpes]</p><p><b>uzrokovan herpesom simplex virusa tipa 1 (HSV-1) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> caused by herpes simplex virus type 1 (HSV-1) [cold sore, fever blister, oral herpes]</p><p><b>herpes simpleks</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an infection caused by the herpes simplex virus</p><p><i>n.</i> a herpes virus that affects the skin and nervous system [herpes simplex virus]</p><p><b>virus koji uzrokuje oralni herpes. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a herpes virus that causes oral herpes [HS1, HSV-1, HSV-I]</p><p><b>virus koji može uzrokovati genitalni herpes. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a herpes virus that can cause genital herpes [HS2, HSV-2, HSV-II]</p><p><b>uobičajena oblika akutnog encefalitisa uzrokovanog herpesom simplexom 1 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common form of acute encephalitis caused by herpes simplex 1 [acute inclusion body encephalitis, herpes encephalitis]</p><p><b>herpes simpleks virus</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a herpes virus that affects the skin and nervous system [herpes simplex]</p><p><b>virus koji uzrokuje boginje i zono. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a herpes virus that causes chickenpox and shingles [herpes varicella zoster virus]</p><p><b>virus koji uzrokuje boginje i zono. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a herpes virus that causes chickenpox and shingles [herpes varicella zoster]</p><p><b>bilo koji od životinjskih virusa koji uzrokuju bolne plikove na koži (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the animal viruses that cause painful blisters on the skin [herpes]</p><p><b>herpes zoster</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eruptions along a nerve path often accompanied by severe neuralgia [shingles, zoster]</p><p><i>n.</i> a herpes virus that causes shingles [herpes zoster virus]</p><p><b>virus koji uzrokuje herpes. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a herpes virus that causes shingles [herpes zoster]</p><p><b>šumarice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mongooses [genus Herpestes]</p><p><b>sjevernoafrička mangusta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> northern African mongoose [ichneumon]</p><p><b>brzokušan živir iz južne Azije veličine freta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> keen-sighted viverrine of southern Asia about the size of a ferret [Indian mongoose]</p><p><b>zoolog koji proučava gmizavaca i vodozemce (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a zoologist who studies reptiles and amphibians</p><p><b>grana zoologije koja se bavi gmizavcima i vodozemcima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of zoology concerned with reptiles and amphibians</p><p><b>Nemački čovjek., Njemački naslov ili oblik adrese za muškarca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a German man</p><p><i>n.</i> a German courtesy title or form of address for a man</p><p><b>rasa koja sebe smatra superiornom nad svima ostalima i sposobna vladati drugima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a race that considers itself superior to all others and fitted to rule the others [master race]</p><p><b>vrsta teropodnog dinosaura pronađenog u Argentini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a kind of theropod dinosaur found in Argentina [herrerasaurus]</p><p><b>vrsta teropodnog dinosaura pronađenog u Argentini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a kind of theropod dinosaur found in Argentina [herrerasaur]</p><p><b>Engleski pjesnik (1591-1674) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English lyric poet (1591-1674) [Robert Herrick]</p><p><b>haringa, sleđ</b></p><p><i>n.</i> valuable flesh of fatty fish from shallow waters of northern Atlantic or Pacific</p><p><i>n.</i> commercially important food fish of northern waters of both Atlantic and Pacific [Clupea harangus]</p><p><b>srebrnasti