 the upper part [poker alumroot, poker heuchera]</p><p><b>višegodišnja biljka sa svijetlo crvenim cvijećem u pernatim šiljcima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial plant of the western United States having bright red flowers in feathery spikes [coralbells]</p><p><b>mineralna grupa iz obitelji zeolita koja se sastoji od vodnog aluminijumskog silikata natrija i kalcija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of minerals of the zeolite family consisting of a hydrous aluminum silicate of sodium and calcium</p><p><b>heurističan, heuristički, koji se koristi nedokazanom spoznajom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commonsense rule (or set of rules) intended to increase the probability of solving some problem [heuristic program, heuristic rule]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or using a general formulation that serves to guide investigation</p><p><b>pravilo zdravog razuma (ili skup pravila) namijenjeno povećanju vjerojatnosti rješavanja nekog problema (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commonsense rule (or set of rules) intended to increase the probability of solving some problem [heuristic, heuristic rule]</p><p><b>pravilo zdravog razuma (ili skup pravila) namijenjeno povećanju vjerojatnosti rješavanja nekog problema (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commonsense rule (or set of rules) intended to increase the probability of solving some problem [heuristic, heuristic program]</p><p><b>malog roda južnoameričkih stabala koja proizvode lateks (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of South American trees yielding latex [genus Hevea, rubber tree]</p><p><b>ljeplovito stablo Amazonije i rijeke Orinoco s kožnim lišćama i mirisnim žuto-bijelim cvijećima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous tree of the Amazon and Orinoco Rivers having leathery leaves and fragrant yellow-white flowers [Para rubber tree, caoutchouc tree]</p><p><b>Mađarski kemičar koji je proučavao radioizotope i bio jedan od otkrivača elementa hafnija (1885-1966) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Hungarian chemist who studied radioisotopes and was one of the discoverers of the element hafnium (1885-1966) [George Charles Hevesy de Hevesy]</p><p><b>cijepati, sjeckati, sjeći, tesati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make or shape as with an axe [hew out]</p><p><i>v.</i> strike with an axe</p><p><b>napraviti ili oblikovati kao sa sjekirom (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make or shape as with an axe [hew]</p><p><b>cijepati, sjeckati, sjeći, tesati (od &quot;hew&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who hews</p><p><b>s masenim udarom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> cut or shaped with hard blows of a heavy cutting instrument like an ax or chisel [hand-hewn]</p><p><b>natrijev heksametafosfat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an evil spell [curse, jinx, whammy]</p><p><i>v.</i> cast a spell over someone or something [bewitch, enchant, glamour, jinx, witch]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to a number system having 16 as its base [hexadecimal]</p><p><b>matica sa šesterokutnim oblikom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nut with a hexagonal shape</p><p><b>antibakterijska tvar koja je prah rastvoran u vodi koji se koristi u antiseptičkim sapunima i zubnim pastima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antibacterial substance that is a water-soluble powder used in antiseptic soaps and toothpaste</p><p><b>bijela čvrsta masna kiselina koja se nalazi u vosku (kao što je pčelinji vosak) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white solid fatty acid found in waxes (such as beeswax) [cerotic acid]</p><p><b>šest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of five and one [6, Captain Hicks, VI, half a dozen, sestet, sextet, sextuplet, sise, six, sixer]</p><p><b>Sasićena masna kiselina koja je glavna masna tvari u mesnim i mliječnim proizvodima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a saturated fatty acid that is the major fat in meat and dairy products [palmitic acid]</p><p><b>heksadecimalan, heksadecimalni, heksadekadski, šesnaestični</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to a number system having 16 as its base [hex]</p><p><b>broj od 0 do 15 u heksadecimalnoj notaciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a digit from 0 to 15 in hexadecimal notation</p><p><b>bilo koja oznaka koja koristi 16 različitih znakova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any notation that uses 16 different characters [sexadecimal notation]</p><p><b>pozicijski sustav brojanja koji koristi heksadecimale i korijen od šesnaest (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a positional system of numeration that uses hexadecimal digits and a radix of sixteen [hexadecimal system, sexadecimal number system]</p><p><b>pozicijski sustav brojanja koji koristi heksadecimale i korijen od šesnaest (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a positional system of numeration that uses hexadecimal digits and a radix of sixteen [hexadecimal number system, sexadecimal number system]</p><p><b>Kortikosteroidni lijekovi (trgovinski nazivi Decadron ili Dexamethasone Intensol ili Dexone ili Hexadrol ili Oradexon) koji se koriste za liječenje alergija ili upale. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a corticosteroid drug (trade names Decadron or Dexamethasone Intensol or Dexone or Hexadrol or Oradexon) used to treat allergies or inflammation [Decadron, Dexamethasone Intensol, Dexone, Oradexon, dexamethasone]</p><p><b>heksagon, šesterokut, šesterokutni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a six-sided polygon</p><p><b>šesterokutan, šesterokutnom</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having six sides or divided into hexagons [hexangular]</p><p><b>heksagram</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a regular polygon formed by extending each of the sides of a regular hexagon to form two equilateral triangles</p><p><b>zelenaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> greenlings [family Hexagrammidae]</p><p><b>tip rod Hexagrammidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Hexagrammidae [genus Hexagrammos]</p><p><b>Ribe za prehranu i sport na zapadnoj obali Sjeverne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common food and sport fish of western coast of North America [kelp greenling]</p><p><b>heksaedar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any polyhedron having six plane faces</p><p><b>u obliku od poluploče ili od poluploče (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a