anied by misfortune [jinxed]</p><p><b>Neobičan rast malih grana na drvetu ili grmlju uzrokovan gljivicama ili insektima ili drugim fiziološkim poremećajima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal tufted growth of small branches on a tree or shrub caused by fungi or insects or other physiological disturbance [staghead, witch broom, witches' broom]</p><p><b>spojevi estrogena koji se koriste za liječenje nepravilnosti u mjesečnici i simptoma menopauze i za sprječavanje trudnoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> estrogen compound used to treat menstrual irregularities and menopausal symptoms and to prevent pregnancy</p><p><b>monosaharid koji sadrži šest atoma ugljika po molekuli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a monosaccharide that contains six carbon atoms per molecule</p><p><b>iju!, vrhunac snage, zenit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the period of greatest prosperity or productivity [bloom, blossom, efflorescence, flower, flush, peak, prime]</p><p><b>Norveški antropolog poznat po studijama kulturne difuzije (1914-2002) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Norwegian anthropologist noted for his studies of cultural diffusion (1914-2002) [Thor Hyerdahl]</p><p><b>Čehoslovački kemičar koji je razvio polarografiju (1890-1967) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Czechoslovakian chemist who developed polarography (1890-1967) [Joroslav Heyrovsky]</p><p><b>Njemački pisac (1830-1914) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German writer (1830-1914) [Paul Heyse, Paul Johann Ludwig von Heyse]</p><p><b>Američki pisac (1885-1940) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer (1885-1940) [DuBois Heyward, Edwin DuBois Hayward]</p><p><b>Šiitska teroristička organizacija sa snažnim vezama s Iranom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Shiite terrorist organization with strong ties to Iran [Hizballah, Hizbollah, Hizbullah, Islamic Jihad, Islamic Jihad for the Liberation of Palestine, Lebanese Hizballah, Organization of the Oppressed on Earth, Party of God, Revolutionary Justice Organization]</p><p><b>Ezekija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Old Testament) king of Judah who abolished idolatry (715-687 BC) [Ezekias]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci:, 3 do 30 megahertza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a grey tetravalent metallic element that resembles zirconium chemically and is found in zirconium minerals [atomic number 72, hafnium]</p><p><i>n.</i> 3 to 30 megahertz [high frequency]</p><p><b>Fluorogljikovodik koji se emitira kao nusproizvod industrijske proizvodnje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fluorocarbon emitted as a by-product of industrial manufacturing [hydrofluorocarbon]</p><p><b>centagram, hektogram, hg</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a heavy silvery toxic univalent and bivalent metallic element [atomic number 80, hydrargyrum, mercury, quicksilver]</p><p><i>n.</i> 100 grams [hectogram]</p><p><b>savezni odjel Sjedinjenih Država koji upravlja svim saveznim programima koji se bave zdravljem i dobrobitom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the United States federal department that administers all federal programs dealing with health and welfare [Department of Health and Human Services, Health and Human Services]</p><p><b>haj, zdravo, Havaji</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expression of greeting [hello, how-do-you-do, howdy, hullo]</p><p><i>n.</i> a state in the United States in the central Pacific on the Hawaiian Islands [Aloha State, Haw., Hawai'i, Hawaii]</p><p><b>aparat za reproduciranje zvuka, glazbena linija, maksimalno vjeran originalu, hi-fi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> equipment for the reproduction of sound with high fidelity [high fidelity sound system]</p><p><i>n.</i> the reproduction of sound with little or no distortion [high fidelity]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by minimal distortion in sound reproduction [high-fidelity]</p><p><b>visoke tehnologije</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling or making use of highly advanced technology or devices [high-tech]</p><p><b>hernija nastala izbočenjem dijela želuca kroz dijafragmu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hernia resulting from the protrusion of part of the stomach through the diaphragm [diaphragmatic hernia, hiatus hernia]</p><p><b>bjelina, pr