obscure]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 3. točkom (a) CRR-a, za sve druge instrumente u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) CRR-a, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) CRR-a, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) CRR-a, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) CRR-a, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) CRR-a, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) CRR-a, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (e) CRR-a. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> reserves that do not show up on the balance sheet (as by understating values)</p><p><b>porez koji potrošač ne želi platiti (kao što su porezi na vrijednost) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tax paid unwittingly by the consumer (such as ad valorem taxes)</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,05 do 0,05 mm, ali ne većim od 0,05 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a green transparent form of the mineral spodumene used as a gemstone</p><p><b>pritajen, pritajeni, skriven, tajanstven, zadnji (od &quot;hidden&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being covert and hidden [covertness]</p><p><b>koža, kriti se, prikriti, sakriti, sakriti se, sakrivanje, skrivati, koža (život ), sakrijete, sakriva, koža s krznom, krzno, kriti, prikrivati, sakrivati, skriti, tajiti, zataškati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the dressed skin of an animal (especially a large animal) [fell]</p><p><i>n.</i> body covering of a living animal [pelt, skin]</p><p><i>v.</i> prevent from being seen or discovered [conceal]</p><p><i>v.</i> be or go into hiding [hide out]</p><p><i>v.</i> cover as if with a shroud [cover, enshroud, shroud]</p><p><i>v.</i> make undecipherable or imperceptible by obscuring or concealing [blot out, obliterate, obscure, veil]</p><p><b>igra u kojoj se dijete krije oči dok se drugi igrači kriju i onda ih pokušavaju pronaći. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a game in which a child covers his eyes while the other players hide then tries to find them [hide-and-seek]</p><p><b>biti ili se sakriti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be or go into hiding [hide]</p><p><b>igra skrivača</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a game in which a child covers his eyes while the other players hide then tries to find them [hide and go seek]</p><p><b>sklonište, skrovište, utočište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hiding place [den, hideout]</p><p><i>n.</i> an area where you can be alone [retreat]</p><p><b>tvrdoglav konzervativni i uskraćenog uma (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> stubbornly conservative and narrow-minded [traditionalist]</p><p><b>Japanski matematički fizičar koji je predložio da su nuklearne sile posredovane masivnim česticama zvani mezonima koje su analoge fotonu u posredovanju elektromagnetnih sila (1907-1981) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Japanese mathematical physicist who proposed that nuclear forces are mediated by massive particles called mesons which are analogous to the photon in mediating electromagnetic forces (1907-1981) [Yukawa]</p><p><b>gnusan, odvratan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> grossly offensive to decency or morality [horrid, horrific, outrageous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> so extremely ugly as to be terrifying [repulsive]</p><p><b>gnusan, odvratan (od &quot;hideous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a hideous manner [horridly, monstrously]</p><p><b>gnusan, odvratan (od &quot;hideous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dreadful ugliness</p><p><b>skrivalište. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hiding place [den, hideaway]</p><p><b>Američki bakteriolog (rođen u Japanu) koji je otkrio uzrok žute groznice i sifilisa (1876-1928) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States bacteriologist (born in Japan) who discovered the cause of yellow fever and syphilis (1876-1928) [Noguchi]</p><p><b>batine, lemanje, prikrivanje, sakrivanje, skrivali, skrivanje, skrivanjem, tajenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of keeping something secret [concealing, concealment]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being hidden</p><p><b>skrovište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a place suitable for hiding something (such as yourself)</p><p><b>znojenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of the sweat glands of the skin secreting a salty fluid [diaphoresis, perspiration, sudation, sweating]</p><p><b>od znoja ili s njim