isnu upotrebu, (poker) igračka karta podijeljena s licem na dolje i ne otkriva se do suđenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any assets that are concealed until they can be used advantageously</p><p><i>n.</i> (poker) a playing card dealt face down and not revealed until the showdown</p><p><b>Udari loptu u rupu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> hit the ball into the hole [hole]</p><p><b>naći utočište, hibernirati, prezimiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remain secluded or in hiding</p><p><i>v.</i> score a hole in one</p><p><i>v.</i> sleep during winter [hibernate]</p><p><b>tajan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to the peripheral and unimportant aspects of life [hole-in-corner]</p><p><i>adj.</i> conducted with or marked by hidden aims or methods [clandestine, cloak-and-dagger, hugger-mugger, hush-hush, secret, surreptitious, undercover, underground]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na periferijske i nevažne aspekte života. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to the peripheral and unimportant aspects of life [hole-and-corner]</p><p><b>Malo nepretenciozno mjesto izvan puta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small unpretentious out-of-the-way place</p><p><b>omogućavajući prolaz u i iz (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> allowing passage in and out [porous]</p><p><b>riblje vrste iz područja Sjevernog Atlantika ili Sjevernog Tihog oceana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> marine food fish of the northern Atlantic or northern Pacific [halibut]</p><p><b>blagdan, dopust, godišnji odmor, odmor, praznici, praznik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> leisure time away from work devoted to rest or pleasure [vacation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a day on which work is suspended by law or custom</p><p><i>v.</i> spend or take a vacation [vacation]</p><p><b>odmaralište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hotel located in a resort area [resort, resort hotel]</p><p><b>vrijeme kada mnogi ljudi uzimaju odmor. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a time when many people take holidays</p><p><b>turist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who travels for pleasure [tourer, tourist]</p><p><b>pretjerano ili licemjerno