ing homeward or to a destination</p><p><b>mehanizam u upravljanoj raketi koji je vodi prema cilju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the mechanism in a guided missile that guides it toward its objective</p><p><b>golub koji je treniran da se vrati kući. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pigeon trained to return home [homer]</p><p><b>torpedo koji se usmjerava na svoju metu (kao što je zvuk brodskih motora) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a torpedo that is guided to its target (as by the sound of a ship's engines)</p><p><b>koji karakteriše obitelj Hominidae, koja uključuje Homo sapiens kao i izumrle vrste ljudskih bića (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterizing the family Hominidae, which includes Homo sapiens as well as extinct species of manlike creatures [hominid]</p><p><b>hominid, veliki čovjekoliki majmun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a primate of the family Hominidae</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterizing the family Hominidae, which includes Homo sapiens as well as extinct species of manlike creatures [hominian]</p><p><b>hominidi, porodica Hominidae, porodica velikih čovjekolikih majmuna, veliki čovjekoliki majmuni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> modern man and extinct immediate ancestors of man [family Hominidae]</p><p><b>karakteristika čovječanstva (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of humankind</p><p><b>primat iz superobitelji Hominoidea (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a primate of the superfamily Hominoidea</p><p><b>Antropoični majmuni i ljudi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> anthropoid apes and human beings [superfamily Hominoidea]</p><p><b>odvojeno od žitarica i klijeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hulled corn with the bran and germ removed</p><p><b>grubo mletog kornjače u koži, kuhano kao doručak u južnim Sjedinjenim Državama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coarsely ground hulled corn boiled as a breakfast dish in the southern United States [grits]</p><p><b>čvrsta pasta od piša, tahinija, limunovog soka i češnjaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thick spread made from mashed chickpeas, tahini, lemon juice and garlic [hoummos, hummus, humous, humus]</p><p><b>čovjek, Homo, ljudsko biće</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is sexually attracted to persons of the same sex [gay, homophile, homosexual]</p><p><i>n.</i> any living or extinct member of the family Hominidae characterized by superior intelligence, articulate speech, and erect carriage [human, human being, man]</p><p><b>izumrle vrste primitivnih hominida s uspravnim stavom ali malim mozgom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extinct species of primitive hominid with upright stature but small brain</p><p><b>izumrle vrste uspravnih istočnoafričkih hominida koji imaju neke napredne ljudske karakteristike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extinct species of upright East African hominid having some advanced humanlike characteristics</p><p><b>Vrsta primitivnog čovjeka koji je živio u Europi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a type of primitive man who lived in Europe [Heidelberg man]</p><p><b>primitivni hominid sličan neandertalcu ali živi u Africi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a primitive hominid resembling Neanderthal man but living in Africa [Rhodesian man]</p><p><b>Jedini preživjeli hominid. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the only surviving hominid</p><p><b>homo sapien neanderthalensis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extinct robust human of Middle Paleolithic in Europe and western Asia [Neandertal, Neandertal man, Neanderthal, Neanderthal man]</p><p><b>podvrste Homo sapiens (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> subspecies of Homo sapiens [modern man]</p><p><b>izumrli primitivni hominid kasnog pleistocena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extinct primitive hominid of late Pleistocene</p><p><b>Kategorija koja se koristi u nekim sustavima klasifikacije za razne bazidomicetne gljive, uključujući npr. gljive i puffballs koje se obično stavljaju u razrede Gasteromycetes i Hymenomycetes (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> category used in some classification systems for various basidiomycetous fungi including e.g. mushrooms and puffballs which are usually placed in the classes Gasteromycetes and Hymenomycetes [subclass Homobasidiomycetes]</p><p><b>koncentričan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a common center [concentric, concentrical]</p><p><b>S simetričnim repom koji se proteže izvan kraja kralježnice (kao kod većine rib s kostom) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> possessing a symmetrical tail that extends beyond the end of the vertebral column (as in most bony fishes)</p><p><b>Simetrična repna pera koja se proteže izvan kraja kralježnice kao kod većine rib s kostom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> symmetrical tail fin extending beyond the end of the vertebral column as in most bony fishes</p><p><b>(s svjetlosnim ili drugim elektromagnetnim zračenjem) koje imaju samo jednu talasnu dužinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of light or other electromagnetic radiation) having only one wavelength [monochromatic]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom ugljika od 0,01 do 0,01 mas.% (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> containing a closed ring of atoms of the same kind especially carbon atoms [isocyclic]</p><p><b>od parazita, posebno hrđavih gljiva (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of parasites especially rust fungi [autoecious]</p><p><b>liječnik homeopatije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a practitioner of homeopathy [homeopath]</p><p><b>homeopatija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of treating disease with small amounts of remedies that, in large amounts in healthy people, produce symptoms similar to those being treated [homeopathy]</p><p><b>o homoseksualnoj ljubavi ili o njoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or concerning homosexual love</p><p><b>homoseksualnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sexual attraction to (or sexual relations with) persons of the same sex [gayness, homosexualism, homosexuality, queerness]</p><p><b>materijal koji je homogeniziran (posebno tkivo koje je mlet i pomešan) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> material that has been homogenized (especially tissue that has been ground and mixed)</p><p><b>homogenost, istorodnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being similar or comparable in kind or nature [homogeneousness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being of uniform throughout in composition or structure</p><p><b>homogen, istovrstan, kinetika homogenih</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> all of the same or similar kind or nature [homogenous]</p><p><b>polinom koji se sastoji od termina istog stupnja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a polynomial consisting of terms all of the same degree</p><p><b>homogen, istovrstan, kinetika homogenih (od &quot;homogeneous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> all similarly</p><p><b>homogen, istovrstan, kinetika homogenih (od &quot;homogeneous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being similar or comparable in kind or nature [homogeneity]</p><p><b>homogenizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of making something homogeneous or uniform in composition [homogenization]</p><p><b>homogenizirati, homogenizirati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> break up the fat globules of [homogenize]</p><p><i>v.</i> become homogeneous or similar, as by mixing [homogenize]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to become equal or homogeneous as by mixing [homogenize]</p><p><b>formiran pomešanjem različitih elemenata, posebno redukcijom jednog elementa na čestice i njihovo raspršivanje u drugoj tvari, homogeni (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> formed by blending unlike elements especially by reducing one element to particles and dispersing them throughout another substance [homogenized]</p><p><i>adj.</i> made homogeneous [homogenized]</p><p><b>homogenizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of making something homogeneous or uniform in composition [homogenisation]</p><p><b>homogenizirati, homogenizirati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to become equal or homogeneous as by mixing [homogenise]</p><p><i>v.</i> break up the fat globules of [homogenise]</p><p><i>v.</i> become homogeneous or similar, as by mixing [homogenise]</p><p><b>formiran pomešanjem različitih elemenata, posebno redukcijom jednog elementa na čestice i njihovo raspršivanje u drugoj tvari, homogeni (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> formed by blending unlike elements especially by reducing one element to particles and dispersing them throughout another substance [homogenised]</p><p><i>adj.</i> made homogeneous [homogenised]</p><p><b>homogenizirano mlijeko</b></p><p><i>n.</i> milk with the fat particles broken up and dispersed uniformly so the cream will not rise</p><p><b>homogen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> all of the same or similar kind or nature [homogeneous]</p><p><b>kiselina koja se formira kao intermedijarni proizvod metabolizma tirozina i fenilalanina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acid formed as an intermediate product of the metabolism of tyrosine and phenylalanine [alcapton, alkapton]</p><p><b>(biologija) sličnost zbog zajedničke evolucije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) similarity because of common evolution</p><p><b>Tkivo ili organ transplantacije od donatora iste vrste, ali različitog genetskoga sastava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tissue or organ transplanted from a donor of the same species but different genetic makeup [allograft]</p><p><b>homograf, istopisnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> two words are homographs if they are spelled the same way but differ in meaning (e.g. fair)</p><p><b>malo rodni nizog višegodišnjeg biljaka iz planinske Europe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of low perennial herbs of montane Europe [genus Homogyne]</p><p><b>Rizomatozna biljka s ljubičastog crvenog cvijeća pogodna za pokrivanje tla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rhizomatous herb with purple-red flowers suitable for groundcover [Tussilago alpina, alpine coltsfoot]</p><p><b>životinja koja ima tjelesnu temperaturu koja je relativno konstanta i neovisna o temperaturi okoliša (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an animal that has a body temperature that is relatively constant and independent of the environmental temperature [homeotherm, homotherm]</p><p><b>od ptica i sisavaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of birds and mammals [homeothermic, homothermic]</p><p><b>sličan u evolucijskom poreklu, ali ne i u funkciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> similar in evolutionary origin but not in function [homological]</p><p><b>sličan u evolucijskom poreklu, ali ne i u funkciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> similar in evolutionary origin but not in function [homologic]</p><p><b>napraviti homolognu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make homologous [homologize]</p><p><b>biti homologni, napraviti homolognu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be homologous</p><p><i>v.</i> make homologous [homologise]</p><p><b>koji imaju isto evolucijsko podrijetlo, ali ne nužno istu funkciju, s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the same evolutionary origin but not necessarily the same function</p><p><i>adj.</i> corresponding or similar in position or structure or function or characteristics</p><p><b>homologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being similar or corresponding in position or value or structure or function</p><p><b>mapa s jednako velikom površinom na planeti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an equal-area projection map of the globe</p><p><b>sličnost oblika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> similarity of form [homomorphy]</p><p><b>sličnost oblika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> similarity of form [homomorphism]</p><p><b>čajni tortrix (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tea tortrix [genus Homona]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se ne primjenjuje ovaj standard, za određene vrste mliječnih plodova, potrebno je utvrditi: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small Indian moth infesting e.g. tea and coffee plants [tea tortrix, tortrix]</p><p><b>homonim</b></p><p><i>n.</i> two words are homonyms if they are pronounced and spelled the same way but have different meanings</p><p><b>homoniman</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or related to or being homonyms [homonymous]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s ili su homonimi (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or related to or being homonyms [homonymic]</p><p><b>homonimija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relation between two words that are spelled the same way but differ in meaning or the relation between two words that are pronounced the same way but differ in meaning</p><p><b>osoba koja je seksualno privlačena osobama istog spola, homoseksualno ili podstiče homoseksualne želje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is sexually attracted to persons of the same sex [gay, homo, homosexual]</p><p><i>adj.</i> homosexual or arousing homosexual desires [gay, queer]</p><p><b>osoba koja mrzi ili se boji homoseksualca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who hates or fears homosexual people</p><p><b>homofobija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> prejudice against (fear or dislike of) homosexual people and homosexuality</p><p><b>Predrasude prema homoseksualcima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> prejudiced against homosexual people</p><p><b>homofon, istozvučnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> two words are homophones if they are pronounced the same way but differ in meaning or spelling or both (e.g. bare and bear)</p><p><b>imaju isti zvuk, s jednim melodijskim redom uz pratnju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the same sound</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a single melodic line with accompaniment</p><p><b>karakteristika pojave riječi različitog podrijetla koje se izgovaraju na isti način (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of the phenomenon of words of different origins that are pronounced the same way</p><p><b>homofonija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the same pronunciation for words of different origins</p><p><i>n.</i> part music with one dominant voice (in a homophonic style)</p><p><b>biljne uši (pčela) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant lice (aphids) [suborder Homoptera]</p><p><b>jednakokrilac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> insects having membranous forewings and hind wings [homopterous insect]</p><p><b>jednakokrilac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> insects having membranous forewings and hind wings [homopteran]</p><p><b>homoseksualac, homoseksualan, gej, lezbo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is sexually attracted to persons of the same sex [gay, homo, homophile]</p><p><i>adj.</i> sexually attracted to members of your own sex</p><p><b>homoseksualnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sexual attraction to (or sexual relations with) persons of the same sex [gayness, homoeroticism, homosexuality, queerness]</p><p><b>homoseksualnost, homoseksualnosti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sexual attraction to (or sexual relations with) persons of the same sex [gayness, homoeroticism, homosexualism, queerness]</p><p><b>karakterizira se homosporom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by homospory</p><p><b>razvoj jedne vrste asexualne spore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the development of a single kind of asexual spores</p><p><b>(botanica) ima stile iste dužine (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (botany) having styles all of the same length [homostylic, homostylous]</p><p><b>(botanica) ima stile iste dužine (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (botany) having styles all of the same length [homostyled, homostylous]</p><p><b>(botanica) ima stile iste dužine (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (botany) having styles all of the same length [homostyled, homostylic]</p><p><b>životinja koja ima tjelesnu temperaturu koja je relativno konstanta i neovisna o temperaturi okoliša (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an animal that has a body temperature that is relatively constant and independent of the environmental temperature [homeotherm, homoiotherm]</p><p><b>od ptica i sisavaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of birds and mammals [homeothermic, homoiothermic]</p><p><b>stanje homozigotnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being homozygous</p><p><b>(genetika) organizam koji ima dva identična alela određenog gena i tako se razmnožava za određenu karakteristiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (genetics) an organism having two identical alleles of a particular gene and so breeding true for the particular characteristic</p><p><b>koji imaju identične alele na odgovarajućim hromozomskim lokima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having identical alleles at corresponding chromosomal loci</p><p><b>Osoba koja je vrlo mala, ali koja nije inače deformirana ili abnormalna, Mali potpuno oblikovan pojedinac koji (prema diskreditiranoj teoriji preformacije) bi trebao biti prisutan u spermiji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is very small but who is not otherwise deformed or abnormal [manikin, mannikin]</p><p><i>n.</i> a tiny fully formed individual that (according to the discredited theory of preformation) is supposed to be present in the sperm cell</p><p><b>Osjećaj domaćinstva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a feeling of home [homelike, homely, homey]</p><p><b>Gomel</b></p><p><i>n.</i> industrial city of Belarus to the southeast of Minsk [Gomel, Homel]</p><p><b>drmator, gazda, glavni, kapo, šef, velika zvjerka, nadzornik, predradnik, upravitelj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who exercises control over workers [boss, chief, foreman, gaffer]</p><p><b>središnje i najveće od četiri glavna japanska otoka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the central and largest of the four main islands of Japan [Honshu]</p><p><b>u Hondurasu ili u njemu živi, od ili u vezi s ili karakteristično za Honduras ili njegov narod (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or inhabitant of Honduras</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of Honduras or its people</p><p><b>Tegucigalpa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital and largest city of Honduras [Tegucigalpa]</p><p><b>monetarna jedinica u Hondurasu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> monetary unit in Honduras</p><p><b>Honduras</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in Central America [Republic of Honduras]</p><p><b>važan mahogni iz Srednje Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an important Central American mahogany tree [Swietinia macrophylla]</p><p><b>Drvo iz Srednje Amerike koje daje dragocjenu tamno-prostačku ružu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Central American tree yielding a valuable dark streaked rosewood [Dalbergia stevensonii]</p><p><b>brus, brusiti, usavršavati, usavršiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a whetstone made of fine gritstone</p><p><i>v.</i> sharpen with a hone</p><p><i>v.</i> make perfect or complete [perfect]</p><p><b>Švicarski skladatelj (rođen u Francuskoj) koji je bio osnivač grupe u Parizu koja je uključivala Erika Satieja i Dariusa Milhauda i Francis Poulenc i Jean Cocteaua (1892-1955) (MT)</b></p><p><