ajuće (od &quot;horrifying&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a horrifying manner</p><p><b>da se kosa podigne i dobiješ gusku kožu., izazvati (nečiji) kosa da stoji na kraju i imati gusku kožu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> have one's hair stand on end and get goosebumps</p><p><i>v.</i> cause (someone's) hair to stand on end and to have goosebumps</p><p><b>Refrakzna erekcija kožnih dlaka u odgovoru na hladnoću ili emocionalni stres ili iritaciju kože (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> reflex erection of hairs of the skin in response to cold or emotional stress or skin irritation [goose bump, goose pimple, goose skin, goosebump, gooseflesh, pilomotor reflex]</p><p><b>groza, grozota, jeza, strava, užas, užasom, averzija, odbojnost, odvratnost, zazor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intense and profound fear</p><p><i>n.</i> something that inspires horror</p><p><i>n.</i> intense aversion [repugnance, repulsion, revulsion]</p><p><b>Uplašen sam. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> stricken with horror [horrified, horror-struck]</p><p><b>Uplašen sam. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> stricken with horror [horrified, horror-stricken]</p><p><b>jelo koje se služi kao predjed prije glavnog obroka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dish served as an appetizer before the main meal</p><p><b>konj, konjetina, Equus caballus, kozlić</b></p><p><i>n.</i> solid-hoofed herbivorous quadruped domesticated since prehistoric times [Equus caballus]</p><p><i>n.</i> a padded gymnastic apparatus on legs [gymnastic horse]</p><p><i>n.</i> troops trained to fight on horseback [cavalry, horse cavalry]</p><p><i>n.</i> a framework for holding wood that is being sawed [buck, sawbuck, sawhorse]</p><p><i>n.</i> a chessman shaped to resemble the head of a horse [knight]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide with a horse or horses</p><p><b>igrati se, ludovati, zafrkavati se, zezati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> indulge in horseplay [arse around, fool, fool around]</p><p><b>Vječna biljka s jakim mirisom, s oštrijim i šiljatim listovima i plitkom žuto-žutih cvijeća. (MT)</b></p><p><