lja psima, lovac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who hunts game [hunter]</p><p><b>višegodišnje močvarne biljke s tamnocrvenim cvijećem i dekumbentnim širokopkraljnim vrčicama koje formiraju rozetu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial bog herb having dark red flowers and decumbent broadly winged pitchers forming a rosette [Sarracenia purpurea, common pitcher plant, huntsman's cups]</p><p><b>višegodišnje močvarne biljke s tamnocrvenim cvijećem i dekumbentnim širokopkraljnim vrčicama koje formiraju rozetu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial bog herb having dark red flowers and decumbent broadly winged pitchers forming a rosette [Sarracenia purpurea, common pitcher plant, huntsman's cup]</p><p><b>biljka s žutom čepom u obliku trube s širokim ustima i uspravnim poklopcima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pitcher plant of southeastern United States having erect yellow trumpet-shaped pitchers with wide mouths and erect lids [Sarracenia flava, huntsman's horns, trumpets, yellow pitcher plant, yellow trumpet]</p><p><b>biljka s žutom čepom u obliku trube s širokim ustima i uspravnim poklopcima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pitcher plant of southeastern United States having erect yellow trumpet-shaped pitchers with wide mouths and erect lids [Sarracenia flava, huntsman's horn, trumpets, yellow pitcher plant, yellow trumpet]</p><p><b>grad u sjevernoj Alabami (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in northern Alabama</p><p><b>Tasmanijsko drvo sa žutom aromatičnom valovitom drvenom zrnom koje se koristi za rezbarenje i gradnju brodova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Tasmanian timber tree with yellow aromatic wavy-grained wood used for carving and ship building [Dacrydium franklinii, Lagarostrobus franklinii]</p><p><b>pripadnik naroda Athapaskan u dolini rijeke Trinity u Kaliforniji, Athapaskan jezik koji govore Hupa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Athapaskan people of the Trinity River valley in California</p><p><i>n.</i> the Athapaskan language spoken by the Hupa</p><p><b>pleter, plot, prepona, prepreka