</p><p><i>n.</i> a long faint constellation in the southern hemisphere near the equator stretching between Virgo and Cancer [Snake]</p><p><i>n.</i> trouble that cannot be overcome by a single effort because of its many aspects or its persistent and pervasive quality</p><p><i>n.</i> small tubular solitary freshwater hydrozoan polyp</p><p><b>lijek protiv hipertenzije (trgovinski naziv Apresoline) koji dilatira krvne žile. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antihypertensive drug (trade name Apresoline) that dilates blood vessels [Apresoline]</p><p><b>abnormalnost trudnoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormality of pregnancy</p><p><b>hortenzija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various deciduous or evergreen shrubs of the genus Hydrangea</p><p><b>ljeplovita špilja s vazdušnim korijenima s bijelim do kremastim cvijećem u prilično ravnim glavama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous climber with aerial roots having white to creamy flowers in fairly flat heads [climbing hydrangea]</p><p><b>Broj: od 300 do 300 g. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous shrub with creamy white flower clusters [wild hydrangea]</p><p><b>ponekad uključen u obitelj Saxifragaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sometimes included in the family Saxifragaceae [Hydrangeaceae, family Hydrangeaceae]</p><p><b>ljeploviti grm s okruglim cvjetovima koji se otvaraju u zeleno i staruju u ružičaste ili plave boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous shrub bearing roundheaded flower clusters opening green and aging to pink or blue [hortensia]</p><p><b>u obliku krsta ili malog stabla s piramidalnim cvjetnim klastericama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous shrub or small tree with pyramidal flower clusters [fall-blooming hydrangea]</p><p><b>ljeplovita špilja s vazdušnim korijenima s velikim ravnim cvjetnim glavama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous climber with aerial roots having large flat flower heads [climbing hydrangea]</p><p><b>ponekad uključen u obitelj Saxifragaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sometimes included in the family Saxifragaceae [family Hydrangeaceae, hydrangea family]</p><p><b>hidrant, pipa, slavina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a faucet for drawing water from a pipe or cask [tap, water faucet, water tap]</p><p><i>n.</i> a discharge pipe with a valve and spout at which water may be drawn from the mains of waterworks</p><p><b>upale i oticanje pokretnog zgloba zbog viška sinovijalne tekućine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation and swelling of a movable joint because of excess synovial fluid</p><p><b>malen rod višegodišnjih biljaka s korijenima i listovima palmate i malim samostalnim cvijećima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of perennial herbs having rhizomes and palmate leaves and small solitary flowers [genus Hydrastis]</p><p><b>višegodišnje biljke sjeveroistočne Sjedinjenih Američkih Država s debelom čvorovitom žutom korijenom i velikim zaobljenim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial herb of northeastern United States having a thick knotted yellow rootstock and large rounded leaves [golden seal, goldenseal, turmeric root, yellow root]</p><p><b>hidrat, hidratizirati, spojiti se s vodom, vezati vodu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any compound that contains water of crystallization</p><p><i>v.</i> supply water or liquid to in order to maintain a healthy balance</p><p><i>v.</i> become hydrated and combine with water</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be hydrated</p><p><b>hidratni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> containing combined water (especially water of crystallization as in a hydrate) [hydrous]</p><p><b>Bijela kristalna spojina koja se prirodno nalazi kao mineral gibbsit (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> white crystalline compound that occurs naturally as the mineral gibbsite [aluminium hydroxide, aluminum hydroxide, hydrated aluminum oxide]</p><p><b>Bijela kristalna spojina koja se prirodno nalazi kao mineral gibbsit (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> white crystalline compound that occurs naturally as the mineral gibbsite [aluminium hydroxide, aluminum hydroxide, hydrated aluminium oxide]</p><p><b>gašeni kreč, gašeno vapno</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a caustic substance produced by heating limestone [calcium hydrate, calcium hydroxide, caustic lime, lime, lime hydrate, slaked lime]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compound of an oxide with water [hydroxide]</p><p><b>hidratacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of combining with water</p><p><b>Hidraulika, hidrauličan, hidraulički, hidraulični, hidro, hydraulički, hydrauličko, vodoprivredni, vodoprivrednih</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> moved or operated or effected by liquid (water or oil)</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the study of hydraulics</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva od 0,15 mas.% ili većim od 0,15 mas.% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> brake system in which a brake pedal moves a piston in the master cylinder [hydraulic brakes]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva od 0,15% ili većim od 0,15% ali ne više od 0,15% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cylinder that contains brake fluid that is compressed by a piston [brake cylinder, master cylinder]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva od 0,15 mas.% ili većim od 0,15 mas.% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> brake system in which a brake pedal moves a piston in the master cylinder [hydraulic brake]</p><p><b>cement koji se tvrdi pod vodom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cement that hardens under water [Portland cement]</p><p><b>grana građevinarstva koja se bavi korištenjem i upravljanjem vodom u pokretu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of civil engineering dealing with the use and control of water in motion</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> press in which a force applied by a piston to a small area is transmitted through water to another piston having a large area</p><p><b>hidraulička pumpa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a water pump that uses the kinetic energy of flowing water to force a small fraction of that water to a reservoir at a higher level [hydraulic ram]</p><p><b>vodena pumpa koja koristi kinetičku energiju tekuće vode kako bi prisilila mali dio te vode u rezervoar na većoj razini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a water pump that uses the kinetic energy of flowing water to force a small fraction of that water to a reservoir at a higher level [hydraulic pump]</p><p><b>hidraulički sustav, hidraulički pogon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanism operated by the resistance offered or the pressure transmitted when a liquid is forced through a small opening or tube</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva veći od 50 W, ali ne veći od 50 W, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transmission that depends on a hydraulic system [hydraulic transmission system]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva veći od 50 W, ali ne veći od 50 W, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transmission that depends on a hydraulic system [hydraulic transmission]</p><p><b>hydraulički, hydrauličko</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a hydraulic manner [hydraulicly]</p><p><b>Hidraulika, hidrauličan, hidraulički, hidraulični, hidro, hydraulički, hydrauličko, vodoprivredni, vodoprivrednih (od &quot;hydraulic&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a hydraulic manner [hydraulically]</p><p><b>hidraulika, hidrotehnički</b></p><p><i>n.</i> study of the mechanics of fluids [fluid mechanics]</p><p><b>bezbojna dimljiva korozivna tekućina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless fuming corrosive liquid</p><p><b>Bivalentna grupa -HNNH- dobivena od hidrazina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the bivalent group -HNNH- derived from hydrazine [hydrazo radical]</p><p><b>Bivalentna grupa -HNNH- dobivena od hidrazina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the bivalent group -HNNH- derived from hydrazine [hydrazo group]</p><p><b>bezbojna eksplozivna tekućina koja je nestabilna, otrovna i gadno miriše. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless explosive liquid that is volatile and poisonous and foul-smelling [HN, azoimide, hydrogen azide]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a salt of hydrazoic acid</p><p><b>krvni poremećaj u kojem postoji višak zapremine te