al condition in which cerebrospinal fluid collects in the ventricles of the brain [hydrocephaly]</p><p><b>abnormalno stanje u kojem se cerebrospinalna tekućina skuplja u komorima mozga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal condition in which cerebrospinal fluid collects in the ventricles of the brain [hydrocephalus]</p><p><b>jednostavne slatkovodne vodene biljke gotovo bez stabljike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> simple nearly stemless freshwater aquatic plants [Hydrocharitaceae, family Hydrocharidaceae, family Hydrocharitaceae, frog's-bit family, frogbit family]</p><p><b>žaba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> frogbit [genus Hydrocharis]</p><p><b>Europska plutajuća biljka s okruglim lišćama u obliku srca i bijelim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European floating plant with roundish heart-shaped leaves and white flowers [frog's-bit, frogbit]</p><p><b>jednostavne slatkovodne vodene biljke gotovo bez stabljike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> simple nearly stemless freshwater aquatic plants [Hydrocharidaceae, family Hydrocharidaceae, family Hydrocharitaceae, frog's-bit family, frogbit family]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,05 do 0,05 mas.% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an aqueous solution of hydrogen chloride [chlorohydric acid]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mas.% masenog udjela, ali ne više od 0,15 mas.% masenog udjela, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a complex consisting of an organic base in association with hydrogen chloride</p><p><b>Fluoroogljikovodik koji zamjenjuje klorofluoroogljikovodik kao rashladno sredstvo i gorivo u aerosolnim konzervama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fluorocarbon that is replacing chlorofluorocarbon as a refrigerant and propellant in aerosol cans [HCFC]</p><p><b>hidroklorotiazid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diuretic drug (trade name Microzide, Esidrix, and HydroDIURIL) used in the treatment of hypertension [Esidrix, HydroDIURIL, Microzide]</p><p><b>čokolada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> capybara [family Hydrochoeridae]</p><p><b>kapibara</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Hydrochoeridae [genus Hydrochoerus]</p><p><b>suhoamerički amfibijski glodavci bez repa veličine svinje s dijelom štapomljenim nogama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pig-sized tailless South American amphibious rodent with partly webbed feet [capibara, capybara]</p><p><b>supstanca koja sa vodom formira gel (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a substance that forms a gel with water</p><p><b>kortizol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an adrenal-cortex hormone (trade names Hydrocortone or Cortef) that is active in carbohydrate and protein metabolism [Cortef, Hydrocortone, cortisol]</p><p><b>kortizol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an adrenal-cortex hormone (trade names Hydrocortone or Cortef) that is active in carbohydrate and protein metabolism [Cortef, cortisol, hydrocortisone]</p><p><b>hidrokrekiranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process whereby hydrocarbon molecules of petroleum are broken down into kerosene and gasolene by the addition of hydrogen under high pressure in the presence of a catalyst</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a solution of hydrogen cyanide in water [prussic acid]</p><p><b>rod porodice Dugongidae koji obuhvaća samo Stellerovu morsku kravu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of the family Dugongidae comprising only Steller's sea cow [genus Hydrodamalis]</p><p><b>izumrli veliki sirenski sisavac koji se nekada nalazio u blizini azijske obale Beringova mora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extinct large sirenian mammal formerly found near the Asiatic coast of the Bering Sea [Steller's sea cow]</p><p><b>hidroklorotiazid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diuretic drug (trade name Microzide, Esidrix, and HydroDIURIL) used in the treatment of hypertension [Esidrix, Microzide, hydrochlorothiazide]</p><p><b>hidrodinamski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to hydrodynamics</p><p><b>hidrodinamika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> study of fluids in motion [hydrokinetics]</p><p><b>hidroelektrana, hidroelektrični</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or used in the production of electricity by waterpower</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva od 0,15% ili više, ali ne više od 0,15% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> turbine consisting of a large and efficient version of a water wheel used to drive an electric generator</p><p><b>Električna energija proizvedena vodom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electricity produced by water power</p><p><b>diuretik koji se koristi za liječenje hipertenzije i edema (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> diuretic used to treat hypertension and edema</p><p><b>slaba otrovna tekuća kiselina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a weak poisonous liquid acid</p><p><b>Fluorogljikovodik koji se emitira kao nusproizvod industrijske proizvodnje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fluorocarbon emitted as a by-product of industrial manufacturing [HFC]</p><p><b>Neustabilna otrovna korozivna kiselina poznata uglavnom u obliku svojih soli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unstable poisonous corrosive acid known primarily in the form of its salts [fluosilicic acid]</p><p><b>hidrokrilac, krilo hidrodinamičkog oblika, hidrogliser</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device consisting of a flat or curved piece (as a metal plate) so that its surface reacts to the water it is passing through [foil]</p><p><i>n.</i> a speedboat that is equipped with winglike structures that lift it so that it skims the water at high speeds [hydroplane]</p><p><b>kolodalni gel u kojem je voda medij disperzije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colloidal gel in which water is the dispersion medium</p><p><b>hidrogen, vodik, vodonik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nonmetallic univalent element that is normally a colorless and odorless highly flammable diatomic gas [H, atomic number 1]</p><p><b>atom vodika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an atom of hydrogen</p><p><b>bezbojna eksplozivna tekućina koja je nestabilna, otrovna i gadno miriše. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless explosive liquid that is volatile and poisonous and foul-smelling [HN, azoimide, hydrazoic acid]</p><p><b>nuklearnog oružja koje oslobađa atomsku energiju spajanjem lakih (vodon