 Vistaril, hydroxyzine]</p><p><b>Koelenterati koji obično imaju izmjenu generacija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coelenterates typically having alternation of generations [class Hydrozoa]</p><p><b>kolonijalni koelenterati s dominantnom fazom polipa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> colonial coelenterates having the polyp phase dominant [hydroid]</p><p><b>sazvežđe na južnoj hemisferi blizu južnog nebeskog pola. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a constellation in the southern hemisphere near the south celestial pole</p><p><b>vodeni čevrotaini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> water chevrotains [genus Hyemoschus]</p><p><b>Najveći Chevrotain (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> largest chevrotain [water chevrotain, water deer]</p><p><b>hijena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> doglike nocturnal mammal of Africa and southern Asia that feeds chiefly on carrion [hyaena]</p><p><b>snažan sisavac poput psa iz južne i istočne Afrike koji lovi u velikim čoparima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a powerful doglike mammal of southern and eastern Africa that hunts in large packs [African hunting dog, Cape hunting dog, Lycaon pictus]</p><p><b>(grčka mitologija) boginja zdravlja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) the goddess of health</p><p><b>higijena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a condition promoting sanitary practices</p><p><i>n.</i> the science concerned with the prevention of illness and maintenance of health [hygienics]</p><p><b>higijenske, higijenski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to promote or preserve health [hygienical]</p><p><b>koji imaju za cilj promicanje ili očuvanje zdravlja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to promote or preserve health [hygienic]</p><p><b>na higijenski način (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a hygienic manner</p><p><b>higijena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the science concerned with the prevention of illness and maintenance of health [hygiene]</p><p><b>za čišćenje ili sterilizaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make sanitary by cleaning or sterilizing [hygienize, sanitise, sanitize]</p><p><b>medicinski stručnjak za higijenu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a medical specialist in hygiene</p><p><b>za čišćenje ili sterilizaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make sanitary by cleaning or sterilizing [hygienise, sanitise, sanitize]</p><p><b>rod gljiva iz obitelji Hygrophoraceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of fungi belonging to the family Hygrophoraceae [genus Hygrocybe]</p><p><b>konična vlažnica, stožasta staklača</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungus having an acutely conic cap and dry stalks [conic waxycap]</p><p><b>Hidrometar za mokre i suhe žarulje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wet and dry bulb hygrometer</p><p><b>higrometar, vlagomjer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> measuring instrument for measuring the relative humidity of the atmosphere</p><p><b>porodica gljiva iz reda Agaricales (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of fungi belonging to the order Agaricales [family Hygrophoraceae]</p><p><b>rod gljiva iz obitelji Hygrophoraceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of fungi belonging to the family Hygrophoraceae [genus Hygrophorus]</p><p><b>gljiva s bijelim konveksnim kapom i lukovitim bijelim žlijezde i stabljkom koji se suži prema osnovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungus with a white convex cap and arcuate white gills and a stalk that tapers toward the base</p><p><b>gljiva s široko konveksnim kapom koja je kremaste boje s nijancom plave iznad rubine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungus with a broadly convex cap that is cream color with a tint of blue over the margin</p><p><b>gljiva s dosadnim kapom skvamuloze i sivo-sjednim skvamulama na bijeloj pozadini stabljike i voskovitim sivo-bijelim žlijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungus with a drab squamulose cap and grey-brown squamules over the white background of the stalk and waxy grey-white gills</p><p><b>gljiva s malo viscidnim poklopcem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungus with a slightly viscid cap</p><p><b>martovka, ožujka, ožujska puževica, proljetna sočnica, snježnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a grey fungus frequently found near melting snow banks</p><p><b>gljiva s viscidnim ljubičastim crvenim kapom i stabljkom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungus with a viscid purplish red cap and stalk</p><p><b>jestiva gljiva s crvenkastim kapom i bližim blijednim žlijezde i suhom stabljkom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an edible fungus with a reddish cap and close pale gills and dry stalk</p><p><b>jestiva gljiva s velikim bijelim čepom i suhom stabljkom i bijelim žlijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an edible fungus with a large white cap and a dry stalk and white gills</p><p><b>gljiva s smeđom ljepljivom kapom s bijelom rubom i bijelim žlijezde i mirisom sirovih krompira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungus having a brownish sticky cap with a white margin and white gills and an odor of raw potatoes</p><p><b>mala gljiva s narandžastom kapom i žutim žlijezde pronađen u sphagnum močvarama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small fungus with orange cap and yellow gills found in sphagnum bogs</p><p><b>hidrofit, higrofit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plant that grows in a moist habitat</p><p><b>koji zahtijevaju obilje vlage (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> requiring an abundance of moisture</p><p><b>higroskop</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hygrometer that shows variations in the relative humidity of the atmosphere</p><p><b>higroskopan, koji apsorbira vlagu iz zraka</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> absorbing moisture (as from the air)</p><p><b>diuretik (trgovinski nazivi Hygroton i Thalidone) koji se koristi za kontrolu hipertenzije i stanja koja uzrokuju edem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diuretic (trade names Hygroton and Thalidone) used to control hypertension and conditions that cause edema [Thalidone, chlorthalidone]</p><p><b>rod gljiva iz obitelji Hygrophoraceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of fungi belonging to the family Hygrophoraceae [genus Hygrotrama]</p><p><b>mala sivo-smeđa gljiva s neprijatnim mirisom naftalina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small grey-brown fungus with an unpleasant odor of mothballs</p><p><b>tip rod Hylidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the type genus of the Hylidae [genus Hyla]</p><p><b>mali ug