.</i> blatant or sensational promotion [ballyhoo, hoopla, plug]</p><p><i>v.</i> publicize in an exaggerated and often misleading manner</p><p><b>učiniti nešto interesantijim, učiniti nešto interesantnijim</b></p><p><i>v.</i> get excited or stimulated [psych up]</p><p><b>rod ribe iz obitelji Catostomidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of fish in the family Catostomidae [genus Hypentelium]</p><p><b>široko rasprostranjeni u toplim čistim plitkim potokima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> widely distributed in warm clear shallow streams [hog molly, hog sucker]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom ugljika od 0,9 g/cm3 ili većim od 0,9 g/cm3 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a steel that contains more than 0.9% carbon</p><p><b>pretjerana kiselost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> excessive acidity</p><p><b>hiperaktivan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> more active than normal [overactive]</p><p><b>stanje koje se karakterizira prekomjernim nemirom i kretanjem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a condition characterized by excessive restlessness and movement</p><p><b>Neobična oštrina sluha zbog povećane razdražljivosti senzornog neuronskog mehanizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormal acuteness of hearing due to increased irritability of the sensory neural mechanism [auditory hyperesthesia, hyperacusis]</p><p><b>Neobična oštrina sluha zbog povećane razdražljivosti senzornog neuronskog mehanizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormal acuteness of hearing due to increased irritability of the sensory neural mechanism [auditory hyperesthesia, hyperacusia]</p><p><b>bol u žlijezde uzrokovana prekomjernim unosom ACTH-a koji dovodi do većeg od normalnog funkcioniranja nadbubrežne žlijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a glandular disorder caused by excessive ACTH resulting in greater than normal functioning of the adrenal gland [Cushing's disease]</p><p><b>bol u žlijezde uzrokovana prekomjernim udjelom kortizola (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a glandular disorder caused by excessive cortisol [Cushing's syndrome]</p><p><b>povećana krv u nekom organu ili d