<p><i>n.</i> a patient with imaginary symptoms and ailments</p><p><i>adj.</i> suffering from hypochondria [hypochondriacal]</p><p><b>koji boluju od hipohondrije (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> suffering from hypochondria [hypochondriac]</p><p><b>hipohondrija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chronic and abnormal anxiety about imaginary symptoms and ailments [hypochondria]</p><p><b>gornji dio trbuha odmah ispod donjih rebara s obje strane epigastrija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the upper region of the abdomen just below the lowest ribs on either side of the epigastrium</p><p><b>anemija koju karakterizira smanjenje koncentracije korpuskularnog hemoglobina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> anemia characterized by a decrease in the concentration of corpuscular hemoglobin [hypochromic anemia]</p><p><b>anemija koju karakterizira smanjenje koncentracije korpuskularnog hemoglobina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> anemia characterized by a decrease in the concentration of corpuscular hemoglobin [hypochromic anaemia]</p><p><b>ime koje se koristi za ljubljenje (posebno za ime koje ima pomalo priloga) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a name of endearment (especially one using a diminutive suffix) [pet name]</p><p><b>obitelj gljiva s svijetlo obojenim mesnim ili membranskim askocarpom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> family of fungi having brightly colored fleshy or membranous ascocarps [family Hypocreaceae]</p><p><b>korišten u nekim klasifikacijama za obitelj Hypocreaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used in some classifications for the family Hypocreaceae [order Hypocreales]</p><p><b>licemjerstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expression of agreement that is not supported by real conviction [lip service]</p><p><i>n.</i> insincerity by virtue of pretending to have qualities or beliefs that you do not really have</p><p><b>licemjer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who professes beliefs and opinions that he or she does not hold in order to conceal his or her real feelings or motives [dissembler, dissimulator, phoney, phony, pretender]</p><p><b>Ispovjedajući osjećaje ili vrline koje nema (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> professing feelings or virtues one does not have</p><p><b>Na licemjerni način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a hypocritical manner</p><p><b>crta koju stvara točka na krugu koja se okreće unutar drugog kruga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a line generated by a point on a circle that rolls around inside another circle</p><p><b>u nekim klasifikacijama smatra se tipskim rodom obitelji Hypodermatidae: muhe-vrčarice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in some classifications considered the type genus of the family Hypodermatidae: warble flies [genus Hypoderma]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s hipodermisom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the hypodermis</p><p><b>muhe-svijetlice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> warble flies [Oestridae, family Hypodermatidae, family Oestridae]</p><p><b>potkožna injekcija, potkožni, potkožan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piston syringe that is fitted with a hypodermic needle for giving injections [hypo, hypodermic syringe]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or located below the epidermis [subcutaneous]</p><p><b>šupljina igle (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hollow needle</p><p><b>injekcijska šprica s gurnicom koja je opremljena iglom za pododernje injekcije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piston syringe that is fitted with a hypodermic needle for giving injections [hypo, hypodermic]</p><p><b>sloj stanica koji luče kitinsku kutiku kod članonožaka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> layer of cells that secretes the chitinous cuticle in e.g. arthropods</p><p><b>Oštećenje osjetljivosti na dodir (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> impairment of tactile sensitivity [hypesthesia]</p><p><b>neuobičajeno niska koncentracija gama globulina u krvi i povećan rizik od infekcije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormally low concentration of gamma globulin in the blood and increased risk of infection</p><p><b>unutarnji ogranak zajedničke ilijske arterije na obje strane tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the inner branch of the common iliac artery on either side of the body [internal iliac artery]</p><p><b>pleksus živaca koji služe zdjeličnim crijevima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plexus of nerves serving the pelvic viscera [plexus hypogastricus]</p><p><b>vena koja se spaja s vanjskom ilijalnom venom kako bi formirala zajedničku ilijalnu venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that unites with the external iliac vein to form the common iliac vein [internal iliac vein]</p><p><b>snabdijeva unutarnje mišiće jezika i druge mišiće jezika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> supplies intrinsic muscles of the tongue and other tongue muscles [hypoglossal nerve, nervus hypoglosus, twelfth cranial nerve]</p><p><b>snabdijeva unutarnje mišiće jezika i druge mišiće jezika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> supplies intrinsic muscles of the tongue and other tongue muscles [hypoglossal, nervus hypoglosus, twelfth cranial nerve]</p><p><b>nepravilno nizak šećer u krvi koji je obično posljedica prekomjernog unosanja inzulina ili loše prehrane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormally low blood sugar usually resulting from excessive insulin or a poor diet [hypoglycemia]</p><p><b>Hipoglikemija ili povezanost s njom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to hypoglycemia [hypoglycemic]</p><p><b>antidijabetik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various agents that decrease the level of glucose in the blood and are used in the treatment of diabetes mellitus [hypoglycemic agent]</p><p><b>hipoglikemija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormally low blood sugar usually resulting from excessive insulin or a poor diet [hypoglycaemia]</p><p><b>Hipoglikemija ili povezanost s njom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to hypoglycemia [hypoglycaemic]</p><p><b>antidijabetik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various agents that decrease the level of glucose in the blood and are used in the treatment of diabetes mellitus [hypoglycaemic agent]</p><p><b>s izbočenom donjom vilicom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a projecting lower jaw [prognathic, prognathous]</p><p><b>neadekvatnost gonada (posebno kod muškaraca s niskim razinama testosterona) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> incompetence of the gonads (especially in the male with low testosterone)</p><p><b>abnormalno nizak nivo kalijuma u cirkulirajućoj krvi što dovodi do slabosti i abnormalnosti srca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormally low level of potassium in the circulating blood leading to weakness and heart abnormalities</p><p><b>bilo koje od različitih poremećaja metabolizma lipoproteina i holesterola koji dovode do niske razine lipoproteina i holesterola u cirkulirajućoj krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various disorders of lipoprotein and cholesterol metabolism that result in low levels of lipoprotein and cholesterol in the circulating blood</p><p><b>neuobičajeno nizak nivo natrija u krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormally low level of sodium in the blood</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an explosive white crystalline weak acid (H2N2O2)</p><p><b>hiponim, podređena riječ, podređenica, subordinirana riječ</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word that is more specific than a given word [subordinate, subordinate word]</p><p><b>hiponimija, subordinacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the semantic relation of being subordinate or belonging to a lower rank or class [subordination]</p><p><b>ovčje žabe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sheep frogs [genus Hypopachus]</p><p><b>hipoparatireoidizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inadequate secretion of parathyroid hormone resulting in abnormally low levels of calcium in the blood</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a crystalline tetrabasic acid (H4P2O6)</p><p><b>čista ili žuta monobasinska kiselina (H3PO2) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clear or yellow monobasic acid (H3PO2) [orthophosphorous acid, phosphorous acid]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s hipofizom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the hypophysis [hypophysial]</p><p><b>štap u obliku lovora koji povezuje hipofizu s hipotalamusom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the funnel-shaped stalk connecting the pituitary gland to the hypothalamus</p><p><b>ukloniti hipofizu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove the pituitary glands [hypophysectomize]</p><p><b>uklanjanje hipofize operacijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the pituitary gland removed by surgery [hypophysectomized]</p><p><b>ukloniti hipofizu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove the pituitary glands [hypophysectomise]</p><p><b>uklanjanje hipofize operacijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the pituitary gland removed by surgery [hypophysectomised]</p><p><b>kirurško uklanjanje hipofize (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> surgical removal of the pituitary gland</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s hipofizom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the hypophysis [hypophyseal]</p><p><b>patuljak čije stanje je uzrokovano nedostatkom hormona rasta, a ne genetskim čimbenicima (kao u slučaju akondroplastičnog patuljka) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dwarf whose condition is caused by a deficiency of growth hormones, rather than by genetic factors (as in the case of the achondroplastic dwarf) [Levi-Lorrain dwarf, pituitary dwarf]</p><p><b>Glavna žlijezda endokrinog sustava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the master gland of the endocrine system [pituitary, pituitary body, pituitary gland]</p><p><b>neobičan nedostatak boje kože (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> unusual lack of skin color</p><p><b>termin koji se koristi u nekim klasifikacijama za borove šipke, koje se obično uključuju u rod Monotropa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> term used in some classifications for the pinesaps, which are usually included in the genus Monotropa [genus Hypopitys]</p><p><b>nedovoljno razvijen organ zbog smanjenja broja stanica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> underdevelopment of an organ because of a decrease in the number of cells</p><p><b>anemija uzrokovana neadekvatnim funkcioniranjem koštane srži (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> anemia resulting from inadequately functioning bone marrow [hypoplastic anemia]</p><p><b>anemija uzrokovana neadekvatnim funkcioniranjem koštane srži (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> anemia resulting from inadequately functioning bone marrow [hypoplastic anaemia]</p><p><b>Achondroplastični patuljak čija je mala veličina rezultat genetske mane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an achondroplastic dwarf whose small size is the result of a genetic defect [normal dwarf, primordial dwarf, true dwarf]</p><p><b>usporeno ili plitko disanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> slow or shallow breathing</p><p><b>neuobičajeno nizak nivo proteina u krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormally low level of protein in the blood</p><p><b>smanjena osjetljivost na mirise (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lessened sensitivity to odors</p><p><b>abnormalno stanje kod muškaraca u kojem se uretra otvara na donjoj površini penisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal condition in males in which the urethra opens on the under surface of the penis</p><p><b>supresija gena zbog djelovanja nepovezanog gena, Akumulacija krvi u nekom organu, bilo koja od tri osobe Božanstva koja čine Trojstvo posebno osoba Krist u kojoj su božanska i ljudska priroda ujedinjena, (metafizika) bitna priroda ili osnovna stvarnost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the suppression of a gene by the effect of an unrelated gene [epistasis]</p><p><i>n.</i> the accumulation of blood in an organ</p><p><i>n.</i> any of the three persons of the Godhead constituting the Trinity especially the person of Christ in which divine and human natures are united [hypostasis of Christ]</p><p><i>n.</i> (metaphysics) essential nature or underlying reality</p><p><b>bilo koja od tri osobe Božanstva koja čine Trojstvo posebno osoba Krist u kojoj su božanska i ljudska priroda ujedinjena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the three persons of the Godhead constituting the Trinity especially the person of Christ in which divine and human natures are united [hypostasis]</p><p><b>što se tiče nečega apstraktnog kao materijalne stvari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> regarding something abstract as a material thing [hypostatization, reification]</p><p><b>hipostazirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> construe as a real existence, of a conceptual entity [hypostatize]</p><p><b>što se tiče nečega apstraktnog kao materijalne stvari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> regarding something abstract as a material thing [hypostatisation, reification]</p><p><b>hipostazirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> construe as a real existence, of a conceptual entity [hypostatise]</p><p><b>hipotenzija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormally low blood pressure</p><p><b>osoba koja ima abnormalno nizak krvni tlak, ako imate abnormalno nizak krvni tlak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who has abnormally low blood pressure</p><p><i>adj.</i> having abnormally low blood pressure</p><p><b>hipotenuza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the side of a right triangle opposite the right angle</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s hipotalamusom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the hypothalamus</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko hormona proizvedenih u hipotalamusu i prenosi se venom u prednju hipofizu gdje stimuliraju oslobađanje hormona prednje hipofize (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several hormones produced in the hypothalamus and carried by a vein to the anterior pituitary gland where they stimulate the release of anterior pituitary hormones [RH, hypothalamic releasing hormone, releasing factor, releasing hormone]</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko hormona proizvedenih u hipotalamusu i prenosi se venom u prednju hipofizu gdje stimuliraju oslobađanje hormona prednje hipofize (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several hormones produced in the hypothalamus and carried by a vein to the anterior pituitary gland where they stimulate the release of anterior pituitary hormones [RH, hypothalamic releasing factor, releasing factor, releasing hormone]</p><p><b>u odnosu na hipotalamus (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with respect to the hypothalamus</p><p><b>hipotalamus</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a basal part of the diencephalon governing autonomic nervous system</p><p><b>filozofirati, pretpostaviti, pretpostavljati, spekulirati, teoretizirati, umovati, vjerovati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> pledge without delivery or title of possession</p><p><i>v.</i> to believe especially on uncertain or tentative grounds [conjecture, hypothesise, hypothesize, speculate, suppose, theorise, theorize]</p><p><b>antioksidansi, hipotermija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> subnormal body temperature</p><p><b>od ili povezane s ili pogođene hipotermijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or affected by hypothermia</p><p><b>hipoteza, pretpostavka, spekulacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a proposal intended to explain certain facts or observations</p><p><i>n.</i> a tentative insight into the natural world [possibility, theory]</p><p><i>n.</i> a message expressing an opinion based on incomplete evidence [conjecture, guess, speculation, supposition, surmisal, surmise]</p><p><b>filozofirati, pretpostaviti, pretpostavljati, spekulirati, teoretizirati, umovati, vjerovati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> to believe especially on uncertain or tentative grounds [conjecture, hypothecate, hypothesize, speculate, suppose, theorise, theorize]</p><p><b>pretpostaviti, filozofirati, pretpostavljati, spekulirati, teoretizirati, umovati, vjerovati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> to believe especially on uncertain or tentative grounds [conjecture, hypothecate, hypothesise, speculate, suppose, theorise, theorize]</p><p><b>temelje se na pretpostavkama, a ne na odgovarajućim dokazima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> based primarily on surmise rather than adequate evidence [conjectural, divinatory, hypothetical, supposed, suppositional, suppositious, supposititious]</p><p><b>hipotetičan, hipotetički, hipotetski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hypothetical possibility, circumstance, statement, proposal, situation, etc.</p><p><i>adj.</i> based primarily on surmise rather than adequate evidence [conjectural, divinatory, hypothetic, supposed, suppositional, suppositious, supposititious]</p><p><b>Stvorenje koje nije promatrano, ali za koje se pretpostavlja da postoji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a creature that has not been observed but is hypothesized to exist</p><p><b>načelo koje navodi postupak koji je potreban za postizanje željenog cilja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a principle stating the action required to attain a desired goal</p><p><b>hipotetičan, hipotetički, hipotetski (od &quot;hypothetical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by hypothesis</p><p><b>niska razina protrombina (faktor II) u cirkulirajućoj krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a low level of prothrombin (factor II) in the circulating blood</p><p><b>hipotireoza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an underactive thyroid gland</p><p><b>(mišičnog tkiva) stanje hipotonije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (of muscular tissue) the state of being hypotonic [hypotonicity, hypotonus]</p><p><b>(živog tkiva) bez normalnog tonusa ili napetosti, (rešenja) s manjim osmotičkim pritiskom od poređenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of living tissue) lacking normal tone or tension</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a solution) having a lower osmotic pressure than a comparison solution</p><p><b>(rešenja) do koje mjere rastvor ima niži osmotički pritisak od nekog drugog, (mišičnog tkiva) stanje hipotonije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (of a solution) the extent to which a solution has a lower osmotic pressure than some other</p><p><i>n.</i> (of muscular tissue) the state of being hypotonic [hypotonia, hypotonus]</p><p><b>(mišičnog tkiva) stanje hipotonije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (of muscular tissue) the state of being hypotonic [hypotonia, hypotonicity]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko bolesti uzrokovanih nedostatkom jednog ili više vitamina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several diseases caused by deficiency of one or more vitamins [avitaminosis]</p><p><b>krvni poremećaj koji se sastoji od smanjenja zapremine cirkulirajuće krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blood disorder consisting of a decrease in the volume of circulating blood [hypovolemia]</p><p><b>smanjenje volumena cirkulirajuće krvi ili s tim povezano smanjenje volumena cirkulirajuće krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a decrease in the volume of circulating blood [hypovolemic]</p><p><b>krvni poremećaj koji se sastoji od smanjenja zapremine cirkulirajuće krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blood disorder consisting of a decrease in the volume of circulating blood [hypovolaemia]</p><p><b>smanjenje volumena cirkulirajuće krvi ili s tim povezano smanjenje volumena cirkulirajuće krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a decrease in the volume of circulating blood [hypovolaemic]</p><p><b>šok uzrokovan teškim gubitkom krvi ili tekućine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shock caused by severe blood or fluid loss</p><p><b>hipoksija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> oxygen deficiency causing a very strong drive to correct the deficiency</p><p><b>hipoksija uzrokovana nedostatkom kisika u krvi u plućima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hypoxia resulting from defective oxygenation of the blood in the lungs</p><p><b>u nekim sustavima klasifikacije uključenim u Amaryllidaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in some classification systems included in the Amaryllidaceae [family Hypoxidaceae]</p><p><b>male biljke koje liče na amaryllis i koje rastu iz korma i nose cvijeće na stabljku bez lišća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small plants that resemble amaryllis and that grow from a corm and bear flowers on a leafless stalk [genus Hypoxis]</p><p><b>višegodišnja zvijezda iz Sjeverne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial star grass of North America [American star grass]</p><p><b>Upotreba niza subjekata s jednim predikatom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> use of a series of subjects with a single predicate</p><p><b>Upotreba niza paralelnih klauzula (kao u `Došao sam, vidio sam, osvojio sam') (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> use of a series of parallel clauses (as in `I came, I saw, I conquered')</p><p><b>Noćne zmije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> night snakes [genus Hypsiglena]</p><p><b>Noćni štakor zapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nocturnal prowler of western United States and Mexico [night snake]</p><p><b>šumovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> musk kangaroos [genus Hypsiprymnodon]</p><p><b>mala kenguru iz sjeveroistočne Australije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small kangaroo of northeastern Australia [musk kangaroo]</p><p><b>znanstveno proučavanje Zemljine konfiguracije iznad razine mora (naglašavajući mjerenje visine kopna u odnosu na razinu mora), mjerenje nadmorske visine zemljišta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the scientific study of the earth's configuration above sea level (emphasizing the measurement of land altitudes relative to sea level)</p><p><i>n.</i> measurement of the elevation of land above sea level [hypsometry]</p><p><b>hipsometar, visinomjer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an altimeter that uses the boiling point of water to determine land elevation</p><p><b>hipsometrija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> measurement of the elevation of land above sea level [hypsography]</p><p><b>Hiraxe i neke izumrle životinje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hyraxes and some extinct animals [order Hyracoidea]</p><p><b>izumrli rod konja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extinct horse genus [genus Hyracotherium]</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko malih sisavaca kopitarnih vrste iz Afrike i Azije s reznicima nalik glodavcima i nogama s kopitom nalik prstima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several small ungulate mammals of Africa and Asia with rodent-like incisors and feet with hooflike toes [coney, cony, das, dassie]</p><p><b>Kineski zeleni čaj sa iskrivljenim lišćama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Chinese green tea with twisted leaves</p><p><b>Europska mentola s aromatičnim i oštrim lišćama koja se koristi u parfume i kao začin u kuhinji, Gorki listovi se koriste u salatama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a European mint with aromatic and pungent leaves used in perfumery and as a seasoning in cookery [Hyssopus officinalis]</p><p><i>n.</i> bitter leaves used sparingly in salads</p><p><b>godišnji sa malim pojedinačnim ružičastim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annual with small solitary pink flowers [Lythrum hysso