iko urođenih bolesti u kojima je koža suha i ljuskava poput ribe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several congenital diseases in which the skin is dry and scaly like a fish</p><p><b>rane tetrapodske vodozemce pronađene u Grenlandu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> early tetrapod amphibian found in Greenland</p><p><b>ledena siga, ledenica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ice resembling a pendent spear, formed by the freezing of dripping water</p><p><b>Stari svijet godišnji široko prirodni u toplim područjima s bijelim cvijećem i mesnim lišće prekriveno dlakama koje liče na led (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Old World annual widely naturalized in warm regions having white flowers and fleshy foliage covered with hairs that resemble ice [Mesembryanthemum crystallinum, ice plant]</p><p><b>leden</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a cold and icy manner</p><p><b>ledena hladnoća, bezdušnost, bezosjećajnost, bešćutnost, hladnoća, neosjećajnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coldness due to a cold environment [chill, gelidity]</p><p><i>n.</i> a lack of affection or enthusiasm [chilliness, coldness, coolness, frigidity, frigidness]</p><p><b>glazura, leđenje brodske palube, šećerna glazura, zaleđenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the formation of frost or ice on a surface [frost]</p><p><i>n.</i> a flavored sugar topping used to coat and decorate cakes [frosting, ice]</p><p><i>n.</i> (ice hockey) the act of shooting the puck from within your own defensive area the length of the rink beyond the opponent's goal [icing the puck]</p><p><b>šećer u prahu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> finely powdered sugar used to make icing</p><p><b>(Hokej na ledu) čin pucanja krug iz unutar svoje obrambene oblasti duljine staze izvan protivničkog gola (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (ice hockey) the act of shooting the puck from within your own defensive area the length of the rink beyond the opponent's goal [icing]</p><p><b>loš, pokvaren, ljigav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> very bad [crappy, lousy, rotten, shitty, stinking, stinky]</p><p><i>adj.</i> soft and sticky [gooey]</p><p><b>