ent of cognition [thought]</p><p><i>n.</i> your intention [mind]</p><p><i>n.</i> a personal view</p><p><i>n.</i> an approximate calculation of quantity or degree or worth [approximation, estimate, estimation]</p><p><i>n.</i> (music) melodic subject of a musical composition [melodic theme, musical theme, theme]</p><p><b>ideal, idealan, idejan, koji postoji samo u zamisli, savršen, savršeniji, uzor, uzoran</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the idea of something that is perfect</p><p><i>n.</i> model of excellence or perfection of a kind [apotheosis, nonesuch, nonpareil, nonsuch, paragon, saint]</p><p><i>adj.</i> conforming to an ultimate standard of perfection or excellence</p><p><i>adj.</i> constituting or existing only in the form of an idea or mental image or conception</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the philosophical doctrine of the reality of ideas [idealistic]</p><p><b>hipotetički plin s molekulama zanemarljive veličine koje ne utječu na međumolekularne sile (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hypothetical gas with molecules of negligible size that exert no intermolecular forces [perfect gas]</p><p><b>bilo koji od pet čvrstih materija čije su lica kongruentni redovni poligoni i čiji su poliedri svi kongruentni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any one of five solids whose faces are congruent regular polygons and whose polyhedral angles are all congruent [Platonic body, Platonic solid, regular convex polyhedron, regular convex solid, regular polyhedron]</p><p><b>(psihijatrija) obrambeni mehanizam koji podijeli nešto o čemu ste ambivalentni u dvije reprezentacije - jedan dobar i jedan loš, Nešto što postoji samo kao ideja., Slika nečega kao idealnog. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychiatry) a defense mechanism that splits something you are ambivalent about into two representations--one good and one bad [idealization]</p><p><i>n.</i> something that exists only as an idea [idealization]</p><p><i>n.</i> a portrayal of something as ideal [glorification, idealization]</p><p><b>idealizirati</b></p><p