aka, prepoznavanje, utvrđivanje, imenovanje, priznanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of designating or identifying something [designation]</p><p><i>n.</i> evidence of identity</p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of having the identity (of a person or object) established</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of recognizing something or someone by remembering [recognition]</p><p><i>n.</i> the attribution to yourself (consciously or unconsciously) of the characteristics of another person (or group of persons)</p><p><b>S druge strane, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, "proizvodnja" znači proizvodnja na temelju proizvoda koji se proizvodi u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tiny particle of material that can be added to a product to indicate the source of manufacture</p><p><b>identificiran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the identity known or established</p><p><b>identifikator, označivač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a symbol that establishes the identity of the one bearing it</p><p><b>identičnost, identificiran, identificirati, identitet, izjednačiti, odrediti, prepoznati, prepoznavanje, raspoznavati, ustanoviti, ustanoviti identitet, utvrditi, identificirati se, poistovjetiti se, poistovjetiti, determinirati, imenovati, određivati, opisati, otkriti, otkrivati, poistovjećivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> recognize as being [place]</p><p><i>v.</i> give the name or identifying characteristics of [name]</p><p><i>v.</i> consider (oneself) as similar to somebody else</p><p><i>v.</i> conceive of as united or associated</p><p><i>v.</i> identify as in botany or biology, for example [describe, discover, distinguish, key, key out, name]</p><p><i>v.</i> consider to be equal or the same</p><p><b>Sličnost lica osobe izgrađena na temelju opisa koji su dobili policajci. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a likeness of a person's face constructed from descriptions given to police [Identikit picture]</p><p><b>Sličnost lica osobe izgrađena na temelju opisa koji su dobili policajci. (MT)<