ific antigens in tissues by the use of markers that are either fluorescent dyes or enzymes (such as horseradish peroxidase)</p><p><b>od ili povezane s imunologijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to immunology [immunological]</p><p><b>protuzakonito tijelo koje prepoznaje invazivnu tvar (antigen: virus ili gljivica ili bakterija ili transplantirani organ) i proizvodi antitela specifična protiv tog antigenu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bodily defense reaction that recognizes an invading substance (an antigen: such as a virus or fungus or bacteria or transplanted organ) and produces antibodies specific against that antigen [immune reaction, immune response]</p><p><b>imunološki</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to immunology [immunologic]</p><p><b>poremećaj imunološkog sustava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disorder of the immune system</p><p><b>imunološki (od &quot;immunological&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> from the point of view of immunology</p><p><b>medicinski znanstvenik koji se specijalizira za imunologiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a medical scientist who specializes in immunology</p><p><b>imunologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of medical science that studies the body's immune system</p><p><b>grana imunologije koja se bavi patologijama imunološkog sustava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of immunology that deals with pathologies of the immune system</p><p><b>lijek koji smanjuje normalni imunološki odgovor tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that lowers the body's normal immune response [immune suppressant drug, immunosuppressive, immunosuppressive drug, immunosuppressor]</p><p><b>osoba čiji je imunološki odgovor neadekvatan (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of persons whose immune response is inadequate</p><p><b>imunosupresija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lowering the body's normal immune response to invasion by foreign substances</p><p><b>lijek koji smanjuje normalni imunološki odgovor tijela, od ili povezane s tvarom koja smanjuje normalan imunološki odgovor tijela i indukuje imunosupreciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that lowers the body's normal immune response [immune suppressant drug, immunosuppressant, immunosuppressive drug, immunosuppressor]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a substance that lowers the body's normal immune response and induces immunosuppression</p><p><b>lijek koji smanjuje normalni imunološki odgovor tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that lowers the body's normal immune response [immune suppressant drug, immunosuppressant, immunosuppressive, immunosuppressor]</p><p><b>lijek koji smanjuje normalni imunološki odgovor tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that lowers the body's normal immune response [immune suppressant drug, immunosuppressant, immunosuppressive, immunosuppressive drug]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s imunoterapijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to immunotherapy</p><p><b>imunoterapija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> therapy designed to produce immunity to a disease or to enhance resistance by the immune system</p><p><b>uhapsiti, utamničiti, zatvoren u tamnici, zazidati, zatvoriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> lock up or confine, in or as in a jail [gaol, imprison, incarcerate, jail, jug, lag, put away, put behind bars, remand]</p><p><b>stanje zatvora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being imprisoned [captivity, imprisonment, incarceration]</p><p><b>nepromjenjiv, nepromjenjivost, postojanost, stalnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being incapable of mutation [fixity, immutableness]</p><p><b>neizmjenljiv, neizmjenljivost, nepromjenljiv, nepromjenjivost, bezuvjetan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not subject or susceptible to change or variation in form or quality or nature [changeless]</p><p><i>adj.</i> constant and unchanging</p><p><b>neizmjenljiv, neizmjenljivost, nepromjenljiv, nepromjenjivost, bezuvjetan (od &quot;immutable&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being incapable of mutation [fixity, immutability]</p><p><b>na nepromijenljiv i nepromijenljiv način (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.<