i (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hymen that is completely closed so that menstrual blood cannot flow out</p><p><b>carski, format papira, imperijalan, imperijalni, vladarski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small tufted beard worn by Emperor Napoleon III [imperial beard]</p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of luggage carried on top of a coach</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or associated with an empire</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or belonging to the British Imperial System of weights and measures</p><p><i>adj.</i> befitting or belonging to an emperor or empress</p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging to or befitting a supreme ruler [majestic, purple, regal, royal]</p><p><b>mala brada koju je nosio car Napoleon III. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small tufted beard worn by Emperor Napoleon III [imperial]</p><p><b>jedinica za mjerenje kapaciteta službeno usvojena u britanskom carskom sustavu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of measure for capacity officially adopted in the British Imperial System [British capacity unit]</p><p><b>dekret koji je izdao vladar (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a decree issued by a sovereign ruler</p><p><b>najveći poznati mamuti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> largest known mammoth [Archidiskidon imperator, imperial mammoth]</p><p><b>galon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a British imperial capacity measure (liquid or dry) equal to 4 quarts or 4.545 liters [congius, gallon]</p><p><b>hibrid iz Ipomoea nil (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hybrid from Ipomoea nil [Ipomoea imperialis]</p><p><b>najveći poznati mamuti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> largest known mammoth [Archidiskidon imperator, imperial elephant]</p><p><b>veliki američki molj s žutim krilima s ljubičastim ili smeđom oznakom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large American moth having yellow wings with purplish or brownish markings [Eacles imperialis]</p><p><b>imperijalizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a policy of extending your rule over foreign countries</p><p><i>n.</i> a political orientation that advocates imperial interests</p><p><i>n.</i> any instance of aggressive extension of authority