te (or a series of such transients) [pulsation, pulse, pulsing]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of applying force suddenly [impetus, impulsion]</p><p><i>n.</i> an impelling force or strength [momentum]</p><p><b>eksploziv koji se koristi za pogon projektila iz topova ili za pogon raketa i raketa ili za lansiranje torpeda i dubinskih naboja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an explosive that is used to propel projectiles from guns or to propel rockets and missiles or to launch torpedos and depth charges [propellant explosive]</p><p><b>Turbina koja se pokreće mlaznicama direktno protiv lopatica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a turbine that is driven by jets direct against the blades</p><p><b>Kupite impulzivno bez odgovarajuće razmatranja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> buy on impulse without proper reflection</p><p><b>sila koja pomera nešto zajedno, Čin primjene sile iznenada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a force that moves something along [drift, impetus]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of applying force suddenly [impetus, impulse]</p><p><b>impulsivan, impulzivan, koji stavlja u pogon, lako uzbudljiv, nagao</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> proceeding from natural feeling or impulse without external stimulus [unprompted]</p><p><i>adj.</i> without forethought</p><p><i>adj.</i> having the power of driving or impelling [driving]</p><p><i>adj.</i> determined by chance or impulse or whim rather than by necessity or reason [capricious, whimsical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by undue haste and lack of thought or deliberation [brainish, hotheaded, impetuous, madcap, tearaway]</p><p><b>impulsivan, impulzivan, koji stavlja u pogon, lako uzbudljiv, nagao (od &quot;impulsive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an impulsive or impetuous way [impetuously]</p><p><b>impulzivnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of acting suddenly on impulse without reflection</p><p><b>nekažnjavanje, nekažnjenost, nekažnjivost, oprost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> exemption from punishment or loss</p><p><b>bludan, grješan, nečist, pokvaren, pomiješan, grešan, prljav<