nt</p><p><i>v.</i> sit on (eggs) [brood, cover, hatch]</p><p><b>inkubacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> maintaining something at the most favorable temperature for its development</p><p><i>n.</i> (pathology) the phase in the development of an infection between the time a pathogen enters the body and the time the first symptoms appear</p><p><i>n.</i> sitting on eggs so as to hatch them by the warmth of the body [brooding]</p><p><b>inkubacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the period between infection and the appearance of symptoms of the disease</p><p><b>inkubator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> apparatus consisting of a box designed to maintain a constant temperature by the use of a thermostat [brooder]</p><p><b>inkubus, mora, teret, inkub</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a male demon believed to lie on sleeping persons and to have sexual intercourse with sleeping women</p><p><i>n.</i> a situation resembling a terrifying dream [nightmare]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who depresses or worries others</p><p><b>uliti, uliti u glavu, utuviti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> teach and impress by frequent repetitions or admonitions [infuse, instill]</p><p><b>poučavanje ili utisnjenje na um često upućivanjem ili ponavljanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> teaching or impressing upon the mind by frequent instruction or repetition [ingraining, instilling]</p><p><b>stanje nevinosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of innocence [blamelessness, guiltlessness, inculpableness]</p><p><b>bez krivice. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> free of guilt [blameless, irreproachable, unimpeachable]</p><p><b>stanje nevinosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of innocence [blamelessness, guiltlessness, inculpability]</p><p><b>okriviti, inkriminirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> suggest that someone is guilty [imply, incriminate]</p><p><b>okrivljenje, krivnja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an accusation that you are responsible for some lapse or misdeed [blame, incrimination]</p><p><b>uzrokovanje krivnje da se pripisuje na (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing blame to be imputed to [inculp