y upland areas and plains of western North America to northern Mexico [Oryzopsis hymenoides, mountain rice, silk grass, silkgrass]</p><p><b>novčana jedinica u Indiji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> monetary unit in India</p><p><b>brzokušan živir iz južne Azije veličine freta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> keen-sighted viverrine of southern Asia about the size of a ferret [Herpestes nyula]</p><p><b>Azijski senf koji se koristi kao biljka, lišće jesti kao kuhana povrća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Asiatic mustard used as a potherb [Brassica juncea, chinese mustard, gai choi, leaf mustard]</p><p><i>n.</i> leaves eaten as cooked greens [leaf mustard, mustard, mustard greens]</p><p><b>nezadovoljstvo britanskom upravom u Indiji dovelo je do brojnih pobuna 1857. i 1858. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> discontent with British administration in India led to numerous mutinies in 1857 and 1858 [Sepoy Mutiny]</p><p><b>Indijski ocean</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the 3rd largest ocean</p><p><b>višegodišnja biljka iz Sjeverne Amerike s sivo-dlakavim listovima koja daje crveni ili žuti pigment, Europska godišnja s grmovima zelenkastih cvijeća nakon kojih slijede crveni pulpasti plodovi slični bobici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial North American plant with greyish hairy foliage yielding a red or yellow pigment [Lithospermum canescens, hoary puccoon]</p><p><i>n.</i> European annual with clusters of greenish flowers followed by red pulpy berrylike fruit [Chenopodium capitatum, strawberry blite, strawberry pigweed]</p><p><b>Vječna biljka iz istočne i južne Sjedinjenih Država s sjajnim narandžastim cvijećem, bilo koja biljka iz roda Castilleja s gustima šiljkama s kapuljačima i s svijetlom bojom na vrhu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect perennial of eastern and southern United States having showy orange flowers [Asclepias tuberosa, butterfly weed, chigger flower, chiggerflower, orange milkweed, pleurisy root, tuber root]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various plants of the genus Castilleja having dense spikes of hooded flowers with brightly colored bracts [painted cup]</p><p><b>Europske godišnje biljke koje se uzgajaju za krmno uzgoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European annual grown for forage [Lathyrus sativus, grass pea, khesari]</p><p><b>tropska američka godišnja planinara s crvenim (ponekad bijelim) cvijećima i fino raskomadanim lištima, Sjevernoamerička lobelija s sjajnim crvenim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American annual climber having red (sometimes white) flowers and finely dissected leaves [Ipomoea quamoclit, Quamoclit pennata, cypress vine, star-glory]</p><p><i>n.</i> North American lobelia having brilliant red flowers [Lobelia cardinalis, cardinal flower]</p><p><b>mala voskava bijela ili ružičasta bijela saprofična šumska biljka s lišćama nalik ljuskama i cvjetom koji kine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small waxy white or pinkish-white saprophytic woodland plant having scalelike leaves and a nodding flower [Monotropa uniflora, waxflower]</p><p><b>Svaka biljka iz roda Cacalia koja ima lišće slično lišćama od planina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various plants of the genus Cacalia having leaves resembling those of plantain</p><p><b>Sjevernoamerička biljka s velikim listovima i žutkastozelenim cvijećem koja raste u rasceme, Pokeweed iz jugoistočne Azije i Kine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American plant having large leaves and yellowish green flowers growing in racemes [American hellebore, Veratrum viride, bugbane, white hellebore]</p><p><i>n.</i> pokeweed of southeastern Asia and China [Phytolacca acinosa]</p><p><b>mali domaći konj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small native range horse [cayuse]</p><p><b>Sjevernoamerička loza s mirisnim cvjetovima i jestivim gomoljicama, vrlo visoka američka višegodišnja biljka iz središnje i istočne Sjedinjenih Država u Kanadi koja ima jestive korenje gomoljaste vrste (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a North American vine with fragrant blossoms and edible tubers [Apios americana, Apios tuberosa, groundnut, groundnut vine, potato bean, wild bean]</p><p><i>n.</i> very tall American perennial of central and the eastern United States to Canada having edible tuberous roots [Helianthus giganteus, giant sunflower, tall sunflower]</p><p><b>vrlo veliki piton iz jugoistočne Azije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> very large python of southeast Asia [Python molurus]</p><p><b>ulaze u zgrade u potrazi za plijenom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> enter buildings in pursuit of prey [Ptyas mucosus]</p><p><b>podgrm s ljubičastim cvjetovima i napušenim čunjem u kojem se zrela sjemena škrcaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect subshrub having purple-tinted flowers and an inflated pod in which the ripe seeds rattle [Crotalaria spectabilis]</p><p><b>crveni pigment sastavljen djelomično od željeznog oksida koji se često koristi u bojama i kozmeticama, crvena zemlja koja sadrži željezni oksid, crvenkasto-smeđa boja koja se podseća na crvenu zemlju koju su američki Indijanci koristili kao boju za tijelo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a red pigment composed in part from ferric oxide which is often used in paints and cosmetics</p><p><i>n.</i> a red soil containing ferric oxide</p><p><i>n.</i> a reddish-brown color resembling the red soil used as body paint by American Indians</p><p><b>U slučaju da je proizvod proizveden od povrća ili voća, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (c) ovog članka, ne smije se upotrebljavati za proizvodnju povrća ili povrća. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a spicy condiment made of chopped fruits or vegetables cooked in vinegar and sugar with ginger and spices [chutney]</p><p><b>rezervat za indijanske potrebe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a reservation set aside for the use of Indians</p><p><b>koji ima jedan rog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> having one horn [Rhinoceros unicornis]</p><p><b>Zeleni šum u Indiji i jugoistočnoj Aziji s velikim ljubičastim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> evergreen spreading shrub of India and southeastern Asia having large purple flowers [Melastoma malabathricum]</p><p><b>Rizomatozna višegodišnja biljka s velikim dramatičnim peltatnim lištima i bijelim do svijetlo ružičastim cvijećem u okruglim glavama na stabljikama bez lišća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rhizomatous perennial herb with large dramatic peltate leaves and white to bright pink flowers in round heads on leafless stems [Darmera peltata, Peltiphyllum peltatum, umbrella plant]</p><p><i>n.</i> Asian herb (Himalayas) [Himalayan rhubarb, Rheum australe, Rheum emodi, red-veined pie plant]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> grains of aquatic grass of North America [wild rice]</p><p><b>Istočnoindijsko drvo korisnog tamno ljubičastog drveta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> East Indian tree having a useful dark purple wood [Dalbergia latifolia, East India rosewood, East Indian rosewood, Indian blackwood]</p><p><b>osnovna jedinica novca u Indiji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in India [rupee]</p><p><b>Visoka višegodišnja biljka s bijelim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> showy perennial herb with white flowers [Hydrophyllum virginianum, John's cabbage, Shawnee salad, Virginia waterleaf, shawny]</p><p><b>Blizanj s cvetnim cvetovima od crvenokakvog žuta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect shrub having racemes of tawny yellow flowers [Alexandria senna, Alexandrian senna, Cassia acutifolia, Cassia augustifolia, Senna alexandrina, tinnevelly senna, true senna]</p><p><b>Cigna uzgajana posebno za svoj jestivi korijenski stalak od kojeg se dobiva škrob od korijena-strelja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> canna grown especially for its edible rootstock from which arrowroot starch is obtained [Canna edulis, Canna indica, achira, arrowroot]</p><p><b>bablje ljeto</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a period of unusually warm weather in the autumn [Saint Martin's summer]</p><p><b>tapir koji se nalazi u Malaiji i Sumatri (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tapir found in Malaya and Sumatra [Malayan tapir, Tapirus indicus]</p><p><b>bolest (česta u Indiji i oko Mediterana) koju uzrokuje rickettsia koja se prenosi ljudima crvenkastim smeđim krpeljem (ixodid) koji živi na psima i drugim sisarima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disease (common in India and around the Mediterranean area) caused by a rickettsia that is transmitted to humans by a reddish brown tick (ixodid) that lives on dogs and other mammals [Kenya fever, Marseilles fever, boutonneuse fever]</p><p><b>Tabakovna biljka Južne Amerike i Meksika, Sjevernoamerička divlja lobelija s malim plavim cvijećem i napuhanim kapsulama koje su ranije korištene kao antispasmodic (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tobacco plant of South America and Mexico [Nicotiana rustica, wild tobacco]</p><p><i>n.</i> North American wild lobelia having small blue flowers and inflated capsules formerly used as an antispasmodic [Lobelia inflata, bladderpod]</p><p><b>staza kroz divljinu koju su nosili Indijanci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a trail through the wilderness worn by Amerindians</p><p><b>obična američka biljka s proljetnim cvjetovima koja ima listove za pokrivanje i uspravnu štapovsku spadix s sveobuhvatnim zelenim i ljubičastim spatheom koji proizvodi crvene bobice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common American spring-flowering woodland herb having sheathing leaves and an upright club-shaped spadix with overarching green and purple spathe producing scarlet berries [Arisaema atrorubens, Arisaema triphyllum, jack-in-the-pulpit, wake-robin]</p><p><b>Indiana</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state in midwestern United States [Hoosier State, IN, Ind.]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States pop artist (born 1928) [Robert Indiana]</p><p><b>rodom ili stanovnikom Indiane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or resident of Indiana [Hoosier]</p><p><b>Glavni i najveći grad Indiana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital and largest city of Indiana [capital of Indiana]</p><p><b>grana indo-iranske obitelji jezika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the Indo-Iranian family of languages [Indo-Aryan]</p><p><b>indikacija, indikator, nagovještaj, pokazatelj, znak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something that serves to indicate or suggest [indication]</p><p><i>n.</i> a number or ratio (a value on a scale of measurement) derived from a series of observed facts [index, index number, indicator]</p><p><b>indicirati, iznijeti, nagovijestiti, nagovještavati, navesti, naznačiti, označavati, označiti, pokazati, spomenuti, ukazati, uputiti, značiti, naznačite, nagoviještati, pokazivati, predstavljati, signalizirati, ukazivati, navoditi, naznačivati, spominjati, ustvrditi, ustvrđivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be a signal for or a symptom of [bespeak, betoken, point, signal]</p><p><i>v.</i> indicate a place, direction, person, or thing [designate, point, show]</p><p><i>v.</i> to state or express briefly</p><p><i>v.</i> give evidence of [argue]</p><p><i>v.</i> suggest the necessity of an intervention</p><p><b>indikacija, najava, navod, oznaka, upozorenje, znak, znamen, indikator, nagovještaj, pokazatelj, pokazivanje, ukazivanje, očitanje, vrijednost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something that serves to indicate or suggest [indicant]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of indicating or pointing out by name [denotation]</p><p><i>n.</i> (medicine) a reason to prescribe a drug or perform a procedure</p><p><i>n.</i> something (as a course of action) that is indicated as expedient or necessary</p><p><i>n.</i> a datum about some physical state that is presented to a user by a meter or similar instrument [meter reading, reading]</p><p><b>indikativan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mood (grammatically unmarked) that represents the act or state as an objective fact [common mood, declarative, declarative mood, fact mood, indicative mood]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to the mood of verbs that is used simple in declarative statements [declarative]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (usually followed by `of') pointing out or revealing clearly [indicatory, revelatory, significative, suggestive]</p><p><b>raspoloženje (gramatički neobjavljeno) koje predstavlja čin ili stanje kao objektivnu činjenicu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mood (grammatically unmarked) that represents the act or state as an objective fact [common mood, declarative, declarative mood, fact mood, indicative]</p><p><b>indikator, pokazatelj, pokazivač, putokaz, znak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a number or ratio (a value on a scale of measurement) derived from a series of observed facts [index, index number, indicant]</p><p><i>n.</i> a signal for attracting attention</p><p><i>n.</i> a device for showing the operating condition of some system</p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) a substance that changes color to indicate the presence of some ion or substance</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva od 1,15 kW ili više, ali ne više od 1,15 kW, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> indicator consisting of a light to indicate whether power is on or a motor is in operation [pilot lamp, pilot light]</p><p><b>voditelji meda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> honey guides [family Indicatoridae]</p><p><b>(obično slijedi `of') koji jasno ukazuje ili otkriva (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (usually followed by `of') pointing out or revealing clearly [indicative, revelatory, significative, suggestive]</p><p><b>optužiti, tužiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> accuse formally of a crime</p><p><b>stanje podložno opozivu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being liable to impeachment [impeachability]</p><p><b>koji su podložni optužbi ili uzrok takve odgovornosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> liable to be accused, or cause for such liability [chargeable]</p><p><b>15-godišnji ciklus koji se koristio kao kronološka jedinica u drevnom Rimu i usvojen u nekim srednjovjekovnim kraljevstvima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a 15-year cycle used as a chronological unit in ancient Rome and adopted in some medieval kingdoms</p><p><b>optužnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a formal document written for a prosecuting attorney charging a person with some offense [bill of indictment]</p><p><i>n.</i> an accusation of wrongdoing</p><p><b>pop grupa koja nije povezana s velikim izdavačkim kućama., Neovisna filmska tvrtka koja nije povezana s uspostavljenim studiom, (pop grupa) ne povezane s velikim izdavačkim kućama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pop group not affiliated with a major record company</p><p><i>n.</i> an independent film company not associated with an established studio</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of pop groups) not affiliated with a major recording company</p><p><b>indiferentnost, nezainteresiranost, ravnodušnost, apatija, indiferencija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> unbiased impartial unconcern</p><p><i>n.</i> apathy demonstrated by an absence of emotional reactions [emotionlessness, impassiveness, impassivity, phlegm, stolidity, unemotionality]</p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of lacking enthusiasm for or interest in things generally [apathy, numbness, spiritlessness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of remaining calm and seeming not to care [nonchalance, unconcern]</p><p><b>Označen nedostatkom interesa., pokazivanje neprijatanosti ili brige u ponašanju ili djelovanju, (obično slijedi `to') ne želi ili odbija obratiti pozornost, (često slijedi `to') bez značaja, Prilično loše do ne baš dobro., s ograničenom kemijskom reakcijom, Označen ne posebnim svidom ili nevoljom ili preferiranjem jedne stvari nad drugom., karakterizira se nedostatkom pristranosti., Ne biva ni dobra ni loša., Ni previše ni premalo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by a lack of interest [apathetic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing no care or concern in attitude or action</p><p><i>adj.</i> (usually followed by `to') unwilling or refusing to pay heed [deaf]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (often followed by `to') lacking importance [immaterial]</p><p><i>adj.</i> fairly poor to not very good</p><p><i>adj.</i> having only a limited ability to react chemically [inert, neutral]</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by no especial liking or dislike or preference for one thing over another</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by a lack of partiality [unbiased, unbiassed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being neither good nor bad [so-so]</p><p><i>adj.</i> neither too great nor too little</p><p><b>bezbrižno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with indifference</p><p><b>domorodac, starosjedilac, urođenik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an indigenous person who was born in a particular place [aboriginal, aborigine, indigene, native]</p><p><b>bijeda, neimaština, oskudica, pauperizam, potrebitost, ubogarstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of extreme poverty or destitution [need, pauperism, pauperization, penury]</p><p><b>domorodac, starosjedilac, urođenik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an indigenous person who was born in a particular place [aboriginal, aborigine, indigen, native]</p><p><b>autohton, autohtonih, domaći, urođen, urođenički, urođenik</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> originating where it is found [autochthonal, autochthonic, autochthonous, endemic]</p><p><b>jezik koji je nastao na određenom mjestu i nije doveden na to mjesto iz drugog mjesta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a language that originated in a specified place and was not brought to that place from elsewhere</p><p><b>autohton, autohtonih, domaći, urođen, urođenički, urođenik (od &quot;indigenous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an indigenous manner</p><p><b>autohton, autohtonih, domaći, urođen, urođenički, urođenik (od &quot;indigenous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nativeness by virtue of originating or occurring naturally (as in a particular place) [autochthony, endemism]</p><p><b>siromašan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> poor enough to need help from others [destitute, impoverished, necessitous, needy, poverty-stricken]</p><p><b>svojstvo teško probavljanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being difficult to digest [indigestibleness]</p><p><b>neprobavljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> digested with difficulty</p><p><b>neprobavljiv (od &quot;indigestible&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being difficult to digest [indigestibility]</p><p><b>slabo varenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disorder of digestive function characterized by discomfort or heartburn or nausea [dyspepsia, stomach upset, upset stomach]</p><p><b>rijeka u dalekoj istočnoj Sibiru koja teče na sjever do Arktičkog oceana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a river in far eastern Siberia that flows generally northward to the Arctic Ocean [Indigirka River]</p><p><b>rijeka u dalekoj istočnoj Sibiru koja teče na sjever do Arktičkog oceana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a river in far eastern Siberia that flows generally northward to the Arctic Ocean [Indigirka]</p><p><b>ozlojeđen, srdit</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> angered at something unjust or wrong [incensed, outraged, umbrageous]</p><p><b>ozlojeđen, srdit (od &quot;indignant&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an indignant manner</p><p><b>ozlojeđenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of righteous anger [outrage]</p><p><b>poniženje, uvreda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an affront to one's dignity or self-esteem</p><p><b>indigo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blue dye obtained from plants or made synthetically [anil, indigotin]</p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous subshrub of southeastern Asia having pinnate leaves and clusters of red or purple flowers [Indigofera tinctoria, indigo plant]</p><p><i>n.</i> a blue-violet color</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a color between blue and violet</p><p><b>mala tamno plava sjevernoamerička bunting (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small deep blue North American bunting [Passerina cyanea, indigo bunting, indigo finch]</p><p><b>Uročnjava s žutom bojom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> much-branched erect herb with bright yellow flowers [Baptisia tinctoria, horsefly weed, rattle weed]</p><p><b>mala tamno plava sjevernoamerička bunting (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small deep blue North American bunting [Passerina cyanea, indigo bird, indigo finch]</p><p><b>mala tamno plava sjevernoamerička bunting (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small deep blue North American bunting [Passerina cyanea, indigo bird, indigo bunting]</p><p><b>podstrov s lišnim listovima iz jugoistočne Azije s obrezanim listovima i grmovima crvenih ili ljubičastih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous subshrub of southeastern Asia having pinnate leaves and clusters of red or purple flowers [Indigofera tinctoria, indigo]</p><p><b>Velika tamno plava neotrovna zmija koja napada jama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large dark-blue nonvenomous snake that invades burrows [Drymarchon corais, gopher snake]</p><p><b>Istočni kamasi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eastern camas [Camassia scilloides, wild hyacinth]</p><p><b>rod tropskih biljaka i grmova s čudnim listovima i cvjetovima u dugim stabljikama ili šiljcima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of tropical herbs and shrubs having odd-pinnate leaves and spurred flowers in long racemes or spikes [genus Indigofera]</p><p><b>grm iz Zapadne Indije i Južne Amerike koji je izvor indigo boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrub of West Indies and South America that is a source of indigo dye [Indigofera suffruticosa, anil]</p><p><b>grm iz Zapadne Indije i Južne Amerike koji je izvor indigo boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrub of West Indies and South America that is a source of indigo dye [Indigofera anil, anil]</p><p><b>podstrov s lišnim listovima iz jugoistočne Azije s obrezanim listovima i grmovima crvenih ili ljubičastih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous subshrub of southeastern Asia having pinnate leaves and clusters of red or purple flowers [indigo, indigo plant]</p><p><b>od masnih vlakana od 5 kg ili više, ali ne više od 10 kg (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blue dye obtained from plants or made synthetically [anil, indigo]</p><p><b>inhibitor proteaze (trgovinski naziv Crixivan) koji se koristi za liječenje HIV- a. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a protease inhibitor (trade name Crixivan) used for treating HIV [Crixivan]</p><p><b>Kći Nehrua koja je bila premijer Indije od 1966. do 1977. godine (1917-1984.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> daughter of Nehru who served as prime minister of India from 1966 to 1977 (1917-1984) [Gandhi, Indira Nehru Gandhi, Mrs. Gandhi]</p><p><b>Kći Nehrua koja je bila premijer Indije od 1966. do 1977. godine (1917-1984.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> daughter of Nehru who served as prime minister of India from 1966 to 1977 (1917-1984) [Gandhi, Indira Gandhi, Mrs. Gandhi]</p><p><b>indirekt, indirektan, neizravan, neizravni, neupravan, posredan, zaobilazan, neizravne</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having intervening factors or persons or influences</p><p><i>adj.</i> not direct in spatial dimension</p><p><i>adj.</i> descended from a common ancestor but through different lines [collateral]</p><p><i>adj.</i> extended senses</p><p><i>adj.</i> not as a direct effect or consequence</p><p><b>U ovom slučaju, u slučaju da se u slučaju "suha" primjenjuje izraz "suha" ili "suha", to znači da se u slučaju "suha" primjenjuje izraz "suha" ili "suha". (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antonyms whose opposition is mediated (e.g., the antonymy of `wet' and `parched' is mediated by the similarity of `parched' to `dry')</p><p><b>korelacija u kojoj su velike vrijednosti jedne varijable povezane s malim vrijednostima druge. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a correlation in which large values of one variable are associated with small values of the other [negative correlation]</p><p><b>izvještaj o govoru u kojem su deiktni izrazi odgovarajuće modifikovani (npr. "On je rekao `Ja sam budala" bi se modifikovao na "On je rekao da je budala") (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a report of a discourse in which deictic terms are modified appropriately (e.g., "he said `I am a fool'" would be modified to "he said he is a fool")</p><p><b>dokazi koji pružaju samo osnovu za zaključivanje o spornoj činjenici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> evidence providing only a basis for inference about the fact in dispute [circumstantial evidence]</p><p><b>Neposredni način izražavanja nečega. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an indirect way of expressing something [circumlocution]</p><p><b>Umetnička oružja za upravljanje oružjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fire delivered on a target that is not itself used as the point of aim for the weapons</p><p><b>metoda za korištenje fluorescentne mikroskopske tehnologije za otkrivanje prisutnosti antigena indirektno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of using fluorescence microscopy to detect the presence of an antigen indirectly</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a concealed lighting fixture</p><p><b>predmet koji je primatelj ili korisnik djelovanja glagola (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the object that is the recipient or beneficiary of the action of the verb</p><p><b>neizravni zahtjev, poziv, zahtjev, želja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expression of some desire or inclination [wish]</p><p><b>posredni porez</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tax levied on goods or services rather than on persons or organizations</p><p><b>mehanizam prijenosa u kojem se zarazni uzročnik prenosi na osobu putem fomita vektorskog uzroka; (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transmission mechanism in which the infectious agent is transferred to the person by a fomite of vector</p><p><b>zaobilazak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> indirect procedure or action</p><p><i>n.</i> deceitful action that is not straightforward</p><p><b>indirektno, neizravno, posredno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> not in a forthright manner</p><p><b>indirekt, indirektan, neizravan, neizravni, neupravan, posredan, zaobilazan, neizravne (od &quot;indirect&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> having the characteristic of lacking a true course toward a goal</p><p><b>neprimjetan, nevidljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> difficult or impossible to perceive or discern</p><p><i>adj.</i> barely able to be perceived [insensible, undetectable]</p><p><b>manjak discipline, nediscipliniranost, neorganiziranost, neposlušnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of lacking discipline [undiscipline]</p><p><b>indiskretan, neoprezan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking discretion</p><p><b>indiskretan, neoprezan (od &quot;indiscreet&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without discretion or wisdom or self-restraint</p><p><b>indiskretan, neoprezan (od &quot;indiscreet&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lacking good judgment [injudiciousness]</p><p><b>indiskretan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not divided or divisible into parts</p><p><b>indiskrecija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being injudicious [injudiciousness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a petty misdeed [peccadillo]</p><p><b>bez diskriminacije</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> failing to make or recognize distinctions</p><p><i>adj.</i> not marked by fine distinctions</p><p><b>slučajno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a random manner [arbitrarily, at random, every which way, haphazardly, randomly, willy-nilly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an indiscriminate manner [promiscuously]</p><p><b>bez diskriminacije (od &quot;indiscriminate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not discriminating [undiscriminating]</p><p><b>Kvalitet koji posjeduje nešto što ne možete bez. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality possessed by something that you cannot possibly do without [indispensableness, vitalness]</p><p><b>neophodan, obavezan, potreban, potrebna, prijeko potreban</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not to be dispensed with</p><p><i>adj.</i> absolutely necessary [essential]</p><p><i>adj.</i> unavoidable</p><p><b>neophodan, obavezan, potreban, potrebna, prijeko potreban (od &quot;indispensable&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality possessed by something that you cannot possibly do without [indispensability, vitalness]</p><p><b>neophodan, oneraspoložiti, diskvalificirati, indisponirati, kvariti, narušavati, narušiti, pokvariti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make unwilling [disincline]</p><p><i>v.</i> make unfit or unsuitable [disqualify, unfit]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to feel unwell</p><p><b>indisponiran, neraspoložen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> somewhat ill or prone to illness [ailing, peaked, poorly, seedy, sickly, under the weather, unwell]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (usually followed by `to') strongly opposed [antipathetic, antipathetical, averse, loath, loth]</p><p><b>nenaklonost, neodlučnost, neraspoloženost, nevoljkost, oklijevanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a slight illness</p><p><i>n.</i> a certain degree of unwillingness [disinclination, hesitancy, hesitation, reluctance]</p><p><b>kvaliteta biti izvan pitanja ili spor ili sumnje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being beyond question or dispute or doubt [indubitability, unquestionability, unquestionableness]</p><p><b>neosporan, siguran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not open to question [incontestable, undisputable]</p><p><i>adj.</i> impossible to doubt or dispute [sure]</p><p><b>nepoderiv, nerastvoriv, nerazoriv, netopiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a substance) incapable of being dissolved [insoluble]</p><p><i>adj.</i> used of decisions and contracts</p><p><b>nejasan, nerazgovjetan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not clearly defined or easy to perceive or understand</p><p><b>nejasno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a dim indistinct manner [dimly]</p><p><b>nejasan, nerazgovjetan (od &quot;indistinct&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being indistinct and without sharp outlines [blurriness, fogginess, fuzziness, softness]</p><p><b>identitet, identičnost, istost, istovjetnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> exact sameness [identicalness, identity]</p><p><b>koji se može raspoznati, nezamjetljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> exactly alike [identical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not capable of being distinguished or differentiated [undistinguishable]</p><p><b>napisati, sastaviti, komponirati, pisati, sastavljati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> produce a literary work [compose, pen, write]</p><p><b>indij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rare soft silvery metallic element [In, atomic number 49]</p><p><b>individua, individualan, individualno, individuum, osoba, osoban, osobni, pojedinac, pojedinačan, pojedini, zaseban, zasebni, individualna, individualnu, pojedinačnim, pojedinca, pojedine, pojedinih, pojedinom, čovjek, jedinka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a human being [mortal, person, somebody, someone, soul]</p><p><i>n.</i> a single organism</p><p><i>adj.</i> being or characteristic of a single thing or person [single]</p><p><i>adj.</i> separate and distinct from others of the same kind [case-by-case, item-by-item]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of or meant for a single person or thing [single]</p><p><i>adj.</i> concerning one person exclusively [private]</p><p><b>plan umirovljenja koji vam omogućuje da godišnje uplaćujete ograničen iznos za umirovljenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a retirement plan that allows you to contribute a limited yearly sum toward your retirement [IRA]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, poduzeća koja se bave proizvodnjom proizvoda mogu: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> discriminating the individual from the generic group or species [individualization, individuation]</p><p><b>napraviti ili označiti ili tretirati kao pojedinac, učiniti osobnim ili više osobnim (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make or mark or treat as individual [individualize]</p><p><i>v.</i> make personal or more personal [individualize, personalise, personalize]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> made for or directed or adjusted to a particular individual [individualized, personalised, personalized]</p><p><b>individualizam, individualnost, jedinost, posebnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being individual [individuality, individuation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a belief in the importance of the individual and the virtue of self-reliance and personal independence</p><p><i>n.</i> the doctrine that government should not interfere in commercial affairs [laissez faire]</p><p><b>osoba koja se bavi neovisnim razmišljanjem ili djelovanjem, Označen ili izražava individualnost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who pursues independent thought or action</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by or expressing individuality [individualistic]</p><p><b>Označen ili izražava individualnost, s minimalno ograničenom slobodom u trgovini (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by or expressing individuality [individualist]</p><p><i>adj.</i> with minimally restricted freedom in commerce [laissez-faire]</p><p><b>na individualistički način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an individualistic manner</p><p><b>individualnost, individualizam, jedinost, posebnost, identitet, osobni identitet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being individual [individualism, individuation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the distinct personality of an individual regarded as a persisting entity [identity, personal identity]</p><p><b>individualizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> discriminating the individual from the generic group or species [individualisation, individuation]</p><p><b>napraviti ili označiti ili tretirati kao pojedinac, učiniti osobnim ili više osobnim (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make or mark or treat as individual [individualise]</p><p><i>v.</i> make personal or more personal [individualise, personalise, personalize]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> made for or directed or adjusted to a particular individual [individualised, personalised, personalized]</p><p><b>individualno, pojedinačno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> apart from others [on an individual basis, one by one, separately, severally, singly]</p><p><b>davanje individualnog karaktera, dati individualni oblik ili oblik na (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> give individual character to</p><p><i>v.</i> give individual shape or form to</p><p><b>individualizam, individualnost, jedinost, posebnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> discriminating the individual from the generic group or species [individualisation, individualization]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being individual [individualism, individuality]</p><p><b>beskrajno mali, nedjeljiv, nerazdjeljiv, nerazdvojiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> impossible of undergoing division</p><p><b>Ne može se podijeliti bez ostatka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> cannot be divided without leaving a remainder [undividable]</p><p><b>grana indo-iranske obitelji jezika, od ili u vezi s bivšim indoeuropskim narodima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the Indo-Iranian family of languages [Indic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the former Indo-European people [Aryan, Indo-European]</p><p><b>član prapovijesnog naroda koji je govorio proto-indoeuropskim jezikom., obitelj jezika koja je do 1000. godine prije Krista govorila širom Europe i dijelovima jugozapadne i južne Azije., od ili povezane s indoeuropskom jezičnom obitelji, od ili u vezi s bivšim indoeuropskim narodima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the prehistoric people who spoke Proto-Indo European [Aryan]</p><p><i>n.</i> the family of languages that by 1000 BC were spoken throughout Europe and in parts of southwestern and southern Asia [Indo-European language, Indo-Hittite]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the Indo-European language family [Indo-Germanic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the former Indo-European people [Aryan, Indo-Aryan]</p><p><b>obitelj jezika koja je do 1000. godine prije Krista govorila širom Europe i dijelovima jugozapadne i južne Azije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the family of languages that by 1000 BC were spoken throughout Europe and in parts of southwestern and southern Asia [Indo-European, Indo-Hittite]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s indoeuropskom jezičnom obitelji (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the Indo-European language family [Indo-European]</p><p><b>obitelj jezika koja je do 1000. godine prije Krista govorila širom Europe i dijelovima jugozapadne i južne Azije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the family of languages that by 1000 BC were spoken throughout Europe and in parts of southwestern and southern Asia [Indo-European, Indo-European language]</p><p><b>grana indoeuropske obitelji jezika uključujući indijske i iranske jezičke skupine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of the Indo-European family of languages including the Indic and Iranian language groups [Indo-Iranian language]</p><p><b>grana indoeuropske obitelji jezika uključujući indijske i iranske jezičke skupine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of the Indo-European family of languages including the Indic and Iranian language groups [Indo-Iranian]</p><p><b>Indokina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a peninsula of southeastern Asia that includes Myanmar and Cambodia and Laos and Malaysia and Thailand and Vietnam [Indochinese peninsula]</p><p><b>Indokina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a peninsula of southeastern Asia that includes Myanmar and Cambodia and Laos and Malaysia and Thailand and Vietnam [Indochina]</p><p><b>jogunast, pust, samovoljan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> incapable of being controlled [uncontrollable, ungovernable, unruly]</p><p><b>Ne-steroidni protuupalni lijek (trgovinski naziv Indocin) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (trade name Indocin) [indomethacin]</p><p><b>indoktrinirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> teach doctrines to</p><p><b>indoktrinacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> teaching someone to accept doctrines uncritically</p><p><b>biljni hormon koji potiče produženje stabljika i korijena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plant hormone promoting elongation of stems and roots [IAA]</p><p><b>sintetički biljni hormon koji potiče produženje stabljika i korijena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a synthetic plant hormone promoting elongation of stems and roots</p><p><b>indolencija, lijenost, nehat, nemar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inactivity resulting from a dislike of work [laziness]</p><p><b>indolentan, lijen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> disinclined to work or exertion [faineant, lazy, otiose, slothful, work-shy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of tumors, e.g.) slow to heal or develop and usually painless</p><p><b>indolentan (od &quot;indolent&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an indolent manner</p><p><b>indometacin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (trade name Indocin) [Indocin]</p><p><b>ako je imovina teško ili nemoguće pobijediti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property being difficult or impossible to defeat [invincibility]</p><p><b>nepopustljiv, nesalomljiv, nesavladiv, neukrotiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> impossible to subdue [never-say-die, unsubduable]</p><p><b>Indonezija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in southeastern Asia on an archipelago including more than 13,000 islands [Dutch East Indies, Republic of Indonesia]</p><p><b>indonezijski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or inhabitant of Indonesia</p><p><i>n.</i> the dialect of Malay used as the national language of the Republic of Indonesia or of Malaysia [Bahasa, Bahasa Indonesia]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of Indonesia or its people or languages</p><p><b>dio Indonezije na južnoj strani otoka Bornea (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of Indonesia on the southern side of the island of Borneo [Kalimantan]</p><p><b>monetarna jedinica u Indoneziji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> monetary unit in Indonesia</p><p><b>dvoranski, koji je u kući, unutarnji, zatvoren, zatvoreni, zatvorenim, unutrašnji</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> located, suited for, or taking place within a building</p><p><i>adj.</i> within doors</p><p><b>staklenik u kojem su biljke uređene na ugodan način (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a greenhouse in which plants are arranged in a pleasing manner [conservatory, hothouse]</p><p><b>u kući, unutra</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> within a building [inside]</p><p><b>podupirati, poduprijeti, sekundirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be behind [back, endorse, plump for, plunk for, support]</p><p><i>v.</i> give support or one's approval to [back, endorse, second]</p><p><i>v.</i> guarantee as meeting a certain standard [certify, endorse]</p><p><i>v.</i> sign as evidence of legal transfer [endorse]</p><p><b>indosament, imprimatur, pokroviteljstvo, sponzorstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a promotional statement (as found on the dust jackets of books) [blurb, endorsement]</p><p><i>n.</i> a speech seconding a motion [endorsement, second, secondment]</p><p><i>n.</i> formal and explicit approval [countenance, endorsement, imprimatur, sanction, warrant]</p><p><i>n.</i> a signature that validates something [endorsement]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of endorsing [endorsement]</p><p><b>indosant</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who expresses strong approval [endorser, ratifier, subscriber]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who transfers his ownership interest in something by signing a check or negotiable security [endorser]</p><p><b>glavni hinduistički bog Rig-Vede (MT)</b></p><p><i