je (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agent capable of producing infection [infective agent]</p><p><b>bolest prenosi se samo određenim kontaktnim putem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disease transmitted only by a specific kind of contact</p><p><b>akutna ali benigna forma virusnog hepatitisa uzrokovana RNA virusom koji ne ostaje u serumu krvi i obično se prenosi uzimanjem hrane ili pića kontaminiranog fekalnim materijama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acute but benign form of viral hepatitis caused by an RNA virus that does not persist in the blood serum and is usually transmitted by ingesting food or drink that is contaminated with fecal matter [hepatitis A]</p><p><b>infekciozna mononukleoza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acute disease characterized by fever and swollen lymph nodes and an abnormal increase of mononuclear leucocytes or monocytes in the bloodstream [glandular fever, kissing disease, mono, mononucleosis]</p><p><b>oblik perifernog polinevritisa koji se karakterizira bolom i slabostima i ponekad paralizom udova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of peripheral polyneuritis characterized by pain and weakness and sometimes paralysis of the limbs [Guillain-Barre syndrome, Landry's paralysis]</p><p><b>infektivan, zarazan (od &quot;infectious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a contagious manner [contagiously]</p><p><b>infektivan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> able to cause disease [morbific, pathogenic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> caused by infection or capable of causing infection [infectious]</p><p><b>sredstvo sposobno za stvaranje infekcije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agent capable of producing infection [infectious agent]</p><p><b>nesretan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not appropriate in application</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by or producing unhappiness [unhappy]</p><p><b>nesretan (od &quot;infelicitous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an infelicitous manner</p><p><b>nesreća, nesretnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inappropriate and unpleasing manner or style (especially manner or style of expression)</p><p><b>izvoditi