onzola, upravljaeka ploča</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electrical device consisting of a flat insulated surface that contains switches and dials and meters for controlling other electrical devices [board, control board, control panel, panel]</p><p><b>instrumantalan, instrumentalni, instrumentalan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or designed for or performed on musical instruments</p><p><i>adj.</i> serving or acting as a means or aid [implemental, subservient]</p><p><b>Operantno uvjetovanje koje spaja odgovor s pojačanjem u diskretnim ispitivanjima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> operant conditioning that pairs a response with a reinforcement in discrete trials</p><p><b>instrumentalna glazba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> music intended to be performed by a musical instrument or group of instruments</p><p><i>n.</i> music produced by playing a musical instrument</p><p><b>instrument</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the semantic role of the entity (usually inanimate) that the agent uses to perform an action or start a process [instrument]</p><p><b>instrumentalizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system of pragmatic philosophy that considers idea to be instruments that should guide our actions and their value is measured by their success</p><p><b>glazbenik, muzičar, svirač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who plays a musical instrument (as a profession) [musician, player]</p><p><b>oruđe, sredstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a subsidiary organ of government created for a special purpose</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being instrumental for some purpose</p><p><i>n.</i> an artifact (or system of artifacts) that is instrumental in accomplishing some end [instrumentation]</p><p><b>Napisati instrumentalnu partituru za (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> write an instrumental score for [instrument]</p><p><b>instrumentacija, instrumentacijski, izrada ili primjena instrumenata, kontrolno-mjerni pribor, kontrolno-mjerni pribori, opremeanje kontrolno-mjernim priborima, usavršavanje, oruđe, sredstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artifact (or system of artifacts