/i> make more intense, stronger, or more marked [compound, deepen, heighten]</p><p><i>v.</i> become more intense [deepen]</p><p><i>v.</i> make the chemically affected part of (a negative) denser or more opaque in order produce a stronger contrast between light and dark</p><p><b>jačati, pojačati (od &quot;intensify&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> increasing in strength or intensity</p><p><b>konotacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> what you must know in order to determine the reference of an expression [connotation]</p><p><b>korišten od skupa atributa koji razlikuju referente određene riječi (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> used of the set of attributes that distinguish the referents of a given word</p><p><b>intenzitet, intenzivnost, jačina, jakost svjetlosnog izvora, silina, glasnoća, volumen</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount of energy transmitted (as by acoustic or electromagnetic radiation) [intensity level, strength]</p><p><i>n.</i> high level or degree [intensiveness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the magnitude of sound (usually in a specified direction) [loudness, volume]</p><p><i>n.</i> chromatic purity: freedom from dilution with white and hence vivid in hue [chroma, saturation, vividness]</p><p><b>intenzitet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount of energy transmitted (as by acoustic or electromagnetic radiation) [intensity, strength]</p><p><b>intenzivan, intenzivne, intenzivnoj, snažan, temeljit, uporan, žestok, intenzifikator, pojačajna čestica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a modifier that has little meaning except to intensify the meaning it modifies [intensifier]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by a high degree or intensity</p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to give force or emphasis</p><p><i>adj.</i> of agriculture</p><p><b>intenzivna terapija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> close monitoring and constant medical care of patients with life-threatening conditions</p><p><b>jedinica intenzivne skrbi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hospital unit staffed and equipped to provide intensive care [ICU]</p><p><b>intenzivno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an intensive manner</p><p><b>intenzivan, intenzivne, intenzivnoj, snažan, temeljit, uporan, žestok (od &quot;intensive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> high level or degree [intensity]</p><p><b>cilj, koncentriran, mišljenje, namjera, napregnut, plan, predumišljaj, svrha, sadržaj, smisao, značenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an anticipated outcome that is intended or that guides your planned actions [aim, design, intention, purpose]</p><p><i>n.</i> the intended meaning of a communication [purport, spirit]</p><p><i>adj.</i> giving or marked by complete attention to [absorbed, captive, engrossed, enwrapped, wrapped]</p><p><b>cilj, intencija, nakana, nakanu, namjera, namjerom, naum, pažnja, svrha</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an anticipated outcome that is intended or that guides your planned actions [aim, design, intent, purpose]</p><p><i>n.</i> (usually plural) the goal with respect to a marriage proposal</p><p><i>n.</i> an act of intending</p><p><b>hotimičan, namjeran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by conscious design or purpose [deliberate, knowing]</p><p><i>adj.</i> done or made or performed with purpose and intent [designed, unintentional]</p><p><b>hotimičnost, intencionalnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> expressive of intentions</p><p><b>hotimično</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with intention [advisedly, by choice, by design, deliberately, designedly, on purpose, purposely]</p><p><b>koncentrirano, napeto</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with strained or eager attention</p><p><b>koncentriranost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being intent and concentrated [engrossment]</p><p><b>između, među, sahraniti, ukopati, zakopati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> place in a grave or tomb [bury, entomb, inhume, lay to rest]</p><p><b>inter alia</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> among other things</p><p><b>U slučaju da je osoba koja je poduzeće izdala zajam u roku od tri godine, zajam je poduzeće koje je poduzeće izdala zajam. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a trust created and operating during the grantor's lifetime [living trust]</p><p><b>kontakt, veza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a channel for communication between groups [contact, liaison, link]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, podrijetlo za upravljanje je: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> action by one military service to provide logistic (or administrative) support to another military service</p><p><b>Pakistanska obavještajna agencija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the Pakistan intelligence agency [Directorate for Inter-Services Intelligence, ISI]</p><p><b>međučin, međusobno djelovati, uzajamno djelovati, interagirati, biti u interakciji, družiti se, komunicirati, kontaktirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> act together or towards others or with others</p><p><b>integralni, interakcija, međudjelovanje, međusobni odnosi, međusobni utjecaj, uzajamno djelovanje, interakcije, interakciju</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mutual or reciprocal action</p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the transfer of energy between elementary particles or between an elementary particle and a field or between fields [fundamental interaction]</p><p><b>Sposobni djelovati ili utjecati jedni na druge (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of acting on or influencing each other [interactive]</p><p><b>interaktivan, interaktivnih, interaktivnog, međudjelatan, sudjelatan, interaktivna, interaktivni, sinergijski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> used especially of drugs or muscles that work together so the total effect is greater than the sum of the two (or more) [synergistic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of acting on or influencing each other [interactional]</p><p><b>interaktivni multimediji</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a multimedia system in which related items of information are connected and can be presented together [hypermedia, hypermedia system, interactive multimedia system]</p><p><b>multimedijalni sustav u kojem su povezani elementi informacija povezani i mogu se zajedno predstavljati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a multimedia system in which related items of information are connected and can be presented together [hypermedia, hypermedia system, interactive multimedia]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "službenici" su osoblje koja je odgovorna za obavljanje dužnosti u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> provision of logistic (or administrative) support by one or more of the military services to one or more departments or agencies of the United States government [interdepartmental support]</p><p><b>Teroristička organizacija koja želi srušiti vladu koju dominiraju Tutsiji i ponovno uspostaviti kontrolu nad Hutuima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a terrorist organization that seeks to overthrow the government dominated by Tutsi and to institute Hutu control again [ALIR, Army for the Liberation of Rwanda, FAR, Former Armed Forces]</p><p><b>kredit od jedne banke drugoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a loan from one bank to another</p><p><b>stražnja podjela prednjeg mozga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the posterior division of the forebrain [betweenbrain, diencephalon, thalmencephalon]</p><p><b>uzgojen od roditelja koji su blisko povezani (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> bred of closely related parents</p><p><b>križati se, ukrštati, hibridizirati, križati, miješati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> breed animals or plants using parents of different races and varieties [cross, crossbreed, hybridise, hybridize]</p><p><b>križanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (genetics) the act of mixing different species or varieties of animals or plants and thus to produce hybrids [cross, crossbreeding, crossing, hybridisation, hybridization, hybridizing]</p><p><i>n.</i> reproduction by parents of different races (especially by white and non-white persons) [crossbreeding, miscegenation]</p><p><b>koji ima dan ili mjesec koji se unosi kako bi kalendarska godina odgovarala solarnoj godini: "29 veljače je interkalarni dan" (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a day or month inserted to make the calendar year correspond to the solar year: "Feb. 29 is an intercalary day"</p><p><b>U slučaju da je datum početka kalendarske godine u veljači, u roku od tri mjeseca od datuma početka kalendarske godine, u roku od tri mjeseca od datuma početka kalendarske godine, u roku od tri mjeseca od datuma početka kalendarske godine, u roku od tri mjeseca od datuma početka kalendarske godine. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a calendar year with an extra day added in February [366 days, bissextile year, leap year]</p><p><b>Ustavljanje (danova) u kalendar (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> insert (days) in a calendar</p><p><b>interkalacija, interkalatori</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an insertion into a calendar [embolism]</p><p><b>Vene koje povezuju dorsalne i dlanovne vene ruke ili dorsalne i plantarne vene stopala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins connecting the dorsal and palmar veins of the hand or the dorsal and plantar veins of the foot [vena intercapitalis]</p><p><b>intervenirati, posredovati, zalagati se, zauzeti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> act between parties with a view to reconciling differences [arbitrate, intermediate, liaise, mediate]</p><p><b>nalazi se između stanica (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> located between cells</p><p><b>Tjelesna tvar u kojoj su ugrađene tkivne stanice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the body substance in which tissue cells are embedded [ground substance, matrix]</p><p><b>odsječak, odsjeći, prekinuti, prepriječiti, preskakanje nedozvoljenog poziva, presresti, preusmjeravanje poziva na pričuvni broj, sjecište, zadržati, ozvučiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the point at which a line intersects a coordinate axis</p><p><i>v.</i> seize on its way [stop]</p><p><i>v.</i> tap a telephone or telegraph wire to get information [bug, tap, wiretap]</p><p><b>hvatanje, lom zrake, obuhvatna pregrada, prekidanje u toku, presretanje, prisluškivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of intercepting</p><p><i>n.</i> (American football) the act of catching a football by a player on the opposing team</p><p><b>avion presretač, lovac, lovac presretač, onaj koji nešto sprečava, onaj koji sprečava, presretač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fast maneuverable fighter plane designed to intercept enemy aircraft</p><p><b>posredovanje, zalaganje, zauzimanje za, intervencija, interveniranje, uplitanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a prayer to God on behalf of another person</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of intervening (as to mediate a dispute, etc.) [intervention]</p><p><b>zagovornik, medijator, posrednik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a negotiator who acts as a link between parties [go-between, intermediary, intermediator, mediator]</p><p><b>izmijeniti, izmijenjati se, mijenjanje, premještanje, razmjena, razmjenjivati, zamijeniti, zamjena, razmjenjivanje, izmjenjivati, razmijeniti, zamjenjivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a junction of highways on different levels that permits traffic to move from one to another without crossing traffic streams</p><p><i>n.</i> mutual interaction [give-and-take, reciprocation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of changing one thing for another thing [exchange]</p><p><i>n.</i> reciprocal transfer of equivalent sums of money (especially the currencies of different countries) [exchange]</p><p><i>v.</i> put in the place of another [exchange, replace, substitute]</p><p><i>v.</i> give to, and receive from, one another [change, exchange]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to change places [counterchange, transpose]</p><p><i>v.</i> reverse (a direction, attitude, or course of action) [alternate, flip, flip-flop, switch, tack]</p><p><b>izmjenjivost, međusobna zamjenljivost, mogućnost izmjene</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being capable of exchange or interchange [exchangeability, fungibility, interchangeableness]</p><p><b>zamjenjiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (mathematics, logic) such that the arguments or roles can be interchanged</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of replacing or changing places with something else [exchangeable, similar, standardised, standardized]</p><p><b>zamjenjiv (od &quot;interchangeable&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being capable of exchange or interchange [exchangeability, fungibility, interchangeability]</p><p><b>naizmjenično</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an interchangeable manner</p><p><b>događaju se između ili među ili zajednički različitim crkvama ili denominacijama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring between or among or common to different churches or denominations [interdenominational]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> used of competition between colleges or universities</p><p><b>domofon, interfon, portafon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a communication system linking different rooms within a building or ship etc [intercommunication system]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 300 kVA ili većim od 300 kVA, ali ne više od 300 kVA, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the loudspeaker on an intercom or public address system [squawk box, squawker]</p><p><b>dojaviti, komunicirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be interconnected, afford passage</p><p><i>v.</i> transmit thoughts or feelings [communicate]</p><p><b>međusobna veza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mutual communication</p><p><b>portafon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a communication system linking different rooms within a building or ship etc [intercom]</p><p><b>sudjelovanje u Svetoj pričesti članova više od jedne crkve (npr. katoličke i pravoslavne) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> participation in Holy Communion by members of more than one church (eg Catholic and Orthodox)</p><p><b>međusobno povezati, povezati, spojiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be interwoven or interconnected [complect, interlink]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be interconnected or interwoven [interlink]</p><p><b>biti međusobno povezan, međusobno povezani, međusobno spojen, spojen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> reciprocally connected [interrelated]</p><p><i>adj.</i> operating as a unit [co-ordinated, coordinated, unified]</p><p><b>biti međusobno povezan, međusobno povezani, međusobno spojen, spojen (od &quot;interconnected&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of being connected reciprocally [interconnection]</p><p><b>međupovezivanje, međusobno povezivanje, uzajamno povezivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of being connected reciprocally [interconnectedness]</p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) the act of interconnecting (wires or computers or theories etc.)</p><p><b>interkontinentalan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> extending or taking place between or among continents</p><p><b>interkontinentalni balistički projektili</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ballistic missile that is capable of traveling from one continent to another [ICBM]</p><p><b>mišići između rebra, nalazi se ili se javlja između rebara (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> muscles between the ribs [intercostal muscle, musculus intercostalis]</p><p><i>adj.</i> located or occurring between the ribs</p><p><b>nekoliko arterija i opskrbljuju međukostalne prostore prsnog kaveza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> several arteries and supplying the intercostal spaces of the rib cage [arteria intercostalis]</p><p><b>mišići između rebra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> muscles between the ribs [intercostal, musculus intercostalis]</p><p><b>nekoliko vena koje ispuštaju međukostalne prostore prsnog kaveza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> several veins draining the intercostal spaces of the rib cage [vena intercostalis]</p><p><b>izmjene, održavanje veze, općenje, spolni odnos, trgovanje, uzajamno</b></p><p><i>n.</i> communication between individuals [social intercourse]</p><p><i>n.</i> sexual activity between individuals, especially the insertion of a man's penis into a woman's vagina until orgasm and ejaculation occur [carnal knowledge, coition, coitus, copulation, relation, sex act, sexual congress, sexual intercourse, sexual relation]</p><p><b>proizvod koji je proizvedena ukrštanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> produced by crossbreeding [hybrid]</p><p><b>događaju se između ili među ili zajednički različitim crkvama ili denominacijama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring between or among or common to different churches or denominations [interchurch]</p><p><b>između ili između odjela, između odjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> between or among departments</p><p><i>adv.</i> between departments</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "službenici" su osoblje koja je odgovorna za obavljanje dužnosti u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> provision of logistic (or administrative) support by one or more of the military services to one or more departments or agencies of the United States government [interagency support]</p><p><b>biti povezani (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be connected [hang together]</p><p><b>međuzavisnost, uzajamna ovisnost, međuovisnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a reciprocal relation between interdependent entities (objects or individuals or groups) [interdependency, mutuality]</p><p><b>interdependencija, međuzavisnost, međuzavisnosti, međuovisnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a reciprocal relation between interdependent entities (objects or individuals or groups) [interdependence, mutuality]</p><p><b>međuovisan, međusobno zavisan, međuzavisan, međuzavisni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> mutually dependent [mutualist, mutually beneficial]</p><p><b>interdikt, zabrana, zabraniti, braniti, priječiti, prohibirati, proskribirati, zabranjivati, zapriječiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ecclesiastical censure by the Roman Catholic Church withdrawing certain sacraments and Christian burial from a person or all persons in a particular district</p><p><i>n.</i> a court order prohibiting a party from doing a certain activity [interdiction]</p><p><i>v.</i> destroy by firepower, such as an enemy's line of communication</p><p><i>v.</i> command against [disallow, forbid, nix, prohibit, proscribe, veto]</p><p><b>interdikcija, zabrana</b></p><p><i>n.</i> authoritative prohibition</p><p><i>n.</i> a court order prohibiting a party from doing a certain activity [interdict]</p><p><b>Vatrena paljba usmjerena na područje kako bi se spriječilo neprijateljsko korištenje tog područja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fire directed to an area to prevent the enemy from using that area</p><p><b>interdisciplinarna, interdisciplinarni, interdisciplinarnost</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> drawing from or characterized by participation of two or more fields of study</p><p><b>interes, interesantan, interesiranje, interesirati, kamata, korist, pažnja, probitak, zainteresirati, zanimanje, zanimati, zanimljivost, interesa, interesnih, interesu, kamate, kamatna, ukamaćuje, interesantnost, interesna grupa, interesna skupina, hobi, razbibriga, razonoda, zabava, baviti se, biti okupiran, brinuti se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sense of concern with and curiosity about someone or something [involvement]</p><p><i>n.</i> a reason for wanting something done [sake]</p><p><i>n.</i> the power of attracting or holding one's attention (because it is unusual or exciting etc.) [interestingness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a fixed charge for borrowing money</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) a right or legal share of something [stake]</p><p><i>n.</i> (usually plural) a social group whose members control some field of activity and who have common aims [interest group]</p><p><i>n.</i> a diversion that occupies one's time and thoughts (usually pleasantly) [pastime, pursuit]</p><p><i>v.</i> excite the curiosity of</p><p><i>v.</i> be on the mind of [concern, occupy, worry]</p><p><i>v.</i> be of importance or consequence [matter to]</p><p><b>kamatne stope za kredite (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> interest paid on loans</p><p><b>interesna grupa, interesna skupina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (usually plural) a social group whose members control some field of activity and who have common aims [interest]</p><p><b>kamata, kamatna stopa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the percentage of a sum of money charged for its use [rate of interest]</p><p><b>Financijske obveze na koje se plaćaju kamate (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of financial obligations on which interest is paid</p><p><b>zainteresiran, zainteresirane, zainteresiranih, zainteresirano, zanimalo</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or showing interest</p><p><i>adj.</i> involved in or affected by or having a claim to or share in [concerned]</p><p><b>zainteresiran, zainteresirane, zainteresiranih, zainteresirano, zanimalo (od &quot;interested&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being interested</p><p><b>interesantan, interesantne, interesantno, komplicirano, zanimljiv, zanimljivih, zanimljivo, zanimljivom</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> arousing or holding the attention</p><p><b>interesantan, interesantne, interesantno, komplicirano, zanimljiv, zanimljivih, zanimljivo, zanimljivom (od &quot;interesting&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an interesting manner</p><p><b>interesantnost, zanimljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the power of attracting or holding one's attention (because it is unusual or exciting etc.) [interest]</p><p><b>granica, međusklop, povezivanje, sprežni sklop, sučelje, vezni sklop, interfejs, korisničko sučelje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) a surface forming a common boundary between two things (two objects or liquids or chemical phases)</p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a program that controls a display for the user (usually on a computer monitor) and that allows the user to interact with the system [user interface]</p><p><i>n.</i> the overlap where two theories or phenomena affect each other or have links with each other</p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) computer circuit consisting of the hardware and associated circuitry that links one device with another (especially a computer and a hard disk drive or other peripherals) [port]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na ili nalazi na interfejsu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or situated at an interface</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> surface tension at the surface separating two non-miscible liquids [interfacial tension]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> surface tension at the surface separating two non-miscible liquids [interfacial surface tension]</p><p><b>koji uključuju osobe različitih vjerskih vjera (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> involving persons of different religious faiths</p><p><b>dolaziti u sukob, interferirati, intervenirati, ometati, pačati se, posredovati, remetiti, smetati, sukobljavati, umiješati se, upletati se, uplitati se, uplitati se u nešto</b></p><p><i>v.</i> come between so as to be hindrance or obstacle</p><p><i>v.</i> get involved, so as to alter or hinder an action, or through force or threat of force [interpose, intervene, step in]</p><p><b>interferencija, interferencije, interferiranje, međudjelovanje, međusobni utjecaj, miješanja, miješanju, ometanje, smetnja, upletanje, uplitanje, uzajamni utjecaj, intervencija, intervencionizam, smetanje, buka, disonanca, disonancija, kakofonija, nesuglasje, opterećenje, prepreka, zapreka, zastoj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a policy of intervening in the affairs of other countries [intervention]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of hindering or obstructing or impeding [hinderance, hindrance]</p><p><i>n.</i> electrical or acoustic activity that can disturb communication [disturbance, noise]</p><p><i>n.</i> (American football) blocking a player's path with your body</p><p><i>n.</i> any obstruction that impedes or is burdensome [encumbrance, hinderance, hindrance, hitch, incumbrance, preventative, preventive]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the light or dark bands produced by the interference and diffraction of light [fringe]</p><p><b>koji se upleće, nametljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> intrusive in a meddling or offensive manner [busy, busybodied, meddlesome, meddling, officious]</p><p><b>interferometar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any measuring instrument that uses interference patterns to make accurate measurements of waves</p><p><b>interferon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antiviral protein produced by cells that have been invaded by a virus</p><p><b>između ili među galaksijama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> between or among galaxies</p><p><b>prostor između galaksija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the space between galaxies</p><p><b>međuvremeni, međuvrijeme, prethodan, prethodni, privremen, privremeni, u međuvremenu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time between one event, process, or period and another [lag, meantime, meanwhile]</p><p><i>adj.</i> serving during an intermediate interval of time</p><p><b>Svaka od ovih vrsta mora biti u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an overhaul between the regular times for overhauling</p><p><b>interijer, interijera, interijerno, interiorni, nutrina, unutarnjeg, unutarnji, unutarnjost, unutrašnje, unutrašnji, unutrašnjost, utroba, interni, nacionalan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the region that is inside of something [inside]</p><p><i>n.</i> the inner or enclosed surface of something [inside]</p><p><i>n.</i> the United States federal department charged with conservation and the development of natural resources [Department of the Interior, DoI, Interior Department]</p><p><i>adj.</i> situated within or suitable for inside a building</p><p><i>adj.</i> inside the country [home, internal, national]</p><p><i>adj.</i> located inward [inner, internal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> inside and toward a center</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or coming from the middle of a region or country [midland, upcountry]</p><p><b>kut unutar dvije susjedne strane višekrugla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the angle inside two adjacent sides of a polygon [internal angle]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "službenici" su osoblje ili subjekti koji se bave upravljanjem ili upravljanjem poslovnim prostorom ili poslovnim prostorom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trade or act of decorating the interior of a building or room, especially with regard to color combination, paint, fabrics, carpeting, etc. [interior decoration]</p><p><b>Dekoracija koja se sastoji od rasporeda i namještaja stanova u kojima se može živjeti, S druge strane, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "službenici" su osoblje ili subjekti koji se bave upravljanjem ili 