uired by custom or law [exogamy]</p><p><i>n.</i> marriage within one's own tribe or group as required by custom or law [endogamy, inmarriage]</p><p><b>udati se unutar iste etničke, društvene ili obiteljske skupine (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> marry within the same ethnic, social, or family group</p><p><b>Šav između dvije čeljusti gornje vilice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the suture between the two maxillae of the upper jawbone [sutura intermaxillaris]</p><p><b>posredni, posrednik, medijator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a negotiator who acts as a link between parties [go-between, intercessor, intermediator, mediator]</p><p><b>intermedijar, posredni, posrednik, posredovati, prijelazni, srednje, srednji, u sredini</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a substance formed during a chemical process before the desired product is obtained</p><p><i>v.</i> act between parties with a view to reconciling differences [arbitrate, intercede, liaise, mediate]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lying between two extremes in time or space or state</p><p><i>adj.</i> around the middle of a scale of evaluation [average, medium]</p><p><b>domaćin koji parazit koristi tijekom svog životnog ciklusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a host that is used by a parasite in the course of its life cycle</p><p><b>Temporalna arterija koja ide do srednjeg dijela moždane kore temporalnog režnja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> temporal artery that goes to the middle part of the cerebral cortex of the temporal lobe [arteria temporalis intermedia]</p><p><b>Bozon koji posreduje slabim interakcijama između čestica. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gauge boson that mediates weak interactions between particles</p><p><b>Azijska trava koja se u Sjedinjene Države ulaga u pašnjake i krmne površine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Asiatic grass introduced into United States rangelands for pasture and fodder [Agropyron intermedium, Elymus hispidus]</p><p><b>intermedijar, posredni, posrednik, posredovati, prijelazni, srednje, srednji, u sredini (od &quot;intermediate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i