><i>adj.</i> stopping and starting at irregular intervals</p><p><b>gužva zbog bolova u mišićima nogu jer je krv u tijelu neadekvatna (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lameness due to pain in leg muscles because the blood supply is inadequate</p><p><b>klinički neurološki sindrom karakteriziran mišićnim grčevima i grčevima te (kada je teški) napadima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clinical neurological syndrome characterized by muscular twitching and cramps and (when severe) seizures [apyretic tetanus, intermittent tetanus, tetanilla, tetany]</p><p><b>klinički neurološki sindrom karakteriziran mišićnim grčevima i grčevima te (kada je teški) napadima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clinical neurological syndrome characterized by muscular twitching and cramps and (when severe) seizures [apyretic tetanus, intermittent cramp, tetanilla, tetany]</p><p><b>koji se povremeno prekida ili izostaje, u razmacima</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an intermittent manner</p><p><b>izmiješati, izmiješati se, pomijješati se, smiješati, miješati, pomiješati, stapati, stopiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> combine into one [blend, immingle, intermingle]</p><p><b>smjesa, mješavina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any foodstuff made by combining different ingredients [concoction, mixture]</p><p><i>n.</i> an additional ingredient that is added by mixing with the base [admixture]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of mixing together [admixture, commixture, mix, mixing, mixture]</p><p><b>postojeći ili djelovanje između molekula (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> existing or acting between molecules</p><p><b>između dvije ili više institucija itd. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> between two or more institutions etc</p><p><b>internirati, staviti pod na</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an advanced student or graduate in medicine gaining supervised practical experience (`houseman' is a British term) [houseman, interne, medical intern]</p><p><i>v.</i> deprive of freedom</p><p><i>v.</i> work as an intern</p><p><b>domaći, interne, interni, internoj, iznutra, unutarnji, unutarnjoj, unutrašnj