orm of an idea or image [mental representation, representation]</p><p><b>metabolički procesi kojima određeni organizmi dobivaju energiju iz organskih molekula (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the metabolic processes whereby certain organisms obtain energy from organic molecules [cellular respiration, respiration]</p><p><b>državni prihodi iz domaćih izvora (isključujući carine) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> government revenue from domestic sources (excluding customs)</p><p><b>poreznik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who collects taxes for the government [collector of internal revenue, exciseman, tax collector, taxman]</p><p><b>Ured Ministarstva financija odgovoran za naplate poreza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the bureau of the Treasury Department responsible for tax collections [IRS]</p><p><b>Rijmu između riječi u istom redu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rhyme between words in the same line</p><p><b>hormon, hormoni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the secretion of an endocrine gland that is transmitted by the blood to the tissue on which it has a specific effect [endocrine, hormone]</p><p><b>grana aorte koja opskrbljuje testise (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the aorta supplying the testicles [arteria testicularis, testicular artery]</p><p><b>motor s unutarnjim izgaranjem</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a heat engine in which combustion occurs inside the engine rather than in a separate furnace [ICE]</p><p><b>Učenje (vrednosti ili stavovi itd.) koje je uključeno u sebe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> learning (of values or attitudes etc.) that is incorporated within yourself [incorporation, internalization]</p><p><b>Uključiti u sebe (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> incorporate within oneself [interiorise, interiorize, internalize]</p><p><b>zabrinutost za ono što se tiče ljudske unutarnje prirode (posebno etičke ili ideološke vrijednosti) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> preoccupation with what concerns human inner nature (especially ethical or ideological values) [inwardness]</p><p><b>samopouzdanje, samosvijest, samouvjerenje</b><