eflect on one's own thoughts and feelings</p><p><b>introspekcija, samoispitivanje, samokritika, samoopažanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the contemplation of your own thoughts and desires and conduct [self-contemplation, self-examination]</p><p><b>introspektivan, koji je sklon samopromatranju, koji se temelji na samopromatranju</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> given to examining own sensory and perceptual experiences [introverted, self-examining]</p><p><b>introspektivan, koji je sklon samopromatranju, koji se temelji na samopromatranju (od &quot;introspective&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thoughtfulness about your own situation and feelings</p><p><b>Nemoguće je pronaći. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> impossible to find</p><p><b>introverzija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being folded inward or sheathed [invagination]</p><p><i>n.</i> the folding in of an outer layer so as to form a pocket in the surface [infolding, intussusception, invagination]</p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) an introverted disposition</p><p><b>usmjerena prema unutra (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> directed inward [introvertive]</p><p><b>introvert, okrenuti unutra</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) a person who tends to shrink from social contacts and to become preoccupied with their own thoughts</p><p><i>v.</i> fold inwards [invaginate]</p><p><i>v.</i> turn inside</p><p><b>introvertan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> given to examining own sensory and perceptual experiences [introspective, self-examining]</p><p><b>Malo sam se povučio. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> somewhat introverted [shut-in]</p><p><b>usmjerena prema unutra (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> directed inward [introversive]</p><p><b>nametati se, provaliti, ugurati, uljez, upasti, uznemiriti, ugurati se, čeprkati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> enter uninvited [irrupt]</p><p><i>v.</i> enter unlawfully on someone's property [trespass]</p><p><i>v.</i> search or inquire in a meddlesome way [horn in, nose, poke, pry]</p><p><i>v.</i> thrust oneself in as if by force [obtrude]</p><p><b>nadirati, napas