eously to provide immunity to poliomyelitis [Salk vaccine]</p><p><b>Mjerenje inteligencije osobe kako je navedeno na testu inteligencije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measure of a person's intelligence as indicated by an intelligence test [I.Q., intelligence quotient]</p><p><b>psihometrijski test inteligencije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a psychometric test of intelligence [intelligence test]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena od 1,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5%, Odbor britanske vlade koji upravlja i prikuplja velike izravne poreze. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a heavy brittle metallic element of the platinum group [atomic number 77, iridium]</p><p><i>n.</i> a board of the British government that administers and collects major direct taxes [Inland Revenue]</p><p><b>IRA</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a militant organization of Irish nationalists who used terrorism and guerilla warfare in an effort to drive British forces from Northern Ireland and achieve a united independent Ireland [Irish Republican Army, Provisional IRA, Provisional Irish Republican Army, Provos]</p><p><i>n.</i> a retirement plan that allows you to contribute a limited yearly sum toward your retirement [individual retirement account]</p><p><i>n.</i> belligerence aroused by a real or supposed wrong (personified as one of the deadly sins) [anger, ire, wrath]</p><p><b>Američki tekstopisac koji je često surađivao s bratom Georgeom Gershwinom (1896-1983) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States lyricist who frequently collaborated with his brother George Gershwin (1896-1983) [Gershwin]</p><p><b>Republika na Bliskom istoku u zapadnoj Aziji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in the Middle East in western Asia [Al-Iraq, Iraq, Republic of Iraq]</p><p><b>irački</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or inhabitant of Iraq [Iraqi]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Iraq or its people or culture [Iraqi]</p><p><b>Iran</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a theocratic Islamic republic in the Middle East in western Asia [Islamic Republic of Iran, Persia]</p><p><b>Spor oko kontrole vodnog puta između Iraka i Irana izbio je u otvorene borbe 1980. i trajao do 1988. godine, kada su prihvatili rezoluciju UN-a o prekidu vatre. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dispute over control of the waterway between Iraq and Iran broke out into open fighting in 1980 and continued until 1988, when they accepted a UN cease-fire resolution [Gulf War]</p><p><b>iz Irana ili u Iranu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or inhabitant of Iran [Iranian, Persian]</p><p><b>iranski, iranski jezik, perzijski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or inhabitant of Iran [Irani, Persian]</p><p><i>n.</i> the modern Persian language spoken in Iran [Iranian language]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Iran or its people or language or culture [Persian]</p><p><b>glavni grad i najveći grad Irana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital and largest city of Iran [Teheran, Tehran, capital of Iran]</p><p><b>100 dinara jednako je 1 rialu u Iranu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> 100 dinars equal 1 rial in Iran [dinar]</p><p><b>Moderni perzijski jezik koji se govori u Iranu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the modern Persian language spoken in Iran [Iranian]</p><p><b>monetarna jedinica u Iranu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> monetary unit in Iran</p><p><b>iranski rijal</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Iran [rial]</p><p><b>Irak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in the Middle East in western Asia [Al-Iraq, Irak, Republic of Iraq]</p><p><b>Irak, irački, stanovnik Iraka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or inhabitant of Iraq [Iraki]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Iraq or its people or culture [Iraki]</p><p><b>Osnovna jedinica novca u Iraku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Iraq [dinar]</p><p><b>Najpoznatiji i možda najvažniji dio iračkog sigurnosnog sustava. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the most notorious and possibly the most important arm of Iraq's security system [IIS, Iraqi Mukhabarat]</p><p><b>dio Kurdistana koji se nalazi u sjeverozapadnom Iraku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the 