adiotherapy]</p><p><b>bezuman, iracionalan, nelogičan, nerazborit, nerazuman, iracionalni broj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a real number that cannot be expressed as a rational number [irrational number]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not consistent with or using reason</p><p><i>adj.</i> real but not expressible as the quotient of two integers</p><p><b>ekstremne predrasude (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extreme prejudice</p><p><b>snažna spontana i iracionalna motivacija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strong spontaneous and irrational motivation</p><p><b>motivacija koja nije u skladu s razumom ili logikom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a motivation that is inconsistent with reason or logic</p><p><b>iracionalni broj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a real number that cannot be expressed as a rational number [irrational]</p><p><b>bezumlje, iracionalizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being irrational [unreason]</p><p><b>bezuman, iracionalan, nelogičan, nerazborit, nerazuman (od &quot;irrational&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an irrational manner</p><p><b>glavna rijeka Mjanmara koja izlazi na sjeveru i teče na jug kroz dužinu Burme do Andamanskog mora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the main river of Myanmar rising in the north and flowing south through the length of Burma to empty into the Andaman Sea [Irrawaddy River]</p><p><b>glavna rijeka Mjanmara koja izlazi na sjeveru i teče na jug kroz dužinu Burme do Andamanskog mora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the main river of Myanmar rising in the north and flowing south through the length of Burma to empty into the Andaman Sea [Irrawaddy]</p><p><b>stanje nesubstancijalnosti ili mašte (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being insubstantial or imaginary [unreality]</p><p><b>nepopravljiv, nepovratan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> insusceptible of reform [irredeemable, unredeemable, unreformable]</p><p><b>nepomirljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> impossible to reconcile [unreconcilable]</p><p><b>nenadoknadiv, nenaplativ, nepovratan, nenaplativa</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> incapable of being recovered or regained [unrecoverable]</p><p><b>beznadan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> insusceptible of reform [irreclaimable, unredeemable, unreformable]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of paper money) not convertible into coin at the pleasure of the holder</p><p><b>regija koja je etnički ili povijesno povezana s jednom zemljom, ali je politički kontrolirana od strane druge zemlje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a region that is related ethnically or historically to one country but is controlled politically by another [irridenta]</p><p><b>iredentizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the doctrine that irredenta should be controlled by the country to which they are ethnically or historically related [irridentism]</p><p><b>zagovornik iredentizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an advocate of irredentism [irridentist]</p><p><b>ireducibilan, neumoljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> incapable of being made smaller or simpler</p><p><b>neoboriv, nepobitan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> impossible to deny or disprove [incontrovertible, positive]</p><p><b>bez obzira na to. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> regardless</p><p><b>nepravilan, nepropisan, neredovan, neredovit, nepravilno, nepravilnog, gerilac, iregularan, nezakonit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of an irregular armed force that fights a stronger force by sabotage and harassment [guerilla, guerrilla, insurgent]</p><p><i>n.</i> merchandise that has imperfections [second]</p><p><i>adj.</i> contrary to rule or accepted order or general practice</p><p><i>adj.</i> not occurring at a regular rate or fixed intervals [unpredictable]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of the military) not belonging to or engaged in by regular army forces</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of solids) not having clear dimensions that can be measured</p><p><i>adj.</i> failing to meet a standard of manufacture due to an imperfection</p><p><i>adj.</i> deviating from normal expectations [atypical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking continuity or regularity [temporary]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a surface or shape)</p><p><i>adj.</i> independent in behavior or thought [maverick, unorthodox]</p><p><b>neispravnost, nepravilnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> behavior that breaches the rule or etiquette or custom or morality [abnormality]</p><p><i>n.</i> not characterized by a fixed principle or rate [unregularity]</p><p><i>n.</i> an irregular asymmetry in shape [geometrical irregularity]</p><p><i>n.</i> irregular and infrequent or difficult evacuation of the bowels [constipation]</p><p><b>nepravilan, nepropisan, neredovan, neredovit, nepravilno, nepravilnog (od &quot;irregular&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> at an uneven rate</p><p><i>adv.</i> having an irregular form</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an irregular manner [on an irregular basis]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an irregular manner</p><p><b>bespredmetnost, bezveznost, irelevantnost, nebitnost, nevažnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the lack of a relation of something to the matter at hand [irrelevancy]</p><p><b>irelevantnost, nebitnost, nevažnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the lack of a relation of something to the matter at hand [irrelevance]</p><p><b>bespredmetan, beznačajan, bezvezan, irelevantan, nevažan, sporedan, beznačajno</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having no bearing on or connection with the subject at issue</p><p><b>bespredmetno, bezvezno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an irrelevant manner</p><p><b>bezbožnost, bezvjerje, nereligioznost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of not being devout [irreligiousness]</p><p><b>netko tko je ravnodušan ili neprijateljski prema religiji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is indifferent or hostile to religion</p><p><b>bezvjeran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> hostile or indifferent to religion</p><p><b>nereligioznost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of not being devout [irreligion]</p><p><b>nepopravljiv, nepopravljivo</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> impossible to remedy or correct or redress</p><p><b>neukloniv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> incapable of being removed or away or dismiss</p><p><b>nenadoknadiv, nenaknadiv, nepopravljiv, nenaknadivo</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> impossible to repair, rectify, or amend</p><p><b>na nepopravljiv način ili u nepopravljivom stupnju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an irreparable manner or to an irreparable degree</p><p><b>nenadoknadiv, nezamjenljiv, nezamjenjiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> impossible to replace [unreplaceable]</p><p><b>nenadoknadiv, nezamjenljiv, nezamjenjiv (od &quot;irreplaceable&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being irreplaceable</p><p><b>Neprelazna živost i dobar duh. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> irrepressible liveliness and good spirit [buoyancy]</p><p><b>neukrotiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> impossible to repress or control [uncontrollable]</p><p><b>besprijekoran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> free of guilt [blameless, inculpable, unimpeachable]</p><p><b>da budeš bezgrešan i bez blage. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an irreproachable and blameless manner [blamelessly]</p><p><b>kvaliteta neponovljivanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being unreproducible</p><p><b>Ne mogu se reprodukirati ili duplicirati (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> impossible to reproduce or duplicate [unreproducible]</p><p><b>kvaliteta biti preplavljujući i nemoguće oduprijeti se (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being overpowering and impossible to resist [irresistibleness]</p><p><b>neodoljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> impossible to resist [resistless]</p><p><i>adj.</i> overpoweringly attractive</p><p><b>želja za nečim što bi bilo bolje ne učiniti ili ne reći (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an urge to do or say something that might be better left undone or unsaid [compulsion]</p><p><b>neodoljiv (od &quot;irresistible&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being overpowering and impossible to resist [irresistibility]</p><p><b>Ne mogu se oduprijeti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> incapable of being resisted [overpoweringly, overwhelmingly]</p><p><b>neodlučan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> uncertain how to act or proceed</p><p><b>neodlučan (od &quot;irresolute&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> lacking determination or decisiveness</p><p><b>neodlučan (od &quot;irresolute&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the