ited States Supreme Court (1745-1829) [John Jay]</p><p><i>n.</i> crested largely blue bird</p><p><b>Američki financijer koji je prodavao obveznice Unije za financiranje američkog građanskog rata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States financier who marketed Union bonds to finance the American Civil War [Cooke]</p><p><b>Američki financijer koji je stekao kontrolu nad Erie Canalom i koji je izazvao financijsku paniku 1869. godine kada je pokušao da ugura tržište zlata (1836-1892) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States financier who gained control of the Erie Canal and who caused a financial panic in 1869 when he attempted to corner the gold market (1836-1892) [Gould]</p><p><b>Česta šarša iz istočne Sjeverne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common jay of eastern North America [Cyanocitta cristata, blue jay]</p><p><b>Islamska teroristička grupa u Azerbejdžanu koja je pokušala bombardirati američku ambasadu 1999. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an indigenous Islamic terrorist group in Azerbaijan that attempted to bomb the United States embassy in 1999</p><p><b>Preći cestu na crvenom svjetlu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cross the road at a red light</p><p><b>Nezazračni pješakac koji ilegalno prelazi ulicu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a reckless pedestrian who crosses a street illegally</p><p><b>disonantan, džez, jazz, jebati, jebati se, karati se, općiti, poševiti, seksati se, spavati, voditi ljubav, ševiti, ševiti se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> empty rhetoric or insincere or exaggerated talk [idle words, malarkey, malarky, nothingness, wind]</p><p><i>n.</i> a genre of popular music that originated in New Orleans around 1900 and developed through increasingly complex styles</p><p><i>n.</i> a style of dance music popular in the 1920s</p><p><i>v.</i> play something in the style of jazz</p><p><i>v.</i> have sexual intercourse with [bang, be intimate, bed, bonk, do it, eff, fuck, get it on, get laid, have a go at it, have intercourse, have it away, have it off, have sex, hump, know, lie with, love