1899-1986) [Borges, Jorge Luis Borges]</p><p><b>Argentinski pisac poznat po kratkim pričama (1899-1986) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Argentinian writer remembered for his short stories (1899-1986) [Borges, Jorge Borges]</p><p><b>Perujanski pisac (rođen 1936) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Peruvian writer (born in 1936) [Mario Vargas Llosa, Vargas Llosa]</p><p><b>Čehoslovački kemičar koji je razvio polarografiju (1890-1967) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Czechoslovakian chemist who developed polarography (1890-1967) [Heyrovsky]</p><p><b>veliki zdjelicu za piće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large drinking bowl</p><p><b>Meksički slikar poznat po svojim monumentalnim muralima (1883-1949) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Mexican painter noted for his monumental murals (1883-1949) [Jose Orozco, Orozco]</p><p><b>Kubanski pjesnik i revolucionar koji se borio za kubansku neovisnost od Španjolske (1853-1895) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Cuban poet and revolutionary who fought for Cuban independence from Spain (1853-1895) [Marti]</p><p><b>Meksički slikar poznat po svojim monumentalnim muralima (1883-1949) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Mexican painter noted for his monumental murals (1883-1949) [Jose Clemente Orozco, Orozco]</p><p><b>Španjolski filozof koji je zagovarao vođstvo intelektualne elite (1883-1955) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Spanish philosopher who advocated leadership by an intellectual elite (1883-1955) [Ortega y Gasset]</p><p><b>Američki slikar rođen u Njemačkoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States painter born in Germany [Albers]</p><p><b>Austrijski arhitekt poznat po upotrebi pravolinijskih jedinica (1870-1956) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian architect known for his use of rectilinear units (1870-1956) [Hoffmann]</p><p><b>Francuski izumitelj koji je (s bratom Jacquesom Etienneom Montgolfierom) bio pionir u balonu na vrući zrak (1740-1810) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French inventor who (with his brother Jacques Etienne Montgolfier) pioneered hot-air ballooning (1740-1810) [Montgolfier]</p><p><b>Josef von Sternberg</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States film maker (born in Austria) whose films made Marlene Dietrich an international star (1894-1969) [von Sternberg]</p><p><b>vođa Nez Percea u njihovom povlačenju od američkih trupa (1840-1904), (Stari zavjet) 11. sin Jakov i jedan od 12 patrijarha Izraela, (Novi zavjet) muž Marije i (u kršćanskom vjerovanju) usvojitelj Isusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> leader of the Nez Perce in their retreat from United States troops (1840-1904) [Chief Joseph]</p><p><i>n.</i> (Old Testament) the 11th son of Jacob and one of the 12 patriarchs of Israel</p><p><i>n.</i> (New Testament) husband of Mary and (in Christian belief) the foster father of Jesus</p><p><b>Joseph Alois Schumpeter</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States economist (born in Czechoslovakia) (1883-1950) [Joseph Schumpeter, Schumpeter]</p><p><b>Američki parapsiholog (1895-1980) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States parapsychologist (1895-1980) [J. B. Rhine, Rhine]</p><p><b>Židovski general koji je vodio pobunu Židova protiv Rimljana i zatim napisao povijest tih događaja (37-100) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Jewish general who led the revolt of the Jews against the Romans and then wrote a history of those events (37-100) [Flavius Josephus, Josephus]</p><p><b>Britanski kemičar koji je otkrio ugljični dioksid i koji je formulirao pojmove specifične i latentne toplote (1728-1799) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> British chemist who identified carbon dioxide and who formulated the concepts of specific heat and latent heat (1728-1799) [Black]</p><p><b>Američki mitolog (1904-1987) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States mythologist (1904-1987) [Campbell]</p><p><b>Engleski romanopisac (rođen u Poljskoj) poznat po morskim pričama i svojoj narativnoj tehnici (1857-1924) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English novelist (born in Poland) noted for sea stories and for his narrative technique (1857-1924) [Conrad, Teodor Josef Konrad Korzeniowski]</p><p><b>Američki skladatelj i glazbeni kritičar (1885-1966) (MT)<