 [Belloc, Hilaire Belloc]</p><p><b>General u vojsci Unije koji je poražen u bitci kod Chancellorsvillea od strane Roberta E. Leeja (1814-1879) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States general in the Union Army who was defeated at Chancellorsville by Robert E. Lee (1814-1879) [Fighting Joe Hooker, Hooker]</p><p><b>Joseph Jacques Césaire Joffre</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French field marshal who commanded the Allied armies in France during World War II (1852-1931) [Joffre]</p><p><b>Mađarski violinist i skladatelj (1831-1907) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Hungarian violinist and composer (1831-1907) [Joachim]</p><p><b>Engleski fizičar koji je eksperimentirao s provodom električne energije kroz plinove i koji je otkrio elektron i utvrdio njegov naboj i masu (1856-1940) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English physicist who experimented with the conduction of electricity through gases and who discovered the electron and determined its charge and mass (1856-1940) [Sir Joseph John Thomson, Thomson]</p><p><b>Američki novinar čije je otkrivanje 1906. godine započelo eru muckraking novinarstva (1866-1936) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States journalist whose exposes in 1906 started an era of muckraking journalism (1866-1936) [Lincoln Steffens, Steffens]</p><p><b>Engleski kirurg koji je prvi koristio antiseptike (1827-1912) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English surgeon who was the first to use antiseptics (1827-1912) [Baron Lister, Lister]</p><p><b>Američki boksač koji je bio svjetski prvak u teškoj kategoriji 12 godina (1914-1981) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States prizefighter who was world heavyweight champion for 12 years (1914-1981) [Joe Louis, Louis]</p><p><b>Francuski kemičar i fizičar koji je prvi izolirao bor i koji je formulirao zakon koji opisuje ponašanje plinova pod stalnim pritiskom (1778-1850) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French chemist and physicist who first isolated boron and who formulated the law describing the behavior of gases under constant pressure (1778-1850) [Gay-Lussac]</p><