ver be proved to be true, but are tested by attempts to falsify them (1902-1994) [Popper, Sir Karl Raimund Popper]</p><p><b>Njemački feldmaršal u Drugom svjetskom ratu koji je vodio osvajanje Poljske i vodio protunapad u Ardenima (1875-1953) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German field marshal in World War II who directed the conquest of Poland and led the Ardennes counteroffensive (1875-1953) [Rundstedt, von Rundstedt]</p><p><b>Švedski kemičar (rođen u Njemačkoj) koji je otkrio kisik prije Priestleya (1742.-1786.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Swedish chemist (born in Germany) who discovered oxygen before Priestley did (1742-1786) [Karl Wilhelm Scheele, Scheele]</p><p><b>Njemački psihijatar (1883-1969) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German psychiatrist (1883-1969) [Jaspers, Karl Jaspers]</p><p><b>Pruski general i vojni teoretičar koji je predložio doktrinu totalnog rata i rata kao proširenje diplomacije (1780-1831) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Prussian general and military theorist who proposed a doctrine of total war and war as an extension of diplomacy (1780-1831) [Clausewitz]</p><p><b>Karl von Frisch</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian zoologist noted for his studies of honeybees (1886-1982) [Frisch]</p><p><b>Njemački kemičar nagrađen za istraživanje polimera (1898-1973) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German chemist honored for his research on polymers (1898-1973) [Ziegler]</p><p><b>Njemački neurolog poznat po studijama afazije (1848-1905) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German neurologist best known for his studies of aphasia (1848-1905) [Wernicke]</p><p><b>Švedski kemičar (rođen u Njemačkoj) koji je otkrio kisik prije Priestleya (1742.-1786.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Swedish chemist (born in Germany) who discovered oxygen before Priestley did (1742-1786) [Karl Scheele, Scheele]</p><p><b>inženjer koji je bio brat Ernsta Wernera von Siemensa i koji se preselio u Englesku (1823-1883) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> engineer who was a brother of Ernst Werner von Siemens and who moved to England (1823-1883) [Siem