ama za glavu, rubac, marama</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a square scarf that is folded into a triangle and worn over the head or about the neck</p><p><b>Ruski revolucionarac koji je bio šef države nakon što je Nikolaj II. abdicirao, ali ga su srušili boljševici (1881-1970) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian revolutionary who was head of state after Nicholas II abdicated but was overthrown by the Bolsheviks (1881-1970) [Aleksandr Feodorovich Kerensky]</p><p><b>bura, graja, izgred, remećenje, urnebes</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disorderly outburst or tumult [commotion, disruption, disturbance, flutter, hoo-ha, hoo-hah, hurly burly, to-do]</p><p><b>infekcija dlakave koži i brade koja obično rezultira oticanjem koje je prekriveno pustuljama i izlijeva tekućinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ringworm infection of the hair follicles of the scalp and beard that usually results in a swelling that is covered with pustules and oozes fluid</p><p><b>lako oboružan pješak, seoski klipan, skitnica, vucibatina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States composer of musical comedies (1885-1945) [Jerome David Kern, Jerome Kern]</p><p><i>n.</i> the part of a metal type that projects beyond its body</p><p><i>v.</i> furnish with a kern</p><p><i>v.</i> remove a portion of space between (adjacent letters)</p><p><b>bit, jezgra, koščica, zrno, centar, esencija, središte, srž, suština</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the inner and usually edible part of a seed or grain or nut or fruit stone [meat]</p><p><i>n.</i> a single whole grain of a cereal</p><p><i>n.</i> the choicest or most essential or most vital part of some idea or experience [center, centre, core, essence, gist, heart, heart and soul, inwardness, marrow, meat, nitty-gritty, nub, pith, substance, sum]</p><p><b>neuobičajeno nakupljanje žučnog pigmenta u mozgu i drugom živčanom tkivu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal accumulation of bile pigment in the brain and other nerve tissue</p><p><b>simptom meningitisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> symptom of meningitis</p><p><b>s masenim 