tic acidosis]</p><p><b>teška dijabetes mellitus s ranim početkom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> severe diabetes mellitus with an early onset [IDDM, autoimmune diabetes, growth-onset diabetes, insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus, juvenile-onset diabetes, juvenile diabetes, ketosis-prone diabetes, type I diabetes]</p><p><b>blagi oblik dijabetesa koji se postepeno razvija kod odraslih osoba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mild form of diabetes mellitus that develops gradually in adults [NIDDM, adult-onset diabetes, adult-onset diabetes mellitus, ketoacidosis-resistant diabetes mellitus, ketosis-resistant diabetes, ketosis-resistant diabetes mellitus, mature-onset diabetes, maturity-onset diabetes, maturity-onset diabetes mellitus, non-insulin-dependent diabetes, non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus, type II diabetes]</p><p><b>blagi oblik dijabetesa koji se postepeno razvija kod odraslih osoba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mild form of diabetes mellitus that develops gradually in adults [NIDDM, adult-onset diabetes, adult-onset diabetes mellitus, ketoacidosis-resistant diabetes, ketosis-resistant diabetes, ketosis-resistant diabetes mellitus, mature-onset diabetes, maturity-onset diabetes, maturity-onset diabetes mellitus, non-insulin-dependent diabetes, non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus, type II diabetes]</p><p><b>ketonurija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> excessive amounts of ketone bodies in the urine as in diabetes mellitus or starvation [acetonuria, ketonuria]</p><p><b>monosaharid s šest ugljikovih atoma i ketonskom grupom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a monosaccharide having six carbon atoms and a ketone group</p><p><b>keton</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of a class of organic compounds having a carbonyl group linked to a carbon atom in each of two hydrocarbon radicals</p><p><b>keton koji je međuprodukt razgradnje masti u tijelu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ketone that is an intermediate product of the breakdown of fats in the body [acetone body]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 g/cm3 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group having the characteristic properties of ketones</p><p><b>ketoza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal increase of ketone bodies in the blood as in diabetes mellitus [acetonemia, ketosis]</p><p><b>ketonurija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> excessive amounts of ketone bodies in the urine as in diabetes mellitus or starvation [acetonuria, ketoaciduria]</p><p><b>Ne-steroidni protuupalni lijek (trgovinski nazivi Orudis ili Orudis KT ili Oruvail) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (trade names Orudis or Orudis KT or Oruvail) [Orudis, Orudis KT, Oruvail]</p><p><b>ne- steroidni protuupalni lijek (trgovinski naziv Torodal) koji se daje samo oralno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory (trade name Torodal) that is given only orally [Torodal]</p><p><b>ne-steroidni protuupalni lijek (trgovinski nazivi Acular i Toradol) koji se daje samo intramuskularno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (trade names Acular and Toradol) that is administered only intramuscularly [Acular, Toradol]</p><p><b>Svakim monosaharidnim šećerima koji sadrže ketonsku grupu ili njezin hemiacetal (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any monosaccharide sugar that contains a ketone group or its hemiacetal</p><p><b>ketoza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal increase of ketone bodies in the blood as in diabetes mellitus [acetonemia, ketonemia]</p><p><b>teška dijabetes mellitus s ranim početkom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> severe diabetes mellitus with an early onset [IDDM, autoimmune diabetes, growth-onset diabetes, insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus, juvenile-onset diabetes, juvenile diabetes, ketoacidosis-prone diabetes, type I diabetes]</p><p><b>blagi oblik dijabetesa koji se postepeno razvija kod odraslih osoba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mild form of diabetes mellitus that develops gradually in adults [NIDDM, adult-onset diabetes, adult-onset diabetes mellitus, ketoacidosis-resistant diabetes, ketoacidosis-resistant diabetes mellitus, ketosis-resist