ituation [fix, hole, jam, mess, muddle, pickle]</p><p><b>timpan, timpani</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large hemispherical brass or copper percussion instrument with a drumhead that can be tuned by adjusting the tension on it [kettle, timpani, tympani, tympanum]</p><p><b>količinu koju će čajnik zadržati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quantity a kettle will hold [kettle]</p><p><b>treći od tri dijela Hebrejskog pisma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the third of three divisions of the Hebrew Scriptures [Hagiographa, Writings]</p><p><b>ledeno jezero u središnjem New Yorku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a glacial lake in central New York [Lake Keuka]</p><p><b>brzo rastuće okruglo-glavlje stablo sa mirisnim bijelim do dubokim ružnim cvjetovima, stablo s čudnim pinatnim lišćama i rascemima mirisnih ružičastih do ljubičastih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fast-growing roundheaded tree with fragrant white to deep rose flowers [Virgilia divaricata]</p><p><i>n.</i> tree with odd-pinnate leaves and racemes of fragrant pink to purple flowers [Virgilia capensis, Virgilia oroboides]</p><p><b>ciljati, dirka, glavni, klin, ključ, ključan, osnovni, rasplet, reket, šifra, tipka, tipkalo, udesiti, ključ za šifriranje, ključ (u kriptografiji), ključne, ključni, ključnih, tonalitet, kila, kilo, kilogram, Samara, tumač, determinirati, identificirati, imenovati, odrediti, određivati, opisati, otkriti, otkrivati, raspoznavati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> metal device shaped in such a way that when it is inserted into the appropriate lock the lock's mechanism can be rotated</p><p><i>n.</i> something crucial for explaining</p><p><i>n.</i> pitch of the voice</p><p><i>n.</i> any of 24 major or minor diatonic scales that provide the tonal framework for a piece of music [tonality]</p><p><i>n.</i> a kilogram of a narcotic drug</p><p><i>n.</i> a winged often one-seed indehiscent fruit as of the ash or elm or maple [key fruit, samara]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States lawyer and poet who wrote a poem after witnessing the British attack on Baltimore during the War of 1812 [Francis Scott Key]</p><p><i>n.</i> a coral reef off the southern coast of Florida [Florida key, cay]</p><p><i>n.</i> (basketball) a space (including the foul line) in front of the basket at each end of a basketball court [paint]</p><p><i>n.</i> a list of answers to a test</p><p><i>n.</i> a list of words or phrases that explain symbols or abbreviations</p><p><i>n.</i> a generic term for any device whose possession entitles the holder to a means of access</p><p><i>n.</i> mechanical device used to wind another device that is driven by a spring (as a clock) [winder]</p><p><i>n.</i> the central building block at the top of an arch or vault [headstone, keystone]</p><p><i>n.</i> a lever (as in a keyboard) that actuates a mechanism when depressed</p><p><i>v.</i> identify as in botany or biology, for example [describe, discover, distinguish, identify, key out, name]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide with a key</p><p><i>v.</i> vandalize a car by scratching the sides with a key</p><p><i>v.</i> regulate the musical pitch of</p><p><i>v.</i> harmonize with or adjust to</p><p><i>adj.</i> serving as an essential component [cardinal, central, fundamental, primal]</p><p><b>Samara</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a winged often one-seed indehiscent fruit as of the ash or elm or maple [key, samara]</p><p><b>mala žuto-zelena lime iz južne Floride (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small yellow-green limes of southern Florida</p><p><b>determinirati, identificirati, imenovati, odrediti, određivati, opisati, otkriti, otkrivati, raspoznavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> identify as in botany or biology, for example [describe, discover, distinguish, identify, key, name]</p><p><b>mala čvrsta palma od južnog Floride i Kube (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small stocky fan palm of southern Florida and Cuba [Thrinax keyensis, Thrinax microcarpa, Thrinax morrisii, silver thatch, silvertop palmetto]</p><p><b>meandar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ornamental pattern consisting of repeated vertical and horizontal l