, Begonia feastii, beefsteak begonia]</p><p><b>bubrežna bolest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disease affecting the kidneys [nephropathy, nephrosis, renal disorder]</p><p><b>bubrežno zatajenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inability of the kidneys to excrete wastes and to help maintain the electrolyte balance [renal failure]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste životinja iz članka 1. stavka 1. točke (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeće: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large fern of New Zealand having kidney-shaped fronds [Trichomanes reniforme]</p><p><b>Kao odresak sa tortom od bubrega, ali bez odreska. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> like steak and kidney pie but without steak</p><p><b>bubrežni kamenac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a calculus formed in the kidney [nephrolith, renal calculus, urinary calculus]</p><p><b>višegodišnje evroazijsko bilje s glavama crvenih ili žutih cvijeća i uobičajeno na livama i pašnjacima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial Eurasian herb having heads of red or yellow flowers and common in meadows and pastures [Anthyllis vulneraria]</p><p><b>široko rasprostranjen zimzelena grm od jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država s glavama cvijeća u listovitom paniclu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> widely spreading evergreen shrub of southwestern United States with flower heads in a leafy panicle [Baccharis pilularis, chaparral broom, coyote brush, coyote bush]</p><p><b>(u obliku lišća ili zrna) nalik bubregu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a leaf or bean shape) resembling the shape of kidney [reniform]</p><p><b>Mekan glatka koža od kože mlade koze (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> soft smooth leather from the hide of a young goat [kid]</p><p><b>Danski filozof koji se zajedno s Nietzscheom smatra osnivačem egzistencijalizma (1813-1855) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Danish philosopher who is generally considered. along with Nietzsche, to be a founder of existentialism (1813-1855) [Soren Aabye Kierkegaard, Soren Kierkegaard]</p><p><b>u obliku svjetle zemlje koja se sastoji o