oney in Papua New Guinea</p><p><b>percepcija položaja tijela i pokreta i mišićnih napetosti itd., sposobnost osjetiti pokrete udova i tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the perception of body position and movement and muscular tensions etc [feeling of movement, kinesthesia]</p><p><i>n.</i> the ability to feel movements of the limbs and body [kinaesthesis, kinesthesia, kinesthesis, kinesthetics, muscle sense, sense of movement]</p><p><b>sposobnost osjetiti pokrete udova i tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ability to feel movements of the limbs and body [kinaesthesia, kinesthesia, kinesthesis, kinesthetics, muscle sense, sense of movement]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s kinestezijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to kinesthesis [kinesthetic]</p><p><b>na kinestetski način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a kinesthetic manner [kinesthetically]</p><p><b>nemogućnost osjetiti kretanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inability to sense movement</p><p><b>kinaze, kinaza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an enzyme that catalyzes the conversion of a proenzyme to an active enzyme</p><p><b>planina Himalaja na granici između Nepala i Tibeta (visina 28.208 stopa) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain the Himalayas on the border between Nepal and Tibet (28,208 feet high) [Kanchanjanga, Kanchenjunga, Mount Kanchenjunga]</p><p><b>dobar, ljubazan, porodica, prijazan, rasa, rod, srdačan, uljudan, vrsta, ljubazni, vrsta (život ), vrste, vrstu, klasa, oblik, razred</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a category of things distinguished by some common characteristic or quality [form, sort, variety]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having or showing a tender and considerate and helpful nature</p><p><i>adj.</i> agreeable, conducive to comfort [genial]</p><p><i>adj.</i> tolerant and forgiving under provocation [tolerant]</p><p><b>malo, na neki način, nekako, otprilike tako, pomalo, prilično</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to some (great or small) extent [kinda, rather, sort of]</p><p><b>dobar, mekog srca, dobrodušan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or proceeding from an innately kind disposition [kindhearted]</p><p><b>suosjećanje koje proizlazi iz dobrog srca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sympathy arising from a kind heart [kindheartedness]</p><p><b>na neki način, otprilike tako, tako nekako, pomalo, prilično</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to some (great or small) extent [kind of, rather, sort of]</p><p><b>dječji vrtić, vrtić, vrtića, zabavište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a preschool for children age 4 to 6 to prepare them for primary school</p><p><b>dječji vrtić, vrtić, vrtića, zabavište (od &quot;kindergarten&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a child who attends a preschool or kindergarten [kindergartner, preschooler]</p><p><b>dijete koje pohađa predškolsku ili vrtić (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a child who attends a preschool or kindergarten [kindergartener, preschooler]</p><p><b>ima ili nastaje iz urođene ljubazne naravi (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or proceeding from an innately kind disposition [kind-hearted]</p><p><b>suosjećanje koje proizlazi iz dobrog srca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sympathy arising from a kind heart [kind-heartedness]</p><p><b>oduševiti se, pripaliti, zapaliti, zapaliti se, rasplamsati se, buditi, izazivati, izazvati, pobuditi, pobuđivati, podjariti, potaknuti, potaći, poticati, probuditi, raspaliti, raspaljivati, raspiriti, rasplamsati, rasplamsavati, razbuktati, razbuktavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> catch fire [inflame]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to start burning [conflagrate, enkindle, inflame]</p><p><i>v.</i> call forth (emotions, feelings, and responses) [arouse, elicit, enkindle, evoke, fire, provoke, raise]</p><p><b>zapalio (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> set afire [enkindled, ignited]</p><p><b>blagonaklonost, dobro djelo, dobrota</b></p><p><i>n.</i> friendliness evidence by a kindly and helpful disposition [helpfulness]</p><p><b>loženje, potpala, potpaljivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> material for starting a fire [punk, spunk, tinder, touchwood]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of setting something on fire [firing, ignition, inflammation, lighting]</p><p><b>dobronamjeran, ljubazno, prijazno, benevolentan, dobar, dobrohotan, dobrostiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> showing or motivated by sympathy and understanding and generosity [benevolent, charitable, good-hearted, large-hearted, openhearted, sympathetic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> pleasant and agreeable</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a kind manner or out of kindness</p><p><b>dobrota, ljubaznost, milosrđe, čovekoljublje, blagonaklonost, dobronamjernost, dragost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being warmhearted and considerate and humane and sympathetic</p><p><i>n.</i> tendency to be kind and forgiving [forgivingness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a kind act [benignity]</p><p><b>rođački, srodan, srodstvo, klan, pleme, porodica, rod, rodbina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> group of people related by blood or marriage [clan, kin, kin group, kinship group, tribe]</p><p><i>adj.</i> similar in quality or character [akin]</p><p><i>adj.</i> related by blood or marriage</p><p><b>U slučaju da je životinja iz kategorije IIa ili IIIa, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 2. to (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> domesticated bovine animals as a group regardless of sex or age [Bos taurus, cattle, cows, oxen]</p><p><b>filmska umjetnost, kinematika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of mechanics concerned with motion without reference to force or mass</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom materijala od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cathode-ray tube in a television receiver [picture tube, television tube]</p><p><b>kineziologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of physiology that studies the mechanics and anatomy in relation to human movement</p><p><b>kretanje koje je odgovor na