 of small particles in random motion [kinetic theory]</p><p><b>teorija da se temperatura tijela povećava kada se kinetička energija povećava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a theory that the temperature of a body increases when kinetic energy increases</p><p><b>kinetika, dinamika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of mechanics concerned with the forces that cause motions of bodies [dynamics]</p><p><b>Specijalni kondenzirani region svakog hromozoma koji se pojavljuje tijekom mitoze gdje se hromatidi drže zajedno kako bi formirali oblik X. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a specialized condensed region of each chromosome that appears during mitosis where the chromatids are held together to form an X shape [centromere]</p><p><b>uređaj koji je izmislio Edison koji je dao dojam kretanja kao beskrajna petlja filma koja se neprekidno kreće preko izvora svjetlosti s brzim zatvaračem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device invented by Edison that gave an impression of movement as an endless loop of film moved continuously over a light source with a rapid shutter</p><p><b>stanje vrtoglavice ili mučnine zbog pokreta koji se javljaju dok se vozi u ili na pokretnom vozilu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being dizzy or nauseated because of the motions that occur while traveling in or on a moving vehicle [motion sickness]</p><p><b>obitelj, obiteljska loza, porodica, rod, rodbina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> people descended from a common ancestor [family, family line, folk, kinsfolk, phratry, sept]</p><p><b>kralj, kraljevati, kralja, car, tajkun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a male sovereign [Rex, male monarch]</p><p><i>n.</i> a competitor who holds a preeminent position [queen, world-beater]</p><p><i>n.</i> a very wealthy or powerful businessman [baron, big businessman, business leader, magnate, mogul, power, top executive, tycoon]</p><p><i>n.</i> preeminence in a particular category or group or field</p><p><i>n.</i> United States woman tennis player (born in 1943) [Billie Jean King, Billie Jean Moffitt King]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States guitar player and singer of the blues (born in 1925) [B. B. King, Riley B King]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States charismatic civil rights leader and Baptist minister who campaigned against the segregation of Blacks (1929-1968) [Martin Luther King, Martin Luther King Jr.]</p><p><i>n.</i> a checker that has been moved to the opponent's first row where it is promoted to a piece that is free to move either forward or backward</p><p><i>n.</i> one of the four playing cards in a deck bearing the picture of a king</p><p><i>n.</i> (chess) the weakest but the most important piece</p><p><b>legendarni kralj Britanaca (možda na temelju povijesne ličnosti u 6. stoljeću, ali priča je previše puta ispričana da bi bila sigurna) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a legendary king of the Britons (possibly based on a historical figure in the 6th century but the story has been retold too many times to be sure) [Arthur]</p><p><b>(legenda) okrugli stol za kralja Artura i njegove vitezove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (legend) the circular table for King Arthur and his knights [Round Table]</p><p><b>bilo koja od brojnih obično rizomatnih hibridnih begonija koje potiču od istočnoindijske biljke s grubim teksturiranim listovima s masnim i bronzanim uzorcima i ljubičastom i crveno-sjedom s neopažavanim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous usually rhizomatous hybrid begonias derived from an East Indian plant having rough-textured leaves patterned in silver and bronze and purple and red-brown with inconspicuous flowers [Begonia rex, beefsteak geranium, painted-leaf begonia, rex begonia]</p><p><b>Gillette</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States inventor and manufacturer who developed the safety razor (1855-1932) [Gillette]</p><p><b>igrački engleski španijel sa crno-sumanim plaštom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a toy English spaniel with a black-and-tan coat</p><p><b>velika kobra iz jugoistočne Azije i istočne Indije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large cobra of southeastern Asia and the East Indies [Naja hannah, Ophiophagus hannah, hamadryad]</p><p><b>meso velikih hladnovodnih rakova, veliki europski rak pauk., Veliki jestivi rak sjevernog Tihog oceana, posebno duž obale Aljaske i Japana, veliki morski članonožci sa atlantske obale Sjeverne Amerike koji imaju kupoličnu lupinu u obliku potkove i čvrst šiljat rep (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> meat of large cold-water crab [Alaska crab, Alaska king crab, Alaskan king crab]</p><p><i>n.</i> a large spider crab of Europe [European spider crab, Maja squinado]</p><p><i>n.</i> large edible crab of northern Pacific waters especially along the coasts of Alaska and Japan [Alaska crab, Alaska king crab, Alaskan king crab, Paralithodes camtschatica]</p><p><i>n.</i> large marine arthropod of the Atlantic coast of North America having a domed carapace that is shaped like a horseshoe and a stiff pointed tail [Limulus polyphemus, Xiphosurus polyphemus, horseshoe crab]</p><p><b>Europski jastrebni algi u sjeveroistočnoj Americi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European hawkweed introduced into northeastern United States [Hieracium praealtum, yellow hawkweed]</p><p><b>Kralj Kastilije i Aragona koji je vladao zajedno sa svojom suprugom Izabelom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the king of Castile and Aragon who ruled jointly with his wife Isabella [Ferdinand, Ferdinand V, Ferdinand of Aragon, Ferdinand the Catholic]</p><p><b>Osmunda regalis, kraljevski pujanik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fern of rain forests of tropical Australia and New Zealand and South Africa [Todea barbara, crepe fern]</p><p><i>n.</i> large deeply rooted fern of worldwide distribution with upright bipinnate compound tufted fronds [French bracken, Osmunda regalis, ditch fern, royal fern, royal osmund]</p><p><b>nezakoniti sin Knut koji je zauzeo engleski prijestolje 1037. (umro 1040.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> illegitimate son of Canute who seized the throne of England in 1037 (died in 1040) [Harefoot, Harold Harefoot, Harold I]</p><p><b>Kralj Engleske koji je naslijedio Edwarda Ispovjednika 1066. godine i bio posljednji anglosaksonski monarh (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> King of England who succeeded Edward the Confessor in 1066 and was the last of the Anglo-Saxon monarchs [Harold II]</p><p><b>Hussein I., kralj Jordana</b></p><p><i>n.</i> king of Jordan credited with creating stability at home and seeking peace with Israel (1935-1999) [Husain, Husayn, Hussein, ibn Talal Hussein]</p><p><b>prvi Stuart koji je bio kralj Engleske i Irske od 1603. do 1625. i kralj Škotske od 1567. do 1625. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first Stuart to be king of England and Ireland from 1603 to 1625 and king of Scotland from 1567 to 1625 [James, James I, King James I]</p><p><b>Engleski prijevod Biblije izdan 1611. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an English translation of the Bible published in 1611 [Authorized Version, King James Version]</p><p><b>prvi Stuart koji je bio kralj Engleske i Irske od 1603. do 1625. i kralj Škotske od 1567. do 1625. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first Stuart to be king of England and Ireland from 1603 to 1625 and king of Scotland from 1567 to 1625 [James, James I, King James]</p><p><b>Engleski prijevod Biblije izdan 1611. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an English translation of the Bible published in 1611 [Authorized Version, King James Bible]</p><p><b>najmlađi sin Henrija II. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> youngest son of Henry II [John, John Lackland]</p><p><b>Heroj tragedije Williama Shakespearea koji je izdan i zlostavljan od strane dvije njegove kćeri. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the hero of William Shakespeare's tragedy who was betrayed and mistreated by two of his scheming daughters [Lear]</p><p><b>Velika skuba s dugim šiljatim čunjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large mackerel with long pointed snout [Scomberomorus cavalla, cavalla, cero]</p><p><b>Hickory iz istočnih Sjedinjenih Država nalik na shagbark ali s puno većim oraškom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hickory of the eastern United States resembling the shagbark but having a much larger nut [Carya laciniosa, big shagbark, big shellbark, big shellbark hickory, king nut hickory]</p><p><b>Hickory iz istočnih Sjedinjenih Država nalik na shagbark ali s puno većim oraškom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hickory of the eastern United States resembling the shagbark but having a much larger nut [Carya laciniosa, big shagbark, big shellbark, big shellbark hickory, king nut]</p><p><b>(grčka mitologija) tragičan kralj Tebe koji je nesvjesno ubio svog oca Laija i oženio svoju majku Jocasta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) a tragic king of Thebes who unknowingly killed his father Laius and married his mother Jocasta [Oedipus, Oedipus Rex]</p><p><b>Panthera leo, lav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large gregarious predatory feline of Africa and India having a tawny coat with a shaggy mane in the male [Panthera leo, lion]</p><p><b>Suverenog vladara Engleske. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sovereign ruler of England [King of Great Britain]</p><p><b>Suverenog vladara Francuske. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sovereign ruler of France</p><p><b>Suverenog vladara Engleske. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sovereign ruler of England [King of England]</p><p><b>Klarinetista iz Sjedinjenih Država koji je 1934. osnovao big band (uključujući crne i bijele glazbenike) i uveo vrstu džeza poznatu kao swing (1909-1986) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States clarinetist who in 1934 formed a big band (including black as well as white musicians) and introduced a kind of jazz known as swing (1909-1986) [Benjamin David Goodman, Benny Goodman, Goodman]</p><p><b>Suverenog vladara Nijemaca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sovereign ruler of the Germans</p><p><b>tanka tropska riba iz dubokih voda dugačka 20 do 30 stopa s crvenom leđnom perajem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thin deep-water tropical fish 20 to 30 feet long having a red dorsal fin [Regalecus glesne, oarfish, ribbonfish]</p><p><b>Američki jazz glazbenik koji je utjecao na stil Louisa Armstronga (1885-1938) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States jazz musician wh