ected Aesop's fables and published them (1621-1695) [Jean de La Fontaine]</p><p><b>Glavni grad u zapadnoj Boliviji i administrativno sjedište bolivijske vlade (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> capital city in western Bolivia and the administrative seat of Bolivia's government [capital of Bolivia]</p><p><b>utor između Argentine i Urugvaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an estuary between Argentina and Uruguay [Plata River, Rio de la Plata]</p><p><b>Francuski pisac moralnih maksima (1613-1680) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French writer of moralistic maxims (1613-1680) [Francois de La Rochefoucauld]</p><p><b>La Spezia</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a port city in Liguria on an arm of the Ligurian Sea</p><p><b>Francuski slikar religijskih djela (1593-1652) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French painter of religious works (1593-1652) [Georges de La Tour]</p><p><b>-Smiješno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> affectedly genteel [grandiose, hifalutin, highfalutin, highfaluting, hoity-toity]</p><p><b>la</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state in southern United States on the Gulf of Mexico [LA, Louisiana, Pelican State]</p><p><b>logor zaštićen kružnom formacijom vagona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a camp defended by a circular formation of wagons [lager]</p><p><b>laboratorij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a workplace for the conduct of scientific research [laboratory, research lab, research laboratory, science lab, science laboratory]</p><p><b>radna ploča u laboratoriju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a workbench in a laboratory [laboratory bench]</p><p><b>Mađarski koreograf koji je razvio Labanotation (1879-1958) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Hungarian choreographer who developed Labanotation (1879-1958) [Rudolph Laban]</p><p><b>sustav notacije za plesne pokrete koji koristi simbole za predstavljanje točaka na tijelu plesača i smjeru pokreta plesača i tempo i dinamiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system of notation for dance movements that uses symbols to represent points on a dancer's body and the direction of the dancer's movement and the tempo and the dynamics</p><p><b>Olejorezin od tamno smeđe do zelenkaste boje koji ima mirisan miris i koristi se kao fiksant u parfemima, meki crno-smeđi smolavi izlučik iz raznih kamennih ruža koji se koristi u parfemima, posebno kao fiksant (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dark brown to greenish oleoresin that has a fragrant odor and is used as a fixative in perfumes [gum labdanum]</p><p><i>n.</i> a soft blackish-brown resinous exudate from various rockroses used in perfumes especially as a fixative [ladanum]</p><p><b>etiketa, ime, labela, naljepnica, natpis, obilježiti, oznaka, oznaka (npr. u signalnoj jedinici poruke), programska oznaka, simbolička adresa, tekst, u ćeliju unosimo tekst, etiketirati, indeksirati, obiježivati, označavati, označiti, označivati, ocijeniti, ocjenjivati, procijeniti, procjenjivati, proglasiti, proglašavati, prosuditi, prosuđivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a brief description given for purposes of identification</p><p><i>n.</i> trade name of a company that produces musical recordings [recording label]</p><p><i>n.</i> a radioactive isotope that is used in a compound in order to trace the mechanism of a chemical reaction</p><p><i>n.</i> an identifying or descriptive marker that is attached to an object</p><p><i>v.</i> assign a label to</p><p><i>v.</i> attach a tag or label to [mark, tag]</p><p><i>v.</i> pronounce judgment on [judge, pronounce]</p><p><i>v.</i> distinguish (as a compound or molecule) by introducing a labeled atom</p><p><i>v.</i> distinguish (an element or atom) by using a radioactive isotope or an isotope of unusual mass for tracing through chemical reactions</p><p><b>imenovan, označen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> bearing or marked with a label or tag [labelled, tagged]</p><p><b>obilježen, označen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> bearing or marked with a label or tag [labeled, tagged]</p><p><b>antihipertenzivni lijekovi (trgovinski nazivi Trandate i Normodyne) koji blokiraju alfa i beta- adrenergičke receptore simpatičkog živčanog sustava (što dovodi do smanjenja krvnog tlaka) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antihypertensive drug (trade names Trandate and Normodyne) that blocks alpha and beta-adrenergic receptors of the sympathetic nervous system (leading to a decrease in blood pressure) [Normodyne, Trandate, labetalol hydrochloride]</p><p><b>antihipertenzivni lijekovi (trgovinski nazivi Trandate i Normodyne) koji blokiraju alfa i beta- adrenergičke receptore simpatičkog živčanog sustava (što dovodi do smanjenja krvnog tlaka) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antihypertensive drug (trade names Trandate and Normodyne) that blocks alpha and beta-adrenergic receptors of the sympathetic nervous system (leading to a decrease in blood pressure) [Normodyne, Trandate, labetalol]</p><p><b>dva vanjska prepada vulve. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the two outer folds of the vulva</p><p><b>dva unutarnja sloja vulve. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the two inner folds of the vulva</p><p><b>labijalan, usnen glas</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a consonant whose articulation involves movement of the lips [labial consonant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the lips of the mouth</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or near the female labium</p><p><b>arterija koja je grana arterije lica koja opskrbljuje usne usta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that is a branch of the facial artery that supplies the lips of the mouth [arteria labialis]</p><p><b>glasnik čija je artikulacija uključuje kretanje usana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a consonant whose articulation involves movement of the lips [labial]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> organ pipe whose tone is produced by air passing across the sharp edge of a fissure or lip [flue, flue pipe]</p><p><b>prekidač konsonanta koji se stvara usnama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stop consonant that is produced with the lips</p><p><b>vene koje izlijevaju usne vulve, vena koja izlijeva usne usta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins draining the lips of the vulva [vena labialis]</p><p><i>n.</i> a vein draining the lips of the mouth [vena labialis]</p><p><b>izgovaraju sa okruglim usnama (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> pronounce with rounded lips [labialize, round]</p><p><b>izgovaraju sa okruglim usnama (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> pronounce with rounded lips [labialise, round]</p><p><b>velika obitelj aromatičnih biljaka i grmova s cvijećem nalik usnama usta i s četvoroklopnim jajnika s četiri jednosemena oraha i uključujući mentinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large family of aromatic herbs and shrubs having flowers resembling the lips of a mouth and four-lobed ovaries yielding four one-seeded nutlets and including mint [Lamiaceae, family Labiatae, family Lamiaceae, mint family]</p><p><b>imaju usne ili dijelove koji liče na usne (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having lips or parts that resemble lips [liplike]</p><p><b>(hemija, fizika, biologija) lako se mijenjaju ili razgrađuju, S obzirom na to da se (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (chemistry, physics, biology) readily undergoing change or breakdown</p><p><i>adj.</i> liable to change</p><p><b>glasnik čija je artikulacija uključuje usne i zube (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a consonant whose articulation involves the lips and teeth [labiodental consonant]</p><p><b>glasnik čija je artikulacija uključuje usne i zube (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a consonant whose articulation involves the lips and teeth [labiodental]</p><p><b>struktura nalik usnama koja ograničava tjelesni otvor (posebno bilo koji od četiri labijalna sloja ženske vulve) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a liplike structure that bounds a bodily orifice (especially any of the four labiate folds of a woman's vulva)</p><p><b>jedna vrsta: grah za jacinte (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one species: hyacinth bean [genus Lablab]</p><p><b>višegodišnje vinove loze iz tropskih područja Starog svijeta s troljubnim listovima i rascima mirisnih ljubičastih graška poput cvijeća, nakon čega slijede smeđe čunje jestivih sjemena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial twining vine of Old World tropics having trifoliate leaves and racemes of fragrant 