>n.</i> wrasses [family Labridae]</p><p><b>pregojnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large connective tissue cell that contains histamine and heparin and serotonin which are released in allergic reactions or in response to injury or inflammation [mast cell, mastocyte]</p><p><b>Francuski arhitekt koji je među prvim uspješno koristio kovane konstrukcije (1801-1875) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French architect who was among the first to use metal construction successfully (1801-1875) [Henri Labrouste]</p><p><b>cvjetni grmovi ili stabla s žutim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> flowering shrubs or trees having bright yellow flowers [genus Laburnum]</p><p><b>S druge strane, za proizvodnju proizvoda iz poglavlja 94. točka (a) ovog članka ne vrijedi: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ornamental shrub or tree of the genus Laburnum [Alpine golden chain, Scotch laburnum]</p><p><b>S druge strane, za proizvodnju proizvoda iz poglavlja 94. točka (a) ovog članka ne vrijedi: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ornamental shrub or tree of the genus Laburnum [common laburnum, golden chain, golden rain]</p><p><b>labirint</b></p><p><i>n.</i> complex system of paths or tunnels in which it is easy to get lost [maze]</p><p><i>n.</i> a complex system of interconnecting cavities [inner ear, internal ear]</p><p><b>Veliki labirint koji je na Kreti izgradio Dedal na zapovijed Minosa kako bi sadržao Minotaura. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vast labyrinth built in Crete by Daedalus at the command of Minos in order to contain the Minotaur</p><p><b>koji podsećaju na labirint po obliku ili složenosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling a labyrinth in form or complexity [labyrinthine, mazy]</p><p><b>labirintski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or affecting or originating in the inner ear</p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling a labyrinth in form or complexity [labyrinthian, mazy]</p><p><b>arterija koja je grana bazilarne arterije koja opskrbljuje labirint (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that is a branch of the basilar artery that supplies the labyrinth [artery of the labyrinth, internal auditory artery]</p><p><b>Osjetni sustav smješten u strukturama unutarnjeg uha koji registrira orijentaciju glave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sensory system located in structures of the inner ear that registers the orientation of the head [equilibrium, sense of balance, sense of equilibrium, vestibular sense]</p><p><b>vene koje isušuju unutarnje uho (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that drain the inner ear [internal auditory vein]</p><p><b>upale unutarnjeg uha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of the inner ear [otitis interna]</p><p><b>amfibijski životinjski organizam superred Labyrinthodontia (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amphibian of the superorder Labyrinthodontia</p><p><b>izumrle vodozemce koje obično liče na teške salamandre ili krokodile i imaju čvrstu ravnu lubanju i konične zube (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extinct amphibians typically resembling heavy-bodied salamanders or crocodiles and having a solid flattened skull and conical teeth [Labyrinthodontia, superorder Labyrinthodonta, superorder Labyrinthodontia]</p><p><b>izumrle vodozemce koje obično liče na teške salamandre ili krokodile i imaju čvrstu ravnu lubanju i konične zube (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extinct amphibians typically resembling heavy-bodied salamanders or crocodiles and having a solid flattened skull and conical teeth [Labyrinthodonta, superorder Labyrinthodonta, superorder Labyrinthodontia]</p><p><b>Složka slična smoli koju luče određene insekte (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> resinlike substance secreted by certain lac insects</p><p><b>crvena boja kao košenil. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> scarlet dye like cochineal</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hard wax separated from shellac by its insolubility in alcohol [shellac wax]</p><p><b>jedna vrsta: ogromna maslačica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one species: giant buttercup [genus Laccopetalum]</p><p><b>spektakularna višegodišnja biljka porijeklom iz mokrih planinskih travnjaka Perua (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spectacular perennial native of wet montane grasslands of Peru [giant buttercup]</p><p><b>čipka, čipke, gajtan, oplesti, vezati, vezica, vrpca, traka, trakica, plesti, preplesti, viti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cord that is drawn through eyelets or around hooks in order to draw together two edges (as of a shoe or garment) [lacing]</p><p><i>n.</i> a delicate decorative fabric woven in an open web of symmetrical patterns</p><p><i>v.</i> spin, wind, or twist together [enlace, entwine, interlace, intertwine, twine]</p><p><i>v.</i> make by braiding or interlacing [braid, plait]</p><p><i>v.</i> do lacework</p><p><i>v.</i> draw through eyes or holes [lace up]</p><p><i>v.</i> add alcohol to (beverages) [fortify, spike]</p><p><b>mala buba s tijelom i krilima prekrivenim čipčanom mrežom podignutih linija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small bug having body and wings covered with a lacy network of raised lines</p><p><b>mala tufted paprika sjeverozapadne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small tufted fern of northwestern America [Cheilanthes gracillima]</p><p><b>udario nasilno, kao u napadu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> hit violently, as in an attack [lam into, lay into, pitch into, tear into]</p><p><b>Čin ili umjetnost pravljenja ručno izrađene čipke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act or art of making handmade lace [tatting]</p><p><b>izvaditi kroz oči ili rupe (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> draw through eyes or holes [lace]</p><p><b>Bjelokosa, s dubokim obranima, s velikim brojem cvjetova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low-growing creeping perennial of Central America having deeply fringed white flowers [Alsobia dianthiflora, Episcia dianthiflora]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve proizvode koji se proizvode u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, za koje se primjenjuje točka (a) ovog članka, za proizvode koji se proizvode u skl