bers of a family (as distinguished from each member's given name) [cognomen, family name, surname]</p><p><b>Osim svega gore navedenog. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in addition to all the foregoing [last but not least]</p><p><b>Držite se dok ste na iskušenju izdržljivosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> hang on during a trial of endurance [outride, ride out, stay]</p><p><b>posljednja četvrtina Mjesečevog perioda revolucije oko Zemlje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the last fourth of the Moon's period of revolution around the Earth</p><p><b>Izbor koji se koristi samo u očaju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expedient adopted only in desperation [pis aller]</p><p><b>izraz poštovanja prema nekome tko je umro. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of expressing respect for someone who has died</p><p><b>katolički sakrament., obredima koji se obavljaju u vezi sa smrću ili sahranom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Catholic sacrament [anointing of the sick, extreme unction]</p><p><i>n.</i> rites performed in connection with a death or burial</p><p><b>konačno iritaciju koja je istegla vaše strpljenje izvan granice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the final irritation that stretches your patience beyond the limit</p><p><b>Posljednja večera</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the traditional Passover supper of Jesus with his disciples on the eve of his crucifixion [Lord's Supper]</p><p><b>završna izjava u usmenom argumentu, Službeni dokument, -Elegantnost zbog modnog izgleda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the final statement in a verbal argument</p><p><i>n.</i> an authoritative statement</p><p><i>n.</i> elegance by virtue of being fashionable [chic, chichi, chicness, modishness, smartness, stylishness, swank]</p><p><b>nešto učinjeno kao posljednje sredstvo (posebno kako bi se spriječila kriza ili katastrofa) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of something done as a final recourse (especially to prevent a crisis or disaster)</p><p><b>neposredno prije roka (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> just before a deadline</p><p><b>najniži u rangu ili važnosti (