hing [laughter]</p><p><i>n.</i> a facial expression characteristic of a person laughing</p><p><i>n.</i> a humorous anecdote or remark intended to provoke laughter [gag, jape, jest, joke]</p><p><i>v.</i> produce laughter [express joy, express mirth]</p><p><b>ismijavati, ismijati, izrugati se, izrugivati se, podrugivati se, rugati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> subject to laughter or ridicule [blackguard, guy, jest at, make fun, poke fun, rib, ridicule, roast]</p><p><b>riješiti problem smijući se ili se pretvarajući da je to zabavno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> deal with a problem by laughing or pretending to be amused by it [laugh off]</p><p><b>hrpu u koži na vanjskom kutu očiju, Poanta šale ili humorne priče (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wrinkle in the skin at the outer corner of your eyes [crow's feet, crow's foot]</p><p><i>n.</i> the point of a joke or humorous story [gag line, punch line, tag line]</p><p><b>smijati se. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> laugh boisterously [guffaw]</p><p><b>riješiti problem smijući se ili se pretvarajući da je to zabavno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> deal with a problem by laughing or pretending to be amused by it [laugh away]</p><p><b>smijati se tiho ili sa suzdržanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> laugh quietly or with restraint [chortle, chuckle]</p><p><b>prethodno snimljeni smijeh dodan u soundtrack radijske ili televizijske emisije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> prerecorded laughter added to the soundtrack of a radio or television show</p><p><b>smiješan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> so unreasonable as to invite derision [absurd, cockeyed, derisory, idiotic, ludicrous, nonsensical, preposterous, ridiculous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> arousing or provoking laughter [amusing, comic, comical, funny, mirthful, risible]</p><p><b>Da bi probudili ili zaslužili smijeh. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> so as to arouse or deserve laughter [ludicrously, preposterously, ridiculously]</p><p><b>ismijavati, smijanje, smijati se, smijeh, nasmije (od &quot;laugh&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is l