boidni mišić koji vuče lopaticu prema kralježnici i blago prema gore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rhomboid muscle that draws the scapula toward the vertebral column and slightly upward [musculus rhomboideus minor, rhomboid minor muscle]</p><p><b>Udaljenost od vode u području Atlantika i Tihog oceana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small finback of coastal waters of Atlantic and Pacific [Balaenoptera acutorostrata, minke whale, piked whale]</p><p><b>Uobičajena čeparica Sjeverne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common scaup of North America [Aythya affinis, lake duck, lesser scaup duck]</p><p><b>Uobičajena čeparica Sjeverne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common scaup of North America [Aythya affinis, lake duck, lesser scaup]</p><p><b>polovodna evroazijska višegodišnja krugolaca s lišćama u obliku koplja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> semiaquatic Eurasian perennial crowfoot with leaves shaped like spears [Ranunculus flammula]</p><p><b>lanac otoka koji čine provinciju Indonezije istočno od Jave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chain of islands forming a province of Indonesia to the east of Java [Nusa Tenggara]</p><p><b>Orhideja s dva trokutasta lista i kratkim lakom rasemom cvijeća zelene do hrđave boje s ružičastim ružičastim usnama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> orchid having two triangular leaves and a short lax raceme of green to rust-colored flowers with the lip flushed mauve [Listera cordata]</p><p><b>grmuša čevrljinka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Old World warbler similar to the greater whitethroat but smaller [Sylvia curruca, whitethroat]</p><p><b>uobičajena zimska zelenina s mnogokvetnim rasemi ružičastih bijeli cvjetovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the common wintergreen having many-flowered racemes of pink-tinged white flowers [Pyrola minor]</p><p><b>Klopar s žutavim cvijećem porijeklom iz Irske (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clover native to Ireland with yellowish flowers [Trifolium dubium, hop clover, shamrock]</p><p><b>različite žute noge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a variety of yellowlegs [Tringa flavipes]</p><p><b>manji, manja, manje (od &quot;less&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German playwright and leader of the Enlightenment (1729-1781) [Gotthold Ephraim Lessing]</p><p><i>n.</i> English author of novels and short stories who grew up in Rhodesia (now Zimbabwe) (born in 1919) [Doris Lessing, Doris May Lessing]</p><p><b>lekcija, nastavni sat, obuka, poduka, pouka, predavanje, sat, vježba, zadatak, nastavna jedinica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of instruction</p><p><i>n.</i> punishment intended as a warning to others [deterrent example, example, object lesson]</p><p><i>n.</i> the significance of a story or event [moral]</p><p><i>n.</i> a task assigned for individual study</p><p><b>najmodavac, zakupodavac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who grants a lease [lease giver]</p><p><b>SAD jazz tenor saksofonist (1909-1959) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States jazz tenor saxophonist (1909-1959) [Pres Young, Young]</p><p><b>otok u istočnoj Grčkoj u istočnom Egejskom moru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an island of eastern Greece in the eastern Aegean Sea [Lesbos, Mytilene]</p><p><b>ako, dopustiti, dozvoliti, izdati, izdavati, iznajmiti, neka, ostaviti, prepreka, pustiti, puštati, vodstvom, dati, dopuštati, dozvoljavati, davati, dozovljavati, odobravati, odobriti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a brutal terrorist group active in Kashmir [Army of the Pure, Army of the Righteous, Lashkar-e-Taiba, Lashkar-e-Tayyiba, Lashkar-e-Toiba]</p><p><i>n.</i> a serve that strikes the net before falling into the receiver's court [net ball]</p><p><i>v.</i> make it possible through a specific action or lack of action for something to happen [allow, permit]</p><p><i>v.</i> actively cause something to happen</p><p><i>v.</i> consent to, give permission [allow, countenance, permit]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to move [get, have]</p><p><i>v.</i> leave unchanged</p><p><i>v.</i> grant use or occupation of under a term of contract [lease, rent]</p><p><b>a da i ne spominjem, ne dirati, odlaganje, ostaviti na miru, popustljivost, uz