eant to be kept a secret [break, bring out, disclose, discover, divulge, expose, give away, let out, reveal, uncover, unwrap]</p><p><b>ispustiti, otkriti, proširiti, pustiti, pustiti na volju, objaviti, objavljivati, objelodaniti, objelodanjivati, odati, odavati, otkrivati, razotkriti, razotkrivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> express audibly [emit, let loose, utter]</p><p><i>v.</i> make known to the public information that was previously known only to a few people or that was meant to be kept a secret [break, bring out, disclose, discover, divulge, expose, give away, let on, reveal, uncover, unwrap]</p><p><i>v.</i> bring out of a specific state [bring out]</p><p><i>v.</i> make (clothes) larger [widen]</p><p><b>da otkrije povjerljive informacije ili tajne (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> divulge confidential information or secrets [babble, babble out, blab, blab out, peach, sing, spill the beans, talk, tattle]</p><p><b>popustiti, popuštanje, prestajanje, prestajati, jenjati, jenjavati, malaksati, opadati, opasti, oslabiti, oslabjeti, popuštati, slabiti, slabjeti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become less in amount or intensity [abate, die away, slack, slack off]</p><p><i>v.</i> reduce pressure or intensity [ease off, ease up]</p><p><b>Čovjek s jakim seksualnim željama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> man with strong sexual desires [lech, lecher, satyr]</p><p><b>razočaranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of dissatisfaction that results when your expectations are not realized [disappointment]</p><p><b>letalno, smrtni, smrtonosan, smrtonosno, ubojit</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of an instrument of certain death [deadly]</p><p><b>sredstvo sposobno uzrokovati smrt. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agent capable of causing death</p><p><b>veličine doze koja će uzrokovati smrt (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the size dose that will cause death</p><p><b>bilo koji gen koji ima učinak koji uzrokuje smrt organizma u bilo kojoj fazi života (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any gene that has an effect that causes the death of the organism at any stage of life</p><p><b>kvaliteta smrtonosnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being deadly [deadliness]</p><p><b>bezvoljan, letargičan, pospan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> deficient in alertness or activity [unenergetic]</p><p><b>encefalitis koji je bio epidemija između 1915 i 1926 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an encephalitis that was epidemic between 1915 and 1926 [encephalitis lethargica, epidemic encephalitis, sleeping sickness, sleepy sickness]</p><p><b>bez energije (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without energy [unenergetically]</p><p><b>bezvoljnost, letargija, mrtvilo, neprirodno težak san, pospanost, potpuna otupjelost, potpuna tromost, učmalost, iscrpljenost, iznemoglost, klonulost, mlitavost, tromost, umor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of comatose torpor (as found in sleeping sickness) [lassitude, sluggishness]</p><p><i>n.</i> weakness characterized by a lack of vitality or energy [inanition, lassitude, slackness]</p><p><i>n.</i> inactivity [flatness, languor, phlegm, sluggishness]</p><p><b>(grčka mitologija) rijeka u Hadesu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) a river in Hades [River Lethe]</p><p><b>supruga ili ljubavnica Zeusa i majka Apolla i Artemide u drevnoj mitologiji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wife or mistress of Zeus and mother of Apollo and Artemis in ancient mythology [Latona]</p><p><b>dopis, list, napisati, označiti slovima, pismo, simbolizirati, slovo, znak, pismeno, slova, slovu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a written message addressed to a person or organization [missive]</p><p><i>n.</i> the conventional characters of the alphabet used to represent speech [alphabetic character, letter of the alphabet]</p><p><i>n.</i> owner who lets another person use something (housing usually) for hire</p><p><i>n.</i> a strictly literal interpretation (as distinct from the intention)</p><p><i>n.</i> an award earned by participation in a school sport [varsity letter]</p><p><i>v.</i> win an athletic letter</p><p><i>v.</i> set down or print with letters</p><p><i>v.</i> mark letters on or mark with letters</p><p><b>"Sredstvo za eksploziju" je sredstvo za eksploziju koje se koristi za proizvodnju eksploziva ili za proizvodnju eksploziva., Poslati eksploziv u... (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thin explosive device inside an envelope or package and detonated when opened [package bomb, parcel bomb]</p><p><i>v.</i> send an explosive to</p><p><b>U slučaju da je vrijednost obveznice u skladu s člankom 5. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, vrijednost obveznice u skladu s člankom 5. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe može se smatrati vrijednosnom obveznicom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bond that has not been registered with the Securities and Exchange Commission and cannot be sold to the general public</p><p><b>poštanski sanduk, poštanski sandučić</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a numbered compartment in a post office where mail is put to be called for [POB, PO Box, Post-Office box, call box]</p><p><i>n.</i> public box for deposit of mail [mailbox, postbox]</p><p><i>n.</i> a private box for delivery of mail [mailbox]</p><p><b>listonoša, pismonoša, poštar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a man who delivers the mail [carrier, mail carrier, mailman, postman]</p><p><b>Kuća za nošenje pisama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> case for carrying letters</p><p><b>akreditiv</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a document issued by a bank that guarantees the payment of a customer's draft</p><p><b>bilo koje pismo u kojem se izražava namjera poduzeti (ili odustati) od neke mjere (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any letter expressing an intention to take (or forgo) some action</p><p><b>Apokrifna knjiga koja se sastoji od pisma koje je Jeremija uputio Židovima u izgnanstvu u Babilonu i koje ih upozorava na idolopoklonstvo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an Apocryphal book consisting of a letter ascribed to Jeremiah to the Jews in exile in Babylon warning them against idolatry [Epistle of Jeremiah]</p><p><b>dozvola za privatnog građanina da zaplijeni imovinu druge nacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a license to a private citizen to seize property of another nation [letter of marque, letters of marque]</p><p><b>dozvola za privatnog građanina da zaplijeni imovinu druge nacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a license to a private citizen to seize property of another nation [letter of mark and reprisal, letters of marque]</p><p><b>slovo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the conventional characters of the alphabet used to represent speech [alphabetic character, letter]</p><p><b>tupi nož koji se koristi za rezanje koverta u kojima se šalju pisma ili za rezanje nerezanih stranica knjiga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dull knife used to cut open the envelopes in which letters are mailed or to slit uncut pages of books [paper knife, paperknife]</p><p><b>papir za pisanje za pisanu korespondenciju, papir presječen na odgovarajuću veličinu za pisanje pisama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> writing paper for use in writing correspondence</p><p><i>n.</i> paper cut to an appropriate size for writing letters [stationery]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je vrijednost neovisnog društva u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, vrijednost neovisnog društva u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe ne može biti vrijednost neovisnog društva u skladu s člankom 6. točkom (a) ove Uredbe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stock or bond that is not registered with the Securities and Exchange Commission and cannot be sold in the public market</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 5. stavkom 3. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 5. stavkom 3. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stock that has not been registered with the Securities and Exchange Commission and cannot be sold to the general public</p><p><b>jeftiniji oblik telegrama koji se šalje u inozemstvo za isporuku sljedećeg dana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cheaper form of telegram that is sent abroad for delivery the next day</p><p><b>osoba koja komunicira putem pisama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who communicates by means of letters [correspondent]</p><p><b>ispravno do posljednjeg detalja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> correct to the last detail [word-perfect]</p><p><b>razgrana razglednica koja se može savijati tako da je poruka unutra. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a postcard that folds so the message is inside</p><p><b>naučen, učen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> highly educated [knowing, knowledgeable, learned, well-educated, well-read]</p><p><b>dopis, list, napisati, označiti slovima, pismo, simbolizirati, slovo, znak, pismeno, slova, slovu (od &quot;letter&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a painter of letters</p><p><b>glava slova, gornji dio slova, zaglavlje pisma</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sheet of stationery with name and address of the organization printed at the top</p><p><b>inskripcija, natpis, zapis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> letters inscribed (especially words engraved or carved) on something [inscription]</p><p><b>sportista koji je dobio pismo u školskom sportu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an athlete who has earned a letter in a school sport</p><p><b>tisak, tiskani tekst, tiskarski stroj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> printing from a plate with raised characters [relief printing]</p><p><b>književnost, pisma, slova, slovima, spoznaje, učenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the literary culture</p><p><i>n.</i> scholarly attainment</p><p><b>pravni dokument kojim se imenuje netko tko će upravljati imovinom kada nije imenovan izvršitelj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> legal document naming someone to administer an estate when no executor has been named</p><p><b>dozvola za privatnog građanina da zaplijeni imovinu druge nacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a license to a private citizen to seize property of another nation [letter of mark and reprisal, letter of marque]</p><p><