rent material [facing]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of attaching an inside lining (to a garment or curtain etc.)</p><p><b>kanal, karika, link, povezati, povezivanje, povezivati, poveznica, priključak, spoj, spojiti, veza, vezati, vezu, kopča, spona, spajanje, sveza, kontakt, asocirati, referirati, priključiti, priključivati, prikopčati, prikopčavati, privezati, privezivati, spajati, ukopčati, ukopčavati, zavezati, zavezivati, pridružiti, podjarmiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the means of connection between things linked in series [nexus]</p><p><i>n.</i> a fastener that serves to join or connect [linkup, tie, tie-in]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being connected [connectedness, connection]</p><p><i>n.</i> a connecting shape [connection, connexion]</p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of length equal to 1/100 of a chain</p><p><i>n.</i> (computing) an instruction that connects one part of a program or an element on a list to another program or list</p><p><i>n.</i> a channel for communication between groups [contact, inter-group communication, liaison]</p><p><i>n.</i> a two-way radio communication system (usually microwave) [radio link]</p><p><i>n.</i> an interconnecting circuit between two or more locations for the purpose of transmitting and receiving data [data link]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a logical or causal connection [associate, colligate, connect, link up, relate, tie in]</p><p><i>v.</i> connect, fasten, or put together two or more pieces [connect, link up, tie]</p><p><i>v.</i> be or become joined or united or linked [connect, join, link up, unite]</p><p><i>v.</i> link with or as with a yoke [yoke]</p><p><b>rani oblik simulatorskih letova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an early form of flight simulator</p><p><b>pridružiti, povezati, povezivati, priključiti, priključivati, prikopčati, prikopčavati, privezati, privezivati, spajati, spojiti, ukopčati, ukopčavati, vezati, zavezati, zavezivati, asocirati, referirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be or become joined or united or linked [connect, join, link, unite