 assets]</p><p><b>raztopina koja sadrži sredstva za izbjeljivanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a solution containing bleaching agents</p><p><b>tjelesna tekućina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the liquid parts of the body [bodily fluid, body fluid, humor, humour]</p><p><b>tekući kristal, tekući kristali</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a liquid exhibiting properties of a crystal that are not shown by ordinary liquids</p><p><b>LCD zaslon, zaslon s tekućim kristalima</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a digital display that uses liquid crystal cells that change reflectivity in an applied electric field [LCD]</p><p><b>odor za čistila u tekućoj formi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a detergent in liquid form</p><p><b>Dijeta hrane koja se može servirati u tekućoj ili prelijepoj formi (uključujući kreme ili pudinge) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diet of foods that can be served in liquid or strained form (plus custards or puddings)</p><p><b>max</b></p><p><i>n.</i> street names for gamma hydroxybutyrate [Georgia home boy, easy lay, goop, grievous bodily harm, max, scoop, soap]</p><p><b>Jedinica za mjerenje volumena tekućine (za mjerenje volumena tekućine ili spremnika za njih) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of capacity for liquids (for measuring the volumes of liquids or their containers) [liquid unit]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva veći od 50 W/cm3 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nuclear reactor using liquid metal as a coolant</p><p><b>tekući dušik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nitrogen in a liquid state</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% do 0,5% masenog ulja, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bluish translucent magnetic liquid obtained by compressing gaseous oxygen and then cooling it below its boiling point [LOX]</p><p><b>dehidrogenizirani analog kortizola (trgovinski nazivi Orasone ili Deltasone ili Liquid Pred ili Meticorten) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dehydrogenated analogue of cortisol (trade names Orasone or Deltasone or Liquid Pred or Meticorten) [Deltasone, Meticorten, Orasone, prednisone]</p><p><b>čisti čips u tekućoj formi (MT)</b>