 nesklon (od &quot;loath&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who hates or loathes [abominator]</p><p><b>gađenje, gnušanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hate coupled with disgust [abhorrence, abomination, detestation, execration, odium]</p><p><b>mrziti, nerad, nesklon (od &quot;loath&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> highly offensive [disgustful, disgusting, distasteful, foul, loathsome, repellant, repellent, repelling, revolting, skanky, wicked, yucky]</p><p><b>odvratan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing or able to cause nausea [nauseating, nauseous, noisome, offensive, queasy, sickening, vile]</p><p><i>adj.</i> highly offensive [disgustful, disgusting, distasteful, foul, loathly, repellant, repellent, repelling, revolting, skanky, wicked, yucky]</p><p><b>odvratan (od &quot;loathsome&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being disgusting to the senses or emotions [lousiness, repulsiveness, sliminess, vileness, wickedness]</p><p><b>lak povratak teniske lopte u visokom luk, čin pokretanja nečeg (kao što je lopta ili školjka itd.) u visokom luka, pogon u visokom luka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an easy return of a tennis ball in a high arc</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of propelling something (as a ball or shell etc.) in a high arc</p><p><i>v.</i> propel in a high arc</p><p><b>Ruski matematičar koji je neovisno otkrio ne-evklidsku geometriju (1792-1856) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian mathematician who independently discovered non-Euclidean geometry (1792-1856) [Nikolai Ivanovich Lobachevsky]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s ili utječu na režanj (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or affecting a lobe</p><p><b>pneumonija koja pogađa jedan ili više režnjeva pluća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pneumonia affecting one or more lobes of the lung</p><p><b>ctenophore koji ima pipke samo u nezrelom stadiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ctenophore having tentacles only in the immature stage [order Lobata]</p><p><b>s masenim udelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, s pregrštom od 8 mm ili više, ali ne više od 10 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or resembling a lobe or lobes [lobated]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having deeply indented margins but with lobes not entirely separate from each other [lobed]</p><p><b>ptičja noga s odvojenim prstima s membranskim krilima duž strana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bird's foot having separate toes each with membranous flaps along the sides</p><p><b>s masenim udelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or resembling a lobe or lobes [lobate]</p><p><b>predsoblje, predvorje, foaje, hodnik, ulaz</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large entrance or reception room or area [antechamber, anteroom, entrance hall, foyer, hall, vestibule]</p><p><i>n.</i> the people who support some common cause or business or principle or sectional interest</p><p><i>n.</i> an interest group that tries to influence legislators or bureaucrats to act in their favor, typically through lobbying [advocacy group, lobby group, pressure group, special-interest group, special interest, special interest group, third house]</p><p><i>v.</i> detain in conversation by or as if by holding on to the outer garments of [buttonhole]</p><p><b>interesna skupina koja pokušava utjecati na zakonodavce ili birokrate da djeluju u njihovu korist, obično kroz lobiranje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an interest group that tries to influence legislators or bureaucrats to act in their favor, typically through lobbying [advocacy group, lobby, pressure group, special-interest group, special interest, special interest group, third house]</p><p><b>Odluka Vijeća 2006/98/EZ od 21. prosinca 2007. o utvrđivanju programa za razvoj i razvoj poljoprivrednih područja (SL L 347, 20.12.2016., str. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> expenses incurred in promoting or evaluating legislation</p><p><b>praksa lobiranja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the practice of lobbying</p><p><b>netko tko je zaposlen da uvjeri zakonodavce da glasaju za zakon koji favorizira poslodavca lobista (MT