mmunication between computers [LAN]</p><p><b>jedinica lokalne uprave, lokalna vlast, mil: mjesni izvor podataka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an administrative unit of local government</p><p><b>telefonski poziv obavljen unutar lokalnog područja pozivanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a telephone call made within a local calling area</p><p><b>stalni odjel koji je stvoren za obavljanje poslova lokalne samouprave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a permanent department created to perform the work of a local government [department of local government]</p><p><b>lokalna uprava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the government of a local area</p><p><b>Sloboda lokalne vlasti da odluči glasovanjem o primjeni kontroverznog zakona u svojoj nadležnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> freedom of a local government to determine by popular vote the applicability of a controversial law in their jurisdiction</p><p><b>lokalni oscilator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an oscillator whose output heterodynes with the incoming radio signal to produce sum and difference tones [heterodyne oscillator]</p><p><b>lokalna podružnica u kojoj su dostupne poštanske usluge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a local branch where postal services are available [post office]</p><p><b>Ulica koja se uglavnom koristi za pristup imovini koja joj graniči. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a street that is primarily used to gain access to the property bordering it [local street]</p><p><b>Ulica koja se uglavnom koristi za pristup imovini koja joj graniči. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a street that is primarily used to gain access to the property bordering it [local road]</p><p><b>mjesno vrijeme</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the official time in a local region (adjusted for location around the Earth) [civil time, standard time]</p><p><b>mjesto, prostor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the scene of any event or action (especially the place of a meeting) [locus, venue]</p><p><b>lokalizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physiology) the principle that specific functions have relatively circumscribed locations in some particular part or organ of the body [localisation of function, localisation principle, localization, localization of function, localization principle]</p><p><i>n.</i> a determination of the place where something is [fix, localization, locating, location]</p><p><b>(fiziologija) princip da određene funkcije imaju relativno ograničena mjesta u nekom određenom dijelu ili organu tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physiology) the principle that specific functions have relatively circumscribed locations in some particular part or organ of the body [localisation, localisation principle, localization, localization of function, localization principle]</p><p><b>(fiziologija) princip da određene funkcije imaju relativno ograničena mjesta u nekom određenom dijelu ili organu tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physiology) the principle that specific functions have relatively circumscribed locations in some particular part or organ of the body [localisation, localisation of function, localization, localization of function, localization principle]</p><p><b>lokalizirati, ograničiti, ograničavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> identify the location or place of [localize, place]</p><p><i>v.</i> concentrate on a particular place or spot [focalise, focalize, localize]</p><p><i>v.</i> restrict something to a particular area [localize]</p><p><i>v.</i> locate [localize, place, set]</p><p><b>ograničen ili ograničen na određenu lokaciju, Lokalno ili lokalno orijentirano (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> confined or restricted to a particular location [localized]</p><p><i>adj.</i> made local or oriented locally [localized]</p><p><b>izraz ili izgovor koji je specifičan za određeno mjesto, Stranost prema nekom mjestu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a phrase or pronunciation that is peculiar to a particular locality</p><p><i>n.</i> a partiality for some particular place [provincialism, sectionalism]</p><p><b>lokalitet, mjesto, položaj, blizina, okolica, susjedstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a surrounding or nearby region [neck of the w