ing the capability for correct and valid reasoning</p><p><i>adj.</i> based on known statements or events or conditions [legitimate]</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by an orderly, logical, and aesthetically consistent relation of parts [coherent, consistent, ordered]</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of thinking and expressing yourself in a clear and consistent manner [coherent, lucid]</p><p><b>Razum koji je namijenjen dokazivanju istine ili laži. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a course of reasoning aimed at demonstrating a truth or falsehood [argument, argumentation, line, line of reasoning]</p><p><b>grafički prikaz programa koji koristi formalnu logiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a graphical representation of a program using formal logic [logic diagram]</p><p><b>pogreška u logičkom argumentaciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fallacy in logical argumentation</p><p><b>logistički odnos između prijedloga p i q oblika `ako p onda q' (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a logical relation between propositions p and q of the form `if p then q' [conditional relation, implication]</p><p><b>operacija koja slijedi pravila simboličke logike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an operation that follows the rules of symbolic logic [logic operation]</p><p><b>pozitivizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the form of empiricism that bases all knowledge on perceptual experience (not on intuition or revelation) [positivism]</p><p><b>netko tko tvrdi da je bilo koja izjava koja se ne može provjeriti empirijski besmislena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who maintains that any statement that cannot be verified empirically is meaningless</p><p><b>dokaz logičkog teorema (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> proof of a logical theorem</p><p><b>(logika) riječ (kao što su `neki' ili `svi' ili `ne') koja povezuje varijable u logičkom prijedlogu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (logic) a word (such as `some' or `all' or `no') that binds the variables in a logical proposition [quantifier]</p><p><b>odnos između prijedloga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a relation between propositions</p><p><b>logički sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system of reasoning [logic, system of logic]</p><p><b>apstraktno mišljenje, rasuđivanje, razmišljanje, rezoniranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thinking that is coherent and logical [abstract thought, reasoning]</p><p><b>logička topologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the way the network works</p><p><b>ispravno i valjano razmišljanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> correct and valid reasoning [logicalness]</p><p><b>logično</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> according to logical reasoning</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a logical manner</p><p><b>logičan, logički (od &quot;logical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> correct and valid reasoning [logicality]</p><p><b>logičar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person skilled at symbolic logic [logistician]</p><p><b>logicizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (philosophy) the philosophical theory that all of mathematics can be derived from formal logic</p><p><b>stanje bezobraznosti koje je posljedica umora. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dull and listless state resulting from weariness [logginess]</p><p><b>Isusova riječ koja se smatra istinskom iako nije zapisana u Evanđeljima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a saying of Jesus that is regarded as authentic although it is not recorded in the Gospels</p><p><b>logisička, logisički, logistički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to logistics [logistical]</p><p><b>Odluka o logističkoj podršci koja je potrebna za određenu vojnu operaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a judgment of the logistic support required for some particular military operation</p><p><b>pomoć između i unutar vojnih zapovjedništva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> assistance between and within military commands [logistic support]</p><p><b>pomoć između i unutar vojnih zapovjedništva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> assistance between and within military commands [logistic assistance]</p><p><b>logistički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to logistics [logistic]</p><p><b>logičar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person skilled at symbolic logic [logician]</p><p><b>komora, logistika, logistike, logistiku</b></p><p><i>n.</i> handling an operation that involves providing labor and materials be supplied as needed</p><p><b>Svaka prekida koja se može pripisati neobičnoj aktivnosti, Neomjerna masa debla koja blokira rijeku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any stoppage attributable to unusual activity</p><p><i>n.</i> an immovable mass of logs blocking a river</p><p><b>logo, logotip, znak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company emblem or device [logotype]</p><p><b>Jedini pisani simbol koji predstavlja cijelu riječ ili frazu bez označavanja njenog izgovora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a single written symbol that represents an entire word or phrase without indicating its pronunciation [logograph]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom materijala ne većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to logograms or logographs [logographic]</p><p><b>s pomoću logograma (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by means of logograms</p><p><b>Jedini pisani simbol koji predstavlja cijelu riječ ili frazu bez označavanja njenog izgovora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a single written symbol that represents an entire word or phrase without indicating its pronunciation [logogram]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom materijala ne većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to logograms or logographs [logogrammatic]</p><p><b>netko koji se stalno svađa oko riječi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone given to disputes over words [logomachist]</p><p><b>netko koji se stalno svađa oko riječi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone given to disputes over words [logomach]</p><p><b>rasprava o riječima ili značenju riječi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> argument about words or the meaning of words</p><p><b>patološki prekomjeran (i često nedosljedan) govor (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pathologically excessive (and often incoherent) talking [logorrhea]</p><p><b>patološki prekomjeran (i često nedosljedan) govor (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pathologically excessive (and often incoherent) talking [logomania]</p><p><b>logos, Reč, Riječ</b></p><p><i>n