<p><b>Postaju glasniji., uzrok da postane glasno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become louder</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to become loud</p><p><b>bučno, glasno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with relatively high volume [aloud, loud]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in manner that attracts attention [clamorously, obstreperously]</p><p><i>adv.</i> used as a direction in music [forte]</p><p><b>osoba koja uzrokuje nevolje govoreći nepromišljeno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who causes trouble by speaking indiscreetly [blusterer]</p><p><b>buka, galama, glasnoća, glasnost, jačina zvuka, volumen</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the magnitude of sound (usually in a specified direction) [intensity, volume]</p><p><i>n.</i> tasteless showiness [brashness, flashiness, garishness, gaudiness, glitz, meretriciousness, tawdriness]</p><p><b>zvučnik, razglas, razglasni sistem, razglasni sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electro-acoustic transducer that converts electrical signals into sounds loud enough to be heard at a distance [loudspeaker system, speaker, speaker system, speaker unit]</p><p><b>razglas, razglasni sistem, razglasni sustav, zvučnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electro-acoustic transducer that converts electrical signals into sounds loud enough to be heard at a distance [loudspeaker, speaker, speaker system, speaker unit]</p><p><b>od žitarica ili žitarica, od žitarica ili žitarica, osim od žitarica ili žitarica s masenim udjelom žitarica ili žitarica, od žitarica ili žitarica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the dried fibrous part of the fruit of a plant of the genus Luffa [loofa, loofah, luffa]</p><p><b>jezero</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long narrow (nearly landlocked) cove in Ireland</p><p><i>n.</i> Irish word for a lake</p><p><b>Američki boksač koji je bio svjetski prvak u teškoj kategoriji 12 godina (1914-1981) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States prizefighter who was world heavyweight champion for 12 years (1914-1981) [Joe Louis, Joseph Louis Barrow]</p><p><b>Američki prirodnjak (rođen u Švicarskoj) koji je proučavao fosile riba (MT)