d universal salvation</p><p><i>n.</i> one of two great schools of Buddhist doctrine emphasizing a common search for universal salvation especially through faith alone [Mahayana Buddhism]</p><p><b>Jedna od dvije velike škole budističke doktrine koja naglašava zajedničko traženje univerzalnog spasenja posebno samo kroz vjeru. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of two great schools of Buddhist doctrine emphasizing a common search for universal salvation especially through faith alone [Mahayana]</p><p><b>religijska doktrina Mahayana budizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the religious doctrine of Mahayana Buddhism</p><p><b>pristalica budizma Mahayana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an adherent of Mahayana Buddhism</p><p><b>(Islam) mesijanski vođa koji će (prema popularnom muslimanskom vjerovanju) pojaviti prije kraja svijeta i vratiti pravdu i religiju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Islam) a messianic leader who (according to popular Muslim belief) will appear before the end of the world and restore justice and religion</p><p><b>Vjerovanje u pojavljivanje Mehdija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> belief in the appearance of the Mahdi</p><p><b>pristalica mahdizma. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an adherent of Mahdism</p><p><b>Afrički grm s dekumbentnim stabljikama i tankim žutim cvjetovima sa mirisom meda, bilo sami ili u parovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> African shrub having decumbent stems and slender yellow honey-scented flowers either solitary or in pairs [Hermannia verticillata, honey bell, honeybells]</p><p><b>Magreb</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the region of northwest Africa comprising the Atlas Mountains and the coastlands of Morocco and Algeria and Tunisia [Maghreb]</p><p><b>član Algonquian ljudi koji su nekada živjeli u dolini Hudson i istočno do Housatonic, Algonkijski jezik koji govore Mohicani. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Algonquian people formerly living in the Hudson valley and eastward to the Housatonic [Mohican]</p><p><i>n.</i> the Algonquian language spoken by the Mohican [Mohican]</p>