uhammad]</p><p><b>Vozač i čuvari slona. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the driver and keeper of an elephant</p><p><b>član naroda Indije koji živi u Maharashtra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of a people of India living in Maharashtra [Maratha]</p><p><b>Indijski jezik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an Indic language [Marathi]</p><p><b>Kineska efedra koja daje efedrin (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Chinese ephedra yielding ephedrine [Ephedra sinica]</p><p><b>tip rod Majidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Majidae [Maja, genus Maia, genus Maja]</p><p><b>ponekad stavljena u obitelj Convallariaceae: lažna lilija doline (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sometimes placed in family Convallariaceae: false lily of the valley [genus Maianthemum]</p><p><b>mala bijela cvjetnica iz zapadne Europe do Japana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small white-flowered plant of western Europe to Japan [false lily of the valley]</p><p><b>Urocica (Prunus spp.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small two-leaved herb of the northern United States and parts of Canada having racemes of small fragrant white flowers [false lily of the valley]</p><p><b>cura, djevojka, služavka, deva, djeva, devojka, moma, sluškinja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a female domestic [amah, housemaid, maidservant]</p><p><i>n.</i> an unmarried girl (especially a virgin) [maiden]</p><p><b>neudana žena koja prisustvuje mladoj na vjenčanju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unmarried woman who attends the bride at a wedding [bridesmaid]</p><p><b>čedan, čist, djeva, djevica, djevičanski, djevojački, djevojka, neupotrebljen, nevin, nov, prvi, svjež, uredan, usidjelica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unmarried girl (especially a virgin) [maid]</p><p><i>n.</i> (cricket) an over in which no runs are scored [maiden over]</p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to set in motion [first, inaugural, initiative, initiatory]</p><p><b>Neudana teta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unmarried aunt</p><p><b>mala široko razgranata zapadnjačka biljka s sitnim plavo-bijelim cvijećima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small w