ki grad Manchester ili njegove stanovnike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or resident of Manchester</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of the English city of Manchester or its residents</p><p><b>Dravidski jezik koji se govori u južnoj središnjoj Indiji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Dravidian language spoken in south central India</p><p><b>član malog gnostičkog sekta koji je nastao u Jordanu i koji je preživio u Iraku i koji vjeruje da je Ivan Krstitelj bio Mesija, oblik aramejskog koji su koristili Mandeanci, o ili koji se odnose na ljude iz Mandaea ili njihov jezik ili kulturu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of a small Gnostic sect that originated in Jordan and survives in Iraq and who believes that John the Baptist was the Messiah [Mandean]</p><p><i>n.</i> the form of Aramaic used by the Mandeans [Mandean]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the Mandaean people or their language or culture [Mandean]</p><p><b>Gnostička religija iz 2. i 3. stoljeća koja vjeruje da je Ivan Krstitelj Mesija i koja uključuje židovske i kršćanske elemente u okvir dualističkih vjerovanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Gnostic religion originating the 2nd and 3rd centuries that believes John the Baptist was the Messiah and that incorporates Jewish and Christian elements into a framework of dualistic beliefs [Mandeanism]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih geometrijskih dizajna (obično kružnih) koji simbolizuju svemir (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various geometric designs (usually circular) symbolizing the universe</p><p><b>grad u središnjem Mjanmaru sjeverno od Rangauna (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in central Myanmar to the north of Rangoon</p><p><b>izvanredni nalog kojim se službeniku naređuje da izvrši ministarski čin koji zakon priznaje kao apsolutnu dužnost i nije stvar za službenikovu diskreciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an extraordinary writ commanding an official to perform a ministerial act that the law recognizes as an absolute duty and not a matter for the official's discretion [writ of mandamus]</p><p><b>jezikom Čada koji se govori u planinama Mandara u Kamerunu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Chadic language spoken in the Mandara mountains in Cameroon [Wandala]</p><p><b>mandarina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrub or small tree having flattened globose fruit with very sweet aromatic pulp and thin yellow-orange to flame-orange rind that is loose and easily removed [Citrus reticulata, mandarin orange, mandarin orange tree]</p><p><i>n.</i> a member of an elite intellectual or cultural group</p><p><i>n.</i> any high government official or bureaucrat</p><p><i>n.</i> a high public official of imperial China</p><p><i>n.</i> a somewhat flat reddish-orange loose skinned citrus of China [mandarin orange]</p><p><i>n.</i> the dialect of Chinese spoken in Beijing and adopted as the official language for all of China [Beijing dialect, Mandarin Chinese, Mandarin dialect]</p><p><b>Dialekt kineskog jezika koji se govori u Pekingu i koji je prihvaćen kao službeni jezik za cijelu Kinu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the dialect of Chinese spoken in Beijing and adopted as the official language for all of China [Beijing dialect, Mandarin, Mandarin dialect]</p><p><b>Dialekt kineskog jezika koji se govori u Pekingu i koji je prihvaćen kao službeni jezik za cijelu Kinu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the dialect of Chinese spoken in Beijing and adopted as the official language for all of China [Beijing dialect, Mandarin, Mandarin Chinese]</p><p><b>Azijska patka s naglasnim grebenom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> showy crested Asiatic duck [Aix galericulata]</p><p><b>mandarina, tangerina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrub or small tree having flattened globose fruit with very sweet aromatic pulp and thin yellow-orange to flame-orange rind that is loose and easily removed [Citrus reticulata, mandarin, mandarin orange tree]</p><p><i>n.</i> a somewhat flat reddish-orange loose skinned citrus of China [mandarin]</p><p><b>grm ili drvo s ravnim globusnim plodovima s vrlo slatkom aromatično