nd [Finnish mark]</p><p><b>Ruski matematičar (1856-1922) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian mathematician (1856-1922) [Andre Markoff, Andrei Markov, Markov]</p><p><b>Markov proces za koji je parametr diskretne vremenske vrijednosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Markov process for which the parameter is discrete time values [Markov chain]</p><p><b>Jednostavan stohastični proces u kojem distribucija budućih stanja ovisi samo o sadašnjem stanju a ne o tome kako je dospio u sadašnjem stanju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a simple stochastic process in which the distribution of future states depends only on the present state and not on how it arrived in the present state [Markov process]</p><p><b>Ruski matematičar (1856-1922) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian mathematician (1856-1922) [Andre Markoff, Andrei Markov, Markoff]</p><p><b>Markovljev lanac, Markovljevi lanci</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Markov process for which the parameter is discrete time values [Markoff chain]</p><p><b>Markovljev proces</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a simple stochastic process in which the distribution of future states depends only on the present state and not on how it arrived in the present state [Markoff process]</p><p><b>Engleski baletni plesač (rođen 1910.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English ballet dancer (born in 1910) [Dame Alicia Markova, Lilian Alicia Marks]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se proizvod proizvodi u skladu s ovom Uredbom, to znači da se proizvod proizvodi u skladu s ovom Uredbom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or generated by a Markov process</p><p><b>marke</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English businessman who created a retail chain (1888-1964) [First Baron Marks of Broughton, Simon Marks]</p><p><b>dobar strijelac, majstor u gađa, nišandžija, strijelac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone skilled in shooting [crack shot, sharpshooter]</p><p><b>streljačka vještina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> skill in shooting</p><p><b>bilješke, lektorske oznake, poskupljenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount added to the cost to d