ile, plenty, pot, quite a little, raft, sight, slew, spate, stack, tidy sum, wad]</p><p><i>n.</i> an ill-structured collection of similar things (objects or people)</p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman Catholic Church and Protestant Churches) the celebration of the Eucharist</p><p><i>n.</i> a body of matter without definite shape</p><p><i>n.</i> the common people generally [hoi polloi, masses, multitude, people, the great unwashed]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of something that is great in magnitude [bulk, volume]</p><p><i>n.</i> a musical setting for a Mass</p><p><i>n.</i> a sequence of prayers constituting the Christian Eucharistic rite</p><p><i>v.</i> join together into a mass or collect or form a mass</p><p><i>adj.</i> formed of separate units gathered into a mass or whole [aggregate, aggregated, aggregative]</p><p><b>(neurologija) princip da moždani korteks djeluje kao koordinirani sustav s velikim masama živčanog tkiva uključenog u sve složene funkcije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (neurology) the principle that the cortex of the brain operates as a coordinated system with large masses of neural tissue involved in all complex functioning [mass-action principle]</p><p><b>(Rimska katolička crkva) čestitku koju šalje obitelji koja je u žalosti i u kojoj piše da je pošiljalac dogovorio misa u spomen na pokojnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman Catholic Church) a card sent to a bereaved family that says the sender has arranged for a Mass to be said in memory of the deceased</p><p><b>kultura koja se široko širi putem masovnih medija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the culture that is widely disseminated via the mass media</p><p><b>količina za koju je masa atomskog jezgra manja od zbira masa njegovih sastavnih čestica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount by which the mass of an atomic nucleus is less than the sum of the masses of its constituent particles [mass deficiency]</p><p><b>količina za koju je masa atomskog jezgra manja od zbira masa njegovih sastavnih čestica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount by which the mass of an atomic nucleus is less than the sum of the masses of its constituent particles [mass defect]</p><p><b>(fizički) masa tijela relativistički smatraju kao energiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the mass of a body regarded relativistically as energy</p><p><b>stanje u kojem velika grupa ljudi pokazuje isto stanje nasilne mentalne agitacije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a condition in which a large group of people exhibit the same state of violent mental agitation [epidemic hysertia]</p><p><b>masovni medij, medij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (usually plural) transmissions that are disseminated widely to the public [medium]</p><p><b>okupljanje, skup</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large gathering of people intended to arouse enthusiasm [rally]</p><p><b>pokolj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the savage and excessive killing of many people [butchery, carnage, massacre, slaughter]</p><p><b>osoba koja je odgovorna za smrt mnogih žrtava u jednom incidentu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is responsible for the deaths of many victims in a single incident</p><p><b>nebrojiva imenica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a noun that does not form plurals</p><p><b>Broj protona i neutrona u atomskom jezgru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sum of the number of neutrons and protons in an atomic nucleus [nucleon number]</p><p><b>masovna proizvodnja, masovna produkcija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the production of large quantities of a standardized article (often using assembly line techniques)</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "sistem javnog prijevoza" znači sustav javnog prijevoza u gradovima koji koristi podzemne ili nadzemne vlakove. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an urban public transit system using underground or elevated trains [rapid transit]</p><p><b>s masenim spektrometrom koji proizvodi grafičko prikaz masnog spektra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mass spectrometer that produces a graphical representation of the mass spectrum</p><p><b>spektrometar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spectroscope for obtaining a mass spectrum by deflecting ions into a thin slit and measuring the ion current with an electrometer [spectrometer]</p><p><b>S druge vrijednosti od 8205 do 9205 (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or involving mass spectroscopy</p><p><b>korištenje spektroskopije za određivanje masa malih električno napunjenih čestica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the use of spectroscopy to determine the masses of small electrically charged particles</p><p><b>s masenim spektrografom ili masenim spektrometrom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a distribution of ions as shown by a mass spectrograph or a mass spectrometer</p><p><b>jedinica mase</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of measurement for mass</p><p><b>(neurologija) princip da moždani korteks djeluje kao koordinirani sustav s velikim masama živčanog tkiva uključenog u sve složene funkcije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (neurology) the principle that the cortex of the brain operates as a coordinated system with large masses of neural tissue involved in all complex functioning [mass action]</p><p><b>(fizička) princip da je izmjerena količina mase ekvivalentna (prema teoriji relativnosti) izmjerenoj količini energije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the principle that a measured quantity of mass is equivalent (according to relativity theory) to a measured quantity of energy</p><p><b>proizvoditi na velikoj razini (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> produce on a large scale</p><p><b>proizvedeno u količinama često tehnikama montažne linije (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> produced in quantity often by assembly-line techniques</p><p><b>s masnim spektrometrom ili s njim povezanim (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or involving a mass spectrometer</p><p><b>gomila, hrpa, količina, masa, masovan, materija, misa, mnoštvo, nagomilati se, narod, prikupiti, tvari, Prijenos tvari, mase, masovnog</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state in New England [Bay State, MA, Massachusetts, Old Colony]</p><p><b>Algonkijski jezik Massachusetta, član Algonkijskog naroda koji je nekada živio oko Massachusetts Bay-a (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the Algonquian language of the Massachuset [Massachusetts]</p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Algonquian people who formerly lived around Massachusetts Bay [Massachusetts]</p><p><b>država u Novoj Engleskoj, član Algonkijskog naroda koji je nekada živio oko Massachusetts Bay-a, jedna od britanskih kolonija koje su formirale Sjedinjene Države., Algonkijski jezik Massachusetta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state in New England [Bay State, MA, Mass., Old Colony]</p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Algonquian people who formerly lived around Massachusetts Bay [Massachuset]</p><p><i>n.</i> one of the British colonies that formed the United States [Massachusetts Bay Colony]</p><p><i>n.</i> the Algonquian language of the Massachuset [Massachuset]</p><p><b>Massachusetts</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inlet of the Atlantic Ocean off of eastern Massachusetts extending from Cape Ann on the north to Cape Cod on the south</p><p><b>jedna od britanskih kolonija koje su formirale Sjedinjene Države. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the British colonies that formed the United States [Massachusetts]</p><p><b>delikatna pernate štit paprika iz istočnih Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> delicate feathery shield fern of the eastern United States [Parathelypteris simulata, Thelypteris simulata]</p><p><b>Tehnološki institut države Massachussetts</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an engineering university in Cambridge [MIT]</p><p><b>krvoproliće, masakr, poklati, pokolj, poubijati, izmasakrirati, klati, masakrirati, pobiti, ubijati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the savage and excessive killing of many people [butchery, carnage, mass murder, slaughter]</p><p><i>v.</i> kill a large number of people indiscriminately [mow down, slaughter]</p><p><b>masaža, masažu, masirati, trljanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> kneading and rubbing parts of the body to increase circulation and promote relaxation</p><p><i>v.</i> manually manipulate (someone's body), usually for medicinal or relaxation purposes [knead, rub down]</p><p><i>v.</i> give a massage to</p><p><b>mjesto gdje se nudi nezakoniti seks pod krinkom terapeutske masaže, Služba za liječenje i liječenje bolesti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a place where illicit sex is available under the guise of therapeutic massage</p><p><i>n.</i> a business establishment that offers therapeutic massage</p><p><b>masaža, masažu, masirati, trljanje (od &quot;massage&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who rubs or kneads parts of the body to stimulate circulation and promote relaxation</p><p><b>mala pigmejska hrastovita zmija, pigmejska hrastovnica koja se nalazi u vlažnim područjima od Velika jezera do Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small pygmy rattlesnake [Sistrurus miliaris, ground rattler]</p><p><i>n.</i> pygmy rattlesnake found in moist areas from the Great Lakes to Mexico [Sistrurus catenatus, massasauga rattler]</p><p><b>pigmejska hrastovnica koja se nalazi u vlažnim područjima od Velika jezera do Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pygmy rattlesnake found in moist areas from the Great Lakes to Mexico [Sistrurus catenatus, massasauga]</p><p><b>Vođa Wampanoag koji je pomogao hodočasnicima (1580-1661) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Wampanoag leader who aided the Pilgrims (1580-1661)</p><p><b>lučki grad u Eritreji na ulivu Crvenog mora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a port town in Eritrea on an inlet of the Red Sea</p><p><b>udarac u biljaru napravljen udaranjem kugle sa kugom koja se drži gotovo vertikalno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a shot in billiards made by hitting the cue ball with the cue held nearly vertically [masse shot]</p><p><b>udarac u biljaru napravljen udaranjem kugle sa kugom koja se drži gotovo vertikalno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a shot in billiards made by hitting the cue ball with the cue held nearly vertically [masse]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je riječ o oružju koje se upotrebljava za ispitivanje, to znači da je oružje koje se koristi za ispitivanje ili ispitivanje izloženo samo jednom cilju ili području (kao što je