aru u južnom Meksiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an extinct termite found in amber in southern Mexico</p><p><b>primitivni termiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> primitive termites [family Mastotermitidae]</p><p><b>masturbirati, onanirati, samozadovoljavati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> stimulate sexually</p><p><i>v.</i> get sexual gratification through self-stimulation [fuck off, jack off, jerk off, she-bop, wank]</p><p><b>masturbacija, samozadovoljavanje, rukoblud, manustupracija, samoblud, onanija, drkanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> manual stimulation of the genital organs (of yourself or another) for sexual pleasure [onanism]</p><p><b>osoba koja se masturbira. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who practices masturbation [onanist]</p><p><b>bez sjaja, brisač, hasura, mat (boja), mutan, neproziran, nesjajnost, otirač, podmetač, prostirač, prostirka, rogožina, strunjača, tapit, sag, tepih, ispreplesti, isprepletati, mrsiti, pomrsiti, zamrsiti, zapetljati, zaplesti, zapletati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thick flat pad used as a floor covering</p><p><i>n.</i> mounting consisting of a border or background for a picture [matting]</p><p><i>n.</i> sports equipment consisting of a piece of thick padding on the floor for gymnastic sports [gym mat]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mass that is densely tangled or interwoven</p><p><i>n.</i> a master's degree in teaching [Master of Arts in Teaching]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of having little or no contrast [flatness, lusterlessness, lustrelessness, matt, matte]</p><p><i>n.</i> a foundation (usually on soft ground) consisting of an extended layer of reinforced concrete [raft, raft foundation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small pad of material that is used to protect surface from an object placed on it</p><p><i>v.</i> twist together or entwine into a confusing mass [entangle, snarl, tangle]</p><p><i>v.</i> change texture so as to become matted and felt-like [felt, felt up, mat up, matt-up, matte, matte up]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not reflecting light [flat, matt, matte, matted]</p><p><b>