alomaniacal]</p><p><b>obitelj sisavaca koja se sastoji od dvosprstih lijenjaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mammal family consisting of the two-toed sloths [family Megalonychidae]</p><p><b>megalopolis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a very large urban complex (usually involving several cities and towns)</p><p><b>u nekim klasifikacijama smatraju se zasebnim redom: šarenice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in some classifications considered a separate order: alderflies [suborder Megaloptera]</p><p><b>gigantski mesojedni dvostruki dinosaurus iz Jure ili ranog krede u Europi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> gigantic carnivorous bipedal dinosaur of the Jurassic or early Cretaceous in Europe [megalosaurus]</p><p><b>Megalosauri (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> megalosaurs [family Megalosauridae]</p><p><b>gigantski mesojedni dvostruki dinosaurus iz Jure ili ranog krede u Europi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> gigantic carnivorous bipedal dinosaur of the Jurassic or early Cretaceous in Europe [megalosaur]</p><p><b>doglasnik, megafon, zvučnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cone-shaped acoustic device held to the mouth to intensify and direct the human voice</p><p><b>ptice kratkih krila s velikim nogama iz Australazije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large-footed short-winged birds of Australasia [mound-bird, mound bird, mound builder, scrub fowl]</p><p><b>megapodi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> megapodes [family Megapodiidae]</p><p><b>vrsta rod Megapodiidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Megapodiidae [genus-Megapodius]</p><p><b>Ploče i ptice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> humpback whales [genus Megaptera]</p><p><b>grbavi kit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large whalebone whale with long flippers noted for arching or humping its back as it dives [humpback, humpback whale]</p><p><b>vidljivi golim okom (posebno kamenja i anatomskih obilježja) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> visible to the naked eye (especially of rocks and anatomical features) [gross]</p><p><b>biljna struktura koja proizvodi megaspore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plant structure that produce