ympathy through maturity or intoxication or a relaxed state</p><p><i>n.</i> a taste (especially of fruit) that is ripe and of full flavor</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of a sensation that is rich and pleasing [fullness, richness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a soft shade of a color</p><p><i>n.</i> geniality, as through the effects of alcohol or marijuana</p><p><b>rod snažno rebrastih globusnih ili sferoidnih kaktusa iz tropske Južne i Srednje Amerike i Kariba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of strongly ribbed globose or spheroid cacti of tropical South and Central America and the Caribbean [genus Melocactus]</p><p><b>glazben</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> containing or constituting or characterized by pleasing melody [melodious, musical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to melody</p><p><b>melodija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a succession of notes forming a distinctive sequence [air, line, melodic phrase, melody, strain, tune]</p><p><b>melodija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a succession of notes forming a distinctive sequence [air, line, melodic line, melody, strain, tune]</p><p><b>tema</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (music) melodic subject of a musical composition [idea, musical theme, theme]</p><p><b>u odnosu na melodiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with respect to melody</p><p><b>melodičan, muzikalan, skladan, glazben</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a musical sound [tuneful]</p><p><i>adj.</i> containing or constituting or characterized by pleasing melody [melodic, musical]</p><p><b>melodičan, muzikalan, skladan (od &quot;melodious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a melodious manner [tunefully]</p><p><b>melodičan, muzikalan, skladan (od &quot;melodious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of having a melody [tunefulness]</p><p><b>Dajte mi melodiju za... (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> supply a melody for [melodize]</p><p><b>Dajte mi melodiju za... (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> supply a melody for [melodise]</p><p><b>melodrama</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an extravagant comedy in which action is more salient than characterization</p><p><b>Imaju uzbuđenje i emocionalnu privlačnost melodrama., karakteristika glume ili pozorničkog nastupa (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the excitement and emotional appeal of melodrama</p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of acting or a stage performance [histrionic]</p><p><b>Kao u melodrami., Na previše emocionalni način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> as in a melodrama</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an overly emotional manner</p><p><b>arija, melodija, napjev, pjesma, skladnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a succession of notes forming a distinctive sequence [air, line, melodic line, melodic phrase, strain, tune]</p><p><i>n.</i> the perception of pleasant arrangements of musical notes [tonal pattern]</p><p><b>čep s rupama na prstima na kojima se svira melodija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> reed pipe with finger holes on which the melody is played [chanter]</p><p><b>rod Mustelidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Mustelidae [genus Melogale]</p><p><b>Bube koji proizvode izlučivanje koje stvara mjehuriće na koži (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> beetle that produces a secretion that blisters the skin [blister beetle]</p><p><b>Blister brojevi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> blister beetles [family Meloidae]</p><p><b>rod Melolonthidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Melolonthidae [genus Melolontha]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih velikih europskih buba koji uništavaju vegetaciju kao ličinke i odrasli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various large European beetles destructive to vegetation as both larvae and adult [May beetle, May bug, cockchafer]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih buba iz obitelji (ili podoblike) Melolonthidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various beetles of the family (or subfamily) Melolonthidae</p><p><b>smatraju zasebnom obitelji u nekim sustavima klasifikacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> considered a separate family in some classification systems [subfamily Melolonthidae]</p><p><b>dinja, lubenica, pipun, ružičast, ružičaste boje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous fruits of the gourd family having