ardacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mild mental retardation [moronity]</p><p><b>Inteligencija koja se otkriva brzinom i budnošću uma. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intelligence as revealed by quickness and alertness of mind [nimbleness]</p><p><b>bilo kakve bolesti uma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any disease of the mind [mental illness, psychopathy]</p><p><b>(psihijatrija) psihološki poremećaj misli ili osjećaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychiatry) a psychological disorder of thought or emotion [disturbance, folie, mental disturbance, psychological disorder]</p><p><b>(psihijatrija) psihološki poremećaj misli ili osjećaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychiatry) a psychological disorder of thought or emotion [disturbance, folie, mental disorder, psychological disorder]</p><p><b>Svaka od sljedećih vrsta: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an actuating force or factor [psychic energy]</p><p><b>iscrpljenost koja utječe na mentalnu oštrinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> exhaustion that affects mental keenness [brain-fag]</p><p><b>mentalna sposobnost, sposobnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the inherent cognitive or perceptual powers of the mind [faculty, module]</p><p><b>mentalno zdravlje, duševno zdravlje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the psychological state of someone who is functioning at a satisfactory level of emotional and behavioral adjustment</p><p><b>mentalna bolnica, mentalna ustanova, psihijatrijska bolnica, psihijatrijska ustanova, sanatorij, žuta kuća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hospital for mentally incompetent or unbalanced person [asylum, insane asylum, institution, mental hospital, mental institution, psychiatric hospital]</p><p><b>mentalna bolnica, mentalna ustanova, psihijatrijska bolnica, psihijatrijska ustanova, sanatorij, žuta kuća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hospital for mentally incompetent or unbalanced person [asylum, insane asylum, institution, mental home, mental institution, psychiatric hospital]</p><p><b>mentalna higijena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of psychiatry concerned with psychological methods [psychotherapeutics, psychotherapy]</p><p><b>mentalna bolest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any disease of the mind [mental disease, psychopathy]</p><p><b>slika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an iconic mental representation [image]</p><p><b>mašta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ability to form mental images of things or events [imagery, imagination, imaging]</p><p><b>mentalna bolnica, mentalna ustanova, psihijatrijska bolnica, psihijatrijska ustanova, sanatorij, žuta kuća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hospital for mentally incompetent or unbalanced person [asylum, insane asylum, institution, mental home, mental hospital, psychiatric hospital]</p><p><b>mentalni leksikon, leksikon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a language user's knowledge of words [lexicon, vocabulary]</p><p><b>Opći pojam koji se koristi za sve primjene mjeračkih tehnika za kvantifikaciju mentalnih funkcija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a generic term used to cover any application of measurement techniques to the quantification of mental functions</p><p><b>posebnu pažnju s namjerom da se sjetite (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> special attention with intent to remember</p><p><b>mentalni sadržaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sum or range of what has been perceived, discovered, or learned [cognitive content, content]</p><p><b>mentalna slika, slika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clear and telling mental image [impression, picture]</p><p><b>(psikološka) izvedba neke složene kognitivne aktivnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) the performance of some composite cognitive activity [cognitive operation, cognitive process, operation, process]</p><p><b>Inteligencija koja se otkriva sposobnošću davanja ispravnih odgovora bez odlaganja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intelligence as revealed by an ability to give correct responses without delay [quick-wittedness, quickness]</p><p><b>nepovjerenje, nevjerica, nevjerovanje, skepsa, skeptičnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> doubt about the truth of something [disbelief, incredulity, skepticism]</p><p><b>mentalno predočavanje, predočavanje, p