jedinjenih Država s bijelim stabljikama i zubnim lišćama koje se uzgajaju zbog svojih velikih blijedožutih cvijeća koji se otvaraju rano ujutro (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> biennial of southwestern United States having white stems and toothed leaves that is grown for its large pale yellow flowers that open in early morning [Mentzelia livicaulis, blazing star]</p><p><b>godišnji biljci koji se uzgajaju posebno zbog mirisnih zlatnih noćnih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annual grown especially for its fragrant golden nocturnal flowers [bartonia]</p><p><b>dvostruko iz jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država s bijelim stabljikama i zubnim lišćama koje se uzgajaju zbog svojih velikih blijedožutih cvijeća koji se otvaraju rano ujutro (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> biennial of southwestern United States having white stems and toothed leaves that is grown for its large pale yellow flowers that open in early morning [Mentzelia laevicaulis, blazing star]</p><p><b>izbor, izbornik, izbornika, jelovnik, meni, menu, popis mogućih postupaka (u računalu), jestvenik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a list of dishes available at a restaurant [bill of fare, card, carte, carte du jour]</p><p><i>n.</i> the dishes making up a meal</p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a list of options available to a computer user [computer menu]</p><p><i>n.</i> an agenda of things to do [fare]</p><p><b>Yehudi Menuhin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> British violinist (born in the United States) who began his career as a child prodigy in the 1920s (1916-1999) [Sir Yehudi Menuhin, Yehudi Menuhin]</p><p><b>vrsta i jedini rod obitelji Menuridae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type and sole genus of the family Menuridae [genus Menura]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lyrebirds and scrubbirds [suborder Menurae]</p><p><b>ptice lire (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lyrebirds [family Menuridae]</p><p><b>biljka iz porodice Gentianales (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dicotyledonous family of marsh plants of order Gentianales [buckbean family, family Menyanthaceae]</p><p><b>tip rod Menyanthaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the type genus of the Menyanthaceae [genus Menyanthes]</p><p><b>višegodišnja biljka iz Europe i Amerike s bijelog ili ljubičasto-bijelijim cvjetovima i intenzivno gorkim trifolijatnim listovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial plant of Europe and America having racemes of white or purplish flowers and intensely bitter trifoliate leaves [bog myrtle, bogbean, buckbean, marsh trefoil, water shamrock]</p><p><b>ljeploviti grmovi Sjeverne Amerike i istočne Azije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous shrubs of North America and eastern Asia [genus Menziesia]</p><p><b>Škrgajući grm sjeverozapadne Sjeverne Amerike s lišćem s plavkastim tonom i čvorovima malih cvjetova u obliku zvona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> straggling shrub of northwestern North America having foliage with a bluish tinge and umbels of small bell-shaped flowers [false azalea, fool's huckleberry]</p><p><b>niski grm istočne Sjedinjenih Država s podvijama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low shrub of the eastern United States with downy twigs [minnie bush, minniebush]</p><p><b>mačji plač, mijauk, mjaukati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sound made by a cat (or any sound resembling this) [mew, miaou, miaow, miaul]</p><p><i>v.</i> cry like a cat [mew]</p><p><b>lijek (trgovinski naziv Atabrine) koji se koristi za liječenje određenih zaraza crvima i koji se jednom koristio za liječenje malarije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug (trade name Atabrine) used to treat certain worm infestations and once used to treat malaria [Atabrine, quinacrine, quinacrine hydrochloride]</p><p><b>sintetički narkotni lijek (trgovinski naziv Demerol) koji se koristi za liječenje boli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a synthetic narcotic drug (trade name Demerol) used to treat pain [Demerol, meperidine hydrochloride]</p><p><b>sintetički narkotni lijek (trgovinski naziv Demerol) koji se koristi za liječenje boli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a synthetic narcotic drug (trade name Demerol) used to treat pain [Demerol, meperidine]</p><p><b>lijek protiv malarije (trgovinski naziv Larium i Mephaquine) koji je učinkovit u slučajevima kada klorokin ne reagira na lijekove. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antimalarial drug (trade name Larium and Mephaquine) that is effective in cases that do not respond to chloroquine [Larium, mefloquine, mefloquine hydrochloride]</p><p><b>toksični antikonvulzivni lijek (trgovinski naziv Mesantoin) koji se koristi u liječenju epilepsije kada manje toksični antikonvulzivni lijekovi nisu djelotvorni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a toxic anticonvulsant drug (trade name Mesantoin) used in the treatment of epilepsy when less toxic anticonvulsants have been ineffective [Mesantoin]</p><p><b>pokazuju lukavost ili izumljivost ili zlo tipično za đavla (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> showing the cunning or ingenuity or wickedness typical of a devil [devilish, diabolic, diabolical, mephistophelian]</p><p><b>Mefisto</b></p><p><i>n.</i> evil spirit to whom Faust sold his soul</p><p><b>pokazuju lukavost ili izumljivost ili zlo tipično za đavla (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> showing the cunning or ingenuity or wickedness typical of a devil [devilish, diabolic, diabolical, mephistophelean]</p><p><b>Odstupanje od štetnog smrada od onečišćenja zraka (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of noxious stench from atmospheric pollution [miasmic]</p><p><b>poddijeljenje ne koristi se u nekim klasifikacijama: skunks (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> subdivision not used in some classifications: skunks [subfamily Mephitinae]</p><p><b>smrad, vonj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a poisonous or foul smelling gas emitted from the earth</p><p><i>n.</i> a distinctive odor that is offensively unpleasant [fetor, foetor, malodor, malodour, reek, stench, stink]</p><p><i>n.</i> in some classifications: type genus of the subfamily Mephitinae [genus Mephitis]</p><p><b>U Meksiku i najjužnijim dijelovima jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> of Mexico and southernmost parts of southwestern United States [hooded skunk]</p>