>n.</i> acid dye in which the negative ion contains a chelated metal atom</p><p><b>nemetal</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or being a nonmetallic element that has some of the properties of metal</p><p><b>S druge vrste: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to metallurgy [metallurgical]</p><p><b>metalurškog</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to metallurgy [metallurgic]</p><p><b>Inženjer obučen za ekstrakciju i rafiniranje i legiranje i proizvodnju metala. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an engineer trained in the extraction and refining and alloying and fabrication of metals [metallurgist]</p><p><b>Inženjer obučen za ekstrakciju i rafiniranje i legiranje i proizvodnju metala. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an engineer trained in the extraction and refining and alloying and fabrication of metals [metallurgical engineer]</p><p><b>kovinarstvo, metalurgija, metalurgija badenska, topljenje metal</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the science and technology of metals</p><p><b>S druge strane, od metala, osim od metala, za kućanstvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> household articles made of metal (especially for use at table)</p><p><b>metalna stolarija, muški ručni rad, obrađivanje kovine</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the metal parts of something</p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of making things out of metal in a skillful manner [metalworking]</p><p><b>metalna stolarija, muški ručni rad, obrađivanje kovine (od &quot;metalwork&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who works metal (especially by hammering it when it is hot and malleable) [smith]</p><p><b>obrada metala</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of making things out of metal in a skillful manner [metalwork]</p><p><b>s masom od 10 kg ili većom, ali ne većom od 10 kg, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vise with two parallel iron jaws and a wide opening below [machinist's vise]</p><p><b>ljevaonica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> factory where metal castings are produced [foundry]</p><p><b>metamatematika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the logical analysis of mathematical reasoning</p><p><b>jedan od niza sličnih dijelova tijela u koje su neke životinje podeljene uzdužno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of a series of similar body segments into which some animals are divided longitudinally [somite]</p><p><b>s dijelom tijela podijeljenim na uzastopne metamere ili segmente, kao kod zemljanih crva ili jastoga (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the body divided into successive metameres or segments, as in earthworms or lobsters [segmental, segmented]</p><p><b>S druge vrste:, koji se karakteriziraju metamorfozom ili promjenom fizičkog oblika ili tvari (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to metamorphosis (especially of rocks) [metamorphous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by metamorphosis or change in physical form or substance</p><p><b>Skampi koji su promijenjeni pritiskom i toplinom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rock altered by pressure and heat</p><p><b>metamorfizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> change in the structure of rock by natural agencies such as pressure or heat or introduction of new chemical substances</p><p><b>Oštećenje vida u kojem se čini da su predmeti iskrivljeni. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a defect of vision in which objects appear to be distorted</p><p><b>izmijeniti, mijenjati, preobraziti, pretvoriti, pretvoriti u nešto drugo, promijeniti, metamorfozirati se, preoblikovati se, preobličiti se, preobličivati se, preobraziti se, preobražavati se, pretvarati se, pretvoriti se, transformirati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> change completely the nature or appearance of [transfigure, transmogrify]</p><p><i>v.</i> change in outward structure or looks [transform, transmute]</p><p><b>metamorfoza, metamorfozom, pretvorba, preobrazba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the marked and rapid transformation of a larva into an adult that occurs in some animals [metabolism]</p><p><i>n.</i> a striking change in appearance or character or circumstances [transfiguration]</p><p><i>n.</i> a complete change of physical form or substance especially as by magic or witchcraft</p><p><b>S druge vrste:, proizvodi se metamorfozom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to metamorphosis (especially of rocks) [metamorphic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> produced by metamorphosis</p><p><b>Drugi stupanj mejoze, Drugi stupanj mitoze (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second stage of meiosis</p><p><i>n.</i> the second stage of mitosis</p><p><b>metafora, uspoređenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a figure of speech in which an expression is used to refer to something that it does not literally denote in order to suggest a similarity</p><p><b>metafora, uspoređenje (od &quot;metaphor&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> expressing one thing in terms normally denoting another [metaphorical]</p><p><b>metaforički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> expressing one thing in terms normally denoting another [metaphoric]</p><p><b>metaforički</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a metaphorical manner</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom proteina od 0,5% do 0,5% u prosjeku, ali ne više od 0,5% u prosjeku, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a glassy solid acid ([HPO3]n) often used as a dehydrating agent</p><p><b>apstraktni, metafizički, apstraktan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to or of the nature of metaphysics</p><p><i>adj.</i> transcending physical matter or the laws of nature</p><p><i>adj.</i> highly abstract and overly theoretical</p><p><b>apstraktni, metafizički, apstraktan (od &quot;metaphysical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a metaphysical manner</p><p><b>metafizika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the philosophical study of being and knowing</p><p><b>metafiza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the growing part of a long bone between the diaphysis and the epiphysis</p><p><b>pernizna anemija u kojoj se različiti elementi koji se formiraju u krvi mijenjaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pernicious anemia in which the various formed elements in the blood are changed [metaplastic anemia]</p><p><b>pernizna anemija u kojoj se različiti elementi koji se formiraju u krvi mijenjaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pernicious anemia in which the various formed elements in the blood are changed [metaplastic anaemia]</p><p><b>bronhodilatator (trgovinski naziv Alupent) koji se koristi za liječenje astme i emfizema i drugih plućnih bolesti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bronchodilator (trade name Alupent) used to treat asthma and emphysema and other lung conditions [Alupent]</p><p><b>Pravilo koje opisuje kako se druga pravila trebaju koristiti (kao u AI) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rule that describes how other rules should be used (as in AI)</p><p><b>veliko brzo rastuće kinesko jednojedno stablo s ravnim svijetlo zelenim listnim listovima i malim kugličnim čunjama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large fast-growing Chinese monoecious tree having flat bright-green deciduous leaves and small globular cones [Metasequoia glyptostrodoides, dawn redwood]</p><p><b>veliko brzo rastuće kinesko jednojedno stablo s ravnim svijetlo zelenim listnim listovima i malim kugličnim čunjama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large fast-growing Chinese monoecious tree having flat bright-green deciduous leaves and small globular cones [dawn redwood, metasequoia]</p><p><b>metastabilnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of a physical system that persists in its existing equilibrium when undisturbed (or only slightly disturbed) but able to pass to a more stable equilibrium when sufficiently disturbed</p><p><b>metastabilan, metastabilni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of physical systems) continuing in its present state of equilibrium unless sufficiently disturbed to pass to a more stable state of equilibrium</p><p><b>metastaza, metastaziranje, Metastaze</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the spreading of a disease (especially cancer) to another part of the body</p><p><b>širenje po cijelom tijelu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> spread throughout the body [metastasize]</p><p><b>širenje po cijelom tijelu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> spread throughout the body [metastasise]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na metastaze ili na koje utječu metastaze (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or affected by metastasis</p><p><b>maligni tumor koji se može proširiti na druge dijelove tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tumor that is malignant and tends to spread to other parts of the body [malignant neoplasm, malignant tumor]</p><p><b>bilo koja kost stopala između gležnja i prstiju, od ili u vezi s metatarsusom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any bone of the foot between the ankle and the toes</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the metatarsus</p><p><b>kratki bočni luk koji čine glave metatarzala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the short lateral arch formed by the heads of the metatarsals</p><p><b>dorsalne i plantarne arterije do metatarzalne regije stopala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dorsal and plantar arteries to the metatarsal region of the foot [arteria metatarsea]</p><p><b>dorsalne i plantarne grane vena koje služe metatarzalnom području stopala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dorsal and plantar branches of veins serving the metatarsal region of the foot [vena metatarsus]</p><p><b>Skelet ljudskog stopala između prstiju i tarsa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the skeleton of the human foot between the toes and the tarsus</p><p><b>podrazred Metatheria, podrazred tobolčara, tobolčari</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pouched animals [subclass Metatheria]</p><p><b>tobolčar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> primitive pouched mammals found mainly in Australia and the Americas</p><p><b>metateza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a linguistic process of transposition of sounds or syllables within a word or words within a sentence</p><p><i>n.</i> a chemical reaction between two compounds in which parts of each are interchanged to form two new compounds (AB+CD=AD+CB) [double decomposition, double decomposition reaction]</p><p><b>bitka tijekom drugog Punskog rata (207. pne.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle during the second Punic War (207 BC)</p><p><b>podcarstvo Metazoa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> multicellular animals having cells differentiated into tissues and organs and usually a digestive cavity and nervous system [subkingdom Metazoa]</p><p><b>bilo koja životinja podkraljevstva Metazoa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any animal of the subkingdom Metazoa</p><p><b>Ruski bakteriolog u Francuskoj koji je formulirao teoriju fagocitoze (1845-1916) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian bacteriologist in France who formulated the theory of phagocytosis (1845-1916) [Elie Metchnikoff, Elie Metchnikov, Ilya Ilich Metchnikov, Metchnikov]</p><p><b>Ruski bakteriolog u Francuskoj koji je formulirao teoriju fagocitoze (1845-1916) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian bacteriologist in France who formulated the theory of phagocytosis (1845-1916) [Elie Metchnikoff, Elie Metchnikov, Ilya Ilich Metchnikov, Metchnikoff]</p><p><b>razgraničenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a line that indicates a boundary [border, borderline, boundary line, delimitation]</p><p><b>dati, davati, dijeliti, podijeliti, porazdijeliti, porazdjeljivati, razdati, razdavati, razdijeliti, razdjeljivati, udijeliti, udjeljivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> administer or bestow, as in small portions [administer, allot, deal, deal out, dish out, dispense, distribute, dole out, lot, parcel out, shell out]</p><p><b>isporučuje se u porcijama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> given out in portions [apportioned, dealt out, doled out, parceled out]</p><p><b>Nakon smrti duša počinje novi ciklus postojanja u drugom ljudskom tijelu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> after death the soul begins a new cycle of existence in another human body [rebirth]</p><p><b>dio stražnjeg mozga koji se razvija u pons i cerebellum (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of the hindbrain that develops into the pons and the cerebellum</p><p><b>meteor, meteoroid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (astronomy) any of the small solid extraterrestrial bodies that hits the earth's atmosphere [meteoroid]</p><p><i>n.</i> a streak of light in the sky at night that results when a meteoroid hits the earth's atmosphere and air friction causes the meteoroid to melt or vaporize or explode [shooting star]</p><p><b>prolazna kiša meteorima kada meteorski roj uđe u Zemljinu atmosferu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transient shower of meteors when a meteor swarm enters the earth's atmosphere [meteor stream]</p><p><b>prolazna kiša meteorima kada meteorski roj uđe u Zemljinu atmosferu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transient shower of meteors when a meteor swarm enters the earth's atmosphere [meteor shower]</p><p><b>kiša meteora</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of meteoroids with similar paths</p><p><b>meteorski, meteorološki</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to atmospheric phenomena, especially weather and weather conditions [meteorologic, meteorological]</p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to or consisting of meteors or meteoroids</p><p><i>adj.</i> like a meteor in speed or brilliance or transience</p><p><b>meteorit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stony or metallic object that is the remains of a meteoroid that has reached the earth's surface</p><p><b>od ili povezanih s meteoriti ili uzrokovane njima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or caused by meteorites [meteoritical]</p><p><b>od ili povezanih s meteoriti ili uzrokovane njima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or caused by meteorites [meteoritic]</p><p><b>meteor, meteoroid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (astronomy) any of the small solid extraterrestrial bodies that hits the earth's atmosphere [meteor]</p><p><b>meteorološki</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to atmospheric phenomena, especially weather and weather conditions [meteoric, meteorological]</p><p><b>meteorološki, meteorološkom, meteorološka, meteorološke</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to atmospheric phenomena, especially weather and weather conditions [meteoric, meteorologic]</p><p><b>mali bespilotni balon postavljen u zrak za promatranje atmosferskih uvjeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small unmanned balloon set aloft to observe atmospheric conditions</p><p><b>meteorološki uvjeti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the prevailing environmental conditions as they influence the prediction of weather</p><p><b>U slučaju meteoroloških podataka, za svaki meteorološki datum se može koristiti sljedeći sustav: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of a network of observation posts where meteorological data is recorded [weather station]</p><p><b>satelit koji prenosi često sliku Zemlje ispod. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a satellite that transmits frequent picture of the earth below [weather satellite]</p><p><b>meteorološki, meteorološkom, meteorološka, meteorološke (od &quot;meteorological&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with respect to the weather</p><p><b>stručnjak koji proučava procese u zemaljskom ozračju koji uzrokuju vremenske uvjete (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a specialist who studies processes in the earth's atmosphere that cause weather conditions</p><p><b>atmosferske pro, meteorologija, vremenoslovlje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> predicting what the weather will be [weather forecasting]</p><p><i>n.</i> the earth science dealing with phenomena of the atmosphere (especially weather)</p><p><b>U slučaju da se primjenjuje primjena ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći uvjet: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an effect of climate on biological processes (as the effect on joint pains etc.)</p><p><b>brojač, brojilo, metar, metara, mjera stiha, stopa, mjerač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of length adopted under the Systeme International d'Unites (approximately 1.094 yards) [m, metre]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various measuring instruments for measuring a quantity</p><p><i>n.</i> (prosody) the accent in a metrical foot of verse [beat, cadence, measure, metre]</p><p><i>n.</i> rhythm as given by division into parts of equal duration [metre, time]</p><p><i>v.</i> measure with a meter</p><p><i>v.</i> stamp with a meter indicating the postage</p><p><b>policajka koja je dodijeljena da piše kazne za parkiranje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> policewoman who is assigned to write parking tickets</p><p><b>očitanje brojača ili mjerača, očitanje, vrijednost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a datum about some physical state that is presented to a user by a meter or similar instrument [indication, reading]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of measuring with meters or similar ins