 (trade name Methedrine) used in the form of a crystalline hydrochloride [Methedrine, chalk, chicken feed, crank, deoxyephedrine, glass, ice, meth, methamphetamine hydrochloride, shabu, trash]</p><p><b>Amfetamin (metedrina) u obliku kristalnog hidroklorida (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amphetamine derivative (trade name Methedrine) used in the form of a crystalline hydrochloride [Methedrine, chalk, chicken feed, crank, deoxyephedrine, glass, ice, meth, methamphetamine, shabu, trash]</p><p><b>bezbojni otrovni plin (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless poisonous gas [formaldehyde]</p><p><b>metan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless odorless gas used as a fuel</p><p><b>alifati, alkan, alkani, homologni niz alkana, parafin, zasićeni ugljikovodici</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a series of non-aromatic saturated hydrocarbons with the general formula CnH(2n+2) [alkane, alkane series, paraffin, paraffin series]</p><p><b>Arheobakterije koje se nalaze u anaerobnim sredinama kao što su crijevni trakt ili sedimenti životinja ili kanalizacija i koje mogu proizvoditi metan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> archaebacteria found in anaerobic environments such as animal intestinal tracts or sediments or sewage and capable of producing methane</p><p><b>metanol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a light volatile flammable poisonous liquid alcohol [methyl alcohol, wood alcohol, wood spirit]</p><p><b>antihistamin koji se koristi za liječenje alergijskih reakcija (kao što su rinitis ili dermatitis ili svrbež) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antihistamine used to treat allergic responses (as rhinitis or dermatitis or pruritus)</p><p><b>lijek za sedativno-hipnotični lijek (trgovinski naziv Quaalude) koji je lijek za zloupotrebu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sedative-hypnotic drug (trade name Quaalude) that is a drug of abuse [Quaalude]</p><p><b>lijek protiv konvulzija (trgovinski naziv Gemonil) koji se koristi za liječenje epilepsije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> anticonvulsant drug (trade name Gemonil) used in the treatment of epilepsy [Gemonil]</p><p><b>Amfetamin (metedrina) u obliku kristalnog hidroklorida (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amphetamine derivative (trade name Methedrine) used in the form of a crystalline hydrochloride [chalk, chicken feed, crank, deoxyephedrine, glass, ice, meth, methamphetamine, methamphetamine hydrochloride, shabu, trash]</p><p><b>zalihe od: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spiced or medicated mead</p><p><b>antibakterijski sredstvo (trgovinski nazivi Mandelamin i Urex) koje se nalazi u mnogim proizvodima koji se koriste za liječenje infekcija mokraćnih puteva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antibacterial agent (trade names Mandelamine and Urex) that is contained in many products that are used to treat urinary infections [Mandelamine, Urex]</p><p><b>antibiotički lijekovi iz obitelji penicilina koji se koriste u liječenju određenih infekcija stafilokokom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antibiotic drug of the penicillin family used in the treatment of certain staphylococcal infections</p><p><b>metionin, metioninski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a crystalline amino acid containing sulfur</p><p><b>mišićni relaksant za skeletne mišiće (trgovinski naziv Robaxin) koji se koristi za liječenje grčeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> muscle relaxant for skeletal muscles (trade name Robaxin) used to treat spasms [Robaxin]</p><p><b>metoda, način, postupak, metode, metodom, metodu, sistem</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a way of doing something, especially a systematic way</p><p><i>n.</i> an acting technique introduced by Stanislavsky in which the actor recalls emotions or reactions from his or her own life and uses them to identify with the character being portrayed [method acting]</p><p><b>glumačka tehnika koju je predstavio Stanislavski u kojoj glumac prisjeća osjećaja ili reakcija iz svog života i koristi ih da se poistovjeti s likom koji se prikazuje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acting technique introduced by Stanislavsky in which the actor recalls emotions or reactions from his or her own life and uses them to identify with the character being portrayed [method]</p><p><b>Članak 4. stavak 1. točka (a) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bookkeeper's chronological list of related debits and credits of a business [accounting, accounting system]</p><p><b>Najbolja metoda za postizanje željenog rezultata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the best method to achieve a desired result</p><p><b>metoda fluksija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of calculus that deals with the variation of a function with respect to changes in the independent variable (or variables) by means of the concepts of derivative and differential [differential calculus]</p><p><b>metoda najmanjih kvadrata</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of fitting a curve to data points so as to minimize the sum of the squares of the distances of the points from the curve [least squares]</p><p><b>metodičan, planski, promišljen, sistematski, sustavan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by method and orderliness</p><p><b>metodičan, planski, promišljen, sistematski, sustavan (od &quot;methodical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a methodical manner</p><p><b>metodičan, planski, promišljen, sistematski, sustavan (od &quot;methodical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of appreciating method and system [orderliness]</p><p><b>vjerska uvjerenja i prakse metodista koji se odlikuju briga za socijalnu dobrobit i javni moral (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the religious beliefs and practices of Methodists characterized by concern with social welfare and public morals</p><p><b>metodist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a follower of Wesleyanism as practiced by the Methodist Church</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to or characteristic of the branch of Protestantism adhering to the views of Wesley [Wesleyan]</p><p><b>protestantska denominacija utemeljena na načelima Johna Wesleya i Charlesa Wesleya (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Protestant denomination founded on the principles of John Wesley and Charles Wesley [Methodists]</p><p><b>skupina metodističkih skupština (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> group of Methodist congregations</p><p><b>metodist (od &quot;methodist&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Protestant denomination founded on the principles of John Wesley and Charles Wesley [Methodist Church]</p><p><b>metodološki, metodološkog</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to the methodology of some discipline</p><p><b>grana filozofije koja analizira principe i postupke istraživanja u određenoj disciplini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of philosophy that analyzes the principles and procedures of inquiry in a particular discipline [methodology]</p><p><b>metodološki</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a methodical manner</p><p><b>metodika, metododika, metodologija, metodologiju</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of philosophy that analyzes the principles and procedures of inquiry in a particular discipline [methodological analysis]</p><p><i>n.</i> the system of methods followed in a particular discipline</p><p><b>metotreksat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> toxic antimetabolite that limits cellular reproduction by acting as an antagonist to folic acid [amethopterin, methotrexate sodium]</p><p><b>toksični antimetabolit koji ograničava staničnu reprodukciju djelujući kao antagonist folne kiseline (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> toxic antimetabolite that limits cellular reproduction by acting as an antagonist to folic acid [amethopterin, methotrexate]</p><p><b>Metušalah</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Old Testament) a patriarch (grandfather of Noah) who is said to have lived 969 years</p><p><i>n.</i> a man who is very old [graybeard, greybeard, old man]</p><p><b>metil</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the univalent radical CH3- derived from methane [methyl group, methyl radical]</p><p><b>lakto nestabilan zapaljivi otrovni tekući alkohol (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a light volatile flammable poisonous liquid alcohol [methanol, wood alcohol, wood spirit]</p><p><b>Odnosno, za proizvodnju proizvoda iz članka 1. stavka 1. točke (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći postupak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a poisonous gas or liquid (CH3Br) used to fumigate rodents, worms, etc.</p><p><b>bezbojni rastvorljivi zapaljivi tekući keton koji se koristi kao rastvarač za smole i kao sredstvo za uklanjanje boje te u lakovima i cementu i ljepilnim sredstvima i tekućinama za čišćenje i celuloidu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> colorless soluble flammable liquid ketone used as a solvent for resins and as a paint remover and in lacquers and cements and adhesives and cleaning fluids and celluloid [butanone]</p><p><b>Jednovalentni radikal CH3- dobiven iz metana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the univalent radical CH3- derived from methane [methyl, methyl radical]</p><p><b>za proizvodnju proizvoda od kiseline ili kiseline (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an azo dye used as an acid-base indicator</p><p><b>bilo koji od tri otrovna bezbojna izomerna fenola (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of three poisonous colorless isomeric phenols [cresol]</p><p><b>Jednovalentni radikal CH3- dobiven iz metana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the univalent radical CH3- derived from methane [methyl, methyl group]</p><p><b>u obliku tekućeg estera s jakim mirisom zimskog zelenog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a liquid ester with a strong odor of wintergreen [birch oil, sweet-birch oil]</p><p><b>nakon primjene metilne skupine (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having received a methyl group</p><p><b>S druge strane, za proizvodnju alkoholnih pića od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiseline ili drugih kiselina od kiselina ili drugih kiselina od kiselina ili od kiselina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ethyl alcohol denatured with methyl alcohol to prevent its use as an alcoholic beverage</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,25% ili više, ali ne više od 0,25%, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless flammable liquid obtained from petroleum or coal tar [toluene]</p><p><b>metildopa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antihypertensive drug (trade name Aldomet) used in the treatment of high blood pressure [Aldomet, alpha methyl dopa]</p><p><b>metilen</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the bivalent radical CH2 derived from methane [methylene group, methylene radical]</p><p><b>metilensko plavo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dark green dye used as a stain, an antiseptic, a chemical indicator, and an antidote in cyanide poisoning [methylthionine chloride]</p><p><b>diklormetan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nonflammable liquid used as a solvent and paint remover and refrigerant [dichloromethane]</p><p><b>bivalentni radikal CH2 dobiven iz metana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the bivalent radical CH2 derived from methane [methylene, methylene radical]</p><p><b>bivalentni radikal CH2 dobiven iz metana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the bivalent radical CH2 derived from methane [methylene, methylene group]</p><p><b>stimulans koji je kemijski povezan s meskalinom i amfetaminom i koji se koristi nezakonito zbog svojih euforičnih i halucinogenih učinaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stimulant drug that is chemically related to mescaline and amphetamine and is used illicitly for its euphoric and hallucinogenic effects [MDMA]</p><p><b>stimulans centralnog živčanog sustava (trgovinski naziv Ritalin) koji se koristi u liječenju narkolepsije kod odraslih i poremećaja nedostatka pažnje kod djece (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> central nervous system stimulant (trade name Ritalin) used in the treatment of narcolepsy in adults and attention deficit disorder in children [Ritalin]</p><p><b>Androgeno jedinjenje koje se nalazi u lijekovima koji se koriste za liječenje nedostatka testosterona i raka dojke kod žena te za stimulaciju rasta i povećanja tjelesne težine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an androgenic compound contained in drugs that are used to treat testosterone deficiency and female breast cancer and to stimulate growth and weight gain</p><p><b>tamnozelena boja koja se koristi kao bledilo, antiseptik, kemijski indikator i protivotrov za trovanje cijanidom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dark green dye used as a stain, an antiseptic, a chemical indicator, and an antidote in cyanide poisoning [methylene blue]</p><p><b>stranca koji je plaćao da bi živio u drevnom grčkom gradu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an alien who paid a fee to reside in an ancient Greek city</p><p><b>osnovna jedinica novca u Mozambiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Mozambique</p><p><b>dehidrogenizirani analog kortizola (trgovinski nazivi Orasone ili Deltasone ili Liquid Pred ili Meticorten) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dehydrogenated analogue of cortisol (trade names Orasone or Deltasone or Liquid Pred or Meticorten) [Deltasone, Liquid Pred, Orasone, prednisone]</p><p><b>strogo pažnje na sitne detalje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> strict attention to minute details [meticulousness, punctiliousness, scrupulousness]</p><p><b>cjepidlaka, pedantan, pretjeran točan, previše pedantan (kritičan), sitničar, sitničav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by precise accordance with details [punctilious]</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by extreme care in treatment of details</p><p><b>studiozno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a meticulous manner</p><p><b>cjepidlaka, pedantan, pretjeran točan, previše pedantan (kritičan), sitničar, sitničav (od &quot;meticulous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> strict attention to minute details [meticulosity, punctiliousness, scrupulousness]</p><p><b>forte, jaka točka, jača strana, snaga, specijalnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an asset of special worth or utility [forte, long suit, speciality, specialty, strength, strong point, strong suit]</p><p><i>n.</i> an occupation for which you are especially well suited [medium]</p><p><b>osoba u zapadnoj Kanadi koja je kaukasijskog i američkog indijanskog porijekla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person in western Canada who is of Caucasian and American Indian ancestry</p><p><b>riječ koja označava jednu stvar ali se odnosi na srodnu stvar. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word that denotes one thing but refers to a related thing</p><p><b>korištenje imena jedne stvari za ono drugo s kojim je usko povezano (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> using the name of one thing for that of another with which it is closely associated [metonymical]</p><p><b>korištenje imena jedne stvari za ono drugo s kojim je usko povezano (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> using the name of one thing for that of another with which it is closely associated [metonymic]</p><p><b>na metonimni način (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a metonymic manner</p><p><b>metonimija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> substituting the name of an attribute or feature for the name of the thing itself (as in `they counted heads')</p><p><b>Craniometrijska točka na pola puta između prednjih izbočina lubanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the craniometric point midway between the frontal eminences of the skull</p><p><b>beta- blokator (trgovinski naziv Lopressor) koji se koristi za liječenje hipertenzije i angine i aritmije te akutnog infarkta miokarda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> beta blocker (trade name Lopressor) used in treating hypertension and angina and arrhythmia and acute myocardial infarction [Lopressor]</p><p><b>bol u maternici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pain in the uterus</p><p><b>lijek koji se koristi kao stimulansa cirkulacije i disanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug used as a circulatory and respiratory stimulant [pentamethylenetetrazol, pentylenetetrazol]</p><p><b>primjena dovoljno Metrazola za izazivanje konvulzija i kome (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the administration of sufficient Metrazol to induce convulsions and coma [metrazol shock therapy, metrazol shock treatment]</p><p><b>primjena dovoljno Metrazola za izazivanje konvulzija i kome (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the administration of sufficient Metrazol to induce convulsions and coma [metrazol shock, metrazol shock treatment]</p><p><b>primjena dovoljno Metrazola za izazivanje konvulzija i kome (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the administration of sufficient Metrazol to induce convulsions and coma [metrazol shock, metrazol shock therapy]</p><p><b>metar, metara, mjera stiha, stopa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of length adopted under the Systeme International d'Unites (approximately 1.094 yards) [m, meter]</p><p><i>n.</i> (prosody) the accent in a metrical foot of verse [beat, cadence, measure, meter]</p><p><i>n.</i> rhythm as given by division into parts of equal duration [meter, time]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rule one meter long (usually marked off in centimeters and millimeters) [meterstick]</p><p><b>metarski, metrički, metrika, metrička jedinica, mjerni sistem, mjerni sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a function of a topological space that gives, for any two points in the space, a value equal to the distance between them [metric function]</p><p><i>n.</i> a decimal unit of measurement of the metric system (based on meters and kilograms and seconds) [metric unit]</p><p><i>n.</i> a system of related measures that facilitates the quantification of some particular characteristic [system of measurement]</p><p><i>adj.</i> based on the meter as a standard of measurement [metrical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> the rhythmic arrangement of syllables [measured, metrical]</p><p><b>Jedinica kapaciteta definirana u metrijskim terminima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a capacity unit defined in metric terms</p><p><b>funkcija topološkog prostora koja za bilo koje dvije točke u prostoru daje vrijednost jednaku udaljenosti između njih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a function of a topological space that gives, for any two points in the space, a value equal to the distance between them [metric]</p><p><b>za proizvodnju od metala ili od metala: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a weight unit used for pearls or diamonds: 50 mg or 1/4 carat [grain]</p><p><b>centner, kvintal, metrička centa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of weight equal to 100 kilograms [centner, doppelzentner, hundredweight]</p><p><b>linearna jedinica udaljenosti u metrijskim oblicima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a linear unit of distance in metric terms</p><p><b>skup točaka tako da za svaki par točaka postoji ne-negativni stvarni broj koji se zove njihova udaljenost koja je simetrična i zadovoljava nejednakost trokut. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a set of points such that for every pair of points there is a nonnegative real number called their distance that is symmetric and satisfies the triangle inequality</p><p><b>metrički sustav, Međunarodni sustav mjernih jedinica, SI, metrički sistem</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a decimal system of weights and measures based on the meter and the kilogram and the second</p><p><b>metrička tona, MT, t, tona</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of weight equivalent to 1000 kilograms [MT, t, tonne]</p><p><b>metrička jedinica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a decimal unit of measurement of the metric system (based on meters and kilograms and seconds) [metric]</p><p><b>decimalna jedinica mase, metrička jedinica za masu, mjerna jedinica za masu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a decimal unit of weight based on the gram [weight unit]</p><p><b>metričan, metrički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> based on the meter as a standard of measurement [metric]</p><p><i>adj.</i> the rhythmic arrangement of syllables [measured, metric]</p><p><b>(prosodija) skupina od 2 ili 3 sloga koja čine osnovnu jedinicu pjesničkog ritma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (prosody) a group of 2 or 3 syllables forming the basic unit of poetic rhythm [foot, metrical unit]</p><p><b>(prosodija) skupina od 2 ili 3 sloga koja čine osnovnu jedinicu pjesničkog ritma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (prosody) a group of 2 or 3 syllables forming the basic unit of poetic rhythm [foot, metrical foot]</p><p><b>metričan (od &quot;metrical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with regard to meter</p><p><b>prebacivanje iz nemetričkog u metrički sustav (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> convert from a non-metric to the metric system [metricise, metricize, metrify]</p><p><b>prijelaz iz imperijalne jedinice mjerenja u metričke jedinice: metar, gram, sekunda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of changing from imperial units of measurement to metric units: meters, grams, seconds [metrification]</p><p><b>izražavanje u metrijskom sustavu, prebacivanje iz nemetričkog u metrički sustav (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> express in the metric system [metricize]</p><p><i>v.</i> convert from a non-metric to the metric system [metricate, metricize, metrify]</p><p><b>izražavanje u metrijskom sustavu, prebacivanje iz nemetričkog u metrički sustav (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> express in the metric system [metricise]</p><p><i>v.</i> convert from a non-metric to the metric system [metricate, metricise, metrify]</p><p><b>metrika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the study of poetic meter and the art of versification [prosody]</p><p><b>pisanje metrične kompozicije (ili metrične strukture kompozicije), prijelaz iz imperijalne jedinice mjerenja u metričke jedinice: metar, gram, sekunda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> writing a metrical composition (or the metrical structure of a composition)</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of changing from imperial units of measurement to metric units: meters, grams, seconds [metrication]</p><p><b>Napisati poetski metar, prebacivanje iz nemetričkog u metrički sustav (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> compose in poetic meter</p><p><i>v.</i> convert from a non-metric to the metric system [metricate, metricise, metricize]</p><p><b>upale sluznice maternice (endometrija) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of the lining of the uterus (of the endometrium) [endometritis]</p><p><b>metro, podzemna željeznica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electric railway operating below the surface of the ground (usually in a city) [subway, subway system, tube, underground]</p><p><b>metrologija</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to metrology</p><p><b>metrologija, mjeriteljstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the scientific study of measurement</p><p><b>metronidazol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antiprotozoal medication (trade name Flagyl) used to treat trichomoniasis and giardiasis [Flagyl]</p><p><b>metronom, taktomjer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clicking pendulum indicates the exact tempo of a piece of music</p><p><b>tempo glazbe mjereno brojem otkucaja koji se događaju u 60 sekundi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the pace of music measured by the number of beats occurring in 60 seconds [M.M., beats per minute, bpm]</p><p><b>ime koje je izvedeno iz imena vaše majke ili materinog predaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a name derived from the name of your mother or a maternal ancestor [matronymic]</p><p><b>metropola, metropole, prijestolnica, velegrad, grad</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large and densely populated urban area [city, urban center]</p><p><i>n.</i> people living in a large densely populated municipality [city]</p><p><b>arhiepiskop, arhiepiskopski, eparhijski, metropolitanski, mitropolit, prijestolnički, gradski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in the Eastern Orthodox Church this title is given to a position between bishop and patriarch</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who lives in a metropolis</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or characteristic of a metropolis</p><p><b>prolaps maternice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> prolapse of the uterus [descensus uteri]</p><p><b>krvarenje iz maternice koje nije uzrokovano menstruacijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bleeding from the uterus that is not due to menstruation</p><p><b>rod malajskih palmi s pinatnim listovima koji jednom cvjetaju i plodovi i zatim umiru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Malayan pinnate-leaved palm trees that flower and fruit once and then die [genus Metroxylon]</p><p><b>Malezijska palma čiji je trun plod sagua - skroba koja se koristi kao zgušćivač hrane i učvršćivalo tkanine. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Malaysian palm whose pithy trunk yields sago--a starch used as a food thickener and fabric stiffener [true sago palm]</p><p><b>Austrijski državnik (1773-1859) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian statesman (1773-1859) [Klemens Metternich, Prince Klemens Wenzel Nepomuk Lothar von Metternich]</p><p><b>karakter, kov, narav, oduševljenje, temperament, vatrenost, žar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the courage to carry on [heart, nerve, spunk]</p><p><b>imati ponosan i nepokolebljivi duh, voljan da se suoči sa opasnošću. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a proud and unbroken spirit</p><p><i>adj.</i> willing to face danger [game, gamey, gamy, gritty, spirited, spunky]</p><p><b>hrabrost i duhovitost. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> courageous high-spiritedness</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,25% ili više, ali ne više od 0,25%, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compound used in the form of its hydrochloride as a local or spinal anesthetic [piperocaine, piperocaine hydrochloride]</p><p><b>maslac s čistima, pomalo smeđena i začinjena sokom limuna i peršunom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clarified butter browned slowly and seasoned with lemon juice and parsley [lemon butter]</p><p><b>Europska rijeka, Američka operacija u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1918) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a European river [Meuse River]</p><p><i>n.</i> an American operation in World War I (1918) [Argonne, Argonne Forest, Meuse-Argonne, Meuse-Argonne operation, Meuse River]</p><p><b>Europska rijeka, Američka operacija u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1918) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a European river [Meuse]</p><p><i>n.</i> an American operation in World War I (1918) [Argonne, Argonne Forest, Meuse, Meuse-Argonne, Meuse-Argonne operation]</p><p><b>Američka operacija u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1918) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an American operation in World War I (1918) [Argonne, Argonne Forest, Meuse, Meuse-Argonne operation, Meuse River]</p><p><b>Američka operacija u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1918) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an American operation in World War I (1918) [Argonne, Argonne Forest, Meuse, Meuse-Argonne, Meuse River]</p><p><b>oralni lijek (trgovinski naziv Mevacor) za smanjenje razine holesterola u krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an oral drug (trade name Mevacor) to reduce blood cholesterol levels [lovastatin]</p><p><b>galeb, krletka, mijau, mijaukati, mjaukati, zatvoren u kavez</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sound made by a cat (or any sound resembling this) [meow, miaou, miaow, miaul]</p><p><i>n.</i> the common gull of Eurasia and northeastern North America [Larus canus, mew gull, sea mew]</p><p><i>v.</i> cry like a cat [meow]</p><p><i>v.</i> utter a high-pitched cry, as of seagulls</p><p><b>olujni galeb, sivi galeb</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the common gull of Eurasia and northeastern North America [Larus canus, mew, sea mew]</p><p><b>cviliti, cviljeti, jecati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cry weakly or softly [pule, wail, whimper]</p><p><b>konjušnica, nekadašnje staje pregrađene u garaže ili stanove, staja, staje, štala</b></p><p><i>n.</i> street lined with buildings that were originally private stables but have been remodeled as dwellings</p><p><b>Grad u sjeverozapadnom Meksiku blizu granice s Kalifornijom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in northwestern Mexico near the California border</p><p><b>meksički, Meksikanac, meksikanski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or inhabitant of Mexico</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Mexico or its inhabitants</p><p><b>gušter s crnim i žutožutožutih ljuski poput kuglica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lizard with black and yellowish beadlike scales [Heloderma horridum, beaded lizard]</p><p><b>Uvođen u Sjedinjene Države iz Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> introduced into the United States from Mexico [Epilachna varivestis, bean beetle]</p><p><b>Črne trešnje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Mexican black cherry [capulin]</p><p><b>Glavni i najveći grad Meksika je politički i kulturni i komercijalni i industrijski centar (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital and largest city of Mexico is a political and cultural and commercial and industrial center [Ciudad de Mexico, Mexico City, capital of Mexico]</p><p><b>Visoka raširena zimzelena biljka pronađena u Meksiku koja ima spuštene grane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall spreading evergreen found in Mexico having drooping branches [Cupressus lusitanica, Portuguese cypress, cedar of Goa]</p><p><b>Poinsettia iz Sjedinjenih Država i istočnog Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> poinsettia of United States and eastern Mexico [Euphorbia cyathophora, fire-on-the-mountain, painted leaf]</p><p><b>tropska američka biljka s otrovnim mlijekom i najozbiljnijim suvištnim lištima obično crvenokrasnim laticama koje okružuju male žute cvijeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American plant having poisonous milk and showy tapering usually scarlet petallike leaves surrounding small yellow flowers [Christmas flower, Christmas star, Euphorbia pulcherrima, lobster plant, painted leaf, poinsettia]</p><p><b>Obični šišmiša s slobodnim repom iz južnih Sjedinjenih Država s kratkim baršunastim krznom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the common freetail bat of southern United States having short velvety fur [Tadarida brasiliensis, guano bat]</p><p><b>posebno jaka sorta marihuane. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a particularly potent variety of marijuana [Acapulco gold]</p><p><b>bilo koji stari pas od malih gotovo bezdlakavih pasa iz Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of an old breed of small nearly hairless dogs of Mexico</p><p><b>cvjetovica s cvjetnim glavama nalik meksičkom šeširu s visokim crveno-sudanim diskom i spušteni žuti ili žuti i crveno-sudanim zrake (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coneflower with flower heads resembling a Mexican hat with a tall red-brown disk and drooping yellow or yellow and red-brown rays [Ratibida columnaris]</p><p><b>godišnje od Meksika i južnih Sjedinjenih Država koje imaju jestivo ljubičasto viskozno voće slično malim paradajzom, malo jestivo žuto do ljubičasto voće nalik paradajzu zatvoreno u ljusku nalik mjehuru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annual of Mexico and southern United States having edible purplish viscid fruit resembling small tomatoes [Physalis ixocarpa, jamberry, tomatillo]</p><p><i>n.</i> small edible yellow to purple tomato-like fruit enclosed in a bladderlike husk [husk tomato, tomatillo]</p><p><b>Vječna biljka iz Meksika koja je rasla u crvenokrasne cvijeće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect perennial of Mexico having rose to crimson flowers [Agastache mexicana]</p><p><b>Sjemenke meksičkih grmova rod Sebastiana koje sadrže ličinke molja čiji pokreti uzrokuju trzanje ili padanje zrna (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> seed of Mexican shrubs of the genus Sebastiana containing the larva of a moth whose movements cause the bean to jerk or tumble [jumping bean, jumping seed]</p><p><b>malo stablo zapadnog Teksasa i planina Meksika koje ima širenje grana s spuštenih grančica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small tree of western Texas and mountains of Mexico having spreading branches with drooping branchlets [Juniperus flaccida, drooping juniper]</p><p><b>biljka iz Oaxace koja ima snažan halucinogeni učinak. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an herb from Oaxaca that has a powerful hallucinogenic effect [Salvia divinorum]</p><p><b>monetarna jedinica u Meksiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> monetary unit in Mexico</p><p><b>Mali dvostruko- ili trostruko-žiglji pinon iz Meksika i južnog Teksasa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small two-needled or three-needled pinon of Mexico and southern Texas [Pinus cembroides, pinon pine]</p><p><b>tvrdi kompaktni oblik kalcita (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hard compact kind of calcite [alabaster, onyx marble, oriental alabaster]</p><p><b>osnovna jedinica novca u Meksiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Mexico [peso]</p><p><b>veliki džepni miš iz Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large pocket mouse of Mexico [Liomys irroratus]</p><p><b>Jednogodišnje biljke s trnastima stabljikama i velikim žutim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annual herb with prickly stems and large yellow flowers [Argemone mexicana]</p><p><b>revolucija za poljoprivredne reforme koju je na sjeveru Meksika vodio Pancho Villa i na jugu Meksika Emiliano Zapata (1910-1911) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a revolution for agrarian reforms led in northern Mexico by Pancho Villa and in southern Mexico by Emiliano Zapata (1910-1911)</p><p><b>Dialekt španjolskog koji se govori u Meksiku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the dialect of Spanish spoken in Mexico</p><p><b>situacija u kojoj nitko ne može izaći kao jasan pobjednik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a situation in which no one can emerge as a clear winner</p><p><b>biljke iz roda Tithonia (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any plant of the genus Tithonia [tithonia]</p><p><b>cipres iz dolina rijeka u meksičkim visoravnicama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cypress of river valleys of Mexican highlands [Montezuma cypress, Taxodium mucronatum]</p><p><b>Eurasijska aromatična gusinja noga s dubovim listovima s mnogim žuto-zelenim cvijećem, tropska američka svinjska trava sa lošim mirisom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Eurasian aromatic oak-leaved goosefoot with many yellow-green flowers [Atriplex mexicana, Chenopodium botrys, Jerusalem oak, feather geranium]</p><p><i>n.</i> rank-smelling tropical American pigweed [American wormseed, Chenopodium ambrosioides, Spanish tea, wormseed]</p><p><b>Uobičajeno se koristi za proizvodnju i proizvodnju proizvoda od sirovine. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> native of Mexican highlands grown for its glossy clear yellow flowers and blue-grey finely dissected foliage [Hunnemania fumariifolia, golden cup]</p><p><b>Ulica imena za flunitrazepan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> street names for flunitrazepan [R-2, circle, forget me drug, roach, roofy, rope, rophy]</p><p><b>Nakon sporova oko Teksasa, zemlje koje su postale meksičke Sjedinjene Države objavile su rat Meksiku 1846. godine i sporazumom 1848. godine preuzele su Texas i Kaliforniju i Arizonu i Novi Meksiko i Nevada i Utah i dio Kolorada i platile Meksiku 15 milijuna dolara. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> after disputes over Texas lands that were settled by Mexicans the United States declared war on Mexico in 1846 and by treaty in 1848 took Texas and California and Arizona and New Mexico and Nevada and Utah and part of Colorado and paid Mexico $15,000,000</p><p><b>Meksikanci (ili osoba od meksičkog podrijetla) koji žive u Sjedinjenim Državama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Mexican (or person of Mexican descent) living in the United States [Mexicano]</p><p><b>Meksikanci (ili osoba od meksičkog podrijetla) koji žive u Sjedinjenim Državama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Mexican (or person of Mexican descent) living in the United States [Mexican-American]</p><p><b>Meksiko</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in southern North America [United Mexican States]</p><p><b>Glavni i najveći grad Meksika je politički i kulturni i komercijalni i industrijski centar (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital and largest city of Mexico is a political and cultural and commercial and industrial center [Ciudad de Mexico, Mexican capital, capital of Mexico]</p><p><b>meksiletin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antiarrhythmic drug (trade name Mexitil) used to treat ventricular arrhythmias [Mexitil]</p><p><b>meksiletin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antiarrhythmic drug (trade name Mexitil) used to treat ventricular arrhythmias [mexiletine]</p><p><b>Američki industrijalist (rođen u Švicarskoj) koji je sa sinovima osnovao velike rudarske i metalne tvrtke (1828-1905) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States industrialist (born in Switzerland) who with his sons established vast mining and metal processing companies (1828-1905) [Guggenheim]</p><p><b>Njemački kompozitor opera u stilu koji je utjecao na Richarda Wagnera (1791-1864) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German composer of operas in a style that influenced Richard Wagner (1791-1864) [Giacomo Meyerbeer, Jakob Liebmann Beer]</p><p><b>Američki biohemičar (rođen u Njemačkoj) koji je proučavao metabolizam mišića (1884-1951) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States biochemist (born in Germany) who studied the metabolism of muscles (1884-1951) [Otto Fritz Meyerhof, Otto Meyerhof]</p><p><b>mali bezkičmenog kaktusa u obliku kugle (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small spineless globe-shaped cactus [Lophophora williamsii, mescal, peyote]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u pitanju proizvodnja, primjenjuje se sljedeći standard: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small European deciduous shrub with fragrant lilac-colored flowers followed by red berries on highly toxic twigs [Daphne mezereum, February daphne]</p><p><b>Sušena kora grma mezereon (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the dried bark of the shrub mezereon</p><p><b>vjerski tekst iz 5. Mojsijeve napisan na pergamentu i zavit u kutiju koja se vezala za vrata mnogih židovskih kuća u skladu s židovskim zakonom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> religious texts from Deuteronomy inscribed on parchment and rolled up in a case that is attached to the doorframe of many Jewish households in accordance with Jewish law [mezuzah]</p><p><b>vjerski tekst iz 5. Mojsijeve napisan na pergamentu i zavit u kutiju koja se vezala za vrata mnogih židovskih kuća u skladu s židovskim zakonom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> religious texts from Deuteronomy inscribed on parchment and rolled up in a case that is attached to the doorframe of many Jewish households in accordance with Jewish law [mezuza]</p><p><b>međukat, mezanin, polukat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> first or lowest balcony [first balcony]</p><p><i>n.</i> intermediate floor just above the ground floor [entresol, mezzanine floor]</p><p><b>srednji kat neposredno iznad prizemlja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intermediate floor just above the ground floor [entresol, mezzanine]</p><p><b>mezzosopran</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a soprano with a voice between soprano and contralto [mezzo-soprano]</p><p><i>n.</i> the female singing voice between contralto and soprano [mezzo-soprano]</p><p><b>skulpturalni relijev između niskog i visokog relijeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sculptural relief between low relief and high relief [half-relief, mezzo-rilievo]</p><p><b>skulpturalni relijev između niskog i visokog relijeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sculptural relief between low relief and high relief [half-relief, mezzo-relievo]</p><p><b>mezzosopran</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a soprano with a voice between soprano and contralto [mezzo]</p><p><i>n.</i> the female singing voice between contralto and soprano [mezzo]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se upotrebljava u proizvodnji proizvoda iz poglavlja 3. točka (a) ovog članka, točka (b) ovog članka ne vrijedi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> print produced by an engraving that