ead]</p><p><b>mliječni, mliječni sok, mlijeko, musti, prisluškivati, mlijeka, mleko, mliko</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white nutritious liquid secreted by mammals and used as food by human beings</p><p><i>n.</i> produced by mammary glands of female mammals for feeding their young</p><p><i>n.</i> a river that rises in the Rockies in northwestern Montana and flows eastward to become a tributary of the Missouri River [Milk River]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of several nutritive milklike liquids</p><p><i>v.</i> take milk from female mammals</p><p><i>v.</i> exploit as much as possible</p><p><i>v.</i> add milk to</p><p><b>neotrovna tanka i smeđa kraljeva zmija s strelicom u obliku okcipitalne točke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nonvenomous tan and brown king snake with an arrow-shaped occipital spot [Lampropeltis triangulum, checkered adder, house snake, milk snake]</p><p><b>snack bar koji prodaje mliječne napitke i lakše osvežavajuće namirnice (kao što je sladoled) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> snack bar that sells milk drinks and light refreshments (such as ice cream)</p><p><b>Veliki konzervi za prijevoz mlijeka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large can for transporting milk</p><p><b>Čokolada od čokoladne pića s šećerom i kakaovim maslacem i mliječnim tkivima u prahu i vanilijom i (obično) lecitinom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chocolate made from chocolate liquor with sugar and cocoa butter and powdered milk solids and vanilla and (usually) lecithin</p><p><b>goveđe stoke koje se uzgajaju radi mlijeka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cattle that are reared for their milk [dairy cattle, dairy cow, milch cow, milcher, milker]</p><p><b>kola za razvoženje mlijeka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a van (typically powered by electricity) with an open side that is used to deliver milk to houses</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a milky white translucent or opaque glass [opal glass]</p><p><b>uobičajena bolest u kojoj se ne može probaviti mlijeko i mlečni proizvodi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> congeni