avanje ili neutralizaciju ili uklanjanje morskih mina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ship equipped to detect and then destroy or neutralize or remove marine mines</p><p><b>aktivnosti otkrivanja i uništavanja morskih mina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of detecting and disposing of marine mines</p><p><b>rudar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> laborer who works in a mine [miner]</p><p><b>carska dinastija Kine od 1368. do 1644. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the imperial dynasty of China from 1368 to 1644 [Ming dynasty]</p><p><b>carska dinastija Kine od 1368. do 1644. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the imperial dynasty of China from 1368 to 1644 [Ming]</p><p><b>umjetna biljka koja liči na bonsai., džinovska zimzelena iglavca ili grm u obliku asimetričnih grana s ravnim vrhom i uzgojen u spremniku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artificial plant resembling a bonsai</p><p><i>n.</i> a dwarfed evergreen conifer or shrub shaped to have flat-topped asymmetrical branches and grown in a container</p><p><b>vulgarni izraz za žensku stidnu dlaku ili genitalije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vulgar term for a woman's pubic hair or genitals</p><p><b>ekstremna škrtnost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extreme stinginess [closeness, meanness, niggardliness, niggardness, parsimoniousness, parsimony, tightfistedness, tightness]</p><p><b>družiti se, miješati se, pomiješati se, izmiješati, miješati, miksati, pomiješati, sjediniti, sjedinjavati, smiješati, spajati, spojiti, stapati, stopiti, udružiti, udruživati, ujediniti, ujedinjavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> to bring or combine together or with something else [amalgamate, commix, mix, unify]</p><p><i>v.</i> get involved or mixed-up with</p><p><i>v.</i> be all mixed up or jumbled together [jumble]</p><p><b>koještarija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a motley assortment of things [farrago, gallimaufry, hodgepodge, hotchpotch, melange, mishmash, oddments, odds and ends, omnium-gatherum, ragbag]</p><p><b>družiti se, miješati se, pomiješati se (od &quot;mingle&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i