sti između njih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> given two equal and opposite forces, the product of the force and the distance between them</p><p><b>obrtni moment koji se vrši na magnet ili dipol kada se nalazi u magnetnom polju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the torque exerted on a magnet or dipole when it is placed in a magnetic field [magnetic moment]</p><p><b>moment inercije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the tendency of a body to resist angular acceleration</p><p><b>trenutak u bikoboru kada matador ubije bika, Odlučujući trenutak od kojeg puno ovisi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the moment in a bullfight when the matador kills the bull</p><p><i>n.</i> a crucial moment on which much depends</p><p><b>časovit</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lasting for a markedly brief time [fleeting, fugitive, momentary]</p><p><b>trenutno, začas</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> for an instant or moment [momently]</p><p><i>adv.</i> at any moment [momently]</p><p><b>kratkotrajan, munjevit, prolazan, trenutačan, trenutak, časovit</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lasting for a markedly brief time [fleeting, fugitive, momentaneous]</p><p><b>časak, moment, sadašnjost, tren, trenutak, važnost, značajnost, momenta, trenutku, trenutno (od &quot;moment&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> for an instant or moment [momentarily]</p><p><i>adv.</i> at any moment [momentarily]</p><p><b>bitan, ovog časa, važan, značajan, golem, krupan, ogroman, velik, znatan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of very great significance</p><p><b>bitan, ovog časa, važan, značajan (od &quot;momentous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a momentous way</p><p><b>bitan, ovog časa, važan, značajan (od &quot;momentous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> utmost importance</p><p><b>brzina kretanja, impuls, inercija, količina gibanja, moment sile, podstrek, pokretna sila, zamah, zamahu, linearni moment, moment</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an impelling force or strength [impulse]</p><p><i>n.</i> the product of a body's mass and its velocity</p><p><b>pretjerana zaštita (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> excessive protection [overprotec