ove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> paralysis of a single limb</p><p><b>od stanice ili organizma koji imaju samo jedan skup hromozoma (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of a cell or organism having a single set of chromosomes [haploid, haploidic]</p><p><b>dominiranje (tržišta ili robe) na isključivanje drugih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> domination (of a market or commodity) to the exclusion of others [monopolization]</p><p><b>monopolizirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> have and control fully and exclusively [monopolize]</p><p><i>v.</i> have or exploit a monopoly of [monopolize]</p><p><b>monopolizirati (od &quot;monopolise&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who monopolizes the means of producing or selling something [monopolist, monopolizer]</p><p><b>monopolist, monopolista</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who monopolizes the means of producing or selling something [monopoliser, monopolizer]</p><p><b>monopolist, monopolista (od &quot;monopolist&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having exclusive control over a commercial activity by possession or legal grant</p><p><b>dominiranje (tržišta ili robe) na isključivanje drugih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> domination (of a market or commodity) to the exclusion of others [monopolisation]</p><p><b>monopolizirati, zadržati pravo</b></p><p><i>v.</i> have and control fully and exclusively [monopolise]</p><p><i>v.</i> have or exploit a monopoly of [monopolise]</p><p><b>monopolizirati, zadržati pravo (od &quot;monopolize&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who monopolizes the means of producing or selling something [monopoliser, monopolist]</p><p><b>isključiva povlastica, monopol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (economics) a market in which there are many buyers but only one seller</p><p><i>n.</i> exclusive control or possession of something</p><p><i>n.</i> a board game in which players try to gain a monopoly on real estate as pieces advance around the board according to the throw of a die</p><p><b>monopoly</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a board used for playing monopoly</p><p><b>monopson</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (economics) a market in which goods or services are offered by several sellers but there is only one buyer</p><p><b>s krugom od 8 mm ili više, ali ne više od 8 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having circular columniation</p><p><b>vlak koji se kreće po jednoj tračnici</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a railway having a single track</p><p><b>Neuspjeh jednog testisa da se spusti u skrotum (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> failure of one testes to descend into the scrotum [monorchism]</p><p><b>Neuspjeh jednog testisa da se spusti u skrotum (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> failure of one testes to descend into the scrotum [monorchidism]</p><p><b>Sladak (kao što su saharoza ili fruktoza) koji se ne hidrolizira kako bi se stvorio drugi šećer (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sugar (like sucrose or fructose) that does not hydrolyse to give other sugars [monosaccharose, simple sugar]</p><p><b>Sladak (kao što su saharoza ili fruktoza) koji se ne hidrolizira kako bi se stvorio drugi šećer (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sugar (like sucrose or fructose) that does not hydrolyse to give other sugars [monosaccharide, simple sugar]</p><p><b>Ima samo jedno značenje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having only one meaning</p><p><b>koji imaju jedno značenje (besplatnost dvosmislenosti) obično pojedinačnih riječi ili fraza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> having a single meaning (absence of ambiguity) usually of individual words or phrases</p><p><b>Bijela kristalna spojina koja se koristi kao dodatak hrani za poboljšanje okusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> white crystalline compound used as a food additive to enhance flavor [MSG]</p><p><b>Ako je to potrebno za liječenje, potrebno je uzeti u obzir i sljedeće: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chromosomal abnormality consisting of the absence of one chromosome from the normal diploid number</p><p><b>tipografija je tipografija u kojoj je svakom znaku dodijeljena ista širina (kao kod pisaće mašine) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a typeface is which each character is given the same width (as by a typewriter) [constant-width font, fixed-width font, typewriter font]</p><p><b>fibrozna displazija kosti ograničena na jednu kost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fibrous dysplasia of bone confined to a single bone</p><p><b>jednosložan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or characterized by or consisting of one syllable</p><p><b>jednosložna riječ, jednosložnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word or utterance of one syllable [monosyllable]</p><p><b>u monosyllabic način (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a monosyllabic manner</p><p><b>jednosložna riječ, jednosložnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word or utterance of one syllable [monosyllabic word]</p><p><b>monoteizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> belief in a single God</p><p><b>Vjernik u jednog boga. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a believer in one god</p><p><b>monoteistički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> believing that there is only one god</p><p><b>teološko učenje da je Krist imao samo jednu volju iako je imao dvije prirode (ljudsku i božansku) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the theological doctrine that Christ had only one will even though he had two natures (human and divine)</p><p><b>jednoličnost, monoton, monotonija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unchanging intonation [drone, droning]</p><p><i>n.</i> a single tone repeated with different words or different rhythms (especially in rendering liturgical texts)</p><p><i>adj.</i> of a sequence or function [monotonic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> sounded or spoken in a tone unvarying in pitch [flat, monotonic, monotonous]</p><p><b>od niza ili funkcije, zvučao ili govorio na tonu koji se ne mijenja u visini (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of a sequence or function [monotone]</p><p><i>adj.</i> sounded or spoken in a tone unvarying in pitch [flat, monotone, monotonous]</p><p><b>dosadan, jednoličan, monoton, ujednačen, monotoni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tediously repetitious or lacking in variety [humdrum]</p><p><i>adj.</i> sounded or spoken in a tone unvarying in pitch [flat, monotone, monotonic]</p><p><b>dosadan, jednoličan, monoton, ujednačen, monotoni (od &quot;monotonous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a monotonous manner</p><p><b>dosada, jednoličnost, monotonija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of wearisome constancy, routine, and lack of variety [humdrum, sameness]</p><p><i>n.</i> constancy of tone or pitch or inflection</p><p><b>jednootvori, red Monotremata, red jednootvora</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coextensive with the subclass Prototheria [order Monotremata]</p><p><b>jednootvor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the most primitive mammals comprising the only extant members of the subclass Prototheria [egg-laying mammal]</p><p><b>biljke saprofitne bez listova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> leafless fleshy saprophytic plants [genus Monotropa]</p><p><b>masno-tamno ili crvenkasto saprofično bilje slično indijskoj cijevi i koje raste u šumskom humusu u istočnoj Sjevernoj Americi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fleshy tawny or reddish saprophytic herb resembling the Indian pipe and growing in woodland humus of eastern North America [false beachdrops, pinesap]</p><p><b>mala voskava bijela ili ružičasta bijela saprofična šumska biljka s lišćama nalik ljuskama i cvjetom koji kine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small waxy white or pinkish-white saprophytic woodland plant having scalelike leaves and a nodding flower [Indian pipe, waxflower]</p><p><b>upotrebljava se u nekim klasifikacijama za saprofične biljke koje se ponekad uključuju u obitelj Pyrolaceae: rodovi Monotropa i Sarcodes (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used in some classification for saprophytic herbs sometimes included in the family Pyrolaceae: genera Monotropa and Sarcodes [family Monotropaceae]</p><p><b>monotip</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) a taxonomic group with a single member (a single species or genus)</p><p><i>n.</i> the sole print made by pressing paper against a painted or inked glass or metal plate</p><p><i>n.</i> a typesetting machine operated from a keyboard that sets separate characters</p><p><b>monotipski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> consisting of only one type</p><p><b>(od dugolančanih ugljikovodikovih spojeva, posebno masti) zasićene osim jedne višestruke veze (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of long-chain carbon compounds especially fats) saturated except for one multiple bond</p><p><b>ne zasićena masna kiselina čiji ugljični lanc ima jednu dvostruku ili trostruku valentnu vezu po molekuli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unsaturated fatty acid whose carbon chain has one double or triple valence bond per molecule</p><p><b>jednovalentan, monovalentan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> containing only one kind of antibody</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a valence of 1 [univalent]</p><p><b>(od blizanaca) dobivene od jednog jajeta ili jajne ćelije (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of twins) derived from a single egg or ovum [identical]</p><p><b>monoksid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an oxide containing just one atom of oxygen in the molecule</p><p><b>koji su dobiveni od jedne oplođene jajne ćelije (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> derived from a single fertilized egg</p><p><b>U slučaju da je ova metoda primjenjena na dva tipa osoba, u slučaju da je primjena primjenjena na jednu ili više vrsta osoba, u slučaju da je primjena primjenjena na jednu ili više vrsta osoba, u slučaju da je primjena primjenjena na jednu ili više vrsta osoba, u slučaju da je primjena primjenjena na jednu ili više vrsta osoba, u slučaju da je primjena primjenjena na jednu ili više vrsta osoba, u slučaju da je primjena primjenjena na jednu ili više vrsta osoba. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two twins developed from the same fertilized ovum (having the same genetic material) [identical twin, monozygous twin]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je ova metoda primjenjena na dva tipa osoba, u slučaju da je primjena primjenjena na jednu ili više vrsta osoba, u slučaju da je primjena primjenjena na jednu ili više vrsta osoba, u slučaju da je primjena primjenjena na jednu ili više vrsta osoba, u slučaju da je primjena primjenjena na jednu ili više vrsta osoba, u slučaju da je primjena primjenjena na jednu ili više vrsta osoba, u slučaju da je primjena primjenjena na jednu ili više vrsta osoba. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two twins developed from the same fertilized ovum (having the same genetic material) [identical twin, monozygotic twin]</p><p><b>mali otvor (na desnoj i lijevoj strani) koji povezuje treću klijetku u diencefalonu s bočnom klijetkom u moždanoj hemisferi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the small opening (on both the right and left sides) that connects the third ventricle in the diencephalon with the lateral ventricle in the cerebral hemisphere [foramen of Monro, interventricular foramen]</p><p><b>Američka filmska glumica poznata po seksualnom privlačnosti (1926-1962), 5. predsjednik Sjedinjenih Američkih Država, grad na jugoistoku Michigana na jezeru Erie, Grad u sjevernoj središnjoj Louisiani. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States film actress noted for sex appeal (1926-1962) [Marilyn Monroe, Norma Jean Baker]</p><p><i>n.</i> 5th President of the United States [James Monroe, President Monroe]</p><p><i>n.</i> a town of southeast Michigan on Lake Erie</p><p><i>n.</i> a town in north central Louisiana</p><p><b>američka vanjska politika protiv uplitanja u zapadnu hemisferiju od strane vanjskih sila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an American foreign policy opposing interference in the western hemisphere from outside powers</p><p><b>Monrovia</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital and chief port and largest city of Liberia [Liberian capital, capital of Liberia]</p><p><b>hrpa masnog tkiva koja pokriva stidno područje kod žena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mound of fatty tissue covering the pubic area in women [mons pubis, mons veneris]</p><p><b>hrpa masnog tkiva koja pokriva stidno područje kod žena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mound of fatty tissue covering the pubic area in women [mons, mons veneris]</p><p><b>hrpa masnog tkiva koja pokriva stidno područje kod žena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mound of fatty tissue covering the pubic area in women [mons, mons pubis]</p><p><b>gospodin, monsun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used as a French courtesy title</p><p><b>Monsinjor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman Catholic Church) an ecclesiastical title of honor bestowed on some priests</p><p><b>monsun, sezona kiša, period vjetar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a seasonal wind in southern Asia</p><p><i>n.</i> rainy season in southern Asia when the southwestern monsoon blows, bringing heavy rains</p><p><i>n.</i> any wind that changes direction with the seasons</p><p><b>čudovište, divovski, nakaza, neman, ogroman, freak, kreatura, monstrum</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an imaginary creature usually having various human and animal parts</p><p><i>n.</i> someone or something that is abnormally large and powerful [behemoth, colossus, giant, goliath]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person or animal that is markedly unusual or deformed [freak, lusus naturae, monstrosity]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cruel wicked and inhuman person [demon, devil, fiend, ogre]</p><p><i>n.</i> (medicine) a grossly malformed and usually nonviable fetus [teras]</p><p><b>biljke iz roda Monstera, tropsko cilindrično voće slično borovnom kožom s okusom ananasa i banana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any plant of the genus Monstera</p><p><i>n.</i> tropical cylindrical fruit resembling a pinecone with pineapple-banana flavor [ceriman]</p><p><b>tropska američka loza s korijenima koji visiju poput konopca i cilindričnim plodovima s okusom ananasa i banane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American vine having roots that hang like cords and cylindrical fruit with a pineapple and banana flavor [ceriman]</p><p><b>monstranca, pokaznica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> proof by a process of argument or a series of proposition proving an asserted conclusion [demonstration]</p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman Catholic Church) a vessel (usually of gold or silver) in which the consecrated Host is exposed for adoration [ostensorium]</p><p><b>čudovišnost, monstruoznost, nakaznost, freak, kreatura, monstrum, nakaza, čudovište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person or animal that is markedly unusual or deformed [freak, lusus naturae, monster]</p><p><i>n.</i>