ially boxing) equipment that protects an athlete's mouth [gumshield]</p><p><i>n.</i> the tube of a pipe or cigarette holder that a smoker holds in the mouth</p><p><i>n.</i> the aperture of a wind instrument into which the player blows directly [embouchure]</p><p><b>lijek za gorglavanje i ispiranje usta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a medicated solution used for gargling and rinsing the mouth [gargle]</p><p><b>janjetina, ovčetina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> meat from a mature domestic sheep [mutton]</p><p><b>pokretljivost, pokretnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being movable [movableness]</p><p><b>mobilan, namještaj, pokretan, pokretljiv, pokretni, pomičan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> personal as opposed to real property [chattel, personal chattel]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of personal property as opposed to real estate) can be moved from place to place (especially carried by hand)</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being moved or conveyed from one place to another [moveable, transferable, transferrable, transportable]</p><p><b>pokretna rampa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a barrier that can be moved to allow passage</p><p><b>vjerski praznik koji pada na različite datume u različitim godinama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a religious holiday that falls on different dates in different years [moveable feast]</p><p><b>mobilan, namještaj, pokretan, pokretljiv, pokretni, pomičan (od &quot;movable&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being movable [movability]</p><p><b>prenošenje, preseliti, preseliti se, preseljenje, radnja, rasti, razvijati se, seliti, seliti se, seoba, uzbuditi, dirnuti, ganuti, korak, krenuti, kretanje, kretati, kretati se, micanje, micati, micati se, odmicati, pobuditi, podnijeti, pokrenuti, pokret, pokretati, pomaći, pomak, pomaknuti, pomicati se, ponukati, postupak, potaknuti, potez, premjestiti, premještanja, premještaj, selidba, seljenje, gibanje, istiskivati, maknuti, nositi, pomicati, premještati, prenositi, ići, prolaziti, proći, biti u pokretu, djelovati, postupati, postupiti, učin