motati, uviti, zamotati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a kiln with an inner chamber for firing things at a low temperature</p><p><i>v.</i> suppress in order to conceal or hide [repress, smother, stifle, strangle]</p><p><i>v.</i> deaden (a sound or noise), especially by wrapping [damp, dampen, dull, mute, tone down]</p><p><b>prigušen, umotan, zamotan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being or made softer or less loud or clear [dull, muted, softened]</p><p><i>adj.</i> wrapped up especially for protection or secrecy</p><p><b>auspuh, boks rukavica, prigušivač, prigušnica, šal</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tubular acoustic device inserted in the exhaust system that is designed to reduce noise [silencer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a scarf worn around the neck</p><p><i>n.</i> a device that decreases the amplitude of electronic, mechanical, acoustical, or aerodynamic oscillations [damper]</p><p><b>građanski odjel, muftija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a jurist who interprets Muslim religious law</p><p><i>n.</i> civilian dress worn by a person who is entitled to wear a military uniform</p><p><b>bubalo, gubica, krčag, kreveljiti, kreveljiti se, krigla, naivčina, novajlija, njuška, obmanjivati, opljačkati, pehar, varati, vrč, šolja, budala, naivac, žrtva, lončić, vrčić, šalica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quantity that can be held in a mug [mugful]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is gullible and easy to take advantage of [chump, fall guy, fool, gull, mark, patsy, soft touch, sucker]</p><p><i>n.</i> the human face (`kisser' and `smiler' and `mug' are informal terms for `face' and `phiz' is British) [countenance, kisser, phiz, physiognomy, smiler, visage]</p><p><i>n.</i> with handle and usually cylindrical</p><p><i>v.</i> rob at gunpoint or with the threat of violence</p><p><b>datoteku s policijskim snimcima (slike kriminalaca koje policija vodi u dosje) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a file of mug shots (pictures of criminals that are kept on file by the police) [mug file]</p><p><b>datoteku s policijskim snimcima (slike kriminalaca koje polic