raction, muscle contraction]</p><p><b>mišićna distrofija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several hereditary diseases of the muscular system characterized by weakness and wasting of skeletal muscles [dystrophy]</p><p><b>mišićni sustav organizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the muscular system of an organism [muscle system, musculature]</p><p><b>životinjsko tkivo koje se uglavnom sastoji od kontraktilnih stanica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> animal tissue consisting predominantly of contractile cells [muscle]</p><p><b>normalna tonicitet mišića (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> normal tonicity of the muscles [muscle tone]</p><p><b>fiziološko stanje koje se sastoji od mišića ili od mišića, koji imaju mišićnu snagu, kreativni živ stil (posebno stil pisanja) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the physiological state of having or consisting of muscle</p><p><i>n.</i> possessing muscular strength [brawn, brawniness, heftiness, muscle, sinew]</p><p><i>n.</i> an imaginative lively style (especially style of writing) [energy, vigor, vigour, vim]</p><p><b>muskulatura</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the muscular system of an organism [muscle system, muscular structure]</p><p><b>arterija koja opskrbljuje trbušnu i međukostalne mišiće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that supplies the abdomen and intercostal muscles [arteria musculophrenica]</p><p><b>vene koje izlijevaju gornji abdominalni zid i donji interkostalni prostor i trbuh (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that drain the upper abdominal wall and the lower intercostal spaces and the abdomen [vena musculophrenica]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na mišiće i kostur (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to muscles and skeleton</p><p><b>muskuloskeletalni sistem, muskuloskeletalni sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the system of muscles and tendons and ligaments and bones and joints and associated tissues that move the body and maintain its form</p><p><b>najveća grana brahijalnog pleksusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> largest branch of the brachial plexus [nervus radialis, radial nerve]</p><p><b>mišić</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the contractile organs of the body [muscle]</p><p><b>Otmičari mišića malog prsta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the abductor muscle of the little finger</p><p><b>Otmičari mišića malog prsta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the abductor muscles of the little toe</p><p><b>Odvajač mišića velikog prsta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the abductor muscle of the great toe</p><p><b>Otmičari mišića palca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the abductor muscle of the thumb</p><p><b>kratki adductor mišić bedra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the short adductor muscle of the thigh</p><p><b>Aduktorski mišić velikog prsta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the adductor muscle of the great toe</p><p><b>dug adductor mišić bedra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the long adductor muscle of the thigh</p><p><b>mišić koji dodira i proteže bedro (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the muscle that adducts and extends the thigh [great adductor muscle]</p><p><b>mišić koji proteže podlakticu i otme laktu u proniranju zgloba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the muscle that extends the forearm and abducts the ulna in pronation of the wrist [anconeous muscle]</p><p><b>mala grana tricepsa koja se ubacuje u kapsulju zgloba laktova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small branch of the triceps that inserts into the capsule of the elbow joint</p><p><b>članak mišića koljena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the articular muscle of the knee</p><p><b>mišić koji savije i supinira podlakticu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a muscle that flexes and supinates the forearm [biceps brachii, biceps humeri]</p><p><b>mišić biceps u bedru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the biceps muscle of the thigh [femoral biceps]</p><p><b>obraznik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a muscle that flattens the cheek and retracts the angle of the mouth [buccinator muscle, cheek muscle]</p><p><b>veliki trokutasti mišić koji pokriva zglob ramena i služi za otvaranje i savijanje i proširenje i okretanje ruke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large triangular muscle covering the shoulder joint and serving to abduct and flex