ard [posterior serratus muscle, serratus posterior]</p><p><b>sfinterni mišić anusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sphincter muscle of the anus [anal sphincter, sphincter ani]</p><p><b>vanjski prsten strijatog mišića koji okružuje anus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an external ring of striated muscle surrounding the anus</p><p><b>unutarnji prsten glatkih mišića koji se formira od kružnih vlakana rektuma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an internal ring of smooth muscle formed by circular fibers of the rectum</p><p><b>glatki mišićni sphincter zajedničkog žučnog kanala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the smooth muscle sphincter of the common bile duct</p><p><b>glatki mišićni sphincter glavnog pankreatskog kanala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the smooth muscle sphincter of the main pancreatic duct</p><p><b>mišić koji skuplja zjenicu, mišić koji steže zjenicu, stegozjeničnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ring of smooth muscle surrounding the iris [pupillary sphincter]</p><p><b>mišić sphincter pylora koji odvaja želudac od dvanaestoglavca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sphincter muscle of the pylorus that separates the stomach from the duodenum [pyloric sphincter, pyloric valve]</p><p><b>strijatni mišić sfinktera koji sužava mokraćnu cijev (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a striated sphincter muscle that constricts the urethra [urethral sphincter]</p><p><b>mišić sphincter mokraćne mjehurice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sphincter muscle of the urinary bladder [bladder sphincter]</p><p><b>kosovratnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of two thick muscles running from the sternum and clavicle to the mastoid and occipital bone [sternocleido mastoideus, sternocleidomastoid, sternocleidomastoid muscle]</p><p><b>Teres mišić koji pomera ruku i okreće je medijalno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> teres muscle that moves the arm and rotates it medially [teres major, teres major muscle]</p><p><b>Teres mišić koji dodira ruku i okreće je bočno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> teres muscle that adducts the arm and rotates it laterally [teres minor, teres 