iji čija je dužnost osigurati strogo pridržavanje utvrđenih kodeksa ponašanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> religious police in Saudi Arabia whose duty is to ensure strict adherence to established codes of conduct [Mutawa'een]</p><p><b>vjerska policija u Saudijskoj Arabiji čija je dužnost osigurati strogo pridržavanje utvrđenih kodeksa ponašanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> religious police in Saudi Arabia whose duty is to ensure strict adherence to established codes of conduct [Mutawa]</p><p><b>Škotska jedinica za mjerenje tekućine jednaka 0,9 američke pinte (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Scottish unit of liquid measure equal to 0.9 United States pint</p><p><b>bezvučni suglasnik, ćutljiv, isključiti ton, mutav, mutavac, najmljeni žalobnik na pogrebu, nijem, nijema osoba, nosač baklje, prigušen zvuk, sordina, statista, prigušiti, crvenokljun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a deaf person who is unable to speak [deaf-and-dumb person, deaf-mute]</p><p><i>n.</i> a device used to soften the tone of a musical instrument</p><p><i>v.</i> deaden (a sound or noise), especially by wrapping [damp, dampen, dull, muffle, tone down]</p><p><i>adj.</i> expressed without speech [tongueless, unspoken, wordless]</p><p><i>adj.</i> unable to speak because of hereditary deafness [dumb, silent]</p><p><b>crvenokljuni labud</b></p><p><i>n.</i> soundless Eurasian swan [Cygnus olor]</p><p><b>prigušen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> in a softened tone [hushed, quiet, subdued]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being or made softer or less loud or clear [dull, muffled, softened]</p><p><b>bezvučni suglasnik, ćutljiv, isključiti ton, mutav, mutavac, najmljeni žalobnik na pogrebu, nijem, nijema osoba, nosač baklje, prigušen zvuk, sordina, statista (od &quot;mute&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without speaking [silently, taciturnly, wordlessly]</p><p><b>mutavost, nijemost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being unable or unwilling to speak [mutism]</p><p><i>n.</i> a refusal to speak when expected [silence]</p><p><b>izvitoperiti, osakatiti, pokvariti