ense]</p><p><b>Član zakona koji se bavi prekršajima zakona o drogama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lawman concerned with narcotics violations [narcotics agent, nark]</p><p><b>snažan antagonist narkota (trgovinski naziv Narcan) posebno učinkovit s morfijem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a potent narcotic antagonist (trade name Narcan) especially effective with morphine [naloxone]</p><p><b>narcizam, samoljublje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exceptional interest in and admiration for yourself [narcissism, self-love]</p><p><b>narcizam, samoljublje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exceptional interest in and admiration for yourself [narcism, self-love]</p><p><b>Nekoga koji je zaljubljen u sebe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone in love with themselves [narcist]</p><p><b>narcistički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of those having an inflated idea of their own importance [egotistic, egotistical, self-loving]</p><p><b>osobnost obilježena samoljubljem i samopouzdanjem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> personality marked by self-love and self-absorption</p><p><b>ovčica, sunovrat, zelenkada, Narcis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bulbous plant having erect linear leaves and showy yellow or white flowers either solitary or in clusters</p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) a beautiful young man who fell in love with his own reflection</p><p><b>sunovrat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> widely cultivated ornamental plant native to southern Europe but naturalized elsewhere having fragrant yellow or white clustered flowers [jonquil]</p><p><b>narcis s bijelim cvjetovima u obliku zvijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a daffodil having star-shaped white blossoms [paper white]</p><p><b>sunovrat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous varieties of Narcissus plants having showy often yellow flowers with a trumpet-shaped central crown [daffodil]</p><p><b>Nekoga koji je zaljubljen u sebe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone in love with themselves [narcissist]</p><p><b>područje koje su preuzeli, kontrolirali i korumpirali narko karteli i gdje provedba zakona