iner with a single aisle [narrow-body, narrow-body aircraft]</p><p><b>suženim</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> reduced in size as by squeezing together</p><p><i>adj.</i> made narrow</p><p><b>čokolada čije je plodno tijelo pričvršćeno na stabljku s malom slobodnom suknjom oko nje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a morel whose pitted fertile body is attached to the stalk with little free skirt around it [Morchella angusticeps, Morchella conica, black morel, conic morel]</p><p><b>suženje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instance of becoming narrow</p><p><i>n.</i> a decrease in width</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of making something narrower</p><p><i>adj.</i> becoming gradually narrower [tapered, tapering]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of circumstances) tending to constrict freedom [constricting, constrictive]</p><p><b>podrobno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a narrow manner</p><p><b>tjeskoba, uzina, ograničenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being narrow</p><p><i>n.</i> an inclination to criticize opposing opinions or shocking behavior [narrow-mindedness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a restriction of range or scope</p><p><i>n.</i> a small margin [narrow margin, slimness]</p><p><b>u obliku usijanih žbunja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bog asphodels [genus Narthecium]</p><p><b>Istočne Sjedinjene Države: New Jersey do Južne Karoline (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> of the eastern United States: New Jersey to South Carolina [American bog asphodel]</p><p><b>Zapadna Europa: Skandinavija do sjeverne Španjolske i Portugala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> of western Europe: Scandinavia to northern Spain and Portugal [European bog asphodel]</p><p><b>narteks</b></p><p><i>n.</i> portico at the west end of an early Christian basilica or church</p><p><i>n.</i> a vestibule leading to the nave of a church</p><p><b>Mali arktički kit mužjak s dugim spiralnim slonovačkim kljupom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small Arctic whale the male having a long spiral ivory tusk [Monodon monoceros, narwhal, narwhale]</p><p><b>Mali arktički kit mužjak s dugim spiralnim slonovačkim kljupom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small Arctic whale the male having a long spiral ivory tusk [Monodon monoceros, narwal, narwhale]</p><p><b>Mali arktički kit mužjak s dugim spiralnim slonovačkim kljupom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small Arctic whale the male having a long spiral ivory tusk [Monodon monoceros, narwal, narwhal]</p><p><b>(koristi se s jednokratnim brojnim imeni) kolokvijalno za `ne a' ili `ne jedan' ili `nikad a' (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used with singular count nouns) colloquial for `not a' or `not one' or `never a'</p><p><b>NASA</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an independent agency of the United States government responsible for aviation and spaceflight [National Aeronautics and Space Administration]</p><p><b>nazal, nazalni, nosivi, nosni, nosni glas, unjkav, nosan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a consonant produced through the nose with the mouth closed [nasal consonant]</p><p><i>n.</i> an elongated rectangular bone that forms the bridge of the nose [nasal bone, os nasale]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or in or relating to the nose [rhinal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> sounding as if the nose were pinched [adenoidal, pinched]</p><p><b>izdužena pravougaona kost koja čini most nosa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an elongated rectangular bone that forms the bridge of the nose [nasal, os nasale]</p><p><b>unutarnji ugao oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the inner corner of the eye</p><p><b>ili od dvije šupljine koja se nalazi između poda lubanje i krova usta i proteže se od lica do grla. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of the two cavities lying between the floor of the cranium and the roof of the mouth and extending from the face to the pharynx</p><p><b>jedna od nekoliko turbinatnih kostiju u nosnoj šupljini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of several turbinate bones in the nasal cavity</p><p><b>glasnik koji se stvara kroz nos zatvorenim ustima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a consonant produced through the nose with the mouth closed [nasal]</p><p><b>lijek za smanjenje kongestije koji privremeno ublažava simptome naziva u vezi sa prehladom i rinitisom te infekcijama gornjih dišnih puteva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a decongestant that provides temporary relief of nasal symptoms of the common cold and rhinitis and upper respiratory infections</p><p><b>prolaz u nosnoj šupljini koji se formira izloženjem nosnih končeja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the passages in the nasal cavity formed by the projections of the nasal conchae</p><p><b>razdvajanje kosti i hrskavice između nosnih šupljina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a partition of bone and cartilage between the nasal cavities</p><p><b>bilo koji od parnih sinusa u kostima lica susjednim nosnoj šupljini koje su obložene sluznicom koja je kontinuirana sa oblogom nosnih šupljina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the paired sinuses in the bones of the face adjacent to the nasal cavity that are lined with mucous membrane that is continuous with the lining of the nasal cavities [paranasal sinus, sinus paranasales]</p><p><b>pretjerana nasalnost u govoru (kao u nekim regionalnim dijalektima) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> exaggerated nasality in speech (as in some regional dialects) [twang]</p><p><b>govorite nosnim glasom (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> speak in a nasal voice</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> proboscis monkeys [genus Nasalis]</p><p><b>Bornejski majmun s dugim bulbusnim nosom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Borneo monkey having a long bulbous nose [proboscis monkey]</p><p><b>Čin nasaliziranja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of nasalizing [nasalization]</p><p><b>govorite nosom ili kroz nos, Izgovara se s spuštenim velom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> speak nasally or through the nose [nasalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> pronounce with a lowered velum [nasalize]</p><p><b>kvaliteta glasa koju proizvode rezonatori nosa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a quality of the voice that is produced by nasal resonators</p><p><b>Čin nasaliziranja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of nasalizing [nasalisation]</p><p><b>govorite nosom ili kroz nos, Izgovara se s spuštenim velom. (