jim partnerom Jamesom Ivesom) izradio tisuće ispisova potpisanih `Currier &amp; Ives' (1813-1888) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States lithographer who (with his partner James Ives) produced thousands of prints signed `Currier &amp; Ives' (1813-1888) [Currier]</p><p><b>Američki pisac romana i kratkih priča uglavnom o moralnim temama (1804-1864) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer of novels and short stories mostly on moral themes (1804-1864) [Hawthorne]</p><p><b>Mesečeve školjke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> moonshells [family Naticidae]</p><p><b>država, nacija, nacionalnost, narod, narodnost, zemlja, puk, pučanstvo, stanovništvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a politically organized body of people under a single government [body politic, commonwealth, country, land, res publica, state]</p><p><i>n.</i> the people who live in a nation or country [country, land]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States prohibitionist who raided saloons and destroyed bottles of liquor with a hatchet (1846-1911) [Carry Amelia Moore Nation, Carry Nation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a federation of tribes (especially Native American tribes)</p><p><b>Grupa militantnih crnaca koji se zalažu za nezavisnost crnaca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of militant Black Americans who profess Islamic religious beliefs and advocate independence for Black Americans</p><p><b>državljanin, državni, nacionalan, narodni, sugrađanin, sunarodnjak, državljanin/državljanka, nacionalna, nacionalne, nacionalni, nacionalnih, nacionalnim, nacionalno, nacionalnog, nacionalnoj, narodnih, podanik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who owes allegiance to that nation [subject]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or belonging to a nation or country</p><p><i>adj.</i> limited to or in the interests of a particular nation</p><p><i>adj.</i> concerned with or applicable to or belonging to an entire nation or country</p><p><i>adj.</i> owned or maintained for the public by the national government</p><p><i>adj.</i> inside the country [home, interior, internal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of or peculiar to the people of a nation</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to nationality</p><p><b>Častno američko društvo znanstvenika koje je stvorio predsjednik Lincoln tijekom američkog građanskog rata. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an honorary American society of scientists created by President Lincoln during the American Civil War</p><p><b>NASA</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an independent agency of the United States government responsible for aviation and spaceflight [NASA]</p><p><b>državna himna</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a song formally adopted as the anthem for a nation</p><p><b>Nezavisna agencija koja nadgleda upravljanje federalnim vladinim zapisima uključujući predsjedničke knjižnice i povijesne zbirke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the independent agency that oversees management of federal government records including presidential libraries and historic collections [NARA]</p><p><b>primanja za radna mjesta i radna mjesta u kojima se radi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> benefits paid to bring incomes up to minimum levels established by law [social assistance, supplementary benefit]</p><p><b>Udruženje američkih agenata za nekretnine koje slijedi strog kodeks etike. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a United States association of real estate agents which follows a strict code of ethics</p><p><b>NASDAQ</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a computerized data system to provide brokers with price quotations for securities traded over the counter [NASDAQ]</p><p><b>Narodna banka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commercial bank chartered by the federal government</p><p><b>U Cooperstownu, New York, u čast velikih bejzbolera. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Hall of Fame and museum in Cooperstown, New York, honoring great baseball players</p><p><b>Glavni grad države. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital city of a nation</p><p><b>cenzura pod civilnim vlastima komunikacija ulaska ili izlaska ili prelaska granica Sjedinjenih Država ili njihovih teritorija ili posjeda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> censorship under civil authority of communications entering or leaving or crossing the borders of the United States or its territories or possessions</p><p><b>dio NOAA-e koji održava najveću svjetsku aktivnu arhivu vremenskih podataka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of NOAA that maintains the world's largest active archive of weather data [NCDC]</p><p><b>državni dug</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the debt of the national government (as distinguished from the debts of individuals and businesses and political subdivisions)</p><p><b>granicu koju je Kongres postavio iznad kojega državni dug ne može rasti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a limit set by Congress beyond which the national debt cannot rise</p><p><b>nacionalna zastava, narodna zastava, državna zastava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an emblem flown as a symbol of nationality [ensign]</p><p><b>Agencija za borbenu podršku koja pruža geografsku obavještajnu pomoć u cilju podrške nacionalnoj sigurnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a combat support agency that provides geographic intelligence in support of national security [NGA]</p><p><b>narodna garda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States military reserves recruited by the states and equipped by the federal government [home reserve]</p><p><b>Agencija koja upravlja Nacionalnom gardom i Nacionalnom gardom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the agency that administers the Army National Guard and the Air National Guard [NGB]</p><p><b>nacionalni praznik, narodni, državni blagdan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> authorized by law and limiting work or official business [legal holiday, public holiday]</p><p><b>nacionalni dohodak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the total value of all income in a nation (wages and profits and interest and rents and pension payments) during a given period (usually 1 yr)</p><p><b>Agencija za provođenje zakona koja je podružnica za istraživanje i razvoj Ministarstva pravosuđa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the law enforcement agency that is the research and development branch of the Department of Justice [NIJ]</p><p><b>Agencija u Upravljanju tehnologijom koja vrši mjerenja i postavlja standarde prema potrebi industrije ili vladinih programa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency in the Technology Administration that makes measurements and sets standards as needed by industry or government programs [NIST]</p><p><b>Agencija u Ministarstvu zdravlja i socijalnih usluga čija je misija da koristi znanost u potrazi za znanjem za poboljšanjem ljudskog zdravlja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency in the Department of Health and Human Services whose mission is to employ science in the pursuit of knowledge to improve human health [NIH]</p><p><b>Program socijalnog osiguranja u Britaniji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> social insurance program in Britain</p><p><b>grupa vladinih agencija i organizacija koje obavljaju obavještajne aktivnosti za vladu Sjedinjenih Država. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of government agencies and organizations that carry out intelligence activities for the United States government [IC, Intelligence Community, United States Intelligence Community]</p><p><b>Nezavisna agencija vlade Sjedinjenih Država zadužena za posredovanje u sporovima između menadžmenta i sindikata. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an independent agency of the United States government charged with mediating disputes between management and labor unions [NLRB]</p><p><b>državnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a man who is a respected leader in national or international affairs [solon, statesman]</p><p><b>Marksistička teroristička grupa osnovana 1963. od strane kolumbijskih intelektualaca koji su bili inspirirani kubanskom revolucijom., Teroristička organizacija u Boliviji koja služi kao kišobran za brojne male domorodačke subverzivne grupe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Marxist terrorist group formed in 1963 by Colombian intellectuals who were inspired by the Cuban Revolution [ELN]</p><p><i>n.</i> a terrorist organization in Bolivia that acts as an umbrella for numerous small indigenous subversive groups [CNPZ, ELN, Nestor Paz Zamora Commission]</p><p><b>Teroristička grupa osnovana 1976. godine radi nezavisnosti Korzije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a terrorist group formed in 1976 to work for Corsican independence [FLNC]</p><p><b>Najveća medicinska biblioteka na svijetu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the world's largest medical library [U.S. National Library of Medicine, United States National Library of Medicine]</p><p><b>Sjećanje na spomenik koji se sastoji od građevine ili prirodnog znamenitosti od povijesnog interesa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> memorial consisting of a structure or natural landmark of historic interest</p><p><b>Agencija u Ministarstvu trgovine koja mapira oceane i čuva njihove žive resurse. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency in the Department of Commerce that maps the oceans and conserves their living resources [NOAA]</p><p><b>nacionalni park</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tract of land declared by the national government to be public property</p><p><b>Agencija Ministarstva unutarnjih poslova odgovorna za nacionalne parkove. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency of the Interior Department responsible for the national parks</p><p><b>obavještajna agencija u Ministarstvu obrane Sjedinjenih Država koja dizajnira, gradi i upravlja sustavima za svemirsko izviđanje kako bi otkrila problematične točke diljem svijeta i praćila sporazume o kontroli naoružanja i pitanja okoliša te pomagala planirati vojne operacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an intelligence agency in the United States Department of Defense that designs and builds and operates space reconnaissance systems to detect trouble spots worldwide and to monitor arms control agreements and environmental issues and to help plan military operations [NRO]</p><p><b>moćan lobi koji zagovara pravo posjedovanja i nošenja oružja i odbacuje bilo kakvo uređenje oružja od strane vlade (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a powerful lobby that advocates the right to own and bear arms and rejects any gun regulation by the government [NRA]</p><p><b>nacionalna zaklada za znanost (američka), zaklada za poticanje razvoja znanosti u SAD</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an independent agency of the federal government responsible for the promotion of progress in science and engineering by supporting programs in research and education [NSF]</p><p><b>Ured za nacionalnu sigurnost, Ured za nacionalnu sigurnost (američki)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the United States cryptologic organization that coordinates and directs highly specialized activities to protect United States information systems and to produce foreign intelligence information [NSA]</p><p><b>Odbor u izvršnom tijelu vlade koji savjetuje predsjednika o vanjskoj i vojnoj i nacionalnoj sigurnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a committee in the executive branch of government that advises the president on foreign and military and national security [NSC]</p><p><b>vojna služba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> compulsory service in the military during peacetime</p><p><b>nacionalsocijalizam, nacional-socijalizam, nacizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of socialism featuring racism and expansionism and obedience to a strong leader [Naziism, Nazism]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na oblik socijalizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to a form of socialism [Nazi]</p><p><b>politička stranka osnovana u Njemačkoj 1919. i dovedena na vlast od strane Hitlera 1933. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the political party founded in Germany in 1919 and brought to power by Hitler in 1933 [Nazi Party]</p><p><b>Agencija u Upravnom uredu za tehnologiju koja je primarni izvor za znanstveno-tehničke i inženjerske informacije povezane s poslovima koje financira vlada. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency in the Technology Administration that is a primary resource for government-funded scientific and technical and engineering and business related information [NTIS]</p><p><b>politika vlade koja kontrolira vanjsku trgovinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a government's policy controlling foreign trade [trade policy]</p><p><b>Organizacija koja se bavi očuvanjem povijesnih spomenika i zgrada te mjesta povijesnog interesa ili prirodne ljepote (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an organization concerned to preserve historic monuments and buildings and places of historical interest or natural beauty [NT]</p><p><b>Organizacija koja je počela 1925. godine da podstakne nacionalizam među indijskim hindusima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an all-male organization begun in 1925 to foster nationalism in India's Hindus [Rashtriya Swayamsevak Sangh]</p><p><b>Federalna agencija u Nacionalnoj uprave za okeane i atmosferu koja je odgovorna za prognozu vremena i pripremu vremenskih mapa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the federal agency in the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration that is responsible for weather forecast and preparation of weather maps</p><p><b>nacionalizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the action of forming or becoming a nation [nationalization]</p><p><i>n.</i> the action of rendering national in character [nationalization]</p><p><i>n.</i> changing something from private to state ownership or control [communisation, communization, nationalization]</p><p><b>nacionalizirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make national in character or scope [nationalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> put under state control or ownership [nationalize]</p><p><b>nacionalizam, rodoljublje, domoljublje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> love of country and willingness to sacrifice for it [patriotism]</p><p><i>n.</i> the doctrine that your national culture and interests are superior to any other</p><p><i>n.</i> the aspiration for national independence felt by people under foreign domination</p><p><i>n.</i> the doctrine that nations should act independently (rather than collectively) to attain their goals</p><p><b>nacionalist, rodoljub, domoljub, patriot</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who loves and defends his or her country [patriot]</p><p><i>n.</i> an advocate of national independence of or a strong national government</p><p><i>adj.</i> devotion to the interests or culture of a particular nation including promoting the interests of one country over those of others [nationalistic]</p><p><b>vlada na otoku Tajvanu osnovana 1949. godine od strane Chiang Kai-sheka nakon osvajanja kopnene Kine od strane komunista pod vodstvom Mao Zedonga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a government on the island of Taiwan established in 1949 by Chiang Kai-shek after the conquest of mainland China by the Communists led by Mao Zedong [China, Republic of China, Taiwan]</p><p><b>Vođa nacionalističkog pokreta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the leader of a nationalist movement</p><p><b>nacionalističke, nacionalistički, nacionalističkog</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> fanatically patriotic [chauvinistic, flag-waving, jingoistic, superpatriotic, ultranationalistic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> devotion to the interests or culture of a particular nation including promoting the interests of one country over those of others [nationalist]</p><p><b>državljanstvo, nacionalna pripadnost, nacionalnost, narodnost, državljanstva, nacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> people having common origins or traditions and often comprising a nation</p><p><i>n.</i> the status of belonging to a particular nation by birth or naturalization</p><p><b>nacionalizacija, nacionaliziranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the action of forming or becoming a nation [nationalisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the action of rendering national in character [nationalisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> changing something from private to state ownership or control [communisation, communization, nationalisation]</p><p><b>nacionalizirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put under state control or ownership [nationalise]</p><p><i>v.</i> make national in character or scope [nationalise]</p><p><b>nacionalno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with regard to a nation taken as a whole</p><p><i>adv.</i> extending throughout an entire nation [across the country, across the nation, nationwide]</p><p><b>nacionalnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being a nation</p><p><b>u cijeloj državi</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring or extending throughout a country or nation [countrywide]</p><p><i>adv.</i> extending throughout an entire nation [across the country, across the nation, nationally]</p><p><b>čist, domaći, domorodac, izvoran, izvorni, koji se odnosi na rođenje, lokalni, mjesni, prirodan, prirođen, rodni, rođen, samorodan, starosjedilački, urođen, urođenički, urođenik, starosjedilac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an indigenous person who was born in a particular place [aboriginal, aborigine, indigen, indigene]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person born in a particular place or country</p><p><i>n.</i> indigenous plants and animals</p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of or existing by virtue of geographic origin</p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging to one by birth</p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of or relating to people inhabiting a region from the beginning [aboriginal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> as found in nature in the elemental form</p><p><b>član ili potomak bilo kojeg od domorodačkih naroda Aljaske (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member or descendant of any of the aboriginal peoples of Alaska [Alaska Native, Alaskan Native]</p><p><b>američki indijanac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any member of the peoples living in North or South America before the Europeans arrived [Amerindian]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to Native Americans or their culture or languages [Amerind, Amerindic, Indian]</p><p><b>član naroda koji je živio u Australiji kada su Evropljani došli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the people living in Australia when Europeans arrived [Aborigine, Australian Aborigine]</p><p><b>Australski drveni marsipalij bez repa s sivim dlakavim ušima i plaštom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sluggish tailless Australian arboreal marsupial with grey furry ears and coat [Phascolarctos cinereus, kangaroo bear, koala, koala bear]</p><p><b>Visoko australsko drvo koje daje čvrsto drvo koje se koristi za štapove itd. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall Australian timber tree yielding tough hard wood used for staves etc [Flindersia australis, flindosa, flindosy]</p><p><b>suštinski i fizički izloženi; (MT)</b></p><