e, etc.</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or consistent with or typical of the ideology and practice of Nazism or the Nazis</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to a form of socialism [national socialist]</p><p><b>nacistička diktatura pod Hitlerom (1933-1945) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the Nazi dictatorship under Hitler (1933-1945) [Third Reich]</p><p><b>politička stranka osnovana u Njemačkoj 1919. i dovedena na vlast od strane Hitlera 1933. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the political party founded in Germany in 1919 and brought to power by Hitler in 1933 [National Socialist German Workers' Party]</p><p><b>socijalni proces usvajanja (ili prisiljavanja na usvajanje) nacizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> social process of adopting (or being forced to adopt) Nazism</p><p><b>nacificirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause or force to adopt Nazism or a Nazi character</p><p><b>nacionalsocijalizam, nacizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of socialism featuring racism and expansionism and obedience to a strong leader [Nazism, national socialism]</p><p><b>Američka glumica (rođena u Rusiji) (1879-1945) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States actress (born in Russia) (1879-1945) [Alla Nazimova]</p><p><b>nacizam, nacionalsocijalizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of socialism featuring racism and expansionism and obedience to a strong leader [Naziism, national socialism]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm,, latinski izraz (ili njegovo skraćenje) koji se koristi za označavanje da se nešto treba posebno obratiti pažnji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a soft grey ductile metallic element used in alloys [atomic number 41, niobium]</p><p><i>n.</i> a Latin phrase (or its abbreviation) used to indicate that special attention should be paid to something [N.B., nota bene]</p><p><b>točka kompasa koja je jedna točka istočno (u smjeru kazalnika na satu) od pravog sjevera (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the compass point that is one point east (clockwise) of due north [north by east]</p><p><b>kompasna točka koja je jedna točka zapadno od