j.</i> affected by nephritis</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the kidneys [renal]</p><p><b>upale bubrega (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inflammation of the kidney [Bright's disease]</p><p><b>bolest bubrega koja je obično povezana s hipertenzijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> kidney disease that is usually associated with hypertension [nephrosclerosis]</p><p><b>maligni tumor bubrega kod male djece koji se karakterizira hipertenzijom i krvlju u urinu i prisutnošću opipljive mase (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> malignant renal tumor of young children characterized by hypertension and blood in the urine and the presence of a palpable mass [Wilms' tumor, Wilms tumour, adenomyosarcoma, embryoma of the kidney]</p><p><b>bubrežna litijaza u kojoj se u bubrežnoj parenhimati formiraju kalcijumske naslage koje dovode do smanjene bubrežne funkcije i krvi u urinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> renal lithiasis in which calcium deposits form in the renal parenchyma and result in reduced kidney function and blood in the urine</p><p><b>dijabetes insipidus uzrokovan neuspjehom bubrega u reagiranju na normalne razine vasopresina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> diabetes insipidus caused by a failure of the kidney to respond to normal levels of vasopressin</p><p><b>maleni rod tropskih paprika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of tropical ferns [genus Nephrolepis]</p><p><b>mačeva paprika sa lukovitim ili spuštenijim pinatnim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sword fern with arching or drooping pinnate fronds [Boston fern, Nephrolepis exaltata bostoniensis]</p><p><b>mačeva paprika sa lukovitim ili spuštenijim pinatnim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sword fern with arching or drooping pinnate fronds [Boston fern, Nephrolepis exaltata]</p><p><b>tropska američka paprika uzgajana zbog njezina fino podijeljenog sivozelenog lišća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American fern cultivated for its finely divided greyish-green foliage [basket fern, toothed sword fern]</p><p><b>Kalcijum koji se formira u bubregu (MT