ents in the nasal mucosa [first cranial nerve, olfactory nerve]</p><p><b>sigurno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a brash cheeky manner [brashly, cheekily]</p><p><b>izrazit, nervozan, razdražljiv, uzbuđen, uzrujan, živčan, živčani, jogunast, nemiran, plah</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> easily agitated</p><p><i>adj.</i> causing or fraught with or showing anxiety [anxious, queasy, uneasy, unquiet]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the nervous system [neural]</p><p><i>adj.</i> excited in anticipation [aflutter]</p><p><i>adj.</i> unpredictably excitable (especially of horses) [flighty, skittish, spooky]</p><p><b>ozbiljan ili nemoćan emocionalni poremećaj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a severe or incapacitating emotional disorder</p><p><b>poremećaj živčanog sustava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disorder of the nervous system [neurological disease, neurological disorder]</p><p><b>emocionalni poremećaj koji vas ostavlja iscrpljenim i nesposobnim za rad (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an emotional disorder that leaves you exhausted and unable to work [nervous prostration]</p><p><b>nervni impuls, živčani impuls</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the electrical discharge that travels along a nerve fiber [impulse, nerve impulse, neural impulse]</p><p><b>emocionalni poremećaj koji vas ostavlja iscrpljenim i nesposobnim za rad (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an emotional disorder that leaves you exhausted and unable to work [nervous exhaustion]</p><p><b>(psikološka) nervoza uzrokovana mentalnim stresom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) nervousness resulting from mental stress [mental strain, strain]</p><p><b>živčani sustav, neuralni sistem, systema nervosum</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sensory and control apparatus consisting of a network of nerve cells [systema nervosum]</p><p><b>tkivo koje se sastoji od neurona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tissue composed of neurons [nerve tissue]</p><p><b>nervozno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an anxiously nervous manner</p><p><i>adv.</i> with nervous excitement</p><p><b>napetost, nervoza, nervoznost, živčanost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the anxious feeling you have when you have the jitters [jitteriness, jumpiness, restiveness]</p><p><i>n.</i> an uneasy psychological state [nerves]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sensitive or highly strung temperament</p><p><b>vena, rebro</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the vascular bundles or ribs that form the branching framework of conducting and supporting tissues in a leaf or other plant organ [vein]</p><p><i>n.</i> one of the horny ribs that stiffen and support the wing of an insect [vein]</p><p><b>živac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any bundle of nerve fibers running to various organs and tissues of the body [nerve]</p><p><b>mali motorni živc koji opskrbljuje lateralni mišić oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small motor nerve supplying the lateral rectus muscle of the eye [abducens, abducens nerve, abducent, abducent nerve, sixth cranial nerve]</p><p><b>nastaje iz dva skupa korijena (kranijalnog i kičmenog) koji se ujedine u nervu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arises from two sets of roots (cranial and spinal) that unite to form the nerve [accessory nerve, eleventh cranial nerve, spinal accessory]</p><p><b>najniži par kralježničkih živaca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the lowest pair of spinal nerves [coccygeal nerve]</p><p><b>cranijalni živc koji opskrbljuje mišiće lica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cranial nerve that supplies facial muscles [facial, facial nerve, seventh cranial nerve]</p><p><b>jedan od par nerva koji potiču iz lumbalnih živaca i opskrbljuju mišiće i kožu prednjeg dijela bedra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of a pair of nerves that originate from lumbar nerves and supply the muscles and skin of the anterior part of the thigh [anterior crural nerve, femoral nerve]</p><p><b>Osjetilni živci u grlu i stražnji dio jezika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sensory nerve to the pharynx and back of the tongue [glossopharyngeal nerve, ninth cranial nerve]</p><p><b>snabdijeva unutarnje mišiće jezika i druge mišiće jezika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> supplies intrinsic muscles of the tongue and other tongue muscles [hypoglossal, hypoglossal nerve, twelfth cranial nerve]</p><p><b>Izlazi iz sakralnog pleksusa i prolazi oko pola puta niz bedro gdje se dijeli na zajednički peronealni i tibijalni živci. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arises from the sacral plexus and passes about halfway down the thigh where it divides into the common peroneal and tibial nerves [sciatic nerve]</p><p><b>okulomotorni živac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> supplies extrinsic muscles of the eye [oculomotor, oculomotor nerve, third cranial nerve]</p><p><b>crni živc koji služi mrežnjači (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cranial nerve that serves the retina [optic nerve, optic tract, second cranial nerve]</p><p><b>jedan od par nerva koji nastaje iz vratne kičmene korijene i prolazi niz prsni koš kako bi inervacija dijafragme i kontrole disanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of a pair of nerves that arises from cervical spinal roots and passes down the thorax to innervate the diaphragm and control breathing [phrenic nerve]</p><p><b>najveća grana brahijalnog pleksusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> largest branch of the brachial plexus [musculospiral nerve, radial nerve]</p><p><b>grana bedrene nerva koja snabdijeva kožne grane unutrašnjem dijelu noge i stopala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the femoral nerve that supplies cutaneous branches to the inner aspect of the leg and foot [saphenous nerve]</p><p><b>moždinski živci</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the 31 pairs of nerves emerging from each side of the spinal cord (each attached to the cord by two roots: ventral and dorsal) [spinal nerve]</p><p><b>Glavni osjetilni živc lica i motorički živc za mišiće žvakanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the main sensory nerve of the face and motor nerve for the muscles of mastication [fifth cranial nerve, trigeminal, trigeminal nerve, trigeminus]</p><p><b>živc koji teče duž unutrašnje strane ruke i prolazi blizu laktova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nerve running along the inner side of the arm and passing near the elbow [cubital nerve, ulnar nerve]</p><p><b>Mješoviti živc koji opskrbljuje grkljan i grkljan i pluća i srce i jednjak i želudac i većinu trbušnih crijeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mixed nerve that supplies the pharynx and larynx and lungs and heart and esophagus and stomach and most of the abdominal viscera [pneumogastric, pneumogastric nerve, tenth cranial nerve, vagus, vagus nerve, wandering nerve]</p><p><b>sastavni osjetilni živc koji opskrbljuje ćelije dlake vestibularnog organa i ćelije dlake hrčke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a composite sensory nerve supplying the hair cells of the vestibular organ and the hair cells of the cochlea [acoustic nerve, auditory nerve, eighth cranial nerve, vestibulocochlear nerve]</p><p><b>bezobrazan, drzak, enerventan, hladnokrvan, jak, koji nepovoljno djeluje na živce, nervozan, rastrojen, razdražljiv, siguran, snažan, žilav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being in a tense state [edgy, high-strung, highly strung, jittery, jumpy, overstrung, restive, uptight]</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing or requiring courage and contempt of danger</p><p><i>adj.</i> offensively bold [brash, cheeky]</p><p><b>neznanje (posebno ortodoksnih vjerovanja) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ignorance (especially of orthodox beliefs) [ignorantness, unknowing, unknowingness]</p><p><b>agnostički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> holding that only material phenomena can be known and knowledge of spiritual matters or ultimate causes is impossible [unbelieving]</p><p><i>adj.</i> uneducated in general [ignorant, unlearned, unlettered]</p><p><b>štakori (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bandicoot rats [genus Nesokia]</p><p><b>predgorje, predbrežje, rt</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strip of land projecting into a body of water [cape]</p><p><b>Bogati zamrznut puding od posječenih kestena i maraschino trešanja i kandiranih voća i likera ili ruma. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rich frozen pudding made of chopped chestnuts and maraschino cherries and candied fruits and liqueur or rum [Nesselrode pudding]</p><p><b>Bogati zamrznut puding od posječenih kestena i maraschino trešanja i kandiranih voća i likera ili ruma. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rich frozen pudding made of chopped chestnuts and maraschino cherries and candied fruits and liqueur or rum [Nesselrode]</p><p><b>Nessie</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large aquatic animal supposed to resemble a serpent or plesiosaur of Loch Ness in Scotland [Loch Ness monster]</p><p><b>gnijezditi se, gnijezdo, gnijezdu, jazbina, labirint, leglo, lopovsko gnijezdo, praviti gnijezdo, prijatan kutak, smjestiti unutar, ubaciti, ugnijezditi, ugnijezditi se, ugraditi, uklopiti, umetnuti, gnezdo, gnijezditi, privinuti se, smjestiti se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a structure in which animals lay eggs or give birth to their young</p><p><i>n.</i> a kind of gun emplacement</p><p><i>n.</i> a cosy or secluded retreat</p><p><i>n.</i> a gang of people (criminals or spies or terrorists) assembled in one locality</p><p><i>n.</i> furniture pieces made to fit close together</p><p><i>v.</i> inhabit a nest, usually after building</p><p><i>v.</i> fit together or fit inside</p><p><i>v.</i> move or arrange oneself in a comfortable and cozy position [cuddle, draw close, nestle, nuzzle, snuggle]</p><p><i>v.</i> gather nests</p><p><b>bijeli novci za crne dane, polog, ušteđevina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fund of money put by as a reserve [savings]</p><p><i>n.</i> device consisting of an artificial egg left in a nest to induce hens to lay their eggs in it</p><p><b>gnijezditi se, gnijezdo, gnijezdu, jazbina, labirint, leglo, lopovsko gnijezdo, praviti gnijezdo, prijatan kutak, smjestiti unutar, ubaciti, ugnijezditi, ugnijezditi se, ugraditi, uklopiti, umetnuti, gnezdo (od &quot;nest&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who settles lawfully on government land with the intent to acquire title to it [homesteader, squatter]</p><p><i>n.</i> a bird that has built (or is building) a nest</p><p><b>mjesto pogodno za gnijezdo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a place suitable for nesting</p><p><b>kriti se, maziti, njegovati,