oizvodnju gina i likera (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nonflavored alcohol of 95 percent or 190 proof used for blending with straight whiskies and in making gin and liqueurs [ethyl alcohol]</p><p><b>imaju boju koja ne privlači pažnju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a color that does not attract attention [neutral-coloured]</p><p><b>imaju boju koja ne privlači pažnju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a color that does not attract attention [neutral-colored]</p><p><b>neutralizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chemical reaction in which an acid and a base interact with the formation of a salt [neutralisation reaction, neutralization, neutralization reaction]</p><p><i>n.</i> (euphemism) the removal of a threat by killing or destroying it (especially in a covert operation or military operation) [neutralization]</p><p><i>n.</i> action intended to keep a country politically neutral or exclude it from a possible war [neutralization]</p><p><i>n.</i> action intended to nullify the effects of some previous action [counteraction, neutralization]</p><p><b>kemijska reakcija u kojoj kiselina i baza reagiraju s stvaranjem soli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chemical reaction in which an acid and a base interact with the formation of a salt [neutralisation, neutralization, neutralization reaction]</p><p><b>likvidirati, neutralizirati, riješiti se, rješavati se, srediti, ucmekati, uklanjati, ukloniti, obeskrijepiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> get rid of (someone who may be a threat) by killing [do in, knock off, liquidate, neutralize, waste]</p><p><i>v.</i> make incapable of military action [neutralize]</p><p><i>v.</i> make ineffective by counterbalancing the effect of [negate, neutralize, nullify]</p><p><i>v.</i> make chemically neutral [neutralize]</p><p><b>Neutralno u određenom pogledu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> made neutral in some respect [neutralized]</p><p><b>politika neutralnosti ili neupojavljivanja u međunarodnim poslovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a policy of neutrality or nonalignment in inter