separate deck) [Chicago, Michigan, boodle, stops]</p><p><b>drugi, mlad, najnoviji, napredan, nedavni, nepoznat, nov, posljednji, skorašnji, skori, suvremen, sve, svjež, nova, nove, novi, novih, novim, novo, novog, novome, novu (od &quot;new&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being new</p><p><b>Newport</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a port city in southeastern Wales</p><p><i>n.</i> a resort city in southeastern Rhode Island</p><p><b>lučki grad u jugoistočnoj Virginiji na uštima rijeke James kod Hampton Roads (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a port city in southeastern Virginia at the mouth of the James River off Hampton Roads</p><p><b>glas o, novine, novost, novosti, vijesti, vijest, informacija, obavijest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> information about recent and important events [intelligence, tidings, word]</p><p><i>n.</i> information reported in a newspaper or news magazine</p><p><i>n.</i> a program devoted to current events, often using interviews and commentary [news program, news show]</p><p><i>n.</i> informal information of any kind that is not previously known to someone</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being sufficiently interesting to be reported in news bulletins [newsworthiness]</p><p><b>Agencija za prikupljanje vijesti za novine i njihovo elektroničko distribuiranje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency to collects news reports for newspapers and distributes it electronically [news organisation, news organization, press agency, press association, wire service]</p><p><b>novinski članak, članak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an article reporting news [news story, newspaper article]</p><p><b>kratka vijest koja se odnosi na neku aktuelnu vijest. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a short news announcement concerning some on-going news story [flash, newsbreak, newsflash]</p><p><b>Konferencija na kojoj novinari i televizijski novinari postavljaju pitanja političaru ili drugoj poznatoj osobi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a conference at which press and tv reporters ask questions of a politician or other celebr