p><p><i>n.</i> a person who likes to be active late at night [nightbird, nighthawk]</p><p><b>nosač na dužnosti tijekom noći. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a porter on duty during the night</p><p><b>Noćni ili sumrakovi jastrebovi, bilo koja ptica koja plače noću. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nocturnal or crepuscular herons [night heron]</p><p><i>n.</i> any bird that cries at night</p><p><b>noćni jahač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> member of a secret mounted band in United States South after the American Civil War [nightrider]</p><p><b>večernja škola, večernji tečajevi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a school that holds classes in the evenings for students who cannot attend during the day</p><p><b>noćna smjena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the work shift during the night (as midnight to 8 a.m.) [graveyard shift]</p><p><i>n.</i> workers who work during the night (as midnight to 8 a.m.) [graveyard shift]</p><p><b>Noćni štakor zapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nocturnal prowler of western United States and Mexico [Hypsiglena torquata]</p><p><b>ljudski izloci koji se koriste kao đubrivo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> human excreta used as fertilizer</p><p><b>emotivna epizoda (obično kod male djece) u kojoj se osoba probudi u strahu s osjećajem tjeskobe i straha, ali ne može se sjetiti bilo kojeg događaja koji bi mogao izazvati ta osjećanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an emotional episode (usually in young children) in which the person awakens in terror with feelings of anxiety and fear but is unable to remember any incident that might have provoked those feelings</p><p><b>sposobnost gledanja u osjetljivoj svjetlosti (kao u mjesečini) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ability to see in reduced illumination (as in moonlight) [night-sight, scotopic vision, twilight vision]</p><p><b>noćna straža, noćni stražar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a watch during the night (as from midnight to 8 a.m.) [graveyard watch, middle watch, midwatch]</p><p><b>stražar koji radi noću. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a watchman who works