ing no sound</p><p><b>bezglasno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without a sound [soundlessly]</p><p><b>bezglasnost, bezvučnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of making no noise</p><p><b>uređaj (kao što su klapseri ili zvonci ili rogovi) koji se koristi za glasno uzbuđivanje na proslavi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device (such as a clapper or bell or horn) used to make a loud noise at a celebration</p><p><b>bučno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with much noise or loud and unpleasant sound</p><p><b>učinak sluha koji se karakterizira glasnom i stalnom buku; (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the auditory effect characterized by loud and constant noise [racketiness]</p><p><b>neprijatan, nezdrav, odvratan, štetan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing or able to cause nausea [loathsome, nauseating, nauseous, offensive, queasy, sickening, vile]</p><p><i>adj.</i> offensively malodorous [fetid, foetid, foul, foul-smelling, funky, ill-scented, smelly, stinking]</p><p><b>neprijatan, nezdrav, odvratan, štetan (od &quot;noisome&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being noxious [harmfulness, noxiousness]</p><p><b>bučan, galamljiv, glasan, upadljiv, živ</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> full of or characterized by loud and nonmusical sounds</p><p><i>adj.</i> attracting attention by showiness or bright colors</p><p><b>U slučaju da je tužitelj ili tužitelj uložili zahtjev u kaznu, tužitelj ili tužitelj može zatražiti od tužitelja ili tužitelja da se povuče. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an entry in the court record to the effect that the plaintiff or prosecutor will not proceed [nolle prosequi]</p><p><b>Odustali od progona upisivanjem nolle prosequi u sudske evidencije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> drop prosecution of by entering a nolle prosequi in the court records [nolle pros, nolle prosequi]</p><p><b>rakovodični čir mekih tkiva i kostiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cancerous ulcer of soft tissue and bone</p><p><b>biljke koje se mogu koristiti za proizvodnju hrane ili za proizvodnju hrane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial plants r