stern]</p><p><i>adj.</i> coming from the northeast [northeasterly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> to, toward, or in the northeast [nor'-east, north-east]</p><p><b>Kompasna točka koja je jedna točka istočno od sjeveroistoka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the compass point that is one point east of northeast [NEbE]</p><p><b>Kompasna točka koja je jedna točka sjeverno od sjeveroistoka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the compass point that is one point north of northeast [NEbN]</p><p><b>sjeveroistok (od &quot;northeast&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a storm blowing from the northeast [noreaster]</p><p><b>Dolazi sa sjeveroistoka., Srednja i srednja visina (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coming from the northeast [northeast]</p><p><i>adj.</i> situated in or oriented toward the northeast [northeast, northeastern]</p><p><b>Srednja i srednja visina, regije Sjedinjenih Država, uključujući države Nove Engleske. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> situated in or oriented toward the northeast [northeast, northeasterly]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of a region of the United States generally including the New England states</p><p><b>sjeveroistočni region Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the northeastern region of the United States [Northeast]</p><p><b>kompasna točka na pola puta između sjevera i istoka, prema sjeveroistoku., u sjeveroistočnom smjeru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the compass point midway between north and east [NE, nor'-east, northeast]</p><p><i>adj.</i> toward the northeast</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a northeastward direction [northeastwardly]</p><p><b>u sjeveroistočnom smjeru (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a northeastward direction [northeastward]</p><p><b>sjever, sjeverni, sjeverni vjetar, okrenut sjever, sjevera, sjevernih, sjeverno, sjevernog, sjeveru, sever (od &quot;north&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wind that blows from the north [boreas, north wind, northerly]</p><p><b>ka sjeveru, okrenut sjever, sjeverni, sjeverno</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wind that blows from the north [boreas, north wind, norther]</p><p><i>adj.</i> situated in or oriented toward the north [northern]</p><p><i>adj.</i> coming from the north [northern]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a northern direction [north, northward, northwards]</p><p><b>sjeverni, sjeverno, sjevernog, sjevernom, sjevernjak, snažni sjeverni vjetar, stanovnik sjevera</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dialect of Middle English that developed into Scottish Lallans</p><p><i>adj.</i> in or characteristic of a region of the United States north of (approximately) the Mason-Dixon line</p><p><i>adj.</i> situated in or oriented toward the north [northerly]</p><p><i>adj.</i> coming from the north [northerly]</p><p><i>adj.</i> situated in or coming from regions of the north</p><p><b>multietnički savez u Afganistanu koji prakticiraju umjeren oblik islama i ujedinjeni su u svojoj opoziciji Talibanu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a multiethnic alliance in Afghanistan who practice a moderate form of Islam and are united in their opposition to the Taliban [United Front]</p><p><b>član američke baptističke konvencije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the American Baptist Convention</p><p><b>udruženje sjevernih baptista (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an association of Northern Baptists [American Baptist Convention]</p><p><b>vrsta velikih riba koja se nalazi u australskim rijekama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a species of large fish found in Australian rivers [Australian bonytongue, Scleropages jardinii]</p><p><b>Čvrsta stabla s bijelim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American stoloniferous perennial having white flowers [Galium boreale, Northern snow bedstraw]</p><p><b>Bukić iz Sjeverne Amerike i Evroazije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> beech fern of North America and Eurasia [Dryopteris phegopteris, Phegopteris connectilis, Thelypteris phegopteris, long beech fern, narrow beech fern]</p><p><b>omiljena ptica u istočnim i središnjim Sjedinjenim Državama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a favorite game bird of eastern and central United States [Colinus virginianus]</p><p><b>u mokrim alpskim i subalpskim livama Kanade i Aljaske (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> of wet alpine and subalpine meadows of Canada and Alaska [Synaptomys borealis]</p><p><b>Zemaljska žaba noćna žaba na travnatom terenu i šumovitim šumama s vrlo tvrdom gornjom površinom glave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> terrestrial burrowing nocturnal frog of grassy terrain and scrub forests having very hard upper surface of head [Pternohyla fodiens, lowland burrowing treefrog]</p><p><b>žaba od kriketa iz istočnih i središnjih Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cricket frog of eastern and central United States [Acris crepitans]</p><p><b>Grupa od 5 svjetlih zvijezda koja formiraju križ u sazvežđu Labud. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cluster of 5 bright stars forming a cross in the constellation Cygnus</p><p><b>Istočne Sjeverne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> of eastern North America [American dewberry, Rubus flagellaris]</p><p><b>lakotuljaste rizomate višegodišnje biljke s aromatičnim pernatim lištima i stabljikama s otvorenim grmovima malih žutih cvjetova nalik gumbovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lightly hairy rhizomatous perennial having aromatic feathery leaves and stems bearing open clusters of small buttonlike yellow flowers [Tanacetum douglasii]</p><p><b>sjeverna Europa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the northernmost countries of Europe</p><p><b>velika leteća vjeverice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large flying squirrel [Glaucomys sabrinus]</p><p><b>Uobičajena štaparica iz Sjeverne Amerike i Europe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common harrier of North America and Europe [Circus cyaneus, hen harrier, marsh hawk]</p><p><b>polutka koja se nalazi sjeverno od ekvatora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the hemisphere that is to the north of the equator</p><p><b>Polystichum lonchitis, kopljasta papratnjača, oštra paprat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> evergreen European fern widely cultivated [Polystichum lonchitis]</p><p><b>Sjeverna Irska</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a division of the United Kingdom located on the northern part of the island of Ireland</p>