nent, protivnik, rival, suparnik, obratan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word that expresses a meaning opposed to the meaning of another word, in which case the two words are antonyms of each other [antonym, opposite word]</p><p><i>n.</i> a relation of direct opposition [contrary, reverse]</p><p><i>n.</i> a contestant that you are matched against [opponent, opposition]</p><p><i>n.</i> something inverted in sequence or character or effect [inverse]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being directly across from each other</p><p><i>adj.</i> of leaves etc [paired]</p><p><i>adj.</i> moving or facing away from each other</p><p><i>adj.</i> the other one of a complementary pair</p><p><i>adj.</i> altogether different in nature or quality or significance</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by opposite extremes [diametric, diametrical, polar]</p><p><i>adv.</i> directly facing each other [face-to-face, face to face]</p><p><b>osoba ili stvar koja ima istu funkciju ili karakteristike kao i druga osoba ili stvar (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person or thing having the same function or characteristics as another [counterpart, vis-a-vis]</p><p><b>antonim, protuznačnica, suprotnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word that expresses a meaning opposed to the meaning of another word, in which case the two words are antonyms of each other [antonym, opposite]</p><p><b>inverzan, na drugoj strani, nasuprot, obrnut, oprečan, oprečnost, protivan, sučelice, suprotan, suprotnost (od &quot;opposite&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an opposite position</p><p><b>oporba, opozicija, opreka, oprečnost, suprotnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relation between opposed entities [opposition]</p><p><b>kontrast, oporba, opozicija, oprjeka, protivljenje, suprotnost, odupiranje, oponiranje, otpor, suprotstavljanje, opreka, oprečnost, konfrontacija, konfrontiranje, sukob, sukobljavanje, oponent, protivnik, rival, suparnik, neprijatelj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the action of opposing something that you disapprove or disagree with [resistance]</p><p><i>n.</i> the relation between opposed entities [oppositeness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of hostile groups opposing each other [confrontation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a contestant that you are matched against [opponent, opposite]</p><p><i>n.</i> a body of people united in opposing something</p><p><i>n.</i> a direction opposite to another</p><p><i>n.</i> an armed adversary (especially a member of an opposing military force) [enemy, foe, foeman]</p><p><i>n.</i> the major political party opposed to the party in office and prepared to replace it if elected</p><p><b>izražavanje suprotnosti ili protivljenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> expressing antithesis or opposition [adversative]</p><p><b>deprimirati, pritiskivati, tiranizirati, tištati, tlačiti, ugnjetavati, potlačiti, mučiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> come down on or keep down by unjust use of one's authority [crush, suppress]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to suffer [persecute]</p><p><b>deprimiran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> burdened psychologically or mentally [laden]</p><p><b>potištenost, potlačenost, pritisak, terora, teroru, tištanje, tjeskoba, tlačenje, ugnjetavanja, ugnjetavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of subjugating by cruelty [subjugation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being kept down by unjust use of force or authority: "after years of oppression they finally revolted"</p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of being oppressed [oppressiveness]</p><p><b>koji tlači, okrutan, opresivne, tiranski, ugnjetački</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> weighing heavily on the senses or spirit</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by unjust severity or arbitrary behavior [tyrannical, tyrannous]</p><p><b>koji tlači, okrutan, opresivne, tiranski, ugnjetački (od &quot;oppressive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a heavy and oppressive way</p><p><b>koji tlači, okrutan, opresivne, tiranski, ugnjetački (od &quot;oppressive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of being oppressed [oppression]</p><p><i>n.</i> unwelcome burdensome difficulty [burdensomeness, heaviness, onerousness]</p><p><b>krvnik, tiranin, tlačitelj, ugnjetač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person of authority who subjects others to undue pressures</p><p><b>sramotan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> expressing offensive reproach [abusive, scurrilous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of conduct or character) deserving or bringing disgrace or shame [black, disgraceful, ignominious, inglorious, shameful]</p><p><b>stanje sramote zbog javnog zlostavljanja, stanje ekstremne nečasnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> state of disgrace resulting from public abuse [obloquy]</p><p><i>n.</i> a state of extreme dishonor [infamy]</p><p><b>pobijati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> challenge the accuracy, probity, or propriety of [call into question, question]</p><p><b>(Rimska mitologija) boginja obilja i plodnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman mythology) goddess of abundance and fertility</p><p><b>ribama s dnožnom kožom bez šupljine i širokom debelom glavom s širokim ustima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bottom-dwelling fish having scaleless slimy skin and a broad thick head with a wide mouth [toadfish]</p><p><b>proteina mrežnjače koja nastaje djelovanjem svjetlosti na rodopsin (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> retinal protein formed by the action of light on rhodopsin</p><p><b>antitijelo u serumu krvi koje se veže za invazivne mikroorganizme i druge antigene kako bi ih učinilo osjetljivijim na djelovanje fagocita (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antibody in blood serum that attaches to invading microorganisms and other antigens to make them more susceptible to the action of phagocytes</p><p><b>proces kojim opsonini čine invazivni mikroorganizam osjetljivijim na fagocitozu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> process whereby opsonins make an invading microorganism more susceptible to phagocytosis [opsonization]</p><p><b>proces kojim opsonini čine invazivni mikroorganizam osjetljivijim na fagocitozu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> process whereby opsonins make an invading microorganism more susceptible to phagocytosis [opsonisation]</p><p><b>učiniti (ćelije) osjetljivijim na djelovanje fagocita (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make (cells) more susceptible to the action of phagocytes</p><p><b>alternativno birati, birati između, odlučivati, odlučuje, optirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> select as an alternative over another [choose, prefer]</p><p><b>povući se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> choose not to do something, as out of fear of failing [cop out]</p><p><b>optativni, željni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mood (as in Greek or Sanskrit) that expresses a wish or hope [optative mood]</p><p><i>adj.</i> indicating an option or wish</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to a mood of verbs in some languages</p><p><b>raspoloženje (kao na grčkom ili sanskritu) koje izražava želju ili nadu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mood (as in Greek or Sanskrit) that expresses a wish or hope [optative]</p><p><b>umjetni jezik. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artificial language</p><p><b>očni, optički, vidni, oko, vizualan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the organ of sight [eye, oculus]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or resembling the eye [ocular, ophthalmic, optical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or using sight [ocular, optical, visual]</p><p><b>u kristalnom obliku koji se dvostruko lomuje, crta u smjeru u kojoj se dvostruko lomljenje ne događa, linija koja prolazi kroz središte zakrivljenosti sočiva tako da se svjetlost ne odražava niti lomlja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in a doubly refracting crystal, the line in the direction of which no double refraction occurs</p><p><i>n.</i> a line that passes through the center of curvature of a lens so that light is neither reflected nor refracted [principal axis]</p><p><b>Prelazak optičkih živaca iz dva oka u podnožju mozga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the crossing of the optic nerves from the two eyes at the base of the brain [chiasma opticum, optic chiasma]</p><p><b>Prelazak optičkih živaca iz dva oka u podnožju mozga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the crossing of the optic nerves from the two eyes at the base of the brain [chiasma opticum, optic chiasm]</p><p><b>(embriologija) dvostrana čaščasta depresija koja se razvija u pigmentirane i osjetilne slojeve mrežnjače (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (embryology) a two-walled cuplike depression that develops into the pigmented and sensory layers of the retina [eyecup]</p><p><b>točka u kojoj vidni živc ulazi u mrežnicu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the point where the optic nerve enters the retina [blind spot, optic disk]</p><p><b>točka u kojoj vidni živc ulazi u mrežnicu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the point where the optic nerve enters the retina [blind spot, optic disc]</p><p><b>crni živc koji služi mrežnjači (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cranial nerve that serves the retina [nervus opticus, optic tract, second cranial nerve]</p><p><b>živčani put od bočnog genikularnog tijela do vidnog korteksa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nerve pathway from the lateral geniculate body to the visual cortex [radiatio optica]</p><p><b>crni živc koji služi mrežnjači (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cranial nerve that serves the retina [nervus opticus, optic nerve, second cranial nerve]</p><p><b>optička, optički, optičkog, optika, vizualan, očni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or involving light or optics</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or using sight [ocular, optic, visual]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or resembling the eye [ocular, ophthalmic, optic]</p><p><b>aberacija, optička aberacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an optical phenomenon resulting from the failure of a lens or mirror to produce a good image [aberration, distortion]</p><p><b>uređaji za promatranje i mjerenje optičkih pojava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> apparatus for observation and measurement of optical phenomena</p><p><b>sočivo za usmjeravanje svjetlosti na predmet (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lens used to concentrate light on an object [condenser]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> optical glass of low dispersion and low refractive index [crown glass, optical crown glass]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> optical glass of low dispersion and low refractive index [crown glass, optical crown]</p><p><b>(fizička) mjera do koje mjere tvar prenosi svjetlost ili drugo elektromagnetno zračenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) a measure of the extent to which a substance transmits light or other electromagnetic radiation [absorbance, photographic density, transmission density]</p><p><b>optička sprava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device for producing or controlling light</p><p><b>disk obložen plastikom koji može pohraniti digitalne podatke kao male jame ukrašene na površini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disk coated with plastic that can store digital data as tiny pits etched in the surface [optical disk]</p><p><b>optički disk</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disk coated with plastic that can store digital data as tiny pits etched in the surface [optical disc]</p><p><b>optičko vlakno, svjetlo vod, svjetlovod</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a very thin fiber made of glass that functions as a waveguide for light [glass fiber, glass fibre, optical fibre]</p><p><b>optičko vlakno</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a very thin fiber made of glass that functions as a waveguide for light [glass fiber, glass fibre, optical fiber]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> optical glass of high dispersion and high refractive index [flint glass]</p><p><b>kombiniranje slika iz oba oka kako bi se formiralo jedno vizualno shvaćanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the combining of images from the two eyes to form a single visual percept [fusion]</p><p><b>čiste homogene stakla s poznatim indeksom lomljivosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clear homogeneous glass of known refractive index</p><p><b>"Optom" je optički fenomen koji rezultira lažnim ili obmanjujućim vizualnim dojmom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an optical phenomenon that results in a false or deceptive visual impression</p><p><b>optički instrument, optički uređaj, optičko pomagalo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instrument desig