aped cones [Oregon pine, Pseudotsuga menziesii, douglas hemlock, douglas pine, douglas spruce, green douglas fir]</p><p><b>mala grmlja s sivo-zelenim listovima i žutim cvijećem s glaukoznim plavim bojama, dekoratni zimzeleni grm s pacifičke obale Sjeverne Amerike s tamno zelenim pinnatnim listovima i žutim cvjetovima s plavo-crnim bojama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small shrub with grey-green leaves and yellow flowers followed by glaucous blue berries [Mahonia nervosa]</p><p><i>n.</i> ornamental evergreen shrub of Pacific coast of North America having dark green pinnate leaves and racemes of yellow flowers followed by blue-black berries [Mahonia aquifolium, Oregon holly grape, holly-leaves barberry, hollygrape, mountain grape]</p><p><b>dekoratni zimzeleni grm s pacifičke obale Sjeverne Amerike s tamno zelenim pinnatnim listovima i žutim cvjetovima s plavo-crnim bojama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ornamental evergreen shrub of Pacific coast of North America having dark green pinnate leaves and racemes of yellow flowers followed by blue-black berries [Mahonia aquifolium, Oregon grape, holly-leaves barberry, hollygrape, mountain grape]</p><p><b>pidgin koji uključuje riječi Chinook i francuski i engleski (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pidgin incorporating Chinook and French and English words [Chinook Jargon]</p><p><b>Visoki larš sa zapadne Sjeverne Amerike ima blijedozelene oštre oštrice i dugokosmične čunje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall larch of western North America have pale green sharply pointed leaves and oblong cones [Larix occidentalis, western larch, western tamarack]</p><p><b>lilij zapadne Sjeverne Amerike s najozbiljnijim narandžast-crvenom ljubičasto-pomičkanim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lily of western North America with showy orange-red purple-spotted flowers [Columbia tiger lily, Lilium columbianum]</p><p><b>javor zapadne Sjeverne Amerike s velikim petlobelim lištima narandžastom u jesen (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> maple of western North America having large 5