 at or to a point across intervening space etc.</p><p><i>adv.</i> throughout an area</p><p><i>adv.</i> throughout a period of time [o'er]</p><p><i>adv.</i> beyond the top or upper surface or edge</p><p><i>adv.</i> over the entire area [all over]</p><p><b>opet</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> anew [again, once again, once more]</p><p><b>ponavljajuće (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> repeatedly [again and again, over and over again, time and again, time and time again]</p><p><b>ponavljajuće (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> repeatedly [again and again, over and over, time and again, time and time again]</p><p><b>u određenom području ili mjestu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a specified area or place [up here]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ovog članka, vrijednosni papir se može koristiti za trgovanje na tržištu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a security traded in the over-the-counter market [OTC security, unlisted security]</p><p><b>za vrijednosne papire koji nisu uvršteni na popis i kojima se trguje na organiziranom tržištu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stock that is not listed and traded on an organized exchange [OTC stock, unlisted stock]</p><p><b>previše ispravlja jer se boji da će pogriješiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make excessive corrections for fear of making an error [overcompensate]</p><p><b>pretjerano gušenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> excessive crowding [congestion]</p><p><b>previše detaljno ili pokazivno izraženo (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> excessively elaborate or showily expressed [empurpled, purple]</p><p><b>Previše ili previše suptilno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> refine too much or with excess of subtlety [overrefine]</p><p><b>privatna tržišta</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> purchasable without a doctor's prescription [nonprescription]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of securities) not traded on a stock exchange [otc]</p><p><b>lijek u slobodnoj prodaji</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that is sold without a prescription [over-the-counter medicine]</p><p><b>izvanburzovno tržište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stock exchange where securities transactions are made via telephone and computer rather than on the floor of an exchange [OTC market]</p><p><b>lijek koji se prodaje bez recepta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that is sold without a prescription [over-the-counter drug]</p><p><b>Prestar da bi bio koristan. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> too old to be useful [overage, overaged, superannuated]</p><p><b>poseban slučaj bombardovanja pod katom u kojem je bomba puštena iza vertikalne tako da se baci natrag na metu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a special case of loft bombing in which the bomb is released past the vertical so it is tossed back to the target</p><p><b>iznad svih očekivanja</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> far more than usual or expected [extraordinary, sinful]</p><p><b>stanje više nego punog, količina koja je veća od odgovarajuće količine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being more than full [excess, surfeit]</p><p><i>n.</i> a quantity that is more than what is appropriate [overmuch, overmuchness, superabundance]</p><p><b>Prekomjerno obilno (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> excessively abundant [plethoric, rife]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se ne uspije postići cilj, potrebno je osigurati da se ostvariju ciljevi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> perform better or achieve a greater degree of success than expected</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to moguće, Komisija može odlučiti o tome da li će se primjenjivati sljedeći uvjeti: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> better than expected performance (better than might have been predicted from intelligence tests)</p><p><b>učenik koji postiže viši standard od IQ-a koji je naznačen (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a student who attains higher standards than the IQ indicated</p><p><b>pretjerano glumiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> exaggerate one's acting [ham, ham it up, overplay]</p><p><b>pretjerano glumiti (od &quot;overact&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> poor acting by a ham actor [hamming]</p><p><b>aktivniji od normalnog (MT)</b><