nuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> weigh more heavily [outbalance, outweigh, preponderate]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be off balance</p><p><b>nadjačati, nadvladati, prevagnuti, savladati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> overcome</p><p><i>v.</i> bear too much</p><p><i>v.</i> contract the abdominal muscles during childbirth to ease delivery [bear down]</p><p><b>bahat, ohol, tiranski, zapovjednički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> expecting unquestioning obedience [authoritarian, dictatorial]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having or showing arrogant superiority to and disdain of those one views as unworthy [disdainful, haughty, imperious, lordly, prideful, sniffy, supercilious, swaggering]</p><p><b>bahato</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an overbearing manner</p><p><b>bahat, ohol, tiranski, zapovjednički (od &quot;overbearing&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being imperious and overbearing [domineeringness, imperiousness]</p><p><b>Ponude koje su veće od prethodnih ponuda, (bridž) ponuda koja je veća od ponuda protivnika (posebno kada vaš partner uopće nije ponudio i vaša ponuda premašuje vrijednost vaše ruke), da se nadmeću za više trikova nego što se može očekivati da će pobijediti,, Ponude više nego što je predmet vrijedi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bid that is higher than preceding bids</p><p><i>n.</i> (bridge) a bid that is higher than your opponent's bid (especially when your partner has not bid at all and your bid exceeds the value of your hand) [overcall]</p><p><i>v.</i> to bid for more tricks than one can expect to win,</p><p><i>v.</i> bid more than the object is worth</p><p><b>(zubarstvo) malookluzija u kojoj se gornji zubi neobično protežu daleko iznad donjih zubiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (dentistry) malocclusion in which the upper teeth extend abnormally far over the lower teeth</p><p><b>ocvao, prenapuhan, prenapuhnut</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> puffed up with vanity [grandiloquent, pompous, pontifical, portentous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> past the stage of full bloom</p><p><b>preko palube, preko strane broda u more, s lađe</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to extremes</p><p><i>adv.</i> from on board a vessel into the water</p><p><b>prelivanje ili uzrokovanje prelivanja tijekom kuhanja, pretjerano kuhanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> overflow or cause to overflow while boiling [boil over]</p><p><i>v.</i> boil excessively</p><p><b>drzak, bezobrazan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> improperly forward or bold [fresh, impertinent, impudent, sassy, saucy, smart, wise]</p><p><b>nanosi, otkrivka, pokrovne stijene, preopteretiti, pretovariti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the surface soil that must be moved away to get at coal seams and mineral deposits</p><p><i>n.</i> an excessive burden [overload]</p><p><i>v.</i> burden with too much work or responsibility</p><p><i>v.</i> load with excessive weight</p><p><b>nanosi, otkrivka, pokrovne stijene, preopteretiti, pretovariti (od &quot;overburden&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> heavily burdened with work or cares [bowed down, loaded down, weighed down]</p><p><b>Previše zauzet. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> too busy</p><p><b>nadlicitirati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (bridge) a bid that is higher than your opponent's bid (especially when your partner has not bid at all and your bid exceeds the value of your hand) [overbid]</p><p><b>(poslovni) prevelika kapitalizacija (prodaja više dionica od poslovnih opcija) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (business) too much capitalization (the sale of more stock than the business warrants) [overcapitalization]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013, Precenite tržišnu vrijednost, U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ovog članka, poduzeća mogu imati: (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> estimate the capital value of (a company) at an unreasonably or unlawfully high level [overcapitalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> overestimate the market value of [overcapitalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> capitalize beyond what the business or the profit-making prospects warrant [overcapitalize]</p><p><b>(poslovni) prevelika kapitalizacija (prodaja više dionica od poslovnih opcija) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (business) too much capitalization (the sale of more stock than the business warrants) [overcapitalisation]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013, Precenite tržišnu vrijednost, U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ovog članka, poduzeća mogu imati: (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> estimate the capital value of (a company) at an unreasonably or unlawfully high level [overcapitalise]</p><p><i>v.</i> overestimate the market value of [overcapitalise]</p><p><i>v.</i> capitalize beyond what the business or the profit-making prospects warrant [overcapitalise]</p><p><b>pretjerano ili neprimjereno pažljivo (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> excessively or unduly careful [too-careful]</p><p><b>oblačan, opšiti rub, pokriti se, pokriven oblacima, potamniti, turoban, zamračiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of the sky when it is covered by clouds [cloud cover, cloudiness]</p><p><i>n.</i> gloomy semidarkness caused by cloud cover [cloudiness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a long whipstitch or overhand stitch overlying an edge to prevent raveling [overcasting]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cast that falls beyond the intended spot</p><p><i>v.</i> make overcast or cloudy [cloud]</p><p><i>v.</i> sew over the edge of with long slanting wide stitches</p><p><i>v.</i> sew with an overcast stitch from one section to the next</p><p><i>adj.</i> filled or abounding with clouds [cloud-covered, clouded, sunless]</p><p><b>oblačan, opšiti rub, pokriti se, pokriven oblacima, potamniti, turoban, zamračiti (od &quot;overcast&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long whipstitch or overhand stitch overlying an edge to prevent raveling [overcast]</p><p><b>Nepotrebno oprezan. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> unnecessarily cautious</p><p><b>preopterećenje, previsok cijena, prekrcati, preopteretiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a price that is too high</p><p><i>v.</i> rip off [fleece, gazump, hook,