ity by exaggerating good qualities [compensate, cover]</p><p><i>v.</i> make excessive corrections for fear of making an error [over-correct]</p><p><b>(psihijatrija) pokušaj prevazilaženja stvarnog ili zamišljenog nedostatka ili neželjene osobine pretjerano pretjeranjem suprotnog, pretjerana naknada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychiatry) an attempt to overcome a real or imagined defect or unwanted trait by overly exaggerating its opposite</p><p><i>n.</i> excessive compensation</p><p><b>preveliko samopouzdanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> total certainty or greater certainty than circumstances warrant [certitude, cocksureness]</p><p><b>prekomjerno samosvjestan, previše povjerljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by excessive confidence [cocksure, positive]</p><p><b>Kuhajte predugo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cook too long</p><p><b>Previše lakovjernosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> too much credulity</p><p><b>Previše lakovjerni za svoje dobro. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> too credulous for your own good</p><p><b>sklon suđenju previše strogo (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> inclined to judge too severely [hypercritical]</p><p><b>za iscrpljivanje zbog pretjerane uzgoje (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> to exhaust by excessive cultivation [overcultivate]</p><p><b>pješački most</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bridge designed for pedestrians [footbridge, pedestrian bridge]</p><p><b>gomilati se, prenatrpati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to crowd together too much</p><p><i>v.</i> crowd together too much</p><p><b>za iscrpljivanje zbog pretjerane uzgoje (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> to exhaust by excessive cultivation [overcrop]</p><p><b>srednji veliki listnat drvo iz središnje i južne Sjedinjene Države (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medium-large deciduous timber tree of central and southern United States [Quercus lyrata]</p><p><b>pokazivanje pretjerane znatiželje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> showing excessive curiosity</p><p><b>izuzetno osjetljiva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> extremely delicate</p><p><b>prekuhati, pretjerati, pretjerivati,