ately 20 miles) that contains a concentration of ozone sufficient to block most ultraviolet radiation from the sun [ozone layer]</p><p><b>rod australskih grmova i višegodišnjih biljaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of Australian shrubs and perennial herbs [genus Ozothamnus]</p><p><b>grm s bijelim vletenim granama i vletenim listovima s mirisnim cvijećem koji formira dugačke spreje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrub with white woolly branches and woolly leaves having fragrant flowers forming long sprays [Helichrysum secundiflorum, cascade everlasting]</p><p><b>p</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a multivalent nonmetallic element of the nitrogen family that occurs commonly in inorganic phosphate rocks and as organic phosphates in all living cells [atomic number 15, phosphorus]</p><p><i>n.</i> the 16th letter of the Roman alphabet</p><p><b>sčestica između poluprovodnika tipa p i poluprovodnika tipa n (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the junction between a p-type semiconductor and an n-type semiconductor</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom materijala od 0,15 mas.% ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mas.% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a junction transistor having an n-type semiconductor between a p-type semiconductor that serves as an emitter and a p-type semiconductor that serves as a collector</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 1,15 kVA ili većim od 2,15 kVA, ali ne većim od 2,15 kVA, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a semiconductor in which electrical conduction is due chiefly to the movement of positive holes</p><p><b>Engleski pisac poznat po svojim humorističkim romanima i pričama (1881-1975) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English writer known for his humorous novels and stories (1881-1975) [Pelham Grenville Wodehouse, Wodehouse]</p><p><b>Njemački proizvođač oružja i izumitelj puške i pištolja za ponavljanje (1838-1914) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German arms manufacturer and inventor of a repeating rifle and pistol (1838-1914) [Mauser, Peter Paul Mauser, von Mauser]</p><p><b>Američki showman koji je popularizirao cirkus 