nje koje organizira putnički agent (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tour arranged by a travel agent [package tour]</p><p><b>trgovina koja prodaje alkoholna pića za konzumiranje na drugom mjestu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a store that sells alcoholic beverages for consumption elsewhere [liquor store, off-licence]</p><p><b>kružno putovanje koje agencija unaprijed organizir, paket aranžman</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tour arranged by a travel agent [package holiday]</p><p><b>bločne konstrukcije, kontruiran u sklopovima</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> enclosed in a package or protective covering</p><p><b>Proizvodi za hranu i piće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> groceries that are packaged for sale</p><p><b>ambalaža, ambalaže, kutiju, pakiranje, pakovanje, promocija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the business of packing</p><p><i>n.</i> a message issued in behalf of some product or cause or idea or person or institution [promo, promotion, promotional material, publicity]</p><p><i>n.</i> material used to make packages</p><p><b>poduzeće koje pakira robu za prodaju ili prijevoz ili skladištenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company that packages goods for sale or shipment or storage [packaging concern]</p><p><b>poduzeće koje pakira robu za prodaju ili prijevoz ili skladištenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company that packages goods for sale or shipment or storage [packaging company]</p><p><b>pakiran, upakiran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> extremely crowed or filled to capacity [jam-packed, jammed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> pressed together or compressed</p><p><b>hematokrit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of the volume occupied by packed red blood cells to the volume of the whole blood as measured by a hematocrit [haematocrit, hematocrit]</p><p><b>Preparat od krvnih stanica odvojenih od tekuće plazme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a preparation of blood cells separated from the liquid plasma</p><p><b>izolator, osoba koja pakira robu, paker</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a workman employed to pack things into containers [bagger, boxer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a wh