ttia koji se nalazi od južnih Sjedinjenih Država do Perua (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> showy poinsettia found from the southern United States to Peru [Euphorbia heterophylla, Japanese poinsettia, mole plant]</p><p><b>valjak za bojenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a roller that has an absorbent surface used for spreading paint</p><p><b>nepotrebno ukrasiti (nešto što je već lijepo), Nepotrebno dodavanje na ono što je već završeno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> adorn unnecessarily (something that is already beautiful) [gild the lily]</p><p><i>v.</i> make unnecessary additions to what is already complete [gild the lily]</p><p><b>obojiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lending itself to being painted</p><p><b>kapsula ispunjena vodotopivom bojom koja se koristi kao projektil u igri paintballa, igra koja simulira vojnu borbu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a capsule filled with water-soluble dye used as a projectile in playing the game of paintball</p><p><i>n.</i> a game that simulates military combat</p><p><b>zrakni pištolj koji se koristi u igri paintbola (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an air gun used in the game of paintball</p><p><b>Sastav za proizvodnju plastičnih proizvoda od plastičnih proizvoda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a box containing a collection of cubes or tubes of artists' paint</p><p><b>kist, slikarski kist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a brush used as an applicator (to apply paint)</p><p><b>šaren</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coated with paint</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking substance or vitality as if produced by painting</p><p><i>adj.</i> having makeup applied</p><p><i>adj.</i> having sections or patches colored differently and usually brightly [calico, motley, multi-color, multi-colored, multi-colour, multi-coloured, multicolor, multicolored, multicolour, multicoloured, particolored, particoloured, piebald, pied, varicolored, varicoloured]</p><p><b>Američki leptir s tamno smeđim krilima s bijelim i zlatno narandžastom mrljom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> American butterfly having dark brown wings with white and golden orange spots [Vanessa virginiensis]</p><p><b>bilo koja biljka iz roda Castilleja s gustima šiljkama s kapuljačima i s svijetlom bojom na vrhu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various plants of the genus Castilleja having dense spikes of hooded flowers with brightly colored bracts [Indian paintbrush]</p><p><b>ljetnoputna vrtna višegodišnja biljka azijskog podrijetla s fino podijeljenim aromatičnim listovima i bijelim do ružičastog ljubičastog cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spring-flowering garden perennial of Asiatic origin having finely divided aromatic leaves and white to pink-purple flowers [Chrysanthemum coccineum, Tanacetum coccineum, pyrethrum]</p><p><b>pustinja na visokom visoravni u sjeveroistočnoj Arizoni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a desert on a high plateau in northeastern Arizona</p><p><b>Zelenila sa bijelom bojom označenom crnim pramenovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> greenling with whitish body marked with black bands [Oxylebius pictus, convict fish, convictfish]</p><p><b>Poinsettia iz Sjedinjenih Država i istočnog Meksika, tropska američka biljka s otrovnim mlijekom i najozbiljnijim suvištnim lištima obično crvenokrasnim laticama koje okružuju male žute cvijeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> poinsettia of United States and eastern Mexico [Euphorbia cyathophora, Mexican fire plant, fire-on-the-mountain]</p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American plant having poisonous milk and showy tapering usually scarlet petallike leaves surrounding small yellow flowers [Christmas flower, Christmas star, Euphorbia pulcherrima, Mexican flameleaf, lobster plant, poinsettia]</p><p><b>višegodišnje aromatično bilje iz jugoistočne Azije s velikim lištima obično svijetle ili plitke boje i šiljakama plavo-fioletskih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial aromatic herb of southeastern Asia having large usually bright-colored or blotched leaves and spikes of blue-violet flowers [Coleus blumei, Joseph's coat, Solenostemon blumei, Solenostemon scutellarioides]</p><p><b>Indijski pšenični pšenični pšeničari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sandgrouse of India [Pterocles indicus]</p><p><b>slatkovodne kornjače s žutom i crvenom oznakom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> freshwater turtles having bright yellow and red markings [Chrysemys picta, painted tortoise, painted turtle]</p><p><b>Čileanska biljka s baršunastim, lovorastim žutavim ili ljubičastim cvijećima s dugim stilovima poput jezika na grlu korolje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Chilean herb having velvety funnel-shaped yellowish or violet flowers with long tonguelike styles at the corolla throat [Salpiglossis sinuata]</p><p><b>slatkovodne kornjače s žutom i crvenom oznakom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> freshwater turtles having bright yellow and red markings [Chrysemys picta, painted terrapin, painted turtle]</p><p><b>slatkovodne kornjače s žutom i crvenom oznakom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> freshwater turtles having bright yellow and red markings [Chrysemys picta, painted terrapin, painted tortoise]</p><p><b>bilo koja od brojnih obično rizomatnih hibridnih begonija koje potiču od istočnoindijske biljke s grubim teksturiranim listovima s masnim i bronzanim uzorcima i ljubičastom i crveno-sjedom s neopažavanim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous usually rhizomatous hybrid begonias derived from an East Indian plant having rough-textured leaves patterned in silver and bronze and purple and red-brown with inconspicuous flowers [Begonia rex, beefsteak geranium, king begonia, rex begonia]</p><p><b>konop zavezan na provi barke ili brodice a služi z, ličilac, maler, slikar, soboslikar, Felis concolor, kuguar, puma</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artist who paints</p><p><i>n.</i> a worker who is employed to cover objects with paint</p><p><i>n.</i> a line that is attached to the bow of a boat and used for tying up (as when docking or towing)</p><p><i>n.</i> large American feline resembling a lion [Felis concolor, catamount, cougar, mountain lion, panther, puma]</p><p><b>simptom hroničnog trovanja olovom i povezan s upornom zatvorom (MT)</b