)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extract from the pancreas of animals that contains pancreatic enzymes</p><p><b>pankreatitis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of the pancreas</p><p><b>neuobičajen nedostatak svih krvnih stanica (crvenih i bijelih krvnih stanica i trombocita) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal deficiency in all blood cells (red blood cells and white blood cells and platelets)</p><p><b>panda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large black-and-white herbivorous mammal of bamboo forests of China and Tibet [Ailuropoda melanoleuca, coon bear, giant panda, panda bear]</p><p><i>n.</i> reddish-brown Old World raccoon-like carnivore [Ailurus fulgens, bear cat, cat bear, lesser panda, red panda]</p><p><b>veliki crno-bijeli biljkoždarski sisavac iz bambuskih šuma Kine i Tibeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large black-and-white herbivorous mammal of bamboo forests of China and Tibet [Ailuropoda melanoleuca, coon bear, giant panda, panda]</p><p><b>policijski kruzer (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a police cruiser</p><p><b>obitelj drvenih biljaka redom Pandanales uključujući pandanus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> family of woody plants of the order Pandanales including pandanus [family Pandanaceae, screw-pine family]</p><p><b>obitelji Typhaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> families Typhaceae [order Pandanales]</p><p><b>vlakna iz lišća pandanusa, bilo koje od različitih tropskih palmi u Starom svijetu s ogromnim korijenima i jestivim konusnim plodovima i lištima poput listova ananasa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fiber from leaves of the pandanus tree</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various Old World tropical palmlike trees having huge prop roots and edible conelike fruits and leaves like pineapple leaves [screw pine]</p><p><b>Polinezijski škriljski bor (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Polynesian screw pine [lauhala, textile screw pine]</p><p><b>svodnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who procures customers for whores (in England they call a pimp a ponce) [fancy man, pander, panderer, pimp, ponce, procurer]</p><p><b>primitivni vjetrovn