u robe ili usluga kupcima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a van suitable for delivering goods or services to customers [delivery truck, delivery van]</p><p><b>drvena oplata, foto snimak, komisija, obložiti, panel, ploča, poklopac, pult, spisak porotnik, vijeće, tabla, uokvirena daska (od &quot;panel&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> fitted or decorated with panels or wainscoting [wainscoted]</p><p><b>daščice, oblaganje zidova drvenim, oplata, panoi, panoima, plastičnim i drugim pločama, ploče, umetanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a panel or section of panels in a wall or door [pane, panelling]</p><p><b>član žirija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of a panel [panellist]</p><p><b>daščice, oblaganje zidova drvenim, oplata, panoi, panoima, plastičnim i drugim pločama, ploče, umetanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a panel or section of panels in a wall or door [pane, paneling]</p><p><b>član odbora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of a panel [panelist]</p><p><b>Difuzna upala cijelog mozga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> diffuse inflammation of the entire brain</p><p><b>vjerovanje da je Bog dio svemira i njegovih pojava i da je on iznad svemira i da interveniše u njegovim aktivnostima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the belief that God is in part of the universe and its phenomena and also transcends the universe and intervenes in its operations</p><p><b>dugačka tanka cigara. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long slender cigar [panatela, panetella]</p><p><b>dugačka tanka cigara. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long slender cigar [panatela, panetela]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous small food fishes</p><p><b>bol, griža savjesti, patnja, tjeskoba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sudden sharp feeling [stab, twinge]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mental pain or distress [sting]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sharp spasm of pain</p><p><b>mačeta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large heavy knife used in Central and South America as a weapon or for cutting vegetation [machete, matchet]</p><p><b>Pangea</b></p>