ure or plan on a different scale</p><p><b>nijemo prikazivanje, pantomima</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a performance using gestures and body movements without words [dumb show, mime]</p><p><i>v.</i> act out without words but with gestures and bodily movements only [mime]</p><p><b>nijemo prikazivanje, pantomima (od &quot;pantomime&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an actor who communicates entirely by gesture and facial expression [mime, mimer, mummer, pantomimist]</p><p><b>pantomimičar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an actor who communicates entirely by gesture and facial expression [mime, mimer, mummer, pantomimer]</p><p><b>vitamin iz vitamina B kompleksa koji igra važnu ulogu u oksidaciji masti i ugljikohidrata i određenih aminokiselina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vitamin of the vitamin B complex that performs an important role in the oxidation of fats and carbohydrates and certain amino acids [pantothenic acid]</p><p><b>vitamin iz vitamina B kompleksa koji igra važnu ulogu u oksidaciji masti i ugljikohidrata i određenih aminokiselina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vitamin of the vitamin B complex that performs an important role in the oxidation of fats and carbohydrates and certain amino acids [pantothen]</p><p><b>općenito izumrli sisari široko rasprostranjeni tijekom Jure (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> generalized extinct mammals widespread during the Jurassic [subclass Pantotheria]</p><p><b>rasprostranjeni su u tropima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> distributed throughout the tropics [pantropical]</p><p><b>rasprostranjeni su u tropima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> distributed throughout the tropics [pantropic]</p><p><b>ostava, smočnica, soba za serviranje, špajza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small storeroom for storing foods or wines [buttery, larder]</p><p><b>sluga (obično glavni sluga u kućanstvu) koji je zadužen za vino i stol (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a manservant (usually the head servant of a household) who has charge of wines and the table [butler]</p><p><b>gaće, gaćice, hlače, muške gaće</b></p><p><i>n.<