ed by procedures that assume the data were drawn from a particular distribution</p><p><b>upale vezivnog tkiva u blizini maternice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of connective tissue adjacent to the uterus</p><p><b>paravojni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of civilians organized in a military fashion (especially to operate in place of or to assist regular army troops) [paramilitary force, paramilitary organisation, paramilitary organization, paramilitary unit]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a group of civilians organized to function like or to assist a military unit</p><p><b>paravojne snage, snage sigurnosti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of civilians organized in a military fashion (especially to operate in place of or to assist regular army troops) [paramilitary, paramilitary organisation, paramilitary organization, paramilitary unit]</p><p><b>skupina civila organizirana na vojni način (posebno radi djelovanja umjesto ili da pomogne redovnim vojskim jedinicama) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of civilians organized in a military fashion (especially to operate in place of or to assist regular army troops) [paramilitary, paramilitary force, paramilitary organization, paramilitary unit]</p><p><b>skupina civila organizirana na vojni način (posebno radi djelovanja umjesto ili da pomogne redovnim vojskim jedinicama) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of civilians organized in a military fashion (especially to operate in place of or to assist regular army troops) [paramilitary, paramilitary force, paramilitary organisation, paramilitary unit]</p><p><b>skupina civila organizirana na vojni način (posebno radi djelovanja umjesto ili da pomogne redovnim vojskim jedinicama) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of civilians organized in a military fashion (especially to operate in place of or to assist regular army troops) [paramilitary, paramilitary force, paramilitary organisation, paramilitary organization]</p><p><b>(psihijatrija) poremećaj pamćenja u kojem su snovi ili fantazije zamijenjeni s stvarnošću (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychiatry) a disorder of memory in which dreams or fantasies are confused with reality</p><p><b>glavni, mjerodavan, najvažniji, najviši, vrhovni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having superior power and influence [overriding, predominant, predominate, preponderant, preponderating]</p><p><b>pitanje čije je rješavanje važnije od bilo čega drugog. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an issue whose settlement is more important than anything else</p><p><b>stanje biti najvažniji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being paramount</p><p><b>ljubavnica, ljubavnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman's lover [fancy man]</p><p><i>n.</i> a woman who cohabits with an important man [concubine, courtesan, doxy]</p><p><b>grupa virusa uključujući one koji uzrokuju pervizum i ospice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of viruses including those causing mumps and measles</p><p><b>južnoamerička rijeka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a South American river [Parana River]</p><p><b>južnoamerička rijeka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a South American river [Parana]</p><p><b>u susjedstvu nosnih šupljina (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> adjacent to the nasal cavities</p><p><b>bilo koji od parnih sinusa u kostima lica susjednim nosnoj šupljini koje su obložene sluznicom koja je kontinuirana sa oblogom nosnih šupljina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the paired sinuses in the bones of the face adjacent to the nasal cavity that are lined with mucous membrane that is continuous with the lining of the nasal cavities [nasal sinus, sinus paranasales]</p><p><b>čvrst ravni nož koji se koristi u Maleziji i Indoneziji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stout straight knife used in Malaysia and Indonesia</p><p><b>paranoja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a psychological disorder characterized by delusions of persecution or grandeur</p><p><b>osoba koja boluje od paranoje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person afflicted with paranoia [paranoid]</p><p><b>oblik shizofrenije karakteriziran halucinacijama (pretraživanja ili vel