ived opinion, preconception, prepossession]</p><p><b>-Make motley. -Da. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make motley [motley]</p><p><b>djelomičan, djelomični, nepotpun, nepravedan, neravnodušan, parcijalan, pristran, sklon, delomičan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the derivative of a function of two or more variables with respect to a single variable while the other variables are considered to be constant [partial derivative]</p><p><i>n.</i> a harmonic with a frequency that is a multiple of the fundamental frequency [overtone, partial tone]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being or affecting only a part</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing favoritism</p><p><i>adj.</i> (followed by `of' or `to') having a strong preference or liking for [fond]</p><p><b>Prekinuti trudnoću bez izbacivanja svih proizvoda začeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> termination of pregnancy without expulsion of all of the products of conception [incomplete abortion]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je ugovorno povlačenje u skladu s člankom 77. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka, ugovorni ugovorni ugovor može se oduzeti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a breach that does not destroy the value of the contract but can give rise to a claim for damages</p><p><b>Korrelacija između dvije varijable kada se uklone učinci jedne ili više povezanih varijabli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a correlation between two variables when the effects of one or more related variables are removed</p><p><b>proteza koja zamjenjuje jedan ili više zuba u zubnom lukovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a denture replacing one or more teeth in a dental arch</p><p><b>Izvod funkcije dvije ili više varijabli u odnosu na jednu varijablicu dok se ostale varijable smatraju konstantnim. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the derivative of a function of two or more variables with respect to a single variable while the other variables are considered to be constant [partial]</p><p><b>diferencijalna jednadžba koja uključuje funkcije više od jedne varijable (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a differential equation involving a functions of more than one variable</p><p><b>pomračenje u kojem je pomračeno tijelo samo djelomično zakriveno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an eclipse in which the eclipsed body is only partially obscured</p><p><b>harmonika s frekvencijom koja je višestruki elementarni frekvencije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a harmonic with a frequency that is a multiple of the fundamental frequency [overtone, partial]</p><p><b>membrana mlade sporofore raznih gljiva koja se proteže od rubova kapa do stabljika i raspada se zbog rasta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> membrane of the young sporophore of various mushrooms extending from the margin of the cap to the stem and is ruptured by growth</p><p><b>(kriminalno pravo) utvrđivanje da je optuženi kriv za neke optužbe, ali nevin za druge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (criminal law) a finding that the defendant is guilty of some charges but innocent of others</p><p><b>ljubav, naklonost, naklonjenost, neobjektivnosti, pristranost, privrženost, sklonost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a predisposition to like something [fancy, fondness]</p><p><i>n.</i> an inclination to favor one group or view or opinion over alternatives [partisanship]</p><p><b>djelomično, naklonjen, pristrano, sklono</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to some extent [in part, part, partly]</p><p><b>djelomičan, djelomični, nepotpun, nepravedan, neravnodušan, parcijalan, pristran, sklon, delomičan (od &quot;partial&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being only a part</p><p><b>(npr. imovine) koja se može podijeliti ili podijeliti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of e.g. property) capable of being parted or divided</p><p><b>član, sudionica, sudionik, učesnik, igrač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who takes part in an activity [player]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who participates in or is skilled at some game [player]</p><p><b>(lingvistički) osnovni odnos koji sastavni dio ima s glavnim glagovima u rečenici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (linguistics) the underlying relation that a constituent has with the main verb in a clause [semantic role]</p><p><b>participirati, podijeliti, sudjelovanje, sudjelovati, sudjeluju, učestvovati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> share in something [take part]</p><p><i>v.</i> become a participant [enter]</p><p><b>podupiruće, podupirući, sudionica, sudionice, sudjelovati, sudjelujemo, sudjelujujući, sudjelujujućih</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> taking part in an activity [active]</p><p><b>sudjelovanja, sudjelovanje, učešće, udjel, angažiranost, angažman, participacija, uključenje, uključenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of sharing in the activities of a group [engagement, involution, involvement]</p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of sharing in common with others (as fellows or partners etc.) [involvement]</p><p><b>Pozajmicu koju dijele grupe banaka koje se udružuju kako bi napravile kredit koji je prevelik za bilo koju od njih. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a loan that is shared by a group of banks that join to make a loan too big for any one of them alone [loan participation, participation loan]</p><p><b>Pozajmicu koju dijele grupe banaka koje se udružuju kako bi napravile kredit koji je prevelik za bilo koju od njih. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a loan that is shared by a group of banks that join to make a loan too big for any one of them alone [loan participation, participation financing]</p><p><b>participativne</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> affording the opportunity for individual participation</p><p><b>participijalni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a non-finite form of the verb [participle]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or consisting of participles</p><p><b>glagolski pridjev, particip</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a non-finite form of the verb [participial]</p><p><b>čestica, čestice, čestičnih, dio, djelić, partikula, trun, djeličak, komadičak, zrnce, zrno, riječca</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (nontechnical usage) a tiny piece of anything [atom, corpuscle, molecule, mote, speck]</p><p><i>n.</i> a body having finite mass and internal structure but negligible dimensions [subatomic particle]</p><p><i>n.</i> a function word that 