bno, posebnu, specifično, element, potankost, pedantan, sitničav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fact about some part (as opposed to general) [specific]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small part that can be considered separately from the whole [detail, item]</p><p><i>n.</i> (logic) a proposition that asserts something about some (but not all) members of a class [particular proposition]</p><p><i>adj.</i> unique or specific to a person or thing or category [peculiar, special]</p><p><i>adj.</i> separate and distinct from others of the same group or category</p><p><i>adj.</i> surpassing what is common or usual or expected [especial, exceptional, special]</p><p><i>adj.</i> first and most important [special]</p><p><i>adj.</i> exacting especially about details [finical, finicky, fussy, picky]</p><p><i>adj.</i> providing specific details or circumstances</p><p><b>grupa baptističkih skupština koja vjeruje u učenja francuskog teologa Ivana Kalvina koji je vjerovao u strogu predodređenost. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> group of Baptist congregations believing the teachings of the French theologian John Calvin who believed in strict predetermination [Calvinistic Baptist]</p><p><b>(logika) prijedlog koji tvrdi nešto o nekim (ali ne svim) članovima klase (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (logic) a proposition that asserts something about some (but not all) members of a class [particular]</p><p><b>pojedinačni opis određene instance (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an individualized description of a particular instance [detailing, particularization]</p><p><b>precizirati, specificirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be specific about [particularize, specialise, specialize, specify]</p><p><b>usmjeren prema određenom objektu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> directed toward a specific object [particularized]</p><p><b>Fokusiranje na nešto posebno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a focus on something particular</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) Uredbe (EZ) br. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to particularism (exclusive interest in one group or class or sect etc.)</p><p><b>naročitost, osobenost, osobitost, posebnost, staloženost, svojstvenost, temeljnost, jedinstvenost, specifičnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being particular and pertaining to a specific case or instance [specialness]</p><p><b>pojedinačni opis određene instance (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an individualized description of a particular instance [detailing, particularisation]</p><p><b>ići u pojedinosti, precizirati, specificirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be specific about [particularise, specialise, specialize, specify]</p><p><b>usmjeren prema određenom objektu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> directed toward a specific object [particularised]</p><p><b>naime, napose, naročito, osobito, pobliže, pojedino, posebice, posebno, potanko, specifično, veoma, vrlo</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to a distinctly greater extent or degree than is common [especially, peculiarly, specially]</p><p><i>adv.</i> specifically or especially distinguished from others [in particular]</p><p><i>adv.</i> uniquely or characteristically [peculiarly]</p><p><b>čestica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small discrete mass of solid or liquid matter that remains individually dispersed in gas or liquid emissions (usually considered to be an atmospheric pollutant) [particulate matter]</p><p><i>adj.</i> composed of distinct particles</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, "gase" su materije koje se upotrebljavaju za proizvodnju goriva ili za proizvodnju goriva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small discrete mass of solid or liquid matter that remains individually dispersed in gas or liquid emissions (usually considered to be an atmospheric pollutant) [particulate]</p><p><b>tok atomskih ili subatomskih čestica koji mogu imati pozitivan (npr. alfa čestice) ili negativan (npr. beta čestice) ili uopće nemaju (npr. neutrone) naboj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stream of atomic or subatomic particles that may be charged positively (e.g. alpha particles) or negatively (e.g. 