ričnih vozila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a removable circuit board for a personal computer</p><p><b>medicinski radnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who helps in identifying or preventing or treating illness or disability [caregiver, health care provider, health professional, primary care provider]</p><p><i>n.</i> a drug used as an anesthetic by veterinarians [angel dust, phencyclidine, phencyclidine hydrochloride]</p><p><b>posto, postotak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a proportion in relation to a whole (which is usually the amount per hundred) [per centum, percent, percentage]</p><p><b>srebro-bijeli metalni element platine koji se sliči platini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a silver-white metallic element of the platinum group that resembles platinum [atomic number 46, palladium]</p><p><b>lak elektronicki uređaj za potrošače koji izgleda kao ručni kompjuter, ali umjesto toga obavlja specifične zadatke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lightweight consumer electronic device that looks like a hand-held computer but instead performs specific tasks [organiser, organizer, personal digital assistant, personal organiser, personal organizer]</p><p><b>Marxisticko-leninistička grupa koja vjeruje da palestinski ciljevi mogu biti postignuti samo revolucionarnim promjenama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Marxist-Leninist group that believes Palestinian goals can only be achieved by revolutionary change [DFLP, Democratic Front for the Liberation of Palestine, Popular Democratic Front for the Liberation of Palestine]</p><p><b>jedinica sile jednaka sili koja daje ubrzanje od 1 stopa/sek/sek masi od 1 funte (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of force equal to the force that imparts an acceleration of 1 foot/sec/sec to a mass of 1 pound [poundal]</p><p><b>17. slovo hebrejskog alfabeta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the 17th letter of the Hebrew alphabet</p><p><b>biljka s izduženom glavom širokih stabljaka lišća nalik seleru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant with an elongated head of broad stalked leaves resembling celery 