by a pendulum</p><p><b>(8. stoljeće) sat s ravnotežnim točkom koji ima lažni klatno priključen na njega (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (18th century) a watch with a balance wheel having a fake pendulum attached to it</p><p><b>tropske škampe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical prawns [family Peneidae]</p><p><b>(grčka mitologija) supruga Odiseja i simbol odanosti i vjernosti, rod guana (drvolike ptice nalik puretama koje se smatraju divljim i pticama za hranu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) the wife of Odysseus and a symbol of devotion and fidelity</p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of guans (turkey-like arboreal birds valued as game and food birds) [genus Penelope]</p><p><b>površina zemlje koja je manje-više ravna i predstavlja naprednu fazu erozije neometanu kretanjem kore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a more or less level land surface representing an advanced stage of erosion undisturbed by crustal movements [peneplane]</p><p><b>površina zemlje koja je manje-više ravna i predstavlja naprednu fazu erozije neometanu kretanjem kore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a more or less level land surface representing an advanced stage of erosion undisturbed by crustal movements [peneplain]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "sredstva za upravljanje" su: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being penetrable (by people or light or missiles etc.) [perviousness]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je osoba u stanju da se pojavi ili prođe kroz njih,, s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> admitting of penetration or passage into or through</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being penetrated</p><p><b>i najkraće dijelove. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the innermost parts</p><p><b>duboko dirnuti, ispuniti, probiti, proći, prodirati, prodrijeti, prožeti, ući, nadirati, penetrirati, perforirati, probijati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> pass into or through, often by overcoming resistance [perforate]</p><p><i>v.</i> come to understand [bottom, fathom]</p><p><i>v.</i> become clear or enter one's consciousness or emotions [click, come home, dawn, fall into place, get across, get through, sink in]</p><p><i>v.</i> enter a group or organization in order to spy on the members [infiltrate]</p><p><i>v.</i> make one's way deeper into or through</p><p><i>v.</i> insert the penis into the vagina or anus of</p><p><i>v.</i> spread or diffuse through [diffuse, imbue, interpenetrate, permeate, pervade, riddle]</p><p><b>prodoran, pronicljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or demonstrating ability to recognize or draw fine distinctions [acute, discriminating, incisive, keen, knifelike, penetrative, piercing, sharp]</p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to penetrate [penetrative]</p><p><b>ozljeda nastala kada predmet (kao što je nož, metak ili šrapnel) prodre u tijelo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> injury incurred when an object (as a knife or bullet or shrapnel) penetrates into the body [penetrating trauma]</p><p><b>ozljeda nastala kada predmet (kao što je nož, metak ili šrapnel) prodre u tijelo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> injury incurred when an object (as a knife or bullet or shrapnel) penetrates into the body [penetrating injury]</p><p><b>prodoran, pronicljiv (od &quot;penetrating&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with ability to see into deeply [penetratively]</p><p><b>penetracija, proboj, probojnost, prodiranje, prodor, pronicanje, pronicljivost, propusnost, ulazak u zonu napada, najezda, provala, upad, uvid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an attack that penetrates into enemy territory [incursion]</p><p><i>n.</i> clear or deep perception of a situation [insight]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of entering into or through something</p><p><i>n.</i> the ability to make way into or through something</p><p><i>n.</i> the depth to which something penetrates (especially the depth reached by a projectile that hits a target)</p><p><i>n.</i> the act (by a man) of inserting his penis into the vagina of a woman</p><p><b>Bomba s oko 30% eksploziva i kućište dizajnirano za prodiranje tvrde mete