taniji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first form of penicillin that was isolated in Great Britain</p><p><b>benzilpenicilin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the penicillin that constitutes the principal component of many commercial antibiotics [benzylpenicillin]</p><p><b>penicilin koji je sličan u svom djelovanju na antibiotike penicilinu G, ali se dobiva drugačije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a penicillin that is similar in antibiotic action to penicillin G but is obtained differently</p><p><b>kristalni penicilin sličan penicilinu G, ali otporniji na djelovanje želučanih kiselina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a crystalline penicillin similar in action to penicillin G but more resistant to the action of gastric acids [phenoxymethyl penicillin]</p><p><b>oblik penicilina V (trgovinski naziv Ledercillin VK) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of penicillin V (trade name Ledercillin VK) [Ledercillin VK]</p><p><b>ne utječe na penicilin (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> unaffected by penicillin</p><p><b>bakterije koje penicilin ne utječe na njih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bacteria that are unaffected by penicillin</p><p><b>beta-laktamaza, penicilinaza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> enzyme produced by certain bacteria that inactivates penicillin and results in resistance to that antibiotic [beta-lactamase]</p><p><b>oblik penicilina koji penicilinaza ne onemogućuje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of penicillin that is not rendered inactive by penicillinase</p><p><b>rod gljiva koji obično rastu kao zelene ili plave plijesni na raspadajućoj hrani (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of fungi commonly growing as green or blue molds on decaying food [genus Penicillium]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s penisom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the penis [penial]</p><p><b>implantat koji stvara umjetnu erekciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an implant that creates an artificial erection</p><p><b>poluotok, poluotoka, poluotoku</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large mass of land projecting into a body of water</p><p><b>poluotočni</b></p><p><i>adj.<