i zastava nosi na koplje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small pennant borne on a lance [pennoncelle, penoncel]</p><p><b>mali zastava nosi na koplje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small pennant borne on a lance [pennoncel, penoncel]</p><p><b>država u srednjem Atlantiku, jedna od britanskih kolonija koje su formirale Sjedinjene Države., Sveučilište u Philadelphiji, Pennsylvania (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Mid-Atlantic state [Keystone State, PA, Pa.]</p><p><i>n.</i> one of the British colonies that formed the United States</p><p><i>n.</i> a university in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania [Penn, University of Pennsylvania]</p><p><b>dialekt visokog njemačkog koji se govori u dijelovima Pensilvanije i Marylanda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dialect of High German spoken in parts of Pennsylvania and Maryland</p><p><b>od 310 do 280 milijuna godina., rodom ili prebivalištem u Pennsylvaniji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> from 310 million to 280 million years ago [Pennsylvanian period, Upper Carboniferous, Upper Carboniferous period]</p><p><i>n.</i> a native or resident of Pennsylvania [Keystone Stater]</p><p><b>od 310 do 280 milijuna godina. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> from 310 million to 280 million years ago [Pennsylvanian, Upper Carboniferous, Upper Carboniferous period]</p><p><b>engleski bakreni novac, moneta, peni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fractional monetary unit of Ireland and the United Kingdom</p><p><i>n.</i> a coin worth one-hundredth of the value of the basic unit [cent, centime]</p><p><b>Poslovni posao na trivijalnoj skali., Poker igrao za male uloge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a business deal on a trivial scale</p><p><i>n.</i> poker played for small stakes [penny ante poker]</p><p><b>Poker igrao za male uloge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> poker played for small stakes [penny ante]</p><p><b>arkada s uređajima na kojima se rade novčići za zabavu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an arcade with coin-operated devices for entertainment</p><p><b>dječja banka novčića (često u obliku svinje) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a