oil from European pennyroyal having an odor like mint</p><p><i>n.</i> aromatic oil from American pennyroyal [hedeoma oil]</p><p><b>mjera težine</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of apothecary weight equal to 24 grains</p><p><b>jeftina flauta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inexpensive fipple flute [tin whistle, whistle]</p><p><b>Količina koju možete kupiti za novčić. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount that can be bought for a penny [penn'orth]</p><p><b>član Algonquian naroda koji pripada Abnaki konfederaciji i živi u dolini Penobscot u sjevernom Maineu, rijeka u središnjem Maineu koja teče u Penobscot Bay (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Algonquian people belonging to the Abnaki confederacy and living in the Penobscot valley in northern Maine</p><p><i>n.</i> a river in central Maine flowing into Penobscot Bay [Penobscot River]</p><p><b>Uliv u Atlantskom oceanu u istočnom Maineu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inlet of the Atlantic in eastern Maine</p><p><b>rijeka u središnjem Maineu koja teče u Penobscot Bay (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a river in central Maine flowing into Penobscot Bay [Penobscot]</p><p><b>čokolada od sirovine i maslaca, mlijeka i orašastih plodova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fudge made with brown sugar and butter and milk and nuts [panocha, panoche, penuche]</p><p><b>osoba koja proučava teoriju i praksu upravljanja zatvorom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who studies the theory and practice of prison management</p><p><b>Kriminologija je grana kriminologije koja se bavi upravljanjem zatvorima i rehabilitacijom zatvorenika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of criminology concerned with prison management and prisoner rehabilitation [poenology]</p><p><b>mali zastava nosi na koplje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small pennant borne on a lance [pennoncel, pennoncelle]</p><p><b>radnik koji radi dosadno papirologiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clerk who does boring paperwork [pencil pusher]</p><p><b>Grad na sjeverozapadu Floride. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a town in extreme northwest Florida</p><p><b>dohodak, mirovina, mirovinski, pansion, penzija, penzionirati, privatni hotel</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a regular payment to a person that is intended to allow them to subsist without working</p><p><i>v.</i> grant a pension to [pension off]</p><p><b>plan za odlaganje novca za potrošnju nakon mirovine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plan for setting aside money to be spent after retirement [pension plan, retirement account, retirement plan, retirement program, retirement savings account, retirement savings plan]</p><p><b>mirovinski fond</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fund reserved to pay workers' pensions when they retire from service [superannuation fund]</p><p><i>n.</i> a financial institution that collects regular contributions from employers to provide retirement income for employees</p><p><b>penzionirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> let go from employment with an attractive pension</p><p><i>v.</i> grant a pension to [pension]</p><p><b>mirovinsko osiguranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plan for setting aside money to be spent after retirement [pension account, retirement account, retirement plan, retirement program, retirement savings account, retirement savings plan]</p><p><b>ima pravo na mirovinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> entitled to receive a pension</p><p><b>mirovinski, penzioner, umirovljenik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the beneficiary of a pension fund [pensioner]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who works only for money [hireling]</p><p><b>najamnik, penzioner, plaćenik, umirovljenik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the beneficiary of a pension fund [pensionary]</p><p><b>sjetan, zamišljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> deeply or seriously thoughtful [brooding, broody, contemplative, meditative, musing, pondering, reflective, ruminative]</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing pensive sadness [wistful]</p><p><b>sjetan, zamišljen (od &quot;pensive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a pensive manner</p><p><b>sjetan, zamišljen (od &quot;pensive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> persistent morbid meditation on a problem [brooding]</p><p><i>n.</i> deep serious thoughtfulness [contemplativeness, meditativeness]</p><p><b>veliki rod potgrmova ili biljaka s bledo- ili ljubičastim ili crvenim ili žutim ili bijelim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large genus of subshrubs or herbs having showy blue or purple or red or yellow or white flowers [genus Penstemon]</p><p><b>biljka iz jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država koja ima dugačke otvorene grmove crvenokrasnih cvijeća s žutim dlakama na donjoj usni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant of southwestern United States having long open clusters of scarlet flowers with yellow hairs on lower lip [golden-beard penstemon]</p><p><b>biljka s svijetlo crvenim cijevastima cvjetovima u dugim uskim grmovima blizu vrhova uspravnih stabljika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant with bright red tubular flowers in long narrow clusters near tips of erect stems [scarlet bugler]</p><p><b>uspravna biljka s plavo-fioletskim cvjetovima u prstenovima blizu vrhova stabljika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect plant with blue-violet flowers in rings near tips of stems [Platte River penstemon]</p><p><b>biljka koja se nalazi na podnožju, s plavim i lavandnim cvjetovima na kratkim uspravnim stabljikama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mat-forming plant with blue and lavender flowers clustered on short erect stems [Davidson's penstemon]</p><p><b>u obliku krema, s krema-bojanim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stems in clumps with cream-colored flowers [hot-rock penstemon]</p><p><b>niska biljka s svjetlo plavim i ljubičastom cvjetom u kratkim grmovima blizu vrhova stabljika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low plant with light blue and violet flowers in short clusters near tips of stems [Jones' penstemon]</p><p><b>nizak grmljav biljka s velikim, sjajnim svjetlim lavandnim ili plavo-fioletskim cvijećem u uskim grmovima na krajevima stabljika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low bushy plant with large showy pale lavender or blue-violet flowers in narrow clusters at ends of stems [lowbush penstemon, shrubby penstemon]</p><p><b>biljka s malim uskim listovima i plavo-fioletskim cvijećem u dugim otvorenim klasterima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant having small narrow leaves and blue-violet flowers in long open clusters [narrow-leaf penstemon]</p><p><b>biljka koja stvara podloge s tamno ružičastim cvijećima na kratkim uspravnim listnim stabljikama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mat-forming plant with deep pink flowers on short erect leafy stems [mountain pride]</p><p><b>Mirisni napuhani bijeli do crvenkasto ružičasti cvijeće u dugim uskim grmovima na uspravnim stabljikama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fragrant puffed-up white to reddish-pink flowers in long narrow clusters on erect stems [balloon flower, scented penstemon]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u ovom slučaju ne primjenjuje primjena ovog članka, to se može primjenjivati na sve vrste proizvoda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect stems with pinkish-lavender flowers in long interrupted clusters [Parry's penstemon]</p><p><b>jedan od najljepših divljih cvjetova na Zapadu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the West's most beautiful wildflowers [cliff penstemon, rock penstemon]</p><p><b>biljka s vrtljicama malih tamno plavo-fioletskih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant with whorls of small dark blue-violet flowers [Rydberg's penstemon]</p><p><b>krugovi tamno plavih do tamno ljubičastih cvijeća na vrhovima uspravnih listnih stabljika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> whorls of deep blue to dark purple flowers at tips of erect leafy stems [cascade penstemon]</p><p><b>vino i lavanda do ljubičastih i crnih cvijeća u nekoliko grmova na gornjoj polovici listovitog stabla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wine and lavender to purple and black flowers in several clusters on the upper half of leafy stems [Whipple's penstemon]</p><p><b>regulator protoka vode, prolaz, ustava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> regulator consisting of a valve or gate that controls the rate of water flow through a sluice [floodgate, head gate, sluice valve, sluicegate, water gate]</p><p><i>n.</i> conduit that carries a rapid flow of water controlled by a sluicegate [sluice, sluiceway]</p><p><b>zaključan, zatvoren</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> closely confined [shut up]</p><p><b>napregnut, skriven, uzdržljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by or showing the suppression of impulses or emotions [repressed]</p><p><b>zvijezda s pet bodova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a star with 5 points [pentagram, pentangle]</p><p><b>pet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of four and one [5, Little Phoebe, Phoebe, V, cinque, fin, five, fivesome, quint, quintet, quintuplet]</p><p><b>Koronarni vazodilatator (trgovinski naziv Peritrate) koji se koristi za liječenje angine pectoris (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a coronary vasodilator (trade name Peritrate) used to treat angina pectoris [Peritrate]</p><p><b>pentagonski, ministarstvo SAD, pentagon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a government building with five sides that serves as the headquarters of the United States Department of Defense</p><p><i>n.</i> the United States military establishment</p><p><i>n.</i> a five-sided polygon</p><p><b>Filipinska teroristička grupa koja se odvojila od Moro Islamskog oslobodilačkog fronta 2001. kako bi nastavila terorizam i otmicu i ucjenu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Filipino terrorist group that broke away from the Moro Islamic Liberation Front in 2001 in order to continue terrorism and kidnapping and extortion</p><p><b>peterokut</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or shaped like a pentagon [pentangular]</p><p><b>zvijezda s pet bodova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a star with 5 points [pentacle, pentangle]</p><p><b>bilo koji poliedr s pet ravnih lica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any polyhedron having five plane faces</p><p><b>brunska škrga s golim repom s dvostrano obrisanim dugim čvrstim dlačama na distalnoj trećini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> brown tree shrew having a naked tail bilaterally fringed with long stiff hairs on the distal third [pen-tail, pen-tailed tree shrew]</p><p><b>podijeljen u pet dijelova (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> divided into five parts</p><p><b>pentametar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a verse line having five metrical feet</p><p><b>lijek koji se koristi kao stimulansa cirkulacije i disanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug used as a circulatory and respiratory stimulant [Metrazol, pentylenetetrazol]</p><p><b>zvijezda s pet bodova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a star with 5 points [pentacle, pentagram]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or shaped like a pentagon [pentagonal]</p><p><b>čista tekuća karboksilna kiselina koja se koristi u parfemima i lijekovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clear liquid carboxylic acid used in perfumes and drugs [valeric acid]</p><p><b>crvljakavrsti članonožci koji imaju dva para kuka na bočnim stranama usta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wormlike arthropod having two pairs of hooks at the sides of the mouth [tongue worm]</p><p><b>crvi na jeziku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tongue worms [subphylum Pentastomida]</p><p><b>s ili karakteriziran ili sastoji se od pet slogova (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or characterized by or consisting of five syllables</p><p><b>Prvi od tri dijela Hebrejskog pisma koji čine prve pet knjiga Hebrejskog pisma i koji se smatraju jednim cjelinom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first of three divisions of the Hebrew Scriptures comprising the first five books of the Hebrew Bible considered as a unit [Laws, Torah]</p><p><b>sportaš koji se takmiči u petatlonu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an athlete who competes in a pentathlon</p><p><b>atletsko natjecanje koje se sastoji od pet različitih događaja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an athletic contest consisting of five different events</p><p><b>Skala s pet nota. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gapped scale with five notes [pentatonic scale]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na pentatonsku ljestvicu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to a pentatonic scale</p><p><b>Skala s pet nota. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gapped scale with five notes [pentatone]</p><p><b>s valentnošću od 5 (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a valence of five</p><p><b>analgetik (trgovinski naziv Talwin) koji je manje ovisan od morfija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> analgesic drug (trade name Talwin) that is less addictive than morphine [Talwin]</p><p><b>duhovi, Blagdan sedmica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> seventh Sunday after Easter [Whitsunday]</p><p><i>n.</i> (Judaism) Jewish holy day celebrated on the sixth of Sivan to celebrate Moses receiving the Ten Commandments [Feast of Weeks, Shabuoth, Shavous, Shavuot, Shavuoth]</p><p><b>bilo koji član petkonosnog vjerskoga tijela, od ili u vezi s ili karakteristika bilo koje od različitih pentikostalnih vjerskih tijela ili njihovih članova, od ili u vezi s ili se događa na Pedesetnicu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any member of a Pentecostal religious body [Pentecostalist]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of any of various Pentecostal religious bodies or their members</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or occurring at Pentecost</p><p><b>svaka fundamentalistička protestantska crkva koja koristi metode oživljavanja da bi postigla iskustva uporediva s pentecostalnim iskustvima prvih kršćanskih učenika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any fundamentalist Protestant Church that uses revivalistic methods to achieve experiences comparable to the Pentecostal experiences of the first Christian disciples</p><p><b>načela i običaja petkonostih vjerskih skupina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the principles and practices of Pentecostal religious groups</p><p><b>bilo koji član petkonosnog vjerskoga tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any member of a Pentecostal religious body [Pentecostal]</p><p><b>nadstrešnica, penthaus, penthouse</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an apartment located on the top floors of a building</p><p><b>ponovno pojavljivanje na slici osnovne slike koja je bila prekrivena (obično kada kasnija slika postane transparentna s godinama) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the reappearance in a painting of an underlying image that had been painted over (usually when the later painting becomes transparent with age)</p><p><b>mineral (gvožđe i nikl sulfid) koji je glavna ruda nikla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mineral (iron and nickel sulphide) that is the chief ore of nickel</p><p><b>Barbiturat (trgovinski naziv Nembutal) koji se koristi kao sedativ i hipnotik i antispasmodik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a barbiturate (trade name Nembutal) used as a sedative and hypnotic and antispasmodic [Nembutal, pentobarbital sodium, yellow jacket]</p><p><b>Barbiturat (trgovinski naziv Nembutal) koji se koristi kao sedativ i hipnotik i antispasmodik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a barbiturate (trade name Nembutal) used as a sedative and hypnotic and antispasmodic [Nembutal, pentobarbital, yellow jacket]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thermionic tube having five electrodes</p><p><b>bilo koji monosaharidni šećer koji sadrži pet atoma ugljika po molekuli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any monosaccharide sugar containing five atoms of carbon per molecule</p><p><b>Barbiturat koji je higroskopski prah (trgovinski naziv Pentothal) koji je jak barbiturat koji djeluje brzo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> barbiturate that is a hygroscopic powder (trade name Pentothal) that is a strong barbiturate that acts rapidly [thiopental, thiopental sodium, thiopentobarbital sodium]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom kisika od 0,01 do 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an oxide containing five atoms of oxygen in the molecule</p><p><b>lijek (trgovinski naziv Trental) koji se koristi za liječenje klaudicije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug (trade name Trental) used to treat claudication [Trental]</p><p><b>lijek koji se koristi kao stimulansa cirkulacije i disanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug used as a circulatory and respiratory stimulant [Metrazol, pentamethylenetetrazol]</p><p><b>čokolada od sirovine i maslaca, mlijeka i orašastih plodova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fudge made with