e having purple or pink or white flowers [Lathyrus latifolius, broad-leaved everlasting pea]</p><p><b>grubi višegodišnji ragweed s puzećim korijenima suhih neplodnih zemljišta jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coarse perennial ragweed with creeping roots of dry barren lands of southwestern United States and Mexico [Ambrosia psilostachya, western ragweed]</p><p><b>Lolium perenne, engleski ljulj, ljulj utrinac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European perennial grass widely cultivated for pasture and hay and as a lawn grass [English ryegrass, Lolium perenne]</p><p><b>različite vrste aster (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a variety of aster</p><p><b>neprestano, trajno, vječno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a perennial manner</p><p><b>rod tropskih američkih grmova i drvenih planinara s tankim granama s širokim ravnim lištima i velikim cvjetnim panicama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of tropical American shrubby trees and woody climbers having slender branches with broad flat leaves and large panicles of flowers [Peireskia, genus Peireskia, genus Pereskia]</p><p><b>Zapadni indijski drveni planinari s trnastima stabljikama i brojnim mirisnim bijelim cvjetovima u panicama, a zatim malim žutim do narandžastim plodovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> West Indian woody climber with spiny stems and numerous fragrant white flowers in panicles followed by small yellow to orange fruits [Barbados-gooseberry vine, Barbados gooseberry]</p><p><b>perestrojka, prestrojka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an economic policy adopted in the former Soviet Union</p><p><b>besprijekoran, odlično, okončati, perfekt, perfektan, perfektno, poboljšati, potpun, pravi, sasvim, savršen, savršeno, svršiti, točan, usavršavati, usavršiti, završen</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tense of verbs used in describing action that has been completed (sometimes regarded as perfective aspect) [perfect tense, perfective, perfective tense]</p><p><i>v.</i> make perfect or complete [hone]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being complete of its kind and without defect or blemish</p><p><i>adj.</i> without qualification [arrant, complete, consummate, double-dyed, everlasting, gross, pure, sodding, staring, stark, thorough, thoroughgoing, unadulterated, utter]</p><p><i>adj.</i> precisely accurate or exact</p><p><b>igra u kojoj bacač ne dopušta bilo kojem protivniku da dođe do baze (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a game in which a pitcher does not allow any opposing player to reach base</p><p><b>hipotetički plin s molekulama zanemarljive veličine koje ne utječu na međumolekularne sile (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hypothetical gas with molecules of negligible size that exert no intermolecular forces [ideal gas]</p><p><b>Participijal koji izražava završenu akciju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a participle that expresses completed action [past participle]</p><p><b>sposobnost prepoznavanja visine tona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ability to identify the pitch of a tone [absolute pitch]</p><p><b>perfekt</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tense of verbs used in describing action that has been completed (sometimes regarded as perfective aspect) [perfect, perfective, perfective tense]</p><p><b>Kladim se da možeš izabrati prvog i drugog u pravom redoslijedu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bet that you can pick the first and second finishers in the right order [exacta]</p><p><b>usavršen, usavršili</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of plans, ideas, etc.) perfectly formed</p><p><b>besprijekoran, odlično, okončati, perfekt, perfektan, perfektno, poboljšati, potpun, pravi, sasvim, savršen, savršeno, svršiti, točan, usavršavati, usavršiti, završen (od &quot;perfect&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a skilled worker who perfects something</p><p><b>sposobnost da postanu savršeni. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capability of becoming perfect</p><p><b>koji može postati ili biti savršen. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of becoming or being made perfect</p><p><b>besprijekornost, dobra svojstva, perfekcija, savršenost, savršenstvo, usavršavanje, vrline, završetak, bezgrešnost, izvanrednost, izvrsnost, perfektnost, vrhunski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being without a flaw or defect [flawlessness, ne plus ultra]</p><p><i>n.</i> an ideal instance [beau ideal, idol, paragon]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of making something perfect</p><p><b>perfekcionizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disposition to feel that anything less than perfect is unacceptable</p><p><b>osoba koja je nezadovoljna bilo čime što ne ispunjava vrlo visoke standarde. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is displeased by anything that does not meet very high standards</p><p><b>savršen, perfekt</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tense of verbs used in describing action that has been completed (sometimes regarded as perfective aspect) [perfect, perfect tense, perfective tense]</p><p><i>n.</i> the aspect of a verb that expresses a completed action [perfective aspect]</p><p><b>aspekt glagola koji izražava završeno djelo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the aspect of a verb that expresses a completed action [perfective]</p><p><b>perfekt</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tense of verbs used in describing action that has been completed (sometimes regarded as perfective aspect) [perfect, perfect tense, perfective]</p><p><b>izvrsno, perfektno, potpuno, sasvim, savršeno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> completely and without qualification [absolutely, dead, utterly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a perfect or faultless way</p><p><b>karakterizira se intenzivnim emocijama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by intense emotion [ardent, fervent, fervid, fiery, impassioned, torrid]</p><p><b>izdajnički, nevjeran, podmukao</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to betray [punic, treacherous]</p><p><b>izdajnički, nevjeran, podmukao (od &quot;perfidious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a perfidious manner</p><p><b>perfidnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> betrayal of a trust [perfidy, treachery]</p><p><b>izdajstvo, perfidnost, podmuklost, pritvornost, izdaja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> betrayal of a trust [perfidiousness, treachery]</p><p><i>n.</i> an act of deliberate betrayal [betrayal, treachery, treason]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "sredstva za proizvodnju" znači sredstva za proizvodnju materijala koja se upotrebljavaju za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala za proizvodnju materijala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a powerful greenhouse gas emitted during the production of aluminum [PFC]</p><p><b>(od lišća) s podnožjem ujedinjenim oko (i očito probodenim) stabljike (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a leaf) having the base united around (and apparently pierced by) the stem</p><p><b>list s bazom ujedinjen oko - i očito proboden od strane - stabljika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a leaf with the base united around--and apparently pierced by--the stem</p><p><b>bušiti, perforirati, probiti, probušiti, bosti, izbušiti, probadati, probijati, probosti, nadirati, penetrirati, prodirati, prodrijeti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a hole into or between, as for ease of separation [punch]</p><p><i>v.</i> pass into or through, often by overcoming resistance [penetrate]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a hole cut through [perforated, pierced, punctured]</p><p><b>perforiran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a hole cut through [perforate, pierced, punctured]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a number or series of holes</p><p><b>bubnjev s rupom ili rupom u njemu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an eardrum with a hole or tear in it</p><p><b>vene koje prate arterije koje perforiraju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that accompany the perforating arteries [vena perforantis]</p><p><b>bušenje, otvor, perforacija, perforiranje, probijanje, rupa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a line of small holes for tearing at a particular place</p><p><i>n.</i> a hole made in something</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of punching a hole (especially a row of holes as for ease of separation)</p><p><b>na silu, po nuždi, silom</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by necessity</p><p><b>činiti, davati, djelovati, glumiti, igrati, ispunjavati, izvesti, izvode, izvodi, izvoditi, izvršiti, nastupati, obaviti, obavljanje, obavljati, obnašati, ostvariti, predstavljati, prikazivati, provesti, raditi, realizirati, svirati, učiniti, usavršiti, vršiti, izvršavati, napraviti, odrađivati, počiniti, praviti, nastupiti, završiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> carry out or perform an action [do, execute]</p><p><i>v.</i> perform a function</p><p><i>v.</i> give a performance (of something)</p><p><i>v.</i> get (something) done [do]</p><p><b>čin, činidba, djelo, djelovanje, dostignuće, ispunjavanje, izvedba, izvođenje, izvršavanje, izvršenje, nastupanje, obavljanje, performansa, predstava, priredba, radna svojstva, radna uspješnost, radni učinak, rezultat, snaga, stupanj izvršenja, trajnost, učinak, učinkovitost, vrhunski rezultat, izvedbe, izvedbi, izvođenja, performance, predstavu, nastup, funkcioniranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dramatic or musical entertainment [public presentation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of presenting a play or a piece of music or other entertainment</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of performing [carrying into action, carrying out, execution]</p><p><i>n.</i> any recognized accomplishment</p><p><i>n.</i> process or manner of functioning or operating [functioning, operation]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se ne ispune uvjeti ugovora, obveznica se daje kako bi se zaštitio primatelj od gubitka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bond given to protect the recipient against loss in case the terms of a contract are not filled [surety bond]</p><p><b>Sposobnost tehnološkog sustava za obavljanje namjenskih zadaća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capability of a technological system to perform as intended [operating capability]</p><p><b>izvođač, izvršitelj, performer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an entertainer who performs a dramatic or musical work for an audience [performing artist]</p><p><b>izvođenje, izvršavanje, koji izvodi razne vještine, obavljati, gluma, glumljenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the performance of a part or role in a drama [acting, playacting, playing]</p><p><b>izvođač, performer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an entertainer who performs a dramatic or musical work for an audience [performer]</p><p><b>reproduktivna umjetnost, izvedbena umjetnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arts or skills that require public performance</p><p><b>aroma, miris, namirisati, parfem, parfimirati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a distinctive odor that is pleasant [aroma, fragrance, scent]</p><p><i>n.</i> a toiletry that emits and diffuses a fragrant odor [essence]</p><p><i>v.</i> fill or impregnate with an odor [aromatise, aromatize]</p><p><i>v.</i> apply perfume to [scent]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 85% ili više, ali ne više od 50%, s prirodnim mirisom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> filled or impregnated with perfume [scented]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a natural fragrance [odoriferous, odorous, scented, sweet, sweet-scented, sweet-smelling]</p><p><b>aroma, miris, namirisati, parfem (od &quot;perfume&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who makes (and sells) perfumes</p><p><b>parfumerija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perfumes in general</p><p><i>n.</i> store where perfumes are sold</p><p><i>n.</i> an establishment where perfumes are made</p><p><i>n.</i> the art of making perfumes</p><p><b>aljkav, nepažljiv, površan (od &quot;perfunctory&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a set manner without serious attention [pro forma]</p><p><b>aljkav, nepažljiv, površan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> hasty and without attention to detail [casual, cursory, passing, superficial]</p><p><i>adj.</i> done or produced as a formality only [pro forma]</p><p><b>uzorkovati, obliti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> force a fluid through (a body part or tissue)</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to spread or flush or flood through, over, or across [suffuse]</p><p><b>perfuzija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pumping a liquid into an organ or tissue (especially by way of blood vessels)</p><p><b>Stari grčki grad smješten u zapadnom dijelu današnje Turske. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient Greek city located in the western part of what is now modern Turkey</p><p><b>okvir koji podržava penjanje biljaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a framework that supports climbing plants [arbor, arbour, bower]</p><p><b>moguće, možda, pak, valjda</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by chance [maybe, mayhap, peradventure, perchance, possibly]</p><p><b>dobri duh, dražesno stvorenje, vila</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a beautiful and graceful girl</p><p><i>n.</i> (Persian folklore) a supernatural being descended from fallen angels and excluded from paradise until penance is done</p><p><b>antihistaminik (trgovinski naziv Periactin) koji se koristi za liječenje nekih alergijskih reakcija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antihistamine (trade name Periactin) used to treat some allergic reactions [cyproheptadine]</p><p><b>oko anusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> around the anus</p><p><b>kolektivni izraz za vanjske dijelove cvijeta koji se sastoje od čaše i korole i koji uključuju štapove i pistile (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> collective term for the outer parts of a flower consisting of the calyx and corolla and enclosing the stamens and pistils [chlamys, floral envelope, perigone, perigonium]</p><p><b>(astronomija) točka na orbiti najbliža tijelu koje se kruži oko njega (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (astronomy) the point in an orbit closest to the body being orbited [point of periapsis]</p><p><b>autonomni pleksus koji prati arteriju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an autonomic plexus that accompanies an artery [plexus periarterialis]</p><p><b>upale vanjskog sloja arterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of the outer coat of an artery</p><p><b>Progresivna bolest vezivnog tkiva koju karakteriziraju čvorovi duž arterija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a progressive disease of connective tissue that is characterized by nodules along arteries [polyarteritis nodosa]</p><p><b>biljka iz Kanarskih otoka koja se široko uzgaja zbog svojih plavih ili ljubičastih ili crvenih ili raznovrsnih cvjetova nalik margariti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> herb of Canary Islands widely cultivated for its blue or purple or red or variegated daisylike flowers [Senecio cruentus, cineraria]</p><p><b>biljka dobivena od Pericallis cruenta i široko uzgajana u različitim obilnim cvjetnim oblicima s cvjetovima od bijelih do ružičastih do crvenih ili ljubičastih ili ljubičastih ili plavih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> herb derived from Pericallis cruenta and widely cultivated in a variety of profusely flowering forms with florets from white to pink to red or purple or violet or blue [florest's cineraria]</p><p><b>nalazi se oko srca ili se odnosi na ili utječe na perikard (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> located around the heart or relating to or affecting the pericardium [pericardial]</p><p><b>nalazi se oko srca ili se odnosi na ili utječe na perikard (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> located around the heart or relating to or affecting the pericardium [pericardiac]</p><p><b>prostor između slojeva perikarda koji sadrži tekućinu koja podmazuje površinu membrane i omogućuje lako kretanje srca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the space between the layers of the pericardium that contains fluid that lubricates the membrane surfaces and allows easy heart movement [pericardial space]</p><p><b>membrana koja okružuje srce (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the membrane surrounding the heart</p><p><b>prostor između slojeva perikarda koji sadrži tekućinu koja podmazuje površinu membrane i omogućuje lako kretanje srca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the space between the layers of the pericardium that contains fluid that lubricates the membrane surfaces and allows easy heart movement [pericardial cavity]</p><p><b>nekoliko malih vena iz perikarda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> several small veins from the pericardium [vena pericardiaca]</p><p><b>perikarditis</b><