riodic]</p><p><b>Sjevernoamerička cikada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American cicada [Magicicada septendecim, seventeen-year locust]</p><p><b>periodično, povremeno, povremen</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a sporadic manner [sporadically]</p><p><b>periodičnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of recurring at regular intervals [cyclicity]</p><p><b>za ili u vezi s ili uključuje ili prakticira periodontologiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or involving or practicing periodontics [periodontic]</p><p><b>parodontne bolesti, parodontoza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disease that attacks the gum and bone and around the teeth [periodontitis]</p><p><b>Odjel zubarstva koji se bavi bolestima desni i drugih struktura oko zuba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of dentistry dealing with diseases of the gums and other structures around the teeth [periodontics]</p><p><b>za ili u vezi s ili uključuje ili prakticira periodontologiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or involving or practicing periodontics [periodontal]</p><p><b>Odjel zubarstva koji se bavi bolestima desni i drugih struktura oko zuba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of dentistry dealing with diseases of the gums and other structures around the teeth [periodontia]</p><p><b>zubar koji se specijalizira za bolesti desni i druge strukture oko zuba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dentist specializing in diseases of the gums and other structure surrounding the teeth</p><p><b>parodontoza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disease that attacks the gum and bone and around the teeth [periodontal disease]</p><p><b>rod Gobiidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Gobiidae [genus Periophthalmus]</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenjem od oko 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dense fibrous membrane covering the surface of bones (except at their extremities) and serving as an attachment for tendons and muscles</p><p><b>peripatetik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who walks from place to place</p><p><i>n.</i> a fo