ica zubnih dodataka oko usta kapsule mahova, područje oko usta kod različitih beskičmenjaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (botany) fringe of toothlike appendages surrounding the mouth of a moss capsule</p><p><i>n.</i> region around the mouth in various invertebrates</p><p><b>s površinom od oko 10 mm ili više, ali ne više od 10 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having columniation completely circling an area of the structure [pseudoperipteral]</p><p><b>peristil</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colonnade surrounding a building or enclosing a court</p><p><b>u obliku boce (ascocarp) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> flask-shaped ascocarp</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s slojem tkiva oko malih krvnih žila (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the tissue layer around small blood vessels</p><p><b>sloj tkiva oko malih krvnih žila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tissue layer around small blood vessels</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s ili utječu na peritoneum (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or affecting the peritoneum</p><p><b>unutrašnjost peritoneuma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the interior of the peritoneum [greater peritoneal sac]</p><p><b>peritonitis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of the peritoneum [peritonitis]</p><p><b>potrbušnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transparent membrane that lines the abdominal cavity in mammals and covers most of the viscera</p><p><b>upala potrbušnice, peritonitis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of the peritoneum [peritoneal inflammation]</p><p><b>bolno upala mudraca i okolnih tkiva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a painful pus filled inflammation of the tonsils and surrounding tissues [quinsy]</p><p><b>Koronarni vazodilatator (trgovinski naziv Peritrate) koji se koristi za liječenje angine pectoris (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a coronary vasodilator (trade name Peritrate) used to treat angina pectoris [pentaerythritol]</p><p><b>Sve je prekriveno ravnomjerno raspoređenim flagelom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> covered all over with uniformly distributed flagella</p><p><b>perika, vlasulja</b><