f northern India and China having purple blossoms and small inedible yellow fruits [China tree, Melia azedarach, Melia azederach, azedarach, azederach, chinaberry, chinaberry tree, pride-of-India]</p><p><i>n.</i> small densely branching Asiatic shrub having lanceolate leaves and panicles of fragrant lilac flowers [Syringa persica]</p><p><b>Svaka vrsta vinove loze od lubenice koja ima plodove glatke bele kore i bijelo ili zelenkasto meso koje nema miris muške, Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of a variety of muskmelon vines having fruit with a smooth white rind and white or greenish flesh that does not have a musky smell [Cucumis melo inodorus, honeydew melon, winter melon, winter melon vine]</p><p><i>n.</i> the fruit of a variety of winter melon vine</p><p><b>višegodišnja biljka koja se uzgaja posebno kao kućna biljka zbog mirisnih plavičasto-tamnolavandarskih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial cultivated especially as a houseplant for its fragrant bluish to dark lavender flowers [Exacum affine]</p><p><b>Euroazijski orah cijenjen zbog svojih velikih jestivih oraha i tvrdog drveta s bogatim oblikama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Eurasian walnut valued for its large edible nut and its hard richly figured wood [Circassian walnut, English walnut, English walnut tree, Juglans regia]</p><p><b>ismijavanje, šegačenje, zadirkivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> light teasing</p><p><b>dragun, lotos-drvo, persimon, kaki, hurma</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several tropical trees of the genus Diospyros [persimmon tree]</p><p><i>n.</i> orange fruit resembling a plum</p><p><b>bilo koje od nekoliko tropskih stabala rod Diospyros (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several tropical trees of the genus Diospyros [persimmon]</p><p><b>biti uporan, izdržati, odoljeti, oduprijeti se, ustrajati, ostati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> continue to exist [die hard, endure, prevail, run]</p><p><i>v.</i> be persistent, refuse to stop [hang in, hang on, hold on, persevere]</p><p><i>v.</i> stay behind [remai