ivanja, moć rasuđivanja, oštroumnost, promišljenost, razboritost, razložitost, razložnost, razumnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intelligence manifested by being astute (as in business dealings) [astuteness, perspicaciousness, shrewdness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the capacity to assess situations or circumstances shrewdly and to draw sound conclusions [judgement, judgment, sound judgement, sound judgment]</p><p><b>jasnoća, pronicljivost, prozračnost, razumljivost, shvatljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clarity as a consequence of being perspicuous [perspicuousness, plainness]</p><p><b>jasan, prozračan, razumljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of language) transparently clear [crystal clear, limpid, lucid, luculent, pellucid]</p><p><b>jasan, prozračan, razumljiv (od &quot;perspicuous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a clear and lucid manner [limpidly, lucidly, pellucidly]</p><p><b>jasan, prozračan, razumljiv (od &quot;perspicuous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clarity as a consequence of being perspicuous [perspicuity, plainness]</p><p><b>isparavanje, znoj, znojenje, perspiracija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> salty fluid secreted by sweat glands [sudor, sweat]</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of the sweat glands of the skin secreting a salty fluid [diaphoresis, hidrosis, sudation, sweating]</p><p><b>hlapiti, isparavati se, znojiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> excrete perspiration through the pores in the skin [sudate, sweat]</p><p><b>hlapiti, isparavati se, znojiti se (od &quot;perspire&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who perspires [sweater]</p><p><b>biti podložan uvjeravanju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being susceptible to persuasion [convincible, persuasible, suasible]</p><p><b>nagovoriti, natjerati, preklinjati, uvjeriti, nagovarati, navesti, navoditi, oduševiti, oduševljavati, osvajati, osvojiti, pridobiti, pridobivati, privoljeti, sklanjati, skloniti, sklonuti, ushititi, ushićivati, uvjeravati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> win approval or support for [carry, sway]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause somebody to adopt a certain position, b