oad leaves and a dense spike of flowers [genus Phalaris]</p><p><b>višegodišnje trave iz Australije i Južne Afrike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial grass of Australia and South Africa [Harding grass, Phalaris tuberosa, hardinggrass, toowomba canary grass]</p><p><b>višegodišnje trave močvarnih livada i jarki s širokim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial grass of marshy meadows and ditches having broad leaves [gardener's garters, lady's laces, reed canary grass, ribbon grass]</p><p><b>Uro od šumaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Canary Islands grass [birdseed grass, canary grass]</p><p><b>višegodišnje trave iz Australije i Južne Afrike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial grass of Australia and South Africa [Harding grass, Phalaris aquatica, hardinggrass, toowomba canary grass]</p><p><b>mala ptica poput pijeskaca koja ima lobate prste i dobra plivačica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small sandpiper-like shorebird having lobate toes and being good swimmers</p><p><b>ptice (Phalaropes) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> phalaropes [family Phalaropidae]</p><p><b>vrsta rod Phalaropidae: phalaropes (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Phalaropidae: phalaropes [genus Phalaropus]</p><p><b>Ploče i ptice iz morskih voda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> phalarope of northern oceans and lakes [red phalarope]</p><p><b>dvanaesti mjesec hinduističkog kalendara. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the twelfth month of the Hindu calendar [Phagun]</p><p><b>obitelj gljiva koja pripada redu Phallales i koja uključuje prave smrdljive rogove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of fungi belonging to the order Phallales and comprising the true stinkhorns [family Phallaceae]</p><p><b>red gljiva koji obuhvaćaju smrdljive i srodne oblike čiji je zreli himenij sluzni i smrdljivi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> order of fungi comprising the stinkhorns and related forms whose mature hymenium is slimy and fetid [order Phallales]</p><p><b>falusni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to a phallus especially as an embodiment of generative power</p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling or being a phallus [priapic]</p><p><b>(psihoanaliza) treća faza u razvoju djeteta kada je svjesnost i manipulacija genitalijama trebao biti primarni izvor zadovoljstva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychoanalysis) the third stage in a child's development when awareness of and manipulation of the genitals is supposed to be a primary source of pleasure [phallic stage]</p><p><b>(psihoanaliza) treća faza u razvoju djeteta kada je svjesnost i manipulacija genitalijama trebao biti primarni izvor zadovoljstva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychoanalysis) the third stage in a child's development when awareness of and manipulation of the genitals is supposed to be a primary source of pleasure [phallic phase]</p><p><b>rekonstruktivna operacija penisa za popravak urođene abnormalnosti ili ozljede (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> reconstructive surgery on the penis to repair congenital abnormality or injury</p><p><b>rod gljiva s kapom ili pileusom koji slobodno visi oko stabljike, Muški spolni organ (`član' je eufemizam) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of fungi having the cap or pileus hanging free around the stem [genus Phallus]</p><p><i>n.</i> the male sex organ (`member' is a euphemism) [member, penis]</p><p><b>uobičajena gljiva koja se nekada koristila za pripremu masti za reumatske bolesti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a common fungus formerly used in preparing a salve for rheumatism [common stinkhorn]</p><p><b>Ovaj smrdljivi rog ima kap sa granuloznom površinom na vrhu i miriše na trule meso. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> this stinkhorn has a cap with a granulose surface at the apex and smells like decaying flesh</p><p><b>otporan na sušu Azijski drveći grm koji daje ugodno kiselu malu crvenu voću koja se obično koristi u šerpetama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> drought-resistant Asiatic treelike shrub bearing pleasantly acid small red edible fruits commonly used in sherbets [Grewia asiatica]</p><p><b>sjemenjače, spermatofiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant that reproduces by means of seeds not spores [seed plant, spermatophyte]</p><p><b>u bivšim sustavima klasifikacije: jedna od dvije glavne biljne divizije, uključujući sve biljke sjemena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in former classification systems: one of two major plant divisions, including all seed-bearing plants</p><p><b>neodoljiva želja za grizanjem površinskih dijelova tijela (kao što je opsesivno grizanje noktiju) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an irresistible desire to pick at superficial body parts (as in obsessive nail-biting)</p><p><b>fanerozoik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the period from about 540 million years ago until the present, a period when abundant life existed [Phanerozoic aeon, Phanerozoic eon]</p><p><b>razdoblje od prije oko 540 milijuna godina do danas, razdoblje kada je postojao obilan život (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the period from about 540 million years ago until the present, a period when abundant life existed [Phanerozoic, Phanerozoic eon]</p><p><b>razdoblje od prije oko 540 milijuna godina do danas, razdoblje kada je postojao obilan život (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the period from about 540 million years ago until the present, a period when abundant life existed [Phanerozoic, Phanerozoic aeon]</p><p><b>sablast</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ghostly appearing figure [apparition, fantasm, phantasma, phantom, specter, spectre]</p><p><i>n.</i> something existing in perception only [apparition, fantasm, phantasma, phantom, shadow]</p><p><b>duhovit lik., Nešto što postoji samo u percepciji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ghostly appearing figure [apparition, fantasm, phantasm, phantom, specter, spectre]</p><p><i>n.</i> something existing in perception only [apparition, fantasm, phantasm, phantom, shadow]</p><p><b>neprestano mijenjajuća se kombinacija stvarnih ili zamišljenih slika (kao u snu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a constantly changing medley of real or imagined images (as in a dream)</p><p><b>karakterizira fantastične slike i nekongruzivne suprotstavljanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by fantastic imagery and incongruous juxtapositions [phantasmagorical, surreal, surrealistic]</p><p><b>karakterizira fantastične slike i nekongruzivne suprotstavljanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by fantastic imagery and incongruous juxtapositions [phantasmagoric, surreal, surrealistic]</p><p><b>koji liči na ili ima karakteristike fantaze (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling or characteristic of a phantom [apparitional, ghostlike, ghostly, spectral, spiritual]</p><p><b>fantazija, iluzija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something many people believe that is false [fancy, fantasy, illusion]</p><p><i>n.</i> fiction with a large amount of imagination in it [fantasy]</p><p><i>n.</i> imagination unrestricted by reality [fantasy]</p><p><b>zamišljeni život živjeli u svijetu fantazije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an imaginary life lived in a fantasy world [fantasy life]</p><p><b>nešto što postoji isključivo u mašti (ali često pogrešno za stvarnost) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something existing solely in the imagination (but often mistaken for reality) [fairyland, fantasy world]</p><p><b>fantom, fantomu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ghostly appearing figure [apparition, fantasm, phantasm, phantasma, specter, spectre]</p><p><i>n.</i> something existing in perception only [apparition, fantasm, phantasm, phantasma, shadow]</p><p><i>adj.</i> something apparently sensed but having no physical reality</p><p><b>iluzija da dio tijela još uvijek postoji nakon što je amputiran (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the illusion that a limb still exists after it has been amputated</p><p><b>bol koju osjeća amputirani koji se čini da se nalazi u nedostajućem udaru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pain felt by an amputee that seems to be located in the missing limb</p><p><b>sindrom koji se sastoji od nelagode ili boli u udobu koji je amputiran (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> syndrome consisting of discomfort or pain in a limb that has been amputated</p><p><b>Voskasta bijela biljka s stabljikama u grmovima i rasemi bijelih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> waxy white nearly leafless plant with stems in clusters and racemes of white flowers [Eburophyton austinae, snow orchid]</p><p><b>naziv drevnih egipatskih kraljeva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the title of the ancient Egyptian kings [Pharaoh of Egypt]</p><p><b>mali crveni mrav toplih područja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small red ant of warm regions [Monomorium pharaonis, pharaoh's ant]</p><p><b>naziv drevnih egipatskih kraljeva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the title of the ancient Egyptian kings [Pharaoh]</p><p><b>mali crveni mrav toplih područja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small red ant of warm regions [Monomorium pharaonis, pharaoh ant]</p><p><b>crkavica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small mostly white vulture of Africa and southern Eurasia [Egyptian vulture, Neophron percnopterus]</p><p><b>o ili u vezi sa drevnim egipatskim kraljevima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the ancient Egyptian kings</p><p><b>pretjerano ili licemjerno pobožno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> excessively or hypocritically pious [holier-than-thou, pharisaical, pietistic, pietistical, sanctimonious, self-righteous]</p><p><b>pretjerano ili licemjerno pobožno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> excessively or hypocritically pious [holier-than-thou, pharisaic, pietistic, pietistical, sanctimonious, self-righteous]</p><p><b>samopravednik ili licemjer, član drevne židovske sekte koja je bila poznata po strogom poštovanju židovskih običaja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a self-righteous or sanctimonious person</p><p><i>n.</i> a member of an ancient Jewish sect noted for strict obedience to Jewish traditions</p><p><b>tvrtka koja proizvodi i prodaje lijekove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company that makes and sells pharmaceuticals [drug company, pharmaceutical company]</p><p><b>lijek, farmaceutski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> drug or medicine that is prepared or dispensed in pharmacies and used in medical treatment [pharmaceutical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to pharmacy or pharmacists [pharmaceutical]</p><p><b>farmaceutskoj, lijek, farmaceutski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> drug or medicine that is prepared or dispensed in pharmacies and used in medical treatment [pharmaceutic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to pharmacy or pharmacists [pharmaceutic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to drugs used in medical treatment</p><p><b>osoba obučena u znanosti o lijekovima (njihov sastav, upotreba i učinci) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone trained in the science of drugs (their composition and uses and effects) [pharmacologist]</p><p><b>tvrtka koja proizvodi i prodaje lijekove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company that makes and sells pharmaceuticals [drug company, pharma]</p><p><b>farmacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the art and science of preparing and dispensing drugs and medicines, [pharmacy]</p><p><b>apotekar, farmaceut, ljekarnik, apoteka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a health professional trained in the art of preparing and dispensing drugs [apothecary, chemist, druggist, pill pusher, pill roller]</p><p><b>grana genetike koja proučava genetski određene varijacije u odgovoru na lijekove kod ljudi ili laboratorijskih organizama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of genetics that studies the genetically determined variations in responses to drugs in humans or laboratory organisms</p><p><b>farmakokinetika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the study of the action of drugs in the body: method and rate of excretion</p><p><b>farmakološki</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to pharmacology [pharmacological]</p><p><b>farmakološki</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to pharmacology [pharmacologic]</p><p><b>farmakologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the science or study of drugs: their preparation and properties and uses and effects [materia medica, pharmacology]</p><p><b>farmakološki (od &quot;pharmacological&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with regard to pharmacology</p><p><b>osoba obučena u znanosti o lijekovima (njihov sastav, upotreba i učinci) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone trained in the science of drugs (their composition and uses and effects) [pharmaceutical chemist]</p><p><b>farmakologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the science or study of drugs: their preparation and properties and uses and effects [materia medica, pharmacological medicine]</p><p><b>(farmakologija) knjiga koja sadrži zbirku farmaceutskih proizvoda s njihovim formulama i metodama pripreme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (pharmacology) a book containing a compilation of pharmaceutical products with their formulas and methods of preparation [formulary]</p><p><b>farmakopeja, ljekopis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a collection or stock of drugs</p><p><b>apoteka, apotekarstvo, farmacija, ljekarna, farmacije, farmaciju</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the art and science of preparing and dispensing drugs and medicines, [pharmaceutics]</p><p><i>n.</i> a retail shop where medicine and other articles are sold [apothecary's shop, chemist's, chemist's shop, drugstore]</p><p><b>rod Trogonidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Trogonidae [genus Pharomacrus]</p><p><b>vrlo rijetka ptica iz Srednje Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> very rare Central American bird [resplendent quetzel, resplendent trogon]</p><p><b>svjetionik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tower with a light that gives warning of shoals to passing ships [beacon, beacon light, lighthouse]</p><p><b>Cezar je porazio Pompeja 48. godine prije Krista. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Caesar defeated Pompey in 48 BC [battle of Pharsalus]</p><p><b>suzbijekle izražene u stražnjem dijelu usta ili grla, od ili u vezi s grlom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a consonant articulated in the back of the mouth or throat [guttural, guttural consonant, pharyngeal consonant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the throat</p><p><b>suzbijekle izražene u stražnjem dijelu usta ili grla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a consonant articulated in the back of the mouth or throat [guttural, guttural consonant, pharyngeal]</p><p><b>mali prodor u zidu grla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small recess in the wall of the pharynx</p><p><b>normalni refleks koji se sastoji od povraćanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> normal reflex consisting of retching [gag reflex]</p><p><b>skup limfnog tkiva u grlu iza uvule (na stražnjem zidu i krovu nosohotre) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of lymphatic tissue in the throat behind the uvula (on the posterior wall and roof of the nasopharynx) [Luschka's tonsil, adenoid, third tonsil, tonsilla adenoidea, tonsilla pharyngealis]</p><p><b>vene iz faringalnog pleksusa koje se isprazniju u unutarnju jugularsku venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins from the pharyngeal plexus that empty into the internal jugular vein [vena pharyngeus]</p><p><b>upale čeljusti i grla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of the fauces and pharynx [raw throat, sore throat]</p><p><b>farinks, ždrijelo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the passage to the stomach and lungs [throat]</p><p><b>miševi u vrećicama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pouched mice [genus Phascogale]</p><p><b>koala</b></p><p><i>n.</i> koalas [genus Phascolarctos]</p><p><b>Australski drveni marsipalij bez repa s sivim dlakavim ušima i plaštom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sluggish tailless Australian arboreal marsupial with grey furry ears and coat [kangaroo bear, koala, koala bear, native bear]</p><p><b>faza, fazni, fazu, mijena, morska mijena, period</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any distinct time period in a sequence of events [stage]</p><p><i>n.</i> (physical chemistry) a distinct state of matter in a system [form]</p><p><i>n.</i> a particular point in the time of a cycle [phase angle]</p><p><i>n.</i> (astronomy) the particular appearance of a body's state of illumination (especially one of the recurring shapes of the part of Earth's moon that is illuminated by the sun)</p><p><i>v.</i> arrange in phases or stages</p><p><i>v.</i> adjust so as to be in a synchronized condition</p><p><b>fazni kut</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a particular point in the time of a cycle [phase]</p><p><b>promjena iz jednog stanja (čvrstoga ili tekućeg ili plinovog) u drugo bez promjene kemijskog sastava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a change from one state (solid or liquid or gas) to another without a change in chemical composition [phase transition, physical change, state change]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u slučaju da se primjenjuje primjena ovog članka, nadležno tijelo može odrediti da je primjena ovog članka primjenjiva na sve proizvode koji se upotrebljavaju u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clinical trial on a few persons to determine the safety of a new drug or invasive medical device [phase I clinical trial]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u slučaju da se primjenjuje primjena ovog članka, nadležno tijelo može odrediti da je primjena ovog članka primjenjiva na sve proizvode koji se upotrebljavaju u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clinical trial on a few persons to determine the safety of a new drug or invasive medical device [phase I]</p><p><b>kliničko ispitivanje na više osoba nego u fazi I. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clinical trial on more persons than in phase I [phase II clinical trial]</p><p><b>kliničko ispitivanje na više osoba nego u fazi I. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clinical trial on more persons than in phase I [phase II]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je primjena lijekova ili lijekova u skladu s člankom 5. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) Uredbe (EU) br. 528/2012, primjenjuje se sljedeći postupak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large clinical trial of a treatment or drug that in phase I and phase II has been shown to be efficacious with tolerable side effects [phase III clinical trial]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je primjena lijekova ili lijekova u skladu s člankom 5. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) Uredbe (EU) br. 528/2012, primjenjuje se sljedeći postupak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large clinical trial of a treatment or drug that in phase I and phase II has been shown to be efficacious with tolerable side effects [phase III]</p><p><b>uvesti postupno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> introduce gradually</p><p><b>FDA ponekad odobri lijek za opću upotrebu, ali zahtijeva od proizvođača da nastavi pratiti njegove učinke. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sometimes the FDA approves a drug for general use but requires the manufacturer to continue to monitor its effects [phase IV clinical trial]</p><p><b>FDA ponekad odobri lijek za opću upotrebu, ali zahtijeva od proizvođača da nastavi pratiti njegove učinke. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sometimes the FDA approves a drug for general use but requires the manufacturer to continue to monitor its effects [phase IV]</p><p><b>fazna modulacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> modulation of the phase of the carrier wave [PM]</p><p><b>stadij u mejozi ili mitozi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stage in meiosis or mitosis</p><p><b>vrijeme kada Mjesec predstavlja određeni ponavljajući se izgled (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a time when the Moon presents a particular recurring appearance</p><p><b>Postepeno se završava. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> terminate gradually</p><p><b>(fizički) idealan prostor u kojem koordinatne dimenzije predstavljaju varijable koje su potrebne za opisivanje sustava ili tvari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) an ideal space in which the coordinate dimensions represent the variables that are required to describe a system or substance</p><p><b>fazna pretvorba, fazni prijelaz</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a change from one state (solid or liquid or gas) to another without a change in chemical composition [phase change, physical change, state change]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se ne primjenjuje primjena ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći postupak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act or instance of a planned discontinuation</p><p><b>biljke iz toplih regija uključujući većinu američkih graha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> herbs of warm regions including most American beans [genus Phaseolus]</p><p><b>U istočnoindijske biljke s dlakavim listovima i malim žutim cvijećima s cilindričnim strukom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> East Indian legume having hairy foliage and small yellow flowers followed by cylindrical pods [Vigna aconitifolia, moth bean]</p><p><b>biljka s okruglim bijelom ili žutom ili smeđom ili crnom bojom, koja se nalazi na jugozapadu Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> twining plant of southwestern United States and Mexico having roundish white or yellow or brown or black beans [tepary bean]</p><p><b>Bliski godišnji biljci široko uzgajani u Kini i Japanu za brašno od sjemena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bushy annual widely grown in China and Japan for the flour made from its seeds [Vigna angularis, adsuki bean, adzuki bean]</p><p><b>Breskasti godišnji stabla široko uzgajana u toplim područjima Indije i Indonezije i Sjedinjenih Američkih Država za hranivo i posebno za njena jestiva sjeme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect bushy annual widely cultivated in warm regions of India and Indonesia and United States for forage and especially its edible seeds [Vigna radiata, mung, mung bean, mung bean plant]</p><p><b>višegodišnje tropske američke loze uzgajane zbog svojih žutih i ljubičastih cvijeća s korolnom kilom navučenom poput školjke puževa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial tropical American vine cultivated for its racemes of showy yellow and purple flowers having the corolla keel coiled like a snail shell [Vigna caracalla, corkscrew flower, snail-flower, snail bean, snail flower, snailflower]</p><p><b>tropski američki grah s crvenim cvijećem i mrljano crnim grahom sličnim Phaseolus vulgaris-u, ali višegodišnji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American bean with red flowers and mottled black beans similar to Phaseolus vulgaris but perennial [Dutch case-knife bean, Phaseolus multiflorus, runner bean, scarlet runner, scarlet runner bean]</p><p><b>biljka od grma ili visokokvalitetne biljke graha s velikim ravnim jestivim sjemenima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bush or tall-growing bean plant having large flat edible seeds [lima bean, lima bean plant]</p><p><b>biljka graha od busha koja se uzgaja uglavnom u južnim Sjedinjenim Državama s malim ravnim jestivim sjemenima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bush bean plant cultivated especially in southern United States having small flat edible seeds [butter-bean plant, butter bean, lima bean, sieva bean]</p><p><b>tropski američki grah s crvenim cvijećem i mrljano crnim grahom sličnim Phaseolus vulgaris-u, ali višegodišnji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American bean with red flowers and mottled black beans similar to Phaseolus vulgaris but perennial [Dutch case-knife bean, Phaseolus coccineus, runner bean, scarlet runner, scarlet runner bean]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, uz pomoć ovog članka, za sve vrste biljaka za uzgoj u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, za koje se primjenjuje točka (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste biljaka za uzgoj u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste biljaka za uzgoj u skladu s člankom 5. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste biljaka za uzgoj u skladu s člankom 5. točkom (a) ovog članka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the common annual twining or bushy bean plant grown for its edible seeds or pods [common bean, common bean plant]</p><p><b>fazanka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a kind of game bird in the family Phasianidae</p><p><b>Ptica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pheasants [family Phasianidae]</p><p><b>rod Phasianus</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Phasianidae: the typical pheasants [genus Phasianus]</p><p><b>obični fazant s svijetlim perjem i bijelim krugom na vratu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common pheasant having bright plumage and a white neck ring [ring-necked pheasant]</p><p><b>insekti s štapom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stick insects [Phasmidae, family Phasmatidae, family Phasmidae]</p><p><b>u nekim klasifikacijama smatraju se podredom Orthoptera: štapovi insekti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in some classifications considered a suborder of Orthoptera: stick insects [Phasmida, order Phasmatodea, order Phasmida]</p><p><b>Veliki cilindrični ili ravni uglavnom tropski insekti s dugim snažnim nogama koji se hrane biljkama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large cylindrical or flattened mostly tropical insects with long strong legs that feed on plants [phasmid insect]</p><p><b>Veliki cilindrični ili ravni uglavnom tropski insekti s dugim snažnim nogama koji se hrane biljkama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large cylindrical or flattened mostly tropical insects with long strong legs that feed on plants [phasmid]</p><p><b>u nekim klasifikacijama smatraju se podredom Orthoptera: štapovi insekti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in some classifications considered a suborder of Orthoptera: stick insects [Phasmatodea, order Phasmatodea, order Phasmida]</p><p><b>insekti s štapom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stick insects [Phasmatidae, family Phasmatidae, family Phasmidae]</p><p><b>jedna od dvije podgrupe Nematoda koje se koriste u nekim sustavima klasifikacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of two subgroups of Nematoda used in some classification systems [class Phasmidia]</p><p><b>Razgovorni govor koristi se za komuniciranje društvenosti više nego informacija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> conversational speech used to communicate sociability more than information [phatic speech]</p><p><b>Razgovorni govor koristi se za komuniciranje društvenosti više nego informacija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> conversational speech used to communicate sociability more than information [phatic communication]</p><p><b>dr.sc.</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a doctorate usually based on at least 3 years graduate study and a dissertation [Ph.D.]</p><p><b>fazan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large long-tailed gallinaceous bird native to the Old World but introduced elsewhere</p><p><i>n.</i> flesh of a pheasant</p><p><b>Australska ptica sa repom poput fazana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Australian bird with a tail like a pheasant [Centropus phasianinus, pheasant cuckoo]</p><p><b>Australska ptica sa repom poput fazana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Australian bird with a tail like a pheasant [Cent