idae [genus Photoblepharon]</p><p><b>ribama u dubokim tamnim vodama s svjetlim organom ispod svakog oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fish of deep dark waters having a light organ below each eye [flashlight fish]</p><p><b>fotokatoda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cathode that emits electrons when illuminated</p><p><b>fotootpornik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transducer used to detect and measure light and other radiations [electric eye, magic eye, photoconductive cell, photoelectric cell]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s ili proizvedene učincima svjetlosti na kemijske sustave (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or produced by the effects of light on chemical systems</p><p><b>radijacija (između ostalog, radijacija) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exchange produced by the chemical action of radiant energy (especially light)</p><p><b>kemijska reakcija proizvedena djelovanjem svjetlosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chemical reaction produced by the action of light</p><p><b>fotokemija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> branch of chemistry that deals with the chemical action of light</p><p><b>kirurški postupak koji koristi intenzivan laserski zrak za uništavanje obolelog tkiva mrežnjače ili za stvaranje ožiljka koji će zadržati mrežnjaču u slučajevima otcjepljene mrežnjače (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> surgical procedure that uses an intense laser beam to destroy diseased retinal tissue or to make a scar that will hold the retina in cases of detached retina</p><p><b>fotokoagulator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> surgical instrument containing a laser for use in photocoagulation</p><p><b>promjena električne provodljivosti tvari kao posljedica apsorpcije elektromagnetnog zračenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> change in the electrical conductivity of a substance as a result of absorbing electromagnetic radiation [photoconductivity]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to photoconductivity</p><p><b>fotootpornik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transducer used to detect and measure light and other radiations [electric eye, magic eye, photocell, photoelectric cell]</p><p><b>fotovodljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> change in the electrical conductivity of a substance as a result of absorbing electromagnetic radiation [photoconduction]</p><p><b>aparat za kopiranje, fotokopirni uređaj, fotopreslikač, uređaj za fotokopiranje, fotokopirka, kopirka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a copier that uses photographic methods of making copies</p><p><b>fotokopija, fotokopiju, fotokopirati, preslik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a photographic copy of written or printed or graphic work</p><p><i>v.</i> reproduce by xerography [run off, xerox]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 300 kWh ili većim (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to photoelectricity [photoelectrical]</p><p><b>fotoćelija, fotootpornik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transducer used to detect and measure light and other radiations [electric eye, magic eye, photocell, photoconductive cell]</p><p><b>Slobodnja ili apsorpcija kvantnih materija iznad određenog razina energije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the release or absorption of quanta above a certain energy level</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 300 kWh ili većim (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to photoelectricity [photoelectric]</p><p><b>s električnim svjetlom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by photoelectric means</p><p><b>Električna energija proizvedena svjetlom ili pod utjecajem svjetlosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electricity generated by light or affected by light</p><p><b>elektron koji se emitira iz atoma ili molekula incidentnim fotonom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electron that is emitted from an atom or molecule by an incident photon</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an emission of photoelectrons (especially from a metallic surface)</p><p><b>od ili povezane s fotodeziranjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to photoemission</p><p><b>graviranje koje se koristi za reprodukciju ilustracije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an engraving used to reproduce an illustration [halftone, halftone engraving]</p><p><b>blic, bljeskalica, flash, fleš</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lamp for providing momentary light to take a photograph [flash, flash bulb, flash lamp, flashbulb, flashgun]</p><p><b>svjetlo koje je izvor umjetnog osvjetljenja širokog zraka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> light that is a source of artificial illumination having a broad beam [flood, flood lamp, floodlight]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom materijala od 85% ili više, ali ne više od 50%, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a photomechanical printing process that uses a glass plate with a gelatin surface that carries the image to be reproduced [collotype, collotype printing]</p><p><b>fotogeničan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> looking attractive in photographs</p><p><b>refleksna epilepsija izazvana treperenjem svjetlosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> reflex epilepsy induced by a flickering light</p><p><b>fotografija, fotografijom, fotografirati, snimati, slikati, snimiti, uslikati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a representation of a person or scene in the form of a print or transparent slide or in digital format [exposure, photo, pic, picture]</p><p><i>v.</i> record on photographic film [shoot, snap]</p><p><i>v.</i> undergo being photographed in a certain way</p><p><b>album za fotografije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an album for photographs</p><p><b>fotograf, fotografska radnja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who takes photographs professionally [lensman]</p><p><b>Model koji pozira za fotografe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a model who poses for photographers</p><p><b>fotografski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to photography or obtained by using photography</p><p><i>adj.</i> representing people or nature with the exactness and fidelity of a photograph</p><p><b>fotić, fotoaparat, fotokamera, kamera</b></p><p><i>n.</i> equipment for taking photographs (usually consisting of a lightproof box with a lens at one end and light-sensitive film at the other) [camera]</p><p><b>(fizička) mjera d