es [U-boat, sub, submarine]</p><p><b>glupak, golub, naivčina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wild and domesticated birds having a heavy body and short legs</p><p><b>Visoka gruba višegodišnja američka biljka s malim bijelim cvijećem, nakon čega slijede crnocrvene bobice na dugim spuštenicima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall coarse perennial American herb having small white flowers followed by blackish-red berries on long drooping racemes [Phytolacca americana, garget, poke, scoke]</p><p><b>abnormalna izbočina prsne kosti uzrokovana rahitisom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormal protrusion of the breastbone caused by rickets [chicken breast]</p><p><b>izmet golubova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> droppings of pigeons</p><p><b>Sjevernopacifički guillemot (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> northern Pacific guillemot [Cepphus columba]</p><p><b>mali sokol iz Europe i Amerike s tamnim perjem s crno-šipčanim repom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small falcon of Europe and America having dark plumage with black-barred tail [Falco columbarius, merlin]</p><p><b>Podignuta skloništa u kojoj se drže golubovi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a raised shelter in which pigeons are kept [loft]</p><p><b>tropska drvena biljka s navidnim žutim cvijećem i ravnim čunjama, Sjemenke i sjemenke s visokom hranjivom vrijednošću (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical woody herb with showy yellow flowers and flat pods [Cajanus cajan, cajan pea, catjang pea, dahl, dhal, pigeon-pea plant, red gram]</p><p><i>n.</i> small highly nutritious seed of the tropical pigeon-pea plant [cajan pea, dahl]</p><p><b>invalidnost u kojoj su prsti okrenuti unutačno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> disability in which the toes are turned inward</p><p><b>s deformacijom prsnog koša uzrokovanom rahitisom u djetinjstvu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a chest deformity marked by a projecting breastbone caused by infantile rickets [chicken-breasted]</p><p><b>tropska drvena biljka s navidnim žutim cvijećem i ravnim čunjama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical woody herb with showy yellow flowers and flat pods [Cajanus cajan, cajan pea, catjang pea, dahl, dhal, pigeon pea, red gram]</p><p><b>Imaju noge koje se okreću prema unutra. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having feet that turn inward</p><p><b>pretinac, stereotipizirati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a specific (often simplistic) category</p><p><i>n.</i> a small compartment [cubbyhole]</p><p><i>v.</i> place into a small compartment</p><p><i>v.</i> treat or classify according to a mental stereotype [stamp, stereotype]</p><p><b>pretinac (od &quot;pigeonhole&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system for classifying things into groups [grouping]</p><p><b>pronađen oko Velikog koraljnog grebena, pronađen od Long Islanda prema jugu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> found around the Great Barrier Reef [Achoerodus gouldii, giant pigfish]</p><p><i>n.</i> found from Long Island southward [Orthopristis chrysopterus, hogfish]</p><p><b>svinjogojstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a farm where pigs are raised or kept [pig farm]</p><p><b>halapljiv, pohlepan, prljav, svinjski, tvrdoglav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling swine [hoggish, piggy, porcine, swinish]</p><p><b>halapljiv, pohlepan, prljav, svinjski, tvrdoglav (od &quot;piggish&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a piggish manner</p><p><b>halapljiv, pohlepan, prljav, svinjski, tvrdoglav (od &quot;piggish&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an excessive desire for food [greediness, hoggishness]</p><p><b>prase, domaća svinja, krmče, prasence, praščić, svinjče</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a young pig [piglet, shoat, shote]</p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling swine [hoggish, piggish, porcine, swinish]</p><p><b>dječja banka novčića (često u obliku svinje) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a child's coin bank (often shaped like a pig) [penny bank]</p><p><b>Čin nošenja nečega na leđima., Vozi se na nečijim ramenima ili leđima., Sljedeći:, prevoz željezničkim vagonom, Podrška na leđima i ramenima, U skladu s, na željezničkom vlaknom vagonu, na leđima ili ramenu ili na kukovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of carrying something piggyback</p><p><i>v.</i> ride on someone's shoulders or back</p><p><i>v.</i> haul truck trailers loaded with commodities on railroad cars</p><p><i>v.</i> haul by railroad car</p><p><i>v.</i> support on the back and shoulders</p><p><i>v.</i> bring into alignment with</p><p><i>adv.</i> on a railroad flatcar [pickaback, pig-a-back]</p><p><i>adv.</i> on the back or shoulder or astraddle on the hip [pickaback, pig-a-back]</p><p><b>Vježnija višegodišnja biljka s cvjetovima u uspravnim stabljikama i mladim biljkama koje se razvijaju na spoju listne listine i listnog stuba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vigorous perennial herb with flowers in erect racemes and having young plants develop at the junction of a leaf blade and the leafstalk [Tolmiea menziesii, pickaback plant, youth-on-age]</p><p><b>glup, tvrdoglav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> obstinate and stupid [bullet-headed, bullheaded]</p><p><b>glup, tvrdoglav (od &quot;pigheaded&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> resolute adherence to your own ideas or desires [bullheadedness, obstinacy, obstinance, self-will, stubbornness]</p><p><b>odojak, prasence, praščić, domaća svinja, krmče, prase, svinjče</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a young pig [piggy, shoat, shote]</p><p><b>pastir ili svinja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a herder or swine [swineherd]</p><p><b>pigment, pigmenta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dry coloring material (especially a powder to be mixed with a liquid to produce paint, etc.)</p><p><i>n.</i> any substance whose presence in plant or animal tissues produces a characteristic color</p><p><i>n.</i> a substance used as a coating to protect or decorate a surface (especially a mixture of pigment suspended in a liquid) [paint]</p><p><i>v.</i> acquire pigment</p><p><i>v.</i> color or dye with a pigment</p><p><b>pigmentacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the deposition of pigment in animals or plants or human beings</p><p><i>n.</i> coloration of living tissues by pigment</p><p><b>patuljak, pigmejac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unusually small individual [pygmy]</p><p><i>n.</i> any 