aja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small shrimp that makes a snapping noise with one of their enlarged chelae [snapping shrimp]</p><p><b>Udario ga je pištoljem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> beat with a pistol</p><p><b>netko naoružan pištoljem (posebno vojnik tako naoružan) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone armed with a pistol (especially a soldier so armed)</p><p><b>klip, pokretni klip, stap, ventil</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States neoclassical composer (1894-1976) [Walter Piston]</p><p><i>n.</i> mechanical device that has a plunging or thrusting motion [plunger]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chamber within which piston moves [cylinder]</p><p><b>klipni prsten</b></p><p><i>n.</i> seal consisting of a split metal ring that seals the gap between a piston and the cylinder wall</p><p><b>klatno, klipnjača, pokretna poluga, stapajica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> connecting rod that moves or is moved by a piston</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, uz pomoć nacionalnog zakonodavstva, podliježe se: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of variable annual Eurasian vines: peas [genus Pisum]</p><p><b>vrsta graška porijeklom iz mediteranske regije i sjeverne Afrike i široko uzgajana posebno za krmnu uporabu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> variety of pea plant native to the Mediterranean region and North Africa and widely grown especially for forage [Austrian winter pea, Pisum sativum arvense, field-pea plant, field pea]</p><p><b>biljke koje proizvode grašak obično se jedu svježe umjesto sušene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant producing peas usually eaten fresh rather than dried [common pea, garden pea, garden pea plant]</p><p><b>vrsta graška porijeklom iz mediteranske regije i sjeverne Afrike i široko uzgajana posebno za krmnu uporabu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> variety of pea plant native to the Mediterranean region and North Africa and widely grown especially for forage [Austrian winter pea, Pis