ent scheme [design]</p><p><i>n.</i> scale drawing of a structure [architectural plan]</p><p><i>v.</i> have the will and intention to carry out some action [be after]</p><p><i>v.</i> make plans for something</p><p><i>v.</i> make or work out a plan for [contrive, design, project]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a design of [design]</p><p><b>plan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plan for actively doing something</p><p><b>pristup</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ideas or actions intended to deal with a problem or situation [approach, attack]</p><p><b>ravan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> involving or having two dimensions [two-dimensional]</p><p><b>Plavci, uglavnom slatkovodni, slobodno plivači (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> free-swimming mostly freshwater flatworms [planarian]</p><p><b>Plavci, uglavnom slatkovodni, slobodno plivači (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> free-swimming mostly freshwater flatworms [planaria]</p><p><b>koji je rasplaman (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having been flattened [flattened]</p><p><b>Proces erozije kojim se stvara ravna površina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of erosion whereby a level surface is produced</p><p><b>pločan metalni disk spreman za pečat kao novčić (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a flat metal disk ready for stamping as a coin [coin blank]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a triangular board supported on casters</p><p><b>Njemački fizičar čije je objašnjenje zračenja crnog tijela u kontekstu kvantnih emisija energije pokrenulo kvantnu teoriju (1858-1947) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German physicist whose explanation of blackbody radiation in the context of quantized energy emissions initiated quantum theory (1858-1947) [Max Karl Ernst Ludwig Planck, Max Planck]</p><p><b>Planckova konstanta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the constant of proportionality relating the energy of a photon to its frequency [h]</p><p><b>(fizici) osnova kvantne teorije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the basis of quantum theory</p><p><b>(fizička) jednačina koja izražava raspo