, bakrorez, daščica, galvanizirati, ilustracija, lim, obložiti, pehar, pladanj, plitica, ploča, ploča na kamin, pločica, posuđe, prevlaka, prevući, pribor, slika, tanjur, pjat, fotografska ploča, umjetno zubalo, zubalo, zubna proteza, tanjir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) base consisting of a rubber slab where the batter stands [home, home base, home plate]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sheet of metal or wood or glass or plastic</p><p><i>n.</i> a full-page illustration (usually on slick paper)</p><p><i>n.</i> dish on which food is served or from which food is eaten</p><p><i>n.</i> the quantity contained in a plate [plateful]</p><p><i>n.</i> a rigid layer of the Earth's crust that is believed to drift slowly [crustal plate]</p><p><i>n.</i> the thin under portion of the forequarter</p><p><i>n.</i> a main course served on a plate</p><p><i>n.</i> any flat platelike body structure or part</p><p><i>n.</i> the positively charged electrode in a vacuum tube</p><p><i>n.</i> a flat sheet of metal or glass on which a photographic image can be recorded [photographic plate]</p><p><i>n.</i> structural member consisting of a horizontal beam that provides bearing and anchorage</p><p><i>n.</i> a shallow receptacle for collection in church [collection plate]</p><p><i>n.</i> a metal sheathing of uniform thickness (such as the shield attached to an artillery piece to protect the gunners) [scale, shell]</p><p><i>n.</i> a dental appliance that artificially replaces missing teeth [dental plate, denture]</p><p><i>v.</i> coat with a layer of metal</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 85% ili više, ali ne više od 85%, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> specially hardened steel plate used to protect fortifications or vehicles from enemy fire [armor plate, armor plating, armour plate, plate armour]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 85% ili više, ali ne više od 85%, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> specially hardened steel plate used to protect fortifications or vehicles from enemy fire [armor plate, armor plating, armour plate, plate 