k</b></p><p><i>n.</i> work table of a machine tool</p><p><i>n.</i> the flat plate of a printing press that presses the paper against the type</p><p><i>n.</i> the roller on a typewriter against which the keys strike</p><p><b>jelo, pripremiti kartu, pripremiti mapu (od &quot;plat&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a skilled worker who coats articles with a film of metal (usually silver or gold)</p><p><b>bina, odmorište, peron, platforma, platformu, podij, visoravan, povišenje, sučelje, platformka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a raised horizontal surface</p><p><i>n.</i> a document stating the aims and principles of a political party [political platform, political program, program]</p><p><i>n.</i> the combination of a particular computer and a particular operating system</p><p><i>n.</i> any military structure or vehicle bearing weapons [weapons platform]</p><p><i>n.</i> a woman's shoe with a very high thick sole [chopine]</p><p><b>krevet bez opruge. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bed without springs</p><p><b>Sljedeći članak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rocking chair on a stationary base</p><p><b>Američki pisac i pjesnik (1932-1963) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer and poet (1932-1963) [Sylvia Plath]</p><p><b>rod Pleuronectidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Pleuronectidae [genus Platichthys]</p><p><b>iverak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> important food fish of Europe [European flatfish]</p><p><b>kaplama, opločenje, pozlaćivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thin coating of metal deposited on a surface [metal plating]</p><p><i>n.</i> the application of a thin coat of metal (as by electrolysis)</p><p><b>odjeće od metalne platine (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> coat with metallic platinum</p><p><b>platina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a heavy precious metallic element [Pt, atomic number 78]</p><p><b>čisti crni prah platine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fine black powder of platinum</p><p><b>plavuša čija je kosa blijeda srebrna (često umjetno obojena) plava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blond whose hair is a pale silvery (