 koji radi i popravlja plugove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a workman who makes and repairs plows [ploughwright]</p><p><b>posao, rad, trik, zanat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an opening remark intended to secure an advantage for the speaker [gambit]</p><p><i>n.</i> a maneuver in a game or conversation [gambit, stratagem]</p><p><b>brati, drob, hrabrost, iščupati, iznutrice, kidati, odvažnost, otkinuti, pokrasti, prebirati, sabirati, srce, srčanost, trgati, utroba, perušati, kupiti, obirati, obrati, pobirati, pobrati, skupljati/skupiti, ubirati, ubrati, čeprkati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of showing courage and determination in spite of possible loss or injury [gutsiness, pluckiness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of pulling and releasing a taut cord</p><p><i>v.</i> pull or pull out sharply [pick off, pull off, tweak]</p><p><i>v.</i> sell something to or obtain something from by energetic and especially underhanded activity [hustle, roll]</p><p><i>v.</i> rip off [fleece, gazump, hook, overcharge, plume, rob, soak, surcharge]</p><p><i>v.</i> pull lightly but sharply with a plucking motion [pick, plunk]</p><p><i>v.</i> strip of feathers [deplumate, deplume, displume, pull, tear]</p><p><i>v.</i> look for and gather [cull, pick]</p><p><b>uzdižete ili povucete prstima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> pluck or pull at with the fingers [pick at, pull at]</p><p><b>hrabar, odvažan smion, srčan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of a stringed instrument</p><p><i>adj.</i> having the feathers removed, as from a pelt or a fowl</p><p><b>hrabar, odvažan, srčan (od &quot;plucky&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a plucky manner</p><p><b>osobina koja pokazuje hrabrost i odlučnost unatoč mogućem gubitku ili povredi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of showing courage and determination in spite of possible loss or injury [gutsiness, pluck]</p><p><b>hrabar, odvažan, srčan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by courage and determination in the face of difficulties or danger [gutsy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing courage [feisty, spunky]<