, Christmas star, Euphorbia pulcherrima, Mexican flameleaf, lobster plant, painted leaf]</p><p><b>soj štetočine slučajno uvezena u Floridu s Bliskog istoka zatim se proširio u Kaliforniji gdje je vrlo ozbiljan štetočina hrane gotovo sve biljke povrća i poinsettias (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strain of pest accidentally imported into Florida from the Middle East then spread to California where it is a very serious pest feeding on almost all vegetable crops and poinsettias [Bemisia tabaci, superbug]</p><p><b>bod, glavna stvar, mjesto, naznačiti, okrenuti jedrenjak više prema vjetru, pitanje, poanta, poen, pojedinost, pokazati, položaj, svrha, točka, ukazati, ukazivati, upraviti, vrh, zašiljiti, točaka, točke, točki, točku, detalj, razina, stadij, stupanj, moment, točka u vremenu, tren, trenutak, trenutak u vremenu, čas, element, natuknica, stavak, članak, vršak, šiljak, točka kompasa, orijentirati se, indicirati, nagoviještati, nagovještavati, pokazivati, predstavljati, signalizirati, značiti, uperiti, uputiti, upućivati, usmjeravati, usmjeriti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a geometric element that has position but no extension</p><p><i>n.</i> the precise location of something</p><p><i>n.</i> a brief version of the essential meaning of something</p><p><i>n.</i> an isolated fact that is considered separately from the whole [detail, item]</p><p><i>n.</i> a specific identifiable position in a continuum or series or especially in a process [degree, level, stage]</p><p><i>n.</i> an instant of time [point in time]</p><p><i>n.</i> the object of an activity</p><p><i>n.</i> a V shape [peak, tip]</p><p><i>n.</i> a very small circular shape [dot]</p><p><i>n.</i> the unit of counting in scoring a game or contest</p><p><i>n.</i> a promontory extending out into a large body of water</p><p><i>n.</i> a distinct part that can be specified separately in a group of things that could be enumerated on a list [item]</p><p><i>n.</i> a style in speech or writing that arrests attention and has a penetrating or convincing quality or effect</p><p><i>n.</i> an outstanding characteristic [spot]</p><p><i>n.</i> sharp end</p><p><i>n.</i> any of 32 horizontal directions indicated on the card of a compass [compass point]</p><p><i>n.</i> a linear unit used to measure the size of type</p><p><i>n.</i> one percent of the total principal of a loan</p><p><i>n.</i> a punctuation mark (.) placed at the end of a declarative sentence to indicate a full stop or after abbreviations [full point, full stop, period, stop]</p><p><i>n.</i> a V-shaped mark at one end of an arrow pointer [head]</p><p><i>n.</i> the dot at the left of a decimal fraction [decimal point, percentage point]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of a shape that tapers to a sharp tip [pointedness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a distinguishing or individuating characteristic</p><p><i>n.</i> the gun muzzle's direction [gunpoint]</p><p><i>n.</i> a wall socket [power point]</p><p><i>n.</i> a contact in the distributor [breaker point, distributor point]</p><p><i>v.</i> indicate a place, direction, person, or thing [designate, indicate, show]</p><p><i>v.</i> be oriented [orient]</p><p><i>v.</i> direct into a position for use [charge, level]</p><p><i>v.</i> direct the course [channelise, channelize, direct, guide, head, maneuver, manoeuver, manoeuvre, steer]</p><p><i>v.</i> be a signal for or a symptom of [bespeak, betoken, indicate, signal]</p><p><i>v.</i> sail close to the wind [luff]</p><p><i>v.</i> mark (Hebrew words) with diacritics</p><p><i>v.</i> mark with diacritics</p><p><i>v.</i> mark (a psalm text) to indicate the points at which the music changes</p><p><i>v.</i> be positionable in a specified manner</p><p><i>v.</i> intend (something) to move towards a certain goal [aim, direct, place, target]</p><p><i>v.</i> indicate the presence of (game) by standing and pointing with the muzzle</p><p><i>v.</i> give a point to [sharpen, taper]</p><p><i>v.</i> repair the joints of bricks [repoint]</p><p><b>U američkom nogometu bod dodijeljen za usp