lternating voltages of the same frequency but differing in phase angle [multiphase]</p><p><b>vrlo veliki žuto-smeđi američki svileni crv s velikim očnim mrljama na stražnjim krilima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> very large yellowish-brown American silkworm moth with large eyespots on hind wings [Antheraea polyphemus]</p><p><b>slovo koje ima dva ili više izgovora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a letter that has two or more pronunciations [polyphonic letter]</p><p><b>višeglasan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having two or more phonetic values</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characterized by polyphony [polyphonous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having two or more independent but harmonically related melodic parts sounding together [contrapuntal]</p><p><b>slovo koje ima dva ili više izgovora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a letter that has two or more pronunciations [polyphone]</p><p><b>polifonija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> music arranged in parts for several voices or instruments [concerted music, polyphony]</p><p><b>ritmička proza koja koristi poetske uređaje aliteracije i asonancije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rhythmical prose employing the poetic devices of alliteration and assonance</p><p><b>na polifonski način (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a polyphonic manner</p><p><b>od ili povezane s ili karakterizirane polifonijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characterized by polyphony [polyphonic]</p><p><b>polifonija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> music arranged in parts for several voices or instruments [concerted music, polyphonic music]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polifosforne kiseline od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a salt or ester of polyphosphoric acid</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,05 do 0,05 mm i (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a series of oxyacids of phosphorus</p><p><b>mala klasa morskih mehurića koja obuhvaća chitone (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small class of marine mollusks comprising the chitons [class Polyplacophora]</p><p><b>primitivni izduženi bilateralno simetrični morski mehurići s plaštom prekrivenom osam apnenim pločama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> primitive elongated bilaterally symmetrical marine mollusk having a mantle covered with eight calcareous plates [chiton, coat-of-mail shell, sea cradle]</p><p><b>(genetika) organizam ili stanica s više od dvostruko većim brojem haploidnih hromozoma, od stanice ili organizma koji imaju više od dvostruko više haploidnih broja hromozoma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (genetics) an organism or cell having more than twice the haploid number of chromosomes</p><p><i>adj.</i> of a cell or organism having more than twice the haploid number of chromosomes</p><p><b>stanje polyploidnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being polyploid</p><p><b>Polypodiaceae</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ferns: a large family that in some classification systems has been subdivided into several families (including Aspleniaceae and Blechnaceae and Davalliaceae and Dennstaedtiaceae and Dryopteridaceae and Oleandraceae and Pteridaceae) [family Polypodiaceae]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> true (leptosporangiate) ferns [Filicales, order Filicales, order Polypodiales]</p><p><b>rod paprike iz obitelji Polypodiaceae i s zaobljenim golim sorijem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of ferns belonging to the family Polypodiaceae and having rounded naked sori [genus Polypodium]</p><p><b>tropski američki paprika s smeđim ljuskivim rizomima uzgojen zbog svojih velikih duboko lobiranih duboko plavo-zelenih listova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American fern with brown scaly rhizomes cultivated for its large deeply lobed deep bluish-green fronds [Phlebodium aureum, golden polypody, rabbit's-foot fern, serpent fern]</p><p><b>Sladak ukus i slatki ukus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fern having rootstock of a sweetish flavor [licorice fern]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste biljaka koje se mogu upotrebljavati za proizvodnju biljaka u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, za koje se primjenjuje članak 3. točka (a) ovog članka, za koje se primjenjuje članak 3. točka (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fern growing on rocks or tree trunks and having fronds greyish and scurfy below [gray polypody, grey polypody, resurrection fern]</p><p><b>čvrsta kožna listnatog paprika zapadne Sjeverne Amerike s ovativnim listovima odvojenim do srednjeg rebra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stiff leathery-leaved fern of western North America having ovate fronds parted to the midrib [coast polypody, leatherleaf, leathery polypody]</p><p><b>uglavnom litofitski ili epifitni paprati iz Sjeverne Amerike i istočne Azije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chiefly lithophytic or epiphytic fern of North America and east Asia [American wall fern, rock brake, rock polypody]</p><p><b>Polypodium vulgare, lezibaba, obični oslad, slatka bujad, slatki korijen</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mat-forming lithophytic or terrestrial fern with creeping rootstocks and large pinnatifid fronds found throughout North America and Europe and Africa and east Asia [adder's fern, common polypody, golden maidenhair, golden polypody, sweet fern, wall fern]</p><p><b>oslad, slatka paprat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous ferns of the genus Polypodium</p><p><b>gljivice koje s godinama postaju korkovite ili drvene, često formiraju škrilje poput poliča na drveću (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fungi that become corky or woody with age, often forming shelflike growths on trees [family Polyporaceae]</p><p><b>Vodičaste pore gljivice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> woody pore fungi [pore fungus, pore mushroom]</p><p><b>vrsta rod Polyporaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Polyporaceae [genus Polyporus]</p><p><b>zec-gljiva, zečarka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large greyish-brown edible fungus forming a mass of overlapping caps that somewhat resembles a hen at the base of trees [Grifola frondosa, hen-of-the-woods, hen of the woods]</p><p><b>gljiva s bočnim stabljikom (kada postoji stabljik) i ljuskičastom kapa koja postaje gotovo crna u zrelosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungus with a lateral stalk (when there is a stalk) and a scaly cap that becomes nearly black in maturity [scaly polypore]</p><p><b>gljiva s bijelom bubrežnom kapom i izduženih pora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fungus with a whitish kidney-shaped cap and elongated pores</p><p><b>riblje ljepote (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wreckfish [genus Polyprion]</p><p><b>Crne ribe iz Atlantskog i Sredozemnog mora pronađene oko stijena i olupina brodova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> brown fish of the Atlantic and Mediterranean found around rocks and shipwrecks [stone bass, wreckfish]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena od 0,01 do 0,01 mm i (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a polymer of propylene used as a thermoplastic molding material [polypropylene]</p><p><b>Akrilna smola koja se koristi za proizvodnju jake mekane tkanine otporne na zamah (trgovinski naziv Acrilan) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> acrylic resin used to make a strong soft crease-resistant fabric (trade name Acrilan) [Acrilan]</p><p><b>polipropilen, polipropilenski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a polymer of propylene used as a thermoplastic molding material [polypropene]</p><p><b>ponavljanje riječi u drugom slučaju ili skretanje u istom rečenju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> repetition of a word in a different case or inflection in the same sentence</p><p><b>mali vaskularni rast na površini sluznice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small vascular growth on the surface of a mucous membrane [polyp]</p><p><b>polisaharide, polisaharid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of a class of carbohydrates whose molecules contain chains of monosaccharide molecules [polyose]</p><p><b>riječ koja ima više značenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word having more than one meaning [polysemantic word, polysemous word]</p><p><b>od riječi (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of words [polysemous]</p><p><b>riječ koja ima više značenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word having more than one meaning [polysemant, polysemous word]</p><p><b>od riječi (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of words [polysemantic]</p><p><b>riječ koja ima više značenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word having more than one meaning [polysemant, polysemantic word]</p><p><b>polisemija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ambiguity of an individual word or phrase that can be used (in different contexts) to express two or more different meanings [lexical ambiguity]</p><p><b>urodni defekt jednog ili više dodatnih hromozoma u somatskim stanicama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> congenital defect of having one or more extra chromosomes in somatic cells</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small to medium-sized terrestrial ferns especially holly ferns [genus Polystichum]</p><p><b>Sjevernoamerički zimzeleni paprikac s pramenjenim lišćama i gustim grmovima lančastih listova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American evergreen fern having pinnate leaves and dense clusters of lance-shaped fronds [Christmas fern, canker brake, dagger fern, evergreen wood fern]</p><p><b>tropski paprika iz Starog svijeta s sjajnim lišćama koje podsjećaju na škrilju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical Old World fern having glossy fronds suggestive of holly [Cyrtomium aculeatum, holly fern]</p><p><b>široko rasprostranjen paprika tropske južne hemisfere s kožnim pinnatifičnim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> widely distributed fern of tropical southern hemisphere having leathery pinnatifid fronds [Rumohra adiantiformis, leather fern, leatherleaf fern, ten-day fern]</p><p><b>Polystichum braunii, dlakava papratnjača</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American fern whose more or less evergreen leathery fronds are covered with pale brown chafflike scales [Braun's holly fern, prickly shield fern]</p><p><b>Polystichum lonchitis, kopljasta papratnjača, oštra paprat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> evergreen European fern widely cultivated [northern holly fern]</p><p><b>Sjeverački paprikac (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American fern [western holly fern]</p><p><b>Europski štapasti paprika uzgajan u mnogim vrstama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European shield fern cultivated in many varieties [soft shield fern]</p><p><b>polistiren</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a polymer of styrene</p><p><b>S više od tri sloja ili karakterizirane riječima od više od tri sloja, (od riječi) dug i težak (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or characterized by words of more than three syllables</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of words) long and ponderous [sesquipedalian]</p><p><b>riječ od više od tri sloja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word of more than three syllables [polysyllable]</p><p><b>u više silabama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a polysyllabic manner</p><p><b>riječ od više od tri sloja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word of more than three syllables [polysyllabic word]</p><p><b>koristeći nekoliko spojnica u bliskoj uzastopnosti, posebno tamo gdje se neki mogu izostaviti (kao u `on je trčao i skačao i smijao se od radosti') (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> using several conjunctions in close succession, especially where some might be omitted (as in `he ran and jumped and laughed for joy')</p><p><b>formiranje izvedenih ili složenih riječi spajanjem sastavnih dijelova od kojih svaki izražava jedno određeno značenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> forming derivative or compound words by putting together constituents each of which expresses a single definite meaning [agglutinative]</p><p><b>politehnička škola, politehnički, politehnika, Veleučilište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a technical school offering instruction in many industrial arts and applied sciences [engineering school, polytechnic institute]</p><p><b>tehnička škola koja nudi obuku u mnogim industrijskim umjetnostima i primjenjenim znanostima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a technical school offering instruction in many industrial arts and applied sciences [engineering school, polytechnic]</p><p><b>politetrafluoroetilen, politetrafluoroetilenski, politetrafluoretilen</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a material used to coat cooking utensils and in industrial applications where sticking is to be avoided [Teflon]</p><p><b>politeizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> belief in multiple Gods</p><p><b>Onaj koji vjeruje u mnoštvo bogova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who believes in a plurality of gods</p><p><b>obožavanje ili vjerovanje u više bogova (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> worshipping or believing in more than one god</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lightweight thermoplastic [polyethylene]</p><p><b>korištenje više od jednog tastera ili tonaliteta istovremeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> using more than one key or tonality simultaneously</p><p><b>glazba koja koristi dva ili više različitih tastera istovremeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> music that uses two or more different keys at the same time [polytonality]</p><p><b>glazba koja koristi dva ili više različitih tastera istovremeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> music that uses two or more different keys at the same time [polytonalism]</p><p><b>(od dugolančanih ugljikovih spojeva, posebno masti) s mnogim nezasićenim vezama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of long-chain carbon compounds especially fats) having many unsaturated bonds</p><p><b>razred masti s dugim ugljičnim lancima s mnogim dvostrukim vezama nezasićenim atomima vodika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a class of fats having long carbon chains with many double bonds unsaturated with hydrogen atoms</p><p><b>Ne zasićena masna kiselina čiji ugljični lanc ima više od jedne dvostruke ili trostruke valentne veze po molekuli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unsaturated fatty acid whose carbon chain has more than one double or triple valence bond per molecule</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena (CAS RN 1344-26-8) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various polymers containing the urethane radical [polyurethane]</p><p><b>poliuretan, poliuretanski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various polymers containing the urethane radical [polyurethan]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom poliuretana od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a foam made by adding water to polyurethane plastics [polyfoam]</p><p><b>bol u bubrezima: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> renal disorder characterized by the production of large volumes of pale dilute urine</p><p><b>(hemija) stanje valencije veće od 2, (toksikologija) stanje u kojem je moguće suzbijati više od jednog toksina ili antigena ili vrste mikroorganizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) the state of having a valence greater than two [multivalence, multivalency, polyvalency]</p><p><i>n.</i> (toxicology) the state of being capable of counteracting more than one toxin or antigen or kind of microorganism [polyvalency]</p><p><b>(hemija) stanje valencije veće od 2, (toksikologija) stanje u kojem je moguće suzbijati više od jednog toksina ili antigena ili vrste mikroorganizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) the state of having a valence greater than two [multivalence, multivalency, polyvalence]</p><p><i>n.</i> (toxicology) the state of being capable of counteracting more than one toxin or antigen or kind of microorganism [polyvalence]</p><p><b>multivalentan, polivalentan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> containing several antibodies each capable of counteracting a specific antigen</p><p><i>adj.</i> having more than one valence, or having a valence of 3 or higher [multivalent]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena (CAS RN 1344-26-8) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vinyl polymer used especially in paints or adhesives [PVA]</p><p><b>polivinil klorid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a polymer of vinyl chloride used instead of rubber in electric cables [PVC]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena (CAS RN 1344-26-8) od (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thermoplastic derived by polymerization from compounds containing the vinyl group [vinyl polymer, vinyl resin]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a polymer of vinyl formaldehyde</p><p><b>mahovnjaci</b></p><p><i>n.</i> marine or freshwater animals that form colonies of zooids [Bryozoa, phylum Bryozoa]</p><p><b