kovan naglim prekidom brze rotacije tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nystagmus caused by suddenly stopping the rapid rotation of the body</p><p><b>poštanska uputnica, poštarina, marka, poštanska marka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the charge for mailing something</p><p><i>n.</i> a small adhesive token stuck on a letter or package to indicate that that postal fees have been paid [postage stamp, stamp]</p><p><b>Metar za masovne pošiljke koji otiskuje ispravnu unaprijed plaćenu poštansku naknadu na poštanskim komadima i bilježi ukupnu naknadu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> meter for bulk mailings that imprints correct prepaid postage on pieces of mail and records the total charge</p><p><b>marka, poštanska marka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small adhesive token stuck on a letter or package to indicate that that postal fees have been paid [postage, stamp]</p><p><b>poštanski, poštanskih, poštanskim</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the system for delivering mail</p><p><b>dopisnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a card for sending messages by post without an envelope [mailing-card, post card, postcard]</p><p><b>radnik u pošti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clerk in a post office [mail clerk]</p><p><b>poštanski broj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a code of letters and digits added to a postal address to aid in the sorting of mail [ZIP, ZIP code, postcode]</p><p><b>poštanska narudžba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a written order for the payment of a sum to a named individual [money order]</p><p><b>Nezavisna savezna agencija koja preporučuje promjene poštanskih cijena. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an independent federal agency that recommends changes in postal rates</p><p><b>poštanska usluga, pošta, poštanska služba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the system whereby messages are transmitted via the post office [mail, mail service, post]</p><p><b>za nositelje pisama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> letter carrier's shoulder bag [mailbag]</p><p><b>nakon biblijskih vremena (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> subsequent to biblical times</p><p><b>poštanski ormarić