ike. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a shard of pottery</p><p><b>pucanj na lak ili slučajni cilj (kao što je lovac na lovce na lovce), Kritika usmjerena na lak cilj i izražena bez pažljivog razmatranja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a shot taken at an easy or casual target (as by a pothunter)</p><p><i>n.</i> criticism aimed at an easy target and made without careful consideration</p><p><b>TBC kičme s uništenjem kralježnica što rezultira zakrivljenjem kičme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> TB of the spine with destruction of vertebrae resulting in curvature of the spine</p><p><b>čorba, varivo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stew of vegetables and (sometimes) meat</p><p><i>n.</i> thick (often creamy) soup [potage]</p><p><b>od biljaka, S druge strane, u slučaju da se ne upotrebljava u proizvodnji proizvoda iz poglavlja 3., (Britanski neformalni) sažet ili skraćeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of plants</p><p><i>adj.</i> preserved in a pot or can or jar</p><p><i>adj.</i> (British informal) summarized or abridged</p><p><b>bazati, grnčar, lončar, ljenčariti, petljati, traćiti, tumarati, čeprkati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a craftsman who shapes pottery on a potter's wheel and bakes them it a kiln [ceramicist, ceramist, thrower]</p><p><i>v.</i> do random, unplanned work or activities or spend time idly [mess around, monkey, monkey around, muck about, muck around, putter, tinker]</p><p><i>v.</i> work lightly [putter]</p><p><i>v.</i> move around aimlessly [potter around, putter, putter around]</p><p><b>kretanje bez cilja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> move around aimlessly [potter, putter, putter around]</p><p><b>samostalna pčela koja gradi gnijezda od blata ili kamenčića spojenih i pričvršćenih na biljku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> solitary bee that builds nests of mud or pebbles cemented together and attached to a plant</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih uspa koje grade vazne stanice od blata za svoja jaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various solitary wasps that construct vase-shaped cells of mud for their eggs</p><p><