violet flowers [Lathyrus splendens]</p><p><b>Prvo ili najviše ili najvažnije ili najpopularnije mjesto. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first or highest or most important or most ostentatious place</p><p><b>dičiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> feel proud of [take pride]</p><p><b>stablo iz sjeverne Indije i Kine koje ima ljubičaste cvijeće i mala nejedljiva žuta voća, izvorno iz Azije, Australije i Istočne Indije, gdje se proizvodi drvo koje se zove pyinma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tree of northern India and China having purple blossoms and small inedible yellow fruits [China tree, Melia azedarach, Melia azederach, Persian lilac, azedarach, azederach, chinaberry, chinaberry tree]</p><p><i>n.</i> native to Asia, Australia, and East Indies, where it provides timber called pyinma [Lagerstroemia speciosa, Queen's crape myrtle]</p><p><b>imati ili pokazati arogantnu superiornost i preziranje onih koje se smatraju nedostojnim, radosni i ponosni posebno zbog trijumfa ili uspjeha (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or showing arrogant superiority to and disdain of those one views as unworthy [disdainful, haughty, imperious, lordly, overbearing, sniffy, supercilious, swaggering]</p><p><i>adj.</i> joyful and proud especially because of triumph or success [exultant, exulting, jubilant, rejoicing, triumphal, triumphant]</p><p><b>ponos, ponositost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of self-respect and personal worth [pride]</p><p><b>niska klanica za klečanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low bench for kneeling on</p><p><b>pop, svećenik, župnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clergyman in Christian churches who has the authority to perform or administer various religious rites</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who performs religious duties and ceremonies in a non-Christian religion [non-Christian priest]</p><p><b>u društvima koji prakticiraju šamanizam: jedan koji djeluje kao medij između vidljivog i duhovnog svijeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in societies practicing shamanism: one acting as a medium between the visible and spirit worlds [shaman]</p><p><b>pravo svećenika da odbije da otkrije povjerljive informacije koje je dobio od osobe tijekom ispovijedi ili slične razmjene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the right of a clergyman to refuse to divulge confidential information received from a person during confession or similar exchanges</p><p><b>Pogrešno označavanje svećenika koji koriste svoj utjecaj kako bi kontrolirali svjetovne ili političke stvari, vještine koje su uključene u posao svećenika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a derogatory reference to priests who use their influence to control secular or political affairs</p><p><i>n.</i> the skills involved in the work of a priest</p><p><b>svećenica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman priest</p><p><b>svećenstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the body of ordained religious practitioners</p><p><b>Engleski kemičar koji je izolirao mnoge pline i otkrio kisik (neovisno o Scheeleu) (1733-1804) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English chemist who isolated many gases and discovered oxygen (independently of Scheele) (1733-1804) [Joseph Priestley]</p><p><b>Pripada ili karakteristika svećenika ili svećeništva (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> befitting or characteristic of a priest or the priesthood [priestly]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na svećenika, svećenički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> associated with the priesthood or priests [hieratic, hieratical, sacerdotal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> befitting or characteristic of a priest or the priesthood [priestlike]</p><p><b>cjepidlaka, formalista, krasti, lopov, snob</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person regarded as arrogant and annoying [snob, snoot, snot]</p><p><b>afektiran, cjepidlački, nadmen, sitničar, uobražen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> exaggeratedly proper [prim, prissy, prudish, puritanical, square-toed, straight-laced, straightlaced, strait-laced, straitlaced, tight-laced, victorian]</p><p><b>afektiran, cjepidlački, nadmen, sitničar, uobražen (od &quot;priggish&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a priggish manner</p><p><b>afektiran, cjepidlački, nadmen, sitničar, uobražen (od &quot;priggish&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> exaggerated and arrogant properness [primness]</p><p><b>omeprazol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antacid (trade name Prilosec) that suppresses acid secretion in the stomach [omeprazole]</p><p><b>čist, izvještačen, ukočen, usiljen</b></p><p><i>v.</i> assume a prim appearance</p><p><i>v.</i> contract one's lips</p><p><i>v.</i> dress primly [prim out, prim up]</p><p><i>adj.</i> affectedly dainty or refined [mincing, niminy-piminy, twee]</p><p><i>adj.</i> exaggeratedly proper [priggish, prissy, prudish, puritanical, square-toed, straight-laced, straightlaced, strait-laced, straitlaced, tight-laced, victorian]</p><p><b>Odjeci se prvenstveno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> dress primly [prim, prim up]</p><p><b>Odjeci se prvenstveno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> dress primly [prim, prim out]</p><p><b>primjenjuje se uglavnom za jesti jabuke, označava najvažniji glumac ili ulogu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used primarily as eating apples</p><p><i>adj.</i> indicating the most important performer or role [leading, star, starring, stellar]</p><p><b>vodeća plesačica. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a leading female ballet dancer</p><p><b>Ponosna i temperamentna osoba., Odlična ženska operska pjevačica. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vain and temperamental person</p><p><i>n.</i> a distinguished female operatic singer [diva]</p><p><b>Kao što se čini na prvi pogled., na prvi pogled. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> as it seems at first sight</p><p><i>adv.</i> at first sight</p><p><b>primat, prvenstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being first in importance</p><p><b>koji postoji od početka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having existed from the beginning [aboriginal, primal, primeval, primordial]</p><p><b>istinski, osnovni, prvobitan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> serving as an essential component [cardinal, central, fundamental, key]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having existed from the beginning [aboriginal, primaeval, primeval, primordial]</p><p><b>svojstvo da je prosti broj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being a prime number</p><p><b>sintetički lijek protiv malarije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> synthetic antimalarial drug</p><p><b>naročito, prvenstveno, uglavnom</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> for the most part [chiefly, in the main, mainly, principally]</p><p><i>adv.</i> of primary import [in the first place]</p><p><b>glavni, izvorni, osnovan, osnovna boja, osnovni, osnovnih, osnovnim, početan, primarna, primarni, primarnom, prvi, prvobitan, izbori, elementaran</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a preliminary election where delegates or nominees are chosen [primary election]</p><p><i>n.</i> one of the main flight feathers projecting along the outer edge of a bird's wing [primary feather, primary quill]</p><p><i>n.</i> (astronomy) a celestial body (especially a star) relative to other objects in orbit around it</p><p><i>n.</i> coil forming the part of an electrical circuit such that changing current in it induces a current in a neighboring circuit [primary coil, primary winding]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of first rank or importance or value</p><p><i>adj.</i> not derived from or reducible to something else</p><p><i>adj.</i> most important element [chief, main, master, principal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or being the essential or basic part [basal, elemental, elementary]</p><p><b>odlaganje menstruacije nakon 18. godine života (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> delay of menarche beyond age 18</p><p><b>akutna respiratorna bolest obilježena visokom groznicom i kašljem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acute respiratory disease marked by high fever and coughing [atypical pneumonia, mycoplasmal pneumonia]</p><p><b>medicinska pomoć primljena pri prvom kontaktu s zdravstvenim sustavom (prije nego što je upućena drugdje) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the medical care received on first contact with the medical system (before being referred elsewhere)</p><p><b>liječnik koji pruža primarnu njegu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the physician who provides primary care</p><p><b>medicinski radnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who helps in identifying or preventing or treating illness or disability [PCP, caregiver, health care provider, health professional]</p><p><b>Električna ćelija koja generiše elektromotornu silu nepovratnom pretvaranjem kemijske energije u električnu energiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electric cell that generates an electromotive force by an irreversible conversion of chemical to electrical energy [galvanic cell, voltaic cell]</p><p><b>Cenzura osoblja vojne jedinice na osobnim komunikacijama osoba dodijeljenih toj jedinici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> armed forces censorship performed by personnel of a military unit on the personal communications of persons assigned to that unit</p><p><b>Spojnica koja čini dio električnog kola tako da promjena struje u njoj indukuje struju u susjednom krugu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coil forming the part of an electrical circuit such that changing current in it induces a current in a neighboring circuit [primary, primary winding]</p><p><b>od kojih se sve ostale mogu dobiti mešanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of three colors from which all others can be obtained by mixing [primary colour]</p><p><b>Svaka od tri primarne boje svjetlosti iz kojih se sve boje mogu dobiti aditivnim mešanjem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of three primary colors of light from which all colors can be obtained by additive mixing [primary colour for light]</p><p><b>od 3 pigmenta od kojih se mogu dobiti sve boje mešanjem: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of three pigments from which all colors can be obtained by mixing [primary colour for pigments]</p><p><b>od kojih se sve ostale mogu dobiti mešanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of three colors from which all others can be obtained by mixing [primary color]</p><p><b>Svaka od tri primarne boje svjetlosti iz kojih se sve boje mogu dobiti aditivnim mešanjem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of three primary colors of light from which all colors can be obtained by additive mixing [primary color for light]</p><p><b>od 3 pigmenta od kojih se mogu dobiti sve boje mešanjem: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of three pigments from which all colors can be obtained by mixing [primary color for pigments]</p><p><b>Zublje u obliku listova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dentition of deciduous teeth</p><p><b>bolno mjesečnice koje su inherentne mjesečnicama i nisu posljedica bolesti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> painful menstruation that is intrinsic to menstruation and not the result of a disease</p><p><b>preliminarni izbori, izbori</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a preliminary election where delegates or nominees are chosen [primary]</p><p><b>jedno od glavnih ptičjih perja koje prolazi uz vanjski rub ptičjeg krila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the main flight feathers projecting along the outer edge of a bird's wing [primary, primary quill]</p><p><b>zdravstveni program</b></p><p><i>n.</i> health care that is provided by a health care professional in the first contact of a patient with the health care system</p><p><b>jedno od glavnih ptičjih perja koje prolazi uz vanjski rub ptičjeg krila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the main flight feathers projecting along the outer edge of a bird's wing [primary, primary feather]</p><p><b>osnovna skola, osnovna škola</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a school for young children [elementary school, grade school, grammar school]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to potrebno za određivanje genetskih karakteristika spola, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, podnositelj zahtjeva može upotrijebiti sljedeće: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the genetically determined sex characteristics bound up with reproduction (genitals and organs of reproduction) [primary sex characteristic, primary sexual characteristic]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to potrebno za određivanje genetskih karakteristika spola, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, podnositelj zahtjeva može upotrijebiti sljedeće: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the genetically determined sex characteristics bound up with reproduction (genitals and organs of reproduction) [primary sex character, primary sexual characteristic]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to potrebno za određivanje genetskih karakteristika spola, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, podnositelj zahtjeva može upotrijebiti sljedeće: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the genetically determined sex characteristics bound up with reproduction (genitals and organs of reproduction) [primary sex character, primary sex characteristic]</p><p><b>Hidroksiklorid (HCl) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a homogeneous solid that can exist over a range of component chemicals [solid solution]</p><p><b>bilo koja od tri boje koja daju primarne boje za svjetlost nakon oduzimanja od bijele svjetlosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the three colors that give the primary colors for light after subtraction from white light [primary subtractive colour for light]</p><p><b>bilo koja od tri boje koja daju primarne boje za svjetlost nakon oduzimanja od bijele svjetlosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the three colors that give the primary colors for light after subtraction from white light [primary subtractive color for light]</p><p><b>Prva faza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first stage</p><p><b>jedan od prvih privremenih zuba mladog sisavaca (jedan od 20 kod djece) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the first temporary teeth of a young mammal (one of 20 in children) [baby tooth, deciduous tooth, milk tooth]</p><p><b>Spojnica koja čini dio električnog kola tako da promjena struje u njoj indukuje struju u susjednom krugu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coil forming the part of an electrical circuit such that changing current in it induces a current in a neighboring circuit [primary, primary coil]</p><p><b>nadbiskup, prelat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a senior clergyman and dignitary [archpriest, hierarch, high priest, prelate]</p><p><i>n.</i> any placental mammal of the order Primates</p><p><b>primati, red Primates, red primata</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an animal order including lemurs and tarsiers and monkeys and apes and human beings [order Primates]</p><p><b>Služba primata. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the office of primate</p><p><b>grana zoologije koja proučava primate (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of zoology that studies primates</p><p><b>Službeni naziv za parenteralni antibiotik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> trade name for a parenteral antibiotic</p><p><b>bujan, cvijet, glavni, mladost, osnovni, prim, pripremiti, proljeće, prvi, puniti, zora</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a natural number that has exactly two distinct natural number divisors: 1 and itself [prime quantity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the period of greatest prosperity or productivity [bloom, blossom, efflorescence, flower, flush, heyday, peak]</p><p><i>n.</i> the second canonical hour</p><p><i>n.</i> the time of maturity when power and vigor are greatest [prime of life]</p><p><i>v.</i> insert a primer into (a gun, mine, or charge) preparatory to detonation or firing</p><p><i>v.</i> cover with a primer [ground, undercoat]</p><p><i>v.</i> fill with priming liquid</p><p><i>adj.</i> first in rank or degree [premier]</p><p><i>adj.</i> used of the first or originating agent</p><p><i>adj.</i> of superior grade [choice, prize, quality, select]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or being an integer that cannot be factored into other integers</p><p><i>adj.</i> being at the best stage of development [meridian]</p><p><b>Prosti faktori veličine su sve proste veličine koje će točno podijeliti datom veličinom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the prime factors of a quantity are all of the prime quantities that will exactly divide the given quantity</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 31. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013 u skladu s člankom 31. stavkom (b) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the interest rate on short-term loans that banks charge their commercial customers with high credit ratings</p><p><b>nulti meridijan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> meridian at zero degree longitude from which east and west are reckoned (usually the Greenwich longitude in England)</p><p><b>premier, premijer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the position of head of the government in the United Kingdom [PM, premier]</p><p><i>n.</i> the person who is head of government (in several countries) [chancellor, premier]</p><p><b>Agent koji je uzrok svih stvari ali nema uzrok. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agent that is the cause of all things but does not itself have a cause [first cause, primum mobile]</p><p><b>Cijeli broj koji nema integralne faktore osim sebe i 1 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an integer that has no integral factors but itself and 1</p><p><b>vrijeme zrelosti kada su snaga i snaga najveći (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time of maturity when power and vigor are greatest [prime]</p><p><b>prirodni broj koji ima točno dva različita dijelača prirodnih brojeva: 1 i sebe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a natural number that has exactly two distinct natural number divisors: 1 and itself [prime]</p><p><b>U razdoblju od 19.00 do 23.00 sati kada je najveća televizija dostupna. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the hours between 7 and 11 p.m. when the largest tv audience is available</p><p><b>čist, izvještačen, ukočen, usiljen (od &quot;prim&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (usually followed by `to' or `for') on the point of or strongly disposed [fit, set]</p><p><b>bukvar, detonator, fitilj, početni udžbenik, upaljač, zaštitna boja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an introductory textbook</p><p><i>n.</i> any igniter that is used to initiate the burning of a propellant [fuse, fusee, fuze, fuzee, priming]</p><p><i>n.</i> the first or preliminary coat of paint or size applied to a surface [flat coat, ground, primer coat, priming, priming coat, undercoat]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first or preliminary coat of paint or size applied to a surface [flat coat, ground, primer, priming, priming coat, undercoat]</p><p><b>iskonsku, prost, prvobitan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having existed from the beginning [aboriginal, primaeval, primal, primordial]</p><p><b>anti- konvulzivan (trgovinski naziv Mysoline) koji se koristi za liječenje epileptičnih napada i esencijalnog tremora. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an anticonvulsant (trade name Mysoline) used to treat grand mal seizures and essential tremor [Mysoline]</p><p><b>(obstetrika) žena koja je trudna po prvi put (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (obstetrics) a woman who is pregnant for the first time [gravida I]</p><p><b>barut za potpaljivanje, kapica na vatrenom oružju, namazivanje podloge, paljenje, početno premazivanje, pripremanje, raniji nadolazak plime</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of making something ready</p><p><i>n.</i> any igniter that is used to initiate the burning of a propellant [fuse, fusee, fuze, fuzee, primer]</p><p><i>n.</i> the first or preliminary coat of paint or size applied to a surface [flat coat, ground, primer, primer coat, priming coat, undercoat]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first or preliminary coat of paint or size applied to a surface [flat coat, ground, primer, primer coat, priming, undercoat]</p><p><b>prvorotkinja, prvorotka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (obstetrics) woman who has been delivered of a child for the first time [para I]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi sa ženom koja je rodila samo jednom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a woman who has given birth only once</p><p><b>jednostavan, nekulturan, običaj, osnovna funkcija, osnovni, primitivac, primitivan, prvobitan, slikarstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who belongs to an early stage of civilization [primitive person]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mathematical expression from which another expression is derived</p><p><i>n.</i> a word serving as the basis for inflected or derived forms</p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging to an early stage of technical development [crude, rude]</p><p><i>adj.</i> little evolved from or characteristic of an earlier ancestral type [archaic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> used of preliterate or tribal or nonindustrial societies</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or created by one without formal training [naive]</p><p><b>naiva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genre of art and outdoor constructions made by untrained artists who do not recognize themselves as artists [naive art, outsider art, self-taught art, vernacular art]</p><p><b>Osoba koja pripada ranom stadiju civilizacije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who belongs to an early stage of civilization [primitive]</p><p><b>jednostavan, nekulturan, običaj, osnovna funkcija, osnovni, primitivac, primitivan, prvobitan, slikarstvo (od &quot;primitive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with reference to the origin or beginning [in the beginning, originally]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a primitive style or manner</p><p><b>jednostavan, nekulturan, običaj, osnovna funkcija, osnovni, primitivac, primitivan, prvobitan, slikarstvo (od &quot;primitive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wild or unrefined state [crudeness, crudity, primitivism, rudeness]</p><p><b>u divljem ili nerafiniranom stanju, Žanrovska karakteristika primitivnih umjetnika ili djece (ili imitacija njih) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wild or unrefined state [crudeness, crudity, primitiveness, rudeness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a genre characteristic of (or imitative of) primitive artists or children</p><p><b>čist, izvještačen, ukočen, usiljen (od &quot;prim&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a prissy manner [prissily]</p><p><b>ukočenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> excessive or affected modesty [Grundyism, prudery, prudishness]</p><p><i>n.</i> exaggerated and arrogant properness [priggishness]</p><p><b>Glavni dio dueta (posebno klavirski duet), Najbolji u svojoj vrsti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the principal part of a duet (especially a piano duet)</p><p><i>adj.</i> the best of its kind</p><p><b>praotac, predak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancestor in the direct line [progenitor]</p><p><b>primogenitura</b></p><p><i>n.</i> right of inheritance belongs exclusively to the eldest son</p><p><b>iskonski, osnovni, početni, pradavnost, praiskonski, prvobitan, iskonske</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having existed from the beginning [aboriginal, primaeval, primal, primeval]</p><p><b>Achondroplastični patuljak čija je mala veličina rezultat genetske mane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an achondroplastic dwarf whose small size is the result of a genetic defect [hypoplastic dwarf, normal dwarf, true dwarf]</p><p><b>organ u najranijoj fazi razvoja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an organ in its earliest stage of development [anlage]</p><p><b>dotjerati se, dotjerivati se, lickati se, nalickati se, srediti se, sređivati se, urediti se, uređivati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> dress or groom with elaborate care [dress, plume, preen]</p><p><b>dotjerati se, dotjerivati se, lickati se, nalickati se, srediti se, sređivati se, urediti se, uređivati se (od &quot;primp&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> careful or finicky grooming</p><p><b>blijedožut, jaglac, jagorčevina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous short-stemmed plants of the genus Primula having tufted basal leaves and showy flowers clustered in umbels or heads [primula]</p><p><b>dvostruko cvjetnica iz reda Primulales s redovnim cvijetom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dicotyledonous family of the order Primulales with a regular flower [Primulaceae, family Primulaceae]</p><p><b>zelena stabla sa žutim cvjetovima iz zapadne Kine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> evergreen rambling yellow-flowered shrub of western China [Jasminum mesnyi]</p><p><b>život u blagostanju i zadovoljstvu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a life of ease and pleasure</p><p><b>jaglac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous short-stemmed plants of the genus Primula having tufted basal leaves and showy flowers clustered in umbels or heads [primrose]</p><p><b>žuti cvjetni priroza porijeklom iz Alpa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> yellow-flowered primrose native to Alps [auricula, bear's ear]</p><p><b>Eurasijska primizra s žutim cvijećem u jednom bočnom čvoru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Eurasian primrose with yellow flowers clustered in a one-sided umbel [oxlip, paigle]</p><p><b>cvjetničke pramure (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> florists' primroses [polyanthus]</p><p><b>uzgojena azijska pramarnica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cultivated Asiatic primrose [Chinese primrose]</p><p><b>cvjetovi u ranom proljeću uobičajeni na britanskim otocima koji imaju mirisne žute ili ponekad ljubičaste cvijeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> early spring flower common in British isles having fragrant yellow or sometimes purple flowers [cowslip, paigle]</p><p><b>jaglac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant of western and southern Europe widely cultivated for its pale yellow flowers [English primrose]</p><p><b>dvostruko cvjetnica iz reda Primulales s redovnim cvijetom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dicotyledonous family of the order Primulales with a regular flower [family Primulaceae, primrose family]</p><p><b>Stivlje (Prunus spp.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Primulaceae [order Primulales]</p><p><b>Agent koji je uzrok svih stvari ali nema uzrok. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agent that is the cause of all things but does not itself have a cause [first cause, prime mover]</p><p><b>prvi, stariji, primas</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the presiding bishop of the Episcopal Church of Scotland</p><p><i>n.</i> a portable paraffin cooking stove [Primus stove]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili većim od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a portable paraffin cooking stove [Primus]</p><p><b>knez, kraljević, princ, vladar, carević</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a male member of a royal family other than the sovereign (especially the son of a sovereign)</p><p><b>princ suprug kraljice Viktorije od Engleske (1819-1861), muški dvostruki kaput (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> prince consort of Queen Victoria of England (1819-1861) [Albert, Albert Francis Charles Augustus Emmanuel]</p><p><i>n.</i> a man's double-breasted frock coat</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, za proizvodnju proizvoda koji sadrže: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small yew having attractive foliage and partially weeping branches cultivated as an ornamental [Prince Albert's yew, Saxe-gothea conspicua]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, za proizvodnju proizvoda koji sadrže: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small yew having attractive foliage and partially weeping branches cultivated as an ornamental [Prince Albert yew, Saxe-gothea conspicua]</p><p><b>najstariji sin Elizabete II i nasljednik engleskog prijestolja (rođen 1948.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the eldest son of Elizabeth II and heir to the English throne (born in 1948) [Charles]</p><p><b>Zamenik koji ispunjava snove svoje voljene. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a suitor who fulfills the dreams of his beloved</p><p><b>princ koji je muž vladajuće žene vladare (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a prince who is the husband of a reigning female sovereign</p><p><b>treći sin Elizabete II. (rođen 1964.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> third son of Elizabeth II (born in 1964) [Edward, Edward Antony Richard Louis]</p><p><b>otok u zaljevu Svetog Lorenza. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an island in the Gulf of Saint Lawrence</p><p><b>Austrijski general u službi Svetoga rimskog carstva tijekom rata za španjolsko nasljeđe (1663-1736) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian general in the service of the Holy Roman Empire during the War of the Spanish Succession (1663-1736) [Eugene]</p><p><b>Japanski državnik koji je postavio japansku ekspanzionističku politiku i formirao savez s Njemačkom i Italijom (1891-1945) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Japanese statesman who set Japan's expansionist policies and formed an alliance with Germany and Italy (1891-1945) [Fumimaro Konoe, Fumimaro Konoye, Konoe, Konoye, Prince Fumimaro Konoye]</p><p><b>Japanski državnik koji je postavio japansku ekspanzionističku politiku i formirao savez s Njemačkom i Italijom (1891-1945) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Japanese statesman who set Japan's expansionist policies and formed an alliance with Germany and Italy (1891-1945) [Fumimaro Konoe, Fumimaro Konoye, Konoe, Konoye, Prince Fumimaro Konoe]</p><p><b>Austrijski državnik (1773-1859) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian statesman (1773-1859) [Klemens Metternich, Metternich]</p><p><b>(Judao-kršćanske i islamske religije) glavni duh zla i protivnik Boga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Judeo-Christian and Islamic religions) chief spirit of evil and adversary of God [Beelzebub, Devil, Lucifer, Old Nick, Satan, the Tempter]</p><p><b>Ruski feldmaršal koji je zapovijedao ruskom opozicijom Napoleonu (1745-1813) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian field marshal who commanded the Russian opposition to Napoleon (1745-1813) [Kutuzov, Mikhail Ilarionovich Kutuzov]</p><p><b>Muški nasljednik britanskog vladara. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the male heir apparent of the British sovereign</p><p><b>Južnoafrički grm koji se uzgaja zbog svog obilja bijelih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> South African shrub grown for its profusion of white flowers [Erica perspicua, Prince-of-Wales'-heath]</p><p><b>Njemački državnik pod čijim je vodstvom Njemačka bila ujedinjena (1815-1898) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German statesman under whose leadership Germany was united (1815-1898) [Bismarck, Iron Chancellor, Otto von Bismarck, Prince Otto von Bismarck, von Bismarck]</p><p><b>Njemački državnik pod čijim je vodstvom Njemačka bila ujedinjena (1815-1898) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German statesman under whose leadership Germany was united (1815-1898) [Bismarck, Iron Chancellor, Otto von Bismarck, Prince Otto Eduard Leopold von Bismarck, von Bismarck]</p><p><b>Ruski anarhista (1842-1921) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian anarchist (1842-1921) [Kropotkin, Pyotr Alexeyevich Kropotkin]</p><p><b>Filip</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Englishman and husband of Elizabeth II (born 1921) [Duke of Edinburgh, Philip]</p><p><b>Engleski vođa (rođen u Njemačkoj) kraljevskih snaga tijekom Engleskog građanskog rata (1619-1682) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English leader (born in Germany) of the Royalist forces during the English Civil War (1619-1682) [Rupert]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko biljaka rodova Chimaphila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several plants of the genus Chimaphila [pipsissewa]</p><p><b>godišnji sa širokim ovativnim lišćama i tankim spušteni šiljci crvenokrasnih cvijeća, Visoka, blesava, tropska američka godišnja biljka s dlakavim stabljikama i dugim šiljcima obično crvenih cvijeća iznad lišća duboko crvenog ljubičastog. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annual with broadly ovate leaves and slender drooping spikes of crimson flowers [Polygonum orientale, kiss-me-over-the-garden-gate, prince's-plume, princess feather]</p><p><i>n.</i> tall showy tropical American annual having hairy stems and long spikes of usually red flowers above leaves deeply flushed with purple [Amaranthus cruentus, Amaranthus hybridus erythrostachys, Amaranthus hybridus hypochondriacus, gentleman's-cane, prince's-plume, purple amaranth, red amaranth]</p><p><b>godišnji sa širokim ovativnim lišćama i tankim spušteni šiljci crvenokrasnih cvijeća, višegodišnja biljka iz jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država s kožnim plavo-zeleno pinnatifidnim listovima i debelim plemenastim šiljcima žutih cvijeća, Visoka, blesava, tropska američka godišnja biljka s dlakavim stabljikama i dugim šiljcima obično crvenih cvijeća iznad lišća duboko crvenog ljubičastog. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annual with broadly ovate leaves and slender drooping spikes of crimson flowers [Polygonum orientale, kiss-me-over-the-garden-gate, prince's-feather, princess feather]</p><p><i>n.</i> perennial of southwestern United States having leathery blue-green pinnatifid leaves and thick plumelike spikes of yellow flowers [Cleome pinnata, Stanleya pinnata, desert plume]</p><p><i>n.</i> tall showy tropical American annual having hairy stems and long spikes of usually red flowers above leaves deeply flushed with purple [Amaranthus cruentus, Amaranthus hybridus erythrostachys, Amaranthus hybridus hypochondriacus, gentleman's-cane, prince's-feather, purple amaranth, red amaranth]</p><p><b>Novi Zeland s pramenom i guste vune (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> New Zealand with pinnate fronds and a densely woolly stalks [Leptopteris superba, Prince-of-Wales fern, Prince-of-Wales plume, Todea superba, crape fern]</p><p><b>Novi Zeland s pramenom i guste vune (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> New Zealand with pinnate fronds and a densely woolly stalks [Leptopteris superba, Prince-of-Wales feather, Prince-of-Wales plume, Todea superba, crape fern]</p><p><b>Novi Zeland s pramenom i guste vune (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> New Zealand with pinnate fronds and a densely woolly stalks [Leptopteris superba, Prince-of-Wales feather, Prince-of-Wales fern, Todea superba, crape fern]</p><p><b>Južnoafrički grm koji se uzgaja zbog svog obilja bijelih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> South African shrub grown for its profusion of white flowers [Erica perspicua, Prince of Wales heath]</p><p><b>dostojanstvo ili čin ili položaj kneza, teritorija kojom vlada knez (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the dignity or rank or position of a prince</p><p><i>n.</i> territory ruled by a prince [principality]</p><p><b>sitni ili beznačajan princ koji vlada nekim beznačajnim kneževinom., Mladi princ. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a petty or insignificant prince who rules some unimportant principality</p><p><i>n.</i> a young prince</p><p><b>raskošan, sjajan, veličanstven</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> ostentatiously rich and superior in quality [deluxe, gilded, grand, lush, luxurious, opulent, sumptuous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having the rank of or befitting a prince</p><p><b>kneginja, kneginjica, kraljevna, princeza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a female member of a royal family other than the queen (especially the daughter of a sovereign)</p><p><b>Engleska aristokrata koja je bila prva žena princa Charlesa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English aristocrat who was the first wife of Prince Charles [Diana, Lady Diana Frances Spencer, Princess of Wales]</p><p><b>godišnji sa širokim ovativnim lišćama i tankim spušteni šiljci crvenokrasnih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annual with broadly ovate leaves and slender drooping spikes of crimson flowers [Polygonum orientale, kiss-me-over-the-garden-gate, prince's-feather, prince's-plume]</p><p><b>Američka filmska glumica koja se povukla u mirovinu kada se udala za kraljevsku obitelj Monaka (1928-1982) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States film actress who retired when she married into the royal family of Monaco (1928-1982) [Grace Kelly, Grace Patricia Kelly, Kelly]</p><p><b>Engleska aristokrata koja je bila prva žena princa Charlesa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English aristocrat who was the first wife of Prince Charles [Diana, Lady Diana Frances Spencer, Princess Diana]</p><p><b>raznolikost klupskog mahova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a variety of club moss [Lycopodium obscurum, ground fir, tree clubmoss]</p><p><b>Najstarija kći britanskog vladara. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the eldest daughter of a British sovereign</p><p><b>Univerzitetski grad u središnjem New Jerseyju, Sveučilište u New Jerseyju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a university town in central New Jersey</p><p><i>n.</i> a university in New Jersey [Princeton University]</p><p><b>Sveučilište u New Jerseyju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a university in New Jersey [Princeton]</p><p><b>Makina čitljiva leksikalna baza podataka organizirana po značenjima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a machine-readable lexical database organized by meanings [WordNet]</p><p><b>tropsko američko drvo, veliki tropski američki drvo roda Cordia uzgajeno zbog svojih obilnih kremasto-bijelog cvijeća i vrijednog drveta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American timber tree [Cordia gerascanthus, Spanish elm]</p><p><i>n.</i> large tropical American tree of the genus Cordia grown for its abundant creamy white flowers and valuable wood [Cordia alliodora, Equador laurel, Spanish elm, cypre, salmwood]</p><p><b>direktor, direktor škole, glavne, glavni, glavnica, najvažniji, osnovni, predsjednik, pročelnik, starješina, upravitelj, upravnik, ravnatelj, zvijezda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the original amount of a debt on which interest is calculated</p><p><i>n.</i> the educator who has executive authority for a school [head, head teacher, school principal]</p><p><i>n.</i> an actor who plays a principal role [lead, star]</p><p><i>n.</i> capital as contrasted with the income derived from it [corpus, principal sum]</p><p><i>n.</i> (criminal law) any person involved in a criminal offense, regardless of whether the person profits from such involvement</p><p><i>n.</i> the major party to a financial transaction at a stock exchange [dealer]</p><p><i>adj.</i> most important element [chief, main, master, primary]</p><p><b>linija koja prolazi kroz središte zakrivljenosti sočiva tako da se svjetlost ne odražava niti lomlja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a line that passes through the center of curvature of a lens so that light is neither reflected nor refracted [optic axis]</p><p><b>dijagonal kvadratne matrice koja ide od gornjeg lijevog ulaza do donjeg desnog ulaza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the diagonal of a square matrix running from the upper left entry to the lower right entry [main diagonal]</p><p><b>znanstvenici koji su zaduženi za eksperiment ili istraživački projekt (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the scientist in charge of an experiment or research project [PI]</p><p><b>Kapital u usporedbi s prihodom koji se od njega dobija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> capital as contrasted with the income derived from it [corpus, principal]</p><p><b>kneževina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> territory ruled by a prince [princedom]</p><p><b>Kneževina Andora, Andora</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small republic in the eastern Pyrenees between Spain and France [Andorra]</p><p><b>Kneževina Lihtenštajn, Lihtenštajn</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small landlocked principality (constitutional monarchy) in central Europe located in the Alps between Austria and Switzerland [Liechtenstein]</p><p><b>Kneževina Monako, Monako</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a constitutional monarchy in a tiny enclave on the French Riviera [Monaco]</p><p><b>prije svega, uglavnom</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> for the most part [chiefly, in the main, mainly, primarily]</p><p><b>mjesto glavnog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the post of principal</p><p><b>otok u Gvinejskom zaljevu koji je dio Sao Tomea i Principea (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an island in the Gulf of Guinea that is part of Sao Tome and Principe</p><p><b>ampicilin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> semisynthetic penicillin (trade names Principen and Polycillin and SK-Ampicillin) [Polycillin, SK-Ampicillin, ampicillin]</p><p><b>element, načelan, načelo, počelo, prauzrok, princip, sastavni dio, zakon, zasada, načelna</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a basic generalization that is accepted as true and that can be used as a basis for reasoning or conduct [rule]</p><p><i>n.</i> a rule or standard especially of good behavior</p><p><i>n.</i> a basic truth or law or assumption</p><p><i>n.</i> a rule or law concerning a natural phenomenon or the function of a complex system [rule]</p><p><i>n.</i> rule of personal conduct [precept]</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) an explanation of the fundamental reasons (especially an explanation of the working of some device in terms of laws of nature) [rationale]</p><p><b>(fizička) princip da promatrač nema načina da razlikuje je li njegov laboratorij u jednaku gravitacijsko polje ili je u ubrzanom referentnom okviru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the principle that an observer has no way of distinguishing whether his laboratory is in a uniform gravitational field or is in an accelerated frame of reference</p><p><b>(hidrostatika) zapremina tijela potopljeno u tekućinu jednaka je zapremini premještene tekućine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (hydrostatics) the volume of a body immersed in a fluid is equal to the volume of the displaced fluid</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, poduzeća mogu imati: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the principle that entities should not be multiplied needlessly [Occam's Razor, Ockham's Razor, law of parsimony]</p><p><b>(fizička) univerzalni zakon koji navodi da se zakoni mehanike ne utječu na jednako pravocrtan pokret sustava koordinata na koji se odnose (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) a universal law that states that the laws of mechanics are not affected by a uniform rectilinear motion of the system of coordinates to which they are referred</p><p><b>(geologija) načelo da je u nizu slojevljenih sedimentnih stijena najniži sloj najstariji., pomicanje bilo koje točke zbog superpozicije valnih sustava jednako je sjemanju pomicanja pojedinačnih valova u toj točki. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (geology) the principle that in a series of stratified sedimentary rocks the lowest stratum is the oldest [superposition, superposition principle]</p><p><i>n.</i> the displacement of any point due to the superposition of wave systems is equal to the sum of the displacements of the individual waves at that point [Huygens' principle of superposition]</p><p><b>koji se drži nekih principa, principijelan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> based on or manifesting objectively defined standards of rightness or morality</p><p><b>rod Sylviidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Sylviidae [genus Prinia]</p><p><b>lizinopril</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ACE inhibiting drug (trade names Prinival or Zestril) administered as an antihypertensive and after heart attacks [Zestril, lisinopril]</p><p><b>dotjerati se, dotjerivati se, napirlitati se, pirlitati se, srediti se, sređivati se, udesiti se, udešavati se, urediti se, uređivati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> dress very carefully and in a finicky manner</p><p><i>v.</i> put on special clothes to appear particularly appealing and attractive [attire, deck out, deck up, dress up, fancy up, fig out, fig up, get up, gussy up, overdress, rig out, tog out, tog up, trick out, trick up]</p><p><b>ispis, ispisati, kopija, novine, otisak, otisnuti, reprod