ji imaju stanice koje nemaju membrano vezane jezgre (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having cells that lack membrane-bound nuclei [prokaryotic]</p><p><b>tip rod Procaviidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Procaviidae [genus Procavia]</p><p><b>hirax koji živi u kamenitim područjima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hyrax that lives in rocky areas [rock hyrax, rock rabbit]</p><p><b>obuhvaća sve nedavne članove reda Hyracoidea (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> includes all recent members of the order Hyracoidea [family Procaviidae]</p><p><b>postupovni, procesni, proceduralan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to procedure</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to court practice and procedure as opposed to the principles of law [adjective]</p><p><b>način, postupak, postupanje, poveznica, procedura, provedba, tok, načini, postupkom, proceduru, proces, funkcija, potprogram, rutina, protokol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a particular course of action intended to achieve a result [process]</p><p><i>n.</i> a process or series of acts especially of a practical or mechanical nature involved in a particular form of work [operation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a set sequence of steps, part of larger computer program [function, routine, subprogram, subroutine]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mode of conducting legal and parliamentary proceedings</p><p><b>dobit, ići dalje, nastaviti, obnoviti, postupiti, poticati, prelaziti, prihod, produžiti, razlijegati, ići, kretati se, prolaziti, proći, odvijati se, odviti se, proteći, proticati, protjecati, teći, nastavljati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> continue talking [carry on, continue, go on]</p><p><i>v.</i> move ahead [continue, go forward]</p><p><i>v.</i> follow a procedure or take a course [go, move]</p><p><i>v.</i> follow a certain course [go]</p><p><i>v.</i> continue a certain state, condition, or activity [continue, go along, go on, keep]</p><p><b>način rada, nastavak, postupak, postupanje, procedura, radovi, rasprave, spisi, suđenje, pravna procedura, pravni postupak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) the 