ss]</p><p><b>margina profita, profitna marža</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio gross profits divided by net sales [gross margin, margin of profit]</p><p><b>podjela dobiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system in which employees receive a share of the net profits of the business</p><p><b>netko tko prodaje dionice na dobit (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who sells stock shares at a profit</p><p><b>financijski izvještaj koji daje operativne rezultate za određeno razdoblje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a financial statement that gives operating results for a specific period [earnings report, income statement, operating statement]</p><p><b>da bi profit bio što veći. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> making the profit as great as possible [profit-maximizing]</p><p><b>da bi profit bio što veći. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> making the profit as great as possible [profit-maximising]</p><p><b>profitabilnost, rentabilnost, rentabilnosti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of affording gain or benefit or profit [gainfulness, lucrativeness, profitableness]</p><p><b>koristan, lukrativan, probitačan, profitabilan, rentabilan, unosan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> yielding material gain or profit</p><p><b>lukrativnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being encouraging or promising of a successful outcome [advantageousness, favorableness, favourableness, positiveness, positivity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of affording gain or benefit or profit [gainfulness, lucrativeness, profitability]</p><p><b>rentabilno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a productive way [fruitfully, productively]</p><p><b>profiter, šiber, špekulant</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who makes excessive profit (especially on goods in short supply)</p><p><i>v.</i> make an unreasonable profit, as on the sale of difficult to obtain goods</p><p><b>mala šuplja kolačić koji je obično ispunjen sa smetaninom i prekriven čokoladom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small hollow pastry that is typically filled with cream and covered with chocolate</p><p><b>beskoristan, nekoristan</