hibitive]</p><p><b>koji imaju tendenciju izazivati upale (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to cause inflammation [pro-inflammatory]</p><p><b>baciti, izbacivati, nacrt, namjeravati, objekt, plan, poduhvat, pothvat, prenijeti, projekt, projektni, projicirati, smisliti, zamisao, projekta, projektne, projektu, zadatak, isturiti, projektirati, predložiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any piece of work that is undertaken or attempted [labor, task, undertaking]</p><p><i>n.</i> a planned undertaking [projection]</p><p><i>v.</i> communicate vividly</p><p><i>v.</i> extend out or project in space [jut, jut out, protrude, stick out]</p><p><i>v.</i> transfer (ideas or principles) from one domain into another</p><p><i>v.</i> project on a screen</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be heard</p><p><i>v.</i> draw a projection of</p><p><i>v.</i> make or work out a plan for [contrive, design, plan]</p><p><i>v.</i> present for consideration, examination, criticism, etc. [propose]</p><p><i>v.</i> imagine [envision, fancy, figure, image, picture, see, visualise, visualize]</p><p><i>v.</i> put or send forth [cast, contrive, throw]</p><p><i>v.</i> throw, send, or cast forward [send off]</p><p><i>v.</i> regard as objective [externalise, externalize]</p><p><b>izbačen, izbačeni, prenesen, projiciran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> extending out above or beyond a surface or boundary [jutting, projecting, protruding, relieved, sticking, sticking out]</p><p><b>projektil, projektila, raketa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a weapon that is forcibly thrown or projected at a targets but is not self-propelled [missile]</p><p><i>n.</i> any vehicle self-propelled by a rocket engine [rocket]</p><p><i>adj.</i> impelling or impelled forward</p><p><b>projektiranje</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> extending out above or beyond a surface or boundary [jutting, projected, protruding, relieved, sticking, sticking out]</p><p><b>ispupčeni dio, izbacivanja projektila, izbočina, plan, predviđanje, projekcija, projekt, ispupčenje, izbočenje, istjerivanje, izbacivanje, izgon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a prediction made by extrapolating from past observations</p><p><i>n.</i> the projection of an image from a film onto a screen</p><p><i>n.</i> a planned undertaking [project]</p><p><i>n.</i> any structure that branches out from a central support</p><p><i>n.</i> any solid convex shape that juts out from something</p><p><i>n.</i> (psychiatry) a defense mechanism by which your own traits and emotions are attributed to someone else</p><p><i>n.</i> the acoustic phenomenon that gives sound a penetrating quality [acoustic projection, sound projection]</p><p><i>n.</i> the representation of a figure or solid on a plane as it would look from a particular direction</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of projecting out from something [jut, jutting, protrusion]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of expelling or projecting or ejecting [ejection, expulsion, forcing out]</p><p><b>ekran</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white or silvered surface where pictures can be projected for viewing [screen, silver screen]</p><p><b>osoba koja upravlja projektorom u bioskopu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who operates the projector in a movie house</p><p><b>Svaki test osobnosti koji je dizajniran kako bi se dobili informacije o osobnosti nekoga na temelju njegovog neograničenog odgovora na dvosmislene predmete ili situacije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any personality test designed to yield information about someone's personality on the basis of their unrestricted response to ambiguous objects or situations [projective technique, projective test]</p><p><b>projektivna geometrija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the geometry of properties that remain invariant under projection [descriptive geometry]</p><p><b>Svaki test osobnosti koji je dizajniran kako bi se dobili informacije o osobnosti nekoga na temelju njegovog neograničenog odgovora na dvosmislene predmete ili situacije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any personality test designed to yield information about someone's personality on the basis of their unrestricted response to ambiguous objects or situations [projective device, projective test]</p><p><b>Svaki test osobnosti koji je dizajniran kako bi se dobili informacije o osobnosti nekoga na temelju njegovog neograničenog odgovora na dvosmislene predmete ili situacije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any personality test designed to yield information about someone's personality on the basis of their unrestricted response to ambiguous objects or situations [projective device, projective technique]</p><p><b>čarobna lampa, projektant, projektor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an optical device for projecting a beam of light</p><p><i>n.</i> an optical instrument that projects an enlarged image onto a screen</p><p><b>prokariot</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unicellular organism having cells lacking membrane-bound nuclei [procaryote]</p><p><b>koji imaju stanice koje nemaju membrano vezane jezgre (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having cells that lack membrane-bound nuclei [procaryotic]</p><p><b>Pro-karotne bakterije i plavo-zelene alge i razni primitivni patogeni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> prokaryotic bacteria and blue-green algae and various primitive pathogens [Monera, kingdom Monera, kingdom Prokaryotae]</p><p><b>Ruski fizičar čije je istraživanje načina kretanja elektrona oko atoma dovelo do razvoja masera i lasera za proizvodnju zračenja visokog intenziteta (1916-2002) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian physicist whose research into ways of moving electrons around atoms led to the development of masers and lasers for producing high-intensity radiation (1916-2002) [Aleksandr Mikjailovich Prokhorov, Aleksandr Prokhorov]</p><p><b>Prokofjev</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian composer of ballets and symphonies and operas (1891-1953) [Sergei Sergeyevich Prokofiev]</p><p><b>prolaktin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> gonadotropic hormone secreted by the anterior pituitary [lactogenic hormone, luteotropin]</p><p><b>Jednostavan protein koji se nalazi u biljkama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a simple protein found in plants</p><p><b>sklizanje ili ispadanje organa (kao što je maternica), Slizanje ili padanje s mjesta, kao i dijelovi tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the slipping or falling out of place of an organ (as the uterus) [descensus, prolapsus]</p><p><i>v.</i> slip or fall out of place, as of body parts</p><p><b>sklizanje ili ispadanje organa (kao što je maternica) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the slipping or falling out of place of an organ (as the uterus) [descensus, prolapse]</p><p><b>s polnim prečnikom većim od ekvatorijalnog prečnika, Okrugla kao jaje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the polar diameter greater than the equatorial diameter [watermelon-shaped]</p><p><i>adj.</i> rounded like an egg [egg-shaped, elliptic, elliptical, oval, oval-shaped, ovate, oviform, ovoid]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cycloid generated by a point outside the rolling circle</p><p><b>radnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the working class (not necessarily employed) [proletarian, worker]</p><p><b>uvodna rasprava koja se stavlja na početak knjige ili rasprave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a preliminary discussion inserted at the beginning of a book or treatise</p><p><b>Službenici za javnu potporu i javne službe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> anticipating and answering objections in advance</p><p><b>proleter, proleterski, radnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the working class (not necessarily employed) [prole, worker]</p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging to or characteristic of the proletariat</p><p><b>proletarijat, rad, radništvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a social class comprising those who do manual labor or work for wages [labor, labour, working class]</p><p><b>množiti se, namnožavati se, namnožiti se, proširiti se, razmnažati se, razmnožavati se, razmnožiti se, umnožavati se, umnožiti se, širiti se, množiti, proširiti, proširivati, razmnažati, razmnožavati, razmnožiti, širiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> grow rapidly</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to grow or increase rapidly</p><p><b>naglo stvranje, naglo širenje, proliferacija, rastuće posjedovanje, rastućeg posjedovanja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> growth by the rapid multiplication of parts</p><p><i>n.</i> a rapid increase in number (especially a rapid increase in the number of deadly weapons)</p><p><b>koji obiluj, obilan, plodan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> intellectually productive [fecund, fertile]</p><p><i>adj.</i> bearing in abundance especially offspring [fertile]</p><p><b>plodnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of producing abundantly and sustaining vigorous and luxuriant growth [fertility, rankness, richness]</p><p><b>prolin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amino acid that is found in many proteins (especially collagen)</p><p><b>dosadan, opširan, razvučen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tediously prolonged or tending to speak or write at great length</p><p><b>opširnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> boring verbosity [long-windedness, prolixness, windiness, wordiness]</p><p><b>dosadan, opširan, razvučen (od &quot;prolix&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> boring verbosity [long-windedness, prolixity, windiness, wordiness]</p><p><b>prolog</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a computer language designed in Europe to support natural language processing [logic programing, logic programming]</p><p><b>napisati ili govoriti prolog (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> write or speak a prologue [prologize, prologuize]</p><p><b>napisati ili govoriti prolog (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> write or speak a prologue [prologise, prologuize]</p><p><b>predgovor, predigra, prolog, uvod</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an introduction to a play</p><p><b>napisati ili govoriti prolog (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> write or speak a prologue [prologise, prologize]</p><p><b>nastaviti, odgoditi, produžiti, prolongirati, održati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> lengthen in time [draw out, extend, protract]</p><p><i>v.</i> lengthen or extend in duration or space [keep up, sustain]</p><p><b>odgađanje, produljenje, produženje, prolongiranje, održavanje kontinuiteta, otezanje, pomicanje roka, prolongacija, proširenje, dugotrajnost</b></p><p><