opagandom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> subject to propaganda [propagandize]</p><p><i>v.</i> spread by propaganda [propagandize]</p><p><b>agitator, izvjestilac, referent, propagandist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who disseminates messages calculated to assist some cause or some government</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characterized by propaganda [propagandistic]</p><p><b>agitator, izvjestilac, referent (od &quot;propagandist&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characterized by propaganda [propagandist]</p><p><b>podložni propagandi, Prenosena propagandom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> subject to propaganda [propagandise]</p><p><i>v.</i> spread by propaganda [propagandise]</p><p><b>prenositi, propagirati, razmnožavati, širiti, umnožavati, prenijeti, priopćavati, priopćiti, pronijeti, pronositi, proširiti, proširivati, razglasiti, razglašavati, raširiti, raširivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> transmit from one generation to the next</p><p><i>v.</i> travel through the air</p><p><i>v.</i> transmit</p><p><i>v.</i> become distributed or widespread [spread]</p><p><i>v.</i> transmit or cause to broaden or spread</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to become widely known [broadcast, circularise, circularize, circulate, diffuse, disperse, disseminate, distribute, pass around, spread]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to propagate, as by grafting or layering</p><p><i>v.</i> multiply sexually or asexually</p><p><b>napredovanja, prenošenje, rasplođivanje, razmnožavanje, širenje, širenje (elektromagnetskih valova)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the spreading of something (a belief or practice) into new regions [extension]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of producing offspring or multiplying by such production [generation, multiplication]</p><p><i>n.</i> the movement of a wave through a medium</p><p><b>za koje je karakteristično razmnožavanje ili koje se odnosi na razmnožavanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by propagation or relating to propagation</p><p><b>netko tko razmnožava biljke (kao pod staklom), Nekoga tko širi vijesti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who propagates plants (as under glass)</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who spreads the news [disseminator]</p><p><b>propionaldehid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless liquid aldehyde [propionaldehyde]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom proteina od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amide of propionic acid (C2H5CONH2) [proprionamide]</p><p><b>dimetiletan, propan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> colorless gas found in natural gas and petroleum</p><p><b>slatka bezbožna, viskozna, higroskopska tekućina koja se koristi kao antifriz i u kočničnoj tekućini te također kao vlažni sredstvo u kozmeticama i proizvodima za osobnu higijenu, iako se može apsorbirati kroz kožu s štetnim učincima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sweet colorless, viscous, hygroscopic liquid used as an antifreeze and in brake fluid and also as a humectant in cosmetics and personal care items although it can be absorbed through the skin with harmful effects [propylene glycol]</p><p><b>tekuća masna kiselina koja se nalazi u mlijeku i znoju te u destilatima goriva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a liquid fatty acid found in milk and sweat and in fuel distillates [propionic acid]</p><p><b>propanol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clear colorless volatile liquid (alcohol) used as a solvent and antiseptic [propyl alcohol]</p><p><b>propranolol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first beta blocker (trade name Inderal) used in treating hypertension and angina pectoris and essential tremor [Inderal]</p><p><b>najprostiji keton (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the simplest ketone [acetone, dimethyl ketone]</p><p><b>riječ koja ima naglasak ili akutni naglasak na antepenult (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> word having stress or acute accent on the antepenult</p><p><b>dati poticaj, množiti se, tjerati naprijed, gurati, pogurati, pokrenuti, pokretati, tjerati, aktivirati, inicirati, motivirati, potaknuti, potaći, poticati, stimulirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to move forward with force [impel]</p><p><i>v.</i> give an incentive for action [actuate, incite, motivate, move, prompt]</p><p><b>gorivo, pokretna sila</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any substance that propels [propellent]</p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to or capable of propelling [propellent, propelling, propulsive]</p><p><b>eksploziv koji se koristi za pogon projektila iz topova ili za pogon raketa i raketa ili za lansiranje torpeda i dubinskih naboja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an explosive that is used to propel projectiles from guns or to propel rockets and missiles or to launch torpedos and depth charges [impulse explosive]</p><p><b>bilo koja tvar koja pokreće, s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any substance that propels [propellant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to or capable of propelling [propellant, propelling, propulsive]</p><p><b>elisa, propeler, vijak broda, zračni vijak, vijak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanical device that rotates to push against air or water [propellor]</p><p><b>zrakoplov koji se pokreće propelerom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an airplane that is driven by a propeller</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to or capable of propelling [propellant, propellent, propulsive]</p><p><b>elisa, propeler, vijak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanical device that rotates to push against air or water [propeller]</p><p><b>akril-aldehid, akrolein, propenal</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pungent colorless unsaturated liquid aldehyde made from propene [acrolein]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a flammable gas obtained by cracking petroleum [propylene]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% masenog udjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a salt or ester of propenoic acid [acrylate]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena od 1,5% ili više, ali ne više od 1,5% ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unsaturated liquid carboxylic acid used in the manufacture of acrylic resins [acrylic acid]</p><p><b>bezbojni tekući nezasićeni nitril od propena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless liquid unsaturated nitrile made from propene [acrylonitrile, vinyl cyanide]</p><p><b>naklonost, sklonost, tendencija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inclination to do something [leaning, tendency]</p><p><i>n.</i> a natural inclination [leaning, proclivity]</p><p><i>n.</i> a disposition to behave in a certain way [aptness]</p><p><b>ne zasićen primarni alkohol prisutan u drvenom alkoholu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unsaturated primary alcohol present in wood spirit [allyl alcohol]</p><p><b>mjerodavan, nadležan, odgovarajućeg, odgovarajući, podesan, pogodan, pravi, pravilan, pristojan, vlastit, vlastiti</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by suitability or rightness or appropriateness</p><p><i>adj.</i> having all the qualities typical of the thing specified</p><p><i>adj.</i> limited to the thing specified</p><p><i>adj.</i> appropriate for a condition or purpose or occasion or a person's character, needs [right]</p><p><b>pravi razlomak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fraction with a numerator smaller than the denominator</p><p><b>Imenica koja označava određenu stvar. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a noun that denotes a particular thing [proper noun]</p><p><b>Imenica koja označava određenu stvar. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a noun that denotes a particular thing [proper name]</p><p><b>kako treba, kako valja, korektno, pogodno, pošteno, pravilno, prikladno, primjereno, pristojno, propisno, solidno, temeljito, umjesno, uredno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in the right manner [decent, decently, right]</p><p><i>adv.</i> indicating exactness or preciseness [exactly, just, precisely]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in accordance with what is appropriate or suitable for the circumstances [appropriately, befittingly, duly, fitly, fittingly, suitably]</p><p><b>U stvarnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in actual fact [strictly speaking, to be precise]</p><p><b>mjerodavan, nadležan, odg