y way of expiation or propitiation [expiative, expiatory]</p><p><i>adj.</i> intended to reconcile or appease [propitiative]</p><p><b>naklonjen, pogodan, povoljan, razmjeran, sklon</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> presenting favorable circumstances</p><p><b>naklonjen, pogodan, povoljan, razmjeran, sklon (od &quot;propitious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an auspicious manner [auspiciously]</p><p><b>naklonjen, pogodan, povoljan, razmjeran, sklon (od &quot;propitious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the favorable quality of strongly indicating a successful result [auspiciousness]</p><p><b>zrakoplov s vanjskim propelerom koji se pokreće turbo-reaktnim motorom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an airplane with an external propeller that is driven by a turbojet engine [turbo-propeller plane, turboprop]</p><p><b>član pozorničke ekipe zadužen za imovinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> member of the stage crew in charge of properties [property man, property master]</p><p><b>predlagač, advokat, proponent, zagovaratelj, zagovornik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who pleads for a cause or propounds an idea [advocate, advocator, exponent]</p><p><b>dio, doza, doziranje, mjerilo, omjer, proporcija, razmjer, razmjera, udio, uzajamni odnos, veličina, srazmjer, dimenzija, proporcije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quotient obtained when the magnitude of a part is divided by the magnitude of the whole</p><p><i>n.</i> magnitude or extent [dimension]</p><p><i>n.</i> balance among the parts of something [symmetry]</p><p><i>n.</i> the relation between things (or parts of things) with respect to their comparative quantity, magnitude, or degree [ratio]</p><p><i>n.</i> harmonious arrangement or relation of parts or elements within a whole (as in a design) [balance, proportionality]</p><p><i>v.</i> give pleasant proportions to</p><p><i>v.</i> adjust in size relative to other things</p><p><b>proporcionalno (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> proportionate</p><p><b>proporcionalan, srazmjeran, razmjeran</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the quantities i