/i> the condition of being protected [shelter]</p><p><i>n.</i> kindly endorsement and guidance [aegis, auspices]</p><p><i>n.</i> the imposition of duties or quotas on imports in order to protect domestic industry against foreign competition [trade protection]</p><p><i>n.</i> payment extorted by gangsters on threat of violence [tribute]</p><p><b>protekcionizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the policy of imposing duties or quotas on imports in order to protect home industries from overseas competition</p><p><b>zagovornik protekcionizma. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an advocate of protectionism</p><p><b>koji brani, preventivni, zaštitne, zaštitni, zaštitnički, zaštitan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> intended or adapted to afford protection of some kind</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing care</p><p><i>adj.</i> (usually followed by `of') solicitously caring or mindful</p><p><b>Obojena boja koja čini organizam manje vidljivim ili privlačnim za grabežljivce (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coloration making an organism less visible or attractive to predators</p><p><b>cerada, pokrov, presvlaka, zaštita</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a covering that is intend to protect from damage or injury [protection, protective covering]</p><p><b>cerada, pokrov, presvlaka, zaštita, zaštitni oklop, zaštitni pokrov</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a covering that is intend to protect from damage or injury [protection, protective cover]</p><p><i>n.</i> the tough natural covering of some organisms</p><p><b>strma umjetna padina ispred utvrđenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a steep artificial slope in front of a fortification [escarp, escarpment, scarp]</p><p><b>Oštro tkivo koje štiti ono što pokriva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a flap of tissue that protects what it covers</p><p><b>zaštitna odjeća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clothing that is intended to protect the wearer from injury</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 952/2013 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tariff imposed to protect domestic firms from import competition</p><p><b>koji brani, preventivni, zaštitne, zaštitni, zaštitnički (od &quot;protective&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a protective manner</p><p><b>koji brani, preventivni, zaštitne, zaštitni, zaštitnički (od &quot;protective&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of protective affection</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of providing protection</p><p><b>namjesnik, osigurač, pokrovitelj, protektor, regent, zaštitnik, branitelj, čuvar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who cares for persons or property [defender, guardian, shielder]</p><p><b>epitet za Jupiter (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an epithet for Jupiter [Jupiter Fidius]</p><p><b>protektorat, zemlja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state or territory partly controlled by (but not a possession of) a stronger state but autonomous in internal affairs [associated state]</p><p><b>položaj zaštitnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the position of protector</p><p><b>ljubimac, onaj koji je pod čijim pokroviteljstvom, onaj koji je pod čijom zaštitom, štićenik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who receives support and protection from an influential patron who furthers the protege's career</p><p><b>Žena zaštitnica. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman protege</p><p><b>štapovi od blata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mud puppies [family Proteidae]</p><p><b>bjelančevina, bjelančevine, protein, proteinska, proteinski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of a large group of nitrogenous organic compounds that are essential constituents of living cells</p><p><b>proces kojim molekula proteina dobiva svoj složeni trodimenzionalni oblik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process whereby a protein molecule assumes its intricate three-dimensional shape [folding]</p><p><b>bilo koji veliki molekul koji sadrži lance aminokiselina povezanih peptidnim vezama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any large molecule containing chains of amino acids linked by peptide bonds</p><p><b>koji se odnose na ili prirode proteina (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or of the nature of protein</p><p><b>proteinaza, peptidaza, proteaza, proteolitički enzim</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any enzyme that catalyzes the splitting of proteins into smaller peptide fractions and amino acids by a process known as proteolysis [peptidase, protease, proteolytic enzyme]</p><p><b>proteinurija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the presence of excessive protein (chiefly albumin but also globulin) in the urine [albuminuria]</p><p><b>Zvezda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aardwolf [genus Proteles]</p><p><b>crvena hijena iz jugoistočne Afrike koja se uglavnom hrani insektima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> striped hyena of southeast Africa that feeds chiefly on insects [aardwolf]</p><p><b>hidroliza proteina na peptide i aminokiseline rascjepom njihovih peptidnih veza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the hydrolysis of proteins into peptides and amino acids by cleavage of their peptide bonds</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s proteolizom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to proteolysis</p><p><b>peptidaza, proteaza, proteinaza, proteolitički enzim</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any enzyme that catalyzes the splitting of proteins into smaller peptide fractions and amino acids by a process known as proteolysis [peptidase, protease, proteinase]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve proizvode koji sadrže: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the full complement of proteins produced by a particular genome</p><p><b>proteomika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of genetics that studies the full set of proteins encoded by a genome</p><p><b>oblik cjepiva koji se može davati inhalatorom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of vaccine that can be administered by an inhaler [proteosome vaccine]</p><p><b>oblik cjepiva koji se može davati inhalatorom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of vaccine that can be administered by an inhaler [proteosome]</p><p><b>rani arhosovarski mesojed (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> early archosaurian carnivore [genus Proterochampsa]</p><p><b>Proterozoik</b></p><p><i>n.</