</i> United States church that is in communication with the see of Canterbury [Episcopal Church]</p><p><b>reformacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a religious movement of the 16th century that began as an attempt to reform the Roman Catholic Church and resulted in the creation of Protestant churches [Reformation]</p><p><b>protestantizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the theological system of any of the churches of western Christendom that separated from the Roman Catholic Church during the Reformation</p><p><b>uvjeravanje, prosvjed</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a formal and solemn declaration of objection [protest]</p><p><i>n.</i> a strong declaration of protest</p><p><b>disident, demonstrant, prosvjednik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who dissents from some established policy [contestant, dissenter, dissident, objector]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who participates in a public display of group feeling [demonstrator]</p><p><b>(grčka mitologija) proročki bog koji je služio Poseidonu, vrsta rod Proteidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) a prophetic god who served Poseidon</p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Proteidae [genus Proteus]</p><p><b>Europski vodeni salamander s stalnim vanjskim žlijezde koji živi u pećinama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European aquatic salamander with permanent external gills that lives in caves [olm]</p><p><b>pjesma u proslavi vjenčanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a song in celebration of a marriage [prothalamium]</p><p><b>pjesma u proslavi vjenčanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a song in celebration of a marriage [prothalamion]</p><p><b>prednji dio grudi insekta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the anterior part of an insect's thorax</p><p><b>proteina u krvnoj plazmi koja je neaktivni prekursor trombina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a protein in blood plasma that is the inactive precursor of thrombin [factor II]</p><p><b>faktor koagulacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a coagulation factor [accelerator factor, factor V, proaccelerin]</p><p><b>Koagulacijski faktor koji se pretvara u enzim koji p