ijezda Suncu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the nearest star to the sun [Proxima]</p><p><b>proksimalan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> situated nearest to point of attachment or origin</p><p><b>najbliži, neposredan, približno</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> closest in degree or order (space or time) especially in a chain of causes and effects</p><p><i>adj.</i> very close in space or time</p><p><b>blizina, neposrednost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being close together [propinquity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the region close around a person or thing</p><p><i>n.</i> a Gestalt principle of organization holding that (other things being equal) objects or events that are near to one another (in space or time) are perceived as belonging together as a unit [law of proximity]</p><p><b>u ili sljedećeg mjeseca nakon današnjeg (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> in or of the next month after the present [prox]</p><p><b>opunomoćenik, ovlaštenje, posrednik, punomoć, punomoćje, punomoćnik, zamjena, zamjenik, zastupnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person authorized to act for another [placeholder, procurator]</p><p><i>n.</i> a power of attorney document given by shareholders of a corporation authorizing a specific vote on their behalf at a corporate meeting</p><p><b>U slučaju da je predmet pribavljanja u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u slučaju pribavljanja u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, pribavljač mora imati pravo na određenu vrijednost. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measure used by an acquirer to gain control of a takeover target</p><p><b>rat koji je pokrenula velika sila koja sama ne sudjeluje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a war instigated by a major power that does not itself participate</p><p><b>selektivni inhibitor ponovnog uzimanja serotonina koji se obično propisuje kao antidepresiv (trgovinski nazivi Prozac ili Sarafem) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a selective-serotonin reuptake inhibitor commonly prescribed as an antidepressant (trade names Prozac or Sarafem) [Sarafem, fluoxetine, fluoxetine hydrocholoride]</p><p><b>izvještačena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person excessively concerned about propriety and decorum [puritan]</p><p><b>mudrost, oprez, opreznost, razboritost, razumnost, smotrenost, štedljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> discretion in practical affairs</p><p><i>n.</i> knowing how to avoid embarrassment or distress [circumspection, discreetness, discretion]</p><p><b>mudar, oprezan, razborit, razuman, smotren, štedljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> careful and sensible</p><p><b>obećanje, promišljen, razborit</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> arising from or characterized by prudence especially in business matters</p><p><b>razborito</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a prudent manner [providentially]</p><p><b>prekomjerna ili oslabljena skromnost (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> excessive or affected modesty [Grundyism, primness, prudishness]</p><p><b>zaljev na sjevernoj obali Aljaske gdje je naftna nafta otkrivena 1968. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bay on the northern coast of Alaska where oil was discovered in 1968</p><p><b>izvještačen, licemjeran, stidljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> exaggeratedly proper [priggish, prim, prissy, puritanical, square-toed, straight-laced, straightlaced, strait-laced, straitlaced, tight-laced, victorian]</p><p><b>izvještačen, licemjeran, stidljiv (od &quot;prudish&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a prudish manner [puritanically]</p><p><b>izvještačen, licemjeran, stidljiv (od &quot;prudish&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> excessive or affected modesty [Grundyism, primness, prudery]</p><p><b>uglavnom dvostruke zimzelene iglavce (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mostly dioecious evergreen conifers [genus Prumnopitys]</p><p><b>veliko brzo rastuće monoecious tropsko zimzeleno drvo s velikim sjajnim lanceolate lišća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large fast-growing monoecious tropical evergreen tree having large glossy lanceolate leaves [Podocarpus amara, Sundacarpus amara]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> South American evergreen tree or shrub [Prumnopity