vo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the art of making puppets and presenting puppet shows</p><p><i>n.</i> a stilted dramatic performance (as if by puppets)</p><p><b>Krma</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a constellation in the southern hemisphere between Vela and Canis Major that shaped like the stern of a boat</p><p><b>djetence, kicoš, psić, štene, vjetropir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a young dog</p><p><i>n.</i> an inexperienced young person [pup]</p><p><b>masnoća na tijelu bebe ili djeteta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fat on the body of a baby or child</p><p><b>privremena ljubav tinejdžera. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> temporary love of an adolescent [calf love, crush, infatuation]</p><p><b>karakteristika štene (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of a puppy [puppylike]</p><p><b>karakteristika štene (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of a puppy [puppyish]</p><p><b>neaktivni vulkan u Andima u južnoj Kolumbiji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inactive volcano in the Andes in southern Colombia</p><p><b>sastav 18 djela napisanih između 1. i 11. stoljeća i uključuju legende i spekulativne povijesti svemira i mitove i običajna obilježja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a body of 18 works written between the first and 11th centuries and incorporating legends and speculative histories of the universe and myths and customary observances</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s Purana (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the Purana</p><p><b>grmlje koje se široko rasprostranjuje duž tropskih obala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrubby tree widely distributed along tropical shores [Hibiscus tiliaceus, balibago, mahagua, mahoe, majagua]</p><p><b>ako imate znatno smanjeno vidno stanje, koji nemaju uvid ili razlučivost. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having greatly reduced vision [dim-sighted, near-blind, sand-blind, visually challenged, visually impaired]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking in insight or discernment [obtuse]</p><p><b>Engleski organist u Westminsterskoj opatiji i skladatelj mnogih kazališnih djela (1659-1695) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.<