estors as proof of being a purebred animal [pedigree, pedigreed, pureblooded, thoroughbred]</p><p><b>Snimak: broj i oznaka proizvoda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a list of ancestors as proof of being a purebred animal [pedigree, pedigreed, pureblood, thoroughbred]</p><p><b>čistokrvan, rasan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pedigreed animal of unmixed lineage [pureblood, thoroughbred]</p><p><i>adj.</i> bred for many generations from member of a recognized breed or strain</p><p><b>krem-juha, pire, ocijediti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> food prepared by cooking and straining or processed in a blender</p><p><i>v.</i> rub through a strainer or process in an electric blender [strain]</p><p><b>čisto, isključivo, potpuno, sasvim, u cjelini, striktno, strogo</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> restricted to something [strictly]</p><p><b>čistoća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> being undiluted or unmixed with extraneous material [purity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being unsullied by sin or moral wrong [innocence, purity, sinlessness, whiteness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a woman's virtue or chastity [honor, honour, purity]</p><p><b>čišćenje tijela upotrebom katartike za stimulaciju evakuacije crijeva, ceremonijalno čišćenje od nečistoće ili nečistoće vršenjem odgovarajućih obreda, čin oslobađanja sebe (ili nekog drugog) od neke stigme ili optužbe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> purging the body by the use of a cathartic to stimulate evacuation of the bowels [catharsis, katharsis]</p><p><i>n.</i> a ceremonial cleansing from defilement or uncleanness by the performance of appropriate rites [purification]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of clearing yourself (or another) from some stigma or charge [purge, purging]</p><p><b>čistilište, koji čisti, purgativan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a purging medicine [aperient, cathartic, physic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> strongly laxative [cathartic, evacuant]</p><p><b>služi za čišćenje ili uklanjanje grijeha, od ili slično čistilištu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to purge or rid of sin [purging, purifying]</p><p><i>