of western North America similar to the coast live oak but occurring chiefly in foothills of mountain ranges removed from the coast [Quercus wizlizenii, interior live oak]</p><p><b>malo grmljevo zimzeleno stablo sa zapadne Sjeverne Amerike slično obalnom živom hradu ali se uglavnom nalazi u podbrdu planinskih lanova udaljenih od obale (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small shrubby evergreen tree of western North America similar to the coast live oak but occurring chiefly in foothills of mountain ranges removed from the coast [Quercus wislizenii, interior live oak]</p><p><b>netko tko postavlja pitanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who asks a question [asker, enquirer, inquirer, questioner]</p><p><b>primitivni kamen mlin za ručno mljevanje kukuruza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a primitive stone mill for grinding corn by hand</p><p><b>mrgodan, mrzovoljan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> habitually complaining [fretful, whiney, whiny]</p><p><b>mrgodan, mrzovoljan (od &quot;querulous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a peevish manner [fractiously, peevishly]</p><p><b>mrgodan, mrzovoljan (od &quot;querulous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being given to complaining</p><p><b>dovoditi u pitanje, dovoditi u sumnju, ispitati, ispitivanje, ispitivati, istraga, obavijestiti, pitanje, pitati, posumnjati, raspitivanje, sumnja, sumnjati, tražiti, upit, upitati, upitnik, uvid, zapitati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instance of questioning [enquiry, inquiry, interrogation, question]</p><p><i>v.</i> pose a question [question]</p><p><b>upitni jezik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a source language consisting of procedural operators that invoke functions to be executed [command language, search language]</p><p><b>tortilja koja je ispunjena sirom i zagrijana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tortilla that is filled with cheese and heated</p><p><b>istraživati, traganje, tragati, traženje, potraga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a search for an alternative that meets cognitive criteria [pursuance, pursuit]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of searching for something [seeking]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a search (for)</p><p><i>v.</i> search the trail of (game)</p><p><i>v.</i> bark with prolonged noises, of dogs [bay]</p><p><i>v.</i> seek alms, as for religious purposes</p><p><i>v.</i> express the need or desire for [ask for, bespeak, call for, request]</p><p><b>ići u potrazi za ili loviti za (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> go in search of or hunt for [go after, pursue, quest for]</p><p><b>ići u potrazi za ili loviti za (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> go in search of or hunt for [go after, pursue, quest after]</p><p><b>istraživati, traganje, tragati, traženje (od &quot;quest&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone making a search or inquiry [searcher, seeker]</p><p><b>ispitivati, pitanje, pitati, postaviti pitanje, preispitivati, rasprava, saslušavati, sumnja, sumnjati, upit, prijedlog, ispitati, upitati, zapitati, pitati se, upitati se, zapitati se, zapitkivati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instance of questioning [enquiry, inquiry, interrogation, query]</p><p><i>n.</i> the subject matter at issue [head]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sentence of inquiry that asks for a reply [interrogation, interrogative, interrogative sentence]</p><p><i>n.</i> uncertainty about the truth or factuality or existence of something [doubt, doubtfulness, dubiousness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a formal proposal for action made to a deliberative assembly for discussion and vote [motion]</p><p><i>n.</i> an informal reference to a marriage proposal</p><p><i>v.</i> challenge the accuracy, probity, or propriety of [call into question, oppugn]</p><p><i>v.</i> pose a series of questions to [interrogate]</p><p><i>v.</i> pose a question [query]</p><p><i>v.</i> conduct an interview in television, newspaper, and radio reporting [interview]</p><p><i>v.</i> place in doubt or express doubtful speculation [wonder]</p><p><b>upitnik, upitnik- pravopisni znak za pitane, znak pitanja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a punctuation mark (?) placed at the end of a sentence to indicate a question [interrogation point]</p><p><b>voditelj ili predsjednik radio- ili televizijske kviz emisije ili panel igre (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the host or chairman of a radio or tv quiz show or panel game [quizmaster]</p><p><b>sporni činjenični spor koji se obično ostavlja poroti da odluči (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disputed factual contention that is generally left for a jury to decide [matter of fact]</p><p><b>sporni pravni spor koji se obično ostavlja sudiji da odluči (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disputed legal contention that is generally left for a judge to decide [matter of law]</p><p><b>Pisan ispit (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a written examination [exam paper, examination paper, test paper]</p><p><b>vrijeme za zastupnička pitanja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a period during a parliamentary session when members of British Parliament may ask questions of the ministers</p><p><b>dvojben, nepouzdan, podozriv, problematičan, sumnjiv, upitan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> subject to question</p><p><i>adj.</i> able to be refuted [confutable, confutative, refutable]</p><p><b>Na upitno i sumnjivo način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a questionable and dubious manner [dubiously]</p><p><b>ispitivač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who asks a question [asker, enquirer, inquirer, querier]</p><p><b>upitni, ispitivanje, propitivanje, raspitivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a request for information [inquiring]</p><p><i>adj.</i> perplexed (as if being expected to know something that you do not know) [quizzical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by or given to doubt [doubting, sceptical, skeptical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing curiosity [inquisitive, speculative, wondering]</p><p><b>upitni (od &quot;questioning&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a curious and questioning manner [wonderingly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a quizzical and questioning manner [quizzically]</p><p><b>anketa, upitni arak, upitni listić, upitnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form containing a set of questions</p><p><b>buniti se, cendrati, cmizdriti, jadati se, jadikovati, prigovarati, tužiti se, čangrizati, žaliti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> express complaints, discontent, displeasure, or unhappiness [complain, kick, kvetch, plain, sound off]</p><p><b>osnovna jedinica novca u Gvatemali, veliki trogon iz Srednje i Južne Amerike s zlatno-zeleno-crvenom perjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Guatemala</p><p><i>n.</i> large trogon of Central America and South America having golden-green and scarlet plumage [quetzal bird]</p><p><b>veliki trogon iz Srednje i Južne Amerike s zlatno-zeleno-crvenom perjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large trogon of Central America and South America having golden-green and scarlet plumage [quetzal]</p><p><b>Quetzalcoatl</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an Aztec deity represented as a plumed serpent</p><p><b>čekati u redu, dugi red, kika, niz, pletenica, red, red čekanja, red čekanja (u sustavima s posluživanjem), redoslijed, rep, splesti kosu, stajati u redu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a line of people or vehicles waiting for something [waiting line]</p><p><i>n.</i> (information processing) an ordered list of tasks to be performed or messages to be transmitted</p><p><i>n.</i> a braid of hair at the back of the head</p><p><i>v.</i> form a queue, form a line, stand in line [line up, queue up]</p><p><b>čekati u redu</b></p><p><i>v.</i> form a queue, form a line, stand in line [line up, queue]</p><p><b>grad na Luzonu koji se susreće s Manilom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> city on Luzon adjoining Manila</p><p><b>stanje povećane budnosti ili pripreme za djelovanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> condition of heightened watchfulness or preparation for action [alert]</p><p><b>Ribe u obliku mišića u zapadnom Atlantiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small fusiform fish of western Atlantic [Decapterus punctatus, cigarfish, round scad]</p><p><b>dosjetka, igra riječi, izgovor, izvrdavanje, izvrdavati, okolišati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an evasion of the point of an argument by raising irrelevant distinctions or objections [cavil, quiddity]</p><p><i>v.</i> evade the truth of a point or question by raising irrelevant objections</p><p><i>v.</i> argue over petty things [bicker, brabble, niggle, pettifog, squabble]</p><p><b>dosjetka, igra riječi, izgovor, izvrdavanje, izvrdavati, okolišati (od &quot;quibble&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disputant who quibbles [caviler, caviller, pettifogger]</p><p><b>pita s nadjevom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Mayan people of south central Guatemala</p><p><i>n.</i> a tart filled with rich unsweetened custard</p><p><i>n.</i> the Mayan language spoken by the Quiche</p><p><b>Quiche napravljen od sira i slanine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> quiche made with cheese and bacon</p><p><b>brz, brzo, duhovit, hitar, nagao, okretan, razborit, snalažljiv, živ, spretan, žustar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any area of the body that is highly sensitive to pain (as the flesh underneath the skin or a fingernail or toenail)</p><p><i>adj.</i> accomplished rapidly and without delay [speedy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> hurried and brief [fast, flying]</p><p><i>adj.</i> moving quickly and lightly [agile, nimble, spry]</p><p><i>adj.</i> apprehending and responding with speed and sensitivity [ready]</p><p><i>adj.</i> performed with little or no delay [immediate, prompt, straightaway]</p><p><i>adj.</i> easily aroused or excited [warm]</p><p><i>adv.</i> with little or no delay [promptly, quickly]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 5. stavkom 4. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 5. stavkom 5. stavkom 4. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> assets in the form of cash (or easily convertible into cash) [current assets, liquid assets]</p><p><b>Hlebovi napravljeni s sredstvom za kvasčenje kojim se omogućuje odmah pečenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> breads made with a leavening agent that permits immediate baking</p><p><b>brzi ili lak prihodi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> quick or easy earnings [fast buck]</p><p><b>brza popravka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hurried repair [band aid, quickie, quicky]</p><p><b>Europska trava koja se brzo širi pužećim rizomima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European grass spreading rapidly by creeping rhizomes [Agropyron repens, couch grass, dog grass, quack grass, quackgrass, witch grass, witchgrass]</p><p><b>marširaju u brzom vremenu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> marching at quick time</p><p><b>osoba koja može brzo i lako steći nova znanja i vještine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone able to acquire new knowledge and skills rapidly and easily [sponge]</p><p><b>osjećaj zamjeranosti i besa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of resentful anger [irascibility, short temper, spleen]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to potrebno za ispitivanje, ispitivanje se provodi u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a normal marching pace of 120 steps per minute</p><p><b>Vešt u promjeni od jedne stvari u drugu posebno mijenjanje kostima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> adept at changing from one thing to another especially changing costumes</p><p><b>od tekuće tvari koja brzo suši (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of a liquid substance that dries quickly</p><p><b>imaju dobro sluh (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having keen hearing [sharp-eared]</p><p><b>zahladiti brzo kako bi se očuvani prirodni sokovi i arome (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> freeze rapidly so as to preserve the natural juices and flavors [flash-freeze]</p><p><b>(koristi se u hrani) konzervirana zamrzavanjem dovoljno brzo kako bi se zadržala okus i hranljiva vrijednost (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of foods) preserved by freezing sufficiently rapidly to retain flavor and nutritional value [flash-frozen, frozen]</p><p><b>koji imaju vrlo oštar vid, vrlo osjetljiv ili budan (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having very keen vision [argus-eyed, hawk-eyed, keen-sighted, lynx-eyed, sharp-eyed, sharp-sighted]</p><p><i>adj.</i> keenly perceptive or alert [sharp-eyed, sharp-sighted]</p><p><b>nagao, raspaljiv, naprasit, razdražljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> quickly aroused to anger [choleric, hot-tempered, hotheaded, irascible, short-tempered]</p><p><b>dovitljiv, oštrouman, snalažljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> mentally nimble and resourceful</p><p><b>Inteligencija koja se otkriva sposobnošću davanja ispravnih odgovora bez odlaganja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intelligence as revealed by an ability to give correct responses without delay [mental quickness, quickness]</p><p><b>oduševiti, oskoruša, potaknuti, ubrzati, ubrzati se, akcelerirati, ubrzavati, krijepiti, animirati, oživotvoriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> move faster [accelerate, speed, speed up]</p><p><i>v.</i> make keen or more acute [whet]</p><p><i>v.</i> give life or energy to [invigorate]</p><p><i>v.</i> show signs of life</p><p><i>v.</i> give new life or energy to [animate, reanimate, recreate, renovate, repair, revive, revivify, vivify]</p><p><b>oduševiti, oskoruša, potaknuti, ubrzati, ubrzati se (od &quot;quicken&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agent that gives or restores life or vigor [enlivener, invigorator]</p><p><b>oduševiti, oskoruša, potaknuti, ubrzati, ubrzati se (od &quot;quicken&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of showing signs of life</p><p><i>n.</i> the stage of pregnancy at which the mother first feels the movements of the fetus</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of accelerating [acceleration, speedup]</p><p><b>brz, brzo, duhovit, hitar, nagao, okretan, razborit, snalažljiv, živ (od &quot;quick&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> more quickly [faster]</p><p><b>brz, brzo, duhovit, hitar, nagao, okretan, razborit, snalažljiv, živ (od &quot;quick&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> most quickly [fastest]</p><p><b>brza popravka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hurried repair [band aid, quick fix, quicky]</p><p><b>negašen kreč, živo vapno, vapno</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white crystalline oxide used in the production of calcium hydroxide [burnt lime, calcined lime, calcium oxide, calx, fluxing lime, lime, unslaked lime]</p><p><b>brzo, hitro, naglo, ubrzano, ubrzo, ubrzanom</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with speed [apace, chop-chop, in short order, rapidly, speedily]</p><p><i>adv.</i> with little or no delay [promptly, quick]</p><p><i>adv.</i> without taking pains [cursorily]</p><p><b>brzina, okretnost, oštroumnost, živahnost, snalažljivost, spretnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> skillful performance or ability without difficulty [adeptness, adroitness, deftness, facility]</p><p><i>n.</i> intelligence as revealed by an ability to give correct responses without delay [mental quickness, quick-wittedness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a rate that is rapid [celerity, rapidity, rapidness, speediness]</p><p><b>živi pijesak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a treacherous situation that tends to entrap and destroy</p><p><i>n.</i> a pit filled with loose wet sand into which objects are sucked down</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve biljke koje su u zemljištenu proizvodnju, za koje se primjenjuje ovaj članak, za koje se primjenjuje sljedeći podtočak:, uzgoj od reznica koje su posadjene izravno u zemlju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cuttings of plants set in the ground to grow as hawthorn for hedges or vines</p><p><i>adj.</i> grown from cuttings planted directly in the ground</p><p><b>žive</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a heavy silvery toxic univalent and bivalent metallic element [Hg, atomic number 80, hydrargyrum, mercury]</p><p><i>adj.</i> liable to sudden unpredictable change [erratic, fickle, mercurial]</p><p><b>Vojni marš koji prati brzi čas., plesni ples s brzim i sporim koracima, Izvesti brzi korak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> military march accompanying quick time</p><p><i>n.</i> a ballroom dance with both quick and slow steps</p><p><i>v.</i> perform a quickstep</p><p><b>brza popravka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hurried repair [band aid, quick fix, quickie]</p><p><b>funta, funta sterlinga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Great Britain and Northern Ireland [British pound, British pound sterling, pound, pound sterling]</p><p><i>n.</i> something for something [quid pro quo]</p><p><i>n.</i> a wad of something chewable as tobacco [chaw, chew, cud, plug, wad]</p><p><b>kviprokvo, naknada, nesporazum, odšteta, protuvrijednost, zabluda, zamjena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something for something [quid]</p><p><b>suština</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an evasion of the point of an argument by raising irrelevant distinctions or objections [cavil, quibble]</p><p><i>n.</i> the essence that makes something the kind of thing it is and makes it different from any other [haecceity]</p><p><b>osoba koja se miješa u tuđe stvari. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who meddles in the affairs of others [busybody, nosey-parker, nosy-parker]</p><p><b>stišati se, utišati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become quiet or quieter [hush, pipe down, quiet, quiet down, quieten]</p><p><b>nijemost, dormancija, dormantnost, mirovanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of quiet (but possibly temporary) inaction [dormancy, quiescency]</p><p><i>n.</i> quiet and inactive restfulness [dormancy, quiescency, sleeping]</p><p><b>nijemost, dormancija, dormantnost, mirovanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of quiet (but possibly temporary) inaction [dormancy, quiescence]</p><p><i>n.</i> quiet and inactive restfulness [dormancy, quiescence, sleeping]</p><p><b>miran, nepokretan, raspoloživ</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not active or activated</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by a state of tranquil repose</p><p><i>adj.</i> being quiet or still or inactive</p><p><i>adj.</i> (pathology) causing no symptoms</p><p><b>miran, mirovanje, smiriti, spokojstvo, tih, tišina, utišati, tišine, muk, stišati se, utišati se, smirivati, stišati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a period of calm weather [lull]</p><p><i>n.</i> an untroubled state [tranquility, tranquillity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the absence of sound [silence]</p><p><i>n.</i> a disposition free from stress or emotion [placidity, repose, serenity, tranquility, tranquillity]</p><p><i>v.</i> become quiet or quieter [hush, pipe down, quiesce, quiet down, quieten]</p><p><i>v.</i> make calm or still [calm, calm down, lull, quieten, still, tranquilize, tranquillise, tranquillize]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by an absence or near absence of agitation or activity</p><p><i>adj.</i> free of noise or uproar</p><p><i>adj.</i> not showy or obtrusive [restrained]</p><p><i>adj.</i> in a softened tone [hushed, muted, subdued]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a body of water) free from disturbance by heavy waves [placid, smooth, still, tranquil, unruffled]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of the sun) characterized by a low level of surface phenomena, such as sunspots</p><p><i>adv.</i> with little or no activity or no agitation (`quiet' is a nonstandard variant for `quietly') [quietly]</p><p><b>smiriti se, stišati se, utišati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become quiet or quieter [hush, pipe down, quiesce, quiet, quieten]</p><p><b>stišati se, utišati se, smiriti, smirivati, stišati, utišati, ušutkati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become quiet or quieter [hush, pipe down, quiesce, quiet, quiet down]</p><p><i>v.</i> make calm or still [calm, calm down, lull, quiet, still, tranquilize, tranquillise, tranquillize]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be quiet or not talk [hush, hush up, shut up, silence, still]</p><p><b>oblik religioznog misticizma koji zahtijeva povlačenje iz svih ljudskih napora i pasivno razmišljanje o Bogu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of religious mysticism requiring withdrawal from all human effort and passive contemplation of God</p><p><b>religijski mističar koji slijedi kvitizam. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a religious mystic who follows quietism</p><p><b>bez buke, mirno, tiho</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with low volume [softly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> with little or no sound</p><p><i>adv.</i> with little or no activity or no agitation (`quiet' is a nonstandard variant for `quietly') [quiet]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a restful manner [restfully]</p><p><b>mir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of making no sound [soundlessness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a state of peace and quiet [quietude, tranquility, tranquillity]</p><p><b>mir, odmor, tišina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of peace and quiet [quietness, tranquility, tranquillity]</p><p><b>eufemizmi za smrt (na temelju analogije između ležanja u krevetu i grobnice) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> euphemisms for death (based on an analogy between lying in a bed and in a tomb) [eternal rest, eternal sleep, rest, sleep]</p><p><b>izuzetno visoka glava (posebno ona koja je izrezana prema gore od čela) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a prominent forelock (especially one brushed upward from the forehead)</p><p><b>bodljika, kalem, nabrati, namotati, pero, ptičje pero, dugo pero, pero za letenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pen made from a bird's feather [quill pen]</p><p><i>n.</i> a stiff hollow protective spine on a porcupine or hedgehog</p><p><i>n.</i> any of the larger wing or tail feathers of a bird [flight feather, pinion, quill feather]</p><p><i>n.</i> the hollow spine of a feather [calamus, shaft]</p><p><b>dugo pero, pero, pero za letenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the larger wing or tail feathers of a bird [flight feather, pinion, quill]</p><p><b>olovka napravljena od ptičje perje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pen made from a bird's feather [quill]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko vodenih ili močvarnih biljaka s sporama koje imaju kratke rizome i lišće nalik perajima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several spore-bearing aquatic or marsh plants having short rhizomes and leaves resembling quills</p><p><b>ušice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> quillworts [Isoetaceae, family Isoetaceae]</p><p><b>grudnjak, ispuniti, jorgan, kompilirati, poplun, postaviti, prijemčiti, proširiti, prošiti, puniti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bedding made of two layers of cloth filled with stuffing and stitched together [comfort, comforter, puff]</p><p><i>v.</i> stitch or sew together</p><p><i>v.</i> create by stitching together</p><p><b>g