ist, ultra]</p><p><i>adj.</i> markedly new or introducing radical change [revolutionary]</p><p><i>adj.</i> arising from or going to the root or source</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or constituting a linguistic root</p><p><i>adj.</i> especially of leaves [basal]</p><p><b>ćelija terorista (obično od 3 do 5 članova) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cell of terrorists (usually 3 to 5 members) [terrorist cell]</p><p><b>utjecaj radikalnih ljevičarskih gledišta i modnog odijevanja i načina života koji s njima idu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an affectation of radical left-wing views and the fashionable dress and lifestyle that goes with them</p><p><b>Operativno uklanjanje maternice i jajnika i jajovnika i grlića maternice i srodnih limfnih čvorova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> surgical removal of the uterus and the ovaries and oviducts and cervix and related lymph nodes [panhysterectomy]</p><p><b>uklanjanje dojke i njenih mišića (velikog i manjeg prsa) i limfnih čvorova u susjednom pazuhu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> removal of a breast and the underlying muscles (pectoralis major and pectoralis minor) and lymph nodes in the adjacent armpit</p><p><b>znak koji ukazuje na ekstrakciju korijena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sign indicating the extraction of a root</p><p><b>radikalizam, radikalnost, radikalstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the political orientation of those who favor revolutionary change in government and society</p><p><b>biti radikalniji u društvenim ili političkim pogledima (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make more radical in social or political outlook</p><p><b>radikalno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a radical manner</p><p><b>radić</b></p><p><i>n.</i> prized variety of chicory having globose heads of red leaves</p><p><b>(anatomija) mala struktura koja liči na korenicu (kao što je fibrila živca) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (anatomy) a small structure resembling a rootlet (such as a fibril of a nerve)</p><p><b>upaljen radikl nerva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of the radicle of a nerve</p><p