door) [rat-a-tat, rat-tat]</p><p><b>radnik zaposlen za uništavanje ili otjeranje štetočina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a workman employed to destroy or drive away vermin [disinfestation officer]</p><p><b>tanka okrugla file u obliku repa pacova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thin round file shaped like the tail of a rat</p><p><b>Sastav kratkih oštih udarca (kao što su udarci na bubnjev ili kucanje na vrata) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a series of short sharp taps (as made by strokes on a drum or knocks on a door) [rat-a-tat, rat-a-tat-tat]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u slučaju poreza primjenjuje druga pravila, to znači da se u slučaju poreza primjenjuje druga pravila., kvaliteta sposobnosti da se ocjenjuje ili procjenjuje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being liable to assessment or taxation [rateability]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being capable of being rated or estimated</p><p><b>U slučaju da je osoba u državi članici u kojoj se nalazi poduzeće u kojoj se nalazi poduzeće u kojoj se nalazi poduzeće, poduzeće može biti poduzeće u kojoj se nalazi poduzeće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> liable to payment of locally assessed property taxes [rateable]</p><p><b>nekretnine koje donose porezne prihode lokalnim samoupravama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> property that provides tax income for local governments [rateables]</p><p><b>voćni liker</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sweet liqueur made from wine and brandy flavored with plum or peach or apricot kernels and bitter almonds [ratafia]</p><p><b>voćni liker</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sweet liqueur made from wine and brandy flavored with plum or peach or apricot kernels and bitter almonds [ratafee]</p><p><i>n.</i> macaroon flavored with ratafia liqueur [ratafia biscuit]</p><p><b>Makaron sa okusom ratafijske likere (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> macaroon flavored with ratafia liqueur [ratafia]</p><p><b>španjolska trska, štap od španjolske trske</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a switch made from the stems of the rattan palms [rattan]</p><p><b>zvuk koji se stvara udaranjem bubnja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sound made by beating a drum [drumbeat, rub-a-dub]</p><p><b>povrće upečeno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vegetable stew</p><p><b>za koje se primjenjuje sljedeće: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two infectious diseases transmitted to humans by the bite of a rat or mouse</p><p><b>bakterija koja uzrokuje groznicu od štakorenih ugriza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bacterium causing ratbite fever [Spirillum minus]</p><p><b>S druge strane, za vozila s motorom ili motorom za vozila s motorom ili motorom za vozila s motorom ili motorom za vozila s motorom ili motorom za vozila s motorom ili motorom za vozila s motorom ili motorom za vozila s motorom ili motorom za vozila s motorom ili motorom za vozila s motorom ili motorom za vozila s motorom ili motorom za vozila s motorom ili motorom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mechanical device consisting of a toothed wheel or rack engaged with a pawl that permits it to move in only one direction [rachet, ratchet]</p><p><b>ozubljena ustavljača, reza, skakavica, zapinjač, zaporni kotač, zupčasti sa zaporom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mechanical device consisting of a toothed wheel or rack engaged with a pawl that permits it to move in only one direction [rachet, ratch]</p><p><i>v.</i> move by degrees in one direction only [rachet up, ratchet down]</p><p><b>kretanje po stupnjevima u jednom smjeru samo (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> move by degrees in one direction only [rachet up, ratchet]</p><p><b>odvijač sa čekićem (da se oštrica okreće samo u jednom smjeru) i spiralom u ručici (da se oštrica okreće) s pritiskom prema dolje na ručicu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a screwdriver with a ratchet (so the blade turns in only one direction) and a spiral in the handle (so the blade rotates) with downward pressure on the handle [spiral ratchet screwdriver]</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenjem od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> toothed wheel held in place by a pawl or detent and turned by a lever</p><p><b>biti cijenjen, brzina, brzina prijenosa, cijena, dio, frekvencija, kotirati, kurs, mjera, namet, norma, normativ, obrok, ocijeniti, odnos, omjer, porez, postotak, procijeniti, rata, razmjer, ritam, stavka, stopa, stupanj, taksa, tarifa, tempo, učestalost, vrijediti, stopi, cijeniti, gradirati, ocjenjivati, procjenjivati, rangirati, stupnjevati, ubrajati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a magnitude or frequency relative to a time unit</p><p><i>n.</i> amount of a charge or payment relative to some basis [charge per unit]</p><p><i>n.</i> the relative speed of progress or change [pace]</p><p><i>n.</i> a quantity or amount or measure considered as a proportion of another quantity or amount or measure</p><p><i>v.</i> assign a rank or rating to [grade, order, place, range, rank]</p><p><i>v.</i> be worthy of or have a certain rating</p><p><i>v.</i> estimate the value of [value]</p><p><b>stopa smanjenja veličine ili broja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the rate of shrinkage in size or number [attrition rate]</p><p><b>veličina amortizacije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the rate at which the value of property is reduced [depreciation rate]</p><p><b>naknada za zamjenu valute jedne zemlje za valutu druge zemlje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the charge for exchanging currency of one country for currency of another [exchange rate]</p><p><b>protok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount of fluid that flows in a given time [flow, flow rate]</p><p><b>stopa povećanja veličine po jedinici vremena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the rate of increase in size per unit time [growth rate]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the rate of change of prices (as indicated by a price index) calculated on a monthly or annual basis [inflation rate]</p><p><b>procenat novčane sume naplaćene za njegovu upotrebu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the percentage of a sum of money charged for its use [interest rate]</p><p><b>iznos novca primljen po jedinici vremena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> amount of money received per unit time [pay rate]</p><p><b>brzina isplata, stopa isplata</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount of money paid out per unit time [installment rate, payment rate, repayment rate]</p><p><b>brzina kojom osoba udahne i izdahne (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the rate at which a person inhales and exhales [respiratory rate]</p><p><b>stopa povrata, stopa povratka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount returned per unit of time expressed as a percentage of the cost</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u slučaju poreza primjenjuje druga pravila, to znači da se u slučaju poreza primjenjuje druga pravila. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being liable to assessment or taxation [ratability]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je osoba u državi članici u kojoj se nalazi poduzeće u kojoj se nalazi poduzeće u kojoj se nalazi poduzeće, poduzeće može biti poduzeće u kojoj se nalazi poduzeće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> liable to payment of locally assessed property taxes [ratable]</p><p><b>nekretnine koje donose porezne prihode lokalnim samoupravama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> property that provides tax income for local governments [ratables]</p><p><b>Noćni mesojed poput jazvice u šumovitim područjima Afrike i južne Azije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nocturnal badger-like carnivore of wooded regions of Africa and southern Asia [Mellivora capensis, honey badger]</p><p><b>porezni obveznik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who pays local rates (especially a householder)</p><p><b>brzine, komunalije, komunalni doprinosi, učestalost, učestalosti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a local tax on property (usually used in the plural)</p><p><b>bolje, donekle, dosta, dovoljno, malo, prije, prilično, radije, relativno, skoro, točnije, pravilnije, pre, pomalo</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> on the contrary [instead]</p><p><i>adv.</i> to some (great or small) extent [kind of, kinda, sort of]</p><p><i>adv.</i> more readily or willingly [preferably, sooner]</p><p><i>adv.</i> to a degree (not used with a negative) [quite]</p><p><b>rupa (kao u zidu zgrade) koju čine pacovi, mala prljava neugodna soba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hole (as in the wall of a building) made by rats</p><p><i>n.</i> a small dirty uncomfortable room</p><p><b>krčma ispod razine ulice s pivom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tavern below street level featuring beer</p><p><b>rod višegodišnjih divljih cvjetova sjevernoameričkih ravnica i prerija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of perennial wildflowers of North American plains and prairies [genus Ratibida]</p><p><b>cvjetovica s cvjetnim glavama nalik meksičkom šeširu s visokim crveno-sudanim diskom i spušteni žuti ili žuti i crveno-sudanim zrake (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coneflower with flower heads resembling a Mexican hat with a tall red-brown disk and drooping yellow or yellow and red-brown rays [Mexican hat]</p><p><b>biljka slična meksičkom šešernom cvetniku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant similar to the Mexican hat coneflower [long-head coneflower, prairie coneflower]</p><p><b>u području SAD-a od srednjeg do jugozapadnog dijelu SAD-a (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coneflower of central to southwestern United States [prairie coneflower]</p><p><b>potpisivanje, potvrda, ratifikacija, ratifikacijski, ratihabicija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> making something valid by formally ratifying or confirming it [confirmation]</p><p><b>odobriti, ovjeriti, potpisati, potvrditi, ratificirati, utvrditi (od &quot;ratify&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> formally approved and invested with legal authority [sanctioned]</p><p><b>netko tko izražava snažno odobravanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who expresses strong approval [endorser, indorser, subscriber]</p><p><b>odobriti, ovjeriti, potpisati, potvrditi, ratificirati, utvrditi, potpisivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> approve and express assent, responsibility, or obligation [sign]</p><p><b>čin, grdnja, karanje, klasa, nazivno opterećenje, ocjena, oporezivanje, položaj, procjena, proračun troškova, proračun troškova (usluge), psovanje, rang, razred, rejting, tarifiranje, vrsta službe, zvanje, evaluacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an appraisal of the value of something [evaluation, valuation]</p><p><i>n.</i> act of ascertaining or fixing the value or worth of [evaluation]</p><p><i>n.</i> standing or position on a scale</p><p><i>n.</i> rank in a military organization [military rank, military rating, paygrade]</p><p><b>sustav procjene, sustav vrednovanja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system of classifying according to quality or merit or amount [scoring system]</p><p><b>količnik, odnos, omjer, omjera, pokazatelj, proporcija, razmjer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relative magnitudes of two quantities (usually expressed as a quotient)</p><p><i>n.</i> the relation between things (or parts of things) with respect to their comparative quantity, magnitude, or degree [proportion]</p><p><b>Razumjeti metodološki i logički (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> reason methodologically and logically</p><p><b>predlog koji je došao logičkim razmišljanjem (kao što je predlog koji mora slijediti iz glavnih i manjih premisa silogizma), logičko i metodološko razmišljanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the proposition arrived at by logical reasoning (such as the proposition that must follow from the major and minor premises of a syllogism) [conclusion]</p><p><i>n.</i> logical and methodical reasoning</p><p><b>Na temelju točnog razmišljanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> based on exact thinking</p><p><b>netko tko logički razmišlja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who reasons logically [reasoner]</p><p><b>obroci, obrok, porcija, provizija, racionirati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the food allowance for one day (especially for service personnel)</p><p><i>n.</i> a fixed portion that is allotted (especially in times of scarcity)</p><p><i>v.</i> restrict the consumption of a relatively scarce commodity, as during war</p><p><i>v.</i> distribute in rations, as in the army [ration out]</p><p><b>Kartica koja potvrđuje pravo nositelja na kupnju robe pod uvjetom racioniranja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a card certifying the bearer's right to purchase rationed goods</p><p><b>Raspodjeljujte u obroka, kao u vojsci. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> distribute in rations, as in the army [ration]</p><p><b>priseban, racional, racionalan, racionalni, razborit, razuman, svrsishodan, utvrđen, racionalni broj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an integer or a fraction [rational number]</p><p><i>adj.</i> consistent with or based on or using reason</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or associated with or requiring the use of the mind [intellectual, noetic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being expressed as a quotient of integers</p><p><i>adj.</i> having its source in or being guided by the intellect (as distinguished from experience or emotion)</p><p><b>motiv koji se može braniti razlozima ili logičnim argumentom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a motive that can be defended by reasoning or logical argument</p><p><b>racionalan broj, racionalni broj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an integer or a fraction [rational]</p><p><b>logička podloga, razlog</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) an explanation of the fundamental reasons (especially an explanation of the working of some device in terms of laws of nature) [principle]</p><p><b>racionalizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychiatry) a defense mechanism by which your true motivation is concealed by explaining your actions and feelings in a way that is not threatening [rationalization]</p><p><i>n.</i> the cognitive process of making something seem consistent with or based on reason [rationalization]</p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) the simplification of an expression or equation by eliminating radicals without changing the value of the expression or the roots of the equation [rationalization]</p><p><i>n.</i> the organization of a business according to scientific principles of management in order to increase efficiency [rationalization]</p><p><i>n.</i> systematic organization [rationalization, systematisation, systematization]</p><p><b>racionalizirati, ispričavati, opravdati, opravdavati, isjeći, kresati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> structure and run according to rational or scientific principles in order to achieve desired results [rationalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> defend, explain, clear away, or make excuses for by reasoning [apologise, apologize, excuse, rationalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> think rationally [rationalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> remove irrational quantities from [rationalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> weed out unwanted or unnecessary things [cut, prune, rationalize]</p><p><b>zamijeniti prirodno za nadnaravno objašnjenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> substitute a natural for a supernatural explanation of [rationalize away]</p><p><b>racionalizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (philosophy) the doctrine that knowledge is acquired by reason without resort to experience</p><p><i>n.</i> the theological doctrine that human reason rather than divine revelation establishes religious truth</p><p><i>n.</i> the doctrine that reason is the right basis for regulating conduct [freethinking]</p><p><b>racionalan, racionalist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who emphasizes observable facts and excludes metaphysical speculation about origins or ultimate causes [positivist]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of rationalism</p><p><b>racionalan, racionalist (od &quot;rationalist&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the philosophical doctrine of rationalism</p><p><b>racionalnost, razboritost, razumnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of having good sense and sound judgment [reason, reasonableness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being consistent with or based on logic [rationalness]</p><p><b>racionalizacija, racionaliziranje, racionalnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cognitive process of making something seem consistent with or based on reason [rationalisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> (psychiatry) a defense mechanism by which your true motivation is concealed by explaining your actions and feelings in a way that is not threatening [rationalisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) the simplification of an expression or equation by eliminating radicals without changing the value of the expression or the roots of the equation [rationalisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the organization of a business according to scientific principles of management in order to increase efficiency [rationalisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> systematic organization [rationalisation, systematisation, systematization]</p><p><b>biti razborit, postupati razumno, racionalizirati, ispričavati, opravdati, opravdavati, isjeći, kresati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> defend, explain, clear away, or make excuses for by reasoning [apologise, apologize, excuse, rationalise]</p><p><i>v.</i> weed out unwanted or unnecessary things [cut, prune, rationalise]</p><p><i>v.</i> structure and run according to rational or scientific principles in order to achieve desired results [rationalise]</p><p><i>v.</i> think rationally [rationalise]</p><p><i>v.</i> remove irrational quantities from [rationalise]</p><p><b>zamijeniti prirodno za nadnaravno objašnjenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> substitute a natural for a supernatural explanation of [rationalise away]</p><p><b>racionalno, razumno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a rational manner</p><p><b>priseban, racional, racionalan, racionalni, razborit, razuman, svrsishodan, utvrđen (od &quot;rational&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being consistent with or based on logic [rationality]</p><p><b>obroci, obrok, porcija, provizija, racionirati (od &quot;ration&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> distributed equitably in limited individual portions</p><p><b>racioniranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of rationing</p><p><b>bezgrebenke</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used in former classifications to include all ratite bird orders [superorder Ratitae]</p><p><b>bezgrebenka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> flightless birds having flat breastbones lacking a keel for attachment of flight muscles: ostriches [flightless bird, ratite bird]</p><p><b>Ptice koje ne mogu letjeti, s ravnim prsnim kostom bez kil za pričvršćivanje mišića za let: nojevi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> flightless birds having flat breastbones lacking a keel for attachment of flight muscles: ostriches [flightless bird, ratite]</p><p><b>koji liči na štakora ili ima karakteristike štakora (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling or characteristic of a rat</p><p><b>(nautički) mali vodoravni konopac između pokrivača jedrenjačkog broda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (nautical) a small horizontal rope between the shrouds of a sailing ship [ratline]</p><p><b>(nautički) mali vodoravni konopac između pokrivača jedrenjačkog broda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (nautical) a small horizontal rope between the shrouds of a sailing ship [ratlin]</p><p><b>bijeli otrovni trioksid arsenika u prahu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white powdered poisonous trioxide of arsenic [arsenic, arsenic trioxide, arsenous anhydride, arsenous oxide, white arsenic]</p><p><b>riblje vrste S. crassa (S. crassa) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deep-sea fish with a large head and body and long tapering tail [grenadier, rattail fish]</p><p><b>Obično uzgajan tropski američki kaktus s vitkim puzećim stabljikama i vrlo velikim krumpirskim cvijećem koje cvjetaju nekoliko dana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> commonly cultivated tropical American cactus having slender creeping stems and very large showy crimson flowers that bloom for several days [Aporocactus flagelliformis, rat's-tail cactus]</p><p><b>riblje vrste S. crassa (S. crassa) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deep-sea fish with a large head and body and long tapering tail [grenadier, rattail]</p><p><b>Klatni palmi na Šri Lanki i južnoj Indiji, izvanredni po velikoj dužini stabljika koji se koriste za malackske štapove., s visokom visinom od oko 30 mm ili više, ali ne više od 30 mm,, Sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> climbing palm of Sri Lanka and southern India remarkable for the great length of the stems which are used for malacca canes [Calamus rotang, rattan palm]</p><p><i>n.</i> the stem of various climbing palms of the genus Calamus and related genera used to make wickerwork and furniture and canes [rattan cane]</p><p><i>n.</i> a switch made from the stems of the rattan palms [ratan]</p><p><b>s visokom visinom od oko 30 mm ili više, ali ne više od 30 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the stem of various climbing palms of the genus Calamus and related genera used to make wickerwork and furniture and canes [rattan]</p><p><b>Klatni palmi na Šri Lanki i južnoj Indiji, izvanredni po velikoj dužini stabljika koji se koriste za malackske štapove. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> climbing palm of Sri Lanka and southern India remarkable for the great length of the stems which are used for malacca canes [Calamus rotang, rattan]</p><p><b>doušnik, izdajnik, lovac na štakore</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disloyal person who betrays or deserts his cause or religion or political party or friend etc. [apostate, deserter, recreant, renegade, turncoat]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of several breeds of terrier developed to catch rats [rat terrier]</p><p><b>Britanski dramaturg (1911-1977) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> British playwright (1911-1977) [Sir Terence Mervyn Rattigan, Terence Rattigan]</p><p><b>da bi pružili optužnički dokaz službeniku zakona (obično u zamjenu za usluge) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> to furnish incriminating evidence to an officer of the law (usually in return for favors) [informing]</p><p><b>brbljanje, brbljivac, čegrtaljka, čegrtati, klepetalo, klepetanje, klepetuša, larma, lupa, štropot, trčkaranje, tresak, zbuniti, zveckati, zvečka, zveket, klepet, klopot, ropac, klepetati, klopotati, zveketati, štropotati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rapid series of short loud sounds (as might be heard with a stethoscope in some types of respiratory disorders) [rale, rattling]</p><p><i>n.</i> a baby's toy that makes percussive noises when shaken</p><p><i>n.</i> loosely connected horny sections at the end of a rattlesnake's tail</p><p><i>v.</i> make short successive sounds</p><p><i>v.</i> shake and cause to make a rattling noise</p><p><b>Čitaj glasno ili ekstravagantno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> recite volubly or extravagantly [rattle off, reel off, roll off, spiel off]</p><p><b>Čitaj glasno ili ekstravagantno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> recite volubly or extravagantly [rattle down, reel off, roll off, spiel off]</p><p><b>Govori neprekidno i dosadno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> talk incessantly and tiresomely [jaw, yack, yack away, yap away]</p><p><b>Uročnjava s žutom bojom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> much-branched erect herb with bright yellow flowers [Baptisia tinctoria, horsefly weed, indigo broom]</p><p><b>Sjevernoamerički čvor koji se nalazi od Mainea i Ontarija do Wisconsina i južno do Georgije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American bugbane found from Maine and Ontario to Wisconsin and south to Georgia [Cimicifuga racemosa, black cohosh, black snakeroot]</p><p><b>bilo koja biljka iz roda Crotalaria s napunjenim čunjama u kojima se sjemena škrcaju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various plants of the genus Crotalaria having inflated pods within which the seeds rattle [crotalaria]</p><p><b>Nedostaje mu razum ili diskrecija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking sense or discretion [rattlepated, scatterbrained, scatty]</p><p><b>Bačena u stanje uznemirenosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> thrown into a state of agitated confusion [flustered, hot and bothered, perturbed]</p><p><b>Nedostaje mu razum ili diskrecija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking sense or discretion [rattlebrained, scatterbrained, scatty]</p><p><b>čegrtuša, teretni vlak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pit viper with horny segments at the end of the tail that rattle when shaken [rattlesnake]</p><p><i>n.</i> a railroad train consisting of freight cars [freight train]</p><p><b>čegrtuša, zmija, zvečarka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pit viper with horny segments at the end of the tail that rattle when shaken [rattler]</p><p><b>Američki paprikac čija se sporangia nalikovala na zvijeri zmije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> American fern whose clustered sporangia resemble a snake's rattle [Botrychium virginianum]</p><p><b>Eryngium yuccifolium, kotrljan, sikavac, zmijska trava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coarse prickly perennial eryngo of United States thought to cure rattlesnake bite [Eryngium yuccifolium, button snakeroot, rattlesnake's master]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih orhideja roda Pholidota koji imaju brojne bijele do smeđe cvijeće u spiralnim krugovima obučenim u blago napuhanim bractama i nalik repom hrčare. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various orchids of the genus Pholidota having numerous white to brown flowers in spiraling racemes clothed in slightly inflated bracts and resembling a rattlesnake's tail</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko malih umjerenih i tropskih orhideja s pomečenim ili prugastim lišćama i šiljcima malih žuto-bijelog cvijeća u okrenutom rasemu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several small temperate and tropical orchids having mottled or striped leaves and spikes of small yellowish-white flowers in a twisted raceme [helleborine]</p><p><b>biljka iz srednje i južne Europe s ljubičastim cvjetovima, biljka iz roda Nabalus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> herb of central and southern Europe having purple florets [Prenanthes purpurea]</p><p><i>n.</i> a plant of the genus Nabalus</p><p><b>jastogovska biljka s rozetom ljubičastih bazalnih listova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hawkweed with a rosette of purple-veined basal leaves [Hieracium venosum]</p><p><b>Eryngium yuccifolium, kotrljan, sikavac, zmijska trava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coarse prickly perennial eryngo of United States thought to cure rattlesnake bite [Eryngium yuccifolium, button snakeroot, rattlesnake master]</p><p><b>brz, čudno, čudnovato, divan, famozan, izvanredan, izvrstan, klepeće, klepetav, koji zveči, oštar, silno, živahan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rapid series of short loud sounds (as might be heard with a stethoscope in some types of respiratory disorders) [rale, rattle]</p><p><i>adj.</i> extraordinarily good or great [fantastic, grand, howling, marvellous, marvelous, terrific, tremendous, wonderful, wondrous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> quick and energetic [alert, brisk, lively, merry, snappy, spanking, zippy]</p><p><i>adv.</i> used as intensifiers [real, really, very]</p><p><b>Teška situacija uplitanja., prljavo, raspadlo, raspadlo stanovanje, zamka za hvatanje štakora. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a difficult entangling situation</p><p><i>n.</i> filthy run-down dilapidated housing</p><p><i>n.</i> a trap for catching rats</p><p><b>obični kućni štakori (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common house rats [genus Rattus]</p><p><b>obični domaći štakor (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common domestic rat [Norway rat, brown rat]</p><p><b>uobičajena domaća štetočina s porekla iz Azije koja se proširila diljem svijeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common household pest originally from Asia that has spread worldwide [black rat, roof rat]</p><p><b>odrpan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or characteristic of rats</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing signs of wear and tear [moth-eaten, shabby, tatty]</p><p><i>adj.</i> dirty and infested with rats</p><p><b>rezerpin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antihypertensive consisting of an alkaloid extracted from the plant Rauwolfia serpentina (trade names Raudixin or Rau-Sed or Sandril or Serpasil) [Raudixin, Sandril, Serpasil, reserpine]</p><p><b>hrapav, promukao</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> unpleasantly loud and harsh [strident]</p><p><i>adj.</i> disturbing the public peace [rowdy]</p><p><b>bučan i razuzdan, hrapav</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with a raucous sound</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a rowdy manner [rowdily]</p><p><b>rezerpin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antihypertensive consisting of an alkaloid extracted from the plant Rauwolfia serpentina (trade names Raudixin or Rau-Sed or Sandril or Serpasil) [Rau-Sed, Sandril, Serpasil, reserpine]</p><p><b>veliki čileanski drveni drvo koje daje grubo drvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large Chilean timber tree yielding coarse lumber [Nothofagus procera]</p><p><b>prostota</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of lacking taste and refinement [coarseness, commonness, grossness, vulgarism, vulgarity]</p><p><b>nepriličan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> ear