an, obični, osjetljiv, ozljeda, povreda, prijesan, sirov, sirovi podaci, sirovina, surov, vlažan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> informal terms for nakedness [altogether, birthday suit]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used especially of commodities) being unprocessed or manufactured using only simple or minimal processes [natural, rude]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having the surface exposed and painful</p><p><i>adj.</i> not treated with heat to prepare it for eating</p><p><i>adj.</i> not processed or refined</p><p><i>adj.</i> devoid of elaboration or diminution or concealment [naked]</p><p><i>adj.</i> brutally unfair or harsh</p><p><i>adj.</i> not processed or subjected to analysis [crude]</p><p><i>adj.</i> untempered and unrefined</p><p><i>adj.</i> hurting [sensitive, sore, tender]</p><p><i>adj.</i> unpleasantly cold and damp [bleak, cutting]</p><p><i>adj.</i> used of wood and furniture [unsanded]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking training or experience [new]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used informally) completely unclothed [bare-ass, bare-assed, in the altogether, in the buff, in the raw, naked as a jaybird, peeled, stark naked]</p><p><b>lzlijepoća koja je snažna i impresivna. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> beauty that is stark and powerfully impressive</p><p><b>neobrađeni podaci, neobrađeni podatci, nepripremljeni podaci, podaci koji nisu obrađeni računalom, podatci koji nisu obrađeni računalom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> unanalyzed data</p><p><b>nepravedno postupanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> unfair treatment</p><p><b>sirovina, neobrađeni materijal, neprerađeni materijal</b></p><p><i>n.</i> material suitable for manufacture or use or finishing [staple]</p><p><b>Neprekuvano meso (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> uncooked meat</p><p><b>nekuhano mlijeko</b></p><p><i>n.</i> unpasteurized milk</p><p><b>Neiskusan i neobrazovan regrut. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inexperienced and untrained recruit</p><p><b>srednje do tamne boje., s masenim udjelom od 0,5% do 0,5% masenog udjela u masenom udjelu od 0,5% do 0,5% masenog udjela u masenom udjelu 