 se, zadirkivati, zafrkavati (od &quot;razz&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cry or noise made to express displeasure or contempt [Bronx cheer, bird, boo, hiss, hoot, raspberry, razz, snort]</p><p><b>bančenje, pijanka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any exciting and complex play intended to confuse (dazzle) the opponent [razmataz, razzle-dazzle, razzmatazz]</p><p><b>bilo koja uzbudljiva i složena igra namijenjena zbunjenju protivnika (osamljivanju) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any exciting and complex play intended to confuse (dazzle) the opponent [razmataz, razzle, razzmatazz]</p><p><b>bilo koja uzbudljiva i složena igra namijenjena zbunjenju protivnika (osamljivanju) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any exciting and complex play intended to confuse (dazzle) the opponent [razmataz, razzle, razzle-dazzle]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,05 do 0,05 mm, ali ne više od 0,05 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a soft silvery metallic element of the alkali metal group [atomic number 37, rubidium]</p><p><b>zrela krvna stanica koja sadrži hemoglobin za nošenje kisika u tjelesna tkiva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mature blood cell that contains hemoglobin to carry oxygen to the bodily tissues [erythrocyte, red blood cell]</p><p><b>trka koja je rezultat izvedbe udarača. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a run that is the result of the batter's performance [run batted in]</p><p><b>savezna policija Kanade (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the federal police force of Canada [Mounties, Royal Canadian Mounted Police]</p><p><b>VR, iznova, još jednom, nanovo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rare heavy polyvalent metallic element that resembles manganese chemically and is used in some alloys [atomic number 75, rhenium]</p><p><i>n.</i> ancient Egyptian sun god with the head of a hawk [Ra]</p><p><i>n.</i> the syllable naming the second (supertonic) note of any major scale in solmization [ray]</p><p><b>staviti novu adresu na (kuvertu), kao za prosljeđivanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put a new address on (an envelope), as for forwarding</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste šuma koje su pod uvjetom da se ne upotrebljavaju u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste šuma koje su pod uvjetom da se upotrebljavaju u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći postupak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> reestablish a forest after clear-cutting or fire, etc.</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste šuma u kojima se koristi šuma u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste šuma u kojima se koristi šuma u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći postupak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the restoration (replanting) of a forest that had been reduced by fire or cutting [reforestation]</p><p><b>opet se svađamo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> argue again</p><p><b>-Ponovo ruku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> arm anew [rearm]</p><p><b>opet, kao nakon vremenskog propusta (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> take on again, as after a time lapse</p><p><b>obnavljati, obnoviti, rekonstruirati, restaurirati, duplicirati, kopirati, prepisati, preslikati, preslikavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> create anew</p><p><i>v.</i> make a replica of [copy]</p><p><i>v.</i> form anew in the imagination</p><p><b>Stvoreno iznova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> created anew</p><p><b>Čin stvaranja ponovo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of creating again</p><p><b>Odjek odjeka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the echo of an echo</p><p><b>opet se pojave. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> appear again [reappear]</p><p><b>Ponovo naglasiti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> emphasize anew [re-emphasize]</p><p><b>Ponovo naglasiti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> emphasize anew [re-emphasise]</p><p><b>Uđi ponovo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> enter again</p><p><b>(uz uglove) upućen u unutrašnjost (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of angles) pointing inward [reentrant]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> re-equip a factory or plant [rejig]</p><p><b>povratak u prethodno stanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> restoration to a previous state</p><p><b>pitanje nakon unakrsnog ispitivanja od strane protivnika odvjetnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> question after cross-examination by opposing counsel</p><p><b>ponavljanje prethodnog iskustva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a recurrence of a prior experience [reliving]</p><p><b>Interpretirati iz drugačijeg gledišta (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> interpret from a different viewpoint [reinterpret]</p><p><b>istražiti ponovno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> explore anew</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se ne primjenjuje primjena ovog članka, za određene proizvode se primjenjuje sljedeći postupak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> forming again (especially with improvements or removal of defects) [regeneration]</p><p><b>ponovno formiran ili novo formiran (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> formed again or anew</p><p><b>ponovno ili ponovno uključiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> incorporate again or anew</p><p><b>uvesti ponovno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> introduce anew [reintroduce]</p><p><b>prijedlog nečeg što je ranije odbijeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a proposal of something previously rejected</p><p><b>(zakonom) smanjenje teške kazne iz zakona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) the reduction in severity of a punishment imposed by law [commutation]</p><p><b>nastaviti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> start an engine again, for example [restart]</p><p><i>v.</i> take up or begin anew [restart, resume]</p><p><b>Proces potrošnje ili ponovno potrošnje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a process of using up or consuming again [reuptake]</p><p><b>(Rimska mitologija) Vestala djevica koja je postala majka od Mars blizanca Romulus i Remus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman mythology) a vestal virgin who became the mother by Mars of the twins Romulus and Remus [Rhea Silvia]</p><p><b>podvrgnuti reabsorpciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> undergo resorption [resorb]</p><p><b>reapsorpcija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the organic process in which the substance of some differentiated structure that has been produced by the body undergoes lysis and assimilation [resorption]</p><p><b>dio rijeke između dva zavoja, doći, doći do, dohvat, dohvatiti, dokučiti, domet, dopirati, doprijeti, doseći, doseg, dosegnuti, dosezanje, dosezati, dostići, dostizanje, nadomak, opseg, ostvariti, posegnuti, postići, postizati, predati, prikupiti, prispjeti, prostor, pružanje ruke, shvatiti, stezanje, stići, udaljenost, dometa, dosežu, ostvarivanja, rastojanje, raspon, dokučivati, dosizati, dostizati, hvatati, pristizati, stizati, dostignuti, ispuniti, ispunjavati, ostvarivati, postignuti, prostirati se, protegnuti se, protezati se, pružati se, pružiti se, sezati, dati, davati, dodati, dodavati, izručiti, izručivati, predavati, proslijediti, prosljeđivati, uručiti, uručivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the limits within which something can be effective [range]</p><p><i>n.</i> an area in which something acts or operates or has power or control: "the range of a supersonic jet" [ambit, compass, orbit, range, scope]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of physically reaching or thrusting out [reaching, stretch]</p><p><i>n.</i> the limit of capability [compass, grasp, range]</p><p><i>v.</i> reach a destination, either real or abstract [arrive at, attain, gain, hit, make]</p><p><i>v.</i> reach a point in time, or a certain state or level [attain, hit]</p><p><i>v.</i> move forward or upward in order to touch [reach out]</p><p><i>v.</i> be in or establish communication with [contact, get hold of, get through]</p><p><i>v.</i> to gain with effort [accomplish, achieve, attain]</p><p><i>v.</i> to extend as far as [extend to, touch]</p><p><i>v.</i> reach a goal [get to, make, progress to]</p><p><i>v.</i> place into the hands or custody of [give, hand, pass, pass on, turn over]</p><p><i>v.</i> to exert much effort or energy [strain, strive]</p><p><b>naletjeti ili naletjeti na (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> run into or up to</p><p><b>biti osjetljiv na miris (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be smelled</p><p><b>stići</b></p><p><i>v.</i> move forward or upward in order to touch [reach]</p><p><i>v.</i> reach outward in space [extend, poke out]</p><p><i>v.</i> attempt to communicate</p><p><b>dostupan, pristupačan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> easily approached [approachable]</p><p><b>dođe do, dopiranje, dosezanje, posezanje, postizanja, dostignuće, postignuće, postizanje, uspjeh</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of physically reaching or thrusting out [reach, stretch]</p><p><i>n.</i> accomplishment of an objective [arrival]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je vrijednost vrijednosnog papira u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 3. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, vrijednost vrijednosnog papira u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe ne može biti vrijednost vrijednosnog papira u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stock that has been bought back by the issuing corporation and is available for retirement or resale [treasury shares, treasury stock]</p><p><b>djelovati, izazvati reakciju, odgovoriti, reagirati, uticati, odazivati se, odazvati se, odgovarati, uzvratiti, uzvraćati, protiviti se, suprotstaviti se, suprotstavljati se, usprotiviti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> show a response or a reaction to something [respond]</p><p><i>v.</i> act against or in opposition to [oppose]</p><p><i>v.</i> undergo a chemical reaction</p><p><b>reaktancija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> opposition to the flow of electric current resulting from inductance and capacitance (rather than resistance)</p><p><b>kemijska tvar koja je prisutna na početku kemijske reakcije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chemical substance that is present at the start of a chemical reaction</p><p><b>međusobno djelovanje, odgovor, otpor, reagiranje, reakcija, suprotno djelovanje, reagira, refleks, uzročno-poljedična veza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) a process in which one or more substances are changed into others [chemical reaction]</p><p><i>n.</i> an idea evoked by some experience</p><p><i>n.</i> a bodily process occurring due to the effect of some antecedent stimulus or agent [response]</p><p><i>n.</i> (mechanics) the equal and opposite force that is produced when any force is applied to a body</p><p><i>n.</i> a response that reveals a person's feelings or attitude</p><p><i>n.</i> extreme conservatism in political or social matters</p><p><i>n.</i> doing something in opposition to another way of doing it that you don't like</p><p><b>motor s brzinom od 300 km/h ili veću, ali ne veću od 300 km/h, koji se koristi za proizvodnju motora s brzinom od 300 km/h ili veću, ali ne veću od 300 km/h, koji se koristi za proizvodnju motora s brzinom od 300 km/h ili veću, ali ne veću od 300 km/h, koji se koristi za proizvodnju motora s brzinom od 300 km/h ili veću, ali ne veću od 300 km/h, koji se koristi za proizvodnju motora s br (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a jet or rocket engine based on a form of aerodynamic propulsion in which the vehicle emits a high-speed stream [reaction-propulsion engine]</p><p><b>(psihijatrija) obrambeni mehanizam u kojem osoba nesvjesno razvija stavove i ponašanje koje su suprotno neprihvatljivim potisnutim željama i nagonima i služe im za skrivanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychiatry) a defense mechanism in which a person unconsciously develops attitudes and behavior that are the opposite of unacceptable repressed desires and impulses and serve to conceal them</p><p><b>U slučaju vozila s brzinom od 300 km/h do 300 km/h, to znači da je vozilo u stanju da se odvija u brzini od 300 km/h do 300 km/h. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> propulsion that results from the ejection at high velocity of a mass of gas to which the vehicle reacts with an equal and opposite momentum</p><p><b>vrijeme reakcije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time that elapses between a stimulus and the response to it [latency, latent period, response time]</p><p><b>Turbina s lopatima raspoređenim tako da stvara obrtni moment od postupnog smanjenja pritiska pare od ulaza do ispuha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a turbine with blades arranged to develop torque from gradual decrease of steam pressure from inlet to exhaust</p><p><b>motor s brzinom od 300 km/h ili veću, ali ne veću od 300 km/h, koji se koristi za proizvodnju motora s brzinom od 300 km/h ili veću, ali ne veću od 300 km/h, koji se koristi za proizvodnju motora s brzinom od 300 km/h ili veću, ali ne veću od 300 km/h, koji se koristi za proizvodnju motora s brzinom od 300 km/h ili veću, ali ne veću od 300 km/h, koji se koristi za proizvodnju motora s br (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a jet or rocket engine based on a form of aerodynamic propulsion in which the vehicle emits a high-speed stream [reaction engine]</p><p><b>nazadnjački, reakcionaran</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an extreme conservative [extreme right-winger, ultraconservative]</p><p><i>adj.</i> opposed to political or social liberalism or reform [far-right, reactionist]</p><p><b>politička orijentacija reakcionarnih. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the political orientation of reactionaries</p><p><b>reakcionar</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> opposed to political or social liberalism or reform [far-right, reactionary]</p><p><b>ponovno aktivirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> activate (an old file) anew</p><p><b>daje otpor, reaktivan, reaktivni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> participating readily in reactions</p><p><i>adj.</i> reacting to a stimulus [responsive]</p><p><b>neprikladno stanje depresije koje je uzrokovano događajima u životu osobe (odluči se od normalne tuge) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inappropriate state of depression that is precipitated by events in the person's life (to be distinguished from normal grief) [exogenous depression]</p><p><b>skizofrenija iznenadne pojave i relativno kratkog trajanja (nekoliko tjedana ili mjeseci) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> schizophrenia of abrupt onset and relatively short duration (a few weeks or months) [acute schizophrenic episode]</p><p><b>ponovno djelovanje, reaktivnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> responsive to stimulation [responsiveness]</p><p><i>n.</i> ready susceptibility to chemical change</p><p><b>reaktor, reaktora</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electrical device used to introduce reactance into a circuit</p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) any of several kinds of apparatus that maintain and control a nuclear reaction for the production of energy or artificial elements [nuclear reactor]</p><p><b>čitanje, čitati, glasiti, objasniti, prikazati, pročitati, proučavati, razumjeti, shvatiti, tumačiti, pročitajte, čitano, čitao, čitate, iščitati, govoriti, kazati, kazivati, izučiti, pohađati, studirati, učiti, školovati se, razumijevati, čuti, prevesti, prevoditi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something that is read</p><p><i>v.</i> interpret something that is written or printed</p><p><i>v.</i> have or contain a certain wording or form [say]</p><p><i>v.</i> look at, interpret, and say out loud something that is written or printed</p><p><i>v.</i> obtain data from magnetic tapes or other digital sources [scan]</p><p><i>v.</i> interpret the significance of, as of palms, tea leaves, intestines, the sky</p><p><i>v.</i> interpret something in a certain way [take]</p><p><i>v.</i> be a student of a certain subject [learn, study, take]</p><p><i>v.</i> indicate a certain reading [record, register, show]</p><p><i>v.</i> audition for a stage role by reading parts of a role</p><p><i>v.</i> to hear and understand</p><p><i>v.</i> make sense of a language [interpret, translate, understand]</p><p><b>Čitaj što je implicirano ali nije izraženo na površini. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> read what is implied but not expressed on the surface</p><p><b>metoda prirodnog porođaja koja pretpostavlja da je to normalan proces i da je bol uglavnom psihološki (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of natural childbirth that assumes it is a normal process and that the pain is largely psychological [Read method of childbirth]</p><p><b>metoda prirodnog porođaja koja pretpostavlja da je to normalan proces i da je bol uglavnom psihološki (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of natural childbirth that assumes it is a normal process and that the pain is largely psychological [Read method]</p><p><b>(računalnička znanost) datoteka koju možete čitati, ali ne možete promijeniti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a file that you can read but cannot change</p><p><b>memorija s mogućnosti čitanja bez mogućnosti upisa, memorija samo za očitavanje, stalna memorija, ROM, ispisna memorija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) memory whose contents can be accessed and read but cannot be changed [ROM, fixed storage, read-only storage]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a memory chip providing read-only memory</p><p><b>ROM, ispisna memorija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) memory whose contents can be accessed and read but cannot be changed [ROM, fixed storage, read-only memory]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se radi o proizvodnji električne energije, to znači da se radi o proizvodnji električne energije koja se koristi za proizvodnju električne energije., informacije prikazane ili zabilježene na elektroničkom uređaju, elektronički uređaj koji prikazuje informacije u vizualnom obliku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the output of a computer in readable form [readout]</p><p><i>n.</i> the information displayed or recorded on an electronic device [readout]</p><p><i>n.</i> an electronic device the displays information in a visual form [readout]</p><p><b>(računarski znanost) mali elektromagnetni spojnik i metalni pol koji se koristi za pisanje i čitanje magnetnih uzoraka na disku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a tiny electromagnetic coil and metal pole used to write and read magnetic patterns on a disk [head]</p><p><b>Najčešća računalna memorija koju programi mogu koristiti za obavljanje potrebnih zadataka dok je računar uključen. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the most common computer memory which can be used by programs to perform necessary tasks while the computer is on [RAM, random-access memory, random access memory, random memory]</p><p><b>kvaliteta pisanog jezika koji čini jednostavnim čitanje i razumijevanje, kvaliteta pisanja (štampa ili rukopis) koja se lako čita (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of written language that makes it easy to read and understand</p><p><i>n.</i> a quality of writing (print or handwriting) that can be easily read [legibility]</p><p><b>čitljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> easily deciphered [clear, decipherable]</p><p><b>na čitljiv način (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a legible manner [decipherably, legibly]</p><p><b>prilagođava se ponovo, -Ponovo se prilagodite. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> adapt anew</p><p><i>v.</i> adjust anew [readjust]</p><p><b>čitač, čitalac, čitalački, čitanka, čitatelj, čitateljica, korektor, lektor, ljubitelj čitanja, predavač, ocjenjivač, recenzent</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who enjoys reading</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who contracts to receive and pay for a service or a certain number of issues of a publication [subscriber]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who can read</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who reads manuscripts and judges their suitability for publication [referee, reviewer]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who reads proof in order to find errors and mark corrections [proofreader]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who reads the lessons in a church service [lector]</p><p><i>n.</i> a public lecturer at certain universities [lector, lecturer]</p><p><i>n.</i> one of a series of texts for students learning to read</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 1303/2013 Komisija je odlučila o primjeni mjera za utvrđivanje primjene članka 3. stavka 1. točke (b) Uredbe (EU) br. 1303/2013. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the audience reached by written communications (books or magazines or newspapers etc.)</p><p><b>bez muke, brzo, lako, odmah, rado, smjesta, spremno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without much difficulty</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a punctual manner [promptly, pronto]</p><p><b>brzina, gotovost, pripravnost, pripremljenost, spremnost, voljnost, priprema</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of having been made ready or prepared for use or action (especially military action) [preparation, preparedness]</p><p><i>n.</i> prompt willingness [eagerness, forwardness, zeal]</p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) being temporarily ready to respond in a particular way [set]</p><p><i>n.</i> a natural effortlessness [facility]</p><p><b>čitajući, čitalački, čitan, čitanje, čitateljski, javno čitanje, lekcija, lektira, način čitanja, načitanost, očitanje, predavanje, štivo, čitanja, čitateljskom, vrijednost, tumačenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cognitive process of understanding a written linguistic message</p><p><i>n.</i> a particular interpretation or performance</p><p><i>n.</i> a datum about some physical state that is presented to a user by a meter or similar instrument [indication, meter reading]</p><p><i>n.</i> written material intended to be read [reading material]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mental representation of the meaning or significance of something [interpretation, version]</p><p><i>n.</i> a city on the River Thames in Berkshire in southern England</p><p><i>n.</i> a public instance of reciting or repeating (from memory) something prepared in advance [recital, recitation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of measuring with meters or similar instruments [meter reading]</p><p><b>čitanje odlomka koji je predavač dodijelio (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the reading of a passage assigned by the teacher</p><p><b>bolnica za osobe s poteškoćama u čitanju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clinic for people with reading disabilities</p><p><b>stalak za čitanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> desk or stand with a slanted top used to hold a text at the proper height for a lecturer [lectern]</p><p><b>svjetiljka koja pruža svjetlost za čitanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lamp that provides light for reading</p><p><b>Pisan materijal namijenjen za čitanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> written material intended to be read [reading]</p><p><b>Program namijenjen učenju pismenosti i pismenosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a program designed to teach literacy skills</p><p><b>čitan, čitaonica, čitaonice</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a room set aside for reading</p><p><b>netko tko uči učenike čitati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who teaches students to read</p><p><b>preudesiti, preurediti, prilagoditi, resetirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> adjust anew [readapt]</p><p><i>v.</i> adjust again after an initial failure [reset]</p><p><b>podešavanje, usklađivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of adjusting again (to changed circumstances)</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of adjusting something to match a standard [adjustment, registration]</p><p><b>ponovni prihvat, preprijam, readmisija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of admitting someone again</p><p><b>ponovo prihvatiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> admit anew</p><p><i>v.</i> admit again or anew</p><p><b>elekronički ekran, ispis, izjava, prikaz očitanja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the output of a computer in readable form [read-out]</p><p><i>n.</i> the information displayed or recorded on an electronic device [read-out]</p><p><i>n.</i> an electronic device the displays information in a visual form [read-out]</p><p><b>gotov, gotovo, hitar, okretan, pripravan, pristupačan, spreman, suglasan, voljan, spremno, kuhati, napraviti, praviti, pripraviti, pripravljati, pripremati, pripremiti, skuhati, slagati, složiti, spremati, spremiti, zgotoviti, zgotovljavati, postaviti, postavljati, prirediti, priređivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> poised for action</p><p><i>v.</i> prepare for eating by applying heat [cook, fix, make, prepare]</p><p><i>v.</i> make ready or suitable or equip in advance for a particular purpose or for some use, event, etc [fix, gear up, prepare, set, set up]</p><p><i>adj.</i> completely prepared or in condition for immediate action or use or progress</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of especially money) immediately available</p><p><i>adj.</i> mentally disposed</p><p><i>adj.</i> made suitable and available for immediate use</p><p><i>adj.</i> apprehending and responding with speed and sensitivity [quick]</p><p><b>da je i ostaje spreman i dostupan za upotrebu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being and remaining ready and available for use [waiting]</p><p><b>novac u obliku gotovine koji je lako dostupan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> money in the form of cash that is readily available [cold cash, ready money]</p><p><b>novac u obliku gotovine koji je lako dostupan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> money in the form of cash that is readily available [cold cash, ready cash]</p><p><b>Priručnik s tablicama koji se koristi za olakšavanje izračunavanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a handbook of tables used to facilitate computation [reckoner]</p><p><b>lako dostupan (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> easy to reach [handy]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 g/m2 do 0,15 g/m2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> cooked in such a way as to be ready for sale</p><p><b>gotov, konfekcijski, tvornički</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a manufactured artifact (as a garment or piece of furniture) that is made in advance and available for purchase</p><p><i>adj.</i> made for purchase and immediate use</p><p><i>adj.</i> repeated regularly without thought or originality [cliched]</p><p><i>adj.</i> commercially produced</p><p><b>proizvod koji sadrži većinu sastojaka za jelo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commercial preparation containing most of the ingredients for a dish</p><p><b>proizvodi za hranu koji su unaprijed pripremljeni i mogu se jesti u obliku prodaje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> food products that are prepared in advance and can be eaten as sold</p><p><b>konfekcijska odjeća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ready-made clothing</p><p><i>adj.</i> (especially of clothing) made in standard sizes and available from merchandise in stock [off-the-peg, off-the-rack, off-the-shelf]</p><p><b>preparacija, priprava, priprema, pripremanje, spremanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of putting or setting in order in advance of some act or purpose [preparation]</p><p><b>članstvo ponovno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> affiliation anew</p><p><b>opet potvrdit