se pojavilo nedavno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a time immediately before the present [recentness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of having happened or appeared not long ago [recentness]</p><p><b>aktualno, nedavni, nov, noviji, recentniji, skorašnji, suvremen, svjež, skorašnje, novije, recentnije, nedavan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> approximately the last 10,000 years [Holocene, Holocene epoch, Recent epoch]</p><p><i>adj.</i> new</p><p><i>adj.</i> of the immediate past or just previous to the present time [late]</p><p><b>Oko posljednjih 10.000 godina. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> approximately the last 10,000 years [Holocene, Holocene epoch, Recent]</p><p><b>nedavno, skoro, u novije vrijeme, u posljednje vrijeme</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in the recent past [late, lately, latterly, of late]</p><p><b>aktualno, nedavni, nov, noviji, recentniji, skorašnji, suvremen, svjež, skorašnje, novije, recentnije (od &quot;recent&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a time immediately before the present [recency]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of having happened or appeared not long ago [recency]</p><p><b>kutija, posuda, sanduk, spremište, spremnik, utičnica, vreća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a container that is used to put or keep things in</p><p><i>n.</i> enlarged tip of a stem that bears the floral parts</p><p><i>n.</i> an electrical (or electronic) fitting that is connected to a source of power and equipped to receive an insert</p><p><b>doček, opažaj, osjetljivost, prihvat, prihvat signala na prijamnoj stanici, prijam, prijem, primanje, recepcija, sjedjeljka, zabava, prijat susret, odgovor, odjek, primitak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the manner in which something is greeted [response]</p><p><i>n.</i> a formal party of people</p><p><i>n.</i> quality or fidelity of a received broadcast</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of receiving [receipt]</p><p><i>n.</i> (American football) the act of catching a pass in football</p><p><b>recepcija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a counter (as in a hotel) where guests are received</p><p><b>red ljudi (gosti i poča