l response</p><p><i>n.</i> an organ having nerve endings (in the skin or viscera or eye or ear or nose or mouth) that respond to stimulation [sense organ, sensory receptor]</p><p><b>niša, odmor, praznici, rupa, skrovito mjesto, stanka, šupljina, udubljenje, ulegnuće, raspust, udubina, kratak odmor, minuta odmora, time-out, raspustiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of abeyance or suspended business [deferral]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small concavity [corner, niche, recession]</p><p><i>n.</i> an arm off of a larger body of water (often between rocky headlands) [inlet]</p><p><i>n.</i> an enclosure that is set back or indented [niche]</p><p><i>n.</i> a pause from doing something (as work) [break, respite, time out]</p><p><i>v.</i> put into a recess</p><p><i>v.</i> make a recess in</p><p><i>v.</i> close at the end of a session [adjourn, break up]</p><p><b>niša, odmor, praznici, rupa, skrovito mjesto, stanka, šupljina, udubljenje, ulegnuće, raspust (od &quot;recess&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a sunken area [deep-set, sunken]</p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling an alcove</p><p><b>poništenje, povlačenje, udubljenje, uzmicanje, udubina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of the economy declines</p><p><i>n.</i> a small concavity [corner, niche, recess]</p><p><i>n.</i> the withdrawal of the clergy and choir from the chancel to the vestry at the end of a church service [recessional]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of ceding back [ceding back]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of becoming more distant [receding]</p><p><b>povlačenje svećenstva i zbora iz kancela u svetište na kraju crkvene službe, himna koja se pjeva na kraju službe dok se svećenici i zbor povlače., odlaska ili s obzirom na to (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the withdrawal of the clergy and choir from the chancel to the vestry at the end of a church service [recession]</p><p><i>n.</i> a hymn that is sung at the end of a service as the clergy and choir withdraw</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to receding</p><p><b>marš koji će se svirati za procesije (M