e same criminal behavior) [habitual criminal, repeater]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who lapses into previous undesirable patterns of behavior [backslider, reversionist]</p><p><b>Pernambuco, Recife</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a port city of northeastern Brazil on the Atlantic [Pernambuco]</p><p><b>recept, sredstvo, formula</b></p><p><i>n.</i> directions for making something [formula]</p><p><b>prijemljiv, primalac, primatelj, koji prima</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who receives something [receiver]</p><p><i>n.</i> the semantic role of the animate entity that is passively involved in the happening denoted by the verb in the clause [recipient role]</p><p><b>Semantička uloga živog bića koji je pasivno uključen u događaj označen glagovima u rečenici. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the semantic role of the animate entity that is passively involved in the happening denoted by the verb in the clause [recipient]</p><p><b>međusoban, obostran, odgovarajući, povratan, recipročan, refleksivan, uzajaman, uzajamnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something (a term or expression or concept) that has an inverse relation to something else</p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) one of a pair of numbers whose product is 1: the reciprocal of 2/3 is 3/2 [multiplicative inverse]</p><p><i>n.</i> hybridization involving a pair of crosses that reverse the sexes associated with each genotype [reciprocal cross]</p><p><i>adj.</i> concerning each of two or more persons or things [mutual]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the multiplicative inverse of a quantity or function</p><p><b>hibridizacija koja uključuje par ukrcavanja koji okreću spolove povezane s svakom genotipom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hybridization involving a pair of crosses that reverse the sexes associated with each genotype [reciprocal]</p><p><b>metoda terapije ponašanja koja se temelji na inhibiciji jednog odgovora pojavom drugog odgovora koji je međusobno nekompatibilan s njim (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of behavior therapy based on the inhibition of one response by the occurrence of another response that is mutually incompatible with it [reciprocal-inhibition therapy]</p><p><b>simens</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of conductance equal to the reciprocal of an ohm [S, mho, siemens]</p><p><b>zamjenik ili zamjenik fraza (kao `svaka druga') koja izražava uzajamno djelovanje ili odnos između pojedinaca naznačenih u množini subjekta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pronoun or pronominal phrase (as `each other') that expresses a mutual action or relationship between the individuals indicated in the plural subject</p><p><b>metoda terapije ponašanja koja se temelji na inhibiciji jednog odgovora pojavom drugog odgovora koji je međusobno nekompatibilan s njim (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of behavior therapy based on the inhibition of one response by the occurrence of another response that is mutually incompatible with it [reciprocal inhibition]</p><p><b>reciprocitet, recipročnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a relation of mutual dependence or action or influence [reciprocity]</p><p><b>recipročno, međusoban</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> (often followed by `for') in exchange or in reciprocation [in return]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a mutual or shared manner [mutually]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an inverse or contrary manner [inversely]</p><p><b>istom mjerom vrijednosti, izmijenjati, odužiti se, uzvraćati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> act, feel, or give mutually or in return</p><p><i>v.</i> alternate the direction of motion of</p><p><b>klipni motor, klipni stroj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an internal-combustion engine in which the crankshaft is turned by pistons moving up and down in cylinders</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a portable power saw with a reciprocating blade [jigsaw, saber saw]</p><p><b>gibanje amo-tamo, izmjena, izmjenično djelovanje, izmjenično kretanje, mijenjanje, uzvraćanje, vraćanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of making or doing something in return</p><p><i>n.</i> alternating back-and-