e]</p><p><b>fotelja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an armchair whose back can be lowered and foot can be raised to allow the sitter to recline in it [lounger, reclining chair]</p><p><b>nasloniti, nasloniti se, opružiti se, osloniti se, počivati, poduprijeti, položiti, zabaciti glavu (od &quot;recline&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of assuming or maintaining a reclining position</p><p><b>naslonjač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an armchair whose back can be lowered and foot can be raised to allow the sitter to recline in it [lounger, recliner]</p><p><b>osamljenik, povučen, pustinjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who lives in solitude [hermit, solitary, solitudinarian, troglodyte]</p><p><i>adj.</i> withdrawn from society [reclusive, withdrawn]</p><p><b>povlačen iz društva., pruža privatnost ili samostalnost (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> withdrawn from society [recluse, withdrawn]</p><p><i>adj.</i> providing privacy or seclusion [cloistered, secluded, sequestered]</p><p><b>sklonost da se više drži u samoći ili izoliranosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disposition to prefer seclusion or isolation</p><p><b>staviti u drugu šifru (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put into a different code</p><p><b>prelazak iz jednog koda u drugi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> converting from one code to another</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je to primjena iz stavka 1. ovog članka, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being recognized [placeable, recognizable]</p><p><b>(zakon) jamstvo koje je sklopljeno pred sudom pod uvjetom izvršenja nekog djela propisanog zakonom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) a security entered into before a court with a condition to perform some act required by law [recognizance]</p><p><b>potvrđivati, prepoznati, pridati, prihvatiti, cijeniti, prepoznavati, uočavati, uočiti, akreditirati, raspoznavati, pozdraviti, pozdraviti se, pozdravljati, pozdravljati se, doznati, saznati, shvatiti, shvaćati, spoznati, spoznavati, znati, spaziti, zapaziti, zapažati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> show approval or appreciation of [recogni