ain information about an enemy or potential enemy) [reconnaissance mission]</p><p><b>metoda izviđanja u kojoj se vatra stavlja na sumnjivi neprijateljski položaj kako bi se neprijatelj otkrio svoju prisutnost pomicanjem ili vraćanjem vatre. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of reconnaissance in which fire is placed on a suspected enemy position in order to cause the enemy to disclose his presence by moving or returning fire</p><p><b>"Opaktivna operacija" je ofanzivna operacija namijenjena otkrivanju ili testiranju snage neprijatelja (ili dobivanju drugih informacija) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an offensive operation designed to discover or test the enemy's strength (or to obtain other information)</p><p><b>izvidnica, izviđanje, izviđačka misija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of reconnoitring (especially to gain information about an enemy or potential enemy) [reconnaissance]</p><p><b>vojni avion koji se koristi za dobivanje informacija o neprijatelju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a military airplane used to gain information about an enemy</p><p><b>brza oklopna vojna vozila s pogonom na sva četiri kotača i otvorenim vrhom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fast armored military vehicle with four-wheel drive and open top [scout car]</p><p><b>izviđati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> explore, often with the goal of finding something or somebody [reconnoitre, scout]</p><p><b>izviđači</b></p><p><i>n.</i> exploring in order to gain information [exploratory survey, reconnoitring, scouting]</p><p><b>izviđač, izviđati, uhoditi</b></p><p><i>v.</i> explore, often with the goal of finding something or somebody [reconnoiter, scout]</p><p><b>izviđači</b></p><p><i>n.</i> exploring in order to gain information [exploratory survey, reconnoitering, scouting]</p><p><b>Osvojiti ponovno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> conquer anew</p><p><b>Posveti se ponovo, kao nakon oskvrnuća. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> consecrate anew, as after a desecration</p><p><b>ponovo promisliti, promisliti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> consider again</p><p><i>v