iously convicted [criminal record]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a record of [enter, put down]</p><p><i>v.</i> register electronically [tape]</p><p><i>v.</i> indicate a certain reading [read, register, show]</p><p><i>v.</i> be aware of [register]</p><p><b>album, ploča</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one or more recordings issued together [album]</p><p><i>n.</i> an album for holding phonograph records [phonograph album]</p><p><b>arhiv, registar, spis, zapis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compilation of the known facts regarding something or someone [book, record]</p><p><b>S druge strane, za proizvodnju električnih vozila od 8 kW do 8 kW, neovisno o tome jesu li to električni motori ili motorni motori. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an automatic mechanical device on a record player that causes new records to be played without manual intervention [auto-changer, changer]</p><p><b>diskografska kuća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company that makes and sells musical recordings</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenjem od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sleeve for storing a phonograph record [record sleeve]</p><p><b>Neformalni ples gdje se svira popularna glazba. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an informal dance where popular music is played [hop]</p><p><b>odvojena od drugih materijala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the jacket for a phonograph record</p><p><b>gramofon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> machine in which rotating records cause a stylus to vibrate and the vibrations are amplified acoustically or electronically [phonograph]</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenjem od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sleeve for storing a phonograph record [record cover]</p><p><b>Nekoga tko je oborio rekord. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who breaks a record [record-holder]</p><p><b>Prelazi bilo koji prethodno utvrđeni rekord. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> surpassing any previously established record</p><p><b>rekorder, rekorderka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who breaks a record [record-breaker]</p><p><b>osoba odgovorna za vođe