e efikasnije koriste. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the withdrawal and redistribution of forces in an attempt to use them more effectively [redeployment]</p><p><b>preraspodijeliti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> distribute anew</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, poduzeća koja imaju poslovne odnose s drugim državama mogu imati: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having population and industries relocated from urban to outlying areas</p><p><b>redistribucija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> distributing again</p><p><b>diskriminirati u prodaji ili iznajmljivanju stanova u određenim područjima susjedstva (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> discriminate in selling or renting housing in certain areas of a neighborhood</p><p><b>crven, crvena boja, crveniti se, crveno, pocrvenjeti, rumen, crvena, crvene, crveni, crvenih, crvenim, crvenom, pocrveniti, riđ (od &quot;red&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> displaying a red color</p><p><b>sučnjava biljka koja stvara tepih s malim bljeskom s bljeskom crvenkasto-ružičaste boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> succulent carpet-forming plant having small brilliant reddish-pink flowers [Calandrinia ciliata, red maids]</p><p><b>siromašni bijelac u južnim Sjedinjenim Državama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a poor White person in the southern United States [cracker]</p><p><b>crvenilo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a response of body tissues to injury or irritation [inflammation, rubor]</p><p><i>n.</i> red color or pigment [red]</p><p><b>nanovo, obnova zadnje naredbe, obnoviti, ponovno, ponovno učiniti, ponovo učiniti, vrati, vrati nazad, ponoviti, prezidati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make new [make over, refashion, remake]</p><p><i>v.</i> do over, as of (part of) a house [reconstruct, remodel]</p><p><b>miris, aroma, miomiris</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pleasingly sweet olfactory property [bouquet, fragrance, fragrancy, sweetness]</p><p><b>mirišljav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to bring to mind [evocative, remindful, reminiscent, resonant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used with `of' or `with') noticeably odorous [smelling]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a strong pleasant odor [aromatic]</p><p><b>otok u Antigvi i Barbudi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an island in Antigua and Barbuda</p><p><b>podvostručiti, pogoršati, pojačati, udvojiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> double in magnitude, extent, or intensity</p><p><i>v.</i> double again</p><p><i>v.</i> make twice as great or intense</p><p><b>Postaju mnogo veći u intenzitetu ili veličini ili količini. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> become much greater in intensity or size or amount</p><p><b>(vojni) privremeni ili dodatni utvrđenje, tvrđavi ili utočište, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (military) a temporary or supplementary fortification</p><p><i>n.</i> an entrenched stronghold or refuge</p><p><b>opasan, strašan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> inspiring fear [formidable, unnerving]</p><p><i>adj.</i> worthy of respect or honor</p><p><b>pasti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> return or recoil</p><p><i>v.</i> contribute</p><p><i>v.</i> have an effect for good or ill</p><p><b>redoks, redoks-reakcija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a reversible chemical reaction in which one reaction is an oxidation and the reverse is a reduction [oxidation-reduction, oxidoreduction]</p><p><b>sjeverna juričica, sjeverna konopljarka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small siskin-like finch with a red crown [Carduelis hornemanni]</p><p><i>n.</i> small siskin-like finch with a red crown and a rosy breast and rump [Carduelis flammea]</p><p><b>Nacrt za iznos nečasnog nacrta plus troškovi i naknade za ponovno izlaganje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a draft for the amount of a dishonored draft plus the costs and charges of drafting again</p><p><b>ispraviti, naknada, naknaditi, pomoć, popraviti, zadovoljenje, zagladiti, iskupiti se, iskupljivati se, ispravljati, kompenzirati, nadoknaditi, nadoknađivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sum of money paid in compensation for loss or injury [amends, damages, indemnification, indemnity, restitution]</p><p><i>n.</i> act of correcting an error or a fault or an evil [remediation, remedy]</p><p><i>v.</i> make reparations or amends for [compensate, correct, right]</p><p><b>dvostruko šumsko bilje porijeklom iz Sjeverne Amerike s crvenim korijenom i crvenim sokom i s jednim listom sa čvorovima i bijelom cvjetom u ranom proljeću i s oštrim emetičkim svojstvima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial woodland native of North America having a red root and red sap and bearing a solitary lobed leaf and white flower in early spring and having acrid emetic properties [Sanguinaria canadensis, bloodroot, puccoon, tetterwort]</p><p><b>crvenonogi prudnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a common Old World wading bird with long red legs [Tringa totanus]</p><p><b>(astronomija) pomak spektra vrlo udaljenih galaksija prema dužim talasnim dužinama (ka crvenom kraju spektra) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (astronomy) a shift in the spectra of very distant galaxies toward longer wavelengths (toward the red end of the spectrum) [red shift]</p><p><b>crvenokožac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (slang) offensive term for Native Americans [Injun, red man]</p><p><b>obična crvenorepka, američka crvenrepka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> flycatching warbler of eastern North America the male having bright orange on sides and wings and tail [American redstart, Setophaga ruticilla]</p><p><i>n.</i> European songbird with a reddish breast and tail [redtail]</p><p><b>Europski korov prirodni u jugozapadnim Sjedinjenim Državama i Meksiku koji ima crvenkasto dekumbentne stabljike s malim lišcima sličnim paprarima i malim duboko crvenkasto-lavandrim cvijećima s tankim plodovima koji se drže ravno gore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European weed naturalized in southwestern United States and Mexico having reddish decumbent stems with small fernlike leaves and small deep reddish-lavender flowers followed by slender fruits that stick straight up [Erodium cicutarium, alfilaria, alfileria, clocks, filaree, filaria, pin clover, pin grass]</p><p><b>tamno smeđe vrste američkog sokola s crvenkasto smeđim repom, Europska ptica pjevačica s crvenkastim grudima i repom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dark brown American hawk species having a reddish-brown tail [Buteo jamaicensis, red-tailed hawk]</p><p><i>n.</i> European songbird with a reddish breast and tail [redstart]</p><p><b>dovesti, namjestiti, natjerati, obratiti, pobijediti, podjarmiti, pokoriti, reducirati, skratiti, smanjiti, sniziti, svesti, umanjiti, vratiti natrag, smanji, umanjuje, deoksidirati, odstraniti kisik, odstranjivati kisik, isjeći, kratiti, sažeti, sažimati, skraćivati, zbiti, reducirati se, zgusnuti se, zgušnjavati se, zgusnuti, zgušnjavati, razblažiti, razrijediti se, mršavjeti, omršavjeti, smršavjeti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cut down on [bring down, cut, cut back, cut down, trim, trim back, trim down]</p><p><i>v.</i> make less complex</p><p><i>v.</i> bring to humbler or weaker state or condition</p><p><i>v.</i> simplify the form of a mathematical equation of expression by substituting one term for another</p><p><i>v.</i> lower in grade or rank or force somebody into an undignified situation</p><p><i>v.</i> be the essential element [boil down, come down]</p><p><i>v.</i> reduce in size [shrink]</p><p><i>v.</i> lessen and make more modest</p><p><i>v.</i> make smaller [scale down]</p><p><i>v.</i> to remove oxygen from a compound, or cause to react with hydrogen or form a hydride, or to undergo an increase in the number of electrons [deoxidise, deoxidize]</p><p><i>v.</i> narrow or limit [tighten]</p><p><i>v.</i> put down by force or intimidation [keep down, quash, repress, subdue, subjugate]</p><p><i>v.</i> undergo meiosis</p><p><i>v.</i> reposition (a broken bone after surgery) back to its normal site</p><p><i>v.</i> destress and thus weaken a sound when pronouncing it</p><p><i>v.</i> reduce in scope while retaining essential elements [abbreviate, abridge, contract, cut, foreshorten, shorten]</p><p><i>v.</i> be cooked until very little liquid is left [boil down, concentrate, decoct]</p><p><i>v.</i> cook until very little liquid is left [boil down, concentrate]</p><p><i>v.</i> lessen the strength or flavor of a solution or mixture [cut, dilute, thin, thin out]</p><p><i>v.</i> take off weight [melt off, slenderize, slim, slim down, thin]</p><p><b>ograničen, oslabljen, reduciran, skraćenje, skraćenju, smanjen, smanjena</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> made less in size or amount or degree [decreased]</p><p><i>adj.</i> well below normal (especially in price) [rock-bottom]</p><p><b>(računalnička znanost) vrsta računalne arhitekture koja ima relativno mali skup računalnih instrukcija koje može izvršiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a kind of computer architecture that has a relatively small set of computer instructions that it can perform [RISC, reduced instruction set computing]</p><p><b>(računalnička znanost) vrsta računalne arhitekture koja ima relativno mali skup računalnih instrukcija koje može izvršiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a kind of computer architecture that has a relatively small set of computer instructions that it can perform [RISC, reduced instruction set computer]</p><p><b>reduktor, spoj između dvije cijevi različitog promjera</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a substance capable of bringing about the reduction of another substance as it itself is oxidized [reducing agent, reductant]</p><p><i>n.</i> pipefitting that joins two pipes of different diameter</p><p><b>koji se da reducirati, koji se da svesti, koji se može pretvoriti</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being reduced</p><p><b>rduciranje, reduciranje, smanjenja, smanjenje, smanjivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any process in which electrons are added to an atom or ion (as by removing oxygen or adding hydrogen) [reduction]</p><p><i>n.</i> loss of excess weight (as by dieting)</p><p><b>supstanca koja je sposobna dovesti do redukcije druge supstance dok se sama oksidira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a substance capable of bringing about the reduction of another substance as it itself is oxidized [reducer, reductant]</p><p><b>dijeta koja vam pomaže da smršate (posebno masnoću) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diet designed to help you lose weight (especially fat) [obesity diet]</p><p><b>supstanca koja je sposobna dovesti do redukcije druge supstance dok se sama oksidira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a substance capable of bringing about the reduction of another substance as it itself is oxidized [reducer, reducing agent]</p><p><b>reduktaza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an enzyme that catalyses the biochemical reduction of some specified substance</p><p><b>(redukcija na apsurdno) opovrgavanje pokazujući da su posljedice prijedloga apsurdne (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (reduction to the absurd) a disproof by showing that the consequences of the proposition are absurd [reductio ad absurdum]</p><p><b>(redukcija na apsurdno) opovrgavanje pokazujući da su posljedice prijedloga apsurdne (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (reduction to the absurd) a disproof by showing that the consequences of the proposition are absurd [reductio]</p><p><b>dovođenje, podjarmljivanje, popust, povlastica, preobražaj, promjena oblika, redukcija, redukcijski, redukcuja, smanjenja, smanjenje, smanjivanja, smanjivanje, snižavanje, sniženje, ugušivanje, umanjenje, reduciranje, umanjivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of decreasing or reducing something [decrease, diminution, step-down]</p><p><i>n.</i> any process in which electrons are added to an atom or ion (as by removing oxygen or adding hydrogen) [reducing]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of reducing complexity [simplification]</p><p><b>(genetika) ćelijska podjela koja proizvodi reprodukcijske stanice u spolno razmnožavajućim organizmama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (genetics) cell division that produces reproductive cells in sexually reproducing organisms [meiosis, miosis]</p><p><b>Smanjenje brzine ulaza na sporiju izlaznu brzinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> gearing that reduces an input speed to a slower output speed</p><p><b>teorija da se svi složeni sustavi mogu potpuno razumjeti u smislu njihovih komponenti, analiza složenih stvari u jednostavnije sastavne dijelove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a theory that all complex systems can be completely understood in terms of their components</p><p><i>n.</i> the analysis of complex things into simpler constituents</p><p><b>teorije redukcionizma ili s njom povezana (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the theory of reductionism</p><p><b>reduktivan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by or causing diminution or curtailment</p><p><b>minimalizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an art movement in sculpture and painting that began in the 1950s and emphasized extreme simplification of form and color [minimal art, minimalism]</p><p><b>bujica, obilatost, obilnost, obilje, suvišak, višak, redundancija, suvišnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the attribute of being superfluous and unneeded [redundancy]</p><p><b>preopširnost, redundancija, suvišnost, višak radnika, zalihost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> repetition of messages to reduce the probability of errors in transmission</p><p><i>n.</i> the attribute of being superfluous and unneeded [redundance]</p><p><i>n.</i> (electronics) a system design that duplicates components to provide alternatives in case one component fails</p><p><i>n.</i> repetition of an act needlessly</p><p><b>provjera redundancije, provjera zalihosti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system of checking for errors in computer functioning [odd-even check, parity check]</p><p><b>blagoglagoljiv, izlišan, opširan, prekomjeran, redundantan, suvišan, zalihosni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> more than is needed, desired, or required [excess, extra, spare, supererogatory, superfluous, supernumerary, surplus]</p><p><i>adj.</i> repetition of same sense in different words [pleonastic, tautologic, tautological]</p><p><b>ponavljati, ponoviti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> form by reduplication [geminate]</p><p><i>v.</i> make or do or perform again [double, duplicate, repeat, replicate]</p><p><b>anadiploza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> repetition of the final words of a sentence or line at the beginning of the next [anadiplosis]</p><p><i>n.</i> the syllable added in a reduplicated word form</p><p><i>n.</i> a word formed by or containing a repeated syllable or speech sound (usually at the beginning of the word)</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of repeating over and again (or an instance thereof) [reiteration]</p><p><b>Pravi insekt: dugonogi grabljivac koji živi uglavnom na drugim insektima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a true bug: long-legged predacious bug living mostly on other insects [assassin bug]</p><p><b>ubojice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> assassin bugs [family Reduviidae]</p><p><b>Vratio sam ga. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> brought back</p><p><b>mali drozd</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American blackbird with scarlet patches on the wings [Agelaius phoeniceus, red-winged blackbird]</p><p><i>n.</i> small European thrush having reddish flanks [Turdus iliacus]</p><p><b>sekvoja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the soft reddish wood of either of two species of sequoia trees</p><p><i>n.</i> either of two huge coniferous California trees that reach a height of 300 feet [sequoia]</p><p><b>ilijene stabla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coniferous trees [Taxodiaceae, subfamily Taxodiaceae]</p><p><b>Nacionalni park u Kaliforniji s šumom sekvoj i obalom Tihog oceana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a national park in California featuring a redwood forest and Pacific Ocean coastline</p><p><b>niskog granatnog tamnozelena grm sa grmovima cigla crveno-cvrkvih cvijeća na krajevima grana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low branching dark green shrub with bunches of brick-red flowers at ends of branches [red shrubby penstemon]</p><p><b>Echo više puta, echo opet i opet., ponavljati ili vraćati odjek ponovno ili više puta, Ponavlja se kao odjek. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> echo repeatedly, echo again and again</p><p><i>v.</i> repeat or return an echo again or repeatedly</p><p><i>v.</i> repeat back like an echo</p><p><b>(zvuci) ponavljajući se odrazom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of sounds) repeating by reflection [echoing]</p><p><b>cijev, pisak, slama, svirala, šaš, trska, trstika, glazbalo s jezičkom, glazbalo s piskom, instrument s jezičkom, instrument s piskom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall woody perennial grasses with hollow slender stems especially of the genera Arundo and Phragmites</p><p><i>n.</i> United States journalist who reported on the October Revolution from Petrograd in 1917 [John Reed]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States physician who proved that yellow fever is transmitted by mosquitoes (1851-1902) [Walter Reed]</p><p><i>n.</i> a vibrator consisting of a thin strip of stiff material that vibrates to produce a tone when air streams over it [vibrating reed]</p><p><i>n.</i> a musical instrument that sounds by means of a vibrating reed [beating-reed instrument, reed instrument]</p><p><b>močvarna strnadica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European bunting inhabiting marshy areas [Emberiza schoeniclus]</p><p><b>višegodišnje trave močvarnih livada i jarki s širokim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial grass of marshy meadows and ditches having broad leaves [Phalaris arundinacea, gardener's garters, lady's laces, ribbon grass]</p><p><b>bilo koja od različitih visokih višegodišnjih trava iz roda Calamagrostis s pernate perje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various tall perennial grasses of the genus Calamagrostis having feathery plumes</p><p><b>glazbalo s jezičkom, glazbalo s piskom, instrument s jezičkom, instrument s piskom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a musical instrument that sounds by means of a vibrating reed [beating-reed instrument, reed]</p><p><b>Visoka močvarna biljka s cilindričnim glavama sjemena koje eksplodiraju kada sazreju i ispuštaju velike količine duvana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall marsh plant with cylindrical seed heads that explode when mature shedding large quantities of down [Typha latifolia, bullrush, bulrush, cat's-tail, nailrod, reedmace]</p><p><b>Trava na pašnjaku u vlažnim mjestima širom Sjeverne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pasture grass of moist places throughout North America [Glyceria grandis]</p><p><b>instrument s klavirom za klavir u kojem se zrak pritiska kroz trske pomoću mehova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a free-reeded instrument with a piano keyboard in which air is forced through the reeds by bellows [harmonium, organ]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> organ pipe with a vibrating reed</p><p><b>Kineska dama palma sa tanjim stabljikama i finim vlaknima od Rhapis excelsa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Chinese lady palm with more slender stems and finer sheath fibers than Rhapis excelsa [Rhapis humilis, slender lady palm]</p><p><b>dio benda ili orkestra koji svira trske instrumente (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the section of a band or orchestra that plays reed instruments</p><p><b>Sastav za orgulje s tonom trske glazbe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an organ stop with the tone of a reed instrument</p><p><b>mala europska ptica koja se razmnožava među trsima i klinovima i zimi u Africi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> migratory American songbird [Dolichonyx oryzivorus, bobolink, ricebird]</p><p><i>n.</i> small European warbler that breeds among reeds and wedges and winters in Africa [Acrocephalus schoenobaenus, sedge bird, sedge warbler, sedge wren]</p><p><b>Kao trska koja je ravna i tanka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling a reed in being upright and slender [reedy]</p><p><b>Visoka močvarna biljka s cilindričnim glavama sjemena koje eksplodiraju kada sazreju i ispuštaju velike količine duvana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall marsh plant with cylindrical seed heads that explode when mature shedding large quantities of down [Typha latifolia, bullrush, bulrush, cat's-tail, nailrod, reed mace]</p><p><b>s masom od 300 mm ili većom, ali ne većom od 300 mm, Kao trska koja je ravna i tanka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a tone of a reed instrument [wheezy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling a reed in being upright and slender [reedlike]</p><p><b>greben, podvodni greben, skraćivanje jedara, skraćivanje jedara u oluji</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a submerged ridge of rock or coral near the surface of the water</p><p><i>n.</i> a rocky region in the southern Transvaal in northeastern South Africa [Rand, Witwatersrand]</p><p><i>n.</i> one of several strips across a sail that can be taken in or rolled up to lessen the area of the sail that is exposed to the wind</p><p><i>v.</i> lower and bring partially inboard</p><p><i>v.</i> roll up (a portion of a sail) in order to reduce its area</p><p><i>v.</i> reduce (a sail) by taking in a reef</p><p><b>kvadratni čvor koji se koristi u grebenu liniju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a square knot used in a reef line [flat knot]</p><p><b>na grebenima od Bermuda i Floride do sjeverne Južne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> on reefs from Bermuda and Florida to northern South America [Holocentrus coruscus]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste ribara u području Unije, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, za koje se primjenjuje odjeljak 1. točka (a) ovog članka, za koje se primjenjuje odjeljak 1. točka (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste ribara u području Unije, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> smooth dogfish of Pacific and Indian Oceans and Red Sea having white-tipped dorsal and caudal fins [Triaenodon obseus, whitetip shark]</p><p><b>onaj koji savija, domaćica, frula, joint, marica, pljuga, smijulja, truba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> marijuana leaves rolled into a cigarette for smoking [joint, marijuana cigarette, spliff, stick]</p><p><b>pun potopljenih grebena ili peska ili bazena (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> full of submerged reefs or sandbanks or shoals [shelfy, shelvy, shoaly]</p><p><b>čađ, dim, dimiti se, mirisati, neprijatni miris, para, pušiti se, smrad, smrdjeti, vonj, vonjati, zaudarati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a distinctive odor that is offensively unpleasant [fetor, foetor, malodor, malodour, mephitis, stench, stink]</p><p><i>v.</i> have an element suggestive (of something) [smack, smell]</p><p><i>v.</i> smell badly and offensively [stink]</p><p><i>v.</i> be wet with sweat or blood, as of one's face [fume]</p><p><i>v.</i> give off smoke, fumes, warm vapour, steam, etc.</p><p><b>čađ, dim, dimiti se, mirisati, neprijatni miris, para, pušiti se, smrad, smrdjeti (od &quot;reek&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> wet with secreted or exuded moisture such as sweat or tears [watery]</p><p><i>adj.</i> giving off a strong unpleasant smell</p><p><b>bubanj za namatanje, govoriti, kalem, kolebanje, kotur, namotaj, namotati, oklijevanje, okretati se, ples, rola, ruleta, špula, vitlo, vrtjeti se, zaljuljati se, bobina, kolut, ljuljati se, njihati se, oteturati, posrnuti, posrtati, teturati, zanijeti se, zanjihati se, zanositi se, zateturati, kovitlati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a roll of photographic film holding a series of frames to be projected by a movie projector</p><p><i>n.</i> music composed for dancing a reel</p><p><i>n.</i> winder consisting of a revolving spool with a handle</p><p><i>n.</i> a winder around which thread or tape or film or other flexible materials can be wound [bobbin, spool]</p><p><i>n.</i> a lively dance of Scottish Highlanders [Scottish reel]</p><p><i>n.</i> an American country dance which starts with the couples facing each other in two lines [Virginia reel]</p><p><i>v.</i> walk as if unable to control one's movements [careen, keel, lurch, stagger, swag]</p><p><i>v.</i> revolve quickly and repeatedly around one's own axis [gyrate, spin, spin around, whirl]</p><p><i>v.</i> wind onto or off a reel</p><p><b>odmotati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> unwind from or as if from a reel [unreel]</p><p><i>v.</i> recite volubly or extravagantly [rattle down, rattle off, roll off, spiel off]</p><p><b>ponovno izabrati. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> elect again [return]</p><p><b>reizbor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> election again</p><p><b>bubanj za namatanje, govoriti, kalem, kolebanje, kotur, namotaj, namotati, oklijevanje, okretati se, ples, rola, ruleta, špula, vitlo, vrtjeti se, zaljuljati se (od &quot;reel&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who walks unsteadily as if about to fall [staggerer, totterer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a dancer of reels</p><p><b>ponovno izvesti ili izvesti, ponovo donijeti., -Pogrešno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> enact or perform again</p><p><i>v.</i> enact again</p><p><i>v.</i> act out [act out, enact]</p><p><b>Izvršavanje uloge u događaju koji se dogodio u ranijem trenutku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> performing a role in an event that occurred at an earlier time</p><p><b>osoba koja glumi ulogu u događaju koji se dogodio ranije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who enacts a role in an event that occurred earlier</p><p><b>očvršćivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make stronger [reinforce]</p><p><b>Informacije koje čine više snažno ili uvjerljivo, vojna operacija (često uključuje nove zalihe ljudi i materijala) za jačanje vojne snage ili pomoć u obavljanju njezine misije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> information that makes more forcible or convincing [reinforcement]</p><p><i>n.</i> a military operation (often involving new supplies of men and materiel) to strengthen a military force or aid in the performance of its mission [reinforcement, support]</p><p><b>Obnovljeno upisovanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a renewed enlistment</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je to samo jedan od glavnih elemenata u ovom broju, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, to znači da se ne primjenjuje samo na jedan od tih elemenata. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an interior angle of a polygon that is greater than 180 degrees [reentrant angle]</p><p><b>polugon s jednim ili više ulaznih uglova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a polygon with one or more reentrant angles [reentrant polygon]</p><p><b>kojeg mogu koristiti više korisnika</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of angles) pointing inward [re-entrant]</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je to samo jedan od glavnih elemenata u ovom broju, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, to znači da se ne primjenjuje samo na jedan od tih elemenata. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an interior angle of a polygon that is greater than 180 degrees [reentering angle]</p><p><b>polugon s jednim ili više ulaznih uglova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a polygon with one or more reentrant angles [reentering polygon]</p><p><b>Pitanje: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of entering again</p><p><b>vratiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bring back into original existence, use, function, or position [reinstate, restore]</p><p><b>Ovim se mjerodavnim postupkom može osigurati da se ne dovodi u pitanje članak 2. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> revise or renew one's assessment [reassess]</p><p><b>ocjenjivanje nečega drugi put (ili više) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the evaluation of something a second time (or more)</p><p><b>upravnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> female ruff</p><p><i>v.</i> pass a rope through</p><p><i>v.</i> pass through a hole or opening</p><p><i>v.</i> fasten by passing through a hole or around something</p><p><b>kontrola</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) questioning of a witness by the party that called the witness after that witness has been subject to cross-examination [redirect examination]</p><p><i>n.</i> a subsequent examination of a patient for the purpose of monitoring earlier treatment [follow-up, followup, review]</p><p><b>ponovo istražiti, preispitati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> look at again [review]</p><p><b>sudac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (sports) the chief official (as in boxing or American football) who is expected to ensure fair play [referee]</p><p><b>Ponovo se sastavljam. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> assembling again [reassembly]</p><p><b>obući novu obluku., Obezbediti novi obličje (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put a new facing on (a garment)</p><p><i>v.</i> provide with a new facing</p><p><b>napraviti novi (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make new [make over, redo, remake]</p><p><b>lak obrok ili obrok (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a light meal or repast</p><p><b>refektorij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a communal dining-hall (usually in a monastery)</p><p><b>dug i uski stol za jelo podržan nosiljkom između dva trska (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long narrow dining table supported by a stretcher between two trestles</p><p><b>navesti, obratiti se, odnositi se, odnositi se na, označavati, pozivati se, pozivati se na, pozvati se na, predati, prikupiti, priopćiti, pripasti, pripisati, slati, spomenuti, spominjati, upućivati, uputiti, uputiti na, referati se, ticati se, vrijediti, odnositi, denotirati, označiti, značiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make reference to [advert, bring up, cite, mention, name]</p><p><i>v.</i> be relevant to [bear on, come to, concern, have to do with, pertain, relate, touch, touch on]</p><p><i>v.</i> think of, regard, or classify under a subsuming principle or with a general group or in relation to another</p><p><i>v.</i> send or direct for treatment, information, or a decision</p><p><i>v.</i> seek information from [consult, look up]</p><p><i>v.</i> have as a meaning [denote]</p><p><i>v.</i> use a name to designate</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je to primjenjivo na sve države članice, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being assigned or credited to [ascribable, due, imputable]</p><p><b>arbitar, arbitražni sudac, sudac, sudac (sport), arbitražni sud, ocjenjivač, recenzent</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (sports) the chief official (as in boxing or American football) who is expected to ensure fair play [ref]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who reads manuscripts and judges their suitability for publication [reader, reviewer]</p><p><i>n.</i> an attorney appointed by a court to investigate and report on a case</p><p><i>v.</i> be a referee or umpire in a sports competition [umpire]</p><p><i>v.</i> evaluate professionally a colleague's work [peer review]</p><p><b>suđenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of umpiring [officiating, officiation, umpirage]</p><p><b>aluzija, nagovještaj, napomena, obavijest, obraćanje, odnos, pozivanje, preporuka, referenca, referentan, smjeranje, upućivanje, uputa, uputnica, veza, referencija, referencu, referentna, referentne, citat, osnova, referentna točka, točka orijentacije, literatura, priručnik, referentna knjiga, referentno djelo, konzultacija, konzultiranje, provjeravanje, izvor, adresa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a remark that calls attention to something or someone [mention]</p><p><i>n.</i> a short note recognizing a source of information or of a quoted passage [acknowledgment, citation, cite, credit, mention, quotation]</p><p><i>n.</i> an indicator that orients you generally [point of reference, reference point]</p><p><i>n.</i> a book to which you can refer for authoritative facts [book of facts, reference book, reference work]</p><p><i>n.</i> a formal recommendation by a former employer to a potential future employer describing the person's qualifications and dependability [character, character reference]</p><p><i>n.</i> the most direct or specific meaning of a word or expression [denotation, extension]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of referring or consulting [consultation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a publication (or a passage from a publication) that is referred to [source]</p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) the code that identifies where a piece of information is stored [address, computer address]</p><p><i>n.</i> the relation between a word or phrase and the object or idea it refers to</p><p><i>v.</i> refer to [cite]</p><p><b>priručnik, literatura, referentna knjiga, referentno djelo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a book to which you can refer for authoritative facts [book of facts, reference, reference work]</p><p><b>koordinatni sistem, koordinatni sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system that uses coordinates to establish position [coordinate system, frame of reference, reference system]</p><p><b>uzorak horizontalnih i vertikalnih crta koji pružaju koordinate za lociranje točaka na slici ili mapi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pattern of horizontal and vertical lines that provide coordinates for locating points on an image or a map</p><p><b>priručnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a manual containing information organized in a summary manner</p><p><b>referentna točka, osnova, referenca, točka orijentacije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an indicator that orients you generally [point of reference, reference]</p><p><b>koordinatni sistem, koordinatni sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system that uses coordinates to establish position [coordinate system, frame of reference, reference frame]</p><p><b>literatura, priručnik, referentna knjiga, referentno djelo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a book to which you can refer for authoritative facts [book of facts, reference, reference book]</p><p><b>povezan, upućen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> supported with written references or citations</p><p><b>referendum</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a legislative act is referred for final approval to a popular vote by the electorate</p><p><b>referent, referentan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something referred to</p><p><i>n.</i> the first term in a proposition</p><p><i>n.</i> something that refers</p><p><i>adj.</i> having reference</p><p><b>referencijalni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> referring or pointing to something</p><p><b>upućivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person whose case has been referred to a specialist or professional group</p><p><i>n.</i> a recommendation to consult the (professional) person or group to whom one has been referred</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of referring (as forwarding an applicant for employment or referring a matter to an appropriate agency)</p><p><b>bol koja se osjeća na drugom mjestu tijela od ozlijeđenog ili bolesnog dijela gdje bi bol bila očekivana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pain that is felt at a place in the body different from the injured or diseased part where the pain would be expected</p><p><b>uložak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a prescription drug that is provided again</p><p><i>n.</i> a commercial product that refills a container with its appropriate contents</p><p><i>v.</i> fill something that had previously been emptied [fill again, replenish]</p><p><b>uložak (od &quot;refill&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> filling again by supplying what has been used up [renewal, replacement, replenishment]</p><p><b>refinanciranje</b></p><p><i>v.</i> renew the financing of</p><p><b>očistiti, plemenit, prečistiti, preraditi, pročistiti, usavršiti se, dotjerati, dotjerivati, ispolirati, laštiti, naštimati, naštimavati, polirati, pročišćavati, pročišćivati, rafinirati, svjetlati, ugladiti, uglađivati, ulaštiti, usavršavati, usavršiti, uštimati, uštimavati, čistiti, elaborirati, obogatiti, obogaćivati, razraditi, razrađivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> improve or perfect by pruning or polishing [down, fine-tune, polish]</p><p><i>v.</i> make more complex, intricate, or richer [complicate, elaborate, rarify]</p><p><i>v.</i> treat or prepare so as to put in a usable condition</p><p><i>v.</i> reduce to a fine, unmixed, or pure state [rectify]</p><p><i>v.</i> attenuate or reduce in vigor, strength, or intensity by polishing or purifying</p><p><i>v.</i> make more precise or increase the discriminatory powers of</p><p><b>fin, oplemenjen, otmjen čovjek, poboljšan, prečišćen, prefinjen, rafiniran, uglađen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of persons and their behavior) cultivated and genteel</p><p><i>adj.</i> freed from impurities by processing [processed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing a high degree of refinement and the assurance that comes from wide social experience [polished, urbane]</p><p><i>adj.</i> precise to a fine degree</p><p><i>adj.</i> suggesting taste, ease, and wealth [elegant, graceful]</p><p><b>prerađeni šećer, rafinirani šećer, šećer</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white crystalline carbohydrate used as a sweetener and preservative [sugar]</p><p><b>istančanost, otmjenost, prečišćavanje, prerada, rafiniranje, uglađenost, usavršavanje, usklađivanja, usklađivanje, nijansa, ton</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a highly developed state of perfection [cultivation, culture, finish, polish]</p><p><i>n.</i> the result of improving something [elaboration]</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of removing impurities (as from oil or metals or sugar etc.) [purification, refining]</p><p><i>n.</i> a subtle difference in meaning or opinion or attitude [nicety, nuance, shade, subtlety]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of excellence in thought and manners and taste [civilisation, civilization]</p><p><b>rafiner</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one whose work is to refine a specific thing</p><p><b>rafinerija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an industrial plant for purifying a crude substance</p><p><b>čišćenje naftnih proizvoda, prerađivanje nafte</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of removing impurities (as from oil or metals or sugar etc.) [purification, refinement]</p><p><b>industrija koja proizvodi i isporučuje naftu i naftne proizvode (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an industry that produces and delivers oil and oil products [oil business, oil industry]</p><p><b>dati novu površinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> give a new surface</p><p><b>restaurator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a skilled worker who is employed to restore or refinish buildings or antique furniture [preserver, renovator, restorer]</p><p><b>oprema, podesiti, popravak, prepraviti, prepravka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> outfitting a ship again (by repairing or replacing parts)</p><p><i>v.</i> fit out again</p><p><b>Ekonomika: reflacija iskustva, ekonomija: povećati potražnju, proširiti snabdijevanje novcem ili povećati cijene nakon perioda deflacije, opet napuniti., opet se napipaju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> economics: experience reflation</p><p><i>v.</i> economics: raise demand, expand the money supply, or raise prices, after a period of deflation</p><p><i>v.</i> inflate again</p><p><i>v.</i> become inflated again</p><p><b>oživljavanje ekonomije, reflacija, uzlet gospodarstva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflation of currency after a period of deflation</p><p><b>baciti sjenku, iskazivati, odbijati, odbijati se, odraz, odraziti, odražavati, održavati, prikazivati, razmisliti, razmišljati, reflektirati, kontemplirati, meditirati, misliti, mozgati, promisliti, promišljati, promozgati, razmatrati, razmotriti, sjajiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> manifest or bring back</p><p><i>v.</i> reflect deeply on a subject [chew over, contemplate, excogitate, meditate, mull, mull over, muse, ponder, ruminate, speculate, think over]</p><p><i>v.</i> to throw or bend back (from a surface) [reverberate]</p><p><i>v.</i> be bright by reflecting or casting light [shine]</p><p><i>v.</i> show an image of</p><p><i>v.</i> give evidence of a certain behavior</p><p><i>v.</i> give evidence of the quality of</p><p><b>dio zračne energije koja se odražava s površine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the fraction of radiant energy that is reflected from a surface [coefficient of reflection, reflection factor, reflectivity]</p><p><b>odbija, odbijene, odražen, reflektiran, reflektirane</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (especially of incident sound or light) bent or sent back</p><p><b>odbijanja</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing reflection or having a device that reflects</p><p><b>reflektorski teleskop</b></p><p><i>n.</i> optical telescope consisting of a large concave mirror that produces an image that is magnified by the eyepiece [reflector]</p><p><b>mrlja, odbijanje, odbljesak, odjeka, odraz, odsjaj, prikaz, razmatranje, razmišljanje, refleksija, refleksije, sjenka, ekspresija, izraz, manifestacija, pokazatelj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a calm, lengthy, intent consideration [contemplation, musing, reflexion, rumination, thoughtfulness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the phenomenon of a propagating wave (light or sound) being thrown back from a surface [reflexion]</p><p><i>n.</i> expression without words [expression, manifestation, reflexion]</p><p><i>n.</i> a likeness in which left and right are reversed [mirror image, reflexion]</p><p><i>n.</i> the image of something as reflected by a mirror (or other reflective material) [reflexion]</p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) a transformation in which the direction of one axis is reversed</p><p><i>n.</i> a remark expressing careful consideration [observation, reflexion]</p><p><i>n.</i> the ability to reflect beams or rays [reflectivity, reflexion]</p><p><b>dio zračne energije koja se odražava s površine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the fraction of radiant energy that is reflected from a surface [coefficient of reflection, reflectance, reflectivity]</p><p><b>koji odbija, koji razmišlja, reflektirajuća, reflektirajući, zamišljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> deeply or seriously thoughtful [brooding, broody, contemplative, meditative, musing, pensive, pondering, ruminative]</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of physically reflecting light or sound</p><p><i>adj.</i> devoted to matters of the mind</p><p><b>albedo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of reflected to incident light [albedo]</p><p><b>koji odbija, koji razmišlja, reflektirajuća, reflektirajući, zamišljen (od &quot;reflective&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a reflective manner</p><p><b>koji odbija, koji razmišlja, reflektirajuća, reflektirajući, zamišljen (od &quot;reflective&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capability of quiet thought or contemplation [reflectivity]</p><p><b>reflektivnost, svojstvo odbijanja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the fraction of radiant energy that is reflected from a surface [coefficient of reflection, reflectance, reflection factor]</p><p><i>n.</i> the ability to reflect beams or rays [reflection, reflexion]</p><p><i>n.</i> the capability of quiet thought or contemplation [reflectiveness]</p><p><b>reflektometar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a meter that measures the reflectance of a surface</p><p><b>reflektor, reflektora, reflektorski teleskop</b></p><p><i>n.</i> device that reflects radiation</p><p><i>n.</i> optical telescope consisting of a large concave mirror that produces an image that is magnified by the eyepiece [reflecting telescope]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se ne primjenjuje, to znači da se ne primjenjuje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> provide with reflectors, such as chemicals [reflectorize]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se ne primjenjuje, to znači da se ne primjenjuje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> provide with reflectors, such as chemicals [reflectorise]</p><p><b>koji odražava, odbljesak, odraz, odsjaj, odsjev, refleks, refleksivan, bezuvjetni refleks, fiziološka reakcija, instinktivni refleks, prirođeni refleks, urođeni refleks</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an automatic instinctive unlearned reaction to a stimulus [inborn reflex, innate reflex, instinctive reflex, physiological reaction, reflex action, reflex response, unconditioned reflex]</p><p><i>adj.</i> without volition or conscious control [automatic, reflexive]</p><p><b>bezuvjetni refleks, fiziološka reakcija, instinktivni refleks, prirođeni refleks, refleks, urođeni refleks</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an automatic instinctive unlearned reaction to a stimulus [inborn reflex, innate reflex, instinctive reflex, physiological reaction, reflex, reflex response, unconditioned reflex]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an angle greater than 180 degrees (but less than 360)</p><p><b>Neuralni put refleksnog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the neural path of a reflex</p><p><b>Kamera koja omogućuje fotografu da vidi i usmjeri tačnu scenu koju fotografira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> camera that allows the photographer to view and focus the exact scene being photographed</p><p><b>oblik epilepsije u kojoj su napadi izazvani perifernom stimulacijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of epilepsy in which attacks are induced by peripheral stimulation</p><p><b>bezuvjetni refleks, fiziološka reakcija, instinktivni refleks, prirođeni refleks, refleks, urođeni refleks</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an automatic instinctive unlearned reaction to a stimulus [inborn reflex, innate reflex, instinctive reflex, physiological reaction, reflex, reflex action, unconditioned reflex]</p><p><b>koji odražava, odbljesak, odraz, odsjaj, odsjev, refleks, refleksivan (od &quot;reflex&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of leaves) bent downward and outward more than 90 degrees</p><p><b>refleksija, ekspresija, izraz, manifestacija, odraz, pokazatelj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the phenomenon of a propagating wave (light or sound) being thrown back from a surface [reflection]</p><p><i>n.</i> expression without words [expression, manifestation, reflection]</p><p><i>n.</i> a remark expressing careful consideration [observation, reflection]</p><p><i>n.</i> a calm, lengthy, intent consideration [contemplation, musing, reflection, rumination, thoughtfulness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the ability to reflect beams or rays [reflection, reflectivity]</p><p><i>n.</i> a likeness in which left and right are reversed [mirror image, reflection]</p><p><i>n.</i> the image of something as reflected by a mirror (or other reflective material) [reflection]</p><p><b>povratan, refleksivan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a personal pronoun compounded with -self to show the agent's action affects the agent [reflexive pronoun]</p><p><i>adj.</i> without volition or conscious control [automatic, reflex]</p><p><i>adj.</i> referring back to itself [self-referent]</p><p><b>osobni zamjenik sa -self da pokaže da djelovanje agenta utječe na agenta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a personal pronoun compounded with -self to show the agent's action affects the agent [reflexive]</p><p><b>povratni glagol, refleksivni glagol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a verb whose agent performs an action that is directed at the agent</p><p><b>refleksivan</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a reflexive manner [reflexly]</p><p><b>povratan, refleksivan (od &quot;reflexive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the coreferential relation between a reflexive pronoun and its antecedent [reflexivity]</p><p><i>n.</i> (logic and mathematics) a relation such that it holds between an element and itself [reflexivity]</p><p><b>refleksivnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the coreferential relation between a reflexive pronoun and its antecedent [reflexiveness]</p><p><i>n.</i> (logic and mathematics) a relation such that it holds between an element and itself [reflexiveness]</p><p><b>koji odražava, odbljesak, odraz, odsjaj, odsjev, refleks, refleksivan (od &quot;reflex&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a reflexive manner [reflexively]</p><p><b>proučavanje refleksnog djelovanja u odnosu na ponašanje organizama, masaža za ublažavanje napetosti pritiskom prstiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the study of reflex action as it relates to the behavior of organisms</p><p><i>n.</i> massage to relieve tension by finger pressure</p><p><b>opet na površini. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> set afloat again</p><p><b>vraćanje natrag, vraćati natrag</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal backward flow of body fluids</p><p><i>n.</i> the outward flow of the tide [ebb]</p><p><b>Kondenzator tako da se para iznad vrele tekućine kondenzira i vraća u posudu kako bi se spriječio suho vrelo sadržaje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> condenser such that vapor over a boiling liquid is condensed and flows back into the vessel to prevent its contents from boiling dry</p><p><b>Osredotoči se još jednom., Osredotoči se ponovo., ponovno usmjeriti ili usmjeriti oštrije (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> focus once again</p><p><i>v.</i> focus anew</p><p><i>v.</i> put again into focus or focus more sharply</p><p><b>ponovno se usredotočiti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> focusing again</p><p><b>Šuma ponovo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> forest anew</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste šuma u kojima se koristi šuma u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste šuma u kojima se koristi šuma u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći postupak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the restoration (replanting) of a forest that had been reduced by fire or cutting [re-afforestation]</p><p><b>nova glumačka ekipa ili novi model (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cast or model anew [recast, remodel]</p><p><b>poboljšati, popraviti se, preinačiti, preoblikovati, prepravka, preurediti, preustrojiti, preustrojstvo, reforma, reforme, reformirati, urediti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a change for the better as a result of correcting abuses</p><p><i>n.</i> a campaign aimed to correct abuses or malpractices</p><p><i>n.</i> self-improvement in behavior or morals by abandoning some vice</p><p><i>v.</i> make changes for improvement in order to remove abuse and injustices</p><p><i>v.</i> bring, lead, or force to abandon a wrong or evil course of life, conduct, and adopt a right one [reclaim, rectify, regenerate]</p><p><i>v.</i> produce by cracking</p><p><i>v.</i> break up the molecules of</p><p><i>v.</i> improve by alteration or correction of errors or defects and put into a better condition</p><p><i>v.</i> change for the better [see the light, straighten out]</p><p><b>liberalni Židov koji pokušava prilagoditi sve aspekte judaizma modernim okolnostima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> liberal Jew who tries to adapt all aspects of Judaism to modern circumstances</p><p><b>Najliberalniji Židovi., vjerovanja i prakse reformiranih Židova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the most liberal Jews</p><p><i>n.</i> beliefs and practices of Reform Jews</p><p><b>Pokret namijenjen društvenim i humanitarnim reformama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a movement intended to bring about social and humanitarian reforms</p><p><b>Upravni odbor za odbranu i disciplinu i obuku mladih ili prvih prestupnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> correctional institution for the detention and discipline and training of young or first offenders [reformatory, training school]</p><p><b>podržavanje ili promicanje reformi (često vladinim djelovanjem) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> favoring or promoting reform (often by government action) [progressive, reformist]</p><p><b>Sposobnost poboljšanja ili reforme (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> susceptible to improvement or reform [redeemable]</p><p><b>ispravljanje, poboljšanje, preinačenje, preustrojstvo, reformacija, reformacijski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> improvement (or an intended improvement) in the existing form or condition of institutions or practices etc.</p><p><i>n.</i> a religious movement of the 16th century that began as an attempt to reform the Roman Catholic Church and resulted in the creation of Protestant churches [Protestant Reformation]</p><p><i>n.</i> rescuing from error and returning to a rightful course [reclamation]</p><p><b>koji imaju tendenciju na reformu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to reform [reformatory]</p><p><b>popravni dom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> correctional institution for the detention and discipline and training of young or first offenders [reform school, training school]</p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to reform [reformative]</p><p><b>poboljšati, popraviti se, preinačiti, preoblikovati, prepravka, preurediti, preustrojiti, preustrojstvo, reforma, reforme, reformirati, urediti (od &quot;reform&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the body of Protestant Christianity arising during the Reformation</p><p><i>adj.</i> caused to abandon an evil manner of living and follow a good one</p><p><b>pristaše reforme, reformator, reformatora</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disputant who advocates reform [crusader, meliorist, reformist, social reformer]</p><p><i>n.</i> an apparatus that reforms the molecular structure of hydrocarbons to produce richer fuel</p><p><b>Nauka o reformi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a doctrine of reform</p><p><b>reformator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disputant who advocates reform [crusader, meliorist, reformer, social reformer]</p><p><i>adj.</i> favoring or promoting reform (often by government action) [progressive, reform-minded]</p><p><b>preformulirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> formulate or develop again, of an improved theory or hypothesis [redevelop]</p><p><b>lomiti zrake, prelamati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> subject to refraction</p><p><i>v.</i> determine the refracting power of (a lens)</p><p><b>od ili povezane s ili sposobne za lomljenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or capable of refraction [refractive]</p><p><b>optički teleskop koji ima veliku konveksnu sočivo koja proizvodi sliku koja se gleda kroz okular (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> optical telescope that has a large convex lens that produces an image that is viewed through the eyepiece</p><p><b>lom, lomljenje, prelamanje, refrakcija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the change in direction of a propagating wave (light or sound) when passing from one medium to another</p><p><i>n.</i> the amount by which a propagating wave is bent [deflection, deflexion]</p><p><b>refraktivan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or capable of refraction [refractile]</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of changing the direction (of a light or sound wave) [deflective]</p><p><b>indeks loma, indeks refrakcije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of the velocity of light in a vacuum to that in a medium [index of refraction]</p><p><b>refraktivan (od &quot;refractive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the physical property of a medium as determined by its index of refraction [refractivity]</p><p><b>refraktivnost, svojstvo prelamanja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the physical property of a medium as determined by its index of refraction [refractiveness]</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je to samo jedan od glavnih elemenata u ovom poglavlju, ne smije se upotrebljavati za proizvodnju električnih vozila. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> measuring instrument for measuring the refractive index of a substance</p><p><b>osobina neovlaštene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being unmanageable [recalcitrance, recalcitrancy, unmanageableness]</p><p><b>građevinski materijal, otpor na vatru, tvrdoglav, uporan, vatrostalan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lining consisting of material with a high melting point [furnace lining]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not responding to treatment [stubborn]</p><p><i>adj.</i> temporarily unresponsive or not fully responsive to a process or stimulus</p><p><i>adj.</i> stubbornly resistant to authority or control [fractious, recalcitrant]</p><p><b>bilo koje od različitih anemijskih stanja koja se ne mogu uspješno liječiti drugim sredstvima osim transfuzijom krvi (i koja nisu povezana s drugom primarnom bolešću) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various anemic conditions that are not successfully treated by any means other than blood transfusions (and that are not associated with another primary disease) [refractory anemia]</p><p><b>bilo koje od različitih anemijskih stanja koja se ne mogu uspješno liječiti drugim sredstvima osim transfuzijom krvi (i koja nisu povezana s drugom primarnom bolešću) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various anemic conditions that are not successfully treated by any means other than blood transfusions (and that are not associated with another primary disease) [refractory anaemia]</p><p><b>(neurologija) vrijeme nakon što se neuron zapali ili mišićno vlakno skuplja tijekom kojeg podsticaj neće izazvati odgovor (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (neurology) the time after a neuron fires or a muscle fiber contracts during which a stimulus will not evoke a response</p><p><b>U slučaju da je proizvod izravno proizveden iz materijala koji se koristi za proizvodnju, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (b) ovog članka, to je: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small porous bowl made of bone ash used in assaying to separate precious metals from e.g. lead [bone-ash cup, cupel]</p><p><b>(od peći) obložene materijalom koji ima visoku točku topljenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of furnaces) lined with material that has a high melting point</p><p><b>lom (koštana) koja je prije bila slomljena, ali se neobično popravila (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> break (a bone) that was previously broken but mended in an abnormal way</p><p><b>obuzdati, pripjev, refren, suzdržati se, uzdržati se, zadržavati, obuzdati se, obuzdavati, obuzdavati se, odustajati, odustati, sprečavati, spriječiti, suzdržati, suzdržavati, suzdržavati se, zaustaviti, zaustaviti se, zaustavljati, zaustavljati se, apstinirati, kloniti se, odreći se, odricati se, suzdržati se od, uzdržavati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of a song where a soloist is joined by a group of singers [chorus]</p><p><i>v.</i> resist doing something [forbear]</p><p><i>v.</i> choose not to consume [abstain, desist]</p><p><b>obnoviti, okrijepiti, 