i>n.</i> (medicine) a systematic plan for therapy (often including diet) [regimen]</p><p><b>upravljanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (medicine) a systematic plan for therapy (often including diet) [regime]</p><p><b>mnoštvo, puk, pukovnija, veliki broj, regimenta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> army unit smaller than a division</p><p><i>v.</i> subject to rigid discipline, order, and systematization</p><p><i>v.</i> form (military personnel) into a regiment</p><p><i>v.</i> assign to a regiment</p><p><b>pukovski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging to or concerning a regiment</p><p><b>pukovski (od &quot;regimental&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a regimental manner or by regiments</p><p><b>pukovski (od &quot;regimental&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the military uniform and insignia of a regiment</p><p><b>primjena naloga ili discipline (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the imposition of order or discipline</p><p><b>mnoštvo, puk, pukovnija, veliki broj (od &quot;regiment&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> strictly controlled</p><p><b>Glavni grad provincije Saskatchewan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the provincial capital of Saskatchewan</p><p><b>Engleski glumac na pozornici i u filmovima (1908-1990) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English actor on stage and in films (1908-1990) [Harrison, Rex Harrison, Sir Rex Harrison]</p><p><b>Engleski inženjer zrakoplovstva (1895-1937) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English aeronautical engineer (1895-1937) [Mitchell, R. J. Mitchell]</p><p><b>Američki slikar (1898-1954) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States painter (1898-1954) [Marsh]</p><p><b>Njemački matematičar i astronom (1436-1476) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German mathematician and astronomer (1436-1476) [Johann Muller, Muller]</p><p><b>kraj, oblast, okolica, okolina, okrug, područje, pokrajina, predio, predjel, prostor, rajon, regija, sfera, kraja, okolice, područja, području, regije, regiji, regiju, dio</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the extended spatial location of something [part]</p><p><i>n.</i> a part of an animal that has a special function or is supplied by a given artery or nerve [area]</p><p><i>n.</i> a large indefinite location on the surface of the Earth</p><p><i>n.</i> the approximate amount of something (usually used prepositionally as in `in the region of') [neighborhood]</p><p><i>n.</i> a knowledge domain that you are interested in or are communicating about [realm]</p><p><b>lokalni, mjesni, okružni, područni, regionalni, zavičajni, Regionalnom, regionalna, regionalne, regionalnih, regionalnim, regionalnog, regionalnoj, regionalan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of a region</p><p><i>adj.</i> related or limited to a particular region</p><p><b>gubitak osjećaja u određenom dijelu tijela uzrokovan primjenom anestetika na sve živce koji opskrbljuju taj dio tijela (kao kada se epiduralni anestetik daje u karlični dio tijekom porođaja) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> loss of sensation in a region of the body produced by application of an anesthetic agent to all the nerves supplying that region (as when an epidural anesthetic is administered to the pelvic region during childbirth) [regional anesthesia]</p><p><b>proučavanje anatomije na temelju područja ili podjela tijela i naglašavajući odnose između različitih struktura (mišića i živaca i arterija itd.) u tom području (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the study of anatomy based on regions or divisions of the body and emphasizing the relations between various structures (muscles and nerves and arteries etc.) in that region [topographic anatomy, topology]</p><p><b>gubitak osjećaja u određenom dijelu tijela uzrokovan primjenom anestetika na sve živce koji opskrbljuju taj dio tijela (kao kada se epiduralni anestetik daje u karlični dio tijekom porođaja) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> loss of sensation in a region of the body produced by application of an anesthetic agent to all the nerves supplying that region (as when an epidural anesthetic is administered to the pelvic region during childbirth) [regional anaesthesia]</p><p><b>ozbiljna hronična i progresivna upala ileuma koja uzrokuje česte napade proljeva s bolovima u trbuhu i mučnino, groznicom i gubitkom težine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a serious chronic and progressive inflammation of the ileum producing frequent bouts of diarrhea with abdominal pain and nausea and fever and weight loss [Crohn's disease, regional ileitis]</p><p><b>ozbiljna hronična i progresivna upala ileuma koja uzrokuje česte napade proljeva s bolovima u trbuhu i mučnino, groznicom i gubitkom težine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a serious chronic and progressive inflammation of the ileum producing frequent bouts of diarrhea with abdominal pain and nausea and fever and weight loss [Crohn's disease, regional enteritis]</p><p><b>regionalizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feature (as a pronunciation or expression or custom) that is characteristic of a particular region</p><p><i>n.</i> a foreign policy that defines the international interests of a country in terms of particular geographic areas</p><p><i>n.</i> loyalty to the interests of a particular region</p><p><b>lokalni, mjesni, okružni, područni, regionalni, zavičajni, Regionalnom, regionalna, regionalne, regionalnih, regionalnim, regionalnog, regionalnoj (od &quot;regional&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a regional manner</p><p><b>dnevnik, evidencija, evidentirati, iskaz, izraziti, matica, opis, popis, preporučiti, prijaviti, prozivnik, registar, registrirati, spisak, spremnik, upisati, upisnik, urezati, urudžbirati, uvesti, zabilježiti, zapisati, prijaviti se, registrirati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an official written record of names or events or transactions [registry]</p><p><i>n.</i> (music) the timbre that is characteristic of a certain range and manner of production of the human voice or of different pipe organ stops or of different musical instruments</p><p><i>n.</i> a book in which names and transactions are listed</p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) memory device that is the part of computer memory that has a specific address and that is used to hold information of a specific kind</p><p><i>n.</i> an air passage (usually in the floor or a wall of a room) for admitting or excluding heated air from the room</p><p><i>n.</i> a regulator (as a sliding plate) for regulating the flow of air into a furnace or other heating device</p><p><i>n.</i> a cashbox with an adding machine to register transactions [cash register]</p><p><i>v.</i> record in writing</p><p><i>v.</i> record in a public office or in a court of law [file]</p><p><i>v.</i> enroll to vote</p><p><i>v.</i> be aware of [record]</p><p><i>v.</i> indicate a certain reading [read, record, show]</p><p><i>v.</i> have one's name listed as a candidate for several parties [cross-file]</p><p><i>v.</i> show in one's face</p><p><i>v.</i> manipulate the registers of an organ</p><p><i>v.</i> send by registered mail</p><p><i>v.</i> enter into someone's consciousness</p><p><b>jezik tonova koji koristi različite glasovne registre (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tone language that uses different voice registers</p><p><b>preporučen, prijavljen, proveden u knjige, registriran, upisan, zabilježen, registriranih, registriranim, registrirano</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of animals) officially recorded with or certified by a recognized breed association</p><p><i>adj.</i> listed or recorded officially</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a boat or vessel) furnished with necessary official documents specifying ownership etc</p><p><b>U slučaju da je vrijednost obveznice u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 3. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 3. točkom (a) ove Uredbe, vrijednost obveznice u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ove Uredbe ne može biti u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ove Uredbe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bond whose owner is recorded on the books of the issuer</p><p><b>preporučena pošta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mail that is registered by the post office when sent in order to assure safe delivery [registered post]</p><p><b>medicinska sestra koja je prošla ispite za registraciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a graduate nurse who has passed examinations for registration [RN]</p><p><b>Pošta koju je pošta registrirala kada je poslala kako bi se osigurala sigurna isporuka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mail that is registered by the post office when sent in order to assure safe delivery [registered mail]</p><p><b>osoba koja je odgovorna za račun klijenta za oglašivačku agenciju ili posredništvo ili drugo poslovanje u području usluga. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone in charge of a client's account for an advertising agency or brokerage or other service business [account executive, account representative, customer's broker, customer's man]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je vrijednost "B" vrijednost "C" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "C" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "C" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "C" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost "D" vrijednost " (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a security whose owner's name is recorded on the books of the issuer (or issuer's agent)</p><p><b>osoba koja je formalno upisana (zajedno s drugima) u registar (i koja time dobiva određena prava) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is formally entered (along with others) in a register (and who obtains certain rights thereby)</p><p><b>matičar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person employed to keep a record of the owners of stocks and bonds issued by the company</p><p><i>n.</i> the administrator responsible for student records</p><p><i>n.</i> someone responsible for keeping records [record-keeper, recorder]</p><p><b>evidentiranje, prijava, prijava adrese, prijavljivanje, registracija, registracijski, uknjižba, unošenje, upis, upisivanje, podešavanje, usklađivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of enrolling [enrollment, enrolment]</p><p><i>n.</i> the body of people (such as students) who register or enroll at the same time [enrollment]</p><p><i>n.</i> a document certifying an act of registering</p><p><i>n.</i> (music) the sound property resulting from a combination of organ stops used to perform a particular piece of music</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of adjusting something to match a standard [adjustment, readjustment]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to potrebno za izvršenje operacije, upotreba je ograničena na: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fire delivered to obtain accurate data for subsequent effective engagement of targets</p><p><b>matični broj, prijavni broj, registracijski broj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the number on the license plate that identifies the car that bears it [license number]</p><p><b>datoteka za registraciju, dnevnik, matični ure, registar, upisivanje, urudžbeni zapisnik, zapisivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an official written record of names or events or transactions [register]</p><p><b>nositelj britanskog profesorstva koje je stvorio kraljevski pokrovitelj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> holder of a British professorship created by a royal patron</p><p><b>vrsta rod Regalecidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Regalecidae [genus Regalecus]</p><p><b>vladajući</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> exercising power or authority [reigning, ruling]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, podrijetlo za proizvodnju proizvoda iz područja primjene Uredbe (EZ) br. 1236/2008 može se upotrebljavati za proizvodnju proizvoda iz područja primjene Uredbe (EZ) br. 1272/2008 ili za proizvodnju proizvoda iz područja primjene Uredbe (EZ) br. 1272/2008 ili za proizvodnju proizvoda iz područja primjene Uredbe (EZ) br. 1272/2008 ili za proizvodnju proizvoda iz područja primjene Uredbe (EZ) br. 1272/2008 ili (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small latex-containing aquatic fern of southern Brazil [Regnellidium diphyllum]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, podrijetlo za proizvodnju proizvoda iz područja primjene Uredbe (EZ) br. 1236/2008 može se upotrebljavati za proizvodnju proizvoda iz područja primjene Uredbe (EZ) br. 1272/2008 ili za proizvodnju proizvoda iz područja primjene Uredbe (EZ) br. 1272/2008 ili za proizvodnju proizvoda iz područja primjene Uredbe (EZ) br. 1272/2008 ili za proizvodnju proizvoda iz područja primjene Uredbe (EZ) br. 1272/2008 ili (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small latex-containing aquatic fern of southern Brazil [regnellidium]</p><p><b>bljuvati, ispovraćati, ispovraćati se, izbljuvati, izbljuvati se, izrigati, izrigati se, pobljuvati, pobljuvati se, porigati, porigati se, povratiti, povraćati, rigati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> eject the contents of the stomach through the mouth [barf, be sick, cast, cat, chuck, disgorge, honk, puke, purge, regurgitate, retch, sick, spew, spue, throw up, upchuck, vomit, vomit up]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je zemlja izložena izloženosti, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, podrijetlo za uzgoj ili proizvodnju zemljišta može biti: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a type of soil consisting of unconsolidated material from freshly deposited alluvium or sand</p><p><b>povratak, vratiti se, vratiti, nazadovati, opadati, opasti, pogoršati se, pogoršavati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the reasoning involved when you assume the conclusion is true and reason backward to the evidence [reasoning backward]</p><p><i>n.</i> returning to a former state [regression, retrogression, retroversion, reversion]</p><p><i>v.</i> go back to a statistical means</p><p><i>v.</i> go back to a previous state [retrovert, return, revert, turn back]</p><p><i>v.</i> get worse or fall back to a previous condition [retrograde, retrogress]</p><p><i>v.</i> go back to bad behavior [fall back, lapse, recidivate, relapse, retrogress]</p><p><b>povratak stanja, regres, regresija, regresijska, vraćanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal state in which development has stopped prematurely [arrested development, fixation, infantile fixation]</p><p><i>n.</i> (psychiatry) a defense mechanism in which you flee from reality by assuming a more infantile state</p><p><i>n.</i> the relation between selected values of x and observed values of y (from which the most probable value of y can be predicted for any value of x) [regression toward the mean, simple regression, statistical regression]</p><p><i>n.</i> returning to a former state [regress, retrogression, retroversion, reversion]</p><p><b>regresijska analiza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the use of regression to make quantitative predictions of one variable from the values of another</p><p><b>kada je regresijska crta linearna (y = ax + b) koeficijent regresije je konstanta (a) koja predstavlja brzinu promjene jedne varijable (y) kao funkciju promjena u drugoj (x) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> when the regression line is linear (y = ax + b) the regression coefficient is the constant (a) that represents the rate of change of one variable (y) as a function of changes in the other (x)</p><p><b>za sve vrste proizvoda, uključujući: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a smooth curve fitted to the set of paired data in regression analysis [regression line]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka primjenjuje jedna od sljedećih vrijednosti: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the equation representing the relation between selected values of one variable (x) and observed values of the other (y) [regression of y on x]</p><p><b>za sve vrste proizvoda, uključujući: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a smooth curve fitted to the set of paired data in regression analysis [regression curve]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka primjenjuje jedna od sljedećih vrijednosti: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the equation representing the relation between selected values of one variable (x) and observed values of the other (y) [regression equation]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točka (a) primjenjuje se sljedeća metoda: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relation between selected values of x and observed values of y (from which the most probable value of y can be predicted for any value of x) [regression, simple regression, statistical regression]</p><p><b>nazadan, regresivan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of taxes) adjusted so that the rate decreases as the amount of income increases</p><p><i>adj.</i> opposing progress</p><p><b>isprika, kajanje, požaliti, sažaljevati, tuga, zažaliti, žaliti, žalost, žaljenje, žalimo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sadness associated with some wrong done or some disappointment [rue, ruefulness, sorrow]</p><p><i>v.</i> feel remorse for [repent, rue]</p><p><i>v.</i> feel sad about the loss or absence of</p><p><i>v.</i> decline formally or politely</p><p><i>v.</i> express with regret</p><p><b>žalostan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> feeling or expressing regret or sorrow or a sense of loss over something done or undone [bad, sorry]</p><p><b>žalostan (od &quot;regretful&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with regret (used in polite formulas)</p><p><b>isprika, kajanje, požaliti, sažaljevati, tuga, zažaliti, žaliti, žalost, žaljenje, žalimo (od &quot;regret&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a polite refusal of an invitation [declination]</p><p><b>vrijedan žaljenja</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> deserving regret [too bad]</p><p><b>nažalost</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by bad luck [alas, unfortunately, unluckily]</p><p><b>reorganizirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> organize anew, as after a setback [reorganise, reorganize]</p><p><i>v.</i> reorganize into new groups</p><p><b>ponovno rasti ili nastaviti rasti nakon ozljede ili prekida (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> grow anew or continue growth after an injury or interruption</p><p><b>istinski, kvalificiran, običan, pravi, pravilan, propisan, redovan, redovit, regularan, simetrički, sistematski, službeni, stručan, točan, uobičajen, uredan, kontinuirano, pravilni, redovita, redovitim, uredne, zakonit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a regular patron [fixture, habitue]</p><p><i>n.</i> a soldier in the regular army</p><p><i>n.</i> a dependable follower (especially in party politics)</p><p><i>n.</i> a garment size for persons of average height and weight</p><p><i>adj.</i> in accordance with fixed order or procedure or principle</p><p><i>adj.</i> often used as intensifiers [veritable]</p><p><i>adj.</i> conforming to a standard or pattern</p><p><i>adj.</i> regularly scheduled for fixed times</p><p><i>adj.</i> in accord with regular practice or procedure</p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring at fixed intervals [even]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to a person who does something regularly [steady]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of the military) belonging to or engaged in by legitimate army forces</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of solids) having clear dimensions that can be measured</p><p><i>adj.</i> not constipated [unconstipated]</p><p><i>adj.</i> symmetrically arranged [even]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not deviating from what is normal</p><p><i>adj.</i> officially full-time</p><p><b>armija, kopnene snage, vojska</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a permanent organization of the military land forces of a nation or state [army, ground forces]</p><p><b>bilo koji od pet čvrstih materija čije su lica kongruentni redovni poligoni i čiji su poliedri svi kongruentni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any one of five solids whose faces are congruent regular polygons and whose polyhedral angles are all congruent [Platonic body, Platonic solid, ideal solid, regular convex solid, regular polyhedron]</p><p><b>bilo koji od pet čvrstih materija čije su lica kongruentni redovni poligoni i čiji su poliedri svi kongruentni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any one of five solids whose faces are congruent regular polygons and whose polyhedral angles are all congruent [Platonic body, Platonic solid, ideal solid, regular convex polyhedron, regular polyhedron]</p><p><b>dodecahedron s dvanaest redovnih petogona kao lica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dodecahedron with twelve regular pentagons as faces</p><p><b>Šestokut s šest strana jednake dužine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hexagon with six sides of equal length</p><p><b>kocka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hexahedron with six equal squares as faces [cube]</p><p><b>ikosahedron s dvadeset jednakoostranih trougao kao lica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an icosahedron with twenty equilateral triangles as faces</p><p><b>Oktaeder s osam jednakostranih trougao kao lica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an octahedron with eight equilateral triangles as faces</p><p><b>redovita isplata, redovna isplata</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a payment made at regular times</p><p><b>Poligon s jednakim stranama i jednakim kutovima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a polygon with all sides and all angles equal</p><p><b>bilo koji od pet čvrstih materija čije su lica kongruentni redovni poligoni i čiji su poliedri svi kongruentni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any one of five solids whose faces are congruent regular polygons and whose polyhedral angles are all congruent [Platonic body, Platonic solid, ideal solid, regular convex polyhedron, regular convex solid]</p><p><b>ritam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> recurring at regular intervals [rhythm]</p><p><b>tetraeder s četiri jednakih trokutnih lica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tetrahedron with four equilateral triangular faces</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, podnositelj zahtjeva može podnijeti zahtjev za odobravanje., Čin uniformiteta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of having been made regular (or more regular) [regularization]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of bringing to uniformity [regularization, regulation]</p><p><b>sinkronizirati, uskladiti, usklađivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bring into conformity with rules or principles or usage [govern, order, regularize, regulate]</p><p><i>v.</i> make regular or more regular [regularize]</p><p><b>pravilnost, redovitost, točnost, urednost, regularnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a property of polygons: the property of having equal sides and equal angles [geometrical regularity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being characterized by a fixed principle or rate</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, podnositelj zahtjeva može podnijeti zahtjev za odobravanje., Čin uniformiteta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of having been made regular (or more regular) [regularisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of bringing to uniformity [regularisation, regulation]</p><p><b>napraviti točno, pravilno, sinkronizirati, uskladiti, usklađivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bring into conformity with rules or principles or usage [govern, order, regularise, regulate]</p><p><i>v.</i> make regular or more regular [regularise]</p><p><b>marljivo, redovito, redovnih, redovno, točno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a regular manner [on a regular basis]</p><p><i>adv.</i> having a regular form</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a regular way without variation</p><p><b>podesiti, prilagoditi, propisati, regulirati, srediti, udesiti, urediti, uređivanje, uređivati, zakonski urediti, modulirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> fix or adjust the time, amount, degree, or rate of [modulate]</p><p><i>v.</i> bring into conformity with rules or principles or usage [govern, order, regularise, regularize]</p><p><i>v.</i> shape or influence [determine, influence, mold, shape]</p><p><i>v.</i> restrain the emission of (sound, fluid, etc.) [baffle]</p><p><b>reguliran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> controlled or governed according to rule or principle or law</p><p><b>reguliranje, upravljanje, propisivanje, ravnanje, regulacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of controlling or directing according to rule [regulation]</p><p><b>kontrola, normativ, odredba, podešavanje, pravilo, prilagodba, propis, regulacija, regulacije, regulativa, reguliranje, statuti, uredba, uređenje, propisivanje, ravnanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an authoritative rule [ordinance]</p><p><i>n.</i> a principle or condition that customarily governs behavior [rule]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being controlled or governed</p><p><i>n.</i> (embryology) the ability of an early embryo to continue normal development after its structure has been somehow damaged or altered</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of bringing to uniformity [regularisation, regularization]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of controlling or directing according to rule [regulating]</p><p><i>adj.</i> prescribed by or according to regulation</p><p><b>(sport) normalno propisano trajanje igre (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (sports) the normal prescribed duration of a game</p><p><b>ograničavanje prema pravilima ili načelima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> restricting according to rules or principles [regulatory]</p><p><b>nadzorno tijelo, regulator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various controls or devices for regulating or controlling fluid flow, pressure, temperature, etc.</p><p><i>n.</i> an official responsible for control and supervision of a particular activity or area of public interest</p><p><i>n.</i> a control that maintains a steady speed in a machine (as by controlling the supply of fuel) [governor]</p><p><b>gen koji proizvodi suppresornu supstancu koja inhibira operatorni gen (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gene that produces a repressor substance that inhibits an operator gene [regulatory gene]</p><p><b>nadzorni, regulatoran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> restricting according to rules or principles [regulative]</p><p><b>državna agencija koja reguliše poslovanje u javnom interesu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a governmental agency that regulates businesses in the public interest [regulatory authority]</p><p><b>državna agencija koja reguliše poslovanje u javnom interesu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a governmental agency that regulates businesses in the public interest [regulatory agency]</p><p><b>gen koji proizvodi suppresornu supstancu koja inhibira operatorni gen (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gene that produces a repressor substance that inhibits an operator gene [regulator gene]</p><p><b>Zločini stvoreni zakonima a ne običnim pravom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> crimes created by statutes and not by common