th [disgorgement, emesis, puking, vomit, vomiting]</p><p><b>povratiti ugled, preosposobiti, rehabilitirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> help to readapt, as to a former state of health or good repute</p><p><i>v.</i> reinstall politically</p><p><i>v.</i> restore to a state of good condition or operation</p><p><b>adaptacija, obnova, oporavak, povraćaj, rehabilitacija, rehabilitacijski, rehabilitacijsko, rekonstrukcije, sanacija, rehabilitaciji, rehabilitaciju</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the restoration of someone to a useful place in society</p><p><i>n.</i> the conversion of wasteland into land suitable for use of habitation or cultivation [reclamation, renewal]</p><p><i>n.</i> vindication of a person's character and the re-establishment of that person's reputation</p><p><i>n.</i> the treatment of physical disabilities by massage and electrotherapy and exercises</p><p><b>Program za vraćanje nekoga u dobro zdravlje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a program for restoring someone to good health</p><p><b>dizajniran za postizanje rehabilitacije, pomaže u vraćanju u dobro stanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> designed to accomplish rehabilitation</p><p><i>adj.</i> helping to restore to good condition [reconstructive]</p><p><b>glazbeno djelo čija je originalna harmonija revidirana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of music whose original harmony has been revised [reharmonization]</p><p><b>pružaju drugačiju harmoniju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> provide with a different harmony [reharmonize]</p><p><b>glazbeno djelo čija je originalna harmonija revidirana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of music whose original harmony has been revised [reharmonisation]</p><p><b>pružaju drugačiju harmoniju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> provide with a different harmony [reharmonise]</p><p><b>Stari materijal koji je malo preobradjen i ponovno korišten, S obzirom na to da je to primjena u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, to se može smatrati primjenom članka 4. stavka 2. točke (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 182/2011, Vrati se. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> old material that is slightly reworked and used again</p><p><i>v.</i> present or use over, with no or few changes</p><p><i>v.</i> go back over [hash over, retrograde]</p><p><b>ponovno saslušati ili suditi sudski slučaj (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> hear or try a court case anew [retry]</p><p><b>Čin slušanja opet. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of hearing again [relistening]</p><p><b>izgovoriti napamet, ponavljanje, proba, proba glume, pokus</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a practice session in preparation for a public performance (as of a play or speech or concert) [dry run]</p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) a form of practice</p><p><b>nabrajati, praviti probu, probati, vježba, vježbati, izvježbati, izvježbavati, trenirati, uvježbati, uvježbavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> engage in a rehearsal (of) [practice, practise]</p><p><b>podgrijati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> heat again</p><p><b>Stavi novu petaču. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put a new heel on [heel]</p><p><b>Pravnik SAD-a koji je bio pomoćnik pravnika Vrhovnog suda SAD-a od 1972. do 1986. godine, kada je imenovan glavnim pravnikom (rođen 1924.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States jurist who served as an associate justice on the United States Supreme Court from 1972 until 1986, when he was appointed chief justice (born in 1924) [William Hubbs Rehnquist, William Rehnquist]</p><p><b>preseljavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put up in a new or different housing</p><p><b>Reich</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the German state</p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian born psychoanalyst who lived in the United States [Wilhelm Reich]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States composer (born in 1936) [Stephen Michael Reich, Steve Reich]</p><p><b>Švicarski kemičar rođen u Poljskoj. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Swiss chemist born in Poland [Tadeus Reichstein]</p><p><b>Škotski filozof zdravog razuma koji se suprotstavio idejama Davida Humea (1710-1796) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Scottish philosopher of common sense who opposed the ideas of David Hume (1710-1796) [Thomas Reid]</p><p><b>materijalizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> regarding something abstract as a material thing [hypostatisation, hypostatization]</p><p><i>n.</i> representing a human being as a physical thing deprived of personal qualities or individuality [depersonalisation, depersonalization]</p><p><b>smatrati apstraktni koncept da je stvarna (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> consider an abstract concept to be real</p><p><b>carska, gospodariti, kraljevska vlas, vlada, vladati, vladavina, vlast, dominirati, prevladati, prevladavati, upravljati, voditi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a period during which something or somebody is dominant or powerful</p><p><i>n.</i> the period during which a monarch is sovereign</p><p><i>n.</i> royal authority [sovereignty]</p><p><i>v.</i> have sovereign power</p><p><i>v.</i> be larger in number, quantity, power, status or importance [dominate, predominate, prevail, rule]</p><p><b>Bilo koji period brutalnog suzbijanja koji bi mogao biti sličan vladavini terora u Francuskoj., povijesni period (1793-94) tijekom Francuske revolucije kada su tisuće pogubljene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any period of brutal suppression thought to resemble the Reign of Terror in France</p><p><i>n.</i> the historic period (1793-94) during the French Revolution when thousands were executed</p><p><b>vladajući</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> exercising power or authority [regnant, ruling]</p><p><b>Zapali se ponovo, kao da nešto gori. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> ignite anew, as of something burning</p><p><b>isplatiti, nadoknaditi, naknaditi, naplatiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> pay back for some expense incurred</p><p><i>v.</i> reimburse or compensate (someone), as for a loss [recoup]</p><p><b>nadoknada, naknada izdatka, odšteta, povrat, regres, vraćanje novca, naknada</b></p><p><i>n.</i> compensation paid (to someone) for damages or losses or money already spent etc.</p><p><b>-Povlači ponovo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> impose anew</p><p><b>-Ponovo nametanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> imposition again</p><p><b>grad u sjeveroistočnoj Francuskoj istočno od Pariza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in northeastern France to the east of Paris [Rheims]</p><p><b>irvas, obuzdati, povodac, tjerati konja, upravljati, uzda, vodilica, vođica, zauzdati, dizgine, uzde, vođice, upregnuti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of a pair of long straps (usually connected to the bit or the headpiece) used to control a horse</p><p><i>n.</i> any means of control</p><p><i>v.</i> control and direct with or as if by reins [draw rein, harness, rein in]</p><p><i>v.</i> stop or slow up one's horse or oneself by or as if by pulling the reins [rein in]</p><p><i>v.</i> stop or check by or as if by a pull at the reins [rein in]</p><p><i>v.</i> keep in check [harness, rule]</p><p><b>zauzdati, upregnuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> stop or slow up one's horse or oneself by or as if by pulling the reins [rein]</p><p><i>v.</i> control and direct with or as if by reins [draw rein, harness, rein]</p><p><i>v.</i> stop or check by or as if by a pull at the reins [rein]</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko američkih divljih cvjetova s usnama u obliku bubrega (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several American wildflowers with a kidney-shaped lip [rein orchis]</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko američkih divljih cvjetova s usnama u obliku bubrega (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several American wildflowers with a kidney-shaped lip [rein orchid]</p><p><b>Ponovno se rađa u drugom tijelu nakon smrti., uzrok da se pojavi u novom obliku, imati novo tijelo (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be born anew in another body after death [transmigrate]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to appear in a new form [renew]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a new body</p><p><b>reinkarnacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> embodiment in a new form (especially the reappearance or a person in another form)</p><p><i>n.</i> a second or new birth [rebirth, renascence]</p><p><i>n.</i> the Hindu or Buddhist doctrine that a person may be reborn successively into one of five classes of living beings (god or human or animal or hungry ghost or denizen of Hell) depending on the person's own actions</p><p><b>nauka da se duša nakon smrti tijela ponovno rađa u drugom tijelu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a doctrine that on the death of the body the soul migrates to or is born again in another body</p><p><b>irvas, sob</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Arctic deer with large antlers in both sexes [Greenland caribou, Rangifer tarandus, caribou]</p><p><b>granati šupljan, sobov lišaj, sobovnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an erect greyish branching lichen of Arctic and even some north temperate regions constituting the chief food for reindeer and caribou and sometimes being eaten by humans [Cladonia rangiferina, arctic moss, reindeer moss]</p><p><b>granati šupljan, sobov lišaj, sobovnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an erect greyish branching lichen of Arctic and even some north temperate regions constituting the chief food for reindeer and caribou and sometimes being eaten by humans [Cladonia rangiferina, arctic moss, reindeer lichen]</p><p><b>očvršćivati, pojačanje, pojačati, učvrstiti, nagraditi, nagrađivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make stronger [reenforce]</p><p><i>v.</i> strengthen and support with rewards [reward]</p><p><b>armiran, pojačan, armiranih, armirano</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> given added strength or support [strengthened]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of soaps or cleaning agents) having a substance (an abrasive or filler) added to increase effectiveness [built]</p><p><b>armirani beton, armiranobetonski, armiranobetonskog</b></p><p><i>n.</i> concrete with metal and/or mesh added to provide extra support against stresses [ferroconcrete]</p><p><b>armatura građevinska, jačanje, pojačanje, učvršćivanje, armatura, armature, armaturi, armaturu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a military operation (often involving new supplies of men and materiel) to strengthen a military force or aid in the performance of its mission [reenforcement, support]</p><p><i>n.</i> information that makes more forcible or convincing [reenforcement]</p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) a stimulus that strengthens or weakens the behavior that produced it [reinforcer, reinforcing stimulus]</p><p><i>n.</i> a device designed to provide additional strength [strengthener]</p><p><i>n.</i> an act performed to strengthen approved behavior [reward]</p><p><b>očvršćivati, pojačanje, pojačati, učvrstiti (od &quot;reinforce&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) a stimulus that strengthens or weakens the behavior that produced it [reinforcement, reinforcing stimulus]</p><p><b>(psikološka) podražaja koji jača ili slabi ponašanje koje ga je proizvelo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) a stimulus that strengthens or weakens the behavior that produced it [reinforcement, reinforcer]</p><p><b>Protestantski teolog iz Sjedinjenih Država (1892-1971) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States Protestant theologian (1892-1971) [Niebuhr]</p><p><b>reinstalirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> install again</p><p><b>ponovno postaviti, popraviti, povratno stanje, restaurirati, uspostaviti, vratiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> restore to the previous state or rank</p><p><i>v.</i> bring back into original existence, use, function, or position [reestablish, restore]</p><p><b>ponovno građenje, ponovno stavljanje na položaj, reaktiviranje ugovora</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being reinstated</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of restoring someone to a previous position</p><p><b>reosiguranja, reosiguranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sharing the risk by insurance companies</p><p><b>osigurati dodatni osiguranje za:, U slučaju da je društvo u skladu s člankom 77. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) Direktive 2009/138/EZ, društvo u skladu s člankom 77. točkom (a) ili (b) Direktive 2009/138/EZ može se vratiti u društvo u skladu s člankom 87. točkom (a) ili (b) Direktive 2009/138/EZ., U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, u slučaju u kojem se u slučaju u kojem je društvo osiguranje u nepovratnom stanju ili u slučaju u kojem je društvo osiguranje u nepovratnom stanju ili u nepovratnom stanju u nepovratnom stanju ili u nepovratnom stanju, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, u slučaju u kojem je društvo osiguranje u nepovratnom stanju ili u nepovratnom stanju, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> provide additional insurance for</p><p><i>v.</i> insure again by transferring to another insurance company all or a part of a liability assumed</p><p><i>v.</i> insure again by assuming all or a part of the liability of an insurance company already covering a risk</p><p><b>ponovo se integrirati. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> integrate again</p><p><b>ponovno interpretirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> interpret from a different viewpoint [re-explain]</p><p><i>v.</i> assign a new or different meaning to</p><p><b>novo ili drugačije značenje, novo ili drugačije tumačenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a new or different meaning</p><p><i>n.</i> a new or different interpretation</p><p><b>uvesti ponovno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> introduce anew [re-introduce]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 2. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an act of renewed introduction</p><p><b>vratiti u postojanje., Stvori ponovo i napravi ponovo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bring back into existence</p><p><i>v.</i> create anew and make over</p><p><b>krijepiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> impart vigor, strength, or vitality to [invigorate]</p><p><b>s obnovljenom energijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> with restored energy [fresh, invigorated, refreshed]</p><p><b>ponovno izdati knjigu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a publication (such as a book) that is reprinted without changes or editing and offered again for sale [reprint, reprinting]</p><p><i>v.</i> print anew [reprint]</p><p><i>v.</i> issue (a new version of)</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s član (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an investment trust that owns and manages a pool of commercial properties and mortgages and other real estate assets [Real Estate Investment Trust]</p><p><b>Njemački bakteriolog koji je opisao bolest poznatu kao Reiterov sindrom i koji je identificirao spirochete koje uzrokuju sifilis kod ljudi (1881-1969) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German bacteriologist who described a disease now known as Reiter's syndrome and who identified the spirochete that causes syphilis in humans (1881-1969) [Hans Conrad Julius Reiter]</p><p><b>upale (neznata etiologija) uglavnom kod muškaraca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inflammatory syndrome (etiology unknown) predominantly in males [Reiter's syndrome]</p><p><b>upale (neznata etiologija) uglavnom kod muškaraca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inflammatory syndrome (etiology unknown) predominantly in males [Reiter's disease]</p><p><b>neprestano ponavljati, ponavljamo, ponavljati, ponoviti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> to say, state, or perform again [ingeminate, iterate, repeat, restate, retell]</p><p><b>ponavljanje (ili primjer) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of repeating over and again (or an instance thereof) [reduplication]</p><p><b>označen ponavljanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by iteration [iterative]</p><p><b>Miševi za žetvu u Novom svijetu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> New World harvest mice [genus Reithrodontomys]</p><p><b>bljuvati, odbaciti, odbačen, odbačena stvar, odbiti, oštećena roba, otkloniti, poreći, povraćati, povratiti, ukloniti (naredba), nadzorna naredba L^PB protokola, odbacivati, odbijati, kuditi, ne odobravati, ne odobriti, negodovati, osuditi, osuđivati, ismijati, ismijavati, prezirati, prezreti, otjerati, tjerati, uskratiti, uskraćivati, eliminirati, isključiti, isključivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person or thing that is rejected or set aside as inferior in quality [cull]</p><p><i>v.</i> refuse to accept or acknowledge</p><p><i>v.</i> refuse to accept [decline, pass up, refuse, turn down]</p><p><i>v.</i> deem wrong or inappropriate [disapprove]</p><p><i>v.</i> reject with contempt [disdain, freeze off, pooh-pooh, scorn, spurn, turn down]</p><p><i>v.</i> resist immunologically the introduction of some foreign tissue or organ [refuse, resist]</p><p><i>v.</i> refuse entrance or membership [refuse, turn away, turn down]</p><p><i>v.</i> dismiss from consideration or a contest [eliminate, rule out, winnow out]</p><p><b>bljuvati, odbaciti, odbačen, odbačena stvar, odbiti, oštećena roba, otkloniti, poreći, povraćati, povratiti, ukloniti (naredba), nadzorna naredba L^PB protokola (od &quot;reject&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> rebuffed (by a lover) without warning [jilted, spurned]</p><p><b>odbacivanje, odbijanje, otklanjanje, neprihvaćanje, nepristajanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of rejecting something</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being rejected</p><p><i>n.</i> (medicine) an immunological response that refuses to accept substances or organisms that are recognized as foreign</p><p><i>n.</i> the speech act of rejecting</p><p><b>odbijaju ili imaju tendenciju odbijanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> rejecting or tending to reject</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> re-equip a factory or plant [re-equip]</p><p><b>radovati se, razveseliti, veselit se, veseliti se, likovati, trijumfirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> feel happiness or joy [joy]</p><p><i>v.</i> to express great joy [exuberate, exult, jubilate, triumph]</p><p><i>v.</i> be ecstatic with joy [triumph, wallow]</p><p><b>radostan, radovanje, veseo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of great happiness</p><p><i>n.</i> the utterance of sounds expressing great joy [exultation, jubilation]</p><p><i>adj.</i> joyful and proud especially because of triumph or success [exultant, exulting, jubilant, prideful, triumphal, triumphant]</p><p><b>(Judaizam) židovski sveti dan koji se slavi 22. ili 23. mjeseca Tishrija kako bi se proslavio završetak godišnjeg ciklusa čitanja Tore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Judaism) a Jewish holy day celebrated on the 22nd or 23rd of Tishri to celebrate the completion of the annual cycle of readings of the Torah [Rejoicing of the Law, Rejoicing over the Law, Shimchath Torah, Simchas Torah, Simchat Torah, Simhat Torah, Simhath Torah]</p><p><b>(Judaizam) židovski sveti dan koji se slavi 22. ili 23. mjeseca Tishrija kako bi se proslavio završetak godišnjeg ciklusa čitanja Tore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Judaism) a Jewish holy day celebrated on the 22nd or 23rd of Tishri to celebrate the completion of the annual cycle of readings of the Torah [Rejoicing in the Law, Rejoicing over the Law, Shimchath Torah, Simchas Torah, Simchat Torah, Simhat Torah, Simhath Torah]</p><p><b>(Judaizam) židovski sveti dan koji se slavi 22. ili 23. mjeseca Tishrija kako bi se proslavio završetak godišnjeg ciklusa čitanja Tore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Judaism) a Jewish holy day celebrated on the 22nd or 23rd of Tishri to celebrate the completion of the annual cycle of readings of the Torah [Rejoicing in the Law, Rejoicing of the Law, Shimchath Torah, Simchas Torah, Simchat Torah, Simhat Torah, Simhath Torah]</p><p><b>odgovoriti, ponovo sastav, prigovoriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> join again</p><p><i>v.</i> answer back [come back, repay, retort, return, riposte]</p><p><b>odgovor, prigovor, uzvraćanje, povratak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a quick reply to a question or remark (especially a witty or critical one) [comeback, counter, replication, retort, return, riposte]</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) a pleading made by a defendant in response to the plaintiff's replication</p><p><b>pomladiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause (a stream or river) to erode, as by an uplift of the land</p><p><i>v.</i> develop youthful topographical features</p><p><i>v.</i> make younger or more youthful</p><p><i>v.</i> return to life [regenerate, restore]</p><p><i>v.</i> become young again</p><p><b>pomlađivanje, stupanje u novi ciklus erozije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the phenomenon of vitality and freshness being restored [greening]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of restoring to a more youthful condition</p><p><b>Zapali ponovo, kao da je vatra, ponovo se probuditi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> kindle anew, as of a fire</p><p><i>v.</i> arouse again</p><p><b>Ponovo čipka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> lace again</p><p><b>ne-steroidni protuupalni lijek (trgovinski naziv Relafen) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (trade name Relafen) [nabumetone]</p><p><b>pogoršanje zdravstvenog stanja, povraćaj, povratak, vratiti se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a failure to maintain a higher state [backsliding, lapse, lapsing, relapsing, reversion, reverting]</p><p><i>v.</i> deteriorate in health [get worse]</p><p><i>v.</i> go back to bad behavior [fall back, lapse, recidivate, regress, retrogress]</p><p><b>pogoršanje zdravstvenog stanja, povraćaj, povratak, vratiti se (od &quot;relapse&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a failure to maintain a higher state [backsliding, lapse, lapsing, relapse, reversion, reverting]</p><p><b>označen ponovnom visokom groznicom i prenosi se ugrizem zaraženih ušiju ili krpelja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> marked by recurring high fever and transmitted by the bite of infected lice or ticks [recurrent fever]</p><p><b>biti povezan, biti povezan s, dovesti u vezu, dovoditi, imati veze, ispričati, odnositi se, odnositi se na, pripovijedati, ticati se, uspostaviti odnos, asocirati, povezati, povezivati, referirati, referati se, vrijediti, biti u odnosu, povezati se, povezivati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a logical or causal connection [associate, colligate, connect, link, link up, tie in]</p><p><i>v.</i> be relevant to [bear on, come to, concern, have to do with, pertain, refer, touch, touch on]</p><p><i>v.</i> give an account of</p><p><i>v.</i> be in a relationship with [interrelate]</p><p><i>v.</i> have or establish a relationship to</p><p><b>koji je u svezi s, koji se odnosi na, odgovarajući, odgovarajućim, odnosu, povezan, povezane, pripadajući, srodan, srodnim, u rodu, vezan, vezan uz, srodna, srodni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being connected either logically or causally or by shared characteristics [related to]</p><p><i>adj.</i> connected by kinship, common origin, or marriage</p><p><b>srodan, u rodbinskoj vezi, povezan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being connected either logically or causally or by shared characteristics [related]</p><p><b>povezanost, srodnost, veza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a particular manner of connectedness</p><p><b>izlaganje, izvještaj, odnos, priča, pripovijedanje, pripovjetka, reakcija, relacija, rod, rođak, srodstvo, veza, srodnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abstraction belonging to or characteristic of two entities or parts together</p><p><i>n.</i> sexual activity between individuals, especially the insertion of a man's penis into a woman's vagina until orgasm and ejaculation occur [carnal knowledge, coition, coitus, copulation, intercourse, sex act, sexual congress, sexual intercourse, sexual relation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person related by blood or marriage [relative]</p><p><i>n.</i> an act of narration [recounting, telling]</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) the principle that an act done at a later time is deemed by law to have occurred at an earlier time [relation back]</p><p><i>n.</i> (usually plural) mutual dealings or connections among persons or groups</p><p><b>(pravno) načelo da se čin učinjen u kasnijem trenutku smatra pravnim da se dogodio u ranijem trenutku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) the principle that an act done at a later time is deemed by law to have occurred at an earlier time [relation]</p><p><b>relacijska, relacijski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a relation or being related</p><p><b>odnosni pridjev</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an adjective that classifies its noun (e.g., `a nervous disease' or `a musical instrument') [classifying adjective]</p><p><b>odnosna baza podataka, relacijska baza podataka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a database in which relations between information items are explicitly specified as accessible attributes</p><p><b>sustav za upravljanje relacijskom bazom podataka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a database management system designed to manage a relational database</p><p><b>odnosi, odnosima, odnosa, odnose</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mutual dealings or connections or communications among persons or groups [dealings]</p><p><b>odnos, povezanost, srodstvo, veza, rod</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a relation between people [human relationship]</p><p><i>n.</i> a state of connectedness between people (especially an emotional connection)</p><p><i>n.</i> a state involving mutual dealings between people or parties or countries</p><p><i>n.</i> (anthropology) relatedness or connection by blood or marriage or adoption [family relationship, kinship]</p><p><b>odnosan, odnosna zamjenica, odnosni, povezan, razmjeran, relativan, relativni, rođak, rođakinja, zavisan, relativne, rod, srodnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person related by blood or marriage [relation]</p><p><i>n.</i> an animal or plant that bears a relationship to another (as related by common descent or by membership in the same genus) [congenator, congener, congeneric]</p><p><i>adj.</i> estimated by comparison [comparative]</p><p><i>adj.</i> properly related in size or degree or other measurable characteristics [proportional]</p><p><b>(kemija) masa atoma kemijskog elementa izražena u jedinicama atomske mase (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) the mass of an atom of a chemical element expressed in atomic mass units [atomic mass, atomic weight]</p><p><b>Reč koja je uvedena relativnim zamjenikom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clause introduced by a relative pronoun</p><p><b>odnos gustoće nečega prema gustoći standarda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of the density of something to the density of a standard</p><p><b>frekvencija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of the number of observations in a statistical category to the total number of observations [frequency]</p><p><b>relativna vlaga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of the amount of water in the air at a given temperature to the maximum amount it could hold at that temperature</p><p><b>relativna učestalost pojave nečega (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relative frequency of occurrence of something [incidence]</p><p><b>(na izborima s više od 2 opcije) broj glasova za kandidata ili stranku koja je dobila najveći broj (ali manje od polovice glasova) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (in an election with more than 2 options) the number of votes for the candidate or party receiving the greatest number (but less that half of the votes) [plurality]</p><p><b>(kemija) zbir relativnih atomskih masa sastavnih atoma molekula (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (chemistry) the sum of the relative atomic masses of the constituent atoms of a molecule [molecular weight]</p><p><b>zamjenik (kao `to' ili `koji' ili `koji') koji uvodi relativnu rečenicu koja se odnosi na neki prethodnik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pronoun (as `that' or `which' or `who') that introduces a relative clause referring to some antecedent</p><p><b>relativna količina, relativna kvantiteta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a quantity relative to some purpose</p><p><b>rodbina iz braka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a relative by marriage [in-law]</p><p><b>razmjerno, relativno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a relative manner [comparatively]</p><p><b>smatraju ili tretiraju kao relativno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> consider or treat as relative [relativize]</p><p><b>(filozofija) filozofsko učenje da su svi kriteriji prosuđivanja relativni prema pojedincima i situacijama koje su uključene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (philosophy) the philosophical doctrine that all criteria of judgment are relative to the individuals and situations involved</p><p><b>relativistička</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating or subject to the special or the general theory of relativity</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the philosophical doctrine of relativism</p><p><b>(fizička) masa tijela u pokretu u odnosu na promatrača: jednaka je masi u mirovanju pomnoženoj sa faktorom koji je veći od 1 i koji se povećava kako se veličina brzine povećava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the mass of a body in motion relative to the observer: it is equal to the rest mass multiplied by a factor that is greater than 1 and that increases as the magnitude of the velocity increases</p><p><b>Po teoriji relativnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by the theory of relativity</p><p><b>(fizici) teorija da su prostor i vrijeme relativni koncepti, a ne apsolutni koncepti, kvaliteta relativnosti i značaja samo u odnosu na nešto drugo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the theory that space and time are relative concepts rather than absolute concepts [Einstein's theory of relativity, relativity theory, theory of relativity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being relative and having significance only in relation to something else</p><p><b>(fizici) teorija da su prostor i vrijeme relativni koncepti, a ne apsolutni koncepti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the theory that space and time are relative concepts rather than absolute concepts [Einstein's theory of relativity, relativity, theory of relativity]</p><p><b>smatraju ili tretiraju kao relativno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> consider or treat as relative [relativise]</p><p><b>izraz u prijedlogu koji je povezan s referentom prijedloga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a term in a proposition that is related to the referent of the proposition</p><p><b>odmarati, olabaviti, omlitaviti, opustiti, opustiti se, oslabiti, popustiti, slabiti, smekšati, ublažiti, odmarati se, odmoriti se, opuštati se, relaksirati se, labaviti, otpustiti, otpuštati, otpuštati se, popuštati, razvezati se, razvezivati se, opuštati, relaksirati, smekšati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become less tense, rest, or take one's ease [decompress, loosen up, slow down, unbend, unwind]</p><p><i>v.</i> make less taut [unbend]</p><p><i>v.</i> become loose or looser or less tight [loose, loosen]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to feel relaxed [loosen up, make relaxed, unlax, unstrain, unwind]</p><p><i>v.</i> become less tense, less formal, or less restrained, and assume a friendlier manner [loosen up]</p><p><i>v.</i> make less severe or strict [loosen]</p><p><i>v.</i> become less severe or strict [loosen]</p><p><i>v.</i> make less active or fast [slack, slack up, slacken]</p><p><b>lijek koji opušta i ublažava napetost, koji imaju tendenciju opuštanja ili ublažavanja mišićnog ili živčanog napetosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that relaxes and relieves tension</p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to relax or relieve muscular or nervous tension</p><p><b>labavost, mlitavost, odmor, oporavljanje, opuštanja, opuštanje, opuštenost, popuštanje, razonoda, relaksacija, relaksacije, slabljenje, smanjenje napon, smekšavanje, ublaženje, počinak, predah, liberalizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physiology) the gradual lengthening of inactive muscle or muscle fibers</p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the exponential return of a system to equilibrium after a disturbance [relaxation behavior]</p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of refreshing tranquility and an absence of tension or worry [easiness]</p><p><i>n.</i> an occurrence of control or strength weakening [loosening, slackening]</p><p><i>n.</i> freedom from activity (work or strain or responsibility) [ease, repose, rest]</p><p><i>n.</i> a method of solving simultaneous equations by guessing a solution and then reducing the errors that result by successive approximations until all the errors are less than some specified amount [relaxation method]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of making less strict [liberalisation, liberalization]</p><p><b>(fizička) eksponencijalni povratak sustava u ravnotežu nakon poremećaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) the exponential return of a system to equilibrium after a disturbance [relaxation]</p><p><b>metoda rješavanja istovremenih jednadžbi pogađanjem rješenja i zatim smanjenjem pogrešaka koje proizlaze iz uzastopnih aproksimacija dok sve pogreške ne budu manje od određene količine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of solving simultaneous equations by guessing a solution and then reducing the errors that result by successive approximations until all the errors are less than some specified amount [relaxation]</p><p><b>vremenska konstanta eksponencijalnog povratka sustava u ravnotežu nakon poremećaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time constant of an exponential return of a system to equilibrium after a disturbance</p><p><b>odmoren, opušten, opušteno, opuštenosti</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> without strain or anxiety</p><p><b>odmarati, olabaviti, omlitaviti, opustiti, opustiti se, oslabiti, popustiti, slabiti, smekšati, ublažiti (od &quot;relax&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any agent that produces relaxation</p><p><b>hormon koji se luteumno tijelo luči tijekom posljednjih dana trudnoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hormone secreted by the corpus luteum during the last days of pregnancy</p><p><b>blag, blaga klima, koji mlitavi, koji slabi, slabi</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> affording physical or mental rest [reposeful, restful]</p><p><b>instrument, osigurati, poslati, prenijeti, prenositi, prijenos, proslijeđeni prijenos (paketa) kroz posrednu posta, relej, sklopnik, smijeniti, smjena, štafeta (trka), uređaj koji mijenja stanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of passing something along from one person or group to another</p><p><i>n.</i> a crew of workers who relieve another crew</p><p><i>n.</i> a fresh team to relieve weary draft animals</p><p><i>n.</i> a race between teams [relay race]</p><p><i>n.</i> electrical device such that current flowing through it in one circuit can switch on and off a current in a second circuit [electrical relay]</p><p><i>v.</i> pass along</p><p><i>v.</i> control or operate by relay</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 1,15 kVA ili većim od 2,25 kVA, ali ne većim od 2,0 kVA, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amplifier for restoring the strength of a transmitted signal [booster, booster amplifier, booster station, relay station, relay transmitter]</p><p><b>štafeta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a race between teams [relay]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 1,15 kVA ili većim od 2,25 kVA, ali ne većim od 2,0 kVA, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amplifier for restoring the strength of a transmitted signal [booster, booster amplifier, booster station, relay link, relay transmitter]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 1,15 kVA ili većim od 2,25 kVA, ali ne većim od 2,0 kVA, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amplifier for restoring the strength of a transmitted signal [booster, booster amplifier, booster station, relay link, relay station]</p><p><b>Naučite nešto ponovo, kao nakon što ste zaboravili ili zanemarili. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> learn something again, as after having forgotten or neglected it</p><p><b>deblokirati, distribucija, ispustiti, izbacivač, izbacivanje, izdanja, izdanje, izvještaj, novinski dokumenti, objeručno gornje vršno odbijanje, odriješiti, odustajanje, oproštaj, opuštanje, oslobađanje, osloboditi, oslobođenje, otpust, otpustite, otpustiti, otpuštanje, popuštanje, pustiti, pustiti u promet, puštanje, puštati, raskidanje, razriješiti, vršno odbijanje lopte, otkaz, izljev, odušak, odrješenje, razrješnica, ispuštati, oslobađati, otpuštati, objaviti, objavljivati, isključiti, izlučiti, izlučivati, lučiti, napustiti, napuštati, odbaciti, odbacivati, odreći se, odricati se, odstupati, odstupiti, ostaviti, ostavljati, povlačiti se, povući se, prepustiti, prepuštati, ustupati, ustupiti, odmrzavati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> merchandise issued for sale or public showing (especially a record or film)</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of liberating someone or something [freeing, liberation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a process that liberates or discharges something</p><p><i>n.</i> an announcement distributed to members of the press in order to supplement or replace an oral presentation [handout, press release]</p><p><i>n.</i> the termination of someone's employment (leaving them free to depart) [discharge, dismissal, di