jivati, pospremati, pospremiti, vraćati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> substitute a person or thing for (another that is broken or inefficient or lost or no longer working or yielding what is expected)</p><p><i>v.</i> take the place or move into the position of [supersede, supervene upon, supplant]</p><p><i>v.</i> put something back where it belongs [put back]</p><p><i>v.</i> put in the place of another [exchange, interchange, substitute]</p><p><b>nadomjestivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> exchangeability by virtue of being replaceable [commutability, substitutability]</p><p><b>nadomjestiv, zamjenljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being replaced</p><p><b>izmjena, nadomjestak, naknada, popunjavanje, sastav, vraćanje, zamjena, zamjenski, zamjeni, zamjenik, nasljednik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of furnishing an equivalent person or thing in the place of another [replacing]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who takes the place of another person [alternate, surrogate]</p><p><i>n.</i> an event in which one thing is substituted for another [permutation, substitution, switch, transposition]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person or thing that takes or can take the place of another [substitute]</p><p><i>n.</i> filling again by supplying what has been used up [refilling, renewal, replenishment]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who follows next in order [successor]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 4. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> current cost of replacing a fixed asset with a new one of equal effectiveness</p><p><b>zamjena, zamjenjivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of furnishing an equivalent person or thing in the place of another [replacement]</p><p><b>presaditi</b></p><p><i>v.</i> plant again or anew</p><p><b>ponovno igranje poena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something (especially a game) that is played again [rematch]</p><p><i>n.</i> the immediate rebroadcast of some action (especially sports action) that has been recorded on videotape [action replay, instant replay]</p><p><i>v.</i> reproduce (a recording) on a recorder [play back]</p><p><i>v.</i> play (a melody) again</p><p><i>v.</i> repeat a game against the same opponent</p><p><i>v.</i> play again</p><p><b>aktualizirati, dodati, napuniti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> fill something that had previously been emptied [fill again, refill]</p><p><b>nadopunjivanje, ponovo punjenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> filling again by supplying what has been used up [refilling, renewal, replacement]</p><p><b>napunjen, prepunjen, pun, snabdjeven, najedati se, najesti se, zasititi, zasititi se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> fill to satisfaction [fill, sate, satiate]</p><p><i>adj.</i> filled to satisfaction with food or drink [full]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (followed by `with') deeply filled or permeated [instinct]</p><p><b>prepunjenost, punokrvnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being satisfactorily full and unable to take on more [satiation, satiety]</p><p><i>n.</i> eating until excessively full [surfeit]</p><p><b>duplikat, kopija, replika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> copy that is not the original [replication, reproduction]</p><p><b>uzvratiti, precrtati, prepisati, ponavljati, ponoviti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bend or turn backward [retroflex]</p><p><i>v.</i> reproduce or make an exact copy of [copy]</p><p><i>v.</i> make or do or perform again [double, duplicate, reduplicate, repeat]</p><p><b>kopija, preslika, replikacija, reprodukcija, povratak, eho, jeka, odjek</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of making copies [reproduction]</p><p><i>n.</i> (genetics) the process whereby DNA makes a copy of itself before cell division</p><p><i>n.</i> a quick reply to a question or remark (especially a witty or critical one) [comeback,