rano područje uz glavnu cestu gdje se automobili mogu privremeno zaustaviti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> designated paved area beside a main road where cars can stop temporarily [lay-by, layby, pull-off, rest area]</p><p><b>liječenje odmaranjem</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rest as a medical treatment for stress or anxiety etc.</p><p><b>Eurasijska biljka s lušim rascemi od ružičastih ili ljubičastih cvijeća i trnastih stabljika i čvrstih korijena, Europska drvena biljka s ružičastim cvijećem i jednoplošnim lištima i dugim čvrstim korijenima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Eurasian plant having loose racemes of pink or purple flowers and spiny stems and tough roots [Ononis spinosa, restharrow]</p><p><i>n.</i> European woody plant having pink flowers and unifoliate leaves and long tough roots [Ononis repens, restharrow]</p><p><b>ponovite pokretanje, ponoviti pokretanje, ponovljeno pokretanje, ponovljenog pokretanja, ponovni početak, ponovno početi, ponovo pokrenuti, ponovno pokretanje, ponovno uključivanje, ponovo početi, nastaviti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> start an engine again, for example [re-start]</p><p><i>v.</i> take up or begin anew [re-start, resume]</p><p><b>ponovno izraziti, ponavljati, ponoviti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> to say, state, or perform again [ingeminate, iterate, reiterate, repeat, retell]</p><p><b>revidirana izjava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a revised statement</p><p><b>gostiona, restauracija, restoran, gostionica, zalogajnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a building where people go to eat [eatery, eating house, eating place]</p><p><b>osoba koja je zaposlena da pruža usluge u blagovaonici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone employed to provide service in a dining room [dining-room attendant]</p><p><b>lanac restorana</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chain of restaurants</p><p><b>gostiona, restauracija, restoran (od &quot;restaurant&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the proprietor of a restaurant [restaurateur]</p><p><b>vlasnik restorana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the proprietor of a restaurant [restauranter]</p><p