a buckthorn, indian cherry]</p><p><b>mala trnasta zimzelena grma sa malenim cvijećem i svijetlo crvenim bojama iz zapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small spiny evergreen shrub of western United States and Mexico with minute flowers and bright red berries [red-berry, redberry]</p><p><b>malo drvo uobičajeno u Europi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small tree common in Europe [alder buckthorn, alder dogwood]</p><p><b>grm na pacifičkoj obali Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrubby tree of the Pacific coast of the United States [bearberry, bearwood, cascara buckthorn, chittamwood, chittimwood]</p><p><b>greben koji formira šav između dva dijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ridge that forms a seam between two parts [raphe]</p><p><b>rod malih palmi za oblikovanje grudi iz Kine i Japana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of small clump-forming fan palms of China and Japan [genus Rhapis]</p><p><b>mala graciozna palma s trunama poput trske i podlogom lišća obučenim oštrim vlaknima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small graceful palm with reedlike stems and leaf bases clothed with loose coarse fibers [bamboo palm, fern rhapis, miniature fan palm]</p><p><b>Kineska dama palma sa tanjim stabljikama i finim vlaknima od Rhapis excelsa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Chinese lady palm with more slender stems and finer sheath fibers than Rhapis excelsa [reed rhapis, slender lady palm]</p><p><b>Osjećaj velikog uzbuđenja ili zadovoljstva (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> feeling great rapture or delight [ecstatic, enraptured, rapt, rapturous]</p><p><b>U ekstazi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an ecstatic manner [ecstatically, rapturously]</p><p><b>recitirati rapsodiju., Reci nešto uz veliko uzbuđenje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> recite a rhapsody [rhapsodize]</p><p><i>v.</i> say (something) with great enthusiasm [rhapsodize]</p><p><b>recitirati rapsodiju., Reci nešto uz veliko uzbuđenje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> recite a rhapsody [rhapsodise]</p><p><i>v.</i> say (something) with great enthusiasm [rhapsodise]</p><p><b>hvalospjev, rapsodija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an enthusiastic expression of emotion</p><p><i>n.</i> (music) a free instrumental composition in one extended movement</p><p><i>n.</i> (in ancient Greece) an epic poem adapted for recitation</p><p><b>paravojna grupa protestanata u Sjevernoj Irskoj koja pokušava spriječiti bilo kakvo političko rješenje s Irskom Republikom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a paramilitary group of Protestants in Northern Ireland that tries to prevent any political settlement with the Irish Republic [Red Hand Defenders]</p><p><b>Rea</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fertility goddess in ancient Greek mythology</p><p><i>n.</i> smaller of two tall fast-running flightless birds similar to ostriches but three-toed [Pterocnemia pennata, nandu]</p><p><i>n.</i> larger of two tall fast-running flightless birds similar to ostriches but three-toed [Rhea americana]</p><p><b>veća od dvije visoke brze ptice koje ne lete slične nojsama ali sa tri prsta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> larger of two tall fast-running flightless birds similar to ostriches but three-toed [rhea]</p><p><b>(Rimska mitologija) Vestala djevica koja je postala majka od Mars blizanca Romulus i Remus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman mythology) a vestal virgin who became the mother by Mars of the twins Romulus and Remus [Rea Silvia]</p><p><b>obitelj ptica koja je u isto vrijeme s redom Rheiformes (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of birds coextensive with the order Rheiformes [family Rheidae]</p><p><b>red ptica ratita: ptice koje su u svojim karakteristikama između noja i emu: nedavno i izumrle ptice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ratite bird order: birds intermediate in characteristics between ostriches and emus: recent and extinct rheas [order Rheiformes]</p><p><b>grad u sjeveroistočnoj Francuskoj istočno od Pariza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in northeastern France to the east of Paris [Reims]</p><p><b>Engleski prijevod Vulgate koji su napravili rimokatolički učenjaki (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an English translation of the Vulgate by Roman Catholic scholars [Douay-Rheims Bible, Douay-Rheims Version, Douay Bible, Douay Version, Rheims-Douay Version]</p><p><b>Engleski prijevod Vulgate koji su napravili rimokatolički učenjaki (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an English translation of the Vulgate by Roman Catholic scholars [Douay-Rheims Bible, Douay-Rheims Version, Douay Bible, Douay Version, Rheims-Douay Bible]</p><p><b>rajnski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a major European river carrying more traffic than any other river in the world [Rhine, Rhine River]</p><p><b>Porajnje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a picturesque region of Germany around the Rhine river [Rhineland]</p><p><b>bilo koje od nekoliko bijelih vina iz doline rijeke Rajne u Njemačkoj (`hock' je britanska upotreba), u području ili u vezi s Rijekom Rinom i zemljama koje mu susreću (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several white wines from the Rhine River valley in Germany (`hock' is British usage) [Rhine wine, hock]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the Rhine River and the lands adjacent to it</p><p><b>renij, renijum</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rare heavy polyvalent metallic element that resembles manganese chemically and is used in some alloys [Re, atomic number 75]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s reologijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to rheology [rheological]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s reologijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to rheology [rheologic]</p><p><b>reologija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of physics that studies the deformation and flow of matter</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je to samo jedan od glavnih mehanizama za mjerenje tekućine, u skladu s člankom 83. stavkom 3. ovog poglavlja, radi se primjenjivati samo na uređaje za mjerenje tekućine. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instrument for measuring the flow of liquids (especially arterial blood)</p><p><b>otpornik, reostat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> resistor for regulating current [variable resistor]</p><p><b>od južne Azije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> of southern Asia [Macaca mulatta, rhesus monkey]</p><p><b>antigen krvne grupe koji posjeduju Rh pozitivni ljudi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blood group antigen possessed by Rh-positive people [Rh, Rh factor]</p><p><b>od južne Azije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> of southern Asia [Macaca mulatta, rhesus]</p><p><b>retorika, govorništvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> using language effectively to please or persuade</p><p><i>n.</i> high-flown style [grandiloquence, grandiosity, magniloquence, ornateness]</p><p><i>n.</i> loud and confused and empty talk [empty talk, empty words, hot air, palaver]</p><p><i>n.</i> study of the technique and rules for using language effectively (especially in public speaking)</p><p><b>retoričan, retorski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to rhetoric</p><p><i>adj.</i> given to rhetoric, emphasizing style at the expense of thought</p><p><b>retorička figura, retoričko sredstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a use of language that creates a literary effect (but often without regard for literal significance)</p><p><b>Izjava koja je formulirana kao pitanje, ali na koje se ne očekuje odgovor. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a statement that is formulated as a question but that is not supposed to be answered</p><p><b>retoričan, retorski (od &quot;rhetorical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a rhetorical manner</p><p><b>govornik, orator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who delivers a speech or oration [orator, public speaker, speechifier, speechmaker]</p><p><b>reuma</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a watery discharge from the mucous membranes (especially from the eyes or nose)</p><p><i>n.</i> rhubarb [genus Rheum]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, uz pomoć ovog članka, za proizvode iz kategorije II. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> long cultivated hybrid of Rheum palmatum [Rheum rhabarbarum, Rheum rhaponticum, garden rhubarb, pie plant]</p><p><b>dugo se koristi za odvajivačka svojstva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> long used for laxative properties [Chinese rhubarb]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, uz pomoć ovog članka, za proizvode iz kategorije II. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> long cultivated hybrid of Rheum palmatum [Rheum cultorum, Rheum rhaponticum, garden rhubarb, pie plant]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, uz pomoć ovog članka, za proizvode iz kategorije II. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> long cultivated hybrid of Rheum palmatum [Rheum cultorum, Rheum rhabarbarum, garden rhubarb, pie plant]</p><p><b>bolestan od reume, reuma, reumatičan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person suffering with rheumatism</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to arthritis [arthritic, creaky, rheumatoid, rheumy]</p><p><b>aortitis koji se javlja u reumatskoj groznici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aortitis occurring in rheumatic fever</p><p><b>teška bolest uglavnom kod djece i karakterizirana bolnim upale zglobova i često oštećenja srčanih zalisaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a severe disease chiefly of children and characterized by painful inflammation of the joints and frequently damage to the heart valves</p><p><b>srčane bolesti uzrokovane ponavljajućim epizodama reumatske groznice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heart disease caused by recurrent episodes of rheumatic fever</p><p><b>reumatizam, reumatizma</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any painful disorder of the joints or muscles or connective tissues</p><p><i>n.</i> a chronic autoimmune disease with inflammation of the joints and marked deformities [atrophic arthritis, rheumatoid arthritis]</p><p><b>Kanadski pasji štap koji daje čvrsto vlakno koje su Indijanci koristili kao konopac, Sjeveravska višegodišnja biljka s ružičastim cvjetovima u labavim cimetima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Canadian dogbane yielding a tough fiber used as cordage by Native Americans [Apocynum cannabinum, Indian hemp]</p><p><i>n.</i> North American perennial having pinkish flowers in loose cymes [Apocynum androsaemifolium, common dogbane, spreading dogbane]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s artritisom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to arthritis [arthritic, creaky, rheumatic, rheumy]</p><p><b>reumatoidni artritis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chronic autoimmune disease with inflammation of the joints and marked deformities [atrophic arthritis, rheumatism]</p><p><b>autoantitela koja se obično nalazi u serumu osoba s reumatoidnim artritisom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> autoantibody that is usually present in the serum of people with rheumatoid arthritis</p><p><b>hronični oblik spondilitisa uglavnom kod muškaraca i obilježen poremećenom pokretljivošću kralježnice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chronic form of spondylitis primarily in males and marked by impaired mobility of the spine [Marie-Strumpell disease, ankylosing spondylitis]</p><p><b>liječnik specijaliziran za reumatske bolesti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a physician specializing in rheumatic diseases</p><p><b>medicinska grana koja se bavi proučavanjem i liječenjem patologija mišića ili tetiva ili zglobova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of medicine dealing with the study and treatment of pathologies of the muscles or tendons or joints</p><p><b>Vlažna, vlažna, vlažna (posebno zraka), od ili povezane s artritisom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> moist, damp, wet (especially of air)</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to arthritis [arthritic, creaky, rheumatic, rheumatoid]</p><p><b>zelena trava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deer grass [genus Rhexia]</p><p><b>jedan od tri zanatlija hinduističkih bogova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of three artisans of the Hindu gods [Ribhus]</p><p><b>nosan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or in or relating to the nose [nasal]</p><p><b>morski psi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> whale sharks [genus Rhincodon]</p><p><b>Veliki mršteni morski pas u toplim površinskim vodama diljem svijeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large spotted shark of warm surface waters worldwide [whale shark]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci se odnose na: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small-toothed sharks comprising only one species [family Rhincodontidae]</p><p><b>Rajna</b></p><p><