ng, origin, rootage, source]</p><p><i>n.</i> (linguistics) the form of a word after all affixes are removed [base, radical, root word, stem, theme]</p><p><i>n.</i> a number that, when multiplied by itself some number of times, equals a given number</p><p><i>n.</i> the set of values that give a true statement when substituted into an equation [solution]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone from whom you are descended (but usually more remote than a grandparent) [ancestor, antecedent, ascendant, ascendent]</p><p><i>n.</i> a simple form inferred as the common basis from which related words in several languages can be derived by linguistic processes [etymon]</p><p><i>n.</i> the embedded part of a bodily structure such as a tooth, nail, or hair</p><p><i>v.</i> take root and begin to grow</p><p><i>v.</i> come into existence, originate</p><p><i>v.</i> cheer for</p><p><i>v.</i> plant by the roots</p><p><i>v.</i> dig with the snout [rootle, rout]</p><p><i>v.</i> become settled or established and stable in one's residence or life style [settle, settle down, steady down, take root]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to take roots</p><p><b>gumozirani napitak s ekstraktima korijena i biljaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> carbonated drink containing extracts of roots and herbs</p><p><b>Soda za sladoled napravljena od sladoleda koji pluta u korijenskom pivu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ice-cream soda made with ice cream floating in root beer</p><p><b>prolaz u korijenu zuba kroz koji njegovi živci i krvne žile ulaze u dušnu šupljinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the passage in the root of a tooth through which its nerve and blood vessels enter the pulp cavity</p><p><b>masna stanica u obliku prstića koja pokriva i štiti vrh korijena koji raste (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thimble-shaped mass of cells covering and protecting the growing tip of a root</p><p><b>uzgajan zbog svog zgušćenog jestivog aromatičnog korijena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> grown for its thickened edible aromatic root [Apium graveolens rapaceum, celeriac, celery root, knob celery, turnip-rooted celery]</p><p><b>kopanje gdje se skladište korenovite povrće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an excavation where root vegetables are stored [cellar]</p><p><b>biljka koja se penje svojim korenima, npr. bršljan. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plant that climbs by its adventitious roots e.g. ivy</p><p><b>korjenjača i gomoljača</b></p><p><i>n.</i> crop grown for its enlarged roots: e.g. beets</p><p><b>da se zauzme za stranu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> take sides with [pull]</p><p><b>tanka dlakava porasta epidermalne stanice iza vrha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thin hairlike outgrowth of an epidermal cell just behind the tip</p><p><b>bodriti, obodriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> spur on or encourage especially by cheers and shouts [barrack, cheer, exhort, inspire, pep up, urge, urge on]</p><p><b>iskopati, iskorijeniti, izrovati, istrijebiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> pull up by or as if by the roots [deracinate, extirpate, uproot]</p><p><i>v.</i> destroy completely, as if down to the roots [eradicate, exterminate, extirpate, uproot]</p><p><b>bolest koju karakterizira raspadanje korijena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> disease characterized by root decay</p><p><b>korijenje, korijenov sistem, korijenov sustav, korijenski sistem, korijenski sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a developed system of roots [rootage]</p><p><b>korjenasto povrće</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various fleshy edible underground roots or tubers</p><p><b>(lingvistički) oblik riječi nakon uklanjanja svih afiksa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (linguistics) the form of a word after all affixes are removed [base, radical, root, stem, theme]</p><p><b>korijenje, korijenov sistem, korijenov sustav, korijenski sistem, korijenski sustav, ishodište, izvor, korijen, početak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fixedness by or as if by roots</p><p><i>n.</i> a developed system of roots [root system]</p><p><i>n.</i> the place where something begins, where it springs into being [beginning, origin, root, source]</p><p><b>(od biljke u loncu) koja je prevelika za svoj spremnik što dovodi do čvrstosti ili upletanja korijena, s čestima od 8 mm ili više, ali ne više od 8 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a potted plant) grown too large for its container resulting in matting or tangling of the roots [potbound]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having the roots matted or densely tangled</p><p><b>ukorijenjen, ukorijenjene, usađena</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> absolutely still [frozen, stock-still]</p><p><b>administrator, iskorijeniti, izvor, koljenaste biljke, kopati, korijen, korijenski, potkopavati, prikovati, puštati korijenje, uzrok (od &quot;root&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an enthusiastic devotee of sports [fan, sports fan]</p><p><b>veliki goli skunk s bijelom leđom i repom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large naked-muzzled skunk with white back and tail [Conepatus leuconotus, badger skunk, hog-nosed skunk, hognosed skunk]</p><p><b>administrator, iskorijeniti, izvor, koljenaste biljke, kopati, korijen, korijenski, potkopavati, prikovati, puštati korijenje, uzrok (od &quot;root&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of putting forth roots and beginning to grow</p><p><b>Refleks koji se sastoji od okretanja glave i usisavanja pokreta izazvanih kod normalnog djeteta nežnim mazanjem strane usta ili obraza. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> reflex consisting of head-turning and sucking movements elicited in a normal infant by gently stroking the side of the mouth or cheek</p><p><b>izrovati, potkopavati, rovati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> dig with the snout [root, rout]</p><p><b>lutaju bez cilja bez veza s mjestom ili zajednicom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> wandering aimlessly without ties to a place or community [vagabond]</p><p><b>mali korijen ili podjela korijena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small root or division of a root</p><p><b>korijenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of belonging to a particular place or group by virtue of social or ethnic or cultural lineage</p><p><b>vodoravno stablo biljke s izdancima iznad i korijenima ispod koje služe kao reproduktivna struktura (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a horizontal plant stem with shoots above and roots below serving as a reproductive structure [rhizome, rootstock]</p><p><b>podloga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a horizontal plant stem with shoots above and roots below serving as a reproductive structure [rhizome, rootstalk]</p><p><i>n.</i> root or part of a root used for plant propagation</p><p><b>konac, konop, konopac, laso, niska, prevariti, špaga, uže, vezati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strong line</p><p><i>n.</i> street names for flunitrazepan [Mexican valium, R-2, circle, forget me drug, roach, roofy, rophy]</p><p><i>v.</i> catch with a lasso [lasso]</p><p><i>v.</i> fasten with a rope [leash]</p><p><b>most koji se sastoji od užadi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bridge consisting of ropes</p><p><b>otrošak (obično na rukama) uzrokovan trenjem od užeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abrasion (usually on the hands) caused by friction from a rope</p><p><b>Sletjeti s pomoću upitnika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> descend by means of a rappel [abseil, rappel]</p><p><b>prevariti, zavesti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> divide by means of a rope [cordon off, rope off]</p><p><i>v.</i> draw in as if with a rope</p><p><b>ljestve s bočnim dijelovima užeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ladder with side pieces of rope</p><p><b>podijeliti pomoću užeta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> divide by means of a rope [cordon off, rope in]</p><p><b>skijaški vučnik koji nudi samo pokretno uže za držanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ski tow offering only a moving rope to hold onto</p><p><b>Prihvatili su se jedni druge, zbog sigurnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> attach to one another, for safety</p><p><b>Sredstva za proizvodnju električnih goriva i goriva za proizvodnju električnih goriva i goriva za proizvodnju električnih goriva i goriva za proizvodnju električnih goriva i goriva za proizvodnju električnih goriva i goriva za proizvodnju električnih goriva i goriva za proizvodnju električnih goriva i goriva za proizvodnju električnih goriva i goriva za pr