ord</p><p><b>križni splet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nerve plexus formed by the 4th and 5th lumbar and 1st, 2nd, 3rd sacral nerves [plexus sacralis]</p><p><b>Vena sakralne regije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vein of the sacral region [vena sacralis]</p><p><b>jedan od pet kralježnica u ljudskoj kičmi koja se u odrasloj osobi spajaju kako bi formirali krstnu kosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of 5 vertebrae in the human spine that fuse in the adult to form the sacrum</p><p><b>krštenje, otajstvo, pričest, sakrament, simbol, svečana zakletva, zavjet, znak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a formal religious ceremony conferring a specific grace on those who receive it</p><p><b>euharistija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Christian sacrament commemorating the Last Supper by consecrating bread and wine [Eucharist, Eucharistic liturgy, Holy Eucharist, Holy Sacrament, Liturgy, Lord's Supper]</p><p><b>koji donosi oprost, obred koji je propisala Crkva, osobito svečan, pričesni, sakramentalni, svet, svetootajstven</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or involving a sacrament</p><p><b>pričest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of participating in the celebration of the Eucharist [Communion, Holy Communion, manduction]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a consecrated ointment consisting of a mixture of oil and balsam [chrism, chrisom, holy oil]</p><p><b>misno vino</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used in a communion service [altar wine]</p><p><b>Grad u sjevernoj središnjoj Kaliforniji 75 milja sjeveroistočno od San Francisca na rijeci Sacramento (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in north central California 75 miles to the northeast of San Francisco on the Sacramento River [capital of California]</p><p><b>planinski lanac u Novom Meksiku istočno od Rio Grandea (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mountain range in New Mexico to the east of the Rio Grande</p><p><b>rijeka u sjevernoj Kaliforniji koja se uzdiže u blizini planine Shasta i teče na jug do zaljeva San Francisco (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a river in northern California rising near Mount Shasta and flowing south to the San Francisco Bay</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za životinje iz područja iz članka 1. stavka 1. točke (a) ovog članka, za koje se primjenjuje članak 2. točka (a) ovog članka, za životinje iz područja iz članka 1. stavka 2. točke (b) ovog članka, za koje se primjenjuje članak 2. točka (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> food and game fish of marine and fresh waters of northwestern coast of North America [Acipenser transmontanus, Pacific sturgeon, white sturgeon]</p><p><b>dragocjen, svet, Svete, sveti, vjerskih</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> concerned with religion or religious purposes</p><p><i>adj.</i> worthy of respect or dedication</p><p><i>adj.</i> made or declared or believed to be holy [consecrated, sanctified]</p><p><i>adj.</i> worthy of religious veneration [hallowed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (often followed by `to') devoted exclusively to a single use or purpose or person</p><p><b>(Rimska katolička crkva) tijelo svih kardinala crkve (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman Catholic Church) the body of all cardinals of the church [College of Cardinals, Sacred College of Cardinals, cardinalate]</p><p><b>(Rimska katolička crkva) tijelo svih kardinala crkve (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman Catholic Church) the body of all cardinals of the church [College of Cardinals, Sacred College, cardinalate]</p><p><b>osoba za koju se neprimjereno smatra da je imun na kritike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person unreasonably held to be immune to criticism</p><p><b>Indsko smokvo poznato po svojoj velikosti i dugovječnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fig tree of India noted for great size and longevity [Ficus religiosa, bo tree, peepul, pipal, pipal tree, pipul]</p><p><b>Afrički ibis kojeg su štovali drevni Egipćani (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> African ibis venerated by ancient Egyptians [Threskiornis aethiopica]</p><p><b>izvorno iz istočne Azije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> native to eastern Asia [Indian lotus, Nelumbo nucifera, lotus]</p><p><b>Vrh kaktusa mescal u obliku gumbova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the button-shaped top of the mescal cactus [magic mushroom, mescal button]</p><p><b>spis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any writing that is regarded as sacred by a religious group [scripture]</p><p><b>sveti spisi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> writing that is venerated for the worship of a deity [religious text, religious writing, sacred writing]</p><p><b>Sveto Trojstvo, trojstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the union of the Father and Son and Holy Ghost in one Godhead [Blessed Trinity, Holy Trinity, Trinity]</p><p><b>Pisanje koje se časti za obožavanje bogova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> writing that is venerated for the worship of a deity [religious text, religious writing, sacred text]</p><p><b>dragocjen, svet, Svete, sveti, vjerskih (od &quot;sacred&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by religion [religiously]</p><p><b>dragocjen, svet, Svete, sveti, vjerskih (od &quot;sacred&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being sacred</p><p><b>žrtva, žrtvovanje, žrtvovati, gubitak, dati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of losing or surrendering something as a penalty for a mistake or fault or failure to perform etc. [forfeit, forfeiture]</p><p><i>n.</i> personnel that are sacrificed (e.g., surrendered or lost in order to gain an objective)</p><p><i>n.</i> a loss entailed by giving up or selling something at less than its value</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of killing (an animal or person) in order to propitiate a deity [ritual killing]</p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) an out that advances the base runners</p><p><i>v.</i> endure the loss of [give]</p><p><i>v.</i> kill or destroy</p><p><i>v.</i> sell at a loss</p><p><i>v.</i> make a sacrifice of</p><p><b>Žrtva je napravljena udaranjem u dug loptu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sacrifice made by hitting a long fly ball</p><p><b>Ubijanje ili ozlijeđivanje drugih dok se uništavaš (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> killing or injuring others while annihilating yourself [martyr operation, suicide mission]</p><p><b>može se namjerno žrtvovati kako bi se postigao cilj. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> may be deliberately sacrificed to achieve an objective</p><p><b>žrtva, žrtvovanje, žrtvovati (od &quot;sacrifice&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a religious person who offers up a sacrifice</p><p><b>prodan s gubitkom, žrtven, žrtveni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> used in or connected with a sacrifice</p><p><b>bogohuljenje, oskrvnuće, skrnavljenje, svetogrđe</b></p><p><i>n.</i> blasphemous behavior [blasphemy, desecration, profanation]</p><p><b>koji je grozno nepoštovan prema onome što se smatra svetim (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> grossly irreverent toward what is held to be sacred [blasphemous, profane]</p><p><b>Na svetoboljubiv način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a sacrilegious manner</p><p><b>Neprihvalnost zbog počinjenja svetomoljenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> profaneness by virtue of committing sacrilege</p><p><b>službenik crkve koji je zadužen za svete predmete (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an officer of the church who is in charge of sacred objects [sexton]</p><p><b>prostorija u crkvi gdje se čuvaju sveti posudi i oblaci ili održavaju se sastanci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a room in a church where sacred vessels and vestments are kept or meetings are held [vestry]</p><p><b>mora se čuvati sveto. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> must be kept sacred [inviolable, inviolate]</p><p><b>krstača</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wedge-shaped bone consisting of five fused vertebrae forming the posterior part of the pelvis</p><p><b>bijedan, nemio, nepopravljiv, neugodan, opak, sjetan, taman, turoban, tužan, zagasit, žalostan, tužni, tužno, zao</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> experiencing or showing sorrow or unhappiness</p><p><i>adj.</i> of things that make you feel sad</p><p><i>adj.</i> bad [deplorable, distressing, lamentable, pitiful, sorry]</p><p><b>netko tko griješi zbog nesposobnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who makes mistakes because of incompetence [blunderer, botcher, bumbler, bungler, butcher, fuckup, fumbler, stumbler]</p><p><b>Imaju tužno lice. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a face with a sad expression</p><p><b>Egipatski državnik koji je (kao predsjednik Egipta) pregovarao o mirovnom sporazumu s Menahemom Beginom (tadšnji premijer Izraela) (1918-1981) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Egyptian statesman who (as president of Egypt) negotiated a peace treaty with Menachem Begin (then prime minister of Israel) (1918-1981) [Anwar Sadat, Anwar el-Sadat]</p><p><b>Irački vođa koji je vodio rat protiv Irana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Iraqi leader who waged war against Iran [Husain, Husayn, Hussein, Saddam Hussein, Saddam bin Hussein at-Takriti]</p><p><b>Irački vođa koji je vodio rat protiv Irana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Iraqi leader who waged war against Iran [Husain, Husayn, Hussein, Saddam, Saddam Hussein]</p><p><b>Irački vođa koji je vodio rat protiv Irana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Iraqi leader who waged war against Iran [Husain, Husayn, Hussein, Saddam, Saddam bin Hussein at-Takriti]</p><p><b>Strahovana paravojna jedinica koju su 1995. godine osnovali mladi vojnici da služe Saddamu Husseinu protiv domaćih protivnika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feared paramilitary unit formed in 1995 by young soldiers to serve Saddam Hussein against domestic opponents [Fedayeen Saddam]</p><p><b>ražalostiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make unhappy</p><p><i>v.</i> come to feel sad</p><p><b>(Hinduizam) asketni svet čovjek (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Hinduism) an ascetic holy man [sadhu]</p><p><b>opteretiti, osedlati, planinsko sedlo, sedlo, sjedalo, sjedište, sedalo, naprtiti, natovariti, opterećivati, prtiti, tovariti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a seat for the rider of a horse or other animal</p><p><i>n.</i> a pass or ridge that slopes gently between two peaks (is shaped like a saddle) [saddleback]</p><p><i>n.</i> cut of meat (especially mutton or lamb) consisting of part of the backbone and both loins</p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of leather across the instep of a shoe</p><p><i>n.</i> a seat for the rider of a bicycle [bicycle seat]</p><p><i>n.</i> posterior part of the back of a domestic fowl</p><p><i>v.</i> put a saddle on</p><p><i>v.</i> load or burden</p><p><i>v.</i> impose a task upon, assign a responsibility to [burden, charge]</p><p><b>S druge strane, za prevoz vozila s motorom ili motorom koji se vozi na vozilu ili motorima koji se koriste za vožnju na vozilu ili motorima koji se koriste za vožnju na vozilu ili motorima koji se koriste za vožnju na vozilu ili motorima koji se koriste za vožnju na vozilu ili motorima koji se koriste za vožnju na vozilu ili motorima koji se koriste za vožnju na vozilu ili motorima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stable gear consisting of a blanket placed under the saddle [horse blanket, saddlecloth]</p><p><b>dijelovi tijela pacijenta koji bi se dotakli sedla ako bi pacijent sjedio u njemu anesteziju se ubrizgavanjem lokalnog anestezičara u kičmenu moždinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the parts of a patient's body that would touch a saddle if the patient were sitting in one are anesthetized by injecting a local anesthetic into the spinal cord [saddle block anesthesia]</p><p><b>dijelovi tijela pacijenta koji bi se dotakli sedla ako bi pacijent sjedio u njemu anesteziju se ubrizgavanjem lokalnog anestezičara u kičmenu moždinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the parts of a patient's body that would touch a saddle if the patient were sitting in one are anesthetized by injecting a local anesthetic into the spinal cord [saddle block anaesthesia]</p><p><b>dugačko usko pero na leđima (sedlu) domaće piletine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long narrow feather on the back (saddle) of a domestic fowl [saddle hackle]</p><p><b>dugačko usko pero na leđima (sedlu) domaće piletine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long narrow feather on the back (saddle) of a domestic fowl [saddle feather]</p><p><b>visoka palca zapadnog sedla (obično metalno prekriveno kožom) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a high pommel of a Western s