undertaking) secure from risk</p><p><i>adj.</i> having reached a base without being put out</p><p><i>adj.</i> financially safe [dependable, good, secure]</p><p><b>bez opasnosti ili ozljede (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> free from danger or injury [unhurt]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je ciljano društvo u pitanju društvo koje je podložno ograničenim regulatornim propisima, ciljano društvo se brani tako što preuzima društvo koje je pod takvim ograničenim regulatornim propisima i zbog čega je ciljano društvo manje privlačno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the target company defends itself by acquiring a company so onerously regulated that it makes the target less attractive</p><p><b>kuća koju koriste članovi određenih organizacija kao skrovište ili utočište. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a house used as a hiding place or refuge by members of certain organizations</p><p><b>vrijeme tijekom ženskog menstrualnog ciklusa u kojem je najmanje vjerojatno da će se zanos dogoditi (obično neposredno prije ili nakon menstruacije) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> that time during a woman's menstrual cycle during which conception is least likely to occur (usually immediately before of after menstruation)</p><p><b>sigurni spolni odnos, siguran seks</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sexual activity (especially sexual intercourse) with the use of measures (such as latex condoms) to avoid the transmission of disease (especially AIDS)</p><p><b>dokument ili pratnja koja osigurava siguran prolaz kroz područje posebno u ratno vrijeme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a document or escort providing safe passage through a region especially in time of war [safeguard]</p><p><b>od željeza ili čelika, s masenim udjelom čelika od 1 mm ili više, ali ne većim od 1 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fireproof metal strongbox (usually in a bank) for storing valuables [deposit box, lockbox, safe-deposit box, safety-deposit, safety deposit box]</p><p><b>od željeza ili čelika, s masenim udjelom čelika od 1 mm ili više, ali ne većim od 1 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fireproof metal strongbox (usually in a bank) for storing valuables [deposit box, lockbox, safe-deposit, safety-deposit, safety deposit box]</p><p><b>lopov koji otvara sefove kako bi ukrao vrijedne stvari. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thief who breaks open safes to steal valuable contents [cracksman, safecracker]</p><p><b>lopov koji otvara sefove kako bi ukrao vrijedne stvari. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thief who breaks open safes to steal valuable contents [cracksman, safebreaker]</p><p><b>čuvati, jamstvo, mjere zaštite, očuvati, osiguranje, osigurati, propusnica, sigurnost, straža, štititi, zajamčiti, zaštita, zaštititi, zaštitnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a precautionary measure warding off impending danger or damage or injury etc. [guard, precaution]</p><p><i>n.</i> a document or escort providing safe passage through a region especially in time of war [safe-conduct]</p><p><i>v.</i> make safe</p><p><i>v.</i> escort safely</p><p><b>Sklonište od napada. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a refuge from attack</p><p><b>čuvanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the responsibility of a guardian or keeper [guardianship, keeping]</p><p><b>siguran, sigurno, sretno, zdravo</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with safety</p><p><b>sigurnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being safe</p><p><b>osiguranje, osiguravajuće uže, sigurnosan, sigurnost, sigurnosti, sklonište, zaklon, branik, štitnik, gumica, kondom, prezervativ, zaštita</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being certain that adverse effects will not be caused by some agent under defined conditions</p><p><i>n.</i> a safe place [refuge]</p><p><i>n.</i> a device designed to prevent injury or accidents [guard, safety device]</p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) the successful act of striking a baseball in such a way that the batter reaches base safely [base hit]</p><p><i>n.</i> contraceptive device consisting of a sheath of thin rubber or latex that is worn over the penis during intercourse [condom, prophylactic, rubber, safe]</p><p><i>n.</i> a score in American football