ion of ammonium carbonate in ammonia water and alcohol [spirits of ammonia]</p><p><b>Drugi stub islama je molitva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second pillar of Islam is prayer [salaat, salah, salat]</p><p><b>duboka luka, Pozdravite sa salamom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a deep bow</p><p><i>v.</i> greet with a salaam</p><p><b>Drugi stub islama je molitva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second pillar of Islam is prayer [salaah, salah, salat]</p><p><b>S obzirom na to da je proizvod u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, može se upotrebljavati samo za proizvodnju proizvoda koji se upotrebljavaju u proizvodnji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being salable or marketable [salableness]</p><p><b>kurentan, povoljan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being sold [saleable]</p><p><b>kurentan, povoljan (od &quot;salable&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being salable or marketable [salability]</p><p><b>nečist, opscen, pogan, pohotan, pohotljiv, pornografski, puten, razbludan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by lust [lubricious, lustful, prurient]</p><p><i>adj.</i> suggestive of or tending to moral looseness [lewd, obscene, raunchy]</p><p><b>opsceno, pogano, pohotno, puteno, razbludno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a lascivious manner [lasciviously]</p><p><b>nečist, opscen, pogan, pohotan, pohotljiv, pornografski, puten, razbludan (od &quot;salacious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of behaving in an obscene manner [bawdiness, lewdness, obscenity, salacity]</p><p><b>osobina ponašanja na nepristojno način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of behaving in an obscene manner [bawdiness, lewdness, obscenity, salaciousness]</p><p><b>salata, salata pripremljena za jelo, salate, salatu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> food mixtures either arranged on a plate or tossed and served with a moist dressing</p><p><b>bar gdje gosti mogu sastaviti salatu po svom ukusu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bar where diners can assemble a salad to their own taste</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u s