enue, gross sales]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, "prikupljenici" su: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agreement (or contract) in which property is transferred from the seller (vendor) to the buyer (vendee) for a fixed price in money (paid or agreed to be paid by the buyer) [sale]</p><p><b>pult, tezga, štand</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a booth where articles are displayed for sale [stall, stand]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je riječ o proizvodnji proizvoda ili usluga, to znači da se proizvodnja proizvoda ili usluga ne može koristiti za proizvodnju proizvoda ili usluga. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an advertising campaign intended to promote sales</p><p><b>osoba koja pokaže predmet potencijalnom kupcu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who demonstrates an article to a prospective buyer [demonstrator]</p><p><b>Sredstva za upravljanje poslovnim sustavom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the division of a business that is responsible for selling products or services [sales division, sales force]</p><p><b>Sredstva za upravljanje poslovnim sustavom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the division of a business that is responsible for selling products or services [sales department, sales force]</p><p><b>rasprodaja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an occasion (usually brief) for buying at specially reduced prices [cut-rate sale, sale]</p><p><b>Financijska društva koja kupuju (s popustom) ugovore o prodaji na rate trgovca na malo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a finance company that buys (at a discount) the installment sales contracts of retail merchants</p><p><b>Sredstva za upravljanje poslovnim sustavom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the division of a business that is responsible for selling products or services [sales department, sales division]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 1303/2013 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> remuneration offered to a salesperson for exceeding some predetermined sales goal</p><p><b>dućan, prodavaonica, trgovina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a place of busin