ski general koji je pokušao da slomi teksašku pobunu i koji je izgubio bitke protiv Winfielda Scotta i Zacharyja Taylora u meksičkom ratu (1795-1876), grad u južnoj Kaliforniji istočno od Long Beacha, Grad u zapadnom El Salvadoru. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strong hot dry wind that blows in winter from the deserts of southern California toward the Pacific Coast</p><p><i>n.</i> Mexican general who tried to crush the Texas revolt and who lost battles to Winfield Scott and Zachary Taylor in the Mexican War (1795-1876) [Antonio Lopez de Santa Ana, Antonio Lopez de Santa Anna, Santa Anna]</p><p><i>n.</i> a city in southern California to the east of Long Beach</p><p><i>n.</i> a city in western El Salvador</p><p><b>Meksikanski general koji je pokušao da slomi teksašku pobunu i koji je izgubio bitke protiv Winfielda Scotta i Zacharyja Taylora u meksičkom ratu (1795-1876) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Mexican general who tried to crush the Texas revolt and who lost battles to Winfield Scott and Zachary Taylor in the Mexican War (1795-1876) [Antonio Lopez de Santa Ana, Antonio Lopez de Santa Anna, Santa Ana]</p><p><b>Grad u jugozapadnoj Kaliforniji na Pacifiku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a town in southwestern California on the Pacific Ocean</p><p><b>otok u Pacifiku uz jugozapadnu obalu Kalifornije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an island resort in the Pacific off the southwestern coast of California [Catalina Island]</p><p><b>Grad u zapadnoj središnjoj Kaliforniji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city of west central California</p><p><b>Djed Mraz, Deda Mraz</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the legendary patron saint of children [Father Christmas, Kriss Kringle, Saint Nicholas, Saint Nick, Santa, St. Nick]</p><p><b>Grad u zapadnoj Kaliforniji na zaljevu Monterey, Grad u središnjem Boliviji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a town in western California on Monterey Bay</p><p><i>n.</i> a city in central Bolivia</p><p><b>rijetka California cipres veći od ali blisko povezan s gowen cipres i ponekad se smatra istom vrs