mitted to an orbiting satellite that receives the signal and amplifies it and transmits it back to earth [satellite TV]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 10 kVA ili više, ali ne više od 10 kVA (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transmitter on a communications satellite</p><p><b>Televizijski sustav u kojem se signal prenosi na satelit koji je u orbiti i koji prima signal i pojačava ga i prenosi ga natrag na zemlju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a television system in which the signal is transmitted to an orbiting satellite that receives the signal and amplifies it and transmits it back to earth [satellite television]</p><p><b>zadovoljavajući, zadovoljiti</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being sated [satisfiable]</p><p><b>prezasićen, zasićenost, zasititi, najedati se, najesti se, zasititi se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> fill to satisfaction [fill, replete, sate]</p><p><i>v.</i> overeat or eat immodestly [binge, englut, engorge, glut, gorge, gormandise, gormandize, gourmandize, ingurgitate, overeat, overgorge, overindulge, pig out, scarf out, stuff]</p><p><i>adj.</i> supplied (especially fed) to satisfaction [satiated]</p><p><b>zalihe (posebno hranjene) do zadovoljavanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> supplied (especially fed) to satisfaction [satiate]</p><p><b>utoljavanje, zasićenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being satisfactorily full and unable to take on more [repletion, satiety]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of achieving full gratification</p><p><b>Francuski skladatelj poznat po svom eksperimentalnosti i odbacivanju romantizma (1866-1925) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French composer noted for his experimentalism and rejection of Romanticism (1866-1925) [Erik Alfred Leslie Satie, Erik Satie]</p><p><b>prezasićenost, sitost, zasićenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being satisfactorily full and unable to take on more [repletion, satiation]</p><p><b>atlas, saten, svila</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a smooth fabric of silk or rayon</p><p><b>jugoistočne Australije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> of southeast 