/i> (Roman mythology) god of agriculture and vegetation</p><p><b>orgija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an orgiastic festival in ancient Rome in honor of Saturn</p><p><i>n.</i> a wild gathering involving excessive drinking and promiscuity [bacchanal, bacchanalia, debauch, debauchery, drunken revelry, orgy, riot]</p><p><b>vrsta rod Saturniidae: carski molj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Saturniidae: emperor moth [genus Saturnia]</p><p><b>veliki molj umjerenih šuma Evroazije s vrlo masno skalo transparentnim krilima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large moth of temperate forests of Eurasia having heavily scaled transparent wings [emperor, emperor moth]</p><p><b>veliki svijetle boje i obično tropski molj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large brightly colored and usually tropical moth [saturniid moth]</p><p><b>veliki svijetle boje i obično tropski molj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large brightly colored and usually tropical moth [saturniid]</p><p><b>važna i široko rasprostranjena obitelj molja uključujući neke od najvećih poznatih insekata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> important and widely distributed family of moths including some of the largest insects known [family Saturniidae]</p><p><b>mrzovoljan, olovni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> bitter or scornful</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing a brooding ill humor [dark, dour, glowering, glum, moody, morose, sour, sullen]</p><p><b>To je stanje koje nastaje usisivanjem prevelikog ulja u sustav. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> toxic condition produced by the absorption of excessive lead into the system [lead poisoning, plumbism]</p><p><b>oblik nenasilnog otpora koji je u Indiji započeo Mahatma Gandhi kako bi se suprotstavio britanskoj vladavini i ubrzao političke reforme. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the form of nonviolent resistance initiated in India by Mahatma Gandhi in order to oppose British rule and to hasten political reforms</p><p><b>Indijski fizičar koji je s Albertom Einsteinom predložio statističke zakone zasnovane na neosobljenosti čestica. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Indian physicist who with Albert Einstein proposed statistical laws based on the indistinguishability of particles [Bose, Satyendra Nath Bose]</p><p><b>Indijski fizičar koji je s Albertom Einsteinom predložio statističke zakone zasnovane na neosobljenosti čestica. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Indian physicist who with Albert Einstein proposed statistical laws based on the indistinguishability of particles [Bose, Satyendra N. Bose]</p><p><b>satir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> man with strong sexual desires [lech, lecher, letch]</p><p><i>n.</i> one of a class of woodland deities [forest god]</p><p><b>Orhideja s širokim ovativnim listovima i dugim zelenim cvjetovima vrlo nepravilnim. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> orchid with broad ovate leaves and long-bracted green very irregular flowers [Coeloglossum bracteatum]</p><p><b>Staro grčki burleske s zborom satira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ancient Greek burlesque with a chorus of satyrs</p><p><b>neuobičajeno intenzivna seksualna želja kod muškaraca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormally intense sexual desire in men</p><p><b>satir (od &quot;satyr&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or having the characteristics of a satyr [satyrical]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s satirom ili koje imaju karakteristike satira (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or having the characteristics of a satyr [satyric]</p><p><b>široko rasprostranjena obitelj leptira u blizini rubova šume (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a widely distributed family of butterflies common near the edges of woods [family Satyridae]</p><p><b>bezobrazluk, biti bezobrazan s kime, drskost, odbrusiti, pekmez, preliti sosom, sok, sos, umak, umakom, začin, začiniti, preljev</b></p><p><i>n.</i> flavorful relish or dressing or topping served as an accompaniment to food</p><p><i>v.</i> behave saucily or impudently towards</p><p><i>v.</i> dress (food) with a relish</p><p><i>v.</i> add zest or flavor to, make more interesting</p><p><b>kremasto bijelo umak s hrskavicom i senkom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> creamy white sauce with horseradish and mustard [horseradish sauce]</p><p><b>Crni umak i puré od rajčica s lukom i gljivicama i suhim bijelim vinom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> brown sauce and tomato puree with onions and mushrooms and dry white wine [hunter's sauce]</p><p><b>Slijedeći proizvodi:, Brus ili govedina zažeta maslacem i brašnom ruxom i različito začinjena biljkama ili Worcestershireom itd. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> brown sauce with tomatoes and a caramelized mixture of minced carrots and onions and celery seasoned with Madeira [Espagnole]</p><p><i>n.</i> bouillon or beef stock thickened with butter and flour roux and variously seasoned with herbs or Worcestershire etc. [brown sauce]</p><p><b>Majonesa i krema kombinirana s kosivom zelenom paprikom i zelenim lukom začinjenim čili sosom i Worcestershire sosom i sokom limuna (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mayonnaise and heavy cream combined with chopped green pepper and green onion seasoned with chili sauce and Worcestershire sauce and lemon juice</p><p><b>Majonesa s estragonom ili čunjom i nabijena vodena kresta i špinat ili krastavac (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mayonnaise with tarragon or dill and chopped watercress and spinach or cucumber [green mayonnaise]</p><p><b>ulje i ocat s senkom i češnjakom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> oil and vinegar with mustard and garlic [French dressing, vinaigrette]</p><p><b>Europska biljka koja miriše na češnjak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European herb that smells like garlic [Alliaria officinalis, garlic mustard, hedge garlic, jack-by-the-hedge]</p><p><b>jelo (često u obliku čamca) za serviranje umaka ili umaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dish (often boat-shaped) for serving gravy or sauce [boat, gravy boat, gravy holder]</p><p><b>lonac za pirjanje, plitka posuda, rajngla s drškom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a deep pan with a handle</p><p><b>lonac za kuhanje koji ima ručke na obje strane i čvrsto prikladan poklopac (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cooking pot that has handles on either side and tight fitting lid</p><p><b>taca, tanjur, tanjurić, tanjurić pod šalicom, disk, gramofonska ploča, okrugla ploča, antena, parabolična antena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something with a round shape resembling a flat circular plate [disc, disk]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small shallow dish for holding a cup at the table</p><p><i>n.</i> directional antenna consisting of a parabolic reflector for microwave or radio frequency radiation [dish, dish aerial, dish antenna]</p><p><i>n.</i> a disk used in throwing competitions [discus]</p><p><b>Veliki listovit grm ili malo stablo s velikim otvorenim ružičastim do ljubičastim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large deciduous shrub or small tree having large open rosy to purplish flowers [Chinese magnolia, Magnolia soulangiana]</p><p><b>s velikim okruglim otvorenim očima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having large round wide-open eyes [round-eyed]</p><p><b>s konkavnim oblikom tanjira (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a concave shape like a saucer</p><p><b>bezobrazno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an impudent or impertinent manner [freshly, impertinently, impudently, pertly]</p><p><b>bezobrazluk, bezobraznost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inappropriate playfulness [archness, impertinence, perkiness, pertness]</p><p><b>bezobrazan, drzak, kicoški, pomodarski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by a lightly pert and exuberant quality [impertinent, irreverent, pert]</p><p><i>adj.</i> improperly forward or bold [fresh, impertinent, impudent, overbold, sassy, smart, wise]</p><p><b>u Saudijskoj Arabiji rođen ili živi u toj zemlji, o ili u vezi sa Saudijskom Arabijom ili njenim stanovnicima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or inhabitant of Saudi Arabia [Saudi Arabian]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Saudi Arabia or its people [Saudi-Arabian]</p><p><b>Saudijska Arabija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an absolute monarchy occupying most of the Arabian Peninsula in southwest Asia [Kingdom of Saudi Arabia]</p><p><b>u Saudijskoj Arabiji rođen ili živi u toj zemlji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.<