m (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who swindles you by means of deception or fraud [chiseler, chiseller, defrauder, gouger, grifter, swindler]</p><p><b>tropska američka jutarnja slava, od žutica iz korena Convolvulus scammonia, biljka s krema do ljubičaste boje i dugim debelim korijenima koja daje katartičnu smolu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American morning glory [Ipomoea orizabensis]</p><p><i>n.</i> resin from the root of Convolvulus scammonia</p><p><i>n.</i> twining plant of Asia Minor having cream-colored to purple flowers and long thick roots yielding a cathartic resin [Convolvulus scammonia]</p><p><b>tropska američka prostrata ili penjiva biljka sa ogromnim škrobnim korijenom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American prostrate or climbing herbaceous perennial having an enormous starchy root [Ipomoea fastigiata, Ipomoea panurata, man-of-the-earth, manroot, wild potato vine, wild sweet potato vine]</p><p><b>fakin, loše raditi, nitkov, protuha, zabrljati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who is playfully mischievous [imp, monkey, rapscallion, rascal, scalawag, scallywag]</p><p><i>v.</i> perform hastily and carelessly</p><p><b>bježanje, letimice čitati, pobjeći, umaknuti, žuriti se, hitati, juriti, odjuriti, pohitati, pojuriti, požuriti, požuriti se, žuriti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rushing about hastily in an undignified way [scramble, scurry]</p><p><i>v.</i> to move about or proceed hurriedly [scurry, scuttle, skitter]</p><p><b>škampi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large shrimp sauteed in oil or butter and garlic</p><p><b>U lovu u europskim vodama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> caught in European waters [Norwegian lobster, langoustine]</p><p><b>gledati, ispitati, ispitivanje, ispitivati, istraživati, motriti, očitati, osmatranje, osmatrati, pregledavati, preletjeti, pretražiti, pretraživanje, pretraživati, razgledati, razlaganje, razlagati, skaniranje, skenirati, pregledati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of scanning</p><p><i>n.</i> an image produced by scanning [CAT scan]</p><p><i>v.</i> examine minutely or intensely</p><p><i>v.</i> examine hastily [glance over, rake, run down, skim]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a wide, sweeping search of</p><p><i>v.</i> conform to a metrical pattern</p><p><i>v.</i> move a light beam over</p><p><i>v.</i> read metrically</p><p><i>v.</i> obtain data from magnetic tapes or other digital sources [read]</p><p><b>bruka, nečastan čovjek, skandal, spletke, sramota</b></p><p><i>n.</i> disgraceful gossip about the private lives of other people [dirt, malicious gossip]</p><p><i>n.</i> a disgraceful event [outrage]</p><p><b>stanje šokiranosti (kao što je neprikladno ponašanje), čin skandaloznog ponašanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being shocked (as by improper behavior) [scandalization]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of scandalizing [outrage, scandalization]</p><p><b>zaprepastiti, zgranuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> strike with disgust or revulsion [appal, appall, offend, outrage, scandalize, shock]</p><p><b>stanje šokiranosti (kao što je neprikladno ponašanje), čin skandaloznog ponašanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being shocked (as by improper behavior) [scandalisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of scandalizing [outrage, scandalisation]</p><p><b>olajavati, zaprepastiti, zgranuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> strike with disgust or revulsion [appal, appall, offend, outrage, scandalise, shock]</p><p><b>osoba koja širi zlonamjerne tračeve. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who spreads malicious gossip</p><p><b>Širi zloćudne tračeve., tipično za tabloide. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spreading malicious gossip</p><p><i>adj.</i> typical of tabloids [sensationalistic, yellow]</p><p><b>sablažnjiv, skandalozan, sramotan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> giving offense to moral sensibilities and injurious to reputation [disgraceful, shameful, shocking]</p><p><b>sablažnjiv, skandalozan, sramotan (od &quot;scandalous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a scandalous manner</p><p><b>sablažnjiv, skandalozan, sramotan (od &quot;scandalous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> disgracefulness that offends public morality</p><p><b>primjenjuje se posebno na biljke (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> used especially of plants</p><p><b>mali red koji obuhvaća samo škrge: u nekim klasifikacijama škrge se smatraju ili primatima (i uključeni u podred Prosimii) ili pravim insektivorima (i uključeni u red Insectivora) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small order comprising only the tree shrews: in some classifications tree shrews are considered either primates (and included in the suborder Prosimii) or true insectivores (and included in the order Insectivora) [order Scandentia]</p><p><b>poluostrvo u sjevernoj Europi koje zauzimaju Norveška i Švedska, grupa kulturno povezanih zemalja u sjevernoj Europi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the peninsula in northern Europe occupied by Norway and Sweden [Scandinavian Peninsula]</p><p><i>n.</i> a group of culturally related countries in northern Europe</p><p><b>Skandinavac, skandinavski, skandinavskom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inhabitant of Scandinavia [Norse, Northman]</p><p><i>n.</i> the northern family of Germanic languages that are spoken in Scandinavia and Iceland [Nordic, Norse, North Germanic, North Germanic language, Scandinavian language]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Scandinavia or its peoples or cultures [Norse]</p><p><b>bilo koja od zemalja koje okupiraju Skandinaviju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any one of the countries occupying Scandinavia [Scandinavian nation]</p><p><b>sjeverni rod Germaničkih jezika koji se govore u Skandinaviji i Islandu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the northern family of Germanic languages that are spoken in Scandinavia and Iceland [Nordic, Norse, North Germanic, North Germanic language, Scandinavian]</p><p><b>Slaninski losos u solari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> salt-cured Scandinavian salmon</p><p><b>bilo koja od zemalja koje okupiraju Skandinaviju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any one of the countries occupying Scandinavia [Scandinavian country]</p><p><b>poluostrvo u sjevernoj Europi koje zauzimaju Norveška i Švedska (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the peninsula in northern Europe occupied by Norway and Sweden [Scandinavia]</p><p><b>skandij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white trivalent metallic element [Sc, atomic number 21]</p><p><b>čitač, čitač osnovne poruke elektroničke pošte, ispitivač, pretraživač, pretražnik, razlagač slika, redni čitač, skaner, skener, skeneru, slikovni čitač, uređaj za ispitivanje, uređaj za pretraživanje, uređaj za skeniranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who scans verse to determine the number and prosodic value of the syllables</p><p><i>n.</i> an electronic device that generates a digital representation of an image for data input to a computer [digital scanner, image scanner]</p><p><i>n.</i> a radar dish that rotates or oscillates in order to scan a broad area</p><p><i>n.</i> a radio receiver that moves automatically across some selected range of frequencies looking for some signal or condition [electronic scanner]</p><p><b>pregled sadržaja, pretraživanje, razlaganje, skeniranje, snimanje, traženje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of translating photographs into a digital form that can be recognized by a computer</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of systematically moving a finely focused beam of light or electrons over a surface in order to produce an image of it for analysis or transmission</p><p><b>razlaganje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> analysis of verse into metrical patterns</p><p><b>mali, mršav, nedovoljan, oskudan, redak, škrtariti, tvrdičiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> work hastily or carelessly [skimp]</p><p><i>v.</i> limit in quality or quantity [skimp]</p><p><i>v.</i> supply sparingly and with restricted quantities [skimp, stint]</p><p><i>adj.</i> less than the correct or legal or full amount often deliberately so [light, short]</p><p><b>malen, mršav, ograničen, oskudan, skučen, skućen, škrt, štedljiv, tek dostatan (od &quot;scanty&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a skimpy manner [skimpily]</p><p><b>Neadekvatno obučen (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> inadequately clothed [hal