.</i> resembling a scarecrow in being thin and ragged</p><p><b>prestrašen, uplašen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> made afraid [frightened]</p><p><b>Osoba koja širi strašne glasine i izaziva nevolje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who spreads frightening rumors and stirs up trouble [stirrer]</p><p><b>strašilo, strašilo za ptice</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an effigy in the shape of a man to frighten birds away from seeds [bird-scarer, scarecrow, straw man, strawman]</p><p><b>čoja, kravata, marama, rubac, spoj, šal, veliki rubac, vratna marama</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a garment worn around the head or neck or shoulders for warmth or decoration</p><p><i>n.</i> a joint made by notching the ends of two pieces of timber or metal so that they will lock together end-to-end [scarf joint]</p><p><i>v.</i> masturbate while strangling oneself</p><p><i>v.</i> unite by a scarf joint</p><p><i>v.</i> wrap in or adorn with a scarf</p><p><b>zavoj za podupiranje ozlijeđene podlaktice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bandage to support an injured forearm [sling, triangular bandage]</p><p><b>Čvor od dva komada drveta ili metala koji se povezuju na dva kraja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a joint made by notching the ends of two pieces of timber or metal so that they will lock together end-to-end [scarf]</p><p><b>prejedati ili jesti neprimjereno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> overeat or eat immodestly [binge, englut, engorge, glut, gorge, gormandise, gormandize, gourmandize, ingurgitate, overeat, overgorge, overindulge, pig out, satiate, stuff]</p><p><b>Američki gangster koji je terorizirao Chicago tijekom prohibicije dok nije uhićen zbog utaje poreza (1899-1947) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States gangster who terrorized Chicago during prohibition until arrested for tax evasion (1899-1947) [Al Capone, Alphonse Capone, Capone]</p><p><b>štap koji se koristi za držanje kravate na mjestu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pin used to hold the tie in place [tie tack, tiepin]</p><p><b>ribe papige (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> parrotfishes [f