en to doubt [doubting, questioning, skeptical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> denying or questioning the tenets of especially a religion [disbelieving, skeptical, unbelieving]</p><p><b>koji sumnja, skeptičan (od &quot;sceptical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with scepticism [skeptically]</p><p><b>psihologija, agnosticizam, skepticizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the disbelief in any claims of ultimate knowledge [agnosticism, skepticism]</p><p><b>žezlo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the imperial authority symbolized by a scepter [scepter]</p><p><i>n.</i> a ceremonial or emblematic staff [scepter, verge, wand]</p><p><b>koji je dobio pravnu moć ili službeni autoritet, posebno kao što je simbolizirano posjedovanjem žezla (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> invested with legal power or official authority especially as symbolized by having a scepter [empowered, sceptered]</p><p><b>koordinirano univerzalno vrijeme na brodu svemirske letjelice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the coordinated universal time on board the spacecraft [spacecraft event time]</p><p><b>uživanje u tuđoj nesreći. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> delight in another person's misfortune</p><p><b>jedna vrsta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one species [genus Schaffneria]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fern of the genus Schaffneria [Asplenium nigripes, Scolopendrium nigripes]</p><p><b>dodatak ispravi, dodijeliti, grafikon, inventar, katalog, lista, napraviti raspored, plan, planirati, popis, predvidjeti, pregled, prilog, raspored, red vožnje, sastaviti grafikon, sastaviti popis, satnica, spisak, tabela, trajanje, unijeti u raspored, vozni red, vremenski plan, vremenski raspored, zakazati, program</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a temporally organized plan for matters to be attended to [agenda, docket]</p><p><i>n.</i> an ordered list of times at which things are planned to occur</p><p><i>v.</i> plan for an activity or event</p><p><i>v.</i> make a schedule</p><p><b>U slučaju da je dijete ili životinja u stanju da se hrani u skladu s određenim redoslijedom (npr.