me or formula [schematisation]</p><p><b>izraziti shematski, opisati shematski</b></p><p><i>v.</i> formulate in regular order</p><p><i>v.</i> give conventional form to [schematise]</p><p><b>dijagram, intrige, mapa, nacrt, napraviti plan, obris, plan, plan rada, planirati, postavke, praviti planove, pregled, program, raspored, shema, sistem, spletka, spletkariti, spletke, planovima, shemu, strategija, sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an elaborate and systematic plan of action [strategy]</p><p><i>n.</i> a statement that evades the question by cleverness or trickery [dodge, dodging]</p><p><i>n.</i> a group of independent but interrelated elements comprising a unified whole [system]</p><p><i>n.</i> an internal representation of the world [schema]</p><p><i>n.</i> a schematic or preliminary plan [outline, schema]</p><p><i>v.</i> form intrigues (for) in an underhand manner [connive, intrigue]</p><p><i>v.</i> devise a system or form a scheme for</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u pitanju luk čija je visina manja od polovine njegove širine, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an arch whose height is less than half its width [diminished arch, skeen arch, skene arch]</p><p><b>projektant</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a planner who draws up a personal scheme of action [plotter]</p><p><b>planiranje</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> acting with a specific goal [calculating, calculative, conniving, shrewd]</p><p><i>adj.</i> concealing crafty designs for advancing your own interest [designing]</p><p><b>(Jidish) zbunjena situacija ili afera (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Yiddish) a confused situation or affair [shemozzle]</p><p><b>grad u istočnom New Yorku na rijeci Mohawk (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city of eastern New York on the Mohawk river</p><p><b>(religija) svijet mrtvih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (religion) the world of the dead [Hades, Hell, infernal region, netherworld, underworld]</p><p><b>brzi pokreti (obično u trostrukom vremenu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fast movement (usually in triple time)</p><p><b>rod monocotyledonous b