xual reproduction by multiple fission</p><p><b>koji se karakteriziraju simptomima sličnim, ali manje teškim od shizofrenije, od ili povezane s ili karakteristične za shizofreniju, Označen povlačenjem i nemogućnošću uspostavljanja bliskih odnosa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> characterized by symptoms similar to but less severe than schizophrenia [schizotypal personality]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of schizophrenia [schizophrenic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by withdrawal and inability to form close relationships</p><p><b>prethodna klasifikacija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a former classification [class Schizomycetes]</p><p><b>Dodatno: uobičajena je za proizvodnju i prodaju u SAD-u. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dainty South American annual having deeply pinnatifid leaves and racemes of fringed almond-scented purple-white flowers [Schizopetalon walkeri]</p><p><b>Dodatno: uobičajena je za proizvodnju i prodaju u SAD-u. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dainty South American annual having deeply pinnatifid leaves and racemes of fringed almond-scented purple-white flowers [schizopetalon]</p><p><b>malen rod listnatog penjanja i puzećeg grma s bijelim cvjetovima u ravnim grmovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of deciduous climbing and creeping shrubs with white flowers in flat clusters [genus Schizophragma]</p><p><b>Kretanje grm s lepljivim zrnama s suprotnim lištima i malim bijelim cvijećima u krajnjim cimetama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> climbing shrub with adhesive aerial roots having opposite leaves and small white flowers in terminal cymes [climbing hydrangea]</p><p><b>shizofrenija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several psychotic disorders characterized by distortions of reality and disturbances of thought and language and withdrawal from social contact [dementia praecox, schizophrenic disorder, schizophrenic psychosis]</p><p><b>šizofrenik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is afflicted with schizophrenia</p><p><i>adj.</i> suffering from some form of schizophrenia