emporary reunion of the Greek Orthodox with the Roman Catholic Church [Lyons]</p><p><b>Sedmi ekumenski koncil 787. godine koji je odbacio ikonoklazu i regulirao obožavanje svetih slika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the seventh ecumenical council in 787 which refuted iconoclasm and regulated the veneration of holy images [Nicaea]</p><p><b>dijete prvog rođaka roditelja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a child of a first cousin of one's parent</p><p><b>crni živc koji služi mrežnjači (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cranial nerve that serves the retina [nervus opticus, optic nerve, optic tract]</p><p><b>Križarski rat od 1145. do 1147. godine koji je propao zbog unutarnjih nesuglasica među križarima i doveo do gubitka Jeruzalema 1187. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Crusade from 1145 to 1147 that failed because of internal disagreements among the crusaders and led to the loss of Jerusalem in 1187</p><p><b>gornja zaštitna paluba koja se proteže duž cijele dužine velikog broda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the uppermost sheltered deck that runs the entire length of a large vessel [main deck]</p><p><b>Englez koji je kao premijer provodio socijalne reforme uključujući ukidanje ropstva širom Britanskog Carstva (1764-1845) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Englishman who as Prime Minister implemented social reforms including the abolition of slavery throughout the British Empire (1764-1845) [Charles Grey, Grey]</p><p><b>Engleski državnik i sin Pit Starijeg (1759-1806) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English statesman and son of Pitt the Elder (1759-1806) [Pitt, Pitt the Younger, William Pitt]</p><p><b>Britanski državnik pod Georgeom III čije je politike dovele do pobune u američkim kolonijama (1732-1792) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> British statesman under George III whose policies led to rebellion in the American colonies (1732-1792) [Frederick North, North]</p><p><b>carska vlada Napoleona III u Francuskoj od 1852. do 1870. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the imperial government of Napoleon III in France from 1852-1870</p><p><b>drugo Novozavjetno pismo koje se tradicionalno pripisuje Svetom Ivanu Apostolu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second New Testament epistle traditionally attributed to Saint John the Apostle [II John]</p><p><b>Druga poslanica Korinćanima</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a New Testament book containing the second epistle from Saint Paul to the church at Corinth [II Corinthians, Second Epistle to the Corinthians]</p><p><b>Novozavjetna knjiga koja sadrži drugo pismo Svetog Pavla Solunjanima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a New Testament book containing Saint Paul's second epistle to the Thessalonians [II Thessalonians, Second Epistle to the Thessalonians]</p><p><b>knjiga Novog zavjeta koja sadrži drugo pismo Svetog Pavla Timoteju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a New Testament book containing Saint Paul's second epistle to Timothy [II Timothy, Second Epistle to Timothy]</p><p><b>Druga Petrova poslanica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second New Testament book traditionally attributed to Saint Peter the Apostle [II Peter]</p><p><b>Druga poslanica Korinćanima</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a New Testament book containing the second epistle from Saint Paul to the church at Corinth [II Corinthians, Second Epistle of Paul the Apostle to the Corinthians]</p><p><b>Novozavjetna knjiga koja sadrži drugo pismo Svetog Pavla Solunjanima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a New Testament book containing Saint Paul's second epistle to the Thessalonians [II Thessalonians, Second Epistle of Paul the Apostle to the Thessalonians]</p><p><b>knjiga Novog zavjeta koja sadrži drugo pismo Svetog Pavla Timoteju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a New Testament book containing Saint Paul's second epistle to Timothy [II Timothy, Second Epistle of Paul the Apostle to Timothy]</p><p><b>plemstvo u Francuskoj i plemićstvo u Britaniji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the nobility in France and the peerage in Britain [Lords Temporal]</p><p><b>osoba koja služi u potčinjenom ili sporednom položaju, sekundarna uloga ili funkcija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> some