h another at a lower temperature</p><p><b>poručnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commissioned officer in the Army or Air Force or Marine Corps holding the lowest rank [2nd lieutenant]</p><p><b>Engleski državnik koji je bio premijer i koji se protivio ratu s američkim kolonijama (1730-1782) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English statesman who served as prime minister and who opposed the war with the American colonies (1730-1782) [Charles Watson-Wentworth, Rockingham]</p><p><b>očekivana vrijednost kvadrata odstupanja nasumične varijable od točke podrijetla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the expected value of the square of the deviations of a random variable from the point of origin</p><p><b>U slučaju hipoteke koja je podređena prvoj hipoteki, u slučaju hipoteke koja je podređena prvoj hipoteki, u slučaju hipoteke koja je podređena prvoj hipoteki, u slučaju hipoteke koja je podređena prvoj hipoteki, u slučaju hipoteke koja je podređena prvoj hipoteki, u slučaju hipoteke koja je podređena prvoj hipoteki. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mortgage that is subordinate to a first mortgage</p><p><b>-Nastavljeno ponašanje koje se vježba toliko dugo da se čini urođenim. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> acquired behavior that is practiced so long it seems innate</p><p><b>Drugi dio u koji je igra igre podijeljena. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second division into which the play of a game is divided</p><p><b>Pronoms i glagola koja se koriste za upućivanje na osobu kojoj se obraća jezikom na kojem se pojavljuju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pronouns and verbs used to refer to the person addressed by the language in which they occur</p><p><b>druga potencija, kvadrat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the product of two equal terms [square]</p><p><b>drugi prijedlog zakona u zakonodavnom tijelu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second presentation of a bill in a legislature</p><p><b>Reich kada su Hohenzollerni monarhi vladali Njemačkom (od 1871. do 1919.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the Reich when Hohenzollern monarchs ruled Germany (from 1871 to 1919) [Hohenzollern empire]</p><p><b>(baseball) osoba koja igra drugu bazu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) the person who plays second base [second baseman]</p><p><b>esp, vidovitost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> apparent power to perceive things that are not present to the senses [E.S.P., ESP, clairvoyance, extrasensory perception]</p><p><b>drugi kompartimant želuca žderca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second compartment of the stomach of a ruminant [reticulum]</p><p><b>tim igrača koji su dostupni bilo pojedinačno ili kao tim kako bi se uklonili ili zamijenili igrači koji su započeli igru. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a squad of players that are available either individually or as a team to relieve or replace the players who started the game</p><p><b>razmišljanje o odluci koju si ranije donio. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thinking again about a choice previously made [afterthought, reconsideration, rethink]</p><p><b>razdoblje koje se proteže od 13. do 27. tjedna trudnoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> time period extending from the 13th to the 27th week of gestation</p><p><b>II vatikanski koncil</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the Vatican Council in 1962-1965 that abandoned the universal Latin liturgy and acknowledged ecumenism and made other reforms [Vatican II]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se u slučaju poduzeća ne provede primjena ovog pravila, poduzeća mogu imati:, povratak relativno lagog disanja nakon početnog iscrpljenja tijekom kontinuiranog napora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> renewed energy or strength to continue an undertaking</p><p><i>n.</i> the return of relatively easy breathing after initial exhaustion during continuous exertion</p><p><b>Drugi svjetski rat, II svjetski rat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a war between the Allies (Australia, Belgium, Bolivia, Brazil, Canada, China, Colombia, Costa Rica, Cuba, Czechoslovakia, Dominican Republic, El Salvador, Ethiopia, France, Greece, Guatemala, Haiti, Honduras, India, Iran, Iraq, Luxembourg, Mexico, Netherlands, New Zealand, Nicaragua, Norway, Panama, Philippines, Poland, South Africa, United Kingdom, United States, USSR, Yugoslavia) and the Axis (Albania, Bulgaria, Finland, Germany, Hungary, Italy, Japan, Rumania, Slovakia, Thailand) from 1939 to 1945 [World War 2, World War II]</p><p><b>gotovo najbolji, skoro prava stvar</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> next to the best</p><p><i>adv.</i> in second place</p><p><b>za manje kvalitetne proizvode (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of inferior status or quality</p><p><b>Opekline koje uzrokuju plikove na koži i površinsko uništavanje derme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> burn causing blisters on the skin and superficial destruction of the dermis</p><p><b>pokušaj predviđanja ili predviđanja, ocjenjivati ili kritizirati s naglištem (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> attempt to anticipate or predict [outguess]</p><p><i>v.</i> evaluate or criticize with hindsight</p><p><b>slušan razgovor (posebno slušan razgovor preko mobitela) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> overheard conversation (especially overheard cellphone conversation)</p><p><b>trgovina koja prodaje ručno robu po sniženim cijenama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a shop that sells secondhand goods at reduced prices [thriftshop]</p><p><b>dozapovjednik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who relieves a commander</p><p><b>završetak na drugom mjestu (kao u utrci) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a finish in second place (as in a race) [runner-up finish]</p><p><b>Srednji do lošiji kvalitet (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> moderate to inferior in quality [mediocre]</p><p><b>Osoba druge klase sposobnosti ili vrijednosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person of second-rate ability or value [mediocrity]</p><p><b>predviđanje budućnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> foreseeing the future [clairvoyant, precognitive]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je član tima u stalnom sastavu, on je zamjena ili zamjena za stalnog člana tima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being a replacement or substitute for a regular member of a team</p><p><b>sportista koji igra samo kada je početnik u timu zamijenjen. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an athlete who plays only when a starter on the team is replaced [reserve, substitute]</p><p><b>korišten u drugoj godini srednje škole ili koledža u Sjedinjenim Državama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> used of the second year in United States high school or college [sophomore]</p><p><b>drugi po redu, drugostepen, dupli, podčinjen, podređeni, pomoćni, sekundar, sekundaran, sekundarni, sporedan, sporedni, srednje, sekundarna (od &quot;secondary&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> of secondary import</p><p><b>drugi po redu, drugostepen, dupli, podčinjen, podređeni, pomoćni, sekundar, sekundaran, sekundarni, sporedan, sporedni, srednje, sekundarna</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the defensive football players who line up behind the linemen</p><p><i>n.</i> coil such that current is induced in it by passing a current through the primary coil [secondary coil, secondary winding]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being of second rank or importance or value</p><p><i>adj.</i> inferior in rank or status [junior-grade, lower-ranking, lowly, petty, subaltern]</p><p><i>adj.</i> depending on or incidental to what is original or primary</p><p><i>adj.</i> not of major importance</p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging to a lower class or rank</p><p><b>prekid menstruacije kod žene koja je ranije imala menstruaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cessation of menstruation in a woman who had previously menstruated</p><p><b>akumulator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cell that can be recharged [storage cell]</p><p><b>Oružane snage cenzura osobnih komunikacija časnika ili civilnih zaposlenika ili regrutiranog osoblja koje nisu predmet primarne cenzure (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> armed forces censorship of the personal communications of officers or civilian employees or enlisted personnel not subject to primary censorship</p><p><b>Svojina tako da se struja inducira kroz primarni kotlov. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coil such that current is induced in it by passing a current through the primary coil [secondary, secondary winding]</p><p><b>izlječenje stalnih zuba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dentition of permanent teeth</p><p><b>dijagonala kvadratne matrice koja ide od donjeg lijevog ulaza do gornjeg desnog ulaza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the diagonal of a square matrix running from the lower left entry to the upper right entry</p><p><b>bolno mjesečnice koje je uzrokovano nekim specifičnim poremećajem (kao što je endometrioza) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> painful menstruation that is caused by some specific disorder (as endometriosis)</p><p><b>srednje obrazovanje, srednjoškolsko obrazovanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> education beyond the elementary grades</p><p><b>emisija elektrona s površine koja je bombardirana primarnim elektronima veće energije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the emission of electrons from a surface that is bombarded by higher energy primary electrons</p><p><b>sekundarna hipertenzija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hypertension that is secondary to another disease</p><p><b>bivša britanska srednja škola koja naglašava praktično umjesto akademsko obrazovanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a former British secondary school emphasizing practical rather than academic education</p><p><b>nastava, srednja škola, srednjoškolske</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a school for students intermediate between elementary school and college [Gymnasium, lycee, lyceum, middle school]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u slučaju izravnog ispitivanja ne primjenjuje primjena ovog članka, nadležno tijelo može se odlučiti o tome da li je primjena ovog članka primjenjiva na sve osobe koje su u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EZ) br. 651/2004. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the genetically determined sex characteristics that are not functionally necessary for reproduction (pitch of the voice and body hair and musculature) [secondary sex characteristic, secondary sexual characteristic]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u slučaju izravnog ispitivanja ne primjenjuje primjena ovog članka, nadležno tijelo može se odlučiti o tome da li je primjena ovog članka primjenjiva na sve osobe koje su u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EZ) br. 651/2004. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the genetically determined sex characteristics that are not functionally necessary for reproduction (pitch of the voice and body hair and musculature) [secondary sex character, secondary sexual characteristic]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u slučaju izravnog ispitivanja ne primjenjuje primjena ovog članka, nadležno tijelo može se odlučiti o tome da li je primjena ovog članka primjenjiva na sve osobe koje su u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EZ) br. 651/2004. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the genetically determined sex characteristics that are not functionally necessary for reproduction (pitch of the voice and body hair and musculature) [secondary sex character, secondary sex characteristic]</p><p><b>uređaj za pohranu podataka koji nije glavna memorija računala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a data storage device that is not the main memory of a computer [auxiliary storage, external storage]</p><p><b>Drugi stupanj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second stage</p><p><b>Svojina tako da se struja inducira kroz primarni kotlov. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coil such that current is induced in it by passing a current through the primary coil [secondary, secondary coil]</p><p><b>časak, dio, drugi, drugi po činu, drugorazredan, manji, podržati, pomagati, pomoći, pomoćnik, sekunda, sekundirati, svjedok dvoboja, tren, druga, druge, drugi glas, drugo, drugog, drugoj, drugom, sekundi (od &quot;second&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who endorses a motion or petition as a necessary preliminary to a discussion or vote</p><p><b>polovan, rabljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> derived from what is primary or original</p><p><i>adj.</i> previously used or owned by another [used]</p><p><i>adv.</i> by indirect means</p><p><b>automobil koji je prethodno bio u vlasništvu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a car that has been previously owned [used-car]</p><p><b>drugo</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in the second place [second]</p><p><b>privremeni premještaj zaposlenika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a speech seconding a motion [endorsement, indorsement, second]</p><p><i>n.</i> the detachment of a person from their regular organization for temporary assignment elsewhere</p><p><b>drugi ili donji dio dueta (posebno klavirski duet) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second or lower part of a duet (especially a piano duet)</p><p><b>obitelj gljiva koje imaju stabljku i kapa i bore masne tkive (gleb) gdje se proizvode spore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a family of fungi that have a stalk and cap and a wrinkled mass of tissue (the gleba) where spores are produced [family Secotiaceae]</p><p><b>red gljiva koji pripadaju klasi Gasteromycetes (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an order of fungi belonging to the class Gasteromycetes [order Secotiales]</p><p><b>Jedinica astronomske dužine temeljena na udaljenosti od Zemlje na kojoj je zvezdana paralaks 1 sekunda luka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of astronomical length based on the distance from Earth at which stellar parallax is 1 second of arc [parsec]</p><p><b>čuvanje tajne, izdvajanje, izolacija, tajanstvenost, tajna, tajnost, tajnovitost, uzdržljivost, zakopčanost, privatnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of keeping things secret [secretiveness, silence]</p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being concealed or hidden [concealment, privacy, privateness]</p><p><b>povučen, skriven, skrovit, tajan, tajanstven, tajna, tajni, tajnost, uzdržljiv, tajnim, misterij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something that should remain hidden from others (especially information that is not to be passed on)</p><p><i>n.</i> information known only to a special group [arcanum]</p><p><i>n.</i> something that baffles understanding and cannot be explained [closed book, enigma, mystery]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not open or public</p><p><i>adj.</i> conducted with or marked by hidden aims or methods [clandestine, cloak-and-dagger, hole-and-corner, hugger-mugger, hush-hush, surreptitious, undercover, underground]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not openly made known [unavowed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> communicated covertly</p><p><i>adj.</i> not expressed [private]</p><p><i>adj.</i> designed to elude detection [hidden]</p><p><i>adj.</i> hidden from general view or use [privy, secluded]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of information) given in confidence or in secret [confidential]</p><p><i>adj.</i> indulging only covertly</p><p><i>adj.</i> having an import not apparent to the senses nor obvious to the intelligence [mysterious, mystic, mystical, occult, orphic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> the next to highest level of official classification for documents</p><p><b>obavještajac, operativac, tajni agent, uhoda, špija, špijun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person secretly employed in espionage for a government [intelligence agent, intelligence officer, operative]</p><p><b>(zakon) šutno odobrenje nečijeg krivičnog djela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) tacit approval of someone's wrongdoing [connivance, tacit consent]</p><p><b>tajno glasovanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vote in which each person's choice is secret but the totaled votes are public</p><p><b>tajni način pisanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a secret method of writing [cipher, cryptograph, cypher]</p><p><b>vladina agencija u Ujedinjenom Kraljevstvu koja je odgovorna za unutarnju sigurnost i kontraobavještaj u inozemstvu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the government agency in the United Kingdom that is responsible for internal security and counterintelligence overseas [MI, Military Intelligence Section 6]</p><p><b>plan, tajni plan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a secret scheme to do something (especially something underhand or illegal) [game, plot]</p><p><b>policijski tim koji djeluje u tajnosti (obično protiv osoba osumnjičenih za izdaju ili pobunu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a police force that operates in secrecy (usually against persons suspected of treason or sedition)</p><p><b>tajna služba, obavještajna služba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the United States intelligence agency that protects current and former presidents and vice presidents and their immediate families and protects distinguished foreign visitors [SS, USSS, US Secret Service, United States Secret Service]</p><p><b>tajno društvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a society that conceals its activities from nonmembers</p><p><b>Uređaj za proizvodnju električnih goriva, Čin pisanja u šifriranom obliku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of writing in code or cipher [cryptogram, cryptograph]</p><p><i>n.</i> act of writing in code or cipher [coding, cryptography, steganography]</p><p><b>stol za pisanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a desk used for writing [escritoire, secretary, writing table]</p><p><b>sekretarski, tajnica, tajnički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a secretary or to a secretary's work</p><p><b>osobna pomoćnica, sekretarica, tajnica, tajnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an assistant who handles correspondence and clerical work for a boss or an organization [secretary]</p><p><b>škola u kojoj se uče tajničke vještine (kucanje na tipku, skraćivanje i dostavljanje itd.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a school where secretarial skills (typing and shorthand and filing etc) are taught</p><p><b>tajništvo, tajništvu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an administrative unit responsible for maintaining records and other secretarial duties [secretariate]</p><p><i>n.</i> thoroughbred that won the triple crown in 1973</p><p><b>Upravni odbor za upravljanje poslovnim sustavom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an administrative unit responsible for maintaining records and other secretarial duties [secretariat]</p><p><b>sekretar, sekretarica, tajnica, tajnik, tajnika, osobna pomoćnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is head of an administrative department of government</p><p><i>n.</i> an assistant who handles correspondence and clerical work for a boss or an organization [secretarial assistant]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person to whom a secret is entrusted [repository]</p><p><i>n.</i> a desk used for writing [escritoire, secretaire, writing table]</p><p><b>sekretar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large long-legged African bird of prey that feeds on reptiles [Sagittarius serpentarius]</p><p><b>tajnik ministarstva, glavni tajnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is a chief administrator (as of the United Nations)</p><p><b>osoba koja je sekretar Ministarstva poljoprivrede, poziciju šefa Odjela za poljoprivredu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Department of Agriculture [Agriculture Secretary]</p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the Department of Agriculture [Agriculture Secretary]</p><p><b>osoba koja je sekretarica Ministarstva trgovine, Službeni položaj: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Department of Commerce [Commerce Secretary]</p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the Department of Commerce [Commerce Secretary]</p><p><b>Glavni direktor bivšeg izvršnog odjela osnovanog 1903. i podijeljenog na dva odjela 1913. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> head of a former executive department created in 1903 and divided into two departments in 1913</p><p><b>Osoba koja je sekretar Ministarstva obrane, položaj šefa Ministarstva obrane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Defense Department [Defense Secretary]</p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the Department of Defense [Defense Secretary]</p><p><b>osoba koja je sekretar Ministarstva obrazovanja, poziciju šefa Odjela za obrazovanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Department of Education [Education Secretary]</p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the Education Department [Education Secretary]</p><p><b>osoba koja je sekretar Ministarstva energetike, položaj šefa Odjela za energetiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Department of Energy [Energy Secretary]</p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the Department of Energy [Energy Secretary]</p><p><b>osoba koja je sekretar Ministarstva zdravstva i socijalnih usluga, Službeni članovi: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Department of Health and Human Services</p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the Department of Health and Human Services</p><p><b>Glavni direktor bivšeg izvršnog odjela osnovanog 1953. godine i podijeljenog na dva odjela 1979. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> head of a former executive department created in 1953 and divided into two departments in 1979</p><p><b>osoba koja je sekretar Ministarstva za stanovanje i urbani razvoj, poziciju šefa Odjela za stanovanje i urbani razvoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Department of Housing and Urban Development</p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the Department of Housing and Urban Development</p><p><b>Osoba koja ima tajnikstvo Ministarstva rada, položaj šefa Odjela za rad (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Department of Labor [Labor Secretary]</p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the Department of Labor [Labor Secretary]</p><p><b>Osoba koja je sekretar State Departmenta, ministar vanjskih poslova., položaj šefa State Departmenta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Department of State</p><p><i>n.</i> a government minister for foreign relations [foreign minister]</p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the State Department</p><p><b>Britanski ministar koji je šef Ministarstva unutarnjih poslova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the British cabinet minister who is head of the Home Office [Home Secretary]</p><p><b>položaj šefa Ministarstva unutarnjih poslova, Osoba koja je sekretar Ministarstva unutarnjih poslova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the Department of the Interior [Interior Secretary]</p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Interior Department [Interior Secretary]</p><p><b>šef bivšeg izvršnog odjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> head of a former executive department [Navy Secretary]</p><p><b>osoba koja je sekretarica Ministarstva financija, poziciju šefa Ministarstva financija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Treasury Department [Treasury Secretary]</p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the Treasury Department [Treasury Secretary]</p><p><b>osoba koja je sekretarica Odjela za promet, poziciju šefa Odjela za promet (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Department of Transportation [Transportation Secretary]</p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the Department of Transportation [Transportation Secretary]</p><p><b>osoba koja je sekretar Odjela za pitanja veterana, položaj šefa Odjela za poslove veterana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the secretaryship of the Department of Veterans Affairs</p><p><i>n.</i> the position of the head of the Department of Veterans Affairs</p><p><b>šef bivšeg izvršnog odjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> head of a former executive department [War Secretary]</p><p><b>položaj tajnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the position of secretary</p><p><b>skup enzima za koje se vjeruje da režu dijelove dužeg proteina, stvarajući fragmente amiloidnog proteina koji se skupljaju i stvaraju amiloidne proteinske plakove u tkivu mozga (patološki znak Alzheimerove bolesti) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a set of enzymes believed to snip pieces off a longer protein producing fragments of amyloid protein that bunch up and create amyloid protein plaques in brain tissue (the pathological hallmark of Alzheimer's)</p><p><b>kriti, lučiti, izlučivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> generate and separate from cells or bodily fluids [release]</p><p><i>v.</i> place out of sight</p><p><b>organ za izlučivanje, sekrecijski organ, žlijezda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various organs that synthesize substances needed by the body and release it through ducts or directly into the bloodstream [gland, secretor, secretory organ]</p><p><b>hormon iz želučnog crijeva koji stimulira izlučivanje vode i bikarbonata iz gušterače i žučnih cijevi kad god želudac isprazni previše kiseline u tanko crijevo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gastrointestinal hormone that stimulates the secretion of water and bicarbonate from the pancreas and bile ducts whenever the stomach empties too much acid into the small intestine</p><p><b>izlučivanje, sakrivanje, izlučevina, lučevina, sekret</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the organic process of synthesizing and releasing some substance [secernment]</p><p><i>n.</i> a functionally specialized substance (especially one that is not a waste) released from a gland or cell</p><p><b>ćutljiv, tajanstven</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> inclined to secrecy or reticence about divulging information [close, closelipped, closemouthed, tightlipped]</p><p><b>ćutljiv, tajanstven (od &quot;secretive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a secretive manner</p><p><b>tajanstvenost, tajnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> characterized by a lack of openness (especially about one's actions or purposes) [closeness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of keeping things secret [secrecy, silence]</p><p><b>potajno, šutke</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in secrecy [in secret, on the Q.T., on the QT]</p><p><i>adv.</i> not openly</p><p><b>organ za izlučivanje, sekrecijski organ, žlijezda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various organs that synthesize substances needed by the body and release it through ducts or directly into the bloodstream [gland, secreter, secretory organ]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s ili stvaraju izlučivanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or producing a secretion</p><p><b>organ za izlučivanje, sekrecijski organ, žlijezda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various organs that synthesize substances needed by the body and release it through ducts or directly into the bloodstream [gland, secreter, secretor]</p><p><b>druga polovica menstrualnog ciklusa nakon ovulacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the second half of the menstrual cycle after ovulation [luteal phase]</p><p><b>sekta, frakcija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a subdivision of a larger religious group [religious order, religious sect]</p><p><i>n.</i> a dissenting clique [faction]</p><p><b>raskolnički, sektaš, sektaški, sekte, sljedbenik vjerske sljedbe</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of a sect [sectarist, sectary]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of a sect or sects</p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging to or characteristic of a sect</p><p><b>Uštromisao prisutnost određenoj sekti ili stranci ili denominaciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a narrow-minded adherence to a particular sect or party or denomination [denominationalism]</p><p><b>član sekte. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of a sect [sectarian, sectary]</p><p><b>član sekte. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of a sect [sectarian, sectarist]</p><p><b>blok, četvrt, desetina, dio, dionica, oblast, odjel, odjeljak, odjeljenje, odlomak, odrezak, odsjek, paragraf, presjeći, presjek, prikazati, profil, rastaviti, rez, sekcija, teren, dijelu, glava, pasus, poglavlje, stavak, isječak, preparat, okrug, segment, odjsečak, segmentirati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a self-contained part of a larger composition (written or musical) [subdivision]</p><p><i>n.</i> a very thin slice (of tissue or mineral or other substance) for examination under a microscope</p><p><i>n.</i> a distinct region or subdivision of a territorial or political area or community or group of people</p><p><i>n.</i> one of several parts or pieces that fit with others to constitute a whole object [segment]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small team of policemen working as part of a police platoon</p><p><i>n.</i> one of the portions into which something is regarded as divided and which together constitute a whole [division, part]</p><p><i>n.</i> a land unit equal to 1 square mile</p><p><i>n.</i> (geometry) the area created by a plane cutting through a solid [plane section]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small class of students who are part of a larger course but are taught separately [discussion section]</p><p><i>n.</i> a division of an orchestra containing all instruments of the same class</p><p><i>n.</i> a small army unit usually having a special function</p><p><i>n.</i> a specialized division of a large organization [department]</p><p><i>n.</i> a segment of a citrus fruit</p><p><i>n.</i> the cutting of or into body tissues or organs (especially by a surgeon as part of an operation) [incision, surgical incision]</p><p><i>v.</i> divide into segments [segment]</p><p><b>vojnik koji je dobio otkaz odjeljka osam kao nesposoban za vojnu službu, otpuštanje iz američke vojske na temelju nesposobnosti ili osobina karaktera koje se smatraju neželjenim (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a soldier who received a Section Eight discharge as unfit for military service</p><p><i>n.</i> a discharge from the US Army based on unfitness or character traits deemed undesirable</p><p><b>radni tim dodijeljen dijelu željeznice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a work crew assigned to a section of a railroad</p><p><b>radnik dodijeljen u odjel band (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a laborer assigned to a section gang</p><p><b>netko tko predaje dio velikog koledža. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who teaches a section of a large college course</p><p><b>dioni, sekcijski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of furniture made up of sections that can be arranged individually or together</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or based upon a section (i.e. as if cut through by an intersecting plane)</p><p><i>adj.</i> consisting of or divided into sections [sectioned]</p><p><i>adj.</i> related or limited to a distinct region or subdivision of a territory or community or group of people</p><p><b>Čin podjele ili podjele (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of dividing or partitioning [division, partition, partitioning, sectionalization, segmentation]</p><p><b>podijeliti na dijelove, posebno na geografske dijelove (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> divide into sections, especially into geographic sections [sectionalize]</p><p><b>Stranost prema nekom mjestu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a partiality for some particular place [localism, provincialism]</p><p><b>Čin podjele ili podjele (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of dividing or partitioning [division, partition, partitioning, sectionalisation, segmentation]</p><p><b>podijeliti na dijelove, posebno na geografske dijelove (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> divide into sections, especially into geographic sections [sectionalise]</p><p><b>blok, četvrt, desetina, dio, dionica, oblast, odjel, odjeljak, odjeljenje, odlomak, odrezak, odsjek, paragraf, presjeći, presjek, prikazati, profil, rastaviti, rez, sekcija, teren, dijelu (od &quot;section&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> consisting of or divided into sections [sectional]</p><p><b>dio zemljišta, grana, isječak, područje, sektor, šestar, zona, dio područja (pokrivanja ćelije posluživan jednom, sektora</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plane figure bounded by two radii and the included arc of a circle</p><p><i>n.</i> a social group that forms part of the society or the economy</p><p><i>n.</i> a particular aspect of life or activity [sphere]</p><p><i>n.</i> the minimum track length that can be assigned to store information</p><p><i>n.</i> a portion of a military position</p><p><i>n.</i> measuring instrument consisting of two graduated arms hinged at one end</p><p><b>sektorski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or resembling a sector</p><p><b>oralni beta- blokator (trgovinski naziv Sectral) koji se koristi za liječenje hipertenzije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an oral beta blocker (trade name Sectral) used in treating hypertension [acebutolol]</p><p><b>jednom u sto g., necrkveni, stogodišnji, svjetovni, vječit, laik, laički, sekularan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is not a clergyman or a professional person [layman, layperson]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the doctrine that rejects religion and religious considerations</p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of or devoted to the temporal world as opposed to the spiritual world [temporal, worldly]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not concerned with or devoted to religion [profane]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to clergy not bound by monastic vows</p><p><i>adj.</i> characteristic of those who are not members of the clergy [laic, lay]</p><p><b>Stogodišnji obred i igre drevnog Rima koji su označavali početak nove generacije (100 godina predstavlja najduži život u generaciji) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the centennial rites and games of ancient Rome that marked the commencement of a new generation (100 years representing the longest life in a generation) [Ludi Saeculares]</p><p><b>doktrina koja naglašava sposobnost osobe za samo-realizaciju kroz razum (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the doctrine emphasizing a person's capacity for self-realization through reason [humanism]</p><p><b>Aktivnost promjene nečega (umjetnosti, obrazovanja, društva, morala itd.) tako da više nije pod kontrolom ili utjecajem religije., prijenos imovine iz crkvene u građansku vlast (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of changing something (art or education or society or morality etc.) so it is no longer under the control or influence of religion [secularization]</p><p><i>n.</i> transfer of property from ecclesiastical to civil possession [secularization]</p><p><b>da se posvetimo i odmaknemo od vjerske orijentacije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make secular and draw away from a religious orientation [secularize]</p><p><b>sekularizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a doctrine that rejects religion and religious considerations</p><p><b>zagovornik sekularizma. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an advocate of secularism</p><p><b>sekularizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of changing something (art or education or society or morality etc.) so it is no longer under the control or influence of religion [secularisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> transfer of property from ecclesiastical to civil possession [secularisation]</p><p><b>da se posvetimo i odmaknemo od vjerske orijentacije., prijenos iz crkvenog u civilno posjedovanje, korištenje ili kontrolu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make secular and draw away from a religious orientation [secularise]</p><p><i>v.</i> transfer from ecclesiastical to civil possession, use, or control [desacralize]</p><p><b>žena koja je po drugi put trudna (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman who is pregnant for the second time [gravida II]</p><p><b>dobiti, dobro čuvan, neopasan, nepokolebljiv, osiguranja, osigurati, postojan, pouzdan, pribaviti, siguran, sigurnost, učvrstiti, uvjeren, uvjeriti, zajamčiti, sigurna, sigurno, dobaviti, dobavljati, ishoditi, nabaviti, nabavljati, namaknuti, namicati, osiguravati, pribavljati, priskrbiti, priskrbljivati, fiksirati, pričvrstiti, pričvršćivati, učvršćivati, zapuniti, začepiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> get by special effort [procure]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be firmly attached [fasten, fix]</p><p><i>v.</i> assure payment of</p><p><i>v.</i> make certain of [assure, ensure, guarantee, insure]</p><p><i>v.</i> fill or close tightly with or as if with a plug [plug, stop up]</p><p><i>v.</i> furnish with battens [batten, batten down]</p><p><i>adj.</i> free from fear or doubt [unafraid, untroubled]</p><p><i>adj.</i> free from danger or risk</p><p><i>adj.</i> not likely to fail or give way</p><p><i>adj.</i> immune to attack [impregnable, inviolable, strong, unassailable, unattackable]</p><p><i>adj.</i> financially safe [dependable, good, safe]</p><p><b>Obveznica koja je osigurana kolateralom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bond that is back by collateral</p><p><b>dobiti, dobro čuvan, neopasan, nepokolebljiv, osiguranja, osigurati, postojan, pouzdan, pribaviti, siguran, sigurnost, učvrstiti, uvjeren, uvjeriti, zajamčiti, sigurna, sigurno (od &quot;secure&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a secure manner [firmly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a confident and unselfconscious manner</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a manner free from fear or risk</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an invulnerable manner</p><p><b>dobiti, dobro čuvan, neopasan, nepokolebljiv, osiguranja, osigurati, postojan, pouzdan, pribaviti, siguran, sigurnost, učvrstiti, uvjeren, uvjeriti, zajamčiti, sigurna, sigurno (od &quot;secure&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of freedom from fear or danger</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being fixed in place as by some firm attachment [fastness, fixedness, fixity, fixture]</p><p><b>dobiti, dobro čuvan, neopasan, nepokolebljiv, osiguranja, osigurati, postojan, pouzdan, pribaviti, siguran, sigurnost, učvrstiti, uvjeren, uvjeriti, zajamčiti, sigurna, sigurno (od &quot;secure&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who obtains or acquires [procurer]</p><p><b>analitičar koji proučava financijske rezultate korporacija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an analyst who studies the financial performance of corporations [financial analyst]</p><p><b>Komisija za vrijednosne papire i burzu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an independent federal agency that oversees the exchange of securities to protect investors [SEC]</p><p><b>poslovni posao trgovačkog posrednika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stock broker's business [brokerage, brokerage firm]</p><p><b>tržište, tržište vrijednosnica, tržište vrijednosnih papira</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the securities markets in the aggregate [market]</p><p><b>Zakon o izdavanju i prodaji vrijednosnih papira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the body of laws governing the issuance and selling of securities</p><p><b>tržište vrijednosnih papira, burza, burza dionica, efektna burza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exchange where security trading is conducted by professional stockbrokers [stock exchange, stock market]</p><p><b>garancija, jamstvo, novčani papiri, osiguranje, pokriće, sigurnosan, sigurnost, uvjerenost, uvjerenje, zaloga, zaštićenost, zaštita, sigurnosne, sigurnosnim, sigurnosti, alarm</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being free from danger or injury</p><p><i>n.</i> defense against financial failure [protection]</p><p><i>n.</i> freedom from anxiety or fear</p><p><i>n.</i> a formal declaration that documents a fact of relevance to finance and investment [certificate]</p><p><i>n.</i> property that your creditor can claim in case you default on your obligation [surety]</p><p><i>n.</i> a department responsible for the security of the institution's property and workers [security department]</p><p><i>n.</i> a guarantee that an obligation will be met [surety]</p><p><i>n.</i> an electrical device that sets off an alarm when someone tries to break in [security measure, security system]</p><p><i>n.</i> measures taken as a precaution against theft or espionage or sabotage etc. [security measures]</p><p><b>bilo što što odrasla osoba koristi za smanjenje anksioznosti, deka (ili igračka) koju dijete nosi s sobom kako bi smanjila tjeskobu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> anything that an adult person uses to reduce anxiety</p><p><i>n.</i> a blanket (or toy) that a child carries around in order to reduce anxiety</p><p><b>savjetnik za alarmne sustave za sprečavanje provale (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an adviser about alarm systems to prevent burglaries</p><p><b>Vijeće sigurnosti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a permanent council of the United Nations [SC]</p><p><b>Odjel odgovoran za sigurnost imovine i radnika institucije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a department responsible for the security of the institution's property and workers [security]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je kreditni račun u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u slučaju da je kreditni račun u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 3. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount of collateral a customer deposits with a broker when borrowing from the broker to buy securities [margin]</p><p><b>voditelj privatne sigurnosne snage koja radi za tvrtku ili industriju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> head of a private security force working for a business or industry</p><p><b>siguronosna služba, zaštitarska služba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a privately employed group hired to protect the security of a business or industry [private security force]</p><p><b>čuvar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a guard who keeps watch [watcher, watchman]</p><p><b>obavještajni podaci o identitetu i sposobnostima i namjerama neprijateljskih pojedinaca ili organizacija koji se mogu baviti špijunažom ili sabotažom ili subverzijom ili terorizmom; (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intelligence on the identity and capability and intentions of hostile individuals or organizations that may be engaged in espionage or sabotage or subversion or terrorism</p><p><b>Agencija za zaštitu privatnosti (CIS) je agencija kanadske vlade koja nadzire aktivnosti Criminal Intelligence Services of Canada i ima ovlast da se upliće u privatnost osumnjičenih terorista ili špijuna. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency of the Canadian government that oversees the activities of the Criminal Intelligence Services of Canada and has the power to intrude on the privacy of suspected terrorists or spies [SIRC]</p><p><b>sigurnosni interes</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any interest in a property that secures the payment of an obligation</p><p><b>alarm</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electrical device that sets off an alarm when someone tries to break in [security, security system]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 2. točkom (a) Uredbe (EZ) br. 765/2008 Europska unija može odobriti da se u skladu s člankom 21. stavkom (b) Uredbe (EZ) br. 765/2009 primjenjuje Uredba (EZ) br. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> measures taken as a precaution against theft or espionage or sabotage etc. [security]</p><p><b>Kontraobavještajna služba koja se ostvaruje zabranom ili brisanjem bilo kakvih informacija od vrijednosti za neprijatelja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> counterintelligence achieved by banning or deleting any information of value to the enemy [censoring, censorship]</p><p><b>vladina agencija u Ujedinjenom Kraljevstvu koja je odgovorna za unutarnju sigurnost i kontraobavještaj na britanskom području. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the government agency in the United Kingdom that is responsible for internal security and counterintelligence on British territory [MI, Military Intelligence Section 5]</p><p><b>osobe u organizaciji odgovornoj za sprečavanje špijuniranja ili krađe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> those in an organization responsible for preventing spying or theft</p><p><b>sigurnosni sustav, alarm</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computing) a system that enforces boundaries between computer networks</p><p><i>n.</i> an electrical device that sets off an alarm when someone tries to break in [security, security measure]</p><p><b>brzina kojom se crveni krvni stanice uspoređuju u krvnoj cijevi pod standardiziranim uvjetima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the rate at which red blood cells settle out in a tube of blood under standardized conditions [ESR, erythrocyte sedimentation rate, sedimentation rate]</p><p><b>Grad u istočnom središnjem Missouriju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a town in east central Missouri</p><p><b>nosiljka, limuzina, sedan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a car that is closed and that has front and rear seats and two or four doors [saloon]</p><p><i>n.</i> a closed litter for one passenger [sedan chair]</p><p><b>za jedan putnik zatvoreni koš za jedan putnik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a closed litter for one passenger [sedan]</p><p><b>miran, sabran, smiren, staložen, trijezan, uravnotežen, smiriti, umiriti, uspavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be calm or quiet as by administering a sedative to [calm, tranquilize, tranquillise, tranquillize]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by dignity and propriety [staid]</p><p><i>adj.</i> dignified and somber in manner or character and committed to keeping promises [grave, sober, solemn]</p><p><b>miran, sabran, smiren, staložen, trijezan, uravnotežen (od &quot;sedate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a sedate manner [calmly]</p><p><b>sabranost, staloženost, uravnoteženost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a trait of dignified seriousness [solemness, solemnity, staidness]</p><p><b>uspavljivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of reduced excitement or anxiety that is induced by the administrative of a sedative agent</p><p><i>n.</i> the administration of a sedative agent or drug [drugging]</p><p><b>sedativ, sredstvo za smirenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that reduces excitability and calms a person [depressant, downer, sedative drug]</p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to soothe or tranquilize [ataractic, ataraxic, tranquilising, tranquilizing, tranquillising, tranquillizing]</p><p><b>sedativ, sredstvo za smirenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that reduces excitability and calms a person [depressant, downer, sedative]</p><p><b>sedativ koji smanjuje aktivnost središnjeg živčanog sustava i smanjuje anksioznost i izaziva san (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sedative that depresses activity of the central nervous system and reduces anxiety and induces sleep [sedative-hypnotic drug]</p><p><b>sedativ koji smanjuje aktivnost središnjeg živčanog sustava i smanjuje anksioznost i izaziva san (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sedative that depresses activity of the central nervous system and reduces anxiety and induces sleep [sedative-hypnotic]</p><p><b>sjedeći</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> requiring sitting or little activity</p><p><b>(Judaizam) ceremonijalna večera prve noći (ili obje noći) Pashe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Judaism) the ceremonial dinner on the first night (or both nights) of Passover [Passover supper]</p><p><b>rogoz, šaš, trska</b></p><p><i>n.</i> grasslike or rushlike plant growing in wet places having solid stems, narrow grasslike leaves and spikelets of inconspicuous flowers</p><p><b>mala europska ptica koja se razmnožava među trsima i klinovima i zimi u Africi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small European warbler that breeds among reeds and wedges and winters in Africa [Acrocephalus schoenobaenus, reedbird, sedge warbler, sedge wren]</p><p><b>škrob (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bulrush [Cyperaceae, family Cyperaceae]</p><p><b>trstenjak rogozar, trstenjak trščar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small Eur