e disruption or overthrow of the government</p><p><b>buntovan, revolucionaran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> arousing to action or rebellion [incendiary, incitive, inflammatory, instigative, rabble-rousing]</p><p><i>adj.</i> in opposition to a civil authority or government [insurgent, subversive]</p><p><b>planetoid od stijena i leda oko tri četvrtine veličine Plutona otkriven 2003. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a planetoid of rock and ice about three-quarters the size of Pluto discovered in 2003</p><p><b>iskušavati, prevariti, sablazan, sablazniti, upotpuniti, zavesti, zavoditi, zavođenje</b></p><p><i>v.</i> induce to have sex [make, score]</p><p><i>v.</i> lure or entice away from duty, principles, or proper conduct</p><p><b>napasnik, zavodnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bad person who entices others into error or wrongdoing</p><p><i>n.</i> a man who takes advantage of women [ladies' man, lady killer]</p><p><b>prijevara, zavođenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> enticing someone astray from right behavior</p><p><i>n.</i> an act of winning the love or sexual favor of someone [conquest]</p><p><b>napastan, napastno, privlačljiv, privlačljivo, zamaman, zamamno, zavodljiv, zavodljivo, zavodnički</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to entice into a desired action or state</p><p><b>napastan, napastno, privlačljiv, privlačljivo, zamaman, zamamno, zavodljiv, zavodljivo, zavodnički (od &quot;seductive&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a tempting seductive manner [temptingly]</p><p><b>zavodnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman who seduces</p><p><b>radinost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being constantly diligent and attentive [sedulousness]</p><p><b>istrajan, marljiv, neumoran, radan, ustrajan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by care and persistent effort [assiduous]</p><p><b>istrajan, marljiv, neumoran, radan, ustrajan (od &quot;sedulous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a sedulous manner</p><p><b>istrajan, marljiv, neumoran, radan, ustrajan (od &quot;sedulous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being constan