of goods for an agreed sum of money [marketing, merchandising]</p><p><b>osoba koja prodaje robu (na proviziju) za druge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who sells goods (on commission) for others</p><p><b>karakteristika nečega što je na prodaju koja ga čini privlačnim za potencijalne kupce (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a characteristic of something that is up for sale that makes it attractive to potential customers</p><p><b>prodajna cijena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the price at which something is offered for sale [asking price]</p><p><b>Konjska utrka u kojoj se pobjednički konj mora staviti na dražbu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a horse race in which the winning horse must be put up for auction</p><p><b>Prodaja relativno velikog broja imovine (stokovi ili obveznice ili robna sredstva) po niskom cijeni koja se obično provodi radi njihovog raspolaganja, a ne kao normalna trgovina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sale of a relatively large number of assets (stocks or bonds or commodities) at a low price typically done to dispose of them rather than as normal trade</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom materijala od 85% ili više, ali ne više od 50%,, zavezati ili pričvršćivati selotapom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> transparent or semitransparent adhesive tape (trade names Scotch tape and Sellotape) used for sealing or attaching or mending [Scotch tape, cellulose tape]</p><p><i>v.</i> fasten or attach with sellotape [scotch tape]</p><p><b>netko tko je prodao., događaj na koji su sve karte prodate, prodaja cjelokupnog zaliha nečega., Izdaja vlastitih načela, načela, zemlje, cilja itd. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who has sold out</p><p><i>n.</i> an event for which all tickets are sold</p><p><i>n.</i> the selling of an entire stock of something</p><p><i>n.</i> a betrayal of one's principles principles, country, cause, etc.</p><p><b>grad u središnjoj Alabami na rijeci Alabama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a town in central Alabama on the Alabama river</p><p><b>Sastav koji se sastoji od generatora i motora koj