tion of an organism or to the controlling nerves</p><p><b>područje korteksa uključujući precentralni i postcentralni gyrus i kombinirajući senzorijske i motoričke funkcije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an area of the cortex including the precentral gyrus and the postcentral gyrus and combining sensory and motor functions [sensorimotor region]</p><p><b>područje korteksa uključujući precentralni i postcentralni gyrus i kombinirajući senzorijske i motoričke funkcije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an area of the cortex including the precentral gyrus and the postcentral gyrus and combining sensory and motor functions [sensorimotor area]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s nervnim procesom osjetljivosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the neural process of sensation</p><p><b>zamjedbena nagluhost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hearing loss due to failure of the auditory nerve [nerve deafness]</p><p><b>područja mozga koja obrađuju i registruju dolazne senzorske informacije i omogućavaju svjesnu svjesnost svijeta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the areas of the brain that process and register incoming sensory information and make possible the conscious awareness of the world</p><p><b>osjetljivi, osjetni, senzorni, senzorske, senzorskih</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of a nerve fiber or impulse originating outside and passing toward the central nervous system [centripetal, receptive]</p><p><i>adj.</i> involving or derived from the senses [sensorial]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or concerned in sensation [sensational]</p><p><b>osjetilna aktivnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> activity intended to achieve a particular sensory result</p><p><b>Afazija karakterizirana tečnim, ali beznačajnim govorom i ozbiljnim oštećenjem sposobnosti razumijevanja govorenih ili pisanih riječi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aphasia characterized by fluent but meaningless speech and severe impairment of the ability understand spoken or written words [Wernicke's aphasia, fluent aphasia, impressive aphasia, receptive aphasia]</p><p><b>oblik psihološkog mučenja koji se nanosi time što žrtvi oduzimaju sve osjetilne informacije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of psychological torture inflicted by depriving the victim of all sensory input</p><p><b>epilepsija koja je uzrokovana somatosenzornim pojavama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> focal epilepsy initiated by somatosensory phenomena</p><p><b>osjetilna sposobnost, osjetilo, čulo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the faculty through which the external world is apprehended [sensation, sense, sentience, sentiency]</p><p><b>Nervno vlakno koje prenosi impulse prema središnjem živčanom sustavu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nerve fiber that carries impulses toward the central nervous system [afferent fiber]</p><p><b>duge, čvrste dlake koje rastu s pupka ili čela većine sisavaca kao što je mačka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long stiff hair growing from the snout or brow of most mammals as e.g. a cat [vibrissa, whisker]</p><p><b>živčanik koji prenosi impulse od receptora prema ili do središnjeg živčanog sustava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nerve that passes impulses from receptors toward or to the central nervous system [afferent, afferent nerve]</p><p><b>neuron koji provodi impulse prema mozgu ili kičmenoj moždini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a neuron conducting impulses inwards to the brain or spinal cord [afferent neuron]</p><p><b>osjetilni organ, osjetni receptor, receptor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an organ having nerve endings (in the skin or viscera or eye or ear or nose or mouth) that respond to stimulation [receptor, sense organ]</p><p><b>osjetilni sistem, osjetilni sustav, senzorni sistem, senzorni sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a particular sense [modality, sense modality]</p><p><i>n.</i> the body's system of sense organs</p><p><b>čulan, pohotljiv, razbludan, senzualan, tjelesan, životinjski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by the appetites and passions of the body [animal, carnal, fleshly]</p><p><i>adj.</i> sexually exciting or gratifying [sultry]</p><p><b>ponižavanje kroz tjelesno zadovoljstvo. (MT)</b></