im rizomima uzgojen zbog svojih velikih duboko lobiranih duboko plavo-zelenih listova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American fern with brown scaly rhizomes cultivated for its large deeply lobed deep bluish-green fronds [Phlebodium aureum, Polypodium aureum, golden polypody, rabbit's-foot fern]</p><p><b>životinja koja liči na morsku zvijezdu s krhkim bičnim rukama koje zrače iz malog središnjeg diska (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an animal resembling a starfish with fragile whiplike arms radiating from a small central disc [brittle-star, brittle star]</p><p><b>obožavanje zmija. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the worship of snakes [ophiolatry]</p><p><b>podred Ophidia, podred Serpentes, podred zmija, zmije</b></p><p><i>n.</i> snakes [Ophidia, suborder Ophidia, suborder Serpentes]</p><p><b>izdajnički, nalik na zmiju, serpentina, vijugav, zmijski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling a serpent in form [snakelike, snaky]</p><p><b>Španjolski misionar koji je osnovao franjevačke misije u Kaliforniji (1713-1784) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Spanish missionary who founded Franciscan missions in California (1713-1784) [Junipero Serra, Miguel Jose Serra]</p><p><b>riblje ribe u primjerice u toplim obalnim vodama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> marine food sport fishes mainly of warm coastal waters [serranid fish]</p><p><b>riblje ribe u primjerice u toplim obalnim vodama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> marine food sport fishes mainly of warm coastal waters [serranid]</p><p><b>riblje vrste: morski štapovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> marine fishes: sea basses [family Serranidae]</p><p><b>tip rod Serranidae: uglavnom mali tihozemski bas (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Serranidae: mostly small Pacific sea basses [genus Serranus]</p><p><b>nalazi se u toplim plitkim vodama zapadnog Atlantika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> found in warm shallow waters of western Atlantic [belted sandfish]</p><p><b>piranje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> piranhas [genus Serrasalmus]</p><p><b>fino ozubiti, isjeckan, nazubljen, zupčast</b><