 slučaju alergijske reakcije na injekciju antiseruma uzrokovane reakcijom antitela na antigen u serumu donatora, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a delayed allergic reaction to the injection of an antiserum caused by an antibody reaction to an antigen in the donor serum [serum sickness]</p><p><b>globulini koji se nalaze u serumu krvi i sadrže većinu antitijela u krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> globulins occurring in blood serum and containing most of the antibodies of the blood</p><p><b>akutni (ponekad fatalni) oblik virusnog hepatitisa uzrokovan DNK virusom koji je obično prisutan u serumu krvi i prenosi se seksualnim kontaktom ili transfuzijom ili gutanjem kontaminirane krvi ili drugih tjelesnih tekućina. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acute (sometimes fatal) form of viral hepatitis caused by a DNA virus that tends to persist in the blood serum and is transmitted by sexual contact or by transfusion or by ingestion of contaminated blood or other bodily fluids [hepatitis B]</p><p><b>ako je u slučaju alergijske reakcije na injekciju antiseruma uzrokovane reakcijom antitela na antigen u serumu donatora, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a delayed allergic reaction to the injection of an antiserum caused by an antibody reaction to an antigen in the donor serum [serum disease]</p><p><b>serval</b></p><p><i>n.</i> slender long-legged African wildcat having large untufted ears and tawny black-spotted coat [Felis serval]</p><p><b>momak, sluga, sluškinja, službenik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person working in the service of another (especially in the household) [retainer]</p><p><i>n.</i> in a subordinate position [handmaid, handmaiden]</p><p><b>Djevojka koja je sluškinja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a girl who is a servant [serving girl]</p><p><b>Ulaz namijenjen za korištenje službenika ili za isporuku robe i uklanjanje otpada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an entrance intended for the use of servants or for delivery of goods and removal of refuse [service door, service entrance]</p><p><b>dostaviti, dvoriti, i