ati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> activities associated with sexual intercourse [sex activity, sexual activity, sexual practice]</p><p><i>n.</i> either of the two categories (male or female) into which most organisms are divided</p><p><i>n.</i> all of the feelings resulting from the urge to gratify sexual impulses [sexual urge]</p><p><i>n.</i> the properties that distinguish organisms on the basis of their reproductive roles [gender, sexuality]</p><p><i>v.</i> stimulate sexually [arouse, excite, turn on, wind up]</p><p><i>v.</i> tell the sex (of young chickens)</p><p><b>seksualna aktivnost između pojedinaca, posebno unosanje muškog penisa u žensku vaginu do orgazma i ejakulacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sexual activity between individuals, especially the insertion of a man's penis into a woman's vagina until orgasm and ejaculation occur [carnal knowledge, coition, coitus, copulation, intercourse, relation, sexual congress, sexual intercourse, sexual relation]</p><p><b>općenje, seks, seksualna aktivnost, spolna aktivnost, spolno općenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> activities associated with sexual intercourse [sex, sexual activity, sexual practice]</p><p><b>seksualna privlačnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> attractiveness to the opposite sex [desirability, desirableness, oomph]</p><p><b>Mlada žena za koju se misli da ima seksualni apel. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a young woman who is thought to have sex appeal [sex kitten, sexpot]</p><p><b>Sjemenice ili jajnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a spermatozoon or an ovum [germ cell, reproductive cell]</p><p><b>promjena u fizičkim seksualnim karakteristikama osobe (kao što su operacije i hormonski tretmani) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a change in a person's physical sexual characteristics (as by surgery and hormone treatments)</p><p><b>one karakteristike (anatomske i psihološke) koje su snažno povezane s jednim spolom u odnosu na drugi spol (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> those characteristics (both anatomical and psychological) that are strongly associated with one sex relative to the other [sex characteristic, sexual characteristic]</p><p><b>one karakteristike (anatomske i psihološke) koje su snažno povezane s jednim spolom u odnosu na drugi spol (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> those characteristics (both anatomical and psychological) that are strongly associated with one sex relative to the other [sex character, sexual characteristic]</p><p><b>kromatina pronađena samo u ženskim stanicama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chromatin found only in female cells</p><p><b>sploni kromosom, spolni kromosom, taurodontizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (genetics) a chromosome that determines the sex of an individual</p><p><b>zakonski prekršaj koji predviđa da je zločin svjesno navesti drugu osobu da se uključi u neželjeni seksualni čin silom ili prijetnjom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a statutory offense that provides that it is a crime to knowingly cause another person to engage in an unwanted sexual act by force or threat [sex offense, sexual abuse, sexual assault]</p><p><b>fiziološka potreba za seksualnom aktivnošću (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a physiological need for sexual activity</p><p><b>žlijezda u kojoj se proizvode gamete (polne stanice) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gland in which gametes (sex cells) are produced [gonad]</p><p><b>bilo koji hormon koji utječe na razvoj i rast spolnih organa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any hormone affecting the development and growth of sex organs [steroid, steroid hormone]</p><p><b>Mlada žena za koju se misli da ima seksualni apel. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a young woman who is thought to have sex appeal [sex bomb, sexpot]</p><p><b>poveznica između gena u spolnim hromozomima koja uzrokuje da se neke osobine pojavljuju češće u jednom spolu nego u drugom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an association between genes in sex chromosomes that makes some characteristics appear more frequently in one sex than in the other</p><p><b>Priručnik koji sadrži upute za seksualne tehnike. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a manual containing instruction in sexual