e sex chromosomes (on the X chromosome in particular)</p><p><b>bilo kakva bolest ili abnormalnost koja je određena spolnim hormonima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any disease or abnormality that is determined by the sex hormones</p><p><b>Željujući ali lišeni seksualnog zadovoljstva (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> desiring but deprived of sexual gratification</p><p><b>bilo koja oznaka koja koristi 16 različitih znakova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any notation that uses 16 different characters [hexadecimal notation]</p><p><b>pozicijski sustav brojanja koji koristi heksadecimale i korijen od šesnaest (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a positional system of numeration that uses hexadecimal digits and a radix of sixteen [hexadecimal number system, hexadecimal system]</p><p><b>netko čije je staro oko šezdeset godina., biti od 60 do 69 godina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone whose age is in the sixties</p><p><i>adj.</i> being from 60 to 69 years old</p><p><b>osnovan na broju 60</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or reckoning in sixtieths</p><p><b>Seksualna avantura. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sexual escapade</p><p><b>dob, rod, seks, spol, spolni odnos, spolno općenje, pol (od &quot;sex&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having sexual differentiation</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by sexuality</p><p><b>erotika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the arousal of feelings of sexual desire [amativeness, amorousness, eroticism, erotism]</p><p><b>seksizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> discriminatory or abusive behavior towards members of the opposite sex</p><p><b>seksist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a man with a chauvinistic belief in the inferiority of women [male chauvinist]</p><p><i>adj.</i> discriminatory on the basis of sex (usually said of men's attitude toward women)</p><p><b>s nedostatkom ili sa nedovoljno razvijenim ili nefunkcionalnim spolnim organima, bez seksualnog požuda, seksualno neprivlačan (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having no or imperfectly developed or nonfunctional sex organs [neuter]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having no sexu