na (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> full of submerged reefs or sandbanks or shoals [reefy, shelfy, shoaly]</p><p><b>(Stari zavjet) najstariji sin Noinog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Old Testament) eldest son of Noah</p><p><b>liturgijska molitva (uzima se za suštinu židovske religije) koju odrasli židovski muškarci recitiraju najmanje dva puta dnevno kako bi izjavili svoju vjeru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a liturgical prayer (considered to be the essence of Jewish religion) that is recited at least twice daily by adult Jewish males to declare their faith</p><p><b>(Jidish) zbunjena situacija ili afera (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Yiddish) a confused situation or affair [schemozzle]</p><p><b>član taoističke Trojstva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Taoist Trinity [Spiritual Jewel]</p><p><b>Nacionalni park u Virginiji za planine Blue Ridge. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a national park in Virginia for the Blue Ridge Mountains</p><p><b>rijeka u sjevernoj Virginiji koja se ulijeva u Potomac u Harpers Ferryju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a river of northern Virginia that empties into the Potomac at Harpers Ferry</p><p><b>Velika dolina između planina Allegheny i planina Blue Ridge u sjevernoj Virginiji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large valley between the Allegheny Mountains and the Blue Ridge Mountains in northern Virginia</p><p><b>smicalice, trikovi, lopovluk, lupeštvo, nitkovluk, pakosnost, pakost, pokvarenost, psina, zloba, zloća, zločestoća, đavolija, đavoljstvo, smicalica, trik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> reckless or malicious behavior that causes discomfort or annoyance in others [devilment, devilry, deviltry, mischief, mischief-making, mischievousness, rascality, roguery, roguishness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the use of tricks to deceive someone (usually to extract money from them) [chicane, chicanery, guile, trickery, wile]</p><p><b>Shenyang</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in northeastern China [Fengtien, Moukden, Mukden]</p><p><b>Američki autor nadrealističkih alegorijskih predstava (rođen 1943), astro