interference</p><p><b>gurati, mijenjanje, pomaći, pomak, pomicanje, pomicati, pomjeriti, premjestiti se, premještanje, preokret, presvlačenje, prijeći, promijeniti, promjena, SHIFT, smicalica, smjena, metamorfoza, preobrazba, preobražaj, transformacija, radno vrijeme, prebacivanje, majica bez rukava, potkušulja, ženska potko?lja, premetati, maknuti, mrdnuti, pomakunti, mijenjati, prebaciti se, prebacivati se, prelaziti, zamijeniti, zamjenjivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an event in which something is displaced without rotation [displacement]</p><p><i>n.</i> a qualitative change [transformation, transmutation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the time period during which you are at work [duty period, work shift]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of changing one thing or position for another [switch, switching]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of moving from one place to another [shifting]</p><p><i>n.</i> (geology) a crack in the earth's crust resulting from the displacement of one side with respect to the other [break, fault, faulting, fracture, geological fault]</p><p><i>n.</i> a crew of workers who work for a specific period of time</p><p><i>n.</i> the key on the typewriter keyboard that shifts from lower-case letters to upper-case letters [shift key]</p><p><i>n.</i> a woman's sleeveless undergarment [chemise, shimmy, slip, teddy]</p><p><i>n.</i> a loose-fitting dress hanging straight from the shoulders without a waist [chemise, sack]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a shift in or exchange of [change over, switch]</p><p><i>v.</i> change place or direction [dislodge, reposition]</p><p><i>v.</i> move around [transfer]</p><p><i>v.</i> move very slightly [agitate, budge, stir]</p><p><i>v.</i> move from one setting or context to another</p><p><i>v.</i> change in quality</p><p><i>v.</i> move and exchange for another</p><p><i>v.</i> move sideways or in an unsteady way [careen, tilt, wobble]</p><p><i>v.</i> move abruptly [lurch, pitch]</p><p><i>v.</i> use a shift key on a keyboard</p><p><i>v.</i> change phonetically as part of a systematic historical change</p><p><i>v.</i> change gears</p><p><i>v.</i> lay aside, abandon, or leave for another [change, switch]</p><p><b>preklopnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the key on the typewriter keyboard that shifts from lower-case letters to upper-case letters [shift]</p><p><b>posmični spremnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) register in which all bits can be shifted one or more positions to the left or to the right</p><p><b>fazni invertor, obrtač faze, prebacivač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stagehand responsible for moving scenery [sceneshifter]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanical device for engaging and disengaging gears [gear lever, gearshift, gearstick]</p><p><b>dovitljiv, nestalan, prevrtljiv, promućuran, snalažljiv (od &quot;shifty&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a shifty manner</p><p><b>nestalnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being a slippery rascal [rascality, slipperiness, trickiness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being changeable in direction</p><p><b>namještajući, pokretan, pomicanje, promjenjiv</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of moving from one place to another [shift]</p><p><i>adj.</i> continuously varying</p><p><i>adj.</i> changing position or direction [shifty]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of soil) unstable [unfirm]</p><p><b>bespomoćan, nesnalažljiv, nespretan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking or characterized by lack of ambition or initiative</p><p><b>bespomoćan, nesnalažljiv, nespretan (od &quot;shiftless&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a failure to be active as a consequence of lack of initiative or ambition</p><p><b>dovitljiv, nestalan, prevrtljiv, promućuran, snalažljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by insincerity or deceit [devious]</p><p><i>adj.</i> changing position or direction [shifting]</p><p><b>bakterija koja uzrokuje dizenteriju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bacillus that causes dysentery [Shigella dysentariae]</p><p><b>Gram-negativne enterobakterije u obliku šipke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rod-shaped Gram-negative enterobacteria</p><p><b>bakterija k