asing in length</p><p><b>Deficit, nedostatak, manjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being an amount by which something is less than expected or required [deficit, shortage]</p><p><b>vrlo brza aktivna plavolikost koja se nalazi širom svijeta u toplim vodama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> very swift active bluish shark found worldwide in warm waters [Isurus oxyrhincus]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih trava koji su kratki i mogu podnijeti sušne uvjete (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various grasses that are short and can tolerate drought conditions [short-grass]</p><p><b>stenografija, stenografski, stenogram</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of writing rapidly using an abbreviated symbolic system [stenography, tachygraphy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> written in abbreviated or symbolic form</p><p><b>netko vješt u transkripciji govora (posebno diktacije) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone skilled in the transcription of speech (especially dictation) [amanuensis, stenographer]</p><p><b>Engleska pasmina kraćogornog goveda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English breed of short-horned cattle [Durham]</p><p><b>biljke iz roda Shortia (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any plant of the genus Shortia</p><p><b>biljka sa jugoistočnog područja Sjedinjenih Država koja ima usamljene bijele cvjetove u obliku lovora s ružičastim i velikim sjajnim zelenim lišćama koje na jesen postaju brončasti crvene boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant of southeastern United States having solitary white funnel-shaped flowers flushed with pink and large glossy green leaves that turn bronze-red in fall [oconee bells]</p><p><b>Malo kratko. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> somewhat short</p><p><b>Veliki bor južne Sjedinjene Države s kratkim iglama u hrpom od 2-3 i crveno-sjedom kore kada su zrele (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large pine of southern United States having short needles in bunches of 2-3 and red-brown bark when mature [Pinus echinata, short-leaf pine, shortleaf yellow pine]</p><p><b>Veliki bor južne Sjedinjene Države s kratkim iglama u h