, testify]</p><p><i>v.</i> make visible or noticeable</p><p><i>v.</i> show in, or as in, a picture [depict, picture, render]</p><p><i>v.</i> give expression to [evince, express]</p><p><i>v.</i> indicate a place, direction, person, or thing [designate, indicate, point]</p><p><i>v.</i> be or become visible or noticeable [show up]</p><p><i>v.</i> indicate a certain reading [read, record, register]</p><p><i>v.</i> give evidence of, as of records</p><p><i>v.</i> take (someone) to their seats, as in theaters or auditoriums [usher]</p><p><i>v.</i> finish third or better in a horse or dog race</p><p><b>plakat koji oglašava predstavu ili predstavu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a poster advertising a show or play [show card, theatrical poster]</p><p><b>Sredstva za razvoj i razvoj industrije: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> those involved in providing entertainment: radio and television and films and theater [entertainment industry, show business]</p><p><b>zabavljačka industrija, zabavljačka profesija, zabavljaštvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> those involved in providing entertainment: radio and television and films and theater [entertainment industry, show biz]</p><p><b>plakat koji oglašava predstavu ili predstavu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a poster advertising a show or play [show bill, theatrical poster]</p><p><b>srednjozapadna država u središnjem dijelu Sjedinjenih Država. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a midwestern state in central United States [MO, Missouri, Mo.]</p><p><b>isticati, izložiti, praviti se važan</b></p><p><i>v.</i> display proudly [flash, flaunt, ostentate, swank]</p><p><b>tražiti da odeš. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> ask to leave</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to moguće, u slučaju da je to moguće, u slučaju da je to moguće, u slučaju da je to moguće, u slučaju da je to moguće, u slučaju da je to moguće, u slučaju da je to moguće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the point in time at which an entertainment (a movie or television show etc.) is scheduled to begin</p><p><b>suđenje održano za show (MT)</b><