><b>grob, grobnica, hram, mjesto hodočašća, oltar, svetinja, svetište, škrinja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a place of worship hallowed by association with some sacred thing or person</p><p><i>v.</i> enclose in a shrine [enshrine]</p><p><b>izbjegavati, odskočiti, skupiti, skupiti se, smanjiti, smanjiti se, smanjivanje, stegnuti se, stezati se, stisnuti, psihijatar, mežurati se, nabirati se, naborati se, sahnuti, sasušiti se, sasušivati se, smežurati se, usahnuti, uvenuti, venuti, ustuknuti, skupljati se, smanjivati se, stiskati se, stisnuti se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a physician who specializes in psychiatry [head-shrinker, psychiatrist]</p><p><i>v.</i> wither, as with a loss of moisture [shrivel, shrivel up, wither]</p><p><i>v.</i> draw back, as with fear or pain [cringe, flinch, funk, quail, recoil, squinch, wince]</p><p><i>v.</i> reduce in size [reduce]</p><p><i>v.</i> become smaller or draw together [contract]</p><p><i>v.</i> decrease in size, range, or extent [shrivel]</p><p><b>udaljite se od izvora odvratnosti ili straha. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> pull away from a source of disgust or fear [retract]</p><p><b>zabušavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> avoid (one's assigned duties) [fiddle, goldbrick, shirk]</p><p><b>transparentni plastični film koji se koristi za omatanje nečeg. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the clinging transparent plastic film that is used to shrinkwrap something</p><p><b>softver na CD-ROM-ovima koji su u kutijama i pakiranjem za smanjenje i koji se prodaju u trgovinama (što znači široko podržanu standardnu platformu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> software on CD-ROMs that are boxed and shrink-wrapped and sold in stores (implying a widely supported standard platform)</p><p><b>koji se može stegnuti, koji se može stisnuti, koji se može uvući u se, koji se skuplja</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being shrunk</p><p><b>kaliranje, rastur, sažimanje, skupljanje, smanjenje, smanjivanje, stezanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> process or result of becoming less or smaller [shrinking]</p><p><i>n.</i> the amount by which something shrinks</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of stealing goods that are on display in a store [shoplifting]</p><p><b>skupljanje, smanjenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> process or result of becoming less or smaller [shrinkage]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of becoming less</p><p><b>netko tko se ustrkava od upoznavanja s drugima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who shrinks from familiarity with others [shy person]</p><p><b>zavojiti nešto čvrsto zagrijanom plastikom koja se skuplja pri hlađenju (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> wrap something tightly with heated plastic that shrinks upon cooling</p><p><b>ispovijedati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> grant remission of a sin to [absolve]</p><p><b>nabrati se, smežurati se, sparušiti s, zgrčiti se, mežurati se, nabirati se, naborati se, sahnuti, sasušiti se, sasušivati se, usahnuti, uvenuti, venuti, smanjiti se, smanjivati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> wither, as with a loss of moisture [shrink, shrivel up, wither]</p><p><i>v.</i> decrease in size, range, or extent [shrink]</p><p><b>mežurati se, nabirati se, naborati se, sahnuti, sasušiti se, sasušivati se, smežurati se, usahnuti, uvenuti, venuti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> wither, as with a loss of moisture [shrink, shrivel, wither]</p><p><b>nabrati se, smežurati se, sparušiti s, zgrčiti se (od &quot;shrivel&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used especially of vegetation) having lost all moisture [dried-up, sear, sere, shrivelled, withered]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lean and wrinkled by shrinkage as from age or illness [shrivelled, shrunken, withered, wizen, wizened]</p><p><i>adj.</i> reduced in efficacy or vitality or intensity [shrivelled, shrunken]</p><p><b>(posebno za vegetaciju) nakon što je izgubila svu vlažnost, mršavi i boreći zbog smanjenja zbog starosti ili bolesti, smanjena učinkovitost ili vitalnost ili intenzitet (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used especially of vegetation) having lost all moisture [dried-up, sear, sere, shriveled, withered]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lean and wrinkled by shrinkage as from age or illness [shriveled, shrunken, withered, wizen, wizened]</p><p><i>adj.</i> reduced in efficacy or vitality or intensity [shriveled, shrunken]</p><p><b>čelično uže, koprena, kućište, mrtvački pokrov, obaviti, omotavati, pokriti, presvlaka, puto, sakriti, skriti, veo, zastor, zavjesa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a line that suspends the harness from the canopy of a parachute</p><p><i>n.</i> (nautical) a line (rope or chain) that regulates the angle at which a sail is set in relation to the wind [mainsheet, sheet, tack, weather sheet]</p><p><i>n.</i> burial garment in which a corpse is wrapped [cerement, pall, winding-clothes, winding-sheet]</p><p><i>v.</i> cover as if with a shroud [cover, enshroud, hide]</p><p><i>v.</i> form a cover like a shroud</p><p><i>v.</i> wrap in a shroud</p><p><b>Posljednji dan prije Posljednjeg posta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the last day before Lent [Fat Tuesday, Mardi Gras, pancake day]</p><p><b>mesopust, poklade</b></p><p><i>n.</i> immediately preceding Lent</p><p><b>grm, žbun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a low woody perennial plant usually having several major stems [bush]</p><p><b>grmlje, šibljak, šikara, nasad grmlja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an area where a number of shrubs are planted</p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of shrubs growing together</p><p><b>grmolik</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or resembling a shrub [fruticose, fruticulose]</p><p><b>u obliku žutih kapsula koje sadrže crveno crveno sjeme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> twining shrub of North America having yellow capsules enclosing scarlet seeds [American bittersweet, Celastrus scandens, bittersweet, climbing bittersweet, false bittersweet, staff vine, waxwork]</p><p><b>nizak grmljav biljka s velikim, sjajnim svjetlim lavandnim ili plavo-fioletskim cvijećem u uskim grmovima na krajevima stabljika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low bushy plant with large showy pale lavender or blue-violet flowers in narrow clusters at ends of stems [Penstemon fruticosus, lowbush penstemon]</p><p><b>tvrdi grm s dugoličnim cjelokupnim lišćama i gustošću žutih cvjetova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stiff shrub having oblong entire leaves and dense cymes of yellow flowers [Hypericum prolificum, Hypericum spathulatum]</p><p><b>škriljci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dwarf shrub</p><p><b>slegnuti ramenima, slijeganje, slijeganje ramenima, slijegati ramenima</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gesture involving the shoulders</p><p><i>v.</i> raise one's shoulders to indicate indifference or resignation</p><p><b>Minimizirati važnost, brisati na stranu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> minimize the importance of, brush aside</p><p><b>skupljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lean and wrinkled by shrinkage as from age or illness [shriveled, shrivelled, withered, wizen, wizened]</p><p><i>adj.</i> reduced in efficacy or vitality or intensity [shriveled, shrivelled]</p><p><b>(Jidiš) malo, (Jidish) izmišljen i često korišten dio posla koji izvođač koristi ukrasti pozornost, (Jidish) šala ili komad klauna, (Jidiš) podmukli trik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Yiddish) a little [schtick, schtik, shtik]</p><p><i>n.</i> (Yiddish) a contrived and often used bit of business that a performer uses to steal attention [schtick, schtik, shtik]</p><p><i>n.</i> (Yiddish) a prank or piece of clowning [schtick, schtik, shtik]</p><p><i>n.</i> (Yiddish) a devious trick [schtick, schtik, shtik]</p><p><b>Stvarno malo shtik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a really little shtik [schtickl, schtikl, shtikl]</p><p><b>(Jidiš) malo, (Jidish) izmišljen i često korišten dio posla koji izvođač koristi ukrasti pozornost, (Jidish) šala ili komad klauna, (Jidiš) podmukli trik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Yiddish) a little [schtick, schtik, shtick]</p><p><i>n.</i> (Yiddish) a contrived and often used bit of business that a performer uses to steal attention [schtick, schtik, shtick]</p><p><i>n.</i> (Yiddish) a prank or piece of clowning [schtick, schtik, shtick]</p><p><i>n.</i> (Yiddish) a devious trick [schtick, schtik, shtick]</p><p><b>Stvarno malo shtik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a really little shtik [schtickl, schtikl, shtickl]</p><p><b>Fucking, tucanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> slang for sexual intercourse [ass, fuck, fucking, nookie, nooky, piece of ass, piece of tail, roll in the hay, screw, screwing, shag]</p><p><b>bilo koji ogranak šintoizma osim Kokka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any branch of Shinto other than Kokka [Shuha Shinto]</p><p><b>komušina, ljuska, mahuna, nešto bezvrijedno, lupina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> material consisting of seed coverings and small pieces of stem or leaves that have been separated from the seeds [chaff, husk, stalk, straw, stubble]</p><p><i>v.</i> remove from the shell</p><p><i>v.</i> remove the shucks from</p><p><b>komušina, ljuska, mahuna, nešto bezvrijedno (od &quot;shuck&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something of little value [damn, darn, hoot, red cent, shit, tinker's dam, tinker's damn]</p><p><i>n.</i> an expression of disappointment or irritation</p><p><b>drhtati, drhtavica, groza, jeza, ježenje, naježiti, protrnuti, strepnja, trnci, uzdrhtati, zgroziti se, ježuri, srsi, žmarci, drhturiti, naježiti se, zadrhtati, podrhtati, podrhtavati, tresti se, zatresti se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an almost pleasurable sensation of fright [chill, frisson, quiver, shiver, thrill, tingle]</p><p><i>n.</i> an involuntary vibration (as if from illness or fear) [tremor]</p><p><i>v.</i> shake, as from cold [shiver]</p><p><i>v.</i> tremble convulsively, as from fear or excitement [shiver, thrill, throb]</p><p><b>grozan, koji dršće, koji se zgraža, strašan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> shaking convulsively or violently</p><p><b>grozno, strašno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with a shudder</p><p><b>izaziva strah i teror. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> provoking fear terror [chilling, scary, shivery]</p><p><b>član najniže ili radničke hinduističke kaste., Najniži od četiri varne: sluge i radnici niskog statusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the lowest or worker Hindu caste [Sudra]</p><p><i>n.</i> the lowest of the four varnas: the servants and workers of low statu