biti: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a shrub or tree of the genus Rhus (usually limited to the non-poisonous members of the genus) [sumac, sumach]</p><p><b>Veliki listnat crveni hrast južnih i istočnih Sjedinjenih Država s velikim elipsnim listovima od sedam do devet lobova, velikim žitama i srednjo tvrdim grubozrnjenim drvetom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large deciduous red oak of southern and eastern United States having large seven-lobed to nine-lobed elliptical leaves, large acorns and medium hard coarse-grained wood [Quercus shumardii, Shumard red oak]</p><p><b>Veliki listnat crveni hrast južnih i istočnih Sjedinjenih Država s velikim elipsnim listovima od sedam do devet lobova, velikim žitama i srednjo tvrdim grubozrnjenim drvetom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large deciduous red oak of southern and eastern United States having large seven-lobed to nine-lobed elliptical leaves, large acorns and medium hard coarse-grained wood [Quercus shumardii, Shumard oak]</p><p><b>izbjegavati, kloniti se, bojkotirati, isključiti, izopćiti, prognati, protjerati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> avoid and stay away from deliberately [eschew]</p><p><i>v.</i> expel from a community or group [ban, banish, blackball, cast out, ostracise, ostracize]</p><p><b>uzgajan zbog svojih sočnih jestivih listova koji se koriste u azijskoj kuhinji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> grown for its succulent edible leaves used in Asian cooking [Chrysanthemum coronarium spatiosum, chop-suey greens, tong ho]</p><p><b>namjerno izbjegavanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deliberately avoiding [avoidance, dodging, turning away]</p><p><b>odložiti, odvesti, odvod, otoka, promjena, račvanje, skrenuti, skretanje, skretnica, zamjena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a passage by which a bodily fluid (especially blood) is diverted from one channel to another</p><p><i>n.</i> a conductor having low resistance in parallel with another device to divert a fraction of the current [bypass, electrical shunt]</p><p><i>n.</i> implant consisting of a tube made of plastic or rubber</p><p><i>v.</i> transfer to another track, of trains</p><p><i>v.</i> provide with or divert by means of an electrical shunt</p><p><b>Zatvoreni krug u kojem se struja dijeli na dvije ili više staza prije nego se ponovno kombinuje kako bi se završio krug (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a closed circuit in which the current divides into two or more paths before recombining to complete the circuit [parallel circuit]</p><p><b>skretničar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small locomotive used to move cars around but not to make trips</p><p><b>Ušuti (nekoga) izgovarajući `shush! ' (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> silence (someone) by uttering `shush!'</p><p><b>fizički oštećen, isključiti, lako rješiv, obustava, padati, potmuo, prekinuti, spavanje, spriječiti ulaz, spustiti se, šutjeti, umukni, zabraniti, zakloniti, zaklopiti, zaključan, zaključati, zatvoren, zatvoriti, zatvoriti se, zatvarati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> move so that an opening or passage is obstructed [close]</p><p><i>v.</i> become closed [close]</p><p><i>v.</i> prevent from entering [exclude, keep out, shut out]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not open [closed, unopen]</p><p><i>adj.</i> used especially of mouth or eyes [closed]</p><p><b>mjesto na mjestu gdje se nešto ne može maknuti ili netko ne može pobjeći (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> place in a place where something cannot be removed or someone cannot escape [lock, lock away, lock in, lock up, put away, shut up]</p><p><b>isključiti, nezgoda, obustaviti, prekinuti, zatvoriti, zaustavljanje rada stroja, isključiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cease to operate or cause to cease operating [close, close down, close up, fold]</p><p><b>bolesnik, fizički oštećen, obustaviti bušotinu, opkoliti, padati, spustiti se, zakloniti, zatvoren, zatvoriti, invalid, obavijati, obaviti, obuhvatiti, obuhvaćati, opasati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> surround completely [close in, enclose, inclose]</p><p><b>isključiti, zaključati, zatvoriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> stem the flow of [close off]</p><p><i>v.</i> isolate or separate [close o