a, sickle alfalfa, sickle medick]</p><p><b>Europski medicinski prirodni u Sjevernoj Americi s žutim cvijećem i srpnim čunjama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European medic naturalized in North America having yellow flowers and sickle-shaped pods [Medicago falcata, sickle alfalfa, sickle lucerne]</p><p><b>urođeni oblik anemije koji se uglavnom javlja kod crnaca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a congenital form of anemia occurring mostly in blacks [crescent-cell anaemia, crescent-cell anemia, drepanocytic anaemia, drepanocytic anemia, sickle-cell anemia, sickle-cell disease]</p><p><b>urođeni oblik anemije koji se uglavnom javlja kod crnaca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a congenital form of anemia occurring mostly in blacks [crescent-cell anaemia, crescent-cell anemia, drepanocytic anaemia, drepanocytic anemia, sickle-cell anaemia, sickle-cell disease]</p><p><b>urođeni oblik anemije koji se uglavnom javlja kod crnaca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a congenital form of anemia occurring mostly in blacks [crescent-cell anaemia, crescent-cell anemia, drepanocytic anaemia, drepanocytic anemia, sickle-cell anaemia, sickle-cell anemia]</p><p><b>Zakrivljen kao srp. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> curved like a sickle [falcate, falciform]</p><p><b>u obliku krastavca ili podkrastavca s žutim cvjetovima i tankim zakrivljenim strukom, Sjevernoamerički kameni krest s vrlo dugim zakrivljenim čipkama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cosmopolitan tropical herb or subshrub with yellow flowers and slender curved pods [Cassia tora, Senna obtusifolia]</p><p><i>n.</i> North American rock cress having very long curved pods [Arabis Canadensis]</p><p><b>različita zlatna aster (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a variety of golden aster</p><p><b>bolesnog izgleda, boležljiv, slab</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> unhealthy looking [sallow]</p><p><i>adj.</i> somewhat ill or prone to illness [ailing, indisposed, peaked, poorly, seedy, under the weather, unwell]</p><p><b>bolest, mučnina, oboljenje, osjećaj mučnine, boljetica, boljka</b></p><p><i>n.</i