n siege of Syracuse (415-413 BC) was eventually won by Syracuse [Syracuse]</p><p><b>odlučujuća bitka u Američkom građanskom ratu (1863.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a decisive battle in the American Civil War (1863) [Vicksburg]</p><p><b>1781. Britanci pod Cornwallisom predaju se nakon tri tjedna opsade američkih i francuskih trupa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in 1781 the British under Cornwallis surrendered after a siege of three weeks by American and French troops [Yorktown]</p><p><b>Legendarno mjesto na Kraljevom okruglom stolu rezervirano za viteza koji će pronaći Sveti gral. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the legendary seat at King Arthur's Round Table reserved for the knight who would find the Holy Grail</p><p><b>(Njemačka mitologija) mitološki njemački ratnik heroj Nibelungske pjesme koji uzima u posjed prokleto blago Nibelungova ubijanjem zmaja koji ga čuva i budi Brynhild i na kraju je ubijen (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (German mythology) mythical German warrior hero of the Nibelungenlied who takes possession of the accursed treasure of the Nibelungs by slaying the dragon that guards it and awakens Brynhild and is eventually killed</p><p><b>Njemačka utvrđenja okrenuta prema Maginotovoj liniji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German fortifications facing the Maginot Line</p><p><b>simens</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of conductance equal to the reciprocal of an ohm [S, mho, reciprocal ohm]</p><p><i>n.</i> engineer who was a brother of Ernst Werner von Siemens and who moved to England (1823-1883) [Karl Wilhelm Siemens, Sir Charles William Siemens]</p><p><i>n.</i> German electrical engineer (1816-1892) [Ernst Werner von Siemens]</p><p><b>sjena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an earth color containing ferric oxides</p><p><b>planinski niz (obično sa škrupovitim vrhovima i nepravilnim obrisima), Španska skuba sa zapadne Sjeverne Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a range of mountains (usually with jagged peaks and irregular outline)</p><p><i>n.</i> a Spanish mackerel of western North America [Scomberomorus sierra]</p><p><b>Siera Leone, Sijera Leone</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in West Africa [Republic of Sierra Leone]</p><p><b>monetarna jedinica u Sijera Leoneu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> monetary unit in Sierra Leone</p><p><b>u Sijera Leoneu ili u toj zemlji živi, o ili u vezi sa Sijerom Leone ili njenim stanovnicima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or inhabitant of Sierra Leone</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to Sierra Leone or its people</p><p><b>podvrste visokih borova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall subspecies of lodgepole pine [Pinus contorta murrayana]</p><p><b>planinski lanac u sjeverozapadnom Meksiku koji se proteže južno od Arizone paralelno sa pacifičkom obalom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain range in northwestern Mexico that runs south from Arizona parallel to the Pacific coastline</p><p><b>planinski lanac u sjeveroistočnom Meksiku koji ide paralelno sa obalom Meksičkog zaliva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain range in northeastern Mexico the runs parallel to the coastline of the Gulf of Mexico</p><p><b>planinski lanac u južnoj Španjolskoj duž mediteranske obale istočno od Granade, planinski lanac u istočnoj Kaliforniji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain range in southern Spain along the Mediterranean coast to the east of Granada</p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain range in eastern California [High Sierra, Sierra Nevada Mountains]</p><p><b>planinski lanac u istočnoj Kaliforniji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain range in eastern California [High Sierra, Sierra Nevada]</p><p><b>grm na pacifičkoj obali Sjedinjenih Država koji donosi mala crvena neukusna voća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrub of the Pacific coast of the United States bearing small red insipid fruit [Pacific plum, Prunus subcordata]</p><p><b>izuzetno visoka zimzelena stabla južnog kraja zapadnih podbrda Sierra Nevady u Kaliforniji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extremely lofty evergreen of southern end of western foothills of Sierra Nevada in California [Sequoia Wellingtonia, Sequoia gigantea, Sequoi