</i> notably out of the ordinary</p><p><b>signalna kućica, ure za davanja signala</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a building from which signals are sent to control the movements of railway trains [signal tower]</p><p><b>bek</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (football) the person who plays quarterback [field general, quarterback]</p><p><i>n.</i> (American football) the position of the football player in the backfield who directs the offensive play of his team [field general, quarterback]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je primljena signala, to znači da je primljena signala. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the detection that a signal is being received [detection]</p><p><b>Vatra postavljena kao signal. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fire set as a signal [signal light]</p><p><b>signalna zastava, zastava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rectangular piece of fabric used as a signalling device [flag]</p><p><b>amplitudni nivo željenog signala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amplitude level of the desired signal</p><p><b>signal svjetlo, signalno svjetlo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fire set as a signal [signal fire]</p><p><b>zgrada iz koje se šalju signali za kontrolu kretanja željezničkih vlakova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a building from which signals are sent to control the movements of railway trains [signal box]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to moguće, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 2. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of signal intensity to noise intensity [S/N, signal-to-noise ratio, signal/noise, signal/noise ratio]</p><p><b>omjer signala i šuma</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of signal intensity to noise intensity [S/N, signal-to-noise, signal/noise, signal/noise ratio]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to moguće, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 2. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of signal intensity to noise intensity [S/N, signal-to-noise, signal-to-noise ratio, signal/noise ratio]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to moguće, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 2. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of signal intensity to noise intensity [S/N, signal-to-noise, signal-to-noise ratio, signal/noise]</p><p><b>impuls, javiti, korak, primjetan, signal, signala, signalizirati, signalni, upadljiv, značajan, znak (od &quot;signal&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who communicates by signals [signaller]</p><p><b>davanje signala (znakova), signalizacija, signalizaciju, signal, signaliziranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any nonverbal action or gesture that encodes a message [sign, signal]</p><p><b>uređaj za slanje signala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device used to send signals</p><p><b>vidljiva oznaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a conspicuous indication [signalization]</p><p><b>Služba za upravljanje prometnim signalima, komunicirati tiho i neverbalno pomoću znakova ili znakova, -Pažljivo i jasno., napraviti vidljiv ili zapažen (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> provide with traffic signals [signalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> communicate silently and non-verbally by signals or signs [sign, signal, signalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> point out carefully and clearly [call attention, point out, signalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> make conspicuous or noteworthy [distinguish, signalize]</p><p><b>vidljiva oznaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a conspicuous indication [signalisation]</p><p><b>davati znakove, signalizirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> provide with traffic signals [signalise]</p><p><i>v.</i> communicate silently and non-verbally by signals or signs [sign, signal, signalise]</p><p><i>v.</i> point out carefully and clearly [call attention, point out, signalise]</p><p><i>v.</i> make conspicuous or noteworthy [distinguish, signalise]</p><p><b>netko tko komunicira pomoću znakova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who communicates by signals [signaler]</p><p><b>impuls, javiti, korak, primjetan, signal, signala, signalizirati, signalni, upadljiv, značajan, znak (od &quot;signal&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> as a signal</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a signal manner [remarkably, unmistakably]</p><p><b>daje signal, skretničar, vezist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a railroad employee in charge of signals and point in a ra