ation]</p><p><i>adj.</i> reproduced or made to resemble</p><p><b>manevar, vojna vježba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a military training exercise [maneuver, manoeuvre]</p><p><b>hinjenje, modeliranje, oponašanje, podražavanje, simulacija, simulacije, simulacijski modeli, simuliranje, model, himba, lažnost, pretvaranje, prijetvornost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of imitating the behavior of some situation or some process by means of something suitably analogous (especially for the purpose of study or personnel training)</p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) the technique of representing the real world by a computer program [computer simulation]</p><p><i>n.</i> representation of something (sometimes on a smaller scale) [model]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of giving a false appearance [feigning, pretence, pretending, pretense]</p><p><b>Akcije koje predstavljaju prijateljske teoretske ili stvarne sposobnosti za zavaravanje neprijateljskih snaga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> actions to represent friendly notional or actual capabilities to mislead hostile forces [electronic simulative deception]</p><p><b>imitator, simulator, uređaj za oponašanje, uređaj za simuliranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a machine that simulates an environment for the purpose of training or research</p><p><b>istodobno odašiljati isti radijski signal s više o, istovremeno emitirati, RTV prijenos u živo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a broadcast that is carried simultaneously by radio and television (or by FM and AM radio)</p><p><b>Crne muhe i muhe za pijesak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> blackflies and sand flies [family Simuliidae]</p><p><b>vrsta rodova Simuliidae: crne muhe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Simuliidae: blackflies [genus Simulium]</p><p><b>istovremeni rad, istovremenost, simultanost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> happening or existing or done at the same time [simultaneousness]</p><p><b>istodoban, istovremen, jednovremen, paralelan, simultan, simultan (koji se zbiva u istom trenutku), simultani, usporednog, simultane, simultano</b