boarding</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sport of skating on a skateboard</p><p><b>klizač, klizačica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who skates</p><p><b>klizanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sport of gliding on skates</p><p><b>klizalište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> building that contains a surface for ice skating or roller skating [rink]</p><p><b>Kap na najsevernijem kraju Jutlanda između Skagerraka i Kattegatta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cape on the northernmost tip of Jutland between the Skagerrak and the Kattegatt [Skagens Odde]</p><p><b>Engleski filolog (1835-1912) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English philologist (1835-1912) [Walter William Skeat]</p><p><b>brzputan let., bježi, kao da si u panici. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hasty flight</p><p><i>v.</i> run away, as if in a panic</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u pitanju luk čija je visina manja od polovine njegove širine, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an arch whose height is less than half its width [diminished arch, scheme arch, skene arch]</p><p><b>sport pucanja u glinične golubove koje se bacaju na vis tako da simuliraju let ptice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sport of shooting at clay pigeons that are hurled upward in such a way as to simulate the flight of a bird [skeet shooting, trapshooting]</p><p><b>sport pucanja u glinične golubove koje se bacaju na vis tako da simuliraju let ptice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sport of shooting at clay pigeons that are hurled upward in such a way as to simulate the flight of a bird [skeet, trapshooting]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u pitanju krastavac, to znači da je krastavac u stanju da se odredi na određenu vrstu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> slender-bodied non-stinging insect having iridescent wings that are outspread at rest [darning needle, devil's darning needle, dragonfly, mosquito hawk, sewing needle, snake doctor, snake feeder]</p><p><b>čvrstoća koja se proteže od stražnje strane killa kako bi podržala kormilo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a brace that extends from the rear of the keel to support the rudderpost</p><p><b>pređa, klupko</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coils of worsted yarn</p><p><b>skeletni, suhonjav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or forming or attached to a skeleton</p><p><i>adj.</i> very thin especially from disease or hunger or cold [cadaverous, emaciated, gaunt, haggard, pinched, wasted]</p><p><b>okvir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the internal supporting structure that gives an artifact its shape [frame, skeleton, underframe]</p><p><b>kosturnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a muscle that is connected at either or both ends to a bone and so move parts of the skeleton [striated muscle]</p><p><b>koštano tkivo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any structure created by the skeleton of an organism</p><p><b>kostur, skelet, systema skeletale</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the hard structure (bones and cartilages) that provides a frame for the body of an animal [frame, skeleton, systema skeletale]</p><p><b>kostur, nacrt, okosnica, shema, skelet, skica, okosnicu, systema skeletale, okvir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something reduced to its minimal form</p><p><i>n.</i> a scandal that is kept secret [skeleton in the closet, skeleton in the cupboard]</p><p><i>n.</i> the hard structure (bones and cartilages) that provides a frame for the body of an animal [frame, skeletal system, systema skeletale]</p><p><i>n.</i> the internal supporting structure that gives an artifact its shape [frame, skeletal frame, underframe]</p><p><b>Pantropska epifitna ili kopnena paprika s obično tamno žutim granama i sitnim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pantropical epiphytic or terrestrial whisk fern with usually dull yellow branches and minute leaves [Psilotum nudum]</p><p><b>Skandal koji se čuva u tajnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a scandal that is kept secret [skeleton, skeleton in the cupboard]</p><p><b>Skandal koji se čuva u tajnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a scandal that is kept secret [skeleton, skeleton in the closet]</p><p><b>otpirač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a passkey with much of the bit filed away so that it can open different locks</p>