d]</p><p><b>u obliku kalčana, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a caustic substance produced by heating limestone [calcium hydrate, calcium hydroxide, caustic lime, hydrated lime, lime, lime hydrate]</p><p><b>slalom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a downhill race over a winding course defined by upright poles</p><p><i>v.</i> race on skis around obstacles</p><p><b>bubnuti, lupa, lupanje, oštra kritika, pobjeda, tresak, tresnuti, udar, udarac, udariti, zalupiti, lupiti, treskati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> winning all or all but one of the tricks in bridge [sweep]</p><p><i>n.</i> the noise made by the forceful impact of two objects</p><p><i>n.</i> a forceful impact that makes a loud noise</p><p><i>n.</i> an aggressive remark directed at a person like a missile and intended to have a telling effect [barb, dig, gibe, jibe, shaft, shot]</p><p><i>v.</i> close violently [bang]</p><p><i>v.</i> strike violently [bang]</p><p><i>v.</i> dance the slam dance [mosh, slam dance, thrash]</p><p><i>v.</i> throw violently [flap down]</p><p><b>oblik plesa u kojem plesači udaraju jedni u druge., Plesati slam ples. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of dancing in which dancers slam into one another [slam dancing]</p><p><i>v.</i> dance the slam dance [mosh, slam, thrash]</p><p><b>oblik plesa u kojem plesači udaraju jedni u druge. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of dancing in which dancers slam into one another [slam dance]</p><p><b>zakucavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something that is a sure to occur</p><p><i>n.</i> a forceful dunk</p><p><b>Ne obraćaj pažnju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> apply carelessly [clap on, slap on]</p><p><b>nasilno i iznenada i glasno., na nesmotren ili nemaran način., koji se brzo kreću., na nasilni ili nagli ili bučni način (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> violent and sudden and noisy</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a careless or reckless manner [slapdash]</p><p><i>adv.</i> with heedless speed</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a violent or sudden or noisy manner [slap-bang]</p><p><b>zakucavanje</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a forceful 