n, knuckle down]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih mrava uhvaćenih kao ličinke i porobljene od strane druge vrste (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various ants captured as larvae and enslaved by another species</p><p><b>osoba koja se bavi trgovinom robljem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person engaged in slave trade [slave trader, slaver]</p><p><b>eksploatator, izrabljivač, nadzornik robova, nadzornik robo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cruel employer who demands excessive work from the employees [Simon Legree]</p><p><i>n.</i> a supervisor of slaves at work</p><p><b>tržište robova</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a marketplace where slaves were auctioned off (especially in the southern United States before the American Civil War)</p><p><b>Neko tko drži robove. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who holds slaves [slaveholder, slaver]</p><p><b>brod koji se koristio za prevoz robova iz njihovih domova na mjesta ropstva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ship used to transport slaves from their homes to places of bondage</p><p><b>bilo koja od južnih država u kojima je ropstvo bilo legalno prije američkog građanskog rata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the southern states in which slavery was legal prior to the American Civil War</p><p><b>trgovina robljem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> traffic in slaves [slave traffic]</p><p><b>osoba koja se bavi trgovinom robljem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person engaged in slave trade [slave dealer, slaver]</p><p><b>trgovina robljem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> traffic in slaves [slave trade]</p><p><b>mrav koji napada kolonije drugih vrsta mrava i odvede mlade da ih odgajaju kao robove. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ant that attacks colonies of other ant species and carries off the young to be reared as slave ants [slave-making ant]</p><p><b>mrav koji napada kolonije drugih vrsta mrava i odvede mlade da ih odgajaju kao robove. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ant that attacks colonies of other ant species and carries off the young to be reared as slave ants [slave-maker]</p><p><b>Neko tko 