gm]</p><p><b>brana, ispustiti vodu, jaz, odvodni kanal, ustava, prolaz</b></p><p><i>n.</i> conduit that carries a rapid flow of water controlled by a sluicegate [penstock, sluiceway]</p><p><i>v.</i> pour as if from a sluice [sluice down]</p><p><i>v.</i> irrigate with water from a sluice [flush]</p><p><i>v.</i> transport in or send down a sluice</p><p><i>v.</i> draw through a sluice</p><p><b>Isplivati kao iz kapije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> pour as if from a sluice [sluice]</p><p><b>zaporni zasun</b></p><p><i>n.</i> regulator consisting of a valve or gate that controls the rate of water flow through a sluice [floodgate, head gate, penstock, sluicegate, water gate]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> regulator consisting of a valve or gate that controls the rate of water flow through a sluice [floodgate, head gate, penstock, sluice valve, water gate]</p><p><b>odvoditi, prolaz, ustava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> conduit that carries a rapid flow of water controlled by a sluicegate [penstock, sluice]</p><p><b>brana, ispustiti vodu, jaz, odvodni kanal, ustava (od &quot;sluice&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pouring from or as if from a sluice</p><p><b>mala, sirot kraj, sirotinjska četvrt, sirotinjska četvrt grada, škriljasti ugljen, zabitna uličica, zabitni kraj, zloglasni dio grada, slum</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a district of a city marked by poverty and inferior living conditions [slum area]</p><p><i>v.</i> spend time at a lower socio-economic level than one's own, motivated by curiosity or desire for adventure</p><p><b>slum</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a district of a city marked by poverty and inferior living conditions [slum]</p><p><b>drijem, drijemati, drijemež, san, spavanje, spavati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a natural and periodic state of rest during which consciousness of the world is suspended [sleep]</p><p><i>n.</i> a dormant or quiescent state</p><p><i>v.</i> be asleep [catch some Z's, kip, log Z's, sleep]</p><p><b>Noćna zabava 