ere (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the smaller of the two Magellanic Clouds visible from the southern hemisphere</p><p><b>osoba ispod prosječne visine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person of below average size</p><p><b>dio ugovora koji sadrži rezerve i kvalifikacije koje su često štampane malim slovima, materijal štampan malim slovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of a contract that contains reservations and qualifications that are often printed in small type [fine print]</p><p><i>n.</i> material printed in small type [fine print]</p><p><b>brod koji je mali. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ship that is small</p><p><b>Pobjeđujem sve osim jednog trika u bridžu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> winning all but one of the tricks in a hand of bridge [little slam]</p><p><b>S druge strane, za proizvode koji se prodaju na brodu ili u mornaričkoj bazi i koji se naplaćuju na račun osobe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> personal items conforming to regulations that are sold aboard ship or at a naval base and charged to the person's pay</p><p><b>Svaka lakša konopca koja se koristi na brodu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any light rope used on shipboard</p><p><b>lakše neformalne razgovore za društvene prilike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> light informal conversation for social occasions [causerie, chin-wag, chin-wagging, chin wag, chin wagging, chit-chat, chit chat, chitchat, gab, gabfest, gossip, tittle-tattle]</p><p><b>gradić, naselje, selo, zaseok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a community of people smaller than a town [settlement, village]</p><p><b>unutarnji glas koji osuđuje tvoje ponašanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inner voice that judges your behavior [voice of conscience, wee small voice]</p><p><b>mala široko rasprostranjena oblika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small widely distributed form [Pieris rapae]</p><p><b>različite vrste aster (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a variety of aster</p><p><b>kratko vatreno oružje, pištolj, vatreno oružje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a portable gun [firearm, piece]</p><p><b>za dionice tvrtki s tržišn