tance</p><p><i>v.</i> make a smudge on [blur, smudge, smutch]</p><p><i>v.</i> cover (a surface) by smearing (a substance) over it [daub]</p><p><i>v.</i> charge falsely or with malicious intent [asperse, besmirch, calumniate, defame, denigrate, slander, smirch, sully]</p><p><b>metoda ispitivanja obojenih stanica u cervikalnom mastiku za ranu dijagnozu raka maternice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of examining stained cells in a cervical smear for early diagnosis of uterine cancer [Pap test, Papanicolaou test]</p><p><b>epitet koji se može koristiti da bi se osramotio nečiji ugled (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an epithet that can be used to smear someone's reputation</p><p><b>bijeli izlučivanje od lojnih žlijezda predkože (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a white secretion of the sebaceous glands of the foreskin</p><p><b>čulo mirisa, miris, mirisati, njuh, njušiti što, omirisati, onjušiti, pomirisati, smrad, smrdjeti, zadah, njušiti, dišati, olfaktivno svojstvo, atmosfera, duh, raspoloženje, mirisanje, njušenje, vonjati, zaudarati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sensation that results when olfactory receptors in the nose are stimulated by particular chemicals in gaseous form [odor, odour, olfactory perception, olfactory sensation]</p><p><i>n.</i> any property detected by the olfactory system [aroma, odor, odour, olfactory property, scent]</p><p><i>n.</i> the general atmosphere of a place or situation and the effect that it has on people [feel, feeling, flavor, flavour, look, spirit, tone]</p><p><i>n.</i> the faculty that enables us to distinguish scents [olfaction, olfactory modality, sense of smell]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of perceiving the odor of something [smelling]</p><p><i>v.</i> inhale the odor of</p><p><i>v.</i> emit an odor</p><p><i>v.</i> smell bad</p><p><i>v.</i> have an element suggestive (of something) [reek, smack]</p><p><i>v.</i> become aware of not through the senses but instinctively [sense, smell out]</p><p><b>prepoznavanje ili otkrivanje putem mirisa ili kao da putem mirisa, postati svjesni ne kroz čula, ali instinktivno (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> recognize or detect by or as if by smelling [nose out, scent out, sniff out]</p><p><i>v.</i> become aware of not through the senses but instinctively [sense, smell]</p><p><b>uzrok da smrdi loše (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to smell bad [stink out, stink up]</p><p><b>mirisanje, njušenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of perceiving the odor of something [smell]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used with `of' or `with') noticeably odorous [redolent]</p><p><b>bočica s amonijakom, bočica s miomirisom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bottle containing smelling salts</p><p><b>mirisna sol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pungent preparation of ammonium carbonate and perfume</p><p><b>smrdljiv, vonjav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> offensively malodorous [fetid, foetid, foul, foul-smelling, funky, ill-scented, noisome, stinking]</p><p><b>njušiti, rastopiti se, taliti, topiti rudu, topiti se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small cold-water silvery fish</p><p><i>n.</i> small trout-like silvery marine or freshwater food fishes of cold northern waters</p><p><i>v.</i> extract (metals) by heating</p><p><b>peć za topljenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an industrial plant for smelting [smeltery]</p><p><b>topionica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an industrial plant for smelting [smelter]</p><p><b>Smetaninu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Czech composer (1824-1884) [Bedrich Smetana]</p><p><b>mali ronac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> smallest merganser and most expert diver [Mergus albellus]</p><p><b>mrvica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tiny or scarcely detectable amount [iota, scintilla, shred, smidgen, smidgeon, smidgin, tittle, whit]</p><p><b>malo, mrvica, zerica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tiny or scarcely detectable amount [iota, scintilla, shred, smidge, smidgeon, smidgin, tittle, whit]</p><p><b>mrvica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tiny or scarcely detectable amount [iota, scintilla, shred, smidge, smidgen, smidgin, tittle, whit]</p><p><b>mrvica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tiny or scarcely detectable amount [iota, scintilla, shred, smidge, smidgen, smidgeon, tittle, whit]</p><p><b>jedna od mnogih podobliaka u koje neki sustavi klasifikacije podjeljuju Liliaceae, ali nisu široko prihvaćeni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of many subfamilies into which some classification systems subdivide the Liliaceae but not widely accepted [subfamily Smilacaceae]</p><p><b>ponekad stavljena u Smilacaceae, krhka biljka iz Južne Afrike s svijetlo zelenim ravnim stabljikama i sjajnim lišće popularno kao cvjetna ukras (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sometimes placed in Smilacaceae [genus Smilax]</p><p><i>n.</i> fragile twining plant of South Africa with bright green flattened stems and glossy foliage popular as a floral decoration [Asparagus asparagoides]</p><p><b>u obliku zelene biljke s čvrstima stabljikama u cik-cak obliku s blistavim lištima i pločama svjetlozelenih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> creeping or climbing evergreen having spiny zigzag stems with shiny leaves and racemes of pale-green flowers [rough bindweed]</p><p><b>Vrlo bodljikava drvena loza iz istočnih Sjedinjenih Država koja raste u zamršene mase s čvrstim okruglim stabljikama s blistavim kožnim lišćama i malim zelenkastim cvijećima nakon kojih slijede gomile nejedljivih blistavih crnih bobica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a very prickly woody vine of the eastern United States growing in tangled masses having tough round stems with shiny leathery leaves and small greenish flowers followed by clusters of inedible shiny black berries [briar, brier, bullbrier, catbrier, greenbrier, horse-brier, horse brier]</p><p><b>biti naklonjen, izraziti osmijeh, nasmiješiti se, osmijeh, osmjehivati se, s prezirom promatrati, smijati se, smiješak, smiješiti se, smješkati se, osmjeh</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a facial expression characterized by turning up the corners of the mouth [grin, grinning, smiling]</p><p><i>v.</i> change one's facial expression by spreading the lips, often to signal pleasure</p><p><i>v.</i> express with a smile</p><p><b>tigri sa sabljim zubima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> saber-toothed tigers [genus Smiledon]</p><p><b>Sjevernoamerički sabljokosac (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American sabertooth</p><p><b>biti naklonjen, izraziti osmijeh, nasmiješiti se, osmijeh, osmjehivati se, s prezirom promatrati, smijati se, smiješak, smiješiti se, smješkati se, osmjeh (od &quot;smile&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who smiles</p><p><i>n.</i> the human face (`kisser' and `smiler' and `mug' are informal terms for `face' and `phiz' is British) [countenance, kisser, mug, phiz, physiognomy, visage]</p><p><b>smješko</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an emoticon of a smiling face</p><p><b>koji se smiješi, nasmijan, nasmijana, vedar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a facial expression characterized by turning up the corners of the mouth [grin, grinning, smile]</p><p><i>adj.</i> smiling with happiness or optimism [beamish, twinkly]</p><p><b>koji se smiješi, nasmijan, nasmijana, vedar (od &quot;smiling&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with smiles</p><p><b>višegodišnji planinski pirinč porijeklom iz mediteranske regije i uvođen u Sjevernu Ameriku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial mountain rice native to Mediterranean region and introduced into North America [Oryzopsis miliacea, smilo grass]</p><p><b>višegodišnji planinski pirinč porijeklom iz mediteranske regije i uvođen u Sjevernu Ameriku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial mountain rice native to Mediterranean region and introduced into North America [Oryzopsis miliacea, smilo]</p><p><b>mrlja, okaljati, umrljati, brljotina, fleka, prljavoća, razmaz, smrljotina, zmazano, ljaga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blemish made by dirt [blot, daub, slur, smear, smudge, spot]</p><p><i>n.</i> an act that brings discredit to the person who does it [blot, smear, spot, stain]</p><p><i>v.</i> smear so as to make dirty or stained [besmirch]</p><p><i>v.</i> charge falsely or with malicious intent [asperse, besmirch, calumniate, defame, denigrate, slander, smear, sully]</p><p><b>glup, sladunjav, usiljen</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a smile expressing smugness or scorn instead of pleasure</p><p><i>v.</i> smile affectedly or derisively [simper]</p><p><b>glup, sladunjav, usiljen (od &quot;smirk&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a smiler whose smile is offensively self-satisfied</p><p><b>Veloute ili smeđi umak s sauteiranim, narezanim lukom i suhim bijelim vinom i kiselom smetanom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veloute or brown sauce with sauteed chopped onion and dry white wine and sour cream</p><p><b>nanijeti udar, pobijediti, poraziti, spopasti, ubiti, uništiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> inflict a heavy blow on, with the hand, a tool, or a weapon</p><p><i>v.</i> affect suddenly with deep feeling</p><p><i>v.</i> cause physical pain or suffering in [afflict]</p><p><b>kovač, Smith, Smit, Kovačević</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Rhodesian statesman who declared independence of Zimbabwe from Great Britain (born in 1919) [Ian Douglas Smith, Ian Smith]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States sculptor (1906-1965) [David Roland Smith, David Smith]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States singer noted for her rendition of patriotic songs (1909-1986) [Kate Smith, Kathryn Elizabeth Smith]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States suffragist who refused to pay taxes until she could vote (1792-1886) [Julia Evelina Smith]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States blues singer (1894-1937) [Bessie Smith]</p><p><i>n.</i> religious leader who founded the Mormon Church in 1830 (1805-1844) [Joseph Smith]</p><p><i>n.</i> English explorer who helped found the colony at Jamestown, Virginia [Captain John Smith, John Smith]</p><p><i>n.</i> Scottish economist who advocated private enterprise and free trade (1723-1790) [Adam Smith]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who works at something specified</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who works metal (especially by hammering it when it is hot and malleable) [metalworker]</p><p><b>crepovi, razvijeni kom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of small fragments considered as a whole</p><p><b>kovačko ognjište, kovačnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a workplace where metal is worked by heating and hammering [forge]</p><p><b>obuzet, paraliziran, pogođen, poražen, savladan, uzet</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used in combination) affected by something overwhelming [stricken, struck]</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by foolish or unreasoning fondness [enamored, in love, infatuated, potty, soft on, taken with]</p><p><b>Američki psiholog i psihofizičar koji je predložio Stevensov zakon moći da zamjeni Fechnerov zakon (1906-1973) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States psychologist and psychophysicist who proposed Stevens' power law to replace Fechner's law (1906-1973) [S. Smith Stevens, Stanley Smith Stevens, Stevens]</p><p><b>dječje odijelo za igru, radno odijelo, zaštitno odijelo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a loose coverall (coat or frock) reaching down to the ankles [dust coat, duster, gabardine, gaberdine]</p><p><i>v.</i> embellish by sewing in straight lines crossing each other diagonally</p><p><b>dječje odijelo za igru, radno odijelo, zaštitno odijelo (od &quot;smock&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> embroidery consisting of ornamental needlework on a garment that is made by gathering the cloth tightly in stitches</p><p><b>mješavina magle i dima, smog</b></p><p><i>n.</i> air pollution by a mixture of smoke and fog [smogginess]</p><p><b>smog</b></p><p><i>n.</i> air pollution by a mixture of smoke and fog [smog]</p><p><b>u oblacima od dima i magle. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> clouded with a mixture of smoke and fog</p><p><b>čađ, dim, dimiti se, očađavati, pušiti, cigareta, pljuga, cigara, smotka, gras, marica, trava, vutra, popušiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cloud of fine particles suspended in a gas [fume]</p><p><i>n.</i> a hot vapor containing fine particles of carbon being produced by combustion [smoking]</p><p><i>n.</i> an indication of some hidden activity</p><p><i>n.</i> something with no concrete substance</p><p><i>n.</i> tobacco leaves that have been made into a cylinder [roll of tobacco]</p><p><i>n.</i> street names for marijuana [Mary Jane, dope, gage, grass, green goddess, locoweed, pot, sens, sess, skunk, weed]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of smoking tobacco or other substances [smoking]</p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) a pitch thrown with maximum velocity [bullet, fastball, heater, hummer]</p><p><i>v.</i> inhale and exhale smoke from cigarettes, cigars, pipes</p><p><i>v.</i> emit a cloud of fine particles [fume]</p><p><b>dimni alarmni signal</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an alarm that is tripped off by fire or smoke [fire alarm]</p><p><b>bomba koja emituje gust dim kada eksplodira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bomb that gives off thick smoke when it explodes [smoke grenade]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 1. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog poglavlja ne primjenjuje druga vrsta biljaka ili biljaka, točka (b) ovog poglavlja ne primjenjuje se na biljke ili biljke koje su u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog poglavlja., bilo koji od različitih grmova rodova Conospermum s panicama uglavnom bijelih vunih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several shrubs or shrubby trees of the genus Cotinus [smoke tree]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various shrubs of the genus Conospermum with panicles of mostly white woolly flowers</p><p><b>bomba koja emituje gust dim kada eksplodira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bomb that gives off thick smoke when it explodes [smoke bomb]</p><p><b>ventilacija (kao u krovu) za izlazak dima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vent (as in a roof) for smoke to escape</p><p><b>Vozi se sa dimom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> drive out with smoke</p><p><b>dimna zavjesa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (military) screen consisting of a cloud of smoke that obscures movements [smokescreen]</p><p><i>n.</i> an action intended to conceal or confuse or obscure [smokescreen]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 1. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog poglavlja ne primjenjuje druga vrsta biljaka ili biljaka, točka (b) ovog poglavlja ne primjenjuje se na biljke ili biljke koje su u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog poglavlja., sivozelena grmlja pustinjskog područja jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika s rijetkim lišće i krajnjim šiljcima plavičasto-fioletskih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several shrubs or shrubby trees of the genus Cotinus [smoke bush]</p><p><i>n.</i> greyish-green shrub of desert regions of southwestern United States and Mexico having sparse foliage and terminal spikes of bluish violet flowers [Dalea spinosa]</p><p><b>(posebno za meso i ribu) sušena i ozdravljena vješanjem u drvenom dimu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used especially of meats and fish) dried and cured by hanging in wood smoke [smoke-dried, smoked]</p><p><b>dimljeni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used especially of meats and fish) dried and cured by hanging in wood smoke [smoke-cured, smoked]</p><p><b>sadržavaju dim (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> containing smoke</p><p><b>bez dima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> free of smoke</p><p><b>dimljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used especially of meats and fish) dried and cured by hanging in wood smoke [smoke-cured, smoke-dried]</p><p><b>Ugalj izliječen pušenjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eel cured by smoking</p><p><b>Hadeck obično pečen ali ponekad pržen s puno maslaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> haddock usually baked but sometimes broiled with lots of butter [finnan, finnan haddie, finnan haddock]</p><p><b>sušene i dimljene slede crvenkaste boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dried and smoked herring having a reddish color [red herring]</p><p><b>Smatra se da je to u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mackerel cured by smoking</p><p><b>dimljeni losos</b></p><p><i>n.</i> salmon cured by smoking</p><p><b>mala kuća u kojoj se dim koristi za liječenje mesa ili ribe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small house where smoke is used to cure meat or fish [meat house]</p><p><b>bezdiman, bezdimni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> emitting or containing little or no smoke</p><p><b>eksploziv (trgovinski naziv Ballistite) koji gori s relativno malom količinom dima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an explosive (trade name Ballistite) that burns with relatively little smoke [Ballistite]</p><p><b>kola za pušače, pušač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who smokes tobacco [tobacco user]</p><p><i>n.</i> a party for men only (or one considered suitable for men only) [stag party]</p><p><i>n.</i> a passenger car for passengers who wish to smoke [smoking car, smoking carriage, smoking compartment]</p><p><b>(vojni) ekran koji se sastoji od oblaka dima koji prikriva pokrete, djelovanje namijenjeno skrivanju ili zbunjivanju ili nejasnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (military) screen consisting of a cloud of smoke that obscures movements [smoke screen]</p><p><i>n.</i> an action intended to conceal or confuse or obscure [smoke screen]</p><p><b>dimnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large tall chimney through which combustion gases and smoke can be evacuated [stack]</p><p><b>pušenje, dim</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of smoking tobacco or other substances [smoke]</p><p><i>n.</i> a hot vapor containing fine particles of carbon being produced by combustion [smoke]</p><p><i>adj.</i> emitting smoke in great volume</p><p><b>osobni automobil za putnike koji žele pušiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a passenger car for passengers who wish to smoke [smoker, smoking carriage, smoking compartment]</p><p><b>osobni automobil za putnike koji žele pušiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a passenger car for passengers who wish to smoke [smoker, smoking car, smoking compartment]</p><p><b>osobni automobil za putnike koji žele pušiti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a passenger car for passengers who wish to smoke [smoker, smoking car, smoking carriage]</p><p><b>Neosporni dokazi (posebno o zločinu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> indisputable evidence (especially of a crime)</p><p><b>muški mekani jakna obično sa remen kravata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a man's soft jacket usually with a tie belt [lounging jacket]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mas.% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blend of tobaccos to be smoked in a pipe</p><p><b>soba za pušače</b></p><p><i>n.</i> room in a h