oothen]</p><p><i>v.</i> make (a surface) shine [polish, shine, smoothen]</p><p><i>v.</i> free from obstructions [smooth out]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a surface free from roughness or bumps or ridges or irregularities</p><p><i>adj.</i> smoothly agreeable and courteous with a degree of sophistication [bland, politic, suave]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of the margin of a leaf shape</p><p><i>adj.</i> smooth and unconstrained in movement [fluent, fluid, liquid]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (music) without breaks between notes [legato]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of motion that runs or flows or proceeds without jolts or turbulence</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking obstructions or difficulties</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a body of water) free from disturbance by heavy waves [placid, quiet, still, tranquil, unruffled]</p><p><b>obična grmlja sa glatkom kore iz istočnih Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common shrub of the eastern United States with smooth bark [Alnus serrulata, hazel alder]</p><p><b>različite vrste aster (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a variety of aster</p><p><b>Australsko drvo koje liči na kauri, ali je mnogo lakše i mekše. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Australian timber tree resembling the kauri but having wood much lighter in weight and softer [Agathis robusta, dundathu pine, queensland kauri]</p><p><b>korov (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a weed [Digitaria ischaemum]</p><p><b>Vječna biljka iz istočne Australije s podlaktim cvetovima od plavog do ljubičastog ili crvenog boje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect or trailing perennial of eastern Australia having axillary racemes of blue to purple or red flowers [Swainsona galegifolia]</p><p><b>mala morska pasa koja živi na dnu mora koja se nalazi duž obale Atlantika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small bottom-dwelling shark found along both Atlantic coasts</p><p><b>Zemljina kugla s peridijumom koji je čvrst, suho i glatko kada je mlad, ali razvija pukotine kada je zreo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an earthball with a peridium that is firm dry and smooth when young but developing cracks when mature [Scleroderma bovista]</p><p><b>Zapadne i središnje Sjedinjene Države (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> of western and central United States [Opheodrys vernalis]</p><p><b>mlat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fished for the hides and vitamin-rich liver [Sphyrna zygaena]</p><p><b>Južnoistočna Sjedinjene Države do sjevernog Meksika i Jamajke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> southeastern United States to northern Mexico and Jamaica [Alabama lip fern, Cheilanthes alabamensis]</p><p><b>mišić koji se skuplja bez svjesne kontrole i nalazi se u zidovima unutarnjih organa kao što su želudac i crijeva i mjehura i krvnih žila (osim srca), mišićno tkivo koje se ne pojavljuje kao prugavo pod mikroskopom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a muscle that contracts without conscious control and found in walls of internal organs such as stomach and intestine and bladder and blood vessels (excluding the heart) [involuntary muscle]</p><p><i>n.</i> muscle tissue that does not appear striated under the microscope</p><p><b>stanice glatkih mišića (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cells of the smooth muscles</p><p><b>ugladiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> free from obstructions [smooth]</p><p><b>Ako je potrebno, možete se požuriti ili izbjeći pravilno postupanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> treat hurriedly or avoid dealing with properly [gloss over, skate over, skimp over, slur over]</p><p><b>mali avion za završetak rada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small plane for finish work [smoothing plane]</p><p><b>Riječni kornjača Mississippi basena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> river turtle of Mississippi basin [Trionyx muticus]</p><p><b>Česta neotrovna grmlja istočne Sjeverne Amerike s voskovitim složenim listovima i zelenim paniculate cvijeće slijede crvene bobice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common nonpoisonous shrub of eastern North America with waxy compound leaves and green paniculate flowers followed by red berries [Rhus glabra, scarlet sumac, vinegar tree]</p><p><b>šuma od šuma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a holly shrub</p><p><b>stijenovit papri