rtive, sneak, stealthy, surreptitious]</p><p><b>ismijavati se, podsmjehivati se, poruga, rugati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a facial expression of contempt or scorn [leer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a contemptuous or scornful remark</p><p><i>v.</i> express through a scornful smile</p><p><i>v.</i> smile contemptuously</p><p><b>ismijavati se, podsmjehivati se, poruga, rugati se (od &quot;sneer&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who expresses contempt by remarks or facial expression [scorner]</p><p><b>ismijavati se, podsmjehivati se, poruga, rugati se (od &quot;sneer&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> expressive of contempt [snide, supercilious]</p><p><b>S podsmijehom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with a sneer [snidely, superciliously]</p><p><b>kihanje, kihati, kihnuti, podcijeniti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a symptom consisting of the involuntary expulsion of air from the nose [sneezing, sternutation]</p><p><i>v.</i> exhale spasmodically, as when an irritant entered one's nose</p><p><b>kihanje, kihati, kihnuti, podcijeniti (od &quot;sneeze&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who sneezes</p><p><b>bilo koja biljka iz roda Helenium koja uzrokuje kihanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various plants of the genus Helenium characteristically causing sneezing</p><p><b>Eurazijska biljka s puste glave bijelih cvijeća u obliku gumbova i dugim sivo-zelenim lištima koji uzrokuju kihanje kada se uprašuju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Eurasian herb having loose heads of button-shaped white flowers and long grey-green leaves that cause sneezing when powdered [Achillea ptarmica, sneezewort]</p><p><b>Eurazijska biljka s puste glave bijelih cvijeća u obliku gumbova i dugim sivo-zelenim lištima koji uzrokuju kihanje kada se uprašuju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Eurasian herb having loose heads of button-shaped white flowers and long grey-green leaves that cause sneezing when powdered [Achillea ptarmica, sneezeweed yarrow]</p><p><b>kihanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a symptom consisting of the involuntary expulsion of air from the 