><i>n.</i> the act of breathing heavily through the nose (as when the nose is congested) [snivel, snuffle]</p><p><i>v.</i> cry or whine with snuffling [blub, blubber, snivel, snuffle]</p><p><i>v.</i> inhale audibly through the nose [sniff]</p><p><b>ridati, šmrcati (od &quot;sniffle&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who breathes audibly through a congested nose [sniveler]</p><p><b>frktati, miris, mirisati, njušiti, njuškanje, onjušiti, šmrkanje, udisati, uvlačiti zrak, zadah (od &quot;sniff&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> liable to sniffle [snuffling, snuffly]</p><p><b>prezriv, smrdljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or showing arrogant superiority to and disdain of those one views as unworthy [disdainful, haughty, imperious, lordly, overbearing, prideful, supercilious, swaggering]</p><p><b>kugličano staklo s malim vrhom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a globular glass with a small top [brandy glass, brandy snifter]</p><p><b>kikotanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disrespectful laugh [snicker, snort]</p><p><i>v.</i> laugh quietly [snicker]</p><p><b>beznačajan čovjek, krojač, odrezak, odsječak, rezuckanje, sjeći škarama, škare, ostrići, kresati, podšišati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small piece of anything (especially a piece that has been snipped off) [snippet, snipping]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of clipping or snipping [clip, clipping]</p><p><i>v.</i> sever or remove by pinching or snipping [clip, nip, nip off, snip off]</p><p><i>v.</i> cultivate, tend, and cut back the growth of [clip, crop, cut back, dress, lop, prune, trim]</p><p><b>odrezati, ostrići</b></p><p><i>v.</i> sever or remove by pinching or snipping [clip, nip, nip off, snip]</p><p><b>barska šljuka, šljuka, šljuku, kritizirati, napadati, napasti, nasrnuti, nasrtati, obarati se, oboriti se, okomiti se, okomljivati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Old or New World straight-billed game bird of the sandpiper family</p><p><i>n.</i> a gunshot from a concealed location</p><p><i>v.</i> hunt or shoot snipe</p><p><i>v.</i> aim and shoot with great 