ice, disalica, plutati, sprava na maski za ronjenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> breathing device consisting of a bent tube fitting into a swimmer's mouth and extending above the surface</p><p><i>n.</i> air passage provided by a retractable device containing intake and exhaust pipes [breather, schnorchel, schnorkel, snorkel breather]</p><p><i>v.</i> dive with a snorkel</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to potrebno za proizvodnju električne energije, u slučaju da je to potrebno za proizvodnju električne energije, u slučaju da je to potrebno za proizvodnju električne energije, u slučaju da je to potrebno za proizvodnju električne energije, u slučaju da je to potrebno za proizvodnju električne energije, u slučaju da je to potrebno za proizvodnju električne energije, u slučaju da je to potrebno za proizvodnju električne energije, u slučaju da je to potrebno za proizvodnju električne energije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> air passage provided by a retractable device containing intake and exhaust pipes [breather, schnorchel, schnorkel, snorkel]</p><p><b>skid ronjenje s snorkelom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> skin diving with a snorkel [snorkeling]</p><p><b>dihalica, dihalice, disalica, plutati, sprava na maski za ronjenje (od &quot;snorkel&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> skin diving with a snorkel [snorkel diving]</p><p><b>brektanje, dahtanje, dahtati, frktanje, prasnuti u smijeh, smijati, ušmrkati, šmrkati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disrespectful laugh [snicker, snigger]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cry or noise made to express displeasure or contempt [Bronx cheer, bird, boo, hiss, hoot, raspberry, razz, razzing]</p><p><i>v.</i> indicate contempt by breathing noisily and forcefully through the nose</p><p><i>v.</i> make a snorting sound by exhaling hard</p><p><i>v.</i> inhale recreational drugs [huff]</p><p><i>v.</i> inhale through the nose [take a hit]</p><p><b>brektanje, dahtanje, dahtati, frktanje, prasnuti u smijeh, smijati, ušmrkati (od &quot;snort&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who expresses contempt or indignation by uttering a snorting sound</p><p><i>n.</i> something outstandingly difficult</p><p><i>n.</i> something that is extraordinary or remarkable or prominent</p><p><b>sjajan, žestok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an act of forcible exhalation [huffing, puffing]</p><p><b>(Britanski neformalni) loše raspoloženi ili uznemireni (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (British informal) ill-tempered or annoyed [shirty]</p><p><b>nosna sluz, nosni mukus, snob</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person regarded as arrogant and annoying [prig, snob, snoot]</p><p><i>n.</i> nasal mucus</p><p><b>(koristi se u govornom jeziku) previše samouvjerena ili arogantna, prljav s izlivom iz nosa (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used colloquially) overly conceited or arrogant [bigheaded, persnickety, snooty, snotty, stuck-up, too big for one's breeches, uppish]</p><p><i>adj.</i> dirty with nasal discharge [snotty]</p><p><b>balav, odvratan, pomorski kadet, šmrkav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used colloquially) overly conceited or arrogant [bigheaded, persnickety, snooty, snot-nosed, stuck-up, too big for one's breeches, uppish]</p><p><i>adj.</i> dirty with nasal discharge [snot-nosed]</p><p><b>Označen je neugodnim nepoštovanjem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by casual disrespect [flip, impudent, insolent]</p><p><b>duhalica, gubica, kljun cijevi, mlaznica, njuška</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long projecting or anterior elongation of an animal's head [neb]</p><p><i>n.</i> informal terms for the nose [beak, honker, hooter, nozzle, schnoz, schnozzle, snoot]</p><p><i>n.</i> beaklike projection of the anterior part of the head of certain insects such as e.g. weevils [rostrum]</p><p><b>Uređaj za proizvodnju električnih goriva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small weevil having a prolonged snout</p><p><b>smetnje na ekranu, snijeg, sniježiti, snježan, bjelina, snijega, snijegom, snijegu, snježna, snježne, snježnog, sneg, snig</b></p><p><i>n.</i> precipitation falling from clouds in the form of ice crystals [snowfall]</p><p><i>n.</i> a layer of snowflake