rs when a single nucleotide in a genome is altered [single nucleotide polymorphism]</p><p><b>grdnja, izgrditi, oštar prijekor, otresanje, prćast, ignoriranje, ignorirati, odbaciti, odbacivati, odbijati, odbiti, zanemariti, zanemarivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instance of driving away or warding off [rebuff, repulse]</p><p><i>n.</i> a refusal to recognize someone you know [cold shoulder, cut]</p><p><i>v.</i> refuse to acknowledge [cut, disregard, ignore]</p><p><i>v.</i> reject outright and bluntly [rebuff, repel]</p><p><i>adj.</i> unusually short</p><p><b>ima prćast nos</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a blunt nose [pug-nose, pug-nosed, short-nosed]</p><p><b>burmut, čađ, izraziti prezir, komad fitilja, njušiti, njuškanje, onjušiti, šmrk burmuta, šmrkati, udisati, ugasiti, utrnuti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the charred portion of a candlewick</p><p><i>n.</i> a pinch of smokeless tobacco inhaled at a single time</p><p><i>n.</i> finely powdered tobacco for sniffing up the nose</p><p><i>n.</i> sensing an odor by inhaling through the nose [sniff]</p><p><i>v.</i> sniff or smell inquiringly [snuffle]</p><p><i>v.</i> inhale (something) through the nose</p><p><i>adj.</i> snuff colored [chukker-brown, mummy-brown, snuff-brown]</p><p><b>onjušiti, crknuti, izdahnuti, krepati, preminuti, skončati, skončavati, umirati, umrijeti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> pass from physical life and lose all bodily attributes and functions necessary to sustain life [buy the farm, cash in one's chips, choke, conk, croak, decease, die, drop dead, exit, expire, give-up the ghost, go, kick the bucket, pass, pass away, perish, pop off]</p><p><b>gasiti, pogasiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put an end to [extinguish]</p><p><i>v.</i> put out, as of fires, flames, or lights [blow out, extinguish, quench]</p><p><b>osoba koja koristi duhan. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who uses snuff [snuffer]</p><p><b>od šmrkljana (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> snuff colored [chukker-brown, mummy-brown, snuff]</p><p><b>tamno žuto smeđe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dark yellowish brown [snuff-colour]</p><p><b>tamno žuto smeđe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dark yellowish brown [snuff-color]</p><p><b>mala ukrasna kutija za nošenje duhan u džepu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small ornamental box for carrying snuff in your pocket</p><p><b>Pterosa (Pterosaurus) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fern of northeastern North America [Dryopteris thelypteris pubescens, Thelypteris palustris pubescens, meadow fern]</p><p><b>burmut, čađ, izraziti prezir, komad fitilja, njušiti, njuškanje, onjušiti, šmrk burmuta, šmrkati, udisati, ugasiti, utrnuti (od &quot;snuff&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cone-shaped implement with a handle</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who snuffs out candles</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who uses snuff [snuff user]</p><p><b>burmut, čađ, izraziti prezir, komad fitilja, njušiti, njuškanje, onjušiti, šmrk burmuta, šmrkati, udisati, ugasiti, utrnuti (od &quot;snuff&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> scissors for cropping and holding the snuff of a candlewick</p><p><b>govor kroz nos, govorenje kroz nos, unjkanje, šmrcati, ridati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of breathing heavily through the nose (as when the nose is congested) [sniffle, snivel]</p><p><i>v.</i> sniff or smell inquiringly [snuff]</p><p><i>v.</i> snuff up mucus through the nose [snivel]</p><p><i>v.</i> cry or whine with snuffling [blub, blubber, sniffle, snivel]</p><p><b>govor kroz nos, govorenje kroz nos, unjkanje (od &quot;snuffle&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who breathes noisily (as through a nose blocked by mucus)</p><p><b>govor kroz nos, govorenje kroz nos, unjkanje (od &quot;snuffle&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> liable to sniffle [sniffly, snuffly]</p><p><b>burmut, čađ, izraziti prezir, komad fitilja, njušiti, njuškanje, onjušiti, šmrk burmuta, šmrkati, udisati, ugasiti, utrnuti (od &quot;snuff&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> liable to sniffle [sniffly, snuffling]</p><p><b>dobro zaklonjen, podesan, pristojan, topao, udoban, udobno, udobno sjesti, ugodan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small secluded room [cubby, cubbyhole, snuggery]</p><p><i>adj.</i> offering safety</p><p><i>adj.</i> fitting closely but comfortably [close, close-fitting]</p><p><i>adj.</i> well and tightly constructed</p><p><i>adj.</i> enjoying or affording comforting warmth and shelter especially in a small space [cosy, cozy]</p><p><b>mala usamljena soba. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small secluded room [cubby, cubbyhole, snug]</p><p><b>poljubiti se, priviti se, udobno se namjestiti, maženje, gnijezditi se, privinuti se, smjestiti se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a close and affectionate (and often prolonged) embrace [cuddle, nestle]</p><p><i>v.</i> move or arrange oneself in a comfortable and cozy position [cuddle, draw close, nest, nestle, nuzzle]</p><p><i>v.</i> position comfortably [nestle]</p><p><b>Privlačenje ili pritiska blizu nekoga ili nečega zbog ili kao da je za naklonost ili zaštitu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> drawn or pressed close to someone or something for or as if for affection or protection [nestled]</p><p><b>poljubiti se, priviti se, udobno se namjestiti (od &quot;snuggle&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> affectionate play (or foreplay without contact with the genital organs) [caressing, cuddling, fondling, hugging, kissing, necking, petting, smooching]</p><p><b>sigurno, udobno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> fitting closely</p><p><i>adv.</i> safely protected</p><p><i>adv.</i> warmly and comfortably sheltered</p><p><b>dobro zaklonjen, podesan, pristojan, topao, udoban, udobno, udobno sjesti, ugodan (od &quot;snug&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of warm snug comfort [cosiness, coziness]</p><p><b>da, dakle, koliko, na taj način, ovako, pa, stoga, tako, toliko, ukoliko, zaista, zato, zbog toga, doista</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the syllable naming the fifth (dominant) note of any musical scale in solmization [soh, sol]</p><p><i>adv.</i> to a very great extent or degree</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a manner that facilitates</p><p><i>adv.</i> in such a condition or manner, especially as expressed or implied</p><p><i>adv.</i> to a certain unspecified extent or degree</p><p><i>adv.</i> in the same way</p><p><i>adv.</i> in the way indicated [thus, thusly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> (usually followed by `that') to an extent or degree as expressed</p><p><i>adv.</i> subsequently or soon afterward (often used as sentence connectors) [and so, then]</p><p><i>adv.</i> (used to introduce a logical conclusion) from that fact or reason or as a result [hence, thence, therefore, thus]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in truth (often tends to intensify) [indeed]</p><p><b>do sada, još</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> used in negative statement to describe a situation that has existed up to this point or up to the present time [as yet, heretofore, hitherto, thus far, til now, until now, up to now, yet]</p><p><i>adv.</i> to the degree or extent that [in so far, insofar, to that degree, to that extent]</p><p><i>adv.</i> used after a superlative [yet]</p><p><b>doviđenja, doviđenja!</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a farewell remark [adieu, adios, arrivederci, au revoir, auf wiedersehen, bye, bye-bye, cheerio, good-by, good-bye, good day, goodby, goodbye, sayonara]</p><p><b>Kao da je stvarno tako., U načinu govora. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> as if it were really so [as it were]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a manner of speaking [as we say]</p><p><b>izvjesni, neki, taj i taj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is deemed to be despicable or contemptible [bum, crumb, dirty dog, git, lowlife, puke, rat, rotter, scum bag, skunk, stinker, stinkpot]</p><p><b>takozvani, tzv.</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> doubtful or suspect [alleged, supposed]</p><p><b>Ne biva ni dobra ni loša., na prihvatljiv (ali ne izvanredan) način (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being neither good nor bad [indifferent]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an acceptable (but not outstanding) manner [acceptably, tolerably]</p><p><b>apsorpcija, kvašenje, nakvasiti, namakanje, natapanje, potopiti, promočiti, prožimanje, upijanje, namakati, namočiti, potapati, zalagati, založiti, opiti, cugati, nacugati se, napijati se,