sum, Solanum nigrum guineese, garden huckleberry, sunberry, wonderberry]</p><p><b>u obliku žutih plodova, s žutim cvjetovima i žutim plodovima sličnim bojama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coarse prickly weed having pale yellow flowers and yellow berrylike fruit [ball nettle, ball nightshade, bull nettle, horse nettle]</p><p><b>Južnoamerička krumpirnica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> South American potato vine [Uruguay potato, Uruguay potato vine]</p><p><b>čvrsta škrgača iz Čilea koja se uzgaja kao ukras zbog svojih mirisnih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hardy climbing shrub of Chile grown as an ornamental for its fragrant flowers [potato tree]</p><p><b>otrovna višegodišnja vinograda Starog svijeta s ljubičastim cvijećem i ovalnim koralno crvenim bojama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> poisonous perennial Old World vine having violet flowers and oval coral-red berries [bittersweet, bittersweet nightshade, climbing nightshade, deadly nightshade, poisonous nightshade, woody nightshade]</p><p><b>Noćni šum s srebrnim lišćem i ljubičastim ili plavim ili bijelim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> weedy nightshade with silvery foliage and violet or blue or white flowers [prairie berry, purple nightshade, silver-leaved nettle, silver-leaved nightshade, silverleaf nightshade, trompillo, white horse nettle]</p><p><b>dvostruko drvo iz tropske Afrike i južne Azije s plavobijelom trnčanošću, s plavim ili bijelim cvjetovima i svijetlo crvenim bojama nalik bojama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> woolly-stemmed biennial arborescent shrub of tropical Africa and southern Asia having silvery-white prickly branches, clusters of blue or white flowers, and bright red berries resembling holly berries [African holly]</p><p><b>Vječna biljka iz jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika s malim bledo smeđim do kremasto-bojnim gomoljicama nalik krumpiru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect or spreading perennial of southwestern United States and Mexico bearing small pale brown to cream-colored tubers resembling potatoes [wild potato]</p><p><b>u obliku od šarene ili crvene trske, s lišćama i cvjetovima od plavog boje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> copiously branched vine of Brazil having deciduous leaves and white flowers tinged with blue [potato vine]</p><p><b>Južnoamerički grm ili malo drvo koje se široko uzgaja u tropima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> South American shrub or small tree widely cultivated in the tropics [Brazilian potato tree, Solanum wrightii, potato tree]</p><p><b>poboljšana vrtna sorta crne nightshade s malim jestivim narančastim ili crnim bojama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> improved garden variety of black nightshade having small edible orange or black berries [Solanum burbankii, Solanum nigrum guineese, garden huckleberry, sunberry, wonderberry]</p><p><b>patlidžan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hairy upright herb native to southeastern Asia but widely cultivated for its large glossy edible fruit commonly used as a vegetable [aubergine, brinjal, eggplant, eggplant bush, garden egg, mad apple]</p><p><b>Evroazijska biljka prirodna u Americi koja ima bijele cvijeće i otrovne dlakave lišće i nosi crne bobice koje su ponekad otrovne, ali ponekad jestive. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Eurasian herb naturalized in America having white flowers and poisonous hairy foliage and bearing black berries that are sometimes poisonous but sometimes edible [black nightshade, common nightshade, poison-berry, poisonberry]</p><p><b>poboljšana vrtna sorta crne nightshade s malim jestivim narančastim ili crnim bojama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> improved garden variety of black nightshade having small edible orange or black berries [Solanum burbankii, Solanum melanocerasum, garden huckleberry, sunberry, wonderberry]</p><p><b>mala južnoamerička grmlja uzgajana kao kućna biljka zbog svojih obilnih ukrasnih ali otrovnih crvenih ili žutih voća veličine trešnje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small South American shrub cultivated as a houseplant for its abundant ornamental but poisonous red or yellow cherry-sized fruit [Jerusalem cherry, Madeira winter cherry, winter cherry]</p><p><b>Uobičajena vrsta biljaka u regiji Južne Amerike. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small perennial shrub cultivated in uplands of South America for its edible bright orange fruits resembling tomatoes or oranges [naranjilla]</p><p><b>Sjevernoamerička noćna šuma s trnastim lišćem i žutim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American nightshade with prickly foliage and racemose yellow flowers [buffalo bur]</p><p><b>godišnji izvor iz Južne Amerike s podzemnim stolonima s jestivim škrobnim gomoljima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annual native to South America having underground stolons bearing edible starchy tubers [potato, white potato, white potato vine]</p><p><b>Vina iz Kostarike rijetko naoružana šiljakim bodljicama i s velikim lilak-plavim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vine of Costa Rica sparsely armed with hooklike spines and having large lilac-blue flowers [giant potato creeper, potato vine]</p><p><b>Južnoamerički grm ili malo drvo koje se široko uzgaja u tropima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> South American shrub or small tree widely cultivated in the tropics [Brazilian potato tree, Solanum macranthum, potato tree]</p><p><b>solarni, solarnog, sunčani, sunčev</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or derived from the sun or utilizing the energies of the sun</p><p><b>apeks</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the point on the celestial sphere toward which the sun and solar system appear to be moving relative to the fixed stars [apex, apex of the sun's way]</p><p><b>električni uređaj koji se sastoji od velikog niza povezanih solarnih ćelija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electrical device consisting of a large array of connected solar cells [solar battery, solar panel]</p><p><b>električni uređaj koji se sastoji od velikog niza povezanih solarnih ćelija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electrical device consisting of a large array of connected solar cells [solar array, solar panel]</p><p><b>kalendar zasnovan na sunčevim ciklusima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a calendar based on solar cycles</p><p><b>foto ćelija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cell that converts solar energy into electrical energy [photovoltaic cell]</p><p><b>solarni kolektor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a concave mirror that concentrates the rays of the sun [solar dish, solar furnace]</p><p><b>stopa prijema zračne sunčeve energije na vanjskom sloju zemaljske atmosfere (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the rate at which radiant solar energy is received at the outer layer of the earth's atmosphere</p><p><b>dan, solarni dan, srednji sunčani dan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> time for Earth to make a complete rotation on its axis [24-hour interval, day, mean solar day, twenty-four hour period, twenty-four hours]</p><p><b>Konkavno ogledalo koje koncentriše sunčeve zrake (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a concave mirror that concentrates the rays of the sun [solar collector, solar furnace]</p><p><b>Mjesec prekida svjetlost od sunca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the moon interrupts light from the sun</p><p><b>solarna energija, sunčana energija, sunčeva energija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> energy from the sun that is converted into thermal or electrical energy [solar power]</p><p><b>velika svjetla tačka na sunčevoj fotosferi koja se najčešće javlja u blizini sunčanih mrlja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large bright spot on the sun's photosphere occurring most frequently in the vicinity of sunspots [facula]</p><p><b>sunčana baklja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sudden eruption of intense high-energy radiation from the sun's surface [flare]</p><p><b>Konkavno ogledalo koje koncentriše sunčeve zrake (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a concave mirror that concentrates the rays of the sun [solar collector, solar dish]</p><p><b>gravitacija Sunca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the gravity of the sun</p><p><b>svjetlosni halo paralelno obzoru na visini Sunca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a luminous halo parallel to the horizon at the altitude of the sun [parhelic circle, parhelic ring]</p><p><b>grijač koji izravno koristi sunčevu energiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a heater that makes direct use of solar energy</p><p><b>kuća dizajnirana za grijanje sunčevim zračenjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a house designed to use solar radiation for heating</p><p><b>magnetno polje Sunca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the magnetic field of the sun</p><p><b>jedna dvanaesta solarne ili tropske godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one-twelfth of a solar or tropical year</p><p><b>električni uređaj koji se sastoji od velikog niza povezanih solarnih ćelija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> electrical device consisting of a large array of connected solar cells [solar array, solar battery]</p><p><b>kut podignut srednjim ekvatorijalnim radijusom Zemlje na udaljenosti od jedne astronomske jedinice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the angle subtended by the mean equatorial radius of the Earth at a distance of one astronomical unit</p><p><b>grana astronomije koja se bavi suncem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of astronomy that deals with the sun</p><p><b>veliki pleksus simpatičnih živaca u trbuhu iza želuca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large plexus of sympathetic nerves in the abdomen behind the stomach [abdominal nerve plexus, coeliac plexus, plexus celiacus]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> energy from the sun that is converted into thermal or electrical energy [solar energy]</p><p><b>prominencija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large eruptions of luminous hydrogen gas that rise thousands of kilometers above the chromosphere</p><p><b>sunčevo zračenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> radiation from the sun</p><p><b>Solarni sistem, Solarni sustav, Sunčev sistem, Sunčev sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sun with the celestial bodies that revolve around it in its gravitational field</p><p><b>teleskop namijenjen promatranju Sunca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a telescope designed to make observations of the sun</p><p><b>sustav koji pretvara sunčevu svjetlost u toplinu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system that converts sunlight into heat</p><p><b>terasa ili vrt usmjeren na iskoristiti sunce dok je