ion</p><p><i>adj.</i> in excellent physical condition [good]</p><p><i>adj.</i> logically valid [reasoned, well-grounded]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having legal efficacy or force [effectual, legal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> vigorous or severe</p><p><i>adj.</i> free from moral defect</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of sleep) deep and complete [heavy, profound, wakeless]</p><p><i>adj.</i> complete</p><p><b>alfabet znakova namijenjen predstavljanju određenih glasova govora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an alphabet of characters intended to represent specific sounds of speech [phonetic alphabet]</p><p><b>duboko spavanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> sleeping deeply [fast asleep]</p><p><b>zvučna barijera</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the increase in aerodynamic drag as an airplane approaches the speed of sound [sonic barrier]</p><p><b>Vrlo kratak govor. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a very short speech</p><p><b>kontakt (dijel zvona) protiv kojeg udara klaper (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> contact (the part of a bell) against which the clapper strikes</p><p><b>filmska kamera koja snima zvukove u sinhroniziranju s vizuelnim slikama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a movie camera that records sounds in synchrony with the visual images</p><p><b>zvučni učinak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an effect that imitates a sound called for in the script of a play</p><p><b>zvučni film</b></p><p><i>n.</i> motion-picture film with sound effects and dialogue recorded on it</p><p><b>otvor u zvučnoj ploči (kao kod violine) dizajniran za rezonancu s tonovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hole in a soundboard (as of a violin) designed to resonate with the tones</p><p><b>bistrost, moć prosuđivanja, moć rasuđivanja, oštroumnost, promišljenost, pronicljivost, razboritost, razložitost, razložnost, razumnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capacity to assess situations or circumstances shrewdly and to draw sound conclusions [judgement, judgment, perspicacity, sound judgment]</p><p><b>bistrost, moć prosuđivanja, moć rasuđivanja, oštroumnost, promišljenost, pronicljivost, razboritost, razložitost, razložnost, razumnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capacity to assess situations or circumstances shrewdly and to draw sound conclusions [judgement, judgment, perspicacity, sound judgement]</p><p><b>zakon koji opisuje promjene zvuka u povijesti jezika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a law describing sound changes in the history of a language</p><p><b>Izjasnite se, Javite se, buniti se, cendrati, cmizdriti, jadati se, jadikovati, prigovarati, tužiti se, čangrizati, žaliti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> express one's opinion openly and without fear or hesitation [animadvert, opine, speak out, speak up]</p><p><i>v.</i> start playing [strike up]</p><p><i>v.</i> express complaints, discontent, displeasure, or unhappiness [complain, kick, kvetch, plain, quetch]</p><p><b>artikulirati, govoriti, izgovarati, izgovoriti, ispipati, ispipavati, ispitati, ispitivati, kužiti, njušiti, onjušiti, pronjušiti, skužiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> speak, pronounce, or utter in a certain way [articulate, enounce, enunciate, pronounce, say]</p><p><i>v.</i> try to learn someone's opinions and intentions [check out, feel out]</p><p><b>percepcija zvuka kao značajnog fenomena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the perception of sound as a meaningful phenomenon [auditory perception]</p><p><b>buka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> annoying and potentially harmful environmental noise [noise pollution]</p><p><b>zvučni tlak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the difference between the instantaneous pressure at a point in a sound field and the average pressure at that point [instantaneous sound pressure]</p><p><b>fizički intenzitet zvuka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the physical intensity of sound [acoustic power]</p><p><b>akustični fenomen koji daje zvucu prodiruću kvalitetu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the acoustic phenomenon that gives sound a penetrating quality [acoustic projection, projection]</p><p><b>svojstvo zvuka, zvučno svojstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an attribute of sound</p><p><b>S druge strane, radi se o mjerenju vremena dolaska zvuka do mikrofona na poznatim položajima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> locating a source of sound (as an enemy gun) by measurements of the time the sound arrives at microphones in known positions</p><p><b>audio snimka, zvučna snimka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a recording of acoustic signals [audio, audio recording]</p><p><b>eho, jeka, odjek</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the repetition of a sound resulting from reflection of the sound waves [echo, replication, reverberation]</p><p><b>reprodukcija zvuka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the reproduction of sound</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a spectrograph for acoustic spectra</p><p><b>zvučni spektar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the distribution of energy as a function of frequency for a particular sound source [acoustic spectrum]</p><p><b>dopušten redoslijed zvukova u riječima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the admissible arrangement of sounds in words [morphology, syllable structure, word structure]</p><p><b>audiosistem, audiosustav, zvučni sistem, zvučni sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system of electronic equipment for recording or reproducing sound [audio system]</p><p><b>kamion opremljen zvučnikom i korišten za oglašavanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a truck equipped with a loudspeaker and used for advertising</p><p><b>Svaka akustična mjerna jedinica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any acoustic unit of measurement</p><p><b>zvučni val</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (acoustics) a wave that transmits sound [acoustic wave]</p><p><b>(od dubine) može se sondirati ili mjeriti za dubinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of depth) capable of being sounded or measured for depth [fathomable, plumbable]</p><p><b>(glazba) rezonator koji se sastoji od tanke ploče čije vibracije pojačavaju zvuk instrumenta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (music) resonator consisting of a thin board whose vibrations reinforce the sound of the instrument [sounding board]</p><p><b>rezonancijska komora u glazbenom instrumentu (kao tijelo violine) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a resona