oordinata kao i u lijevom sustavu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) parity is conserved in a universe in which the laws of physics are the same in a right-handed system of coordinates as in a left-handed system [conservation of parity, mirror symmetry, parity]</p><p><b>prostorvrijeme</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the four-dimensional coordinate system (3 dimensions of space and 1 of time) in which physical events are located [space-time continuum]</p><p><b>prostorvrijeme</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the four-dimensional coordinate system (3 dimensions of space and 1 of time) in which physical events are located [space-time]</p><p><b>svemirski brod</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a craft capable of traveling in outer space [ballistic capsule, space vehicle]</p><p><b>vrijeme koje se daje satom koji se nosi na letjelici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the clock time given by a clock carried on board a spacecraft [SCLK]</p><p><b>koordinirano univerzalno vrijeme na brodu svemirske letjelice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the coordinated universal time on board the spacecraft [SCET]</p><p><b>prorijeđen, raspoređen, razmaknut, razmješten</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> spaced apart [separated]</p><p><i>adj.</i> arranged with spaces between</p><p><b>Opušteno (ili kao da je) nekim narkotičnim drogom, zbunjen ili dezorijentiran kao da je opijen uzimanjem droge (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> stupefied by (or as if by) some narcotic drug [spacey, spacy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> confused or disoriented as if intoxicated through taking a drug</p><p><b>putovanje izvan Zemljine atmosfere (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a voyage outside the Earth's atmosphere [space travel, spaceflight]</p><p><b>putovanje izvan Zemljine atmosfere (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a voyage outside the Earth's atmosphere [space travel, spacefaring]</p><p><b>čovjek iz svemira, astronaut</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person trained to travel in a spacecraft [astronaut, cosmonaut]</p><p><b>svemirski brod, zvjezdani brod</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a spacecraft designed to carry a crew into interstellar space (especially in science fiction) [starship]</p><p><b>tlakno odijelo koje astronauti nose dok su u svemiru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pressure suit worn by astronauts while in outer space</p><p><b>kretanje u svemiru izvan svemirske letjelice (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> move in space outside a space craft</p><p><b>astronaut koji je aktivan izvan svemirske letjelice u svemiru. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an astronaut who is active outside a spacecraft in outer space</p><p><b>prema svemiru. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> towards outer space [spacewards]</p><p><b>prema svemiru. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> towards outer space [spaceward]</p><p><b>Opušteno (ili kao da je) nekim narkotičnim drogom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> stupefied by (or as if by) some narcotic drug [spaced-out, spacy]</p><p><b>prostoran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to or involving or having the nature of space [spatial]</p><p><b>podjela, prored, raspon, raspored, raspoređivanje, rastojanje, razmak, razmještanje, razmještanje u prostoru, prostiranje, prostorni raspored, protezanje, razmještaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time between occurrences of a repeating event</p><p><i>n.</i> the property possessed by an array of things that have space between them [spatial arrangement]</p><p><b>Postoje u prostoru i vremenu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> existing in both space and time [spatiotemporal]</p><p><b>obiman, obuhvatan, opsežan, pristran, prostran, prostranim, prostranu, širok</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> very large in expanse or scope [broad, wide]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of buildings and rooms) having ample space [roomy]</p><p><b>obiman, obuhvatan, opsežan, pristran, prostran, prostranim, prostranu, širok (od &quot;spacious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with ample room [roomily]</p><p><b>opsežnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spatial largeness and extensiveness (especially inside a building) [capaciousness, commodiousness, roominess]</p><p><b>prah (koji sadrži gips i ljepilo) koji se u kombinaciji s vodom formira kao plastična pasta koja se koristi za popunjavanje pukotina i rupa u gipsu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> powder (containing gypsum plaster and glue) that when mixed with water forms a plastic paste used to fill cracks and holes in plaster [spackling compound]</p><p><b>prah (koji sadrži gips i ljepilo) koji se u kombinaciji s vodom formira kao plastična pasta koja se koristi za popunjavanje pukotina i rupa u gipsu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> powder (containing gypsum plaster and glue) that when mixed with water forms a plastic paste used to fill cracks and holes in plaster [spackle]</p><p><b>Opušteno (ili kao da je) nekim narkotičnim drogom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> stupefied by (or as if by) some narcotic drug [spaced-out, spacey]</p><p><b>ašov, lopata</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a playing card in the major suit that has one or more black figures on it</p><p><i>n.</i> a sturdy hand shovel that can be pushed into the earth with the foot</p><p><i>v.</i> dig (up) with a spade</p><p><b>tanak malo sa središnjom točkom i rezanjem rubova na obje strane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thin bit with a center point and cutting edges on either side</p><p><b>oblik kazina u kojem su pikove vrijedne jedan bod. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of casino in which spades have the value of one point</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> shaped in the form of a spade [spade-shaped]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> shaped in the form of a spade [spade-like]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste ribolovnih proizvoda koji se proizvode u području Unije, za koje se primjenjuje ovaj članak, za ribolovne proizvode koji se proizvode u području Unije, za koje se primjenjuje sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deep-bodied disk-shaped food fish of warmer western Atlantic coastal waters [Chaetodipterus faber, angelfish]</p><p><b>žaba koja koplje na sjevernoj hemisferi s rogovitom projekcijom nalik lopati na svakoj stražnjoj nozi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a burrowing toad of the northern hemisphere with a horny spade-like projection on each hind foot [spadefoot toad]</p><p><b>žaba koja koplje na sjevernoj hemisferi s rogovitom projekcijom nalik lopati na svakoj stražnjoj nozi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a burrowing toad of the northern hemisphere with a horny spade-like projection on each hind foot [spadefoot]</p><p><b>količinu koju lopata može zadržati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quantity a shovel can hold [shovel, shovelful]</p><p><b>- za vrijeme rada na zadatku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dull or routine preliminary work preparing for an undertaking</p><p><b>Mesna os špica često okružena špatom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the fleshy axis of a spike often surrounded by a spathe</p><p><b>bužir, izolacijska cijev, špageti, špaget</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spaghetti served with a tomato sauce</p><p><i>n.</i> pasta in the form of long strings</p><p><b>Špageti sa mesnim kuglicama u paradižnom umaku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spaghetti with meatballs in a tomato sauce</p><p><b>komplicirano autocesto sa više višaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a complicated highway interchange with multiple overpasses</p><p><b>od svih brojnih sosova za špagete ili druge vrste tjestenina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous sauces for spaghetti or other kinds of pasta [pasta sauce]</p><p><b>bundeva, tikvica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> squash plant bearing oval fruit with smooth yellowish skin and tender stranded flesh resembling spaghetti</p><p><i>n.</i> medium-sized oval squash with flesh in the form of strings that resemble spaghetti</p><p><b>film s niskim proračunom koji je proizvela europska filmska kuća (posebno talijanska) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a low-budget Western movie produced by a European (especially an Italian) film company</p><p><b>tanki špageti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thin spaghetti</p><p><b>Španjolska, Španjolskoj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a parliamentary monarchy in southwestern Europe on the Iberian Peninsula [Espana, Kingdom of Spain]</p><p><b>krtica krtica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mole rats [family Spalacidae]</p><p><b>vrsta rod Spalacidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Spalacidae [genus Spalax]</p><p><b>cijepanje, cijepati, lomiti se, ljuštenje, raspadanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fragment broken off from the edge or face of stone or ore and having at least one thin edge [spawl]</p><p><b>Talijanski fiziolog koji je opovrgao teoriju spontane generacije (1729-1799) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Italian physiologist who disproved the theory of spontaneous generation (1729-1799) [Lazzaro Spallanzani]</p><p><b>raspad atomske jezgre, rasprskavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) a nuclear reaction in which a bombarded nucleus breaks up into many particles</p><p><b>neželjena pošta, spam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a canned meat made largely from pork</p><p><i>n.</i> unwanted e-mail (usually of a commercial nature sent out in bulk) [junk e-mail]</p><p><i>v.</i> send unwanted or junk e-mail</p><p><b>netko tko šalje neželjenu e-poštu (često u masi) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who sends unwanted email (often in bulk)</p><p><b>časak, ispružiti, izmjeriti, izračunati, kratak interval, kratak razmak, luk, luka, mjeriti, mjerni raspon, mjerno područje, obuhvatiti, omotač, opseg, ovojnica, pedalj, prebaciti, premostiti, raspon, raspona, razmak, spojiti, svod, širina, trenutak, vezivati, zagrliti, par, most, protezati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the complete duration of something</p><p><i>n.</i> the distance or interval between two points</p><p><i>n.</i> two items of the same kind [brace, couple, couplet, distich, duad, duet, duo, dyad, pair, twain, twosome, yoke]</p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of length based on the width of the expanded human hand (usually taken as 9 inches)</p><p><i>n.</i> a structure that allows people or vehicles to cross an obstacle such as a river or canal or railway etc. [bridge]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of sitting or standing astride [straddle]</p><p><i>v.</i> to cover or extend over an area or time period [cross, sweep, traverse]</p><p><b>odnos težine zrakoplova prema rasponu krila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ratio of the weight of an airplane to its wingspan</p><p><b>njemački mitraljez. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a German machine gun</p><p><b>od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od plastičnih vlakana ili od (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an elastic synthetic fabric</p><p><b>trouglast zid među lukovima ili iza olučja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an approximately triangular surface area between two adjacent arches and the horizontal plane above them [spandril]</p><p><b>s površinom od oko 10 mm ili više, ali ne više od 10 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an approximately triangular surface area between two adjacent arches and the horizontal plane above them [spandrel]</p><p><b>Skok, drkadžija, bang. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> leap, jerk, bang [bang]</p><p><b>blistava kapljica, blistavilo, krasiti, sjaj, šljokica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> adornment consisting of a small piece of shiny material used to decorate clothing [diamante, sequin]</p><p><i>v.</i> glitter as if covered with spangles</p><p><i>v.</i> decorate with spangles [bespangle]</p><p><b>s masom od 300 g/m2 ili većom od 300 g/m2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> covered with beads or jewels or sequins [beady, gemmed, jeweled, jewelled, sequined, spangly]</p><p><b>s masom od 300 g/m2 ili većom od 300 g/m2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> covered with beads or jewels or sequins [beady, gemmed, jeweled, jewelled, sequined, spangled]</p><p><b>Španjolac, Španjolka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or inhabitant of Spain</p><p><b>španijel</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several breeds of small to medium-sized gun dogs with a long silky coat and long frilled ears</p><p><b>španjolci, španjolski, španjolski jezik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the Romance language spoken in most of Spain and the countries colonized by Spain</p><p><i>n.</i> the people of Spain [Spanish people]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of Spain or the people of Spain</p><p><b>Amerikanci čiji je prvi jezik španjolski. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an American whose first language is Spanish [Hispanic, Hispanic American]</p><p><b>Velika flota poslata iz Španjolske protiv Engleske od strane Filipa II 1588. godine. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the great fleet sent from Spain against England by Philip II in 1588 [Invincible Armada]</p><p><b>visoka juka iz jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i Meksika s drvenastom stabljikom i čvrstima šiljatim lištima nalik maču i velikim gromom bijelih cvijeća, tvrda juka s kratkim deblom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall yucca of the southwestern United States and Mexico having a woody stem and stiff swordlike pointed leaves and a large cluster of white flowers [Yucca baccata]</p><p><i>n.</i> a stiff yucca with a short trunk [Yucca aloifolia]</p><p><b>Visoka grmlja bez trnja s blijedožutim cvijećem i fleksibilnim granama poput grmlja koje se koriste u košarici, Uro u obliku grmlja s zlatnim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall thornless shrub having pale yellow flowers and flexible rushlike twigs used in basketry [Spartium junceum, weaver's broom]</p><p><i>n.</i> erect shrub of southwestern Europe having racemes of golden yellow flowers [Genista hispanica, Spanish gorse]</p><p><b>Španjolska verzija burgoo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Spanish version of burgoo [olla podrida]</p><p><b>Glavni grad i najveći grad u središtu Španjolske (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital and largest city situated centrally in Spain [Madrid, capital of Spain]</p><p><b>tropsko američko drvo koje daje mirisnu drvo koje se koristi posebno za kutije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American tree yielding fragrant wood used especially for boxes [Cedrela odorata, Spanish cedar tree]</p><p><b>tropsko američko drvo koje daje mirisnu drvo koje se koristi posebno za kutije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American tree yielding fragrant wood used especially for boxes [Cedrela odorata, Spanish cedar]</p><p><b>pitomi kesten</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wild or cultivated throughout southern Europe, northwestern Africa and southwestern Asia [Castanea sativa, European chestnut, sweet chestnut]</p><p><b>Građanski rat u Španjolskoj u kojem je Franku uspjelo svrgnuti republikansku vladu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> civil war in Spain in which Franco succeeded in overthrowing the republican government</p><p><b>Yucca iz jugoistočnih Sjedinjenih Država slična španjolskim bajonetima, ali s kraćim deblom i glatkim lištima, drvena juka iz jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i sjevernog Meksika s lišćama u obliku mača i bijelim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> yucca of southeastern United States similar to the Spanish bayonets but with shorter trunk and smoother leaves [Yucca gloriosa]</p><p><i>n.</i> arborescent yucca of southwestern United States and northern Mexico with sword-shaped leaves and white flowers [Yucca carnerosana]</p><p><b>tropsko američko drvo, veliki tropski američki drvo roda Cordia uzgajeno zbog svojih obilnih kremasto-bijelog cvijeća i vrijednog drveta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American timber tree [Cordia gerascanthus, princewood]</p><p><i>n.</i> large tropical American tree of the genus Cordia grown for its abundant creamy white flowers and valuable wood [Cordia alliodora, Equador laurel, cypre, princewood, salmwood]</p><p><b>babak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> green beetle of southern Europe</p><p><b>Europski purek uzgojen i korišten kao purek (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European leek cultivated and used like leeks [Allium scorodoprasum, giant garlic, rocambole, sand leek]</p><p><b>Uro u obliku grmlja s zlatnim cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect shrub of southwestern Europe having racemes of golden yellow flowers [Genista hispanica, Spanish broom]</p><p><b>Nekakav hrup. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a kind of grunt [Haemulon macrostomum]</p><p><b>država u zapadno-srednjoj Africi (uključujući otoke u Gvinejskom zaljevu) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a country of west central Africa (including islands in the Gulf of Guinea) [Equatorial Guinea, Republic of Equatorial Guinea]</p><p><b>Brojni i uglavnom čvrsti grm, porijeklom iz zapadnog Iberskog poluotoka, s velikim brojem bijelih ili ružičastih cvijeća. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect dense shrub native to western Iberian peninsula having profuse white or pink flowers [Erica lusitanica, Portuguese heath]</p><p><b>inkvizicija koju su 1478. pokrenuli kralj Ferdinand i kraljica Izabela koja je čuvala ortodoksnost katolicizma u Španjolskoj (posebno od 15. do 17. stoljeća) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inquisition initiated in 1478 by King Ferdinand and Queen Isabella that guarded the orthodoxy of Catholicism in Spain (especially from the 15th to the 17th centuries)</p><p><b>žaruljasto-violeta (Bolbous iris) iz zapadnog Sredozemlja s obično ljubičastom-fioleta cvjetom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bulbous iris of western Mediterranean region having usually violet-purple flowers [Iris xiphium, xiphium iris]</p><p><b>tropsko američko stablo s malim jestivim plodom s zelenom kožnom kožom i slatkom sočnom prozirnom pulpom, okrugli, dublji karipski plod s zelenom kožnom kožom i slatkom sokovitoj prozirnoj pulpi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American tree bearing a small edible fruit with green leathery skin and sweet juicy translucent pulp [Melicocca bijuga, Melicocca bijugatus, Spanish lime tree, genip, ginep, honey berry, mamoncillo]</p><p><i>n.</i> round one-inch Caribbean fruit with green leathery s