hes of Europe, Africa, America, and South Atlantic islands [genus Spartina]</p><p><b>Visoka trska poput trske uobičajena u solnim livama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall reedlike grass common in salt meadows [salt reed grass]</p><p><b>Sjevernoamerička konopljana s lištima sa suvim membranskim rubovima i s dužnim krovom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American cordgrass having leaves with dry membranous margins and glumes with long awns [freshwater cordgrass, prairie cordgrass, slough grass]</p><p><b>jedna vrsta: španjolska metla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one species: Spanish broom [genus Spartium]</p><p><b>Visoka grmlja bez trnja s blijedožutim cvijećem i fleksibilnim granama poput grmlja koje se koriste u košarici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall thornless shrub having pale yellow flowers and flexible rushlike twigs used in basketry [Spanish broom, weaver's broom]</p><p><b>grč, napad gnjeva, spazam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a painful and involuntary muscular contraction [cramp, muscle spasm]</p><p><i>n.</i> (pathology) sudden constriction of a hollow organ (as a blood vessel)</p><p><b>grčevit, na mahove</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> affected by involuntary jerky muscular contractions [convulsive, spastic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring in spells and often abruptly [fitful]</p><p><b>bolest dojenčadi i male djece (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disease of infants and young children [croup]</p><p><b>s grčevima, u naglim i naprijednim napadima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with spasms [jerkily]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in spurts and fits</p><p><b>opuštanje ili ublažavanje mišićnih grčeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the relaxation or relief of muscle spasms</p><p><b>lijek koji se koristi za ublažavanje ili sprečavanje grčeva (posebno glatkih mišića) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug used to relieve or prevent spasms (especially of the smooth muscles) [antispasmodic, antispasmodic agent]</p><p><b>Ruski šahovski majstor koji se preselio u Pariz. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian chess master who moved to Paris [Boris Spassky, Boris Vasilevich Spassky]</p><p><b>izazvan mozgovnom kljenuti, spastički</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person suffering from spastic paralysis</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or characterized by spasm</p><p><i>adj.</i> suffering from spastic paralysis</p><p><i>adj.</i> affected by involuntary jerky muscular contractions [convulsive, spasmodic]</p><p><b>abasija zbog spastičnih kontrakcija mišića nogu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abasia due to spastic contractions of the leg muscles</p><p><b>bolesno stanje mokraćne mjehura uzrokovano povredom kičmene moždine ili multiple sklerozom ili traumom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a urinary bladder disorder resulting from spinal cord lesion or multiple sclerosis or trauma</p><p><b>ponavljajući se bolovi u trbuhu i proljev (često se izmjenjuju s razdobljima zatvoru) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> recurrent abdominal pain and diarrhea (often alternating with periods of constipation) [irritable bowel syndrome, mucous colitis]</p><p><b>gubitak ili nedostatak motoričke kontrole s nenamjernim grčevima uzrokovanim trajnim oštećenjem mozga prisutnim pri rođenju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a loss or deficiency of motor control with involuntary spasms caused by permanent brain damage present at birth [cerebral palsy]</p><p><b>spastičnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of moving or acting in spasms</p><p><b>ćuška, gamaše, istući, pljuska, posvađati se, razmirica, čarka, aplaudirati, pljeskati, pljesnuti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a quarrel about petty points [bicker, bickering, fuss, pettifoggery, squabble, tiff]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cloth covering (a legging) that covers the instep and ankles [gaiter]</p><p><i>n.</i> a young oyster or other bivalve</p><p><i>v.</i> come down like raindrops</p><p><i>v.</i> become permanently attached</p><p><i>v.</i> strike with a sound like that of falling rain</p><p><i>v.</i> clap one's hands or shout after performances to indicate approval [acclaim, applaud, clap]</p><p><i>v.</i> engage in a brief and petty quarrel</p><p><i>v.</i> spawn</p><p><i>v.</i> clap one's hands together [clap]</p><p><b>Urezanje i izlaganje za upotrebu u proizvodnji hrane za životinje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heart-shaped sea urchins [order Spatangoida]</p><p><b>meso piletine (ili divlje ptice) razdvojeno na leđima i roštilj (obično odmah nakon što je ubijeno), pripremite se za jelo ako ili kao da je spatchcock, ustaviti ili uključiti (riječi) u rečenicu ili priču (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> flesh of a chicken (or game bird) split down the back and grilled (usually immediately after being killed)</p><p><i>v.</i> prepare for eating if or as if a spatchcock</p><p><i>v.</i> interpolate or insert (words) into a sentence or story</p><p><b>bujica, iznenadna poplava, nagli pljusak, gomila, hrpa, hrpetina, masa, mnoštvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (often followed by `of') a large number or amount or extent [batch, deal, flock, good deal, great deal, hatful, heap, lot, mass, mess, mickle, mint, mountain, muckle, passel, peck, pile, plenty, pot, quite a little, raft, sight, slew, stack, tidy sum, wad]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sudden forceful flow [rush, surge, upsurge]</p><p><i>n.</i> the occurrence of a water flow resulting from sudden rain or melting snow [freshet]</p><p><b>uobičajena bracta koja okružuje ili podupire spadix ili drugi cvjetović (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a conspicuous bract surrounding or subtending a spadix or other inflorescence</p><p><b>bilo koja biljka iz roda Spathiphyllum s bijelim ili zelenim špatom i čipom mirisnih cvijeća i često uzgajana kao ukrasna biljka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various plants of the genus Spathiphyllum having a white or green spathe and a spike of fragrant flowers and often cultivated as an ornamental [peace lily, spathiphyllum]</p><p><b>bilo koja biljka iz roda Spathiphyllum s bijelim ili zelenim špatom i čipom mirisnih cvijeća i često uzgajana kao ukrasna biljka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various plants of the genus Spathiphyllum having a white or green spathe and a spike of fragrant flowers and often cultivated as an ornamental [peace lily, spathe flower]</p><p><b>prostorni, prostornim, prostran, prostoran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to or involving or having the nature of space [spacial]</p><p><b>prostiranje, prostorni raspored, protezanje, razmještaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property possessed by an array of things that have space between them [spacing]</p><p><b>prostorno svojstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any property relating to or occupying space [spatiality]</p><p><b>položaj, pozicija, prostorni odnos, smještaj, smještaj u prostoru</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the spatial property of a place where or way in which something is situated [position]</p><p><b>prostornost, prostorno svojstvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any property relating to or occupying space [spatial property]</p><p><b>prostoran</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with regard to space</p><p><b>od ili povezane s prostorom i vremenom zajedno (imajući i prostorno proširenje i vremensko trajanje), Postoje u prostoru i vremenu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to space and time together (having both spatial extension and temporal duration)</p><p><i>adj.</i> existing in both space and time [spaciotemporal]</p><p><b>prskanje, sitne kapljice, štrcanje, vodena prašina, pljuskati, pljusnuti, pokapati, polijevati, politi, poprskati, poprskavati, pošpricati, poštrcati, prskati, zalijevati, zaliti, zapljusnuti, špricati, štrcati, dobovati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the noise of something spattering or sputtering explosively [spattering, splatter, splattering, splutter, sputter, sputtering]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of splashing a (liquid) substance on a surface [spattering, splash, splashing, splattering]</p><p><i>v.</i> dash a liquid upon or against [plash, splash, splatter, splosh, swash]</p><p><i>v.</i> rain gently [patter, pitter-patter, spit, sprinkle]</p><p><i>v.</i> spot, splash, or soil [bespatter]</p><p><b>Česta vodena lilija iz istočne i središnje Sjeverne Amerike, s širokim listovima i žutim cvjetovima u obliku kugle (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common water lily of eastern and central North America, having broad leaves and globe-shaped yellow flowers [Nuphar advena, cow lily, yellow pond lily]</p><p><b>prskanje, sitne kapljice, štrcanje, vodena prašina (od &quot;spatter&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> covered with bright patches (often used in combination) [dabbled, splashed, splattered]</p><p><b>prskanje, sitne kapljice, štrcanje, vodena prašina (od &quot;spatter&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the noise of something spattering or sputtering explosively [spatter, splatter, splattering, splutter, sputter, sputtering]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of splashing a (liquid) substance on a surface [spatter, splash, splashing, splattering]</p><p><b>lopatica, špatula</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a turner with a narrow flexible blade</p><p><i>n.</i> a hand tool with a thin flexible blade used to mix or spread soft substances</p><p><b>(oblik lišća) širokog okruglog vrha i uskog temelja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a leaf shape) having a broad rounded apex and a narrow base [spatulate]</p><p><b>(oblik lišća) širokog okruglog vrha i uskog temelja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a leaf shape) having a broad rounded apex and a narrow base [spatula-shaped]</p><p><b>listovi u obliku špačice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spatula-shaped leaf</p><p><b>oteklina konjskog zgloba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a swelling of the hock joint of a horse</p><p><b>I od konja koji ima oteklinu na čvorovima, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of horses) afflicted with a swelling of the hock-joint</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenjem od oko 20 mm ili više, ali ne više od 30 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fragment broken off from the edge or face of stone or ore and having at least one thin edge [spall]</p><p><b>bacati ikru, ikra, izleći, izrod, mrijestiti se, okot, okotiti, razmnožavati se, žgadija, potomak, izazivati, izazvati, iznjedriti, izroditi, prouzrokovati, prouzročiti, roditi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the mass of eggs deposited by fish or amphibians or molluscs</p><p><i>v.</i> call forth [breed, engender]</p><p><i>v.</i> lay spawn</p><p><b>bacati ikru, ikra, izleći, izrod, mrijestiti se, okot, okotiti, razmnožavati se, žgadija, potomak (od &quot;spawn&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a female fish at spawning time</p><p><b>jaloviti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove the ovaries of [alter, castrate, neuter]</p><p><b>jaloviti (od &quot;spay&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a female animal) having the ovaries removed</p><p><b>jaloviti (od &quot;spay&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> neutering a female by removing the ovaries</p><p><b>držati govor, govor, govoriti, istupiti, izraziti, razgovarati, značiti, znati, govori, ispričati, izgovarati, izgovoriti, izreći, izricati, kazati, kazivati, pričati, prozboriti, reći, verbalizirati, zboriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> express in speech [mouth, talk, utter, verbalise, verbalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> exchange thoughts [talk]</p><p><i>v.</i> use language [talk]</p><p><i>v.</i> give a speech to [address]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a characteristic or natural sound</p><p><b>biti glasnogovornik za (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be a spokesperson for</p><p><b>Govori nespoznatljivo u ili kao da je u religijskom ekstazu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> speak unintelligibly in or as if in religious ecstasy</p><p><b>spomenuti nekoga ime koji samo onda pojavljuje (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> mention someone's name who just then appears</p><p><b>otvoreno izražavati svoje mišljenje bez straha i oklijevanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> express one's opinion openly and without fear or hesitation [animadvert, opine, sound off, speak up]</p><p><b>govoriti glasnije</b></p><p><i>v.</i> express one's opinion openly and without fear or hesitation [animadvert, opine, sound off, speak out]</p><p><i>v.</i> speak louder</p><p><b>Sposobnost izražavanja u riječima ili rečenicama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being uttered in words or sentences [utterable]</p><p><b>(tokom zabrane) ilegalni barroom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (during prohibitio