osti na koplje, osti, strelica, vlat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long pointed rod used as a tool or weapon [lance, shaft]</p><p><i>n.</i> an implement with a shaft and barbed point used for catching fish [fishgig, fizgig, gig, lance]</p><p><i>v.</i> pierce with a spear</p><p><i>v.</i> thrust up like a spear [spear up]</p><p><b>sporedni glumac u publičnim scenama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a minor actor in crowd scenes [extra, supernumerary]</p><p><b>Europski bodljik s prilično velikim glavama i trnastima lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European thistle with rather large heads and prickly leaves [Cirsium lanceolatum, Cirsium vulgare, boar thistle, bull thistle]</p><p><b>uređaj sličan prslugi koji se u raznim primitivnim društvima koristio za pogon strelice ili koplja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device resembling a sling that is used in various primitive societies to propel a dart or spear [dart thrower, throwing board, throwing stick]</p><p><b>uzdignut kao koplje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> thrust up like a spear [spear]</p><p><b>glava i oštar vrh koplja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the head and sharpened point of a spear [spearhead, spearpoint]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to moguće, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, u skladu s člankom 6. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, u skladu s člankom 6. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, u skladu s člankom 6. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, u skladu s člankom 6. točkom (b) ovog Pravilnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several large vigorous pelagic fishes resembling sailfishes but with first dorsal fin much reduced</p><p><b>isturena borbena linija, oštrica, šiljak koplja, udarna snaga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who leads or initiates an activity (attack or campaign etc.)</p><p><i>n.</i> the leading military unit in an attack</p><p><i>n.</i> the head and sharpened point of a spear [spear-point, spearpoint]</p><p