e achieved by normal techniques (especially on film)</p><p><b>divizija američke vojske koja je posebno obučena za gerilske borbe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a division of the United States Army that is specially trained for guerilla fighting [U. S. Army Special Forces, United States Army Special Forces]</p><p><b>posebni interes</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an interest group that tries to influence legislators or bureaucrats to act in their favor, typically through lobbying [advocacy group, lobby, lobby group, pressure group, special-interest group, special interest group, third house]</p><p><b>skupina koja se bavi određenim problemom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an interest group that tries to influence legislators or bureaucrats to act in their favor, typically through lobbying [advocacy group, lobby, lobby group, pressure group, special-interest group, special interest, third house]</p><p><b>Žiri čiji su članovi odabrani za posebno znanje za slučaj koji uključuje složena pitanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a jury whose members are selected for special knowledge for a case involving complicated issues [blue ribbon jury]</p><p><b>Ulice imena za ketamin (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> street names for ketamine [K, cat valium, green, honey oil, jet, super C, super acid]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "specifična atletska natjecanja" znači natjecanja koja se održavaju na temelju Olimpijskih igara, ali su namijenjena osobama s mentalnim ili fizičkim invaliditetom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an athletic contest modeled after the Olympic Games but intended for mentally or physically handicapped persons</p><p><b>argument koji ignorira sve nepovoljne dokaze, (pravni) radni zapis koji se temelji na novim činjenicama kako bi se izbjegle suprotne tvrdnje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an argument that ignores all unfavorable evidence</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) a pleading that alleges new facts in avoidance of the opposing allegations</p><p><b>fizička teorija relativnosti zasnovana na 