n trained to deal with violent and dangerous situations [SWAT squad, SWAT team, Special Weapons and Tactics team]</p><p><b>Odjel policajaca koji su obučeni za suočavanje s nasilnim i opasnim situacijama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a squad of policemen who have been trained to deal with violent and dangerous situations [SWAT squad, SWAT team, Special Weapons and Tactics squad]</p><p><b>skupina koja se bavi određenim problemom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an interest group that tries to influence legislators or bureaucrats to act in their favor, typically through lobbying [advocacy group, lobby, lobby group, pressure group, special interest, special interest group, third house]</p><p><b>specijalizacija, diferencijacija, specijalnost, usmjerenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) the structural adaptation of some body part for a particular function [differentiation, specialization]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of specializing [specialization]</p><p><i>n.</i> the special line of work you have adopted as your career [specialism, speciality, specialization, specialty]</p><p><b>specijalizirati se, precizirati, specificirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> devote oneself to a special area of work [specialize]</p><p><i>v.</i> be specific about [particularise, particularize, specialize, specify]</p><p><i>v.</i> suit to a special purpose [specialize]</p><p><i>v.</i> become more focused on an area of activity or field of study [narrow, narrow down, specialize]</p><p><i>v.</i> evolve so as to lead to a new species or develop in a way most suited to the environment [differentiate, specialize, speciate]</p><p><b>specijaliziran, specijaliziranim</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> developed or designed for a special activity or function [specialized]</p><p><b>stručnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expert who is devoted to one occupation or branch of learning [specialist, specializer]</p><p><b>specijalizacija, specijalnost, usmjerenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the concentration of your efforts on a particular field of study or occupation</p