 work [specialise]</p><p><i>v.</i> evolve so as to lead to a new species or develop in a way most suited to the environment [differentiate, specialise, speciate]</p><p><b>specijalizirali, specijaliziran, specijalizirano, stručan, usavršen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> developed or designed for a special activity or function [specialised]</p><p><b>stručnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expert who is devoted to one occupation or branch of learning [specialiser, specialist]</p><p><b>pogotovo, posebno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a special manner [especially]</p><p><i>adv.</i> to a distinctly greater extent or degree than is common [especially, particularly, peculiarly]</p><p><b>izvanrednost, jedinstvenost, naročitost, osobitost, posebnost, razlikovnost, specifičnost, specijalnost, osobenost, svojstvenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a distinguishing trait [distinctiveness, peculiarity, speciality, specialty]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being particular and pertaining to a specific case or instance [particularity]</p><p><b>specijalitete, forte, jaka točka, jača strana, snaga, specijalnost, izvanrednost, jedinstvenost, naročitost, osobitost, posebnost, razlikovnost, specifičnost, specijalizacija, usmjerenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an asset of special worth or utility [forte, long suit, metier, speciality, strength, strong point, strong suit]</p><p><i>n.</i> a distinguishing trait [distinctiveness, peculiarity, speciality, specialness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the special line of work you have adopted as your career [specialisation, specialism, speciality, specialization]</p><p><b>trgovina koja prodaje samo jednu vrstu robe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a store that sells only one kind of merchandise</p><p><b>evoluiraju tako da dovedu do nove vrste ili se razvijaju na način koji je najprikladniji za okoliš (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> evolve so as to lead to a new species or develop in a way most suited to the environment [differentiate, specialise, specialize]</p><p><b>specijacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the evolution o