ive covering consisting of a panel to protect people from the splashing water or mud etc. [dashboard, splashboard]</p><p><b>nedostatak elegancije kao posljedica ponosnosti i nadmašenosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lack of elegance as a consequence of being pompous and puffed up with vanity [inflation, ostentation, ostentatiousness, pomposity, pompousness, pretentiousness, puffiness]</p><p><b>prskanje, raspršivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of splashing a (liquid) substance on a surface [spatter, spattering, splash, splattering]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of scattering water about haphazardly [splash]</p><p><b>karakterizira se vodom koja slučajno leti., Označen je ostentacijom, ali često bez ukusnog., prekrivena je pločama svijetle boje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by water flying about haphazardly</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by ostentation but often tasteless [flamboyant, showy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> covered with patches of bright color</p><p><b>Jednom prskalicom., drvena ploča u sredini stražnje strane ravne stolice, Izbaci zvuk metka koji se ravna na udaru., razdvojena i ravna za kuhanje, Ravnotežen pri udaru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a single splash</p><p><i>n.</i> a slat of wood in the middle of the back of a straight chair</p><p><i>v.</i> give off the sound of a bullet flattening on impact</p><p><i>v.</i> split open and flatten for cooking</p><p><i>v.</i> flatten on impact</p><p><b>mrlja od boje, prskanje, izlijevati, izliti, prolijevati, proliti, pljuskati, pljusnuti, pokapati, polijevati, politi, poprskati, poprskavati, pošpricati, poštrcati, prskati, zalijevati, zaliti, zapljusnuti, špricati, štrcati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the noise of something spattering or sputtering explosively [spatter, spattering, splattering, splutter, sputter, sputtering]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small quantity of something moist or liquid [dab, splash]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause or allow (a liquid substance) to run or flow from a container [slop, spill]</p><p><i>v.</i> dash a liquid upon or against [plash, spatter, splash, splosh, swash]</p><p><b>mrlja od boje, prskanje (od &quot;splatter&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> covered with bright patches (often used in combination) [dabbled, spattered, splashed]</p><p><b>mrlja od boje, prskanje (od &quot;splatter&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the noise of something spattering or sputtering explosively [spatter, spattering, splatter, splutter, sputter, sputtering]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of splashing a (liquid) substance on a surface [spatter, spattering, splash, splashing]</p><p><b>dislocirati, iskrenuti, izmjestiti, izvrnuti, iščašiti, uganuti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an outward bevel around a door or window that makes it seem larger</p><p><i>v.</i> spread open or apart</p><p><i>v.</i> turn outward [rotate, spread out, turn out]</p><p><i>v.</i> move out of position [dislocate, luxate, slip]</p><p><i>adj.</i> turned outward in an ungainly manner</p><p><b>stopala pogođena s pala luk, koji imaju noge koje se okreću prema van. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a foot afflicted with a fallen arch [flatfoot, pes planus]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having feet that turn outward [splayfooted]</p><p><b>koji imaju noge koje se okreću prema van. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having feet that turn outward [splayfoot]</p><p><b>duševno stanje, potišteno, slezena, splin, sumornost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large dark-red oval organ on the left side of the body between the stomach and the diaphragm [lien]</p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of resentful anger [irascibility, quick temper, short temper]</p><p><b>jelenjak, slezenica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various chiefly rock-inhabiting ferns of the genus Asplenium</p><p><b>blistav, divan, izuzetan, izvrstan, klasni, krasan, odličan, raskošan, sjajan, veličanstven, vrlo lijep, velik</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having great beauty and splendor [glorious, resplendent, splendiferous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> very good [excellent, fantabulous, first-class, ripping]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by grandeur [brilliant, glorious, magnificent]</p><p><b>izvrstan</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> extremely well [excellently, famously, magnificently]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an impressively beautiful manner [gorgeously, magnificently, resplendently]</p><p><b>Imaju veliku ljepotu i sjajnost. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having great beauty and splendor [glorious, resplendent, splendid]</p><p><b>divota, krasota, sjaj, veličanstvenost, blistavost, briljantnost, grandioznost, izuzetnost, izvanrednost, izvrsnost, raskošnost, uzvišenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a quality that outshines the usual [brilliancy, luster, lustre, splendour]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being magnificent or splendid or grand [brilliance, grandeur, grandness, magnificence, splendour]</p><p><b>blistanje, divota, krasota, rascijepiti se, raskoš, razdvojiti se, sijanje, sjaj, slikovitost, blistavost, briljantnost, grandioznost, izuzetnost, izvanrednost, izvrsnost, raskošnost, uzvišenost, veličanstvenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a quality that outshines the usual [brilliancy, luster, lustre, splendor]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being magnificent or splendid or grand [brilliance, grandeur, grandness, magnificence, splendor]</p><p><b>operacija uklanjanja slezine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> surgical removal of the spleen</p><p><b>hipohondar, mrzovoljan, razdražljiv, žučljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the spleen [lienal, splenic]</p><p><i>adj.</i> very irritable [bristly, prickly, waspish]</p><p><b>koji se tiče slezene</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the spleen [lienal, splenetic]</p><p><b>arterija koja potiče iz celijaka i isporučuje krv slezni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that originates from the celiac trunk and supplies blood to the spleen [arteria lienalis, lienal artery]</p><p><b>Ako je to slučaj, potrebno je utvrditi da je to slučaj s: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a highly infectious animal disease (especially cattle and sheep) [anthrax]</p><p><b>vena koju čine nekoliko malih vena na površini slezine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein form