pira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> greyish-brown moth whose larva is the potato tuberworm [Phthorimaea operculella, potato moth, potato tuber moth]</p><p><b>mrlja, prljati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an irregularly shaped spot [blotch, splotch]</p><p><b>zapljusnuti, pljuskati, pljusnuti, polijevati, politi, poprskati, poprskavati, pošpricati, poštrcati, prskati, zalijevati, zaliti, špricati, štrcati, pokapati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a splashing sound [slosh, slush, splash]</p><p><i>v.</i> walk through mud or mire [slop, slosh, splash, squelch, squish]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause (a liquid) to spatter about, especially with force [splash, sprinkle]</p><p><i>v.</i> dash a liquid upon or against [plash, spatter, splash, splatter, swash]</p><p><b>mrlja, packa, prljati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an irregularly shaped spot [blotch, splodge]</p><p><i>v.</i> blotch or spot</p><p><b>mrlja, packa, prljati (od &quot;splotch&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked with irregularly shaped spots or blots [blotched, blotchy]</p><p><b>izljev osjećaja, napadnost, provala čuvstava, prepustiti se, prepuštati se, ugađati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ostentatious display (of effort or extravagance etc.)</p><p><i>n.</i> any act of immoderate indulgence [binge, orgy]</p><p><i>v.</i> indulge oneself [fling]</p><p><i>v.</i> be showy or ostentatious</p><p><b>brz, cvrčanje, cvrčati, halabuka, jurnjava, nerazumljiv, poprskati, prepirka, prskati, svađa, vreva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the noise of something spattering or sputtering explosively [spatter, spattering, splatter, splattering, sputter, sputtering]</p><p><i>n.</i> an utterance (of words) with spitting sounds (as in rage) [sputter]</p><p><i>v.</i> utter with a spitting sound, as if in a rage [sputter]</p><p><i>v.</i> spit up in an explosive manner [spit out, sputter]</p><p><b>Spock</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States pediatrician whose many books on child care influenced the upbringing of children around the world (1903-1998) [Benjamin Spock]</p><p><b>Engleski lončar koji je os