ropska stabla s jednosemnim plodovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical trees having one-seeded fruit [genus Spondias]</p><p><b>tropsko američko stablo s jestivim žutim plodovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tropical American tree having edible yellow fruit [hog plum, yellow mombin, yellow mombin tree]</p><p><b>obična tropska američka grmlja ili malo stablo s ljubičastim plodovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common tropical American shrub or small tree with purplish fruit [jocote, mombin, mombin tree]</p><p><b>artritis koji zahvaća jedan ili više međuvretnjačkih zglobova u kičmi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arthritis that affects one or more of the intervertebral joints in the spine</p><p><b>spondilitis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inflammation of a spinal joint</p><p><b>izmak jednog kralježnika naprijed preko onog ispod njega, stvarajući pritisak na kralježničke živce. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a forward dislocation of one vertebra over the one beneath it producing pressure on spinal nerves</p><p><b>brisanje, brisati spužvom, čišćenje, obrisati, pranje, spužva, trut</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a porous mass of interlacing fibers that forms the internal skeleton of various marine animals and usable to absorb water or any porous rubber or cellulose product similarly used</p><p><i>n.</i> someone able to acquire new knowledge and skills rapidly and easily [quick study]</p><p><i>n.</i> a follower who hangs around a host (without benefit to the host) in hope of gain or advantage [leech, parasite, sponger]</p><p><i>n.</i> primitive multicellular marine animal whose porous body is supported by a fibrous skeletal framework [parazoan, poriferan]</p><p><i>v.</i> wipe with a sponge, so as to clean or moisten</p><p><i>v.</i> ask for and get free [bum, cadge, grub, mooch]</p><p><i>v.</i> erase with a sponge</p><p><i>v.</i> soak up with a sponge</p><p><i>v.</i> gather sponges, in the ocean</p><p><b>vodotvorna vreća za držanje kupaonice (sapun i pasta za zube itd.) kada putujete (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a waterproof bag for holding bathrooms items (soap and toothpaste etc.) when you are travelling [toilet bag]</p><p><b>oprati se s spužvom ili rupčićem umjesto u kadi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> you wash your body with a sponge or washcloth instead of in a bathtub</p><p><b>biskvit</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a light porous cake made with eggs and flour and sugar without shortening</p><p><b>od tkanine od čelika ili čelika od čelika ili čelika, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any soft porous fabric (especially in a loose honeycomb weave)</p><p><b>čisti ga spužvom, trljajući, oprati s spužvom (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> clean with a sponge, by rubbing [sponge off]</p><p><i>v.</i> wash with a sponge</p><p><b>rod Porifera (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Porifera</p><p><b>bilo koji od nekoliko tropskih godišnjih planinara s velikim žutim cvijećem i jestivim mladim plodovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several tropical annual climbers having large yellow flowers and edible young fruits [dishcloth gourd, luffa, rag gourd, strainer vine]</p><p><b>mokra mop s spužvom kao apsorbent (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wet mop with a sponge as the absorbent</p><p><b>maruh, pravi smrčak, srček</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an edible and choice morel with a globular to elongate head with an irregular pattern of pits and ridges [Morchella esculenta, common morel, sponge mushroom]</p><p><b>maruh, pravi smrčak, srček</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an edible and choice morel with a globular to elongate head with an irregular pattern of pits and ridges [Morchella esculenta, common morel, sponge morel]</p><p><b>čisti ga spužvom, trljajući (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> clean with a sponge, by rubbing [sponge down]</p><p><b>Nanesite ga s spužvom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> apply with a sponge</p><p><b>upijaju kao da su s gumbom (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> absorb as if with a sponge</p><p><b>krastavci, koji se hrane slatkovodnim spužvama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hairy-bodied insect whose larvae feed on freshwater sponges [spongillafly]</p><p><b>l