perience [ghost, shade, specter, spectre, wraith]</p><p><i>v.</i> frighten or scare, and often provoke into a violent action</p><p><b>sablastan (od &quot;spooky&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an unnatural eery manner [eerily]</p><p><b>sablastan, jogunast, nemiran, plah</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> unpredictably excitable (especially of horses) [flighty, nervous, skittish]</p><p><b>bobina, cijev, kalem, kotur, motati, namotaj, namotati, namotavati, špula, bubanj za namatanje, kolut</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a winder around which thread or tape or film or other flexible materials can be wound [bobbin, reel]</p><p><i>v.</i> transfer data intended for a peripheral device (usually a printer) into temporary storage</p><p><i>v.</i> wind onto a spool or a reel</p><p><b>lopatica, naivan čovjek, zaljubljen čovjek, zvekan, žlica, kašika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of cutlery with a shallow bowl-shaped container and a handle</p><p><i>n.</i> as much as a spoon will hold [spoonful]</p><p><i>n.</i> formerly a golfing wood with an elevated face</p><p><i>v.</i> scoop up or take up with a spoon</p><p><i>v.</i> snuggle and lie in a position where one person faces the back of the others [smooch]</p><p><b>mekani kruh od kukuruznog brašna i ponekad riže ili hominy (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> soft bread made of cornmeal and sometimes rice or hominy [batter bread]</p><p><b>dijeta koja ne zahtijeva žvakanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diet that does not require chewing [pap, soft diet]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> shaped in the form of a spoon</p><p><b>bijela žličarka, čaplja kašikara</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wading birds having a long flat bill with a tip like a spoon</p><p><b>veliki sumak iz središnje Sjedinjene Države s ravnom glavom i izbočenom vilicom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large catfish of central United States having a flattened head and projecting jaw [Pylodictus olivaris, flathead catfish, goujon, mudcat, shovelnose catfish]</p><p><