p><i>v.</i> overcome or allay [appease, quell]</p><p><b>privremeno boravite (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> reside temporarily</p><p><b>izbjegavati. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> stay clear of, avoid [keep one's distance, keep one's eyes off, keep one's hands off, stand back]</p><p><b>biti svjež, ostajati svjež, ostati svjež, zadržati svježinu, zadržavati svježinu</b></p><p><i>v.</i> fail to spoil or rot [keep]</p><p><b>ostajati na mjestu, ostajati nepomičan, ostati na mjestu, ostati nepomičan</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be stationary</p><p><b>U slučaju da je sudski sud odlučio da se sudski sud ne može izvršiti u određenom razdoblju, sudski sud može odlučiti da se sudski sud ne može izvršiti u određenom razdoblju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an order whereby a judgment is precluded from being executed for a specific period of time</p><p><b>ne ulazite ili hodate po njemu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> refrain from entering or walking onto [keep off]</p><p><b>ostajati, ostati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> continue in a place, position, or situation [continue, remain, stay]</p><p><b>ostati preko noći (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> stay overnight [sleep over]</p><p><b>zadržavati, ostati, zaglibiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> stay put (in a certain place) [stay, stick, stick around]</p><p><b>biti vjerni jedni drugima, posebno u teškim vremenima (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be loyal to one another, especially in times of trouble [stick together]</p><p><b>Ne ide u krevet. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> not go to bed [sit up]</p><p><b>Osoba koja rijetko ide nigdje., ne daje se za putovanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who seldom goes anywhere [homebody]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not given to travel</p><p><b>bavljenje, boravak, boraviti, boravljenje, čekati, mider, odlaganje, odsjedati, ostajati, ostanak, ostati, podupirač, poduprijeti, prebivanje, prepreka, pričvrstiti, steznik, stub, veza, zadržavanje, zastoj, zaustaviti, boravka (od &quot;stay&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person or other animal having powers of endurance or perseverance</p><p><b>izdržljivost, stamenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> enduring strength and energy [stamina, toughness]</p><p><b>Jabuka koja se uglavnom uzgaja u dolini Shenandoah (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> apple grown chiefly in the Shenandoah Valley</p><p><b>krastavska sirka jabuka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> crisp tart apple</p><p><b>boravak, mider, sartije, korzet, steznik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman's close-fitting foundation garment [corset, girdle]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fore-and-aft sail set on a stay (as between two masts)</p><p><b>sustav publiciranja standarda Internet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a communicable infection transmitted by sexual intercourse or genital contact [Cupid's disease, Cupid's itch, VD, Venus's curse, dose, sexually transmitted disease, social disease, venereal disease, venereal infection]</p><p><i>n.</i> a doctor's degree in theology [Doctor of Sacred Theology]</p><p><b>korist, mjesto, položaj, pozicija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the post or function properly or customarily occupied or served by another [lieu, place, position]</p><p><b>čvrst, jak, nepokolebljiv, nepomičan, nepopustljiv, postojan, prodoran, ravnomjeran, uporan, uravnotežen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by firm determination or resolution [firm, steady, stiff, unbendable, unfaltering, unshakable, unwavering]</p><p><i>adj.</i> firm and dependable especially in loyalty [staunch, unswerving]</p><p><b>čvrsto</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with resolute determination [firm, firmly, unwaveringly]</p><p><b>čvrstoća, postojanost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> loyalty in the face of trouble and difficulty [staunchness]</p><p><i>n.</i> steadfast resolution</p><p><b>čvrst, čvrsto, miran, nepomičan, neprekidan, odmjeren, oprezan, postojan, pouzdan, prodoran, ravnomjeran, siguran, stalan, staložen, staložiti se, tako ravno, učvrstiti se, uporan, ustrajan (od &quot;steady&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> made steady or constant</p><p><b>čvrsto, odmjereno, redovito, stalno, sustavno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> at a steady rate or pace</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a steady manner [steady]</p><p><b>čvrstoća, nepokolebljivost, postojanost, stalnost, ustrajnost, solidnost, čvrstina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> freedom from wavering or indecision</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being steady or securely and immovably fixed in place [firmness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being steady--regular and unvarying</p><p><b>čvrst, čvrsto, miran, nepomičan, neprekidan, odmjeren, oprezan, postojan, pouzdan, prodoran, ravnomjeran, siguran, stalan, staložen, staložiti se, tako ravno, učvrstiti se, uporan, ustrajan, ustaliti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person loved by another person [sweetheart, sweetie, truelove]</p><p><i>v.</i> make steady [becalm, calm]</p><p><i>v.</i> support or hold steady and make steadfast, with or as if with a brace [brace, stabilise, stabilize]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not subject to change or variation especially in behavior</p><p><i>adj.</i> not liable to fluctuate or especially to fall [firm, unfluctuating]</p><p><i>adj.</i> securely in position</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by firm determination or resolution [firm, steadfast, stiff, unbendable, unfaltering, unshakable, unwavering]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to a person who does something regularly [regular]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not easily excited or upset</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a steady manner [steadily]</p><p><b>smiriti se, smjestiti se, snaći se, uklopiti se, ukorijeniti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become settled or established and stable in one's residence or life style [root, settle, settle down, take root]</p><p><b>(kosmologija) teorija da svemir održava stalnu prosječnu gustoću s materijom stvorenom da popuni prazninu koju ostave galaksije koje se udaljavaju jedna od druge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (cosmology) the theory that the universe maintains a constant average density with matter created to fill the void left by galaxies that are receding from each other [continuous creation theory]</p><p><b>dosljedan u radu ili ponašanju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> consistent in performance or behavior [dependable, rock-steady]</p><p><b>čvrst, čvrsto, miran, nepomičan, neprekidan, odmjeren, oprezan, postojan, pouzdan, prodoran, ravnomjeran, siguran, stalan, staložen, staložiti se, tako ravno, učvrstiti se, uporan, ustrajan (od &quot;steady&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> causing to become steady</p><p><b>komad mesa, odrezak, odrezak mesa, šnicla</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a slice of meat cut from the fleshy part of an animal or large fish</p><p><b>odrezak s zarubljenim bubrezima i lukom, kuhan u vinu i čokoladi, zatim prekriven kolačima i pečen (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> steak with sauteed kidneys and onions cooked in wine and stock then covered with pastry and baked</p><p><b>odrezak prekriven slomljenim zrncima paprike, pečen u panci i poslužen sa sosom od konjak i maslaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> steak covered with crushed peppercorns pan-broiled and served with brandy-and-butter sauce [pepper steak, peppered steak]</p><p><b>oštar stolni nož koji se koristi za jelo odrezaka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sharp table knife used in eating steak</p><p><b>Oštri umak za odrezak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pungent bottled sauce for steak</p><p><b>U slučaju da je proizvod izravno proizveden iz goveđe meso, u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, ne smije se upotrebljavati za proizvodnju goveđe meso. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ground beef mixed with raw egg and e.g. onions and capers and anchovies [cannibal mound, tartar steak]</p><p><b>restoran koji se specijalizirao za odrezak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a restaurant that specializes in steaks [chophouse]</p><p><b>krasti, oteti, pokrasti, prikradati se, ukradena lopta, ukrasti, ukrasti loptu, otuđiti, otuđivati, kliznuti, odšuljati se, prikrasti se, prišuljati se, prišunjati se, ušuljati se, ušunjati se, šuljati se, šunjati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an advantageous purchase [bargain, buy]</p><p><i>n.</i> a stolen base</p><p><i>v.</i> take without the owner's consent [rip, rip off]</p><p><i>v.</i> move stealthily [slip]</p><p><i>v.</i> steal a base</p><p><b>I otiđi potajno i potajno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> leave furtively and stealthily [slip away, sneak away, sneak off, sneak out]</p><p><b>kradljivac, lopov, tat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a criminal who takes property belonging to someone else with the intention of keeping it or selling it [thief]</p><p><b>krađa, lopovluk, potaja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of taking something from someone unlawfully [larceny, theft, thievery, thieving]</p><p><i>n.</i> avoiding detection by moving carefully [stealth]</p><p><b>kradomice, kradomičnost, potajan, potajnost, potaja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> avoiding detection by moving carefully [stealing]</p><p><b>zrakoplov dizajniran u skladu s tehnologijom koja otežava otkrivanje radarom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an aircraft designed in accordance with technology that makes detection by radar difficult</p><p><b>Bombarder koji je teško otkriti radarom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bomber that is difficult to detect by radar</p><p><b>borbeni zrakoplov koji je teško otkriti radarom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fighter that is difficult to detect by radar</p><p><b>kradom, krišom, potajno, tajno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a stealthy manner</p><p><b>sklonost da bude lukav i skriven i da radi stvari skriveno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a disposition to be sly and stealthy and to do things surreptitiously [furtiveness, sneakiness]</p><p><b>kradomičan, nečujan, skriveni, tajni, tih</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by quiet and caution and secrecy [furtive, sneak, sneaky, surreptitious]</p><p><b>energija, isparavanje, kretati se, kuhati, para, pariti se, parni, pramčana statva, snaga, pariti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> water at boiling temperature diffused in the atmosphere</p><p><i>v.</i> travel by means of steam power [steamer]</p><p><i>v.</i> emit steam</p><p><i>v.</i> rise as vapor</p><p><i>v.</i> get very angry</p><p><i>v.</i> clean by means of steaming [steam clean]</p><p><i>v.</i> cook something by letting steam pass over it</p><p><b>prostorija koja se može ispuniti parom u kojoj se ljudi kupaju, znojiš se u parnoj sobi prije masaže i hladnog tuša (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a room that can be filled with steam in which people bathe [steam room, vapor bath, vapour bath]</p><p><i>n.</i> you sweat in a steam room before getting a rubdown and cold shower [Turkish bath, vapor bath, vapour bath]</p><p><b>parni kotao, kotao</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sealed vessel where water is converted to steam [boiler]</p><p><b>kućište razvodnika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the chamber from which steam is distributed to a cylinder</p><p><b>pariti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> clean by means of steaming [steam]</p><p><b>ugljen koji je pogodan za upotrebu u parnim kotlovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coal suitable for use under steam boilers</p><p><b>parni stroj, parostroj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> external-combustion engine in which heat is used to raise steam which either turns a turbine or forces a piston to move up and down in a cylinder</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve proizvode koji se upotrebljavaju za proizvodnju električne energije u Uniji, za koje se primjenjuje članak 2. točka (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći odredbi: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> care (installation and maintenance) of equipment for ventilating or heating or refrigerating</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva od 0,15 mas.% ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mas.% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a heating system in which steam is generated in boilers and piped to radiators [steam heating]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva od 0,15 mas.% ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mas.% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a heating system in which steam is generated in boilers and piped to radiators [steam heat]</p><p><b>gume za pritisak koje mogu izbaciti paru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pressing iron that can emit steam</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pipe conducting steam [steam pipe]</p><p><b>lokomotiva koja se pogoni parnim strojem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a locomotive powered by a steam engine</p><p><b>glazbeni instrument koji se sastoji od niza parnih zvižduka koje se sviraju sa tastature (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a musical instrument consisting of a series of steam whistles played from a keyboard [calliope]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pipe conducting steam [steam line]</p><p><b>prostorija koja se može ispuniti parom u kojoj se ljudi kupaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a room that can be filled with steam in which people bathe [steam bath, vapor bath, vapour bath]</p><p><b>električna lopata koja se pokreće parom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a power shovel that is driven by steam</p><p><b>turbina u kojoj par udara lopate i čini ih okretnim (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> turbine in which steam strikes blades and makes them turn</p><p><b>Pljučka u kojoj se zvuk stvara parom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a whistle in which the sound is produced by steam</p><p><b>toplina pomoću pare (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> heat by means of steam</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom goriva ne većim od 50 kVA (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> powered by a steam engine</p><p><b>parobrod</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a boat propelled by a steam engine</p><p><b>zamagljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> cooked in steam</p><p><i>adj.</i> aroused to impatience or anger [annoyed, irritated, miffed, nettled, peeved, pissed, pissed off, riled, roiled, stung]</p><p><b>puding kuhan parom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pudding cooked by steaming</p><p><b>kotao za kuhanje, parobrod, strimer uređaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clam that is usually steamed in the shell [long-neck clam, soft-shell clam, steamer clam]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cooking utensil that can be used to cook food by steaming it</p><p><i>n.</i> a ship powered by one or more steam engines [steamship]</p><p><i>n.</i> an edible clam with thin oval-shaped shell found in coastal regions of the United States and Europe [Mya arenaria, long-neck clam, soft-shell clam, steamer clam]</p><p><i>v.</i> travel by means of steam power [steam]</p><p><b>školjka koja se obično pare u ljusci, jedna školjka s tankom ovalnom školjkom koja se nalazi u obalnim područjima Sjedinjenih Država i Europe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clam that is usually steamed in the shell [long-neck clam, soft-shell clam, steamer]</p><p><i>n.</i> an edible clam with thin oval-shaped shell found in coastal regions of the United States and Europe [Mya arenaria, long-neck clam, soft-shell clam, steamer]</p><p><b>Sredstva za proizvodnju električnih vozila i opreme za proizvodnju električnih vozila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a craftsman who installs and maintains equipment for ventilating or heating or refrigerating</p><p><b>oblak zbog magle ili magle ili pare (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cloudiness resulting from haze or mist or vapor [haziness, mistiness, vaporousness, vapourousness]</p><p><b>kipeći, kipuće, vrelo</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> filled with steam or emitting moisture in the form of vapor or mist [steamy]</p><p><i>adv.</i> (used of heat) extremely [piping]</p><p><b>dovesti u određeno stanje od strane ogromne sile ili pritiska, Naprijed sa velikom snagom., Preplašiti ga upotrebom velike sile., Izravno ili ravno s parnim valjkom (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bring to a specified state by overwhelming force or pressure [steamroller]</p><p><i>v.</i> proceed with great force [steamroller]</p><p><i>v.</i> overwhelm by using great force [steamroller]</p><p><i>v.</i> make level or flat with a steamroller [steamroller]</p><p><b>smrviti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a massive inexorable force that seems to crush everything in its way [juggernaut]</p><p><i>n.</i> vehicle equipped with heavy wide smooth rollers for compacting roads and pavements [road roller]</p><p><i>v.</i> bring to a specified state by overwhelming force or pressure [steamroll]</p><p><i>v.</i> proceed with great force [steamroll]</p><p><i>v.</i> crush with a steamroller as if to level</p><p><i>v.</i> overwhelm by using 