road coarsely toothed leaves with copious stinging hairs [Urtica dioica]</p><p><b>bez ubodnog udaraca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> without a sting</p><p><b>manta, raža</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large venomous ray with large barbed spines near the base of a thin whiplike tail capable of inflicting severe wounds</p><p><b>cicija, škrt, tvrdica</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> unwilling to spend (money, time, resources, etc.) [ungenerous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> deficient in amount or quality or extent [meager, meagerly, meagre, scrimpy]</p><p><b>smrad, smradu, smrdjeti, zaudarati, vonj, vonjati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a distinctive odor that is offensively unpleasant [fetor, foetor, malodor, malodour, mephitis, reek, stench]</p><p><i>v.</i> be extremely bad in quality or in one's performance</p><p><i>v.</i> smell badly and offensively [reek]</p><p><b>Zlonamjerna kalifornijska biljka s zvonovitim cvijećem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a malodorous California herb with bell-shaped flowers [Fritillaria agrestis]</p><p><b>mala bomba dizajnirana da ostavlja loš miris kada eksplodira (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small bomb designed to give off a foul odor when it explodes [stench bomb]</p><p><b>Blizanozelena neugodno mirisljiva muha koja ima mesojede ličinke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pale green unpleasant-smelling lacewing fly having carnivorous larvae [chrysopid, green lacewing]</p><p><b>uzrok da smrdi loše (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to smell bad [smell up, stink up]</p><p><b>uzrok da smrdi loše (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to smell bad [smell up, stink out]</p><p><b>Crested smrdljiva južnoamerička ptica čiji mladići imaju kandže na prvom i drugom prstima krila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> crested ill-smelling South American bird whose young have claws on the first and second digits of the wings [Opisthocomus hoazin, hoactzin, hoatzin]</p><p><b>kanta, krntija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is deemed to be despicable or contemptible [bum, crumb, dirty dog, git, lowlife, puke, rat, rotter, scum bag, skunk,