ple flowers and foul-smelling leaves [Iris foetidissima, gladdon, gladdon iris, roast beef plant, stinking iris]</p><p><b>Europski gusinčji stopala s jakim mirisom lišća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European goosefoot with strong-scented foliage [Chenopodium vulvaria]</p><p><b>Helleborus foetidus, smrdljivi kukurijek</b></p><p><i>n.</i> digitate-leaved hellebore with an offensive odor and irritant qualities when taken internally [Helleborus foetidus, bear's foot, setterwort]</p><p><b>Europska biljka sa lošim mirisom, s ružnim listovima i krugovima tamno ljubičastih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ill-smelling European herb with rugose leaves and whorls of dark purple flowers [Ballota nigra, black archangel, black horehound, fetid horehound]</p><p><b>Iris s ljubičastim cvijećem i smrdljivim lišćama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> iris with purple flowers and foul-smelling leaves [Iris foetidissima, gladdon, gladdon iris, roast beef plant, stinking gladwyn]</p><p><b>široko rasprostranjena korovna trava s bijelom vrhom cvijeća s žutim diskovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> widespread rank-smelling weed having white-rayed flower heads with yellow discs [Anthemis cotula, dog fennel, mayweed, stinking chamomile]</p><p><b>otrovna smrdljiva biljka Starog svijeta s ljepljivim dlakavim lišcima i žuto-sjednim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> poisonous fetid Old World herb having sticky hairy leaves and yellow-brown flowers [Hyoscyamus niger, black henbane, henbane]</p><p><b>smrdljiva snijet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> disease of wheat characterized by replacement of the grains with greasy masses of smelly smut spores [bunt]</p><p><i>n.</i> similar to Tilletia caries [Tilletia foetida, bunt]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve proizvode koji sadrže: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> scrubby Australian acacia having extremely foul-smelling blossoms [Acacia cambegei, gidgee]</p><p><b>vrlo listovit loš smrad tropski korovnjak čija se sjemena koriste kao doda