ih loznica s trifolijatnim listovima i navidnim cvijećima u okrilnim klasterima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> genus of tropical herbs and woody vines having trifoliate leaves and showy flowers in axillary clusters [genus Mucuna, genus Stizolobium]</p><p><b>godišnje drvene vinove loze iz Azije s dugim grmovima ljubičastih cvijeća i gusto dlakavim čunjama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the annual woody vine of Asia having long clusters of purplish flowers and densely hairy pods [Bengal bean, Benghal bean, Florida bean, Mucuna aterrima, Mucuna deeringiana, Mucuna pruriens utilis, cowage, velvet bean]</p><p><b>Škrgevici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pike-perches [genus Stizostedion]</p><p><b>Slatkovodne perke poput špica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pike-like freshwater perches [dory, jack salmon, walleye, walleyed pike]</p><p><b>što možete ponoviti odmah nakon što ga primjetite (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> what you can repeat immediately after perceiving it [immediate memory, short-term memory]</p><p><b>hermelin, zerdav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ermine in its brown summer coat with black-tipped tail</p><p><b>kratka ravna drvena štapka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a short straight stick of wood</p><p><b>slučajni, stohastički, stohastička, stohastičke</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being or having a random variable</p><p><b>slučajni proces, slučajno zbivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a statistical process involving a number of random variables depending on a variable parameter (which is usually time)</p><p><b>varijabilna količina koja je nasumična (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a variable quantity that is random [chance variable, random variable, variant, variate]</p><p><b>stohastičnim mjerama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by stochastic means</p><p><b>nepredvidivost, slučajnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of lacking any predictable order or plan [haphazardness, noise, randomness]</p><p><b>deblo, dionica, dionice, državne vrijednosnice, gotovina, klada, marva, obilje, panj, porijeklo, pripravan, roba, skladište, snabdjeti se, temeljni, udjela, zaliha, zalihe, inventar, pričuva, rezerva, loza, obitelj, porod, potomstvo, rod, soj, stoka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the capital raised by a corporation through the issue of shares entitling holders to an ownership interest (equity)</p><p><i>n.</i> the merchandise that a shop has on hand [inventory]</p><p><i>n.</i> the handle of a handgun or the butt end of a rifle or shotgun or part of the support of a machine gun or artillery gun [gunstock]</p><p><i>n.</i> a certificate documenting the shareholder's ownership in the corporation [stock certificate]</p><p><i>n.</i> a supply of something available for future use [fund, store]</p><p><i>n.</i> the descendants of one individual [ancestry, blood, blood line, bloodline, descent, line, line of descent, lineage, origin, parentage, pedigree, stemma]</p><p><i>n.</i> a special variety of domesticated animals within a species [breed, strain]</p><p><i>n.</i> liquid in which meat and vegetables are simmered [broth]</p><p><i>n.</i> the reputation and popularity a person has</p><p><i>n.</i> persistent thickened stem of a herbaceous perennial plant [caudex]</p><p><i>n.</i> a plant or stem onto which a graft is made</p><p><i>n.</i> any of several Old World plants cultivated for their brightly colored flowers [gillyflower]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various ornamental flowering plants of the genus Malcolmia [Malcolm stock]</p><p><i>n.</i> lumber used in the construction of something</p><p><i>n.</i> the handle end of some implements or tools</p><p><i>n.</i> an ornamental white cravat [neckcloth]</p><p><i>n.</i> any animals kept for use or profit [farm animal, livestock]</p><p><i>v.</i> have on hand [carry, stockpile]</p><p><i>v.</i> equip with a stock</p><p><i>v.</i> supply with fish</p><p><i>v.</i> supply with livestock</p><p><i>v.</i> amass so as to keep for future use or sale or for a particular occasion or use [buy in, stock up]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide or furnish with a stock of something</p><p><i>v.</i> put forth and grow sprouts or shoots [sprout]</p><p><i>adj.</i> repeated too often [banal, commonplace, hackneyed, old-hat, shopworn, threadbare, timeworn, tired, trite, well-worn]</p><p><i>adj.</i> routine</p><p><i>adj.</i> regularly and widely used or sold [standard]</p><p><b>uzgajivač stoke</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who breeds animals [breeder]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u pitanju trgovačka društva, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, trgovačka društva mogu imati: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a corporation's purchase of its own outstanding stock</p><p><b>automobil koji se drži u trgovinskom skladištu za redovite prodaje, trkački automobil s osnovnom šasijom komercijalno dostupnog automobila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a car kept in dealers' stock for regular sales</p><p><i>n.</i> a racing car with the basic chassis of a commercially available car</p><p><b>potvrda o vlasništvu dioničara u korporaciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a certificate documenting the shareholder's ownership in the corporation [stock]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, društvo može imati samo jednu poslovnu jedinicu., pozorišna kuća koja izvodi predstave iz repertoara (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company whose capital is represented by stock</p><p><i>n.</i> a theatrical company that performs plays from a repertoire [repertory, repertory company]</p><p><b>kub od dehidrirane hrane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cube of dehydrated stock</p><p><b>Dividendni iznos koji se plaća u obliku dionica umjesto u gotovini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dividend paid in stock rather than in cash</p><p><b>burza, burza dionica, efektna burza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exchange where security trading is conducted by professional stockbrokers [securities market, stock market]</p><p><b>poljoprivrednik koji uzgaja ili uzgaja stoku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> farmer who breed or raises livestock [stock raiser, stockman]</p><p><b>postojeći fotografija licenciran za određenu uporabu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exisitng photograph licensed for a specific use [stock photograph]</p><p><b>burzovni indeks, indeks</b></p><p><i>n.</i> index based on a statistical compilation of the share prices of a number of representative stocks [stock market index]</p><p><b>(zakonom o udruženjima) odobrenje i isporuka dionica za prodaju javnosti ili dionica tako ponuđenih u određenom trenutku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (corporation law) the authorization and delivery of shares of stock for sale to the public or the shares thus offered at a particular time</p><p><b>burzovni izvještaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a detailed list of all the items in stock [inventory]</p><p><b>burza, burza dionica, burze, marketno tržište, efektna burza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exchange where security trading is conducted by professional stockbrokers [securities market, stock exchange]</p><p><b>burzovni indeks, indeks</b></p><p><i>n.</i> index based on a statistical compilation of the share prices of a number of representative stocks [stock index]</p><p><b>stopa u vlasništvu vlasnika zabeleženih zaliha na određeni datum (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stock held by stockholders of record on a given date</p><p><b>pravo kupnje ili prodaje dionica po određenoj cijeni u određenom razdoblju, U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, "službenici" su osoblje koje je podređeno upravljanju ili upravljanju u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the right to buy or sell a stock at a specified price within a stated period</p><p><i>n.</i> a benefit given by a company to an employee in the form of an option to buy stock in the company at a discount or at a fixed price</p><p><b>postojeći fotografija licenciran za određenu uporabu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exisitng photograph licensed for a specific use [stock image]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u pitanju trgovački ugovor, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, trgovački ugovor može se smatrati trgovačkim ugovorom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a power of attorney document to transfer ownership of a registered security from the owner to another party</p><p><b>organiziran plan za zaposlenike društva za kupnju dionica njegovih dionica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an organized plan for employees of a company to buy shares of its stock</p><p><b>poljoprivrednik koji uzgaja ili uzgaja stoku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> farmer who breed or raises livestock [stock farmer, stockman]</p><p><b>Sklop za skladištenje robe i zaliha koje se koriste u poduzeću (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> storeroom for storing goods and supplies used in a business [stockroom]</p><p><b>ukrašeno sedlo koje koriste kauboji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an ornamented saddle used by cowboys [Western saddle]</p><p><b>dijeljenje dionica, dioba dionica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an increase in the number of outstanding shares of a corporation without changing the shareholders' equity [split, split up]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je trgovačko društvo u skladu s člankom 77. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013, to je društvo koje se trguje na tržištu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the letters used to identify listed companies on the securities exchanges where they are traded</p><p><b>štampač znakova koji automatski štampa cijene na trake (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a character printer that automatically prints stock quotations on ticker tape [ticker]</p><p><b>osoba koja kupuje i prodaje dionice dionica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who buys and sells stock shares</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka ne primjenjuje druga pravila, to znači da se ne primjenjuje druga pravila. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> amass so as to keep for future use or sale or for a particular occasion or use [buy in, stock]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je vrijednost vrijednosnog papira u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, vrijednost vrijednosnog papira u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe može se smatrati vrijednosnim papirom u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe., U slučaju da je u pitanju vrijednost, vrijednost ili vrijednost za koju se može očekivati da će se uložiti u vrijednost ili vrijednost za koju se može očekivati da će se uložiti u vrijednost ili vrijednost za koju se može očekivati da će se uložiti u vrijednost ili vrijednost. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a type of security issued by a corporation (usually together with a bond or preferred stock) that gives the holder the right to purchase a certain amount of common stock at a stated price [stock-purchase warrant, warrant]</p><p><i>n.</i> a written certificate that gives the holder the right to purchase shares of a stock for a specified price within a specified period of time</p><p><b>Svaka oprema koja se stalno koristi u okviru profesije ili zanimanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any equipment constantly used as part of a profession or occupation</p><p><b>U slučaju da je ugovor o budućnosti temeljen na dioničnom indeksu, ugovor o budućnosti se može smatrati ugovorom o budućnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a futures contract based on a stock index</p><p><b>U slučaju da je vrijednost vrijednosnog papira u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, vrijednost vrijednosnog papira u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe može se smatrati vrijednosnim papirom u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a type of security issued by a corporation (usually together with a bond or preferred stock) that gives the holder the right to purchase a certain amount of common stock at a stated price [stock warrant, warrant]</p><p><b>nepokretan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> absolutely still [frozen, rooted]</p><p><i>adv.</i> without moving or making a sound [still]</p><p><b>primjer popisa, da se u pojedinačni zapis ili izvještaj uključi ili uključi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instance of stocktaking [stocktake]<