vu koji je promovirao abolicionistički cilj (1811-1896) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer of a novel about slavery that advanced the abolitionists' cause (1811-1896) [Harriet Beecher Stowe, Harriet Elizabeth Beecher Stowe]</p><p><b>natovariti, slagati (od &quot;stow&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of packing or storing away [stowage]</p><p><b>standardna temperatura i pritisak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> standard temperature and pressure [s.t.p.]</p><p><b>nepravilno poravnanje jednog ili oba oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormal alignment of one or both eyes [squint]</p><p><b>operacija rezanja mišića ili tetive oka radi ispravljanja strabizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the surgical operation of cutting a muscle or tendon of the eye in order to correct strabismus</p><p><b>Engleski životopisac i vodeći član Bloomsbury grupe (1880-1932) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English biographer and leading member of the Bloomsbury Group (1880-1932) [Giles Lytton Strachey, Lytton Strachey]</p><p><b>violina koju je napravio Antonio Stradivari ili član njegove obitelji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a violin made by Antonio Stradivari or a member of his family [Stradavarius]</p><p><b>violina koju je napravio Antonio Stradivari ili član njegove obitelji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a violin made by Antonio Stradivari or a member of his family [Strad]</p><p><b>raskrečiti se, biti ležeran, ponašati se neobavezno</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a noncommittal or equivocal position</p><p><i>n.</i> a gymnastic exercise performed with a leg on either side of the parallel bars</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of sitting or standing astride [span]</p><p><i>n.</i> the option to buy or sell a given stock (or stock index or commodity future) at a given price before a given date</p><p><i>v.</i> sit or stand astride of</p><p><i>v.</i> range or extend over [range]</p><p><i>v.</i> be noncommittal</p><p><b>Talijanski proizvođač violina koji je razvio modernu violinu i stvorio violine bez premca u kvaliteti tona (1644?-1737) 