ške, strateško</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or concerned with strategy [strategical]</p><p><i>adj.</i> highly important to or an integral part of a strategy or plan of action especially in war</p><p><b>pregovori između Sjedinjenih Država i Unije sovjetskih socijalističkih republika započeti 1969. u Helsinku namijenjeni ograničavanju zaliha nuklearnog oružja obje zemlje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> negotiations between the United States and the Union of Soviet Socialist Republics opened in 1969 in Helsinki designed to limit both countries' stock of nuclear weapons [SALT]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013 Komisija može odlučiti o primjeni tih odredbi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acquisition based on analysis of the benefits of consolidation in anticipation of increased earning power</p><p><b>obavještajne informacije potrebne za oblikovanje politika i vojnih planova na nacionalnoj i međunarodnoj razini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intelligence that is required for forming policy and military plans at national and international levels</p><p><b>(vojni) upozorenje prije početka prijetnje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (military) a warning prior to the start of a threatening act</p><p><b>strateški</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or concerned with strategy [strategic]</p><p><b>strateški</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with regard to strategy</p><p><b>strategija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the science or art of strategy</p><p><b>strateg</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expert in strategy (especially in warfare) [strategian]</p><p><b>strategija, taktičke vještina, strategija poduzeća, strategije, strategiju, plan, shema</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an elaborate and systematic plan of action [scheme]</p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of military science dealing with military command and the planning and conduct of a war</p><p><b>grad u središnjoj Engleskoj na rijeci Avon (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a town in central England on the River Avon [Stratford-upon-Avon]</p><p><b>grad u središnjoj Engleskoj na rijeci Avon (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a town in central England on the River Avon [Stratford-on-Avon]</p><p><b>slojevitost, stratifikacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act or process or arranging persons into classes or social strata</p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being arranged in social strata or classes within a group [social stratification]</p><p><i>n.</i> forming or depositing in layers</p><p><i>n.</i> a layered configuration</p><p><i>n.</i> the placing of seeds in damp sand or sawdust or peat moss in order to preserve them or promote germination</p><p><b>naslagan u slojevima, slojevit, uslojen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> arranged in a sequence of grades or ranks [graded, ranked]</p><p><i>adj.</i> deposited or arranged in horizontal layers [bedded]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of society) socially hierarchical [class-conscious]</p><p><b>jezik koji se ne može koristiti kao svoj metajezik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a language that cannot be used as its own metalanguage</p><p><b>Populacija se dijeli na slojeve i uzimamo nasumični uzorak iz svakog sloja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the population is divided into strata and a random sample is taken from each stratum [proportional sample, representative sample]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) primjenjuje na sve vrste životinja, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeći postupak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the population is divided into subpopulations (strata) and random samples are taken of each stratum [proportional sampling, representative sampling]</p><p><b>uslojiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> divide society into social classes or castes</p><p><i>v.</i> form layers or strata</p><p><i>v.</i> develop different social levels, classes, or castes</p><p><i>v.</i> form, arrange, or deposit in layers</p><p><i>v.</i> render fertile and preserve by placing between layers of earth or sand</p><p><b>stratigrafija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of geology that studies the arrangement and succession of strata</p><p><b>Vlada vojske i vojske. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> government by the military and an army [military government]</p><p><b>stratosfera</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the atmospheric layer between the troposphere and the mesosphere</p><p><b>naslaga, sloj, stratus, društvena klasa, društveni stalež, klasa, stalež, nivo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of several parallel layers of material arranged one on top of another (such as a layer of tissue or cells in an organism or a layer of sedimentary rock)</p><p><i>n.</i> people having the same social, economic, or educational status [class, social class, socio-economic class]</p><p><i>n.</i> an abstract place usually conceived as having depth [layer, level]</p><p><i>n.</i> a subpopulation divided into a stratified sampling</p><p><b>najunutarniji sloj epiderme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the innermost layer of the epidermis [malpighian layer, rete Malpighii, stratum germinativum]</p><p><b>najvanjski sloj epiderme koji se sastoji od mrtvih stanica koje se odbijaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the outermost layer of the epidermis consisting of dead cells that slough off [corneum, horny layer]</p><p><b>najunutarniji sloj epiderme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the innermost layer of the epidermis [malpighian layer, rete Malpighii, stratum basale]</p><p><b>sloj epiderme neposredno ispod sloja rogova ili (na dlanovima i podnožju) neposredno ispod sloja luciduma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the layer of epidermis just under the stratum corneum or (on the palms and soles) just under the stratum lucidum</p><p><b>sloj epiderme neposredno ispod sloja rogovita u koži dlanova i podnožja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the layer of epidermis immediately under the stratum corneum in the skin of the palms and soles</p><p><b>stratus</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large dark low cloud [stratus cloud]</p><p><b>stratus</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large dark low cloud [stratus]</p><p><b>Njemački kompozitor mnogih opera, Austrijski skladatelj i sin Straussa Starijeg, Austrijski skladatelj valcera (1804-1849) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German composer of many operas [Richard Strauss]</p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian composer and son of Strauss the Elder [Johann Strauss, Strauss the Younger]</p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian composer of waltzes (1804-1849) [Johann Strauss, Strauss the Elder]</p><p><b>Austrijski skladatelj valcera (1804-1849) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian composer of waltzes (1804-1849) [Johann Strauss, Strauss]</p><p><b>Austrijski skladatelj i sin Straussa Starijeg (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Austrian composer and son of Strauss the Elder [Johann Strauss, Strauss]</p><p><b>Od ili u vezi s ili poput ili na način Stravinskija (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or like or in the manner of Stravinsky [Stravinskyan]</p><p><b>skladatelj rođen u Rusiji, ali živjela u Sjedinjenim Državama nakon 1939. godine (1882-1971), glazba Stravinskog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> composer who was born in Russia but lived in the United States after 1939 (1882-1971) [Igor Fyodorovich Stravinsky, Igor Stravinsky]</p><p><i>n.</i> the music of Stravinsky</p><p><b>Od ili u vezi s ili poput ili na način Stravinskija (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or like or in the manner of Stravinsky [Stravinskian]</p><p><b>slama, slamka, ljuska, lupina, slamčica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant fiber used e.g. for making baskets and hats or as fodder</p><p><i>n.</i> material consisting of seed coverings and small pieces of stem or leaves that have been separated from the seeds [chaff, husk, shuck, stalk, stubble]</p><p><i>n.</i> a variable yellow tint [pale yellow, wheat]</p><p><i>n.</i> a thin paper or plastic tube used to suck liquids into the mouth [drinking straw]</p><p><i>v.</i> cover or provide with or as if with straw</p><p><i>v.</i> spread by scattering ("straw" is archaic) [strew]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of a pale yellow color like straw</p><p><b>član radne bande koji nadgleda druge radnike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of a work gang who supervises the other workers [assistant foreman]</p><p><b>Europski žuti cvjetni lisinjak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European yellow-flowered foxglove [Digitalis lutea, yellow foxglove]</p><p><b>slamni šešir, panamski šešir, slamnati šešir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stiff hat made of straw with a flat crown [Panama, Panama hat, boater, leghorn, sailor, skimmer]</p><p><b>strašilo, strašilo za ptice</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person used as a cover for some questionable activity [figurehead, front, front man, nominal head, strawman]</p><p><i>n.</i> a weak or sham argument set up to be easily refuted [strawman]</p><p><i>n.</i> an effigy in the shape of a man to frighten birds away from seeds [bird-scarer, scarecrow, scarer, strawman]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small tropical and subtropical edible mushroom having a white cap and long stem [Chinese mushroom, Volvariella volvacea]</p><p><b>nezvanično glasovanje koje se vodi radi utvrđivanja mišljenja o nekom pitanju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unofficial vote taken to determine opinion on some issue [straw vote]</p><p><b>nezvanično glasovanje koje se vodi radi utvrđivanja mišljenja o nekom pitanju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unofficial vote taken to determine opinion on some issue [straw poll]</p><p><b>Slatko vino od grožđa djelomično sušenog na suncu na lozi ili na slamnim podlogacima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sweet wine from grapes partially sun-dried on the vine or on straw mats</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the color of dry straw [straw-coloured]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the color of dry straw [straw-colored]</p><p><b>jagoda, jagoda-vrtna, vrtna jagoda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sweet fleshy red fruit</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various low perennial herbs with many runners and bearing white flowers followed by edible fruits having many small achenes scattered on the surface of an enlarged red pulpy berry</p><p><i>n.</i> a soft red birthmark [hemangioma simplex, strawberry mark]</p><p><b>Europska godišnja s grmovima zelenkastih cvijeća nakon kojih slijede crveni pulpasti plodovi slični bobici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European annual with clusters of greenish flowers followed by red pulpy berrylike fruit [Chenopodium capitatum, Indian paint, strawberry pigweed]</p><p><b>Uravno listnatog biljka s crvenkastim čunjama i sjemenama, čvrsta grmljava stabla iz jugoistočne Sjedinjenih Država koja imaju drvo koje miriše na klinčeve i mirisne crveno-smeđe cvijeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> upright deciduous plant with crimson pods and seeds [Euonymus americanus, wahoo]</p><p><i>n.</i> hardy shrub of southeastern United States having clove-scented wood and fragrant red-brown flowers [Calycanthus floridus, Carolina allspice, strawberry shrub, sweet shrub]</p><p><b>Daiquiri sa slomljenim jagodama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> daiquiri with crushed strawberries</p><p><b>Istočnoazijska saksifraga s racemama malih crveno-bijih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eastern Asiatic saxifrage with racemes of small red-and-white flowers [Saxifraga sarmentosam, Saxifraga stolonifera, mother-of-thousands, strawberry saxifrage]</p><p><b>mala tropska grmljava stabla koja nose mala žutobijela voća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small tropical shrubby tree bearing small yellowish fruit [Psidium littorale, guava, yellow cattley guava]</p><p><b>urođeni svijetlo crveni površinski vaskularni tumor sličan jagodini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a congenital bright red superficial vascular tumor resembling a strawberry [strawberry hemangioma]</p><p><b>urođeni svijetlo crveni površinski vaskularni tumor sličan jagodini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a congenital bright red superficial vascular tumor resembling a strawberry [strawberry haemangioma]</p><p><b>Sladoled s okusom svježih jagode (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ice cream flavored with fresh strawberries</p><p><b>napravljen od jagode (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> made with strawberries [strawberry preserves]</p><p><b>mekano crveno urođeno mrlje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a soft red birthmark [hemangioma simplex, strawberry]</p><p><b>Europska godišnja s grmovima zelenkastih cvijeća nakon kojih slijede crveni pulpasti plodovi slični bobici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> European annual with clusters of greenish flowers followed by red pulpy berrylike fruit [Chenopodium capitatum, Indian paint, strawberry blite]</p><p><b>napravljen od jagode (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> made with strawberries [strawberry jam]</p><p><b>Istočnoazijska saksifraga s racemama malih crveno-bijih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eastern Asiatic saxifrage with racemes of small red-and-white flowers [Saxifraga sarmentosam, Saxifraga stolonifera, mother-of-thousands, strawberry geranium]</p><p><b>čvrsta grmljava stabla iz jugoistočne Sjedinjenih Država koja imaju drvo koje miriše na klinčeve i mirisne crveno-smeđe cvijeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hardy shrub of southeastern United States having clove-scented wood and fragrant red-brown flowers [Calycanthus floridus, Carolina allspice, strawberry bush, sweet shrub]</p><p><b>Stari kosmati godišnji iz istočne Sjeverne Amerike s slatko žutim plodovima, dekorativne američke godišnje s okruglim mesnim žutim bojama zatvorenim u školjku nalik mjehuru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> stout hairy annual of eastern North America with sweet yellow fruits [Physalis pruinosa, dwarf cape gooseberry]</p><p><i>n.</i> decorative American annual having round fleshy yellow berries enclosed in a bladderlike husk [Physalis pubescens, downy ground cherry]</p><p><b>malo večnozeleno europsko grmlje koje nosi mnogo sjeme crvene bobice koje su jestive, ali slabe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small evergreen European shrubby tree bearing many-seeded scarlet berries that are edible but bland [Arbutus unedo, Irish strawberry]</p><p><b>za proizvodnju proizvoda iz poglavlja II. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrubs or small trees having aromatic bark [Calycanthaceae, calycanthus family, family Calycanthace