ious attention to rules and details [stringency]</p><p><i>n.</i> uncompromising resolution [sternness]</p><p><b>suženje, stenoza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> abnormal narrowing of a bodily canal or passageway [stenosis]</p><p><i>n.</i> severe criticism</p><p><b>dugi korak, korak, krupno koračati, napredak, prekoračiti, stopa, koračati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a step in walking or running [pace, tread]</p><p><i>n.</i> the distance covered by a step [footstep, pace, step]</p><p><i>n.</i> significant progress (especially in the phrase `make strides')</p><p><i>v.</i> walk with long steps</p><p><i>v.</i> cover or traverse by taking long steps</p><p><b>s tonom visokog tonusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> having the timbre of a loud high-pitched sound [shrillness, stridency]</p><p><b>s tonom visokog tonusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> having the timbre of a loud high-pitched sound [shrillness, stridence]</p><p><b>gromki, kreštav, oštar, piskav, prodoran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> conspicuously and offensively loud [blatant, clamant, clamorous, vociferous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of speech sounds produced by forcing air through a constricted passage (as `f', `s', `z', or `th' in both `thin' and `then') [continuant, fricative, sibilant, spirant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being sharply insistent on being heard [shrill]</p><p><i>adj.</i> unpleasantly loud and harsh [raucous]</p><p><b>gromki, kreštav, oštar, piskav, prodoran (od &quot;strident&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a strident manner</p><p><b>dugi korak, korak, krupno koračati, napredak, prekoračiti (od &quot;stride&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who walks rapidly with long steps</p><p><b>zvuk zvižduka pri disanju (obično se čuje pri nadahnuću) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a whistling sound when breathing (usually heard on inspiration)</p><p><b>stvaraju škrkavu škripuću buku trljanjem posebnih tjelesnih struktura. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a shrill creaking noise by rubbing together special bodily structures [clitter]</p><p><b>Škrkavo škrkanje ili čirkanj