/p><p><i>v.</i> indicate (a certain time) by striking</p><p><i>v.</i> affect or afflict suddenly, usually adversely [hit]</p><p><i>v.</i> stop work in order to press demands [walk out]</p><p><i>v.</i> touch or seem as if touching visually or audibly [fall, shine]</p><p><i>v.</i> attain [come to]</p><p><i>v.</i> produce by manipulating keys or strings of musical instruments [hit]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to form (an electric arc) between electrodes of an arc lamp</p><p><i>v.</i> find unexpectedly [attain, chance on, chance upon, come across, come upon, discover, fall upon, happen upon, light upon]</p><p><i>v.</i> produce by ignition or a blow</p><p><i>v.</i> remove by erasing or crossing out or as if by drawing a line [excise, expunge, scratch]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to experience suddenly [come to, hit]</p><p><i>v.</i> drive something violently into a location [hit]</p><p><i>v.</i> occupy or take on [assume, take, take up]</p><p><i>v.</i> disassemble a temporary structure, such as a tent or a theatrical set</p><p><i>v.</i> form by stamping, punching, or printing [coin, mint]</p><p><i>v.</i> smooth with a strickle [strickle]</p><p><i>v.</i> pierce with force</p><p><i>v.</i> arrive at after reckoning, deliberating, and weighing</p><p><b>negativno utječe na (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> affect adversely</p><p><b>pogoditi pravu žicu</b></p><p><i>v.</i> create an emotional response</p><p><i>v.</i> refer to or be relevant or familiar to [hit home, strike a note, strike home]</p><p><i>v.</i> evoke a reaction, response, or emotion [touch a chord]</p><p><b>odnositi se na ili biti relevantni ili poznati za (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> refer to or be relevant or familiar to [hit home, strike a chord, strike home]</p><p><b>uzvraćaju udarac, uzvratiti udarac</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a counterattack and return like for like, especially evil for evil [retaliate]</p><p><b>obarati, oboriti, povaliti, povaljivati, rušiti, srušiti, svaliti, svaljivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> declare null and void [cancel]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to die, especially suddenly</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to fall by or as if by delivering a blow [cut down, drop, fell]</p><p><b>učiniti besmislenim, kao što je iznenađenje ili šokiranje (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> render speechless, as by surprising or shocking</p><p><b>Napravi oštar udarac ili gurni. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> deliver a sharp blow or push [knock]</p><p><b>odnositi se na ili biti relevantni ili poznati za (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> refer to or be relevant or familiar to [hit home, strike a chord, strike a note]</p><p><b>netko tko vodi štrajk (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who leads a strike</p><p><b>brisati, izbrisati, križati, maknuti, micati, otpisati, otpisivati, prekrižiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove from a list [cross off, cross out, mark, strike out]</p><p><b>izbiti, brisati, izbrisati, križati, maknuti, micati, otpisati, otpisivati, prekrižiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> remove from a list [cross off, cross out, mark, strike off]</p><p><i>v.</i> put out or be put out by a strikeout</p><p><i>v.</i> be unsuccessful in an endeavor</p><p><i>v.</i> make a motion as with one's fist or foot towards an object or away from one's body</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to get out [retire]</p><p><i>v.</i> set out on a course of action</p><p><b>Novac plaćen štrajkeri iz sindikalnih fondova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> money paid to strikers from union funds</p><p><b>Počnite svirati., Počnite (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> start playing [sound off]</p><p><i>v.</i> begin</p><p><b>(baseball) područje iznad domaćeg ploče između batera koljena i ramena kroz koje must pitch proći kako bi se nazvao udarac (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) the area over home plate between a batter's knees and shoulders through which a pitch must pass in order to be called a strike</p><p><b>geološka pukotina u kojoj se jedna od susjednih površina čini da se pomakla horizontalno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a geological fault in which one of the adjacent surfaces appears to have moved horizontally</p><p><b>zatvorena ili imobilizirana udarom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> closed or immobilized by a strike</p><p><b>štrajkbreher, štrajkolomac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who works (or provides workers) during a strike [blackleg, rat, scab]</p><p><b>Svrha: Svrha: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> confrontational activities intended to break up a strike by workers</p><p><b>precrtavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an out resulting from the batter getting three strikes</p><p><b>član navalnog reda, napadač, štrajkaš, udarač, udarni mehanizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a forward on a soccer team</p><p><i>n.</i> someone receiving intensive training for a naval technical rating</p><p><i>n.</i> an employee on strike against an employer</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who hits [hitter]</p><p><i>n.</i> the part of a mechanical device that strikes something</p><p><b>izvanredan, neobičan, upadljiv, dodir, doticaj, kontakt, udarac, udaranje, istaknut</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the physical coming together of two or more things [contact, impinging]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of contacting one thing with another [hit, hitting]</p><p><i>adj.</i> sensational in appearance or thrilling in effect [dramatic, spectacular]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a quality that thrusts itself into attention [outstanding, prominent, salient, spectacular]</p><p><b>izvanredan, neobičan, upadljiv (od &quot;striking&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a striking manner</p><p><b>izvanredan, neobičan, upadljiv (od &quot;striking&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being salient [salience, saliency]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of standing out strongly and distinctly [boldness]</p><p><b>Švedski dramaturg i romanopisac (1849-1912) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Swedish dramatist and novelist (1849-1912) [August Strindberg, Johan August Strindberg]</p><p><b>gudački, konop, nanizati, napeti, niz, niz podataka, postaviti, povezani niz znakova ili bitova koji djeluju kao j, snabdjeti žicom, struna, tetiva, uzica, vrpca, zamka, žica, niska, nit, gudaći instrument, gudački instrument, gudačko glazbalo, red, slijed, tok, navesti, navlačiti, navoditi, navući, nizati, udjenuti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lightweight cord [twine]</p><p><i>n.</i> stringed instruments that are played with a bow [bowed stringed instrument]</p><p><i>n.</i> a tightly stretched cord of wire or gut, as a part of an instrument or a tennis racket</p><p><i>n.</i> a sequentially ordered set of things or events or ideas in which each successive member is related to the preceding [train]</p><p><i>n.</i> a linear sequence (as of characters, words, proteins, etc.)</p><p><i>n.</i> a tie consisting of a cord that goes through a seam around an opening [drawing string, drawstring]</p><p><i>n.</i> a tough piece of fiber in vegetables, meat, or other food (especially the tough fibers connecting the two halves of a bean pod)</p><p><i>n.</i> (cosmology) a hypothetical one-dimensional subatomic particle having a concentration of energy and the dynamic properties of a flexible loop [cosmic string]</p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of objects threaded on a single strand</p><p><i>n.</i> a necklace made by stringing objects together [chain, strand]</p><p><i>v.</i> thread on or as if on a string [draw, thread]</p><p><i>v.</i> add as if on a string [string up]</p><p><i>v.</i> move or come along [string along]</p><p><i>v.</i> stretch out or arrange like a string</p><p><i>v.</i> string together</p><p><i>v.</i> remove the stringy parts of</p><p><i>v.</i> provide with strings</p><p><b>prevariti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> move or come along [string]</p><p><b>kontrabas</b></p><p><i>n.</i> largest and lowest member of the violin family [bass fiddle, bass viol, bull fiddle, contrabass, double bass]</p><p><b>Zeleni grah sa konicama koje se moraju ukloniti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> green beans with strings that must be removed</p><p><b>sir koji se formira u dugim nitima koje su isprepletene zajedno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cheese formed in long strings twisted together</p><p><b>linija preko bilijardnog st