h plodova ili špinata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mushrooms stuffed with any of numerous mixtures of e.g. meats or nuts or seafood or spinach</p><p><b>parovane zelene paprike napunjene obično rižom i mesom i kratko pečene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> parboiled green peppers stuffed usually with rice and meat and baked briefly</p><p><b>dosadan koji je izuzetno formalan, pompozan i staromodan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bore who is extremely formal, pompous, and old-fashioned</p><p><b>U slučaju da je proizvod namijenjen za proizvodnju hrane, u slučaju da je proizvod namijenjen za proizvodnju hrane, u slučaju da je proizvod namijenjen za proizvodnju hrane, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, ne smije se upotrebljavati., U slučaju da je proizvod proizveden u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, proizvedeni su: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tomato cases filled with various salad mixtures and served cold [cold stuffed tomato]</p><p><i>n.</i> tomato cases filled with various mixtures and baked briefly [hot stuffed tomato]</p><p><b>građa, ispuniti, kljukati, materijal, nadjenuti, natrpati, popuniti, predmet, puniti, roba, stvar, stvari, sukno, štof, tvar, začepiti (od &quot;stuff&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a craftsman who stuffs and mounts the skins of animals for display [animal stuffer, taxidermist]</p><p><i>n.</i> an advertising circular that is enclosed with other material and (usually) sent by mail</p><p><b>lako uvredljiv, mlak, sparan, zagušljiv (od &quot;stuffy&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a stuffy manner [stodgily]</p><p><b>stanje obstrukcije ili zaustavljanja ili zraka u nosu ili grlu, kvaliteta blizine i loše provjetrenja, tupa i pompozna gravitacija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> state of obstruction or stoppage or air in the nose or throat</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being close and poorly ventilated [closeness]</p><p><i>n.</i> dull and pompous gravity [stodginess]</p><p><b>brtvilo, ispunjavanje, materijal za tapeciranje, nadjev, ono čime se što puni, punjenje, tijesnilo, tjesnilo, uložak za brtvljenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mixture of seasoned ingredients used to stuff meats and vegetables [dressing]</p><p><i>n.</i> padding put in mattresses and cushions and upholstered furniture</p><p><b>brtvenica, obočje brtvenice, šupernica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small chamber in which packing is compressed around a reciprocating shaft or piston to form a seal [packing box]</p><p><b>orašasti štap koji se koristi za stiskanje kutije za punjenje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a nut used to tighten a stuffing box [packing nut]</p><p><b>lako uvredljiv, mlak, sparan, zagušljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking fresh air [airless, close, unaired]</p><p><i>adj.</i> excessively conventional and unimaginative and hence dull [stodgy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> affected with a sensation of stoppage or obstruction</p><p><b>ismijavanje nekoga ili nešto kao glupo ili apsurdno ili nedosljedno, čin stvaranja nečeg uzaludnog i beskorisnog (kao što je rutina) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> derision of someone or something as foolish or absurd or inconsistent [befooling]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of making something futile and useless (as by routine) [constipation, deadening, impairment]</p><p><b>izvrći ruglu, napraviti glupim, osakatiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> prove to be of unsound mind or demonstrate someone's incompetence</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to appear foolish</p><p><i>v.</i> deprive of strength or efficiency [cripple]</p><p><b>greška, posrnuti, poticaj, smetnja, spotaći se, spotaknuti se, spoticanje, zapeti, posrtaj, pogriješiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unsteady uneven gait [lurch, stagger]</p><p><i>n.</i> an unintentional but embarrassing blunder [misstep, trip, trip-up]</p><p><i>v.</i> walk unsteadily [bumble, falter]</p><p><i>v.</i> miss a step and fall or nearly fall [trip]</p><p><i>v.</i> encounter by chance [hit]</p><p><i>v.</i> make an error [slip up, trip up]</p><p><b>Drugi razred nagradni borac., Neugodna glupa osoba. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a second-rate prize fighter [palooka]</p><p><i>n.</i> an awkward stupid person [clod, gawk, goon, lout, lubber, lummox, lump, oaf]</p><p><b>posrtač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a walker or runner who trips and almost falls [tripper]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who makes mistakes because of incompetence [blunderer, botcher, bumbler, bungler, butcher, fuckup, fumbler, sad sack]</p><p><b>bilo kakve prepreke ili prepreke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any obstacle or impediment</p><p><b>batrljak, klada, krnjadak, krnjatak, panj, pikavac, zbuniti, ambon, govornica, katedra, podij, postolje, povišeni podij, pozornica, propovjedaonica, stupati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the base part of a tree that remains standing after the tree has been felled [tree stump]</p><p><i>n.</i> the part of a limb or tooth that remains after the rest is removed</p><p><i>n.</i> (cricket) any of three upright wooden posts that form the wicket</p><p><i>n.</i> a platform raised above the surrounding level to give prominence to the person on it [ambo, dais, podium, pulpit, rostrum, soapbox]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be perplexed or confounded [mix up]</p><p><i>v.</i> walk heavily [stamp, stomp]</p><p><i>v.</i> travel through a district and make political speeches</p><p><i>v.</i> remove tree stumps from</p><p><b>politička govornica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> political oratory</p><p><b>oštra lopata za kopanje korijena i korova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sharp hand shovel for digging out roots and weeds [spud]</p><p><b>batrljak, klada, krnjadak, krnjatak, panj, pikavac, zbuniti (od &quot;stump&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a particularly difficult or baffling question or problem [poser, sticker, toughie]</p><p><b>batrljak, klada, krnjadak, krnjatak, panj, pikavac, zbuniti (od &quot;stump&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> campaigning for something by making political speeches (stump speeches)</p><p><b>Živi u potokima od Južne Karoline do Floride. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inhabits streams from South Carolina to Florida [Lepomis punctatus, spotted sunfish]</p><p><b>kratak i debeo</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> short and thick [chunky, dumpy, low-set, squat, squatty]</p><p><b>onesvijestiti, ošamutiti, preneraziti, zabezeknuti, zaglušiti, zapaniti, omamiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make senseless or dizzy by or as if by a blow [stupefy]</p><p><i>v.</i> hit something or somebody as if with a sandbag [sandbag]</p><p><i>v.</i> overcome as with astonishment or disbelief [bedaze, daze]</p><p><b>oružje koje je dizajnirano za privremeno onesposobljavanje žrtve ispuštanjem ne-letalnog visokonapetostnog električnog udaraca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a weapon designed to disable a victim temporarily by delivering a nonlethal high-voltage electric shock [stun gun]</p><p><b>oružje koje je dizajnirano za privremeno onesposobljavanje žrtve ispuštanjem ne-letalnog visokonapetostnog električnog udaraca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a weapon designed to disable a victim temporarily by delivering a nonlethal high-voltage electric shock [stun baton]</p><p><b>uzbuđen do nestrpljenja ili besa (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> aroused to impatience or anger [annoyed, irritated, miffed, nettled, peeved, pissed, pissed off, riled, roiled, steamed]</p><p><b>oduševljen, onesviješten, ošamućen, zanijet, zaprepašten, zatečen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> filled with the emotional impact of overwhelming surprise or shock [amazed, astonied, astonished, astounded]</p><p><i>adj.</i> knocked unconscious by a heavy blow [KO'd, kayoed, knocked out, out]</p><p><i>adj.</i> in a state of mental numbness especially as resulting from shock [dazed, stupefied, stupid]</p><p><b>izuzetna osoba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a very attractive or seductive looking woman [beauty, dish, knockout, looker, lulu, mantrap, peach, ravisher, smasher, sweetheart]</p><p><i>n.</i> an unexpected and amazing event</p><p><b>iznenadan, zadivljujući</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> commanding attention [arresting, sensational]</p><p><i>adj.</i> causing great astonishment and consternation</p><p><i>adj.</i> causing or capable of causing bewilderment or shock or insensibility</p><p><i>adj.</i> strikingly beautiful or attractive</p><p><b>iznenadan (od &quot;stunning&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a spectacular manner [spectacularly]</p><p><b>akrobacija, podvig, prestanak rasta, senzacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a difficult or unusual or dangerous feat</p><p><i>n.</i> a creature (especially a whale) that has been prevented from attaining full growth</p><p><i>v.</i> check the growth or development of</p><p><i>v.</i> perform a stunt or stunts</p><p><b>Pilot koji putuje po zemlji pružajući izložbe kaskaderskih letova i padobrana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pilot who travels around the country giving exhibits of stunt flying and parachuting [barnstormer, stunt pilot]</p><p><b>Službeni opis: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the performance of stunts while in flight in an aircraft [acrobatics, aerobatics, stunting]</p><p><b>manevrirani zmajev koji se upravlja s dvije linije i leti objema rukama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a maneuverable kite controlled by two lines and flown with both hands [sport kite]</p><p><b>dubler, dvojnik, kaskader</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stand-in for movie stars to perform dangerous stunts [double, stunt woman]</p><p><b>Pilot koji putuje po zemlji pružajući izložbe kaskaderskih letova i padobrana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pilot who travels around the country giving exhibits of stunt flying and parachuting [barnstormer, stunt flier]</p><p><b>dubler, dvojnik, kaskader</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stand-in for movie stars to perform dangerous stunts [double, stunt man]</p><p><b>malog rasta, usporava, zakržljao</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> inferior in size or quality [scrawny, scrubby]</p><p><b>malog rasta, usporava, zakržljao (od &quot;stunted&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> smallness of stature [puniness, runtiness]</p><p><b>akrobacija, podvig, prestanak rasta, senzacija (od &quot;stunt&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the performance of stunts while in flight in an aircraft [acrobatics, aerobatics, stunt flying]</p><p><b>svetište u obliku kupole koje su podigli budisti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dome-shaped shrine erected by Buddhists [tope]</p><p><b>vruć oblog</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is not very bright [dolt, dullard, pillock, poor fish, pudden-head, pudding head, stupid, stupid person]</p><p><b>omamljenost, otupjelost, zapanjenost, zaprepaštenost, zaprepaštenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of stupefied astonishment</p><p><i>n.</i> marginal consciousness [grogginess, semiconsciousness, stupor]</p><p><i>n.</i> the action of stupefying</p><p><b>zaprepašten</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> as if struck dumb with astonishment and surprise [dumbfounded, dumbstricken, dumbstruck, dumfounded, flabbergasted, thunderstruck]</p><p><i>adj.</i> in a state of mental numbness especially as resulting from shock [dazed, stunned, stupid]</p><p><b>omamiti, skameniti, začuditi, zapanjiti, frapirati, preneraziti, preneražavati, smesti, smetati, zabezeknuti, zadiviti, zapanjivati, zaprepastiti, zaprepašćivati, zbuniti, zbunjivati, zgranjivati, zgranuti, onesvijestiti, ošamutiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make dull or stupid or muddle with drunkenness or infatuation [besot]</p><p><i>v.</i> be a mystery or bewildering to [amaze, baffle, beat, bewilder, dumbfound, flummox, get, gravel, mystify, nonplus, perplex, pose, puzzle, stick, vex]</p><p><i>v.</i> make senseless or dizzy by or as if by a blow [stun]</p><p><b>zapanjujući, začuđujući</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> so surprisingly impressive as to stun or overwhelm [astonishing, astounding, staggering]</p><p><i>adj.</i> making physically stupid or dull or insensible</p><p><i>adj.</i> shocking with surprise and consternation</p><p><b>čudan, čudesan, divan, izvanredan, neobičan, ogroman, zapanjujući, značajan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> so great in size or force or extent as to elicit awe [colossal, prodigious]</p><p><b>čudan, čudesan, divan, izvanredan, neobičan, ogroman, zapanjujući, značajan (od &quot;stupendous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to a stupendous degree</p><p><b>bedak, bedast, budalast, glup, glupi, idiotski, tup, zatupljujući, neinteligentan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is not very bright [dolt, dullard, pillock, poor fish, pudden-head, pudding head, stupe, stupid person]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking or marked by lack of intellectual acuity</p><p><i>adj.</i> in a state of mental numbness especially as resulting from shock [dazed, stunned, stupefied]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking intelligence [unintelligent]</p><p><b>Osoba koja nije jako pametna. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who is not very bright [dolt, dullard, pillock, poor fish, pudden-head, pudding head, stupe, stupid]</p><p><b>glupavost, idiotarija, glupost, tupoglavost, bedastoća, budalaština, ludost, stupidnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a poor ability to understand or to profit from experience</p><p><i>n.</i> a stupid mistake [betise, folly, foolishness, imbecility]</p><p><b>bedak, bedast, budalast, glup, glupi, idiotski, tup, zatupljujući (od &quot;stupid&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a stupid manner [doltishly]</p><p><b>mrtvilo, omama, ošamućenost, otupjelost, ukočenost, utrnulost, šok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the feeling of distress and disbelief that you have when something bad happens accidentally [daze, shock]</p><p><i>n.</i> marginal consciousness [grogginess, semiconsciousness, stupefaction]</p><p><b>zatupio</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> stunned or confused and slow to react (as from blows or drunkenness or exhaustion) [dazed, foggy, groggy, logy]</p><p><b>čvrst, jedar, krupan, nepopustljiv, otporan, robustan, snažan, uporan (od &quot;sturdy&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a sturdy manner</p><p><b>stanje snažnog i robusnog, svojstvo nečega što je snažno izgrađeno, odlučnost koja se pokazuje snagom karaktera (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being vigorous and robust</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of something that is strongly built</p><p><i>n.</i> resoluteness evidenced by strength of character</p><p><b>čvrst, jedar, krupan, nepopustljiv, ot