im cvjetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sprawling shrubby perennial noted for its scarlet black-marked flowers [Clianthus formosus, Clianthus speciosus, Sturt pea, desert pea]</p><p><b>mucanje, mucati, zamuckivanje, zamuckivati, petljati, zamucati, zapeti, zapinjati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a speech disorder involving hesitations and involuntary repetitions of certain sounds [stammer]</p><p><i>v.</i> speak haltingly [bumble, falter, stammer]</p><p><b>mucavac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who speaks with involuntary pauses and repetitions [stammerer]</p><p><b>Stuttgart</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in southwestern Germany famous for innovative architecture</p><p><b>posljednji holandski kolonijalni administrator Nove Nizozemske. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the last Dutch colonial administrator of New Netherland [Peter Stuyvesant, Petrus Stuyvesant]</p><p><b>čmičak, čmičak (na oku), kotac, svinjac, ječmenac, obor, svinjara</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an infection of the sebaceous gland of the eyelid [eye infection, hordeolum, stye]</p><p><i>n.</i> a pen for swine [pigpen, pigsty]</p><p><b>ječmenac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an infection of the sebaceous gland of the eyelid [eye infection, hordeolum, sty]</p><p><b>pakleno., Tamno i tužno kao rijeka Akeron i Styx u Hadesu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> hellish</p><p><i>adj.</i> dark and dismal as of the rivers Acheron and Styx in Hades [Acheronian, Acherontic]</p><p><b>dizajn, izradba, moda, način, naslov, pero, pisaljka, stil, stilistika, vrsta pisma, format, stila, stilom, stil izražavanja, trend, "Elana", stilus, štap za urezivanje, štapić za crtanje, štapić za pisanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> how something is done or how it happens [fashion, manner, mode, way]</p><p><i>n.</i> a way of expressing something (in language or art or music etc.) that is characteristic of a particular person or group of people or period [expressive style]</p><p><i>n.</i> a particular kind (as to appearance)</p><p><i>n.</i> the popular taste at a given time [trend, vogue]</p><p