alised, conventionalized, stylized]</p><p><b>elegantan, gizdav, koji je po modi, koji odgovara nekom stilu, otmjen, sa stilom, sjajan, elegentan, moderan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having elegance or taste or refinement in manners or dress [fashionable]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being or in accordance with current social fashions [fashionable]</p><p><b>elegantan, gizdav, koji je po modi, koji odgovara nekom stilu, otmjen, sa stilom, sjajan (od &quot;stylish&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a stylish manner</p><p><b>elegantan, gizdav, koji je po modi, koji odgovara nekom stilu, otmjen, sa stilom, sjajan (od &quot;stylish&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> elegance by virtue of being fashionable [chic, chichi, chicness, last word, modishness, smartness, swank]</p><p><b>stilista</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artist who is a master of a particular style</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who cuts or beautifies hair [hairdresser, hairstylist, styler]</p><p><b>stilistika, stilski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to style (especially in the use of language)</p><p><b>Retorički stilski način. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a rhetorically stylistic manner</p><p><b>Rani kršćanski asket koji je živio na vrhu visokih stubova. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an early Christian ascetic who lived on top of high pillars</p><p><b>stilizacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of stylizing [stylisation]</p><p><b>predstavljaju prema konvencionalnom stilu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> represent according to a conventional style [conventionalize, stylise]</p><p><b>korištenje umjetničkih oblika i konvencija za stvaranje efekata (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> using artistic forms and conventions to create effects [conventionalised, conventionalized, stylised]</p><p><b>proteže se od temelja grločne kosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extends from the base of the temporal bone</p><p><b>vena koja izlijeva bubnjevu i isprazni u retromandibularnu venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that drains the tympanic cavity and empties into the retromandibular vein [