ales [family Styracaceae, storax family, styrax family]</p><p><b>neobičan ceratopsijski dinosaurus s mnogim velikim šiljcima oko ruba njegove kostne frill i dugog nosa rog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unusual ceratopsian dinosaur having many large spikes around the edge of its bony frill and a long nose horn [styracosaurus]</p><p><b>neobičan ceratopsijski dinosaurus s mnogim velikim šiljcima oko ruba njegove kostne frill i dugog nosa rog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unusual ceratopsian dinosaur having many large spikes around the edge of its bony frill and a long nose horn [styracosaur]</p><p><b>bilo koji grm ili malo stablo rodova Styrax s mirisnim cvjetovima u obliku zvona koji visi ispod tamnozelenih listova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any shrub or small tree of the genus Styrax having fragrant bell-shaped flowers that hang below the dark green foliage</p><p><b>široko rasprostranjena obitelj grmova i stabala red Ebenales (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a widely distributed family of shrubs and trees of order Ebenales [Styracaceae, family Styracaceae, storax family]</p><p><b>grmovi iz Kine i Japana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shrubby tree of China and Japan [Japanese snowbell]</p><p><b>malo stablo porijeklom iz Japana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small tree native to Japan [snowbell]</p><p><b>Styrax iz jugozapadnih Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> styrax of southwestern United States [Texas snowbell, Texas snowbells]</p><p><b>bezbožna uljasta tekućina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless oily liquid [cinnamene, phenylethylene, vinylbenzene]</p><p><b>stiropor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a light resilient foam of polystyrene</p><p><b>Američki pisac najpoznatiji po svojim romanima (rođen 1925.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer best known for his novels (born in 1925) [William Styron]</p><p><b>Stiks</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) a river in Hades across which Charon carried dead souls [River Styx]</p><p><b>biti podložan uvjeravanju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being