e]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s ili smještena u regiji južno od pustinje Sahare (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or situated in the region south of the Sahara Desert</p><p><b>supsaharska Afrika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the region of Africa to the south of the Sahara Desert [Black Africa]</p><p><b>Svaka vrsta ispitivanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of a battery of related tests</p><p><b>nakiseo</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> slightly sour to the taste</p><p><b>manje od akutne (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> less than acute</p><p><b>hronična bakterijska infekcija endokarda i srčanih zalisaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chronic bacterial infection of the endocardium and heart valves</p><p><b>rijetka hronična progresivna encefalitis uzrokovana virusom ospica i uglavnom se javlja kod djece i mladih odraslih osoba. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rare chronic progressive encephalitis caused by the measles virus and occurring primarily in children and young adults [Bosin's disease, Dawson's encephalitis, SSPE, Van Bogaert encephalitis, inclusion body encephalitis, sclerosing leukoencephalitis, subacute sclerosing leukoencephalitis, subacute sclerosing panencephalitis]</p><p><b>rijetka hronična progresivna encefalitis uzrokovana virusom ospica i uglavnom se javlja kod djece i mladih odraslih osoba. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rare chronic progressive encephalitis caused by the measles virus and occurring primarily in children and young adults [Bosin's disease, Dawson's encephalitis, SSPE, Van Bogaert encephalitis, inclusion body encephalitis, sclerosing leukoencephalitis, subacute inclusion body encephalitis, subacute sclerosing panencephalitis]</p><p><b>rijetka hronična progresivna encefalitis uzrokovana virusom ospica i uglavnom se javlja kod djece i mladih odraslih osoba. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rare chronic progressive encephalitis caused by the measles virus and occurring primarily in children and young adults [Bosin's disease, Dawson's encephalitis, SSPE, Van Bogaert encephalitis, inclusion body encephalitis, sclerosing leukoencephalitis, subacute inclusion body encephalitis, subacute sclerosing leukoencephalitis]</p><p><b>uzgoj na velikim visinama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> growing at high altitudes [alpestrine]</p><p><b>srednjo visok drveni drvo iz Skalnih planina s uskom koničnom do stupničkom krunom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medium-tall timber tree of the Rocky Mountains having a narrowly conic to columnar crown [Abies lasiocarpa, Alpine fir]</p><p><b>srednjo veličine šarša iz Skaljnih planina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medium-sized larch of the Rocky Mountains [Larix lyallii]</p><p><b>podčinjen, potčinjen</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a British commissioned army officer below the rank of captain</p><p><i>adj.</i> inferior in rank or status [junior-grade, lower-ranking, lowly, petty, secondary]</p><p><b>uzgoj ili ostajanje pod vodom, dijelom vodeni (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> growing or remaining under water [subaqueous, submerged, submersed, underwater]</p><p><i>adj.</i> partially aquatic [semiaquatic]</p><p><b>uzgoj ili ostajanje pod vodom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> growing or remaining under water [subaquatic, submerged, submersed, underwater]</p><p><b>prostor u meningima ispod arahnoidne membrane i iznad pia mater koji sadrži cerebrospinalnu tekućinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a space in the meninges beneath the arachnoid membrane and above the pia mater that contains the cerebrospinal fluid</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s geografskim širinama južno od arktičkog kruga (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to latitudes just south of the Arctic Circle</p><p><b>(voda) koja se prirodno uzdiže u bunaru na visinu znatno iznad površine okolne vodene površine, ali ne teče iz bunara (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of water) rising naturally in a well to a height appreciably above that of the surrounding water table but not flowing out of the well</p><p><b>subatomske, subatomski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to constituents of the atom or forces within the atom</p><p><i>adj.</i> of smaller than atomic dimensions</p><p><b>čestica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a body having finite mass and internal structure but negligible dimensions [particle]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se ne upotrebljava u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, točka 1. točka (b) ovog članka ne vrijedi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the lowest molding of an architectural base or of a baseboard</p><p><b>rad kao zamjena za nekoga tko je bolestan ili na odsustvu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> working as a substitute for someone who is ill or on leave of absence [substituting]</p><p><b>podrazred</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) a taxonomic category below a class and above an order</p><p><b>podklasa Sporozoa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a subclass of Sporozoa [Acnidosporidia]</p><p><b>Heliozoani (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heliozoans [Actinopoda]</p><p><b>jedan od četiri podklase ili superredova monocotyledona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of four subclasses or superorders of Monocotyledones [Alismatidae]</p><p><b>klasa gastropoda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a class of Gastropoda [Amphineura]</p><p><b>najstariji poznati gmizavci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> oldest known reptiles [Anapsida]</p><p><b>primitivne fosilne ptice poput gmizavaca iz Jure ili ranog krede (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> primitive reptile-like fossil birds of the Jurassic or early Cretaceous [Archaeornithes]</p><p><b>veliki potklasa gmizavaca s dipsidima uključujući: krokodile (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large subclass of diapsid reptiles including: crocodiles [Archosauria]</p><p><b>jedan od četiri podklase ili superred Monocotyledones (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of four subclasses or superorder of Monocotyledones [Arecidae]</p><p><b>skupina uglavnom simpatičnih biljaka i nekih stabala i grmova uglavnom s 2 spojena karpela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of mostly sympetalous herbs and some trees and shrubs mostly with 2 fused carpels [Asteridae]</p><p><b>primitivni vodeni životnici uglavnom slatkovodni rakovi: škampi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> primitive aquatic mainly freshwater crustaceans: fairy shrimps [Branchiopoda]</p><p><b>skupina obitelji uglavnom cvijeća s baznom ili centralnom posteljicom i trinukleatnim peludom (binukleatni pelud češći je u cvjetnim biljkama) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of families of mostly flowers having basal or central placentation and trinucleate pollen (binucleate pollen is commoner in flowering plants) [Caryophyllidae]</p><p><b>škrge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> barnacles [Cirripedia]</p><p><b>paraziti jednokostiju donjih kralježnjaka i beskičmenjaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> single-host parasites of lower vertebrates and invertebrates [Cnidosporidia]</p><p><b>jedan od četiri podklase ili superredova monocotyledona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of four subclasses or superorders of Monocotyledones [Commelinidae]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (c) ovog (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> minute planktonic or parasitic crustaceans [Copepoda]</p><p><b>ribama s parovima peraca koji liče na udove i koje se smatraju predcima vodozemaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fishes having paired fins resembling limbs and regarded as ancestral to amphibians [Crossopterygii]</p><p><b>U prethodnim klasifikacijama koristi se za sve žive gmizavce osim kornjača. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used in former classifications to include all living reptiles except turtles [Diapsida]</p><p><b>dvoškržnjaci, podrazred Dibranchia, podrazred Dibranchiata</b></p><p><i>n.</i> comprising all living cephalopods except the family Nautilidae: the orders Octopoda (octopuses) and Decapoda (squids and cuttlefish) [Dibranchia, Dibranchiata, subclass Dibranchiata]</p><p><b>dvoškržnjaci, podrazred Dibranchia, podrazred Dibranchiata</b></p><p><i>n.</i> comprising all living cephalopods except the family Nautilidae: the orders Octopoda (octopuses) and Decapoda (squids and cuttlefish) [Dibranchia, Dibranchiata, subclass Dibranchia]</p><p><b>skupina obitelji više ili manje naprednih stabala i grmova i biljaka s ili polipetalnim ili gamopetalnim korolama i često s jajnikave pričvršćenim na zidove jajnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of families of more or less advanced trees and shrubs and herbs having either polypetalous or gamopetalous corollas and often with ovules attached to the walls of the ovary [Dilleniidae]</p><p><b>riblje ribe s kostiju na južnoj hemisferi koje dišu modifikovanim zračnim mjehurom i žlijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bony fishes of the southern hemisphere that breathe by a modified air bladder as well as gills [Dipnoi]</p><p><b>velika i taksonomski teška skupina Ascomycetes u kojoj je mesno plodno tijelo diskovo ili čašito. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large and taxonomically difficult group of Ascomycetes in which the fleshy fruiting body is disklike or cup-shaped [Discomycetes]</p><p><b>morski psi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sharks [Elasmobranchii, Selachii, subclass Selachii]</p><p><b>u nekim starijim klasifikacijama uključuje Branchiopoda i Copepoda i Ostracoda i Cirripedia (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in some older classifications includes the Branchiopoda and Copepoda and Ostracoda and Cirripedia [Entomostraca]</p><p><b>Kategorija koja se ne koristi u mnogim sustavima klasifikacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> category not used in many classification systems [Euascomycetes]</p><p><b>košarice zvijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> basket stars [Euryalida]</p><p><b>plodvaši, podrazred Eutheria, podrazred plodvaša, podrazred pravih sisavca, pravi sisavci</b></p><p><i>n.</i> all mammals except monotremes and marsupials [Eutheria]</p><p><b>podklasa insekata za koju se karakterizira postupna i obično nepotpuna metamorfoza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> subclass of insects characterized by gradual and usually incomplete metamorphosis [Exopterygota, Hemimetabola]</p><p><b>skupina uglavnom drvenih biljaka koje se smatraju među najprimitivnijim angiospermima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of chiefly woody plants considered among the most primitive of angiosperms [Hamamelidae]</p><p><b>Kategorija koja se koristi u nekim sustavima klasifikacije za razne bazidomicetne gljivice uključujući hrđave i smute (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> category used in some classification systems for various basidiomycetous fungi including rusts and smuts [Heterobasidiomycetes]</p><p><b>Chimera i izumrli oblici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chimaeras and extinct forms [Holocephali]</p><p><b>Kategorija koja se koristi u nekim sustavima klasifikacije za razne bazidomicetne gljive, uključujući npr. gljive i puffballs koje se obično stavljaju u razrede Gasteromycetes i Hymenomycetes (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> category used in some classification systems for various basidiomycetous fungi including e.g. mushrooms and puffballs which are usually placed in the classes Gasteromycetes and Hymenomycetes [Homobasidiomycetes]</p><p><b>u nekim nedavnim klasifikacijama, koekstenzivna s Ciliata: minijaturni organizmi pronađeni u razgradnom infuziji organske tvari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in some recent classifications, coextensive with the Ciliata: minute organisms found in decomposing infusions of organic matter [Infusoria]</p><p><b>Dijapsidni gmizavci: gušterice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> diapsid reptiles: lizards [Lepidosauria]</p><p><b>jedan od četiri podklase ili superredova monocotyledona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of four subclasses or superorders of Monocotyledones [Liliidae]</p><p><b>skupina obitelji stabala i grmova i biljaka s dobro razvijenim periantama i apokarpnim jajnika i općenito se smatraju najprimitivnijim postojećim cvjetnim biljkama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of families of trees and shrubs and herbs having well-developed perianths and apocarpous ovaries and generally regarded as the most primitive extant flowering plants [Magnoliidae, ranalian complex]</p><p><b>Najveća potklasa krustaca uključujući većinu poznatih morskih, slatkovodnih i kopnenih krustaca: rakovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> largest subclass of Crustacea including most of the well-known marine, freshwater, and terrestrial crustaceans: crabs [Malacostraca]</p><p><b>podrazred Metatheria, podrazred tobolčara, tobolčari</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pouched animals [Metatheria]</p><p><b>krhke zvijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> brittle stars [Ophiurida]</p><p><b>Gastropodi s žlijezde kada su prisutni iza srca i bez operkula: uključuje morske puževe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> gastropods having the gills when present posterior to the heart and having no operculum: includes sea slugs [Opisthobranchia]</p><p><b>Sjemenke škampa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> seed shrimps [Ostracoda]</p><p><b>općenito izumrli sisari široko rasprostranjeni tijekom Jure (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> generalized extinct mammals widespread during the Jurassic [Pantotheria]</p><p><b>biljni flagellati koji sadrže hlorofil (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plantlike flagellates containing chlorophyll [Phytomastigina]</p><p><b>uši (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> echidnas [Prototheria]</p><p><b>korjenonošci, podrazred Rhizopoda, podrazred korijenožaca</b></p><p><i>n.</i> creeping protozoans: amoebas and foraminifers [Rhizopoda]</p><p><b>skupina stabala i grmova i biljaka uglavnom s polipetalnim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of trees and shrubs and herbs mostly with polypetalous flowers [Rosidae]</p><p><b>morski psi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sharks [Elasmobranchii, Selachii, subclass Elasmobranchii]</p><p><b>izumrli gmizavci iz Perma do Jure koji se smatraju predcima sisavaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extinct reptiles of the Permian to Jurassic considered ancestral to mammals [Synapsida]</p><p><b>Velika raznolika skupina rib s kostom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large diverse group of bony fishes [Teleostei]</p><p><b>parazitski sporozoji koji formiraju spore koji sadrže jedan ili više zaraznih sporozoita (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> parasitic sporozoans that form spores containing one or more infective sporozoites [Telosporidia]</p><p><b>u nekim klasifikacijama smatra se filom kraljevstva Protista (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in some classifications considered a phylum of the kingdom Protista [Zoomastigina]</p><p><b>nalazi se ispod ključne kosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> situated beneath the clavicle</p><p><b>potključna arterija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two arteries that supply blood to the neck and arms [arteria subclavia]</p><p><b>nastavak osne vene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a continuation of the axillary vein [vena subclavia]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na fazu razvoja bolesti prije nego što se simptomi primjećuju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to the stage in the development of a disease before the symptoms are observed</p><p><b>Promenljivo oštećenje funkcije kortike, koje se može dokazati samo uz 3 uzbuđenja moždanih valova u sekundi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transient impairment of cortical function demonstrable only by 3-per-second brainwave spikes</p><p><b>pododbor, podsvijest, potkomisija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a subset of committee members organized for a specific purpose</p><p><b>automobil manji od kompaktnog automobila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a car smaller than a compact car [subcompact car]</p><p><b>automobil manji od kompaktnog automobila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a car smaller than a compact car [subcompact]</p><p><b>podsvijestan, podsvjestan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> psychic activity just below the level of awareness [subconscious mind]</p><p><i>adj.</i> just below the level of consciousness</p><p><b>psihička aktivnost ispod razine svijesti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> psychic activity just below the level of awareness [subconscious]</p><p><b>podsvjesno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> from the subconscious mind</p><p><b>podsvijest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state of mind not immediately available to consciousness</p><p><b>velika i posebna kopnena masa (kao što su Indija ili Grenland) koja je poseban dio nekog kontinenta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large and distinctive landmass (as India or Greenland) that is a distinct part of some continent</p><p><b>nuzugovor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a contract assigning to another party some obligations of a prior contract</p><p><i>v.</i> arranged for contracted work to be done by others [farm out, job]</p><p><i>v.</i> work under a subcontract</p><p><b>kooperant, podizvođač, podugovor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who enters into a subcontract with the primary contractor</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s ili biti ili uključivati živčane centre ispod moždane kore (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or being or involving nerve centers below the cerebral cortex</p><p><b>subkultura</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a social group within a national culture that has distinctive patterns of behavior and beliefs</p><p><b>potkožan, potkožna, potkožna primjena, potkožni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or located below the epidermis [hypodermic]</p><p><b>injekcija ispod kože (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an injection under the skin</p><p><b>U slučaju da se ne provede ispitivanje, ispitivanje se provodi na temelju ispitivanja koje se provodi na koži. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of skin test in which the suspected allergen is injected into the skin [intradermal test]</p><p><b>potkožan, potkožna, potkožna primjena, potkožni (od &quot;subcutaneous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> below the skin</p><p><b>Podmnožinu podataka u bazi podataka koji se koriste u određenoj aplikaciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a subset of data in a database that are used in a specific application</p><p><b>svećenik red ispod đakona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clergyman an order below deacon</p><p><b>poddirektorij, podimenik, podređeno radno područje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a direc