arsioidea]</p><p><b>dinosauri sa kratkim prednjim udovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> carnivorous saurischian dinosaurs with short forelimbs [Theropoda]</p><p><b>oklopni dinosauri: stegosauri i ankilosauri (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> armored dinosaurs: stegosaurs and ankylosaurs [Thyreophora, thyreophoran]</p><p><b>U Novom svijetu muha hvatači (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> New World flycatchers [Tyranni]</p><p><b>pasanci, porodica Dasypodidae, porodica pasanaca</b></p><p><i>n.</i> armadillos [Xenarthra]</p><p><b>ptice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> damselflies [Zygoptera]</p><p><b>podčiniti, podčinjen, podložiti, podređen, podređeni, sporedan, subordiniran, zavisan, hiponim, podređena riječ, podređenica, subordinirana riječ, podvrgnuti, niže razine</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an assistant subject to the authority or control of another [foot soldier, subsidiary, underling]</p><p><i>n.</i> a word that is more specific than a given word [hyponym, subordinate word]</p><p><i>v.</i> rank or order as less important or consider of less value</p><p><i>v.</i> make subordinate, dependent, or subservient [subdue]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lower in rank or importance [low-level]</p><p><i>adj.</i> subject or submissive to authority or the control of another</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a clause) unable to stand alone syntactically as a complete sentence [dependent]</p><p><b>Reč u složenoj rečenici koja ne može biti sama kao cjelovita rečenica i koja funkcioniše unutar rečenice kao imenica ili pridjev ili pridjev (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clause in a complex sentence that cannot stand alone as a complete sentence and that functions within the sentence as a noun or adjective or adverb [dependent clause]</p><p><b>spojnica (kao što su `s obzirom' ili `to' ili `ko') koja uvodi ovisnu rečenicu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a conjunction (like `since' or `that' or `who') that introduces a dependent clause [subordinating conjunction]</p><p><b>hiponim, podređena riječ, podređenica, subordinirana riječ</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word that is more specific than a given word [hyponym, subordinate]</p><p><b>podčiniti, podčinjen, podložiti, podređen, podređeni, sporedan, subordiniran, zavisan (od &quot;subordinate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> secondary importance [subsidiarity]</p><p><b>podčiniti, podčinjen, podložiti, podređen, podređeni, sporedan, subordiniran, zavisan (od &quot;subordinate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to connect a subordinate clause to a main clause [subordinative]</p><p><b>podređenost koja se javlja kada spojnica čini jednu jezičku jedinicu sastavnikom druge, spojnica (kao što su `s obzirom' ili `to' ili `ko') koja uvodi ovisnu rečenicu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the subordination that occurs when a conjunction makes one linguistic unit a constituent of another</p><p><i>n.</i> a conjunction (like `since' or `that' or `who') that introduces a dependent clause [subordinate conjunction]</p><p><b>podređenost, hiponimija, subordinacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being subordinate to something</p><p><i>n.</i> the semantic relation of being subordinate or belonging to a lower rank or class [hyponymy]</p><p><i>n.</i> the grammatical relation of a modifying word or phrase to its head</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of obedient submissiveness</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of mastering or subordinating someone [mastery]</p><p><b>služi za povezivanje podređene klauzule s glavnom klauzulom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to connect a subordinate clause to a main clause [subordinating]</p><p><b>podmititi</b></p><p><i>v.</i> incite to commit a crime or an evil deed</p><p><i>v.</i> procure (false testimony or perjury)</p><p><i>v.</i> induce to commit perjury or give false testimony</p><p><b>podmuklo ili neprikladno navesti nekoga da učini nešto neprikladno ili nezakonito, krivokletstvo koje je netko bio uvjeren da daje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> underhandedly or improperly inducing someone to do something improper or unlawful</p><p><i>n.</i> perjured testimony that someone was persuaded to give</p><p><b>(zakon) navodi nekoga da podnese lažnu zakletvu u okviru sudskog postupka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) inducing someone to make a false oath as part of a judicial proceeding</p><p><b>podmititi (od &quot;suborn&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who pays (or otherwise incites) you to commit a wrongful act [briber]</p><p><b>dio dijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a part of a part</p><p><b>(biologija) taksonomska grupa rangirana između filuma i klase (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) a taxonomic group ranking between a phylum and a class</p><p><b>za čizme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lancelets [Cephalochordata]</p><p><b>ribe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fishes [Craniata, Vertebrata, subphylum Vertebrata]</p><p><b>crvi na jeziku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tongue worms [Pentastomida]</p><p><b>plaštenjaci</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tunicates [Tunicata, Urochorda, Urochordata, subphylum Urochorda, subphylum Urochordata]</p><p><b>plaštenjaci</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tunicates [Tunicata, Urochorda, Urochordata, subphylum Tunicata, subphylum Urochordata]</p><p><b>plaštenjaci</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tunicates [Tunicata, Urochorda, Urochordata, subphylum Tunicata, subphylum Urochorda]</p><p><b>ribe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fishes [Craniata, Vertebrata, subphylum Craniata]</p><p><b>poziv na sud</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a writ issued by court authority to compel the attendance of a witness at a judicial proceeding [subpoena ad testificandum]</p><p><i>v.</i> serve or summon with a subpoena</p><p><b>Zakon koji je izdao sudski organ kako bi se prisustvovalo svjedočenju u sudskom postupku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a writ issued by court authority to compel the attendance of a witness at a judicial proceeding [subpoena]</p><p><b>sudski nalog koji je izdao sud na zahtjev jedne od stranaka u tužbi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a writ issued by a court at the request of one of the parties to a suit</p><p><b>populacija koja je dio većeg stanovništva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a population that is part of a larger population</p><p><b>funkcija, potprogram, procedura, rutina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a set sequence of steps, part of larger computer program [function, procedure, routine, subroutine]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u slučaju nesreće osoba koja je uzrokovala nesreću ne može vratiti u društvo osiguranja, u slučaju da se osoba koja je uzrokovala nesreću ne može vratiti u društvo osiguranika, u slučaju da se u slučaju nesreće osoba koja je uzrokovala nesreću ne može vratiti u društvo osiguranika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> substitute one creditor for another, as in the case where an insurance company sues the person who caused an accident for the insured</p><p><b>subrogacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) the act of substituting of one creditor for another</p><p><b>potprogram, subrutina, zatvoreni potprogram, potprogram .zatvore n i potprogram, funkcija, procedura, rutina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a set sequence of steps, part of larger computer program [function, procedure, routine, subprogram]</p><p><b>biblioteka, programska biblioteka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computing) a collection of standard programs and subroutines that are stored and available for immediate use [library, program library]</p><p><b>obavezati se, obvezati se, potpisati, potpisati se, pretplati, pretplatiti, pretplatiti se, slagati se, pretplatiti se (na komunikacijsku uslugu), autogram, potpisivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> offer to buy, as of stocks and shares</p><p><i>v.</i> mark with one's signature [sign]</p><p><i>v.</i> adopt as a belief [support]</p><p><i>v.</i> pay (an amount of money) as a contribution to a charity or service, especially at regular intervals [pledge]</p><p><i>v.</i> receive or obtain regularly [subscribe to, take]</p><p><b>pretplatiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> receive or obtain regularly [subscribe, take]</p><p><b>opredijelili</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of a contract or will or other document) having a signature written at the end</p><p><b>abonent, potpisnik, pretplatnik, prinosnik, upisnik, čitatelj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who expresses strong approval [endorser, indorser, ratifier]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who contracts to receive and pay for a service or a certain number of issues of a publication [reader]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who contributes (or promises to contribute) a sum of money [contributor]</p><p><b>linija, priključak, telefonska linija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a telephone connection [line, phone line, telephone circuit, telephone line]</p><p><b>donji indeks, indeks, potpisan znak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a character or symbol set or printed or written beneath or slightly below and to the side of another character [inferior]</p><p><i>adj.</i> written or printed below and to one side of another character [inferior]</p><p><b>potpis, potpisivanje, predbilježba, pretplata, ugovorni sporazum, upis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a payment for consecutive issues of a newspaper or magazine for a given period of time</p><p><i>n.</i> agreement expressed by (or as if expressed by) signing your name</p><p><i>n.</i> a pledged contribution</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of signing your name</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (b) ovog članka, društvo može imati pravo na upis u dionice u novom izdavanju običnih dionica prije nego što se ponudi javnosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the right of a shareholder in a company to subscribe to shares of a new issue of common stock before it is offered to the public</p><p><b>U slučaju da je iznos od plaćanja iznosi od [...] % do [...] %, u slučaju kada je iznos od [...] % do [...] %: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a warrant that expires on a stipulated date</p><p><b>poddionica, pododjel, pododsjek, podrazdjel</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a section of a section [subdivision]</p><p><b>podsekvenca</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something that follows something else [sequel]</p><p><i>n.</i> following in time [posteriority, subsequentness]</p><p><b>kasniji, naknadni, potonji, slijedeće, slijedeći, sljedeći</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> following in time or order</p><p><b>kasniji, naknadno, nakon, nakon toga, potom, slijedom toga, zatim</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> happening at a time subsequent to a reference time [after, afterward, afterwards, later, later on]</p><p><b>kasniji, naknadni, potonji, slijedeće, slijedeći, sljedeći (od &quot;subsequent&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> following in time [posteriority, subsequence]</p><p><b>biti od koristi, služiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be helpful or useful</p><p><b>pokornost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the condition of being something that is useful in reaching an end or carrying out a plan</p><p><i>n.</i> in a subservient state [subservientness]</p><p><i>n.</i> abject or cringing submissiveness [obsequiousness, servility]</p><p><b>koristan, podložan, pokoran, ponizan, probitačan (&lt;for&gt; za), servilan, uraditi po nečijoj naredbi</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> compliant and obedient to authority</p><p><i>adj.</i> serving or acting as a means or aid [implemental, instrumental]</p><p><i>adj.</i> abjectly submissive [slavish, submissive]</p><p><b>ponizno, probitačno, servilno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an obsequious manner [obsequiously, servilely]</p><p><b>koristan, podložan, pokoran, ponizan, probitačan (&lt;for&gt; za), servilan, uraditi po nečijoj naredbi (od &quot;subservient&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in a subservient state [subservience]</p><p><b>podskup, pretplatnička oprema, pretplatnički (telefonski) uređaj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a set whose members are members of another set</p><p><b>U slučaju da je proizvodnja proizvoda u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka u potpunosti ili djelomično ograničena na proizvodnju proizvoda u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, točka (b) ovog članka ne vrijedi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low-growing woody shrub or perennial with woody base [suffrutex]</p><p><b>opadati, sleći se, slegnuti se, smiriti se, spasti, legnuti, lijegati, padati, pasti, tonuti, uranjati, uroniti, utonuti, uvaliti se, uvaljivati se, zalegnuti, zaleći, zalijegati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> wear off or die down [lessen]</p><p><i>v.</i> sink to a lower level or form a depression</p><p><i>v.</i> sink down or precipitate [settle]</p><p><i>v.</i> descend into or as if into some soft substance or place [sink]</p><p><b>klizanje tla, slijeganje, taloženje, remisija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an abatement in intensity or degree (as in the manifestations of a disease) [remission, remittal]</p><p><i>n.</i> a gradual sinking to a lower level [settling, subsiding]</p><p><i>n.</i> the sudden collapse of something into a hollow beneath it [cave in]</p><p><b>subsidijarnost, supsidijarnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> secondary importance [subordinateness]</p><p><b>društvo kći, društvo-kći, filijala, podružnica, podružnicu, poduzeće u vlasništvu, pomoćna služba, pomoćni, pomoćnik, pomoćan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an assistant subject to the authority or control of another [foot soldier, subordinate, underling]</p><p><i>n.</i> a company that is completely controlled by another company [subsidiary company]</p><p><i>adj.</i> functioning in a supporting capacity [auxiliary, supplemental, supplementary]</p><p><b>Poduzeće koje je u potpunosti pod kontrolom drugog društva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company that is completely controlled by another company [subsidiary]</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka ne primjenjuje članak 5. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, podnositelj zahtjeva može upisati sljedeće: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> details of an account supporting the amount stated in the general ledger</p><p><b>opadati, sleći se, slegnuti se, smiriti se (od &quot;subside&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gradual sinking to a lower level [settling, subsidence]</p><p><b>Službenici koji su primili subvenciju, Pružanje subvencije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> money (or other benefits) obtained as a subsidy [subsidization]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of providing a subsidy [grant, subsidization]</p><p><b>subvencionirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> secure the assistance of by granting a subsidy, as of nations or military forces [subsidize]</p><p><i>v.</i> support through subsidies [subsidize]</p><p><b>subvencioniran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having partial financial support from public funds [subsidized]</p><p><b>subvencionirati (od &quot;subsidise&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who assists or supports by giving a subsidy [subsidizer]</p><p><b>Službenici koji su primili subvenciju, Pružanje subvencije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> money (or other benefits) obtained as a subsidy [subsidisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of providing a subsidy [grant, subsidisation]</p><p><b>subvencionirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> support through subsidies [subsidise]</p><p><i>v.</i> secure the assistance of by granting a subsidy, as of nations or military forces [subsidise]</p><p><b>subvencioniran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having partial financial support from public funds [subsidised]</p><p><b>subvencionirati (od &quot;subsidize&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who assists or supports by giving a subsidy [subsidiser]</p><p><b>pomoć, potpora, subvencija, subvencije, subvencioniranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a grant paid by a government to an enterprise that benefits the public</p><p><b>izdržavati se, opstati, postojati, preživjeti, preživljavati, uzdržavati se, živjeti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> support oneself [exist, live, survive]</p><p><b>izdržavanje, opstanak, postojanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> minimal (or marginal) resources for subsisting</p><p><i>n.</i> a means of surviving</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of existing in reality</p><p><b>naturalna poljoprivreda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> farming that provides for the basic needs of the farmer without surpluses for marketing</p><p><b>preživio</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who lives through affliction [survivor]</p><p><b>podzemlje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the layer of soil between the topsoil and bedrock [undersoil]</p><p><b>(brzine) manja od brzine zvuka u određenom mediju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of speed) less than that of sound in a designated medium</p><p><b>potprostor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a space that is contained within another space</p><p><b>podvrsta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) a taxonomic group that is a division of a species [race]</p><p><b>bitnost, bivstvo, imanje, materija, sadržaj, smisao, substanca, supstanca, suština, tvar, sadržajem, supstancu, građa, materijal, supstancija, bit, centar, esencija, jezgra, središte, srž, poanta, poenta, značenje, poruka, predmet, tema, dosljednost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the real physical matter of which a person or thing consists</p><p><i>n.</i> the choicest or most essential or most vital part of some idea or experience [center, centre, core, essence, gist, heart, heart and soul, inwardness, kernel, marrow, meat, nitty-gritty, nub, pith, sum]</p><p><i>n.</i> the idea that is intended [meaning]</p><p><i>n.</i> material of a particular kind or constitution</p><p><i>n.</i> considerable capital (wealth or income) [means]</p><p><i>n.</i> what a communication that is about something is about [content, message, subject matter]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of holding together and retaining its shape [body, consistence, consistency]</p><p><i>n.</i> a particular kind or species of matter with uniform properties</p><p><b>prekomjerno korištenje droga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> excessive use of drugs [drug abuse, habit]</p><p><b>drogeraš, narkoman, ovisnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who takes drugs [drug user, user]</p><p><b>ne ispunjava određene norme (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> falling short of some prescribed norm [deficient, inferior]</p><p><b>bijeli nervni tkiv CNS-a koji se sastoji od neurona i njihovih mijelinskih omotača (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> whitish nervous tissue of the CNS consisting of neurons and their myelin sheaths [white matter]</p><p><b>grivo-živo živčano tkivo koje sadrži stanična tijela i vlakna (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> greyish nervous tissue containing cell bodies as well as fibers [gray matter, gray substance, grey matter, grey substance]</p><p><b>sloj duboko pigmentirane sive tvari u srednjem mozgu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a layer of deeply pigmented grey matter in the midbrain [locus niger, nucleus niger]</p><p><b>bitan, izobilan, solidan, stvaran, supstancijalan, suštinski, temeljan, temeljit, tvaran, zamašan, zbiljski, značajan, znatan, imućan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of considerable importance, size, or worth [significant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the real nature or essential elements of something [substantive]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having substance or capable of being treated as fact [material, real]</p><p><i>adj.</i> providing abundant nourishment [hearty, satisfying, solid, square]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of good quality and condition [solid, strong]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having an abundant supply of money or possessions of value [affluent, flush, loaded, moneyed, wealthy]</p><p><b>jačina, suština</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being substantial or having substance [solidness, substantialness]</p><p><b>bitno, čvrsto, jako, sadržajno, substancijalan, suštinsko, znatno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to a great extent or degree [considerably, well]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a strong substantial way</p><p><b>bitan, izobilan, solidan, stvaran, supstancijalan, suštinski, temeljan, temeljit, tvaran, zamašan, zbiljski, značajan, znatan (od &quot;substantial&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being substantial or having substance [solidness, substantiality]</p><p><b>poslužiti kao dokaz, potkrijepiti dokumentima, podupirati, poduprijeti, potkrepljivati, potkrijepiti, potvrditi, potvrđivati, inkarnirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> establish or strengthen as with new evidence or facts [affirm, confirm, corroborate, support, sustain]</p><p><i>v.</i> represent in bodily form [body forth, embody, incarnate]</p><p><i>v.</i> make real or concrete [actualise, actualize, realise, realize]</p><p><i>v.</i> solidify, firm, or strengthen</p><p><b>poslužiti kao dokaz, potkrijepiti dokumentima (od &quot;substantiate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to support or corroborate [collateral, confirmative, confirmatory, confirming, corroborative, corroboratory, substantiative, validating, validatory, verificatory, verifying]</p><p><b>dokaz, ostvarenje, potkrepa, potvrda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> additional proof that something that was believed (some fact or hypothesis or theory) is correct [check, confirmation, verification]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of validating [proof, validation]</p><p><b>služe za potporu ili potvrdu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> serving to support or corroborate [collateral, confirmative, confirmatory, confirming, corroborative, corroboratory, substantiating, validating, validatory, verificatory, verifying]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je riječ o subjektu ili subjektu koji je u skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka, to znači da je predmet subjekta ili subjekta koji je u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or having the nature or function of a substantive (i.e. a noun or noun equivalent)</p><p><b>imenica, nezavisan, samostalan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any word or group of words functioning as a noun</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the real nature or essential elements of something [substantial]</p><p><i>adj.</i> defining rights and duties as opposed to giving the rules by which rights and duties are established [essential]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being on topic and prompting thought [meaty]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je proizvod iz članka 1. stavka 2. točke (a) primjenjuje se samo na proizvod iz članka 2. stavka 2. točke (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dye with a high affinity for cellulose fibers (cotton or rayon etc.) [direct dye]</p><p><b>podstanica, trafostanica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a subsidiary station where electricity is transformed for distribution by a low-voltage network</p><p><b>Izmenljivost zbog toga što je zamjenjiva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> exchangeability by virtue of being replaceable [commutability, replaceability]</p><p><b>(od riječi) zamjenljive u određenom kontekstu bez promjene uvoza izraza, za koje se može zamjeniti drugim ili drugim ekvivalentnim proizvodom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of words) interchangeable in a given context without changing the import of the expression</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being exchanged for another or for something else that is equivalent [commutable]</p><p><b>nadomjestak, nadomjestiti, rezervni, zamijeniti, zamjena, zamjenik, nadomjeske, supstituirati, alternativan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person or thing that takes or can take the place of another [replacement]</p><p><i>n.</i> an athlete who plays only when a starter on the team is replaced [reserve, second-stringer]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who takes the place of another (as when things get dangerous or difficult) [backup, backup man, fill-in, relief, reliever, stand-in]</p><p><i>v.</i> put in the place of another [exchange, interchange, replace]</p><p><i>v.</i> be a substitute [fill in, stand in, sub]</p><p><i>v.</i> act as a substitute [deputise, deputize, step in]</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of substituting in any of several positions on a team [utility]</p><p><i>adj.</i> serving or used in place of another [alternate, alternative]</p><p><i>adj.</i> artificial and inferior [ersatz]</p><p><b>zamjenjivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> working as a substitute for someone who is ill or on leave of absence [subbing]</p><p><b>supstitucija, zamjena, zamjenik, zamjenjivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an event in which one thing is substituted for another [permutation, replacement, switch, transposition]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of putting one thing or person in the place of another: "he sent Smith in for Jones but the substitution came too late to help" [commutation, exchange]</p><p><b>razred svih stavki koje se mogu zamijeniti na istu poziciju (ili slot) u gramatčkoj rečenici (u paradigmatičnom odnosu jedna s drugom) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the class of all items that can be substituted into the same position (or slot) in a grammatical sentence (are in paradigmatic relation with one another) [paradigm]</p><p><b>podloga, substrat, supstrat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the substance that is acted upon by an enzyme or ferment</p><p><i>n.</i> a surface on which an organism grows or is attached [substratum]</p><p><i>n.</i> any stratum or layer lying underneath another [substratum]</p><p><i>n.</i> an indigenous language that contributes features to the language of an invading people who impose their language on the indigenous population [substratum]</p><p><b>niži sloj, osnova, podloga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a surface on which an organism grows or is attached [substrate]</p><p><i>n.</i> any stratum or layer lying underneath another [substrate]</p><p><i>n.</i> an indigenous language that contributes features to the language of an invading people who impose their language on the indigenous population [substrate]</p><p><b>niz koji je dio dužeg niza. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a string that is part of a longer string</p><p><b>podgradnja, infrastruktura, baza, dno, osnova, osnovica, podloga, podnožje, temelj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic structure or features of a system or organization [infrastructure]</p><p><i>n.</i> lowest support of a structure [base, foot, foundation, fundament, groundwork, understructure]</p><p><b>uključiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> contain or include</p><p><i>v.</i> consider (an instance of something) as part of a general rule or principle [colligate]</p><p><b>obuhvaćanje, sadržavanje, uključivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the premise of a syllogism that contains the minor term (which is the subject of the conclusion) [minor premise, minor premiss]</p><p><i>n.</i> incorporating something under a more general category</p><p><b>dubinski, podzemni, potpovršinski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> beneath the surface</p><p><b>podsistem, podsustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system that is part of some larger system</p><p><b>biti suprotno od (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be opposite to [delimit]</p><p><b>izgovor, okolišanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something intended to misrepresent the true nature of an activity [blind]</p><p><b>blizu ali ne baš na kraju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> near but not precisely at an end</p><p><b>podzeman, podzemlja, podzemnoga</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being or operating under the surface of the earth [subterraneous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lying beyond what is openly revealed or avowed (especially being kept in the background or deliberately concealed) [subterraneous, ulterior]</p><p><b>koji se nalazi ili djeluje ispod površine zemlje, laganje izvan onoga što je otvoreno otkriveno ili priznato (posebno držanje u pozadini ili namjerno skrivanje) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being or operating under the surface of the earth [subterranean]</p><p><i>adj.</i> lying beyond what is openly revealed or avowed (especially being kept in the background or deliberately concealed) [subterranean, ulterior]</p><p><b>Ovalna masa sive tvari smještena u kaudalnom dijelu subtalamusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an oval mass of grey matter located in the caudal part of the subthalamus</p><p><b>Ventralni dio talamusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ventral part of the thalamus</p><p><b>polipeptidni antibiotik (sličan bacitracinu) dobiven iz bakterije u zemljištu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a polypeptide antibiotic (similar to bacitracin) obtained from a soil bacterium</p><p><b>učiniti (osjetila) oštrijim (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make (senses) more keen [subtilize]</p><p><b>Označite fine razlike i suptilnosti, kao među riječima., učiniti suptilnije ili prefinjenije, učiniti (osjetila) oštrijim (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> mark fine distinctions and subtleties, as among words</p><p><i>v.</i> make more subtle or refined [rarefy, sublimate]</p><p><i>v.</i> make (senses) more keen [subtilise]</p><p><b>podnaslov</b></p><p><i>n.</i> translation of foreign dialogue of a movie or TV program [caption]</p><p><i>n.</i> secondary or explanatory title</p><p><i>v.</i> supply (a movie) with subtitles</p><p><b>fin, nježan, prepreden, suptilan, tankoćutan, umješan, vješt</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> difficult to detect or grasp by the mind or analyze [elusive]</p><p><i>adj.</i> able to make fine distinctions</p><p><i>adj.</i> working or spreading in a hidden and usually injurious way [insidious, pernicious]</p><p><b>cjepidlačenje, domišljatost, finoća, istančanost, lukavost, mudrovanje, okretnost, oštroumnost, podmuklost, prepredenost, profinjenost, rafiniranost, rafinman, suptilnost, tančina, vještina, nijansa, ton, spretnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a subtle difference in meaning or opinion or attitude [nicety, nuance, refinement, shade]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being difficult to detect or analyze [niceness]</p><p><b>prorijeđen</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a subtle manner</p><p><b>Sedma nota diatonne skale. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (music) the seventh note of the diatonic scale [leading tone]</p><p><b>monotono urbano raspršivanje standardiziranih zgrada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> monotonous urban sprawl of standardized buildings</p><p><b>podzbroj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sum of part of a group of numbers</p><p><b>odbiti, oduzeti, oduzimati, suptrahirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a subtraction [deduct, take off]</p><p><i>v.</i> take off or away</p><p><b>odbiti, oduzeti, oduzimati (od &quot;subtract&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who subtracts numbers</p><p><i>n.</i> a machine that subtracts numbers</p><p><b>odbitak, oduzimanje, oduzimanje u matematici</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an arithmetic operation in which the difference between two numbers is calculated [minus]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of subtracting (removing a part from the whole) [deduction]</p><p><b>odbijen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> constituting or involving subtraction</p><p><b>suptrahend, umanjitelj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the number to be subtracted from the minuend</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a subordinate treasury or place of deposit</p><p><b>od ili povezane s ili karakteristične za uvjete u subtropskim područjima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of conditions in the subtropics [semitropic, semitropical, subtropical]</p><p><b>od ili povezane s ili karakteristične za uvjete u subtropskim područjima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of conditions in the subtropics [semitropic, semitropical, subtropic]</p><p><b>regije susjedne tropima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> regions adjacent to the tropics [semitropics]</p><p><b>mali rod biljaka sjeverno-umjerenog područja i planina tropske Afrike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus of herbs of north temperate regions and mountains of tropical Africa [genus Subularia]</p><p><b>mala vodena biljka s tuftovanim lišćama u obliku grede u bazalnoj rozeti i sitnim bijelim cvijećima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small aquatic plant having tufted awl-shaped leaves in a basal rosette and minute white flowers [awlwort]</p><p><b>podjedinica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a monetary unit that is valued at a fraction (usually one hundredth) of the basic monetary unit [fractional monetary unit]</p><p><b>predgrađe</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a residential district located on the outskirts of a city [suburban area, suburbia]</p><p><b>iz predgrađa, malograđanski, stanovnik predgrađa, u četvrti vila, u predgrađu, prigradski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or characteristic of or situated in suburbs</p><p><b>predgrađe</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a residential district located on the outskirts of a city [suburb, suburbia]</p><p><b>preuzeti predgrađanski karakter, - Da. - Da. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> take on suburban character [suburbanize]</p><p><i>v.</i> make suburban in character [suburbanize]</p><p><b>Okružena mnogim predgrađima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> surrounded by many suburbs [suburbanized]</p><p><b>stanovnik predgrađa (MT)</b></