eparing a summary (or an instance thereof) [summarization]</p><p><b>sažimati, rezimirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be a summary of [sum, sum up, summarize]</p><p><i>v.</i> give a summary (of) [resume, sum up, summarize]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, poduzeća mogu imati: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of preparing a summary (or an instance thereof) [summarisation]</p><p><b>sabrati, sažetak, sažeti, zbroji, rezimirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> give a summary (of) [resume, sum up, summarise]</p><p><i>v.</i> be a summary of [sum, sum up, summarise]</p><p><b>izvod, kratak pregled, kratak sadržaj, kratki sadržaj, pregled, sažetak, sažeti pregled, sumarni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a brief statement that presents the main points in a concise form [sum-up]</p><p><i>adj.</i> performed speedily and without formality [drumhead]</p><p><i>adj.</i> briefly giving the gist of something [compact, compendious, succinct]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je sud odlučio da se ne primjenjuje pravna odredba, tužitelj se može odlučiti na temelju pravne odredbe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a judgment rendered by the court prior to a verdict because no material issue of fact exists and one party or the other is entitled to a judgment as a matter of law [judgement on the pleadings, judgment on the pleadings, summary judgment]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je sud odlučio da se ne primjenjuje pravna odredba, tužitelj se može odlučiti na temelju pravne odredbe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a judgment rendered by the court prior to a verdict because no material issue of fact exists and one party or the other is entitled to a judgment as a matter of law [judgement on the pleadings, judgment on the pleadings, summary judgement]</p><p><b>Kratko i nesimpatično odbijanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a brief and unsympathetic rejection [short shrift]</p><p><b>brojati, brojiti, izbrojati, izbrojiti, nabrojati, nabrojiti, pobrajati, pobrojati, pobrojavati, pobrojiti, 