ngly, wonderfully, wondrous, wondrously]</p><p><b>soj bakterija koji je otporan na sve antibiotike, soj štetočine slučajno uvezena u Floridu s Bliskog istoka zatim se proširio u Kaliforniji gdje je vrlo ozbiljan štetočina hrane gotovo sve biljke povrća i poinsettias (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strain of bacteria that is resistant to all antibiotics</p><p><i>n.</i> a strain of pest accidentally imported into Florida from the Middle East then spread to California where it is a very serious pest feeding on almost all vegetable crops and poinsettias [Bemisia tabaci, poinsettia strain]</p><p><b>nadzornik tereta, soprakariko</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an officer on a merchant ship in charge of the cargo and its sale and purchase</p><p><b>povećanje ili povećanje, povećanje pritiska na plin ili tekućinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> increase or raise [advance, boost]</p><p><i>v.</i> increase the pressure on a gas or liquid [pressurise, pressurize]</p><p><b>prekomprimiran, prenabijen, pretovaren</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of e.g. an engine) having the power increased by fitting with a supercharger</p><p><i>adj.</i> fraught with great emotion [charged]</p><p><b>kompresijska pumpa, kompresor, puhaljka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> compressor that forces increased oxygen into the cylinders of an internal-combustion engine</p><p><b>greben na čelnoj kosti iznad oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ridge on the frontal bone above the eye socket [superciliary ridge, supraorbital ridge, supraorbital torus]</p><p><b>greben na čelnoj kosti iznad oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ridge on the frontal bone above the eye socket [superciliary arch, supraorbital ridge, supraorbital torus]</p><p><b>gord, ohol, uobražen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or showing arrogant superiority to and disdain of those one views as unworthy [disdainful, haughty, imperious, lordly, overbearing, prideful, sniffy, swaggering]</p><p><i>adj.</i> expressive of contempt [sneering, snide]</p><p><b>gord, ohol, uobražen (od &quot;supercilious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with a sneer [sneeringly, snidely]</p><p><b>gord, ohol, uobražen (od &quot;supercilious&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of displaying arrogance by patronizing those considered inferior [condescension, disdainfulness]</p><p><b>obrva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the arch of hair above each eye [brow, eyebrow]</p><p><b>(biologija) taksonomska klasa ispod filuma i iznad klase (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) a taxonomic class below a phylum and above a class</p><p><b>superklasa hrvaca u obliku jegulje bez vilice i zdjeličnih peraja: lampreje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> superclass of eel-shaped chordates lacking jaws and pelvic fins: lampreys [Agnatha]</p><p><b>pauci, red Araneae, red Araneida, red paukova</b></p><p><i>n.</i> spiders [Chelicerata]</p><p><b>od kojih su svi kralježnjaci s gornjim i donjim vilicama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> comprising all vertebrates with upper and lower jaws [Gnathostomata]</p><p><b>korišten u nekim klasifikacijama za stonožce (Diplopoda) i stonožce (Chilopoda) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used in some classifications to encompass the millipedes (Diplopoda) and centipedes (Chilopoda)</p><p><b>računalo vrlo velike moći, super računalo, veleračunalo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mainframe computer that is one of the most powerful available at a given time</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom energije od 10 kVA ili više, ali ne više od 10 kVA (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a collider that operates at very low temperatures</p><p><b>supervodljivost, supravodljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the disappearance of electrical resistance at very low temperatures</p><p><b>superkritičan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (especially of fissionable material) able to sustain a chain reaction in such a manner that the rate of reaction increases</p><p><b>(psihoanaliza) taj dio podsvijesti koji djeluje kao savjest (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (psychoanalysis) that part of the unconscious mind that acts as a conscience</p><p><b>Napor iznad i izvan poziva dužnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an effort above and beyond the call of duty</p><p><b>više nego što je potrebno, poželjno ili potrebno (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> more than is needed, desired, or required [excess, extra, redundant, spare, superfluous, supernumerary, surplus]</p><p><b>(biologija) taksonomska grupa koja se rangira ispod reda, ali iznad obitelji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) a taxonomic group ranking below an order but above a family</p><p><b>biljne uši (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> plant lice [Aphidoidea]</p><p><b>cvjetari, nadporodica Apoidea, nadporodica cvjetara</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bees [Apoidea]</p><p><b>Skala insekti i mliječne bubače (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> scale insects and mealybugs [Coccoidea]</p><p><b>Antropoični majmuni i ljudi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> anthropoid apes and human beings [Hominoidea]</p><p><b>Scarabaeus i štakori jelena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> scarabaeid beetles and stag beetles [Lamellicornia]</p><p><b>superplemena glodavca u biti jednaka podredu Myomorpha ali isključuje Dipodidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a superfamily of rodents essentially equal to the suborder Myomorpha but with the Dipodidae excluded [Muroidea]</p><p><b>Dvoskrilje muhe, posebno obitelji: Muscidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> two-winged flies especially the families: Muscidae [Muscoidea]</p><p><b>Majmuni Novog svijeta: kapucini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> New World monkeys: capuchin [Platyrrhini]</p><p><b>obitelji Sphecidae i Stizidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> families Sphecidae and Stizidae [Sphecoidea]</p><p><b>štapovi odjeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clothes moths [Tineoidea]</p><p><b>muholovke</b></p><p><i>n.</i> New World tyrant flycatchers most numerous in Central America and South America but also in the United States and Canada [Tyrannidae]</p><p><b>(od sapunu) koji sadrži ekstra nesaponiziranu masticu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of soap) containing extra unsaponified fat</p><p><b>Kladim se da možete izabrati prva četiri finiša u utrci u pravom redoslijedu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bet that you can pick the first four finishers in a race in the right order</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to slučaj, ispitni postupak se može provesti na temelju sljedećih metoda: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fertilization of two or more ova released during the same menstrual cycle by sperm from separate acts of coitus (especially by different males)</p><p><b>zatrudnjeti kada je fetus već prisutan u maternici (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> conceive when a fetus is already present in the uterus</p><p><b>oplodnja druge jajne ćelije nakon početka trudnoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fertilization of a second ovum after a pregnancy has begun</p><p><b>plitak, površan, površinski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> concerned with or comprehending only what is apparent or obvious</p><p><i>adj.</i> of, affecting, or being on or near the surface</p><p><i>adj.</i> of little substance or significance [trivial]</p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring on or near the surface of the skin</p><p><i>adj.</i> hasty and without attention to detail [casual, cursory, passing, perfunctory]</p><p><b>Isprazni u veliku safennu venu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> empties into the great saphenous vein [vena epigastrica superficialis]</p><p><b>Velika vena duž linije Sylvian pukotine do kavernusnog sinusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large vein along the line of the Sylvian fissure to the cavernous sinus</p><p><b>Pridružite srednju vrpcu da ispraznite u retromandibularnu venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> join the middle temporal vein to empty into the retromandibular vein</p><p><b>površnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lack of depth of knowledge or thought or feeling [shallowness]</p><p><i>n.</i> shallowness in terms of affecting only surface layers of something</p><p><b>površno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a superficial manner</p><p><b>površina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the purely external aspect of a thing</p><p><i>n.</i> outer surface of an area or a body</p><p><b>najbolje kvalitete, najfiniji, prefinjen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of extremely fine size or texture</p><p><i>adj.</i> excessively delicate or refined [overrefined]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used especially of merchandise) very fine in quality</p><p><b>obilje, suvišak, višak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extreme excess [embarrassment, overplus, plethora]</p><p><b>prekomjeran, suvišan, suvišni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> serving no useful purpose [otiose, pointless, purposeless, senseless, wasted]</p><p><i>adj.</i> more than is needed, desired, or required [excess, extra, redundant, spare, supererogatory, supernumerary, surplus]</p><p><b>prekomjeran, suvišan, suvišni (od &quot;superfluous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a superfluous manner</p><p><b>Federalni program za lociranje i istraživanje i čišćenje najgorih nekontrolisanih i napuštenih toksičnih otpada širom zemlje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the federal government's program to locate and investigate and clean up the worst uncontrolled and abandoned toxic waste sites nationwide [Superfund program]</p><p><b>Federalni program za lociranje i istraživanje i čišćenje najgorih nekontrolisanih i napuštenih toksičnih otpada širom zemlje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the federal government's program to locate and investigate and clean up the worst uncontrolled and abandoned toxic waste sites nationwide [Superfund]</p><p><b>mjesto gdje je odlagan toksični otpad i koje je Agencija za zaštitu okoliša odredila za čišćenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a site where toxic wastes have been dumped and the Environmental Protection Agency has designated them to be cleaned up [toxic site, toxic waste area]</p><p><b>izuzetno svijetla zvijezda velikog promjera i male gustoće. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an extremely bright star of very large diameter and low density</p><p><b>Policijski doušnik koji implicira mnoge ljude. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a police informer who implicates many people [grass]</p><p><b>radio prijemnik koji kombinira lokalno generiranu frekvenciju s nosiocem frekvencije kako bi proizveo superzvučni signal koji se demodulira i pojačava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a