rseeing the performance or operation of a person or group [oversight, supervising, supervision]</p><p><b>domar, inspektor, nadzornik, stambeni upravitelj, upravnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who directs and manages an organization [overseer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a caretaker for an apartment house [super]</p><p><b>gornji, izvanredan, nadmoćan, poglavar, pretpostavljen, superioran, viši, vrhunski, nadređeni, pretpostavljeni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of greater rank or station or quality [higher-up, superordinate]</p><p><i>n.</i> the head of a religious community</p><p><i>n.</i> a combatant who is able to defeat rivals [master, victor]</p><p><i>n.</i> the largest freshwater lake in the world [Lake Superior]</p><p><i>n.</i> a town in northwest Wisconsin on Lake Superior across from Duluth</p><p><i>n.</i> a character or symbol set or printed or written above and immediately to one side of another character [superscript]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of high or superior quality or performance</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or characteristic of high rank or importance</p><p><i>adj.</i> (sometimes followed by `to') not subject to or influenced by</p><p><i>adj.</i> written or printed above and to one side of another character [superscript]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having an orbit farther from the sun than the Earth's orbit</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a higher rank [higher-ranking, ranking]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (often followed by `to') above being affected or influenced by</p><p><b>alveolska arterija koja opskrbljuje gornje zube (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the alveolar artery that supplies the upper teeth [arteria alveolaris superior]</p><p><b>gornji ogranak cerebelne arterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the superior branch of the cerebellar artery</p><p><b>moždana vena koja ispušta dorsalnu konveksnost moždane polutke i isprazni u kavernusni sinus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cerebral vein that drains the dorsal convexity of the cerebral hemisphere and empties into the cavernous sinus [vena cerebrum superior]</p><p><b>Osnovni vizualni centar između mrežnjače i strijatnog kora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an essential visual center between the retina and the striate cortex</p><p><b>(astronomija) poravnanje Zemlje i planeta na suprotnoj strani Sunca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (astronomy) the alignment of the Earth and a planet on the opposite side of the sun</p><p><b>bilo koji sud koji ima nadležnost iznad nižeg suda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any court that has jurisdiction above an inferior court</p><p><b>vene koje prate gornju epigastričnu arteriju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that accompany the superior epigastric artery [venae epigastricae superiores]</p><p><b>glava vjerskih redova ili skupština (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the head of a religious order or congregation [general]</p><p><b>arterija koja je grana arterije lica koja opskrbljuje gornju usnu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artery that is a branch of the facial artery that supplies the upper lip [arteria labialis superior]</p><p><b>pripojnica vene lica koja izlijeva gornju usnu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tributary of the facial vein that drains the upper lip [vena labialis superior]</p><p><b>potiče iz gornjeg dijela aorte koji opskrbljuje tanko crevo i luk i debelo crevo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> originates from the upper part of the aorta that supplies the small intestines and the cecum and the colon</p><p><b>vena koja počinje na unutrašnjem uglu oka i prolazi kroz gornju orbitalnu pukotinu da se isprazni u kavernusi sinus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that begins at the inner angle of the eye socket and passes through the superior orbital fissure to empty into the cavernous sinus</p><p><b>gornji planet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the planets whose orbit lies outside the earth's orbit</p><p><b>jedna od dvije plućne vene (lijeva i desna) koja vraća krv iz gornjih režnja pluća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two pulmonary veins (left and right) returning blood from the superior lobes of the lungs [vena pulmonalis superior]</p><p><b>gornji ravni mišić</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ocular muscle whose contraction turns the eyeball upward and medially [rectus superior, superior rectus muscle]</p><p><b>gornji ravni mišić</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ocular muscle whose contraction turns the eyeball upward and medially [rectus superior, superior rectus]</p><p><b>više od obične sposobnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> more than ordinary ability</p><p><b>dugačka vena koja pomaže u stvaranju unutarnje moždane vene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long vein that helps to form the internal cerebral vein</p><p><b>vena na svakoj strani koja odvodjuje gornji dio štitnjače i isprazni u unutarnju jugularnu venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein on each side that drains the upper part of the thyroid and empties into the internal jugular vein</p><p><b>prima krv iz glave, ruku i grudi i isprazni u desnu prednje srce. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> receives blood from the head and arms and chest and empties into the right atrium of the heart [precava]</p><p><b>bilo koja od gornjih dva glasna žica koja nisu uključena u vokalizaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of the upper two vocal cords that are not involved in vocalization [false vocal cord, false vocal fold, ventricular fold, vestibular fold]</p><p><b>superiornost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being superior [high quality]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being at a competitive advantage [favorable position, favourable position]</p><p><i>n.</i> displaying a sense of being better than others</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of excelling or surpassing or going beyond usual limits [transcendence, transcendency]</p><p><b>pretjerano procjenjivanje vlastite vrijednosti i važnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exaggerated estimate of your own value and importance</p><p><b>ležeći odmah iznad ili na nečemu drugom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lying immediately above or on something else</p><p><b>superlativ</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an exaggerated expression (usually of praise)</p><p><i>n.</i> the highest level or degree attainable [acme, elevation, height, meridian, peak, pinnacle, summit, tiptop, top]</p><p><i>n.</i> the superlative form of an adjective or adverb [superlative degree]</p><p><i>adj.</i> highest in quality [greatest, sterling]</p><p><b>superlativ</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the superlative form of an adjective or adverb [superlative]</p><p><b>superlativ (od &quot;superlative&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to a superlative degree</p><p><b>U slučaju da je to potrebno za uspostavljanje sustava za upravljanje brzom, to znači da je potrebno za uspostavljanje sustava za upravljanje brzom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a variable load on a structure (e.g. a bridge) such as moving traffic [live load]</p><p><b>smješten izvan Mjeseca ili njegove orbite oko Zemlje, Nezemaljski ili eterični. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> situated beyond the moon or its orbit around the earth [superlunary, translunar, translunary]</p><p><i>adj.</i> unworldly or ethereal [superlunary, translunar, translunary]</p><p><b>smješten izvan Mjeseca ili njegove orbite oko Zemlje, Nezemaljski ili eterični. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> situated beyond the moon or its orbit around the earth [superlunar, translunar, translunary]</p><p><i>adj.</i> unworldly or ethereal [superlunar, translunar, translunary]</p><p><b>nadčovjek, natčovjek, superman</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person with great powers and abilities [Ubermensch, demigod]</p><p><i>n.</i> street name for lysergic acid diethylamide [Elvis, Lucy in the sky with diamonds, Zen, acid, back breaker, battery-acid, dose, dot, loony toons, pane, window pane]</p><p><b>robna kuća, supermarket, veletrgovina, samoposluga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large self-service grocery store selling groceries and dairy products and household goods</p><p><b>Upravitelj supermarketa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an operator of a supermarket [supermarketer]</p><p><b>robna kuća, supermarket, veletrgovina (od &quot;supermarket&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an operator of a supermarket [supermarketeer]</p><