supernaturalistic]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s natprirodnim (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to supernaturalism [supernaturalist]</p><p><b>nadzemaljski, natprirodan (od &quot;supernatural&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a supernatural manner [preternaturally]</p><p><b>nadzemaljski, natprirodan (od &quot;supernatural&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being attributed to power that seems to violate or go beyond natural forces [supernaturalism]</p><p><b>izvan opsega normalnih ili znanstveno objasnjenih, koji su veći od normalnog ili prosječnog (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> beyond the range of the normal or scientifically explainable [supranormal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> exceeding the normal or average</p><p><b>supernova</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a star that explodes and becomes extremely luminous in the process</p><p><b>prekobrojan, statist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person serving no apparent function</p><p><i>n.</i> a minor actor in crowd scenes [extra, spear carrier]</p><p><i>adj.</i> more than is needed, desired, or required [excess, extra, redundant, spare, supererogatory, superfluous, surplus]</p><p><b>(biologija) taksonomska grupa koja se rangira iznad reda i ispod klase ili podklase (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) a taxonomic group ranking above an order and below a class or subclass</p><p><b>nadred Acanthopterygii, nadred tvrdoperki, tvrdoperke</b></p><p><i>n.</i> teleost fishes having fins with sharp bony rays [Acanthopterygii]</p><p><b>izumrle vodozemce koje obično liče na teške salamandre ili krokodile i imaju čvrstu ravnu lubanju i konične zube (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extinct amphibians typically resembling heavy-bodied salamanders or crocodiles and having a solid flattened skull and conical teeth [Labyrinthodonta, Labyrinthodontia, superorder Labyrinthodontia]</p><p><b>izumrle vodozemce koje obično liče na teške salamandre ili krokodile i imaju čvrstu ravnu lubanju i konične zube (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extinct amphibians typically resembling heavy-bodied salamanders or crocodiles and having a solid flattened skull and conical teeth [Labyrinthodonta, Labyrinthodontia, superorder Labyrinthodonta]</p><p><b>mekoperke, nadred Malacopterygii, nadred mekoperki</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an extensive group of teleost fishes having fins supported by flexible cartilaginous rays [Malacopterygii]</p><p><b>korišten u prethodnim klasifikacijama kako bi se uključili svi redovi ptica ratita (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> used in former classifications to include all ratite bird orders [Ratitae]</p><p><b>nadređeni, pretpostavljeni, hiperonim, nadređena riječ, nadređenica, superordinirana riječ</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of greater rank or station or quality [higher-up, superior]</p><p><i>n.</i> a word that is more generic than a given word [hypernym, superordinate word]</p><p><i>v.</i> place in a superior order or rank</p><p><i>adj.</i> of higher rank or status or value</p><p><b>hiperonim, nadređena riječ, nadređenica, superordinirana riječ</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word that is more generic than a given word [hypernym, superordinate]</p><p><b>hiperonimija, superordinacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the semantic relation of being superordinate or belonging to a higher rank or class [hypernymy]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom polipropilena od 0,05 do 0,05 mm,, u jednovrijednom anionu O2- (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metallic oxide containing the univalent anion O2-</p><p><i>n.</i> the univalent anion O2- [superoxide anion]</p><p><b>u jednovrijednom anionu O2- (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the univalent anion O2- [superoxide]</p><p><b>superoksid dismutaza, superoksid-dismutaza, SOD</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an enzyme that catalyzes the conversion of superoxide into hydrogen peroxide and oxygen [SOD]</p><p><b>fanatično patriotski. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> fanatically patriotic [chauvinistic, flag-waving, jingoistic, nationalistic, ultranationalistic]</p><p><b>šovinizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fanatical patriotism [chauvinism, jingoism, ultranationalism]</p><p><b>(biologija) taksonomska grupa rangirana između filuma i ispod klase ili podklase (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (biology) a taxonomic group ranking between a phylum and below a class or subclass</p><p><b>Točno se poklapaju kada se preklapaju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coinciding exactly when superimposed [identical]</p><p><b>mjesto (jedan geometrijski oblik) na drugom tako da se njihovi perimetri poklapaju, mjesto na vrhu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> place (one geometric figure) upon another so that their perimeters coincide</p><p><i>v.</i> place on top of [lay over, superimpose]</p><p><b>slaganje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (geology) the deposition of one geological stratum on another</p><p><i>n.</i> (geology) the principle that in a series of stratified sedimentary rocks the lowest stratum is the oldest [principle of superposition, superposition principle]</p><p><i>n.</i> (geometry) the placement of one object ideally in the position of another one in order to show that the two coincide</p><p><i>n.</i> the placement of one thing on top of another</p><p><b>(geologija) načelo da je u nizu slojevljenih sedimentnih stijena najniži sloj najstariji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (geology) the principle that in a series of stratified sedimentary rocks the lowest stratum is the oldest [principle of superposition, superposition]</p><p><b>velesila</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state powerful enough to influence events throughout the world [great power, major power, power, world power]</p><p><b>da je više koncentrirano nego što je normalno moguće i stoga nije u ravnoteži. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being more concentrated than normally possible and therefore not in equilibrium</p><p><b>napisati na vrhu ili izvan, napisati na vanjskom ili gornjem dijelu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> write on the top or outside</p><p><i>v.</i> write on the outside or upper part of</p><p><b>eksponent, natpis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a character or symbol set or printed or written above and immediately to one side of another character [superior]</p><p><i>adj.</i> written or printed above and to one side of another character [superior]</p><p><b>natpis napisan iznad nečega drugog., Aktivnost nadpisanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an inscription written above something else</p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of superscribing</p><p><b>istiskivati, istisnuti, smijeniti, zamijeniti, zauzeti mjesto, istiskati, nadomjestiti, nadomještati, naslijediti, nasljeđivati, smjenjivati, zamjenjivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> take the place or move into the position of [replace, supervene upon, supplant]</p><p><b>Zamenjanje jedne osobe ili stvari drugom osobom, posebno nekom koja se smatra superiornom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> act of replacing one person or thing by another especially one held to be superior [supersession]</p><p><b>ako imate alergiju ili posebnu ili prekomjernu osjetljivost (posebno na određeni faktor) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having an allergy or peculiar or excessive susceptibility (especially to a specific factor) [allergic, hypersensitised, hypersensitive, hypersensitized, sensitised, sensitized, supersensitive, supersensitized]</p><p><b>ako imate alergiju ili posebnu ili prekomjernu osjetljivost (posebno na određeni faktor) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having an allergy or peculiar or excessive susceptibility (especially to a specific factor) [allergic, hypersensitised, hypersensitive, hypersensitized, sensitised, sensitized, supersensitised, supersensitized]</p><p><b>ako imate alergiju ili posebnu ili prekomjernu osjetljivost (posebno na određeni faktor) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having an allergy or peculiar or excessive susceptibility (especially to a specific factor) [allergic, hypersensitised, hypersensitive, hypersensitized, sensitised, sensitized, supersensitised, supersensitive]</p><p><b>Zamenjanje jedne osobe ili stvari drugom osobom, posebno nekom koja se smatra superiornom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> act of replacing one person or thing by another especially one held to be superior [supersedure]</p><p><b>veliki (20-foot) i brz mesojed dinosaur s uspravnim rezanjem kandže 15 inča dugačke na svakoj stražnjoj nozi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large (20-ft) and swift carnivorous dinosaur having an upright slashing claw 15 inches long on each hind foot [utahraptor]</p><p><b>(brzine) veća od brzine zvuka u određenom mediju (posebno zraku), s frekvencijom većom od frekvencije zvučnog zvuka (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of speed) greater than the speed of sound in a given medium (especially air)</p><p><i>adj.</i> having frequencies above those of audible sound [ultrasonic]</p><p><b>adept, genij, majstor, virtuoz, vunderkind</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is dazzlingly skilled in any field [ace, adept, champion, genius, hotshot, maven, mavin, sensation, star, virtuoso, whiz, whizz, wiz, wizard]</p><p><b>praznovjerje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an irrational belief arising from ignorance or fear [superstitious notion]</p><p><b>praznovjeran, sujevjeran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> showing ignorance of the laws of nature and faith in magic or chance</p><p><b>praznovjerje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an irrational belief arising from ignorance or fear [superstition]</p><p><b>praznovjerno, sujevjerno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a superstitious manner</p><p><b>bilo koji sloj ili sloj koji se nalaze na drugom sloju ili sloju, jezik kasnije osvajača koji je nametnut domorodačkom stanovništvu i doprinosi značajkama njihovog jezika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any stratum or layer superimposed on another [superstratum]</p><p><i>n.</i> the language of a later invading people that is imposed on an indigenous population and contributes features to their language [superstratum]</p><p><b>bilo koji sloj ili sloj koji se nalaze na drugom sloju ili sloju, jezik kasnije osvajača koji je nametnut domorodačkom stanovništvu i doprinosi značajkama njihovog jezika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any stratum or layer superimposed on another [superstrate]</p><p><i>n.</i> the language of a later invading people that is imposed on an indigenous population and contributes features to their language [superstrate]</p><p><b>hipotetička čestica koja je elementarna čestica u teoriji prostora-vremena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hypothetical particle that is the elementary particle in a theory of space-time</p><p><b>nadgradnja, nadgrađe, nadgrađe broda, nadgrađe platforme</b></p><p><i>n.</i> structure consisting of the part of a ship above the main deck</p><p><b>supersimetrija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) a theory that tries to link the four fundamental forces</p><p><b>najveća klasa naftnih tankera (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the largest class of oil tankers</p><p><b>prirez</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an additional tax on certain kinds of income that has already been taxed [surtax]</p><p><b>Prevod riječi stranih opera (ili zborskog djela) prikazan na ekranu iznad pozornice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> translation of the words of a foreign opera (or choral work) projected on a screen above the stage [surtitle]</p><p><b>(Glazba) Druga nota diatonne skale (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (music) the second note of a diatonic scale</p><p><b>Najmoćniji tornado koji može stvoriti ogromno razornu štetu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the most powerful tornado which can create enormously devastating damage</p><p><b>proizići iz, sljedovati za</b></p><p><i>v.</i> take place as an additional or unexpected development</p><p><b>istiskati, istisnuti, nadomjestiti, nadomještati, naslijediti, nasljeđivati, smijeniti, smjenjivati, zamijeniti, zamjenjivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> take the place or move into the position of [replace, supersede, supplant]</p><p><b>a slijedeći na dodatku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a following on in addition</p><p><b>nadgledati, nadzirati, rukovoditi, upravljati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> watch and direct [manage, oversee, superintend]</p><p><i>v.</i> keep tabs on [monitor]</p><p><b>pod promatranjem ili pod vodstvom nadglednika ili nadzornika (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> under observation or under the direction of a superintendent or overseer</p><p><b>nadziranje, Upravljanje, kontrola, nadgledanje, nadzor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> management by overseeing the performance or operation of a person or group [oversight, superintendence, supervision]</p><p><b>direkcija, nadgledanje, nadgledanje napredovanja poziva, nadziranje, nadzor, nadzora, kontrola</b></p><p><i>n.</i> management by overseeing the performance or operation of a person or group [oversight, superintendence, supervising]</p><p><b>kontrolor, nadglednik, nadzornik, starješina, supervizor, upravitelj posrednika, upravljački program</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who supervises or has charge and direction of</p><p><i>n.</i> a program that controls the execution of other programs [executive program, supervisory program]</p><p><b>Uputstvo koje prekida program koji se izvršava i prenosi kontrolu nadzorniku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instruction that interrupts the program being executed and passes control to the supervisor [system call]</p><p><b>nadzorni, nadzoran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or limited to or involving supervision</p><p><b>nadzorni program, računalni program koji upravlja rasporedom poslova</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a program that controls the execution of other programs [executive program, supervisor]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a routine that coordinates the operation of subroutines [executive routine]</p><p><b>Specijalni programi koji stalno borave u glavnoj memoriji računala i kontroliraju obradu korisničkih programa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> specialized programs that reside permanently in the computer's main memory and control the processing of user's programs</p><p><b>(ruku ili predlaktu) tako da je leđa dolje ili unazad, ili okrenuti (noga) (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> turn (the hand or forearm) so that the back is downward or backward, or turn out (the leg)</p><p><b>okretanje ruku i podlakti tako da su dlanovi okrenuti prema gore (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rotation of the hands and forearms so that the palms face upward</p><p><b>mišić (posebno u podlakti) koji proizvodi ili pomaže u supinaciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a muscle (especially in the forearm) that produces or assists in supination</p><p><b>lijen, trom</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lying face upward [resupine]</p><p><i>adj.</i> passive as a result of indolence or indifference</p><p><b>lijen, trom (od &quot;supine&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with the face upward</p><p><i>adv.</i> in an indifferently supine manner</p><p><b>večera</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a light evening meal</p><p><i>n.</i> a social gathering where a light evening meal is served</p><p><b>Obično mali luksuzni noćni klub. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> usually a small luxurious nightclub</p><p><b>bez večere. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> without supper</p><p><b>vrijeme večere</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the customary or habitual hour for the evening meal [dinnertime]</p><p><b>uzimanje tekuće hrane žlicom ili pićem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ingestion of liquid food with a spoon or by drinking</p><p><b>istisnuti, zamijeniti, istiskati, nadomjestiti, nadomještati, naslijediti, nasljeđivati, smijeniti, smjenjivati, zamjenjivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> take the place or move into the position of [replace, supersede, supervene upon]</p><p><b>istisnuti, zamijeniti (od &quot;supplant&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who wrongfully or illegally seizes and holds the place of another [usurper]</p><p><b>istisnuti, zamijeniti (od &quot;supplant&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> act of taking the place of another especially using underhanded tactics [displacement]</p><p><b>gibak, mek, popustljiv</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make pliant and flexible</p><p><i>adj.</i> gracefully thin and bending and moving with ease [lissom, lissome, lithe, lithesome, sinuous]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of e.g. personality traits) readily adaptable [limber]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of persons' bodies) capable of moving or bending freely [limber]</p><p><b>Šten napravljen od drveta američkog tropskog loza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> walking stick made from the wood of an American tropical vine</p><p><b>dodatak, dopuna, dopuniti, nadopuniti, prilog, suplement, dodati, dometati, dometnuti, dopunjavati, kačiti, kvačiti, nadodati, nadodavati, nadometati, nadometnuti, nadopunjavati, pridodati, pridodavati, prikačiti, priključiti, priključivati, prikvačiti, prilagati -priložiti, prilijepiti, priljepljivati, pripajati, pripojiti, privjesiti, pričvrstiti, pričvršćivati, vješati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> textual matter that is added onto a publication [addendum, postscript]</p><p><i>n.</i> a quantity added (e.g. to make up for a deficiency) [supplementation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a supplementary component that improves capability [accessory, add-on, appurtenance]</p><p><i>v.</i> add as a supplement to what seems insufficient</p><p><i>v.</i> serve as a supplement to</p><p><i>v.</i> add to the very end [add on, affix, append]</p><p><b>dodatan, dopunski, dopunjen, naknadan, suplementaran, pomoćan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> functioning in a supporting capacity [auxiliary, subsidiary, supplementary]</p><p><i>adj.</i> added to complete or make up a deficiency [supplementary]</p><p><b>dopunski, ostali, pomoćni, sporedan, pomoćan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> functioning in a supporting capacity [auxiliary, subsidiary, supplemental]</p><p><i>adj.</i> added to complete or make up a deficiency [supplemental]</p><p><b>primanja za radna mjesta i radna mjesta u kojima se radi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> benefits paid to bring incomes up to minimum levels established by law [national assistance, social assistance]</p><p><b>dopunjavanje, nadomjestak, nadopuna</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a quantity added (e.g. to make up for a deficiency) [supplement]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of supplementing [subjoining, subjunction]</p><p><b>elastičnost, gipkost, popustljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the gracefulness of a person or animal that is flexible and supple [lissomeness, litheness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being pliant and flexible [pliancy, pliantness]</p><p><i>n.</i> adaptability of mind or character [pliability, pliancy, pliantness]</p><p><b>molilac, preklinjući, molitelj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one praying humbly for something [petitioner, requester, supplicant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> humbly entreating [supplicant, supplicatory]</p><p><b>molitelj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who prays to God [prayer]</p><p><i>n.</i> one praying humbly for something [petitioner, requester, suppliant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> humbly entreating [suppliant, supplicatory]</p><p><b>moliti, preklinjati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> ask humbly (for something)</p><p><i>v.</i> make a humble, earnest petition</p><p><i>v.</i> ask for humbly or earnestly, as in prayer</p><p><b>molba, preklinjanje, invokacija, molitva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a prayer asking God's help as part of a religious service [invocation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a humble request for help from someone in authority [plea]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of communicating with a deity (especially as a petition or in adoration or contrition or thanksgiving) [prayer]</p><p><b>ponizno preklinjem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> humbly entreating [suppliant, supplicant]</p><p><b>dobavljač, isporučitelj, nabavljač, opskrbljivač, snabdjevač, uvoznik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone whose business is to supply a particular service or commodity [provider]</p><p><b>dobava, dobaviti, dopuniti, dostaviti, dostavljati, nabava, nabava robe, nabaviti, nabavka, nadomještati, navesti, opskrba, opskrbiti, opskrbljivati, opskrbni, opskrbu, ponuda, pribavljati, pribor, snabdijevanje, snabdijevati, snabdjeti, upisati, zaliha, pričuva, rezerva, nabavljanje, namicanje, opskrbljivanje, pribavljanje, opremati, opremiti, dodati, nadovezati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amount of something available for use</p><p><i>n.</i> offering goods and services for sale</p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of supplying or providing something [provision, supplying]</p><p><i>v.</i> give something useful or necessary to [furnish, provide, render]</p><p><i>v.</i> circulate or distribute or equip with [issue]</p><p><i>v.</i> give what is desired or needed, especially support, food or sustenance [cater, ply, provide]</p><p><i>v.</i> state or say further [add, append]</p><p><b>mehanički uređaj za držanje nečeg i snabdijevanje po potrebi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanical device for holding something and supplying it as needed</p><p><b>Sklop za skladištenje zaliha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a closet for storing supplies</p><p><b>put kojim se mogu isporučivati zalihe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a route over which supplies can be delivered [supply route]</p><p><b>Službenik zadužen za logistiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commissioned officer responsible for logistics</p><p><b>napojna trasa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a route over which supplies can be delivered [supply line]</p><p><b>brod za opskrbu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ship that usually provides supplies to other ships [tender]</p><p><b>škola ekonomske teorije koja naglašava troškove proizvodnje kao sredstvo za poticanje gospodarstva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the school of economic theory that stresses the costs of production as a means of stimulating the economy</p><p><b>snabdijevanje, nabava, nabavljanje, namicanje, opskrba, opskrbljivanje, pribavljanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of supplying or providing something [provision, supply]</p><p><b>navijati, navijati za nekoga, nosač, održavanje, oslonac, podgradni, podnositi, podrška, podržati, podržavanje, podržavati, podupirač, podupirati, poduprijeti, pomagati, pomoć, potpomagati, potpomoći, potpora, pružati potporu, pružiti potporu, uzdržavanje, oslanjanja, podršci, podrške, podršku, podupiremo, potporom, potporu, podupiranje, dokumentacija, postolje, potporanj, pratnja, pomoći, uzdržavati, potkrepljivati, potkrijepiti, potvrditi, potvrđivati, braniti, durati, izdržati, izdržavati, izdurati, otrpjeti, podnašati, podnijeti, probaviti, probavljati, tolerirati, trpjeti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of providing for or maintaining by supplying with money or necessities</p><p><i>n.</i> aiding the cause or policy or interests of</p><p><i>n.</i> something providing immaterial assistance to a person or cause or interest</p><p><i>n.</i> a military operation (often involving new supplies of men and materiel) to strengthen a military force or aid in the performance of its mission [reenforcement, reinforcement]</p><p><i>n.</i> documentary validation [documentation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the financial means whereby one lives [bread and butter, keep, livelihood, living, sustenance]</p><p><i>n.</i> supporting structure that holds up or provides a foundation</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of bearing the weight of or strengthening [supporting]</p><p><i>n.</i> a musical part (vocal or instrumental) that supports or provides background for other musical parts [accompaniment, backup, musical accompaniment]</p><p><i>n.</i> any device that bears the weight of another thing</p><p><i>n.</i> financial resources provided to make some project possible [backing, financial backing, financial support, funding]</p><p><i>v.</i> give moral or psychological support, aid, or courage to [back up]</p><p><i>v.</i> support materially or financially</p><p><i>v.</i> be behind [back, endorse, indorse, plump for, plunk for]</p><p><i>v.</i> be the physical support of [hold, hold up, sustain]</p><p><i>v.</i> establish or strengthen as with new evidence or facts [affirm, confirm, corroborate, substantiate, sustain]</p><p><i>v.</i> adopt as a belief [subscribe]</p><p><i>v.</i> support with evidence or authority or make more certain or confirm [bear out, corroborate, underpin]</p><p><i>v.</i> argue or speak in defense of [defend, fend for]</p><p><i>v.</i> play a subordinate role to (another performer)</p><p><i>v.</i> be a regular customer or client of [keep going, patronage, patronise, patronize]</p><p><i>v.</i> put up with something or somebody unpleasant [abide, bear, brook, digest, endure, put up, stand, stick out, stomach, suffer, tolerate]</p><p><b>kolona koja podržava tešku težinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a column that supports a heavy weight</p><p><b>Elastične čarape namijenjene smanjenju pritiska na vene noge (kao u slučaju proširenih vena) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> elasticized stocking intended to reduce pressure on the veins of the leg (as in case of varicose veins) [support stocking]</p><p><b>(borza) cijena po kojoj određeni vrijednosni papir postaje privlačan za ulagatelje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (stock market) the price at which a certain security becomes attractive to investors</p><p><b>plaćanje koje je jedna osoba izvršila za uzdržavanje druge osobe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a payment made by one person for the support of another</p><p><b>Elastične čarape namijenjene smanjenju pritiska na vene noge (kao u slučaju proširenih vena) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> elasticized stocking intended to reduce pressure on the veins of the leg (as in case of varicose veins) [support hose]</p><p><b>sustavi oslanjanja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a network of facilities and people who interact and remain in informal communication for mutual assistance</p><p><b>Sposoban da se nosi iako neprijatno (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being borne though unpleasant [bearable, endurable, sufferable]</p><p><b>podržan, podržani, podržanu, potkrijepljen, potporu, što sve podržava</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> sustained or maintained by aid (as distinct from physical support)</p><p><i>adj.</i> held up or having the weight borne especially from below</p><p><b>držač, navijač, pomagač, pristalica, pristaša, mecena, pokrovitelj, asistent, pomoćnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who backs a politician or a team etc. [admirer, booster, champion, friend, protagonist]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who supports or champions something [patron, sponsor]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who contributes to the fulfillment of a need or furtherance of an effort or purpose [assistant, help, helper]</p><p><i>n.</i> a band (usually elastic) worn around the leg to hold up a stocking (or around the arm to hold up a sleeve) [garter]</p><p><i>n.</i> a support for the genitals worn by men engaging in strenuous exercise [athletic supporter, jock, jockstrap, suspensor]</p><p><b>radikalna islamska grupa terorista u iračkom dijelu Kurdistana koji se protive neovisnoj sekularnoj naciji koju zastupaju Sjedinjene Države. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a radical Islamic group of terrorists in the Iraqi part of Kurdistan who oppose an independent secular nation as advocated by the United States [Ansar al-Islam, Ansar al Islam]</p><p><b>podrška, podrške, podržavanje, prateće, prateći</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of bearing the weight of or strengthening [support]</p><p><i>adj.</i> furnishing support and encouragement [encouraging]</p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of bearing a structural load [load-bearing]</p><p><b>Vatra koju ispuštaju pomoćne jedinice kako bi zaštitile ili pomogle jedinici u borbi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fire delivered by supporting units to protect or assist a unit in combat</p><p><b>drugi odvod osim glavnih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cast other than the principals [ensemble]</p><p><b>potporanj, potporna konstrukcija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a structure that serves to support something</p><p><b>toranj koji služi kao podrška nečemu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tower that serves to support something</p><p><b>koji pruža podršku, potporan, sklon, suportivan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> furnishing support or assistance</p><p><b>koji se može zaključiti na osnovu neznatnih razloga (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being inferred on slight grounds [presumable, surmisable]</p><p><b>presumpcija, presupozicija, pretpostavka, supozicija, vjerovanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a hypothesis that is taken for granted [assumption, supposition]</p><p><i>n.</i> the cognitive process of supposing [supposition]</p><p><b>držati, misliti, pretpostaviti, pretpostavljati, smatrati, trebati, reći, nagađati, suditi, zamišljati, filozofirati, spekulirati, teoretizirati, umovati, vjerovati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> express a supposition [say]</p><p><i>v.</i> expect, believe, or suppose [guess, imagine, opine, reckon, think]</p><p><i>v.</i> to believe especially on uncertain or tentative grounds [conjecture, hypothecate, hypothesise, hypothesize, speculate, theorise, theorize]</p><p><i>v.</i> take for granted or as a given [presuppose]</p><p><i>v.</i> require as a necessary antecedent or precondition [presuppose]</p><p><b>navodni, pretpostavljen, tobožnji</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> required or under orders</p><p><i>adj.</i> mistakenly believed</p><p><i>adj.</i> doubtful or suspect [alleged, so-called]</p><p><i>adj.</i> based primarily on surmise rather than adequate evidence [conjectural, divinatory, hypothetic, hypothetical, suppositional, suppositious, supposititious]</p><p><b>tobožnji, vjerojatno, navodno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> believed or reputed to be the case [purportedly]</p><p><b>hipoteza, nagađanje, predmnijevanje, pretpostavka, spekulacija, presumpcija, presupozicija, supozicija, vjerovanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a message expressing an opinion based on incomplete evidence [conjecture, guess, hypothesis, speculation, surmisal, surmise]</p><p><i>n.</i> a hypothesis that is taken for granted [assumption, supposal]</p><p><i>n.</i> the cognitive process of supposing [supposal]</p><p><b>temelje se na pretpostavkama, a ne na odgovarajućim dokazima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> based primarily on surmise rather than adequate evidence [conjectural, divinatory, hypothetic, hypothetical, supposed, suppositious, supposititious]</p><p><b>temelje se na pretpostavkama, a ne na odgovarajućim dokazima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> based primarily on surmise rather than adequate evidence [conjectural, divinatory, hypothetic, hypothetical, supposed, suppositional, supposititious]</p><p><b>falsificiranje, lažan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> based primarily on surmise rather than adequate evidence [conjectural, divinatory, hypothetic, hypothetical, supposed, suppositional, suppositious]</p><p><b>supozitorij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small plug of medication designed for insertion into the rectum or vagina where it melts</p><p><b>izostaviti, obustaviti, obuzdati, potiskivanje, potisnuti, savladati, suzbiti, svladati, ugušiti, uništiti, zabraniti, zakazati, zatajiti, potlačiti, tiranizirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bring under control by force or authority [conquer, stamp down, subdue]</p><p><i>v.</i> come down on or keep down by unjust use of one's authority [crush, oppress]</p><p><i>v.</i> consciously restrain from showing [bottle up, inhibit]</p><p><i>v.</i> put out of one's consciousness [repress]</p><p><i>v.</i> lessen to the point of stopping</p><p><b>lijek koji potiskuje apetit. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a drug that suppresses appetite [appetite suppressant]</p><p><b>potisnut, zabranjen, zatajan, zatajen, zatomljen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> kept from public knowledge by various means</p><p><i>adj.</i> manifesting or subjected to suppression</p><p><i>adj.</i> held in check with difficulty [smothered, stifled, strangled]</p><p><b>izostaviti, obustaviti, obuzdati, potiskivanje, potisnuti, savladati, suzbiti, svladati, ugušiti, uništiti, zabraniti, zakazati, zatajiti (od &quot;suppress&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who suppresses [suppressor]</p><p><i>n.</i> a gene that suppresses the phenotypic expression of another gene (especially of a mutant gene) [suppresser gene, suppressor, suppressor gene]</p><p><i>n.</i> an electrical device for suppressing unwanted currents [suppressor]</p><p><b>gen koji potiskuje fenotipsku ekspresiju drugog gena (posebno mutiranog gena) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gene that suppresses the phenotypic expression of another gene (especially of a mutant gene) [suppresser, suppressor, suppressor gene]</p><p><b>obustava, obuzdavanje, potiskivanje, povlačenje, sakrivanje, sprečavanje, sprječavanje, ugušenje, ukinuće, zabašurivanje, zabrana, zaplijena, zatajivanje, zatomljenje, inhibicija, suzbijanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the failure to develop some part or organ</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of withholding or withdrawing some book or writing from publication or circulation [curtailment]</p><p><i>n.</i> forceful prevention [crushing, quelling, stifling]</p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) the conscious exclusion of unacceptable thoughts or desires [inhibition]</p><p><b>koji imaju tendenciju da potiskuju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tending to suppress</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 5. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika, "službenici" su osoblje koje je odgovorno za obavljanje dužnosti u skladu s člankom 5. točkom (a) ovog Pravilnika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fire on or about a weapon system to degrade its performance below what is needed to fulfill its mission objectives</p><p><b>potiskivač, prigušivač, tlačitelj, ugušivač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who suppresses [suppresser]</p><p><i>n.</i> a gene that suppresses the phenotypic expression of another gene (especially of a mutant gene) [suppresser, suppresser gene, suppressor gene]</p><p><i>n.</i> an electrical device for suppressing unwanted currents [suppresser]</p><p><b>gen koji potiskuje fenotipsku ekspresiju drugog gena (posebno mutiranog gena) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a gene that suppresses the phenotypic expression of another gene (especially of a mutant gene) [suppresser, suppresser gene, suppressor]</p><p><b>gnojiti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cause to ripen and discharge pus [mature]</p><p><i>v.</i> ripen and generate pus [fester, maturate]</p><p><b>bol koja je upala i formirala gnoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sore that has become inflamed and formed pus [fester]</p><p><b>gnoj</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (medicine) the formation of morbific matter in an abscess or a vesicle and the discharge of pus [festering, maturation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a fluid product of inflammation [festering, ichor, purulence, pus, sanies]</p><p><b>koji se odnose na ili karakteriziraju supuracijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or characterized by suppuration</p><p><b>Na prvom mjestu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> (in writing) at an earlier place [above]</p><p><b>Pokret koji je pokušao da pređe ekspresionizam. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a movement that tried to go beyond expressionism</p><p><b>sekundarna infekcija uzrokovana oportunističkom infekcijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> secondary infection caused by an opportunistic infection</p><p><b>nadnacionalan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> transcending established national boundaries or spheres of interest</p><p><b>izvan opsega normalnih ili znanstveno objasnjenih (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> beyond the range of the normal or scientifically explainable [supernormal]</p><p><b>nalazi se ili se javlja iznad oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> located or occurring above the eye socket [supraorbital]</p><p><b>nalazi se ili se javlja iznad oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> located or occurring above the eye socket [supraocular]</p><p><b>greben na čelnoj kosti iznad oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ridge on the frontal bone above the eye socket [superciliary arch, superciliary ridge, supraorbital torus]</p><p><b>greben na čelnoj kosti iznad oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ridge on the frontal bone above the eye socket [superciliary arch, superciliary ridge, supraorbital ridge]</p><p><b>Ispušće prednju stranu vlasišta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> drains the front of the scalp [vena supraorbitalis]</p><p><b>ili jednog od par složenim endokrinim žlijezdama koje se nalaze u blizini bubrega (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of a pair of complex endocrine glands situated near the kidney [adrenal, adrenal gland]</p><p><b>kirurško uklanjanje jedne ili obje nadbubrežne žlijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> surgical removal of one or both adrenal glands [adrenalectomy]</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na značaj govora koji se proteže preko više od jednog govora. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> pertaining to a feature of speech that extends over more than a single speech sound</p><p><b>Ispušće prednju stranu vlasišta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> drains the front of the scalp [vena supratrochlearis]</p><p><b>vjerovanje da je neka skupina ili rasa superiornija od svih ostalih (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the belief that some particular group or race is superior to all others</p><p><b>osoba koja zagovara nadmoć neke određene grupe ili rasne grupe nad svim ostalima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who advocates the supremacy of some particular group or racial group over all others</p><p><b>nadmoć, vrhovna vlast</b></p><p><i>n.</i> power to dominate or defeat [domination, mastery]</p><p><b>suprematizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a geometric abstractionist movement originated by Kazimir Malevich in Russia that influenced constructivism</p><p><b>umjetnik škole suprematizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an artist of the school of suprematism</p><p><b>glavni, najviši, vrhovni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> final or last in your life or progress</p><p><i>adj.</i> greatest in status or authority or power [sovereign]</p><p><i>adj.</i> highest in excellence or achievement</p><p><i>adj.</i> greatest or maximal in degree [sublime]</p><p><b>Zapovjednik ACLANTA (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> commanding officer of ACLANT [SACLANT]</p><p><b>Zapovjednik ACE-a. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> commanding officer of ACE [SACEUR]</p><p><b>netko s moći da riješi stvari po volji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone with the power to settle matters at will [arbiter]</p><p><b>Nadnaravno biće koje je shvaćeno kao savršeno i svemoćno i svesno stvoritelj i vladar svemira. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the supernatural being conceived as the perfect and omnipotent and omniscient originator and ruler of the universe [God]</p><p><b>Vrhovni sud</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the highest federal court in the United States [Supreme Court of the United States, United States Supreme Court]</p><p><i>n.</i> the highest court in most states of the United States [high court, state supreme court]</p><p><b>Najviši savezni sud u Sjedinjenim Državama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the highest federal court in the United States [Supreme Court, United States Supreme Court]</p><p><b>Najviši voditelji u organizaciji (npr. vrhovni zapovjednik i viši vojni dužnosnici) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the highest leaders in an organization (e.g. the commander-in-chief and senior officers of the military) [high command]</p><p><b>Vrhovni stožer koji savjetuje NATO-u u vojnim pitanjima i nadgleda sve aspekte savezničke komande Europe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the supreme headquarters that advises NATO on military matters and oversees all aspects of the Allied Command Europe [SHAPE]</p><p><b>Teroristička organizacija čiji je cilj da preuzme Japan i onda svijet. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a terrorist organization whose goal is to take over Japan and then the world [Aum, Aum Shinrikyo]</p><p><b>krajnje</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to the maximum degree [sublimely]</p><p><b>Najvažniji čovjek u organizaciji. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the most important person in an organization</p><p><b>luka u južnom Libanu na Sredozemnom moru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a port in southern Lebanon on the Mediterranean Sea [Tyre]</p><p><b>jedan od odjeljaka (ili poglavlja) u Kur'anu, mišićni zadnji dio šape (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the sections (or chapters) in the Koran</p><p><i>n.</i> the muscular back part of the shank [calf]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the molding or border above the base of a structure (a pedestal or podium or wall)</p><p><b>prestati, prestanak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stopping [cessation]</p><p><b>preopterećenje, preopteretiti, prekrcati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an additional charge (as for items previously omitted or as a penalty for failure to exercise common caution or common skill)</p><p><i>v.</i> charge an extra fee, as for a special service</p><p><i>v.</i> rip off [fleece, gazump, hook, overcharge, pluck, plume, rob, soak]</p><p><i>v.</i> fill to capacity with people</p><p><i>v.</i> print a new denomination on a stamp or a banknote</p><p><i>v.</i> fill to an excessive degree</p><p><i>v.</i> place too much a load on [overcharge, overload]</p><p><i>v.</i> show an omission in (an account) for which credit ought to have been given</p><p><b>odvojeno vanjsko krzno obično od bogate materijale, tunika koja se nosi preko viteškog oklopa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a loose outer coat usually of rich material</p><p><i>n.</i> a tunic worn over a knight's armor</p><p><b>glasnik koji se stvara bez zvuka iz glasnih žica., proizvedeno bez vibracija glasnih žica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a consonant produced without sound from the vocal cords [voiceless consonant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> produced without vibration of the vocal cords [hard, unvoiced, voiceless]</p><p><b>naravno, nesumnjiv, pouzdan, siguran, svakako, zacijelo, sigurno</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or feeling no doubt or uncertainty [certain]</p><p><i>adj.</i> exercising or taking care great enough to bring assurance [certain]</p><p><i>adj.</i> certain to occur [certain]</p><p><i>adj.</i> physically secure or dependable</p><p><i>adj.</i> reliable in operation or effect [certain]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of persons) worthy of trust or confidence [trusted]</p><p><i>adj.</i> infallible or unfailing</p><p><i>adj.</i> certain not to fail</p><p><i>adj.</i> impossible to doubt or dispute [indisputable]</p><p><i>adv.</i> definitely or positively (`sure' is sometimes used informally for `surely') [certainly, for certain, for sure, sure as shooting, sure enough, surely]</p><p><b>sigurno, zacijelo</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> absolutely certain</p><p><i>adv.</i> definitely or positively (`sure' is sometimes used informally for `surely') [certainly, for certain, for sure, sure, sure enough, surely]</p><p><b>sigurno, zacijelo</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> as supposed or expected</p><p><i>adv.</i> definitely or positively (`sure' is sometimes used informally for `surely') [certainly, for certain, for sure, sure, sure as shooting, surely]</p><p><b>pouzdanost, sigurna stvar, sigurnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something that is certain 