irati, provjeravati, provjeriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> examine so as to determine accuracy, quality, or condition [check, check into, check out, check over, check up on, go over, look into]</p><p><b>okrug u južnoj Engleskoj na Lamanšu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a county in southern England on the English Channel</p><p><b>Engleska pasmina sa kratkim nogama i zlatnim kožnim plaštom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an English breed with short legs and a golden liver-colored coat</p><p><b>Univerzitet u Brightonu, Engleska (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a red-brick university in Brighton, England [University of Sussex]</p><p><b>dokazati, održati, podnijeti, podržati, podržavati, podupirati, potpomagati, pretrpjeti, uzdržavati, zadobiti, dobiti, hraniti, odgajati, odnjegovati, nahraniti, poduprijeti, potkrepljivati, potkrijepiti, potvrditi, potvrđivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> lengthen or extend in duration or space [keep up, prolong]</p><p><i>v.</i> undergo (as of injuries and illnesses) [get, have, suffer]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide with nourishment [nourish, nurture]</p><p><i>v.</i> supply with necessities and support [keep, maintain]</p><p><i>v.</i> be the physical support of [hold, hold up, support]</p><p><i>v.</i> admit as valid</p><p><i>v.</i> establish or strengthen as with new evidence or facts [affirm, confirm, corroborate, substantiate, support]</p><p><b>održivost, Potrajnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being sustainable</p><p><b>održiv, održivi, održivog, održivu</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being sustained</p><p><b>kontinuiran, ravnomjeran, ravnomjernoga</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> maintained at length without interruption or weakening</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of an electric arc) continuous [free burning]</p><p><b>dokazati, održati, podnijeti, podržati, podržavati, podupirati, potpomagati, pretrpjeti, uzdržavati, zadobiti (od &quot;sustain&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who upholds or maintains [maintainer, upholder]</p><p><b>pedala na klaviru koji podiže amortizatore sa žica i ta