ations</p><p><i>n.</i> the practice of investing things with symbolic meaning [symbolisation, symbolization]</p><p><i>n.</i> an artistic movement in the late 19th century that tried to express abstract or mystical ideas through the symbolic use of images</p><p><b>član umjetničkog pokreta koji je izrazio ideje indirektno putem simbola., osoba vješt u tumačenju ili predstavljanju simbola (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of an artistic movement that expressed ideas indirectly via symbols</p><p><i>n.</i> someone skilled in the interpretation or representation of symbols [symboliser, symbolizer]</p><p><b>oznaka, simbol, simbolizacija, simbolička predodžba, simbolička reprezentacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the use of symbols to convey meaning [symbolisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> something visible that by association or convention represents something else that is invisible [symbol, symbolic representation, symbolisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the practice of investing things with symbolic meaning [symbolisation, symbolism]</p><p><b>označavaju, označavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> express indirectly by an image, form, or model [represent, stand for, symbolise, typify]</p><p><i>v.</i> represent or identify by using a symbol [symbolise]</p><p><b>označavaju, označavati (od &quot;symbolize&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone skilled in the interpretation or representation of symbols [symboliser, symbolist]</p><p><b>označavaju, označavati (od &quot;symbolize&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of representing something with a symbol [symbolising]</p><p><b>upotreba simbola</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the study or the use of symbols and symbolism</p><p><b>obožavanje simbola (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the worship of symbols [symbol-worship, symbolatry]</p><p><b>simetričan, simetrični</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having similarity in size, shape, and relative position of corresponding parts [symmetrical]</p><p><b>podešen, simetričan, skladan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having similarity in size, shape, and relative position o