ojavom tamnog prstena oko tamnog središta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any cell that has a specific receptor for an antigen or antibody or hormone or drug, or is the focus of contact by a virus or phagocyte or nerve fiber etc.</p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal red blood cell with the appearance of a dark ring surrounding a dark center</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 575/2013 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company that has been chosen as attractive for takeover by a potential acquirer [takeover target]</p><p><b>jezik na koji se treba prevesti tekst napisan na drugom jeziku, Računarski jezik na koji se treba prevesti nešto napisano na drugom računalnom jeziku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the language into which a text written in another language is to be translated [object language]</p><p><i>n.</i> a computer language into which something written in another computer language is to be translated [object language]</p><p><b>(radiologija) organ namijenjen primanju terapeutske doze radioaktivne tvari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (radiology) organ intended to receive the therapeutic dose of a radioactive substance</p><p><b>gađanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> practice in shooting at targets</p><p><b>Kompletno sastavljen ili sastavljen program spreman za učitavanje u računalo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a fully compiled or assembled program ready to be loaded into the computer [object program]</p><p><b>razina vježbanja za ciljanu vježbu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a practice range for target practice [firing range]</p><p><b>Automatski usmjeren prema metu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> guided automatically toward the target</p><p><b>rođen ili stanovnik Sjeverne Karoline (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or resident of North Carolina [North Carolinian]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Pacific newts [genus Taricha]</p><p><b>triton na vlažnoj obali od Aljaske do južne Kalifornije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> newt of humid coast from Alaska to southern California [ro