> set or determine the amount of (a payment such as a fine) [assess]</p><p><i>v.</i> use to the limit [task]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a charge against or accuse</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 1303/2013 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an advantage bestowed by legislation that reduces a tax on some preferred activity</p><p><b>vrijednost utvrđena za oporezivu imovinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the value set on taxable property</p><p><b>službenik koji procjenjuje imovinu u svrhu oporezivanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an official who evaluates property for the purpose of taxing it [assessor]</p><p><b>izbjegavanje plaćanja poreza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the minimization of tax liability by lawful methods</p><p><b>ukupna vrijednost oporezivih imovine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> collective value of taxable assets</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 1303/2013 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tax deduction that is granted in order to encourage a particular type of commercial activity [tax break]</p><p><b>novac dugovan za porez (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> money owed for taxes</p><p><b>iznosom kojom se porezi povećavaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount by which taxes are increased [tax-increase, tax hike]</p><p><b>kategorija poreznih obveznika na temelju iznosa njihovih prihoda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a category of taxpayers based on the amount of their income [income bracket, income tax bracket]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 1303/2013 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tax deduction that is granted in order to encourage a particular type of commercial activity [tax benefit]</p><p><b>ubiranje poreza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the collection of taxes</p><p><b>utjerivač poreza, poreznik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who collects taxes for the government [collector of internal revenue, exciseman, internal revenue agent, taxman]</p><p><b>porezna olakšica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a direct reduction in tax liability (not dependent on the taxpayer's tax bracket)</p><p><b>sniženje poreza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of reducing taxation</p><p><b>sniženje poreza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a reduction in the gross amount on which a tax is calculated [deduction, tax write-off]</p><p><b>utaja poreza, evazija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the deliberate failure to pay taxes (usually by making a false report)</p><p><b>obrazac za plaćanje poreza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form to use when paying your taxes</p><p><b>država ili nezavisni region u kojem su porezi niski (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a country or independent region where taxes are low</p><p><b>iznosom kojom se porezi povećavaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount by which taxes are increased [tax-increase, tax boost]</p><p><b>prihod</b></p><p><i>n.</i> government income due to taxation [revenue, tax revenue, taxation]</p><p><b>porezno pravo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the body of laws governing taxation</p><p><b>iznos poreza koji je dugovan (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount of tax owed</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u slučaju neplaćanja poreza ne primjenjuje odredba o povlačenju poreza (analogno odredbi o povlačenju poreza) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lien of which a tax collector may avail himself in default of taxes (analogous to a judgment lien)</p><p><b>Program za određivanje poreza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a program for setting taxes [tax program]</p><p><b>Program za određivanje poreza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a program for setting taxes [tax policy]</p><p><b>porezna stopa, stopa poreza, visina poreza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rate used to calculate tax liability</p><p><b>porezna prijava, povrat poreza, povratak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> document giving the tax collector information about the taxpayer's tax liability [income tax return, return]</p><p><b>prihod</b></p><p><i>n.</i> government income due to taxation [revenue, tax income, taxation]</p><p><b>način organiziranja poslovanja kako bi se smanjili porezi koje mora platiti na tekuće zarade (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a way of organizing business to reduce the taxes it must pay on current earnings [shelter]</p><p><b>porezni sistem, porezni sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a legal system for assessing and collecting taxes</p><p><b>U slučaju da je porez u skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, porez se može izračunati na temelju sljedećih kriterija: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a reduction in the gross amount on which a tax is calculated [deduction, tax deduction]</p><p><b>oslobođenje poreza, oslobođen od poreza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a security that is not subject to taxation [tax-exempt security]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of goods or funds) not taxed [tax-free, untaxed]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je vrijednost ne podliježe oporezivanju, vrijednost se može izračunati na temelju: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a security that is not subject to taxation [tax-exempt]</p><p><b>oslobođen od poreza, oslobođenje poreza, oslobođenje takse</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of goods or funds) not taxed [tax-exempt, untaxed]</p><p><b>povišenje poreza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the amount by which taxes are increased [tax boost, tax hike]</p><p><b>obveza oporezivanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> liability to taxation</p><p><b>oporeziv, podložan porezu</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of goods or funds) subject to taxation [nonexempt]</p><p><b>ponekad klasifikovana kao član reda Taxales (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sometimes classified as member of order Taxales [family Taxaceae, yew family]</p><p><b>u kojoj se nalazi obitelj Taxaceae: tews (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coextensive with the family Taxaceae: yews [order Taxales]</p><p><b>naknada, oporezivanje, porez, porezi, taksiranje, oporezivanja, namet, prihod</b></p><p><i>n.</i> charge against a citizen's person or property or activity for the support of government [revenue enhancement, tax]</p><p><i>n.</i> government income due to taxation [revenue, tax income, tax revenue]</p><p><i>n.</i> the imposition of taxes</p><p><b>breme, davanje, dažbina, državni porez, financijski, harač, oporezovati, opterećenost, opteretiti, porez, porezni, taksa, taksirati, teret, poreza, porezi, poreznim, porezno, oporezivati (od &quot;tax&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bureaucrat who levies taxes</p><p><b>klizi po zemlji, taksi, taksi služba, taksirati, voziti taksi, auto-taksi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a car driven by a person whose job is to take passengers where they want to go in exchange for money [cab, hack, taxicab]</p><p><i>v.</i> travel slowly</p><p><i>v.</i> ride in a taxicab [cab]</p><p><b>Žena koja pleše s mušterijama koje plaćaju naknadu za svaki ples. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman employed to dance with patrons who pay a fee for each dance</p><p><b>cijena vožnje taksijem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the fare charged for riding in a taxicab [cab fare]</p><p><b>stajalište taksija, taksi stajalište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a place where taxis park while awaiting customers [cabstand, taxistand]</p><p><b>rulna pista</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a paved surface in the form of a strip [taxiway]</p><p><b>taksi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a car driven by a person whose job is to take passengers where they want to go in exchange for money [cab, hack, taxi]</p><p><b>u nekim klasifikacijama smatra se rodom podobitelji Melinae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> in some classifications considered a genus of subfamily Melinae [genus Taxidea]</p><p><b>vrsta jazvice porijeklom iz Amerike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a variety of badger native to America [American badger]</p><p><b>nadjevač životinja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a craftsman who stuffs and mounts the skins of animals for display [animal stuffer, stuffer]</p><p><b>umjetnost montaže životinjskih koža tako da imaju životinjski izgled (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the art of mounting the skins of animals so that they have lifelike appearance</p><p><b>netko tko vozi taksi za život (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who drives a taxi for a living [cabby, cabdriver, cabman, hack-driver, hack driver, livery driver, taximan]</p><p><b>netko tko vozi taksi za život (MT)</b></p><p><