o koji od nekoliko primitivnih insekata bez krila i bez očiju koji imaju glavu u obliku čunjeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several minute primitive wingless and eyeless insects having a cone-shaped head [proturan]</p><p><b>član naroda u jugoistočnoj Indiji (Andhra Pradesh) koji govori jezik Telugu, Dravidski jezik koji govore Telugu u jugoistočnoj Indiji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the people in southeastern India (Andhra Pradesh) who speak the Telugu language</p><p><i>n.</i> a Dravidian language spoken by the Telugu in southeastern India</p><p><b>često propisani benzodiazepin (trgovinski naziv Restoril) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a frequently prescribed benzodiazepine (trade name Restoril) [Restoril]</p><p><b>Vulkanska aktivnost ili potresni tokovi na površini zemlje koji nastaju zbog potkopoljskih kretanja uz ravnicu rasjeline ili zbog vulkanske aktivnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shaking and vibration at the surface of the earth resulting from underground movement along a fault plane or from volcanic activity [earthquake, quake, seism]</p><p><b>drzak, ludo hrabar</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> presumptuously daring [daredevil]</p><p><b>brzopletost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fearless daring [audaciousness, audacity]</p><p><b>nekadašnji podred Stegocephalia (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> formerly a suborder of Stegocephalia [order Temnospondyli]</p><p><b>radnik (posebno u uredu) koji je zaposlen na privremenoj osnovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a worker (especially in an office) hired on a temporary basis [temporary, temporary worker]</p><p><b>čvrstoća, ćud, kaliti, narav, raspoloženje, stupanj tvrdoće, temperament, temperirati, učiniti tvrdim, umiriti, očvrsnuti, čvrsnuti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sudden outburst of anger [irritation, pique]</p><p><i>n.</i> a characteristic (habitual or relatively temporary) state of feeling [humor, humour, mood]</p><p><i>n.</i> a disposition to exhibit uncontrolled anger [biliousness, irritability, peevishness, pettishness, snappishness, surliness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the elasticity and hardness of a metal object [toughness]</p><p><i>v.</i> bring to a desired consistency, texture, or hardness by a process of gradually heating and cooling [anneal, normalize]</p><p><i>v.</i> harden by reheating and cooling in oil [harden]</p><p><i>v.</i> adjust the pitch (of pianos)</p><p><i>v.</i> make more temperate, acceptable, or suitable by adding something else [moderate, mollify, season]</p><p><i>v.</i> change by restraining or moderating [chasten]</p><p><b>tempera</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pigment mixed with water-soluble glutinous materials such as size and egg yolk [poster color, poster colour, poster paint]</p><p><b>ćud, temperament, temperamentan, raspoloženje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> your usual mood [disposition]</p><p><i>n.</i> excessive emotionalism or irritability and excitability (especially when displayed openly)</p><p><i>n.</i> an adjustment of the intervals (as in tuning a keyboard instrument) so that the scale can be used to play in different keys</p><p><b>koji se odnosi na ili uzrokovan temperamentom, podložna naglim promjenama raspoloženja, vjerojatno će se neprocjenjivo odvijati (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or caused by temperament</p><p><i>adj.</i> subject to sharply varying moods [moody]</p><p><i>adj.</i> likely to perform unpredictably [erratic]</p><p><b>po temperamentu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> by temperament</p><p><b>suzdržljivost, umjerenost, uzdržljivost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of avoiding excesses [moderation]</p><p><i>n.</i> abstaining from excess [sobriety]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of tempering</p><p><b>blag, suzdržljiv, umjeren</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of weather or climate) free from extremes</p><p><i>adj.</i> not extreme in behavior</p><p><i>adj.</i> not extreme [moderate]</p><p><b>kišna šuma u umjerenom području (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rain forest in a temperate area</p><p><b>umjereni pojas</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of the Earth's surface between the Arctic Circle and the Tropic of Cancer or between the Antarctic Circle and the Tropic of Capricorn</p><p><b>blag, suzdržljiv, umjeren (od &quot;temperate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with restraint</p><p><i>adv.</i> without extravagance</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a sparing manner [abstemiously]</p><p><b>blag, suzdržljiv, umjeren (od &quot;temperate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> moderate weather [fair weather, sunshine]</p><p><i>n.</i> exhibiting restraint imposed on the self [self-restraint]</p><p><b>febra, povišena tjelesna temperatura, temperatura, temperature, temperaturne, temperaturnih, temperaturom</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the degree of hotness or coldness of a body or environment (corresponding to its molecular activity)</p><p><i>n.</i> the somatic sensation of cold or heat</p><p><b>proces kojim se mijenja stepen vrućine tijela (ili medija) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a process whereby the degree of hotness of a body (or medium) changes</p><p><b>promjena temperature u skladu s udaljenostima (posebno visinom) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> change in temperature as a function of distance (especially altitude)</p><p><b>proces postaje hladnije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of becoming cooler [chilling, cooling]</p><p><b>temperaturna ljestvica, temperaturna skala</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system of measuring temperature</p><p><b>mjerna jedinica temperature</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of measurement for temperature</p><p><b>kaljen, okaljen, smekšan, temperiran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> made hard or flexible or resilient especially by heat treatment [hardened, toughened, treated]</p><p><i>adj.</i> adjusted or attuned by adding a counterbalancing element</p><p><b>žarenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hardening something by heat treatment [annealing]</p><p><i>adj.</i> moderating by making more temperate</p><p><b>metež, nepogoda, oluja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a violent commotion or disturbance [storm]</p><p><i>n.</i> (literary) a violent wind</p><p><b>U slučaju da je osoba u slučaju da je osoba u slučaju da je osoba u slučaju da je osoba u