ascar [tendrac]</p><p><b>plodna životinja koja se uglavnom hrani crvima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> prolific animal that feeds chiefly on earthworms [tailless tenrec]</p><p><b>tenreci i izumrli srodni oblici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tenrecs and extinct related forms [family Tenrecidae]</p><p><b>glagolsko vrijeme, napet, napregnut, zategnut, zategnuti, gramatičko vrijeme, vrijeme, zategnuti se, iznervirati se, nervirati se, poživčaniti, uzrujati se, uzrujavati se, živčaniti, uzbuditi, uzbuđivati, uznemiravati, uznemiriti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a grammatical category of verbs used to express distinctions of time</p><p><i>v.</i> become stretched or tense or taut [strain]</p><p><i>v.</i> increase the tension on</p><p><i>v.</i> become tense, nervous, or uneasy [tense up]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be tense and uneasy or nervous or anxious [strain, tense up]</p><p><i>adj.</i> in or of a state of physical or nervous tension</p><p><i>adj.</i> pronounced with relatively tense tongue muscles (e.g., the vowel sound in `beat')</p><p><i>adj.</i> taut or rigid</p><p><b>sustav vremena koji se koristi u određenom jeziku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system of tenses used in a particular language</p><p><b>iznervirati se, nervirati se, poživčaniti, uzrujati se, uzrujavati se, živčaniti, uzbuditi, uzbuđivati, uznemiravati, uznemiriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become tense, nervous, or uneasy [tense]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to be tense and uneasy or nervous or anxious [strain, tense]</p><p><b>s uputama koje ukazuju na napetost (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having inflections to indicate tense</p><p><b>glagolsko vrijeme, napet, napregnut, zategnut, zategnuti (od &quot;tense&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a tense manner</p><p><b>zategnutost, napetost, stres</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the physical condition of being stretched or strained [tautness, tension, tensity]</p><p><i>n.</i> (psychology) a state of mental or emotional strain or suspense [stress, tension]</p><p><b>otpor na istezanje, rastegljiv, vučni, zategnu