><p><i>n.</i> a three-tone Chadic language [Pidlimdi, Yamaltu]</p><p><b>Jedinica informacija jednaka 1000 gigabajta ili 10^12 (1,000,000,000,000) bita (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of information equal to 1000 gigabits or 10^12 (1,000,000,000,000) bits [Tb, Tbit]</p><p><b>Jedinica informacija jednaka 1000 gigabajta ili 10 ^ 12 (1,000,000,000,000) bajta, jedinica informacija jednaka 1024 gibibajta ili 2^40 (1,099,511,627,776) bajta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of information equal to 1000 gigabytes or 10^12 (1,000,000,000,000) bytes [TB]</p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of information equal to 1024 gibibytes or 2^40 (1,099,511,627,776) bytes [TB, TiB, tebibyte]</p><p><b>(računovodstvo) jedinica za mjerenje brzine računalnog sustava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a unit for measuring the speed of a computer system [trillion floating point operations per second]</p><p><b>trilijun perioda u sekundi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one trillion periods per second [THz]</p><p><b>Tera jezik (od &quot;tera&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (medicine) a grossly malformed and usually nonviable fetus [monster]</p><p><b>bilo koji agens koji ometa normalan razvoj embriona: alkohol ili talidomid ili rendgenski zračenje ili rubeola su primjeri (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any agent that interferes with normal embryonic development: alcohol or thalidomide or X-rays or rubella are examples</p><p><b>razvoj defekta u embrionu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the development of defects in an embryo</p><p><b>za koje se smatra da su u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EZ) br. 1907/2006 ili člankom 6. točkom (b) Uredbe (EZ) br. 1907/2006. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to substances or agents that can interfere with normal embryonic development</p><p><b>Biološka grana koja se bavi razvojem malformacija ili ozbiljnih odstupanja od normalnog tipa organizma. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of biology concerned with the development of malformations or serious deviations from the normal type of organism</p><p><b>tumor koji se sastoji od mješavine tkiva koje se obično ne nalaze na tom mjestu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tumor consisting of a mixture of tissues not normally found at that site</p><p><b>lijek protiv hipertenzije (trgovinski naziv Hytrin) koji se koristi za liječenje visokog krvnog tlaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antihypertensive drug (trade name Hytrin) used to treat high blood pressure [Hytrin]</p><p><b>oralni antifungalni lijek (trgovinski naziv Lamisil) koji se koristi za liječenje slučajeva gljivične bolesti noktiju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an oral antifungal drug (trade name Lamisil) used to treat cases of fungal nail disease [Lamisil]</p><p><b>terbij, terbijum</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metallic element of the rare earth group [Tb, atomic number 65]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, "specifični materijali" su materijali koji se upotrebljavaju za proizvodnju električnih goriva. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a separate group of related lanthanides, including terbium, europium, gadolinium, and sometimes dysprosium</p><p><b>treći kanonski sat. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the third canonical hour [tierce]</p><p><b>jastreb</b></p><p><i>n.</i> male hawk especially male peregrine or gyrfalcon [tercelet, tiercel]</p><p><b>Muški sokol, posebno muški peregrine ili gyrfalcon (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> male hawk especially male peregrine or gyrfalcon [tercel, tiercel]</p><p><b>tristogodišnji, tristogodišnjica, trostoljetni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the 300th anniversary (or the celebration of it) [tercentennial, triennial]</p><p><b>tristogodišnjica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the 300th anniversary (or the celebration of it) [tercentenary, triennial]</p><p><b>Kardinalni broj koji je zbir jednog i jednog i jednog. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of one and one and one [3, III, deuce-ace, leash, ternary, ternion, terzetto, three, threesome, tierce, trey, triad, trine, trinity, trio, triplet, troika]</p><p><b>vrsta rod Terebellidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of Terebellidae [genus Terebella]</p><p><b>morski crvi od poliheta koji se kopuju ili oblikuju cijevi, obično s dugim debelim tijelima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> marine burrowing or tube-forming polychete worms usually having long thick bodies [family Terebellidae]</p><p><b>malo mediteransko drvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Mediterranean tree yielding Chian turpentine [Pistacia terebinthus]</p><p><b>crvljakav morski bivalv koji se probuše u drvene pristaništa i brodove pomoću školjki nalik bušilici (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wormlike marine bivalve that bores into wooden piers and ships by means of drill-like shells [shipworm]</p><p><b>brodski crvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shipworms [family Teredinidae]</p><p><b>tipični brodski crv (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> typical shipworm</p><p><b>ne usklađen s zakonima o ishrani (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not conforming to dietary laws [nonkosher, tref]</p><p><b>glumac iz drevnog Rima (rođen u Grčkoj) čije su komedije bile zasnovane na djelima Menandra (190?-159 pne.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dramatist of ancient Rome (born in Greece) whose comedies were based on works by Menander (190?-159 BC) [Publius Terentius Afer]</p><p><b>Britanski dramaturg (1911-1977) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> British playwright (1911-1977) [Rattigan, Sir Terence Mervyn Rattigan]</p><p><b>Sultanat i jedna od 13 država Federacije Malezije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sultanate and one of the 13 states of the Federation of Malaysia</p><p><b>jedan od dva mišića u regiji ramena koji pokreću ramena i ruke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two muscles in the shoulder region that move the shoulders and arms [teres muscle]</p><p><b>Teres mišić koji pomera ruku i okreće je medijalno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> teres muscle that moves the arm and rotates it medially [musculus teres major, teres major muscle]</p><p><b>Teres mišić koji pomera ruku i okreće je medijalno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> teres muscle that moves the arm and rotates it medially [musculus teres major, teres major]</p><p><b>Teres mišić koji dodira ruku i okreće je bočno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> teres muscle that adducts the arm and rotates it laterally [musculus teres minor, teres minor muscle]</p><p><b>Teres mišić koji dodira ruku i okreće je bočno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> teres muscle that adducts the arm and rotates it laterally [musculus teres minor, teres minor]</p><p><b>jedan od dva mišića u regiji ramena koji pokreću ramena i ruke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two muscles in the shoulder region that move the shoulders and arms [teres]</p><p><b>Indijska časna sestra i misionarka u rimokatoličkoj crkvi (rođena albanskim roditeljima u današnjoj Makedoniji) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Indian nun and missionary in the Roman Catholic Church (born of Albanian parents in what is now Macedonia) [Agnes Gonxha Bojaxhiu, Mother Teresa, Mother Theresa, Theresa]</p><p><b>Španjolski mističar i vjerski reformator (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Spanish mystic and religious reformer [Saint Teresa of Avila]</p><p><b>Sovjetska kosmonautkinja koja je bila prva žena u svemiru (rođena 1937.) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Soviet cosmonaut who was the first woman in space (born in 1937) [Valentina Tereshkova, Valentina Vladmirovna Tereshkova]</p><p><b>od biljnih dijelova (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> especially of plant parts</p><p><b>okolišati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be deliberately ambiguous or unclear in order to mislead or withhold information [beat around the bush, equivocate, palter, prevaricate]</p><p><i>v.</i> abandon one's beliefs or allegiances [apostatise, apostatize]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, podrijetlo za proizvodnju proizvoda može se upotrebljavati za proizvodnju proizvoda koji se upotrebljavaju u proizvodnji proizvoda., Čin napuštanja stranke zbog razloga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> falsification by means of vague or ambiguous language [equivocation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of abandoning a party for cause [apostasy]</p><p><b>odgovornik koji izbjegava dati jasan direktan odgovor (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a respondent who avoids giving a clear direct answer [equivocator, hedger]</p><p><b>goveđe ili pile ili morske plodove marinirane u začinjenom sojinom umaku i na roštu ili na roštu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> beef or chicken or seafood marinated in spicy soy sauce and grilled or broiled</p><p><b>član, član razlomka, element, granica, izraz, naziv, nazvati, označiti, pojam, polugodište, propis, rok, semestar, termin, trajanje, tromjesečje, uvjet, uvjeti, mandat, zatvorska kazna, imenovati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word or expression used for some particular thing</p><p><i>n.</i> a limited period of time</p><p><i>n.</i> (usually plural) a statement of what is required as part of an agreement [condition, strings]</p><p><i>n.</i> any distinct quantity contained in a polynomial</p><p><i>n.</i> one of the substantive phrases in a logical proposition</p><p><i>n.</i> the end of gestation or point at which birth is imminent [full term]</p><p><i>n.</i> (architecture) a statue or a human bust or an animal carved out of the top of a square pillar [terminal figure, terminus]</p><p><i>v.</i> name formally or designate with a term</p><p><b>U slučaju da je dijete rođeno u trudnoćnoj dobi između 37 i 42 završene tjedna, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> infant born at a gestational age between 37 and 42 completed weeks</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 3. točkom (d) ove Uredbe, u skladu s (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low-cost insurance that is valid only for a stated period of time and has no cash surrender value or loan value</p><p><b>U slučaju da je ugovor o prijenosu imovine na osobu u tijeku, ugovor o prijenosu imovine na osobu u tijeku je u tijeku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the period of time during which a contract conveying property to a person is in effect [lease]</p><p><b>služenje vojnog roka, vojna služba, vojni rok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a period of time spent in military service [duty tour, enlistment, hitch, tour, tour of duty]</p><p><b>mandat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the term during which some position is held [incumbency, tenure]</p><p><b>sastav namijenjen pokazivanju napretka učenika tijekom školskog razdoblja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a composition intended to indicate a student's progress during a school term</p><p><b>apsida</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a scolding nagging bad-tempered woman [shrew]</p><p><b>član, član razlomka, element, granica, izraz, naziv, nazvati, označiti, pojam, polugodište, propis, rok, semestar, termin, trajanje, tromjesečje, uvjet, uvjeti (od &quot;term&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who serves a specified term</p><p><b>član, član razlomka, element, granica, izraz, naziv, nazvati, označiti, pojam, polugodište, propis, rok, semestar, termin, trajanje, tromjesečje, uvjet, uvjeti (od &quot;term&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type genus of the Termitidae [genus Termes]</p><p><b>ograničen, vremenski određen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being terminated after a designated time</p><p><b>U slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka ne primjenjuje samo na određene subjekte, u slučaju da se u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka ne primjenjuje na druge subjekte, to znači da se u skladu s člankom 4. točkom (a) ili (b) ovog članka ne primjenjuje na druge subjekte. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an interest in property that terminates under specific conditions</p><p><b>finalni, izvod, klema, kolodvor, kraj, krajnja, krajnja stanica, krajnji, krajnji uređaj, priključak, stanica, stezaljka, terminal, terminalan, završan, završni, posljednji</b></p><p><i>n.</i> station where transport vehicles load or unload passengers or goods [depot, terminus]</p><p><i>n.</i> a contact on an electrical device (such as a battery) at which electric current enters or leaves [pole]</p><p><i>n.</i> either extremity of something that has length [end]</p><p><i>n.</i> electronic equipment consisting of a device providing access to a computer</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or situated at the ends of a delivery route</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or occurring in a term or fixed period of time</p><p><i>adj.</i> being or situated at an end</p><p><i>adj.</i> occurring at or forming an end or termination [concluding, final, last]</p><p><i>adj.</i> causing or ending in or approaching death</p><p><b>emuliranje terminala, oponašanje terminala</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) having a computer act exactly like a terminal</p><p><b>(arhitektura) kip ili ljudska busta ili životinja izrezbana s vrha kvadratnog stuba (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (architecture) a statue or a human bust or an animal carved out of the top of a square pillar [term, terminus]</p><p><b>posljednji dopust prije otpuštanja iz vojne službe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> final leave before discharge from military service</p><p><b>granica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> final or latest limiting point [limit, terminus ad quem]</p><p><b>konstantna maksimalna brzina koju tijelo koje pada kroz atmosferu pod gravitacijskom privlačnošću postiže (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the constant maximum velocity reached by a body falling through the atmosphere under the attraction of gravity</p><p><b>na kraju</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> at the end</p><p><b>dokrajčiti, dovršiti, konačan, ograničen, okončati, prekinuti rad, prestati, raskinuti, svršiti, završavati, završiti, završiti program, završiti se, završni, dokrajčivati, dovršavati, okončavati, prekidati, prekinuti, prestajati, svršavati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bring to an end or halt [end]</p><p><i>v.</i> have an end, in a temporal, spatial, or quantitative sense [cease, end, finish, stop]</p><p><i>v.</i> be the end of [end]</p><p><i>v.</i> terminate the employment of [can, dismiss, displace, fire, force out, give notice, give the axe, give the sack, sack, send away]</p><p><b>gotov, okončan, završen</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having come or been brought to a conclusion [all over, complete, concluded, ended, over]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of e.g. a contract or term of office) having come to an end</p><p><b>dovršetak, kraj, krajnje opterećenje, ograničavanje, okončanje, okončavanje, otkaz, prekid, prestanak, priključni uređaj, protek, raskid, svršetak, završavanje, završetak, istek, ishod, rezultat, dočetak, završetak riječi, zaključivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a coming to an end of a contract period [expiration, expiry]</p><p><i>n.</i> a place where something ends or is complete [end point, endpoint, terminus]</p><p><i>n.</i> something that results [final result, outcome, result, resultant]</p><p><i>n.</i> the end of a word (a suffix or inflectional ending or final morpheme) [ending]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of ending something [conclusion, ending]</p><p><b>Kraj je došao. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coming to an end</p><p><b>kraj, ono što ograničava, opterećenje, terminator, zaključnik, zaključnik (lokalne mreže), završnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who exterminates (especially someone whose occupation is the extermination of troublesome rodents and insects) [eradicator, exterminator]</p><p><b>o terminologiji ili o njoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or concerning terminology</p><p><b>nazivlje, stručni izrazi, terminologija, terminologije, nomenklatura</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system of words used to name things in a particular discipline [language, nomenclature]</p><p><b>granica, kraj, krajnja stanica, svršetak, završetak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a place where something ends or is complete [end point, endpoint, termination]</p><p><i>n.</i> the ultimate goal for which something is done [destination]</p>