tivation</p><p><b>kuća koja je dio terase (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a house that is part of a terrace</p><p><b>kopneni, suhozemni, teren, terena, zemaljski, zemljište</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of ground having specific characteristics or military potential</p><p><b>let na vrlo niskim visinama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> flight at very low altitudes [low level flight]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, države članice mogu u skladu s člankom 21. stavkom (b) ovog članka osigurati da se u skladu s člankom 21. stavkom (c) ovog članka: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tactical intelligence on the natural and man-made characteristics of an area</p><p><b>žuti kristalni antibiotik (trgovni znak Terramycin) dobiven iz zemljišnog aktinomiceta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a yellow crystalline antibiotic (trademark Terramycin) obtained from a soil actinomycete [hydroxytetracycline, oxytetracycline, oxytetracycline hydrochloride]</p><p><b>čokolada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> box turtles [genus Terrapene]</p><p><b>uglavnom prerijska kornjača zapadnih Sjedinjenih Država i sjevernog Meksika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> primarily a prairie turtle of western United States and northern Mexico [Western box turtle]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih jestivih sjevernoameričkih kornjača s mrežnim nogama koje žive u slatkoj ili slanoj vodi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various edible North American web-footed turtles living in fresh or brackish water</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 3. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za životinje koje su u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, primjenjuje se sljedeće: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vivarium in which selected living plants are kept and observed</p><p><b>Obezbediti (kuću) s terasom (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> provide (a house) with a terrace [terrace]</p><p><b>obalni region Antarktika na jugu Australije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a costal region of Antarctica to the south of Australia [Adelie Coast, Adelie Land]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s ili nastanjivanje kopna za razliku od mora ili zraka, pripadaju ovoj zemlji ili svijetu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or inhabiting the land as opposed to the sea or air [tellurian, telluric, terrestrial]</p><p><i>adj.</i> belonging to this earth or world [mundane]</p><p><b>Ravni prostor gdje se teška topovi mogu montirati iza parapeta na vrhu zidina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> level space where heavy guns can be mounted behind the parapet at the top of a rampart</p><p><b>kopnen, kopneni, zemaljski, zemljin</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or inhabiting the land as opposed to the sea or air [tellurian, telluric, terrene]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characteristic of the planet Earth or its inhabitants [planetary]</p><p><i>adj.</i> operating or living or growing on land</p><p><i>adj.</i> concerned with the world or worldly matters [mundane]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of this earth [sublunar, sublunary]</p><p><b>(astronomija) mjerilo vremena definirano Zemljinim orbitalnim kretanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (astronomy) a measure of time defined by Earth's orbital motion [TDT, TT, ephemeris time, terrestrial time]</p><p><b>metoda kontrole leta rakete pomoću uređaja koji reagiraju na snagu i smjer zemaljskog gravitacijskog polja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of controlling the flight of a missile by devices that respond to the strength and direction of the earth's gravitational field</p><p><b>planet koji ima kompaktnu stjenovitu površinu poput Zemlje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a planet having a compact rocky surface like the Earth's</p><p><b>(astronomija) mjerilo vremena definirano Zemljinim orbitalnim kretanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (astronomy) a measure of time defined by Earth's orbital motion [TDT, TT, ephemeris time, terrestrial dynamical time]</p><p><b>kopnen, kopneni, zemaljski, zemljin (od &quot;terrestrial&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a worldly manner [mundanely]</p><p><i>adv.</i> to a land environment</p><p><b>grozan, grozno, str