p><i>n.</i> an act of terrorism [terrorization]</p><p><b>terorizirati, zastrašivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> coerce by violence or with threats [terrorize]</p><p><i>v.</i> fill with terror [terrify, terrorize]</p><p><b>terorizam, terorizma</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the calculated use of violence (or the threat of violence) against civilians in order to attain goals that are political or religious or ideological in nature [act of terrorism, terrorist act]</p><p><b>terorist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a radical who employs terror as a political weapon</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, "službenici" su osoblje koje je podređeno postupku "službenici" ili "službenici" u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the calculated use of violence (or the threat of violence) against civilians in order to attain goals that are political or religious or ideological in nature [act of terrorism, terrorism]</p><p><b>iznenadni napad koji uključuje namjerno korištenje nasilja protiv civila u nadi da će se postići politički ili vjerski ciljevi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a surprise attack involving the deliberate use of violence against civilians in the hope of attaining political or religious aims</p><p><b>ćelija terorista (obično od 3 do 5 članova) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cell of terrorists (usually 3 to 5 members) [radical cell]</p><p><b>politički pokret koji koristi terorizam kao oružje za postizanje svojih ciljeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a political movement that uses terror as a weapon to achieve its goals [FTO, foreign terrorist organization, terrorist organization]</p><p><b>politički pokret koji koristi terorizam kao oružje za postizanje svojih ciljeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a political movement that uses terror as a weapon to achieve its goals [FTO, foreign terrorist organization, terrorist group]</p><p><b>Čin inspirirajući sa strahom, Teroristički čin (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of inspiring with fear [frightening, terrorisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> an act of terrorism [terrorisation]</p><p><b>prisiljavanje nasiljem ili prijetnjama, ispuniti sa terorom (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> coerce by violence or with threats [terrorise]</p><p><i>v.</i> fill with terror [terrify, terrorise]</p><p><b>frotir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English actress (1847-1928) [Dame Alice Ellen Terry, Dame Ellen Terry]</p><p><i>n.</i> a pile fabric (usually cotton) with uncut loops on both sides [terry cloth, terrycloth]</p><p><b>od tkanine od pređe (obično od pamuka) s nerezanim petljama sa obje strane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pile fabric (usually cotton) with uncut loops on both sides [terry, terrycloth]</p><p><b>ručnik za kupanje s grubim pločom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bath towel with rough loose pile [Turkish towel]</p><p><b>od tkanine od pređe (obično od pamuka) s nerezanim petljama sa obje strane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pile fabric (usually cotton) with uncut loops on both sides [terry, terry cloth]</p><p><b>kratak, sažet, slikovit</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> brief and to the point [crisp, curt, laconic]</p><p><b>kratak, sažet, slikovit (od &quot;terse&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a short and concise manner [telegraphically]</p><p><b>kratak, sažet, slikovit (od &quot;terse&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a neatly short and concise expressive style</p><p><b>povratna groznica</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to symptoms (especially malarial fever) that appear every other day</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a tonal system based on major thirds</p><p><b>tercijar, tercijaran, tercijarna, treći po redu, treći</b></p><p><i>n.</i> from 63 million to 2 million years ago [Tertiary period]</p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the second and just before the fourth in position [3rd, third]</p><p><b>Tercijar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> from 63 million to 2 million years ago [Tertiary]</p><p><b>Treća faza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the third stage</p><p><b>žena koja je trudna treći put (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a woman who is pregnant for the third time [gravida III]</p><p><b>neka treća stvar slična dva suprotnosti ali različita od obje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> some third thing similar to two opposites but distinct from both</p><p><b>bitka u Francuskoj 687. među potomcima Klovisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a battle in France in 687 among the descendants of Clovis [battle of Tertry]</p><p><b>Tertulijan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Carthaginian theologian whose writing influenced early Christian theology (160-230) [Quintus Septimius Florens Tertullianus]</p><p><b>Polietilentereftalat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a kind of polyester fabric [Dacron]</p><p><b>stih s shemom rime: aba bcb cdc itd. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a verse form with a rhyme scheme: aba bcb cdc, etc.</p><p><b>Kardinalni broj koji je zbir jednog i jednog i jednog. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of one and one and one [3, III, deuce-ace, leash, tercet, ternary, ternion, three, threesome, tierce, trey, triad, trine, trinity, trio, triplet, troika]</p><p><b>jedinica magnetske indukcije, tesla</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of magnetic flux density equal to one weber per square meter</p><p><i>n.</i> United States electrical engineer and inventor (born in Croatia but of Serbian descent) who discovered the principles of alternating currents and developed the first alternating-current induction motor and the Tesla coil and several forms of oscillators (1856-1943) [Nikola Tesla]</p><p><b>Teslin kalem</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a step-up transformer with an air core</p><p><b>mala tesera. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small tessera</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, pločica s teserama (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> fit together exactly, of identical shapes</p><p><i>v.</i> tile with tesserae</p><p><b>s masnim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, s masom od 300 mm ili većom, ali ne većom od 300 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a checkered or mottled appearance</p><p><i>adj.</i> decorated with small pieces of colored glass or stone fitted together in a mosaic</p><p><b>oblaganje poput šahovske ploče, popločenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the careful juxtaposition of shapes in a pattern</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of adorning with mosaic</p><p><b>mala kvadratna pločica od kamena ili stakla koja se koristi za pravljenje mozaika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small square tile of stone or glass used in making mosaics</p><p><b>Četvorodimenzionalni analog kocke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the four-dimensional analogue of a cube</p><p><b>Ticino</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an Italian-speaking region of southern Switzerland [Ticino]</p><p><b>iskušati, iskušavanje, ispit, ispitati, ispitivanje, ispitivati, ispitni, isprobati, kušnja, ogled, pokus, pretraga, proba, probati, probni, provjera, provjeriti, test, testiranje, testirati, zadatak za ispitivanje znanja, ispitna, isprobavanje, iskušavati, isprobavati, probavati, provjeravati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> trying something to find out about it [trial, trial run, tryout]</p><p><i>n.</i> any standardized procedure for measuring sensitivity or memory or intelligence or aptitude or personality etc [mental test, mental testing, psychometric test]</p><p><i>n.</i> a set of questions or exercises evaluating skill or knowledge [exam, examination]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of undergoing testing [trial]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of testing something [run, trial]</p><p><i>n.</i> a hard outer covering as of some amoebas and sea urchins</p><p><i>v.</i> put to the test, as for its quality, or give experimental use to [essay, examine, prove, try, try out]</p><p><i>v.</i> test or examine for the presence of disease or infection [screen]</p><p><i>v.</i> examine someone's knowledge of something [quiz]</p><p><i>v.</i> show a certain characteristic when tested</p><p><i>v.</i> achieve a certain score or rating on a test</p><p><i>v.</i> determine the presence or properties of (a substance)</p><p><i>v.</i> undergo a test</p><p><b>zabranu ispitivanja nuklearnog oružja koja je zajednički dogovorena od strane zemalja koje posjeduju nuklearno oružje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ban on the testing of nuclear weapons that is mutually agreed to by countries that possess nuclear weapons</p><p><b>mjesto opremljeno instrumentima za ispitivanje (npr. motori ili strojevi ili računalni programi itd.) u radnim uvjetima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a place equipped with instruments for testing (e.g. engines or machinery or computer programs etc.) under working conditions</p><p><b>U slučaju da je predmet pravne zaštite ili zaštite od kazne, tužitelj može zatražiti od tužitelja da se odluči o tome. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a representative legal action whose outcome is likely to become a precedent [test suit]</p><p><b>(štampa) otisak napravljen za provjeru pogrešaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (printing) an impression made to check for errors [proof, trial impression]</p><p><b>pokusna vožnja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> test of the roadworthiness of a vehicle one is considering buying</p><p><i>v.</i> test a vehicle by driving it</p><p><b>Vozač koji vozi motorno vozilo kako bi procijenio njegovo djelovanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a driver who drives a motor vehicle to evaluate its performance</p><p><b>oprema za ispitivanje, oprema za provjeravanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> equipment required to perform a test</p><p><b>testiranje aviona (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> test a plane</p><p><b>raketa ispaljena u svrhu ispitivanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rocket fired for test purposes [research rocket, test rocket]</p><p><b>Međunarodni meč za prvenstvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an international championship match [match game, matched game]</p><p><b>Pisan ispit, s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm, ali ne većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a written examination [exam paper, examination paper, question sheet]</p><p><i>n.</i> paper impregnated with an indicator for use in chemical tests</p><p><b>razdoblje ispitivanja, probni rok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a period of time during which someone or something is tested [trial perio