etermined from that of the offspring [test-cross]</p><p><b>ispitan, ispitano, provjeren, testiran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> tested and proved useful or correct [tried, well-tried]</p><p><i>adj.</i> tested and proved to be reliable [time-tested, tried, tried and true]</p><p><b>netko tko je testiran (kao što je test inteligencije ili akademski ispit) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is tested (as by an intelligence test or an academic examination) [examinee]</p><p><b>iskušivač, ispitivač, ispitivalo, laborant, pila, uređaj za ispitivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who administers a test to determine your qualifications [examiner, quizzer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a flat canopy (especially one over a four-poster bed)</p><p><b>mudo, testis</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the two male reproductive glands that produce spermatozoa and secrete androgens [ball, ballock, bollock, egg, nut, orchis, testis]</p><p><b>od testisa ili s njima povezana (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or involving the testes</p><p><b>grana aorte koja opskrbljuje testise (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the aorta supplying the testicles [arteria testicularis, internal spermatic artery]</p><p><b>maligni tumor testisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> malignant tumor of the testis [seminoma]</p><p><b>vena iz testisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein from the testicles [vena testicularis]</p><p><b>srednjovjekovni oklop od ploče za zaštitu konjske glave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medieval plate armor to protect a horse's head [chamfron, chanfron, front-stall, frontstall]</p><p><b>osoba koja svjedoči ili daje izjavu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who testifies or gives a deposition [deponent, deposer]</p><p><b>posvjedočiti, potvrda, potvrditi, svjedočiti, dokazati, dokazivati, pokazati, pokazivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> give testimony in a court of law [attest, bear witness, take the stand]</p><p><i>v.</i> provide evidence for [bear witness, evidence, prove, show]</p><p><b>mrzovoljan, naprasit, razdražljiv (od &quot;testy&quot;)<