 of Sioux people which was made up of several groups that lived on the plains [Lakota, Teton, Teton Dakota]</p><p><b>tetra, četiri -prefiks</b></p><p><i>n.</i> brightly colored tropical freshwater fishes</p><p><b>kiselina koja sadrži četiri zamjenjiva atoma vodika po molekuli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an acid containing four replaceable hydrogen atoms per molecule</p><p><b>za proizvodnju proizvoda od proizvoda iz poglavlja II. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dye used as an acid-base indicator [bromophenol blue, bromphenol blue]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,25% ili više, ali ne više od 0,25%, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a crystalline compound used in the form of a hydrochloride as a local anesthetic</p><p><b>perkloretilen</b></p><p><i>n.</i> anthelmintic agent used against hookworm and other nematodes [carbon dichloride, ethylene tetrachloride, tetrachloroethylene]</p><p><b>tetraklorid</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any compound that contains four chlorine atoms per molecule</p><p><b>tetrakloretilen, perkloretilen</b></p><p><i>n.</i> anthelmintic agent used against hookworm and other nematodes [carbon dichloride, ethylene tetrachloride, tetrachlorethylene]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom masnoće od 1 kg ili više, ali ne više od 1 kg, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a colorless nonflammable liquid used as a solvent for fats and oils [carbon tet, carbon tetrachloride, perchloromethane]</p><p><b>koeficijent korelacije izračunan za dvije promjenljive s normalnom raspodjelom koje su obje izražene kao dikotomija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a correlation coefficient computed for two normally distributed variables that are both expressed as a dichotomy [tetrachoric correlation coefficient]</p><p><b>koeficijent korelacije izračunan za dvije promjenljive s normalnom raspodjelom koje su obje izražene kao dikotomija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a correlation coefficient computed for two normally distributed variables that are both expressed as a dichotomy [tetrachoric correlation]</p><p><b>drvo sandarac (MT)</b></