idst]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not thin</p><p><i>adj.</i> having component parts closely crowded together</p><p><i>adj.</i> relatively dense in consistency</p><p><i>adj.</i> spoken as if with a thick tongue [slurred]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a short and solid form or stature [compact, heavyset, stocky, thickset]</p><p><i>adj.</i> hard to pass through because of dense growth [dense]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of darkness) densely dark [deep]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used informally) associated on close terms [buddy-buddy, chummy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used informally) stupid [blockheaded, boneheaded, duncical, duncish, fatheaded, loggerheaded, thick-skulled, thickheaded, wooden-headed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> abounding</p><p><i>adv.</i> with a thick consistency [thickly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in quick succession [thickly]</p><p><b>koža koja je vrlo debela (kao kod slona ili nosoroga) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> skin that is very thick (as an elephant or rhinoceros)</p><p><b>s debelim kljunom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a thick beak</p><p><b>raznolikost murre (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a variety of murre [Uria lomvia]</p><p><b>imaju deblje tijelo (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a thick body</p><p><b>s masnim granama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having thick branches</p><p><b>ukusna morel sa koničnim plodnim dijelom s dubokim i nepravilnim jamama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a delicious morel with a conic fertile portion having deep and irregular pits [Morchella crassipes]</p><p><b>imaju debeo kosu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having thick hair</p><p><b>Ptica s velikim glavama i velikim očima, noćna ili sumrakasta ptica, iz Starog svijeta i tropske Amerike, s zgustenim zglobom koljena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large-headed large-eyed crepuscular or nocturnal shorebird of the Old World and tropical America having a thickened knee joint [Burhinus oedicnemus, stone curlew]</p><p><b>imaju debele usne (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having thick lips</p><p><b>Neosjetljiv na kritike. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> insensit