 thingummy, whatchamacallit, whatchamacallum, whatsis, widget]</p><p><b>stvarčica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> something unspecified whose name is either forgotten or not known [doodad, doohickey, doojigger, gimmick, gismo, gizmo, gubbins, thingamabob, thingamajig, thingmabob, thingmajig, thingumabob, thingumajig, whatchamacallit, whatchamacallum, whatsis, widget]</p><p><b>činiti se, misliti, namjeravati, pomisliti, razmisliti, razmišljati, sjetiti se, smatrati, vjerovati, zamisliti, zamišljati, mislite, pomišljaju, razmišljajte, nagađati, pretpostaviti, pretpostavljati, suditi, mozgati, premišljati se, promisliti, promišljati, promozgati, prosuditi, prosuđivati, rasuditi, rasuđivati, pomišljati, htjeti, naumiti, željeti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instance of deliberate thinking</p><p><i>v.</i> judge or regard [believe, conceive, consider]</p><p><i>v.</i> expect, believe, or suppose [guess, imagine, opine, reckon, suppose]</p><p><i>v.</i> use or exercise the mind or one's power of reason in order to make inferences, decisions, or arrive at a solution or judgments [cerebrate, cogitate]</p><p><i>v.</i> recall knowledge from memory [call back, call up, recall, recollect, remember, retrieve]</p><p><i>v.</i> imagine or visualize</p><p><i>v.</i> focus one's attention on a certain state</p><p><i>v.</i> have in mind as a purpose [intend, mean]</p><p><i>v.</i> decide by pondering, reasoning, or reflecting</p><p><i>v.</i> ponder</p><p><i>v.</i> dispose the mind in a certain way</p><p><i>v.</i> have or formulate in the mind</p><p><i>v.</i> be capable of conscious thought</p><p><i>v.</i> bring into a given condition by mental preoccupation</p><p><b>razmisliti, razmišljati o, zabavljati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> have on one's mind, think about actively</p><p><i>v.</i> take into consideration, have in view [entertain, flirt with, think of, toy with]</p><p><b>Da se vratimo u prošlost. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> recapture the past [remember]</p><p><b>tvrtka koja radi istraživanje za najam i izdaje izvješća o implikacijama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company that does research for hire and issues reports on the implications [think tank]</p><p><b>misliti, pamtiti, sjetiti se, sjećati se, upamtiti, razmišljati o, zabavljati se, cijeniti, držati, gledati, promatrati, smatrati, razmišljati, domisliti se, domišljati se, izmisliti, izmišljati, izumiti, kovati, skovati, smisliti, smišljati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> keep in mind for attention or consideration [remember]</p><p><i>v.</i> take into consideration, have in view [entertain, flirt with, think about, toy with]</p><p><i>v.</i> look on as or consider [be known as, esteem, know as, look on, look upon, regard as, repute, take to be]</p><p><i>v.</i> intend to refer to [have in mind, mean]</p><p><i>v.</i> devise or invent [concoct, dream up, hatch, think up]</p><p><i>v.</i> choose in one's mind</p><p><b>domisliti se, dovinuti se, izmisliti, osmišljati, razmisliti se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> consider carefully and rationally</p><p><b>promisliti, razmisliti, razmišljati, kontemplirati, meditirati, misliti, mozgati, promišljati, promozgati, razmatrati, razmotriti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> reflect deeply on a subject [chew over, contemplate, excogitate, meditate, mull, mull over, muse, ponder, reflect, ruminate, speculate]</p><p><b>članak u novinama ili časopisima koji predstavlja mišljenja i ideje i raspravu umjesto samo činjenica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an article in a newspaper or magazine or journal that represents opinions and ideas and discussion rather than bare facts</p><p><b>tvrtka koja radi istraživanje za najam i izdaje izvješća o implikacijama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company that does research for hire and issues reports on the implications [think factory]</p><p><b>-Vrlo visoko. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> esteem very highly</p><p><b>pažljivo razmotriti i ponovno razmotriti (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> consider and reconsider carefully</p><p><b>domisliti se, domišljati se, izmisliti, izmišljati, izumiti, kovati, misliti, skovati, smisliti, smišljati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> devise or invent [concoct, dream up, hatch, think of]</p><p><b>koji je sposoban za zamišljanje ili zamišljanje ili razmatranje (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being conceived or imagined or considered</p><p><b>kreativni mislilac, mislilac, um</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an important intellectual [creative thinker, mind]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who exercises the mind (usually in an effort to reach a decision)</p><p><b>misliti, mišljenje, mnijenje, razmišljanje, uman</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of using your mind to consider something carefully [cerebration, intellection, mentation, thought, thought process]</p><p><i>adj.</i> endowed with the capacity to reason [intelligent, reasoning]</p><p><b>stanje u kojem se misli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a state in which one thinks</p><p><b>nedovoljno, razrijeđeno, tanko</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> without force or sincere effort</p><p><i>adv.</i> without viscosity [thin]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a small quantity or extent [lightly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a widely distributed manner</p><p><b>Miješano s vodom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> mixed with water [cut, weakened]</p><p><b>razrjeđivač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diluting agent [diluent, dilutant]</p><p><b>mršav, prorijediti, prorijediti se, prorijeđen, rijedak, slab, smanjiti, stanjiti, stanjiti se, tanak, tanjiti (od &quot;thin&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> relatively small dimension through an object as opposed to its length or width [slenderness, tenuity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of having little body fat [leanness, spareness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being very narrow or thin [fineness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being scanty or scattered [spareness, sparseness, sparsity]</p><p><i>n.</i> a consistency of low viscosity</p><p><b>isklinjavanje, istanjavanje, razrjeđivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of diluting something [cutting]</p><p><b>S druge konstrukcije od željeza ili čelika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> shears with one serrate blade</p><p><b>mala bakterija u obliku šipke koja živi u kanalizaciji ili tlu i oksidira sumpor (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small rod-shaped bacteria living in sewage or soil and oxidizing sulfur</p><p><b>bilo koji bakterija iz roda Thiobacillus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any bacterium of the genus Thiobacillus [sulfur bacteria, sulphur bacteria]</p><p><b>Slobodno živeće kokosove ili štapastih bakterija koje energiju dobivaju od oksidiranja sumpora ili spojeva sumpora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> free-living coccoid to rod-shaped bacteria that derive energy from oxidizing sulfur or sulfur compounds [family Thiobacteriaceae]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,5% ili više, ali ne više od 0,5% (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a salt of thiocyanic acid</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom kiseline od 1 kPa ili više, ali ne većim od 1 kPa, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unstable acid that can be obtained by distilling a thiocyanate salt</p><p><b>Spoj koji se uglavnom koristi u veterinarskoj medicini za uklanjanje unutarnjih parazita od životinja iz farmi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a compound used primarily in veterinary medicine to rid farm animals of internal parasites [phenothiazine]</p><p><b>lijek protiv tumora koji se koristi za liječenje akutne leukemije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antineoplastic drug used to treat acute leukemias</p><p><b>Barbiturat koji je higroskopski prah (trgovinski naziv Pentothal) koji je jak barbiturat koji djeluje brzo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> barbiturate that is a hygroscopic powder (trade name Pentothal) that is a strong barbiturate that acts rapidly [Pentothal, thiopental sodium, thiopentobarbital sodium]</p><p><b>Barbiturat koji je higroskopski prah (trgovinski naziv Pentothal) koji je jak barbiturat koji djeluje brzo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> barbiturate that is a hygroscopic powder (trade name Pentothal) that is a strong barbiturate that acts rapidly [Pentothal, thiopental, thiopentobarbital sodium]</p><p><b>Barbiturat koji je higroskopski prah (trgovinski naziv Pentothal) koji je jak barbiturat koji djeluje brzo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> barbiturate that is a hygroscopic powder (trade name Pentothal) that is a strong barbiturate that acts rapidly [Pentothal, thiopental, thiopental sodium]</p><p><b>- lijek za smirenje (trgovinski naziv Mellaril) koji se koristi za liječenje shizofrenije i drugih psihotičnih poremećaja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tranquilizer (trade name Mellaril) used to treat schizophrenia and other psychotic disorders [Mellaril]</p><p><b>S druge strane, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, u skladu s člankom 6. stavkom 1. ovog Pravilnika, proizvodi koji sadrže sulfonamidne proteine mogu se koristiti za proizvodnju: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> trade name for a sulfonamide antibacterial</p><p><b>lijek protiv tumora koji se koristi za liječenje određenih malignih tumora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antineoplastic drug used to treat certain malignancies</p><p><b>uspavač (trgovinski naziv Navane) koji se koristi za liječenje shizofrenije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tranquilizer (trade name Navane) used to treat schizophrenia [Navane]</p><p><b>potiskuje funkciju štitne žlijezde (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> depresses the function of the thyroid gland</p><p><b>treće, treći, trećih, trećina, trećinu, trećoj, treća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of three equal parts of a divisible whole [one-third, tierce]</p><p><i>n.</i> the fielding position of the player on a baseball team who is stationed near the third of the bases in the infield (counting counterclockwise from home plate) [third base]</p><p><i>n.</i> following the second position in an ordering or series</p><p><i>n.</i> the musical interval between one note and another three notes away from it</p><p><i>n.</i> the third from the lowest forward ratio gear in the gear box of a motor vehicle [third gear]</p><p><i>n.</i> the base that must be touched third by a base runner in baseball [third base]</p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the second and just before the fourth in position [3rd, tertiary]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in the third place [thirdly]</p><p><b>Engleski fizičar koji je proučavao gustoću plinova i otkrio argon (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> English physicist who studied the density of gases and discovered argon [John William Strutt, Lord Rayleigh, Rayleigh]</p><p><b>Baza koja mora biti dodirnuti treći bazom trkač u bejzbolu, položaj igrača u bejzbol timu koji je stacioniran u blizini treće baze na infield (brojajući u suprotnom smjeru kazaljke na kući ploči) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the base that must be touched third by a base runner in baseball [third]</p><p><i>n.</i> the fielding position of the player on a baseball team who is stationed near the third of the bases in the infield (counting counterclockwise from home plate) [third]</p><p><b>(baseball) osoba koja igra treću bazu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) the person who plays third base [third sacker]</p><p><b>bitka u Prvom svjetskom ratu (1917) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> battle in World War I (1917) [Ypres, battle of Ypres]</p><p><b>za poštansku poštu koja se sastoji od tiskanog materijala koji ispunjava uvjete za popuste poštanske tarife, jeftini smještaj na brodu ili vlaku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mail consisting of printed matter qualifying for reduced postal rates [third-class mail]</p><p><i>n.</i> inexpensive accommodations on a ship or train [tourist class]</p><p><b>Treći carigradski sabor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the sixth ecumenical council in 680-681 which condemned Monothelitism by defining two wills in Christ, divine and human [Constantinople]</p><p><b>okulomotorni živac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> supplies extrinsic muscles of the eye [nervus oculomotorius, oculomotor, oculomotor nerve]</p><p><b>Križarski rat od 1189. do 1192. godine pod vodstvom Richarda I. i kralja Francuske koji je propao jer vojska rastrgana nesuglasicama i borbom na stranom tlu nije mogla uspjeti protiv snaga ujedinjenih vjerskom revnošću (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Crusade from 1189 to 1192 led by Richard I and the king of France that failed because an army torn by dissensions and fighting on foreign soil could not succeed against forces united by religious zeal</p><p><b>paluba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the deck below the main deck [lower deck]</p><p><b>Ispitivanje često popraćeno mučenjem kako bi se dobili informacije ili priznanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> interrogation often accompanied by torture to extort information or a confession</p><p><b>dimenzija kojom se čvrsti predmet razlikuje od dvodimenzionalnog crteža toga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the dimension whereby a solid object differs from a two-dimensional drawing of it</p><p><b>Treće pismo iz Novog zavjeta koje se tradicionalno pripisuje svetom Ivanu Apostolu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the third New Testament epistle traditionally attributed to Saint John the Apostle [III John]</p><p><b>obični ljudi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the common people [Commons]</p><p><b>čulna struktura sposobna za prijem svjetlosti smještena na dorsalnoj strani diencefalona u različitim gmizavcima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sensory structure capable of light reception located on the dorsal side of the diencephalon in various reptiles [pineal eye]</p><p><b>zaštitni sloj kože u očima gmizavaca i ptica i nekih sisara (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a protective fold of skin in the eyes of reptiles and birds and some mammals [nictitating membrane]</p><p><b>treći od najnižeg prijelaznog omjera u mjenjačnici motornog vozila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the third from the lowest forward ratio gear in the gear box of a motor vehicle [third]</p><p><b>interesna skupina koja pokušava utjecati na zakonodavce ili birokrate da djeluju u njihovu korist, obično kroz lobiranje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an interest group that tries to influence legislators or bureaucrats to act in their favor, typically through lobbying [advocacy group, lobby, lobby group, pressure group, special-interest group, special interest, special interest group]</p><p><b>Lateranski koncil 1179. godine koji je osudio hereze Albigenaca i Waldesaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the Lateran Council in 1179 that condemned the heresies of the Albigenses and the Waldenses</p><p><b>Akcija i reakcija su jednake i suprotne. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> action and reaction are equal and opposite [Newton's third law, Newton's third law of motion, law of action and reaction]</p><p><b>Zakon koji navodi da se entropija tvari približava nuli dok se njena temperatura približava apsolutnoj nuli. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> law stating that the entropy of a substance approaches zero as its temperature approaches absolute zero</p><p><b>neovisni proizvođač, treća osoba, treća strana</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone other than the principals who are involved in a transaction</p><p><i>n.</i> a political party organized in opposition to the major parties in a two-party system</p><p><b>treća osoba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pronouns and verbs that are used to refer to something other than the speaker or addressee of the language in which they occur</p><p><b>kub, treća potencija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the product of three equal terms [cube]</p><p><b>S druge strane, za vozila s motorom za vožnju u kategoriji vozila iz točkova 8702 do 8703 ne smiju se koristiti električni pogoni za vožnju u kategoriji vozila za vožnju u kategoriji vozila za vožnju u kategoriji vozila za vožnju u kategoriji vozila za vožnju u kategoriji vozila za vožnju u kategoriji vozila za vožnju u kategoriji vozila za vožnju u kategoriji vozila za vožnju u kategoriji vozila za vožnju u kategoriji vozila za vožnju u kategoriji vozila za vožnju u kategoriji vozila za vožnju u kategoriji vozila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rail through which electric current is supplied to an electric locomotive</p><p><b>nacistička diktatura pod Hitlerom (1933-1945) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the Nazi dictatorship under Hitler (1933-1945) [Nazi Germany]</p><p><b>(baseball) osoba koja igra treću bazu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (baseball) the person who plays third base [third baseman]</p><p><b>knjižavci, omasum, psalterium</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the third compartment of the stomach of a ruminant [omasum, psalterium]</p><p><b>skup limfnog tkiva u grlu iza uvule (na stražnjem zidu i krovu nosohotre) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of lymphatic tissue in the throat behind the uvula (on the posterior wall and roof of the nasopharynx) [Luschka's tonsil, adenoid, pharyngeal tonsil, tonsilla adenoidea, tonsilla pharyngealis]</p><p><b>razdoblje koje se proteže od 28. tjedna trudnoće do porođaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> time period extending from the 28th week of gestation until delivery</p><p><b>Uzak komor u srednjoj ravni ispod corpus callosuma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a narrow ventricle in the midplane below the corpus callosum</p><p><b>Podrazumijeva se da su u regiji koje su u razvoju i koje su u razvoju u Aziji i Africi i Latinskoj Americi zajedno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> underdeveloped and developing countries of Asia and Africa and Latin America collectively</p><p><b>za poštansku poštu koja se sastoji od tiskanog materijala koji ispunjava uvjete za popuste poštanske tarife (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mail consisting of printed matter qualifying for reduced postal rates [third class]</p><p><b>Opekline koje su karakterizirane uništenjem i epiderme i derme (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> burn characterized by destruction of both epidermis and dermis</p><p><b>koji uključuju ili se odnose na tri dimenzije ili aspekte (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> involving or relating to three dimensions or aspects [3-dimensional, three-d, three-dimensional]</p><p><b>svojstvo imati tri dimenzije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of having three dimensions [three-dimensionality]</p><p><b>završetak na trećem mjestu (kao u utrci) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a finish in third place (as in a race)</p><p><b>od druge vrste (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of lesser quality than second-rate</p><p><b>Onaj koji je trećeg reda ili jasno inferiorni. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who is third-rate or distinctly inferior</p><p><b>korišten u trećoj ili predposljednjoj godini srednje škole ili koledža u Sjedinjenim Državama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> used of the third or next to final year in United States high school or college [junior, next-to-last]</p><p><b>odvojena od prvobitnog ili izvornog kroz dva međupredjela, dvostruko neizravnim sredstvima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> derived from what is primary or original by two intermediate steps</p><p><i>adv.</i> by doubly indirect means</p><p><b>treće, treći, trećih, trećina, trećinu, trećoj, treća (od &quot;third&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in the third place [third]</p><p><b>biti žedan, pohlepa, požuda, žeđ, žeđa, čeznuti, željeti, žuditi, žudjeti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a physiological need to drink [thirstiness]</p><p><i>n.</i> strong desire for something (not food or drink) [hunger, hungriness, thirstiness]</p><p><i>v.</i> feel the need to drink</p><p><i>v.</i> have a craving, appetite, or great desire for [crave, hunger, lust, starve]</p><p><b>znatiželja koja potiče istraživanje i proučavanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> curiosity that motivates investigation and study [desire to know, lust for learning]</p><p><b>biti žedan, pohlepa, požuda, žeđ, žeđa (od &quot;thirst&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person with a strong desire for something [longer, yearner]</p><p><b>žedan (od &quot;thirsty&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a thirsty manner</p><p><i>adv.</i> with eagerness [eagerly]</p><p><b>žeđ</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a deficiency of moisture (especially when resulting from a permanent absence of rainfall) [aridity, aridness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a physiological need to drink [thirst]</p><p><i>n.</i> strong desire for something (not food or drink) [hunger, hungriness, thirst]</p><p><b>žedan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> needing moisture</p><p><i>adj.</i> feeling a need or desire to drink</p><p><i>adj.</i> (usually followed by `for') extremely desirous [athirst, hungry]</p><p><i>adj.</i> able to take in large quantities of moisture</p><p><b>trinaest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of twelve and one [13, XIII, baker's dozen, long dozen]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than twelve [13, xiii]</p><p><b>trinaesti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> position 13 in a countable series of things</p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the twelfth in position [13th]</p><p><b>one, trideset, tridesetak (od &quot;thirty&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time of life between 30 and 40 [mid-thirties, thirty-something]</p><p><i>n.</i> the decade from 1930 to 1939 [1930s]</p><p><b>trideseti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> position 30 in a countable series of things</p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the twenty-ninth in position [30th]</p><p><b>one, trideset, tridesetak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the product of ten and three [30, XXX]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being ten more than twenty [30, xxx]</p><p><b>niz sukoba (1618-1648) između protestanata i katolika koji su počeli u Njemačkoj i proširili se dok se Francuska i Danska i Švedska nisu suprotstavile Svetoj rimskoj imperiji i Španjolskoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a series of conflicts (1618-1648) between Protestants and Catholics starting in Germany and spreading until France and Denmark and Sweden were opposing the Holy Roman Empire and Spain</p><p><b>-Biti osam više od trideset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being eight more than thirty [38, xxxviii]</p><p><b>redovni broj od trideset osam u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of thirty-eight in counting order [38th]</p><p><b>redovni broj od trideset pet u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of thirty-five in counting order [35th]</p><p><b>Slijedi nakon tridesetog na položaju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the thirtieth in position [31st]</p><p><b>biti pet više od trideset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being five more than thirty [35, xxxv]</p><p><b>biti četiri više od trideset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being four more than thirty [34, xxxiv]</p><p><b>redovni broj od trideset četiri u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of thirty-four in counting order [34th]</p><p><b>Da je devet više od trideset. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being nine more than thirty [39, ixl]</p><p><b>redovni broj trideset devet u redu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of thirty-nine in counting order [39th]</p><p><b>biti jedan više od trideset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being one more than thirty [31, xxxi]</p><p><b>jedan dio u trideset dva jednaka dijela, redovni broj trideset dva u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one part in thirty-two equal parts [one-thirty-second, thirty-second part]</p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of thirty-two in counting order [32nd]</p><p><b>glazbena nota s vremenskom vrijednošću od trideset sekundi cijele note (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a musical note having the time value of a thirty-second of a whole note [demisemiquaver]</p><p><b>jedan dio u trideset dva jednaka dijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one part in thirty-two equal parts [one-thirty-second, thirty-second]</p><p><b>biti sedam više od trideset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being seven more than thirty [37, xxxvii]</p><p><b>redovni broj od trideset sedam u redu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of thirty-seven in counting order [37th]</p><p><b>biti šest više od trideset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being six more than thirty [36, xxxvi]</p><p><b>redovni broj od trideset i šest u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of thirty-six in counting order [36th]</p><p><b>životni vijek između 30 i 40 godina. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time of life between 30 and 40 [mid-thirties, thirties]</p><p><b>redovni broj od trideset tri u redoslijedu brojanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> the ordinal number of thirty-three in counting order [33rd]</p><p><b>biti tri više od trideset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being three more than thirty [33, xxxiii]</p><p><b>biti dva više od trideset (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> being two more than thirty [32, xxxii]</p><p><b>Francuski filozof (rođen u Njemačkoj) poznat kao jedan od prvih ateista u Europi koji se sebe opisao kao ateista (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French philosopher (born in Germany) famous as being one of the first self-described atheists in Europe [Dietrich, Paul-Henri Thiry, Paul Heinrich Dietrich, baron d'Holbach, d'Holbach]</p><p><b>večeras</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> during the night of the present day [this night, tonight]</p><p><b>večeras</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> during the night of the present day [this evening, tonight]</p><p><b>čičak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous plants of the family Compositae and especially of the genera Carduus and Cirsium and Onopordum having prickly-edged leaves</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 do 0,15 g/m2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> pappus of a thistle consisting of silky featherlike hairs attached to the seed-like fruit of a thistle</p><p><b>Kao da je trn. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling a thistle</p><p><b>ovamo, ovdje, tu</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> to or toward that place [there]</p><p><b>biljke iz umjerenih područja: penikris (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> herbs of temperate regions: pennycress [genus Thlaspi]</p><p><b>Fetoidni evroazijski korov s okruglim ravnim čunjama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> foetid Eurasian weed having round flat pods [French weed, fanweed, field pennycress, mithridate mustard, penny grass, stinkweed]</p><p><b>magisterij iz teologije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a master's degree in theology [Master of Theology]</p><p><b>mada</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the Tai languages</p><p><b>rašlja, trpjeti, viljuška, soha</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a holder attached to the gunwale of a boat that holds the oar in place and acts as a fulcrum for rowing [oarlock, peg, pin, rowlock, tholepin]</p><p><b>viljuška, soha</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a holder attached to the gunwale of a boat that holds the oar in place and acts as a fulcrum for rowing [oarlock, peg, pin, rowlock, thole]</p><p><b>Američki urar koji je uveo masovnu proizvodnju (1785-1859), Američki socijalista koji je bio šest puta kandidat za predsjednika (1884-1968), radio-novinar tijekom Prvog i Drugog svjetskog rata poznat po svom noćnom novom emitovanju (1892-1981), Velški pjesnik (1914-1953), Poslanik koji nije vjerovao u uskrsnuće Isusa dok ga nije vidio očima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States clockmaker who introduced mass production (1785-1859) [Seth Thomas]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States socialist who was a candidate for president six times (1884-1968) [Norman Mattoon Thomas, Norman Thomas]</p><p><i>n.</i> a radio broadcast journalist during World War I and World War II noted for his nightly new broadcast (1892-1981) [Lowell Jackson Thomas, Lowell Thomas]</p><p><i>n.</i> Welsh poet (1914-1953) [Dylan Marlais Thomas, Dylan Thomas]</p><p><i>n.</i> the Apostle who would not believe the resurrection of Jesus until he saw Jesus with his own eyes [Saint Thomas, St. Thomas, Thomas the doubting Apostle, doubting Thomas]</p><p><b>(Rimska katolička crkva) nadbiskup Canterburyja od 1162. do 1170. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman Catholic Church) archbishop of Canterbury from 1162 to 1170 [Becket, Saint Thomas a Becket, St. Thomas a Becket]</p><p><b>Njemački svećenik (1380-1471) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German ecclesiastic (1380-1471) [a Kempis]</p><p><b>Izumitelj iz Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States inventor [Edison, Thomas Edison]</p><p><b>(Rimska katolička crkva) Talijanski teolog i doktor crkve koji se sjeća za svoj pokušaj pomirenja vjere i razuma u sveobuhvatnoj teologiji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Roman Catholic Church) Italian theologian and Doctor of the Church who is remembered for his attempt to reconcile faith and reason in a comprehensive theology [Aquinas, Saint Thomas, Saint Thomas Aquinas, St. Thomas, St. Thomas Aquinas]</p><p><b>Američki inženjer telefona koji je pomagao Alexanderu Grahamu Bellu u