lus that has broken away from a thrombus</p><p><b>enzim koji se oslobađa iz trombocita i pretvara protrombin u trombin kada krv počne zgrušavati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an enzyme liberated from blood platelets that converts prothrombin into thrombin as blood starts to clot [factor III, thromboplastin]</p><p><b>proces razgradnje i rastvaranja krvnih ugrušaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of breaking up and dissolving blood clots</p><p><b>vrsta lijekova koji mogu razbiti ugruške blokiraju protok krvi do srčanog mišića (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a kind of pharmaceutical that can break up clots blocking the flow of blood to the heart muscle [clot buster, thrombolytic agent]</p><p><b>vrsta lijekova koji mogu razbiti ugruške blokiraju protok krvi do srčanog mišića (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a kind of pharmaceutical that can break up clots blocking the flow of blood to the heart muscle [clot buster, thrombolytic]</p><p><b>liječenje koje se sastoji od primjene farmakološkog agensa koji uzrokuje tromboliza abnormalnog krvnog ugruška (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> therapy consisting of the administration of a pharmacological agent to cause thrombolysis of an abnormal blood clot</p><p><b>trombocitopenija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blood disease characterized by an abnormally small number of platelets in the blood [thrombocytopenia]</p><p><b>Phlebitis u kombinaciji s stvaranjem krvnog ugruška (trombus) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> phlebitis in conjunction with the formation of a blood clot (thrombus)</p><p><b>enzim koji se oslobađa iz trombocita i pretvara protrombin u trombin kada krv počne zgrušavati (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an enzyme liberated from blood platelets that converts prothrombin into thrombin as blood starts to clot [factor III, thrombokinase]</p><p><b>- da se zatvori zbog tromba. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> become blocked by a thrombus</p><p><b>koji je zahvaćen ili je začepljen ugrušanjem koagulacije krvi (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> affected with or obstructed by a clot of coagulated blood</p><p><b>tromboza, začepljenje vena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the formation or presence of a thrombus (a clot of coagulated blood attached at the site of its formation) in a blood vessel</p><p><b>krvni ugrušak koji se formira unutar krvne žile i ostaje vezan za mjesto njegovog porijekla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blood clot formed within a blood vessel and remaining attached to its place of origin</p><p><b>prijestol, prijestolja, prijestolje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the chair of state for a monarch, bishop, etc.</p><p><i>n.</i> a plumbing fixture for defecation and urination [can, commode, crapper, pot, potty, stool, toilet]</p><p><i>n.</i> the position and power of an exalted person (a sovereign or bishop) who is entitled to sit in a chair of state on ceremonial occasions</p><p><i>v.</i> sit on the throne as a ruler</p><p><i>v.</i> put a monarch on the throne [enthrone]</p><p><b>gomila, gužva, mnoštvo, navala, rulja, vreva, sabiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large gathering of people [concourse, multitude]</p><p><i>v.</i> press tightly together or cram [jam, mob, pack, pile]</p><p><b>gomila, gužva, mnoštvo, navala, rulja, vreva (od &quot;throng&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> filled with great numbers crowded together</p><p><b>S druge strane, za proizvodnju proizvoda iz tarifne kategorije 9403 ili 9404 ne smiju se upotrebljavati proizvodi iz tarifne kategorije 9404 ili 9405 osim onih koji se upotrebljavaju za proizvodnju proizvoda iz tarifne kategorije 9405 ili 9406, Obična staromorska bradavica poznata po svojoj pjesmi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a spinning machine formerly used to twist and wind fibers of cotton or wool continuously</p><p><i>n.</i> common Old World thrush noted for its song [Turdus philomelos, mavis, song thrush]</p><p><b>dušnik, gušiti, prigušiti, prigušivač, regulator, regulirati, ventil, gas, gas pedala, papučica ubrzanja, papučica za gas, papučica za ubrzavanje, pedala za ubrzavanje, daviti, udaviti, zadaviti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a valve that regulates