cus]</p><p><b>mišić koji ide od tibije do prvih metatarzalnih i klinastih kostiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a muscle running from the tibia to the first metatarsal and cuneiform bones [tibialis anterior]</p><p><b>ili dva skeletna mišića u svakoj nozi koja proizlaze iz tibije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two skeletal muscle in each leg arising from the tibia [musculus tibialis, tibialis]</p><p><b>duboki mišić noge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a deep muscle of the leg [tibialis posticus]</p><p><b>duboki mišić noge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a deep muscle of the leg [tibialis posterior]</p><p><b>muhe za žetvu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> harvest flies [genus Tibicen]</p><p><b>drek, govno</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of information equal to 1024 gibibits or 2^40 (1,099,511,627,776) bits [tebibit]</p><p><b>Grad dvadeset milja istočno od Rima (Tibur je drevno ime) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a town twenty miles to the east of Rome (Tibur is the ancient name) [Tivoli]</p><p><b>grč u licu, grčevita bol u licu, grčevito trzanje, tik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a local and habitual twitching especially in the face</p><p><b>intenzivna paroksismalna neuralgija duž trigeminalnog živca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intense paroxysmal neuralgia along the trigeminal nerve [trigeminal neuralgia]</p><p><b>igra u kojoj dva igrača napunjuju križeve i krugove u jedan od odjeljaka kvadratne mreže od devet mjesta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a game in which two players alternately put crosses and circles in one of the compartments of a square grid of nine spaces [noughts and crosses, tick-tack-toe, ticktacktoe, ticktacktoo, tit-tat-toe]</p><p><b>osnovna jedinica novca u Tajlandu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in Thailand [baht]</p><p><b>Zidne škriljke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wall creepers [genus Tichodroma]</p><p><b>crvenokosa i siva ptica koja živi u gradskim zidovima i planinskim liticama južne Evrasije i sjeverne Afrike. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> crimson-and-grey songbird that inhabits town walls and mountain cliffs of southern Eurasia and northern Africa [tichodrome, wall creeper]</p><p><b>crvenokosa i siva ptica koja živi u gradskim zidovima i planinskim liticama južne Evrasije i sjeverne Afrike. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> crimson-and-grey songbird that inhabits town walls and mountain cliffs of southern Eurasia and northern Africa [Tichodroma muriaria, wall creeper]</p><p><b>Ticino</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an Italian-speaking region of southern Switzerland [Tessin]</p><p><b>bilježiti, jedan otkucaj digitalnog sata u računalu, kontrolni znak, krpelj, kucanje, kukica, kvačica, markirati, obilježiti, otkucaj, otkucavati, označiti, trenutak, veresija, kuckati, kucnuti, škljocati, škljocnuti, kucati, odbiti, otkucati, tući, udarati, udariti, označavati, provjeravati, provjeriti, ubrojavati, ubrojiti, zabilježiti, zabilježivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metallic tapping sound [ticking]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of two families of small parasitic arachnids with barbed proboscis</p><p><i>n.</i> a mark indicating that something has been noted or completed etc. [check, check mark]</p><p><i>n.</i> a light mattress</p><p><i>v.</i> make a clicking or ticking sound [click]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a sound like a clock or a timer [beat, ticktack, ticktock]</p><p><i>v.</i> sew [retick]</p><p><i>v.</i> put a check mark on or near or next to [check, check off, mark, mark off, tick off]</p><p><b>uzrokovane reketsijalnim bakterijama i prenose se drvenim krpeljima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> caused by rickettsial bacteria and transmitted by wood ticks [Rocky Mountain spotted fever, mountain fever]</p><p><b>bilježiti, označavati, označiti, provjeravati, provjeriti, ubrojavati, ubrojiti, zabilježiti, zabilježivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put a check mark on or near or next to [check, check off, mark, mark off, tick]</p><p><b>raditi minimalnom snagom, raditi na mjestu</b></p><p><i>v.</i> run disconnected or idle [idle]</p><p><b>bilo koja od različitih tropskih i subtropskih biljaka s trifolijatnim listovima i grubo ljepljivim dijelovima ili podnožjima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various tropical and subtropical plants having trifoliate leaves and rough sticky pod sections or loments [beggar's lice, beggar lice]</p><p><b>igra u kojoj dva igrača napunjuju križeve i krugove u jedan od odjeljaka kvadratne mreže od devet mjesta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a game in which two players alternately put crosses and circles in one of the compartments of a square grid of nine spaces [noughts and crosses, tic-tac-toe, ticktacktoe, ticktacktoo, tit-tat-toe]</p><p><b>bilo koja od brojnih biljaka roda Coreopsis s obiljem prikazivanja obično žutih cvjetova nalik na margarine tijekom dugih razdoblja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous plants of the genus Coreopsis having a profusion of showy usually yellow daisylike flowers over long periods [coreopsis, tickseed, tickweed]</p><p><b>prekidač, zujalica, sat</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the hollow muscular organ located behind the sternum and between the lungs [heart, pump]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small portable timepiece [watch]</p><p><i>n.</i> a character printer that automatically prints stock quotations on ticker tape [stock ticker]</p><p><b>traka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a continuous thin ribbon of paper on which stock quotes are written</p><p><b>etiketa, globa, karta, karton, kazna, putna karta, srećka, ulaznica, vozna karta</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a commercial document showing that the holder is entitled to something (as to ride on public transportation or to enter a public entertainment)</p><p><i>n.</i> a label written or printed on paper, cardboard, or plastic that is attached to something to indicate its owner, nature, price, etc. [tag]</p><p><i>n.</i> a summons issued to an offender (especially to someone who violates a traffic regulation)</p><p><i>n.</i> a list of candidates nominated by a political party to run for election to public offices [slate]</p><p><i>n.</i> the appropriate or desirable thing [just the ticket]</p><p><i>v.</i> issue