><p><b>prozor kroz koji se prodaju karte (kao iz blagajne) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a window through which tickets are sold (as from a ticket booth)</p><p><b>dozvola koja je prethodno izdata osuđenima koja im omogućuje da napuste zatvor pod određenim ograničenjima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a permit formerly given to convicts allowing them to leave prison under specific restrictions</p><p><b>kucanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a metallic tapping sound [tick]</p><p><i>n.</i> a strong fabric used for mattress and pillow covers</p><p><b>problematična situacija koja će na kraju postati opasna ako se ne riješi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a problematic situation that will eventually become dangerous if not addressed [time bomb]</p><p><b>golicanje, golicati, škakljanje, škakljati, zagolicati, draškati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cutaneous sensation often resulting from light stroking</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of tickling [tickling, titillation]</p><p><i>v.</i> touch (a body part) lightly so as to excite the surface nerves and cause uneasiness, laughter, or spasmodic movements [titillate, vellicate]</p><p><i>v.</i> feel sudden intense sensation or emotion [thrill, vibrate]</p><p><i>v.</i> touch or stroke lightly</p><p><b>uznijeti, zgroziti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> fill with sublime emotion [beatify, exalt, exhilarate, inebriate, thrill]</p><p><b>golicanje, golicati, škakljanje, škakljati (od &quot;tickle&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a file of memoranda or notices that remind of things to be done [tickler file]</p><p><b>Smanjena zavojnica u seriji s anodom vakuumske cijevi i priključena na mrežu za pružanje povratne informacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small coil in series with the anode of a vacuum tube and coupled to the grid to provide feedback</p><p><b>datoteka s memorandumima ili obavijestima koje podsjećaju na stvari koje treba učiniti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a file of memoranda or notices that remind of things to be done [tickler]</p><p><b>povratna sprega, škakljanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of tickling [tickle, titillation]</p><p><i>adj.</i> exciting by touching lightly so as to cause laughter or twitching movements [tingling, titillating]</p><p><b>kritički, osjetljiv, škakljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> difficult to handle [delicate, touchy]</p><p><b>bilo koja od brojnih biljaka roda Coreopsis s obiljem prikazivanja obično žutih cvjetova nalik na margarine tijekom dugih razdoblja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous plants of the genus Coreopsis having a profusion of showy usually yellow daisylike flowers over long periods [coreopsis, tick-weed, tickweed]</p><p><b>Sjevernoamerička borovnica s velikim cvijećem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American bur marigold with large flowers [Bidens coronata, Bidens trichosperma]</p><p><b>kucati, odbiti, otkucati, otkucavati, tući, udarati, udariti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> system of signalling by hand signs used by bookmakers at racetracks</p><p><i>v.</i> make a sound like a clock or a timer [beat, tick, ticktock]</p><p><b>igra u kojoj dva igrača napunjuju križeve i krugove u jedan od odjeljaka kvadratne mreže od devet mjesta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a game in which two players alternately put crosses and circles in one of the compartments of a square grid of nine spaces [noughts and crosses, tic-tac-toe, tick-tack-toe, ticktacktoo, tit-tat-toe]</p><p><b>igra u kojoj dva igrača napunjuju križeve i krugove u jedan od odjeljaka kvadratne mreže od devet mjesta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a game in which two players alternately put crosses and circles in one of the compartments of a square grid of nine spaces [noughts and crosses, tic-tac-toe, tick-tack-toe, ticktacktoe, tit-tat-toe]</p><p><b>kucati, odbiti, otkucati, otkucavati, tući, udarati, udariti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> steady recurrent ticking sound as made by a clock [tictac, tocktact]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a sound like a clock or a timer [beat, tick, ticktack]</p><p><b>bilo koja od brojnih biljaka roda Coreopsis s obiljem prikazivanja obično žutih cvjetova nalik na margarine tijekom dugih razdoblja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous plants of the genus Coreopsis having a profusion of showy usually yellow daisylike flowers over long periods [coreopsis, tick-weed, tickseed]</p><p><b>Bitka u kojoj su američke revolucionarne trupe zauzele Fort Ticonderoga od Britanaca 1775. godine. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pitched battle in which American revolutionary troops captured Fort Ticonderoga from the British in 1775 [Fort Ticonderoga]</p><p><b>stabilan ponavljajući zvuk tikkanja kao što je napravljen od strane sata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> steady recurrent ticking sound as made by a clock [ticktock, tocktact]</p><p><b>koji je kao plima i oseka, koji ovisi o protjecanju i otjecanju, koji se tiče plime i oseke</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or caused by tides</p><p><b>bazen koji je pun vode pri plimi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a basin that is full of water at high tide</p><p><b>visoki val (često opasan) uzrokovan plimenim tokom (kao što je sudaranje plimenog struja ili u uskom estuaru) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a high wave (often dangerous) caused by tidal flow (as by colliding tidal currents or in a narrow estuary) [aegir, bore, eager, eagre]</p><p><b>vodena struja uzrokovana plima i plima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the water current caused by the tides [tidal flow]</p><p><b>vodena struja uzrokovana plima i plima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the water current caused by the tides [tidal current]</p><p><b>potok u kojem se učinci plime protežu daleko uzvodno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stream in which the effects of the tide extend far upstream [tidal stream, tidewater river, tidewater stream]</p><p><b>potok u kojem se učinci plime protežu daleko uzvodno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stream in which the effects of the tide extend far upstream [tidal river, tidewater river, tidewater stream]</p><p><b>plimni val, prilivni val</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an overwhelming manifestation of some emotion or phenomenon</p><p><i>n.</i> an unusual (and often destructive) rise of water along the seashore caused by a storm or a combination of wind and high tide</p><p><i>n.</i> a wave resulting from the periodic flow of the tides that is caused by the gravitational attraction of the moon and sun</p><p><b>područje podložno plivskom djelovanju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an area subject to tidal action</p><p><b>poslastica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small tasty bit of food [choice morsel, titbit]</p><p><b>dijete, klinac, mališan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a young person of either sex [child, fry, kid, minor, nestling, nipper, shaver, small fry, tike, tyke, youngster]</p><p><b>blago opijen. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> slightly intoxicated [potty, tipsy]</p><p><b>igra u kojoj igrači pokušavaju preokrenuti plastične diske u šalicu tako što ih oštro pritisnu na stranu većim diskom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a game in which players try to flip plastic disks into a cup by pressing them on the side sharply with a larger disk</p><p><b>morska mijena, nositi, oseka, plima, pomoći, priliv, tok, tok struje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the periodic rise and fall of the sea level under the gravitational pull of the moon</p><p><i>n.</i> something that may increase or decrease (like the tides of the sea)</p><p><i>n.</i> there are usually two high and two low tides each day [lunar time period]</p><p><i>v.</i> rise or move forward [surge]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to float with the tide</p><p><i>v.</i> be carried with the tide</p><p><b>pomoći</b></p><p><i>v.</i> suffice for a period between two points [bridge over, keep going]</p><p><b>područje turbulentne vode u rijeci ili moru uzrokovano jednom strujom koja teče u drugu struju ili preko nje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stretch of turbulent water in a river or the sea caused by one current flowing into or across another current [countercurrent, crosscurrent, rip, riptide]</p><p><b>Zemlja u blizini mora koja je preplavila plima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> land near the sea that is overflowed by the tide</p><p><b>Indikator koji se sastoji od crte na granicama plime ili plime u visokom ili niskom vodnom stanju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> indicator consisting of a line at the highwater or low-water limits of the tides</p><p><b>plimna voda</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low-lying coastal land drained by tidal streams</p><p><i>n.</i> the coastal plain of the South: eastern parts of Virginia and North Carolina and South Carolina and Georgia [Tidewater region]</p><p><b>obalna ravnica Juga: istočni dijelovi Virginije i Sjeverne Karoline i Južne Karoline i Gruzije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the coastal plain of the South: eastern parts of Virginia and North Carolina and South Carolina and Georgia [Tidewater]</p><p><b>potok u kojem se učinci plime protežu daleko uzvodno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stream in which the effects of the tide extend far upstream [tidal river, tidal stream, tidewater stream]</p><p><b>potok u kojem se učinci plime protežu daleko uzvodno. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a stream in which the effects of the tide extend far upstream [tidal river, tidal stream, tidewater river]</p><p><b>kanal u kojem teče plima i plima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a channel in which a tidal current runs</p><p><b>čist, srediti, sređen, uredan, urediti (od &quot;tidy&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a tidy manner</p><p><b>urednost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the habit of being tidy</p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being neat and orderly [neatness]</p><p><b>novosti, vijesti, informacija, novost, obavijest, vijest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> information about recent and important events [intelligence, news, word]</p><p><b>čist, srediti, sređen, uredan, urediti, posložiti, pospremati, pospremiti, rediti, slagati, složiti, spremati, spremiti, uređivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> receptacle that holds odds and ends (as sewing materials)</p><p><i>v.</i> put (things or places) in order [clean up, neaten, square away, straighten, straighten out, tidy up]</p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by order and cleanliness in appearance or habits</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of hair) neat and tidy [kempt]</p><p><i>adj.</i> large in amount or extent or degree [goodish, goodly, healthy, hefty, respectable, sizable, sizeable]</p><p><b>gomila, hrpa, hrpetina, masa, mnoštvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (often followed by `of') a large number or amount or extent [batch, deal, flock, good deal, great deal, hatful, heap, lot, mass, mess, mickle, mint, mountain, muckle, passel, peck, pile, plenty, pot, quite a little, raft, sight, slew, spate, stack, wad]</p><p><b>Kalifornijska godišnja s glavama cvijeća s žutim zrake na vrhu s bijelim (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> California annual having flower heads with yellow rays tipped with white [Layia platyglossa, tidytips]</p><p><b>pospremiti, urediti, posložiti, pospremati, rediti, slagati, složiti, spremati, spremiti, uređivati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put (things or places) in order [clean up, neaten, square away, straighten, straighten out, tidy]</p><p><b>Kalifornijska godišnja s glavama cvijeća s žutim zrake na vrhu s bijelim (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> California annual having flower heads with yellow rays tipped with white [Layia platyglossa, tidy tips]</p><p><b>čvor, izjednačen rezultat, kravata, mašna, neriješen rezultat, neriješena igra, povezati, pričvrstiti, privezati, spojiti, spona, svezati, veza, vezati, zategnuti, željeznički prag, odnos, udruženje, kopča, izjednačenje, neodlučen ishod, remi, povezivati, privezivati, svezivati, vezivati, zavezati, zavezivati, remizirati, priključiti, priključivati, prikopčati, prikopčavati, spajati, ukopčati, ukopčavati, družiti se, povezati se, povezivati se, vezati se, zbližavati se, zbližiti se, oženiti, oženiti se, udati se, vjenčati, vjenčati se, ženiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> neckwear consisting of a long narrow piece of material worn (mostly by men) under a collar and tied in knot at the front [necktie]</p><p><i>n.</i> a social or business relationship [affiliation, association, tie-up]</p><p><i>n.</i> equality of score in a contest</p><p><i>n.</i> a horizontal beam used to prevent two other structural members from spreading apart or separating [tie beam]</p><p><i>n.</i> a fastener that serves to join or connect [link, linkup, tie-in]</p><p><i>n.</i> the finish of a contest in which the score is tied and the winner is undecided [draw, standoff]</p><p><i>n.</i> (music) a slur over two notes of the same pitch</p><p><i>n.</i> one of the cross braces that support the rails on a railway track [crosstie, railroad tie, sleeper]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cord (or string or ribbon or wire etc.) with which something is tied</p><p><i>v.</i> fasten or secure with a rope, string, or cord [bind]</p><p><i>v.</i> finish a game with an equal number of points, goals, etc. [draw]</p><p><i>v.</i> limit or restrict to</p><p><i>v.</i> connect, fasten, or put together two or more pieces [connect, link, link up]</p><p><i>v.</i> form a knot or bow in</p><p><i>v.</i> create social or emotional ties [attach, bind, bond]</p><p><i>v.</i> perform a marriage ceremony [marry, splice, wed]</p><p><i>v.</i> make by tying pieces together</p><p><i>v.</i> unite musical notes by a tie</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a horizontal beam used to prevent two other structural members from spreading apart or separating [tie]</p><p><b>Komad nakita koji drži mušku kravatu na mjestu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of jewelry that holds a man's tie in place</p><p><b>privezati, svezati, vezati, zavezati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> secure with or as if with ropes [bind, tie up, truss]</p><p><i>v.</i> restrain from independence by an obligation</p><p><b>asocirati, povezati, povezivati, referirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be in connection with something relevant</p><p><i>v.</i> make a logical or causal connection [associate, colligate, connect, link, link up, relate]</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenjem od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a rack for storing ties</p><p><b>podupirač</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two rods that link the