er's itch]</p><p><b>gljivična infekcija vlasišta karakterizirana ćelavim mrljama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fungal infection of the scalp characterized by bald patches</p><p><b>gljivična infekcija ne-dlakavih dijelova kože (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fungal infection of nonhairy parts of the skin</p><p><b>gljivična infekcija prepona (najčešće kod muškaraca) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fungal infection of the groin (most common in men) [eczema marginatum, jock itch]</p><p><b>gljivična infekcija stopala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fungal infection of the feet [athlete's foot]</p><p><b>Larve žive u cevima od hrane koja je vezana za svilenu materiju koju on previja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the larvae live in tubes of its food material fastened with silk that it spins [casemaking clothes moth]</p><p><b>gljivična infekcija noktiju (posebno noktiju na nogama) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fungal infection of the nails (especially toenails)</p><p><b>konzerva, konzervirati, kositar, lim, limena kutija, limenka, kalaj, kalajisati (od &quot;tin&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having prongs or tines [pronged]</p><p><b>mali žutobijeli moljci čije se ličinke hrane vune ili krzna (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small yellowish moths whose larvae feed on wool or fur [tineid moth]</p><p><b>mali žutobijeli moljci čije se ličinke hrane vune ili krzna (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small yellowish moths whose larvae feed on wool or fur [tineid]</p><p><b>štapovi odjeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clothes moths [family Tineidae]</p><p><b>mali tupi moljak s žvakaćim ustima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small dull-colored moth with chewing mouthparts [tineoid moth]</p><p><b>mali tupi moljak s žvakaćim ustima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small dull-colored moth with chewing mouthparts [tineoid]</p><p><b>štapovi odjeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> clothes moths [superfamily Tineoidea]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> webbing clothes moths [genus Tineola]</p><p><b>molj koji stvara mrežu u kojoj živi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.