li njenim stanovnicima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a Polynesian native or inhabitant of Tonga</p><p><i>n.</i> the Polynesian language spoken by the Tongan people</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the island monarchy of Tonga or its people</p><p><b>monetarna jedinica u Tongi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> monetary unit in Tonga</p><p><b>kliješta, kliješte</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various devices for taking hold of objects [pair of tongs]</p><p><b>govor, jezičak, jezik, jezični mišić, hrid, prevlaka, rat, ražanj, rt, šilo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mobile mass of muscular tissue covered with mucous membrane and located in the oral cavity [clapper, glossa, lingua]</p><p><i>n.</i> a human written or spoken language used by a community [natural language]</p><p><i>n.</i> any long thin projection that is transient [knife]</p><p><i>n.</i> a manner of speaking</p><p><i>n.</i> a narrow strip of land that juts out into the sea [spit]</p><p><i>n.</i> the tongue of certain animals used as meat</p><p><i>n.</i> the flap of material under the laces of a shoe or boot</p><p><i>n.</i> metal striker that hangs inside a bell and makes a sound by hitting the side [clapper]</p><p><i>v.</i> articulate by tonguing, as when playing wind instruments</p><p><i>v.</i> lick or explore with the tongue</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mortise joint made by fitting a projection on the edge of one board into a matching groove on another board</p><p><b>tanak depresor koji se koristi za pritisak jezika tijekom pregleda usta i grla. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a thin depressor used to press the tongue down during an examination of the mouth and throat</p><p><b>Istočnoazijski paprika s listovima u obliku jezika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> east Asian fern having fronds shaped like tongues [Cyclophorus lingua, Pyrrosia lingua, felt fern]</p><p><b>urođena anomalija u kojoj je sluznica ispod jezika prekratka i ograničava pokretljivost jezika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a congenital anomaly in which the mucous membrane under the tongue is too short limiting the mobility of the tongue [ankyloglossia]</p><p><b>izraz koji je teško jasno izgovoriti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an expression that is difficult to articulate clearly</p><p><b>crvljakavrsti članonožci koji imaju dva para kuka na bočnim stranama usta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wormlike arthropod having two pairs of hooks at the sides of the mouth [pentastomid]</p><p><b>riblje pločice s lijevom okom čiji rep je konjski do točke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> left-eyed marine flatfish whose tail tapers to a point [tonguefish]</p><p><b>Orhideja s plavim do ljubičastim cvijećima s izbočinama u obliku jezika ili trake na dnu usana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> orchid having blue to purple flowers with tongue-shaped or strap-shaped protuberances (calli) at the lip base [tongueflower]</p><p><b>ironičan, u šali</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> cleverly amusing in tone [bantering, facetious]</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a bantering fashion [banteringly]</p><p><i>adv.</i> not seriously [facetiously, jokingly]</p><p><b>koji je oštro opominje nekoga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rebuking a person harshly [chiding, objurgation, scolding]</p><p><b>U obliku jezika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> shaped like a tongue [lingulate]</p><p><b>lišeni govora (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> deprive of speech</p><p><b>mucav, tepav, nijem</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> unable to express yourself clearly or fluently [incoherent]</p><p><b>koji je opremljen ili nalik na jezik, ima način govora kako je navedeno (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> provided with or resembling a tongue</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a manner of speaking as specified</p><p><b>riblje pločice s lijevom okom čiji rep je konjski do točke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> left-eyed marine flatfish whose tail tapers to a point [tongue-fish]</p><p><b>Orhideja s plavim do ljubičastim cvijećima s izbočinama u obliku jezika ili trake na dnu usana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> orchid having blue to purple flowers with tongue-shaped or strap-shaped protuberances (calli) at the lip base [tongue-flower]</p><p><b>Nemaju jezik., izražen bez govora (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking a tongue</p><p><i>adj.</i> expressed without speech [mute, unspoken, wordless]</p><p><b>Puno je i u Africi i Panami i sjevernoj Južnoj Americi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> almost completely aquatic frog native to Africa and Panama and northern South America</p><p><b>sličan jeziku po obliku ili funkciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling a tongue in form or function</p><p><b>s masenim udubljenjem od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plane having cutters designed to make the tongues and grooves on the edges of matchboards [match plane]</p><p><b>Američki pisac čiji romani opisuju živote Afroamerikanaca (rođen 1931) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer whose novels describe the lives of African-Americans (born in 1931) [Chloe Anthony Wofford, Morrison]</p><p><b>koji jača, osnovni ton, tonalitet, tonik, soda, soda-voda, tonski</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lime- or lemon-flavored carbonated water containing quinine [quinine water, tonic water]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sweet drink containing carbonated water and flavoring [pop, soda, soda pop, soda water]</p><p><i>n.</i> (music) the first note of a diatonic scale [keynote]</p><p><i>n.</i> a medicine that strengthens and invigorates [restorative]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or producing normal tone or tonus in muscles or tissue</p><p><i>adj.</i> employing variations in pitch to distinguish meanings of otherwise similar words [tonal]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (used of syllables) bearing the principle stress, usually accompanied by a change in pitch [accented]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or being the keynote of a major or minor scale</p><p><i>adj.</i> imparting vitality and energy [bracing, brisk, fresh, refreshful, refreshing]</p><p><b>naglasak koji proizlazi iz tonosa umjesto glasnosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> emphasis that results from pitch rather than loudness [pitch accent]</p><p><b>epilepsija u kojoj je tijelo rigidno tijekom napada (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> epilepsy in which the body is rigid during the seizure</p><p><b>osnovni taster u kojem je glazbeno djelo napisano (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic key in which a piece of music is written [home key]</p><p><b>sustav solmizacije pomoću solfa slogova: do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, ti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a system of solmization using the solfa syllables: do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, ti [solfa]</p><p><b>vodom s aromom limene ili limuna koja sadrži kinin (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lime- or lemon-flavored carbonated water containing quinine [quinine water, tonic]</p><p><b>Elastična napetost živog mišića, arterija itd. koja olakšava odgovor na podražaje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the elastic tension of living muscles, arteries, etc. that facilitate response to stimuli [tone, tonus]</p><p><b>noćas, večeras</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the present or immediately coming night</p><p><i>adv.</i> during the night of the present day [this evening, this night]</p><p><b>Mirisno crno sjemenke tonka graha, Visoko tropsko južnoameričko stablo koje ima pulpito jaje u obliku čestica mirisnih crnih mandljastih sjemena koji se koriste za aromatizaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fragrant black nutlike seeds of the tonka bean tree [coumara nut]</p><p><i>n.</i> tall tropical South American tree having pulpy egg-shaped pods of fragrant black almond-shaped seeds used for flavoring [Coumarouna odorata, Dipteryx odorata, tonka bean tree]</p><p><b>Visoko tropsko južnoameričko stablo koje ima pulpito jaje u obliku čestica mirisnih crnih mandljastih sjemena koji se koriste za aromatizaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall tropical South American tree having pulpy egg-shaped pods of fragrant black almond-shaped seeds used for flavoring [Coumarouna odorata, Dipteryx odorata, tonka bean]</p><p><b>nosivost, pristojba po toni, težina, tonaža</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tax imposed on ships that enter the US [tonnage duty, tunnage]</p><p><b>porez koji se nametne brodovima koji ulaze u SAD (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tax imposed on ships that enter the US [tonnage, tunnage]</p><p><b>metrička tona, tona, MT, t</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of weight equivalent to 1000 kilograms [MT, metric ton, t]</p><p><b>antiaritmički lijek (trgovinski naziv Tonocard) koji se koristi za liječenje ventrikulnih aritmija kada manje opasni lijekovi nisu uspjeli (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> antiarrhythmic drug (trade name Tonocard) used to treat ventricular arrhythmias when less dangerous drugs have failed [tocainide]</p><p><b>tonometar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> measuring instrument for measuring tension or pressure (especially for measuring intraocular pressure in testing for glaucoma)</p><p><b>tonometrija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the measurement of intraocular pressure by determining the amount of force needed to make a slight indentation in the cornea</p><p><b>tona</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large number or amount [dozens, gobs, heaps, lashings, loads, lots, oodles, piles, rafts, scads, scores, slews, stacks, wads]</p><p><b>angina, krajnik, nepčana tonzila, tonzile</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two masses of lymphatic tissue one on each side of the oral pharynx [faucial tonsil, palatine tonsil, tonsilla]</p><p><b>nepčana tonzila, tonzile</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two masses of lymphatic tissue one on each side of the oral pharynx [faucial tonsil, palatine tonsil, tonsil]</p><p><b>skup limfnog tkiva u grlu iza uvule (na stražnjem zidu i krovu nosohotre) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of lymphatic tissue in the throat behind the uvula (on the posterior wall and roof of the nasopharynx) [Luschka's tonsil, adenoid, pharyngeal tonsil, third tonsil, tonsilla pharyngealis]</p><p><b>skup limfnog tkiva u grlu iza uvule (na stražnjem zidu i krovu nosohotre) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a collection of lymphatic tissue in the throat behind the uvula (on the posterior wall and roof of the nasopharynx) [Lu