ularnost kože (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> enlargement of the nose with dilation of follicles and redness and prominent vascularity of the skin [brandy nose, copper nose, hammer nose, hypertrophic rosacea, potato nose, rhinophyma, rum-blossom, rum nose]</p><p><b>jedro postavljeno na dvorištu topgallant masta, masto pripečen na vrh masta na kvadratnom brodu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sail set on a yard of a topgallant mast [topgallant sail]</p><p><i>n.</i> a mast fixed to the head of a topmast on a square-rigged vessel [topgallant mast]</p><p><b>masto pripečen na vrh masta na kvadratnom brodu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mast fixed to the head of a topmast on a square-rigged vessel [topgallant]</p><p><b>jedro postavljeno na dvorištu topgallant masta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sail set on a yard of a topgallant mast [topgallant]</p><p><b>Odlaganje urata oko zgloba ili u vanjskom uhu, uštrica koja se formira na zubima i desni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a deposit of urates around a joint or in the external ear [chalkstone]</p><p><i>n.</i> an incrustation that forms on the teeth and gums [calculus, tartar]</p><p><b>lagani šešir koji se nosi u tropskim zemljama radi zaštite od sunca, velika južnoafrička antilopa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lightweight hat worn in tropical countries for protection from the sun [pith hat, pith helmet, sun helmet, topee]</p><p><i>n.</i> a large South African antelope [Damaliscus lunatus, sassaby]</p><p><b>dekorativno obrezan, dekorativno obrezan ili okresan, dekorativno okresan, figuralno obrezan, figuralno obrezan ili okresan, figuralno okresan, skulpturirano grmlje, visoka živica, vještina uzgoja biljaka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a garden having shrubs clipped or trimmed into decorative shapes especially of animals</p><p><i>n.</i> making decorative shapes by trimming shrubs or trees</p><p><b>element, poglavlje, predmet, predmet razgovora, tema, stvar, pitanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the subject matter of a conversation or discussion [subject, theme]</p><p><