struktura (mišića i živaca i arterija itd.) u tom području (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the study of anatomy based on regions or divisions of the body and emphasizing the relations between various structures (muscles and nerves and arteries etc.) in that region [regional anatomy, topology]</p><p><b>kota, mjesto, topografska točka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a point located with respect to surface features of some region [place, spot]</p><p><b>topografski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> concerned with topography [topographic]</p><p><b>topografski</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with regard to topography</p><p><b>topografija, toponimija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the configuration of a surface and the relations among its man-made and natural features</p><p><i>n.</i> precise detailed study of the surface features of a region</p><p><b>obožavanje mjesta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the worship of places [place-worship]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s topologijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to topology [topological]</p><p><b>topološki</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to topology [topologic]</p><p><b>topološki prostor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) any set of points that satisfy a set of postulates of some kind [mathematical space]</p><p><b>topološko</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> from the point of view of topology</p><p><b>prostorni obrazac razmještaja umrežavanja, razmještaj, topologija, top o legija (mreže)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> topographic study of a given place (especially the history of the place as indicated by its topography)</p><p><i>n.</i> the study of anatomy based on regions or divisions of the body and emphasizing the relations between various structures (muscles and nerves and arteries etc.) in that region [regional anatomy, topographic anatomy]</p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of pure mathematics that deals only with the properties of a figure X that hold for every figure into which X can be transformed with a one-to-one correspondence that is continuous in both directions [analysis situs]</p><p><i>n.</i> the configuration of a communication network [network topology]</p><p><b>toponimija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the nomenclature of regional anatomy [toponymy]</p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of lexicology that studies the place names of a region or a language [toponymy]</p><p><b>toponim</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the name by which a geographical place is known [place name]</p><p><b>toponimija, toponomastika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the nomenclature of regional anatomy [toponomy]</p><p><i>n.</i> the branch of lexicology that studies the place names of a region or a language [toponomy]</p><p><b>tradicionalna tema ili motiv ili književna konvencija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a traditional theme or motif or literary convention</p><p><b>s vrhom određenog karaktera (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a top of a specified character</p><p><b>radnik koji napravi ili doda vrh nečemu, radnik koji seče vrhove (drveća ili povrća itd.), Osoba koja je najistaknutija ili najbolja, Vrlo dobra šala koja nadmašuje sve što je bilo prije., Ženski kratki kaput., muški šešir s visokom krunom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a worker who makes or adds the top to something</p><p><i>n.</i> a worker who cuts tops off (of trees or vegetables etc.)</p><p><i>n.</i> the person who is most outstanding or excellent [best]</p><p><i>n.</i> an exceedingly good witticism that surpasses all that have gone before</p><p><i>n.</i> a woman's short coat</p><p><i>n.</i> a man's hat with a tall crown [beaver, dress hat, high hat, opera hat, silk hat, stovepipe, top hat]</p><p><b>kolosalan, naduven, odličan, prvorazredan, silan, visok, arogantan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a flavorful addition on top of a dish</p><p><i>adj.</i> excellent [top-flight, top-hole]</p><p><b>kolosalan, naduven, odličan, prvorazredan, silan, visok, arogantan (od &quot;topping&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> (used as an intensifier) extremely well [marvellously, marvelously, superbly, terrifically, wonderfully, wondrous, wondrously]</p><p><b>oboriti, prevrnuti, ljosnuti, pasti, 