mong those who won [pari-mutuel machine, totalisator, totalizator, totalizer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a calculator that performs simple arithmetic functions [adding machine, totalizer]</p><p><b>princip potpune i neograničene moći u vladi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the principle of complete and unrestricted power in government [absolutism, totalitarianism]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s principima totalitarizma prema kojima država reguliše svako područje života (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the principles of totalitarianism according to which the state regulates every realm of life [totalitarian]</p><p><b>totalitaran</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an adherent of totalitarian principles or totalitarian government</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by a government in which the political authority exercises absolute and centralized control</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the principles of totalitarianism according to which the state regulates every realm of life [totalistic]</p><p><b>Vlada koja podređuje pojedinca državi i strogo kontrolira sve aspekte života prinudnim mjerama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a government that subordinates the individual to the state and strictly controls all aspects of life by coercive measures [totalitation regime]</p><p><b>totalitarizam, autoritarizam, despotizam, diktatura, staljinizam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a form of government in which the ruler is an absolute dictator (not restricted by a constitution or laws or opposition etc.) [Caesarism, Stalinism, absolutism, authoritarianism, despotism, dictatorship, monocracy, one-man rule, shogunate, tyranny]</p><p><i>n.</i> the principle of complete and unrestricted power in government [absolutism, totalism]</p><p><b>Vlada koja podređuje pojedinca državi i strogo kontrolira sve aspekte života prinudnim mjerama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a government that subordinates the individual to the state and strictly controls all aspects of life by coercive measures [totalitarian state]</p><p><b>cjelina, cjelokupnost, c