p><b>totem</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a clan or tribe identified by their kinship to a common totemic object</p><p><i>n.</i> emblem consisting of an object such as an animal or plant</p><p><b>plemenski znak koji se sastoji od stuba urezanog i naslikanog totemskim figurama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tribal emblem consisting of a pillar carved and painted with totemic figures</p><p><b>totem (od &quot;totem&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to totemism</p><p><b>vjerovanje u srodstvo grupe ljudi s zajedničkim totemom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> belief in the kinship of a group of people with a common totem</p><p><b>osoba koja pripada klanu ili plemenu koji ima totem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who belongs to a clan or tribe having a totem</p><p><b>mališan, malo dijete, sračunati (od &quot;tot&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone whose employment involves carrying something [bearer, carrier]</p><p><b>sposobnost stanice da proizvede drugačije stanice i tako razvije novi organizam ili dio stanice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ability of a cell to give rise to unlike cells and so to develop a new organism or part [totipotency]</p><p><b>sposobnost stanice da proizvede drugačije stanice i tako razvije novi organizam ili dio stanice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the ability of a cell to give rise to unlike cells and so to develop a new organism or part [totipotence]</p><p><b>koji imaju sposobnost da daju početak različitim stanicama (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having the ability to give rise to unlike cells</p><p><b>štednički račun koji je uložio netko tko je povjerenik korisnika i koji ga kontrolira tijekom svog života (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a savings account deposited by someone who makes themselves the trustee for a beneficiary and who controls it during their lifetime [savings account trust, savings bank trust, trust account, trustee account]</p><p><b>klimati se, kolebati se, teturati se, gegati se</b></p><p><i>v.</i> move without being stable, as if threatening to fall</p><p><i>