stralije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American annual plant with usually yellow or orange flowers [Impatiens capensis, celandine, jewelweed, lady's earrings, orange balsam]</p><p><i>n.</i> Mediterranean vine having oblong fruit that when ripe expels its seeds and juice violently when touched [Ecballium elaterium, exploding cucumber, squirting cucumber]</p><p><i>n.</i> prostrate or semi-erect subshrub of tropical America, and Australia [Mimosa pudica, action plant, humble plant, live-and-die, sensitive plant, shame plant]</p><p><b>Upišite bez gledanja na tastaturu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> type without looking at the keyboard</p><p><b>vješt tajper koji može otkucati dokument bez gledanja na tipkovnicu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a skilled typist who can type a document without looking at the keyboard</p><p><b>Osjetljivo za čula, posebno za dodir. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> perceptible by the senses especially the sense of touch [tangible]</p><p><b>(Američki nogomet) igra u kojoj je protivnička ekipa je udario nogomet u svoju kraj zonu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (American football) a play in which the opposing team has kicked the football into your end zone</p><p><b>gol, slijetanje, zgoditak u ragbiju</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a score in American football</p><p><i>n.</i> a landing (as the wheels touch the landing field)</p><p><b>ćaknut, dirnut, ganut, napipan, napipaše</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having come into contact</p><p><i>adj.</i> being excited or provoked to the expression of an emotion [affected, moved, stirred]</p><p><i>adj.</i> slightly insane [fey]</p><p><b>biti tangenta, diranje, dirati, dirnuti, dodir, dodirivati, dodirnuti, dotaći, dotaknuti, doticanje, ganuti, kontakt, nagovještaj, napipati, opip, opipati, pipati, pritisnuti, taknuti, ticati se, veza (od &quot;touch&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who causes or allows a part of the body to come in contact with someone or something</p><p><b>lako uvredljiv, previše osjetljiv (od &quot;touchy&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a touchy manner</p><p><b>osjećaju se lako iritiraju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> feeling easily irritated [testiness, tetchiness]</p><p><b>diranje, dirljiv, ganutljiv, uzbudljiv, dodir, dodirivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the event of something coming in contact with the body [touch]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of putting two things together with no space between them [touch]</p><p><i>adj.</i> arousing affect [affecting, poignant]</p><p><b>diranje, dirljiv, ganutljiv, uzbudljiv (od &quot;touching&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a poignant or touching manner [affectingly, poignantly]</p><p><b>bilo koji od sporednih linija u nogometu ili ragbiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of the sidelines in soccer or rugby</p><p><b>Računarski ekran koji omogućuje korisniku interakciju s kompjuterom dodirivanjem područja na ekranu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a computer display that enables the user to interact with the computer by touching areas on the screen [touch screen]</p><p><b>iskušavanje, kamen kušač, kriterij</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a basis for comparison [criterion, measure, standard]</p><p><b>materijal za paljenje vatre (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> material for starting a fire [kindling, punk, spunk, tinder]</p><p><b>lako uvredljiv, previše osjetljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> quick to take offense [feisty, huffy, thin-skinned]</p><p><i>adj.</i> difficult to handle [delicate, ticklish]</p><p><b>(često ponižavajuće) otvoreno izražavanje ljubavi i naklonosti (posebno kroz fizički dodir) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (often derogatory) openly expressing love and affection (especially through physical contact)</p><p><b>čvrst, grub, krut, otporan, težak, tvrd, žestok, žilav, teškim, žestoki, razbojnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who learned to fight in the streets rather than being formally trained in the sport of boxing [street fighter]</p><p><i>n.</i> an aggressive and violent young criminal [goon, hood, hoodlum, punk, strong-armer, thug, toughie]</p><p><i>n.</i> a cruel and brutal fellow [bully, hooligan, roughneck, rowdy, ruffian, yob, yobbo, yobo]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not given to gentleness or sentimentality</p><p><i>adj.</i> very difficult [rugged]</p><p><i>adj.</i> physically toughened [toughened]</p><p><i>adj.</i> substantially made or constructed [sturdy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> violent and lawless [ruffianly]</p><p><i>adj.</i> feeling physical discomfort or pain (`tough' is occasionally used colloquially for `bad') [bad]</p><p><i>adj.</i> resistant to cutting or chewing</p><p><i>adj.</i> unfortunate or hard to bear [hard]</p><p><i>adj.</i> making great mental demands [baffling, elusive, knotty, problematic, problematical]</p><p><b>netko tko maltretira slabije ljude. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who bullies weaker people [plug-ugly]</p><p><b>loša sreća, nesreća</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an unfortunate state resulting from unfavorable outcomes [bad luck, ill luck, misfortune]</p><p><b>suočavanje s činjenicama ili poteškoćama realno i odlučno (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> facing facts or difficulties realistically and with determination [unsentimental]</p><p><b>s relativno čvrstom vanjskom oblogom, Neosjetljiv na kritike. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a relatively tough outer covering</p><p><i>adj.</i> insensitive to criticism [thick-skinned]</p><p><b>očvrsnuti, ogrubjeti, otvrdnuti, postati krut, ogrubiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make tough or tougher</p><p><b>čvrst, žilav</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> physically toughened [tough]</p><p><i>adj.</i> made hard or flexible or resilient especially by heat treatment [hardened, tempered, treated]</p><p><b>razbojnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an aggressive and violent young criminal [goon, hood, hoodlum, punk, strong-armer, thug, tough]</p><p><i>n.</i> a particularly difficult or baffling question or problem [poser, sticker, stumper]</p><p><b>uporno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a ruggedly tough manner</p><p><b>čvrstoća, grubost, izdržljivost, nepopustljivost, otpornost, žilavost, stamenost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> enduring strength and energy [stamina, staying power]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being big and strong [huskiness, ruggedness]</p><p><i>n.</i> the elasticity and hardness of a metal object [temper]</p><p><i>n.</i> impressive difficulty [formidability]</p><p><b>lučki grad i pomorska baza u jugoistočnoj Francuskoj na mediteranskoj obali. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a port city and naval base in southeastern France on the Mediterranean coast</p><p><b>grad na rijeci Garonne u južnoj Francuskoj jugoistočno od Bordea (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city on the Garonne River in southern France to the southeast of Bordeaux</p><p><b>Francuski slikar koji je prikazao život u kafićima i glazbenim dvoranama Montmartrea (1864-1901) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French painter who portrayed life in the cafes and music halls of Montmartre (1864-1901) [Henri Toulouse-Lautrec]</p><p><b>mali perik za pokrivanje djelomične ćelavosti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small hairpiece to cover partial baldness [toupee]</p><p><b>čuperak, tupe</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small hairpiece to cover partial baldness [toupe]</p><p><b>nosio je mali parfem da bi pokrio djelomično ćelavost (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> wearing a small hairpiece to cover partial baldness</p><p><b>ekskurzija, izlet, kružno putovanje, obilazak, posjet, proputovati, put, putovanje, putovati, red, smjena, truneja, tura, vožnja, posjetu, služenje vojnog roka, vojna služba, vojni rok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a journey or route all the way around a particular place or area [circuit]</p><p><i>n.</i> a time period for working (after which you will be relieved by someone else) [go, spell, turn]</p><p><i>n.</i> a period of time spent in military service [duty tour, enlistment, hitch, term of enlistment, tour of duty]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a tour of a certain place</p><p><b>majstorski ili briljantan podvig (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a masterly or brilliant feat</p><p><b>Francuska biciklistička utrka za profesionalne bicikliste koja traje tri tjedna i obuhvaća oko 3.000 milja. (MT)</b></