</p><p><i>v.</i> go after with the intent to catch [chase, chase after, dog, give chase, go after, tag, tail, trail]</p><p><i>v.</i> travel across or pass over [cover, cross, cut across, cut through, get across, get over, pass over, traverse]</p><p><i>v.</i> make tracks upon</p><p><b>Učešće u sportskim aktivnostima koje se izvode na trkačkoj stazi ili na polju povezanom s njom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> participating in athletic sports performed on a running track or on the field associated with it</p><p><b>loviti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> pursue for food or sport (as of wild animals) [hunt, hunt down, run]</p><p><b>U slučaju vozila s brzinom od 300 km/h do 300 km/h, za vozila s brzinom od 300 km/h ili više, za vozila s brzinom od 300 km/h do 300 km/h, za vozila s brzinom od 300 km/h do 300 km/h, za vozila s brzinom od 300 km/h do 300 km/h, za vozila s brzinom od 300 km/h do 300 km/h: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a footrace performed on a track (indoor or outdoor)</p><p><b>natjecanje u atletici između dva ili više timova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a track and field competition between two or more teams</p><p><b>putna staza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the fastest time ever recorded for a specific distance at a particular racetrack</p><p><i>n.</i> the sum of recognized accomplishments [record]</p><p><b>zvijezda trkač (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a star runner</p><p><b>(računovodstvo) vrijeme koje je potrebno za čitanje/pisanje glave da se preseli na susjednu tračnicu podataka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) the time it takes for a read/write head to move to an adjacent data track</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being traced or tracked [traceable]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an electronic device consisting of a rotatable ball in a housing</p><p><b>gusjenični</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having tracks</p><p><b>gusjeničar, gusjeničarsko vozilo, vozilo na gusjenicama, vozilo na tračnicama</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a self-propelled vehicle that moves on tracks</p><p><b>lokator, operator, pratilac, sistem za praćenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who tracks down game</p><p><b>detektiranje, ostavlja traga, praćenje, praćenje po tragu, praćenjem, slijeđenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the pursuit (of a person or animal) by following tracks or marks they left behind [trailing]</p><p><b>radnik koji polaže i popravlja željezničke pruge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a workman who lays and repairs railroad tracks [platelayer]</p><p><b>bez puta</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having no tracks</p><p><i>adj.</i> lacking pathways [pathless, roadless, untracked, untrod, untrodden]</p><p><b>trolejbus</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a passenger bus with an electric motor that draws power from overhead wires [trolley coach, trolleybus]</p><p><b>period, površina, prostor, prostorija, putevi, rasprava, tok, trakt, trakta, parcela, zemljište, sistem, sustav, živčani put</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an extended area of land [parcel, parcel of land, piece of ground, piece of land]</p><p><i>n.</i> a system of body parts that together serve some particular purpose</p><p><i>n.</i> a brief treatise on a subject of interest [pamphlet]</p><p><i>n.</i> a bundle of myelinated nerve fibers following a path through the brain [nerve pathway, nerve tract, pathway]</p><p><b>jedna od mnogih kuća sličnog dizajna izgrađenih zajedno na zemljištu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of many houses of similar design constructed together on a tract of land</p><p><b>stanovi koji se sastoje od sličnih kuća koje su zajedno izgrađene na zemljištu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> housing consisting of similar houses constructed together on a tract of land</p><p><b>fleksibilnost, popustljivost, povodljivost, prilagodljivost, tolerantnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being easily persuaded [flexibility, tractableness]</p><p><b>gibak, lako obradiv, pokoran, popustljiv, povodljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> easily managed (controlled or taught or molded) [manipulable]</p><p><i>adj.</i> responsive to suggestions and influences [amenable]</p><p><b>fleksibilnost, popustljivost, povodljivost, prilagodljivost, tolerantnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being easily persuaded [flexibility, tractability]</p><p><b>sljedbenik traktarijanstva i pristalica okxfordskog pokreta (koji je bio izložen u pamfletima pod nazivom "Proklama za Times") (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a follower of Tractarianism and supporter of the Oxford movement (which was expounded in pamphlets called `Tracts for the Times')</p><p><b>načela osnivača okxfordskog pokreta kako su izloženi u pamfletima pod nazivom "Tracts for the Times" (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> principles of the founders of the Oxford movement as expounded in pamphlets called `Tracts for the Times' [Puseyism]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being shaped or bent or drawn out [ductile, malleable, pliable, pliant, tensile]</p><p><b>tegljenje, trakcija, vlak, vuča, vučenje, frikcija, trenje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the friction between a body and the surface on which it moves (as between an automobile tire and the road) [adhesive friction, grip]</p><p><i>n.</i> (orthopedics) the act of pulling on a bone or limb (as in a fracture) to relieve pressure or align parts in a special way during healing</p><p><b>S parnim pogonom za vučenje teških tereta duž površina koje nisu tračnice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> steam-powered locomotive for drawing heavy loads along surfaces other than tracks</p><p><b>vučni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> exerting traction and serving to pull</p><p><b>tegljač, traktor, traktoru, uvlačenje, vučna lokomotiva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wheeled vehicle with large wheels</p><p><i>n.</i> a truck that has a cab but no body</p><p><b>kamion koji se sastoji od traktora i prikolice zajedno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a truck consisting of a tractor and trailer together [articulated lorry, rig, semi, trailer truck, t