neral (calcium magnesium silicate) of the amphibole group used as a form of asbestos</p><p><b>tremolo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (music) a tremulous effect produced by rapid repetition of a single tone or rapid alternation of two tones</p><p><i>n.</i> vocal vibrato especially an excessive or poorly controlled one</p><p><b>drhtanje, drhtavica, tremor, zadrhtati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an involuntary vibration (as if from illness or fear) [shudder]</p><p><i>n.</i> a small earthquake [earth tremor, microseism]</p><p><i>n.</i> shaking or trembling (usually resulting from weakness or stress or disease)</p><p><i>v.</i> shake with seismic vibrations [quake]</p><p><b>drhtav, koji drhti, kolebljiv, plašljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of the voice) quivering as from weakness or fear [quavering]</p><p><b>drhtav, koji drhti, kolebljiv, plašljiv (od &quot;tremulous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a tremulous manner</p><p><b>drveni kol, koji se koristi za vezanje drveta u brodogradilištu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wooden peg that is used to fasten timbers in shipbuilding [treenail, trunnel]</p><p><b>iskopati rov, jarak, kanal, kopati kanal, prokop, rov</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a ditch dug as a fortification having a parapet of the excavated earth</p><p><i>n.</i> a long steep-sided depression in the ocean floor [deep, oceanic abyss]</p><p><i>n.</i> any long ditch cut in the ground</p><p><i>v.</i> impinge or infringe upon [encroach, entrench, impinge]</p><p><i>v.</i> fortify by surrounding with trenches</p><p><i>v.</i> cut or carve deeply into</p><p><i>v.</i> set, plant, or bury in a trench</p><p><i>v.</i> cut a trench in, as for drainage [ditch]</p><p><i>v.</i> dig a trench or trenches</p><p><b>trenčkot, vojnička kišna kabanica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a military style raincoat</p><p><b>obilježena bolovima u mišićima i zglobovima i prenosi se ušiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> marked by pain in muscles and joints and transmitted by lice</p><p><b>slijepi ili sušivi, ali bez smrzavanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> 