ormone from the anterior pituitary [TRF, protirelin, thyrotropin-releasing factor, thyrotropin-releasing hormone]</p><p><b>Čad koji je nepotpun uklonjen i još uvijek pričvršćen na tri kuta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chad that is incompletely removed and still attached at three corners</p><p><b>Slatko mirisnu žutu čvrstu formu CHI3 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sweet smelling yellow solid haloform CHI3 [iodoform]</p><p><b>s dodanom tri atoma joda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thyronine with three iodine atoms added</p><p><b>Celulozni acetat koji relativno sporo gori (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cellulose acetate that is relatively slow to burn [cellulose triacetate]</p><p><b>grupa od tri, trovalentan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of one and one and one [3, III, deuce-ace, leash, tercet, ternary, ternion, terzetto, three, threesome, tierce, trey, trine, trinity, trio, triplet, troika]</p><p><i>n.</i> a set of three similar things considered as a unit [trio, triple, triplet]</p><p><i>n.</i> three people considered as a unit [threesome, trinity, trio]</p><p><i>n.</i> a three-note major or minor chord [common chord]</p><p><b>rod Triakidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Triakidae [genus Triaenodon]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste ribara u području Unije, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, za koje se primjenjuje odjeljak 1. točka (a) ovog članka, za koje se primjenjuje odjeljak 1. točka (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, za sve vrste ribara u području Unije, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 3. točkom (a) ovog članka, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> smooth dogfish of Pacific and Indian Oceans and Red Sea having white-tipped dorsal and caudal fins [reef whitetip shark, whitetip shark]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 1303/2013 države članice mogu odobriti pomoć u skladu s člankom 21. stavkom 1. točkom (a) Uredbe (EU) br. 1303/2013. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sorting and allocating aid on the basis of need for or likely benefit from medical treatment or food</p><p><b>male morske pse glatke kože i bez šiljaka na dorsnim perajima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small sharks with smooth skins and lacking spines on their dorsal fins [family Triakidae]</p><p><b>ispit, ispitivanje, ogled, opit, pokus, pokusni, pokušaj, proba, probni, raspravi, sudski proces, pokusna, iskušavanje, isprobavanje, testiranje, test, nevolja, patnja, stradanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of testing something [run, test]</p><p><i>n.</i> trying something to find out about it [test, trial run, tryout]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of undergoing testing [test]</p><p><i>n.</i> (law) the determination of a person's innocence or guilt by due process of law</p><p><i>n.</i> (sports) a preliminary competition to determine qualifications</p><p><i>n.</i> an annoying or frustrating or catastrophic event [tribulation, visitation]</p><p><b>eksperimentiranje dok se ne nađe rješenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> experimenting until a solution is found</p><p><b>odvjetnik koji se specijalizira za branenje klijenata pred sudom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lawyer who specializes in defending clients before a court of law [trial lawyer]</p><p><b>pokusna bilanca, sirova bilanca</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a balance of debits and credits in double-entry bookkeeping</p><p><b>test javnog mišljenja., balon poslat na probu zračnih struja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a test of public opinion</p><p><i>n.</i> a balloon sent up to test air currents</p><p><b>primitivna metoda utvrđivanja krivice ili nevinosti osobe podvrgavanjem optužene opasnim ili bolnim testovima za koje se vjerovalo da su pod božanskom kontrolom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a primitive method of determining a person's guilt or innocence by subjecting the accused person to dangerous or painful tests believed to be under divine control [ordeal]</p><p><b>prvi sud pred kojim se odlučuje o činjenicama predmeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the first court before which the facts of a case are decided</p><p><b>(štampa) otisak napravljen za provjeru pogrešaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (printing) an impression made to check for errors [proof, test copy]</p><p><b>sudija u sudskom sudu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a judge in a trial court</p><p><b>odvjetnik koji se specijalizira za branenje klijenata pred sudom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a lawyer who specializes in defending clients before a court of law [trial attorney]</p><p><b>pokusni rok, probni rok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a period of time during which someone or something is tested [test period]</p><p><b>probna vožnja, probni rad, test</b></p><p><i>n.</i> trying something to find out about it [test, trial, tryout]</p><p><b>Pokušavanje različitih metoda ili teorija dok se pogreška ne smanji ili ukloni na zadovoljavajući način, koji se odnosi na rješavanje problema iskustvom umjesto teorijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> trying out various means or theories until error is satisfactorily reduced or eliminated</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to solving problems by experience rather than theory</p><p><b>rod Aleyrodidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of Aleyrodidae [genus Trialeurodes]</p><p><b>bijela muha koja živi u staklenicama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> whitefly that inhabits greenhouses [greenhouse whitefly]</p><p><b>sintetički kortikosteroid (trgovinski nazivi Aristocort ili Aristopak ili Kenalog) koji se koristi kao protivupalni sredstvo (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a synthetic corticosteroid (trade names Aristocort or Aristopak or Kenalog) used as an anti-inflammatory agent [Aristocort, Aristopak, Kenalog]</p><p><b>trokut</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a three-sided polygon [trigon, trilateral]</p><p><i>n.</i> something approximating the shape of a triangle</p><p><i>n.</i> a small northern constellation near Perseus between Andromeda and Aries [Triangulum]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various triangular drafting instruments used to draw straight lines at specified angles</p><p><i>n.</i> a percussion instrument consisting of a metal bar bent in the shape of an open triangle</p><p><b>trokutni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having three angles</p><p><i>adj.</i> having three sides [three-sided, trilateral]</p><p><b>zavoj za podupiranje ozlijeđene podlaktice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bandage to support an injured forearm [scarf bandage, sling]</p><p><b>prizma čije su baze trouglovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a prism whose bases are triangles</p><p><b>svojstvo da je oblikovan kao trougao (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being shaped like a triangle</p><p><b>triangulirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> divide into triangles or give a triangular form to</p><p><i>v.</i> measure by using trigonometry</p><p><i>v.</i> survey by triangulation</p><p><i>adj.</i> composed of or marked with triangles</p><p><b>triangulacija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a trigonometric method of determining the position of a fixed point from the angles to it from two fixed points a known distance apart</p><p><i>n.</i> a method of surveying</p><p><b>Mali sjeverni sazvežđe u blizini Perseja između Andromede i Ovana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small northern constellation near Perseus between Andromeda and Aries [Triangle]</p><p><b>malo svjetlo sazvežđe u polarnom području južne hemisfere u blizini Circina i Apusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small bright constellation in the polar region of the southern hemisphere near Circinus and Apus [Southern Triangle]</p><p><b>Trijas</b></p><p><i>n.</i> from 230 million to 190 million years ago [Triassic period]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or denoting the first period of the Mesozoic era</p><p><b>Prije 230 do 190 milijuna godina. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> from 230 million to 190 million years ago [Triassic]</p><p><b>slijepoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> conenoses [genus Triatoma]</p><p><b>u slučaju bolesti u kojoj je osoba u stanju da se odmakne od bolesti ili bolesti u kojoj je osoba u stanju da se odmakne od bolesti, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i>