čje gdje se susreću Argentina, Brazil i Paraguay (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the border area where Argentina and Brazil and Paraguay meet</p><p><b>troskok</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an athletic contest in which a competitor must perform successively a hop and a step and a jump in continuous movement [hop-step-and-jump]</p><p><b>Čin dobivanja tri igrača na jednom djelu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of getting three players out on one play</p><p><b>vrsta curacao s većim sadržajem alkohola (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> type of curacao having higher alcoholic content</p><p><b>glazbeno vrijeme s tri otkucaja u svakom taktu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> musical time with three beats in each bar</p><p><b>konja koji je osvojio Kentucky Derby i Belmont Stakes i Preakness trke, Nezvanična titula za igrača koji vodi ligu u prosjeku udaraca i domaćinstvu i trka u batingu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of a horse that has won the Kentucky Derby and the Belmont Stakes and the Preakness races</p><p><i>adj.</i> unofficial championship title for player who heads the league in batting average and home runs and runs batted in</p><p><b>sezona bejzbola u kojoj igrač osvaja trostruku krunu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a season of baseball during which a player wins the triple crown</p><p><b>napravljen od tri kriške obično prženog kruha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> made with three slices of usually toasted bread [club sandwich, three-decker]</p><p><b>tip s dva prazna mjesta između redova (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> type with two empty spaces between lines</p><p><b>tipkanje koje ostavlja dvije linije prazne između linija tipkanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> typing that leaves two lines blank between lines of typing</p><p><b>svira brze note na vjetrenom instrumentu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> play fast notes on a wind instrument [double tongue]</p><p><b>grupa od troje, troje, trolist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of one and one and one [3, III, deuce-ace, leash, tercet, ternary, ternion, terzetto, three, threesome, tierce, trey, triad, trine, trinity, trio, troika]</p><p><i>n.</i> one of three offspring born at the same time from the same pregnancy</p><p><i>n.</i> a set of three similar things considered as a unit [triad, trio, triple]</p><p><b>normalna verzija genetske kodove u kojoj niz od tri nukleotida kodira sintezu određene aminokiseline (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the normal version of the genetic code in which a sequence of three nucleotides codes for the synthesis of a specific amino acid</p><p><b>Ribe u toplim vodama širom svijeta koje imaju duge analne i dorsne peraje koje sa repnim perajem sugeriraju rep s tri režnja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large food fish of warm waters worldwide having long anal and dorsal fins that with a caudal fin suggest a three-lobed tail</p><p><b>mala vrsta koja obuhvaća biljke često uključene u rod Matricaria (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small genus comprising plants often included in genus Matricaria [genus Tripleurospermum]</p><p><b>Europski godišnji korov s bijelim cvijećem i fino podijeljenim lišćama, prirodan i ponekad uzgajan u istočnoj Sjevernoj Americi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> ubiquitous European annual weed with white flowers and finely divided leaves naturalized and sometimes cultivated in eastern North America [Matricaria inodorum, corn mayweed, scentless camomile, scentless false camomile, scentless hayweed, scentless mayweed]</p><p><b>Bjelokosti iz Malog Azije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mat-forming perennial herb of Asia Minor [Matricaria oreades, turfing daisy]</p><p><b>Bjelokosti i plodovi: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> low densely tufted perennial herb of Turkey having small white flowers [Matricaria tchihatchewii, turfing daisy]</p><p><b>tripleksni, trostruki, trožilni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having three units or components or elements [ternary, treble, triple]</p><p><b>u 3 primjerka, utrostručen, utrostručiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of three copies</p><p><i>v.</i> reproduce threefold</p><p><b>trostrukost</b></p><p><i>n.