d in both children and adults [psilosis, sprue]</p><p><b>vrijeme koje je potrebno da Zemlja napravi jedan krug oko Sunca, mjereno između dva proljetna jednodnevnica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time for the earth to make one revolution around the sun, measured between two vernal equinoxes [astronomical year, equinoctial year, solar year]</p><p><b>tropski pojas</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of the Earth's surface between the Tropic of Cancer and the Tropic of Capricorn [Torrid Zone, tropics]</p><p><b>figurativan, slikovit, tropski, tropskih, tropsko (od &quot;tropical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a tropical manner</p><p><b>uglavnom bijela mrežasti tropski morski ptica često se nalazi daleko od kopna (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mostly white web-footed tropical seabird often found far from land [boatswain bird, tropic bird]</p><p><b>obratnica, tropski, tropski pojas (od &quot;tropic&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of the Earth's surface between the Tropic of Cancer and the Tropic of Capricorn [Torrid Zone, tropical zone]</p><p><b>Zmije sa linijama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> lined snakes [genus Tropidoclonion]</p><p><b>Tajna zmija gradskih deponija i parkova kao i prerija i otvorenih šuma. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> secretive snake of city dumps and parks as well as prairies and open woods [lined snake]</p><p><b>Nevoljan odgovor na orijentaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an involuntary orienting response</p><p><b>naziv mjesta regije ili jezika koji se uzimaju zajedno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the place names of a region or a language considered collectively [troponymy]</p><p><b>riječ koja označava način na koji se nešto radi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a word that denotes a manner of doing something [manner name]</p><p><b>Semantički odnos biti način čini nešto, naziv mjesta regije ili jezika koji se uzimaju zajedno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the semantic relation of being a manner of does something</p><p><i>n.</i> the place names of a region or a language considered collectively [troponomy]</p><p><b>tropopauza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the region of discontinuity between the troposphere and the stratosphere</p><p><b>troposfera</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the lowest atmospheric layer</p><p><b>kas, kasanje, kasati, pokazati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a slow pace of running [jog, lope]</p><p><i>n.</i> radicals who support Trotsky's theory that socialism must be established throughout the world by continuing revolution [Trotskyist, Trotskyite]</p><p><i>n.</i> a literal translation used in studying a foreign language (often used illicitly) [crib, pony]</p><p><i>n.</i> a gait faster than a walk</p><p><i>v.</i> run at a moderately swift pace [clip, jog]</p><p><i>v.</i> ride at a trot</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to trot</p><p><b>iznijeti, pokazati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> bring out and show for inspection and admiration</p><p><b>vjernost, zaruke</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mutual promise to marry [betrothal, engagement]</p><p><i>n.</i> a solemn pledge of fidelity [plight]</p><p><b>Dugi ribarski lanci s mnogo kraćih lanci i udice pričvršćene na njega (obično obješene između boja) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long fishing line with many shorter lines and hooks attached to it (usually suspended between buoys) [setline, spiller, trawl, trawl line]</p><p><b>Ruski revolucionar i komunistički teoretičar koji je pomogao Leninu i izgradio vojsku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Russian revolutionary and Communist theorist who helped Lenin and built up the army [Leon Trotsky, Lev Davidovich Bronstein]</p><p><b>oblik komunizma kojeg je zagovarao Leon Trockij. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the form of communism advocated by Leon Trotsky</p><p><b>Radikali koji podržavaju Trockovu teoriju da socijalizam mora biti uspostavljen širom svijeta kroz kontinuiranu revoluciju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> radicals who support Trotsky's theory that socialism must be established throughout the world by continuing revolution [Trot, Trotskyite]</p><p><b>Radikali koji podržavaju Trockovu teoriju da socijalizam mora biti usposta