</i> the activity of transporting goods by truck [hauling, trucking]</p><p><b>hodati, kamion, kamionet, kamionski, kolica, kotur, otvoreni teretni vagon, piljariti, posao, povrće za trgovinu, predmeti od male vrijednosti, prijevoz kamionom, prikolica, skitati, terenac, teretni vagon, teretnjak, trampa, trampiti, trgovina, vagon, vagonet, voziti kamionom, zamjena (od &quot;truck&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who drives a truck as an occupation [teamster, truck driver]</p><p><b>hodati, kamion, kamionet, kamionski, kolica, kotur, otvoreni teretni vagon, piljariti, posao, povrće za trgovinu, predmeti od male vrijednosti, prijevoz kamionom, prikolica, skitati, terenac, teretni vagon, teretnjak, trampa, trampiti, trgovina, vagon, vagonet, voziti kamionom, zamjena (od &quot;truck&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of transporting goods by truck [hauling, truckage]</p><p><b>poduzeće koje prijevozi robu ili imovinu kamionom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a company that ships goods or possessions by truck</p><p><b>cestovni promet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an industry that provides transportation for commercial products</p><p><b>kamion koji se sastoji od traktora i prikolice zajedno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a truck consisting of a tractor and trailer together [articulated lorry, rig, semi, tractor trailer, trailer truck]</p><p><b>ulagivati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a low bed to be slid under a higher bed [truckle bed, trundle, trundle bed]</p><p><i>v.</i> yield to out of weakness</p><p><i>v.</i> try to gain favor by cringing or flattering [bootlick, fawn, kotow, kowtow, suck up, toady]</p><p><b>pomoćni krevet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a low bed to be slid under a higher bed [truckle, trundle, trundle bed]</p><p><b>ulagivati se (od &quot;truckle&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who humbles himself as a sign of respect [apple polisher, bootlicker, fawner, groveler, groveller]</p><p><b>puzanje pred nekim, ulagivanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of obeying meanly (especially obeying in a humble manner or for unworthy reasons)</p><p><b>Neprijateljski odnos i odnos s drugim osobama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> obstreperous and defiant aggressiveness [truculency]</p><p><b>Neprijateljski odnos i odnos s drugim osobama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> obstreperous and defiant aggressiveness [truculence]</p><p><b>okrutan, svirep, zvjerski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> defiantly aggressive</p><p><b>okrutan, svirep, zvjerski (od &quot;truculent&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in an aggressively truculent manner</p><p><i>adv.</i> in a defiantly truculent manner</p><p><b>vući se, zamorna šetnja, zamorno putovanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long difficult walk</p><p><i>v.</i> walk heavily and firmly, as when weary, or through mud [footslog, pad, plod, slog, tramp]</p><p><b>vući se, zamorna šetnja, zamorno putovanje (od &quot;trudge&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who walks in a laborious heavy-footed manner [plodder, slogger]</p><p><b>centrirati, iskren, istina, istinit, izjednačiti, odan, odgovarajući, pravi, prirodan, stvaran, stvarni, točan, točno, uravnotežen, vjeran, istinito, pravu, pravo, istinski, zakonito</b></p><p><i>n.</i> proper alignment</p><p><i>v.</i> make level, square, balanced, or concentric [true up]</p><p><i>adj.</i> consistent with fact or reality</p><p><i>adj.</i> accurately placed or thrown [dead on target]</p><p><i>adj.</i> devoted (sometimes fanatically) to a cause or concept or truth</p><p><i>adj.</i> expressing or given to expressing the truth [truthful]</p><p><i>adj.</i> conforming to definitive criteria</p><p><i>adj.</i> worthy of being depended on [dependable, honest, reliable]</p><p><i>adj.</i> not pretended [genuine, unfeigned]</p><p><i>adj.</i> rightly so called</p><p><i>adj.</i> determined with reference to the earth's axis rather than the magnetic poles</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a legally established claim [lawful, rightful]</p><p><i>adj.</i> in tune [on-key]</p><p><i>adj.</i> accurately fitted [straight]</p><p><i>adv.</i> as acknowledged [admittedly, a