e mold of the class Myxomycetes [acellular slime mold, myxomycete, plasmodial slime mold]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko malih ptica pjevačica tamne boje koje se hrane sjemenima ili insektima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several small dull-colored singing birds feeding on seeds or insects [sparrow]</p><p><b>istina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a true statement [truth]</p><p><b>seksualno vjerni (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> sexually faithful</p><p><b>predstavlja stvari ili postupke ili uvjete kao što su zapravo (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> representing things or actions or conditions as they actually are [true-to-life]</p><p><b>amfibija bez repa slična žabi, ali više kopnena i ima sušu bradavicu kože (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tailless amphibian similar to a frog but more terrestrial and having drier warty skin</p><p><b>lakše obrađivano drvo tulipana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> light easily worked wood of a tulip tree [tulipwood, white poplar, whitewood, yellow poplar]</p><p><b>napraviti ravnu, kvadratnu, uravnoteženu ili koncentričnu (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make level, square, balanced, or concentric [true]</p><p><b>bilo koji od različitih tropskih američkih šišmiša iz obitelji Desmodontidae koji grize sisare i ptice kako bi se hranili njihovom krvlju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various tropical American bats of the family Desmodontidae that bite mammals and birds to feed on their blood [vampire bat]</p><p><b>bilo koji od dva donja glasna pregrada koja se spajaju da formiraju glotu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of the two lower vocal folds that come together to form the glottis [inferior vocal cord, inferior vocal fold, true vocal fold]</p><p><b>bilo koji od dva donja glasna pregrada koja se spajaju da formiraju glotu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of the two lower vocal folds that come together to form the glottis [inferior vocal cord, inferior vocal fold, true vocal cord]</p><p><b>grmuše</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small active brownish or greyish Old World birds [Old World warbler]</p><p><b>čovjek stalnih načela, koji je prave modre boje, koji ne blijedi, koji ne gubi boju, odan, odan čovjek, postojan, pouzdan, prava modra boja, stalan, vjeran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by unswerving loyalty</p><p><b>koji nudi niz izjava od kojih se svaka mora procijeniti kao istinita ili lažna (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> offering a series of statements each of which is to be judged as true or false</p><p><b>predstavlja stvari ili postupke ili uvjete kao što su zapravo (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> representing things or actions or conditions as they actually are [true to life]</p><p><b>Neosporni u odanosti prijatelju ili zavjetu ili cilju (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> unwavering in devotion to friend or vow or cause [fast, firm, loyal]</p><p><b>Osoba koju voli druga osoba. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person loved by another person [steady, sweetheart, sweetie]</p><p><b>čvor za vezanje krajeva dvije linije zajedno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a knot for tying the ends of two lines together [fisherman's knot, true lover's knot]</p><p><b>istina, lojalnost, odanost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> conformity to reality or actuality [the true, truth, verity]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being loyal [loyalty]</p><p><i>n.</i> exactness of adjustment</p><p><b>Francuski filmski redatelj (1932-1984) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> French filmmaker (1932-1984) [Francois Truffaut]</p><p><b>gomoljača, gomoljika, tartuf, tartufima</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various highly prized edible subterranean fungi of the genus Tuber [earth-ball, earthnut]</p><p><i>n.</i> edible subterranean fungus of the genus Tuber [earthnut]</p><p><i>n.</i> creamy chocolate candy [chocolate truffle]</p><p><b>istina, očevidnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an obvious truth</p><p><b>iskreno, istinito, istinski, odano, stvarno, točno, uistinu, vjerno, zaista</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in accordance with truth or fact or reality [genuinely, really]</p><p><i>adv.</i> by right [rightfully]</p><p><i>adv.</i> with sincerity [sincerely, unfeig