ance]</p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of believing in the honesty and reliability of others [trustfulness, trustingness]</p><p><i>n.</i> a consortium of independent organizations formed to limit competition by controlling the production and distribution of a product or service [cartel, combine, corporate trust]</p><p><i>n.</i> complete confidence in a person or plan etc [faith]</p><p><i>n.</i> a trustful relationship [confidence]</p><p><i>v.</i> have confidence or faith in</p><p><i>v.</i> allow without fear</p><p><i>v.</i> be confident about something [believe]</p><p><i>v.</i> expect and wish [desire, hope]</p><p><i>v.</i> confer a trust upon [commit, confide, entrust, intrust]</p><p><i>v.</i> (chiefly archaic) extend credit to</p><p><b>štednički račun koji je uložio netko tko je povjerenik korisnika i koji ga kontrolira tijekom svog života (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a savings account deposited by someone who makes themselves the trustee for a beneficiary and who controls it during their lifetime [Totten trust, savings account trust, savings bank trust, trustee account]</p><p><b>(zakon) vladine aktivnosti koje nastoje raspustiti korporativne trustove i monopolne institucije (posebno u skladu s antitrustnim zakonima Sjedinjenih Država) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (law) government activities seeking to dissolve corporate trusts and monopolies (especially under the United States antitrust laws)</p><p><b>povjereničko društvo</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an organization (usually with a commercial bank) that is engaged as a trustee or fiduciary or agent in handling trust funds or estates of custodial arrangements or stock transfers or related services [trust corporation]</p><p><b>"odjel" znači subjekt koji je uključen u poslovni odnos s drugim subjektima ili u poslovni odnos s drugim subjektima ili u poslovni odnos s drugim subjektima ili u poslovni odnos s drugim subjektima ili u poslovni odnos s drugim subjektima ili u poslovni odnos s drugim subjektima ili u poslovni odnos s drugim subjek