cem postavljenim pod pravim kutom na drugi ravni komad (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a square having a metal ruler set at right angles to another straight piece</p><p><b>isprobati, pokušati, probati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> putting clothes on to see whether they fit [fitting, trying on]</p><p><b>Norveški diplomata koji je bio prvi generalni tajnik Ujedinjenih naroda (1896-1968) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Norwegian diplomat who was the first Secretary General of the United Nations (1896-1968) [Lie, Trygve Lie]</p><p><b>Norveški diplomata koji je bio prvi generalni tajnik Ujedinjenih naroda (1896-1968) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Norwegian diplomat who was the first Secretary General of the United Nations (1896-1968) [Lie, Trygve Halvden Lie]</p><p><b>naporan, pokušava, pokušavajući, pokušavanje, pokušavao</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> hard to endure</p><p><i>adj.</i> extremely irritating to the nerves [nerve-racking, nerve-wracking, stressful]</p><p><b>stavljanje odjeće da vidi da li im odgovaraju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> putting clothes on to see whether they fit [fitting, try-on]</p><p><b>isprobavanje, opit, proba, test</b></p><p><i>n.</i> trying something to find out about it [test, trial, trial run]</p><p><i>n.</i> a test of the suitability of a performer [audition]</p><p><b>voćne muhe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fruit flies [Trephritidae, family Trephritidae, family Trypetidae]</p><p><b>enzim pankreatskog podrijetla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an enzyme of pancreatic origin</p><p><b>neaktivni prekursor tripsina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> inactive precursor of trypsin</p><p><b>triptofan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amino acid that occurs in proteins [tryptophane]</p><p><b>triptofan</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amino acid that occurs in proteins [tryptophan]</p><p><b>dogovor, ročište, sastanak, stočni sajam</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a date [rendezvous]</p><p><i>n.</i> a secret rendezvous (especially between lovers) [assignation]</p><p><b>Agencija osnovana 2001. godine kako bi zaštitila prometne sustave Sjedinjen