 one (od &quot;twenty&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the time of life between 20 and 30 [mid-twenties]</p><p><i>n.</i> the decade from 1920 to 1929 [1920s]</p><p><b>dvadeseti, dvadeseti dio, dvadesetog</b></p><p><i>n.</i> position 20 in a countable series of things</p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the nineteenth in position [20th]</p><p><b>stoljeće od 1901. do 2000. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the century from 1901 to 2000</p><p><b>dvadeset, one</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of nineteen and one [20, XX]</p><p><i>n.</i> a United States bill worth 20 dollars [twenty dollar bill]</p><p><i>adj.</i> denoting a quantity consisting of 20 items or units [20, xx]</p><p><b>Američki novčanicu vrijednu 20 dolara. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a United States bill worth 20 dollars [twenty]</p><p><b>jedan dio u pet jednakih dijelova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one part in five equal parts [fifth, fifth part, one-fifth]</p><p><b>Kardinalni broj koji je zbir od 27 i 1, Biti osam više od dvadeset (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of twenty-seven and one [28, XXVIII]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being eight more than twenty [28, xxviii]</p><p><b>Dolazi sljedeći nakon dvadeset i sedmog u poziciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the twenty-seventh in position [28th]</p><p><b>Sljedeći nakon 24. na položaju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the twenty-fourth in position [25th]</p><p><b>Sljedeći nakon dvadesetog u poziciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> coming next after the twentieth in position [21st]</p><p><b>Kardinalni broj koji je zbir od dvadeset četiri i jedan., Biti pet više od dvadeset (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the cardinal number that is the sum of twenty-four and one [25, XXV]</p><p><i>adj.</i> being five more than twenty [25, xxv]</p><p><b>dvadeset pet posto, jedna četvrtina, četvrti dio, četvrtina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of four equal parts [fourth, fourth part, one-fourth, one-quarter, quarter, quartern]</p><p><b>dvade