čnih vozila (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a carriage for carrying a sheet of paper</p><p><b>tipografija je tipografija u kojoj je svakom znaku dodijeljena ista širina (kao kod pisaće mašine) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a typeface is which each character is given the same width (as by a typewriter) [constant-width font, fixed-width font, monospaced font]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom materijala od: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a keyboard for manually entering characters to be printed</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom materijala ne većim od 50 g/m2 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> writing paper suitable for use in a typewriter [typing paper]</p><p><b>s masom od preko 300 mm ili većom, ali ne većom od 300 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a long strip of inked material for making characters on paper with a typewriter [ribbon]</p><p><b>tipkanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> writing done with a typewriter [typing]</p><p><b>Sljedeći članci: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> reed maces [genus Typha]</p><p><b>U Americi, Europi, Sjevernoj Africi, Aziji (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> reed maces of America, Europe, North Africa, Asia [lesser bullrush, narrow-leaf cattail, narrow-leaved reedmace, soft flag]</p><p><b>Visoka močvarna biljka s cilindričnim glavama sjemena koje eksplodiraju kada sazreju i ispuštaju velike količine duvana. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall marsh plant with cylindrical seed heads that explode when mature shedding large quantities of down [bullrush, bulrush, cat's-tail, nailrod, reed mace, reedmace]</p><p><b>višegodišnje močvarne biljke s puzećim korijenima i dugim linearnim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial marsh plants with creeping rootstocks and long linear leaves [cattail family, family Typhaceae]</p><p><b>slijepe zmije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> blind snakes [family Typhlopidae]</p><p><b>(grčka mitologija) sin Gaea i Tartarus koji je stvorio vrtlogovi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (Greek mythology) son of Gaea and Tartarus who created the whirlwinds</p><p><b>tifus, tifusni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> serious infect