je koja se javlja bez manične faze koja se javlja u klasičnom obliku bipolarnog poremećaja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a major depressive episode that occurs without the manic phase that occurs in the classic form of bipolar disorder</p><p><b>izvanredan, jedina, jedini, jedinstven, jedinstveni, jedinstvenim, jedinstvenog, poseban, unikat, jedinstvena, jedinstvenu</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> radically distinctive and without equal [alone, unequaled, unequalled, unparalleled]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (followed by `to') applying exclusively to a given category or condition or locality</p><p><i>adj.</i> the single one of its kind [singular]</p><p><i>adj.</i> highly unusual or rare but not the single instance</p><p><b>iznimno, jedinstveno</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> so as to be unique [unambiguously]</p><p><b>jedinstvenost, jednoznačnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being one of a kind [singularity]</p><p><b>od odjeće od pređe od 8 kg ili više, ali ne više od 8 kg ili više (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (of linens or clothes) not ironed [wrinkled]</p><p><b>Ne razlikuju se po spolu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> not distinguished on the basis of sex</p><p><b>koji se odnose samo na jedan spol ili imaju samo jedan tip spolnog organa (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to only one sex or having only one type of sexual organ</p><p><b>jednoglasje, sklad, sloga</b></p><p><i>n.</i> corresponding exactly</p><p><i>n.</i> occurring together or simultaneously</p><p><i>n.</i> (music) two or more sounds or tones at the same pitch or in octaves</p><p><b>agregat, blok, cjelina, element, jedinica, jedinični, jedinka, komad, mjera, odjeljak, osnovni dio, parametar, uređaj, jedinici, mjerna jedinica, društvena grupa, grupa, skupina, stvar, građevna jedinica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any division of quantity accepted as a standard of measurement or exchange [unit of measurement]</p><p><i>n.</i> an individual or group or structure or other entity regarded as a structural or functional constituent of a whole</p><p><i>n.</i> an organization regarded as part of a larger social group [social unit]</p><p><i>n.</i> a single undivided whole</p><p><i>n.</i> a single undivided natural thing occurring in the composition of something else [building block]</p><p><i>n.</i> an assemblage of parts that is regarded as a single entity [whole]</p><p><b>najmanja skupina atoma ili molekula čije ponavljanje u redovnim intervalima u tri dimenzije stvara rešetke kristala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the smallest group of atoms or molecules whose repetition at regular intervals in three dimensions produces the lattices of a crystal</p><p><b>(genetika) karakter koji se nasljeđuje na osnovi "sve ili ništa" i ovisi o prisutnosti jednog gena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (genetics) a character inherited on an all-or-none basis and dependent on the presence of a single gene</p><p><b>jedinična cijena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> calculated cost for a given unit of a product</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (a) ili (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (b) ili (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (b (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a regulated investment company consisting of professional managers who issue redeemable securities representing a portfolio of many different securities [unit trust]</p><p><b>jedinična matrica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a scalar matrix in which all of the diagonal elements are unity [identity matrix]</p><p><b>-U redu. -U redu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a charge of ammunition for a single shot [one shot, round]</p><p><b>jedinica, mjerna jedinica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any division of quantity accepted as a standard of measurement or exchange [unit]</p><p><b>jedinica vremena, vremenska jedinica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit for measuring time periods [time unit]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 do 0,01 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of measurement for viscosity</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ili (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (a) ili (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (b) ili (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (b) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (c) ove Uredbe, u skladu s člankom 4. stavkom (b (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a regulated investment company consisting of professional managers who issue redeemable securities representing a portfolio of many different securities [unit investment trust]</p><p><b>odjeća od izdržljivog materijala koja pokriva tijelo od ramena do bedra (i može imati dugačke rukave ili noge koje dosežu do gležnjeva) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tight-fitting garment of stretchy material that covers the body from the shoulders to the thighs (and may have long sleeves or legs reaching down to the ankles) [body suit, cat suit, leotard]</p><p><b>unitaran, unitarist</b></p><p><i>n.</i> adherent of Unitarianism</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characterizing Unitarianism</p><p><b>protestantska denominacija koja odbacuje nauku o Trojstvu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the Protestant denomination that rejects the doctrine of the Trinity</p><p><b>religija koja ne drži nauke i koja naglašava slobodu vjerovanja i odbacuje Trojicu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a non-doctrinal religion that stresses individual freedom of belief and rejects the Trinity</p><p><b>jedinstven, unitaran</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to or characterized by or aiming toward unity</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or pertaining to or involving the use of units</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by or constituting a form of government in which power is held by one central authority</p><p><i>adj.</i> having the indivisible character of a unit [one]</p><p><b>sjediniti, spojiti, stopiti, ujediniti, ujediniti se, združiti se, objediniti, objediniti se, objedinjavati, objedinjavati se, sjediniti se, sjedinjavati, sjedinjavati se, ujedinjavati, ujedinjavati se, združiti, združivati, združivati se, spojiti se, kombinirati, pridružiti, fuzionirati, stapati, udružiti, udruživati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> act in concert or unite in a common purpose or belief [unify]</p><p><i>v.</i> become one [merge, unify]</p><p><i>v.</i> have or possess in combination [combine]</p><p><i>v.</i> be or become joined or united or linked [connect, join, link, link up]</p><p><i>v.</i> bring together for a common purpose or action or ideology or in a shared situation [unify]</p><p><i>v.</i> join or combine [merge, unify]</p><p><b>sjedinjen, složen, ujedinjen, Ujedinjenih, sjedinjenja</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by unity</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to two people who are married to each other [joined]</p><p><b>osnovna jedinica novca u Ujedinjenim Arapskim Emiratima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in the United Arab Emirates [dirham]</p><p><b>monetarna jedinica u Ujedinjenim Arapskim Emiratima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> monetary unit in the United Arab Emirates</p><p><b>Ujedinjeni Arapski Emirati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a federation of seven Arab emirates on the eastern Arabian peninsula</p><p><b>šeikstvo istočne Arabije i glavni grad Ujedinjenih Arapskih Emirata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sheikhdom of eastern Arabia and capital of the United Arab Emirates [Abu Dhabi]</p><p><b>Republika u sjeveroistočnoj Africi poznata kao Ujedinjena Arapska Republika do 1971. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in northeastern Africa known as the United Arab Republic until 1971 [Arab Republic of Egypt, Egypt]</p><p><b>spajanje Kongregacijske kršćanske crkve i Evangeličke i reformirane crkve 1957. godine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> merger of the Congregational Christian Church and the Evangelical and Reformed Church in 1957</p><p><b>multietnički savez u Afganistanu koji prakticiraju umjeren oblik islama i ujedinjeni su u svojoj opoziciji Talibanu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a multiethnic alliance in Afghanistan who practice a moderate form of Islam and are united in their opposition to the Taliban [Northern Alliance]</p><p><b>Ujedinjena Kraljevina i Irska, Ujedinjena Kraljevina, Ujedinjeno Kraljevstvo, Velika Britanija i Sjeverna Irska</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a monarchy in northwestern Europe occupying most of the British Isles [Britain, Great Britain, U.K., UK, United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland]</p><p><b>Monarhija u sjeverozapadnoj Europi koja zauzima većinu Britanskih otoka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a monarchy in northwestern Europe occupying most of the British Isles [Britain, Great Britain, U.K., UK, United Kingdom]</p><p><b>zajednica Wesleyan Metodističke crkve i Evangelical United Brethren Crkve (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> union of the Wesleyan Methodist Church and the Evangelical United Brethren Church</p><p><b>Sjedinjene Meksičke Države</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in southern North America [Mexico]</p><p><b>industrijski sindikat rudara u Sjevernoj Americi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an industrial union of mine workers in North America [United Mine Workers of America]</p><p><b>industrijski sindikat rudara u Sjevernoj Americi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an industrial union of mine workers in North America [United Mine Workers]</p><p><b>Ujedine Narode, Ujedini Narodi, Ujedinjeni narodi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an organization of independent states formed in 1945 to promote international peace and security [UN]</p><p><b>Agencija Ujedinjenih naroda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency of the United Nations [UN agency]</p><p><b>UNICEF</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency of the United Nations responsible for programs to aid education and the health of children and mothers in developing countries [UNICEF, United Nations International Children's Emergency Fund]</p><p><b>Ured Ujedinjenih naroda odgovoran za sprečavanje kriminala i krivično pravosuđe i reformu zakona (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the United Nations office responsible for crime prevention and criminal justice and law reform [Centre for International Crime Prevention]</p><p><b>Dan za proslavu osnivanja Ujedinjenih naroda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a day for celebrating the founding of the United Nations [October 24]</p><p><b>UNESCO</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency of the United Nations that promotes education and communication and the arts [UNESCO]</p><p><b>UNICEF</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency of the United Nations responsible for programs to aid education and the health of children and mothers in developing countries [UNICEF, United Nations Children's Fund]</p><p><b>Agencija Ujedinjenih naroda koja promoviše kontrolu droge i prevenciju kriminala. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency of the United Nations that promotes drug control and crime prevention [DCCP]</p><p><b>administrativno tijelo Ujedinjenih naroda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the administrative arm of the United Nations</p><p><b>Ujedinjena Republika Tanzanija, Tanzanija</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a republic in eastern Africa [Tanzania]</p><p><b>Teroristička organizacija u Kolumbiji osnovana 1997. godine kao krovna grupa za lokalne i regionalne paravojne grupe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a terrorist organization in Colombia formed in 1997 as an umbrella for local and regional paramilitary groups [AUC, Autodefensas Unidas de Colombia, United Self-Defense Group of Colombia]</p><p><b>Teroristička organizacija u Kolumbiji osnovana 1997. godine kao krovna grupa za lokalne i regionalne paravojne grupe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a terrorist organization in Colombia formed in 1997 as an umbrella for local and regional paramilitary groups [AUC, Autodefensas Unidas de Colombia, United Self-Defense Force of Colombia]</p><p><b>celibata i komunističke kršćanske sekte u Sjedinjenim Državama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a celibate and communistic Christian sect in the United States [Shakers]</p><p><b>Sjedinjene Američke Države, Sjedinjene Države</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American republic containing 50 states - 48 conterminous states in North America plus Alaska in northwest North America and the Hawaiian Islands in the Pacific Ocean [America, U.S., U.S.A., US, USA, United States of America, the States]</p><p><i>n.</i> the executive and legislative and judicial branches of the federal government of the United States [U.S., U.S. government, US Government, United States government]</p><p><b>Zračno- zrakoplovno zrakoplovstvo Sjedinjenih Američkih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the airforce of the United States of America [Air Force, U. S. Air Force, USAF, US Air Force]</p><p><b>škola za obuku muškaraca i žena da postanu časnici u američkom zrakoplovstvu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a school for training men and women to become officers in the United States Air Force [US Air Force Academy]</p><p><b>Vojska Sjedinjenih Američkih Država. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the army of the United States of America [Army, U. S. Army, USA, US Army]</p><p><b>Laboratorij za obranu Komande za krivično istraživanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a defense laboratory of the Criminal Investigation Command [U.S. Army Criminal Investigation Laboratory, USACIL, US Army Criminal Investigation Laboratory]</p><p><b>Specijalno obučena elitna jedinica američke vojske. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a specially trained elite unit of the United States Army</p><p><b>divizija američke vojske koja je posebno obučena za gerilske borbe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a division of the United States Army that is specially trained for guerilla fighting [Special Forces, U. S. Army Special Forces]</p><p><b>Osoba koja je na mjestu tajnika Ministarstva pravosuđa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the person who holds the position of secretary of the Justice Department [Attorney General, US Attorney General]</p><p><b>mobilna snaga za provedbu zakona Ulaznica i Naturalizacija služba koja otkriva i sprečava nezakoniti ulazak stranca u Sjedinjene Države (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the mobile law enforcement arm of the Immigration and Naturalization Service that detects and prevents illegal entry of aliens into the United States [US Border Patrol]</p><p><b>Odbor za savjetovanje predsjednika. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a board to advise the President [US Cabinet]</p><p><b>Građanski rat u Sjedinjenim Državama između Sjeverne i Južne. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> civil war in the United States between the North and the South [American Civil War, War between the States]</p><p><b>Agencija Ministarstva prometa odgovorna za patroliranje obala i olakšavanje pomorske trgovine. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency of the Department of Transportation responsible for patrolling shores and facilitating nautical commerce [U. S. Coast Guard, US Coast Guard]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, države članice mogu u skladu s člankom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka odrediti da se u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka ne primjenjuju propisi o državnim pravima. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a consolidation and codification by subject matter of the general and permanent laws of the United States [U. S. Code]</p><p><b>Kongres Sjedinjenih Američkih Država, kongres</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the legislature of the United States government [Congress, U.S. Congress, US Congress]</p><p><b>Ustav napisan na Ustavnoj konvenciji u Philadelphiji 1787. godine i kasnije ratifikovan od strane originalnih trinaest država. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the constitution written at the Constitutional Convention in Philadelphia in 1787 and subsequently ratified by the original thirteen states [Constitution, Constitution of the United States, U.S. Constitution, US Constitution]</p><p><b>sustav težine i mjera na temelju stopa i funte i sekundi i pinta koji datira iz kolonijalne Amerike, ali se u nekim aspektima razlikuje od britanskog carskog sustava (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the system of weights and measures based on the foot and pound and second and pint that dates back to colonial America but differs in some respects from the British Imperial System</p><p><b>Federalno ministarstvo odgovorno za zaštitu nacionalne sigurnosti Sjedinjenih Država. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the federal department responsible for safeguarding national security of the United States [Defense, Defense Department, Department of Defense, DoD]</p><p><b>savezni odjel u Sjedinjenim Državama koji postavlja i održava vanjsku politiku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the federal department in the United States that sets and maintains foreign policies [Department of State, DoS, State, State Department]</p><p><b>američki dolar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the basic unit of money in the United States</p><p><b>Jedinica za mjerenje kapaciteta za suhe tvari službeno prihvaćena u Uobičajenom sustavu Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of measurement of capacity for dry substances officially adopted in the United States Customary System</p><p><b>Agencija u Ministarstvu unutarnjih poslova koja čuva i štiti ribe i divlje životinje i njihova staništa. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency in the Department of the Interior that conserves and protects fish and wildlife and their habitats [FWS, US Fish and Wildlife Service]</p><p><b>Izvršni i zakonodavni i sudski grani savezne vlade Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the executive and legislative and judicial branches of the federal government of the United States [U.S., U.S. government, US Government, United States]</p><p><b>Nezavisna ne-partijanska savezna agencija koja djeluje kao istražna ruka Kongresa čineći izvršnu vlast odgovornom Kongresu i vladu odgovornom građanima Sjedinjenih Država. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an independent nonpartisan federal agency that acts as the investigative arm of Congress making the executive branch accountable to Congress and the government accountable to citizens of the United States [GAO, Government Accounting Office]</p><p><b>Agencija zakonodavne grane koja pruža štampanje i vezivanje usluga za Kongres i odjeljenja i ustanove savezne vlade (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an agency of the legislative branch that provides printing and binding services for Congress and the departments and establishments of the federal government [GPO, Government Printing Office, US Government Printing Office]</p><p><b>donji zakonodavni dom Kongresa Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the lower legislative house of the United States Congress [House of Representatives, U.S. House, U.S. House of Representatives, US House, US House of Representatives]</p><p><b>obavještajna služba u Sjedinjenim Državama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an intelligence service in the United States</p><p><b>grupa vladinih agencija i organizacija koje obavljaju obavještajne aktivnosti za vladu Sjedinjenih Država. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a group of government agencies and organizations that carry out intelligence activities for the United States government [IC, Intelligence Community, National Intelligence Community]</p><p><b>U skladu s člankom 2. stavkom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, "sredstva" su sredstva koja se upotrebljavaju za upravljanje i upravljanje sustavom upravljanja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a liquid unit officially adopted in the United States Customary System</p><p><b>amfibijska divizija američke mornarice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amphibious division of the United States Navy [Marine Corps, Marines, USMC, US Marine Corps, United States Marines]</p><p><b>amfibijska divizija američke mornarice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an amphibious division of the United States Navy [Marine Corps, Marines, USMC, US Marine Corps, United States Marine Corps]</p><p><b>Najstarija savezna agencija za provođenje zakona u SAD-u odgovorna je danas za zaštitu saveznog pravosuđa i prijevoz saveznih zatvorenika i zaštitu saveznih svjedoka i upravljanje imovinom zaplenjenom od kriminalaca i općenito osiguravanje učinkovitog rada saveznog pravosudnog sustava. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the United States' oldest federal law enforcement agency is responsible today for protecting the Federal Judiciary and transporting federal prisoners and protecting federal witnesses and managing assets seized from criminals and generally ensuring the effective operation of the federal judicial system [Marshals, US Marshals Service]</p><p><b>škola za obuku muškaraca i žena da postanu časnici u vojsci Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a school for training men and women to become officers in the United States Army [US Military Academy]</p><p><b>kovnica koja proizvodi i distribuira američke kovanice za cirkulaciju kroz Federalne rezervne banke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the mint that manufactures and distributes United States coins for circulation through Federal Reserve Banks [U.S. Mint, US Mint]</p><p><b>Najveća medicinska biblioteka na svijetu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the world's largest medical library [National Library of Medicine, U.S. National Library of Medicine]</p><p><b>škola za obuku muškaraca i žena da postanu časnici u mornarici Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a school for training men and women to become officers in the United States Navy [US Naval Academy]</p><p><b>Ujedinjene Američke Države (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the navy of the United States of America [Navy, USN, US Navy]</p><p><b>Sjedinjene Američke Države, Sjedinjenih Američkih Država</b></p><p><i>n.</i> North American republic containing 50 states - 48 conterminous states in North America plus Alaska in northwest North America and the Hawaiian Islands in the Pacific Ocean [America, U.S., U.S.A., US, USA, United States, the States]</p><p><b>Neovisna agencija savezne vlade odgovorna za dostavu pošte (a ponekad i telekomunikacije) između pojedinaca i poduzeća u Sjedinjenim Državama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an independent agency of the federal government responsible for mail delivery (and sometimes telecommunications) between individuals and businesses in the United States [PO, Post Of