senting this number [1, I, ace, one, single]</p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of being united into one [oneness]</p><p><b>jednovalentan, monovalentan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> used of a chromosome that is not paired or united with its homologous chromosome during synapsis</p><p><i>adj.</i> having a valence of 1 [monovalent]</p><p><b>puž</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a class of mollusks typically having a one-piece coiled shell and flattened muscular foot with a head bearing stalked eyes [gastropod]</p><p><i>adj.</i> used of mollusks, especially gastropods, as snails etc.</p><p><b>opća, općeg, opći, univerzalan, univerzalni, univerzalnom, univerzalnost, univerzalnu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (linguistics) a grammatical rule (or other linguistic feature) that is found in all languages [linguistic universal]</p><p><i>n.</i> (logic) a proposition that asserts something of all members of a class [universal proposition]</p><p><i>n.</i> a behavioral convention or pattern characteristic of all members of a particular culture or of all human beings</p><p><i>n.</i> coupling that connects two rotating shafts allowing freedom of movement in all directions [universal joint]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of worldwide scope or applicability [cosmopolitan, ecumenical, general, oecumenical, world-wide, worldwide]</p><p><i>adj.</i> applicable to or common to all members of a group or set</p><p><i>adj.</i> adapted to various purposes, sizes, forms, operations</p><p><b>osoba ovlaštena za obavljanje svih vrsta poslovanja za glavnog rukovodioca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone authorized to transact every kind of business for the principal [general agent]</p><p><b>osoba čija krv ima O Rh negativnu grupu može se sigurno transfundirati osobama s drugim krvnim skupinama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person whose type O Rh-negative blood may be safely transfused into persons with other blood types</p><p><b>(fizička) univerzalna konstanta u jednadžbi plina: pritisak puta zapremina = R puta temperatura (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (phys