piper]</p><p><b>veliki pijesak poput pluvera sjevernoameričkih polja i visoravni (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> large plover-like sandpiper of North American fields and uplands [Bartramia longicauda, Bartramian sandpiper, upland plover]</p><p><b>Čvrsta višegodišnja biljka s pločama i pločama. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tufted rigid North American perennial with loose clusters of white flowers [Aster ptarmicoides]</p><p><b>dići, oduševljenje, podići, polet, uzdignuće, uzvisina, zamah</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (geology) a rise of land to a higher elevation (as in the process of mountain building) [upheaval, upthrow, upthrust]</p><p><i>n.</i> a brassiere that lifts and supports the breasts</p><p><i>v.</i> fill with high spirits [elate, intoxicate, lift up, pick up]</p><p><i>v.</i> lift up from the earth, as by geologic forces</p><p><i>v.</i> lift up or elevate</p><p><b>dići, oduševljenje, podići, polet, uzdignuće, uzvisina, zamah (od &quot;uplift&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> exalted emotionally especially with pride</p><p><b>odižući</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the rise of something</p><p><b>uzlazna veza (zemaljske postaje do satelita), veza prema nadređenom čvoru</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a transmission from Earth to a spacecraft or the path of such a transmission</p><p><b>otprema, otpremanje, otpremiti, poslati podatke, postaviti, postavljanje, prenijeti podatke s manjeg računala na veće, prenijeti podatke s terminala na računalo, slanje datoteka</b></p><p><i>v.</i> transfer a file or program to a central computer from a smaller computer or a computer at a remote location</p><p><b>Sljedeći članak: (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> designed for consumers with high incomes</p><p><b>na najvećoj visini, najviši, sasvim gore, vrhovni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> at or nearest to the top [topmost, uppermost]</p><p><b>budan (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> vigilant [on guard, on one's guard, on your guard]</p><p><b>gornji, viši, gornjega</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the higher of two berths [upper berth]</p><p><i>n.</i> piece of leather or synthetic material that forms the part of a shoe or boot above the sole that encases the foot</p><p><i>n.</i> a central nervous system stimulant that increases energy and decreases appetite [amphetamine, pep pill, speed]</p><p><i>adj.</i> the topmost one of two</p><p><i>adj.</i> higher in place or position</p><p><i>adj.</i> superior in rank or accomplishment</p><p><b>Rijeka u srednjoj Engleskoj koja teče kroz Stratford-on-Avon i uliva se u Severn. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a river in central England that flows through Stratford-on-Avon and empties into the Severn [Avon, River Avon, Upper Avon River]</p><p><b>Rijeka u srednjoj Engleskoj koja teče kroz Stratford-on-Avon i uliva se u Severn. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a river in central England that flows through Stratford-on-Avon and empties into the Severn [Avon, River Avon, Upper Avon]</p><p><b>Najzadnji ili najviši prostor na balkonu s najjeftinijim sjedalima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> rearmost or uppermost area in the balcony containing the least expensive seats [family circle, peanut gallery, second balcony]</p><p><b>za sve ostale uslove: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the higher of two berths [upper]</p><p><b>gornja granica, gornja međa, gornji graničnik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (mathematics) a number equal to or greater than any other number in a given set</p><p><b>top koji pruža oklop ploče za gornju ruku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cannon that provides plate armor for the upper arm [rerebrace]</p><p><b>od 310 do 280 milijuna godina. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> from 310 million to 280 million years ago [Pennsylvanian, Pennsylvanian period, Upper Carboniferous period]</p><p><b>od 310 do 280 milijuna godina. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> from 310 million to 280 million years ago [Pennsylvanian, Pennsylvanian period, Upper Carboniferous]</p><p><b>gornja klasa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the class occupying the highest position in the social hierarchy [upper crust]</p><p><b>klasa koja zauzima najviši položaj u društvenoj hijerarhiji (MT)<