ličinama u mokraći (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> brown bile pigment formed from urobilinogens and found in feces and in small amounts in urine</p><p><b>kromogen koji se formira u crijevima od razgradnje bilirubina (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a chromogen formed in the intestine from the breakdown of bilirubin [stercobilinogen]</p><p><b>ekstravazacija urina u skrotalni vrećić (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> extravasation of urine into the scrotal sac</p><p><b>prolaz urina iz anusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> passage of urine from the anus [urochezia]</p><p><b>prolaz urina iz anusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> passage of urine from the anus [urochesia]</p><p><b>plaštenjaci</b></p><p><i>n.</i> primitive marine animal having a saclike unsegmented body and a urochord that is conspicuous in the larva [tunicate, urochordate]</p><p><i>n.</i> a notochord of a larval tunicate typically confined to the caudal region</p><p><b>plaštenjaci</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tunicates [Tunicata, Urochordata, subphylum Tunicata, subphylum Urochorda, subphylum Urochordata]</p><p><b>plaštenjaci</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tunicates [Tunicata, Urochorda, subphylum Tunicata, subphylum Urochorda, subphylum Urochordata]</p><p><b>plaštenjaci</b></p><p><i>n.</i> primitive marine animal having a saclike unsegmented body and a urochord that is conspicuous in the larva [tunicate, urochord]</p><p><b>šarene lisice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> grey foxes [genus Urocyon]</p><p><b>tamno siva američka lisica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dark grey American fox [gray fox, grey fox]</p><p><b>rod gljiva od vrste Tilletiaceae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a genus of smut fungi belonging to the family Tilletiaceae [genus Urocystis]</p><p><b>gljivica smut koja uzrokuje crnolikove mjehuriće na ljuskama i lištima luka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> smut fungus causing blackish blisters on scales and leaves of onions [onion smut]</p><p><b>gljivica koja pogađa lišće i stabljike pšenice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fungus affecting leaves and stems of wheat [wheat flag smut]</p