ane za financiranje izgradnje javnih usluga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bond issued to finance the construction of public utility services [utility revenue bond]</p><p><b>igrač bejzbola cijenjen zbog sposobnosti da igra na nekoliko pozicija, radnik koji će služiti u bilo kojem položaju kada ga pozovu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a baseball player valued for the ability to play at several positions</p><p><i>n.</i> a workman expected to serve in any capacity when called on</p><p><b>uslužni program, pomoćni program</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (computer science) a program designed for general support of the processes of a computer [service program, utility]</p><p><b>Obveznice koje su izdane za financiranje izgradnje javnih usluga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bond issued to finance the construction of public utility services [utility bond]</p><p><b>uslužna rutina, uslužni program</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a routine that can be used as needed [service routine]</p><p><b>upotrebljava se od govedine (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> used of beef [utility]</p><p><b>iskoristiv, upotrebljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> capable of being put to a profitable or practical use</p><p><b>iskorištavanje, iskorištenja, iskorištenje, korištenje, uporaba, upotreba, poraba, upotrebljavanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of using [employment, exercise, usage, use, utilisation]</p><p><i>n.</i> the state of having been made use of</p><p><b>iskoristiti, korisno upotrijebiti, koristiti, koristiti se, upotrijebiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put into service [apply, employ, use, utilise]</p><p><i>v.</i> convert (from an investment trust to a unit trust)</p><p><b>korišten</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> put to use [employed, utilised]</p><p><b>iskoristiti, korisno upotrijebiti, koristiti, koristiti se, upotrijebiti (od &quot;utilize&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who puts to good use [utiliser]</p><p><b>granični, krajnji, najveći, najviši, najviši stupanj, ekstreman</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the greatest possible degree [level best, maximum, uttermost]<