es mathematician (1880-1960) [Oswald Veblen]</p><p><b>vektor, vektorski, vektorskim, vektorsko, vektoru</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a variable quantity that can be resolved into components</p><p><i>n.</i> a straight line segment whose length is magnitude and whose orientation in space is direction</p><p><i>n.</i> any agent (person or animal or microorganism) that carries and transmits a disease [transmitter]</p><p><i>n.</i> (genetics) a virus or other agent that is used to deliver DNA to a cell</p><p><b>vektorska algebra</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the part of algebra that deals with the theory of vectors and vector spaces</p><p><b>analiza vektorskog polja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the analysis of a vector field [decomposition]</p><p><b>vektor koji je proizvod dva druga vektora (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vector that is the product of two other vectors [cross product]</p><p><b>vektor</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vector that is the sum of two or more other vectors [resultant]</p><p><b>Neposredno prijenos zaraznog uzroka koji se javlja kada vektor ugrize ili dotakne osobu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> indirect transmission of an infectious agent that occurs when a vector bites or touches a person</p><p><b>(od sanskritske riječi za `znanje') bilo koji od najstarijih svetih spisa hinduizma napisan u ranom sanskritu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (from the Sanskrit word for `knowledge') any of the most ancient sacred writings of Hinduism written in early Sanskrit [Vedic literature]</p><p><b>izvorno iz Australije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> native to Australia [Rodolia cardinalis]</p><p><b>Vedski tekstovi iz 5. i 4. stoljeća prije Krista koji se bave fonetikom i ritualnim zapovijedima i lingvistikom i gramatikom i etimologijom i leksikografijom i prosodijom i astronomijom i astrologijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Vedic texts from the fifth and fourth centuries BC dealing with phonetics and ritual injunctions and linguistics and grammar and etymology and lexicography and prosody and astronomy and astrology</p><p><b>(od sanskrita za kraj Vede) jedan od šest ortodoksnih filozofskih sustava ili gledišta ukorijenjenih u Upanishadima za razliku od Mimamsa koji se oslanja na Vede i Brahmane (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (from the Sanskrit for `end of the Veda') one of six orthodox philosophical systems or viewpoints rooted in the Upanishads as opposed to Mimamsa which relies on the Vedas and Brahmanas</p><p><b>Od ili u vezi sa Veda ili drevnog sanskrita u kojem su napisani (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the Vedas or to the ancient Sanskrit in which they were written</p><p><b>(od sanskritske riječi za `znanje') bilo koji od najstarijih svetih spisa hinduizma napisan u ranom sanskritu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (from the Sanskrit word for `knowledge') any of the most ancient sacred writings of Hinduism written in early Sanskrit [Veda]</p><p><b>oblik hinduizma koji se prvenstveno okreće oko mitološke verzije i ritualne ideologije u Veda. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the form of Hinduism that revolves primarily around the mythic version and ritual ideologies in the Vedas</p><p><b>učenjak ili autoritet na Vede (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a scholar of or an authority on the Vedas</p><p><b>kolebati se, mijenjanje pravca, mijenjati pravac, obraćanje, obrnuti se, obrtanje, otpustiti konop, promijeniti pravac, skretanje, spuštati, mijenjanje prav, spuštati (uže)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> turn sharply [curve, cut, sheer, slew, slue, swerve, trend]</p><p><i>v.</i> shift to a clockwise direction</p><p><b>promjena smjera vjetra u smjeru kazaljke na satu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of turning aside suddenly [swerve, swerving]</p><p><b>crno-smeđi sjevernoamerički trush poznat po svojoj pjesmi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tawny brown North American thrush noted for its song [Hylocichla fuscescens, Wilson's thrush]</p><p><b>povrće</b></p><p><i>n.</i> edible seeds or roots or stems or leaves or bulbs or tubers or nonsweet fruits of any of numerous herbaceous plant [vegetable, veggie]</p><p><b>Vega</b></p><p><i>n.</i> prolific Spanish playwright (1562-1635) [Lope Felix de Vega Carpio, Lope de Vega]</p><p><i>n.</i> the brightest star in the constellation Lyra</p><p><b>vegetarijanac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a strict vegetarian</p><p><b>aktivno se opustite. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> engage in passive relaxation [vegetate]</p><p><b>biljni, povrće, povrtni, varivo, zelenje, biljno, povrćem, zeleniš, povrtne biljke</b></p><p><i>n.</i> edible seeds or roots or stems or leaves or bulbs or tubers or nonsweet fruits of any of numerous herbaceous plant [veg, veggie]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various herbaceous plants cultivated for an edible part such as the fruit or the root of the beet or the leaf of spinach or the seeds of bean plants or the flower buds of broccoli or cauliflower</p><p><b>povrtnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small garden where vegetables are grown [kitchen garden, vegetable patch]</p><p><b>drvo od mekog drveta s lakomim cvetovima obično crvenim ili ružičastim cvetovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a softwood tree with lax racemes of usually red or pink flowers [Sesbania grandiflora, scarlet wisteria tree]</p><p><b>sjemenka palme iz Južne Amerike koja je nalik orahu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nutlike seed of a South American palm [apple nut, ivory nut]</p><p><b>bilo koja od različitih biljaka bundeve uzgajanih zbog svojih izduženih plodova s glatkom tamnozelenom kožom i bijelom mesom, Veliki izduženi bundevi sa kremasto do duboko zeleno kožom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various squash plants grown for their elongated fruit with smooth dark green skin and whitish flesh [marrow, marrow squash]</p><p><i>n.</i> large elongated squash with creamy to deep green skins [marrow]</p><p><b>biljna tvar, biomasa</b></p><p><i>n.</i> matter produced by plants or growing in the manner of a plant</p><p><b>biljno ulje, ulje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of a group of liquid edible fats that are obtained from plants [oil]</p><p><b>Sredozemska dvostruko biljka s dugim stabljkom od ljubičastih cvjetova i mliječnim sokom i dugim jestivim korijenom, dug bijeli sljovnik (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Mediterranean biennial herb with long-stemmed heads of purple ray flowers and milky sap and long edible root [Tragopogon porrifolius, oyster plant, salsify]</p><p><i>n.</i> long white salsify [oyster plant]</p><p><b>povrtnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small garden where vegetables are grown [kitchen garden, vegetable garden]</p><p><b>višegodišnje prostrane biljke koje tvore podloge s plavim vuničnim lišćama, biljka iz Novog Zelanda koja stvara jastuke i čiji su listovi gusto prekriveni smeđom dlakom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial prostrate mat-forming herb with hoary woolly foliage [Raoulia australis, Raoulia lutescens, sheep plant]</p><p><i>n.</i> cushion-forming New Zealand herb having leaves densely covered with tawny hairs [Haastia pulvinaris, sheep plant]</p><p><b>biljna vlakna iz kapoka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a plant fiber from the kapok tree [kapok, silk cotton]</p><p><b>juha od zelenja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> soup made with a variety of vegetables [minestrone, petite marmite]</p><p><b>lupuha koji ima cilindrične plodove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the loofah climber that has cylindrical fruit [Luffa cylindrica, loofah]</p><p><b>masnoća od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće od masnoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a waxy fat obtained from certain plants (e.g. bayberry) and used as tallow</p><p><b>S druge strane, u slučaju da se upotrebljava u proizvodnji proizvoda iz poglavlja 3. točka (a) ovog članka, točka (a) ovog članka ne smije se primjenjivati na proizvode koji se upotrebljavaju u proizvodnji proizvoda iz poglavlja 3. točke (a) ovog članka. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a waxy substance obtained from plants (especially from the trunks of certain palms)</p><p><b>Sastavljen od biljaka ili biljaka, (reprodukcije) karakterizirane asexualnim procesima (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> composed of vegetation or plants [vegetational, vegetative]</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of reproduction) characterized by asexual processes [vegetative]</p><p><b>vegetarijanac, vegetarijanski, vegetarijanske, vegetarijanskog, biljojed, biljožder</b></p><p><i>n.</i> eater of fruits and grains and nuts</p><p><b>vegetarijanstvo, šečerna bolest</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a diet excluding all meat and fish</p><p><b>rasti, živjeti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> lead a passive existence without using one's body or mind</p><p><i>v.</i> establish vegetation on</p><p><i>v.</i> produce vegetation</p><p><i>v.</i> grow like a plant</p><p><i>v.</i> grow or spread abnormally</p><p><i>v.</i> propagate asexually</p><p><i>v.</i> engage in passive relaxation [vege out]</p><p><b>vegetacija, vegetacije, vegetacijom, flora</b></p><p><i>n.</i> all the plant life in a particular region or period [botany, flora]</p><p><i>n.</i> the process of growth in plants</p><p><i>n.</i> an abnormal growth or excrescence (especially a warty excrescence on the valves of the heart)</p><p><i>n.</i> inactivity that is passive and monotonous, comparable to the inactivity of plant life</p><p><b>Sastavljen od biljaka ili biljaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> composed of vegetation or plants [vegetal, vegetative]</p><p><b>biljni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> composed of vegetation or plants [vegetal, vegetational]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to an activity that is passive and monotonous [vegetive]</p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to involuntary bodily functions</p><p><i>adj.</i> (of reproduction) characterized by asexual processes [vegetal]</p><p><b>bilo koja stanica biljke ili životinje osim reproduktivnih stanica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of the cells of a plant or animal except the reproductive cells [somatic cell]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je aktivnost pasivna i monotonska ili je povezana s njom, (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to an activity that is passive and monotonous [vegetative]</p><p><b>povrće</b></p><p><i>n.</i> edible seeds or roots or stems or leaves or bulbs or tubers or nonsweet fruits of any of numerous herbaceous plant [veg, vegetable]</p><p><b>naglost, silina, silovitost, žestina, naglasak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> intensity or forcefulness of expression [emphasis]</p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being wild or turbulent [ferocity, fierceness, furiousness, fury, violence, wildness]</p><p><b>nagao, naprasit, plah, silan, žestok</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by extreme intensity of emotions or convictions [fierce, tearing, trigger-happy, violent]</p><p><i>adj.</i> characterized by great force or energy</p><p><b>nagao, naprasit, plah, silan, žestok (od &quot;vehement&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a vehement manner</p><p><b>automobil, kola, letjelica, pomoćno sredstvo, prenosilac, prijevozno sredstvo, prometno sredstvo, transportno sredstvo, vozila, vozilo, vozni</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a conveyance that transports people or objects</p><p><i>n.</i> a medium for the expression or achievement of something</p><p><i>n.</i> any substance that facilitates the use of a drug or pigment or other material that is mixed with it</p><p><i>n.</i> any inanimate object (as a towel or money or clothing or dishes or books or toys etc.) that can transmit infectious agents from one person to another [fomite]</p><p><b>Sastav vozila koja dolaze i odlaze u određenu lokalitetu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the aggregation of vehicles coming and going in a particular locality [vehicular traffic]</p><p><b>Neposredno prijenos zaraznog uzroka koji se javlja kada se vozilo (ili fomite) dotakne tijela osobe ili je progutao (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> indirect transmission of an infectious agent that occurs when a vehicle (or fomite) touches a person's body or is ingested</p><p><b>kolski, transportni, vozni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or intended for (motor) vehicles</p><p><b>Sastav vozila koja dolaze i odlaze u određenu lokalitetu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the aggregation of vehicles coming and going in a particular locality [vehicle traffic]</p><p><b>prekriti velom, veo, zastor, tajiti, zataškati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a garment that covers the head and face [head covering]</p><p><i>n.</i> a membranous covering attached to the immature fruiting body of certain mushrooms [velum]</p><p><i>n.</i> the inner membrane of embryos in higher vertebrates (especially when covering the head at birth) [caul, embryonic membrane]</p><p><i>n.</i> a vestment worn by a priest at High Mass in the Roman Catholic Church [humeral veil]</p><p><i>v.</i> to obscure, or conceal with or as if with a veil</p><p><i>v.</i> make undecipherable or imperceptible by obscuring or concealing [blot out, hide, obliterate, obscure]</p><p><b>prikrivene, zastrte</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or as if having a veil or concealing cover</p><p><i>adj.</i> muted or unclear</p><p><b>optužbu koja se razumije bez potrebe da se govori. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an accusation that is understood without needing to be spoken [unspoken accusation]</p><p><b>prekriti velom, veo, zastor (od &quot;veil&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a net of transparent fabric with a loose open weave [gauze, netting]</p><p><b>ćud, raspoloženje, rudna žica, stil, šara, vena, žica, žila, rebro</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blood vessel that carries blood from the capillaries toward the heart [vena, venous blood vessel]</p><p><i>n.</i> a distinctive style or manner</p><p><i>n.</i> any of the vascular bundles or ribs that form the branching framework of conducting and supporting tissues in a leaf or other plant organ [nervure]</p><p><i>n.</i> a layer of ore between layers of rock [mineral vein]</p><p><i>n.</i> one of the horny ribs that stiffen and support the wing of an insect [nervure]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a veinlike pattern</p><p><b>vena koja služi penisu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein serving the penis</p><p><b>koji se odnose na vene biljaka (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> relating to the veins of plants</p><p><b>ćud, raspoloženje, rudna žica, stil, šara, vena, žica, žila (od &quot;vein&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or showing markings that resemble veins [veinlike, venose]</p><p><b>ima ili pokazuje oznake koje podsećaju na vene (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or showing markings that resemble veins [veined, venose]</p><p><b>Jedro</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a constellation in the southern hemisphere between Carina and Pyxis</p><p><b>glasnik koji se stvara dok se leđa jezika dodiruju ili blizu mekog nepca., od ili u vezi s velumom, proizvodnja s leđima jezika koji se dodiruju ili blizu mekog nepca (kao `k' u `cat' i `g' u `gun' i `ng' u `sing') (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a consonant produced with the back of the tongue touching or near the soft palate [velar consonant]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the velum</p><p><i>adj.</i> produced with the back of the tongue touching or near the soft palate (as `k' in `cat' and `g' in `gun' and `ng' in `sing')</p><p><b>glasnik koji se stvara dok se leđa jezika dodiruju ili blizu mekog nepca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a consonant produced with the back of the tongue touching or near the soft palate [velar]</p><p><b>Španjolski slikar (1599-1660) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Spanish painter (1599-1660) [Diego Rodriguez de Silva y Velazquez]</p><p><b>derivat biljke periwinkle koji se koristi kao antineoplastični lijek (trgovinski naziv Velban) koji ometa ćelijsku podjelu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> periwinkle plant derivative used as an antineoplastic drug (trade name Velban) that disrupts cell division [vinblastine]</p><p><b>čičak-traka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nylon fabric used as a fastening</p><p><i>v.</i> fasten with Velcro</p><p><b>podignute otvorene travnjake u južnoj Africi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> elevated open grassland in southern Africa [veldt]</p><p><b>podignute otvorene travnjake u južnoj Africi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> elevated open grassland in southern Africa [veld]</p><p><b>Samo želja, bez napora da se postigne., Volja u najslabijem obliku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mere wish, unaccompanied by effort to obtain</p><p><i>n.</i> volition in its weakest form</p><p><b>zagolicati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> touch (a body part) lightly so as to excite the surface nerves and cause uneasiness, laughter, or spasmodic movements [tickle, titillate]</p><p><i>v.</i> irritate as if by a nip, pinch, or tear [pinch]</p><p><b>iznenadni mišićni grč (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sudden muscle spasm [twitch, twitching]</p><p><b>pergamena, pergament</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a heavy creamy-colored paper resembling parchment</p><p><i>n.</i> fine parchment prepared from the skin of a young animal e.g. a calf or lamb</p><p><b>tricikl</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several early bicycles with pedals on the front wheel</p><p><i>n.</i> a vehicle with three wheels that is moved by foot pedals [tricycle, trike]</p><p><b>mali aktivni mesojed koji se vjerojatno hranio protoceratopsima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small active carnivore that probably fed on protoceratops</p><p><b>brzina, frekvencija, iznos, ubrzanje, udarna brzina, vektor brzine, brzine, brzinu</b></p><p><i>n.</i> distance travelled per unit time [speed]</p><p><b>s visokom visinom od 300 mm ili većom od 300 mm, ali ne više od 300 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a banked oval track for bicycle or motorcycle racing</p><p><b>kadifa, samt, velur</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heavy fabric that resembles velvet [velours]</p><p><b>kadifa, samt, velur</b></p><p><i>n.</i> heavy fabric that resembles velvet [velour]</p><p><b>Bijeli umak napravljen od mesa umjesto mlijeka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> white sauce made with stock instead of milk</p><p><b>mekano nepce, membrana, tanka opna</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a membranous covering attached to the immature fruiting body of certain mushrooms [veil]</p><p><i>n.</i> a muscular flap that closes off the nasopharynx during swallowing or speaking [soft palate]</p><p><b>Trgovni znak: mekani prerađeni američki sir (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> trademark: soft processed American cheese</p><p><b>baršun, baršunast, kadifa, korist, prednost, samt</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a silky densely piled fabric with a plain back</p><p><i>adj.</i> smooth and soft to sight or hearing or touch or taste [velvet-textured, velvety]</p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling velvet in having a smooth soft surface [velvety]</p><p><b>samostalna osa iz obitelji Mutillidae (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a solitary wasp of the family Mutillidae</p><p><b>godišnje drvene vinove loze iz Azije s dugim grmovima ljubičastih cvijeća i gusto dlakavim čunjama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the annual woody vine of Asia having long clusters of purplish flowers and densely hairy pods [Bengal bean, Benghal bean, Florida bean, Mucuna aterrima, Mucuna deeringiana, Mucuna pruriens utilis, Stizolobium deeringiana, cowage]</p><p><b>obična trava s tankim stabljikama i uskim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common grass with slender stems and narrow leaves [Agrostis canina, Rhode Island bent, brown bent, dog bent, velvet bent grass]</p><p><b>obična trava s tankim stabljikama i uskim lištima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> common grass with slender stems and narrow leaves [Agrostis canina, Rhode Island bent, brown bent, dog bent, velvet bent]</p><p><b>mladog lišća koje se široko koristi kao listno povrće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> young leaves widely used as leaf vegetables [Amaranthus caudatus, love-lies-bleeding, tassel flower]</p><p><b>Visoka europska višegodišnja trava s baršunastom stabljkom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall European perennial grass having a velvety stem [Holcus lanatus, Yorkshire fog]</p><p><b>vrba s dugim fleksibilnim granama koja se koristi u košari (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> willow with long flexible twigs used in basketry [Salix viminalis, common osier, hemp willow]</p><p><b>bilo koja biljka iz roda Verbascum s velikim, obično vletnim listovima i krajnjim šiljcima žutih ili bijelih ili ljubičastih cvijeća, Javanska biljka koja se uzgaja zbog svojih lijepih baršunastih listova s ljubičastom dlakom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various plants of the genus Verbascum having large usually woolly leaves and terminal spikes of yellow or white or purplish flowers [flannel leaf, mullein]</p><p><i>n.</i> Javanese foliage plant grown for their handsome velvety leaves with violet-purple hairs [Gynura aurantiaca, purple velvet plant, royal velvet plant]</p><p><b>listovice ili istočna Sjeverna Amerika sa složenim lišćama koje postaju sjajno crvene na jesen i gusto panike zelenkasto žute cvijeće s crvenkastim kiselnim bojama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous shrubby tree or eastern North America with compound leaves that turn brilliant red in fall and dense panicles of greenish yellow flowers followed by crimson acidic berries [Rhus typhina, Virginian sumac, staghorn sumac, vinegar tree]</p><p><b>bilo koja od brojnih mesojednih životinja nalik crvima s baršunastom kožom u tropskim šumama koje imaju karakteristike članonožaka i crva anela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous velvety-skinned wormlike carnivorous animals common in tropical forests having characteristics of both arthropods and annelid worms [onychophoran, peripatus]</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (c), Visoka godišnja biljka ili potgreb tropske Azije s baršunastim lištima i žutim cvijećem i koja daje snažno vlakno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arborescent perennial shrub having palmately lobed furry leaves and showy red-purple flowers [Lavatera arborea, tree mallow, velvetleaf]</p><p><i>n.</i> tall annual herb or subshrub of tropical Asia having velvety leaves and yellow flowers and yielding a strong fiber [Abutilon theophrasti, China jute, Indian mallow, butter-print, velvetleaf, velvetweed]</p><p><b>glatka i mekana za vid ili sluh ili dodir ili okus (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> smooth and soft to sight or hearing or touch or taste [velvet, velvety]</p><p><b>od tkanine od pamuka s kratkom hrpom koja imitira baršun (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a usually cotton fabric with a short pile imitating velvet</p><p><b>U slučaju da je u skladu s člankom 1. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (a) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (b) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (c) ovog članka, u skladu s člankom 2. točkom (c), Visoka godišnja biljka ili potgreb tropske Azije s baršunastim lištima i žutim cvijećem i koja daje snažno vlakno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arborescent perennial shrub having palmately lobed furry leaves and showy red-purple flowers [Lavatera arborea, tree mallow, velvet-leaf]</p><p><i>n.</i> tall annual herb or subshrub of tropical Asia having velvety leaves and yellow flowers and yielding a strong fiber [Abutilon theophrasti, China jute, Indian mallow, butter-print, velvet-leaf, velvetweed]</p><p><b>Visoka godišnja biljka ili potgreb tropske Azije s baršunastim lištima i žutim cvijećem i koja daje snažno vlakno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tall annual herb or subshrub of tropical Asia having velvety leaves and yellow flowers and yielding a strong fiber [Abutilon theophrasti, China jute, Indian mallow, butter-print, velvet-leaf, velvetleaf]</p><p><b>baršunast</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> smooth and soft to sight or hearing or touch or taste [velvet, velvet-textured]</p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling velvet in having a smooth soft surface [velvet]</p><p><b>Ima kosu koja se osjeća kao baršun. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having hair that feels like velvet [velvety-haired]</p><p><b>Ima kosu koja se osjeća kao baršun. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having hair that feels like velvet [velvety-furred]</p><p><b>Plumenjak sličan baršunu (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> plumage resembling velvet</p><p><b>Imaju kožu poput baršuna. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having skin like velvet</p><p><b>vena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a blood vessel that carries blood from the capillaries toward the heart [vein, venous blood vessel]</p><p><b>jedna od dvije veze koje služe mozgu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two communicating veins serving the brain [anastomotic vein]</p><p><b>kratka vena koju formiraju supraorbitalna vena i supratrochlearna vena i koja se nastavlja kao facialna vena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a short vein formed by the supraorbital vein and the supratrochlear vein and continuing as the facial vein [angular vein]</p><p><b>vena koja prati arteriju slijepog crijeva i isprazni se u vene ileokolic (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that accompanies the appendicular artery and empties into the ileocolic vein [appendicular vein]</p><p><b>vena koje primaju krv iz interlobularnih vena bubrega i rektalnih venula (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that receive blood from interlobular veins of kidney and rectal venules [arcuate vein of the kidney]</p><p><b>jedna od dvije vene koja služi regiji uha (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of two veins serving the ear region [auricular vein]</p><p><b>nastavak bazilične vene i brahijalne vene koja postaje podklavijalna vena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a continuation of the basilic vein and brachial vein that becomes the subclavian vein [axillary vein]</p><p><b>jedan od sustava vena koji ispuštaju grudi i trbušne zidove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of a system of veins that drain the thoracic and abdominal walls [azygos vein, azygous vein]</p><p><b>Velika vena koja prolazi uz medijalnu površinu temporalnog režnja i isprazni se u veliku moždanu venu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large vein passing along the medial surface of the temporal lobe and emptying into the great cerebral vein [basal vein]</p><p><b>vena koja izlijeva stražnji dio ruke i podlaktice i isprazni u ostiljnu venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that drains the back of the hand and forearm and empties into the axillary vein [basilic vein]</p><p><b>jedna od nekoliko vena koje ispuštaju spužvatnu tvar kralježnica i isprazni u prednji unutarnji venski pleksus kralježnice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of a number of veins draining the spongy substance of the vertebrae and emptying into the anterior internal vertebral venous plexus [basivertebral vein]</p><p><b>dvije vene u obje ruke koje prate brahijalnu arteriju i prazne u oslinjsku venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> two veins in either arm that accompany the brachial artery and empty into the axillary vein [brachial vein]</p><p><b>vena formirana spajanjem unutarnje jugularske i podklavijalne vene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins formed by the union of the internal jugular and subclavian veins [brachiocephalic vein, innominate vein]</p><p><b>vena koja služe bronhijima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins serving the bronchi [bronchial vein]</p><p><b>vena glave penisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vein of the head of the penis</p><p><b>vena prednje žlice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vein of the vestibular bulb</p><p><b>vena kohlearnog kanala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vein of the cochlear canal</p><p><b>jedna od dvije velike vene koje vraćaju krv osiromašenu kisikom u desnu prednje srce (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two large veins that return oxygen-depleted blood to the right atrium of the heart</p><p><b>vena formirana spajanjem retinalnih vena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vein formed by the union of the retinal veins [central vein of retina]</p><p><b>Jedini odvodni žilac (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a single draining vein [central vein of suprarenal gland]</p><p><b>Velika vena u ruci koja se isprazni u ostiljnu venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a large vein of the arm that empties into the axillary vein [cephalic vein]</p><p><b>vena koja prolazi uz radijalnu obalu podlaktice i pridružuje se glavnoj veni blizu laktova (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that passes along the radial edge of the forearm and joins the cephalic vein near the elbow [accessory cephalic vein]</p><p><b>vene koje isušuju mozak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the veins draining the cerebellum [cerebellar vein]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko vena koje služe moždanoj hemisferi mozga (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several veins serving the cerebral hemispheres of the brain [cerebral vein]</p><p><b>prati prednju moždanu arteriju i isprazni u bazalnu venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> accompanies the anterior cerebral artery and empties into the basal vein [anterior cerebral vein]</p><p><b>moždana vena formirana od dvije unutarnje moždane vene i nastavlja u sinus rectus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cerebral vein formed by the two internal cerebral veins and continuing into the sinus rectus [great cerebral vein]</p><p><b>bilo koja od dvije moždane vene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two cerebral veins [middle cerebral vein]</p><p><b>dvije parne vene koje prolaze oko srednje linije i spajaju se kako bi formirale veliku moždanu venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> two paired veins passing caudally near the midline and uniting to form the great cerebral vein [internal cerebral vein]</p><p><b>moždana vena koja ispušta dorsalnu konveksnost moždane polutke i isprazni u kavernusni sinus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cerebral vein that drains the dorsal convexity of the cerebral hemisphere and empties into the cavernous sinus [superior cerebral vein]</p><p><b>vena koja prati arteriju istog imena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that accompanies an artery of the same name [cervical vein, deep cervical vein]</p><p><b>jedna od dvije vene koje služe hronoidnom sloju oka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two veins serving the choroid coat of the eye [choroid vein]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko zakrivljenih paralelnih vena koje prate arterije istog imena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several curved parallel veins accompanying arteries of the same name [circumflex vein]</p><p><b>prati arteriju istog imena. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> accompanies the artery of the same name [circumflex iliac vein]</p><p><b>ili dvije vene koje prate arterije istog imena koje služe kuk i bedro (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two veins that accompany arteries of the same name serving the hip and thigh [circumflex femoral vein]</p><p><b>vene koje služe klitoris (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that serve the clitoris [clitoral vein]</p><p><b>vena koja služi debelom crijevu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vein serving the large intestine [colic vein]</p><p><b>vena koja prati drugu strukturu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein accompanying another structure [accompanying vein]</p><p><b>jedna od nekoliko vena u podkožnom tkivu koje se isprazni u duboke vene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of a number of veins in the subcutaneous tissue that empty into deep veins [cutaneous vein]</p><p><b>vena koja izlijeva žučni mjehur (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vein that drains the gallbladder [cystic vein]</p><p><b>jedna od vena koje služe prstima ili nogama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the veins serving the fingers or toes [digital vein]</p><p><b>jedna od vena koja služi spužvastom dijelu lubanje kostiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the veins serving the spongy part of the cranial bones [diploic vein]</p><p><b>duboka dorsalna vena klitorisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deep dorsal vein of the clitoris</p><p><b>jedna od nekoliko veza u koži glave i glave koje ispuštaju krv iz sinusa u dure mater do vena izvan lubanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of several connecting veins in the scalp and head that drain blood from sinuses in the dura mater to veins outside the skull [emissary vein]</p><p><b>Isprazni u vanjsku ilijalnu venu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> empties into the external iliac vein [inferior epigastric vein]</p><p><b>Isprazni u veliku safennu venu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> empties into the great saphenous vein [superficial epigastric vein]</p><p><b>vene koje ispuštaju etmoidalne sinuse i prazne u gornju oftalmološku venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that drain the ethmoidal sinuses and empty into the superior ophthalmic vein [ethmoidal vein]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko vena koje isušuju lice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several veins draining the face [facial vein]</p><p><b>nastavak ugljevog vena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a continuation of the angular vein [anterior facial vein]</p><p><b>vena koja prati bedrenu arteriju u istom omotaču (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that accompanies the femoral artery in the same sheath [femoral vein]</p><p><b>jedna od nekoliko vena koje isušuju zidove želuca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of several veins draining the stomach walls [gastric vein]</p><p><b>nastaje od spajanja vena iz želučnog srca. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arises from a union of veins from the gastric cardia [left gastric vein]</p><p><b>primuje vene iz gornjih površina želuca i isprazni u portalnu venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> receives veins from the upper surfaces of the stomach and empties into the portal vein [pyloric vein, right gastric vein]</p><p><b>jedna od dvije vene koja služi velikom zakrivljenosti želuca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of two veins serving the great curvature of the stomach [gastroepiploic vein, gastroomental vein]</p><p><b>vene koje ispuštaju krv iz struktura oko koljena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that drain blood from structures around the knee [genicular vein]</p><p><b>vene koje izlijevaju glutealne mišiće s obje strane tijela (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins draining the gluteal muscles on either side of the body [gluteal vein]</p><p><b>vena formirana spajanjem 4. do 7. stražnje međukostalne vene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein formed by the union of the 4th to 7th posterior intercostal veins [accessory hemiazygos vein, accessory hemiazygous vein]</p><p><b>nastavak lijeve uzlazne ljesne vene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a continuation of the left ascending lumbar vein [hemizygos vein, hemizygous vein]</p><p><b>vena koja isuši jetru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that drains the liver [hepatic vein]</p><p><b>vena koja odlijeva kraj ileuma i slijepog crijeva i cecum i donji dio uzlaznog debelog crijeva (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that drains the end of the ileum and the appendix and the cecum and the lower part of the ascending colon [ileocolic vein]</p><p><b>jedna od tri vene koje isušuju karlice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of three veins draining the pelvic area [iliac vein]</p><p><b>ogranak unutarnje ilijačke vene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a branch of the internal iliac vein [iliolumbar vein]</p><p><b>Vene koje povezuju dorsalne i dlanovne vene ruke ili dorsalne i plantarne vene stopala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins connecting the dorsal and palmar veins of the hand or the dorsal and plantar veins of the foot [intercapitular vein]</p><p><b>nekoliko vena koje ispuštaju međukostalne prostore prsnog kaveza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> several veins draining the intercostal spaces of the rib cage [intercostal vein]</p><p><b>jedna od nekoliko vena koje prate kralježničke živce (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of several veins accompanying spinal nerves [intervertebral vein]</p><p><b>vene u vratu koje vraćaju krv iz glave (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins in the neck that return blood from the head [jugular, jugular vein]</p><p><b>vene koje izlijevaju usne vulve, vena koja izlijeva usne usta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins draining the lips of the vulva [labial vein]</p><p><i>n.</i> a vein draining the lips of the mouth [labial vein]</p><p><b>potputnica vene lica koja odvodjuje donju usnu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tributary of the facial vein that drains the lower lip [inferior labial vein]</p><p><b>pripojnica vene lica koja izlijeva gornju usnu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tributary of the facial vein that drains the upper lip [superior labial vein]</p><p><b>Ispušta suzne žlijezde. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> drains the lacrimal gland [lacrimal vein]</p><p><b>jedna od dvije vene koja odvodjuje grkljan. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of two veins draining the larynx [laryngeal vein]</p><p><b>vena koju čine nekoliko malih vena na površini slezine (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein formed by several small veins on the surface of the spleen [splenic vein]</p><p><b>vena koja prima krv iz jezika i usta i isprazni u unutarnju jugularu ili facu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that receives blood from the tongue and the floor of the mouth and empties into the internal jugular or the facial vein [lingual vein]</p><p><b>vene koje ispuštaju stražnji zid tijela i lumbalne kičmene venske pleksuse (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that drain the posterior body wall and the lumbar vertebral venous plexuses [lumbar vein]</p><p><b>zadnja nastavak pterygoidnog pleksusa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> posterior continuation of the pterygoid plexus [maxillary vein]</p><p><b>potokan portalne vene koji prolazi iz crijeva između dva sloja mezenterija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tributary of the portal vein passing from the intestine between the two layers of mesentery [mesenteric vein]</p><p><b>dorsalne i dlanovne vene ruke (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dorsal and palmar veins of the hand [metacarpal vein]</p><p><b>dorsalne i plantarne grane vena koje služe metatarzalnom području stopala (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> dorsal and plantar branches of veins serving the metatarsal region of the foot [metatarsal vein]</p><p><b>vene koje izlijevaju gornji abdominalni zid i donji interkostalni prostor i trbuh (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that drain the upper abdominal wall and the lower intercostal spaces and the abdomen [musculophrenic vein]</p><p><b>jedna od vena koje ispuštaju vanjski nos i prazne u uglovu ili facu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the veins that drain the external nose and empty into the angular or facial vein [external nasal vein]</p><p><b>vena smještena u prednjem medijalnom dijelu orbite (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein located in the anterior medial part of the orbit [nasofrontal vein]</p><p><b>prijemnik koronarnog sinususa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tributary of the coronary sinus [oblique vein of the left atrium]</p><p><b>vena koju formiraju pritokovi koji ispuštaju zglobove kuka i mišiće bedra (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein formed by the union of tributaries that drain the hip joints and thigh muscles [obturator vein]</p><p><b>vena koja izlijeva okcipitalni region (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that drains the occipital region [occipital vein]</p><p><b>jedna od dvije vene koje služe oku (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two veins that serve the eye [ophthalmic vein]</p><p><b>jedna od vena koje ispuštaju jajnike (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the veins that drain the ovaries [ovarian vein]</p><p><b>vena koja odvodjuje područje nepca i isprazni u facialnu venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that drains the region of the palate and empties into the facial vein [palatine vein]</p><p><b>male vene koje nastaju u koži oko pupka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small veins arising in skin around the navel [paraumbilical vein]</p><p><b>vene koje isušuju grudi i prazne u podklavijsku venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that drain the pectoral muscles and empty into the subclavian vein [pectoral vein]</p><p><b>vene koje prate arterije koje perforiraju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that accompany the perforating arteries [perforating vein]</p><p><b>nekoliko malih vena iz perikarda (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> several small veins from the pericardium [pericardial vein]</p><p><b>Prate peronealne arterije. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> accompany the peroneal arteries [fibular vein, peroneal vein]</p><p><b>vene iz faringalnog pleksusa koje se isprazniju u unutarnju jugularsku venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins from the pharyngeal plexus that empty into the internal jugular vein [pharyngeal vein]</p><p><b>jedna od dvije vene koje ispuštaju dijafragmu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two veins that drain the diaphragm [phrenic vein]</p><p><b>vena koja nastaje u koljenu i uzdiže se da postane femoralna vena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein arising in the knee and ascending to become the femoral vein [popliteal vein]</p><p><b>kratka vena koja nosi krv u jetru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a short vein that carries blood into the liver [hepatic portal vein, portal, portal vein]</p><p><b>nastaje blizu vrha srca i isprazni u koronarnom sinus (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> arises near the apex of the heart and empties into the coronary sinus [posterior vein of the left ventricle]</p><p><b>duboka vena penisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deep vein of the penis</p><p><b>jedna od dvije plućne vene (lijeva i desna) koja vraća krv iz donjih režnja pluća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two pulmonary veins (left and right) returning blood from the inferior lobes of the lungs [inferior pulmonary vein]</p><p><b>bilo koja od četiri vene koja nose arterijsku krv iz pluća u lijevu prednje srce (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of four veins that carry arterial blood from the lungs to the left atrium of the heart [pulmonary vein]</p><p><b>jedna od dvije plućne vene (lijeva i desna) koja vraća krv iz gornjih režnja pluća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two pulmonary veins (left and right) returning blood from the superior lobes of the lungs [superior pulmonary vein]</p><p><b>privoznik desne želučane vene. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tributary of the right gastric vein [prepyloric vein]</p><p><b>površinske vene koje se uzdižu na radijalnu stranu podlaktice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> superficial veins ascending the radial side of the forearm [radial vein]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko vena koje odlijevaju zidove analnog kanala i rektuma (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several veins draining the walls of the anal canal and rectum [hemorrhoidal vein, rectal vein]</p><p><b>vene koje prate bubrežne arterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that accompany renal arteries [renal vein]</p><p><b>stražnja grana vene lica (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> posterior branch of the facial vein [posterior facial vein, retromandibular vein]</p><p><b>Vena sakralne regije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vein of the sacral region [sacral vein]</p><p><b>jedna od dvije glavne površinske vene noge koje ispuštaju krv iz stopala. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of two chief superficial veins of the leg that drain blood from the foot [saphenous vein]</p><p><b>vena koja je pritok podklavijalne vene ili vanjske jugularne vene i prati silaznu škapularnu arteriju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> vein that is a tributary of the subclavian vein or external jugular vein and accompanies the descending scapular artery [dorsal scapular vein]</p><p><b>vene koje prolaze iz mošnja do pudendalnih vena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins passing from the scrotum to the pudendal veins [scrotal vein]</p><p><b>pripojnice donje mezenterične vene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> tributaries of the inferior mesenteric vein [sigmoid vein]</p><p><b>vene koje isušuju kičmenu moždinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that drain the spinal cord [spinal vein]</p><p><b>Ispušće sternocleidomastoidni mišić (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> drains the sternocleidomastoid muscle [sternocleidomastoid vein]</p><p><b>vena koja izlijeva bubnjevu i isprazni u retromandibularnu venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that drains the tympanic cavity and empties into the retromandibular vein [stylomastoid vein]</p><p><b>nastavak osne vene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a continuation of the axillary vein [subclavian vein]</p><p><b>priliv jezične vene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a tributary of the lingual vein [sublingual vein]</p><p><b>Ispušće prednju stranu vlasišta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> drains the front of the scalp [supraorbital vein]</p><p><b>Ispušće prednju stranu vlasišta. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> drains the front of the scalp [supratrochlear vein]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko vena koje isušuju temporalnu regiju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several veins draining the temporal region [temporal vein]</p><p><b>vena iz testisa (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein from the testicles [testicular vein]</p><p><b>vene koje isušuju grudi. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins that drain the thoracic walls [thoracic vein]</p><p><b>vena koja nastaje iz područja površinske epigastrične vene i otvara se u osno ili prsnu venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein arising from the region of the superficial epigastric vein and opening into the axillary vein or thoracic vein [thoracoepigastric vein]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko malih vena koje ispuštaju krv iz područja štitnjače. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several small veins draining blood from the thyroid area [thyroid vein]</p><p><b>Vene donje noge (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> veins of the lower leg [tibial vein]</p><p><b>nekoliko malih vena iz dušnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> several small veins from the trachea [tracheal vein]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko vena podlaktice (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several veins of the forearm [ulnar vein]</p><p><b>vena u pupčanoj vrpci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein in the umbilical cord [umbilical vein]</p><p><b>vena koja prolazi kroz rupu vratnih kralježnica i formira pleksus oko kralježnice arterije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that goes through the foramina of the cervical vertebrae and forms a plexus around the vertebral artery [vertebral vein]</p><p><b>vena koja prati kralježnicu, ali prolazi kroz otvor poprečne faze 7. vratnog kralježnice i isprazni se u brahiocefalnu venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that accompanies the vertebral vein but passes through the foramen of the transverse process of the 7th cervical vertebra and empties into the brachiocephalic vein [accessory vertebral vein]</p><p><b>vena koja prati uzlazuće vratne arterije i otvara se u kralježničku venu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vein that 