l&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a corrupt and deceitful manner [deceitfully, dishonestly]</p><p><b>(botanica) raspored vena u lišću, (zoologija) sustav venskih krvnih žila kod životinje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (botany) the arrangement of veins in a leaf</p><p><i>n.</i> (zoology) the system of venous blood vessels in an animal [venous blood system]</p><p><b>prodavati, piljariti, preprodavati, torbariti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> sell or offer for sale from place to place [hawk, huckster, monger, peddle, pitch]</p><p><b>kupac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who buys [buyer, emptor, purchaser]</p><p><b>Prvi mjesec revolucionarnog kalendara (rujan i listopad) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> first month of the Revolutionary calendar (September and October)</p><p><b>kramar, prodavač, trgovac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who promotes or exchanges goods or services for money [marketer, seller, trafficker, vendor]</p><p><b>sukob u kojem se članovi suprotstavljenih strana međusobno ubijaju. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feud in which members of the opposing parties murder each other [blood feud]</p><p><b>prodaja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of selling goods for a living [hawking, peddling, vendition]</p><p><b>automat, automat za kupovinu, automat za prodaju</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a slot machine for selling goods</p><p><b>rad na prodaju robe za život (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of selling goods for a living [hawking, peddling, vending]</p><p><b>isporučitelj (opreme), prodavač, prodavačem, prodavatelj (opreme), trgovac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who promotes or exchanges goods or services for money [marketer, seller, trafficker, vender]</p><p><b>aukcija, dražba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the public sale of something to the highest bidder [auction, auction sale]</p><p><b>furnir, tanka glazura, tanki furnir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coating consisting of a thin layer of superior wood glued to a base of inferior wood [veneering]</p><p><i>n.</i> an ornamental coating to a building [facing]</p><p><i>v.</i> cover with veneer</p><p><b>premaz, furnir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> coating consisting of a thin layer of superior wood glued to a base of inferior wood [veneer]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of applying veneer</p><p><b>kvaliteta koja zaslužuje poštovanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of deserving veneration [venerableness]</p><p><b>dostojan, poštovan, prečasni, uvažen, velečasni</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> impressive by reason of age</p><p><i>adj.</i> profoundly honored [august, revered]</p><p><b>dostojan, poštovan, prečasni, uvažen, velečasni (od &quot;venerable&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the quality of deserving veneration [venerability]</p><p><b>častiti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> regard with feelings of respect and reverence [fear, revere, reverence]</p><p><b>častiti (od &quot;venerate&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> feeling or manifesting veneration [respectful, reverential]</p><p><b>obožavanje, postovanje, poštovanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a feeling of profound respect for someone or something [awe, fear, reverence]</p><p><i>n.</i> religious zeal [cultism, devotion]</p><p><b>netko tko gleda s dubokim poštovanjem ili poštovanjem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who regards with deep respect or reverence</p><p><b>na spolovilu, spolni, venerički, venerični, genitalan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to the external sex organs [genital]</p><p><b>infekcija prenosi se spolnim odnosom ili genitalnim kontaktom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a communicable infection transmitted by sexual intercourse or genital contact [Cupid's disease, Cupid's itch, STD, VD, Venus's curse, dose, sexually transmitted disease, social disease, venereal infection]</p><p><b>infekcija prenosi se spolnim odnosom ili genitalnim kontaktom (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a communicable infection transmitted by sexual intercourse or genital contact [Cupid's disease, Cupid's itch, STD, VD, Venus's curse, dose, sexually transmitted disease, social disease, venereal disease]</p><p><b>mala benigna bradavica na ili oko genitalija i anus