a, ventilacija, ventilacijski sistem, ventilacijski sustav</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanical system in a building that provides fresh air [ventilating system, ventilation]</p><p><b>ventilator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a device (such as a fan) that introduces fresh air or expels foul air</p><p><i>n.</i> a device that facilitates breathing in cases of respiratory failure [breathing apparatus, breathing device, breathing machine]</p><p><b>s ventilacijom ili s plućnom ventilacijom (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> provided with ventilation or involving pulmonary ventilation</p><p><b>propuhavanje, propuhivanje, provjetravanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of venting [discharge]</p><p><b>Američki genetista koji je objavio potpune bazične sekvence svih gena slobodnog organizma, bakterije gripe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States geneticist who published the complete base sequences for all the genes of a free-living organism, the influenza bacterium [Craig Ventner, J. Craig Ventner]</p><p><b>bronhodilatator (trgovinski nazivi Ventolin ili Proventil) koji se koristi za astmu i emfizem i druga plućna oboljenja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a bronchodilator (trade names Ventolin or Proventil) used for asthma and emphysema and other lung conditions [Proventil, albuterol]</p><p><b>Šesti mjesec revolucionarnog kalendara (februar i ožujak) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sixth month of the Revolutionary calendar (February and March)</p><p><b>prema ili na ili blizu trbuha (prednje strane primata ili donje površine donje životinje), Najbliže ili okrenuto prema osi organa ili organizma (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> toward or on or near the belly (front of a primate or lower surface of a lower animal)</p><p><i>adj.</i> nearest to or facing toward the axis of an organ or organism [adaxial]</p><p><b>ili par peraja koji su priključeni na zdjelični pojas kod riba koji pomažu u kontroli smjera kretanja (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of a pair of fins attached to the pelvic girdle in fishes that help control the direction of movement [pelvic fin]</p><p><b>jedan od dva korijena kralježnice živca koji prolazi od trbuha od kičmene moždine i koji se sastoji od motoričkih vlakana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the two roots of a spinal nerve that passes ventrally from the spinal cord and that consists of motor fibers [anterior horn, anterior root, ventral root]</p><p><b>s jajnikom na zidu duž ventralne šavure jednostavnog jajnika (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> with ovules borne on the wall along the ventral suture of a simple ovary [marginal placentation]</p><p><b>jedan od dva korijena kralježnice živca koji prolazi od trbuha od kičmene moždine i koji se sastoji od motoričkih vlakana (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of the two roots of a spinal nerve that passes ventrally from the spinal cord and that consists of motor fibers [anterior horn, anterior root, ventral horn]</p><p><b>u ventralu ili u smjeru (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a ventral location or direction</p><p><b>klijetka, šupljina, ventrikula</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one of four connected cavities in the brain</p><p><i>n.</i> a chamber of the heart that receives blood from an atrium and pumps it to the arteries [heart ventricle]</p><p><b>oteklina na jednoj strani (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a swelling on one side [ventricous]</p><p><b>oteklina na jednoj strani (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having a swelling on one side [ventricose]</p><p><b>od ili u vezi s komorom (sjesta ili mozak) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to a ventricle (of the heart or brain)</p><p><b>lokalizirano širenje ili izbočenje na zidu lijeve srčane klijetke (koja se javlja nakon infarkta miokarda) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a localized dilation or protrusion on the wall of the left ventricle of the heart (occurring after a myocardial infarction)</p><p><b>Fibrilacija srčanog mišića koja dovodi do smetnji u ritmičkim kontrakcijama klijetaka i može dovesti do srčanog zastoja. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> fibrillation of heart muscles resulting in interference with rhythmic contractions of the ventricles and possibly leading to cardiac arrest</p><p><b>bilo koja od gornjih dva glasna žica koja nisu uključena u vokalizaciju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> either of the upper two vocal cords that are not involved in vocalization [false vocal cord, false vocal fold, superior vocal cord, vestibular fold]</p><p><b>Običan urođeni srčani defekt (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a common congenital heart defect</p><p><b>želudac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thick-walled muscular pouch below the crop in many birds and reptiles for grinding food [gastric mill, gizzard]</p><p><b>umjetnost projiciranja glasa tako da izgleda kao da dolazi iz drugog izvora (kao iz lutke trbušnjaka) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the art of projecting your voice so that it seems to come from another source (as from a ventriloquist's dummy) [ventriloquy]</p><p><b>trbuhozborac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a performer who projects the voice into a wooden dummy</p><p><b>drvena lutka u koju trbušnjak projicira glas (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a wooden dummy into which a ventriloquist projects the voice</p><p><b>umjetnost projiciranja glasa tako da izgleda kao da dolazi iz drugog izvora (kao iz lutke trbušnjaka) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the art of projecting your voice so that it seems to come from another source (as from a ventriloquist's dummy) [ventriloquism]</p><p><b>izložiti se opasnosti, poduhvat, pothvat, riskirati, rizik, smjelost, staviti na kocku, usuditi se, upustiti se, upuštati se, nagađati, naslutiti, naslućivati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any venturesome undertaking especially one with an uncertain outcome</p><p><i>n.</i> an investment that is very risky but could yield great profits [speculation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a commercial undertaking that risks a loss but promises a profit</p><p><i>v.</i> proceed somewhere despite the risk of possible dangers [embark]</p><p><i>v.</i> put forward, of a guess, in spite of possible refutation [guess, hazard, pretend]</p><p><i>v.</i> put at risk [adventure, hazard, jeopardize, stake]</p><p><b>poduzetnički kapital, rizični kapital</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wealth available for investment in new or speculative enterprises [risk capital]</p><p><b>kapitalizam koji ulaže u inovativna poduzeća (posebno visokotehnološka) gdje su potencijalni profiti veliki (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> capitalism that invests in innovative enterprises (especially high technology) where the potential profits are large</p><p><b>speculator koji daje novac za inovativne projekte (posebno u visokotehnološkom sektoru) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a speculator who makes money available for innovative projects (especially in high technology)</p><p><b>izložiti se opasnosti, poduhvat, pothvat, riskirati, rizik, smjelost, staviti na kocku, usuditi se (od &quot;venture&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a merchant who undertakes a trading venture (especially a venture that sends goods overseas) [merchant-venturer]</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who enjoys taking risks [adventurer]</p><p><b>drzak</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> disposed to venture or take risks [audacious, daring, venturous]</p><p><b>drzak (od &quot;venturesome&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being adventurous [adventurousness]</p><p><b>Robert Venturi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States architect (born in 1925) [Robert Charles Venturi, Robert Venturi]</p><p><i>n.</i> a tube with a constriction</p><p><b>kratka cijev koja se ubacuje u cijevovod i koristi se za mjerenje količine tekućine koja teče u cijevodu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a short tube inserted into a pipeline and used to measure the quantity of a liquid that is flowing in the pipeline</p><p><b>voljni riskirati ili preuzeti rizik (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> disposed to venture or take risks [audacious, daring, venturesome]</p><p><b>mjesto natjecanja, mjesto sastanka, mjesto zbivanja</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the scene of any event or action (especially the place of a meeting) [locale, locus]</p><p><i>n.</i> in law: the jurisdiction where a trial will be held</p><p><b>Minutna v