erminally ill policy holders [viatication]</p><p><b>Prodaja osiguranja od strane nositelja osiguranja koji je u smrtnoj bolesti (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sale of an insurance policy by a terminally ill policy holder [viatical settlement]</p><p><b>osobito emocionalno ozračje koje se instinktivno doživljava. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a distinctive emotional aura experienced instinctively [vibration]</p><p><b>vibrafon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a percussion instrument similar to a xylophone but having metal bars and rotating disks in the resonators that produce a vibrato sound [vibraharp, vibraphone]</p><p><b>glazbenik koji svira vibrafon (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a musician who plays the vibraphone [vibraphonist]</p><p><b>Viborg</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a town of Denmark in north central Jutland</p><p><b>vibrafon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a percussion instrument similar to a xylophone but having metal bars and rotating disks in the resonators that produce a vibrato sound [vibes, vibraphone]</p><p><b>antibiotika dobivenog od tetraciklina koji je učinkovit protiv mnogih infekcija (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an antibiotic derived from tetracycline that is effective against many infections [doxycycline]</p><p><b>s karakterom glasnog dubokog zvuka (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> having the character of a loud deep sound [plangency, resonance, reverberance, ringing, sonority, sonorousness]</p><p><b>drhtav, koji odzvanja, koji vibrira, rezonantan, sonoran, titrav, treperav, vitalno, živahan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> vigorous and animated [vivacious]</p><p><i>adj.</i> of sounds that are strong and resonating</p><p><i>adj.</i> of colors that are bright and striking</p><p><b>vibrafon</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a percussion instrument similar to a xylophone but having metal bars and rotating disks in the resonators that produce a vibrato sound [vibes, vibraharp]</p><p><b>glazbenik koji svira vibrafon (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a musician who plays the vibraphone [vibist]</p><p><b>podrhtavati, titrati, treperiti, valjati se, vibrirati, klimati, oscilirati, ječati, odjekivati, odzvanjati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> shake, quiver, or throb</p><p><i>v.</i> move or swing from side to side regularly [oscillate]</p><p><i>v.</i> be undecided about something [hover, oscillate, vacillate]</p><p><i>v.</i> sound with resonance [resonate]</p><p><i>v.</i> feel sudden intense sensation or emotion [thrill, tickle]</p><p><b>trstika</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a vibrator consisting of a thin strip of stiff material that vibrates to produce a tone when air streams over it [reed]</p><p><b>kolebanje, njihanje, titraj, titranje, treperenje, vibracija, vibracije, vibracijski, vibriranje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of vibrating [quiver, quivering]</p><p><i>n.</i> a shaky motion [palpitation, quiver, quivering, shakiness, shaking, trembling]</p><p><i>n.</i> (physics) a regular periodic variation in value about a mean [oscillation]</p><p><i>n.</i> a distinctive emotional aura experienced instinctively [vibe]</p><p><b>treptajni, vibracijski</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> of or relating to or characterized by vibration</p><p><b>vibrator, vibrato</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (music) a pulsating effect in an instrumental or vocal tone produced by slight and rapid variations in pitch</p><p><b>prekidač, pretvarač vibracije, rezonator, vibrator</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mechanical device that vibrates</p><p><i>n.</i> mechanical device that produces vibratory motion</p><p><b>koji oscilira, koji vibrira</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> moving very rapidly to and fro or up and down</p><p><b>titraš</b></p><p><i>n.</i> curved rodlike motile bacterium [vibrion]</p><p><b>bakterije u obliku zareza koje uzrokuju azijsku koleru (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> comma-shaped bacteria that cause Asiatic cholera [comma bacillus]</p><p><b>bakterije koje uzrokuju pobačaj kod ovaca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bacteria that cause abortion in sheep</p><p><b>zakrivljena, pokretna bakterija nalik šipci (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> curved rodlike motile bacterium [vibrio]</p><p><b>uzrokovane bakteri