ujorška berza (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a street in lower Manhattan where the New York Stock Exchange is located [Wall Street]</p><p><b>Ulica u Donjem Manhattanu gdje se nalazi njujorška berza, korišteno za aludiranje na vrijednosnu industriju Sjedinjenih Država (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a street in lower Manhattan where the New York Stock Exchange is located [Wall St.]</p><p><i>n.</i> used to allude to the securities industry of the United States [the Street]</p><p><b>platno šator s četiri vertikalna zida (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a canvas tent with four vertical walls</p><p><b>komad namještaja koji ima nekoliko jedinica i stoji uz jedan zid sobe. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a piece of furniture having several units that stands against one wall of a room</p><p><b>zazidati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> enclose with a wall [wall in]</p><p><b>radnik koji papirne zidove (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a worker who papers walls [wallpaperer]</p><p><b>Walla Walla</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a town in southeastern Washington near the Oregon border</p><p><b>vrsta manjeg klokana</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various small or medium-sized kangaroos [brush kangaroo]</p><p><b>Škotski pobunjenik koji je vodio otpor Edwardu I., Engleski pisac poznat po svojim kriminalističkim romanima (1875-1932), Engleski prirodnjak koji je formulirao koncept evolucije sličan onom koji je imao Charles Darwin (1823-1913) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> Scottish insurgent who led the resistance to Edward I [Sir William Wallace]</p><p><i>n.</i> English writer noted for his crime novels (1875-1932) [Edgar Wallace, Richard Horatio Edgar Wallace]</p><p><i>n.</i> English naturalist who formulated a concept of evolution that resembled Charles Darwin's (1823-1913) [Alfred Russel Wallace]</p><p><b>Američki kemičar koji je razvio nailon (1896-1937) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States chemist who developed nylon (1896-1937) [Carothers, Wallace Hume Carothers]</p><p><b>Američki kemičar koji je razvio nailon (1896-1937) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> 