]</p><p><b>garantirati, jamčiti, jamstvo, opravdati, osigurati, ovlast, ovlastiti, ovlašten, potjernica, punomoć, punomoćan, zajamčiti (od &quot;warrant&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who provides a warrant or guarantee to another [guarantor, surety, warrantor]</p><p><b>osoba koja daje nalog ili jamstvo drugoj osobi (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> one who provides a warrant or guarantee to another [guarantor, surety, warranter]</p><p><b>garancija, jamstvo, opravdanje, ovlaštenje, punomoć, jamstveni list</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a written assurance that some product or service will be provided or will meet certain specifications [guarantee, warrant, warrantee]</p><p><b>kunićnjak, povezani tuneli, kolonija zečeva</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States writer and poet (1905-1989) [Robert Penn Warren]</p><p><i>n.</i> United States jurist who served as chief justice of the United States Supreme Court (1891-1974) [Earl Warren]</p><p><i>n.</i> a series of connected underground tunnels occupied by rabbits [rabbit warren]</p><p><i>n.</i> an overcrowded residential area [rabbit warren]</p><p><i>n.</i> a colony of rabbits</p><p><b>Američki pravnik imenovan glavnim sudijom Vrhovnog suda Sjedinjenih Država od strane Richarda Nixona (1907-1995) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States jurist appointed chief justice of the United States Supreme Court by Richard Nixon (1907-1995) [Burger, Warren E. Burger, Warren Earl Burger]</p><p><b>Američki pravnik imenovan glavnim sudijom Vrhovnog suda Sjedinjenih Država od strane Richarda Nixona (1907-1995) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States jurist appointed chief justice of the United States Supreme Court by Richard Nixon (1907-1995) [Burger, Warren Burger, Warren Earl Burger]</p><p><b>Američki pravnik imenovan glavnim sudijom Vrhovnog suda Sjedinjenih Država od strane Richarda Nixona (1907-1995) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> United States jurist appointed chief justice of the United States Supreme Court by Richard Nixon (1907-1995) [Burger, Warren Burger, Warre