a (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> lasting through a week [seven-day]</p><p><b>nedjeljni, sedmično, tjedni, tjedno</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a periodical that is published every week (or 52 issues per year)</p><p><i>adj.</i> of or occurring every seven days [hebdomadal, hebdomadary]</p><p><i>adv.</i> without missing a week [each week, every week, hebdomadally]</p><p><b>bilo koju noć u tjednu osim subote ili nedjelje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any night of the week except Saturday or Sunday</p><p><b>malen, mali (od &quot;wee&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the property of being very small in size [diminutiveness, minuteness, petiteness, tininess]</p><p><b>Slijedeći proizvodi: (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a smooth-textured sausage of minced beef or pork usually smoked [dog, frank, frankfurter, hot dog, hotdog, wiener, wienerwurst]</p><p><b>Kuhanje gdje su pečeni frankfurteri glavno jelo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a cookout where roasted frankfurters are the main course [wiener roast]</p><p><b>(koristi se neformalno) vrlo mali (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used informally) very small [bittie, bitty, itsy-bitsy, itty-bitty, teensy, teensy-weensy, teentsy, teeny, teeny-weeny, wee, weeny]</p><p><b>(koristi se neformalno) vrlo mali (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> (used informally) very small [bittie, bitty, itsy-bitsy, itty-bitty, teensy, teensy-weensy, teentsy, teeny, teeny-weeny, wee, weensy]</p><p><b>jadikovati, lijevati kap po kap, plakati, grcati, jecati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> shed tears because of sadness, rage, or pain [cry]</p><p><b>jadikovati, lijevati kap po kap, plakati (od &quot;weep&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who weeps [crier]</p><p><i>n.</i> a hired mourner</p><p><b>tužbu izražava plačem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sadness expressed by weeping [tearfulness]</p><p><b>kišovit, plač, plačan, plakanje, oplakivanje, prolijevanje suza</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the process of shedding tears (usually accompanied by sobs or other inarticulate sounds) [crying, tears]</p><p><i>adj.</i> showing sorrow [dolorous, dolourous, lachrymose, tearful]</p><p><i>adj.</i> having branches or flower heads that bend downward [cernuous, drooping, nodding, pendulous]</p><p><b>vrsta europske bukove s višenim udovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> variety of European beech with pendulous limbs [Fagus pendula, Fagus sylvatica pendula]</p><p><b>višegodišnje južnoafričke trave s gusto skupljenim krhkim stabljikama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> perennial South African grass having densely clumped flimsy stems [African love grass, Eragrostis curvula]</p><p><b>Srednja velika smreka iz Kalifornije i Oregona s višenastvenim granama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> medium-sized spruce of California and Oregon having pendulous branches [Brewer's spruce, Picea breweriana]</p><p><b>malo grmlje na Novom Zelandu koje ima plačuće grane i raseme od bijelih do ljubičastih cvijeća, nakon čega slijede vune bez dva sjemena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small shrubby tree of New Zealand having weeping branches and racemes of white to violet flowers followed by woolly indehiscent two-seeded pods</p><p><b>žalosna vrba</b></p><p><i>n.</i> willow with long drooping branches and slender leaves native to China [Babylonian weeping willow, Salix babylonica]</p><p><b>plačan, plačljiv</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> liable to weep easily</p><p><b>žitar, žižak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several families of mostly small beetles that feed on plants and plant products</p><p><b>urin</b></p><p><i>n.</i> liquid excretory product [pee, piddle, piss, urine, water]</p><p><b>potka, poutka, sloj oblaka, trak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the yarn woven across the warp yarn in weaving [filling, pick, woof]</p><p><b>Alfred Wegener</b></p><p><i>n.</i> German geophysicist who proposed the theory of continental drift (1880-1930) [Alfred Lothar Wegener]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko kineskih carskih dinastija koja su vladala od 220 do 265 i od 386 do 556 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several imperial dynasties of China ruling from 220 to 265 and from 386 to 556 [Wei dynasty]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko kineskih carskih dinastija koja su vladala od 220 do 265 i od 386 do 556 (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several imperial dynasties of China ruling from 220 to 265 and from 386 to 556 [Wei]</p><p><b>Brojni grmovi koji se često uzgajaju zbog svojih bijeli, ružičastih ili crvenih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous shrub widely cultivated for its white or pink or red flowers [Weigela florida]</p><p><b>Brojni grmovi koji se često uzgajaju zbog svojih bijeli, ružičastih ili crvenih cvijeća (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> deciduous shrub widely cultivated for its white or pink or red flowers [weigela]</p><p><b>biti težak, izmjeriti, mjeriti, odjedriti, prosuđivati, težiti, usporediti, vagati, izvagati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> have a certain weight</p><p><i>v.</i> show consideration for [consider, count]</p><p><i>v.</i> determine the weight of [librate]</p><p><i>v.</i> have weight [count, matter]</p><p><i>v.</i> to be oppressive or burdensome [press]</p><p><b>podignuti sidro u pripremi za plovidbu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> heave up an anchor in preparation for sailing [weigh the anchor]</p><p><b>biti potlači ili obeshrabrujuće za, Primenite silu sa teškom težinom. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be oppressive or disheartening to [weigh on]</p><p><i>v.</i> exert a force with a heavy weight [bear down, bear down on, drag down, press down on]</p><p><b>biti potlači ili obeshrabrujuće za (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> be oppressive or disheartening to [weigh down]</p><p><b>podignuti sidro u pripremi za plovidbu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> heave up an anchor in preparation for sailing [weigh anchor]</p><p><b>Svaka vrsta vozila može se koristiti za uzgajanje. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> platform scale flush with a roadway for weighing vehicles and cattle etc</p><p><b>pun, teško opterećeni radom ili briga (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> full of [heavy]</p><p><i>adj.</i> heavily burdened with work or cares [bowed down, loaded down, overburdened]</p><p><b>vagalac, vagar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an official who weighs and records the weight</p><p><b>mozganje, rasprava</b></p><p><i>n.</i> careful consideration [advisement, deliberation]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,01 mm ili većim od 0,01 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a measuring instrument for weighing [scale]</p><p><b>breme, opterećenje, opteretiti, povećati težinu, staviti uteg, teret, težina, težinska vrijednost, težiti, tjelesna težina, uteg, vaganje, vagati, važnost, vrijednost, značaj, mase, teg, težine, mjerna jedinica mase, naprtiti, natovariti, natovarivati, opterećivati, prtiti, teretiti, tovariti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the vertical force exerted by a mass as a result of gravity</p><p><i>n.</i> sports equipment used in calisthenic exercises and weightlifting [exercising weight, free weight]</p><p><i>n.</i> the relative importance granted to something [weightiness]</p><p><i>n.</i> an artifact that is heavy</p><p><i>n.</i> an oppressive feeling of heavy force</p><p><i>n.</i> a system of units used to express the weight of something [system of weights]</p><p><i>n.</i> a unit used to measure weight [weight unit]</p><p><i>n.</i> (statistics) a coefficient assigned to elements of a frequency distribution in order to represent their relative importance [weighting]</p><p><i>v.</i> weight down with a load [burden, burthen, weight down]</p><p><i>v.</i> present with a bias [angle, slant]</p><p><b>naprtiti, natovariti, natovarivati, opteretiti, opterećivati, prtiti, teretiti, tovariti</b></p><p><i>v.</i> weight down with a load [burden, burthen, weight]</p><p><b>osoba koja dobiva na težini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who gains weight [gainer]</p><p><b>kulturizam koji povećava mišićnu masu i tjelesnu težinu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> bodybuilding that increases muscle mass and body weight</p><p><b>decimalna jedinica mase, metrička jedinica za masu, mjerna jedinica za masu, mjerna jedinica mase, težina</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a decimal unit of weight based on the gram [metric weight unit]</p><p>