er]</p><p><i>n.</i> someone who makes and repairs wooden wheels [wheelwright]</p><p><i>n.</i> the man at the outermost end of the rank in wheeling</p><p><i>n.</i> a person who rides a bicycle [bicycler, bicyclist, biker, cyclist]</p><p><i>n.</i> a draft horse harnessed behind others and nearest the wheels of a vehicle [wheel horse]</p><p><b>lukav ili beskrupulozan čovjek koji zna kako zaobići poteškoće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a shrewd or unscrupulous person who knows how to circumvent difficulties [hustler, operator]</p><p><b>planinski vrh u sjeveroistočnom New Mexiconu u Rocky Mountains (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mountain peak in northeastern New Mexico in the Rocky Mountains</p><p><b>U slučaju plovila s ograničenim prostorom za plovidbu, to znači da se brod može ploviti iz zatvorenog prostora. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an enclosed compartment from which a vessel can be navigated [pilothouse]</p><p><b>obrtanje, prevoženje, vožnja kolima</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a city in the northern panhandle of West Virginia on the Ohio river</p><p><i>n.</i> propelling something on wheels [rolling]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 85% ili više, ali ne više od 50% masenog udjela (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having no wheels or having no wheeled vehicles</p><p><b>S druge konstrukcije od željeza ili električne energije (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> mechanical device including an arrangement of wheel in a machine (especially a train of gears)</p><p><b>kolar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who makes and repairs wooden wheels [wheeler]</p><p><b>dahtanje, dahtati, disati teško, teško disanje, soptati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> breathing with a husky or whistling sound</p><p><i>n.</i> (Briticism) a clever or amusing scheme or trick</p><p><i>v.</i> breathe with difficulty</p><p><b>s škrićem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> with a wheeze [wheezingly]</p><p><b>prisutnost abnormalnog visokokog zvuka koji se čuje stetoskopom kada su disajni putevi blokirani (kao kod astme ili hroničnog bronhitisa) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> 