ke</p><p><i>v.</i> perceive by inhaling through the nose [sniff]</p><p><i>v.</i> drive or carry as if by a puff of air</p><p><i>v.</i> strike out by swinging and missing the pitch charged as the third</p><p><i>v.</i> smoke and exhale strongly [puff]</p><p><i>v.</i> utter with a puff of air</p><p><b>dah, dašak, dimiti, laki čamac, strujanje, strujanje dima, strujati, šajka (od &quot;whiff&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a batter who strikes out by swinging at and missing the third strike</p><p><b>prečni stub koji je pričvršćen za tragove konja i za vozilo ili opremu koju konj vuče (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a crossbar that is attached to the traces of a draft horse and to the vehicle or implement that the horse is pulling [swingletree, whippletree]</p><p><b>član političke stranke koja je podsticala socijalne reforme u 18. i 19. stoljeću u Engleskoj., Podržavač Američke revolucije., član Whig stranke koja je postojala u Sjedinjenim Državama prije Američkog građanskog rata (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the political party that urged social reform in 18th and 19th century England</p><p><i>n.</i> a supporter of the American Revolution</p><p><i>n.</i> a member of the Whig Party that existed in the United States before the American Civil War</p><p><b>bivša politička stranka u Sjedinjenim Državama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a former political party in the United States</p><p><b>a, časak, dok, dokle, probaviti, u isto vrijeme, vrijeme, za vrijeme</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a period of indeterminate length (usually short) marked by some action or condition [patch, piece, spell]</p><p><b>trošiti ili proći, kao sa dosadnošću ili na ugodan način (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> spend or pass, as with boredom or in a pleasant manner [get through]</p><p><b>ćef, ćud, hir, impuls</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sudden desire [caprice, impulse]</p><p><i>n.</i> an odd or fanciful or capricious idea [notion, whimsey, whimsy]</p><p><b>cmizdrenje, cmizdriti, cviljenje, plakanje, plakati, cviliti, cviljeti, jecati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a complaint uttered in a plaintive whining way [whine]</p><p><i>v.</i> cry weakly or softly [mewl, pule, wail]</p><p><b>Čudna ili maštovita ili kaprisavna ideja., osobina djelovanja nepredvidljivo i više iz hir ili kapricija nego iz razuma ili prosudbe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an odd or fanciful or capricious idea [notion, whim, whimsy]</p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of acting unpredictably and more from whim or caprice than from reason or judgment [arbitrariness, capriciousness, flightiness, whimsicality, whimsy]</p><p><b>ćudljiv, hirovit, kapriciozan</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> determined by chance or impulse or whim rather than by necessity or reason [capricious, impulsive]</p><p><b>osobina djelovanja nepredvidljivo i više iz hir ili kapricija nego iz razuma ili prosudbe, Karakteristika ponašanja kao vilenjak. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of acting unpredictably and more from whim or caprice than from reason or judgment [arbitrariness, capriciousness, flightiness, whimsey, whimsy]</p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of behaving like an imp [impishness, mischievousness, puckishness]</p><p><b>ćudljiv, hirovit, kapriciozan (od &quot;whimsical&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a fanciful manner [fancifully]</p><p><b>ćud, kapric</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an odd or fanciful or capricious idea [notion, whim, whimsey]</p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of acting unpredictably and more from whim or caprice than from reason or judgment [arbitrariness, capriciousness, flightiness, whimsey, whimsicality]</p><p><b>štipavac</b></p><p><i>n.</i> very spiny and dense evergreen shrub with fragrant golden-yellow flowers [Irish gorse, Ulex europaeus, furze, gorse]</p><p><i>n.</i> small Eurasian shrub having clusters of yellow flowers that yield a dye [Genista tinctoria, dyer's-broom, dyer's greenweed, dyeweed, greenweed, woadwaxen, woodwaxen]</p><p><i>n.</i> any of various hard colored rocks (especially rocks consisting of chert or basalt) [whinstone]</p><p><b>borovnica</b></p><p><i>n.</i> erect European blueberry having solitary flowers and blue-black berries [Viccinium myrtillus, bilberry, blaeberry, whortleberry]</p><p><b>obična travarka</b></p><p><i>n.</i> brown-and-buff European songbird of grassy meadows [Saxicola rubetra]</p><p><b>cmizdrenje, cviliti, cviljenje, jadikovati, kukati, šmrcati, cičati, zaškripati, zaškripiti, zaškripnuti, škripati, škripiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a complaint uttered in a plaintive whining way [whimper]</p><p><i>v.</i> move with a whining sound</p><p><i>v.</i> talk in a tearful manner [snivel]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a high-pitched, screeching noise [creak, screak, screech, skreak, squeak]</p><p><i>v.</i> complain whiningly [grizzle, yammer, yawp]</p><p><b>štipavac (od &quot;whin&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person given to excessive complaints and crying and whining [bellyacher, complainer, crybaby, grumbler, moaner, sniveller, squawker]</p><p><b>često se žališ (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> habitually complaining [fretful, querulous, whiny]</p><p><b>tiho zarzati, njištati, rzati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the characteristic sounds made by a horse [neigh, nicker, whicker]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a characteristic sound, of a horse [neigh, nicker, whicker]</p><p><b>Svaka od različitih tvrdo obojenih stijena (posebno stijene koje se sastoje od krasta ili bazalta) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of various hard colored rocks (especially rocks consisting of chert or basalt) [whin]</p><p><b>često se žališ (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> habitually complaining [fretful, querulous, whiney]</p><p><b>bič, bičevati, plamenac, šiba, šibati, kandžija, korbač, istući, izlemati, izmlatiti, ošinuti, izlupati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an instrument with a handle and a flexible lash that is used for whipping</p><p><i>n.</i> a legislator appointed by the party to enforce discipline [party whip]</p><p><i>n.</i> a dessert made of sugar and stiffly beaten egg whites or cream and usually flavored with fruit</p><p><i>n.</i> (golf) the flexibility of the shaft of a golf club</p><p><i>n.</i> a quick blow delivered with a whip or whiplike object [lash, whiplash]</p><p><i>v.</i> beat severely with a whip or rod [flog, lash, lather, slash, strap, trounce, welt]</p><p><i>v.</i> defeat thoroughly [mop up, pip, rack up, worst]</p><p><i>v.</i> thrash about flexibly in the manner of a whiplash</p><p><i>v.</i> strike as if by whipping [lash]</p><p><i>v.</i> whip with or as if with a wire whisk [whisk]</p><p><i>v.</i> subject to harsh criticism [blister, scald]</p><p><b>položaj prednosti i kontrole (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> position of advantage and control [upper hand]</p><p><b>neotrovni arahnid koji liči na škorpiju i koji ima dug tanak rep bez žderca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nonvenomous arachnid that resembles a scorpion and that has a long thin tail without a stinger [whip-scorpion]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko malih brzo pokretnih zmija s dugim bičnim repovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several small fast-moving snakes with long whiplike tails [whip-snake, whipsnake]</p><p><b>Prođite kroz vrlo brzo (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> go through very fast</p><p><b>vrh koji se okreće bičem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a top that is spun by whipping [whipping top]</p><p><b>pripremiti ili kuhati brzo ili naglo (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> prepare or cook quickly or hastily [whomp up]</p><p><b>(Britanski) traženje novca obično u dobrotvorne svrhe (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> (British) solicitation of money usually for a benevolent purpose</p><p><b>neotrovni arahnid koji liči na škorpiju i koji ima dug tanak rep bez žderca (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> nonvenomous arachnid that resembles a scorpion and that has a long thin tail without a stinger [whip scorpion]</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko malih brzo pokretnih zmija s dugim bičnim repovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several small fast-moving snakes with long whiplike tails [whip snake, whipsnake]</p><p><b>bič</b></p><p><i>n.</i> closely twisted hard cord used for the lashes of whips</p><p><i>n.</i> a strong worsted or cotton fabric with a diagonal rib</p><p><b>udarac bičem</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an injury to the neck (the cervical vertebrae) resulting from rapid acceleration or deceleration (as in an automobile accident) [whiplash injury]</p><p><i>n.</i> a quick blow delivered with a whip or whiplike object [lash, whip]</p><p><b>ozljeda vrata (krvnog kralježnika) nastala zbog brzog ubrzanja ili usporavanja (kao u automobilskoj nesreći) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an injury to the neck (the cervical vertebrae) resulting from rapid acceleration or deceleration (as in an automobile accident) [whiplash]</p><p><b>s ili nalik biču ili biču (kao i bič) (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having or resembling a lash or whip (as does a flagellum) [flagellate, flagellated, lash-like]</p><p><b>slatko vrhnje, šlag</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cream that has been beaten until light and fluffy</p><p><b>osoba koja kažnjava rukom ili bičem. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a person who administers punishment by wielding a switch or whip [switcher]</p><p><b>pomoćnik lovaca u upravljanju psima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> huntsman's assistant in managing the hounds</p><p><b>netko tko je nevažan, ali drzak i drzak (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is unimportant but cheeky and presumptuous [jackanapes, lightweight]</p><p><b>mali vitki pas tipa greyhounda razvijen u Engleskoj (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> small slender dog of greyhound type developed in England</p><p><b>bičevanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> beating with a whip or strap or rope as a form of punishment [flagellation, flogging, lashing, tanning]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sound defeat [debacle, drubbing, slaughter, thrashing, trouncing, walloping]</p><p><i>n.</i> a sewing stitch passing over an edge diagonally [whipstitch, whipstitching]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of overcoming or outdoing [beating]</p><p><i>adj.</i> smart and fashionable [snappy]</p><p><b>netko tko je kažnjen zbog grešaka drugih. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> someone who is punished for the errors of others [scapegoat]</p><p><b>Krema koja sadrži dovoljno maslinove masti (30% do 36%) za bičanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> cream that has enough butterfat (30% to 36%) to be whipped [light whipping cream]</p><p><b>Post koji se nekada koristio u javnosti na koji su prekršaji vezani da bi bili bičevani. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> post formerly used in public to which offenders are tied to be whipped</p><p><b>vrh koji se okreće bičem (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a top that is spun by whipping [whip top]</p><p><b>vino i lavanda do ljubičastih i crnih cvijeća u nekoliko grmova na gornjoj polovici listovitog stabla (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> wine and lavender to purple and black flowers in several clusters on the upper half of leafy stems [Penstemon whippleanus]</p><p><b>prečni stub koji je pričvršćen za tragove konja i za vozilo ili opremu koju konj vuče (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a crossbar that is attached to the traces of a draft horse and to the vehicle or implement that the horse is pulling [swingletree, whiffletree]</p><p><b>kozodoj, leganj mračnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> American nocturnal goatsucker with grey-and-white plumage [Caprimulgus vociferus]</p><p><b>Sklonjenje i skakanje natrag bez lomljenja (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> bending and snapping back readily without breaking [flexible]</p><p><b>sjemena s ručicama na oba kraja, žrtvovati, posebno u kockanju ili pregovorima, s pločom za piljenje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a saw with handles at both ends [lumberman's saw, two-handed saw, two-man saw]</p><p><i>v.</i> victimize, especially in gambling or negotiations</p><p><i>v.</i> saw with a whipsaw</p><p><b>bilo koja od nekoliko malih brzo pokretnih zmija s dugim bičnim repovima (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several small fast-moving snakes with long whiplike tails [whip-snake, whip snake]</p><p><b>šivanje šav koji prolazi preko ruba dijagonalno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sewing stitch passing over an edge diagonally [whipping, whipstitching]</p><p><b>šivanje šav koji prolazi preko ruba dijagonalno (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a sewing stitch passing over an edge diagonally [whipping, whipstitch]</p><p><b>bilo koji od brojnih vrlo agilnih i budnih guštera Novog svijeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous very agile and alert New World lizards [whiptail lizard]</p><p><b>bilo koji od brojnih vrlo agilnih i budnih guštera Novog svijeta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of numerous very agile and alert New World lizards [whiptail]</p><p><b>šum, zujanje, fijukati, fijuknuti, hujati, hujiti, zujati, zvrjati, zvrljati, šumiti</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sound of something in rapid motion [birr, whirr, whirring]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a soft swishing sound [birr, purr, whirr, whiz, whizz]</p><p><b>kovitlac, kovitlanje, kovitlati se, okretanje, snažno okretati, vir, vitlati se, vrtlog, pokušaj, kovitlati, okretati se, vrtjeti se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> confused movement [commotion]</p><p><i>n.</i> the shape of something rotating rapidly [convolution, swirl, vortex]</p><p><i>n.</i> a usually brief attempt [crack, fling, go, offer, pass]</p><p><i>n.</i> the act of rotating rapidly [spin, twirl, twist, twisting]</p><p><i>v.</i> turn in a twisting or spinning motion [swirl, twiddle, twirl]</p><p><i>v.</i> cause to spin [birl, spin, twirl]</p><p><i>v.</i> flow in a circular current, of liquids [eddy, purl, swirl, whirlpool]</p><p><i>v.</i> revolve quickly and repeatedly around one's own axis [gyrate, reel, spin, spin around]</p><p><i>v.</i> fly around [tumble, whirl around]</p><p><b>Letjeti okolo. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> fly around [tumble, whirl]</p><p><b>Čisti pas koji je osvojio trostruku krunu 1941. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> thoroughbred that won the triple crown in 1941</p><p><b>kovitlac, kovitlanje, kovitlati se, okretanje, snažno okretati, vir, vitlati se, vrtlog (od &quot;whirl&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dervish whose actions include ecstatic dancing and whirling [whirling dervish]</p><p><i>n.</i> a revolving mechanism</p><p><b>vrteška, zvrčka, zvrk, čigra, vrtuljak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a conical child's plaything tapering to a steel point on which it can be made to spin [spinning top, teetotum, top]</p><p><i>n.</i> a large, rotating machine with seats for children to ride or amusement [carousel, carrousel, merry-go-round, roundabout]</p><p><i>v.</i> whirl or spin like a whirligig</p><p><b>vodeni bubač koji brzo kruži po vodenoj površini (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> aquatic beetle that circles rapidly on the water surface</p><p><b>vrtloženje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the act of rotating in a circle or spiral [gyration]</p><p><b>Dervis koji se ponaša kao ekstatičan plesač i vrtljaj. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a dervish whose actions include ecstatic dancing and whirling [whirler]</p><p><b>vir, vrtlog, kovitlati se</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a powerful circular current of water (usually the result of conflicting tides) [maelstrom, vortex]</p><p><i>v.</i> flow in a circular current, of liquids [eddy, purl, swirl, whirl]</p><p><b>kovitlac, uragan, vihor, zračna vijavica, zračni vrtlog</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a more or less vertical column of air whirling around itself as it moves over the surface of the Earth</p><p><b>helikopter, vrtložnjak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an aircraft without wings that obtains its lift from the rotation of overhead blades [chopper, eggbeater, helicopter]</p><p><b>šum, šumiti, zujanje, zujati, fijukati, fijuknuti, hujati, hujiti, zvrjati, zvrljati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sound of something in rapid motion [birr, whir, whirring]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a soft swishing sound [birr, purr, whir, whiz, whizz]</p><p><i>v.</i> make a vibrant sound, as of some birds [churr]</p><p><b>šum, šumiti, zujanje, zujati (od &quot;whirr&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> sound of something in rapid motion [birr, whir, whirr]</p><p><i>adj.</i> like the sound of rapidly vibrating wings</p><p><b>Izdaju sibilantni zvuk., pokret s šapućem zvuka (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> make a sibilant sound</p><p><i>v.</i> move with a whishing sound</p><p><b>brisanje, bućkalo, izlupati, mala metla, miješalica, miješalica za mikser, odjuriti, zamah, bičevati</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a mixer incorporating a coil of wires</p><p><i>n.</i> a small short-handled broom used to brush clothes [whisk broom]</p><p><i>v.</i> move somewhere quickly</p><p><i>v.</i> move quickly and nimbly</p><p><i>v.</i> brush or wipe off lightly [whisk off]</p><p><i>v.</i> whip with or as if with a wire whisk [whip]</p><p><b>Odvuci ih brzo i iznenada. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> take away quickly and suddenly [whisk off]</p><p><b>mala metla sa kratkim rukom koja se koristi za četkanje odjeće (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a small short-handled broom used to brush clothes [whisk]</p><p><b>Odmah se pomakni. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> move by very quickly [fly by, zip by]</p><p><b>uglavnom tropske biljke koje se formiraju u grupe i imaju izgled poput kostura, ali slične metlama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> chiefly tropical clump-forming plants of skeletal appearance resembling whisk brooms</p><p><b>brišite ili lagano obrišite, Odvuci ih brzo i iznenada. (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> brush or wipe off lightly [whisk]</p><p><i>v.</i> take away quickly and suddenly [whisk away]</p><p><b>dlaka, kontaktna opru, kontaktna vlas, zalistak</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a very small distance or space [hair, hair's-breadth, hairsbreadth]</p><p><i>n.</i> a long stiff hair growing from the snout or brow of most mammals as e.g. a cat [sensory hair, vibrissa]</p><p><i>v.</i> furnish with whiskers [bewhisker]</p><p><b>žabri žabri s crnom glavom i bez grebena (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a jay of northern North America with black-capped head and no crest [Canada jay, Perisoreus canadensis, camp robber, gray jay, grey jay]</p><p><b>dlaka, kontaktna opru, kontaktna vlas, zalistak (od &quot;whisker&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having hair on the cheeks and chin [barbate, bearded, bewhiskered, whiskery]</p><p><b>bez brade (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having no beard [beardless]</p><p><b>brkovi (mačke), zulufi, brada</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the hair growing on the