giju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a specialist in gynecology [gynaecologist, gynecologist]</p><p><b>šeširi za žene (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> hats for women [millinery]</p><p><b>obožavanje žena. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the worship of women [gynaeolatry, gyneolatry]</p><p><b>žene, ženski rod, ženstvenost, žena</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the state of being an adult woman [muliebrity]</p><p><i>n.</i> women as a class [fair sex, woman]</p><p><i>n.</i> the status of a woman</p><p><b>imati ljubavne odnose (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> have amorous affairs [philander, womanize]</p><p><b>ženskar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a man who likes many women and has short sexual relationships with them [philanderer, womanizer]</p><p><b>koji imaju karakteristike povezane s ženama i smatraju se neželjenim kod muškaraca (MT)</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> having characteristics associated with women and considered undesirable in men</p><p><b>osobina ženstvenosti (nisuštena riječ za muškarca) (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being effeminate (derogatory of a man) [effeminacy, effeminateness, sissiness, softness, unmanliness]</p><p><b>imati ljubavne odnose, davanje (više) ženskih, efeminiranih ili ženskih kvaliteta ili izgleda (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> have amorous affairs [philander, womanise]</p><p><i>v.</i> to give a (more) feminine, effeminate, or womanly quality or appearance to [effeminise, effeminize, feminise, feminize]</p><p><b>ženskar</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a man who likes many women and has short sexual relationships with them [philanderer, womaniser]</p><p><b>žene, ženski rod, ženski svijet</b></p><p><i>n.</i> women as distinguished from men</p><p><b>osobina ženstvenosti., sliči na ženu. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being womanly [womanliness]</p><p><i>adj.</i> resembling a woman</p><p><b>osobina ženstvenosti. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the trait of being womanly [womanlike]</p><p><b>ženstven, ženstvena</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> befitting or characteristic of a woman especially a mature woman [feminine]</