og višeg suda kojim se donjem sudu naređuje da ne izvršava nadležnost u određenom slučaju (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a judicial writ from a higher court ordering a lower court not to exercise jurisdiction in a particular case</p><p><b>Zakon kojim se naređuje da se zemljište vrati pravom vlasniku. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a writ ordering that land be restored to its rightful owner</p><p><b>bilježiti, napisati, pisati, upisati, zabilježiti, bilježenje, napiše, piše, pišete, pišite, pišu, upisivanje, komponirati, sastaviti, sastavljati, javiti se, javljati se, skladati, ispisati, ispisivati, sricati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> produce a literary work [compose, indite, pen]</p><p><i>v.</i> communicate or express by writing</p><p><i>v.</i> communicate (with) in writing [drop a line]</p><p><i>v.</i> write music [compose]</p><p><i>v.</i> mark or trace on a surface</p><p><i>v.</i> record data on a computer [save]</p><p><i>v.</i> write or name the letters that comprise the conventionally accepted form of (a word or part of a word) [spell]</p><p><i>v.</i> create code, write a computer program</p><p><b>napisati o određenoj temi (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> write about a particular topic [write of, write on]</p><p><b>pisati za komercijalne publikacije (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> write for commercial publications</p><p><b>napisati, zapisati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> put down in writing [get down, put down, set down]</p><p><i>v.</i> reduce the estimated value of something [expense, write off]</p><p><b>glasati tako što ćete ubaciti ime koje se ne pojavljuje na glasovanju., pisati organizaciji (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> cast a vote by inserting a name that does not appear on the ballot</p><p><i>v.</i> write to an organization</p><p><b>kodirati, prekodirati, prevesti, prevoditi, šifrirati</b></p><p><i>v.</i> convert ordinary language into code [cipher, code, cypher, encipher, encrypt, inscribe]</p><p><b>napisati o određenoj temi (MT)</b></p><p><i>v.</i> write about a particular topic [write about, write on]