uthor</p><p><i>n.</i> letters or symbols that are written or imprinted on a surface to represent the sounds or words of a language</p><p><i>n.</i> the activity of putting something in written form [committal to writing]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an arm of a tablet-armed chair</p><p><b>zadatak da napišeš nešto. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an assignment to write something [written assignment]</p><p><b>s masenim udjelom od 0,15 mm ili više, ali ne više od 0,15 mm, (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> work surface consisting of a wide lightweight board that can be placed across the lap and used for writing</p><p><b>pisaći stol</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a portable case containing writing materials and having a writing surface</p><p><i>n.</i> a desk for writing (usually with a sloping top)</p><p><b>sredstvo za pisanje</b></p><p><i>n.</i> an implement that is used to write</p><p><b>Svaka trajna ili oprljiva mastila koja se koristi s olovkama (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any permanent or washable ink used with pens</p><p><b>papir na koji se mogu pisati poruke. (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a pad of paper on which messages can be written [message pad]</p><p><b>pisaći papir</b></p><p><i>n.</i> paper material made into thin sheets that are sized to take ink</p><p><b>stil, stil pisanja, umjetnički stil, žanr</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a style of expressing yourself in writing [genre, literary genre]</p><p><b>grafija, pismo, sistem pisanja, sistem pisma, sustav pisanja, sustav pisma</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a method of representing the sounds of a language by written or printed symbols [orthography]</p><p><b>stol za pisanje (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a desk used for writing [escritoire, secretaire, secretary]</p><p><b>spisi, tekstovi</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the third of three divisions of the Hebrew Scriptures [Hagiographa, Ketubim]</p><p><b>ispisan, napisan, napisano, pisan, pisani, pismen, pismeni, napisali, pisalo, pisano, pisanoj, pp. od write</b></p><p