ss (usually in favor of a person or cause) [ardor, ardour, elan]</p><p><i>n.</i> excessive fervor to do something or accomplish some end</p><p><i>n.</i> prompt willingness [eagerness, forwardness, readiness]</p><p><b>Zeland</b></p><p><i>n.</i> the largest island of Denmark and the site of Copenhagen [Seeland, Sjaelland]</p><p><b>Zeland (od &quot;zealand&quot;)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a native or inhabitant of Zealand</p><p><b>fanatik</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a member of an ancient Jewish sect in Judea in the first century who fought to the death against the Romans and who killed or persecuted Jews who collaborated with the Romans</p><p><i>n.</i> a fervent and even militant proponent of something [drumbeater, partisan]</p><p><b>fanatizam, fanatičnost</b></p><p><i>n.</i> excessive intolerance of opposing views [fanaticism, fanatism]</p><p><b>oduševljen, predan, revan, revnostan, vatren</b></p><p><i>adj.</i> marked by active interest and enthusiasm [avid]</p><p><b>oduševljen, predan, revan, revnostan, vatren (od &quot;zealous&quot;)</b></p><p><i>adv.</i> in a zealous manner</p><p><b>žuti karotenoid (izomerni s luteinom i često se pojavljuje s njim) koji je glavni pigment u žutom indijskom kukuruzu (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> yellow carotenoid (isomeric with lutein and occurs widely with it) that is the main pigment in yellow Indian corn</p><p><b>jedinica informacija jednaka 1024 eksbibita ili 2 ^ 70 bita (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of information equal to 1024 exbibits or 2^70 bits [Zibit]</p><p><b>jedinica informacija jednaka 1024 eksbibajta ili 2 ^ 70 bajta (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> a unit of information equal to 1024 exbibytes or 2^70 bytes [ZB, ZiB, zettabyte]</p><p><b>zebra</b></p><p><i>n.</i> any of several fleet black-and-white striped African equines</p><p><b>obilježen pješački prijelaz preko ceste</b></p><p><i>n.</i> street crossing where pedestrians have right of way [pedestrian crossing]</p><p><b>mala australska ptica s znakovima poput zebre (MT)</b></p><p><i>n.</i> 